"Frequency bands:\n"
"Band 1: 32 Hz\n"
"Band 2: 100 Hz\n"
"Band 3: 320 Hz\n"
"Band 4: 1000 Hz\n"
"Band 5: 3200 Hz\n"
"Band 6: 10000 Hz\n"
