"[code]true[/code] for all other values (including [constant @GDScript.INF] "
"and [constant @GDScript.NAN])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/bool.xml
msgid ""
"Casts an [int] value to a [bool]. Returns [code]false[/code] if [param from] "
"is equal to [code]0[/code], and [code]true[/code] for all other values."
msgstr ""
"Emet un valor [int] a un [bool]. Retorna [code]false[/code] si [param from] "
"és igual a [code]0[/code] i [code]true[/code] per a tots els altres valors."

#: doc/classes/bool.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if one [bool] is [code]true[/code] and the other "
"[bool] is [code]false[/code]. Equivalent to logical XOR (NEQ)."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/bool.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [bool] is [code]false[/code] and "
"[param right] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/bool.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both [bool]s are [code]true[/code], or if both "
"[bool]s are [code]false[/code]. Equivalent to logical XNOR (EQ)."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/bool.xml
#, fuzzy
