"la seva línia següent. S'eliminaran els espais en blanc entremig. Si la "
"línia següent té contingut, s'inserirà [param line_ending] entremig."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Moves all lines down that are selected or have a caret on them."
msgstr ""
"Mou totes les línies cap avall que estan seleccionades o tenen un accent."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Moves all lines up that are selected or have a caret on them."
msgstr ""
"Mou totes les línies cap amunt que estiguin seleccionades o que tinguin un "
"accent."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Removes the comment delimiter with [param start_key]."
msgstr "Elimina el delimitador de comentaris amb [param start_key]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Removes the string delimiter with [param start_key]."
msgstr "Elimina el delimitador de cadena amb [param start_key]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Emits [signal code_completion_requested], if [param force] is [code]true[/"
"code] will bypass all checks. Otherwise will check that the caret is in a "
"word or in front of a prefix. Will ignore the request if all current options "
"are of type file path, node path, or signal."
msgstr ""
"Emet [signal code_completion_requested], si [param force] és [code]true[/"
"code] passarà per alt totes les comprovacions. En cas contrari, comprovarà "
"que el cursor està en una paraula o davant d'un prefix. Ignorarà la "
"sol·licitud si totes les opcions actuals són de tipus ruta del fitxer, ruta "
"del node o senyal."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets the current selected completion option."
msgstr "Estableix l'opció de finalització seleccionada actual."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets the code hint text. Pass an empty string to clear."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el text de la pista del codi. Passeu una cadena buida per esborrar-"
"la."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the code hint will draw below the main caret. If "
"[code]false[/code], the code hint will draw above the main caret. See "
"[method set_code_hint]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la pista del codi es dibuixarà a sota del cursor "
"principal. Si [code]false[/code], la pista del codi es dibuixarà per sobre "
"del signe de cursor principal. Veure [method set_code_hint]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets the code region start and end tags (without comment delimiter)."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les etiquetes d'inici i final de la regió del codi (sense "
"delimitador de comentaris)."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the given line as bookmarked. If [code]true[/code] and [member "
"gutters_draw_bookmarks] is [code]true[/code], draws the [theme_item "
"bookmark] icon in the gutter for this line. See [method "
"get_bookmarked_lines] and [method is_line_bookmarked]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la línia donada com a marcador. Si [code]true[/code] i [member "
"gutters_draw_bookmarks] és [code]true[/code], dibuixa la icona [theme_item "
"bookmark] al canal d'aquesta línia. Vegeu [method get_bookmarked_lines] i "
"[method is_line_bookmarked]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the given line as a breakpoint. If [code]true[/code] and [member "
"gutters_draw_breakpoints_gutter] is [code]true[/code], draws the [theme_item "
"breakpoint] icon in the gutter for this line. See [method "
"get_breakpointed_lines] and [method is_line_breakpointed]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la línia donada com a punt d'interrupció. Si [code]true[/code] i "
"[member gutters_draw_breakpoints_gutter] és [code]true[/code], dibuixa la "
"icona [theme_item breakpoint] al canal d'aquesta línia. Vegeu [method "
"get_breakpointed_lines] i [method is_line_breakpointed]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the given line as executing. If [code]true[/code] and [member "
"gutters_draw_executing_lines] is [code]true[/code], draws the [theme_item "
"executing_line] icon in the gutter for this line. See [method "
"get_executing_lines] and [method is_line_executing]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la línia donada com a executant. Si [code]true[/code] i [member "
"gutters_draw_executing_lines] és [code]true[/code], dibuixa la icona "
"[theme_item executing_line] al canal d'aquesta línia. Vegeu [method "
"get_executing_lines] i [method is_line_executing]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets the symbol emitted by [signal symbol_validate] as a valid lookup."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el símbol emès per [signal symbol_validate] com a cerca vàlida."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Toggle the folding of the code block at the given line."
msgstr "Commuta el plegat del bloc de codi a la línia donada."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Toggle the folding of the code block on all lines with a caret on them."
msgstr "Commuteu el plegat del bloc de codi a totes les línies amb un accent."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Unfolds all lines that are folded."
msgstr "Desplega totes les línies que es dobleguen."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Unfolds the given line if it is folded or if it is hidden under a folded "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Desplega la línia donada si està plegada o si s'amaga sota una línia plegada."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Unindents all lines that are selected or have a caret on them. Uses spaces "
"or a tab depending on [member indent_use_spaces]. Equivalent to the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_text_dedent] action. See [method indent_lines]."
msgstr ""
"Anul·la el sagnat de totes les línies seleccionades o amb un accent. "
"Utilitza espais o una pestanya en funció de [member indent_use_spaces]. "
"Equivalent a l'acció [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_text_dedent]. Veure "
"[method indent_lines]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Submits all completion options added with [method "
"add_code_completion_option]. Will try to force the autocomplete menu to "
"popup, if [param force] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will replace all current candidates."
msgstr ""
"Envia totes les opcions de finalització afegides amb [method "
"add_code_completion_option]. Intentarà forçar que el menú d'emplenament "
"automàtic aparegui, si [param force] és [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això substituirà tots els candidats actuals."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses [member auto_brace_completion_pairs] to "
"automatically insert the closing brace when the opening brace is inserted by "
"typing or autocompletion. Also automatically removes the closing brace when "
"using backspace on the opening brace."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], utilitza [member auto_brace_completion_pairs] per "
"inserir automàticament la clau de tancament quan s'insereix la clau "
"d'obertura escrivint o completant automàticament. També elimina "
"automàticament la clau de tancament quan s'utilitza el retrocés a la clau "
"d'obertura."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlights brace pairs when the caret is on either "
"one, using [member auto_brace_completion_pairs]. If matching, the pairs will "
"be underlined. If a brace is unmatched, it is colored with [theme_item "
"brace_mismatch_color]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], ressalta els parells de claus quan el accent està en "
"qualsevol d'ells, utilitzant [member auto_brace_completion_pairs]. Si "
"coincideixen, les parelles estaran subratllades. Si una clau no coincideix, "
"es pinta amb [theme_item brace_mismatch_color]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the brace pairs to be autocompleted. For each entry in the dictionary, "
"the key is the opening brace and the value is the closing brace that matches "
"it. A brace is a [String] made of symbols. See [member "
"auto_brace_completion_enabled] and [member "
"auto_brace_completion_highlight_matching]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els parells de claus per completar automàticament. Per a cada "
"entrada del diccionari, la clau és la clau d'obertura i el valor és la clau "
"de tancament que hi coincideix. Una clau és un [String] fet de símbols. "
"Vegeu [member auto_brace_completion_enabled] i [member "
"auto_brace_completion_highlight_matching]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_text_completion_query] action requests code completion. To handle it, see "
"[method _request_code_completion] or [signal code_completion_requested]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'acció [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_text_completion_query] sol·licita la finalització del codi. Per gestionar-"
"ho, vegeu [method _request_code_completion] o [signal "
"code_completion_requested]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets prefixes that will trigger code completion."
msgstr "Estableix prefixos que activaran la finalització del codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the comment delimiters. All existing comment delimiters will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els delimitadors de comentaris. S'eliminaran tots els delimitadors "
"de comentaris existents."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the string delimiters. All existing string delimiters will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els delimitadors de cadena. S'eliminaran tots els delimitadors de "
"cadenes existents."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], bookmarks are drawn in the gutter. This gutter is "
"shared with breakpoints and executing lines. See [method "
"set_line_as_bookmarked]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els marcadors es dibuixen al canal. Aquest canal es "
"comparteix amb punts d'interrupció i línies d'execució. Veure [method "
"set_line_as_bookmarked]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], breakpoints are drawn in the gutter. This gutter is "
"shared with bookmarks and executing lines. Clicking the gutter will toggle "
"the breakpoint for the line, see [method set_line_as_breakpoint]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els punts d'interrupció es dibuixen al canal. Aquest "
"canal es comparteix amb adreces d'interès i línies d'execució. Si feu clic "
"al canal, es canviarà el punt d'interrupció de la línia, vegeu [method "
"set_line_as_breakpoint]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], executing lines are marked in the gutter. This gutter "
"is shared with breakpoints and bookmarks. See [method set_line_as_executing]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les línies d'execució es marquen al canal. Aquest "
"canal es comparteix amb punts d'interrupció i marcadors. Veure [method "
"set_line_as_executing]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the fold gutter is drawn. In this gutter, the "
"[theme_item can_fold_code_region] icon is drawn for each foldable line (see "
"[method can_fold_line]) and the [theme_item folded_code_region] icon is "
"drawn for each folded line (see [method is_line_folded]). These icons can be "
"clicked to toggle the fold state, see [method toggle_foldable_line]. [member "
"line_folding] must be [code]true[/code] to show icons."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es dibuixa el canal de plec. En aquest canal, es "
"dibuixa la icona [theme_item can_fold_code_region] per a cada línia plegable "
"(vegeu [method can_fold_line]) i la icona [theme_item folded_code_region] es "
"dibuixa per a cada línia plegada (vegeu [method is_line_folded]). Es pot fer "
"clic en aquestes icones per canviar l'estat de plec, vegeu [method "
"toggle_foldable_line]. [member line_folding] ha de ser [code]true[/code] per "
"mostrar les icones."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the line number gutter is drawn. Line numbers start at "
"[code]1[/code] and are incremented for each line of text. Clicking and "
"dragging in the line number gutter will select entire lines of text."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es dibuixa el canal del número de línia. Els números "
"de línia comencen a [code]1[/code] i s'incrementen per a cada línia de text. "
"Si feu clic i arrossegueu al canal del número de línia, es seleccionaran "
"línies senceres de text."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "The minimum width in digits reserved for the line number gutter."
msgstr "L'amplada mínima en dígits reservada per al canal del número de línia."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], line numbers drawn in the gutter are zero padded based "
"on the total line count. Requires [member gutters_draw_line_numbers] to be "
"set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els números de línia dibuixats al canal s'empallen en "
"zero segons el recompte total de línies. Requereix que [member "
"gutters_draw_line_numbers] s'estableixi com a [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], an extra indent is automatically inserted when a new "
"line is added and a prefix in [member indent_automatic_prefixes] is found. "
"If a brace pair opening key is found, the matching closing brace will be "
"moved to another new line (see [member auto_brace_completion_pairs])."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], s'insereix automàticament un sagnat addicional quan "
"s'afegeix una línia nova i es troba un prefix a [member "
"indent_automatic_prefixes]. Si es troba una clau d'obertura de parell de "
"claudàtors, la clau de tancament coincident es mourà a una altra línia nova "
"(vegeu [member auto_brace_completion_pairs])."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Prefixes to trigger an automatic indent. Used when [member indent_automatic] "
"is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Prefixos per activar un sagnat automàtic. S'utilitza quan [member "
"indent_automatic] s'estableix en [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Size of the tabulation indent (one [kbd]Tab[/kbd] press) in characters. If "
"[member indent_use_spaces] is enabled the number of spaces to use."
msgstr ""
"Mida del sagnat de la tabulació (un [kbd]Tab[/kbd] premsa) en caràcters. Si "
"[member indent_use_spaces] està habilitat, el nombre d'espais a utilitzar."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Use spaces instead of tabs for indentation."
msgstr "Utilitzeu espais en comptes de tabulacions per al sagnat."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], lines can be folded. Otherwise, line folding methods "
"like [method fold_line] will not work and [method can_fold_line] will always "
"return [code]false[/code]. See [member gutters_draw_fold_gutter]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les línies es poden plegar. En cas contrari, els "
"mètodes de plegat de línies com [method fold_line] no funcionaran i [method "
"can_fold_line] sempre tornarà [code]false[/code]. Veure [member "
"gutters_draw_fold_gutter]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Draws vertical lines at the provided columns. The first entry is considered "
"a main hard guideline and is drawn more prominently."
msgstr ""
"Dibuixa línies verticals a les columnes proporcionades. La primera entrada "
"es considera una directriu dura principal i es dibuixa de manera més "
"destacada."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Set when a validated word from [signal symbol_validate] is clicked, the "
"[signal symbol_lookup] should be emitted."
msgstr ""
"Estableix quan es fa clic en una paraula validada de [signal "
"symbol_validate], s'ha d'emetre [signal symbol_lookup]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [signal symbol_hovered] signal is emitted when "
"hovering over a word."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a breakpoint is added or removed from a line. If the line is "
"removed via backspace, a signal is emitted at the old line."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan s'afegeix o s'elimina un punt d'interrupció d'una línia. Si la "
"línia s'elimina per retrocés, s'emet un senyal a la línia antiga."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user requests code completion. This signal will not be sent "
"if [method _request_code_completion] is overridden or [member "
"code_completion_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari sol·licita la finalització del codi. Aquest senyal no "
"s'enviarà si se substitueix [method _request_code_completion] o si [member "
"code_completion_enabled] és [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user hovers over a symbol. Unlike [signal "
"Control.mouse_entered], this signal is not emitted immediately, but when the "
"cursor is over the symbol for [member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/"
"tooltip_delay_sec] seconds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member symbol_tooltip_on_hover] must be [code]true[/code] for "
"this signal to be emitted."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari passa el cursor per sobre d'un símbol. A diferència de "
"[signal Control.mouse_entered], aquest senyal no s'emet immediatament, sinó "
"quan el cursor està sobre el símbol de [member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/"
"tooltip_delay_sec] segons.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member symbol_tooltip_on_hover] ha de ser [code]true[/code] "
"perquè aquest senyal s'emeti."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user has clicked on a valid symbol."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari ha fet clic en un símbol vàlid."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user hovers over a symbol. The symbol should be validated "
"and responded to, by calling [method set_symbol_lookup_word_as_valid].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member symbol_lookup_on_click] must be [code]true[/code] for "
"this signal to be emitted."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari passa el cursor per sobre d'un símbol. El símbol s'ha "
"de validar i respondre, trucant a [method set_symbol_lookup_word_as_valid].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member symbol_lookup_on_click] ha de ser [code]true[/code] "
"perquè aquest senyal s'emeti."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a class."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a classe."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a function."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a funció."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a Godot signal."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a senyal Godot."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a variable."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a variable."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a member."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a membre."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as an enum entry."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com una entrada d'enumeració."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a constant."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a constant."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a Godot node path."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com un camí de node Godot."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a file path."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a ruta de fitxer."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as unclassified or plain text."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a text sense classificar o sense classificar."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Marks the option as a keyword."
msgstr "Marca l'opció com a paraula clau."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid ""
"The option is local to the location of the code completion query - e.g. a "
"local variable. Subsequent value of location represent options from the "
"outer class, the exact value represent how far they are (in terms of inner "
"classes)."
msgstr ""
"L'opció és local a la ubicació de la consulta de finalització del codi, p. "
"una variable local. El valor posterior de la ubicació representa opcions de "
"la classe externa, el valor exacte representa fins a quin punt es troben (en "
"termes de classes internes)."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid ""
"The option is from the containing class or a parent class, relative to the "
"location of the code completion query. Perform a bitwise OR with the class "
"depth (e.g. [code]0[/code] for the local class, [code]1[/code] for the "
"parent, [code]2[/code] for the grandparent, etc.) to store the depth of an "
"option in the class or a parent class."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid ""
"The option is from user code which is not local and not in a derived class "
"(e.g. Autoload Singletons)."
msgstr ""
"L'opció prové del codi d'usuari que no és local ni d'una classe derivada "
"(per exemple, Carrega automàtica Singletons)."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid ""
"The option is from other engine code, not covered by the other enum "
"constants - e.g. built-in classes."
msgstr ""
"L'opció és d'un altre codi de motor, no cobert per les altres constants "
"d'enumeració, p. classes integrades."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] of the bookmark icon for bookmarked lines."
msgstr "[Color] de la icona d'adreces d'interès per a les línies marcades."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] of the text to highlight mismatched braces."
msgstr "[Color] del text per ressaltar claus que no coincideixen."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] of the breakpoint icon for bookmarked lines."
msgstr "[Color] de la icona de punt d'interrupció per a les línies marcades."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] for all icons related to line folding."
msgstr "[Color] per a totes les icones relacionades amb el plegat de línies."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets the background [Color] for the code completion popup."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el fons [Color] per a la finestra emergent de finalització del "
"codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Background highlight [Color] for matching text in code completion options."
msgstr ""
"Ressaltat de fons [Color] per fer coincidir el text a les opcions de "
"finalització del codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] of the scrollbar in the code completion popup."
msgstr ""
"[Color] de la barra de desplaçament a la finestra emergent de finalització "
"del codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] of the scrollbar in the code completion popup when hovered."
msgstr ""
"[Color] de la barra de desplaçament a la finestra emergent de finalització "
"del codi quan es passa el cursor."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Background highlight [Color] for the current selected option item in the "
"code completion popup."
msgstr ""
"Ressaltat de fons [Color] per a l'element d'opció seleccionat actual a la "
"finestra emergent de finalització del codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] of the executing icon for executing lines."
msgstr "[Color] de la icona d'execució per executar línies."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[Color] of background line highlight for folded code region."
msgstr "[Color] de la línia de fons destacada per a la regió de codi plegada."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"[Color] of the main line length guideline, secondary guidelines will have "
"50% alpha applied."
msgstr ""
"[Color] de la pauta de longitud de la línia principal, les directrius "
"secundàries tindran un 50% d'alfa aplicat."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets the [Color] of line numbers."
msgstr "Estableix el [Color] dels números de línia."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Max number of options to display in the code completion popup at any one "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim d'opcions per mostrar a la finestra emergent de finalització "
"del codi en qualsevol moment."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Max width of options in the code completion popup. Options longer than this "
"will be cut off."
msgstr ""
"Amplada màxima d'opcions a la finestra emergent de finalització del codi. "
"Les opcions més llargues que aquesta es tallaran."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Width of the scrollbar in the code completion popup."
msgstr ""
"Amplada de la barra de desplaçament a la finestra emergent de finalització "
"del codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the bookmark gutter for bookmarked "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Texture2D] personalitzat per dibuixar al canal d'adreces "
"d'interès per a les línies marcades."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the breakpoint gutter for breakpointed "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Texture2D] personalitzat per dibuixar al canal de punt "
"d'interrupció per a línies de punt d'interrupció."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a line can "
"be folded."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Texture2D] personalitzat per dibuixar el canal plegable de la "
"línia quan es pot plegar una línia."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a code "
"region can be folded."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Texture2D] personalitzat per dibuixar el canal plegable de "
"línia quan es pot plegar una regió de codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Background panel for the color preview box in autocompletion (visible when "
"the color is translucent)."
msgstr ""
"Tauler de fons per al quadre de vista prèvia del color a l'emplenament "
"automàtic (visible quan el color és translúcid)."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Icon to draw in the executing gutter for executing lines."
msgstr "Icona per dibuixar al canal d'execució per executar línies."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a line is "
"folded and can be unfolded."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Texture2D] personalitzat per dibuixar el canal plegable de la "
"línia quan es plega una línia i es pot desplegar."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a code "
"region is folded and can be unfolded."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Texture2D] personalitzat per dibuixar al canal plegable de "
"línia quan es plega una regió de codi i es pot desplegar."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw at the end of a folded line."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Texture2D] personalitzat per dibuixar al final d'una línia "
"plegada."

#: doc/classes/CodeEdit.xml
msgid "[StyleBox] for the code completion popup."
msgstr "[StyleBox] per a la finestra emergent de finalització del codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "A syntax highlighter intended for code."
msgstr "Un marcador de sintaxi destinat al codi."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"By adjusting various properties of this resource, you can change the colors "
"of strings, comments, numbers, and other text patterns inside a [TextEdit] "
"control."
msgstr ""
"En ajustar diverses propietats d'aquest recurs, podeu canviar els colors de "
"les cadenes, els comentaris, els números i altres patrons de text dins d'un "
"control [TextEdit]."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a color region (such as for comments or strings) from [param start_key] "
"to [param end_key]. Both keys should be symbols, and [param start_key] must "
"not be shared with other delimiters.\n"
"If [param line_only] is [code]true[/code] or [param end_key] is an empty "
"[String], the region does not carry over to the next line."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una regió de color (com ara comentaris o cadenes) de [param "
"start_key] a [param end_key]. Les dues claus han de ser símbols i [param "
"start_key] no s'han de compartir amb altres delimitadors.\n"
"Si [param line_only] és [code]true[/code] o [param end_key] és un [String] "
"buit, la regió no es trasllada a la línia següent."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the color for a keyword.\n"
"The keyword cannot contain any symbols except '_'."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el color d'una paraula clau.\n"
"La paraula clau no pot contenir cap símbol excepte '_'."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the color for a member keyword.\n"
"The member keyword cannot contain any symbols except '_'.\n"
"It will not be highlighted if preceded by a '.'."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el color d'una paraula clau de membre.\n"
"La paraula clau membre no pot contenir cap símbol excepte '_'.\n"
"No es ressaltarà si està precedit d'un \".\"."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Removes all color regions."
msgstr "Elimina totes les regions de color."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Removes all keywords."
msgstr "Elimina totes les paraules clau."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Removes all member keywords."
msgstr "Elimina totes les paraules clau dels membres."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Returns the color for a keyword."
msgstr "Retorna el color d'una paraula clau."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Returns the color for a member keyword."
msgstr "Retorna el color d'una paraula clau membre."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the start key exists, else [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si existeix la clau d'inici, sinó [code]false[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the keyword exists, else [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la paraula clau existeix, sinó [code]false[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the member keyword exists, else [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si existeix la paraula clau membre, sinó "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Removes the color region that uses that start key."
msgstr "Elimina la regió de color que utilitza aquesta tecla d'inici."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Removes the keyword."
msgstr "Elimina la paraula clau."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Removes the member keyword."
msgstr "Elimina la paraula clau del membre."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the color regions. All existing regions will be removed. The "
"[Dictionary] key is the region start and end key, separated by a space. The "
"value is the region color."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les regions de color. S'eliminaran totes les regions existents. La "
"clau [Dictionary] és la clau d'inici i final de la regió, separades per un "
"espai. El valor és el color de la regió."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Sets color for functions. A function is a non-keyword string followed by a "
"'('."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el color per a les funcions. Una funció és una cadena que no és "
"una paraula clau seguida d'un \"(\"."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the keyword colors. All existing keywords will be removed. The "
"[Dictionary] key is the keyword. The value is the keyword color."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els colors de la paraula clau. S'eliminaran totes les paraules "
"clau existents. La clau [Dictionary] és la paraula clau. El valor és el "
"color de la paraula clau."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the member keyword colors. All existing member keyword will be removed. "
"The [Dictionary] key is the member keyword. The value is the member keyword "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els colors de la paraula clau dels membres. S'eliminaran totes les "
"paraules clau dels membres existents. La clau [Dictionary] és la paraula "
"clau del membre. El valor és el color de la paraula clau del membre."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Sets color for member variables. A member variable is non-keyword, non-"
"function string proceeded with a '.'."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el color de les variables membres. Una variable membre no és una "
"paraula clau, una cadena no funcional continuada amb un '.'."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Sets the color for numbers."
msgstr "Estableix el color dels números."

#: doc/classes/CodeHighlighter.xml
msgid "Sets the color for symbols."
msgstr "Estableix el color dels símbols."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for 2D physics objects."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a objectes de física 2D."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for 2D physics objects. [CollisionObject2D] can hold any "
"number of [Shape2D]s for collision. Each shape must be assigned to a "
"[i]shape owner[/i]. Shape owners are not nodes and do not appear in the "
"editor, but are accessible through code using the [code]shape_owner_*[/code] "
"methods.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only collisions between objects within the same canvas "
"([Viewport] canvas or [CanvasLayer]) are supported. The behavior of "
"collisions between objects in different canvases is undefined."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a objectes de física 2D. [CollisionObject2D] pot "
"contenir qualsevol nombre de [Shape2D]s per a la col·lisió. Cada forma s'ha "
"d'assignar a un [i]propietari de la forma[/i]. Els propietaris de formes no "
"són nodes i no apareixen a l'editor, però són accessibles mitjançant el codi "
"mitjançant els mètodes [code]shape_owner_*[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només s'admeten les col·lisions entre objectes dins del mateix "
"llenç ([Viewport] llenç o [CanvasLayer]). El comportament de les col·lisions "
"entre objectes en diferents llenços no està definit."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Accepts unhandled [InputEvent]s. [param shape_idx] is the child index of the "
"clicked [Shape2D]. Connect to [signal input_event] to easily pick up these "
"events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _input_event] requires [member input_pickable] to be "
"[code]true[/code] and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"Accepta [InputEvent]s no gestionats. [param shape_idx] és l'índex secundari "
"de l'[Shape2D] en què s'ha fet clic. Connecteu-vos a [signal input_event] "
"per recollir fàcilment aquests esdeveniments.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method _input_event] requereix que [member input_pickable] "
"sigui [code]true[/code] i com a mínim un bit [member collision_layer] sigui "
"establert."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan el punter del ratolí entra en qualsevol de les formes "
"d'aquest objecte. Requereix que [member input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/"
"code] i que s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer]. Tingueu en "
"compte que moure's entre diferents formes dins d'un sol [CollisionObject2D] "
"no farà que aquesta funció es cridi."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan el punter del ratolí surt de totes les formes d'aquest "
"objecte. Requereix que [member input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i que "
"s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer]. Tingueu en compte que "
"moure's entre diferents formes dins d'un sol [CollisionObject2D] no farà que "
"aquesta funció es cridi."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes or moves "
"from one shape to another. [param shape_idx] is the child index of the newly "
"entered [Shape2D]. Requires [member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] "
"and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be called."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan el punter del ratolí entra en qualsevol de les formes "
"d'aquest objecte o es mou d'una forma a una altra. [param shape_idx] és "
"l'índex secundari de l'[Shape2D] que acaba d'entrar. Requereix que [member "
"input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i com a mínim un bit [member "
"collision_layer] per ser cridat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer exits any of this object's shapes. [param "
"shape_idx] is the child index of the exited [Shape2D]. Requires [member "
"input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be called."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan el punter del ratolí surt de qualsevol de les formes d'aquest "
"objecte. [param shape_idx] és l'índex secundari del [Shape2D] sortit. "
"Requereix que [member input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i com a mínim "
"un bit [member collision_layer] per ser cridat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new shape owner for the given object. Returns [code]owner_id[/"
"code] of the new owner for future reference."
msgstr ""
"Crea un propietari de forma nou per a l'objecte donat. Retorna "
"[code]owner_id[/code] del nou propietari com a referència futura."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
#: modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member collision_layer] "
"is enabled, given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si la capa especificada de [member collision_layer] està habilitada "
"o no, donat un [param layer_number] entre 1 i 32."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
#: modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member collision_mask] is "
"enabled, given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si la capa especificada de [member collision_mask] està habilitada o "
"no, donat un [param layer_number] entre 1 i 32."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Returns the object's [RID]."
msgstr "Retorna [RID] de l'objecte."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]one_way_collision_direction[/code] of the shape owner "
"identified by the given [param owner_id]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] of the shape owner "
"identified by given [param owner_id]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] del propietari de la forma "
"identificat per [param owner_id] donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [code]owner_id[/code] identifiers. You can use these "
"ids in other methods that take [code]owner_id[/code] as an argument."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Array] dels identificadors [code]owner_id[/code]. Podeu "
"utilitzar aquests identificadors en altres mètodes que prenen "
"[code]owner_id[/code] com a argument."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the shape owner and its shapes are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el propietari de la forma i les seves formes estan "
"desactivats."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if collisions for the shape owner originating from "
"this [CollisionObject2D] will not be reported to collided with "
"[CollisionObject2D]s."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si no s'informarà que les col·lisions per al "
"propietari de la forma originades en aquesta [CollisionObject2D] han xocat "
"amb [CollisionObject2D]s."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Removes the given shape owner."
msgstr "Elimina el propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
#: modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member collision_layer], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"Basat en [param value], habilita o desactiva la capa especificada a [member "
"collision_layer], donat un [param layer_number] entre 1 i 32."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
#: modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member collision_mask], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"Basat en [param value], habilita o desactiva la capa especificada a [member "
"collision_mask], donat un [param layer_number] entre 1 i 32."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [code]owner_id[/code] of the given shape."
msgstr "Retorna el [code]owner_id[/code] de la forma donada."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid "Adds a [Shape2D] to the shape owner."
msgstr "Afegeix un [Shape2D] al propietari de la forma."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Removes all shapes from the shape owner."
msgstr "Elimina totes les formes del propietari de la forma."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Returns the parent object of the given shape owner."
msgstr "Retorna l'objecte pare del propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid "Returns the [Shape2D] with the given ID from the given shape owner."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [Shape2D] amb l'identificador donat del propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Returns the number of shapes the given shape owner contains."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de formes que conté el propietari de la forma donada."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the child index of the [Shape2D] with the given ID from the given "
"shape owner."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex secundari de [Shape2D] amb l'identificador donat del "
"propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid "Returns the shape owner's [Transform2D]."
msgstr "Retorna el [Transform2D] del propietari de la forma."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Removes a shape from the given shape owner."
msgstr "Elimina una forma del propietari de la forma donada."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], disables the given shape owner."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], desactiva el propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enable] is [code]true[/code], collisions for the shape owner "
"originating from this [CollisionObject2D] will not be reported to collided "
"with [CollisionObject2D]s."
msgstr ""
"Si [param enable] és [code]true[/code], no s'informarà de les col·lisions "
"per al propietari de la forma originades a partir d'aquest "
"[CollisionObject2D] que han xocat amb [CollisionObject2D]s."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sets the [code]one_way_collision_direction[/code] of the shape owner "
"identified by the given [param owner_id] to [param direction]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] of the shape owner identified "
"by given [param owner_id] to [param margin] pixels."
msgstr ""
"Estableix [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] del propietari de la forma "
"identificat per [param owner_id] donat a [param margin] píxels."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid "Sets the [Transform2D] of the given shape owner."
msgstr "Estableix el [Transform2D] del propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject2D is in. Collision objects can exist "
"in one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision "
"layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes físiques en què es troba aquest CollisionObject2D. Els objectes de "
"col·lisió poden existir en una o més de les 32 capes diferents. Vegeu també "
"[member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'objecte A només pot detectar un contacte amb l'objecte B si "
"l'objecte B es troba a qualsevol de les capes que l'objecte A explora. "
"Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i màscares de "
"col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject2D scans. Collision objects can scan "
"one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision "
"layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de la física escaneja aquest CollisionObject2D. Els objectes de "
"col·lisió poden escanejar una o més de les 32 capes diferents. Vegeu també "
"[member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'objecte A només pot detectar un contacte amb l'objecte B si "
"l'objecte B es troba a qualsevol de les capes que l'objecte A explora. "
"Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i màscares de "
"col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml
msgid ""
"The priority used to solve colliding when occurring penetration. The higher "
"the priority is, the lower the penetration into the object will be. This can "
"for example be used to prevent the player from breaking through the "
"boundaries of a level."
msgstr ""
"La prioritat utilitzada per resoldre els xocs quan es produeixen "
"penetracions. Com més alta sigui la prioritat, menor serà la penetració a "
"l'objecte. Això es pot utilitzar, per exemple, per evitar que el jugador "
"trenqui els límits d'un nivell."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Defines the behavior in physics when [member Node.process_mode] is set to "
"[constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Defineix el comportament en física quan [member Node.process_mode] "
"s'estableix en [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this object is pickable. A pickable object can detect "
"the mouse pointer entering/leaving, and if the mouse is inside it, report "
"input events. Requires at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aquest objecte es pot seleccionar. Un objecte "
"seleccionable pot detectar el punter del ratolí entrant/sortint i, si el "
"ratolí es troba dins d'ell, informar dels esdeveniments d'entrada. Requereix "
"com a mínim un bit [member collision_layer] per establir-se."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when an input event occurs. Requires [member input_pickable] to be "
"[code]true[/code] and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set. "
"See [method _input_event] for details."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es produeix un esdeveniment d'entrada. Requereix que [member "
"input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i que s'estableixi almenys un "
"[member collision_layer]. Consulteu [method _input_event] per obtenir més "
"informació."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this signal to be emitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject2D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject2D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject2D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan el punter del ratolí entra en qualsevol de les formes d'aquest "
"objecte. Requereix que [member input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i que "
"s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer]. Tingueu en compte que "
"moure's entre diferents formes dins d'un sol [CollisionObject2D] no farà que "
"aquest senyal s'emeti.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa de la manca de detecció de col·lisions contínua, és "
"possible que aquest senyal no s'emeti en l'ordre esperat si el ratolí es mou "
"prou ràpid i l'àrea de [CollisionObject2D] és petita. És possible que aquest "
"senyal tampoc no s'emeti si un altre [CollisionObject2D] se solapa amb el "
"[CollisionObject2D] en qüestió."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this signal to be emitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject2D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject2D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject2D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan el punter del ratolí surt de totes les formes d'aquest objecte. "
"Requereix que [member input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i que "
"s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer]. Tingueu en compte que "
"moure's entre diferents formes dins d'un sol [CollisionObject2D] no farà que "
"aquest senyal s'emeti.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa de la manca de detecció de col·lisions contínua, és "
"possible que aquest senyal no s'emeti en l'ordre esperat si el ratolí es mou "
"prou ràpid i l'àrea de [CollisionObject2D] és petita. És possible que aquest "
"senyal tampoc no s'emeti si un altre [CollisionObject2D] se solapa amb el "
"[CollisionObject2D] en qüestió."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes or moves "
"from one shape to another. [param shape_idx] is the child index of the newly "
"entered [Shape2D]. Requires [member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] "
"and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan el punter del ratolí entra en qualsevol de les formes d'aquest "
"objecte o es mou d'una forma a una altra. [param shape_idx] és l'índex "
"secundari de l'[Shape2D] que acaba d'entrar. Requereix que [member "
"input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i que s'estableixi almenys un "
"[member collision_layer]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer exits any of this object's shapes. [param "
"shape_idx] is the child index of the exited [Shape2D]. Requires [member "
"input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan el punter del ratolí surt de qualsevol de les formes d'aquest "
"objecte. [param shape_idx] és l'índex secundari del [Shape2D] sortit. "
"Requereix que [member input_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i que "
"s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], remove from the physics simulation to stop all "
"physics interactions with this [CollisionObject2D].\n"
"Automatically re-added to the physics simulation when the [Node] is "
"processed again."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member Node.process_mode] s'estableix en [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], suprimiu-lo de la simulació de física per "
"aturar totes les interaccions físiques amb aquest [CollisionObject2D].\n"
"S'ha tornat a afegir automàticament a la simulació de física quan es torna a "
"processar [Node]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], make the body static. Doesn't affect [Area2D]. "
"[PhysicsBody2D] can't be affected by forces or other bodies while static.\n"
"Automatically set [PhysicsBody2D] back to its original mode when the [Node] "
"is processed again."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member Node.process_mode] s'estableix en [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], feu que el cos estigui estàtic. No afecta "
"[Area2D]. [PhysicsBody2D] no es pot veure afectat per forces o altres cossos "
"mentre està estàtica.\n"
"Torneu a [PhysicsBody2D] automàticament al seu mode original quan es torni a "
"processar [Node]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], do not affect the physics simulation."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member Node.process_mode] s'estableix en [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], no afecteu la simulació física."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for 3D physics objects."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a objectes de física 3D."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for 3D physics objects. [CollisionObject3D] can hold any "
"number of [Shape3D]s for collision. Each shape must be assigned to a "
"[i]shape owner[/i]. Shape owners are not nodes and do not appear in the "
"editor, but are accessible through code using the [code]shape_owner_*[/code] "
"methods.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] With a non-uniform scale, this node will likely not behave "
"as expected. It is advised to keep its scale the same on all axes and adjust "
"its collision shape(s) instead."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a objectes de física 3D. [CollisionObject3D] pot "
"contenir qualsevol nombre de [Shape3D]s per a la col·lisió. Cada forma s'ha "
"d'assignar a un [i]propietari de la forma[/i]. Els propietaris de formes no "
"són nodes i no apareixen a l'editor, però són accessibles mitjançant el codi "
"mitjançant els mètodes [code]shape_owner_*[/code].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Amb una escala no uniforme, probablement aquest node no es "
"comportarà com s'esperava. Es recomana mantenir la mateixa escala en tots "
"els eixos i ajustar-ne la forma de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Receives unhandled [InputEvent]s. [param event_position] is the location in "
"world space of the mouse pointer on the surface of the shape with index "
"[param shape_idx] and [param normal] is the normal vector of the surface at "
"that point. Connect to the [signal input_event] signal to easily pick up "
"these events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _input_event] requires [member input_ray_pickable] to "
"be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject3D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan el punter del ratolí entra en qualsevol de les formes "
"d'aquest objecte. Requereix que [member input_ray_pickable] sigui "
"[code]true[/code] i que s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer]. "
"Tingueu en compte que moure's entre diferents formes dins d'un sol "
"[CollisionObject3D] no farà que aquesta funció es cridi."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject3D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan el punter del ratolí surt de totes les formes d'aquest "
"objecte. Requereix que [member input_ray_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i "
"que s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer]. Tingueu en compte que "
"moure's entre diferents formes dins d'un sol [CollisionObject3D] no farà que "
"aquesta funció es cridi."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Adds a [Shape3D] to the shape owner."
msgstr "Afegeix un [Shape3D] al propietari de la forma."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [Shape3D] with the given ID from the given shape owner."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [Shape3D] amb l'identificador donat del propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the child index of the [Shape3D] with the given ID from the given "
"shape owner."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex secundari de [Shape3D] amb l'identificador donat del "
"propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Returns the shape owner's [Transform3D]."
msgstr "Retorna el [Transform3D] del propietari de la forma."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid "Sets the [Transform3D] of the given shape owner."
msgstr "Estableix el [Transform3D] del propietari de la forma donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject3D [b]is in[/b]. Collision objects "
"can exist in one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member "
"collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision "
"layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de la física aquest CollisionObject3D [b]es a[/b]. Els objectes de "
"col·lisió poden existir en una o més de les 32 capes diferents. Vegeu també "
"[member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'objecte A només pot detectar un contacte amb l'objecte B si "
"l'objecte B es troba a qualsevol de les capes que l'objecte A explora. "
"Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i màscares de "
"col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject3D [b]scans[/b]. Collision objects "
"can scan one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member "
"collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision "
"layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de la física aquest CollisionObject3D [b]scans[/b]. Els objectes "
"de col·lisió poden escanejar una o més de les 32 capes diferents. Vegeu "
"també [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'objecte A només pot detectar un contacte amb l'objecte B si "
"l'objecte B es troba a qualsevol de les capes que l'objecte A explora. "
"Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i màscares de "
"col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [CollisionObject3D] will continue to receive input "
"events as the mouse is dragged across its shapes."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [CollisionObject3D] continuarà rebent esdeveniments "
"d'entrada a mesura que arrossegueu el ratolí per les seves formes."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the object receives an unhandled [InputEvent]. [param "
"event_position] is the location in world space of the mouse pointer on the "
"surface of the shape with index [param shape_idx] and [param normal] is the "
"normal vector of the surface at that point."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'objecte rep un [InputEvent] no gestionat. [param "
"event_position] és la ubicació a l'espai mundial del punter del ratolí a la "
"superfície de la forma amb l'índex [param shape_idx] i [param normal] és el "
"vector normal de la superfície en aquest punt."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject3D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject3D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject3D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan el punter del ratolí entra en qualsevol de les formes d'aquest "
"objecte. Requereix que [member input_ray_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i "
"que s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa de la manca de detecció contínua de col·lisions, és "
"possible que aquest senyal no s'emeti en l'ordre esperat si el ratolí es mou "
"prou ràpid i l'àrea de [CollisionObject3D] és petita. És possible que aquest "
"senyal tampoc no s'emeti si un altre [CollisionObject3D] s'està superposant "
"al [CollisionObject3D] en qüestió."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject3D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject3D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject3D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan el punter del ratolí surt de totes les formes d'aquest objecte. "
"Requereix que [member input_ray_pickable] sigui [code]true[/code] i que "
"s'estableixi almenys un [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa de la manca de detecció contínua de col·lisions, és "
"possible que aquest senyal no s'emeti en l'ordre esperat si el ratolí es mou "
"prou ràpid i l'àrea de [CollisionObject3D] és petita. És possible que aquest "
"senyal tampoc no s'emeti si un altre [CollisionObject3D] s'està superposant "
"al [CollisionObject3D] en qüestió."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], remove from the physics simulation to stop all "
"physics interactions with this [CollisionObject3D].\n"
"Automatically re-added to the physics simulation when the [Node] is "
"processed again."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member Node.process_mode] s'estableix en [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], suprimiu-lo de la simulació de física per "
"aturar totes les interaccions físiques amb aquest [CollisionObject3D].\n"
"S'ha tornat a afegir automàticament a la simulació de física quan es torna a "
"processar [Node]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionObject3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], make the body static. Doesn't affect [Area3D]. "
"[PhysicsBody3D] can't be affected by forces or other bodies while static.\n"
"Automatically set [PhysicsBody3D] back to its original mode when the [Node] "
"is processed again."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member Node.process_mode] s'estableix en [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], feu que el cos estigui estàtic. No afecta "
"[Area3D]. [PhysicsBody3D] no es pot veure afectat per forces o altres cossos "
"mentre està estàtica.\n"
"Torneu a [PhysicsBody3D] automàticament al seu mode original quan es torni a "
"processar [Node]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid "A node that provides a polygon shape to a [CollisionObject2D] parent."
msgstr ""
"Un node que proporciona una forma de polígon a un pare [CollisionObject2D]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that provides a polygon shape to a [CollisionObject2D] parent and "
"allows it to be edited. The polygon can be concave or convex. This can give "
"a detection shape to an [Area2D], turn a [PhysicsBody2D] into a solid "
"object, or give a hollow shape to a [StaticBody2D].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A non-uniformly scaled [CollisionPolygon2D] will likely not "
"behave as expected. Make sure to keep its scale the same on all axes and "
"adjust its polygon instead."
msgstr ""
"Un node que proporciona una forma de polígon a un [CollisionObject2D] pare i "
"permet editar-lo. El polígon pot ser còncau o convex. Això pot donar una "
"forma de detecció a un [Area2D], convertir un [PhysicsBody2D] en un objecte "
"sòlid o donar una forma buida a un [StaticBody2D].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] És probable que un [CollisionPolygon2D] no tingui una escala "
"uniforme no es comportarà com s'esperava. Assegureu-vos de mantenir la seva "
"escala igual en tots els eixos i ajusteu-ne el polígon."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid "Collision build mode."
msgstr "Mode de creació de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], no collisions will be detected. This property should "
"be changed with [method Object.set_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], no es detectaran col·lisions. Aquesta propietat s'ha "
"de canviar amb [method Object.set_deferred]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], only edges that face up, relative to "
"[CollisionPolygon2D]'s rotation, will collide with other objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property has no effect if this [CollisionPolygon2D] is a "
"child of an [Area2D] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The one way collision direction can be configured by setting "
"[member one_way_collision_direction]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], només les vores que estiguin cap amunt, en relació amb "
"la rotació de [CollisionPolygon2D], xocaran amb altres objectes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat no té cap efecte si aquest "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] és fill d'un node [Area2D].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La direcció de col·lisió unidireccional es pot configurar "
"configurant [member one_way_collision_direction]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml
msgid "The direction used for one-way collision."
msgstr "La direcció utilitzada per a la col·lisió unidireccional."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"The margin used for one-way collision (in pixels). Higher values will make "
"the shape thicker, and work better for colliders that enter the polygon at a "
"high velocity."
msgstr ""
"El marge utilitzat per a la col·lisió unidireccional (en píxels). Els valors "
"més alts faran que la forma sigui més gruixuda i funcioni millor per als "
"col·lisionadors que entren al polígon a gran velocitat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"The polygon's list of vertices. Each point will be connected to the next, "
"and the final point will be connected to the first.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned vertices are in the local coordinate space of the "
"given [CollisionPolygon2D]."
msgstr ""
"La llista de vèrtexs del polígon. Cada punt es connectarà al següent i el "
"punt final es connectarà al primer.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els vèrtexs retornats es troben a l'espai de coordenades locals "
"del [CollisionPolygon2D] donat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Collisions will include the polygon and its contained area. In this mode the "
"node has the same effect as several [ConvexPolygonShape2D] nodes, one for "
"each convex shape in the convex decomposition of the polygon (but without "
"the overhead of multiple nodes)."
msgstr ""
"Les col·lisions inclouran el polígon i la seva àrea continguda. En aquest "
"mode, el node té el mateix efecte que diversos [ConvexPolygonShape2D] nodes, "
"un per a cada forma convexa en la descomposició convexa del polígon (però "
"sense la sobrecàrrega de múltiples nodes)."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Collisions will only include the polygon edges. In this mode the node has "
"the same effect as a single [ConcavePolygonShape2D] made of segments, with "
"the restriction that each segment (after the first one) starts where the "
"previous one ends, and the last one ends where the first one starts (forming "
"a closed but hollow polygon)."
msgstr ""
"Les col·lisions només inclouran les vores del polígon. En aquest mode el "
"node té el mateix efecte que un sol [ConcavePolygonShape2D] fet de segments, "
"amb la restricció que cada segment (després del primer) comença on acaba "
"l'anterior, i l'últim acaba on comença el primer (formant un polígon tancat "
"però buit)."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that provides a thickened polygon shape (a prism) to a "
"[CollisionObject3D] parent."
msgstr ""
"Un node que proporciona una forma de polígon gruixuda (un prisma) a un pare "
"[CollisionObject3D]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that provides a thickened polygon shape (a prism) to a "
"[CollisionObject3D] parent and allows it to be edited. The polygon can be "
"concave or convex. This can give a detection shape to an [Area3D] or turn a "
"[PhysicsBody3D] into a solid object.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A non-uniformly scaled [CollisionShape3D] will likely not "
"behave as expected. Make sure to keep its scale the same on all axes and "
"adjust its shape resource instead."
msgstr ""
"Un node que proporciona una forma de polígon gruixuda (un prisma) a un pare "
"[CollisionObject3D] i permet editar-lo. El polígon pot ser còncau o convex. "
"Això pot donar una forma de detecció a un [Area3D] o convertir un "
"[PhysicsBody3D] en un objecte sòlid.\n"
"[b]Advertència:[/b] És probable que un [CollisionShape3D] no tingui una "
"escala uniforme no es comportarà com s'esperava. Assegureu-vos de mantenir "
"la seva escala igual en tots els eixos i ajusteu el seu recurs de forma."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml
#: doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The collision shape color that is displayed in the editor, or in the running "
"project if [b]Debug > Visible Collision Shapes[/b] is checked at the top of "
"the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value is [member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/"
"collision/shape_color]. The [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] value documented "
"here is a placeholder, and not the actual default debug color."
msgstr ""
"El color de la forma de col·lisió que es mostra a l'editor o al projecte en "
"execució si [b]Debug > Formes de col·lisió visibles[/b] està marcat a la "
"part superior de l'editor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El valor per defecte és [member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/"
"collision/shape_color]. El valor [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] documentat "
"aquí és un marcador de posició, i no el color de depuració predeterminat "
"real."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when the shape is displayed, it will show a solid fill "
"color in addition to its wireframe."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"Length that the resulting collision extends in either direction "
"perpendicular to its 2D polygon."
msgstr ""
"Longitud que la col·lisió resultant s'estén en qualsevol direcció "
"perpendicular al seu polígon 2D."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], no collision will be produced. This property should be "
"changed with [method Object.set_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], no es produirà cap col·lisió. Aquesta propietat s'ha "
"de canviar amb [method Object.set_deferred]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"The collision margin for the generated [Shape3D]. See [member "
"Shape3D.margin] for more details."
msgstr ""
"El marge de col·lisió per al [Shape3D] generat. Vegeu [member "
"Shape3D.margin] per a més detalls."

#: doc/classes/CollisionPolygon3D.xml
msgid "Array of vertices which define the 2D polygon in the local XY plane."
msgstr "Matriu de vèrtexs que defineixen el polígon 2D en el pla XY local."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml
msgid "A node that provides a [Shape2D] to a [CollisionObject2D] parent."
msgstr "Un node que proporciona un [Shape2D] a un [CollisionObject2D] pare."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that provides a [Shape2D] to a [CollisionObject2D] parent and allows "
"it to be edited. This can give a detection shape to an [Area2D] or turn a "
"[PhysicsBody2D] into a solid object."
msgstr ""
"Un node que proporciona un [Shape2D] a un pare [CollisionObject2D] i permet "
"editar-lo. Això pot donar una forma de detecció a un [Area2D] o convertir un "
"[PhysicsBody2D] en un objecte sòlid."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A disabled collision shape has no effect in the world. This property should "
"be changed with [method Object.set_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió desactivada no té cap efecte al món. Aquesta "
"propietat s'ha de canviar amb [method Object.set_deferred]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether this collision shape should only detect collision on one side "
"(top or bottom).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property has no effect if this [CollisionShape2D] is a "
"child of an [Area2D] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The one way collision direction can be configured by setting "
"[member one_way_collision_direction]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si aquesta forma de col·lisió només ha de detectar la col·lisió en "
"un costat (superior o inferior).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat no té cap efecte si aquest [CollisionShape2D] "
"és fill d'un node [Area2D].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La direcció de col·lisió unidireccional es pot configurar "
"configurant [member one_way_collision_direction]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"The margin used for one-way collision (in pixels). Higher values will make "
"the shape thicker, and work better for colliders that enter the shape at a "
"high velocity."
msgstr ""
"El marge utilitzat per a la col·lisió unidireccional (en píxels). Els valors "
"més alts faran que la forma sigui més gruixuda i funcionin millor per als "
"col·lisionadors que entren a la forma a gran velocitat."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape2D.xml doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml
msgid "The actual shape owned by this collision shape."
msgstr "La forma real que té aquesta forma de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml
msgid "A node that provides a [Shape3D] to a [CollisionObject3D] parent."
msgstr "Un node que proporciona un [Shape3D] a un [CollisionObject3D] pare."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that provides a [Shape3D] to a [CollisionObject3D] parent and allows "
"it to be edited. This can give a detection shape to an [Area3D] or turn a "
"[PhysicsBody3D] into a solid object.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A non-uniformly scaled [CollisionShape3D] will likely not "
"behave as expected. Make sure to keep its scale the same on all axes and "
"adjust its [member shape] resource instead."
msgstr ""
"Un node que proporciona un [Shape3D] a un pare [CollisionObject3D] i permet "
"editar-lo. Això pot donar una forma de detecció a un [Area3D] o convertir un "
"[PhysicsBody3D] en un objecte sòlid.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] És probable que un [CollisionShape3D] no tingui una escala "
"uniforme no es comportarà com s'esperava. Assegureu-vos de mantenir la seva "
"escala igual en tots els eixos i ajusteu el seu recurs [member shape]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the collision shape's shape to the addition of all its convexed "
"[MeshInstance3D] siblings geometry."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la forma de la forma de col·lisió a l'addició de tota la seva "
"geometria convexa [MeshInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml
#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid "Use [signal Resource.changed] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [signal Resource.changed]."

#: doc/classes/CollisionShape3D.xml modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml
#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServer.xml
msgid "This method does nothing."
msgstr "Aquest mètode no fa res."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid "A color represented in RGBA format."
msgstr "Un color representat en format RGBA."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"A color represented in RGBA format by a red ([member r]), green ([member "
"g]), blue ([member b]), and alpha ([member a]) component. Each component is "
"a 32-bit floating-point value, usually ranging from [code]0.0[/code] to "
"[code]1.0[/code]. Some properties (such as [member CanvasItem.modulate]) may "
"support values greater than [code]1.0[/code], for overbright or HDR (High "
"Dynamic Range) colors.\n"
"Colors can be created in a number of ways: By the various [Color] "
"constructors, by static methods such as [method from_hsv], and by using a "
"name from the set of standardized colors based on [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X11_color_names]X11 color names[/url] with the "
"addition of [constant TRANSPARENT].\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"color_constants.png]Color constants cheatsheet[/url]\n"
"Although [Color] may be used to store values of any encoding, the red "
"([member r]), green ([member g]), and blue ([member b]) properties of "
"[Color] are expected by Godot to be encoded using the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SRGB#Transfer_function_(%22gamma%22)]nonlinear sRGB "
"transfer function[/url] unless otherwise stated. This color encoding is used "
"by many traditional art and web tools, making it easy to match colors "
"between Godot and these tools. Godot uses [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Rec._709]Rec. ITU-R BT.709[/url] color primaries, which are used by the sRGB "
"standard.\n"
"All physical simulation, such as lighting calculations, and colorimetry "
"transformations, such as [method get_luminance], must be performed on "
"linearly encoded values to produce correct results. When performing these "
"calculations, convert [Color] to and from linear encoding using [method "
"srgb_to_linear] and [method linear_to_srgb].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a Color will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it is equal to [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 1)[/code] (opaque black). "
"Otherwise, a Color will always evaluate to [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, color constants are defined in the [code]Colors[/code] "
"static class instead of [code skip-lint]Color[/code]. Additionally, named "
"colors use [code]PascalCase[/code] syntax instead of [code]UPPER_SNAKE_CASE[/"
"code]. For example, [code skip-lint]Color.ALICE_BLUE[/code] in GDScript is "
"[code skip-lint]Colors.AliceBlue[/code] in C#."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Color.xml doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "2D GD Paint Demo"
msgstr "Demostració de pintura 2D GD"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Tween Interpolation Demo"
msgstr "Demostració d'interpolació interpolació"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "GUI Drag And Drop Demo"
msgstr "Demostració d'arrossegar i deixar anar GUI"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a default [Color] from opaque black. This is the same as "
"[constant BLACK].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this constructs a [Color] with all of its components set "
"to [code]0.0[/code] (transparent black)."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Color] predeterminat a partir del negre opac. Això és el "
"mateix que [constant BLACK].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, això construeix un [Color] amb tots els seus components "
"establerts a [code]@0.0[/code] (negre transparent)."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] from the existing color, with [member a] set to the "
"given [param alpha] value.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color(Color.RED, 0.2) # 20% opaque red.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(Colors.Red, 0.2f); // 20% opaque red.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Color] a partir del color existent, amb [member a] establert "
"al valor [param alpha] donat.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var vermell = Color (Color.VERMELL, 0,2) # 20% vermell opac.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var vermell = color nou (Colors.Vermell, 0,2f); // 20% vermell opac.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Color] as a copy of the given [Color]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Color] com a còpia del [Color] donat."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] either from an HTML color code or from a standardized "
"color name. The supported color names are the same as the constants."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Color] a partir d'un codi de color HTML o a partir d'un nom "
"de color estandarditzat. Els noms de color admesos són els mateixos que les "
"constants."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] either from an HTML color code or from a standardized "
"color name, with [param alpha] on the range of 0.0 to 1.0. The supported "
"color names are the same as the constants."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Color] a partir d'un codi de color HTML o a partir d'un nom "
"de color estandarditzat, amb [param alpha] en l'interval de 0,0 a 1,0. Els "
"noms de color admesos són els mateixos que les constants."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] from RGB values, typically between 0.0 and 1.0. [member "
"a] is set to 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7) # Similar to `Color.from_rgba8(51, 255, "
"178, 255)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(0.2f, 1.0f, 0.7f); // Similar to `Color.Color8(51, "
"255, 178, 255)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Color] a partir de valors RGB, normalment entre 0,0 i 1,0. "
"[member a] s'estableix en 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7) # Similar a `Color.from_rgba8(51, 255, 178, "
"255)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (0,2f, 1,0f, 0,7f); // Similar a `Color.Color8(51, "
"255, 178, 255)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] from RGBA values, typically between 0.0 and 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7, 0.8) # Similar to `Color.from_rgba8(51, "
"255, 178, 204)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(0.2f, 1.0f, 0.7f, 0.8f); // Similar to "
"`Color.Color8(51, 255, 178, 255, 204)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Color] a partir de valors RGBA, normalment entre 0,0 i 1,0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7, 0.8) # Similar a `Color.from_rgba8(51, 255, "
"178, 204)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (0,2f, 1,0f, 0,7f, 0,8f); // Similar a "
"`Color.Color8(51, 255, 178, 255, 204)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new color resulting from overlaying this color over the given "
"color. In a painting program, you can imagine it as the [param over] color "
"painted over this color (including alpha).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var bg = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.5) # Green with alpha of 50%\n"
"var fg = Color(1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.5) # Red with alpha of 50%\n"
"var blended_color = bg.blend(fg) # Brown with alpha of 75%\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var bg = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // Green with alpha of 50%\n"
"var fg = new Color(1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // Red with alpha of 50%\n"
"Color blendedColor = bg.Blend(fg); // Brown with alpha of 75%\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un color nou resultant de la superposició d'aquest color sobre el "
"color donat. En un programa de pintura, podeu imaginar-lo com el color "
"[param over] pintat sobre aquest color (inclòs l'alfa).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var bg = Color(0,0, 1,0, 0,0, 0,5) # Verd amb alfa del 50%\n"
"var fg = Color(1,0, 0,0, 0,0, 0,5) # Vermell amb alfa del 50%\n"
"var blended_color = bg.blend(fg) # Marró amb alfa del 75%\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var bg = color nou (0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // Verd amb alfa del 50%\n"
"var fg = color nou (1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // Vermell amb alfa del 50%\n"
"Color blendedColor = bg.Blend (fg); // Marró amb alfa del 75%\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new color with all components clamped between the components of "
"[param min] and [param max], by running [method @GlobalScope.clamp] on each "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un color nou amb tots els components subjectats entre els components "
"de [param min] i [param max], executant [method @GlobalScope.clamp] a cada "
"component."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new color resulting from making this color darker by the specified "
"[param amount] (ratio from 0.0 to 1.0). See also [method lightened].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var green = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n"
"var darkgreen = green.darkened(0.2) # 20% darker than regular green\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var green = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color darkgreen = green.Darkened(0.2f); // 20% darker than regular green\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un color nou resultant de fer que aquest color sigui més fosc amb el "
"[param amount] especificat (proporció de 0,0 a 1,0). Vegeu també [method "
"lightened].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var verd = Color (0,0, 1,0, 0,0)\n"
"var darkgreen = green.darkened(0,2) # 20% més fosc que el verd normal\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var verd = color nou (0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color verd fosc = verd. Enfosquit (0,2f); // 20% més fosc que el verd "
"normal\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a color from an [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"HSL_and_HSV]HSV profile[/url]. The hue ([param h]), saturation ([param s]), "
"and value ([param v]) are typically between 0.0 and 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_hsv(0.58, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromHsv(0.58f, 0.5f, 0.79f, 0.8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Construeix un color a partir d'un perfil [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"HSL_and_HSV]HSV[/url]. La tonalitat ([param h]), la saturació ([param s]) i "
"el valor ([param v]) solen estar entre 0,0 i 1,0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_hsv(0,58; 0,5; 0,79; 0,8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromHsv(0,58f, 0,5f, 0,79f, 0,8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a color from an [url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/"
"colorpicker/]OK HSL profile[/url]. The hue ([param h]), saturation ([param "
"s]), and lightness ([param l]) are typically between 0.0 and 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_ok_hsl(0.58, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromOkHsl(0.58f, 0.5f, 0.79f, 0.8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Construeix un color a partir d'un perfil [url=https://bottosson.github.io/"
"posts/colorpicker/]OK HSL[/url]. La tonalitat ([param h]), la saturació "
"([param s]) i la lluminositat ([param l]) solen estar entre 0,0 i 1,0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_ok_hsl(0,58; 0,5; 0,79; 0,8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromOkHsl(0,58f, 0,5f, 0,79f, 0,8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns a [Color] constructed from red ([param r8]), green ([param g8]), "
"blue ([param b8]), and optionally alpha ([param a8]) integer channels, each "
"divided by [code]255.0[/code] for their final value.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var red = Color.from_rgba8(255, 0, 0)             # Same as Color(1, 0, 0).\n"
"var dark_blue = Color.from_rgba8(0, 0, 51)        # Same as Color(0, 0, "
"0.2).\n"
"var my_color = Color.from_rgba8(306, 255, 0, 102) # Same as Color(1.2, 1, 0, "
"0.4).\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lower precision of [method from_rgba8] compared to "
"the standard [Color] constructor, a color created with [method from_rgba8] "
"will generally not be equal to the same color created with the standard "
"[Color] constructor. Use [method is_equal_approx] for comparisons to avoid "
"issues with floating-point precision error."
msgstr ""
"Torna un [Color] construït des dels canals (nombres sencers) de vermell "
"([param r8]), verd ([param g8]), blau ([param b8]), i opcionalment alfa "
"([param a8]), cadascún dividits entre [code]255.0[/code] per obtenir el seu "
"valor final. Va bé utilitzar [method Color8] en comptes del constructor "
"estàndard [Color] quan necessites fer coincidir exactament els valors de "
"colors en una [Image].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var red = Color8(255, 0, 0)             # Igual que Color(1, 0, 0).\n"
"var dark_blue = Color8(0, 0, 51)        # Igual que Color(0, 0, 0.2).\n"
"var my_color = Color8(306, 255, 0, 102) # Igual que Color(1.2, 1, 0, 0.4).\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa de la baixa precisió de [method Color8] comparat amb el "
"constructor estàndard [Color], un color creat amb [method Color8], en "
"general no serà igual al mateix color creat amb el constructor estàndard "
"[Color]. Utilitza [method Color.is_equal_approx] per fer comparacions i "
"evitar problemes amb els errors de precisió de coma flotant."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Decodes a [Color] from an RGBE9995 format integer. See [constant "
"Image.FORMAT_RGBE9995]."
msgstr ""
"Descodifica un [Color] a partir d'un nombre enter de format RGBE9995. Veure "
"[constant Image.FORMAT_RGBE9995]."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a [Color] from the given string, which can be either an HTML color "
"code or a named color (case-insensitive). Returns [param default] if the "
"color cannot be inferred from the string.\n"
"If you want to create a color from String in a constant expression, use the "
"equivalent constructor instead (i.e. [code]Color(\"color string\")[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Crea un [Color] a partir de la cadena donada, que pot ser un codi de color "
"HTML o un color amb nom (no distingeix entre majúscules i minúscules). "
"Retorna [param default] si el color no es pot inferir de la cadena.\n"
"Si voleu crear un color a partir de String en una expressió constant, feu "
"servir el constructor equivalent (és a dir, [code]Color(\"cadena de color\")"
"[/code])."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the light intensity of the color, as a value between 0.0 and 1.0 "
"(inclusive). This is useful when determining light or dark color. Colors "
"with a luminance smaller than 0.5 can be generally considered dark.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method get_luminance] relies on the color using linear "
"encoding to return an accurate relative luminance value. If the color uses "
"the default nonlinear sRGB encoding, use [method srgb_to_linear] to convert "
"it to linear encoding first."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la intensitat de la llum del color, com a valor entre 0,0 i 1,0 "
"(inclosos). Això és útil per determinar el color clar o fosc. Els colors amb "
"una luminància inferior a 0,5 generalment es poden considerar foscos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method get_luminance] es basa en el color mitjançant la "
"codificació lineal per retornar un valor de luminància relativa precís. Si "
"el color utilitza la codificació sRGB no lineal predeterminada, utilitzeu "
"primer [method srgb_to_linear] per convertir-lo a codificació lineal."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Color] associated with the provided [param hex] integer in 32-"
"bit RGBA format (8 bits per channel). This method is the inverse of [method "
"to_rgba32].\n"
"In GDScript and C#, the [int] is best visualized with hexadecimal notation "
"([code]\"0x\"[/code] prefix, making it [code]\"0xRRGGBBAA\"[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color.hex(0xff0000ff)\n"
"var dark_cyan = Color.hex(0x008b8bff)\n"
"var my_color = Color.hex(0xbbefd2a4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(0xff0000ff);\n"
"var dark_cyan = new Color(0x008b8bff);\n"
"var my_color = new Color(0xbbefd2a4);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If you want to use hex notation in a constant expression, use the equivalent "
"constructor instead (i.e. [code]Color(0xRRGGBBAA)[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [Color] associat a l'enter [param hex] proporcionat en format "
"RGBA de 32 bits (8 bits per canal). Aquest mètode és la inversa de [method "
"to_rgba32].\n"
"En GDScript i C#, el [int] es visualitza millor amb la notació hexadecimal "
"([code]\"0x\"[/code] prefix, fent-lo [code]\"0xRRGGBBAA\"[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var vermell = Color.hex(0xff0000ff)\n"
"var dark_cyan = Color.hex(0x008b8bff)\n"
"var el meu_color = Color.hex(0xbbefd2a4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var vermell = color nou (0xff0000ff);\n"
"var dark_cyan = color nou (0x008b8bff);\n"
"var el meu_color = color nou (0xbbefd2a4);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Si voleu utilitzar la notació hexadecimal en una expressió constant, feu "
"servir el constructor equivalent (és a dir, [code]Color(0xRRGGBBAA)[/code])."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Color] associated with the provided [param hex] integer in 64-"
"bit RGBA format (16 bits per channel). This method is the inverse of [method "
"to_rgba64].\n"
"In GDScript and C#, the [int] is best visualized with hexadecimal notation "
"([code]\"0x\"[/code] prefix, making it [code]\"0xRRRRGGGGBBBBAAAA\"[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new color from [param rgba], an HTML hexadecimal color string. "
"[param rgba] is not case-sensitive, and may be prefixed by a hash sign "
"([code]#[/code]).\n"
"[param rgba] must be a valid three-digit or six-digit hexadecimal color "
"string, and may contain an alpha channel value. If [param rgba] does not "
"contain an alpha channel value, an alpha channel value of 1.0 is applied. If "
"[param rgba] is invalid, returns an empty color.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var blue = Color.html(\"#0000ff\") # blue is Color(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0)\n"
"var green = Color.html(\"#0F0\")   # green is Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0)\n"
"var col = Color.html(\"663399cc\") # col is Color(0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var blue = Color.FromHtml(\"#0000ff\"); // blue is Color(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, "
"1.0)\n"
"var green = Color.FromHtml(\"#0F0\");   // green is Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)\n"
"var col = Color.FromHtml(\"663399cc\"); // col is Color(0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un color nou de [param rgba], una cadena de color hexadecimal HTML. "
"[param rgba] no distingeix entre majúscules i minúscules i pot anar prefixat "
"per un signe hash ([code]#[/code]).\n"
"[param rgba] ha de ser una cadena de color hexadecimal de tres o sis dígits "
"vàlida i pot contenir un valor de canal alfa. Si [param rgba] no conté un "
"valor de canal alfa, s'aplica un valor de canal alfa d'1,0. Si [param rgba] "
"no és vàlid, retorna un color buit.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var blau = Color.html(\"#0000ff\") # blau és Color(0,0, 0,0, 1,0, 1,0)\n"
"var verd = Color.html(\"#0F0\") # verd és Color(0,0, 1,0, 0,0, 1,0)\n"
"var col = Color.html(\"663399cc\") # col és Color(0,4, 0,2, 0,6, 0,8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var blau = Color.FromHtml(\"#0000ff\"); // el blau és Color(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, "
"1.0)\n"
"var green = Color.FromHtml(\"#0F0\");   // el verd és Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)\n"
"var col = Color.FromHtml(\"663399cc\"); // col és Color(0,4, 0,2, 0,6, 0,8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param color] is a valid HTML hexadecimal color "
"string. The string must be a hexadecimal value (case-insensitive) of either "
"3, 4, 6 or 8 digits, and may be prefixed by a hash sign ([code]#[/code]). "
"This method is identical to [method String.is_valid_html_color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF\")   # Returns true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55AAFF20\") # Returns true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"55AAFF\")    # Returns true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#F2C\")      # Returns true\n"
"\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#AABBC\")    # Returns false\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF5\")  # Returns false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF\");   // Returns true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF20\"); // Returns true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"55AAFF\");    // Returns true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#F2C\");      // Returns true\n"
"\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#AABBC\");    // Returns false\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55aaFF5\");  // Returns false\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si [param color] és una cadena de color "
"hexadecimal HTML vàlida. La cadena ha de ser un valor hexadecimal (no "
"distingeix entre majúscules i minúscules) de 3, 4, 6 o 8 dígits, i pot anar "
"prefixada per un signe hash ([code]#[/code]). Aquest mètode és idèntic a "
"[method String.is_valid_html_color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF\") # Retorna cert\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55AAFF20\") # Retorna cert\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"55AAFF\") # Retorna cert\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#F2C\") # Retorna cert\n"
"\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#AABBC\") # Retorna fals\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF5\") # Retorna fals\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF\");   // Retorna cert\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF20\"); // Retorna cert\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"55AAFF\");    // Retorna cert\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#F2C\");      // Retorna cert\n"
"\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#AABBC\");    // Retorna fals\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55aaFF5\");  // Retorna fals\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color with its [member r], [member g], and [member b] components "
"inverted ([code](1 - r, 1 - g, 1 - b, a)[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var black = Color.WHITE.inverted()\n"
"var color = Color(0.3, 0.4, 0.9)\n"
"var inverted_color = color.inverted() # Equivalent to `Color(0.7, 0.6, "
"0.1)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var black = Colors.White.Inverted();\n"
"var color = new Color(0.3f, 0.4f, 0.9f);\n"
"Color invertedColor = color.Inverted(); // Equivalent to `new Color(0.7f, "
"0.6f, 0.1f)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color amb els seus components [member r], [member g] i [member b] "
"invertits ([code](1 - r, 1 - g, 1 - b, a)[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var negre = Color.WHITE.inverted()\n"
"var color = Color (0,3, 0,4, 0,9)\n"
"var inverted_color = color.inverted() # Equivalent a `Color(0.7, 0.6, 0.1)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var negre = Colors.White.Inverted();\n"
"var color = color nou (0,3f, 0,4f, 0,9f);\n"
"Color invertitColor = color.Invertit(); // Equivalent a \"color nou (0.7f, "
"0.6f, 0.1f)\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this color and [param to] are approximately "
"equal, by running [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] on each component."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest color i [param to] són aproximadament "
"iguals, executant [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] a cada component."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the linear interpolation between this color's components and [param "
"to]'s components. The interpolation factor [param weight] should be between "
"0.0 and 1.0 (inclusive). See also [method @GlobalScope.lerp].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n"
"var aqua = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.8)\n"
"\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0.2) # Returns Color(0.8, 0.2, 0.16)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0.5) # Returns Color(0.5, 0.5, 0.4)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 1.0) # Returns Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"var aqua = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f);\n"
"\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 0.2f); // Returns Color(0.8f, 0.2f, 0.16f)\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 0.5f); // Returns Color(0.5f, 0.5f, 0.4f)\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 1.0f); // Returns Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la interpolació lineal entre els components d'aquest color i els "
"components de [param to]. El factor d'interpolació [param weight] hauria "
"d'estar entre 0,0 i 1,0 (inclosos). Vegeu també [method @GlobalScope.lerp].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var vermell = Color (1,0, 0,0, 0,0)\n"
"var aqua = Color(0,0, 1,0, 0,8)\n"
"\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0,2) # Retorna Color(0,8, 0,2, 0,16)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0,5) # Retorna Color(0,5, 0,5, 0,4)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 1.0) # Retorna Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var vermell = color nou (1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"var aqua = color nou (0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f);\n"
"\n"
"vermell.Lerp(aqua, 0,2f); // Retorna Color (0,8f, 0,2f, 0,16f)\n"
"vermell.Lerp(aqua, 0,5f); // Retorna Color (0,5f, 0,5f, 0,4f)\n"
"vermell.Lerp(aqua, 1.0f); // Retorna Color (0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new color resulting from making this color lighter by the "
"specified [param amount], which should be a ratio from 0.0 to 1.0. See also "
"[method darkened].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var green = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n"
"var light_green = green.lightened(0.2) # 20% lighter than regular green\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var green = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color lightGreen = green.Lightened(0.2f); // 20% lighter than regular green\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un color nou resultant de fer aquest color més clar amb el [param "
"amount] especificat, que hauria de ser una proporció de 0,0 a 1,0. Vegeu "
"també [method darkened].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var verd = Color (0,0, 1,0, 0,0)\n"
"var light_green = green.lightened(0,2) # 20% més clar que el verd normal\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var verd = color nou (0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color verd clar = verd.Aclarit (0,2f); // 20% més clar que el verd normal\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the color that is encoded using the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SRGB]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/url]. This "
"method requires the original color to use linear encoding. See also [method "
"srgb_to_linear] which performs the opposite operation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The color's alpha channel ([member a]) is not affected. The "
"alpha channel is always stored with linear encoding, regardless of the color "
"space of the other color channels."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia del color que es codifica mitjançant la funció de "
"transferència sRGB no lineal [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SRGB][/url]. "
"Aquest mètode requereix que el color original utilitzi la codificació "
"lineal. Vegeu també [method srgb_to_linear] que realitza l'operació "
"contrària.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El canal alfa del color ([member a]) no es veu afectat. El "
"canal alfa s'emmagatzema sempre amb codificació lineal, independentment de "
"l'espai de color dels altres canals de color."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the color that uses linear encoding. This method requires "
"the original color to be encoded using the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/SRGB]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/url]. See also [method "
"linear_to_srgb] which performs the opposite operation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The color's alpha channel ([member a]) is not affected. The "
"alpha channel is always stored with linear encoding, regardless of the color "
"space of the other color channels."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia del color que utilitza codificació lineal. Aquest mètode "
"requereix que el color original estigui codificat mitjançant la funció de "
"transferència sRGB no lineal [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SRGB][/url]. "
"Vegeu també [method linear_to_srgb] que realitza l'operació contrària.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El canal alfa del color ([member a]) no es veu afectat. El "
"canal alfa s'emmagatzema sempre amb codificació lineal, independentment de "
"l'espai de color dels altres canals de color."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to a 32-bit integer in ABGR format (each "
"component is 8 bits). ABGR is the reversed version of the default RGBA "
"format.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_abgr32()) # Prints 4281565439\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToAbgr32()); // Prints 4281565439\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color convertit a un nombre enter de 32 bits en format ABGR (cada "
"component té 8 bits). ABGR és la versió invertida del format RGBA "
"predeterminat.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color (1, 0,5, 0,2)\n"
"print(color.to_abgr32()) # Prints 4281565439\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToAbgr32()); // Imprimeix 4281565439\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to a 64-bit integer in ABGR format (each "
"component is 16 bits). ABGR is the reversed version of the default RGBA "
"format.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_abgr64()) # Prints -225178692812801\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToAbgr64()); // Prints -225178692812801\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color convertit a un nombre enter de 64 bits en format ABGR (cada "
"component té 16 bits). ABGR és la versió invertida del format RGBA "
"predeterminat.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color (1, 0,5, 0,2)\n"
"print(color.to_abgr64()) # Prints -225178692812801\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToAbgr64()); // Impressions -225178692812801\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to a 32-bit integer in ARGB format (each "
"component is 8 bits). ARGB is more compatible with DirectX.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_argb32()) # Prints 4294934323\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToArgb32()); // Prints 4294934323\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color convertit a un nombre enter de 32 bits en format ARGB (cada "
"component és de 8 bits). ARGB és més compatible amb DirectX.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color (1, 0,5, 0,2)\n"
"print(color.to_argb32()) # Prints 4294934323\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToArgb32()); // Imprimeix 4294934323\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to a 64-bit integer in ARGB format (each "
"component is 16 bits). ARGB is more compatible with DirectX.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_argb64()) # Prints -2147470541\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToArgb64()); // Prints -2147470541\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color convertit a un nombre enter de 64 bits en format ARGB (cada "
"component és de 16 bits). ARGB és més compatible amb DirectX.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color (1, 0,5, 0,2)\n"
"print(color.to_argb64()) # Prints -2147470541\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToArgb64()); // Impressions -2147470541\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to an HTML hexadecimal color [String] in RGBA "
"format, without the hash ([code]#[/code]) prefix.\n"
"Setting [param with_alpha] to [code]false[/code], excludes alpha from the "
"hexadecimal string, using RGB format instead of RGBA format.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var white = Color(1, 1, 1, 0.5)\n"
"var with_alpha = white.to_html() # Returns \"ffffff7f\"\n"
"var without_alpha = white.to_html(false) # Returns \"ffffff\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var white = new Color(1, 1, 1, 0.5f);\n"
"string withAlpha = white.ToHtml(); // Returns \"ffffff7f\"\n"
"string withoutAlpha = white.ToHtml(false); // Returns \"ffffff\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color convertit en un color hexadecimal HTML [String] en format "
"RGBA, sense el prefix hash ([code]#[/code]).\n"
"Si estableix [param with_alpha] com a [code]false[/code], exclou l'alfa de "
"la cadena hexadecimal, utilitzant el format RGB en comptes del format RGBA.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var blanc = Color(1, 1, 1, 0,5)\n"
"var with_alpha = white.to_html() # Retorna \"ffffff7f\"\n"
"var without_alpha = white.to_html(false) # Retorna \"ffffff\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var blanc = color nou (1, 1, 1, 0,5f);\n"
"cadena ambAlpha = blanc.ToHtml(); // Retorna \"ffffff7f\"\n"
"cadena senseAlpha = blanc.ToHtml(fals); // Retorna \"ffffff\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to a 32-bit integer in RGBA format (each "
"component is 8 bits). RGBA is Godot's default format. This method is the "
"inverse of [method hex].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_rgba32()) # Prints 4286526463\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToRgba32()); // Prints 4286526463\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color convertit a un nombre enter de 32 bits en format RGBA (cada "
"component és de 8 bits). RGBA és el format predeterminat de Godot. Aquest "
"mètode és la inversa de [method hex].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color (1, 0,5, 0,2)\n"
"print(color.to_rgba32()) # Prints 4286526463\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (1, 0,5f, 0,2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToRgba32()); // Imprimeix 4286526463\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to a 64-bit integer in RGBA format (each "
"component is 16 bits). RGBA is Godot's default format. This method is the "
"inverse of [method hex64].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_rgba64()) # Prints -140736629309441\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToRgba64()); // Prints -140736629309441\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color convertit a un nombre enter de 64 bits en format RGBA (cada "
"component és de 16 bits). RGBA és el format predeterminat de Godot. Aquest "
"mètode és la inversa de [method hex64].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color (1, 0,5, 0,2)\n"
"print(color.to_rgba64()) # Prints -140736629309441\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = color nou (1, 0,5f, 0,2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToRgba64()); // Impressions -140736629309441\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"The color's alpha component, typically on the range of 0 to 1. A value of 0 "
"means that the color is fully transparent. A value of 1 means that the color "
"is fully opaque.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The alpha channel is always stored with linear encoding, "
"regardless of the encoding of the other color channels. The [method "
"linear_to_srgb] and [method srgb_to_linear] methods do not affect the alpha "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"El component alfa del color, normalment en el rang de 0 a 1. Un valor de 0 "
"significa que el color és totalment transparent. Un valor d'1 significa que "
"el color és totalment opac.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El canal alfa sempre s'emmagatzema amb codificació lineal, "
"independentment de la codificació dels altres canals de color. Els mètodes "
"[method linear_to_srgb] i [method srgb_to_linear] no afecten el canal alfa."

