#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Access color components using their index. [code][0][/code] is equivalent to "
"[member r], [code][1][/code] is equivalent to [member g], [code][2][/code] "
"is equivalent to [member b], and [code][3][/code] is equivalent to [member "
"a]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Color.xml doc/classes/float.xml doc/classes/int.xml
#: doc/classes/Plane.xml doc/classes/Quaternion.xml doc/classes/Vector2.xml
#: doc/classes/Vector2i.xml doc/classes/Vector3.xml doc/classes/Vector3i.xml
#: doc/classes/Vector4.xml doc/classes/Vector4i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the same value as if the [code]+[/code] was not there. Unary [code]+"
"[/code] does nothing, but sometimes it can make your code more readable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el mateix valor que si [code]+[/code] no hi fos. Unary [code]+[/"
"code] no fa res, però de vegades pot fer que el vostre codi sigui més "
"llegible."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Inverts the given color. This is equivalent to [code]Color.WHITE - c[/code] "
"or [code]Color(1 - c.r, 1 - c.g, 1 - c.b, 1 - c.a)[/code]. Unlike with "
"[method inverted], the [member a] component is inverted, too."
msgstr ""
"Inverteix el color donat. Això és equivalent a [code]Color.WHITE - c[/code] "
"o [code]Color(1 - c.r, 1 - c.g, 1 - c.b, 1 - c.a)[/code]. A diferència de "
"[method inverted], el component [member a] també està invertit."

#: doc/classes/ColorPalette.xml
msgid ""
"A resource class for managing a palette of colors, which can be loaded and "
"saved using [ColorPicker]."
msgstr ""
"Una classe de recurs per gestionar una paleta de colors, que es pot carregar "
"i desar amb [ColorPicker]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPalette.xml
msgid ""
"The [ColorPalette] resource is designed to store and manage a collection of "
"colors. This resource is useful in scenarios where a predefined set of "
"colors is required, such as for creating themes, designing user interfaces, "
"or managing game assets. The built-in [ColorPicker] control can also make "
"use of [ColorPalette] without additional code."
msgstr ""
"El recurs [ColorPalette] està dissenyat per emmagatzemar i gestionar una "
"col·lecció de colors. Aquest recurs és útil en escenaris on es requereix un "
"conjunt predefinit de colors, com ara per crear temes, dissenyar interfícies "
"d'usuari o gestionar actius del joc. El control [ColorPicker] integrat també "
"pot fer ús de [ColorPalette] sense codi addicional."

#: doc/classes/ColorPalette.xml
msgid "A [PackedColorArray] containing the colors in the palette."
msgstr "Un [PackedColorArray] que conté els colors de la paleta."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "A widget that provides an interface for selecting or modifying a color."
msgstr ""
"Un giny que proporciona una interfície per seleccionar o modificar un color."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"A widget that provides an interface for selecting or modifying a color. It "
"can optionally provide functionalities like a color sampler (eyedropper), "
"color modes, and presets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This control is the color picker widget itself. You can use a "
"[ColorPickerButton] instead if you need a button that brings up a "
"[ColorPicker] in a popup."
msgstr ""
"Un giny que proporciona una interfície per seleccionar o modificar un color. "
"Opcionalment, pot proporcionar funcionalitats com ara un mostrador de colors "
"(comptagotes), modes de color i valors predefinits.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest control és el propi widget de selecció de colors. Podeu "
"utilitzar un [ColorPickerButton] si necessiteu un botó que mostri un "
"[ColorPicker] en una finestra emergent."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given color to a list of color presets. The presets are displayed "
"in the color picker and the user will be able to select them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The presets list is only for [i]this[/i] color picker."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix el color donat a una llista de colors predefinits. Els valors "
"predefinits es mostren al selector de colors i l'usuari els podrà "
"seleccionar.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La llista de valors predefinits és només per al selector de "
"colors [i]@[/i]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given color to a list of color recent presets so that it can be "
"picked later. Recent presets are the colors that were picked recently, a new "
"preset is automatically created and added to recent presets when you pick a "
"new color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The recent presets list is only for [i]this[/i] color picker."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix el color donat a una llista de preajustos recents de color perquè es "
"pugui escollir més tard. Els valors predefinits recents són els colors que "
"s'han escollit recentment, es crea automàticament un valor predefinit nou i "
"s'afegeix als valors predefinits recents quan trieu un color nou.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La llista de preajustos recents només és per al selector de "
"colors [i]@[/i]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given color from the list of color presets of this color picker."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el color donat de la llista de valors predefinits de color d'aquest "
"selector de colors."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given color from the list of color recent presets of this color "
"picker."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el color donat de la llista de valors predefinits recents de color "
"d'aquest selector de colors."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Returns the list of colors in the presets of the color picker."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la llista de colors als valors predefinits del selector de colors."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Returns the list of colors in the recent presets of the color picker."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la llista de colors dels valors predefinits recents del selector de "
"colors."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it's possible to add presets under Swatches. If "
"[code]false[/code], the button to add presets is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], és possible afegir valors predefinits a les mostres. "
"Si [code]false[/code], el botó per afegir presets està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "The currently selected color."
msgstr "El color seleccionat actualment."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The currently selected color mode."
msgstr "El mode de color seleccionat actualment."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color mode buttons are visible."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], els botons del mode de color són visibles."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the color will apply only after the user releases the "
"mouse button, otherwise it will apply immediately even in mouse motion event "
"(which can cause performance issues)."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el color només s'aplicarà després que l'usuari deixi "
"anar el botó del ratolí, en cas contrari s'aplicarà immediatament fins i tot "
"en l'esdeveniment de moviment del ratolí (que pot causar problemes de "
"rendiment)."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows an alpha channel slider (opacity)."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], mostra un control lliscant de canal alfa (opacitat)."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows an intensity slider. The intensity is applied as "
"follows: convert the color to linear encoding, multiply it by [code]2 ** "
"intensity[/code], and then convert it back to nonlinear sRGB encoding."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], mostra un control lliscant d'intensitat. La intensitat "
"s'aplica de la següent manera: convertiu el color a codificació lineal, "
"multipliqueu-lo per [code]2 ** intensity[/code] i, a continuació, torneu a "
"convertir-lo en codificació sRGB no lineal."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the hex color code input field is visible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el camp d'entrada del codi de color hexadecimal és "
"visible."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The shape of the color space view."
msgstr "La forma de la vista de l'espai de color."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Swatches and Recent Colors presets are visible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els valors predefinits de mostres i colors recents són "
"visibles."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color sampler and color preview are visible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el mostrador de colors i la vista prèvia del color són "
"visibles."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color sliders are visible."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], els controls lliscants de color són visibles."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Emitted when the color is changed."
msgstr "S'emet quan es canvia de color."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Emitted when a preset is added."
msgstr "S'emet quan s'afegeix un valor predefinit."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Emitted when a preset is removed."
msgstr "S'emet quan s'elimina un valor predefinit."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Red/Green/Blue sliders in sRGB color space."
msgstr ""
"Permet editar el color amb controls lliscants vermell/verd/blau a l'espai de "
"color sRGB."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Allows editing the color with Hue/Saturation/Value sliders."
msgstr "Permet editar el color amb els controls lliscants To/Saturació/Valor."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "This is replaced by [constant MODE_LINEAR]."
msgstr "Això es substitueix per [constant MODE_LINEAR]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Red/Green/Blue sliders in linear color space."
msgstr ""
"Permet editar el color amb controls lliscants vermell/verd/blau en un espai "
"de color lineal."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Hue/Saturation/Lightness sliders.\n"
"OKHSL is a new color space similar to HSL but that better match perception "
"by leveraging the Oklab color space which is designed to be simple to use, "
"while doing a good job at predicting perceived lightness, chroma and hue.\n"
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/colorpicker/]Okhsv and Okhsl color "
"spaces[/url]"
msgstr ""
"Permet editar el color amb els controls lliscants To/Saturació/"
"Lluminositat.\n"
"OKHSL és un nou espai de color similar a HSL, però que millora la percepció "
"de la coincidència aprofitant l'espai de color Oklab, dissenyat per ser "
"senzill d'utilitzar, alhora que fa una bona feina per predir la lleugeresa, "
"la croma i la tonalitat percebudes.\n"
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/colorpicker/]Okhsv i espais de color "
"Okhsl[/url]"

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSV Color Model rectangle color space."
msgstr "Espai de color rectangle HSV Color Model."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSV Color Model rectangle color space with a wheel."
msgstr "HSV Color Model rectangle espai de color amb una roda."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSV Color Model circle color space. Use Saturation as a radius."
msgstr ""
"Espai de color del cercle del model de color HSV. Utilitzeu la saturació com "
"a radi."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSL OK Color Model circle color space."
msgstr "HSL OK Color Model cercle espai de color."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The color space shape and the shape select button are hidden. Can't be "
"selected from the shapes popup."
msgstr ""
"La forma de l'espai de color i el botó de selecció de forma estan amagats. "
"No es pot seleccionar a la finestra emergent de formes."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "OKHSL Color Model rectangle with constant lightness."
msgstr "Rectangle OKHSL Color Model amb lluminositat constant."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "OKHSL Color Model rectangle with constant saturation."
msgstr "Rectangle del model de color OKHSL amb saturació constant."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Color of rectangle or circle drawn when a picker shape part is focused but "
"not editable via keyboard or joypad. Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, "
"so a partially transparent color should be used to ensure the picker shape "
"remains visible."
msgstr ""
"Color del rectangle o del cercle dibuixat quan una part de la forma del "
"selector està enfocada, però no es pot editar amb el teclat o el joypad. Es "
"mostra [i]over[/i] la forma del selector, de manera que s'ha d'utilitzar un "
"color parcialment transparent per garantir que la forma del selector es "
"mantingui visible."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the [theme_item Slider.center_grabber] theme property of the "
"sliders."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix la propietat del tema [theme_item Slider.center_grabber] dels "
"controls lliscants."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The width of the hue selection slider."
msgstr "L'amplada del control lliscant de selecció de tonalitat."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The minimum width of the color labels next to sliders."
msgstr ""
"L'amplada mínima de les etiquetes de color al costat dels controls lliscants."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The margin around the [ColorPicker]."
msgstr "El marge al voltant de [ColorPicker]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The height of the saturation-value selection box."
msgstr "L'alçada del quadre de selecció del valor de saturació."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The width of the saturation-value selection box."
msgstr "L'amplada del quadre de selecció del valor de saturació."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for the \"Add Preset\" button."
msgstr "La icona del botó \"Afegeix un valor predefinit\"."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The texture for the arrow grabber."
msgstr "La textura per a la captura de fletxes."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The icon for the button that copies the color in text format to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"La icona del botó que copia el color en format de text al porta-retalls."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Custom texture for the hue selection slider on the right."
msgstr ""
"Textura personalitzada per al control lliscant de selecció de to a la dreta."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for the button that switches color text to hexadecimal."
msgstr "La icona del botó que canvia el color del text a hexadecimal."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for color preset drop down menu when expanded."
msgstr "La icona del menú desplegable preestablert de color quan s'amplia."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for color preset drop down menu when folded."
msgstr "La icona del menú desplegable preestablert en color quan es plega."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for color preset option menu."
msgstr "La icona del menú d'opcions preestablerts de color."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The indicator used to signalize that the color value is outside the 0-1 "
"range."
msgstr ""
"L'indicador que s'utilitza per indicar que el valor del color està fora del "
"rang 0-1."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The image displayed over the color box/circle (depending on the [member "
"picker_shape]), marking the currently selected color."
msgstr ""
"La imatge que es mostra sobre el quadre/cercle de color (segons el [member "
"picker_shape]), marcant el color seleccionat actualment."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The fill image displayed behind the picker cursor."
msgstr "La imatge de farciment que es mostra darrere del cursor del selector."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Background panel for the color preview box (visible when the color is "
"translucent)."
msgstr ""
"Tauler de fons per al quadre de vista prèvia del color (visible quan el "
"color és translúcid)."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The icon for the revert button (visible on the middle of the \"old\" color "
"when it differs from the currently selected color). This icon is modulated "
"with a dark color if the \"old\" color is bright enough, so the icon should "
"be bright to ensure visibility in both scenarios."
msgstr ""
"La icona del botó de revertir (visible al centre del color \"vell\" quan és "
"diferent del color seleccionat actualment). Aquesta icona es modula amb un "
"color fosc si el color \"vell\" és prou brillant, de manera que la icona ha "
"de ser brillant per garantir la visibilitat en ambdós escenaris."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for the screen color picker button."
msgstr "La icona del botó de selecció de colors de la pantalla."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for circular picker shapes."
msgstr "La icona per a les formes del selector circular."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for rectangular picker shapes."
msgstr "La icona per a les formes de selector rectangulars."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for rectangular wheel picker shapes."
msgstr "La icona per a les formes de selector de rodes rectangulars."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used when the circle-shaped part of the picker is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, so a partially transparent "
"[StyleBox] should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A "
"[StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline works well for this "
"purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] "
"resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/"
"controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"El [StyleBox] s'utilitza quan la part en forma de cercle del selector està "
"enfocada. Es mostra [i]over[/i] la forma del selector, de manera que s'ha "
"d'utilitzar una [StyleBox] parcialment transparent per garantir que la forma "
"del selector es mantingui visible. Un [StyleBox] que representa un esquema o "
"un subratllat funciona bé per a aquest propòsit. Per desactivar l'efecte "
"visual del focus, assigneu un recurs [StyleBoxEmpty]. Tingueu en compte que "
"desactivar l'efecte visual del focus perjudicarà la usabilitat de la "
"navegació del teclat/controlador, per la qual cosa no es recomana per raons "
"d'accessibilitat."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used when the rectangle-shaped part of the picker is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, so a partially transparent "
"[StyleBox] should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A "
"[StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline works well for this "
"purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] "
"resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/"
"controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"El [StyleBox] s'utilitza quan la part rectangular del selector està "
"enfocada. Es mostra [i]over[/i] la forma del selector, de manera que s'ha "
"d'utilitzar una [StyleBox] parcialment transparent per garantir que la forma "
"del selector es mantingui visible. Un [StyleBox] que representa un esquema o "
"un subratllat funciona bé per a aquest propòsit. Per desactivar l'efecte "
"visual del focus, assigneu un recurs [StyleBoxEmpty]. Tingueu en compte que "
"desactivar l'efecte visual del focus perjudicarà la usabilitat de la "
"navegació del teclat/controlador, per la qual cosa no es recomana per raons "
"d'accessibilitat."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used for the old color sample part when it is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the sample, so a partially transparent [StyleBox] "
"should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A [StyleBox] that "
"represents an outline or an underline works well for this purpose. To "
"disable the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note "
"that disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/controller "
"navigation usability, so this is not recommended for accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"El [StyleBox] utilitzat per a la part de mostra de color antiga quan està "
"enfocada. Es mostra [i]over[/i] la mostra, de manera que s'hauria "
"d'utilitzar una [StyleBox] parcialment transparent per garantir que la forma "
"del selector es mantingui visible. Un [StyleBox] que representa un esquema o "
"un subratllat funciona bé per a aquest propòsit. Per desactivar l'efecte "
"visual del focus, assigneu un recurs [StyleBoxEmpty]. Tingueu en compte que "
"desactivar l'efecte visual del focus perjudicarà la usabilitat de la "
"navegació del teclat/controlador, per la qual cosa no es recomana per raons "
"d'accessibilitat."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "A button that brings up a [ColorPicker] when pressed."
msgstr "Un botó que mostra un [ColorPicker] quan es prem."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Encapsulates a [ColorPicker], making it accessible by pressing a button. "
"Pressing the button will toggle the [ColorPicker]'s visibility.\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods "
"associated with this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, the button may not be wide enough for the color "
"preview swatch to be visible. Make sure to set [member "
"Control.custom_minimum_size] to a big enough value to give the button enough "
"space."
msgstr ""
"Encapsula un [ColorPicker], fent-lo accessible prement un botó. En prémer el "
"botó es canviarà la visibilitat de [ColorPicker].\n"
"Vegeu també [BaseButton] que conté propietats i mètodes comuns associats amb "
"aquest node.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] De manera predeterminada, és possible que el botó no sigui prou "
"ample perquè la mostra de vista prèvia del color sigui visible. Assegureu-"
"vos d'establir [member Control.custom_minimum_size] en un valor prou gran "
"per donar prou espai al botó."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [ColorPicker] that this node toggles.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [ColorPicker] que aquest node alterna.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu amagar-lo o algun dels seus fills, feu "
"servir la seva propietat [member CanvasItem.visible]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the control's [PopupPanel] which allows you to connect to popup "
"signals. This allows you to handle events when the ColorPicker is shown or "
"hidden.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [PopupPanel] del control que us permet connectar-vos a senyals "
"emergents. Això us permet gestionar esdeveniments quan el ColorPicker es "
"mostra o s'amaga.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu amagar-lo o algun dels seus fills, feu "
"servir la seva propietat [member Window.visible]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the alpha channel in the displayed [ColorPicker] will "
"be visible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el canal alfa del [ColorPicker] que es mostra serà "
"visible."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the intensity slider in the displayed [ColorPicker] "
"will be visible."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "Emitted when the color changes."
msgstr "S'emet quan el color canvia."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the [ColorPicker] is created (the button is pressed for the "
"first time)."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es crea [ColorPicker] (el botó es prem per primera vegada)."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [ColorPicker] is closed."
msgstr "S'emet quan [ColorPicker] està tancat."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "The background of the color preview rect on the button."
msgstr "El fons de la vista prèvia del color rect al botó."

#: doc/classes/ColorRect.xml
msgid "A control that displays a solid color rectangle."
msgstr "Un control que mostra un rectangle de color sòlid."

#: doc/classes/ColorRect.xml
msgid ""
"Displays a rectangle filled with a solid [member color]. If you need to "
"display the border alone, consider using a [Panel] instead."
msgstr ""
"Mostra un rectangle ple amb un [member color] sòlid. Si necessiteu mostrar "
"només la vora, penseu a utilitzar un [Panel]."

#: doc/classes/ColorRect.xml
msgid "The fill color of the rectangle."
msgstr "El color de farciment del rectangle."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid ""
"More customization of the rendering pipeline will be added in the future."
msgstr "En el futur s'afegirà més personalització del canal de representació."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid "Stores attributes used to customize how a Viewport is rendered."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema els atributs utilitzats per personalitzar com es representa una "
"finestra gràfica."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid ""
"The compositor resource stores attributes used to customize how a [Viewport] "
"is rendered."
msgstr ""
"El recurs del compositor emmagatzema els atributs utilitzats per "
"personalitzar com es representa un [Viewport]."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid "The Compositor"
msgstr "El compositor"

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid ""
"The custom [CompositorEffect]s that are applied during rendering of "
"viewports using this compositor."
msgstr ""
"Els [CompositorEffect]s personalitzats que s'apliquen durant la "
"representació de les finestres amb aquest compositor."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"The implementation may change as more of the rendering internals are exposed "
"over time."
msgstr ""
"La implementació pot canviar a mesura que més dels elements interns de "
"renderització quedin exposats amb el temps."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid "This resource allows for creating a custom rendering effect."
msgstr "Aquest recurs permet crear un efecte de renderització personalitzat."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"This resource defines a custom rendering effect that can be applied to "
"[Viewport]s through the viewports' [Environment]. You can implement a "
"callback that is called during rendering at a given stage of the rendering "
"pipeline and allows you to insert additional passes. Note that this callback "
"happens on the rendering thread. CompositorEffect is an abstract base class "
"and must be extended to implement specific rendering logic."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recurs defineix un efecte de renderització personalitzat que es pot "
"aplicar a [Viewport]s a través de les finestres [Environment]. Podeu "
"implementar una devolució de trucada que es crida durant la representació en "
"una etapa determinada de la canalització de representació i us permet "
"inserir passades addicionals. Tingueu en compte que aquesta devolució de "
"trucada es produeix al fil de representació. CompositorEffect és una classe "
"base abstracta i s'ha d'ampliar per implementar una lògica de representació "
"específica."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this function with your custom rendering code. [param "
"effect_callback_type] should always match the effect callback type you've "
"specified in [member effect_callback_type]. [param render_data] provides "
"access to the rendering state, it is only valid during rendering and should "
"not be stored."
msgstr ""
"Implementeu aquesta funció amb el vostre codi de representació "
"personalitzat. [param effect_callback_type] sempre hauria de coincidir amb "
"el tipus de devolució d'efecte que heu especificat a [member "
"effect_callback_type]. [param render_data] proporciona accés a l'estat de "
"representació, només és vàlid durant la representació i no s'ha "
"d'emmagatzemar."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this will trigger a color buffer "
"resolve before the effect is run.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the resolved buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var color_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"color\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] i MSAA està habilitat, això activarà una resolució de "
"memòria intermèdia de color abans que s'executi l'efecte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A [method _render_callback], per accedir al buffer resolt, "
"utilitzeu:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var color_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"color\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this will trigger a depth buffer "
"resolve before the effect is run.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the resolved buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var depth_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"depth\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] i MSAA està habilitat, això activarà una resolució del "
"buffer de profunditat abans que s'executi l'efecte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A [method _render_callback], per accedir al buffer resolt, "
"utilitzeu:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var depth_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"profunditat\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"The type of effect that is implemented, determines at what stage of "
"rendering the callback is called."
msgstr ""
"El tipus d'efecte que s'implementa determina en quina fase de representació "
"s'anomena la devolució de trucada."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this rendering effect is applied to any viewport it is "
"added to."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers motion vectors being calculated during "
"the opaque render state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the motion vector "
"buffer use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var motion_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_velocity_texture()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], això activa els vectors de moviment que es calculen "
"durant l'estat de renderització opaca.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A [method _render_callback], per accedir a la memòria "
"intermèdia de vectors de moviment, utilitzeu:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var motion_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_velocity_texture()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers normal and roughness data to be output "
"during our depth pre-pass, only applicable for the Forward+ renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the roughness buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var roughness_buffer = "
"render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"forward_clustered\", "
"\"normal_roughness\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The raw normal and roughness buffer is stored in an optimized format, "
"different than the one available in Spatial shaders. When sampling the "
"buffer, a conversion function must be applied. Use this function, copied "
"from [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"da5f39889f155658cef7f7ec3cc1abb94e17d815/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/"
"shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl#L334-L341]here[/"
"url]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec4 normal_roughness_compatibility(vec4 p_normal_roughness) {\n"
"\tfloat roughness = p_normal_roughness.w;\n"
"\tif (roughness > 0.5) {\n"
"\t\troughness = 1.0 - roughness;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\troughness /= (127.0 / 255.0);\n"
"\treturn vec4(normalize(p_normal_roughness.xyz * 2.0 - 1.0) * 0.5 + 0.5, "
"roughness);\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], això activa les dades normals i de rugositat que "
"s'emetin durant el nostre pas previ de profunditat, només aplicable al "
"renderitzador Forward+.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A [method _render_callback], per accedir al buffer de "
"rugositat, utilitzeu:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var roughness_buffer = "
"render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"forward_clustered\", "
"\"normal_roughness\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"El buffer normal i rugositat brut s'emmagatzema en un format optimitzat, "
"diferent del disponible en els ombrejats espacials. En el mostreig del "
"buffer, s'ha d'aplicar una funció de conversió. Utilitzeu aquesta funció, "
"copiada de [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"da5f39889f155658cef7f7ec3cc1abb94e17d815/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/"
"shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl#L334-L341]aquí[/"
"url]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"compatibilitat_rugositat_normal vec4 (rugositat_normal_vec4) {\n"
"\trugositat flotant = p_rugositat_normal.w;\n"
"\tif (rugositat > 0,5) {\n"
"\t\trugositat = 1,0 - rugositat;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\trugositat /= (127,0 / 255,0);\n"
"\tretorna vec4(normalize(p_normal_roughness.xyz * 2,0 - 1,0) * 0,5 + 0,5, "
"rugositat);\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers specular data being rendered to a "
"separate buffer and combined after effects have been applied, only "
"applicable for the Forward+ renderer."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], això activa les dades especulars que es representen a "
"una memòria intermèdia separada i es combinen després que s'hagin aplicat "
"els efectes, només aplicable al renderitzador Forward+."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called before our opaque rendering pass, but after depth "
"prepass (if applicable)."
msgstr ""
"La devolució de trucada es crida abans de la nostra passada de representació "
"opaca, però després de la prepassa de profunditat (si escau)."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called after our opaque rendering pass, but before our sky "
"is rendered."
msgstr ""
"La devolució de trucada es crida després de la nostra passada de "
"renderització opaca, però abans que es renderitzi el nostre cel."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called after our sky is rendered, but before our back "
"buffers are created (and if enabled, before subsurface scattering and/or "
"screen space reflections)."
msgstr ""
"La devolució de trucada es crida després de renderitzar el nostre cel, però "
"abans que es creïn els nostres buffers posteriors (i, si està activat, abans "
"de la dispersió subterrània i/o els reflexos de l'espai de la pantalla)."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called before our transparent rendering pass, but after our "
"sky is rendered and we've created our back buffers."
msgstr ""
"La devolució de trucada es crida abans de la nostra transmissió de "
"renderització transparent, però després de renderitzar el nostre cel i hem "
"creat els nostres buffers posteriors."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called after our transparent rendering pass, but before any "
"built-in post-processing effects and output to our render target."
msgstr ""
"La devolució de trucada es crida després de la nostra passada de "
"renderització transparent, però abans de qualsevol efecte de "
"postprocessament integrat i sortida al nostre objectiu de renderització."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EffectCallbackType] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de l'enumeració [enum EffectCallbackType]."

#: doc/classes/CompressedCubemap.xml
msgid "An optionally compressed [Cubemap]."
msgstr "Un [Cubemap] comprimit opcionalment."

#: doc/classes/CompressedCubemap.xml
msgid ""
"A cubemap that is loaded from a [code].ccube[/code] file. This file format "
"is internal to Godot; it is created by importing other image formats with "
"the import system. [CompressedCubemap] can use one of 4 compression "
"methods:\n"
"- Lossless (WebP or PNG, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Lossy (WebP, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Compressed (compressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Uncompressed (uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (compressed on the GPU. Lower file sizes than VRAM "
"Compressed, but slower to compress and lower quality than VRAM Compressed)\n"
"Only [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] actually reduces the memory usage on the GPU. "
"The [b]Lossless[/b] and [b]Lossy[/b] compression methods will reduce the "
"required storage on disk, but they will not reduce memory usage on the GPU "
"as the texture is sent to the GPU uncompressed.\n"
"Using [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] also improves loading times, as VRAM-compressed "
"textures are faster to load compared to textures using lossless or lossy "
"compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable artifacts and is "
"intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D.\n"
"See [Cubemap] for a general description of cubemaps."
msgstr ""
"Un mapa de cubs que es carrega des d'un fitxer [code].ccube[/code]. Aquest "
"format de fitxer és intern de Godot; es crea important altres formats "
"d'imatge amb el sistema d'importació. [CompressedCubemap] pot utilitzar un "
"dels 4 mètodes de compressió:\n"
"- Sense pèrdua (WebP o PNG, sense comprimir a la GPU)\n"
"- Amb pèrdua (WebP, sense comprimir a la GPU)\n"
"- VRAM comprimit (comprimit a la GPU)\n"
"- VRAM sense comprimir (sense comprimir a la GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (comprimit a la GPU. Mides de fitxer més baixes que la "
"VRAM comprimida, però més lenta de comprimir i de menor qualitat que la VRAM "
"comprimida)\n"
"Només [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] redueix realment l'ús de memòria a la GPU. Els "
"mètodes de compressió [b]Lossless[/b] i [b]Lossy[/b] reduiran "
"l'emmagatzematge necessari al disc, però no reduiran l'ús de memòria a la "
"GPU a mesura que la textura s'envia a la GPU sense comprimir.\n"
"L'ús de [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] també millora els temps de càrrega, ja que "
"les textures comprimides amb VRAM són més ràpides de carregar en comparació "
"amb les textures que utilitzen compressió sense pèrdues o amb pèrdues. La "
"compressió VRAM pot mostrar artefactes notables i està pensada per a ser "
"utilitzada per a la representació en 3D, no en 2D.\n"
"Vegeu [Cubemap] per obtenir una descripció general dels mapes de cub."

#: doc/classes/CompressedCubemapArray.xml
