#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "A CPU-based 2D particle emitter."
msgstr "Un emissor de partícules 2D basat en CPU."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"CPU-based 2D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and "
"effects.\n"
"See also [GPUParticles2D], which provides the same functionality with "
"hardware acceleration, but may not run on older devices."
msgstr ""
"Node de partícules 2D basat en CPU que s'utilitza per crear una varietat de "
"sistemes i efectes de partícules.\n"
"Vegeu també [GPUParticles2D], que proporciona la mateixa funcionalitat amb "
"l'acceleració de maquinari, però és possible que no s'executi en dispositius "
"antics."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particle systems (2D)"
msgstr "Sistemes de partícules (2D)"

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets this node's properties to match a given [GPUParticles2D] node with an "
"assigned [ParticleProcessMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les propietats d'aquest node perquè coincideixin amb un node "
"[GPUParticles2D] determinat amb un [ParticleProcessMaterial] assignat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [Curve] of the parameter specified by [enum Parameter]."
msgstr "Retorna el [Curve] del paràmetre especificat per [enum Parameter]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Returns the maximum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "Retorna l'interval de valors màxim del paràmetre indicat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Returns the minimum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "Retorna l'interval de valors mínim del paràmetre indicat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Returns the enabled state of the given particle flag."
msgstr "Retorna l'estat d'activació de l'indicador de partícula indicat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Requests the particles to process for extra process time during a single "
"frame.\n"
"[param process_time] defines the time that the particles will process while "
"emitting is on. [param process_time_residual] defines the time that "
"particles will process with emitting turned off for the simulation. When "
"combined with [member speed_scale] set to [code]0.0[/code], this is useful "
"to be able to seek a particle system timeline."
msgstr ""
"Demana que les partícules es processin durant un temps de procés addicional "
"durant un sol fotograma.\n"
"[param process_time] defineix el temps que processaran les partícules mentre "
"l'emissió estigui activada. [param process_time_residual] defineix el temps "
"que processaran les partícules amb l'emissió desactivada per a la simulació. "
"Quan es combina amb [member speed_scale] establert a [code]0.0[/code], això "
"és útil per poder cercar una línia de temps del sistema de partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Restarts the particle emitter.\n"
"If [param keep_seed] is [code]true[/code], the current random seed will be "
"preserved. Useful for seeking and playback."
msgstr ""
"Reinicia l'emissor de partícules.\n"
"Si [param keep_seed] és [code]true[/code], es conservarà la llavor aleatòria "
"actual. Útil per buscar i reproduir."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sets the [Curve] of the parameter specified by [enum Parameter]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum value for the given parameter."
msgstr "Estableix el valor màxim per al paràmetre donat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Sets the minimum value for the given parameter."
msgstr "Estableix el valor mínim del paràmetre indicat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Enables or disables the given particle flag."
msgstr "Activa o desactiva la marca de partícules donada."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Number of particles emitted in one emission cycle."
msgstr "Nombre de partícules emeses en un cicle d'emissió."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's rotation will be animated along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"La rotació de cada partícula s'animarà al llarg d'aquest [Curve]. Hauria de "
"ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Maximum initial rotation applied to each particle, in degrees."
msgstr "Rotació inicial màxima aplicada a cada partícula, en graus."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member angle_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member angle_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's angular velocity will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat angular de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Curve]. "
"Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial angular velocity (rotation speed) applied to each particle "
"in [i]degrees[/i] per second."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat angular inicial màxima (velocitat de rotació) aplicada a cada "
"partícula en [i]degrees[/i] per segon."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member angular_velocity_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member angular_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's animation offset will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament d'animació de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest "
"[Curve]. Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum animation offset that corresponds to frame index in the texture. "
"[code]0[/code] is the first frame, [code]1[/code] is the last one. See "
"[member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation]."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament d'animació màxim que correspon a l'índex de fotogrames de la "
"textura. [code]0[/code] és el primer fotograma, [code]1[/code] és l'últim. "
"Veure [member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member anim_offset_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member anim_offset_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's animation speed will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat d'animació de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Curve]. "
"Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum particle animation speed. Animation speed of [code]1[/code] means "
"that the particles will make full [code]0[/code] to [code]1[/code] offset "
"cycle during lifetime, [code]2[/code] means [code]2[/code] cycles etc.\n"
"With animation speed greater than [code]1[/code], remember to enable [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] property if you want the animation "
"to repeat."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat màxima d'animació de partícules. La velocitat d'animació de "
"[code]1[/code] significa que les partícules faran un cicle de compensació "
"complet de [code]0[/code] a [code]@1[/code] durant la vida útil, [code]2[/"
"code] significa [code]@2[/code] cicles, etc.\n"
"Amb una velocitat d'animació superior a [code]1[/code], recordeu activar la "
"propietat [member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] si voleu que "
"l'animació es repeteixi."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member anim_speed_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member anim_speed_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color. If [member texture] is defined, it will be "
"multiplied by this color."
msgstr ""
"El color inicial de cada partícula. Si es defineix [member texture], es "
"multiplicarà per aquest color."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color will vary along this [Gradient] (multiplied "
"with [member color])."
msgstr ""
"El color inicial de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Gradient] "
"(multiplicat per [member color])."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's color will vary along this [Gradient] over its lifetime "
"(multiplied with [member color])."
msgstr ""
"El color de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Gradient] al llarg de "
"la seva vida útil (multiplicat per [member color])."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Damping will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"L'amortiment variarà al llarg d'aquest [Curve]. Hauria de ser una unitat "
"[Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum rate at which particles lose velocity. For example value of "
"[code]100[/code] means that the particle will go from [code]100[/code] "
"velocity to [code]0[/code] in [code]1[/code] second."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat màxima a la qual les partícules perden velocitat. Per exemple, el "
"valor de [code]100[/code] significa que la partícula passarà de [code]100[/"
"code] a [code]@0[/code] en [code]1[/code] segon."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member damping_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member damping_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Unit vector specifying the particles' emission direction."
msgstr "Vector unitari que especifica la direcció d'emissió de les partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particle draw order."
msgstr "Ordre d'extracció de partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Color]s to modulate particles by when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [Color]s per modular les partícules quan s'utilitzen [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] o [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the direction the particles will be emitted in when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la direcció en què s'emetran les partícules quan utilitzeu "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the initial positions to spawn particles when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les posicions inicials per generar partícules quan s'utilitza "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] o [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The rectangle's extents if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RECTANGLE]."
msgstr ""
"Les extensions del rectangle si [member emission_shape] s'estableix en "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RECTANGLE]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The ring's inner radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"El radi interior de l'anell si [member emission_shape] s'estableix en "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The ring's outer radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"El radi exterior de l'anell si [member emission_shape] s'estableix en "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted inside this region."
msgstr "Dins d'aquesta regió s'emetran partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The sphere's radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."
msgstr ""
"El radi de l'esfera si [member emission_shape] s'estableix en [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles are being emitted. [member emitting] can be "
"used to start and stop particles from emitting. However, if [member "
"one_shot] is [code]true[/code] setting [member emitting] to [code]true[/"
"code] will not restart the emission cycle until after all active particles "
"finish processing. You can use the [signal finished] signal to be notified "
"once all active particles finish processing."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], s'estan emetent partícules. [member emitting] es pot "
"utilitzar per iniciar i aturar l'emissió de partícules. Tanmateix, si "
"[member one_shot] és [code]true[/code] establint [member emitting] a "
"[code]true[/code] no es reiniciarà el cicle d'emissió fins que s'acabi el "
"procés de totes les partícules actives. Podeu utilitzar el senyal [signal "
"finished] per rebre una notificació quan totes les partícules actives acabin "
"de processar-se."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"How rapidly particles in an emission cycle are emitted. If greater than "
"[code]0[/code], there will be a gap in emissions before the next cycle "
"begins."
msgstr ""
"Amb quina rapidesa s'emeten les partícules en un cicle d'emissió. Si és "
"superior a [code]0[/code], hi haurà un buit en les emissions abans que "
"comenci el següent cicle."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The particle system's frame rate is fixed to a value. For example, changing "
"the value to 2 will make the particles render at 2 frames per second. Note "
"this does not slow down the simulation of the particle system itself."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat de fotogrames del sistema de partícules es fixa en un valor. "
"Per exemple, canviar el valor a 2 farà que les partícules es mostrin a 2 "
"fotogrames per segon. Tingueu en compte que això no alenteix la simulació "
"del propi sistema de partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], results in fractional delta calculation which has a "
"smoother particles display effect."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], resulta en un càlcul delta fraccionari que té un "
"efecte de visualització de partícules més suau."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Gravity applied to every particle."
msgstr "Gravetat aplicada a cada partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's hue will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"La tonalitat de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Curve]. Hauria de "
"ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial hue variation applied to each particle. It will shift the "
"particle color's hue."
msgstr ""
"Màxima variació de to inicial aplicada a cada partícula. Canviarà la "
"tonalitat del color de la partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member hue_variation_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member hue_variation_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial velocity magnitude for each particle. Direction comes from "
"[member direction] and [member spread]."
msgstr ""
"Magnitud de velocitat inicial màxima per a cada partícula. La direcció ve de "
"[member direction] i [member spread]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member initial_velocity_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member initial_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Amount of time each particle will exist."
msgstr "Quantitat de temps que existirà cada partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Particle lifetime randomness ratio."
msgstr "Relació d'aleatorietat de la vida útil de les partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's linear acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should be "
"a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"L'acceleració lineal de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta [Curve]. "
"Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum linear acceleration applied to each particle in the direction of "
"motion."
msgstr ""
"Acceleració lineal màxima aplicada a cada partícula en la direcció del "
"moviment."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member linear_accel_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member linear_accel_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space "
"(known as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate "
"along the [CPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated. If [code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will "
"not move or rotate along the [CPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it "
"is moved or rotated."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les partícules utilitzen l'espai de coordenades del "
"node pare (conegut com a coordenades locals). Això farà que les partícules "
"es moguin i giren al llarg del node [CPUParticles2D] (i dels seus pares) "
"quan es mou o gira. Si [code]false[/code], les partícules utilitzen "
"coordenades globals; no es mouran ni giraran al llarg del node "
"[CPUParticles2D] (i dels seus pares) quan es mou o gira."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], only one emission cycle occurs. If set [code]true[/"
"code] during a cycle, emission will stop at the cycle's end."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], només es produeix un cicle d'emissió. Si s'estableix "
"[code]true[/code] durant un cicle, l'emissió s'aturarà al final del cicle."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's orbital velocity will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat orbital de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Curve]. "
"Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum orbital velocity applied to each particle. Makes the particles "
"circle around origin. Specified in number of full rotations around origin "
"per second."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat orbital màxima aplicada a cada partícula. Fa que les partícules "
"circulin al voltant de l'origen. Especificat en nombre de rotacions "
"completes al voltant de l'origen per segon."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member orbit_velocity_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member orbit_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Align Y axis of particle with the direction of its velocity."
msgstr "Alineeu l'eix Y de la partícula amb la direcció de la seva velocitat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Particle system starts as if it had already run for this many seconds."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de partícules comença com si ja hagués funcionat durant tants "
"segons."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's radial acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should be "
"a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"L'acceleració radial de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta [Curve]. "
"Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum radial acceleration applied to each particle. Makes particle "
"accelerate away from the origin or towards it if negative."
msgstr ""
"Acceleració radial màxima aplicada a cada partícula. Fa que la partícula "
"s'acceleri lluny de l'origen o cap a ell si és negativa."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member radial_accel_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member radial_accel_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Emission lifetime randomness ratio."
msgstr "Relació d'aleatorietat de la vida útil de les emissions."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"L'escala de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta [Curve]. Hauria de ser "
"una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Maximum initial scale applied to each particle."
msgstr "Escala inicial màxima aplicada a cada partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member scale_amount_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member scale_amount_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's horizontal scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"L'escala horitzontal de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta [Curve]. "
"Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] ha d'estar habilitat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's vertical scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"L'escala vertical de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta [Curve]. "
"Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] ha d'estar habilitat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the random seed used by the particle system. Only effective if [member "
"use_fixed_seed] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la llavor aleatòria utilitzada pel sistema de partícules. Només "
"efectiu si [member use_fixed_seed] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particle system's running speed scaling ratio. A value of [code]0[/code] can "
"be used to pause the particles."
msgstr ""
"Relació d'escala de velocitat de funcionament del sistema de partícules. Un "
"valor de [code]0[/code] es pot utilitzar per aturar les partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scale curve will be split into x and y components. "
"See [member scale_curve_x] and [member scale_curve_y]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la corba d'escala es dividirà en components x i y. "
"Vegeu [member scale_curve_x] i [member scale_curve_y]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial direction range from [code]+spread[/code] to [code]-"
"spread[/code] degrees."
msgstr ""
"La direcció inicial de cada partícula va des de [code]+spread[/code] fins a "
"[code]-spread[/code] graus."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's tangential acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should "
"be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"L'acceleració tangencial de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta "
"[Curve]. Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum tangential acceleration applied to each particle. Tangential "
"acceleration is perpendicular to the particle's velocity giving the "
"particles a swirling motion."
msgstr ""
"Acceleració tangencial màxima aplicada a cada partícula. L'acceleració "
"tangencial és perpendicular a la velocitat de la partícula donant a les "
"partícules un moviment giratori."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member tangential_accel_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member tangential_accel_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particle texture. If [code]null[/code], particles will be squares."
msgstr ""
"Textura de partícules. Si [code]null[/code], les partícules seran quadrats."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles will use the same seed for every simulation "
"using the seed defined in [member seed]. This is useful for situations where "
"the visual outcome should be consistent across replays, for example when "
"using Movie Maker mode."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les partícules utilitzaran la mateixa llavor per a "
"cada simulació utilitzant la llavor definida a [member seed]. Això és útil "
"per a situacions en què el resultat visual ha de ser coherent entre les "
"repeticions, per exemple, quan s'utilitza el mode Movie Maker."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when all active particles have finished processing. When [member "
"one_shot] is disabled, particles will process continuously, so this is never "
"emitted."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan totes les partícules actives han acabat de processar-se. Quan "
"[member one_shot] està desactivat, les partícules es processaran "
"contínuament, de manera que això no s'emet mai."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Particles are drawn in the order emitted."
msgstr "Les partícules es dibuixen en l'ordre d'emissió."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles are drawn in order of remaining lifetime. In other words, the "
"particle with the highest lifetime is drawn at the front."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules es dibuixen per ordre de vida restant. En altres paraules, la "
"partícula amb la vida útil més alta es dibuixa al davant."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set initial velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir les propietats de velocitat inicial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set angular velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats de velocitat angular."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set orbital velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats de velocitat orbital."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set linear acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats d'acceleració lineal."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set radial acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats d'acceleració radial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set tangential acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats d'acceleració tangencial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set damping properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats d'amortiment."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set angle properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats d'angle."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set scale properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats d'escala."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set hue variation properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats de variació de to."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set animation speed properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per definir les propietats de velocitat de l'animació."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set animation offset properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_curve] per establir propietats de compensació d'animació."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Parameter] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum Parameter]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_particle_flag] to set [member particle_flag_align_y]."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_particle_flag] per establir [member "
"particle_flag_align_y]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Present for consistency with 3D particle nodes, not used in 2D."
msgstr ""
"Present per coherència amb els nodes de partícules 3D, no utilitzats en 2D."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ParticleFlags] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum ParticleFlags]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "All particles will be emitted from a single point."
msgstr "Totes les partícules seran emeses des d'un sol punt."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted in the volume of a sphere flattened to two "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran en el volum d'una esfera aplanada a dues dimensions."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted on the surface of a sphere flattened to two "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran a la superfície d'una esfera aplanada a dues "
"dimensions."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted in the area of a rectangle."
msgstr "Les partícules s'emeten a l'àrea d'un rectangle."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position chosen randomly among [member "
"emission_points]. Particle color will be modulated by [member "
"emission_colors]."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran en una posició escollida aleatòriament entre "
"[member emission_points]. El color de les partícules estarà modulat per "
"[member emission_colors]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position chosen randomly among [member "
"emission_points]. Particle velocity and rotation will be set based on "
"[member emission_normals]. Particle color will be modulated by [member "
"emission_colors]."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran en una posició escollida aleatòriament entre "
"[member emission_points]. La velocitat i la rotació de les partícules "
"s'establiran en funció de [member emission_normals]. El color de les "
"partícules estarà modulat per [member emission_colors]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted in the area of a ring parameterized by its outer "
"and inner radius."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran a la zona d'un anell parametritzat pel seu radi "
"exterior i interior."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EmissionShape] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum EmissionShape]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "A CPU-based 3D particle emitter."
msgstr "Un emissor de partícules 3D basat en CPU."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"CPU-based 3D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and "
"effects.\n"
"See also [GPUParticles3D], which provides the same functionality with "
"hardware acceleration, but may not run on older devices."
msgstr ""
"Node de partícules 3D basat en CPU que s'utilitza per crear una varietat de "
"sistemes i efectes de partícules.\n"
"Vegeu també [GPUParticles3D], que proporciona la mateixa funcionalitat amb "
"l'acceleració de maquinari, però és possible que no s'executi en dispositius "
"antics."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RibbonTrailMesh.xml doc/classes/TubeTrailMesh.xml
msgid "Particle systems (3D)"
msgstr "Sistemes de partícules (3D)"

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the axis-aligned bounding box that contains all the particles that "
"are active in the current frame."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el quadre delimitador alineat amb l'eix que conté totes les "
"partícules que estan actives al marc actual."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets this node's properties to match a given [GPUParticles3D] node with an "
"assigned [ParticleProcessMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les propietats d'aquest node perquè coincideixin amb un node "
"[GPUParticles3D] determinat amb un [ParticleProcessMaterial] assignat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum angle."
msgstr "Angle màxim."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum angle."
msgstr "Angle mínim."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's angular velocity (rotation speed) will vary along this "
"[Curve] over its lifetime. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat angular de cada partícula (velocitat de rotació) variarà al "
"llarg d'aquesta [Curve] al llarg de la seva vida útil. Hauria de ser una "
"unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum initial angular velocity (rotation speed) applied to each particle "
"in [i]degrees[/i] per second."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat angular inicial mínima (velocitat de rotació) aplicada a cada "
"partícula en [i]degrees[/i] per segon."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum animation offset."
msgstr "Desplaçament màxim d'animació."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum animation offset."
msgstr "Desplaçament mínim d'animació."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum particle animation speed."
msgstr "Velocitat màxima d'animació de partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum particle animation speed."
msgstr "Velocitat mínima d'animació de partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex colors. To "
"have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member color] "
"will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color inicial de cada partícula.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member color] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de la malla de "
"partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] [code]true[/"
"code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] s'ha "
"d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas contrari, "
"[member color] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color will vary along this [Gradient] (multiplied "
"with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_initial_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's "
"vertex colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"color_initial_ramp] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color inicial de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Gradient] "
"(multiplicat per [member color]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member color_initial_ramp] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de "
"la malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] ser "
"[code]true[/code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/"
"code] s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas "
"contrari, [member color_initial_ramp] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's color will vary along this [Gradient] over its lifetime "
"(multiplied with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"color_ramp] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [Gradient] al llarg de "
"la seva vida útil (multiplicat per [member color]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member color_ramp] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de la "
"malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] ser "
"[code]true[/code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/"
"code] s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas "
"contrari, [member color_ramp] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum damping."
msgstr "Amortiment màxim."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum damping."
msgstr "Amortiment mínim."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The rectangle's extents if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX]."
msgstr ""
"Les extensions del rectangle si [member emission_shape] s'estableix en "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Color]s to modulate particles by when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member emission_colors] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"emission_colors] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [Color]s per modular les partícules quan s'utilitzen [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] o [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member emission_colors] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de la "
"malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] ser "
"[code]true[/code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/"
"code] s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas "
"contrari, [member emission_colors] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The axis of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"L'eix de l'anell quan s'utilitza l'emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The angle of the cone when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]. "
"The default angle of 90 degrees results in a ring, while an angle of 0 "
"degrees results in a cone. Intermediate values will result in a ring where "
"one end is larger than the other.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on [member emission_ring_height], the angle may be "
"clamped if the ring's end is reached to form a perfect cone."
msgstr ""
"L'angle del con quan s'utilitza l'emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]. "
"L'angle predeterminat de 90 graus dóna com a resultat un anell, mentre que "
"un angle de 0 graus resulta en un con. Els valors intermedis donaran lloc a "
"un anell on un extrem és més gran que l'altre.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Depenent de [member emission_ring_height], l'angle es pot "
"subjectar si s'arriba a l'extrem de l'anell per formar un con perfecte."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The height of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"L'alçada de l'anell quan s'utilitza l'emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The inner radius of the ring when using the emitter [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"El radi interior de l'anell quan s'utilitza l'emissor [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The radius of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"El radi de l'anell quan s'utilitza l'emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The sphere's radius if [enum EmissionShape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."
msgstr ""
"El radi de l'esfera si [enum EmissionShape] s'estableix en [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The particle system's frame rate is fixed to a value. For example, changing "
"the value to 2 will make the particles render at 2 frames per second. Note "
"this does not slow down the particle system itself."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat de fotogrames del sistema de partícules es fixa en un valor. "
"Per exemple, canviar el valor a 2 farà que les partícules es mostrin a 2 "
"fotogrames per segon. Tingueu en compte que això no frena el propi sistema "
"de partícules."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Amount of [member spread] in Y/Z plane. A value of [code]1[/code] restricts "
"particles to X/Z plane."
msgstr ""
"Quantitat de [member spread] al pla Y/Z. Un valor de [code]1[/code] "
"restringeix les partícules al pla X/Z."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum hue variation."
msgstr "Màxima variació de tonalitat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum hue variation."
msgstr "Variació mínima de tonalitat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum value of the initial velocity."
msgstr "Valor màxim de la velocitat inicial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum value of the initial velocity."
msgstr "Valor mínim de la velocitat inicial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum linear acceleration."
msgstr "Màxima acceleració lineal."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum linear acceleration."
msgstr "Acceleració lineal mínima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space "
"(known as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate "
"along the [CPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated. If [code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will "
"not move or rotate along the [CPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it "
"is moved or rotated."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les partícules utilitzen l'espai de coordenades del "
"node pare (conegut com a coordenades locals). Això farà que les partícules "
"es moguin i giren al llarg del node [CPUParticles3D] (i dels seus pares) "
"quan es mou o gira. Si [code]false[/code], les partícules utilitzen "
"coordenades globals; no es mouran ni giraran al llarg del node "
"[CPUParticles3D] (i dels seus pares) quan es mou o gira."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Mesh] used for each particle. If [code]null[/code], particles will be "
"spheres."
msgstr ""
"El [Mesh] utilitzat per a cada partícula. Si [code]null[/code], les "
"partícules seran esferes."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum orbit velocity."
msgstr "Velocitat màxima de l'òrbita."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum orbit velocity."
msgstr "Velocitat òrbita mínima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], particles will not move on the Z axis."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], les partícules no es mouran a l'eix Z."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles rotate around Y axis by [member angle_min]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les partícules giren al voltant de l'eix Y per [member "
"angle_min]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum radial acceleration."
msgstr "Acceleració radial màxima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum radial acceleration."
msgstr "Acceleració radial mínima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum scale."
msgstr "Escala màxima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum scale."
msgstr "Escala mínima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Curve for the scale over life, along the x axis."
msgstr "Corba de l'escala sobre la vida, al llarg de l'eix x."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Curve for the scale over life, along the y axis."
msgstr "Corba per a l'escala sobre la vida, al llarg de l'eix y."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Curve for the scale over life, along the z axis."
msgstr "Corba de l'escala sobre la vida, al llarg de l'eix z."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], three different scale curves can be specified, "
"one per scale axis."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix a [code]true[/code], es poden especificar tres corbes "
"d'escala diferents, una per eix d'escala."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial direction range from [code]+spread[/code] to [code]-"
"spread[/code] degrees. Applied to X/Z plane and Y/Z planes."
msgstr ""
"La direcció inicial de cada partícula va des de [code]+spread[/code] fins a "
"[code]-spread[/code] graus. Aplicat al pla X/Z i als plans Y/Z."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum tangent acceleration."
msgstr "Acceleració tangent màxima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum tangent acceleration."
msgstr "Acceleració tangent mínima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [AABB] that determines the node's region which needs to be visible on "
"screen for the particle system to be active.\n"
"Grow the box if particles suddenly appear/disappear when the node enters/"
"exits the screen. The [AABB] can be grown via code or with the [b]Particles "
"→ Generate AABB[/b] editor tool."
msgstr ""
"El [AABB] que determina la regió del node que ha de ser visible a la "
"pantalla perquè el sistema de partícules estigui actiu.\n"
"Feu créixer la caixa si les partícules apareixen o desapareixen de sobte "
"quan el node entra o surt de la pantalla. El [AABB] es pot fer créixer "
"mitjançant codi o amb l'eina d'editor [b]Particles → Genera AABB[/b]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Particles are drawn in order of depth."
msgstr "Les partícules es dibuixen per ordre de profunditat."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_particle_flag] to set [member particle_flag_rotate_y]."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_particle_flag] per establir [member "
"particle_flag_rotate_y]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_particle_flag] to set [member particle_flag_disable_z]."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_particle_flag] per establir [member "
"particle_flag_disable_z]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted in the volume of a sphere."
msgstr "Les partícules s'emetran en el volum d'una esfera."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted on the surface of a sphere."
msgstr "Les partícules s'emeten a la superfície d'una esfera."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted in the volume of a box."
msgstr "Les partícules s'emetran en el volum d'una caixa."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted in a ring or cylinder."
msgstr "Les partícules s'emeten en un anell o cilindre."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid "Provides access to advanced cryptographic functionalities."
msgstr "Proporciona accés a funcionalitats criptogràfiques avançades."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"The Crypto class provides access to advanced cryptographic functionalities.\n"
"Currently, this includes asymmetric key encryption/decryption, signing/"
"verification, and generating cryptographically secure random bytes, RSA "
"keys, HMAC digests, and self-signed [X509Certificate]s.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Generate new RSA key.\n"
"var key = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"\n"
"# Generate new self-signed certificate with the given key.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(key, "
"\"CN=mydomain.com,O=My Game Company,C=IT\")\n"
"\n"
"# Save key and certificate in the user folder.\n"
"key.save(\"user://generated.key\")\n"
"cert.save(\"user://generated.crt\")\n"
"\n"
"# Encryption\n"
"var data = \"Some data\"\n"
"var encrypted = crypto.encrypt(key, data.to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\n"
"# Decryption\n"
"var decrypted = crypto.decrypt(key, encrypted)\n"
"\n"
"# Signing\n"
"var signature = crypto.sign(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, "
"data.sha256_buffer(), key)\n"
"\n"
"# Verifying\n"
"var verified = crypto.verify(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, "
"data.sha256_buffer(), signature, key)\n"
"\n"
"# Checks\n"
"assert(verified)\n"
"assert(data.to_utf8_buffer() == decrypted)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Diagnostics;\n"
"\n"
"Crypto crypto = new Crypto();\n"
"\n"
"// Generate new RSA key.\n"
"CryptoKey key = crypto.GenerateRsa(4096);\n"
"\n"
"// Generate new self-signed certificate with the given key.\n"
"X509Certificate cert = crypto.GenerateSelfSignedCertificate(key, "
"\"CN=mydomain.com,O=My Game Company,C=IT\");\n"
"\n"
"// Save key and certificate in the user folder.\n"
"key.Save(\"user://generated.key\");\n"
"cert.Save(\"user://generated.crt\");\n"
"\n"
"// Encryption\n"
"string data = \"Some data\";\n"
"byte[] encrypted = crypto.Encrypt(key, data.ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\n"
"// Decryption\n"
"byte[] decrypted = crypto.Decrypt(key, encrypted);\n"
"\n"
"// Signing\n"
"byte[] signature = crypto.Sign(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, "
"Data.Sha256Buffer(), key);\n"
"\n"
"// Verifying\n"
"bool verified = crypto.Verify(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, "
"Data.Sha256Buffer(), signature, key);\n"
"\n"
"// Checks\n"
"Debug.Assert(verified);\n"
"Debug.Assert(data.ToUtf8Buffer() == decrypted);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"La classe Crypto proporciona accés a funcionalitats criptogràfiques "
"avançades.\n"
"Actualment, això inclou el xifratge/desxifrat de claus asimètriques, la "
"signatura/verificació i la generació de bytes aleatoris criptogràficament "
"segurs, claus RSA, resums HMAC i [X509Certificate]s autosignats.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Genera una nova clau RSA.\n"
"clau var = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"\n"
"# Genereu un nou certificat autofirmat amb la clau proporcionada.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(clau, "
"\"CN=elmeudomini.com,O=La meva empresa de jocs,C=IT\")\n"
"\n"
"# Desa la clau i el certificat a la carpeta d'usuari.\n"
"key.save(\"usuari://claugenerada\")\n"
"cert.save(\"usuari://generated.crt\")\n"
"\n"
"# Xifratge\n"
"var data = \"Algunes dades\"\n"
"var encriptat = crypto.encrypt(clau, dades.to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\n"
"# Desxifrat\n"
"var decrypted = crypto.decrypt (clau, xifrat)\n"
"\n"
"# Signatura\n"
"var signatura = crypto.sign(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, "
"data.sha256_buffer(), clau)\n"
"\n"
"# S'està verificant\n"
"var verificat = crypto.verify(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, "
"data.sha256_buffer(), signatura, clau)\n"
"\n"
"# xecs\n"
"afirmar (verificat)\n"
"assert(data.to_utf8_buffer() == desxifrat)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"utilitzant Godot;\n"
"utilitzant System.Diagnostics;\n"
"\n"
"Crypto crypto = nou Crypto();\n"
"\n"
"// Genera una nova clau RSA.\n"
"Clau CryptoKey = crypto.GenerateRsa(4096);\n"
"\n"
"// Genera un nou certificat autofirmat amb la clau proporcionada.\n"
"X509Certificate cert = crypto.GenerateSelfSignedCertificate(clau, "
"\"CN=elmeudomini.com,O=La meva empresa de jocs,C=IT\");\n"
"\n"
"// Desa la clau i el certificat a la carpeta d'usuari.\n"
"key.Save (\"usuari://generated.key\");\n"
"cert.Save(\"usuari://generated.crt\");\n"
"\n"
"// Xifratge\n"
"string data = \"Algunes dades\";\n"
"byte[] xifrat = crypto.Encrypt(clau, dades.ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\n"
"// Desxifrat\n"
"byte[] decrypted = crypto.Decrypt(clau, xifrat);\n"
"\n"
"// Signatura\n"
"byte[] signatura = crypto.Sign(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, "
"Data.Sha256Buffer(), clau);\n"
"\n"
"// Verificant\n"
"bool verificat = crypto.Verify(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, "
"Data.Sha256Buffer(), signatura, clau);\n"
"\n"
"// Comprovacions\n"
"Debug.Assert (verificat);\n"
"Debug.Assert(data.ToUtf8Buffer() == desxifrat);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Compares two [PackedByteArray]s for equality without leaking timing "
"information in order to prevent timing attacks.\n"
"See [url=https://paragonie.com/blog/2015/11/preventing-timing-attacks-on-"
"string-comparison-with-double-hmac-strategy]this blog post[/url] for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Compara dos [PackedByteArray]s per a la igualtat sense filtrar informació de "
"temps per tal d'evitar atacs de temps.\n"
"Consulteu [url=https://paragonie.com/blog/2015/11/preventing-timing-attacks-"
"on-string-comparison-with-double-hmac-strategy]aquesta publicació de bloc[/"
"url] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Decrypt the given [param ciphertext] with the provided private [param key].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum size of accepted ciphertext is limited by the key "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Desxifra el [param ciphertext] donat amb el [param key] privat "
"proporcionat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La mida màxima del text xifrat acceptat està limitada per la "
"mida de la clau."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Encrypt the given [param plaintext] with the provided public [param key].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum size of accepted plaintext is limited by the key "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Xifreu el [param plaintext] donat amb el [param key] públic proporcionat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La mida màxima del text sense format acceptat està limitada per "
"la mida de la clau."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Generates a [PackedByteArray] of cryptographically secure random bytes with "
"given [param size]."
msgstr ""
"Genera un [PackedByteArray] de bytes aleatoris criptogràficament segurs amb "
"[param size] donat."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Generates an RSA [CryptoKey] that can be used for creating self-signed "
"certificates and passed to [method StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream]."
msgstr ""
"Genera un RSA [CryptoKey] que es pot utilitzar per crear certificats "
"autofirmats i passar a [method StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream]."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Generates a self-signed [X509Certificate] from the given [CryptoKey] and "
"[param issuer_name]. The certificate validity will be defined by [param "
"not_before] and [param not_after] (first valid date and last valid date). "
"The [param issuer_name] must contain at least \"CN=\" (common name, i.e. the "
"domain name), \"O=\" (organization, i.e. your company name), \"C=\" "
"(country, i.e. 2 lettered ISO-3166 code of the country the organization is "
"based in).\n"
"A small example to generate an RSA key and an X509 self-signed certificate.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"# Generate 4096 bits RSA key.\n"
"var key = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"# Generate self-signed certificate using the given key.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(key, \"CN=example.com,O=A "
"Game Company,C=IT\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var crypto = new Crypto();\n"
"// Generate 4096 bits RSA key.\n"
"CryptoKey key = crypto.GenerateRsa(4096);\n"
"// Generate self-signed certificate using the given key.\n"
"X509Certificate cert = crypto.GenerateSelfSignedCertificate(key, "
"\"CN=mydomain.com,O=My Game Company,C=IT\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Genera un [X509Certificate] autosignat a partir dels [CryptoKey] i [param "
"issuer_name] donats. La validesa del certificat la definiran [param "
"not_before] i [param not_after] (primera data vàlida i darrera data vàlida). "
"L'[param issuer_name] ha de contenir com a mínim \"CN=\" (nom comú, és a "
"dir, el nom del domini), \"O=\" (organització, és a dir, el nom de la vostra "
"empresa), \"C=\" (país, és a dir, codi ISO-3166 de 2 lletres del país on té "
"la seu de l'organització).\n"
"Un petit exemple per generar una clau RSA i un certificat autofirmat X509.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"# Genera una clau RSA de 4096 bits.\n"
"clau var = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"# Genereu un certificat autofirmat amb la clau proporcionada.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(clau, "
"\"CN=example.com,O=A Game Company,C=IT\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var crypto = new Crypto();\n"
"// Genera una clau RSA de 4096 bits.\n"
"Clau CryptoKey = crypto.GenerateRsa(4096);\n"
"// Genera un certificat autofirmat amb la clau proporcionada.\n"
"X509Certificate cert = crypto.GenerateSelfSignedCertificate(clau, "
"\"CN=elmeudomini.com,O=La meva empresa de jocs,C=IT\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Generates an [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMAC]HMAC[/url] digest of "
"[param msg] using [param key]. The [param hash_type] parameter is the "
"hashing algorithm that is used for the inner and outer hashes.\n"
"Currently, only [constant HashingContext.HASH_SHA256] and [constant "
"HashingContext.HASH_SHA1] are supported."
msgstr ""
"Genera un [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMAC]HMAC[/url] de [param msg] "
"mitjançant [param key]. El paràmetre [param hash_type] és l'algoritme hash "
"que s'utilitza per als hash intern i extern.\n"
"Actualment, només s'admeten [constant HashingContext.HASH_SHA256] i "
"[constant HashingContext.HASH_SHA1]."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Sign a given [param hash] of type [param hash_type] with the provided "
"private [param key]."
msgstr ""
"Signa un [param hash] determinat del tipus [param hash_type] amb el [param "
"key] privat proporcionat."

#: doc/classes/Crypto.xml
msgid ""
"Verify that a given [param signature] for [param hash] of type [param "
"hash_type] against the provided public [param key]."
msgstr ""
"Verifiqueu que un [param signature] determinat per a [param hash] del tipus "
"[param hash_type] amb el públic proporcionat [param key]."

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml
msgid "A cryptographic key (RSA or elliptic-curve)."
msgstr "Una clau criptogràfica (RSA o corba el·líptica)."

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml
msgid ""
"The CryptoKey class represents a cryptographic key. Keys can be loaded and "
"saved like any other [Resource].\n"
"They can be used to generate a self-signed [X509Certificate] via [method "
"Crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate] and as private key in [method "
"StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream] along with the appropriate certificate."
msgstr ""
"La classe CryptoKey representa una clau criptogràfica. Les claus es poden "
"carregar i desar com qualsevol altra [Resource].\n"
"Es poden utilitzar per generar un [X509Certificate] autosignat mitjançant "
"[method Crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate] i com a clau privada a "
"[method StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream] juntament amb el certificat adequat."

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml doc/classes/X509Certificate.xml
msgid "SSL certificates"
msgstr "Certificats SSL"

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this CryptoKey only has the public part, and "
"not the private one."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta CryptoKey només té la part pública, i "
"no la privada."

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml
msgid ""
"Loads a key from [param path]. If [param public_only] is [code]true[/code], "
"only the public key will be loaded.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param path] should be a \"*.pub\" file if [param public_only] "
"is [code]true[/code], a \"*.key\" file otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Carrega una clau des de [param path]. Si [param public_only] és [code]true[/"
"code], només es carregarà la clau pública.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param path] hauria de ser un fitxer \"*.pub\" si [param "
"public_only] és [code]true[/code], un altre fitxer \"*.key\"."

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml
msgid ""
"Loads a key from the given [param string_key]. If [param public_only] is "
"[code]true[/code], only the public key will be loaded."
msgstr ""
"Carrega una clau del [param string_key] donat. Si [param public_only] és "
"[code]true[/code], només es carregarà la clau pública."

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml
msgid ""
"Saves a key to the given [param path]. If [param public_only] is [code]true[/"
"code], only the public key will be saved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param path] should be a \"*.pub\" file if [param public_only] "
"is [code]true[/code], a \"*.key\" file otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Desa una clau al [param path] donat. Si [param public_only] és [code]true[/"
"code], només es desarà la clau pública.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param path] hauria de ser un fitxer \"*.pub\" si [param "
"public_only] és [code]true[/code], un altre fitxer \"*.key\"."

#: doc/classes/CryptoKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a string containing the key in PEM format. If [param public_only] is "
"[code]true[/code], only the public key will be included."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una cadena que conté la clau en format PEM. Si [param public_only] "
"és [code]true[/code], només s'inclourà la clau pública."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGBox3D.xml
msgid "A CSG Box shape."
msgstr "Una forma de caixa CSG."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGBox3D.xml
msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a box for use with the CSG system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Aquest node us permet crear una caixa per utilitzar-la amb el sistema CSG.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGBox3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCombiner3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGMesh3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPrimitive3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml
msgid "Prototyping levels with CSG"
msgstr "Nivells de prototipatge amb CSG"

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGBox3D.xml
msgid "The material used to render the box."
msgstr "El material utilitzat per render la caixa."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCombiner3D.xml
msgid "A CSG node that allows you to combine other CSG modifiers."
msgstr "Un node CSG que us permet combinar altres modificadors CSG."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCombiner3D.xml
msgid ""
"For complex arrangements of shapes, it is sometimes needed to add structure "
"to your CSG nodes. The CSGCombiner3D node allows you to create this "
"structure. The node encapsulates the result of the CSG operations of its "
"children. In this way, it is possible to do operations on one set of shapes "
"that are children of one CSGCombiner3D node, and a set of separate "
"operations on a second set of shapes that are children of a second "
"CSGCombiner3D node, and then do an operation that takes the two end results "
"as its input to create the final shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Per a disposicions complexes de formes, de vegades cal afegir estructura als "
"vostres nodes CSG. El node CSGCombiner3D us permet crear aquesta estructura. "
"El node encapsula el resultat de les operacions CSG dels seus fills. "
"D'aquesta manera, és possible fer operacions en un conjunt de formes que són "
"fills d'un node CSGCombiner3D, i un conjunt d'operacions separades en un "
"segon conjunt de formes que són fills d'un segon node CSGCombiner3D, i "
"després fer una operació que pren els dos resultats finals com a entrada per "
"crear la forma final.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
msgid "A CSG Cylinder shape."
msgstr "Una forma de cilindre CSG."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a cylinder (or cone) for use with the CSG "
"system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Aquest node us permet crear un cilindre (o con) per utilitzar-lo amb el "
"sistema CSG.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] a cone is created, the [member radius] will only apply "
"to one side."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] es crea un con, el [member radius] només s'aplicarà a "
"un costat."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
msgid "The height of the cylinder."
msgstr "L'alçada del cilindre."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
msgid "The material used to render the cylinder."
msgstr "El material utilitzat per fer el cilindre."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerCylinder.xml
msgid "The radius of the cylinder."
msgstr "El radi del cilindre."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of sides of the cylinder, the higher this number the more detail "
"there will be in the cylinder."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de costats del cilindre, com més gran sigui aquest nombre, més "
"detall hi haurà al cilindre."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGCylinder3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the normals of the cylinder are set to give a smooth "
"effect making the cylinder seem rounded. If [code]false[/code] the cylinder "
"will have a flat shaded look."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les normals del cilindre s'estableixen per donar un "
"efecte suau fent que el cilindre sembli arrodonit. Si [code]false[/code] el "
"cilindre tindrà un aspecte ombrejat pla."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGMesh3D.xml
msgid "A CSG Mesh shape that uses a mesh resource."
msgstr "Una forma de malla CSG que utilitza un recurs de malla."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGMesh3D.xml
msgid ""
"This CSG node allows you to use any mesh resource as a CSG shape, provided "
"it is [i]manifold[/i]. A manifold shape is closed, does not self-intersect, "
"does not contain internal faces and has no edges that connect to more than "
"two faces. See also [CSGPolygon3D] for drawing 2D extruded polygons to be "
"used as CSG nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Aquest node CSG us permet utilitzar qualsevol recurs de malla com a forma "
"CSG, sempre que sigui [i]manifold[/i]. Una forma múltiple està tancada, no "
"s'autointerseca, no conté cares internes i no té arestes que es connectin a "
"més de dues cares. Vegeu també [CSGPolygon3D] per dibuixar polígons extruïts "
"en 2D per utilitzar-los com a nodes CSG.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGMesh3D.xml
msgid "The [Material] used in drawing the CSG shape."
msgstr "El [Material] utilitzat per dibuixar la forma CSG."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGMesh3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Mesh] resource to use as a CSG shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some [Mesh] types such as [PlaneMesh], [PointMesh], [QuadMesh], "
"and [RibbonTrailMesh] are excluded from the type hint for this property, as "
"these primitives are non-[i]manifold[/i] and thus not compatible with the "
"CSG algorithm.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using an [ArrayMesh], all vertex attributes except "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX], [constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL] and [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV] are left unused. Only [constant Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX] and "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV] will be passed to the GPU.\n"
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL] is only used to determine which faces require "
"the use of flat shading. By default, CSGMesh will ignore the mesh's vertex "
"normals, recalculate them for each vertex and use a smooth shader. If a flat "
"shader is required for a face, ensure that all vertex normals of the face "
"are approximately equal."
msgstr ""

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid "Extrudes a 2D polygon shape to create a 3D mesh."
msgstr "Extrudeix una forma de polígon 2D per crear una malla 3D."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"An array of 2D points is extruded to quickly and easily create a variety of "
"3D meshes. See also [CSGMesh3D] for using 3D meshes as CSG nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"S'extrudeix una sèrie de punts 2D per crear de manera ràpida i senzilla una "
"varietat de malles 3D. Vegeu també [CSGMesh3D] per utilitzar malles 3D com a "
"nodes CSG.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_DEPTH], the depth of the extrusion."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_DEPTH], la profunditat de l'extrusió."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"Material to use for the resulting mesh. The UV maps the top half of the "
"material to the extruded shape (U along the length of the extrusions and V "
"around the outline of the [member polygon]), the bottom-left quarter to the "
"front end face, and the bottom-right quarter to the back end face."
msgstr ""
"Material a utilitzar per a la malla resultant. La UV mapeja la meitat "
"superior del material a la forma extruïda (U al llarg de la longitud de les "
"extrusions i V al voltant del contorn de [member polygon]), el quart "
"inferior esquerre a la cara frontal i el quart inferior dret a la cara "
"posterior."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid "The [member mode] used to extrude the [member polygon]."
msgstr "El [member mode] s'utilitza per extruir el [member polygon]."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], by default, the top half of the "
"[member material] is stretched along the entire length of the extruded "
"shape. If [code]false[/code] the top half of the material is repeated every "
"step of the extrusion."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], per defecte, la meitat superior "
"de [member material] s'estira al llarg de tota la longitud de la forma "
"extruïda. Si [code]false[/code] es repeteix la meitat superior del material "
"a cada pas de l'extrusió."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], the path interval or ratio of "
"path points to extrusions."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], l'interval del camí o la "
"proporció del camí apunta a les extrusions."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], this will determine if the "
"interval should be by distance ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_DISTANCE]) or "
"subdivision fractions ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_SUBDIVIDE])."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], això determinarà si l'interval "
"ha de ser per distància ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_DISTANCE]) o fraccions de "
"subdivisió ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_SUBDIVIDE])."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], if [code]true[/code] the ends of "
"the path are joined, by adding an extrusion between the last and first "
"points of the path."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], si [code]true[/code] s'uneixen "
"els extrems del camí, afegint una extrusió entre els darrers i primers punts "
"del camí."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], if [code]true[/code] the "
"[Transform3D] of the [CSGPolygon3D] is used as the starting point for the "
"extrusions, not the [Transform3D] of the [member path_node]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], the location of the [Path3D] "
"object used to extrude the [member polygon]."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], la ubicació de l'objecte "
"[Path3D] s'utilitza per extreure el [member polygon]."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], the path rotation method used to "
"rotate the [member polygon] as it is extruded."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], el mètode de rotació del camí "
"utilitzat per girar [member polygon] a mesura que s'extrudeix."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], if [code]true[/code] the polygon "
"will be rotated according to the proper tangent of the path at the sampled "
"points. If [code]false[/code] an approximation is used, which decreases in "
"accuracy as the number of subdivisions decreases."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], si [code]true[/code] el polígon "
"es girarà segons la tangent adequada del camí als punts mostrejats. Si "
"[code]false[/code] s'utilitza una aproximació, que disminueix en precisió a "
"mesura que disminueix el nombre de subdivisions."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], extrusions that are less than "
"this angle, will be merged together to reduce polygon count."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], les extrusions que siguin "
"inferiors a aquest angle es fusionaran per reduir el nombre de polígons."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], this is the distance along the "
"path, in meters, the texture coordinates will tile. When set to 0, texture "
"coordinates will match geometry exactly with no tiling."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_PATH], aquesta és la distància al llarg "
"del camí, en metres, les coordenades de textura seran en mosaic. Quan "
"s'estableix a 0, les coordenades de textura coincidiran exactament amb la "
"geometria sense mosaic."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"The point array that defines the 2D polygon that is extruded. This can be a "
"convex or concave polygon with 3 or more points. The polygon must [i]not[/i] "
"have any intersecting edges. Otherwise, triangulation will fail and no mesh "
"will be generated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If only 1 or 2 points are defined in [member polygon], no mesh "
"will be generated."
msgstr ""
"La matriu de punts que defineix el polígon 2D que s'extrudeix. Pot ser un "
"polígon convex o còncau amb 3 o més punts. El polígon ha de [i]not[/i] tenir "
"vores que s'interseccionin. En cas contrari, la triangulació fallarà i no es "
"generarà cap malla.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si només es defineixen 1 o 2 punts a [member polygon], no es "
"generarà cap malla."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], applies smooth shading to the extrusions."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], aplica un ombrejat suau a les extrusions."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_SPIN], the total number of degrees the "
"[member polygon] is rotated when extruding."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_SPIN], el nombre total de graus de "
"[member polygon] es gira quan s'extrudeix."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_SPIN], the number of extrusions made."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] és [constant MODE_SPIN], el nombre d'extrusions "
"realitzades."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid "The [member polygon] shape is extruded along the negative Z axis."
msgstr "La forma [member polygon] s'extrudeix al llarg de l'eix Z negatiu."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape is extruded by rotating it around the Y axis."
msgstr "La forma [member polygon] s'extrudeix girant-la al voltant de l'eix Y."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape is extruded along the [Path3D] specified in "
"[member path_node]."
msgstr ""
"La forma [member polygon] s'extrudeix al llarg de la [Path3D] especificada a "
"[member path_node]."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape is not rotated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires the path Z coordinates to continually decrease to "
"ensure viable shapes."
msgstr ""
"La forma [member polygon] no es gira.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Requereix que les coordenades Z del camí disminueixin "
"contínuament per garantir formes viables."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape is rotated along the path, but it is not rotated "
"around the path axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires the path Z coordinates to continually decrease to "
"ensure viable shapes."
msgstr ""
"La forma [member polygon] es gira al llarg del camí, però no al voltant de "
"l'eix del camí.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Requereix que les coordenades Z del camí disminueixin "
"contínuament per garantir formes viables."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape follows the path and its rotations around the "
"path axis."
msgstr ""
"La forma [member polygon] segueix el camí i les seves rotacions al voltant "
"de l'eix del camí."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is set to [constant MODE_PATH], [member path_interval] "
"will determine the distance, in meters, each interval of the path will "
"extrude."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] s'estableix a [constant MODE_PATH], [member "
"path_interval] determinarà la distància, en metres, que s'extrudrà cada "
"interval del camí."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPolygon3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member mode] is set to [constant MODE_PATH], [member path_interval] "
"will subdivide the polygons along the path."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member mode] s'estableix en [constant MODE_PATH], [member "
"path_interval] subdividirà els polígons al llarg del camí."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPrimitive3D.xml
msgid "Base class for CSG primitives."
msgstr "Classe base per a primitives CSG."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPrimitive3D.xml
msgid ""
"Parent class for various CSG primitives. It contains code and functionality "
"that is common between them. It cannot be used directly. Instead use one of "
"the various classes that inherit from it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Classe pare per a diverses primitives CSG. Conté codi i funcionalitat que "
"són comuns entre ells. No es pot utilitzar directament. En comptes d'això, "
"utilitzeu una de les diferents classes que en hereten.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGPrimitive3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set, the order of the vertices in each triangle are reversed resulting in "
"the backside of the mesh being drawn."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix, l'ordre dels vèrtexs de cada triangle s'inverteix i es "
"dibuixa la part posterior de la malla."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid "The CSG base class."
msgstr "La classe base CSG."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"This is the CSG base class that provides CSG operation support to the "
"various CSG nodes in Godot.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] CSG nodes are only intended for prototyping as they have "
"a significant CPU performance cost. Consider baking final CSG operation "
"results into static geometry that replaces the CSG nodes.\n"
"Individual CSG root node results can be baked to nodes with static resources "
"with the editor menu that appears when a CSG root node is selected.\n"
"Individual CSG root nodes can also be baked to static resources with scripts "
"by calling [method bake_static_mesh] for the visual mesh or [method "
"bake_collision_shape] for the physics collision.\n"
"Entire scenes of CSG nodes can be baked to static geometry and exported with "
"the editor glTF scene exporter: [b]Scene > Export As... > glTF 2.0 Scene...[/"
"b]"
msgstr ""
"Aquesta és la classe base CSG que proporciona suport operatiu CSG als "
"diferents nodes CSG de Godot.\n"
"[b]Rendiment:[/b] Els nodes CSG només estan destinats a la creació de "
"prototips, ja que tenen un cost de rendiment de CPU important. Penseu en la "
"cocció dels resultats finals de l'operació CSG en una geometria estàtica que "
"substitueixi els nodes CSG.\n"
"Els resultats dels nodes arrel CSG individuals es poden incorporar a nodes "
"amb recursos estàtics amb el menú de l'editor que apareix quan es selecciona "
"un node arrel CSG.\n"
"Els nodes arrel CSG individuals també es poden convertir en recursos "
"estàtics amb scripts trucant a [method bake_static_mesh] per a la malla "
"visual o [method bake_collision_shape] per a la col·lisió física.\n"
"Es poden crear escenes senceres dels nodes CSG a la geometria estàtica i "
"exportar-les amb l'editor d'exportador d'escenes glTF: [b]Scene > Exporta "
"com... > glTF 2.0 Scene...[/b]"

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a baked physics [ConcavePolygonShape3D] of this node's CSG operation "
"result. Returns an empty shape if the node is not a CSG root node or has no "
"valid geometry.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] If the CSG operation results in a very detailed geometry "
"with many faces physics performance will be very slow. Concave shapes should "
"in general only be used for static level geometry and not with dynamic "
"objects that are moving.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG mesh data updates are deferred, which means they are "
"updated with a delay of one rendered frame. To avoid getting an empty shape "
"or outdated mesh data, make sure to call [code]await "
"get_tree().process_frame[/code] before using [method bake_collision_shape] "
"in [method Node._ready] or after changing properties on the [CSGShape3D]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a baked static [ArrayMesh] of this node's CSG operation result. "
"Materials from involved CSG nodes are added as extra mesh surfaces. Returns "
"an empty mesh if the node is not a CSG root node or has no valid geometry.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG mesh data updates are deferred, which means they are "
"updated with a delay of one rendered frame. To avoid getting an empty mesh "
"or outdated mesh data, make sure to call [code]await "
"get_tree().process_frame[/code] before using [method bake_static_mesh] in "
"[method Node._ready] or after changing properties on the [CSGShape3D]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] with two elements, the first is the [Transform3D] of this "
"node and the second is the root [Mesh] of this node. Only works when this "
"node is the root shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG mesh data updates are deferred, which means they are "
"updated with a delay of one rendered frame. To avoid getting an empty shape "
"or outdated mesh data, make sure to call [code]await "
"get_tree().process_frame[/code] before using [method get_meshes] in [method "
"Node._ready] or after changing properties on the [CSGShape3D]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this is a root shape and is thus the object "
"that is rendered."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta és una forma d'arrel i, per tant, és "
"l'objecte que es representa."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Enables automatic smoothing. This overrides any smoothing on the CSG node "
"and instead uses [member smoothing_angle] to calculate normals based on the "
"angle between faces.\n"
"Children of a [CSGCombiner3D] node will be treated as a single mesh."
msgstr ""
"Permet un suavitzat automàtic. Això anul·la qualsevol suavització al node "
"CSG i, en canvi, utilitza [member smoothing_angle] per calcular normals "
"basant-se en l'angle entre les cares.\n"
"Els fills d'un node [CSGCombiner3D] es tractaran com una única malla."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Calculate tangents for the CSG shape which allows the use of normal and "
"height maps. This is only applied on the root shape, this setting is ignored "
"on any child. Setting this to [code]false[/code] can speed up shape "
"generation slightly."
msgstr ""
"Calcula tangents per a la forma CSG que permet l'ús de mapes normals i "
"d'altura. Això només s'aplica a la forma de l'arrel, aquesta configuració "
"s'ignora en qualsevol fill. Establir-ho a [code]false[/code] pot accelerar "
"lleugerament la generació de formes."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this area is in.\n"
"Collidable objects can exist in any of 32 different layers. These layers "
"work like a tagging system, and are not visual. A collidable can use these "
"layers to select with which objects it can collide, using the collision_mask "
"property.\n"
"A contact is detected if object A is in any of the layers that object B "
"scans, or object B is in any layer scanned by object A. See [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-"
"masks]Collision layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes físiques en què es troba aquesta àrea.\n"
"Els objectes col·lisionables poden existir en qualsevol de les 32 capes "
"diferents. Aquestes capes funcionen com un sistema d'etiquetatge i no són "
"visuals. Un col·lidable pot utilitzar aquestes capes per seleccionar amb "
"quins objectes pot xocar, utilitzant la propietat collision_mask.\n"
"Es detecta un contacte si l'objecte A es troba en qualsevol de les capes que "
"l'objecte B escaneja, o si l'objecte B es troba en qualsevol capa escanejada "
"per l'objecte A. Vegeu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i màscares de "
"col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this CSG shape scans for collisions. Only effective if "
"[member use_collision] is [code]true[/code]. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision "
"layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de física que aquesta forma CSG escaneja per col·lisions. Només "
"efectiu si [member use_collision] és [code]true[/code]. Consulteu "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-"
"and-masks]Capes i màscares de col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir "
"més informació."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The priority used to solve colliding when occurring penetration. Only "
"effective if [member use_collision] is [code]true[/code]. The higher the "
"priority is, the lower the penetration into the object will be. This can for "
"example be used to prevent the player from breaking through the boundaries "
"of a level."
msgstr ""
"La prioritat utilitzada per resoldre els xocs quan es produeixen "
"penetracions. Només efectiu si [member use_collision] és [code]true[/code]. "
"Com més alta sigui la prioritat, menor serà la penetració a l'objecte. Això "
"es pot utilitzar, per exemple, per evitar que el jugador trenqui els límits "
"d'un nivell."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The operation that is performed on this shape. This is ignored for the first "
"CSG child node as the operation is between this node and the previous child "
"of this nodes parent."
msgstr ""
"L'operació que es realitza sobre aquesta forma. Això s'ignora per al primer "
"node fill CSG, ja que l'operació és entre aquest node i el fill anterior "
"d'aquest node pare."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"When autosmooth is enabled, faces with an angle between them greater than "
"this will be smoothed, while faces with a smaller angle will remain sharp.\n"
"Note: An angle lower than 0.1 will cause all smoothing to be disabled, this "
"can be used to increase performance."
msgstr ""
"Quan l'autosuavització està habilitat, les cares amb un angle entre elles "
"més gran que aquest es suavitzaran, mentre que les cares amb un angle més "
"petit es mantindran nítides.\n"
"Nota: un angle inferior a 0,1 farà que tot el suavitzat estigui desactivat, "
"això es pot utilitzar per augmentar el rendiment."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid "The CSG library no longer uses snapping."
msgstr "La biblioteca CSG ja no utilitza l'ajustament."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid "This property does nothing."
msgstr "Aquesta propietat no fa res."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a collision shape to the physics engine for our CSG shape. This will "
"always act like a static body. Note that the collision shape is still active "
"even if the CSG shape itself is hidden. See also [member collision_mask] and "
"[member collision_priority]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una forma de col·lisió al motor de física per a la nostra forma CSG. "
"Això sempre actuarà com un cos estàtic. Tingueu en compte que la forma de "
"col·lisió encara està activa encara que la pròpia forma CSG estigui amagada. "
"Vegeu també [member collision_mask] i [member collision_priority]."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Geometry of both primitives is merged, intersecting geometry is removed."
msgstr ""
"La geometria d'ambdues primitives es fusiona, s'elimina la geometria que "
"s'interseca."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid "Only intersecting geometry remains, the rest is removed."
msgstr "Només queda la geometria de la intersecció, la resta s'elimina."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The second shape is subtracted from the first, leaving a dent with its shape."
msgstr ""
"La segona forma es resta de la primera, deixant una boqueta amb la seva "
"forma."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
msgid "A CSG Sphere shape."
msgstr "Una forma d'esfera CSG."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a sphere for use with the CSG system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Aquest node us permet crear una esfera per utilitzar-la amb el sistema CSG.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
msgid "The material used to render the sphere."
msgstr "El material utilitzat per representar l'esfera."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
msgid "Number of vertical slices for the sphere."
msgstr "Nombre de rodanxes verticals per a l'esfera."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
msgid "Radius of the sphere."
msgstr "Radi de l'esfera."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
msgid "Number of horizontal slices for the sphere."
msgstr "Nombre de rodanxes horitzontals per a l'esfera."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGSphere3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the normals of the sphere are set to give a smooth "
"effect making the sphere seem rounded. If [code]false[/code] the sphere will "
"have a flat shaded look."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les normals de l'esfera s'estableixen per donar un "
"efecte suau fent que l'esfera sembli arrodonida. Si [code]false[/code] "
"l'esfera tindrà un aspecte ombrejat pla."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml
msgid "A CSG Torus shape."
msgstr "Una forma CSG Torus."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml
msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a torus for use with the CSG system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another "
"CSG node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during "
"gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Aquest node us permet crear un torus per utilitzar-lo amb el sistema CSG.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els nodes CSG estan pensats per ser utilitzats per a la creació "
"de prototips de nivell. La creació de nodes CSG té un cost de CPU important "
"en comparació amb la creació d'un [MeshInstance3D] amb un [PrimitiveMesh]. "
"Moure un node CSG dins d'un altre node CSG també té un cost de CPU "
"important, per la qual cosa s'ha d'evitar durant el joc."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml doc/classes/TorusMesh.xml
msgid "The inner radius of the torus."
msgstr "El radi interior del torus."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml
msgid "The material used to render the torus."
msgstr "El material utilitzat per fer el torus."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml doc/classes/TorusMesh.xml
msgid "The outer radius of the torus."
msgstr "El radi exterior del torus."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml doc/classes/TorusMesh.xml
msgid "The number of edges each ring of the torus is constructed of."
msgstr "El nombre d'arestes amb què està construït cada anell del torus."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml doc/classes/TorusMesh.xml
msgid "The number of slices the torus is constructed of."
msgstr "El nombre de rodanxes amb què està construït el torus."

#: modules/csg/doc_classes/CSGTorus3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the normals of the torus are set to give a smooth "
"effect making the torus seem rounded. If [code]false[/code] the torus will "
"have a flat shaded look."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les normals del to s'estableixen per donar un efecte "
"suau fent que el to sembli arrodonit. Si [code]false[/code] el torus tindrà "
"un aspecte ombrejat pla."

#: modules/mono/doc_classes/CSharpScript.xml
msgid ""
"A script implemented in the C# programming language, saved with the "
"[code].cs[/code] extension (Mono-enabled builds only)."
msgstr ""
"Un script implementat en el llenguatge de programació C#, desat amb "
"l'extensió [code].cs[/code] (només versions habilitades per a mono)."

#: modules/mono/doc_classes/CSharpScript.xml
msgid ""
"This class represents a C# script. It is the C# equivalent of the [GDScript] "
"class and is only available in Mono-enabled Godot builds."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe representa un script C#. És l'equivalent en C# de la classe "
"[GDScript] i només està disponible a les compilacions Godot habilitades per "
"a Mono."

#: modules/mono/doc_classes/CSharpScript.xml
msgid "C# documentation index"
msgstr "Índex de documentació C#"

#: modules/mono/doc_classes/CSharpScript.xml
msgid "Returns a new instance of the script."
msgstr "Retorna una nova instància de l'script."

#: doc/classes/Cubemap.xml
msgid ""
"Six square textures representing the faces of a cube. Commonly used as a "
"skybox."
msgstr ""
"Sis textures quadrades que representen les cares d'un cub. S'utilitza "
"habitualment com a skybox."

#: doc/classes/Cubemap.xml
msgid ""
"A cubemap is made of 6 textures organized in layers. They are typically used "
"for faking reflections in 3D rendering (see [ReflectionProbe]). It can be "
"used to make an object look as if it's reflecting its surroundings. This "
"usually delivers much better performance than other reflection methods.\n"
"This resource is typically used as a uniform in custom shaders. Few core "
"Godot methods make use of [Cubemap] resources.\n"
"To create such a texture file yourself, reimport your image files using the "
"Godot Editor import presets. To create a Cubemap from code, use [method "
"ImageTextureLayered.create_from_images] on an instance of the Cubemap "
"class.\n"
"The expected image order is X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (in Godot's coordinate "
"system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\"). You can use one of the "
"following templates as a base:\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_2x3.webp]2×3 cubemap template "
"(default layout option)[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp]3×2 cubemap "
"template[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp]1×6 cubemap "
"template[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp]6×1 cubemap "
"template[/url]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot doesn't support using cubemaps in a "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial]. To use a cubemap as a skybox, convert the default "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial] to a [ShaderMaterial] using the [b]Convert to "
"ShaderMaterial[/b] resource dropdown option, then replace its code with the "
"following:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"shader_type sky;\n"
"\n"
"uniform samplerCube source_panorama : filter_linear, source_color, "
"hint_default_black;\n"
"uniform float exposure : hint_range(0, 128) = 1.0;\n"
"\n"
"void sky() {\n"
"\t// If importing a cubemap from another engine, you may need to flip one of "
"the `EYEDIR` components below\n"
"\t// by replacing it with `-EYEDIR`.\n"
"\tvec3 eyedir = vec3(EYEDIR.x, EYEDIR.y, EYEDIR.z);\n"
"\tCOLOR = texture(source_panorama, eyedir).rgb * exposure;\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"After replacing the shader code and saving, specify the imported Cubemap "
"resource in the Shader Parameters section of the ShaderMaterial in the "
"inspector.\n"
"Alternatively, you can use [url=https://danilw.github.io/GLSL-howto/"
"cubemap_to_panorama_js/cubemap_to_panorama.html]this tool[/url] to convert a "
"cubemap to an equirectangular sky map and use [PanoramaSkyMaterial] as usual."
msgstr ""
"Un cubemap està format per 6 textures organitzades en capes. Normalment "
"s'utilitzen per simular reflexos en la representació 3D (vegeu "
"[ReflectionProbe]). Es pot utilitzar per fer que un objecte sembli com si "
"reflectís el seu entorn. Això normalment ofereix un rendiment molt millor "
"que altres mètodes de reflexió.\n"
"Aquest recurs s'utilitza normalment com a uniforme en ombrejats "
"personalitzats. Pocs mètodes bàsics de Godot fan ús dels recursos "
"[Cubemap].\n"
"Per crear aquest fitxer de textura tu mateix, torna a importar els fitxers "
"d'imatge utilitzant els valors predefinits d'importació de l'Editor Godot. "
"Per crear un Cubemap a partir del codi, utilitzeu [method "
"ImageTextureLayered.create_from_images] en una instància de la classe "
"Cubemap.\n"
"L'ordre de la imatge esperat és X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (al sistema de "
"coordenades de Godot, de manera que Y+ és \"amunt\" i Z- és \"avant\"). "
"Podeu utilitzar una de les plantilles següents com a base:\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_2x3.webp] Plantilla de mapa "
"de cubs 2×3 (opció de disseny per defecte)[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp]3×2 cubemap "
"template[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp]1 plantilla de "
"cubemap[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp]6×1 plantilla de "
"mapa de cub[/url]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Godot no admet l'ús de mapes de cub en un "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial]. Per utilitzar un cubemap com a skybox, convertiu el "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial] predeterminat en un [ShaderMaterial] mitjançant "
"l'opció [b]Convert to ShaderMaterial[/b] i, a continuació, substituïu el seu "
"codi pel següent:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"shader_type cel;\n"
"\n"
"uniform samplerCube source_panorama : filter_linear, source_color, "
"hint_default_black;\n"
"exposició flotant uniforme: hint_range(0, 128) = 1,0;\n"
"\n"
"cel buit () {\n"
"\t// Si importeu un mapa de cubs d'un altre motor, potser haureu de capgirar "
"un dels components `EYEDIR` a continuació\n"
"\t// substituint-lo per `-EYEDIR`.\n"
"\tvec3 eyedir = vec3(EYEDIR.x, EYEDIR.y, EYEDIR.z);\n"
"\tCOLOR = textura (font_panorama, eyedir).rgb * exposició;\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Després de substituir el codi shader i desar-lo, especifiqueu el recurs "
"Cubemap importat a la secció Shader Parameters del ShaderMaterial a "
"l'inspector.\n"
"Alternativament, podeu utilitzar [url=https://danilw.github.io/GLSL-howto/"
"cubemap_to_panorama_js/cubemap_to_panorama.html]aquesta eina[/url] per "
"convertir un mapa de cubs en un mapa celeste equirectangular i utilitzar "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial] com de costum."

#: doc/classes/Cubemap.xml
msgid "Creates a placeholder version of this resource ([PlaceholderCubemap])."
msgstr ""
"Crea una versió de marcador de posició d'aquest recurs "
"([PlaceholderCubemap])."

#: doc/classes/CubemapArray.xml
msgid "An array of [Cubemap]s, stored together and with a single reference."
msgstr ""
"Una matriu de [Cubemap]s, emmagatzemats junts i amb una única referència."

#: doc/classes/CubemapArray.xml
msgid ""
"[CubemapArray]s are made of an array of [Cubemap]s. Like [Cubemap]s, they "
"are made of multiple textures, the amount of which must be divisible by 6 "
"(one for each face of the cube).\n"
"The primary benefit of [CubemapArray]s is that they can be accessed in "
"shader code using a single texture reference. In other words, you can pass "
"multiple [Cubemap]s into a shader using a single [CubemapArray]. [Cubemap]s "
"are allocated in adjacent cache regions on the GPU, which makes "
"[CubemapArray]s the most efficient way to store multiple [Cubemap]s.\n"
"Godot uses [CubemapArray]s internally for many effects, including the [Sky] "
"if you set [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"texture_array_reflections] to [code]true[/code].\n"
"To create such a texture file yourself, reimport your image files using the "
"Godot Editor import presets. To create a CubemapArray from code, use [method "
"ImageTextureLayered.create_from_images] on an instance of the CubemapArray "
"class.\n"
"The expected image order is X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (in Godot's coordinate "
"system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\"). You can use one of the "
"following templates as a base:\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_2x3.webp]2×3 cubemap template "
"(default layout option)[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp]3×2 cubemap "
"template[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp]1×6 cubemap "
"template[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp]6×1 cubemap "
"template[/url]\n"
"Multiple layers are stacked on top of each other when using the default "
"vertical import option (with the first layer at the top). Alternatively, you "
"can choose a horizontal layout in the import options (with the first layer "
"at the left).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [CubemapArray] is not supported in the Compatibility renderer "
"due to graphics API limitations."
msgstr ""
"[CubemapArray]s estan formats per una matriu de [Cubemap]s. Igual que "
"[Cubemap]s, estan fets de múltiples textures, la quantitat de les quals ha "
"de ser divisible per 6 (una per cada cara del cub).\n"
"El principal avantatge dels [CubemapArray]s és que es pot accedir a ells en "
"codi d'ombra mitjançant una única referència de textura. En altres paraules, "
"podeu passar diversos [Cubemap]s a un shader mitjançant un sol "
"[CubemapArray]. Els [Cubemap]s s'assignen a les regions de memòria cau "
"adjacents a la GPU, la qual cosa fa que [CubemapArray]s sigui la manera més "
"eficient d'emmagatzemar diversos [Cubemap]s.\n"
"Godot utilitza [CubemapArray]s internament per a molts efectes, inclòs [Sky] "
"si configureu [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"texture_array_reflections] com a [code]true[/code].\n"
"Per crear aquest fitxer de textura tu mateix, torna a importar els fitxers "
"d'imatge utilitzant els valors predefinits d'importació de l'Editor Godot. "
"Per crear un CubemapArray a partir del codi, utilitzeu [method "
"ImageTextureLayered.create_from_images] en una instància de la classe "
"CubemapArray.\n"
"L'ordre de la imatge esperat és X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (al sistema de "
"coordenades de Godot, de manera que Y+ és \"amunt\" i Z- és \"avant\"). "
"Podeu utilitzar una de les plantilles següents com a base:\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_2x3.webp] Plantilla de mapa "
"de cub 2×3 (opció de disseny per defecte)[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp]@3×2 plantilla de "
"mapa de cub[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp] Plantilla de mapa "
"de cubs 1×6[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp]@6×1 plantilla de "
"mapa de cub[/url]\n"
"S'apilen diverses capes unes sobre les altres quan s'utilitza l'opció "
"d'importació vertical predeterminada (amb la primera capa a la part "
"superior). Alternativament, podeu triar un disseny horitzontal a les opcions "
"d'importació (amb la primera capa a l'esquerra).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [CubemapArray] no s'admet al renderitzador de compatibilitat a "
"causa de les limitacions de l'API de gràfics."

#: doc/classes/CubemapArray.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a placeholder version of this resource ([PlaceholderCubemapArray])."
msgstr ""
"Crea una versió de marcador de posició d'aquest recurs "
"([PlaceholderCubemapArray])."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "A mathematical curve."
msgstr "Una corba matemàtica."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"This resource describes a mathematical curve by defining a set of points and "
"tangents at each point. By default, it ranges between [code]0[/code] and "
"[code]1[/code] on the X and Y axes, but these ranges can be changed.\n"
"Please note that many resources and nodes assume they are given [i]unit "
"curves[/i]. A unit curve is a curve whose domain (the X axis) is between "
"[code]0[/code] and [code]1[/code]. Some examples of unit curve usage are "
"[member CPUParticles2D.angle_curve] and [member Line2D.width_curve]."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recurs descriu una corba matemàtica definint un conjunt de punts i "
"tangents en cada punt. Per defecte, oscil·la entre [code]0[/code] i [code]1[/"
"code] als eixos X i Y, però aquests intervals es poden canviar.\n"
"Tingueu en compte que molts recursos i nodes assumeixen que reben [i]corbes "
"d'unitat[/i]. Una corba unitària és una corba el domini de la qual (l'eix X) "
"es troba entre [code]0[/code] i [code]@1[/code]. Alguns exemples d'ús de "
"corbes unitats són [member CPUParticles2D.angle_curve] i [member "
"Line2D.width_curve]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a point to the curve. For each side, if the [code]*_mode[/code] is "
"[constant TANGENT_LINEAR], the [code]*_tangent[/code] angle (in degrees) "
"uses the slope of the curve halfway to the adjacent point. Allows custom "
"assignments to the [code]*_tangent[/code] angle if [code]*_mode[/code] is "
"set to [constant TANGENT_FREE]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un punt a la corba. Per a cada costat, si el mode [code]*_mode[/"
"code] és [constant TANGENT_LINEAR], l'angle [code]*_tangent[/code] (en "
"graus) utilitza el pendent de la corba a mig camí del punt adjacent. Permet "
"assignacions personalitzades a l'angle [code]*_tangent[/code] si "
"[code]*_mode[/code] està establert en [constant TANGENT_FREE]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Recomputes the baked cache of points for the curve."
msgstr "Recalcula la memòria cau de punts per a la corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Removes duplicate points, i.e. points that are less than 0.00001 units "
"(engine epsilon value) away from their neighbor on the curve."
msgstr ""
"Elimina els punts duplicats, és a dir, els punts que es troben a menys de "
"0,00001 unitats (valor d'èpsilon del motor) del seu veí a la corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid "Removes all points from the curve."
msgstr "Elimina tots els punts de la corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the difference between [member min_domain] and [member max_domain]."
msgstr "Retorna la diferència entre [member min_domain] i [member max_domain]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Returns the left [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna l'esquerra [enum TangentMode] per al punt a [param index]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the left tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'angle tangent esquerre (en graus) per al punt a [param index]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Returns the curve coordinates for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna les coordenades de la corba per al punt a [param index]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Returns the right [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna el [enum TangentMode] dret per al punt a [param index]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the right tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna l'angle tangent dret (en graus) per al punt a [param index]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the difference between [member min_value] and [member max_value]."
msgstr "Retorna la diferència entre [member min_value] i [member max_value]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Removes the point at [param index] from the curve."
msgstr "Elimina el punt a [param index] de la corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the Y value for the point that would exist at the X position [param "
"offset] along the curve."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor Y per al punt que existiria a la posició X [param offset] "
"al llarg de la corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the Y value for the point that would exist at the X position [param "
"offset] along the curve using the baked cache. Bakes the curve's points if "
"not already baked."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor Y per al punt que existiria a la posició X [param offset] "
"al llarg de la corba utilitzant la memòria cau al forn. Enforna els punts de "
"la corba si encara no està al forn."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the left [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index] to [param "
"mode]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el [enum TangentMode] esquerre per al punt [param index] a [param "
"mode]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the left tangent angle for the point at [param index] to [param "
"tangent]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'angle tangent esquerre per al punt [param index] a [param "
"tangent]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Assigns the horizontal position [param offset] to the point at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the right [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index] to [param "
"mode]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el [enum TangentMode] correcte per al punt [param index] a [param "
"mode]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the right tangent angle for the point at [param index] to [param "
"tangent]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'angle tangent dret per al punt a [param index] a [param tangent]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Assigns the vertical position [param y] to the point at [param index]."
msgstr "Assigna la posició vertical [param y] al punt [param index]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "The number of points to include in the baked (i.e. cached) curve data."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de punts que s'han d'incloure a les dades de la corba hornejades "
"(és a dir, a la memòria cau)."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "The maximum domain (x-coordinate) that points can have."
msgstr "El domini màxim (coordenada x) que poden tenir els punts."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum value (y-coordinate) that points can have. Tangents can cause "
"higher values between points."
msgstr ""
"El valor màxim (coordenada y) que poden tenir els punts. Les tangents poden "
"provocar valors més alts entre punts."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "The minimum domain (x-coordinate) that points can have."
msgstr "El domini mínim (coordenada x) que poden tenir els punts."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum value (y-coordinate) that points can have. Tangents can cause "
"lower values between points."
msgstr ""
"El valor mínim (coordenada y) que poden tenir els punts. Les tangents poden "
"provocar valors més baixos entre punts."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid "The number of points describing the curve."
msgstr "El nombre de punts que descriuen la corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The left [enum TangentMode] for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"L'esquerra [enum TangentMode] per al punt a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The left tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"L'angle tangent esquerre (en graus) per al punt a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The position of the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"La posició del punt a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The right [enum TangentMode] for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"La dreta [enum TangentMode] per al punt a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The right tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"L'angle tangent dret (en graus) per al punt a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Emitted when [member max_domain] or [member min_domain] is changed."
msgstr "S'emet quan es canvia [member max_domain] o [member min_domain]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "Emitted when [member max_value] or [member min_value] is changed."
msgstr "S'emet quan es canvia [member max_value] o [member min_value]."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "The tangent on this side of the point is user-defined."
msgstr "La tangent d'aquest costat del punt està definida per l'usuari."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid ""
"The curve calculates the tangent on this side of the point as the slope "
"halfway towards the adjacent point."
msgstr ""
"La corba calcula la tangent d'aquest costat del punt com a pendent a mig "
"camí cap al punt adjacent."

#: doc/classes/Curve.xml
msgid "The total number of available tangent modes."
msgstr "El nombre total de modes tangents disponibles."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid "Describes a Bézier curve in 2D space."
msgstr "Descriu una corba de Bézier a l'espai 2D."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"This class describes a Bézier curve in 2D space. It is mainly used to give a "
"shape to a [Path2D], but can be manually sampled for other purposes.\n"
"It keeps a cache of precalculated points along the curve, to speed up "
"further calculations."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe descriu una corba de Bézier a l'espai 2D. S'utilitza "
"principalment per donar forma a un [Path2D], però es pot mostrejar "
"manualment per a altres propòsits.\n"
"Manté una memòria cau de punts precalculats al llarg de la corba, per "
"accelerar els càlculs posteriors."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a point with the specified [param position] relative to the curve's own "
"position, with control points [param in] and [param out]. Appends the new "
"point at the end of the point list.\n"
"If [param index] is given, the new point is inserted before the existing "
"point identified by index [param index]. Every existing point starting from "
"[param index] is shifted further down the list of points. The index must be "
"greater than or equal to [code]0[/code] and must not exceed the number of "
"existing points in the line. See [member point_count]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un punt amb el [param position] especificat en relació a la posició "
"de la pròpia corba, amb els punts de control [param in] i [param out]. "
"Afegeix el punt nou al final de la llista de punts.\n"
"Si s'indica [param index], el nou punt s'insereix abans del punt existent "
"identificat per l'índex [param index]. Cada punt existent a partir de [param "
"index] es desplaça més avall a la llista de punts. L'índex ha de ser "
"superior o igual a [code]0[/code] i no ha de superar el nombre de punts "
"existents a la línia. Veure [member point_count]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total length of the curve, based on the cached points. Given "
"enough density (see [member bake_interval]), it should be approximate enough."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la longitud total de la corba, en funció dels punts de la memòria "
"cau. Donada prou densitat (vegeu [member bake_interval]), hauria de ser prou "
"aproximada."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid "Returns the cache of points as a [PackedVector2Array]."
msgstr "Retorna la memòria cau de punts com a [PackedVector2Array]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the closest offset to [param to_point]. This offset is meant to be "
"used in [method sample_baked].\n"
"[param to_point] must be in this curve's local space."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el desplaçament més proper a [param to_point]. Aquest desplaçament "
"s'ha d'utilitzar a [method sample_baked].\n"
"[param to_point] ha d'estar a l'espai local d'aquesta corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the closest point on baked segments (in curve's local space) to "
"[param to_point].\n"
"[param to_point] must be in this curve's local space."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt més proper dels segments cuits (a l'espai local de la corba) "
"a [param to_point].\n"
"[param to_point] ha d'estar a l'espai local d'aquesta corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading to the vertex [param idx]. "
"The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the index is "
"out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code]"
"(0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del punt de control que porta al vèrtex [param idx]. La "
"posició retornada és relativa al vèrtex [param idx]. Si l'índex està fora "
"dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola i retorna [code](0, 0)[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading out of the vertex [param "
"idx]. The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the "
"index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and "
"returns [code](0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del punt de control que surt del vèrtex [param idx]. La "
"posició retornada és relativa al vèrtex [param idx]. Si l'índex està fora "
"dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola i retorna [code](0, 0)[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the vertex [param idx]. If the index is out of "
"bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0)"
"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del vèrtex [param idx]. Si l'índex està fora dels límits, "
"la funció envia un error a la consola i retorna [code](0, 0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Deletes the point [param idx] from the curve. Sends an error to the console "
"if [param idx] is out of bounds."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el punt [param idx] de la corba. Envia un error a la consola si "
"[param idx] està fora dels límits."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position between the vertex [param idx] and the vertex [code]idx "
"+ 1[/code], where [param t] controls if the point is the first vertex "
"([code]t = 0.0[/code]), the last vertex ([code]t = 1.0[/code]), or in "
"between. Values of [param t] outside the range ([code]0.0 <= t <= 1.0[/"
"code]) give strange, but predictable results.\n"
"If [param idx] is out of bounds it is truncated to the first or last vertex, "
"and [param t] is ignored. If the curve has no points, the function sends an "
"error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a point within the curve at position [param offset], where [param "
"offset] is measured as a pixel distance along the curve.\n"
"To do that, it finds the two cached points where the [param offset] lies "
"between, then interpolates the values. This interpolation is cubic if [param "
"cubic] is set to [code]true[/code], or linear if set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"Cubic interpolation tends to follow the curves better, but linear is faster "
"(and often, precise enough)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un punt dins de la corba a la posició [param offset], on [param "
"offset] es mesura com a distància de píxels al llarg de la corba.\n"
"Per fer-ho, troba els dos punts de la memòria cau on es troba [param offset] "
"i, a continuació, interpola els valors. Aquesta interpolació és cúbica si "
"[param cubic] s'estableix a [code]true[/code], o lineal si s'estableix a "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"La interpolació cúbica tendeix a seguir millor les corbes, però la lineal és "
"més ràpida (i sovint, prou precisa)."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [method sample_baked], but returns [Transform2D] that includes a "
"rotation along the curve, with [member Transform2D.origin] as the point "
"position and the [member Transform2D.x] vector pointing in the direction of "
"the path at that point. Returns an empty transform if the length of the "
"curve is [code]0[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var baked = curve.sample_baked_with_rotation(offset)\n"
"# The returned Transform2D can be set directly.\n"
"transform = baked\n"
"# You can also read the origin and rotation separately from the returned "
"Transform2D.\n"
"position = baked.get_origin()\n"
"rotation = baked.get_rotation()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Similar a [method sample_baked], però retorna [Transform2D] que inclou una "
"rotació al llarg de la corba, amb [member Transform2D.origin] com a posició "
"del punt i el vector [member Transform2D.x] apuntant en la direcció del camí "
"en aquest punt. Retorna una transformació buida si la longitud de la corba "
"és [code]0[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var al forn = curve.sample_baked_with_rotation(offset)\n"
"# El Transform2D retornat es pot configurar directament.\n"
"transformar = al forn\n"
"# També podeu llegir l'origen i la rotació per separat del Transform2D "
"retornat.\n"
"posició = baked.get_origin()\n"
"rotació = al forn.get_rotation()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position at the vertex [param fofs]. It calls [method sample] "
"using the integer part of [param fofs] as [code]idx[/code], and its "
"fractional part as [code]t[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició al vèrtex [param fofs]. Crida a [method sample] "
"utilitzant la part sencera de [param fofs] com a [code]idx[/code] i la seva "
"part fraccional com a [code]t[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the position of the control point leading to the vertex [param idx]. If "
"the index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console. The "
"position is relative to the vertex."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la posició del punt de control que condueix al vèrtex [param idx]. "
"Si l'índex està fora dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola. La "
"posició és relativa al vèrtex."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the position of the control point leading out of the vertex [param "
"idx]. If the index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the "
"console. The position is relative to the vertex."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la posició del punt de control que surt del vèrtex [param idx]. Si "
"l'índex està fora dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola. La "
"posició és relativa al vèrtex."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the position for the vertex [param idx]. If the index is out of bounds, "
"the function sends an error to the console."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la posició del vèrtex [param idx]. Si l'índex està fora dels "
"límits, la funció envia un error a la consola."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of points along the curve, with a curvature controlled point "
"density. That is, the curvier parts will have more points than the "
"straighter parts.\n"
"This approximation makes straight segments between each point, then "
"subdivides those segments until the resulting shape is similar enough.\n"
"[param max_stages] controls how many subdivisions a curve segment may face "
"before it is considered approximate enough. Each subdivision splits the "
"segment in half, so the default 5 stages may mean up to 32 subdivisions per "
"curve segment. Increase with care!\n"
"[param tolerance_degrees] controls how many degrees the midpoint of a "
"segment may deviate from the real curve, before the segment has to be "
"subdivided."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una llista de punts al llarg de la corba, amb una densitat de punts "
"controlada per curvatura. És a dir, les parts més corbes tindran més punts "
"que les parts més rectes.\n"
"Aquesta aproximació fa segments rectes entre cada punt i després els "
"subdivideix fins que la forma resultant sigui prou semblant.\n"
"[param max_stages] controla quantes subdivisions pot enfrontar un segment de "
"corba abans que es consideri prou aproximat. Cada subdivisió divideix el "
"segment per la meitat, de manera que les 5 etapes predeterminades poden "
"significar fins a 32 subdivisions per segment de corba. Augmenta amb cura!\n"
"[param tolerance_degrees] controla quants graus pot desviar-se el punt mitjà "
"d'un segment de la corba real, abans que el segment s'hagi de subdividir."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of points along the curve, with almost uniform density. "
"[param max_stages] controls how many subdivisions a curve segment may face "
"before it is considered approximate enough. Each subdivision splits the "
"segment in half, so the default 5 stages may mean up to 32 subdivisions per "
"curve segment. Increase with care!\n"
"[param tolerance_length] controls the maximal distance between two "
"neighboring points, before the segment has to be subdivided."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una llista de punts al llarg de la corba, amb una densitat gairebé "
"uniforme. [param max_stages] controla quantes subdivisions pot enfrontar un "
"segment de corba abans que es consideri prou aproximat. Cada subdivisió "
"divideix el segment per la meitat, de manera que les 5 etapes "
"predeterminades poden significar fins a 32 subdivisions per segment de "
"corba. Augmenta amb cura!\n"
"[param tolerance_length] controla la distància màxima entre dos punts veïns, "
"abans que el segment s'hagi de subdividir."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance in pixels between two adjacent cached points. Changing it "
"forces the cache to be recomputed the next time the [method "
"get_baked_points] or [method get_baked_length] function is called. The "
"smaller the distance, the more points in the cache and the more memory it "
"will consume, so use with care."
msgstr ""
"La distància en píxels entre dos punts adjacents a la memòria cau. Canviar-"
"lo obliga a tornar a calcular la memòria cau la propera vegada que es cridi "
"la funció [method get_baked_points] o [method get_baked_length]. Com més "
"petita sigui la distància, més punts a la memòria cau i més memòria "
"consumirà, així que feu servir amb cura."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"The position of the control point leading to the vertex at [code]index[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"La posició del punt de control que condueix al vèrtex a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"The position of the control point leading out of the vertex at [code]index[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"La posició del punt de control que surt del vèrtex a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve2D.xml doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"The position of for the vertex at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"La posició del vèrtex a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid "Describes a Bézier curve in 3D space."
msgstr "Descriu una corba de Bézier a l'espai 3D."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"This class describes a Bézier curve in 3D space. It is mainly used to give a "
"shape to a [Path3D], but can be manually sampled for other purposes.\n"
"It keeps a cache of precalculated points along the curve, to speed up "
"further calculations."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe descriu una corba de Bézier a l'espai 3D. S'utilitza "
"principalment per donar forma a un [Path3D], però es pot mostrejar "
"manualment per a altres propòsits.\n"
"Manté una memòria cau de punts precalculats al llarg de la corba, per "
"accelerar els càlculs posteriors."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid "Returns the cache of points as a [PackedVector3Array]."
msgstr "Retorna la memòria cau de punts com a [PackedVector3Array]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid "Returns the cache of tilts as a [PackedFloat32Array]."
msgstr "Retorna la memòria cau d'inclinacions com a [PackedFloat32Array]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the cache of up vectors as a [PackedVector3Array].\n"
"If [member up_vector_enabled] is [code]false[/code], the cache will be empty."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la memòria cau dels vectors amunt com a [PackedVector3Array].\n"
"Si [member up_vector_enabled] és [code]false[/code], la memòria cau estarà "
"buida."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the closest offset to [param to_point]. This offset is meant to be "
"used in [method sample_baked] or [method sample_baked_up_vector].\n"
"[param to_point] must be in this curve's local space."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el desplaçament més proper a [param to_point]. Aquest desplaçament "
"s'ha d'utilitzar a [method sample_baked] o [method sample_baked_up_vector].\n"
"[param to_point] ha d'estar a l'espai local d'aquesta corba."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading to the vertex [param idx]. "
"The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the index is "
"out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code]"
"(0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del punt de control que porta al vèrtex [param idx]. La "
"posició retornada és relativa al vèrtex [param idx]. Si l'índex està fora "
"dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola i retorna [code](0, 0, 0)"
"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading out of the vertex [param "
"idx]. The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the "
"index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and "
"returns [code](0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del punt de control que surt del vèrtex [param idx]. La "
"posició retornada és relativa al vèrtex [param idx]. Si l'índex està fora "
"dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola i retorna [code](0, 0, 0)"
"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the vertex [param idx]. If the index is out of "
"bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0, "
"0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del vèrtex [param idx]. Si l'índex està fora dels límits, "
"la funció envia un error a la consola i retorna [code](0, 0, 0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the tilt angle in radians for the point [param idx]. If the index is "
"out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'angle d'inclinació en radians per al punt [param idx]. Si l'índex "
"està fora dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola i retorna "
"[code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position between the vertex [param idx] and the vertex [code]idx "
"+ 1[/code], where [param t] controls if the point is the first vertex "
"([code]t = 0.0[/code]), the last vertex ([code]t = 1.0[/code]), or in "
"between. Values of [param t] outside the range ([code]0.0 >= t <=1[/code]) "
"give strange, but predictable results.\n"
"If [param idx] is out of bounds it is truncated to the first or last vertex, "
"and [param t] is ignored. If the curve has no points, the function sends an "
"error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a point within the curve at position [param offset], where [param "
"offset] is measured as a distance in 3D units along the curve. To do that, "
"it finds the two cached points where the [param offset] lies between, then "
"interpolates the values. This interpolation is cubic if [param cubic] is set "
"to [code]true[/code], or linear if set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"Cubic interpolation tends to follow the curves better, but linear is faster "
"(and often, precise enough)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un punt dins de la corba a la posició [param offset], on [param "
"offset] es mesura com a distància en unitats 3D al llarg de la corba. Per "
"fer-ho, troba els dos punts de la memòria cau on es troba [param offset] i, "
"a continuació, interpola els valors. Aquesta interpolació és cúbica si "
"[param cubic] s'estableix a [code]true[/code], o lineal si s'estableix a "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"La interpolació cúbica tendeix a seguir millor les corbes, però la lineal és "
"més ràpida (i sovint, prou precisa)."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an up vector within the curve at position [param offset], where "
"[param offset] is measured as a distance in 3D units along the curve. To do "
"that, it finds the two cached up vectors where the [param offset] lies "
"between, then interpolates the values. If [param apply_tilt] is [code]true[/"
"code], an interpolated tilt is applied to the interpolated up vector.\n"
"If the curve has no up vectors, the function sends an error to the console, "
"and returns [code](0, 1, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un vector amunt dins de la corba a la posició [param offset], on "
"[param offset] es mesura com a distància en unitats 3D al llarg de la corba. "
"Per fer-ho, troba els dos vectors a la memòria cau entre els quals es troba "
"[param offset] i després interpola els valors. Si [param apply_tilt] és "
"[code]true[/code], s'aplica una inclinació interpolada al vector interpolat "
"cap amunt.\n"
"Si la corba no té vectors amunt, la funció envia un error a la consola i "
"retorna [code](0, 1, 0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Transform3D] with [code]origin[/code] as point position, "
"[code]basis.x[/code] as sideway vector, [code]basis.y[/code] as up vector, "
"[code]basis.z[/code] as forward vector. When the curve length is 0, there is "
"no reasonable way to calculate the rotation, all vectors aligned with global "
"space axes. See also [method sample_baked]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the tilt angle in radians for the point [param idx]. If the index is "
"out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console.\n"
"The tilt controls the rotation along the look-at axis an object traveling "
"the path would have. In the case of a curve controlling a [PathFollow3D], "
"this tilt is an offset over the natural tilt the [PathFollow3D] calculates."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'angle d'inclinació en radians per al punt [param idx]. Si "
"l'índex està fora dels límits, la funció envia un error a la consola.\n"
"La inclinació controla la rotació al llarg de l'eix de mira que tindria un "
"objecte que recorre el camí. En el cas d'una corba que controla un "
"[PathFollow3D], aquesta inclinació és un desplaçament sobre la inclinació "
"natural que calcula [PathFollow3D]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance in meters between two adjacent cached points. Changing it "
"forces the cache to be recomputed the next time the [method "
"get_baked_points] or [method get_baked_length] function is called. The "
"smaller the distance, the more points in the cache and the more memory it "
"will consume, so use with care."
msgstr ""
"La distància en metres entre dos punts adjacents a la memòria cau. Canviar-"
"lo obliga a tornar a calcular la memòria cau la propera vegada que es cridi "
"la funció [method get_baked_points] o [method get_baked_length]. Com més "
"petita sigui la distància, més punts a la memòria cau i més memòria "
"consumirà, així que feu servir amb cura."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and the curve has more than 2 control points, the last "
"point and the first one will be connected in a loop."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], i la corba té més de 2 punts de control, l'últim punt "
"i el primer es connectaran en un bucle."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"The tilt angle in radians for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"L'angle d'inclinació en radians per al punt a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"point_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Curve3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the curve will bake up vectors used for orientation. "
"This is used when [member PathFollow3D.rotation_mode] is set to [constant "
"PathFollow3D.ROTATION_ORIENTED]. Changing it forces the cache to be "
"recomputed."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la corba enfornarà els vectors utilitzats per a "
"l'orientació. S'utilitza quan [member PathFollow3D.rotation_mode] "
"s'estableix a [constant PathFollow3D.ROTATION_ORIENTED]. Canviar-lo obliga a "
"tornar a calcular la memòria cau."

#: doc/classes/CurveTexture.xml
msgid "A 1D texture where pixel brightness corresponds to points on a curve."
msgstr ""
"Una textura 1D on la brillantor del píxel correspon als punts d'una corba."

#: doc/classes/CurveTexture.xml
msgid ""
"A 1D texture where pixel brightness corresponds to points on a unit [Curve] "
"resource, either in grayscale or in red. This visual representation "
"simplifies the task of saving curves as image files.\n"
"If you need to store up to 3 curves within a single texture, use "
"[CurveXYZTexture] instead. See also [GradientTexture1D] and "
"[GradientTexture2D]."
msgstr ""
"Una textura 1D on la brillantor del píxel correspon als punts d'un recurs "
"[Curve] de la unitat, ja sigui en escala de grisos o en vermell. Aquesta "
"representació visual simplifica la tasca de desar les corbes com a fitxers "
"d'imatge.\n"
"Si necessiteu emmagatzemar fins a 3 corbes dins d'una sola textura, "
"utilitzeu [CurveXYZTexture]. Vegeu també [GradientTexture1D] i "
"[GradientTexture2D]."

#: doc/classes/CurveTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"El [Curve] que es representa a la textura. Hauria de ser una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CurveTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The format the texture should be generated with. When passing a CurveTexture "
"as an input to a [Shader], this may need to be adjusted."
msgstr ""
"El format amb què s'ha de generar la textura. Quan es passa una CurveTexture "
"com a entrada a un [Shader], és possible que s'hagi d'ajustar."

#: doc/classes/CurveTexture.xml doc/classes/CurveXYZTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The width of the texture (in pixels). Higher values make it possible to "
"represent high-frequency data better (such as sudden direction changes), at "
"the cost of increased generation time and memory usage."
msgstr ""
"L'amplada de la textura (en píxels). Els valors més alts permeten "
"representar millor les dades d'alta freqüència (com ara canvis de direcció "
"sobtats), a costa d'augmentar el temps de generació i l'ús de la memòria."

#: doc/classes/CurveTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Store the curve equally across the red, green and blue channels. This uses "
"more video memory, but is more compatible with shaders that only read the "
"green and blue values."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzemeu la corba per igual als canals vermell, verd i blau. Això fa "
"servir més memòria de vídeo, però és més compatible amb els shaders que "
"només llegeixen els valors verd i blau."

#: doc/classes/CurveTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Store the curve only in the red channel. This saves video memory, but some "
"custom shaders may not be able to work with this."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema la corba només al canal vermell. Això estalvia memòria de vídeo, "
"però és possible que alguns shaders personalitzats no puguin funcionar amb "
"això."

#: doc/classes/CurveXYZTexture.xml
msgid ""
"A 1D texture where the red, green, and blue color channels correspond to "
"points on 3 curves."
msgstr ""
"Una textura 1D on els canals de color vermell, verd i blau corresponen a "
"punts de 3 corbes."

#: doc/classes/CurveXYZTexture.xml
msgid ""
"A 1D texture where the red, green, and blue color channels correspond to "
"points on 3 unit [Curve] resources. Compared to using separate "
"[CurveTexture]s, this further simplifies the task of saving curves as image "
"files.\n"
"If you only need to store one curve within a single texture, use "
"[CurveTexture] instead. See also [GradientTexture1D] and [GradientTexture2D]."
msgstr ""
"Una textura 1D on els canals de color vermell, verd i blau corresponen als "
"punts de 3 recursos [Curve] de la unitat. En comparació amb l'ús de "
"[CurveTexture]s separats, això simplifica encara més la tasca de desar les "
"corbes com a fitxers d'imatge.\n"
"Si només necessiteu emmagatzemar una corba dins d'una textura única, feu "
"servir [CurveTexture]. Vegeu també [GradientTexture1D] i [GradientTexture2D]."

#: doc/classes/CurveXYZTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture's red channel. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"El [Curve] que es representa al canal vermell de la textura. Hauria de ser "
"una unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CurveXYZTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture's green channel. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"El [Curve] que es representa al canal verd de la textura. Hauria de ser una "
"unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CurveXYZTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture's blue channel. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"El [Curve] que es representa al canal blau de la textura. Hauria de ser una "
"unitat [Curve]."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid "Class representing a cylindrical [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "Classe que representa un [PrimitiveMesh] cilíndric."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Class representing a cylindrical [PrimitiveMesh]. This class can be used to "
"create cones by setting either the [member top_radius] or [member "
"bottom_radius] properties to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Classe que representa un [PrimitiveMesh] cilíndric. Aquesta classe es pot "
"utilitzar per crear cons configurant les propietats [member top_radius] o "
"[member bottom_radius] a [code]0.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Bottom radius of the cylinder. If set to [code]0.0[/code], the bottom faces "
"will not be generated, resulting in a conic shape. See also [member "
"cap_bottom]."
msgstr ""
"Radi inferior del cilindre. Si s'estableix en [code]0.0[/code], les cares "
"inferiors no es generaran, donant lloc a una forma cònica. Vegeu també "
"[member cap_bottom]."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generates a cap at the bottom of the cylinder. This "
"can be set to [code]false[/code] to speed up generation and rendering when "
"the cap is never seen by the camera. See also [member bottom_radius].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member bottom_radius] is [code]0.0[/code], cap generation "
"is always skipped even if [member cap_bottom] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], genera una tapa a la part inferior del cilindre. Això "
"es pot establir a [code]false[/code] per accelerar la generació i "
"renderització quan la càmera no veu mai la tapa. Vegeu també [member "
"bottom_radius].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si [member bottom_radius] és [code]@0.0[/code], la generació de "
"límits sempre s'omet encara que [member cap_bottom] sigui [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generates a cap at the top of the cylinder. This can "
"be set to [code]false[/code] to speed up generation and rendering when the "
"cap is never seen by the camera. See also [member top_radius].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member top_radius] is [code]0.0[/code], cap generation is "
"always skipped even if [member cap_top] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], genera una tapa a la part superior del cilindre. Això "
"es pot establir a [code]false[/code] per accelerar la generació i "
"renderització quan la càmera no veu mai la tapa. Vegeu també [member "
"top_radius].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si [member top_radius] és [code]@0.0[/code], la generació de "
"límits sempre s'omet encara que [member cap_top] sigui [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid "Full height of the cylinder."
msgstr "Altura total del cilindre."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Number of radial segments on the cylinder. Higher values result in a more "
"detailed cylinder/cone at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de segments radials del cilindre. Els valors més alts donen lloc a un "
"cilindre/con més detallat a costa del rendiment."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Number of edge rings along the height of the cylinder. Changing [member "
"rings] does not have any visual impact unless a shader or procedural mesh "
"tool is used to alter the vertex data. Higher values result in more "
"subdivisions, which can be used to create smoother-looking effects with "
"shaders or procedural mesh tools (at the cost of performance). When not "
"altering the vertex data using a shader or procedural mesh tool, [member "
"rings] should be kept to its default value."
msgstr ""
"Nombre d'anells de vora al llarg de l'altura del cilindre. Canviar [member "
"rings] no té cap impacte visual tret que s'utilitzi un shader o una eina de "
"malla procedimental per alterar les dades del vèrtex. Els valors més alts "
"donen lloc a més subdivisions, que es poden utilitzar per crear efectes "
"d'aspecte més suau amb ombrejadors o eines de malla procedimental (a costa "
"del rendiment). Quan no s'alterin les dades del vèrtex utilitzant un shader "
"o una eina de malla procedimental, [member rings] s'ha de mantenir al seu "
"valor predeterminat."

#: doc/classes/CylinderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Top radius of the cylinder. If set to [code]0.0[/code], the top faces will "
"not be generated, resulting in a conic shape. See also [member cap_top]."
msgstr ""
"Radi superior del cilindre. Si s'estableix en [code]0.0[/code], les cares "
"superiors no es generaran, donant lloc a una forma cònica. Vegeu també "
"[member cap_top]."

#: doc/classes/CylinderShape3D.xml
msgid "A 3D cylinder shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Una forma de cilindre 3D utilitzada per a la col·lisió física."

#: doc/classes/CylinderShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D cylinder shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] There are several known bugs with cylinder collision shapes. "
"Using [CapsuleShape3D] or [BoxShape3D] instead is recommended.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [CylinderShape3D] is fast to check collisions against, "
"but it is slower than [CapsuleShape3D], [BoxShape3D], and [SphereShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de cilindre 3D, pensada per al seu ús en física. Normalment "
"s'utilitza per proporcionar una forma per a un [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Hi ha diversos errors coneguts amb formes de col·lisió de "
"cilindres. Es recomana utilitzar [CapsuleShape3D] o [BoxShape3D].\n"
"[b]Rendiment:[/b] [CylinderShape3D] és ràpid per comprovar les col·lisions, "
"però és més lent que [CapsuleShape3D], [BoxShape3D] i [SphereShape3D]."

#: doc/classes/CylinderShape3D.xml
msgid "The cylinder's height."
msgstr "Alçada del cilindre."

#: doc/classes/CylinderShape3D.xml
msgid "The cylinder's radius."
msgstr "El radi del cilindre."

#: doc/classes/DampedSpringJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 2D physics bodies with a spring-like force."
msgstr ""
"Una articulació física que connecta dos cossos físics en 2D amb una força "
"semblant a una molla."

#: doc/classes/DampedSpringJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 2D physics bodies with a spring-like "
"force. This behaves like a spring that always wants to stretch to a given "
"length."
msgstr ""
"Una articulació física que connecta dos cossos físics en 2D amb una força "
"semblant a una molla. Aquest es comporta com una molla que sempre vol "
"estirar-se a una longitud determinada."

#: doc/classes/DampedSpringJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"The spring joint's damping ratio. A value between [code]0[/code] and "
"[code]1[/code]. When the two bodies move into different directions the "
"system tries to align them to the spring axis again. A high [member damping] "
"value forces the attached bodies to align faster."
msgstr ""
"Relació d'amortiment de la junta de molla. Un valor entre [code]0[/code] i "
"[code]1[/code]. Quan els dos cossos es mouen en direccions diferents, el "
"sistema intenta alinear-los de nou amb l'eix de la molla. Un valor [member "
"damping] alt força els cossos connectats a alinear-se més ràpidament."

#: doc/classes/DampedSpringJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"The spring joint's maximum length. The two attached bodies cannot stretch it "
"past this value."
msgstr ""
"Longitud màxima de la junta de molla. Els dos cossos connectats no poden "
"estirar-lo més enllà d'aquest valor."

#: doc/classes/DampedSpringJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"When the bodies attached to the spring joint move they stretch or squash it. "
"The joint always tries to resize towards this length."
msgstr ""
"Quan els cossos units a l'articulació de la molla es mouen, l'estiren o "
"l'aixafen. L'articulació sempre intenta redimensionar-se cap a aquesta "
"longitud."

#: doc/classes/DampedSpringJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"The higher the value, the less the bodies attached to the joint will deform "
"it. The joint applies an opposing force to the bodies, the product of the "
"stiffness multiplied by the size difference from its resting length."
msgstr ""
"Com més gran sigui el valor, menys la deformaran els cossos units a "
"l'articulació. L'articulació aplica una força oposada als cossos, el "
"producte de la rigidesa multiplicat per la diferència de mida de la seva "
"longitud de repòs."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid "Node that projects a texture onto a [MeshInstance3D]."
msgstr "Node que projecta una textura sobre un [MeshInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"[Decal]s are used to project a texture onto a [Mesh] in the scene. Use "
"Decals to add detail to a scene without affecting the underlying [Mesh]. "
"They are often used to add weathering to building, add dirt or mud to the "
"ground, or add variety to props. Decals can be moved at any time, making "
"them suitable for things like blob shadows or laser sight dots.\n"
"They are made of an [AABB] and a group of [Texture2D]s specifying [Color], "
"normal, ORM (ambient occlusion, roughness, metallic), and emission. Decals "
"are projected within their [AABB] so altering the orientation of the Decal "
"affects the direction in which they are projected. By default, Decals are "
"projected down (i.e. from positive Y to negative Y).\n"
"The [Texture2D]s associated with the Decal are automatically stored in a "
"texture atlas which is used for drawing the decals so all decals can be "
"drawn at once. Godot uses clustered decals, meaning they are stored in "
"cluster data and drawn when the mesh is drawn, they are not drawn as a post-"
"processing effect after.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Decals cannot affect an underlying material's transparency, "
"regardless of its transparency mode (alpha blend, alpha scissor, alpha hash, "
"opaque pre-pass). This means translucent or transparent areas of a material "
"will remain translucent or transparent even if an opaque decal is applied on "
"them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Decals are only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering "
"methods, not Compatibility. When using the Mobile rendering method, only 8 "
"decals can be displayed on each mesh resource. Attempting to display more "
"than 8 decals on a single mesh resource will result in decals flickering in "
"and out as the camera moves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, decals will only "
"correctly affect meshes whose visibility AABB intersects with the decal's "
"AABB. If using a shader to deform the mesh in a way that makes it go outside "
"its AABB, [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] must be increased on "
"the mesh. Otherwise, the decal may not be visible on the mesh."
msgstr ""
"Els [Decal]s s'utilitzen per projectar una textura sobre un [Mesh] a "
"l'escena. Utilitzeu calcomanes per afegir detalls a una escena sense afectar "
"el [Mesh] subjacent. Sovint s'utilitzen per afegir meteorització a "
"l'edifici, afegir brutícia o fang al terra o afegir varietat als accessoris. "
"Els adhesius es poden moure en qualsevol moment, per la qual cosa són "
"adequats per a coses com ara ombres o punts de visió làser.\n"
"Estan formats per un [AABB] i un grup de [Texture2D]s que especifiquen "
"[Color], normal, ORM (oclusió ambiental, rugositat, metàl·lic) i emissió. "
"Els adhesius es projecten dins del seu [AABB], de manera que l'alteració de "
"l'orientació de l'adhesiu afecta la direcció en què es projecten. Per "
"defecte, els adhesius es projecten cap avall (és a dir, de la Y positiva a "
"la Y negativa).\n"
"Els [Texture2D]s associats amb l'adhesiu s'emmagatzemen automàticament en un "
"atles de textures que s'utilitza per dibuixar els adhesius perquè tots els "
"adhesius es puguin dibuixar alhora. Godot utilitza adhesius agrupats, és a "
"dir, s'emmagatzemen a les dades del clúster i es dibuixen quan es dibuixa la "
"malla, no es dibuixen com a efecte de postprocessament després.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els adhesius no poden afectar la transparència d'un material "
"subjacent, independentment del seu mode de transparència (mescla alfa, "
"tisora alfa, hash alfa, pre-pass opac). Això significa que les zones "
"translúcides o transparents d'un material es mantindran translúcides o "
"transparents fins i tot si s'aplica un adhesiu opac.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els adhesius només s'admeten als mètodes de representació "
"Forward+ i Mobile, no Compatibilitat. Quan s'utilitza el mètode de "
"representació mòbil, només es poden mostrar 8 adhesius a cada recurs de "
"malla. Si intenteu mostrar més de 8 adhesius en un sol recurs de malla, els "
"adhesius parpellejaran dins i fora mentre la càmera es mou.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació mòbil, les "
"calcomanes només afectaran correctament les malles la visibilitat de les "
"quals AABB es creua amb l'AABB de la calcomanía. Si utilitzeu un shader per "
"deformar la malla d'una manera que la faci sortir del seu AABB, [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] s'ha d'augmentar a la malla. En cas "
"contrari, és possible que l'adhesiu no sigui visible a la malla."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Texture2D] associated with the specified [enum DecalTexture]. "
"This is a convenience method, in most cases you should access the texture "
"directly.\n"
"For example, instead of [code]albedo_tex = "
"$Decal.get_texture(Decal.TEXTURE_ALBEDO)[/code], use [code]albedo_tex = "
"$Decal.texture_albedo[/code].\n"
"One case where this is better than accessing the texture directly is when "
"you want to copy one Decal's textures to another. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"for i in Decal.TEXTURE_MAX:\n"
"\t$NewDecal.set_texture(i, $OldDecal.get_texture(i))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < (int)Decal.DecalTexture.Max; i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<Decal>(\"NewDecal\").SetTexture(i, "
"GetNode<Decal>(\"OldDecal\").GetTexture(i));\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [Texture2D] associat amb el [enum DecalTexture] especificat. "
"Aquest és un mètode còmode, en la majoria dels casos hauríeu d'accedir "
"directament a la textura.\n"
"Per exemple, en comptes de [code]albedo_tex = "
"$Decal.get_texture(Decal.TEXTURE_ALBEDO)[/code], utilitzeu [code]albedo_tex "
"= $Decal.texture_albedo[/code].\n"
"Un cas en què això és millor que accedir directament a la textura és quan "
"voleu copiar les textures d'un adhesiu a un altre. Per exemple:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"per i a Decal.TEXTURE_MAX:\n"
"\t$NewDecal.set_texture(i, $OldDecal.get_texture(i))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < (int)Decal.DecalTexture.Max; i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<Decal>(\"NewDecal\").SetTexture(i, "
"GetNode<Decal>(\"OldDecal\").GetTexture(i));\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Texture2D] associated with the specified [enum DecalTexture]. This "
"is a convenience method, in most cases you should access the texture "
"directly.\n"
"For example, instead of [code]$Decal.set_texture(Decal.TEXTURE_ALBEDO, "
"albedo_tex)[/code], use [code]$Decal.texture_albedo = albedo_tex[/code].\n"
"One case where this is better than accessing the texture directly is when "
"you want to copy one Decal's textures to another. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"for i in Decal.TEXTURE_MAX:\n"
"\t$NewDecal.set_texture(i, $OldDecal.get_texture(i))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < (int)Decal.DecalTexture.Max; i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<Decal>(\"NewDecal\").SetTexture(i, "
"GetNode<Decal>(\"OldDecal\").GetTexture(i));\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Estableix el [Texture2D] associat amb el [enum DecalTexture] especificat. "
"Aquest és un mètode còmode, en la majoria dels casos hauríeu d'accedir "
"directament a la textura.\n"
"Per exemple, en comptes de [code]$Decal.set_texture(Decal.TEXTURE_ALBEDO, "
"albedo_tex)[/code], utilitzeu [code]$Decal.texture_albedo = albedo_tex[/"
"code].\n"
"Un cas en què això és millor que accedir directament a la textura és quan "
"voleu copiar les textures d'un adhesiu a un altre. Per exemple:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"per i a Decal.TEXTURE_MAX:\n"
"\t$NewDecal.set_texture(i, $OldDecal.get_texture(i))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < (int)Decal.DecalTexture.Max; i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<Decal>(\"NewDecal\").SetTexture(i, "
"GetNode<Decal>(\"OldDecal\").GetTexture(i));\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Blends the albedo [Color] of the decal with albedo [Color] of the underlying "
"mesh. This can be set to [code]0.0[/code] to create a decal that only "
"affects normal or ORM. In this case, an albedo texture is still required as "
"its alpha channel will determine where the normal and ORM will be "
"overridden. See also [member modulate]."
msgstr ""
"Combina l'albedo [Color] de l'adhesiu amb l'albedo [Color] de la malla "
"subjacent. Això es pot establir a [code]0.0[/code] per crear un adhesiu que "
"només afecti normal o ORM. En aquest cas, encara es requereix una textura "
"d'albedo, ja que el seu canal alfa determinarà on es substituiran el normal "
"i l'ORM. Vegeu també [member modulate]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies which [member VisualInstance3D.layers] this decal will project on. "
"By default, Decals affect all layers. This is used so you can specify which "
"types of objects receive the Decal and which do not. This is especially "
"useful so you can ensure that dynamic objects don't accidentally receive a "
"Decal intended for the terrain under them."
msgstr ""
"Especifica en quin [member VisualInstance3D.layers] es projectarà aquesta "
"etiqueta. Per defecte, els adhesius afecten totes les capes. S'utilitza "
"perquè pugueu especificar quins tipus d'objectes reben l'adhesiu i quins no. "
"Això és especialment útil perquè pugueu assegurar-vos que els objectes "
"dinàmics no rebin accidentalment una etiqueta destinada al terreny que hi ha "
"sota."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from the camera at which the Decal begins to fade away (in 3D "
"units)."
msgstr ""
"La distància des de la càmera a la qual comença a desaparèixer l'adhesiu (en "
"unitats 3D)."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], decals will smoothly fade away when far from the "
"active [Camera3D] starting at [member distance_fade_begin]. The Decal will "
"fade out over [member distance_fade_begin] + [member distance_fade_length], "
"after which it will be culled and not sent to the shader at all. Use this to "
"reduce the number of active Decals in a scene and thus improve performance."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els adhesius s'esvairan sense problemes quan estiguin "
"lluny de l'activa [Camera3D] a partir de [member distance_fade_begin]. "
"L'adhesiu s'esvairà sobre [member distance_fade_begin] + [member "
"distance_fade_length], després de la qual cosa s'eliminarà i no s'enviarà al "
"shader. Utilitzeu-ho per reduir el nombre d'adhesius actius en una escena i "
"millorar així el rendiment."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"The distance over which the Decal fades (in 3D units). The Decal becomes "
"slowly more transparent over this distance and is completely invisible at "
"the end. Higher values result in a smoother fade-out transition, which is "
"more suited when the camera moves fast."
msgstr ""
"La distància a la qual s'esvaeix l'adhesiu (en unitats 3D). L'adhesiu es "
"torna lentament més transparent a aquesta distància i és completament "
"invisible al final. Els valors més alts donen lloc a una transició de "
"desaparició més suau, que és més adequada quan la càmera es mou ràpidament."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Energy multiplier for the emission texture. This will make the decal emit "
"light at a higher or lower intensity, independently of the albedo color. See "
"also [member modulate]."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador d'energia per a la textura d'emissió. Això farà que l'adhesiu "
"emeti llum a una intensitat més alta o més baixa, independentment del color "
"de l'albedo. Vegeu també [member modulate]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the curve over which the decal will fade as the surface gets further "
"from the center of the [AABB]. Only positive values are valid (negative "
"values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code]). See also [member upper_fade]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la corba sobre la qual s'esvaeix l'adhesiu a mesura que la "
"superfície s'allunya del centre de [AABB]. Només els valors positius són "
"vàlids (els valors negatius es fixaran a [code]0.0[/code]). Vegeu també "
"[member upper_fade]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the [Color] of the Decal by multiplying the albedo and emission "
"colors with this value. The alpha component is only taken into account when "
"multiplying the albedo color, not the emission color. See also [member "
"emission_energy] and [member albedo_mix] to change the emission and albedo "
"intensity independently of each other."
msgstr ""
"Canvia el [Color] de l'adhesiu multiplicant els colors de l'albedo i "
"l'emissió amb aquest valor. El component alfa només es té en compte quan es "
"multiplica el color de l'albedo, no el color d'emissió. Vegeu també [member "
"emission_energy] i [member albedo_mix] per canviar l'emissió i la intensitat "
"de l'albedo independentment l'una de l'altra."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Fades the Decal if the angle between the Decal's [AABB] and the target "
"surface becomes too large. A value of [code]0[/code] projects the Decal "
"regardless of angle, a value of [code]1[/code] limits the Decal to surfaces "
"that are nearly perpendicular.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member normal_fade] to a value greater than [code]0.0[/"
"code] has a small performance cost due to the added normal angle "
"computations."
msgstr ""
"S'esvaeix l'adhesiu si l'angle entre [AABB] de l'adhesiu i la superfície "
"objectiu es fa massa gran. Un valor de [code]0[/code] projecta l'adhesiu "
"independentment de l'angle, un valor de [code]1[/code] limita l'adhesiu a "
"superfícies que són gairebé perpendiculars.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Establir [member normal_fade] a un valor superior a [code]0.0[/"
"code] té un cost de rendiment petit a causa dels càlculs d'angle normal "
"afegits."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the [AABB] used by the decal. All dimensions must be set to "
"a value greater than zero (they will be clamped to [code]0.001[/code] if "
"this is not the case). The AABB goes from [code]-size/2[/code] to [code]size/"
"2[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To improve culling efficiency of \"hard surface\" decals, set "
"their [member upper_fade] and [member lower_fade] to [code]0.0[/code] and "
"set the Y component of the [member size] as low as possible. This will "
"reduce the decals' AABB size without affecting their appearance."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] with the base [Color] of the Decal. Either this or the [member "
"texture_emission] must be set for the Decal to be visible. Use the alpha "
"channel like a mask to smoothly blend the edges of the decal with the "
"underlying object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally "
"with [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter]."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] amb la base [Color] de l'adhesiu. S'ha d'establir això o [member "
"texture_emission] perquè l'adhesiu sigui visible. Utilitzeu el canal alfa "
"com una màscara per barrejar suaument les vores de l'adhesiu amb l'objecte "
"subjacent.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A diferència de [BaseMaterial3D] el mode de filtre del qual es "
"pot ajustar segons el material, el mode de filtre per a les textures [Decal] "
"s'estableix globalment amb [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/"
"filter]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] with the emission [Color] of the Decal. Either this or the "
"[member texture_albedo] must be set for the Decal to be visible. Use the "
"alpha channel like a mask to smoothly blend the edges of the decal with the "
"underlying object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally "
"with [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter]."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] amb l'emissió [Color] del Decal. S'ha d'establir això o [member "
"texture_albedo] perquè l'adhesiu sigui visible. Utilitzeu el canal alfa com "
"una màscara per barrejar suaument les vores de l'adhesiu amb l'objecte "
"subjacent.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A diferència de [BaseMaterial3D] el mode de filtre del qual es "
"pot ajustar segons el material, el mode de filtre per a les textures [Decal] "
"s'estableix globalment amb [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/"
"filter]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] with the per-pixel normal map for the decal. Use this to add "
"extra detail to decals.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally "
"with [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this texture alone will not result in a visible decal, "
"as [member texture_albedo] must also be set. To create a normal-only decal, "
"load an albedo texture into [member texture_albedo] and set [member "
"albedo_mix] to [code]0.0[/code]. The albedo texture's alpha channel will be "
"used to determine where the underlying surface's normal map should be "
"overridden (and its intensity)."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] amb el mapa normal per píxel per a l'adhesiu. Utilitzeu-ho per "
"afegir detalls addicionals als adhesius.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A diferència de [BaseMaterial3D] el mode de filtre del qual es "
"pot ajustar segons el material, el mode de filtre per a les textures [Decal] "
"s'estableix globalment amb [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/"
"filter].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La configuració d'aquesta textura sola no donarà lloc a una "
"etiqueta visible, ja que també s'ha d'establir [member texture_albedo]. Per "
"crear una etiqueta només normal, carregueu una textura d'albedo a [member "
"texture_albedo] i configureu [member albedo_mix] a [code]@0.0[/code]. El "
"canal alfa de la textura de l'albedo s'utilitzarà per determinar on s'ha "
"d'anul·lar el mapa normal de la superfície subjacent (i la seva intensitat)."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] storing ambient occlusion, roughness, and metallic for the "
"decal. Use this to add extra detail to decals.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally "
"with [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this texture alone will not result in a visible decal, "
"as [member texture_albedo] must also be set. To create an ORM-only decal, "
"load an albedo texture into [member texture_albedo] and set [member "
"albedo_mix] to [code]0.0[/code]. The albedo texture's alpha channel will be "
"used to determine where the underlying surface's ORM map should be "
"overridden (and its intensity).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to technical limitations, modifying the underlying "
"surface's roughness using [member texture_orm] does [i]not[/i] affect screen-"
"space reflections ([member Environment.ssr_enabled]), reflections from "
"[VoxelGI], and reflections from SDFGI ([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]). "
"Only reflections from [ReflectionProbe]s are affected."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the curve over which the decal will fade as the surface gets further "
"from the center of the [AABB]. Only positive values are valid (negative "
"values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code]). See also [member lower_fade]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la corba sobre la qual s'esvaeix l'adhesiu a mesura que la "
"superfície s'allunya del centre de [AABB]. Només els valors positius són "
"vàlids (els valors negatius es fixaran a [code]0.0[/code]). Vegeu també "
"[member lower_fade]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_albedo]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] corresponent a [member texture_albedo]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_normal]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] corresponent a [member texture_normal]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_orm]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] corresponent a [member texture_orm]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_emission]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] corresponent a [member texture_emission]."

#: doc/classes/Decal.xml
msgid "Max size of [enum DecalTexture] enum."
msgstr "Mida màxima de la enumeració [enum DecalTexture]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "A built-in data structure that holds key-value pairs."
msgstr "Una estructura de dades integrada que conté parells clau-valor."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Dictionaries are associative containers that contain values referenced by "
"unique keys. Dictionaries will preserve the insertion order when adding new "
"entries. In other programming languages, this data structure is often "
"referred to as a hash map or an associative array.\n"
"You can define a dictionary by placing a comma-separated list of [code]key: "
"value[/code] pairs inside curly braces [code]{}[/code].\n"
"Creating a dictionary:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_dict = {} # Creates an empty dictionary.\n"
"\n"
"var dict_variable_key = \"Another key name\"\n"
"var dict_variable_value = \"value2\"\n"
"var another_dict = {\n"
"\t\"Some key name\": \"value1\",\n"
"\tdict_variable_key: dict_variable_value,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"\n"
"# Alternative Lua-style syntax.\n"
"# Doesn't require quotes around keys, but only string constants can be used "
"as key names.\n"
"# Additionally, key names must start with a letter or an underscore.\n"
"# Here, `some_key` is a string literal, not a variable!\n"
"another_dict = {\n"
"\tsome_key = 42,\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary(); // Creates an empty "
"dictionary.\n"
"var pointsDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"You can access a dictionary's value by referencing its corresponding key. In "
"the above example, [code]points_dict[\"White\"][/code] will return [code]50[/"
"code]. You can also write [code]points_dict.White[/code], which is "
"equivalent. However, you'll have to use the bracket syntax if the key you're "
"accessing the dictionary with isn't a fixed string (such as a number or "
"variable).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export_enum(\"White\", \"Yellow\", \"Orange\") var my_color: String\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# We can't use dot syntax here as `my_color` is a variable.\n"
"\tvar points = points_dict[my_color]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export(PropertyHint.Enum, \"White,Yellow,Orange\")]\n"
"public string MyColor { get; set; }\n"
"private Godot.Collections.Dictionary _pointsDict = new "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tint points = (int)_pointsDict[MyColor];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"In the above code, [code]points[/code] will be assigned the value that is "
"paired with the appropriate color selected in [code]my_color[/code].\n"
"Dictionaries can contain more complex data:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_dict = {\n"
"\t\"First Array\": [1, 2, 3, 4] # Assigns an Array to a String key.\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"First Array\", new Godot.Collections.Array { 1, 2, 3, 4 } }\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To add a key to an existing dictionary, access it like an existing key and "
"assign to it:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"points_dict[\"Blue\"] = 150 # Add \"Blue\" as a key and assign 150 as its "
"value.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var pointsDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"pointsDict[\"Blue\"] = 150; // Add \"Blue\" as a key and assign 150 as its "
"value.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Finally, untyped dictionaries can contain different types of keys and values "
"in the same dictionary:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# This is a valid dictionary.\n"
"# To access the string \"Nested value\" below, use "
"`my_dict.sub_dict.sub_key` or `my_dict[\"sub_dict\"][\"sub_key\"]`.\n"
"# Indexing styles can be mixed and matched depending on your needs.\n"
"var my_dict = {\n"
"\t\"String Key\": 5,\n"
"\t4: [1, 2, 3],\n"
"\t7: \"Hello\",\n"
"\t\"sub_dict\": { \"sub_key\": \"Nested value\" },\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// This is a valid dictionary.\n"
"// To access the string \"Nested value\" below, use "
"`((Godot.Collections.Dictionary)myDict[\"sub_dict\"])[\"sub_key\"]`.\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary {\n"
"\t{ \"String Key\", 5 },\n"
"\t{ 4, new Godot.Collections.Array { 1, 2, 3 } },\n"
"\t{ 7, \"Hello\" },\n"
"\t{ \"sub_dict\", new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"sub_key\", \"Nested "
"value\" } } },\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The keys of a dictionary can be iterated with the [code]for[/code] keyword:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var groceries = { \"Orange\": 20, \"Apple\": 2, \"Banana\": 4 }\n"
"for fruit in groceries:\n"
"\tvar amount = groceries[fruit]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var groceries = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"Orange\", 20 }, "
"{ \"Apple\", 2 }, { \"Banana\", 4 } };\n"
"foreach (var (fruit, amount) in groceries)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// `fruit` is the key, `amount` is the value.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To enforce a certain type for keys and values, you can create a [i]typed "
"dictionary[/i]. Typed dictionaries can only contain keys and values of the "
"given types, or that inherit from the given classes:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and int values.\n"
"# Attempting to use any other type for keys or values will result in an "
"error.\n"
"var typed_dict: Dictionary[String, int] = {\n"
"\t\"some_key\": 1,\n"
"\t\"some_other_key\": 2,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"# Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and values of any type.\n"
"# Attempting to use any other type for keys will result in an error.\n"
"var typed_dict_key_only: Dictionary[String, Variant] = {\n"
"\t\"some_key\": 12.34,\n"
"\t\"some_other_key\": \"string\",\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and int values.\n"
"// Attempting to use any other type for keys or values will result in an "
"error.\n"
"var typedDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary<String, int> {\n"
"\t{\"some_key\", 1},\n"
"\t{\"some_other_key\", 2},\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and values of any type.\n"
"// Attempting to use any other type for keys will result in an error.\n"
"var typedDictKeyOnly = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary<String, Variant> {\n"
"\t{\"some_key\", 12.34},\n"
"\t{\"some_other_key\", \"string\"},\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Dictionaries are always passed by reference. To get a copy of a "
"dictionary which can be modified independently of the original dictionary, "
"use [method duplicate].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Erasing elements while iterating over dictionaries is [b]not[/"
"b] supported and will result in unpredictable behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a dictionary will evaluate to "
"[code]false[/code] if it's empty ([code]{}[/code]). Otherwise, a dictionary "
"will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Els diccionaris són contenidors associatius que contenen valors referenciats "
"per claus úniques. Els diccionaris conservaran l'ordre d'inserció quan "
"s'afegeixin noves entrades. En altres llenguatges de programació, aquesta "
"estructura de dades s'anomena sovint un mapa hash o una matriu associativa.\n"
"Podeu definir un diccionari col·locant una llista separada per comes de "
"[code]key: valor[/code] parelles dins de claus [code]{}[/code].\n"
"Creació d'un diccionari:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_dict = {} # Crea un diccionari buit.\n"
"\n"
"var dict_variable_key = \"Un altre nom de clau\"\n"
"var dict_variable_value = \"valor2\"\n"
"var un altre_dict = {\n"
"\"Algun nom de clau\": \"valor1\",\n"
"dict_variable_key: dict_variable_value,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"\n"
"# Sintaxi alternativa a l'estil Lua.\n"
"# No requereix cometes al voltant de les claus, però només es poden "
"utilitzar constants de cadena com a noms de clau.\n"
"# A més, els noms de les claus han de començar amb una lletra o un guió "
"baix.\n"
"# Aquí, `some_key` és un literal de cadena, no una variable!\n"
"un altre_dict = {\n"
"alguna_clau = 42,\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary(); // Crea un diccionari "
"buit.\n"
"var pointsDict = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Podeu accedir al valor d'un diccionari fent referència a la seva clau "
"corresponent. A l'exemple anterior, [code]points_dict[\"White\"][/code] "
"retornarà [code]50[/code]. També podeu escriure [code]points_dict.White[/"
"code], que és l'equivalent. Tanmateix, haureu d'utilitzar la sintaxi de "
"claudàtors si la clau amb la qual accediu al diccionari no és una cadena "
"fixa (com ara un número o una variable).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export_enum(\"Blanc\", \"Groc\", \"Taronja\") var my_color: cadena\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"# Aquí no podem utilitzar la sintaxi de punts ja que `my_color` és una "
"variable.\n"
"var punts = points_dict[my_color]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export(PropertyHint.Enum, \"White,Yellow,Orange\")]\n"
"cadena pública MyColor { get; set; }\n"
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary privat _pointsDict = nou "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"anul·lació pública void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"int punts = (int)_pointsDict[MyColor];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Al codi anterior, a [code]points[/code] s'assignarà el valor que es combina "
"amb el color adequat seleccionat a [code]my_color[/code].\n"
"Els diccionaris poden contenir dades més complexes:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var el meu_dict = {\n"
"\"First Array\": [1, 2, 3, 4] # Assigna una matriu a una clau de cadena.\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"First Array\", new Godot.Collections.Array { 1, 2, 3, 4 } }\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Per afegir una clau a un diccionari existent, accediu-hi com una clau "
"existent i assigneu-li:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"points_dict[\"Blue\"] = 150 # Afegiu \"Blau\" com a clau i assigneu 150 com "
"a valor.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var pointsDict = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"pointsDict[\"Blue\"] = 150; // Afegeix \"Blau\" com a clau i assigna 150 com "
"a valor.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Finalment, els diccionaris sense mecanografia poden contenir diferents tipus "
"de claus i valors al mateix diccionari:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Aquest és un diccionari vàlid.\n"
"# Per accedir a la cadena \"Valor imbricat\" a continuació, utilitzeu "
"`my_dict.sub_dict.sub_key` o `my_dict[\"sub_dict\"][\"sub_key\"]`.\n"
"# Els estils d'indexació es poden barrejar i combinar en funció de les "
"vostres necessitats.\n"
"var el meu_dict = {\n"
"\"Clau de cadena\": 5,\n"
"\t4: [1, 2, 3],\n"
"7: \"Hola\",\n"
"\"sub_dict\": { \"sub_key\": \"Nested value\" },\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Aquest és un diccionari vàlid.\n"
"// Per accedir a la cadena \"Valor imbricat\" a continuació, utilitzeu "
"`((Godot.Collections.Dictionary)myDict[\"sub_dict\"])[\"sub_key\"]`.\n"
"var myDict = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary {\n"
"\t{ \"String Key\", 5 },\n"
"\t{ 4, new Godot.Collections.Array { 1, 2, 3 } },\n"
"\t{ 7, \"Hello\" },\n"
"\t{ \"sub_dict\", new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"sub_key\", \"Nested "
"value\" } } },\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Les claus d'un diccionari es poden repetir amb la paraula clau [code]for[/"
"code]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var queviures = { \"Orange\": 20, \"Apple\": 2, \"Banana\": 4 }\n"
"per a la fruita als queviures:\n"
"quantitat var = queviures[fruit]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var groceries = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"Orange\", 20 }, "
"{ \"Apple\", 2 }, { \"Banana\", 4 } };\n"
"foreach (var (fruita, quantitat) en queviures)\n"
"{\n"
"// `fruit` és la clau, `import` és el valor.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Per aplicar un tipus determinat per a claus i valors, podeu crear un "
"[i]diccionari escrit[/i]. Els diccionaris escrits només poden contenir claus "
"i valors dels tipus donats, o que hereten de les classes donades:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Crea un diccionari escrit amb tecles String i valors int.\n"
"# Si intenteu utilitzar qualsevol altre tipus per a claus o valors, es "
"produirà un error.\n"
"var typed_dict: Dictionary[String, int] = {\n"
"\"alguna_clau\": 1,\n"
"\"alguna_altra_clau\": 2,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"# Crea un diccionari escrit amb claus de cadena i valors de qualsevol "
"tipus.\n"
"# Si intenteu utilitzar qualsevol altre tipus per a les claus, es produirà "
"un error.\n"
"var typed_dict_key_only: Dictionary[String, Variant] = {\n"
"\"alguna_clau\": 12.34,\n"
"\"some_other_key\": \"cadena\",\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Crea un diccionari escrit amb tecles String i valors int.\n"
"// Si intenteu utilitzar qualsevol altre tipus per a claus o valors, es "
"produirà un error.\n"
"var typedDict = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary<String, int> {\n"
"\t{\"some_key\", 1},\n"
"\t{\"some_other_key\", 2},\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// Crea un diccionari escrit amb claus de cadena i valors de qualsevol "
"tipus.\n"
"// Si intenteu utilitzar qualsevol altre tipus per a les claus, es produirà "
"un error.\n"
"var typedDictKeyOnly = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary<String, Variant> {\n"
"\t{\"some_key\", 12.34},\n"
"\t{\"some_other_key\", \"string\"},\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els diccionaris sempre es passen per referència. Per obtenir "
"una còpia d'un diccionari que es pot modificar independentment del "
"diccionari original, utilitzeu [method duplicate].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'esborrat d'elements mentre s'itera sobre diccionaris és "
"compatible amb [b]not[/b] i donarà lloc a un comportament impredictible.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En un context booleà, un diccionari s'avaluarà com a "
"[code]false[/code] si està buit (@@MLC_TOKEN_115@115@@@@MLC_TOKEN_115@1{}"
"@EN_115@115@@@[code]false[/code]) En cas contrari, un diccionari sempre "
"s'avaluarà com a [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "GDScript basics: Dictionary"
msgstr "Conceptes bàsics de GDScript: Diccionari"

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "Constructs an empty [Dictionary]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Dictionary] buit."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a typed dictionary from the [param base] dictionary. A typed "
"dictionary can only contain keys and values of the given types, or that "
"inherit from the given classes, as described by this constructor's "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Crea un diccionari escrit a partir del diccionari [param base]. Un "
"diccionari escrit només pot contenir claus i valors dels tipus donats, o que "
"hereten de les classes donades, tal com descriuen els paràmetres d'aquest "
"constructor."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the same dictionary as [param from]. If you need a copy of the "
"dictionary, use [method duplicate]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el mateix diccionari que [param from]. Si necessiteu una còpia del "
"diccionari, utilitzeu [method duplicate]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Assigns elements of another [param dictionary] into the dictionary. Resizes "
"the dictionary to match [param dictionary]. Performs type conversions if the "
"dictionary is typed."
msgstr ""
"Assigna elements d'un altre [param dictionary] al diccionari. Canvia la mida "
"del diccionari perquè coincideixi amb [param dictionary]. Realitza "
"conversions de tipus si el diccionari està escrit."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "Clears the dictionary, removing all entries from it."
msgstr "Esborra el diccionari, eliminant-ne totes les entrades."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new copy of the dictionary.\n"
"By default, a [b]shallow[/b] copy is returned: all nested [Array], "
"[Dictionary], and [Resource] keys and values are shared with the original "
"dictionary. Modifying any of those in one dictionary will also affect them "
"in the other.\n"
"If [param deep] is [code]true[/code], a [b]deep[/b] copy is returned: all "
"nested arrays and dictionaries are also duplicated (recursively). Any "
"[Resource] is still shared with the original dictionary, though."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia nova del diccionari.\n"
"Per defecte, es retorna una còpia [b]shallow[/b]: totes les claus i valors "
"[Array], [Dictionary] i [Resource] imbricats es comparteixen amb el "
"diccionari original. Modificar qualsevol d'aquests d'un diccionari també els "
"afectarà a l'altre.\n"
"Si [param deep] és [code]true[/code], es retorna una còpia [b]deep[/b]: "
"totes les matrius i diccionaris imbricats també es dupliquen (de manera "
"recursiva). Tot i això, qualsevol [Resource] encara es comparteix amb el "
"diccionari original."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicates this dictionary, deeply, like [method duplicate] when passing "
"[code]true[/code], with extra control over how subresources are handled.\n"
"[param deep_subresources_mode] must be one of the values from [enum "
"Resource.DeepDuplicateMode]. By default, only internal resources will be "
"duplicated (recursively)."
msgstr ""
"Duplica aquest diccionari, profundament, com [method duplicate] quan passa "
"[code]true[/code], amb un control addicional sobre com es gestionen els "
"subrecursos.\n"
"[param deep_subresources_mode] ha de ser un dels valors de [enum "
"Resource.DeepDuplicateMode]. Per defecte, només es duplicaran els recursos "
"interns (de manera recursiva)."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the dictionary entry by key, if it exists. Returns [code]true[/code] "
"if the given [param key] existed in the dictionary, otherwise [code]false[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not erase entries while iterating over the dictionary. You "
"can iterate over the [method keys] array instead."
msgstr ""
"Elimina l'entrada del diccionari per clau, si existeix. Retorna [code]true[/"
"code] si el [param key] donat existia al diccionari, en cas contrari "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No esborreu les entrades mentre itereu sobre el diccionari. En "
"lloc d'això, podeu iterar sobre la matriu [method keys]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Finds and returns the first key whose associated value is equal to [param "
"value], or [code]null[/code] if it is not found.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]null[/code] is also a valid key. If inside the "
"dictionary, [method find_key] may give misleading results."
msgstr ""
"Cerca i retorna la primera clau el valor associat de la qual és igual a "
"[param value], o [code]null[/code] si no es troba.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]null[/code] també és una clau vàlida. Si està dins del "
"diccionari, [method find_key] pot donar resultats enganyosos."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the corresponding value for the given [param key] in the dictionary. "
"If the [param key] does not exist, returns [param default], or [code]null[/"
"code] if the parameter is omitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the [param default] argument is computationally expensive or "
"has unwanted side effects, consider using the [method has] method instead:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Always calls `expensive_function()`.\n"
"dict.get(\"key\", expensive_function())\n"
"# Calls `expensive_function()` only if the key does not exist.\n"
"dict.get(\"key\") if dict.has(\"key\") else expensive_function()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor corresponent per al [param key] donat al diccionari. Si "
"[param key] no existeix, retorna [param default], o [code]null[/code] si "
"s'omet el paràmetre.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si l'argument [param default] és car computacionalment o té "
"efectes secundaris no desitjats, consideri utilitzar el mètode [method "
"has]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Sempre crida a `expensive_function()`.\n"
"dict.get(\"clau\", funció_cara())\n"
"# Crida a `expensive_function()` només si la clau no existeix.\n"
"dict.get(\"clau\") si dict.has(\"clau\") sinó expensive_function()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Gets a value and ensures the key is set. If the [param key] exists in the "
"dictionary, this behaves like [method get]. Otherwise, the [param default] "
"value is inserted into the dictionary and returned."
msgstr ""
"Obté un valor i assegura que la clau està establerta. Si [param key] "
"existeix al diccionari, això es comporta com [method get]. En cas contrari, "
"el valor [param default] s'insereix al diccionari i es retorna."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the built-in [Variant] type of the typed dictionary's keys as a "
"[enum Variant.Type] constant. If the keys are not typed, returns [constant "
"TYPE_NIL]. See also [method is_typed_key]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el tipus [Variant] integrat de les claus del diccionari escrit com a "
"constant [enum Variant.Type]. Si no s'escriuen les claus, retorna [constant "
"TYPE_NIL]. Vegeu també [method is_typed_key]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [b]built-in[/b] class name of the typed dictionary's keys, if "
"the built-in [Variant] type is [constant TYPE_OBJECT]. Otherwise, returns an "
"empty [StringName]. See also [method is_typed_key] and [method "
"Object.get_class]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom de classe [b]built-in[/b] de les claus del diccionari escrit, "
"si el tipus [Variant] integrat és [constant TYPE_OBJECT]. En cas contrari, "
"retorna un [StringName] buit. Vegeu també [method is_typed_key] i [method "
"Object.get_class]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Script] instance associated with this typed dictionary's keys, "
"or [code]null[/code] if it does not exist. See also [method is_typed_key]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la instància [Script] associada amb les claus d'aquest diccionari "
"escrit, o [code]null[/code] si no existeix. Vegeu també [method "
"is_typed_key]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the built-in [Variant] type of the typed dictionary's values as a "
"[enum Variant.Type] constant. If the values are not typed, returns [constant "
"TYPE_NIL]. See also [method is_typed_value]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el tipus [Variant] integrat dels valors del diccionari escrit com a "
"constant [enum Variant.Type]. Si no s'escriuen els valors, retorna [constant "
"TYPE_NIL]. Vegeu també [method is_typed_value]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [b]built-in[/b] class name of the typed dictionary's values, if "
"the built-in [Variant] type is [constant TYPE_OBJECT]. Otherwise, returns an "
"empty [StringName]. See also [method is_typed_value] and [method "
"Object.get_class]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom de classe [b]built-in[/b] dels valors del diccionari escrit, "
"si el tipus [Variant] integrat és [constant TYPE_OBJECT]. En cas contrari, "
"retorna un [StringName] buit. Vegeu també [method is_typed_value] i [method "
"Object.get_class]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Script] instance associated with this typed dictionary's "
"values, or [code]null[/code] if it does not exist. See also [method "
"is_typed_value]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la instància [Script] associada amb els valors d'aquest diccionari "
"escrit, o [code]null[/code] si no existeix. Vegeu també [method "
"is_typed_value]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary contains an entry with the given "
"[param key].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_dict = {\n"
"\t\"Godot\" : 4,\n"
"\t210 : null,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"print(my_dict.has(\"Godot\")) # Prints true\n"
"print(my_dict.has(210))     # Prints true\n"
"print(my_dict.has(4))       # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"Godot\", 4 },\n"
"\t{ 210, default },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(\"Godot\")); // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(210));     // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(4));       // Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"In GDScript, this is equivalent to the [code]in[/code] operator:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"if \"Godot\" in { \"Godot\": 4 }:\n"
"\tprint(\"The key is here!\") # Will be printed.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns [code]true[/code] as long as the [param "
"key] exists, even if its corresponding value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el diccionari conté una entrada amb el [param "
"key] donat.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var el meu_dict = {\n"
"\t\"Godot\": 4,\n"
"\t210: nul,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"print(my_dict.has(\"Godot\")) # Imprimeix true\n"
"print(my_dict.has(210)) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(my_dict.has(4)) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"Godot\", 4 },\n"
"\t{ 210, default },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(\"Godot\")); // Imprimeix True\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(210));     // Imprimeix True\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(4));       // Imprimeix fals\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"A GDScript, això és equivalent a l'operador [code]in[/code]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"si \"Godot\" a { \"Godot\": 4 }:\n"
"\tprint(\"La clau és aquí!\") # S'imprimirà.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode retorna [code]true[/code] sempre que existeixi "
"[param key], encara que el seu valor corresponent sigui [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary contains all keys in the given "
"[param keys] array.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data = { \"width\": 10, \"height\": 20 }\n"
"data.has_all([\"height\", \"width\"]) # Returns true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el diccionari conté totes les claus de la "
"matriu [param keys] donada.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var dades = { \"width\": 10, \"height\": 20 }\n"
"data.has_all([\"height\", \"width\"]) # Retorna cert\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a hashed 32-bit integer value representing the dictionary contents.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var dict1 = { \"A\": 10, \"B\": 2 }\n"
"var dict2 = { \"A\": 10, \"B\": 2 }\n"
"\n"
"print(dict1.hash() == dict2.hash()) # Prints true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var dict1 = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"A\", 10 }, { \"B\", "
"2 } };\n"
"var dict2 = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"A\", 10 }, { \"B\", "
"2 } };\n"
"\n"
"// Godot.Collections.Dictionary has no Hash() method. Use GD.Hash() "
"instead.\n"
"GD.Print(GD.Hash(dict1) == GD.Hash(dict2)); // Prints True\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Dictionaries with the same entries but in a different order "
"will not have the same hash.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Dictionaries with equal hash values are [i]not[/i] guaranteed "
"to be the same, because of hash collisions. On the contrary, dictionaries "
"with different hash values are guaranteed to be different."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un valor enter de 32 bits que representa el contingut del "
"diccionari.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var dict1 = { \"A\": 10, \"B\": 2 }\n"
"var dict2 = { \"A\": 10, \"B\": 2 }\n"
"\n"
"print(dict1.hash() == dict2.hash()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var dict1 = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"A\", 10 }, { \"B\", "
"2 } };\n"
"var dict2 = nou Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"A\", 10 }, { \"B\", "
"2 } };\n"
"\n"
"// Godot.Collections.Dictionary no té cap mètode Hash(). Utilitzeu GD.Hash() "
"al seu lloc.\n"
"GD.Print(GD.Hash(dict1) == GD.Hash(dict2)); // Imprimeix True\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els diccionaris amb les mateixes entrades però en un ordre "
"diferent no tindran el mateix hash.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els diccionaris amb valors hash iguals són [i]not[/i] es "
"garanteixen els mateixos, a causa de les col·lisions hash. Al contrari, es "
"garanteix que els diccionaris amb diferents valors hash són diferents."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is empty (its size is [code]0[/"
"code]). See also [method size]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el diccionari està buit (la seva mida és "
"[code]0[/code]). Vegeu també [method size]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is read-only. See [method "
"make_read_only]. Dictionaries are automatically read-only if declared with "
"[code]const[/code] keyword."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el diccionari és només de lectura. Veure "
"[method make_read_only]. Els diccionaris són de només lectura automàticament "
"si es declaren amb la paraula clau [code]const[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is typed the same as [param "
"dictionary]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's keys are typed the same as "
"[param dictionary]'s keys."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's values are typed the same as "
"[param dictionary]'s values."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is typed. Typed dictionaries can "
"only store keys/values of their associated type and provide type safety for "
"the [code][][/code] operator. Methods of typed dictionary still return "
"[Variant]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si s'escriu el diccionari. Els diccionaris escrits "
"només poden emmagatzemar claus/valors del seu tipus associat i proporcionar "
"seguretat de tipus per a l'operador [code][][/code]. Els mètodes de "
"diccionari escrit encara retornen [Variant]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's keys are typed."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] si les claus del diccionari tenen tipus."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's values are typed."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] si els valors del diccionari tenen tipus."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "Returns the list of keys in the dictionary."
msgstr "Retorna la llista de claus del diccionari."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the dictionary read-only, i.e. disables modification of the "
"dictionary's contents. Does not apply to nested content, e.g. content of "
"nested dictionaries."
msgstr ""
"Fa que el diccionari sigui només de lectura, és a dir, desactiva la "
"modificació del contingut del diccionari. No s'aplica al contingut imbricat, "
"p. contingut dels diccionaris imbricats."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Adds entries from [param dictionary] to this dictionary. By default, "
"duplicate keys are not copied over, unless [param overwrite] is [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var dict = { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2 }\n"
"var other_dict = { \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": \"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"# Overwriting of existing keys is disabled by default.\n"
"dict.merge(other_dict)\n"
"print(dict)  # { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"# With overwriting of existing keys enabled.\n"
"dict.merge(other_dict, true)\n"
"print(dict)  # { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var dict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t[\"item\"] = \"sword\",\n"
"\t[\"quantity\"] = 2,\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"var otherDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t[\"quantity\"] = 15,\n"
"\t[\"color\"] = \"silver\",\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// Overwriting of existing keys is disabled by default.\n"
"dict.Merge(otherDict);\n"
"GD.Print(dict); // { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"// With overwriting of existing keys enabled.\n"
"dict.Merge(otherDict, true);\n"
"GD.Print(dict); // { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method merge] is [i]not[/i] recursive. Nested dictionaries are "
"considered as keys that can be overwritten or not depending on the value of "
"[param overwrite], but they will never be merged together."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix entrades de [param dictionary] a aquest diccionari. Per defecte, les "
"claus duplicades no es copien, tret que [param overwrite] sigui [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var dict = { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2 }\n"
"var other_dict = { \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": \"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"# La sobreescriptura de les claus existents està desactivada per defecte.\n"
"dict.merge(altre_dict)\n"
"imprimir (dict) # { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"# Amb la sobreescriptura de les claus existents activada.\n"
"dict.merge(altre_dict, veritable)\n"
"imprimir (dict) # { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var dict = nou Godot.Col·leccions.Diccionari\n"
"{\n"
"\t[\"item\"] = \"espasa\",\n"
"\t[\"quantity\"] = 2,\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"var otherDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t[\"quantity\"] = 15,\n"
"\t[\"color\"] = \"plata\",\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// La sobreescriptura de les claus existents està desactivada per defecte.\n"
"dict.Fusionar(altreDict);\n"
"GD.Print(dict); // { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"// Amb la sobreescriptura de les claus existents activada.\n"
"dict.Merge(otherDict, true);\n"
"GD.Print(dict); // { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method merge] és [i]not[/i] recursiu. Els diccionaris nius es "
"consideren claus que es poden sobreescriure o no en funció del valor de "
"[param overwrite], però mai es fusionaran."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this dictionary merged with the other [param dictionary]. "
"By default, duplicate keys are not copied over, unless [param overwrite] is "
"[code]true[/code]. See also [method merge].\n"
"This method is useful for quickly making dictionaries with default values:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var base = { \"fruit\": \"apple\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\" }\n"
"var extra = { \"fruit\": \"orange\", \"dressing\": \"vinegar\" }\n"
"# Prints { \"fruit\": \"orange\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\", \"dressing\": "
"\"vinegar\" }\n"
"print(extra.merged(base))\n"
"# Prints { \"fruit\": \"apple\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\", \"dressing\": "
"\"vinegar\" }\n"
"print(extra.merged(base, true))\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest diccionari combinada amb l'altre [param "
"dictionary]. Per defecte, les claus duplicades no es copien, tret que [param "
"overwrite] sigui [code]true[/code]. Vegeu també [method merge].\n"
"Aquest mètode és útil per crear ràpidament diccionaris amb valors per "
"defecte:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var base = { \"fruit\": \"apple\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\" }\n"
"var extra = { \"fruit\": \"orange\", \"dressing\": \"vinegar\" }\n"
"# Impressions { \"fruit\": \"orange\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\", "
"\"dressing\": \"vinegar\" }\n"
"imprimir (extra.fusionat (base))\n"
"# Impressions { \"fruit\": \"apple\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\", "
"\"dressing\": \"vinegar\" }\n"
"imprimir (extra.merged (base, veritable))\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the two dictionaries contain the same keys and "
"values, inner [Dictionary] and [Array] keys and values are compared "
"recursively."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els dos diccionaris contenen les mateixes claus "
"i valors, les claus i valors interiors [Dictionary] i [Array] es comparen "
"recursivament."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the value of the element at the given [param key] to the given [param "
"value]. Returns [code]true[/code] if the value is set successfully. Fails "
"and returns [code]false[/code] if the dictionary is read-only, or if [param "
"key] and [param value] don't match the dictionary's types. This is the same "
"as using the [code][][/code] operator ([code]dict[key] = value[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el valor de l'element a [param key] donat a [param value] donat. "
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el valor s'ha establert correctament. Falla i "
"retorna [code]false[/code] si el diccionari és de només lectura, o si [param "
"key] i [param value] no coincideixen amb els tipus del diccionari. Això és "
"el mateix que utilitzar l'operador [code][][/code] ([code]dict[key] = value[/"
"code])."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of entries in the dictionary. Empty dictionaries ([code]"
"{ }[/code]) always return [code]0[/code]. See also [method is_empty]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre d'entrades al diccionari. Els diccionaris buits ([code]{ }"
"[/code]) sempre tornen [code]0[/code]. Vegeu també [method is_empty]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Sorts the dictionary in ascending order, by key. The final order is "
"dependent on the \"less than\" ([code]<[/code]) comparison between keys.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var numbers = { \"c\": 2, \"a\": 0, \"b\": 1 }\n"
"numbers.sort()\n"
"print(numbers) # Prints { \"a\": 0, \"b\": 1, \"c\": 2 }\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This method ensures that the dictionary's entries are ordered consistently "
"when [method keys] or [method values] are called, or when the dictionary "
"needs to be converted to a string through [method @GlobalScope.str] or "
"[method JSON.stringify]."
msgstr ""
"Ordena el diccionari en ordre ascendent, per clau. L'ordre final depèn de la "
"comparació \"menys que\" ([code]<[/code]) entre les claus.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"nombres var = { \"c\": 2, \"a\": 0, \"b\": 1 }\n"
"nombres.sort()\n"
"print(nombres) # Imprimeix { \"a\": 0, \"b\": 1, \"c\": 2 }\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Aquest mètode garanteix que les entrades del diccionari estiguin ordenades "
"de manera coherent quan es crida [method keys] o [method values], o quan el "
"diccionari s'ha de convertir en una cadena mitjançant [method "
"@GlobalScope.str] o [method JSON.stringify]."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid "Returns the list of values in this dictionary."
msgstr "Retorna la llista de valors d'aquest diccionari."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the two dictionaries do not contain the same "
"keys and values."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els dos diccionaris no contenen les mateixes "
"claus i valors."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the two dictionaries contain the same keys and "
"values. The order of the entries does not matter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, by convention, this operator compares by [b]reference[/"
"b]. If you need to compare by value, iterate over both dictionaries."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els dos diccionaris contenen les mateixes claus "
"i valors. L'ordre de les entrades no importa.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, per convenció, aquest operador compara per [b]reference[/"
"b]. Si necessiteu comparar per valor, itereu sobre els dos diccionaris."

#: doc/classes/Dictionary.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the corresponding value for the given [param key] in the dictionary. "
"If the entry does not exist, fails and returns [code]null[/code]. For safe "
"access, use [method get] or [method has]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor corresponent per al [param key] donat al diccionari. Si "
"l'entrada no existeix, falla i retorna [code]null[/code]. Per a un accés "
"segur, utilitzeu [method get] o [method has]."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid "Provides methods for managing directories and their content."
msgstr "Proporciona mètodes per gestionar directoris i el seu contingut."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used to manage directories and their content, even outside of "
"the project folder.\n"
"[DirAccess] can't be instantiated directly. Instead it is created with a "
"static method that takes a path for which it will be opened.\n"
"Most of the methods have a static alternative that can be used without "
"creating a [DirAccess]. Static methods only support absolute paths "
"(including [code]res://[/code] and [code]user://[/code]).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Standard\n"
"var dir = DirAccess.open(\"user://levels\")\n"
"dir.make_dir(\"world1\")\n"
"# Static\n"
"DirAccess.make_dir_absolute(\"user://levels/world1\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessing project (\"res://\") directories once exported may "
"behave unexpectedly as some files are converted to engine-specific formats "
"and their original source files may not be present in the expected PCK "
"package. Because of this, to access resources in an exported project, it is "
"recommended to use [ResourceLoader] instead of [FileAccess].\n"
"Here is an example on how to iterate through the files of a directory:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func dir_contents(path):\n"
"\tvar dir = DirAccess.open(path)\n"
"\tif dir:\n"
"\t\tdir.list_dir_begin()\n"
"\t\tvar file_name = dir.get_next()\n"
"\t\twhile file_name != \"\":\n"
"\t\t\tif dir.current_is_dir():\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Found directory: \" + file_name)\n"
"\t\t\telse:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Found file: \" + file_name)\n"
"\t\t\tfile_name = dir.get_next()\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"An error occurred when trying to access the path.\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void DirContents(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var dir = DirAccess.Open(path);\n"
"\tif (dir != null)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tdir.ListDirBegin();\n"
"\t\tstring fileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\twhile (fileName != \"\")\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (dir.CurrentIsDir())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Found directory: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\telse\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Found file: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tfileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\telse\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"An error occurred when trying to access the path.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Keep in mind that file names may change or be remapped after export. If you "
"want to see the actual resource file list as it appears in the editor, use "
"[method ResourceLoader.list_directory] instead."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe s'utilitza per gestionar directoris i el seu contingut, fins "
"i tot fora de la carpeta del projecte.\n"
"[DirAccess] no es pot instància directament. En canvi, es crea amb un mètode "
"estàtic que pren un camí per al qual s'obrirà.\n"
"La majoria dels mètodes tenen una alternativa estàtica que es pot utilitzar "
"sense crear un [DirAccess]. Els mètodes estàtics només admeten camins "
"absoluts (inclosos [code]res://[/code] i [code]user://[/code]).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Estàndard\n"
"var dir = DirAccess.open(\"usuari://nivells\")\n"
"dir.make_dir(\"world1\")\n"
"# Estàtica\n"
"DirAccess.make_dir_absolute(\"usuari://nivells/món1\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'accés als directoris del projecte (\"res://\") un cop "
"exportats pot comportar-se de manera inesperada, ja que alguns fitxers es "
"converteixen a formats específics del motor i els seus fitxers font "
"originals poden no estar presents al paquet PCK esperat. Per això, per "
"accedir als recursos d'un projecte exportat, es recomana utilitzar "
"[ResourceLoader] en comptes de [FileAccess].\n"
"Aquí teniu un exemple de com iterar pels fitxers d'un directori:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func dir_contents(camí):\n"
"\tvar dir = DirAccess.open (camí)\n"
"\tif dir:\n"
"\t\tdir.list_dir_begin()\n"
"\t\tvar nom_fitxer = dir.get_next()\n"
"\t\tmentre que nom_fitxer != \"\":\n"
"\t\t\tsi dir.current_is_dir():\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Directori trobat: \" + nom_fitxer)\n"
"\t\t\taltra cosa:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Fitxer trobat: \" + nom_fitxer)\n"
"\t\t\tnom_fitxer = dir.get_next()\n"
"\taltra cosa:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"S'ha produït un error en intentar accedir al camí.\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void DirContents (camí de la cadena)\n"
"{\n"
"\tutilitzant var dir = DirAccess.Open (camí);\n"
"\tif (dir != nul)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tdir.ListDirBegin();\n"
"\t\tstring fileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\tmentre (nom del fitxer != \"\")\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (dir.CurrentIsDir())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Directori trobat: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\taltra cosa\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Fitxer trobat: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tfileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\taltra cosa\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"S'ha produït un error en intentar accedir al camí.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Tingueu en compte que els noms dels fitxers poden canviar o tornar a "
"assignar-se després de l'exportació. Si voleu veure la llista real de "
"fitxers de recursos tal com apareix a l'editor, feu servir [method "
"ResourceLoader.list_directory]."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "File system"
msgstr "Sistema de fitxers"

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the currently opened directory to the one passed as an argument. The "
"argument can be relative to the current directory (e.g. [code]newdir[/code] "
"or [code]../newdir[/code]), or an absolute path (e.g. [code]/tmp/newdir[/"
"code] or [code]res://somedir/newdir[/code]).\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The new directory must be within the same scope, e.g. when you "
"had opened a directory inside [code]res://[/code], you can't change it to "
"[code]user://[/code] directory. If you need to open a directory in another "
"access scope, use [method open] to create a new instance instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Copies the [param from] file to the [param to] destination. Both arguments "
"should be paths to files, either relative or absolute. If the destination "
"file exists and is not access-protected, it will be overwritten.\n"
"If [param chmod_flags] is different than [code]-1[/code], the Unix "
"permissions for the destination path will be set to the provided value, if "
"available on the current operating system.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr ""
"Copia el fitxer [param from] a la destinació [param to]. Tots dos arguments "
"haurien de ser camins als fitxers, ja siguin relatius o absoluts. Si el "
"fitxer de destinació existeix i no està protegit d'accés, se sobreescriurà.\n"
"Si [param chmod_flags] és diferent de [code]-1[/code], els permisos Unix per "
"al camí de destinació s'establiran amb el valor proporcionat, si està "
"disponible al sistema operatiu actual.\n"
"Retorna una de les constants de codi [enum Error] ([constant OK] en cas "
"d'èxit)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid "Static version of [method copy]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "Versió estàtica de [method copy]. Només admet camins absoluts."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates symbolic link between files or folders.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, this method works only if the application is "
"running with elevated privileges or Developer Mode is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Crea un enllaç simbòlic entre fitxers o carpetes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A Windows, aquest mètode només funciona si l'aplicació s'està "
"executant amb privilegis elevats o si el mode de desenvolupador està "
"habilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a macOS, Linux i Windows."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a temporary directory. This directory will be freed when the "
"returned [DirAccess] is freed.\n"
"If [param prefix] is not empty, it will be prefixed to the directory name, "
"separated by a [code]-[/code].\n"
"If [param keep] is [code]true[/code], the directory is not deleted when the "
"returned [DirAccess] is freed.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the directory failed. You can use "
"[method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"Crea un directori temporal. Aquest directori s'alliberarà quan s'alliberi el "
"[DirAccess] retornat.\n"
"Si [param prefix] no està buit, tindrà el prefix del nom del directori, "
"separat per un [code]-[/code].\n"
"Si [param keep] és [code]true[/code], el directori no s'elimina quan "
"s'allibera el [DirAccess] retornat.\n"
"Retorna [code]null[/code] si no s'ha pogut obrir el directori. Podeu "
"utilitzar [method get_open_error] per comprovar l'error que s'ha produït."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the current item processed with the last [method get_next] "
"call is a directory ([code].[/code] and [code]..[/code] are considered "
"directories)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si l'element actual processat amb la darrera trucada [method "
"get_next] és un directori ([code].[/code] i [code]..[/code] es consideren "
"directoris)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the target directory exists. The argument can be relative to "
"the current directory, or an absolute path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned [bool] in the editor and after exporting when used "
"on a path in the [code]res://[/code] directory may be different. Some files "
"are converted to engine-specific formats when exported, potentially changing "
"the directory structure."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si el directori de destinació existeix. L'argument pot ser relatiu "
"al directori actual o una ruta absoluta.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El [bool] retornat a l'editor i després de l'exportació quan "
"s'utilitza en un camí al directori [code]res://[/code] pot ser diferent. "
"Alguns fitxers es converteixen a formats específics del motor quan "
"s'exporten, la qual cosa pot canviar l'estructura del directori."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Static version of [method dir_exists]. Supports only absolute paths.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned [bool] in the editor and after exporting when used "
"on a path in the [code]res://[/code] directory may be different. Some files "
"are converted to engine-specific formats when exported, potentially changing "
"the directory structure."
msgstr ""
"Versió estàtica de [method dir_exists]. Només admet camins absoluts.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El [bool] retornat a l'editor i després d'exportar quan "
"s'utilitza en un camí al directori [code]res://[/code] pot ser diferent. "
"Alguns fitxers es converteixen a formats específics del motor quan "
"s'exporten, la qual cosa pot canviar l'estructura del directori."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the target file exists. The argument can be relative to the "
"current directory, or an absolute path.\n"
"For a static equivalent, use [method FileAccess.file_exists].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many resources types are imported (e.g. textures or sound "
"files), and their source asset will not be included in the exported game, as "
"only the imported version is used. See [method ResourceLoader.exists] for an "
"alternative approach that takes resource remapping into account."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si el fitxer de destinació existeix. L'argument pot ser relatiu al "
"directori actual o una ruta absoluta.\n"
"Per a un equivalent estàtic, utilitzeu [method FileAccess.file_exists].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] S'importen molts tipus de recursos (per exemple, textures o "
"fitxers de so) i el seu actiu d'origen no s'inclourà al joc exportat, ja que "
"només s'utilitza la versió importada. Vegeu [method ResourceLoader.exists] "
"per obtenir un enfocament alternatiu que tingui en compte la reasignació de "
"recursos."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the currently opened directory (e.g. "
"[code]res://folder[/code] or [code]C:\\tmp\\folder[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el camí absolut al directori obert actualment (per exemple, "
"[code]res://folder[/code] o [code]@C:\\tmp\\folder[/code])."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the currently opened directory's drive index. See [method "
"get_drive_name] to convert returned index to the name of the drive."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de la unitat del directori obert actualment. Vegeu [method "
"get_drive_name] per convertir l'índex retornat al nom de la unitat."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory "
"contents, excluding files. The array is sorted alphabetically.\n"
"Affected by [member include_hidden] and [member include_navigational].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned directories in the editor and after exporting in "
"the [code]res://[/code] directory may differ as some files are converted to "
"engine-specific formats when exported."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [PackedStringArray] que conté noms de fitxers del contingut del "
"directori, exclosos els fitxers. La matriu està ordenada alfabèticament.\n"
"Afectat per [member include_hidden] i [member include_navigational].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els directoris retornats a l'editor i després d'exportar-los al "
"directori [code]res://[/code] poden diferir ja que alguns fitxers es "
"converteixen a formats específics del motor quan s'exporten."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory "
"contents, excluding files, at the given [param path]. The array is sorted "
"alphabetically.\n"
"Use [method get_directories] if you want more control of what gets "
"included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned directories in the editor and after exporting in "
"the [code]res://[/code] directory may differ as some files are converted to "
"engine-specific formats when exported."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [PackedStringArray] que conté els noms de fitxer del contingut "
"del directori, exclosos els fitxers, a l'[param path] donat. La matriu està "
"ordenada alfabèticament.\n"
"Utilitzeu [method get_directories] si voleu més control del que s'inclou.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els directoris retornats a l'editor i després d'exportar-los al "
"directori [code]res://[/code] poden diferir ja que alguns fitxers es "
"converteixen a formats específics del motor quan s'exporten."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"On Windows, returns the number of drives (partitions) mounted on the current "
"filesystem.\n"
"On macOS and Android, returns the number of mounted volumes.\n"
"On Linux, returns the number of mounted volumes and GTK 3 bookmarks.\n"
"On other platforms, the method returns 0."
msgstr ""
"A Windows, retorna el nombre de unitats (particions) muntades al sistema de "
"fitxers actual.\n"
"A macOS i Android, retorna el nombre de volums muntats.\n"
"A Linux, retorna el nombre de volums muntats i d'adreces d'interès GTK 3.\n"
"En altres plataformes, el mètode retorna 0."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"On Windows, returns the label of the drive (partition) passed as an "
"argument.\n"
"On other platforms, or if the requested drive does not exist, returns an "
"empty String."
msgstr ""
"A Windows, retorna l'etiqueta de la unitat (partició) passat com a "
"argument.\n"
"En altres plataformes, o si la unitat sol·licitada no existeix, retorna una "
"cadena buida."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"On Windows, returns the name of the drive (partition) passed as an argument "
"(e.g. [code]C:[/code]).\n"
"On macOS, returns the path to the mounted volume passed as an argument.\n"
"On Linux, returns the path to the mounted volume or GTK 3 bookmark passed as "
"an argument.\n"
"On Android (API level 30+), returns the path to the mounted volume as an "
"argument.\n"
"On other platforms, or if the requested drive does not exist, returns an "
"empty String."
msgstr ""
"A Windows, retorna el nom de la unitat (partició) passat com a argument (per "
"exemple, [code]C:[/code]).\n"
"A macOS, retorna el camí al volum muntat passat com a argument.\n"
"A Linux, retorna el camí al volum muntat o al marcador GTK 3 passat com a "
"argument.\n"
"A Android (nivell API 30+), retorna el camí al volum muntat com a argument.\n"
"En altres plataformes, o si la unitat sol·licitada no existeix, retorna una "
"cadena buida."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory "
"contents, excluding directories. The array is sorted alphabetically.\n"
"Affected by [member include_hidden].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used on a [code]res://[/code] path in an exported project, "
"only the files actually included in the PCK at the given folder level are "
"returned. In practice, this means that since imported resources are stored "
"in a top-level [code].godot/[/code] folder, only paths to [code]*.gd[/code] "
"and [code]*.import[/code] files are returned (plus a few files such as "
"[code]project.godot[/code] or [code]project.binary[/code] and the project "
"icon). In an exported project, the list of returned files will also vary "
"depending on whether [member ProjectSettings.editor/export/"
"convert_text_resources_to_binary] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory "
"contents, excluding directories, at the given [param path]. The array is "
"sorted alphabetically.\n"
"Use [method get_files] if you want more control of what gets included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used on a [code]res://[/code] path in an exported project, "
"only the files included in the PCK at the given folder level are returned. "
"In practice, this means that since imported resources are stored in a top-"
"level [code].godot/[/code] folder, only paths to [code].gd[/code] and "
"[code].import[/code] files are returned (plus a few other files, such as "
"[code]project.godot[/code] or [code]project.binary[/code] and the project "
"icon). In an exported project, the list of returned files will also vary "
"depending on [member ProjectSettings.editor/export/"
"convert_text_resources_to_binary]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns file system type name of the current directory's disk. Returned "
"values are uppercase strings like [code]NTFS[/code], [code]FAT32[/code], "
"[code]EXFAT[/code], [code]APFS[/code], [code]EXT4[/code], [code]BTRFS[/"
"code], and so on.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, Windows and for PCK "
"virtual file system."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom del tipus de sistema de fitxers del disc del directori "
"actual. Els valors retornats són cadenes en majúscules com [code]NTFS[/"
"code], [code]FAT32[/code], [code]EXFAT[/code], [code]APFS[/code], "
"[code]EXT4[/code], [code]BTRFS[/code], i així successivament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a macOS, Linux, Windows i per al "
"sistema de fitxers virtual PCK."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next element (file or directory) in the current directory.\n"
"The name of the file or directory is returned (and not its full path). Once "
"the stream has been fully processed, the method returns an empty [String] "
"and closes the stream automatically (i.e. [method list_dir_end] would not be "
"mandatory in such a case)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'element següent (fitxer o directori) al directori actual.\n"
"Es retorna el nom del fitxer o directori (i no el seu camí complet). Un cop "
"el flux s'ha processat completament, el mètode retorna un [String] buit i "
"tanca el flux automàticament (és a dir, [method list_dir_end] no seria "
"obligatori en aquest cas)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the result of the last [method open] call in the current thread."
msgstr "Retorna el resultat de la darrera trucada [method open] al fil actual."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the available space on the current directory's disk, in bytes. "
"Returns [code]0[/code] if the platform-specific method to query the "
"available space fails."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'espai disponible al disc del directori actual, en bytes. Retorna "
"[code]0[/code] si el mètode específic de la plataforma per consultar l'espai "
"disponible falla."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the directory is a macOS bundle.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file system or directory use case sensitive "
"file names.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux (for EXT4 and F2FS "
"filesystems only) and Windows. On other platforms, it always returns "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el sistema de fitxers o el directori utilitza "
"noms de fitxers sensibles a majúscules i minúscules.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a macOS, Linux (només per a sistemes "
"de fitxers EXT4 i F2FS) i Windows. En altres plataformes, sempre retorna "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if paths [param path_a] and [param path_b] resolve "
"to the same file system object. Returns [code]false[/code] otherwise, even "
"if the files are bit-for-bit identical (e.g., identical copies of the file "
"that are not symbolic links)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els camins [param path_a] i [param path_b] es "
"resolen amb el mateix objecte del sistema de fitxers. Retorna [code]false[/"
"code] en cas contrari, encara que els fitxers siguin idèntics bit per bit "
"(per exemple, còpies idèntiques del fitxer que no són enllaços simbòlics)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file or directory is a symbolic link, "
"directory junction, or other reparse point.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el fitxer o el directori és un enllaç simbòlic, "
"una unió de directoris o un altre punt d'anàlisi.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a macOS, Linux i Windows."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the stream used to list all files and directories using the "
"[method get_next] function, closing the currently opened stream if needed. "
"Once the stream has been processed, it should typically be closed with "
"[method list_dir_end].\n"
"Affected by [member include_hidden] and [member include_navigational].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The order of files and directories returned by this method is "
"not deterministic, and can vary between operating systems. If you want a "
"list of all files or folders sorted alphabetically, use [method get_files] "
"or [method get_directories]."
msgstr ""
"Inicialitza el flux utilitzat per llistar tots els fitxers i directoris "
"mitjançant la funció [method get_next], tancant el flux actualment obert si "
"cal. Un cop s'ha processat el flux, normalment s'ha de tancar amb [method "
"list_dir_end].\n"
"Afectat per [member include_hidden] i [member include_navigational].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'ordre dels fitxers i directoris retornats per aquest mètode "
"no és determinista i pot variar entre els sistemes operatius. Si voleu una "
"llista de tots els fitxers o carpetes ordenats alfabèticament, utilitzeu "
"[method get_files] o [method get_directories]."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Closes the current stream opened with [method list_dir_begin] (whether it "
"has been fully processed with [method get_next] does not matter)."
msgstr ""
"Tanca el flux actual obert amb [method list_dir_begin] (no importa si s'ha "
"processat completament amb [method get_next])."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a directory. The argument can be relative to the current directory, "
"or an absolute path. The target directory should be placed in an already "
"existing directory (to create the full path recursively, see [method "
"make_dir_recursive]).\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr ""
"Crea un directori. L'argument pot ser relatiu al directori actual o una ruta "
"absoluta. El directori de destinació s'ha de col·locar en un directori ja "
"existent (per crear el camí complet de manera recursiva, vegeu [method "
"make_dir_recursive]).\n"
"Retorna una de les constants de codi [enum Error] ([constant OK] en cas "
"d'èxit)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid "Static version of [method make_dir]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "Versió estàtica de [method make_dir]. Només admet camins absoluts."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a target directory and all necessary intermediate directories in its "
"path, by calling [method make_dir] recursively. The argument can be relative "
"to the current directory, or an absolute path.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr ""
"Crea un directori de destinació i tots els directoris intermedis necessaris "
"al seu camí, trucant a [method make_dir] de manera recursiva. L'argument pot "
"ser relatiu al directori actual o una ruta absoluta.\n"
"Retorna una de les constants de codi [enum Error] ([constant OK] en cas "
"d'èxit)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Static version of [method make_dir_recursive]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr ""
"Versió estàtica de [method make_dir_recursive]. Només admet camins absoluts."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [DirAccess] object and opens an existing directory of the "
"filesystem. The [param path] argument can be within the project tree "
"([code]res://folder[/code]), the user directory ([code]user://folder[/code]) "
"or an absolute path of the user filesystem (e.g. [code]/tmp/folder[/code] or "
"[code]C:\\tmp\\folder[/code]).\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the directory failed. You can use "
"[method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou objecte [DirAccess] i obre un directori existent del sistema de "
"fitxers. L'argument [param path] pot estar dins de l'arbre del projecte "
"([code]res://folder[/code]), el directori d'usuari ([code]user://folder[/"
"code]) o una ruta absoluta del sistema de fitxers d'usuari (g. [code]/tmp/"
"folder[/code] o [code]C:\\tmp\\folder[/code]).\n"
"Retorna [code]null[/code] si no s'ha pogut obrir el directori. Podeu "
"utilitzar [method get_open_error] per comprovar l'error que s'ha produït."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns target of the symbolic link.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'objectiu de l'enllaç simbòlic.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a macOS, Linux i Windows."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Permanently deletes the target file or an empty directory. The argument can "
"be relative to the current directory, or an absolute path. If the target "
"directory is not empty, the operation will fail.\n"
"If you don't want to delete the file/directory permanently, use [method "
"OS.move_to_trash] instead.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr ""
"Suprimeix permanentment el fitxer de destinació o un directori buit. "
"L'argument pot ser relatiu al directori actual o una ruta absoluta. Si el "
"directori de destinació no està buit, l'operació fallarà.\n"
"Si no voleu suprimir el fitxer/directori permanentment, feu servir [method "
"OS.move_to_trash].\n"
"Retorna una de les constants de codi [enum Error] ([constant OK] en cas "
"d'èxit)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid "Static version of [method remove]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "Versió estàtica de [method remove]. Només admet camins absoluts."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Renames (move) the [param from] file or directory to the [param to] "
"destination. Both arguments should be paths to files or directories, either "
"relative or absolute. If the destination file or directory exists and is not "
"access-protected, it will be overwritten.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr ""
"Canvia el nom (mou) el fitxer o el directori [param from] a la destinació "
"[param to]. Tots dos arguments han de ser camins a fitxers o directoris, ja "
"siguin relatius o absoluts. Si el fitxer o directori de destinació existeix "
"i no està protegit per l'accés, es sobreescriurà.\n"
"Retorna una de les constants de codi [enum Error] ([constant OK] en cas "
"d'èxit)."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid "Static version of [method rename]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "Versió estàtica de [method rename]. Només admet camins absoluts."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hidden files are included when navigating the "
"directory.\n"
"Affects [method list_dir_begin], [method get_directories] and [method "
"get_files]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els fitxers ocults s'inclouen en navegar pel "
"directori.\n"
"Afecta [method list_dir_begin], [method get_directories] i [method "
"get_files]."

#: doc/classes/DirAccess.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code].[/code] and [code]..[/code] are included when "
"navigating the directory.\n"
"Affects [method list_dir_begin] and [method get_directories]."
msgstr ""
"Si s'inclouen [code]true[/code], [code].[/code] i [code]..[/code] quan es "
"navega pel directori.\n"
"Afecta [method list_dir_begin] i [method get_directories]."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight2D.xml
msgid "Directional 2D light from a distance."
msgstr "Llum direccional 2D des de la distància."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight2D.xml
msgid ""
"A directional light is a type of [Light2D] node that models an infinite "
"number of parallel rays covering the entire scene. It is used for lights "
"with strong intensity that are located far away from the scene (for example: "
"to model sunlight or moonlight).\n"
"Light is emitted in the +Y direction of the node's global basis. For an "
"unrotated light, this means that the light is emitted downwards. The "
"position of the node is ignored; only the basis is used to determine light "
"direction.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [DirectionalLight2D] does not support light cull masks (but it "
"supports shadow cull masks). It will always light up 2D nodes, regardless of "
"the 2D node's [member CanvasItem.light_mask]."
msgstr ""
"Una llum direccional és un tipus de node [Light2D] que modela un nombre "
"infinit de raigs paral·lels que cobreixen tota l'escena. S'utilitza per a "
"llums de gran intensitat que es troben lluny de l'escena (per exemple: per "
"modelar la llum del sol o la llum de la lluna).\n"
"La llum s'emet en la direcció +Y de la base global del node. Per a una llum "
"sense girar, això significa que la llum s'emet cap avall. S'ignora la "
"posició del node; només s'utilitza la base per determinar la direcció de la "
"llum.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [DirectionalLight2D] no admet màscares d'eliminació de llum "
"(però admet màscares de eliminació d'ombra). Sempre il·luminarà els nodes "
"2D, independentment del [member CanvasItem.light_mask] del node 2D."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight2D.xml
msgid ""
"The height of the light. Used with 2D normal mapping. Ranges from 0 "
"(parallel to the plane) to 1 (perpendicular to the plane)."
msgstr ""
"L'alçada de la llum. S'utilitza amb mapes normals 2D. Va de 0 (paral·lel al "
"pla) a 1 (perpendicular al pla)."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight2D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum distance from the camera center objects can be before their "
"shadows are culled (in pixels). Decreasing this value can prevent objects "
"located outside the camera from casting shadows (while also improving "
"performance). [member Camera2D.zoom] is not taken into account by [member "
"max_distance], which means that at higher zoom values, shadows will appear "
"to fade out sooner when zooming onto a given point."
msgstr ""
"La distància màxima dels objectes del centre de la càmera pot ser abans que "
"les seves ombres siguin eliminades (en píxels). Disminuir aquest valor pot "
"evitar que els objectes situats fora de la càmera facin ombres (a la vegada "
"que millora el rendiment). [member Camera2D.zoom] no té en compte [member "
"max_distance], la qual cosa significa que amb valors de zoom més alts, les "
"ombres semblaran que s'esvaeixen més aviat quan s'apropi a un punt "
"determinat."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid "Directional light from a distance, as from the Sun."
msgstr "Llum direccional des de la distància, com del Sol."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"A directional light is a type of [Light3D] node that models an infinite "
"number of parallel rays covering the entire scene. It is used for lights "
"with strong intensity that are located far away from the scene to model "
"sunlight or moonlight.\n"
"Light is emitted in the -Z direction of the node's global basis. For an "
"unrotated light, this means that the light is emitted forwards, illuminating "
"the front side of a 3D model (see [constant Vector3.FORWARD] and [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]). The position of the node is ignored; only the basis "
"is used to determine light direction."
msgstr ""
"Una llum direccional és un tipus de node [Light3D] que modela un nombre "
"infinit de raigs paral·lels que cobreixen tota l'escena. S'utilitza per a "
"llums de forta intensitat que es troben lluny de l'escena per modelar la "
"llum del sol o la llum de la lluna.\n"
"La llum s'emet en la direcció -Z de la base global del node. Per a una llum "
"sense girar, això significa que la llum s'emet cap endavant, il·luminant la "
"part frontal d'un model 3D (vegeu [constant Vector3.FORWARD] i [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]). S'ignora la posició del node; només s'utilitza la "
"base per determinar la direcció de la llum."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml doc/classes/Light3D.xml
#: doc/classes/OmniLight3D.xml doc/classes/SpotLight3D.xml
msgid "Faking global illumination"
msgstr "Falsificació de la il·luminació global"

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shadow detail is sacrificed in exchange for smoother "
"transitions between splits. Enabling shadow blend splitting also has a "
"moderate performance cost. This is ignored when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_ORTHOGONAL]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el detall de l'ombra es sacrifica a canvi de "
"transicions més suaus entre les divisions. Habilitar la divisió de la "
"barreja d'ombres també té un cost de rendiment moderat. Això s'ignora quan "
"[member directional_shadow_mode] és [constant SHADOW_ORTHOGONAL]."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Proportion of [member directional_shadow_max_distance] at which point the "
"shadow starts to fade. At [member directional_shadow_max_distance], the "
"shadow will disappear. The default value is a balance between smooth fading "
"and distant shadow visibility. If the camera moves fast and the [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance] is low, consider lowering [member "
"directional_shadow_fade_start] below [code]0.8[/code] to make shadow "
"transitions less noticeable. On the other hand, if you tuned [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance] to cover the entire scene, you can set "
"[member directional_shadow_fade_start] to [code]1.0[/code] to prevent the "
"shadow from fading in the distance (it will suddenly cut off instead)."
msgstr ""
"Proporció de [member directional_shadow_max_distance], moment en què l'ombra "
"comença a esvair-se. A [member directional_shadow_max_distance], l'ombra "
"desapareixerà. El valor predeterminat és un equilibri entre l'esvaïment suau "
"i la visibilitat de l'ombra llunyana. Si la càmera es mou ràpidament i la "
"[member directional_shadow_max_distance] és baixa, penseu a baixar [member "
"directional_shadow_fade_start] per sota de [code]0.8[/code] per fer que les "
"transicions d'ombres siguin menys notables. D'altra banda, si heu ajustat "
"[member directional_shadow_max_distance] per cobrir tota l'escena, podeu "
"establir [member directional_shadow_fade_start] a [code]1.0[/code] per "
"evitar que l'ombra s'esvaeixi a la distància (de sobte es tallarà)."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum distance for shadow splits. Increasing this value will make "
"directional shadows visible from further away, at the cost of lower overall "
"shadow detail and performance (since more objects need to be included in the "
"directional shadow rendering)."
msgstr ""
"La distància màxima per a les divisions d'ombra. L'augment d'aquest valor "
"farà que les ombres direccionals siguin visibles des de més lluny, a costa "
"d'un menor detall i rendiment general de l'ombra (ja que s'han d'incloure "
"més objectes a la representació de l'ombra direccional)."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid "The light's shadow rendering algorithm."
msgstr "Algorisme de representació d'ombres de la llum."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the directional shadow pancake. The pancake offsets the "
"start of the shadow's camera frustum to provide a higher effective depth "
"resolution for the shadow. However, a high pancake size can cause artifacts "
"in the shadows of large objects that are close to the edge of the frustum. "
"Reducing the pancake size can help. Setting the size to [code]0[/code] turns "
"off the pancaking effect."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la mida de la creps d'ombra direccional. El pancake compensa "
"l'inici del tronc de la càmera de l'ombra per proporcionar una resolució de "
"profunditat efectiva més alta per a l'ombra. No obstant això, una gran mida "
"de creps pot provocar artefactes a les ombres d'objectes grans que es troben "
"a prop de la vora del tronc. Reduir la mida del pancake pot ajudar. Establir "
"la mida a [code]0[/code] desactiva l'efecte pancaking."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from camera to shadow split 1. Relative to [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance]. Only used when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_2_SPLITS] or [constant "
"SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."
msgstr ""
"La distància de la càmera a la divisió de l'ombra 1. Relativa a [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance]. Només s'utilitza quan [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] és [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_2_SPLITS] o [constant "
"SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from shadow split 1 to split 2. Relative to [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance]. Only used when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."
msgstr ""
"La distància des de la divisió d'ombra 1 fins a la divisió 2. Relativa a "
"[member directional_shadow_max_distance]. Només s'utilitza quan [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] és [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from shadow split 2 to split 3. Relative to [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance]. Only used when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."
msgstr ""
"La distància des de l'ombra dividida 2 fins a la divisió 3. Relativa a "
"[member directional_shadow_max_distance]. Només s'utilitza quan [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] és [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Whether this [DirectionalLight3D] is visible in the sky, in the scene, or "
"both in the sky and in the scene."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest [DirectionalLight3D] és visible al cel, a l'escena o tant al cel "
"com a l'escena."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Renders the entire scene's shadow map from an orthogonal point of view. This "
"is the fastest directional shadow mode. May result in blurrier shadows on "
"close objects."
msgstr ""
"Representa el mapa d'ombres de tota l'escena des d'un punt de vista "
"ortogonal. Aquest és el mode d'ombra direccional més ràpid. Pot donar lloc a "
"ombres més borroses en objectes propers."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the view frustum in 2 areas, each with its own shadow map. This "
"shadow mode is a compromise between [constant SHADOW_ORTHOGONAL] and "
"[constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS] in terms of performance."
msgstr ""
"Divideix la vista en 2 àrees, cadascuna amb el seu propi mapa d'ombres. "
"Aquest mode d'ombra és un compromís entre [constant SHADOW_ORTHOGONAL] i "
"[constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS] en termes de rendiment."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the view frustum in 4 areas, each with its own shadow map. This is "
"the slowest directional shadow mode."
msgstr ""
"Divideix la vista en 4 àrees, cadascuna amb el seu propi mapa d'ombres. "
"Aquest és el mode d'ombra direccional més lent."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid "Makes the light visible in both scene lighting and sky rendering."
msgstr ""
"Fa que la llum sigui visible tant a la il·luminació de l'escena com a la "
"representació del cel."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the light visible in scene lighting only (including direct lighting "
"and global illumination). When using this mode, the light will not be "
"visible from sky shaders."
msgstr ""
"Fa que la llum sigui visible només a la il·luminació de l'escena (inclosa la "
"il·luminació directa i la il·luminació global). Quan utilitzeu aquest mode, "
"la llum no serà visible des dels ombres del cel."

#: doc/classes/DirectionalLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the light visible to sky shaders only. When using this mode the light "
"will not cast light into the scene (either through direct lighting or "
"through global illumination), but can be accessed through sky shaders. This "
"can be useful, for example, when you want to control sky effects without "
"illuminating the scene (during a night cycle, for example)."
msgstr ""
"Fa que la llum només sigui visible per als ombra del cel. Quan s'utilitza "
"aquest mode, la llum no emetrà llum a l'escena (ja sigui mitjançant la "
"il·luminació directa o la il·luminació global), sinó que es pot accedir a "
"través dels ombres del cel. Això pot ser útil, per exemple, quan voleu "
"controlar els efectes del cel sense il·luminar l'escena (durant un cicle "
"nocturn, per exemple)."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid "A server interface for low-level window management."
msgstr ""
"Una interfície de servidor per a la gestió de finestres de baix nivell."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"[DisplayServer] handles everything related to window management. It is "
"separated from [OS] as a single operating system may support multiple "
"display servers.\n"
"[b]Headless mode:[/b] Starting the engine with the [code]--headless[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url] disables all rendering and window management functions. Most "
"functions from [DisplayServer] will return dummy values in this case."
msgstr ""
"[DisplayServer] gestiona tot allò relacionat amb la gestió de finestres. "
"Està separat de [OS] ja que un sol sistema operatiu pot suportar diversos "
"servidors de visualització.\n"
"[b]Mode sense cap:[/b] L'arrencada del motor amb [code]--headless[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]argument de la "
"línia d'ordres[/url] desactiva totes les funcions de representació i gestió "
"de finestres. La majoria de les funcions de [DisplayServer] retornaran "
"valors ficticis en aquest cas."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid "Use [AccessibilityServer] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [AccessibilityServer]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new, empty accessibility sub-element resource. Sub-elements can be "
"used to provide accessibility information for objects which are not [Node]s, "
"such as list items, table cells, or menu items. Sub-elements are freed "
"automatically when the parent element is freed, or can be freed early using "
"the [method accessibility_free_element] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea un recurs de subelement d'accessibilitat nou i buit. Els subelements es "
"poden utilitzar per proporcionar informació d'accessibilitat per a objectes "
"que no són [Node]s, com ara elements de llista, cel·les de taula o elements "
"de menú. Els subelements s'alliberen automàticament quan s'allibera "
"l'element pare o es poden alliberar abans d'hora mitjançant el mètode "
"[method accessibility_free_element]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new, empty accessibility sub-element from the shaped text buffer. "
"Sub-elements are freed automatically when the parent element is freed, or "
"can be freed early using the [method accessibility_free_element] method.\n"
"If [param is_last_line] is [code]true[/code], no trailing newline is "
"appended to the text content. Set to [code]true[/code] for the last line in "
"multi-line text fields and for single-line text fields."
msgstr ""
"Crea un subelement d'accessibilitat nou i buit a partir de la memòria "
"intermèdia de text amb forma. Els subelements s'alliberen automàticament "
"quan s'allibera l'element pare o es poden alliberar abans d'hora mitjançant "
"el mètode [method accessibility_free_element].\n"
"Si [param is_last_line] és [code]true[/code], no s'adjunta cap nova línia al "
"final del contingut del text. Establiu a [code]true[/code] per a l'última "
"línia dels camps de text de diverses línies i per als camps de text d'una "
"sola línia."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Frees the accessibility element [param id] created by [method "
"accessibility_create_element], [method accessibility_create_sub_element], or "
"[method accessibility_create_sub_text_edit_elements]."
msgstr ""
"Allibera l'element d'accessibilitat [param id] creat per [method "
"accessibility_create_element], [method accessibility_create_sub_element] o "
"[method accessibility_create_sub_text_edit_elements]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if a screen reader, Braille display or other "
"assistive app is active, [code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] "
"if status is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessibility debugging tools, such as Accessibility Insights "
"for Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS), or AT-SPI Browser (Linux/BSD), "
"do not count as assistive apps and will not affect this value. To test your "
"project with these tools, set [member ProjectSettings.accessibility/general/"
"accessibility_support] to [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]1[/code] si hi ha un lector de pantalla, una pantalla Braille "
"o una altra aplicació d'assistència activa, [code]0[/code] en cas contrari. "
"Retorna [code]-1[/code] si l'estat és desconegut.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a Linux, macOS i Windows.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les eines de depuració d'accessibilitat, com ara Accessibility "
"Insights per a Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS) o AT-SPI Browser "
"(Linux/BSD), no compten com a aplicacions d'assistència i no afectaran "
"aquest valor. Per provar el vostre projecte amb aquestes eines, configureu "
"[member ProjectSettings.accessibility/general/accessibility_support] com a "
"[code]1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if a high-contrast user interface theme should be "
"used, [code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] if status is "
"unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland, GNOME), "
"macOS, and Windows."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if flashing, blinking, and other moving content that "
"can cause seizures in users with photosensitive epilepsy should be disabled, "
"[code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] if status is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if background images, transparency, and other "
"features that can reduce the contrast between the foreground and background "
"should be disabled, [code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] if "
"status is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets text selection to the text field. [param text_start_id] and [param "
"text_end_id] should be elements created by [method "
"accessibility_create_sub_text_edit_elements]. Character offsets are relative "
"to the corresponding element."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la selecció de text al camp de text. [param text_start_id] i "
"[param text_end_id] haurien de ser elements creats per [method "
"accessibility_create_sub_text_edit_elements]. Els desplaçaments de caràcters "
"són relatius a l'element corresponent."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Plays the beep sound from the operative system, if possible. Because it "
"comes from the OS, the beep sound will be audible even if the application is "
"muted. It may also be disabled for the entire OS by the user.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Reprodueix el so del bip del sistema operatiu, si és possible. Com que prové "
"del sistema operatiu, el so serà audible encara que l'aplicació estigui "
"silenciada. També pot ser desactivat per a tot el sistema operatiu per part "
"de l'usuari.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland) i "
"Windows."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid "Returns the user's clipboard as a string if possible."
msgstr "Si és possible, retorna el porta-retalls de l'usuari com una cadena."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the user's clipboard as an image if possible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method uses the copied pixel data, e.g. from an image "
"editing software or a web browser, not an image file copied from file "
"explorer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el porta-retalls de l'usuari com a imatge si és possible.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode utilitza les dades de píxels copiades, p. des "
"d'un programari d'edició d'imatges o un navegador web, no un fitxer d'imatge "
"copiat des de l'explorador de fitxers."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the user's [url=https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/139191/"
"whats-the-difference-between-primary-selection-and-clipboard-buffer]primary[/"
"url] clipboard as a string if possible. This is the clipboard that is set "
"when the user selects text in any application, rather than when pressing "
"[kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd]. The clipboard data can then be pasted by clicking the "
"middle mouse button in any application that supports the primary clipboard "
"mechanism.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el porta-retalls [url=https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/"
"139191/whats-the-difference-between-primary-selection-and-clipboard-"
"buffer]primary[/url] de l'usuari com a cadena si és possible. Aquest és el "
"porta-retalls que s'estableix quan l'usuari selecciona text en qualsevol "
"aplicació, en lloc de prémer [kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd]. Les dades del porta-"
"retalls es poden enganxar fent clic al botó central del ratolí en qualsevol "
"aplicació que admeti el mecanisme principal del porta-retalls.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode només s'implementa a Linux (X11/Wayland)."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a text content on the user's clipboard."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is an image content on the user's "
"clipboard."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid "Sets the user's clipboard content to the given string."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el contingut del porta-retalls de l'usuari a la cadena donada."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the user's [url=https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/139191/whats-"
"the-difference-between-primary-selection-and-clipboard-buffer]primary[/url] "
"clipboard content to the given string. This is the clipboard that is set "
"when the user selects text in any application, rather than when pressing "
"[kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd]. The clipboard data can then be pasted by clicking the "
"middle mouse button in any application that supports the primary clipboard "
"mechanism.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el contingut del porta-retalls [url=https://unix.stackexchange.com/"
"questions/139191/whats-the-difference-between-primary-selection-and-"
"clipboard-buffer]primary[/url] de l'usuari a la cadena donada. Aquest és el "
"porta-retalls que s'estableix quan l'usuari selecciona text en qualsevol "
"aplicació, en lloc de prémer [kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd]. Les dades del porta-"
"retalls es poden enganxar fent clic al botó central del ratolí en qualsevol "
"aplicació que admeti el mecanisme principal del porta-retalls.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode només s'implementa a Linux (X11/Wayland)."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Displays OS native color picker.\n"
"Callbacks have the following arguments: [code]status: bool, color: Color[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_COLOR_PICKER] feature.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"Mostra el selector de color natiu del sistema operatiu.\n"
"Les devolucions de trucada tenen els arguments següents: [code]status: bool, "
"color: Color[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa si el servidor de visualització té "
"la característica [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_COLOR_PICKER].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode només s'implementa a Linux (X11/Wayland)."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new application status indicator with the specified icon, tooltip, "
"and activation callback.\n"
"[param callback] should take two arguments: the pressed mouse button (one of "
"the [enum MouseButton] constants) and the click position in screen "
"coordinates (a [Vector2i])."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou indicador d'estat de l'aplicació amb la icona especificada, la "
"informació sobre eines i la devolució de trucada d'activació.\n"
"[param callback] hauria de tenir dos arguments: el botó premut del ratolí "
"(una de les constants [enum MouseButton]) i la posició del clic a les "
"coordenades de la pantalla (a [Vector2i])."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the default mouse cursor shape set by [method cursor_set_shape]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la forma predeterminada del cursor del ratolí establerta per [method "
"cursor_set_shape]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom mouse cursor image for the given [param shape]. This means the "
"user's operating system and mouse cursor theme will no longer influence the "
"mouse cursor's appearance.\n"
"[param cursor] can be either a [Texture2D] or an [Image], and it should not "
"be larger than 256×256 to display correctly. Optionally, [param hotspot] can "
"be set to offset the image's position relative to the click point. By "
"default, [param hotspot] is set to the top-left corner of the image. See "
"also [method cursor_set_shape].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Web, calling this method every frame can cause the cursor to "
"flicker."
msgstr ""
"Estableix una imatge personalitzada del cursor del ratolí per al [param "
"shape] donat. Això significa que el sistema operatiu de l'usuari i el tema "
"del cursor del ratolí ja no influiran en l'aparença del cursor del ratolí.\n"
"[param cursor] pot ser un [Texture2D] o un [Image], i no hauria de ser "
"superior a 256×256 per mostrar-se correctament. Opcionalment, es pot "
"configurar [param hotspot] per compensar la posició de la imatge en relació "
"al punt de clic. Per defecte, [param hotspot] està configurat a l'extrem "
"superior esquerre de la imatge. Vegeu també [method cursor_set_shape].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Al web, cridar a aquest mètode cada fotograma pot fer que el "
"cursor parpellegi."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the default mouse cursor shape. The cursor's appearance will vary "
"depending on the user's operating system and mouse cursor theme. See also "
"[method cursor_get_shape] and [method cursor_set_custom_image]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la forma predeterminada del cursor del ratolí. L'aparença del "
"cursor variarà segons el sistema operatiu de l'usuari i el tema del cursor "
"del ratolí. Vegeu també [method cursor_get_shape] i [method "
"cursor_set_custom_image]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid "Removes the application status indicator."
msgstr "Elimina l'indicador d'estat de l'aplicació."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Shows a text input dialog which uses the operating system's native look-and-"
"feel. [param callback] should accept a single [String] parameter which "
"contains the text field's contents.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_INPUT] feature. Supported platforms include "
"macOS, Windows, and Android."
msgstr ""
"Mostra un diàleg d'entrada de text que utilitza l'aspecte natiu del sistema "
"operatiu. [param callback] hauria d'acceptar un únic paràmetre [String] que "
"contingui el contingut del camp de text.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa si el servidor de visualització té "
"la característica [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_INPUT]. Les plataformes "
"admeses inclouen macOS, Windows i Android."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Shows a text dialog which uses the operating system's native look-and-feel. "
"[param callback] should accept a single [int] parameter which corresponds to "
"the index of the pressed button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG] feature. Supported platforms include macOS, "
"Windows, and Android."
msgstr ""
"Mostra un diàleg de text que utilitza l'aspecte natiu del sistema operatiu. "
"[param callback] hauria d'acceptar un únic paràmetre [int] que correspongui "
"a l'índex del botó premut.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa si el servidor de visualització té "
"la característica [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG]. Les plataformes admeses "
"inclouen macOS, Windows i Android."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Allows the [param process_id] PID to steal focus from this window. In other "
"words, this disables the operating system's focus stealing protection for "
"the specified PID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Permet al PID [param process_id] robar el focus d'aquesta finestra. En "
"altres paraules, això desactiva la protecció de robatori de focus del "
"sistema operatiu per al PID especificat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode només s'implementa a Windows."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Displays OS native dialog for selecting files or directories in the file "
"system.\n"
"Each filter string in the [param filters] array should be formatted like "
"this: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Image Files;image/png,image/jpeg[/code]. The "
"description text of the filter is optional and can be omitted. It is "
"recommended to set both file extension and MIME type. See also [member "
"FileDialog.filters].\n"
"Callbacks have the following arguments: [code]status: bool, selected_paths: "
"PackedStringArray, selected_filter_index: int[/code]. [b]On Android,[/b] the "
"third callback argument ([code]selected_filter_index[/code]) is always "
"[code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE] feature. Supported platforms include "
"Linux (X11/Wayland), Windows, macOS, and Android.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param current_directory] might be ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only "
"file extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support "
"MIME types.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android and Linux, [param show_hidden] is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android and macOS, native file dialogs have no title.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed apps will save security-scoped bookmarks to "
"retain access to the opened folders across multiple sessions. Use [method "
"OS.get_granted_permissions] to get a list of saved bookmarks.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, this method uses the Android Storage Access "
"Framework (SAF).\n"
"The file picker returns a URI instead of a filesystem path. This URI can be "
"passed directly to [FileAccess] to perform read/write operations.\n"
"When using [constant FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_DIR], it returns a tree URI that "
"grants full access to the selected directory. File operations inside this "
"directory can be performed by passing a path on the form "
"[code]treeUri#relative/path/to/file[/code] to [FileAccess].\n"
"To avoid opening the file picker again after each app restart, you can take "
"persistable URI permission as follows:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"val uri = \"content://com.android...\" # URI of the selected file or "
"folder.\n"
"val persist = true # Set to false to release the persistable permission.\n"
"var android_runtime = Engine.get_singleton(\"AndroidRuntime\")\n"
"android_runtime.updatePersistableUriPermission(uri, persist)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The persistable URI permission remains valid across app restarts as long as "
"the directory is not moved, renamed, or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Mostra el diàleg natiu del sistema operatiu per seleccionar fitxers o "
"directoris al sistema de fitxers.\n"
"Cada cadena de filtre de la matriu [param filters] ha de tenir el format "
"següent: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Fitxers d'imatge;image/png,image/jpeg[/"
"code]. El text de descripció del filtre és opcional i es pot ometre. Es "
"recomana establir tant l'extensió de fitxer com el tipus MIME. Vegeu també "
"[member FileDialog.filters].\n"
"Les devolucions de trucada tenen els arguments següents: [code]status: bool, "
"selected_paths: PackedStringArray, selected_filter_index: int[/code]. [b]A "
"Android,[/b] el tercer argument de devolució de trucada "
"([code]selected_filter_index[/code]) sempre és [code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa si el servidor de visualització té "
"la característica [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE]. Les plataformes "
"admeses inclouen Linux (X11/Wayland), Windows, macOS i Android.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param current_directory] pot ser ignorat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els diàlegs de fitxers incrustats i els diàlegs de fitxers de "
"Windows només admeten extensions de fitxers, mentre que els diàlegs de "
"fitxers d'Android, Linux i macOS també admeten tipus MIME.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A Android i Linux, [param show_hidden] s'ignora.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A Android i macOS, els diàlegs de fitxers natius no tenen "
"títol.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A macOS, les aplicacions sandbox desaran les adreces d'interès "
"amb l'àmbit de seguretat per mantenir l'accés a les carpetes obertes durant "
"diverses sessions. Utilitzeu [method OS.get_granted_permissions] per obtenir "
"una llista d'adreces d'interès desades.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A Android, aquest mètode utilitza l'Android Storage Access "
"Framework (SAF).\n"
"El selector de fitxers retorna un URI en lloc d'una ruta del sistema de "
"fitxers. Aquest URI es pot passar directament a [FileAccess] per realitzar "
"operacions de lectura/escriptura.\n"
"Quan s'utilitza [constant FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_DIR], retorna un URI d'arbre "
"que concedeix accés complet al directori seleccionat. Les operacions de "
"fitxers dins d'aquest directori es poden realitzar passant un camí al "
"formulari [code]treeUri#relative/path/to/file[/code] a [FileAccess].\n"
"Per evitar que torni a obrir el selector de fitxers després de cada reinici "
"de l'aplicació, podeu prendre el permís d'URI persistent de la següent "
"manera:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"val uri = \"content://com.android...\" # URI del fitxer o carpeta "
"seleccionats.\n"
"val persist = true # Estableix com a false per alliberar el permís "
"persistent.\n"
"var android_runtime = Engine.get_singleton(\"AndroidRuntime\")\n"
"android_runtime.updatePersistableUriPermission(uri, persistir)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"El permís d'URI persistent continua sent vàlid durant els reinicis de "
"l'aplicació sempre que el directori no es mogui, no es canvii el nom ni es "
"suprimeixi."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Displays OS native dialog for selecting files or directories in the file "
"system with additional user selectable options.\n"
"Each filter string in the [param filters] array should be formatted like "
"this: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Image Files;image/png,image/jpeg[/code]. The "
"description text of the filter is optional and can be omitted. It is "
"recommended to set both file extension and MIME type. See also [member "
"FileDialog.filters].\n"
"[param options] is array of [Dictionary]s with the following keys:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code] - option's name [String].\n"
"- [code]\"values\"[/code] - [PackedStringArray] of values. If empty, boolean "
"option (check box) is used.\n"
"- [code]\"default\"[/code] - default selected option index ([int]) or "
"default boolean value ([bool]).\n"
"Callbacks have the following arguments: [code]status: bool, selected_paths: "
"PackedStringArray, selected_filter_index: int, selected_option: Dictionary[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE_EXTRA] feature. Supported platforms "
"include Linux (X11/Wayland), Windows, and macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param current_directory] might be ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only "
"file extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support "
"MIME types.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux (X11), [param show_hidden] is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, native file dialogs have no title.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed apps will save security-scoped bookmarks to "
"retain access to the opened folders across multiple sessions. Use [method "
"OS.get_granted_permissions] to get a list of saved bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Mostra el diàleg natiu del sistema operatiu per seleccionar fitxers o "
"directoris al sistema de fitxers amb opcions addicionals seleccionables per "
"l'usuari.\n"
"Cada cadena de filtre de la matriu [param filters] ha de tenir el format "
"següent: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Fitxers d'imatge;image/png,image/jpeg[/"
"code]. El text de descripció del filtre és opcional i es pot ometre. Es "
"recomana establir tant l'extensió de fitxer com el tipus MIME. Vegeu també "
"[member FileDialog.filters].\n"
"[param options] és una matriu de [Dictionary]s amb les claus següents:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code] - nom de l'opció [String].\n"
"- [code]\"valors\"[/code] - [PackedStringArray] de valors. Si està buit, "
"s'utilitza l'opció booleana (casella de verificació).\n"
"- [code]\"default\"[/code] - índex d'opció seleccionada per defecte ([int]) "
"o valor booleà predeterminat ([bool]).\n"
"Les devolucions de trucada tenen els arguments següents: [code]status: bool, "
"selected_paths: PackedStringArray, selected_filter_index: int, "
"selected_option: Dictionary[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa si el servidor de visualització té "
"la característica [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE_EXTRA]. Les "
"plataformes admeses inclouen Linux (X11/Wayland), Windows i macOS.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param current_directory] pot ser ignorat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els diàlegs de fitxers incrustats i els diàlegs de fitxers de "
"Windows només admeten extensions de fitxers, mentre que els diàlegs de "
"fitxers d'Android, Linux i macOS també admeten tipus MIME.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A Linux (X11), [param show_hidden] s'ignora.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A macOS, els diàlegs de fitxers natius no tenen títol.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A macOS, les aplicacions sandbox desaran les adreces d'interès "
"amb l'àmbit de seguretat per mantenir l'accés a les carpetes obertes durant "
"diverses sessions. Utilitzeu [method OS.get_granted_permissions] per obtenir "
"una llista d'adreces d'interès desades."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Forces window manager processing while ignoring all [InputEvent]s. See also "
"[method process_events].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Windows and macOS."
msgstr ""
"Força el processament del gestor de finestres ignorant tots els "
"[InputEvent]s. Vegeu també [method process_events].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a Windows i macOS."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns OS theme accent color. Returns [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code], if "
"accent color is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Windows, Android, and "
"Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the OS theme base color (default control background). Returns "
"[code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] if the base color is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Windows, and Android."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color base del tema del sistema operatiu (fons de control per "
"defecte). Retorna [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] si el color base és "
"desconegut.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode s'implementa a macOS, Windows i Android."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Rect2], each of which is the bounding rectangle for a "
"display cutout or notch. These are non-functional areas on edge-to-edge "
"screens used by cameras and sensors. Returns an empty array if the device "
"does not have cutouts. See also [method get_display_safe_area].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Currently only implemented on Android. Other platforms will "
"return an empty array even if they do have display cutouts or notches."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Array] de [Rect2], cadascun dels quals és el rectangle "
"delimitant per a un retall o una osca de visualització. Es tracta d'àrees no "
"funcionals a les pantalles de punta a punta utilitzades per càmeres i "
"sensors. Retorna una matriu buida si el dispositiu no té retalls. Vegeu "
"també [method get_display_safe_area].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Actualment només s'implementa a Android. Altres plataformes "
"retornaran una matriu buida encara que tinguin retalls o osques de pantalla."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the unobscured area of the display where interactive controls should "
"be rendered. See also [method get_display_cutouts].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Currently only implemented on Android and iOS. On other "
"platforms, [code]screen_get_usable_rect(SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW)[/code] will "
"be returned as a fallback. See also [method screen_get_usable_rect]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'àrea no enfosquida de la pantalla on s'han de representar els "
"controls interactius. Vegeu també [method get_display_cutouts].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Actualment només s'implementa a Android i iOS. En altres "
"plataformes, [code]screen_get_usable_rect(SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW)[/code] es "
"retornarà com a alternativa. Vegeu també [method screen_get_usable_rect]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the screen containing the window with the keyboard "
"focus, or the primary screen if there's no focused window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux/X11, macOS, and Windows. On "
"other platforms, this method always returns the primary screen."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the [DisplayServer] currently in use. Most operating "
"systems only have a single [DisplayServer], but Linux has access to more "
"than one [DisplayServer] (currently X11 and Wayland).\n"
"The names of built-in display servers are [code]Windows[/code], [code]macOS[/"
"code], [code]X11[/code] (Linux), [code]Wayland[/code] (Linux), "
"[code]Android[/code], [code]iOS[/code], [code]web[/code] (HTML5), and "
"[code]headless[/code] (when started with the [code]--headless[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the primary screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux/X11, macOS, and Windows. On "
"other platforms, this method always returns [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the number of displays available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11 and Wayland), macOS, "
"and Windows. On other platforms, this method always returns [code]1[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the screen that overlaps the most with the given "
"rectangle. Returns [constant INVALID_SCREEN] if the rectangle doesn't "
"overlap with any screen or has no area."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de la pantalla que més se solapa amb el rectangle donat. "
"Retorna [constant INVALID_SCREEN] si el rectangle no es solapa amb cap "
"pantalla o no té cap àrea."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if positions of [b]OK[/b] and [b]Cancel[/b] "
"buttons are swapped in dialogs. This is enabled by default on Windows to "
"follow interface conventions, and be toggled by changing [member "
"ProjectSettings.gui/common/swap_cancel_ok].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This doesn't affect native dialogs such as the ones spawned by "
"[method DisplayServer.dialog_show]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si les posicions dels botons [b]OK[/b] i "
"[b]Cancel[/b] s'intercanvien als diàlegs. Això està activat per defecte a "
"Windows per seguir les convencions de la interfície i es pot canviar "
"canviant [member ProjectSettings.gui/common/swap_cancel_ok].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això no afecta els diàlegs natius com els generats per [method "
"DisplayServer.dialog_show]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the window at the specified screen [param position] (in "
"pixels). On multi-monitor setups, the screen position is relative to the "
"virtual desktop area. On multi-monitor setups with different screen "
"resolutions or orientations, the origin may be located outside any display "
"like this:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"* (0, 0)        +-------+\n"
"                |       |\n"
"+-------------+ |       |\n"
"|             | |       |\n"
"|             | |       |\n"
"+-------------+ +-------+\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'ID de la finestra a la pantalla especificada [param position] (en "
"píxels). En configuracions de diversos monitors, la posició de la pantalla "
"és relativa a l'àrea de l'escriptori virtual. En configuracions de diversos "
"monitors amb diferents resolucions o orientacions de pantalla, l'origen es "
"pot localitzar fora de qualsevol pantalla com aquesta:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"* (0, 0) +-------+\n"
"                |       |\n"
"+-------------+ |       |\n"
"|             | |       |\n"
"|             | |       |\n"
"+-------------+ +-------+\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of Godot window IDs belonging to this process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Native dialogs are not included in this list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la llista d'identificadors de finestra Godot que pertanyen a aquest "
"procés.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els diàlegs natius no s'inclouen en aquesta llista."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid "Use [NativeMenu] or [PopupMenu] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [NativeMenu] o [PopupMenu]."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label] to the global menu with ID "
"[param menu_root].\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"An [param accelerator] can optionally be defined, which is a keyboard "
"shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if it's not "
"currently open. The [param accelerator] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] and [param key_callback] Callables need to "
"accept exactly one Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callables "
"will be the value passed to [param tag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un nou element comprovable amb el text [param label] al menú global "
"amb l'identificador [param menu_root].\n"
"Retorna l'índex de l'element inserit, no es garanteix que sigui el mateix "
"que el valor [param index].\n"
"Opcionalment es pot definir una [param accelerator], que és una drecera de "
"teclat que es pot prémer per activar el botó de menú encara que no estigui "
"obert actualment. El [param accelerator] és generalment una combinació de "
"[enum KeyModifierMask]s i [enum Key]s utilitzant OR bit a bit com ara "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els Callables [param callback] i [param key_callback] han "
"d'acceptar exactament un paràmetre Variant, el paràmetre passat als "
"Callables serà el valor passat a [param tag].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode només s'implementa a macOS.\n"
"[b]Identificadors de menú del sistema compatibles:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Menú principal (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Menú emergent Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\": menú Apple (macOS, elements personalitzats afegits abans de "
"\"Serveis\").\n"
"\"_window\" - menú finestra (macOS, elements personalitzats afegits després "
"de \"Porta-ho tot al davant\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Menú d'ajuda (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

