"shared/static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Saves patch ZIP archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the "
"shared/static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
