#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Uploads specified file over SCP protocol to the remote host."
msgstr ""
"Carrega el fitxer especificat mitjançant el protocol SCP a l'amfitrió remot."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Executes specified command on the remote host via SSH protocol and returns "
"command output in the [param output]."
msgstr ""
"Executa l'ordre especificada a l'amfitrió remot mitjançant el protocol SSH i "
"retorna la sortida de l'ordre a [param output]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Executes specified command on the remote host via SSH protocol and returns "
"process ID (on the remote host) without waiting for command to finish."
msgstr ""
"Executa l'ordre especificada a l'amfitrió remot mitjançant el protocol SSH i "
"retorna l'ID de procés (a l'amfitrió remot) sense esperar que finalitzi "
"l'ordre."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Invalid message type used as the default value when no type is specified."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitza un tipus de missatge no vàlid com a valor predeterminat quan no "
"s'especifica cap tipus."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Message type for informational messages that have no effect on the export."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de missatge per a missatges informatius que no tenen cap efecte en "
"l'exportació."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Message type for warning messages that should be addressed but still allow "
"to complete the export."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de missatge per als missatges d'advertència que s'han d'adreçar però "
"que permeten completar l'exportació."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Message type for error messages that must be addressed and fail the export."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de missatge per als missatges d'error que s'han d'adreçar i que falla "
"l'exportació."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if the remotely debugged project is expected to use the remote "
"file system. If set, [method gen_export_flags] will append [code]--remote-"
"fs[/code] and [code]--remote-fs-password[/code] (if [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/file_server/password] is defined) command line "
"arguments to the returned list."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if remote debug is enabled. If set, [method gen_export_flags] "
"will append [code]--remote-debug[/code] and [code]--breakpoints[/code] (if "
"breakpoints are selected in the script editor or added by the plugin) "
"command line arguments to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"La marca s'estableix si la depuració remota està habilitada. Si s'estableix, "
"[method gen_export_flags] afegirà [code]--remote-debug[/code] i [code]--"
"breakpoints[/code] (si els punts d'interrupció estan seleccionats a l'editor "
"de la llista d'ordres de retorn o els arguments afegits a l'editor de la "
"llista de connectors)."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if remotely debugged project is running on the localhost. If "
"set, [method gen_export_flags] will use [code]localhost[/code] instead of "
"[member EditorSettings.network/debug/remote_host] as remote debugger host."
msgstr ""
"El senyalador s'estableix si el projecte depurat de forma remota s'està "
"executant a l'host local. Si s'estableix, [method gen_export_flags] "
"utilitzarà [code]localhost[/code] en comptes de [member "
"EditorSettings.network/debug/remote_host] com a host depurador remot."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if the \"Visible Collision Shapes\" remote debug option is "
"enabled. If set, [method gen_export_flags] will append the [code]--debug-"
"collisions[/code] command line argument to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"El senyalador s'estableix si l'opció de depuració remota \"Formes de "
"col·lisió visibles\" està activada. Si s'estableix, [method "
"gen_export_flags] afegirà l'argument de línia d'ordres [code]--debug-"
"collisions[/code] a la llista retornada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if the \"Visible Navigation\" remote debug option is enabled. If "
"set, [method gen_export_flags] will append the [code]--debug-navigation[/"
"code] command line argument to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"La marca s'estableix si l'opció de depuració remota \"Navegació visible\" "
"està activada. Si s'estableix, [method gen_export_flags] afegirà l'argument "
"de la línia d'ordres [code]--debug-navigation[/code] a la llista retornada."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Exporter for Android."
msgstr "Exportador per a Android."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Exporting for Android"
msgstr "Exportació per a Android"

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Gradle builds for Android"
msgstr "Gradle construeix per a Android"

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Android plugins documentation index"
msgstr "Índex de documentació dels connectors d'Android"

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]arm64[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els binaris [code]arm64[/code] s'inclouen al projecte "
"exportat."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]arm32[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els binaris [code]arm32[/code] s'inclouen al projecte "
"exportat."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]x86_32[/code] binaries are included into "
"exported project."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els binaris [code]x86_32[/code] s'inclouen al projecte "
"exportat."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]x86_64[/code] binaries are included into "
"exported project."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [code]x86_64[/code] s'inclouen els binaris al projecte "
"exportat."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"A list of additional command line arguments, separated by space, which the "
"exported project will receive when started."
msgstr ""
"Una llista d'arguments de línia d'ordres addicionals, separats per espai, "
"que rebrà el projecte exportat quan s'iniciï."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to an APK file to use as a custom export template for debug exports. If "
"left empty, default template is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Camí a un fitxer APK per utilitzar-lo com a plantilla d'exportació "
"personalitzada per a les exportacions de depuració. Si es deixa buit, "
"s'utilitza la plantilla per defecte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només s'utilitza si [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] està desactivat."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to an APK file to use as a custom export template for release exports. "
"If left empty, default template is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Camí a un fitxer APK per utilitzar-lo com a plantilla d'exportació "
"personalitzada per a les exportacions de versions. Si es deixa buit, "
"s'utilitza la plantilla per defecte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només s'utilitza si [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] està desactivat."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [url=https://developer.android.com/design/ui/wear/"
"guides/components/swipe-to-dismiss]Swipe to dismiss[/url] will be enabled.\n"
"This functionality is intended for smartwatches and is generally ignored on "
"standard Android devices. However, some devices may not ignore it. "
"Therefore, it is recommended to keep this feature disabled for standard "
"Android apps to avoid unexpected behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [code]false[/code] by default. To enable this behavior, "
"[member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [url=https://developer.android.com/design/ui/wear/"
"guides/components/swipe-to-dismiss]Feu lliscar per descartar[/url] "
"s'habilitarà.\n"
"Aquesta funcionalitat està pensada per a rellotges intel·ligents i, en "
"general, s'ignora als dispositius Android estàndard. Tanmateix, és possible "
"que alguns dispositius no ho ignorin. Per tant, es recomana mantenir aquesta "
"funció desactivada per a les aplicacions estàndard d'Android per evitar "
"comportaments inesperats.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això és [code]false[/code] per defecte. Per habilitar aquest "
"comportament, cal [member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/"
"use_gradle_build]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to a ZIP file holding the source for the export template used in a "
"Gradle build. If left empty, the default template is used."
msgstr ""
"Camí a un fitxer ZIP que conté la font de la plantilla d'exportació "
"utilitzada en una compilació de Gradle. Si es deixa buit, s'utilitza la "
"plantilla per defecte."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], native libraries are compressed when performing a "
"Gradle build.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] While enabling compression can reduce the size of the binary, "
"it may result in slower application startup because the native libraries "
"must be extracted before use, rather than being loaded directly.\n"
"If you're distributing your app via the Play Store, it's generally "
"recommended to keep this option [code]false[/code], see [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/build/releases/past-releases/agp-3-6-0-release-"
"notes#extractNativeLibs]official documentation[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les biblioteques natives es comprimeixen quan es "
"realitza una compilació Gradle.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Tot i que l'habilitació de la compressió pot reduir la mida del "
"binari, pot resultar en l'inici de l'aplicació més lent perquè les "
"biblioteques natives s'han d'extreure abans d'utilitzar-les, en lloc de "
"carregar-se directament.\n"
"Si esteu distribuint la vostra aplicació a través de Play Store, en general "
"es recomana mantenir aquesta opció [code]false[/code], consulteu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/build/releases/past-releases/agp-3-6-0-"
"release-notes#extractNativeLibs]documentació oficial[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"A dictionary of custom theme attributes to include in the exported Android "
"project. Each entry defines a theme attribute name and its value, and will "
"be added to the [b]GodotAppMainTheme[/b].\n"
"For example, the key [code]android:windowSwipeToDismiss[/code] with the "
"value [code]false[/code] is resolved to [code]<item "
"name=\"android:windowSwipeToDismiss\">false</item>[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To add a custom attribute to the [b]GodotAppSplashTheme[/b], "
"prefix the attribute name with [code][splash][/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Reserved attributes configured via other export options or "
"project settings cannot be overridden by [code]custom_theme_attributes[/"
"code] and are skipped during export."
msgstr ""
"Un diccionari d'atributs de tema personalitzats per incloure al projecte "
"d'Android exportat. Cada entrada defineix un nom d'atribut de tema i el seu "
"valor, i s'afegirà a [b]GodotAppMainTheme[/b].\n"
"Per exemple, la clau [code]android:windowSwipeToDismiss[/code] amb el valor "
"[code]false[/code] es resol a [code]<item "
"name=\"android:windowSwipeToDismiss\">false</item>[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per afegir un atribut personalitzat a [b]GodotAppSplashTheme[/"
"b], prefixeu el nom de l'atribut amb [code][splash][/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]custom_theme_attributes[/code] no poden substituir els "
"atributs reservats configurats mitjançant altres opcions d'exportació o "
"configuració del projecte i es salten durant l'exportació."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Application export format (*.apk or *.aab)."
msgstr "Format d'exportació de l'aplicació (*.apk o *.aab)."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the Gradle build directory. If left empty, then [code]res://android[/"
"code] will be used."
msgstr ""
"Camí al directori de compilació de Gradle. Si es deixa buit, s'utilitzarà "
"[code]res://android[/code]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum Android API level required for the application to run (used during "
"Gradle build). See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/"
"uses-sdk-element#uses]android:minSdkVersion[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Nivell mínim d'API d'Android necessari perquè l'aplicació s'executi "
"(utilitzat durant la creació de Gradle). Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/uses-sdk-"
"element#uses]android:minSdkVersion[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"The Android API level on which the application is designed to run (used "
"during Gradle build). See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"manifest/uses-sdk-element#uses]android:targetSdkVersion[/url]."
msgstr ""
"El nivell d'API d'Android en què s'ha dissenyat l'aplicació per executar-se "
"(utilitzat durant la creació de Gradle). Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/uses-sdk-"
"element#uses]android:targetSdkVersion[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], Gradle build is used instead of pre-built APK."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], s'utilitza la compilació Gradle en comptes de l'APK "
"preconstruït."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], OpenGL ES debug context will be created (additional "
"runtime checking, validation, and logging)."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es crearà el context de depuració d'OpenGL ES "
"(comprovació, validació i registre addicionals en temps d'execució)."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path of the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PATH[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore[/code] if "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"Ruta del fitxer de magatzem de claus de depuració.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PATH[/code].\n"
"Torna a [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore[/code] si està "
"buit."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Password for the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PASSWORD[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_pass[/code] "
"if both it and [member keystore/debug] are empty."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya per al fitxer de magatzem de claus de depuració.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PASSWORD[/code].\n"
"Les alternatives a [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_pass[/"
"code] si tant això com [member keystore/debug] estan buits."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"User name for the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_USER[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_user[/code] "
"if both it and [member keystore/debug] are empty."
msgstr ""
"Nom d'usuari per al fitxer de magatzem de claus de depuració.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_USER[/code].\n"
"Les alternatives a [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_user[/"
"code] si tant això com [member keystore/debug] estan buits."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path of the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PATH[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Ruta del fitxer de magatzem de claus de llançament.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PATH[/code]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Password for the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya per al fitxer de magatzem de claus de llançament.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PASSWORD[/code]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"User name for the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_USER[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Nom d'usuari per al fitxer de magatzem de claus de llançament.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_USER[/code]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Background layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Capa de fons del fitxer d'icones adaptatives de l'aplicació. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"icon_design_adaptive#design-adaptive-icons]Disseny d'icones adaptatives[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Foreground layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Capa de primer pla del fitxer d'icones adaptatives de l'aplicació. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"icon_design_adaptive#design-adaptive-icons]Disseny d'icones adaptatives[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Monochrome layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Capa monocroma del fitxer d'icones adaptatives de l'aplicació. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"icon_design_adaptive#design-adaptive-icons]Disseny d'icones adaptatives[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Application icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer d'icona de l'aplicació. Si es deixa buit, tornarà a [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Application category for the Google Play Store. Only define this if your "
"application fits one of the categories well. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#appCategory]android:appCategory[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Categoria d'aplicació per a Google Play Store. Definiu-ho només si la vostra "
"aplicació s'adapta bé a una de les categories. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#appCategory]android:appCategory[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], task initiated by main activity will be excluded from "
"the list of recently used applications. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/activity-"
"element#exclude]android:excludeFromRecents[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la tasca iniciada per l'activitat principal quedarà "
"exclosa de la llista d'aplicacions utilitzades recentment. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/activity-"
"element#exclude]android:excludeFromRecents[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Name of the application."
msgstr "Nom de l'aplicació."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when the user uninstalls an app, a prompt to keep the "
"app's data will be shown. See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/"
"topics/manifest/application-"
"element#fragileuserdata]android:hasFragileUserData[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], quan l'usuari desinstal·la una aplicació, es mostrarà "
"una sol·licitud per conservar les dades de l'aplicació. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#fragileuserdata]android:hasFragileUserData[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the user will be able to set this app as the system "
"launcher in Android preferences."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'usuari podrà configurar aquesta aplicació com a "
"llançador del sistema a les preferències d'Android."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], this app will show in Android TV launcher UI."
msgstr ""
"Si és [code]true[/code], aquesta aplicació es mostrarà a la interfície del "
"llançador d'Android TV."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this app will show in the device's app library.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [code]true[/code] by default."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aquesta aplicació es mostrarà a la biblioteca "
"d'aplicacions del dispositiu.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això és [code]true[/code] per defecte."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], package signing is enabled."
msgstr "Si és [code]true[/code], la signatura del paquet està habilitada."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Unique application identifier in a reverse-DNS format. The reverse DNS "
"format should preferably match a domain name you control, but this is not "
"strictly required. For instance, if you own [code]example.com[/code], your "
"package unique name should preferably be of the form "
"[code]com.example.mygame[/code]. This identifier can only contain lowercase "
"alphanumeric characters ([code]a-z[/code], and [code]0-9[/code]), "
"underscores ([code]_[/code]), and periods ([code].[/code]). Each component "
"of the reverse DNS format must start with a letter: for instance, "
"[code]com.example.8game[/code] is not valid.\n"
"If [code]$genname[/code] is present in the value, it will be replaced by the "
"project name converted to lowercase. If there are invalid characters in the "
"project name, they will be stripped. If all characters in the project name "
"are stripped, [code]$genname[/code] is replaced by [code]noname[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing the package name will cause the package to be "
"considered as a new package, with its own installation and data paths. The "
"new package won't be usable to update existing installations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When publishing to Google Play, the package name must be "
"[i]globally[/i] unique. This means no other apps published on Google Play "
"must be using the same package name as yours. Otherwise, you'll be prevented "
"from publishing your app on Google Play."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read/write access to the \"properties\" table in the checkin "
"database. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES]ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés de lectura/escriptura a la taula \"propietats\" de la base de "
"dades de registre. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES]ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the approximate location information. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION]ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés a la informació aproximada de la ubicació. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION]ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the precise location information. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION]ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet accedir a la informació precisa de la ubicació. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION]ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the extra location provider commands. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS]ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés a les ordres addicionals del proveïdor d'ubicació. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS]ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to access any geographic locations persisted in the "
"user's shared collection. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION]ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació accedir a les ubicacions geogràfiques que es "
"mantinguin a la col·lecció compartida de l'usuari. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION]ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to create mock location providers for testing."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació creï proveïdors d'ubicació simulats per fer proves."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the information about networks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE]ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés a la informació de les xarxes. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE]ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to use SurfaceFlinger's low level features."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació utilitzi les funcions de baix nivell de "
"SurfaceFlinger."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the information about Wi-Fi networks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_WIFI_STATE]ACCESS_WIFI_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés a la informació sobre xarxes Wi-Fi. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_WIFI_STATE]ACCESS_WIFI_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to call into AccountAuthenticators. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCOUNT_MANAGER]ACCOUNT_MANAGER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions cridin a AccountAuthenticators. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCOUNT_MANAGER]ACCOUNT_MANAGER[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to add voicemails into the system. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ADD_VOICEMAIL]ADD_VOICEMAIL[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació afegir missatges de veu al sistema. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ADD_VOICEMAIL]ADD_VOICEMAIL[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to act as an AccountAuthenticator for the "
"AccountManager."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació actuï com a AccountAuthenticator per al "
"AccountManager."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to collect battery statistics. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BATTERY_STATS]BATTERY_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació recopilar estadístiques de bateria. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BATTERY_STATS]BATTERY_STATS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by an AccessibilityService, to ensure that only the system "
"can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE]BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Ha de ser requerit per un AccessibilityService, per garantir que només el "
"sistema s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE]BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to tell the AppWidget service which application can "
"access AppWidget's data. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BIND_APPWIDGET]BIND_APPWIDGET[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació indiqui al servei AppWidget quina aplicació pot "
"accedir a les dades d'AppWidget. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_APPWIDGET]BIND_APPWIDGET[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by device administration receiver, to ensure that only the "
"system can interact with it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN]BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"El receptor d'administració del dispositiu ha de ser requerit per garantir "
"que només el sistema pugui interactuar amb ell. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN]BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by an InputMethodService, to ensure that only the system "
"can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_INPUT_METHOD]BIND_INPUT_METHOD[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ha de ser requerit per un InputMethodService, per assegurar-se que només el "
"sistema s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_INPUT_METHOD]BIND_INPUT_METHOD[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a HostApduService or OffHostApduService to ensure that "
"only the system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_NFC_SERVICE]BIND_NFC_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Un HostApduService o OffHostApduService l'ha de requerir per assegurar-se "
"que només el sistema s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NFC_SERVICE]BIND_NFC_SERVICE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a NotificationListenerService, to ensure that only the "
"system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE]BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Un NotificationListenerService ha de ser requerit per garantir que només el "
"sistema s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE]BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a PrintService, to ensure that only the system can bind "
"to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_PRINT_SERVICE]BIND_PRINT_SERVICE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Un servei d'impressió ha de ser requerit per garantir que només el sistema "
"s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BIND_PRINT_SERVICE]BIND_PRINT_SERVICE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a RemoteViewsService, to ensure that only the system can "
"bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_REMOTEVIEWS]BIND_REMOTEVIEWS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Un RemoteViewsService ha de ser requerit per garantir que només el sistema "
"s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BIND_REMOTEVIEWS]BIND_REMOTEVIEWS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a TextService (e.g. SpellCheckerService) to ensure that "
"only the system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_TEXT_SERVICE]BIND_TEXT_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Un TextService (per exemple, SpellCheckerService) l'ha de requerir per "
"garantir que només el sistema s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_TEXT_SERVICE]BIND_TEXT_SERVICE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a VpnService, to ensure that only the system can bind to "
"it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_VPN_SERVICE]BIND_VPN_SERVICE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ha de ser requerit per un VpnService, per garantir que només el sistema s'hi "
"pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_VPN_SERVICE]BIND_VPN_SERVICE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a WallpaperService, to ensure that only the system can "
"bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_WALLPAPER]BIND_WALLPAPER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Un servei de fons de pantalla ha de ser requerit per garantir que només el "
"sistema s'hi pot vincular. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_WALLPAPER]BIND_WALLPAPER[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to connect to paired bluetooth devices. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH]BLUETOOTH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions es connectin a dispositius Bluetooth vinculats. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH]BLUETOOTH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to discover and pair bluetooth devices. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_ADMIN]BLUETOOTH_ADMIN[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a les aplicacions descobrir i emparellar dispositius Bluetooth. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_ADMIN]BLUETOOTH_ADMIN[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to pair bluetooth devices without user interaction, and "
"to allow or disallow phonebook access or message access. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED]BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions sincronitzin dispositius Bluetooth sense la "
"interacció de l'usuari i permetin o no l'accés a l'agenda telefònica o "
"l'accés als missatges. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED]BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Required to be able to disable the device (very dangerous!)."
msgstr "Necessari per poder desactivar el dispositiu (molt perillós!)."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast a notification that an application "
"package has been removed. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED]BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació emetre una notificació que s'ha eliminat un paquet "
"d'aplicació. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED]BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast an SMS receipt notification. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_SMS]BROADCAST_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació emeti una notificació de recepció per SMS. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_SMS]BROADCAST_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast sticky intents. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_STICKY]BROADCAST_STICKY[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació emeti intencions persistents. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_STICKY]BROADCAST_STICKY[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast a WAP PUSH receipt notification. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH]BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació emeti una notificació de rebut WAP PUSH. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH]BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to initiate a phone call without going through the "
"Dialer user interface. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#CALL_PHONE]CALL_PHONE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació iniciï una trucada telefònica sense passar per la "
"interfície d'usuari del marcador. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#CALL_PHONE]CALL_PHONE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to call any phone number, including emergency numbers, "
"without going through the Dialer user interface. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PRIVILEGED]CALL_PRIVILEGED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació trucar a qualsevol número de telèfon, inclosos els "
"d'emergència, sense passar per la interfície d'usuari del Marcador. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PRIVILEGED]CALL_PRIVILEGED[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Required to be able to access the camera device. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#CAMERA]CAMERA[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Necessari per poder accedir al dispositiu de càmera. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#CAMERA]CAMERA[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to capture audio output. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT]CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació capturar la sortida d'àudio. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT]CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to capture secure video output."
msgstr "Permet a una aplicació capturar una sortida de vídeo segura."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to capture video output."
msgstr "Permet a una aplicació capturar la sortida de vídeo."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to change whether an application component (other than "
"its own) is enabled or not. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE]CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació canviï si un component d'aplicació (que no és el "
"seu) està habilitat o no. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE]CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify the current configuration, such as locale. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_CONFIGURATION]CHANGE_CONFIGURATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació modifiqui la configuració actual, com ara la "
"configuració regional. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#CHANGE_CONFIGURATION]CHANGE_CONFIGURATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to change network connectivity state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE]CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions canviïn l'estat de connectivitat de xarxa. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE]CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to enter Wi-Fi Multicast mode. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions entrin en el mode de multidifusió Wi-Fi. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to change Wi-Fi connectivity state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions canviïn l'estat de connectivitat Wi-Fi. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to clear the caches of all installed applications on "
"the device. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CLEAR_APP_CACHE]CLEAR_APP_CACHE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació esborri la memòria cau de totes les aplicacions "
"instal·lades al dispositiu. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#CLEAR_APP_CACHE]CLEAR_APP_CACHE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to clear user data."
msgstr "Permet que una aplicació esborri les dades de l'usuari."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows enabling/disabling location update notifications from the radio. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES]CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet activar/desactivar les notificacions d'actualització d'ubicació des "
"de la ràdio. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES]CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Array of custom permission strings."
msgstr "Matriu de cadenes de permisos personalitzades."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to delete packages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DELETE_PACKAGES]DELETE_PACKAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació suprimi paquets. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DELETE_PACKAGES]DELETE_PACKAGES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows low-level access to power management."
msgstr "Permet l'accés de baix nivell a la gestió de l'energia."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to RW to diagnostic resources. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DIAGNOSTIC]DIAGNOSTIC[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a les aplicacions a RW recursos de diagnòstic. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DIAGNOSTIC]DIAGNOSTIC[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to disable the keyguard if it is not secure. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DISABLE_KEYGUARD]DISABLE_KEYGUARD[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions desactivin el bloqueig del teclat si no és segur. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DISABLE_KEYGUARD]DISABLE_KEYGUARD[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to retrieve state dump information from system "
"services. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DUMP]DUMP[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació recuperi informació d'abocament d'estat dels "
"serveis del sistema. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#DUMP]DUMP[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to expand or collapse the status bar. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#EXPAND_STATUS_BAR]EXPAND_STATUS_BAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació expandeixi o replegui la barra d'estat. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#EXPAND_STATUS_BAR]EXPAND_STATUS_BAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Run as a manufacturer test application, running as the root user. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#FACTORY_TEST]FACTORY_TEST[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Executeu com a aplicació de prova del fabricant, s'executa com a usuari "
"root. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#FACTORY_TEST]FACTORY_TEST[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows access to the flashlight."
msgstr "Permet l'accés a la llanterna."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to force a BACK operation on whatever is the top "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació forçar una operació BACK en qualsevol que sigui "
"l'activitat principal."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the list of accounts in the Accounts Service. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_ACCOUNTS]GET_ACCOUNTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés a la llista de comptes del Servei de Comptes. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_ACCOUNTS]GET_ACCOUNTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to find out the space used by any package. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_PACKAGE_SIZE]GET_PACKAGE_SIZE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació esbrinar l'espai utilitzat per qualsevol paquet. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_PACKAGE_SIZE]GET_PACKAGE_SIZE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 21."
msgstr "Obsolet al nivell 21 de l'API."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to retrieve private information about the current top "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació recuperar informació privada sobre l'activitat "
"principal actual."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Used on content providers to allow the global search system to access their "
"data. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GLOBAL_SEARCH]GLOBAL_SEARCH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitza en proveïdors de contingut per permetre que el sistema de cerca "
"global accedeixi a les seves dades. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#GLOBAL_SEARCH]GLOBAL_SEARCH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows access to hardware peripherals."
msgstr "Permet l'accés als perifèrics de maquinari."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to inject user events (keys, touch, trackball) into "
"the event stream and deliver them to ANY window."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació injectar esdeveniments d'usuari (tecles, tàctil, "
"trackball) al flux d'esdeveniments i lliurar-los a QUALSEVOL finestra."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to install a location provider into the Location "
"Manager. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER]INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació instal·li un proveïdor d'ubicacions al Gestor "
"d'ubicacions. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER]INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to install packages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_PACKAGES]INSTALL_PACKAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació instal·lar paquets. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_PACKAGES]INSTALL_PACKAGES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to install a shortcut in Launcher. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_SHORTCUT]INSTALL_SHORTCUT[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació instal·li una drecera al Launcher. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_SHORTCUT]INSTALL_SHORTCUT[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to open windows that are for use by parts of the "
"system user interface."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació obri finestres per a les parts de la interfície "
"d'usuari del sistema."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to open network sockets. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INTERNET]INTERNET[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions obrin endolls de xarxa. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INTERNET]INTERNET[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to call "
"ActivityManager.killBackgroundProcesses(String). See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES]KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació cridi a "
"ActivityManager.killBackgroundProcesses(String). Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES]KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to use location features in hardware, such as the "
"geofencing api. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#LOCATION_HARDWARE]LOCATION_HARDWARE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació utilitzi funcions d'ubicació al maquinari, com ara "
"l'API de geofencing. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#LOCATION_HARDWARE]LOCATION_HARDWARE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage the list of accounts in the AccountManager."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació gestionar la llista de comptes al AccountManager."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage (create, destroy, Z-order) application "
"tokens in the window manager."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació gestionar (crear, destruir, ordenar Z) fitxes "
"d'aplicació al gestor de finestres."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage access to documents, usually as part of a "
"document picker. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_DOCUMENTS]MANAGE_DOCUMENTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació gestionar l'accés als documents, normalment com a "
"part d'un selector de documents. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#MANAGE_DOCUMENTS]MANAGE_DOCUMENTS[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application a broad access to external storage in scoped storage. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació un accés ampli a l'emmagatzematge extern a "
"l'emmagatzematge amb abast. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify and delete media files on this device or any "
"connected storage device without user confirmation. Applications must "
"already be granted the [code]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] or "
"[code]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] permissions for this permission to take "
"effect. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_MEDIA]MANAGE_MEDIA[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació modificar i suprimir fitxers multimèdia en aquest "
"dispositiu o qualsevol dispositiu d'emmagatzematge connectat sense la "
"confirmació de l'usuari. Les sol·licituds ja han de tenir els permisos "
"[code]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] o [code]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] "
"perquè aquest permís tingui efecte. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#MANAGE_MEDIA]MANAGE_MEDIA[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MASTER_CLEAR]MASTER_CLEAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MASTER_CLEAR]MASTER_CLEAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to know what content is playing and control its "
"playback. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL]MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació saber quin contingut s'està reproduint i controlar-ne "
"la reproducció. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL]MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify global audio settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS]MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació modifiqui la configuració global d'àudio. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS]MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows modification of the telephony state - power on, mmi, etc. Does not "
"include placing calls. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#MODIFY_PHONE_STATE]MODIFY_PHONE_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet modificar l'estat de la telefonia - engegada, mmi, etc. No inclou fer "
"trucades. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_PHONE_STATE]MODIFY_PHONE_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows formatting file systems for removable storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet formatar sistemes de fitxers per a l'emmagatzematge extraïble. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows mounting and unmounting file systems for removable storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet muntar i desmuntar sistemes de fitxers per a emmagatzematge "
"extraïble. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to perform I/O operations over NFC. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#NFC]NFC[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions realitzin operacions d'E/S mitjançant NFC. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#NFC]NFC[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 15."
msgstr "Obsolet al nivell 15 de l'API."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to make its activities persistent."
msgstr "Permet que una aplicació faci les seves activitats persistents."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to post notifications. Added in API level 33. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/"
"notification-permission]Notification runtime permission[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació publiqui notificacions. S'ha afegit al nivell 33 de "
"l'API. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/"
"notifications/notification-permission]Permís d'execució de notificacions[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 29."
msgstr "Obsolet al nivell 29 de l'API."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to see the number being dialed during an outgoing call "
"with the option to redirect the call to a different number or abort the call "
"altogether. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS]PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació vegi el número que s'està marcant durant una "
"trucada sortint amb l'opció de redirigir la trucada a un número diferent o "
"avortar-la del tot. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS]PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's calendar data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALENDAR]READ_CALENDAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi les dades del calendari de l'usuari. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALENDAR]READ_CALENDAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's call log. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALL_LOG]READ_CALL_LOG[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi el registre de trucades de l'usuari. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALL_LOG]READ_CALL_LOG[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's contacts data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CONTACTS]READ_CONTACTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi les dades de contactes de l'usuari. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CONTACTS]READ_CONTACTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 33."
msgstr "Obsolet al nivell 33 de l'API."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read from external storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi des d'emmagatzematge extern. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to take screen shots and more generally get access to "
"the frame buffer data."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació faci captures de pantalla i, de manera més general, "
"tingui accés a les dades de la memòria intermèdia."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read (but not write) the user's browsing history "
"and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació llegir (però no escriure) l'historial de navegació i "
"les adreces d'interès de l'usuari."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 16."
msgstr "Obsolet al nivell 16 de l'API."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the low-level system log files. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_LOGS]READ_LOGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi els fitxers de registre del sistema de "
"baix nivell. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_LOGS]READ_LOGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read audio files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_AUDIO]READ_MEDIA_AUDIO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació llegir fitxers d'àudio des d'emmagatzematge extern. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_AUDIO]READ_MEDIA_AUDIO[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read image files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_IMAGES]READ_MEDIA_IMAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació llegir fitxers d'imatge des d'emmagatzematge extern. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_IMAGES]READ_MEDIA_IMAGES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read video files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VIDEO]READ_MEDIA_VIDEO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació llegir fitxers de vídeo des d'emmagatzematge extern. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VIDEO]READ_MEDIA_VIDEO[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read image or video files from external storage "
"that a user has selected via the permission prompt photo picker. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED]READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi fitxers d'imatge o de vídeo de "
"l'emmagatzematge extern que un usuari hagi seleccionat mitjançant el "
"selector de fotos de sol·licitud de permís. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED]READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read only access to phone state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_PHONE_STATE]READ_PHONE_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés només de lectura a l'estat del telèfon. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_PHONE_STATE]READ_PHONE_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to read the user's personal profile data."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi les dades del perfil personal de l'usuari."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SMS]READ_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació llegeixi missatges SMS. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SMS]READ_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to read from the user's social stream."
msgstr "Permet que una aplicació llegeixi el flux social de l'usuari."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to read the sync settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_SETTINGS]READ_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a les aplicacions llegir la configuració de sincronització. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_SETTINGS]READ_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to read the sync stats. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_STATS]READ_SYNC_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a les aplicacions llegir les estadístiques de sincronització. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_STATS]READ_SYNC_STATS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to read the user dictionary."
msgstr "Permet a una aplicació llegir el diccionari de l'usuari."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Required to be able to reboot the device. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#REBOOT]REBOOT[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Necessari per poder reiniciar el dispositiu. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#REBOOT]REBOOT[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive the Intent.ACTION_BOOT_COMPLETED that is "
"broadcast after the system finishes booting. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED]RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació rebi l'Intent.ACTION_BOOT_COMPLETED que s'emet "
"després que el sistema acabi d'arrencar. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED]RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to monitor incoming MMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_MMS]RECEIVE_MMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació supervisar els missatges MMS entrants. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_MMS]RECEIVE_MMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_SMS]RECEIVE_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació rebi missatges SMS. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_SMS]RECEIVE_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive WAP push messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH]RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació rebi missatges push WAP. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH]RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to record audio. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO]RECORD_AUDIO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació gravar àudio. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO]RECORD_AUDIO[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to change the Z-order of tasks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REORDER_TASKS]REORDER_TASKS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació canviar l'ordre Z de les tasques. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REORDER_TASKS]REORDER_TASKS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application (Phone) to send a request to other applications to "
"handle the respond-via-message action during incoming calls. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE]SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació (telèfon) enviï una sol·licitud a altres "
"aplicacions per gestionar l'acció de resposta mitjançant missatge durant les "
"trucades entrants. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE]SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to send SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_SMS]SEND_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació enviï missatges SMS. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_SMS]SEND_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to watch and control how activities are started "
"globally in the system."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació veure i controlar com s'inicien les activitats "
"globalment al sistema."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast an Intent to set an alarm for the user. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALARM]SET_ALARM[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació emeti una intenció per establir una alarma per a "
"l'usuari. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALARM]SET_ALARM[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to control whether activities are immediately finished "
"when put in the background. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#SET_ALWAYS_FINISH]SET_ALWAYS_FINISH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació controli si les activitats s'acaben immediatament "
"quan es posen en segon pla. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#SET_ALWAYS_FINISH]SET_ALWAYS_FINISH[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows to modify the global animation scaling factor. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ANIMATION_SCALE]SET_ANIMATION_SCALE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet modificar el factor d'escala global de l'animació. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ANIMATION_SCALE]SET_ANIMATION_SCALE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Configure an application for debugging. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_DEBUG_APP]SET_DEBUG_APP[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Configurar una aplicació per a la depuració. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_DEBUG_APP]SET_DEBUG_APP[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows low-level access to setting the orientation (actually rotation) of "
"the screen."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés de baix nivell per configurar l'orientació (en realitat la "
"rotació) de la pantalla."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows low-level access to setting the pointer speed."
msgstr "Permet l'accés de baix nivell per configurar la velocitat del punter."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to set the maximum number of (not needed) application "
"processes that can be running. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#SET_PROCESS_LIMIT]SET_PROCESS_LIMIT[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació estableixi el nombre màxim de processos d'aplicació "
"(no necessaris) que es poden executar. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_PROCESS_LIMIT]SET_PROCESS_LIMIT[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the system time directly. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME]SET_TIME[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions estableixin l'hora del sistema directament. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME]SET_TIME[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the system time zone directly. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME_ZONE]SET_TIME_ZONE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions estableixin directament la zona horària del "
"sistema. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME_ZONE]SET_TIME_ZONE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the wallpaper. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER]SET_WALLPAPER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions estableixin el fons de pantalla. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER]SET_WALLPAPER[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the wallpaper hints. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS]SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a les aplicacions establir els consells de fons de pantalla. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS]SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allow an application to request that a signal be sent to all persistent "
"processes. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES]SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació sol·liciti que s'enviï un senyal a tots els "
"processos persistents. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES]SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to open, close, or disable the status bar and its "
"icons. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#STATUS_BAR]STATUS_BAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació obrir, tancar o desactivar la barra d'estat i les "
"seves icones. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#STATUS_BAR]STATUS_BAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to allow access the subscribed feeds ContentProvider."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació permeti l'accés als canals subscrits "
"ContentProvider."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an app to create windows using the type "
"WindowManager.LayoutParams.TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY, shown on top of all "
"other apps. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW]SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació creï finestres amb el tipus "
"WindowManager.LayoutParams.TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY, que es mostra a sobre "
"de totes les altres aplicacions. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW]SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows using the device's IR transmitter, if available. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#TRANSMIT_IR]TRANSMIT_IR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet utilitzar el transmissor IR del dispositiu, si està disponible. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#TRANSMIT_IR]TRANSMIT_IR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to update device statistics. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS]UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet a una aplicació actualitzar les estadístiques del dispositiu. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS]UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to request authtokens from the AccountManager."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació sol·liciti certificats d'autor al AccountManager."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to use SIP service. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#USE_SIP]USE_SIP[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació utilitzi el servei SIP. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#USE_SIP]USE_SIP[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the vibrator. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#VIBRATE]VIBRATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés al vibrador. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#VIBRATE]VIBRATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows using PowerManager WakeLocks to keep processor from sleeping or "
"screen from dimming. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#WAKE_LOCK]WAKE_LOCK[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet utilitzar PowerManager WakeLocks per evitar que el processador "
"s'adormi o que la pantalla s'enfosqui. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WAKE_LOCK]WAKE_LOCK[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to write the apn settings and read sensitive fields of "
"an existing apn settings like user and password. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_APN_SETTINGS]WRITE_APN_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que les aplicacions escriguin la configuració d'apn i llegiu camps "
"sensibles de la configuració d'un apn existent, com ara l'usuari i la "
"contrasenya. Vegeu [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_APN_SETTINGS]WRITE_APN_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write the user's calendar data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALENDAR]WRITE_CALENDAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que una aplicació escrigui les dades del calendari de l'usuari. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALENDAR]WRITE_CALENDAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's call log data. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALL_LOG]WRITE_CALL_LOG[/url]."
msgstr ""
