"d'implementació per defecte [code]tcp://[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns device architecture for one-click deploy."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'arquitectura del dispositiu per al desplegament amb un sol clic."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns visibility for the specified [param "
"preset]. Default implementation return [code]true[/code] for all options."
msgstr ""
"Valida [param option] i retorna la visibilitat per al [param preset] "
"especificat. La implementació per defecte retorna [code]true[/code] per a "
"totes les opcions."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns warning message for the specified "
"[param preset]. Default implementation return empty string for all options."
msgstr ""
"Valida [param option] i retorna un missatge d'advertència per a [param "
"preset] especificat. La implementació per defecte retorna una cadena buida "
"per a totes les opcions."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a property list, as an [Array] of dictionaries. Each [Dictionary] "
"must at least contain the [code]name: StringName[/code] and [code]type: "
"Variant.Type[/code] entries.\n"
"Additionally, the following keys are supported:\n"
"- [code]hint: PropertyHint[/code]\n"
"- [code]hint_string: String[/code]\n"
"- [code]usage: PropertyUsageFlags[/code]\n"
"- [code]class_name: StringName[/code]\n"
"- [code]default_value: Variant[/code], default value of the property.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility: bool[/code], if set to [code]true[/code], [method "
"_get_export_option_visibility] is called for each property when this "
"property is changed.\n"
"- [code]required: bool[/code], if set to [code]true[/code], this property "
"warnings are critical, and should be resolved to make export possible. This "
"value is a hint for the [method _has_valid_export_configuration] "
"implementation, and not used by the engine directly.\n"
"See also [method Object._get_property_list]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una llista de propietats, com a [Array] de diccionaris. Cada "
"[Dictionary] ha de contenir com a mínim les entrades [code]: StringName[/"
"code] i [code]type: Variant.Type[/code].\n"
"A més, s'admeten les tecles següents:\n"
"- [code]hint: PropertyHint[/code]\n"
"- [code]hint_string: String[/code]\n"
"- [code]usage: PropertyUsageFlags[/code]\n"
"- [code]nom_classe: StringName[/code]\n"
"- [code]default_value: Variant[/code], valor per defecte de la propietat.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility: bool[/code], si s'estableix en [code]true[/code], "
"es crida [method _get_export_option_visibility] per a cada propietat quan es "
"canvia aquesta propietat.\n"
"- [code]obligatori: bool[/code], si s'estableix en [code]true[/code], "
"aquests avisos de propietat són crítics i s'han de resoldre per fer possible "
"l'exportació. Aquest valor és una pista per a la implementació [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration] i no l'utilitza directament el motor.\n"
"Vegeu també [method Object._get_property_list]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
