"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_developer_kernel_increased-memory-"
"limit]com.apple.developer.kernel.increased-memory-limit[/url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
