msgstr "Número de port SSH de l'amfitrió remot."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Script code to execute on the remote host when running the app.\n"
"The following variables can be used in the script:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - Path of temporary folder on the remote, used to "
"upload app and scripts to.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - Name of the ZIP containing uploaded "
"application.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - Name of application executable.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - Array of the command line argument for the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Codi d'script per executar-lo a l'amfitrió remot quan s'executa "
"l'aplicació.\n"
"Les variables següents es poden utilitzar a l'script:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - Camí de la carpeta temporal al comandament "
"remot, que s'utilitza per carregar aplicacions i scripts.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - Nom del codi postal que conté l'aplicació "
"penjada.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - Nom de l'executable de l'aplicació.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - Matriu de l'argument de la línia d'ordres per a "
"l'aplicació."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project textures are exported in the ETC2/ASTC format."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project textures are exported in the S3TC/BPTC format."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Exporter for macOS."
msgstr "Exportador per a macOS."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Exporting for macOS"
msgstr "Exportació per a macOS"

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Running Godot apps on macOS"
msgstr "Executant aplicacions Godot a macOS"

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Application category for the App Store."
msgstr "Categoria d'aplicació per a l'App Store."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user (in English)."
msgstr "Avís de drets d'autor del paquet visible per l'usuari (en anglès)."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user (localized)."
msgstr "Avís de drets d'autor del paquet visible per l'usuari (localitzat)."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]1[/code], ANGLE libraries are exported with the exported "
"application. If set to [code]0[/code], ANGLE libraries are exported only if "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/gl_compatibility/driver] is set to [code]"
"\"opengl3_angle\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix en [code]1[/code], les biblioteques ANGLE s'exporten amb "
"l'aplicació exportada. Si s'estableix a [code]0[/code], les biblioteques "
"ANGLE només s'exporten si [member ProjectSettings.rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"driver] s'estableix a [code]\"opengl3_angle\"[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Application icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/macos_native_icon], and then to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer d'icona de l'aplicació. Si es deixa buit, tornarà a [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/macos_native_icon] i després a [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"macOS 26 Liquid Glass icon source file. Use [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"icon-composer/]Icon Composer[/url] to create Liquid Glass icons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Supported when exporting from macOS only, Xcode 26+ required.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Liquid Glass icons are supported on macOS 26 only, use [member "
"application/icon] to set the icon for older macOS versions."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer font de la icona de macOS 26 Liquid Glass. Utilitzeu [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/icon-composer/]Icon Composer[/url] per crear icones de "
"vidre líquid.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només s'admet quan s'exporta des de macOS, es requereix Xcode "
"26+.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les icones de Liquid Glass només s'admeten a macOS 26, "
"utilitzeu [member application/icon] per configurar la icona per a versions "
"anteriors de macOS."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum version of macOS required for this application to run on Apple "
"Silicon Macs, in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/"
"code] format, can only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and "
"periods ([code].[/code])."
msgstr ""
"La versió mínima de macOS necessària perquè aquesta aplicació s'executi a "
"Apple Silicon Mac, en el format [code]major.minor.patch[/code] o "
"[code]major.minor[/code], només pot contenir caràcters numèrics ([code]0-9[/"
"code]) i períodes ([code].[/code])."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum version of macOS required for this application to run on Intel Macs, "
"in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/code] format, "
"can only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and periods ([code].[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"La versió mínima de macOS necessària perquè aquesta aplicació s'executi en "
"Mac Intel, en el format [code]major.minor.patch[/code] o [code]major.minor[/"
"code], només pot contenir caràcters numèrics ([code]0-9[/code]) i períodes "
"([code].[/code])."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Application executable architecture.\n"
"Supported architectures: [code]x86_64[/code], [code]arm64[/code], and "
"[code]universal[/code] ([code]x86_64 + arm64[/code]).\n"
"Official export templates include [code]universal[/code] binaries only."
msgstr ""

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"PKCS #12 certificate file used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_FILE[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer de certificat PKCS #12 utilitzat per signar el paquet [code].app[/"
"code].\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_FILE[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Password for the certificate file used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya per al fitxer de certificat utilitzat per signar el paquet "
"[code].app[/code].\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Tool to use for code signing."
msgstr "Eina per a la signatura de codi."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the code signing "
"tool."
msgstr ""
"Matriu dels arguments addicionals de la línia d'ordres passats a l'eina de "
"signatura de codi."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow access to contacts in the user's address book, if it's "
"enabled you should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"address_book_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_addressbook]com.apple.security.personal-information.addressbook[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Habiliteu-lo per permetre l'accés als contactes de la llibreta d'adreces de "
"l'usuari; si està habilitat, també hauríeu de proporcionar un missatge d'ús "
"a l'opció [member privacy/address_book_usage_description]. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_addressbook]com.apple.security.personal-information.addressbook[/"
"url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows app to use dynamic linker environment variables to inject code. If "
"you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable "
"them according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_allow-dyld-environment-"
"variables]com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que l'aplicació utilitzi variables d'entorn de l'enllaç dinàmic per "
"injectar codi. Si utilitzeu complements amb codi natiu dinàmic o "
"automodificable, activeu-los segons la documentació del complement. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_allow-dyld-environment-"
"variables]com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory for JIT code. If you are "
"using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them "
"according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-"
"jit]com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet crear memòria escriptible i executable per al codi JIT. Si utilitzeu "
"complements amb codi natiu dinàmic o automodificable, activeu-los segons la "
"documentació del complement. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-"
"jit]com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory without JIT restrictions. If "
"you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable "
"them according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_allow-unsigned-executable-"
"memory]com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet crear memòria escriptible i executable sense restriccions JIT. Si "
"utilitzeu complements amb codi natiu dinàmic o automodificable, activeu-los "
"segons la documentació del complement. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_allow-unsigned-executable-"
"memory]com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to interact with Bluetooth devices. This entitlement is "
"required to use wireless controllers. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_bluetooth]com.apple.security.device.bluetooth[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Activa per permetre que l'aplicació interactuï amb dispositius Bluetooth. "
"Aquest dret és necessari per utilitzar controladors sense fil. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_bluetooth]com.apple.security.device.bluetooth[/"
"url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to interact with USB devices. This entitlement is "
"required to use wired controllers. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_usb]com.apple.security.device.usb[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Activa per permetre que l'aplicació interactuï amb dispositius USB. Aquest "
"dret és necessari per utilitzar controladors per cable. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_usb]com.apple.security.device.usb[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enables App Sandbox. The App Sandbox restricts access to user data, "
"networking, and devices. Sandboxed apps can't access most of the file "
"system, can't use custom file dialogs and execute binaries outside the .app "
"bundle. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/"
"app_sandbox]App Sandbox[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To distribute an app through the App Store, you must enable the "
"App Sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Activa l'aplicació Sandbox. L'App Sandbox restringeix l'accés a les dades "
"dels usuaris, les xarxes i els dispositius. Les aplicacions amb zona de "
"sorra no poden accedir a la major part del sistema de fitxers, no poden "
"utilitzar diàlegs de fitxers personalitzats ni executar binaris fora del "
"paquet .app. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/"
"app_sandbox]App Sandbox[/url].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per distribuir una aplicació a través de l'App Store, heu "
"d'habilitar l'App Sandbox."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Downloads\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_files_downloads_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.downloads.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés de lectura o escriptura a la carpeta \"Descàrregues\" de "
"l'usuari. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_files_downloads_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.downloads.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Movies\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_movies_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.movies.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés de lectura o escriptura a la carpeta \"Pel·lícules\" de "
"l'usuari. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_assets_movies_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.movies.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Music\" folder. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_music_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.music.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés de lectura o escriptura a la carpeta \"Música\" de l'usuari. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/com_apple_security_assets_music_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.music.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Pictures\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_pictures_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.pictures.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés de lectura o escriptura a la carpeta \"Imatges\" de l'usuari. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/com_apple_security_assets_pictures_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.pictures.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the locations the user has selected using a "
"native file dialog. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_files_user-selected_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'accés de lectura o escriptura a les ubicacions que l'usuari ha "
"seleccionat mitjançant un diàleg de fitxer natiu. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_files_user-selected_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"List of helper executables to embedded to the app bundle. Sandboxed app are "
"limited to execute only these executable. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-"
"sandboxed-app]Embedding a command-line tool in a sandboxed app[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Llista d'executables d'ajuda per incrustar al paquet d'aplicacions. "
"L'aplicació Sandbox es limita a executar només aquests executables. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/embedding-a-helper-tool-"
"in-a-sandboxed-app]Incrustar una eina de línia d'ordres en una aplicació de "
"sorra[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to establish outgoing network connections. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_client]com.apple.security.network.client[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Activa per permetre que l'aplicació estableixi connexions de xarxa sortints. "
"Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_client]com.apple.security.network.client[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to listen for incoming network connections. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_server]com.apple.security.network.server[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Activa per permetre que l'aplicació escolti les connexions de xarxa "
"entrants. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_server]com.apple.security.network.server[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to send Apple events to other apps. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_automation_apple-"
"events]com.apple.security.automation.apple-events[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Activa per permetre que l'aplicació enviï esdeveniments d'Apple a altres "
"aplicacions. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_automation_apple-"
"events]com.apple.security.automation.apple-events[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use the microphone or other audio input sources, if "
"it's enabled you should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"microphone_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_device_audio-"
"input]com.apple.security.device.audio-input[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Activeu-lo si necessiteu utilitzar el micròfon o altres fonts d'entrada "
"d'àudio, si està activat, també hauríeu de proporcionar un missatge d'ús a "
"l'opció [member privacy/microphone_usage_description]. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_audio-input]com.apple.security.device.audio-input[/"
"url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow access to the user's calendar, if it's enabled you should "
"also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"calendar_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_calendars]com.apple.security.personal-information.calendars[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Habilita per permetre l'accés al calendari de l'usuari, si està habilitat, "
"també hauríeu de proporcionar un missatge d'ús a l'opció [member privacy/"
"calendar_usage_description]. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_calendars]com.apple.security.personal-information.calendars[/"
"url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use the camera, if it's enabled you should also "
"provide usage message in the [member privacy/camera_usage_description] "
"option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_camera]com.apple.security.device.camera[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Activeu-lo si necessiteu utilitzar la càmera, si està habilitat també "
"hauríeu de proporcionar un missatge d'ús a l'opció [member privacy/"
"camera_usage_description]. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_camera]com.apple.security.device.camera[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Custom entitlements [code].plist[/code] file, if specified the rest of "
"entitlements in the export config are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer de drets personalitzats [code].plist[/code], si s'especifica, la "
"resta de drets a la configuració d'exportació s'ignoren."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"You can temporarily enable this entitlement to use native debugger (GDB, "
"LLDB) with the exported app. This entitlement should be disabled for "
"production export. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/"
"embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-sandboxed-app]Embedding a command-line tool in "
"a sandboxed app[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Podeu activar temporalment aquest dret per utilitzar el depurador natiu "
"(GDB, LLDB) amb l'aplicació exportada. Aquest dret s'ha de desactivar per a "
"l'exportació de producció. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/xcode/embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-sandboxed-app]Incrustar una "
"eina de línia d'ordres en una aplicació de sorra[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows app to load arbitrary libraries and frameworks (not signed with the "
"same Team ID as the main executable or by Apple). Enable it if you are using "
"GDExtension add-ons or ad-hoc signing, or want to support user-provided "
"external add-ons. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_disable-library-"
"validation]com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permet que l'aplicació carregui biblioteques i marcs arbitraris (no signats "
"amb el mateix ID d'equip que l'executable principal ni per Apple). Activeu-"
"lo si feu servir complements de GDExtension o signatura ad-hoc, o voleu "
"admetre els complements externs proporcionats per l'usuari. Vegeu "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_disable-library-"
"validation]com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use location information from Location Services, if "
"it's enabled you should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"location_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_location]com.apple.security.personal-information.location[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Activeu-lo si necessiteu utilitzar la informació d'ubicació dels Serveis "
"d'Ubicació, si està activat, també hauríeu de proporcionar un missatge d'ús "
"a l'opció [member privacy/location_usage_description]. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_personal-information_location]com.apple.security.personal-"
"information.location[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow access to the user's Photos library, if it's enabled you "
"should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"photos_library_usage_description] option. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_personal-information_photos-"
"library]com.apple.security.personal-information.photos-library[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Habiliteu-lo per permetre l'accés a la biblioteca de fotos de l'usuari; si "
"està habilitat, també hauríeu de proporcionar un missatge d'ús a l'opció "
"[member privacy/photos_library_usage_description]. Vegeu [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_personal-information_photos-"
"library]com.apple.security.personal-information.photos-library[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\" or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle."
msgstr ""
"El \"Nom complet\", \"Nom comú\" o hash SHA-1 de la identitat de signatura "
"utilitzada per signar el paquet [code].app[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\" or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used to sign [code].pkg[/code] installer package for App Store distribution, "
"use [code]3rd Party Mac Developer Installer: Name.[/code] identity."
msgstr ""
"El \"Nom complet\", \"Nom comú\" o hash SHA-1 de la identitat de signatura "
"utilitzada per signar el paquet d'instal·lador [code].pkg[/code] per a la "
"distribució de l'App Store, utilitzeu [code] Instal·lador de desenvolupadors "
"de Mac de tercers: Nom.[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Provisioning profile file downloaded from Apple developer account dashboard. "
"See [url=https://developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-"
"download-or-delete-profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/"
"url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_PROVISIONING_PROFILE[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer de perfil de subministrament baixat des del tauler de control del "
"compte de desenvolupador d'Apple. Vegeu [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"help/account/manage-profiles/edit-download-or-delete-profiles]Editar, baixar "
"o suprimir perfils de subministrament[/url].\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_PROVISIONING_PROFILE[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, a wrapper that can be used to run the application with console "
"output is created alongside the exported application."
msgstr ""
"Si està activat, es crea un embolcall que es pot utilitzar per executar "
"l'aplicació amb sortida de consola juntament amb l'aplicació exportada."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application is rendered at native display "
"resolution, otherwise it is always rendered at loDPI resolution and upscaled "
"by OS when required."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'aplicació es representa amb una resolució de "
"visualització nativa, en cas contrari sempre es representa amb una resolució "
"loDPI i el sistema operatiu augmenta l'escala quan sigui necessari."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Application distribution target."
msgstr "Destí de distribució de l'aplicació."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Apple App Store Connect API issuer key file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer de clau de l'emissor de l'API Apple App Store Connect.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Apple App Store Connect API issuer key ID.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY_ID[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ID de clau de l'emissor de l'API d'App Store Connect d'Apple.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY_ID[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Apple App Store Connect API issuer UUID.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_UUID[/code]."
msgstr ""
"UUID de l'emissor de l'API Apple App Store Connect.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_UUID[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Apple ID account name (email address).\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_NAME[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Nom del compte d'ID d'Apple (adreça de correu electrònic).\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_NAME[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Apple ID app-specific password.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya específica de l'aplicació ID d'Apple.\n"
"Es pot substituir amb la variable d'entorn "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_PASSWORD[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Tool to use for notarization."
msgstr "Eina per a la notarització."

