msgstr "La diferència màxima entre l'eix X dels punts de pivot."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The amount of damping that happens at the Y motion."
msgstr "La quantitat d'amortiment que es produeix en el moviment Y."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the linear motion across the Y axis is limited."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el moviment lineal a través de l'eix Y és limitat."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The minimum difference between the pivot points' Y axis."
msgstr "La diferència mínima entre l'eix Y dels punts de pivot."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the Y axis movement. The lower, the more "
"momentum gets lost."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de restitució en el moviment de l'eix Y. Com més baix, més "
"impuls es perd."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the Y axis. The lower, the slower "
"the movement."
msgstr ""
"Un factor aplicat al moviment a través de l'eix Y. Com més baix, més lent és "
"el moviment."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The maximum difference between the pivot points' Y axis."
msgstr "La diferència màxima entre l'eix Y dels punts de pivot."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The amount of damping that happens at the Z motion."
msgstr "La quantitat d'amortiment que es produeix en el moviment Z."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the linear motion across the Z axis is limited."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el moviment lineal a través de l'eix Z és limitat."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The minimum difference between the pivot points' Z axis."
msgstr "La diferència mínima entre l'eix Z dels punts de pivot."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the Z axis movement. The lower, the more "
"momentum gets lost."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de restitució en el moviment de l'eix Z. Com més baix, més "
"impuls es perd."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the Z axis. The lower, the slower "
"the movement."
msgstr ""
"Un factor aplicat al moviment a través de l'eix Z. Com més baix, més lent és "
"el moviment."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The maximum difference between the pivot points' Z axis."
msgstr "La diferència màxima entre l'eix Z dels punts de pivot."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], then there is a linear motor on the X axis. It will "
"attempt to reach the target velocity while staying within the force limits."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], hi ha un motor lineal a l'eix X. Intentarà assolir la "
"velocitat objectiu mentre es manté dins dels límits de força."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor can apply on the X axis while trying to "
"reach the target velocity."
msgstr ""
"La força màxima que el motor lineal pot aplicar a l'eix X mentre intenta "
"assolir la velocitat objectiu."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The speed that the linear motor will attempt to reach on the X axis."
msgstr "La velocitat que intentarà assolir el motor lineal a l'eix X."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], then there is a linear motor on the Y axis. It will "
"attempt to reach the target velocity while staying within the force limits."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], llavors hi ha un motor lineal a l'eix Y. Intentarà "
"assolir la velocitat objectiu mentre es manté dins dels límits de força."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor can apply on the Y axis while trying to "
"reach the target velocity."
msgstr ""
"La força màxima que el motor lineal pot aplicar a l'eix Y mentre intenta "
"assolir la velocitat objectiu."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The speed that the linear motor will attempt to reach on the Y axis."
msgstr "La velocitat que intentarà assolir el motor lineal a l'eix Y."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], then there is a linear motor on the Z axis. It will "
"attempt to reach the target velocity while staying within the force limits."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], hi ha un motor lineal a l'eix Z. Intentarà assolir la "
"velocitat objectiu mentre es manté dins dels límits de força."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor can apply on the Z axis while trying to "
"reach the target velocity."
msgstr ""
"La força màxima que el motor lineal pot aplicar a l'eix Z mentre intenta "
"assolir la velocitat objectiu."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The speed that the linear motor will attempt to reach on the Z axis."
msgstr "La velocitat que intentarà assolir el motor lineal a l'eix Z."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The minimum difference between the pivot points' axes."
msgstr "La diferència mínima entre els eixos dels punts de pivot."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The maximum difference between the pivot points' axes."
msgstr "La diferència màxima entre els eixos dels punts de pivot."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the axes. The lower, the slower the "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"Un factor aplicat al moviment a través dels eixos. Com més baix, més lent és "
"el moviment."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the axes' movement. The lower, the more "
"momentum gets lost."
msgstr ""
"L'import de la restitució del moviment dels eixos. Com més baix, més impuls "
"es perd."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping that happens at the linear motion across the axes."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'amortiment que es produeix en el moviment lineal entre els "
"eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The velocity the linear motor will try to reach."
msgstr "La velocitat que intentarà assolir el motor lineal."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor will apply while trying to reach the "
"velocity target."
msgstr ""
"La força màxima que aplicarà el motor lineal mentre s'intenta assolir "
"l'objectiu de velocitat."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in negative direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the axes."
msgstr ""
"La rotació mínima en sentit negatiu per trencar-se i girar al voltant dels "
"eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in positive direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the axes."
msgstr ""
"La rotació mínima en sentit positiu per trencar-se i girar al voltant dels "
"eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "The speed of all rotations across the axes."
msgstr "La velocitat de totes les rotacions als eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of rotational damping across the axes. The lower, the more "
"damping occurs."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'amortiment rotacional entre els eixos. Com més baix, més "
"amortiment es produeix."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of rotational restitution across the axes. The lower, the more "
"restitution occurs."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de restitució rotacional entre els eixos. Com més baix, més es "
"produeix la restitució."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum amount of force that can occur, when rotating around the axes."
msgstr "La màxima força que es pot produir en girar al voltant dels eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"When rotating across the axes, this error tolerance factor defines how much "
"the correction gets slowed down. The lower, the slower."
msgstr ""
"Quan es gira pels eixos, aquest factor de tolerància a l'error defineix fins "
"a quin punt es ralenteix la correcció. Com més baix, més lent."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Target speed for the motor at the axes."
msgstr "Velocitat objectiu del motor en els eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Maximum acceleration for the motor at the axes."
msgstr "Acceleració màxima del motor en els eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "If enabled, linear motion is possible within the given limits."
msgstr ""
"Si està activat, el moviment lineal és possible dins dels límits donats."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "If enabled, rotational motion is possible within the given limits."
msgstr ""
"Si està activat, el moviment de rotació és possible dins dels límits donats."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "If enabled, there is a rotational motor across these axes."
msgstr "Si està activat, hi ha un motor de rotació en aquests eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
msgid "If enabled, there is a linear motor across these axes."
msgstr "Si està activat, hi ha un motor lineal entre aquests eixos."

#: doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Flag] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum Flag]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid "Provides methods for some common 2D geometric operations."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona mètodes per a algunes operacions geomètriques 2D habituals."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Provides a set of helper functions to create geometric shapes, compute "
"intersections between shapes, and process various other geometric operations "
"in 2D."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona un conjunt de funcions auxiliars per crear formes geomètriques, "
"calcular interseccions entre formes i processar altres operacions "
"geomètriques en 2D."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bresenham%27s_line_algorithm]Bresenham line[/url] between the [param from] "
"and [param to] points. A Bresenham line is a series of pixels that draws a "
"line and is always 1-pixel thick on every row and column of the drawing "
"(never more, never less).\n"
"Example code to draw a line between two [Marker2D] nodes using a series of "
"[method CanvasItem.draw_rect] calls:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _draw():\n"
"\tfor pixel in Geometry2D.bresenham_line($MarkerA.position, "
"$MarkerB.position):\n"
"\t\tdraw_rect(Rect2(pixel, Vector2.ONE), Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la línia [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bresenham%27s_line_algorithm]Bresenham[/url] entre els punts [param from] i "
"[param to]. Una línia de Bresenham és una sèrie de píxels que dibuixa una "
"línia i sempre té 1 píxel de gruix a cada fila i columna del dibuix (mai "
"més, mai menys).\n"
"Exemple de codi per dibuixar una línia entre dos nodes [Marker2D] mitjançant "
"una sèrie de trucades [method CanvasItem.draw_rect]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"funció _dibuixar():\n"
"\tper al píxel a Geometry2D.bresenham_line($MarkerA.position, "
"$MarkerB.position):\n"
"\t\tdraw_rect(Rect2(píxel, Vector2.ONE), Color.BLANC)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Clips [param polygon_a] against [param polygon_b] and returns an array of "
"clipped polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] between "
"polygons. Returns an empty array if [param polygon_b] completely overlaps "
"[param polygon_a].\n"
"If [param polygon_b] is enclosed by [param polygon_a], returns an outer "
"polygon (boundary) and inner polygon (hole) which could be distinguished by "
"calling [method is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"Retalla [param polygon_a] contra [param polygon_b] i retorna una matriu de "
"polígons retallats. Això realitza [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] entre "
"polígons. Retorna una matriu buida si [param polygon_b] se superposa "
"completament a [param polygon_a].\n"
"Si [param polygon_b] està tancat per [param polygon_a], retorna un polígon "
"exterior (límit) i un polígon interior (forat) que es poden distingir "
"cridant a [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Clips [param polyline] against [param polygon] and returns an array of "
"clipped polylines. This performs [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] between the "
"polyline and the polygon. This operation can be thought of as cutting a line "
"with a closed shape."
msgstr ""
"Talla [param polyline] contra [param polygon] i retorna una matriu de "
"polilínies retallades. Això realitza [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] entre "
"la polilínia i el polígon. Aquesta operació es pot pensar com tallar una "
"línia amb una forma tancada."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Given an array of [Vector2]s, returns the convex hull as a list of points in "
"counterclockwise order. The last point is the same as the first one."
msgstr ""
"Donada una matriu de [Vector2]s, retorna el casc convex com una llista de "
"punts en ordre contrari a les agulles del rellotge. L'últim punt és el "
"mateix que el primer."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Decomposes the [param polygon] into multiple convex hulls and returns an "
"array of [PackedVector2Array]."
msgstr ""
"Descomposa [param polygon] en múltiples cascs convexos i retorna una matriu "
"de [PackedVector2Array]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Mutually excludes common area defined by intersection of [param polygon_a] "
"and [param polygon_b] (see [method intersect_polygons]) and returns an array "
"of excluded polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_XOR] between "
"polygons. In other words, returns all but common area between polygons.\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"Exclou mútuament l'àrea comuna definida per la intersecció de [param "
"polygon_a] i [param polygon_b] (vegeu [method intersect_polygons]) i retorna "
"una matriu de polígons exclosos. Això realitza [constant OPERATION_XOR] "
"entre polígons. En altres paraules, retorna tota l'àrea comuna entre "
"polígons.\n"
"L'operació pot produir un polígon exterior (límit) i un polígon interior "
"(forat) que es poden distingir cridant a [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the 2D point on the 2D segment ([param s1], [param s2]) that is "
"closest to [param point]. The returned point will always be inside the "
"specified segment."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt 2D del segment 2D ([param s1], [param s2]) més proper a "
"[param point]. El punt retornat sempre estarà dins del segment especificat."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the 2D point on the 2D line defined by ([param s1], [param s2]) that "
"is closest to [param point]. The returned point can be inside the segment "
"([param s1], [param s2]) or outside of it, i.e. somewhere on the line "
"extending from the segment."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt 2D de la línia 2D definida per ([param s1], [param s2]) més "
"proper a [param point]. El punt retornat pot estar dins del segment ([param "
"s1], [param s2]) o fora d'aquest, és a dir, en algun lloc de la línia que "
"s'estén des del segment."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Given the two 2D segments ([param p1], [param q1]) and ([param p2], [param "
"q2]), finds those two points on the two segments that are closest to each "
"other. Returns a [PackedVector2Array] that contains this point on ([param "
"p1], [param q1]) as well the accompanying point on ([param p2], [param q2])."
msgstr ""
"Tenint en compte els dos segments 2D ([param p1], [param q1]) i ([param p2], "
"[param q2]), troba aquests dos punts als dos segments que estan més a prop "
"l'un de l'altre. Retorna un [PackedVector2Array] que conté aquest punt a "
"([param p1], [param q1]), així com el punt que l'acompanya a ([param p2], "
"[param q2])."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Intersects [param polygon_a] with [param polygon_b] and returns an array of "
"intersected polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] "
"between polygons. In other words, returns common area shared by polygons. "
"Returns an empty array if no intersection occurs.\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"Interseca [param polygon_a] amb [param polygon_b] i retorna una matriu de "
"polígons tallats. Això realitza [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] entre "
"polígons. En altres paraules, retorna l'àrea comuna compartida per polígons. "
"Retorna una matriu buida si no es produeix cap intersecció.\n"
"L'operació pot produir un polígon exterior (límit) i un polígon interior "
"(forat) que es poden distingir cridant a [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Intersects [param polyline] with [param polygon] and returns an array of "
"intersected polylines. This performs [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] "
"between the polyline and the polygon. This operation can be thought of as "
"chopping a line with a closed shape."
msgstr ""
"Interseca [param polyline] amb [param polygon] i retorna una matriu de "
"polilínies tallades. Això realitza [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] entre "
"la polilínia i el polígon. Aquesta operació es pot pensar com tallar una "
"línia amb una forma tancada."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is inside the circle or if it's "
"located exactly [i]on[/i] the circle's boundary, otherwise returns "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si [param point] es troba dins del cercle o si es "
"troba exactament [i]on[/i] al límit del cercle, en cas contrari torna "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is inside [param polygon] or if "
"it's located exactly [i]on[/i] polygon's boundary, otherwise returns "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si [param point] es troba dins [param polygon] o "
"si es troba exactament [i]@@[/i] als límits del polígon, un altre retorn, "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param polygon]'s vertices are ordered in "
"clockwise order, otherwise returns [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Assumes a Cartesian coordinate system where [code]+x[/code] is "
"right and [code]+y[/code] is up. If using screen coordinates ([code]+y[/"
"code] is down), the result will need to be flipped (i.e. a [code]true[/code] "
"result will indicate counter-clockwise)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els vèrtexs de [param polygon] estan ordenats "
"en el sentit de les agulles del rellotge, en cas contrari retorna "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Suposa un sistema de coordenades cartesianes on [code]+x[/code] "
"té la raó i [code]+y[/code] està encertat. Si s'utilitzen les coordenades de "
"pantalla ([code]+y[/code]), s'haurà d'invertir el resultat (és a dir, un "
"resultat [code]true[/code] indicarà en sentit contrari a les agulles del "
"rellotge)."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the point of intersection between the two lines ([param from_a], "
"[param dir_a]) and ([param from_b], [param dir_b]). Returns a [Vector2], or "
"[code]null[/code] if the lines are parallel.\n"
"[code]from[/code] and [code]dir[/code] are [i]not[/i] endpoints of a line "
"segment or ray but the slope ([code]dir[/code]) and a known point "
"([code]from[/code]) on that line. To get the intersection between two line "
"segments, use [method segment_intersects_segment].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var from_a = Vector2.ZERO\n"
"var dir_a = Vector2.RIGHT\n"
"var from_b = Vector2.DOWN\n"
"\n"
"# Returns Vector2(1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2(1, -1))\n"
"# Returns Vector2(-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2(-1, -1))\n"
"# Returns null\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2.RIGHT)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fromA = Vector2.Zero;\n"
"var dirA = Vector2.Right;\n"
"var fromB = Vector2.Down;\n"
"\n"
"// Returns new Vector2(1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, new Vector2(1, -1));\n"
"// Returns new Vector2(-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, new Vector2(-1, -1));\n"
"// Returns null\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, Vector2.Right);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt d'intersecció entre les dues línies ([param from_a], [param "
"dir_a]) i ([param from_b], [param dir_b]). Retorna [Vector2], o [code]null[/"
"code] si les línies són paral·leles.\n"
"[code]from[/code] i [code]dir[/code] són [i]not[/i] punts finals d'un "
"segment de línia o raig, però el pendent ([code]dir[/code]) i un punt "
"conegut ([code]from[/code]) en aquesta línia. Per obtenir la intersecció "
"entre dos segments de línia, utilitzeu [method segment_intersects_segment].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var de_a = Vector2.ZERO\n"
"var dir_a = Vector2.DRET\n"
"var from_b = Vector2.DOWN\n"
"\n"
"# Retorna Vector2(1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2(1, -1))\n"
"# Retorna Vector2(-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(de_a, dir_a, de_b, Vector2(-1, -1))\n"
"# Retorna nul\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2.RIGHT)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var deA = Vector2.Zero;\n"
"var dirA = Vector2.Dreta;\n"
"var deB = Vector2.Avall;\n"
"\n"
"// Retorna Vector2 nou (1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, nou Vector2(1, -1));\n"
"// Retorna Vector2 nou (-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, nou Vector2(-1, -1));\n"
"// Retorna nul\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, Vector2.Right);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Given an array of [Vector2]s representing tiles, builds an atlas. The "
"returned dictionary has two keys: [code]points[/code] is a "
"[PackedVector2Array] that specifies the positions of each tile, [code]size[/"
"code] contains the overall size of the whole atlas as [Vector2i]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Merges (combines) [param polygon_a] and [param polygon_b] and returns an "
"array of merged polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_UNION] between "
"polygons.\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and multiple inner "
"polygons (holes) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"Fusiona (combina) [param polygon_a] i [param polygon_b] i retorna una matriu "
"de polígons combinats. Això realitza [constant OPERATION_UNION] entre "
"polígons.\n"
"L'operació pot produir un polígon exterior (límit) i múltiples polígons "
"interiors (forats) que es podrien distingir cridant a [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Inflates or deflates [param polygon] by [param delta] units (pixels). If "
"[param delta] is positive, makes the polygon grow outward. If [param delta] "
"is negative, shrinks the polygon inward. Returns an array of polygons "
"because inflating/deflating may result in multiple discrete polygons. "
"Returns an empty array if [param delta] is negative and the absolute value "
"of it approximately exceeds the minimum bounding rectangle dimensions of the "
"polygon.\n"
"Each polygon's vertices will be rounded as determined by [param join_type].\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To translate the polygon's vertices specifically, multiply them "
"to a [Transform2D]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon = PackedVector2Array([Vector2(0, 0), Vector2(100, 0), "
"Vector2(100, 100), Vector2(0, 100)])\n"
"var offset = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"polygon = Transform2D(0, offset) * polygon\n"
"print(polygon) # Prints [(50.0, 50.0), (150.0, 50.0), (150.0, 150.0), (50.0, "
"150.0)]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Vector2[] polygon = [new Vector2(0, 0), new Vector2(100, 0), new "
"Vector2(100, 100), new Vector2(0, 100)];\n"
"var offset = new Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"polygon = new Transform2D(0, offset) * polygon;\n"
"GD.Print((Variant)polygon); // Prints [(50, 50), (150, 50), (150, 150), (50, "
"150)]\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Infla o desinfla [param polygon] en unitats [param delta] (píxels). Si "
"[param delta] és positiu, fa que el polígon creixi cap a l'exterior. Si "
"[param delta] és negatiu, redueix el polígon cap a dins. Retorna una matriu "
"de polígons perquè inflar o desinflar pot donar lloc a diversos polígons "
"discrets. Retorna una matriu buida si [param delta] és negatiu i el seu "
"valor absolut supera aproximadament les dimensions mínimes del rectangle "
"delimitant del polígon.\n"
"Els vèrtexs de cada polígon s'arrodoniran segons el determinat [param "
"join_type].\n"
"L'operació pot produir un polígon exterior (límit) i un polígon interior "
"(forat) que es poden distingir cridant a [method is_polygon_clockwise].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per traduir específicament els vèrtexs del polígon, "
"multipliqueu-los a [Transform2D]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polígon = PackedVector2Array ([Vector2(0, 0), Vector2(100, 0), "
"Vector2(100, 100), Vector2(0, 100)])\n"
"var offset = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"polígon = Transform2D(0, desplaçament) * polígon\n"
"imprimir (polígon) # Imprimeix [(50.0, 50.0), (150.0, 50.0), (150.0, 150.0), "
"(50.0, 150.0)]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Vector2[] polígon = [new Vector2(0, 0), new Vector2(100, 0), new "
"Vector2(100, 100), new Vector2(0, 100)];\n"
"var offset = nou Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"polígon = nou Transform2D(0, desplaçament) * polígon;\n"
"GD.Print((Variant)polígon); // Imprimeix [(50, 50), (150, 50), (150, 150), "
"(50, 150)]\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Inflates or deflates [param polyline] by [param delta] units (pixels), "
"producing polygons. If [param delta] is positive, makes the polyline grow "
"outward. Returns an array of polygons because inflating/deflating may result "
"in multiple discrete polygons. If [param delta] is negative, returns an "
"empty array.\n"
"Each polygon's vertices will be rounded as determined by [param join_type].\n"
"Each polygon's endpoints will be rounded as determined by [param end_type].\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"Infla o desinfla [param polyline] en unitats [param delta] (píxels), "
"produint polígons. Si [param delta] és positiu, fa que la polilínia creixi "
"cap a l'exterior. Retorna una matriu de polígons perquè inflar o desinflar "
"pot donar lloc a diversos polígons discrets. Si [param delta] és negatiu, "
"retorna una matriu buida.\n"
"Els vèrtexs de cada polígon s'arrodoniran segons el determinat [param "
"join_type].\n"
"Els extrems de cada polígon s'arrodoniran segons el determinat [param "
"end_type].\n"
"L'operació pot produir un polígon exterior (límit) i un polígon interior "
"(forat) que es poden distingir cridant a [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns if [param point] is inside the triangle specified by [param a], "
"[param b] and [param c]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si [param point] es troba dins del triangle especificat per [param "
"a], [param b] i [param c]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Given the 2D segment ([param segment_from], [param segment_to]), returns the "
"position on the segment (as a number between 0 and 1) at which the segment "
"hits the circle that is located at position [param circle_position] and has "
"radius [param circle_radius]. If the segment does not intersect the circle, "
"-1 is returned (this is also the case if the line extending the segment "
"would intersect the circle, but the segment does not)."
msgstr ""
"Donat el segment 2D ([param segment_from], [param segment_to]), retorna la "
"posició del segment (com a nombre entre 0 i 1) en què el segment toca el "
"cercle que es troba a la posició [param circle_position] i té un radi [param "
"circle_radius]. Si el segment no talla el cercle, es retorna -1 (això també "
"és el cas si la línia que s'estén el segment talla el cercle, però el "
"segment no ho fa)."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Checks if two line segments intersect, with line [code]a[/code] between "
"[param from_a] and [param to_a] and line [code]b[/code] between [param "
"from_b] and [param to_b]. If the line segments intersect, the point of "
"intersection is returned as a [Vector2]. If no intersection takes place, "
"[code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Triangulates the area specified by discrete set of [param points] such that "
"no point is inside the circumcircle of any resulting triangle. Returns a "
"[PackedInt32Array] where each triangle consists of three consecutive point "
"indices into [param points] (i.e. the returned array will have [code]n * 3[/"
"code] elements, with [code]n[/code] being the number of found triangles). If "
"the triangulation did not succeed, an empty [PackedInt32Array] is returned."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Triangulates the polygon specified by the points in [param polygon]. Returns "
"a [PackedInt32Array] where each triangle consists of three consecutive point "
"indices into [param polygon] (i.e. the returned array will have [code]n * 3[/"
"code] elements, with [code]n[/code] being the number of found triangles). "
"Output triangles will always be counter clockwise, and the contour will be "
"flipped if it's clockwise. If the triangulation did not succeed, an empty "
"[PackedInt32Array] is returned."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Create regions where either subject or clip polygons (or both) are filled."
msgstr ""
"Creeu regions on s'omplin els polígons de subjecte o de retall (o tots dos)."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Create regions where subject polygons are filled except where clip polygons "
"are filled."
msgstr ""
"Creeu regions on s'omplen els polígons subjectes excepte on s'omplen els "
"polígons de retall."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid "Create regions where both subject and clip polygons are filled."
msgstr "Creeu regions on s'omplin tant els polígons de subjecte com de clip."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Create regions where either subject or clip polygons are filled but not "
"where both are filled."
msgstr ""
"Creeu regions on s'omplin els polígons del subjecte o del clip però no on "
"s'omplin tots dos."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Squaring is applied uniformally at all convex edge joins at [code]1 * delta[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"La quadratura s'aplica uniformement a totes les unions de vores convexes a "
"[code]1 * delta[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"While flattened paths can never perfectly trace an arc, they are "
"approximated by a series of arc chords."
msgstr ""
"Tot i que els camins aplanats mai poden traçar perfectament un arc, "
"s'aproximen mitjançant una sèrie de cordes d'arc."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"There's a necessary limit to mitered joins since offsetting edges that join "
"at very acute angles will produce excessively long and narrow \"spikes\". "
"For any given edge join, when miter offsetting would exceed that maximum "
"distance, \"square\" joining is applied."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha un límit necessari per a les unions amb ingletes, ja que les vores "
"compensades que s'uneixen en angles molt aguts produiran \"puntes\" "
"excessivament llargues i estretes. Per a qualsevol unió de vora donada, quan "
"el desplaçament d'ingletes superi aquesta distància màxima, s'aplica la unió "
"\"quadrada\"."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Endpoints are joined using the [enum PolyJoinType] value and the path filled "
"as a polygon."
msgstr ""
"Els punts finals s'uneixen mitjançant el valor [enum PolyJoinType] i el camí "
"s'omple com a polígon."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid ""
"Endpoints are joined using the [enum PolyJoinType] value and the path filled "
"as a polyline."
msgstr ""
"Els punts finals s'uneixen mitjançant el valor [enum PolyJoinType] i el camí "
"s'omple com una polilínia."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid "Endpoints are squared off with no extension."
msgstr "Els punts finals es quadran sense extensió."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid "Endpoints are squared off and extended by [code]delta[/code] units."
msgstr ""
"Els punts finals es quadran i s'amplien amb unitats [code]delta[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry2D.xml
msgid "Endpoints are rounded off and extended by [code]delta[/code] units."
msgstr ""
"Els punts finals s'arrodoneixen i s'amplien per unitats [code]delta[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid "Provides methods for some common 3D geometric operations."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona mètodes per a algunes operacions geomètriques 3D habituals."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Provides a set of helper functions to create geometric shapes, compute "
"intersections between shapes, and process various other geometric operations "
"in 3D."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona un conjunt de funcions auxiliars per crear formes geomètriques, "
"calcular interseccions entre formes i processar altres operacions "
"geomètriques en 3D."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array with 6 [Plane]s that describe the sides of a box centered "
"at the origin. The box size is defined by [param extents], which represents "
"one (positive) corner of the box (i.e. half its actual size)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu amb 6 [Plane]s que descriuen els costats d'una caixa "
"centrada a l'origen. La mida de la caixa es defineix per [param extents], "
"que representa una cantonada (positiva) de la caixa (és a dir, la meitat de "
"la seva mida real)."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of [Plane]s closely bounding a faceted capsule centered at "
"the origin with radius [param radius] and height [param height]. The "
"parameter [param sides] defines how many planes will be generated for the "
"side part of the capsule, whereas [param lats] gives the number of "
"latitudinal steps at the bottom and top of the capsule. The parameter [param "
"axis] describes the axis along which the capsule is oriented (0 for X, 1 for "
"Y, 2 for Z)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de [Plane]s que delimiten de prop una càpsula facetada "
"centrada a l'origen amb un radi [param radius] i una alçada [param height]. "
"El paràmetre [param sides] defineix quants plans es generaran per a la part "
"lateral de la càpsula, mentre que [param lats] dóna el nombre de passos "
"latitudinals a la part inferior i superior de la càpsula. El paràmetre "
"[param axis] descriu l'eix al llarg del qual s'orienta la càpsula (0 per X, "
"1 per Y, 2 per Z)."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of [Plane]s closely bounding a faceted cylinder centered at "
"the origin with radius [param radius] and height [param height]. The "
"parameter [param sides] defines how many planes will be generated for the "
"round part of the cylinder. The parameter [param axis] describes the axis "
"along which the cylinder is oriented (0 for X, 1 for Y, 2 for Z)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de [Plane]s que delimiten de prop un cilindre facetat "
"centrat a l'origen amb un radi [param radius] i una alçada [param height]. "
"El paràmetre [param sides] defineix quants plans es generaran per a la part "
"rodona del cilindre. El paràmetre [param axis] descriu l'eix al llarg del "
"qual s'orienta el cilindre (0 per X, 1 per Y, 2 per Z)."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Clips the polygon defined by the points in [param points] against the [param "
"plane] and returns the points of the clipped polygon."
msgstr ""
"Retalla el polígon definit pels punts a [param points] contra [param plane] "
"i retorna els punts del polígon retallat."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Calculates and returns all the vertex points of a convex shape defined by an "
"array of [param planes]."
msgstr ""
"Calcula i retorna tots els punts vèrtex d'una forma convexa definida per una "
"matriu de [param planes]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the 3D point on the 3D segment ([param s1], [param s2]) that is "
"closest to [param point]. The returned point will always be inside the "
"specified segment."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt 3D del segment 3D ([param s1], [param s2]) més proper a "
"[param point]. El punt retornat sempre estarà dins del segment especificat."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the 3D point on the 3D line defined by ([param s1], [param s2]) that "
"is closest to [param point]. The returned point can be inside the segment "
"([param s1], [param s2]) or outside of it, i.e. somewhere on the line "
"extending from the segment."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt 3D de la línia 3D definida per ([param s1], [param s2]) més "
"proper a [param point]. El punt retornat pot estar dins del segment ([param "
"s1], [param s2]) o fora d'aquest, és a dir, en algun lloc de la línia que "
"s'estén des del segment."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Given the two 3D segments ([param p1], [param p2]) and ([param q1], [param "
"q2]), finds those two points on the two segments that are closest to each "
"other. Returns a [PackedVector3Array] that contains this point on ([param "
"p1], [param p2]) as well the accompanying point on ([param q1], [param q2])."
msgstr ""
"Tenint en compte els dos segments 3D ([param p1], [param p2]) i ([param q1], "
"[param q2]), troba aquests dos punts als dos segments més propers l'un a "
"l'altre. Retorna un [PackedVector3Array] que conté aquest punt a ([param "
"p1], [param p2]), així com el punt que l'acompanya a ([param q1], [param "
"q2])."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Vector3] containing weights based on how close a 3D position "
"([param point]) is to a triangle's different vertices ([param a], [param b] "
"and [param c]). This is useful for interpolating between the data of "
"different vertices in a triangle. One example use case is using this to "
"smoothly rotate over a mesh instead of relying solely on face normals.\n"
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barycentric_coordinate_system]Here is a "
"more detailed explanation of barycentric coordinates.[/url]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Vector3] que conté pesos basats en la proximitat d'una posició "
"3D ([param point]) als diferents vèrtexs d'un triangle ([param a], [param b] "
"i [param c]). Això és útil per interpolar entre les dades de diferents "
"vèrtexs en un triangle. Un exemple d'ús és utilitzar-lo per girar suaument "
"sobre una malla en lloc de dependre només de les normals facials.\n"
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barycentric_coordinate_system]Aquí hi ha "
"una explicació més detallada de les coordenades baricèntriques.[/url]"

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Tests if the 3D ray starting at [param from] with the direction of [param "
"dir] intersects the triangle specified by [param a], [param b] and [param "
"c]. If yes, returns the point of intersection as [Vector3]. If no "
"intersection takes place, returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Comprova si el raig 3D que comença a [param from] amb la direcció de [param "
"dir] talla el triangle especificat per [param a], [param b] i [param c]. En "
"cas afirmatiu, retorna el punt d'intersecció com a [Vector3]. Si no es "
"produeix cap intersecció, retorna [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Given a convex hull defined though the [Plane]s in the array [param planes], "
"tests if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects with that hull. "
"If an intersection is found, returns a [PackedVector3Array] containing the "
"point the intersection and the hull's normal. Otherwise, returns an empty "
"array."
msgstr ""
"Donat un casc convex definit mitjançant els [Plane]s a la matriu [param "
"planes], prova si el segment ([param from], [param to]) es creua amb aquest "
"casc. Si es troba una intersecció, retorna un [PackedVector3Array] que conté "
"el punt de la intersecció i la normal del casc. En cas contrari, retorna una "
"matriu buida."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Checks if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects the cylinder "
"with height [param height] that is centered at the origin and has radius "
"[param radius]. If no, returns an empty [PackedVector3Array]. If an "
"intersection takes place, the returned array contains the point of "
"intersection and the cylinder's normal at the point of intersection."
msgstr ""
"Comprova si el segment ([param from], [param to]) talla el cilindre amb "
"l'alçada [param height] que està centrat a l'origen i té un radi [param "
"radius]. Si no, retorna un [PackedVector3Array] buit. Si es produeix una "
"intersecció, la matriu retornada conté el punt d'intersecció i la normal del "
"cilindre al punt d'intersecció."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Checks if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects the sphere that "
"is located at [param sphere_position] and has radius [param sphere_radius]. "
"If no, returns an empty [PackedVector3Array]. If yes, returns a "
"[PackedVector3Array] containing the point of intersection and the sphere's "
"normal at the point of intersection."
msgstr ""
"Comprova si el segment ([param from], [param to]) talla l'esfera que es "
"troba a [param sphere_position] i té un radi [param sphere_radius]. Si no, "
"retorna un [PackedVector3Array] buit. En cas afirmatiu, retorna un "
"[PackedVector3Array] que conté el punt d'intersecció i la normal de l'esfera "
"al punt d'intersecció."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Tests if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects the triangle "
"[param a], [param b], [param c]. If yes, returns the point of intersection "
"as [Vector3]. If no intersection takes place, returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Comprova si el segment ([param from], [param to]) talla el triangle [param "
"a], [param b], [param c]. En cas afirmatiu, retorna el punt d'intersecció "
"com a [Vector3]. Si no es produeix cap intersecció, retorna [code]null[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/Geometry3D.xml
msgid ""
"Tetrahedralizes the volume specified by a discrete set of [param points] in "
"3D space, ensuring that no point lies within the circumsphere of any "
"resulting tetrahedron. The method returns a [PackedInt32Array] where each "
"tetrahedron consists of four consecutive point indices into the [param "
"points] array (resulting in an array with [code]n * 4[/code] elements, where "
"[code]n[/code] is the number of tetrahedra found). If the tetrahedralization "
"is unsuccessful, an empty [PackedInt32Array] is returned."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid "Base node for geometry-based visual instances."
msgstr "Node base per a instàncies visuals basades en geometria."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Base node for geometry-based visual instances. Shares some common "
"functionality like visibility and custom materials."
msgstr ""
"Node base per a instàncies visuals basades en geometria. Comparteix algunes "
"funcionalitats comunes, com ara la visibilitat i els materials "
"personalitzats."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid "Visibility ranges (HLOD)"
msgstr "Intervals de visibilitat (HLOD)"

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the value of a shader uniform for this instance only ([url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.html#per-instance-"
"uniforms]per-instance uniform[/url]). See also [method "
"ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] to assign a uniform on all instances "
"using the same [ShaderMaterial].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a shader uniform to be assignable on a per-instance basis, "
"it [i]must[/i] be defined with [code]instance uniform ...[/code] rather than "
"[code]uniform ...[/code] in the shader code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param name] is case-sensitive and must match the name of the "
"uniform in the code exactly (not the capitalized name in the inspector).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Per-instance shader uniforms are only available in Spatial and "
"CanvasItem shaders, but not for Fog, Sky, or Particles shaders."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid "The mode used to cast shadows from this instance."
msgstr "El mode utilitzat per projectar ombres d'aquesta instància."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the bounding box of this node with a custom one. This can be used "
"to avoid the expensive [AABB] recalculation that happens when a skeleton is "
"used with a [MeshInstance3D] or to have precise control over the "
"[MeshInstance3D]'s bounding box. To use the default AABB, set value to an "
"[AABB] with all fields set to [code]0.0[/code]. To avoid frustum culling, "
"set [member custom_aabb] to a very large AABB that covers your entire game "
"world such as [code]AABB(-10000, -10000, -10000, 20000, 20000, 20000)[/"
"code]. To disable all forms of culling (including occlusion and layer "
"culling), call [method RenderingServer.instance_set_ignore_culling] on the "
"[GeometryInstance3D]'s [RID]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The extra distance added to the GeometryInstance3D's bounding box ([AABB]) "
"to increase its cull box."
msgstr ""
"La distància addicional afegida al quadre delimitador de GeometryInstance3D "
"([AABB]) per augmentar el seu quadre de descens."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid "Use [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale]."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid "The texel density to use for lightmapping in [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"La densitat de texels que s'ha d'utilitzar per al lightmapping a "
"[LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The texel density to use for lightmapping in [LightmapGI]. Greater scale "
"values provide higher resolution in the lightmap, which can result in "
"sharper shadows for lights that have both direct and indirect light baked. "
"However, greater scale values will also increase the space taken by the mesh "
"in the lightmap texture, which increases the memory, storage, and bake time "
"requirements. When using a single mesh at different scales, consider "
"adjusting this value to keep the lightmap texel density consistent across "
"meshes.\n"
"For example, doubling [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale] doubles the lightmap "
"texture resolution for this object [i]on each axis[/i], so it will "
"[i]quadruple[/i] the texel count."
msgstr ""
"La densitat de texels que s'ha d'utilitzar per al lightmapping a "
"[LightmapGI]. Els valors d'escala més grans proporcionen una resolució més "
"alta al mapa de llum, cosa que pot donar lloc a ombres més nítides per a "
"llums que tenen llum directa i indirecta. Tanmateix, els valors d'escala més "
"grans també augmentaran l'espai ocupat per la malla a la textura del mapa de "
"llum, la qual cosa augmenta els requisits de memòria, emmagatzematge i temps "
"de cocció. Quan utilitzeu una única malla a diferents escales, considereu "
"ajustar aquest valor per mantenir la densitat de texel del mapa de llum "
"coherent entre les malles.\n"
"Per exemple, duplicar [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale] duplica la resolució "
"de textura del mapa de llum per a aquest objecte [i]en cada eix[/i], de "
"manera que [i]quadruple[/i] serà el nombre de texels."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The global illumination mode to use for the whole geometry. To avoid "
"inconsistent results, use a mode that matches the purpose of the mesh during "
"gameplay (static/dynamic).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Lights' bake mode will also affect the global illumination "
"rendering. See [member Light3D.light_bake_mode]."
msgstr ""
"El mode d'il·luminació global a utilitzar per a tota la geometria. Per "
"evitar resultats inconsistents, utilitzeu un mode que coincideixi amb el "
"propòsit de la malla durant el joc (estàtica/dinàmica).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El mode de cocció de les llums també afectarà la representació "
"global de la il·luminació. Veure [member Light3D.light_bake_mode]."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables occlusion culling for this instance. Useful "
"for gizmos that must be rendered even when occlusion culling is in use.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ignore_occlusion_culling] does not affect frustum "
"culling (which is what happens when an object is not visible given the "
"camera's angle). To avoid frustum culling, set [member custom_aabb] to a "
"very large AABB that covers your entire game world such as "
"[code]AABB(-10000, -10000, -10000, 20000, 20000, 20000)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], desactiva l'eliminació d'oclusió per a aquesta "
"instància. Útil per a aparells que s'han de representar fins i tot quan "
"s'utilitza l'eliminació d'oclusió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member ignore_occlusion_culling] no afecta l'eliminació del "
"frustum (que és el que passa quan un objecte no és visible donat l'angle de "
"la càmera). To avoid frustum culling, set [member custom_aabb] to a very "
"large AABB that covers your entire game world such as [code]AABB(-10000, "
"-10000, -10000, 20000, 20000, 20000)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Changes how quickly the mesh transitions to a lower level of detail. A value "
"of 0 will force the mesh to its lowest level of detail, a value of 1 will "
"use the default settings, and larger values will keep the mesh in a higher "
"level of detail at farther distances.\n"
"Useful for testing level of detail transitions in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Canvia la rapidesa amb què la malla passa a un nivell de detall inferior. Un "
"valor de 0 forçarà la malla al seu nivell de detall més baix, un valor d'1 "
"utilitzarà la configuració predeterminada i els valors més grans mantindran "
"la malla en un nivell de detall més alt a distàncies més llunyanes.\n"
"Útil per provar transicions de nivell de detall a l'editor."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The material overlay for the whole geometry.\n"
"If a material is assigned to this property, it will be rendered on top of "
"any other active material for all the surfaces."
msgstr ""
"La superposició de material per a tota la geometria.\n"
"Si s'assigna un material a aquesta propietat, es representarà a sobre de "
"qualsevol altre material actiu per a totes les superfícies."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The material override for the whole geometry.\n"
"If a material is assigned to this property, it will be used instead of any "
"material set in any material slot of the mesh."
msgstr ""
"La substitució del material per a tota la geometria.\n"
"Si s'assigna un material a aquesta propietat, s'utilitzarà en lloc de "
"qualsevol material establert a qualsevol ranura de material de la malla."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The transparency applied to the whole geometry (as a multiplier of the "
"materials' existing transparency). [code]0.0[/code] is fully opaque, while "
"[code]1.0[/code] is fully transparent. Values greater than [code]0.0[/code] "
"(exclusive) will force the geometry's materials to go through the "
"transparent pipeline, which is slower to render and can exhibit rendering "
"issues due to incorrect transparency sorting. However, unlike using a "
"transparent material, setting [member transparency] to a value greater than "
"[code]0.0[/code] (exclusive) will [i]not[/i] disable shadow rendering.\n"
"In spatial shaders, [code]1.0 - transparency[/code] is set as the default "
"value of the [code]ALPHA[/code] built-in.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member transparency] is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code], so this property cannot be used to make transparent "
"materials more opaque than they originally are.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method. When "
"using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering method, [member transparency] is "
"ignored and is considered as always being [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Starting distance from which the GeometryInstance3D will be visible, taking "
"[member visibility_range_begin_margin] into account as well. The default "
"value of 0 is used to disable the range check."
msgstr ""
"Distància inicial des de la qual serà visible la GeometryInstance3D, tenint "
"en compte també [member visibility_range_begin_margin]. El valor "
"predeterminat de 0 s'utilitza per desactivar la comprovació d'interval."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Margin for the [member visibility_range_begin] threshold. The "
"GeometryInstance3D will only change its visibility state when it goes over "
"or under the [member visibility_range_begin] threshold by this amount.\n"
"If [member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], this acts as a hysteresis distance. If "
"[member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] "
"or [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], this acts as a fade "
"transition distance and must be set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code] "
"for the effect to be noticeable."
msgstr ""
"Marge per al llindar [member visibility_range_begin]. GeometryInstance3D "
"només canviarà el seu estat de visibilitat quan superi o per sota del "
"llindar [member visibility_range_begin] en aquesta quantitat.\n"
"Si [member visibility_range_fade_mode] és [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], això actua com una distància d'histèresi. "
"Si [member visibility_range_fade_mode] és [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] o [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], "
"això actua com a distància de transició d'esvaïment i s'ha d'establir en un "
"valor superior a [code]@0.0[/code] perquè l'efecte sigui perceptible."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Distance from which the GeometryInstance3D will be hidden, taking [member "
"visibility_range_end_margin] into account as well. The default value of 0 is "
"used to disable the range check."
msgstr ""
"Distància a partir de la qual s'amagarà GeometryInstance3D, tenint en compte "
"també [member visibility_range_end_margin]. El valor predeterminat de 0 "
"s'utilitza per desactivar la comprovació d'interval."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Margin for the [member visibility_range_end] threshold. The "
"GeometryInstance3D will only change its visibility state when it goes over "
"or under the [member visibility_range_end] threshold by this amount.\n"
"If [member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], this acts as a hysteresis distance. If "
"[member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] "
"or [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], this acts as a fade "
"transition distance and must be set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code] "
"for the effect to be noticeable."
msgstr ""
"Marge per al llindar [member visibility_range_end]. GeometryInstance3D només "
"canviarà el seu estat de visibilitat quan superi o per sota del llindar "
"[member visibility_range_end] en aquesta quantitat.\n"
"Si [member visibility_range_fade_mode] és [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], això actua com una distància d'histèresi. "
"Si [member visibility_range_fade_mode] és [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] o [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], "
"això actua com a distància de transició d'esvaïment i s'ha d'establir en un "
"valor superior a [code]@0.0[/code] perquè l'efecte sigui perceptible."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Controls which instances will be faded when approaching the limits of the "
"visibility range."
msgstr ""
"Controla quines instàncies s'esvairan quan s'acosta als límits del rang de "
"visibilitat."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Will not cast any shadows. Use this to improve performance for small "
"geometry that is unlikely to cast noticeable shadows (such as debris)."
msgstr ""
"No projectarà cap ombra. Utilitzeu-ho per millorar el rendiment de la "
"geometria petita que és poc probable que projectin ombres notables (com ara "
"restes)."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Will cast shadows from all visible faces in the GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"Will take culling into account, so faces not being rendered will not be "
"taken into account when shadow casting."
msgstr ""
"Projectarà ombres de totes les cares visibles a GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"Tindrà en compte l'eliminació, de manera que les cares que no es representen "
"no es tindran en compte a l'hora de projectar ombres."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Will cast shadows from all visible faces in the GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"Will not take culling into account, so all faces will be taken into account "
"when shadow casting."
msgstr ""
"Projectarà ombres de totes les cares visibles a GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"No es tindrà en compte l'eliminació, de manera que es tindran en compte "
"totes les cares a l'hora de projectar ombres."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Will only show the shadows casted from this object.\n"
"In other words, the actual mesh will not be visible, only the shadows casted "
"from the mesh will be."
msgstr ""
"Només mostrarà les ombres projectades per aquest objecte.\n"
"En altres paraules, la malla real no serà visible, només les ombres "
"projectades des de la malla."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Disabled global illumination mode. Use for dynamic objects that do not "
"contribute to global illumination (such as characters). When using [VoxelGI] "
"and SDFGI, the geometry will [i]receive[/i] indirect lighting and "
"reflections but the geometry will not be considered in GI baking."
msgstr ""
"Mode d'il·luminació global desactivat. S'utilitza per a objectes dinàmics "
"que no contribueixen a la il·luminació global (com ara personatges). Quan "
"utilitzeu [VoxelGI] i SDFGI, la geometria [i]rebrà[/i] il·luminació "
"indirecta i reflexos, però la geometria no es tindrà en compte a la cocció "
"GI."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Baked global illumination mode. Use for static objects that contribute to "
"global illumination (such as level geometry). This GI mode is effective when "
"using [VoxelGI], SDFGI and [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"Mode d'il·luminació global al forn. S'utilitza per a objectes estàtics que "
"contribueixen a la il·luminació global (com ara la geometria de nivell). "
"Aquest mode GI és efectiu quan s'utilitza [VoxelGI], SDFGI i [LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Dynamic global illumination mode. Use for dynamic objects that contribute to "
"global illumination. This GI mode is only effective when using [VoxelGI], "
"but it has a higher performance impact than [constant GI_MODE_STATIC]. When "
"using other GI methods, this will act the same as [constant "
"GI_MODE_DISABLED]. When using [LightmapGI], the object will receive indirect "
"lighting using lightmap probes instead of using the baked lightmap texture."
msgstr ""
"Mode d'il·luminació global dinàmica. S'utilitza per a objectes dinàmics que "
"contribueixen a la il·luminació global. Aquest mode GI només és efectiu quan "
"s'utilitza [VoxelGI], però té un impacte de rendiment més elevat que "
"[constant GI_MODE_STATIC]. Quan utilitzeu altres mètodes GI, actuarà de la "
"mateixa manera que [constant GI_MODE_DISABLED]. Quan utilitzeu [LightmapGI], "
"l'objecte rebrà il·luminació indirecta mitjançant sondes de mapes de llum en "
"lloc d'utilitzar la textura del mapa de llum al forn."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid "The standard texel density for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"La densitat de texel estàndard per al mapatge de llum amb [LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies texel density by 2× for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]. To ensure "
"consistency in texel density, use this when scaling a mesh by a factor "
"between 1.5 and 3.0."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica la densitat de texels per 2x per al lightmapping amb "
"[LightmapGI]. Per garantir la consistència en la densitat de texels, "
"utilitzeu-ho quan escaleu una malla per un factor entre 1,5 i 3,0."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies texel density by 4× for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]. To ensure "
"consistency in texel density, use this when scaling a mesh by a factor "
"between 3.0 and 6.0."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica la densitat de texels per 4x per al lightmapping amb "
"[LightmapGI]. Per garantir la consistència en la densitat de texels, "
"utilitzeu-ho quan escaleu una malla per un factor entre 3,0 i 6,0."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies texel density by 8× for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]. To ensure "
"consistency in texel density, use this when scaling a mesh by a factor "
"greater than 6.0."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica la densitat de texels per 8× per al lightmapping amb "
"[LightmapGI]. Per garantir la consistència en la densitat de texels, "
"utilitzeu-ho quan escaleu una malla en un factor superior a 6,0."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum LightmapScale] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum LightmapScale]."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Will not fade itself nor its visibility dependencies, hysteresis will be "
"used instead. This is the fastest approach to manual LOD, but it can result "
"in noticeable LOD transitions depending on how the LOD meshes are authored. "
"See [member visibility_range_begin] and [member Node3D.visibility_parent] "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"No s'esvairà ni les seves dependències de visibilitat, s'utilitzarà la "
"histèresi. Aquest és l'enfocament més ràpid del LOD manual, però pot "
"provocar transicions de LOD notables depenent de com s'elaborin les malles "
"LOD. Consulteu [member visibility_range_begin] i [member "
"Node3D.visibility_parent] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Will fade-out itself when reaching the limits of its own visibility range. "
"This is slower than [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], but it can "
"provide smoother transitions. The fading range is determined by [member "
"visibility_range_begin_margin] and [member visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method. When "
"using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering method, this mode acts like "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] but with hysteresis disabled."
msgstr ""
"S'esvairà en arribar als límits del seu propi rang de visibilitat. Això és "
"més lent que [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], però pot "
"proporcionar transicions més suaus. El rang d'esvaïment està determinat per "
"[member visibility_range_begin_margin] i [member "
"visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només s'admet quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació "
"Forward+. Quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació mòbil o de "
"compatibilitat, aquest mode actua com [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] però amb la histèresi desactivada."

#: doc/classes/GeometryInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Will fade-in its visibility dependencies (see [member "
"Node3D.visibility_parent]) when reaching the limits of its own visibility "
"range. This is slower than [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], but it "
"can provide smoother transitions. The fading range is determined by [member "
"visibility_range_begin_margin] and [member visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method. When "
"using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering method, this mode acts like "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] but with hysteresis disabled."
msgstr ""
"S'esvairà les seves dependències de visibilitat (vegeu [member "
"Node3D.visibility_parent]) quan arribi als límits del seu propi rang de "
"visibilitat. Això és més lent que [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], "
"però pot proporcionar transicions més suaus. El rang d'esvaïment està "
"determinat per [member visibility_range_begin_margin] i [member "
"visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només s'admet quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació "
"Forward+. Quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació mòbil o de "
"compatibilitat, aquest mode actua com [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] però amb la histèresi desactivada."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Represents a glTF accessor."
msgstr "Representa un accessor glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"GLTFAccessor is a data structure representing a glTF [code]accessor[/code] "
"that would be found in the [code]\"accessors\"[/code] array. A buffer is a "
"blob of binary data. A buffer view is a slice of a buffer. An accessor is a "
"typed interpretation of the data in a buffer view.\n"
"Most custom data stored in glTF does not need accessors, only buffer views "
"(see [GLTFBufferView]). Accessors are for more advanced use cases such as "
"interleaved mesh data encoded for the GPU."
msgstr ""
"GLTFAccessor és una estructura de dades que representa un glTF "
"[code]accessor[/code] que es trobaria a la matriu [code]\"accessors\"[/"
"code]. Un buffer és una gota de dades binàries. Una vista de memòria "
"intermèdia és una porció d'una memòria intermèdia. An accessor is a typed "
"interpretation of the data in a buffer view.\n"
"Most custom data stored in glTF does not need accessors, only buffer views "
"(see [GLTFBufferView]). Accessors are for more advanced use cases such as "
"interleaved mesh data encoded for the GPU."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid "Buffers, BufferViews, and Accessors in Khronos glTF specification"
msgstr "Buffers, BufferViews i Accessors a l'especificació de Khronos glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Creates a new GLTFAccessor instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància de GLTFAccessor analitzant el [Dictionary] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Serializes this GLTFAccessor instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "Serialitza aquesta instància GLTFAccessor en un [Dictionary]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "The glTF accessor type, as an enum."
msgstr "El tipus d'accés glTF, com a enumeració."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the buffer view this accessor is referencing. If [code]-1[/"
"code], this accessor is not referencing any buffer view."
msgstr ""
"L'índex de la vista de memòria intermèdia a què fa referència aquest "
"descriptor d'accés. Si [code]-1[/code], aquest descriptor no fa referència a "
"cap vista de memòria intermèdia."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "The offset relative to the start of the buffer view in bytes."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament relatiu a l'inici de la vista de memòria intermèdia en bytes."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"The glTF component type as an enum. See [enum GLTFComponentType] for "
"possible values. Within the core glTF specification, a value of 5125 or "
"\"UNSIGNED_INT\" must not be used for any accessor that is not referenced by "
"mesh.primitive.indices."
msgstr ""
"El tipus de component glTF com a enumeració. Vegeu [enum GLTFComponentType] "
"per veure els possibles valors. Dins de l'especificació bàsica de glTF, no "
"s'ha d'utilitzar un valor de 5125 o \"UNSIGNED_INT\" per a cap descriptor "
"que no sigui referenciat per mesh.primitive.indices."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "The number of elements referenced by this accessor."
msgstr "El nombre d'elements referenciats per aquest accessor."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Maximum value of each component in this accessor."
msgstr "Valor màxim de cada component d'aquest accessor."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Minimum value of each component in this accessor."
msgstr "Valor mínim de cada component d'aquest accessori."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Specifies whether integer data values are normalized before usage."
msgstr ""
"Especifica si els valors de dades enters es normalitzen abans d'utilitzar-"
"los."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Number of deviating accessor values stored in the sparse array."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de valors d'accessoris desviats emmagatzemats a la matriu dispersa."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the buffer view with sparse indices. The referenced buffer view "
"MUST NOT have its target or byteStride properties defined. The buffer view "
"and the optional byteOffset MUST be aligned to the componentType byte length."
msgstr ""
"L'índex de la vista del buffer amb índexs escassos. La vista de memòria "
"intermèdia a la qual es fa referència NO HA de tenir les propietats objectiu "
"o byteStride definides. La vista de memòria intermèdia i el byteOffset "
"opcional HAN d'estar alineats amb la longitud de bytes componentType."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"The indices component data type as an enum. Possible values are 5121 for "
"\"UNSIGNED_BYTE\", 5123 for \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\", and 5125 for "
"\"UNSIGNED_INT\"."
msgstr ""
"El tipus de dades del component dels índexs com a enumeració. Els valors "
"possibles són 5121 per a \"UNSIGNED_BYTE\", 5123 per a \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\" i "
"5125 per a \"UNSIGNED_INT\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the bufferView with sparse values. The referenced buffer view "
"MUST NOT have its target or byteStride properties defined."
msgstr ""
"L'índex del bufferView amb valors escassos. La vista de memòria intermèdia a "
"la qual es fa referència NO HA de tenir les propietats objectiu o byteStride "
"definides."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "The offset relative to the start of the bufferView in bytes."
msgstr "El desplaçament relatiu a l'inici del bufferView en bytes."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid "Use [member accessor_type] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [member accessor_type]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"The glTF accessor type, as an [int]. Possible values are [code]0[/code] for "
"\"SCALAR\", [code]1[/code] for \"VEC2\", [code]2[/code] for \"VEC3\", "
"[code]3[/code] for \"VEC4\", [code]4[/code] for \"MAT2\", [code]5[/code] for "
"\"MAT3\", and [code]6[/code] for \"MAT4\"."
msgstr ""
"El tipus d'accés glTF, com a [int]. Els valors possibles són [code]@0[/code] "
"per a \"SCALAR\", [code]1[/code] per a \"VEC2\", [code]@2[/code] per a "
"\"VEC3\", [code]3[/code] per a \"VEC4\", [code]4[/code] per a \"MAT2\", "
"[code]@5[/code] per a \"MAT3\" i [code]6[/code] per a \"MAT4\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Accessor type \"SCALAR\". For the glTF object model, this can be used to map "
"to a single float, int, or bool value, or a float array."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'accessori \"ESCALAR\". Per al model d'objectes glTF, això es pot "
"utilitzar per assignar un sol valor flotant, int o bool, o una matriu "
"flotant."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Accessor type \"VEC2\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float2\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of two floats."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'accessori \"VEC2\". Per al model d'objectes glTF, això s'assigna a "
"\"float2\", representat al glTF JSON com una matriu de dos flotants."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Accessor type \"VEC3\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float3\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of three floats."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'accessori \"VEC3\". Per al model d'objectes glTF, això s'assigna a "
"\"float3\", representat al glTF JSON com una matriu de tres flotants."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Accessor type \"VEC4\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float4\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of four floats."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'accessori \"VEC4\". Per al model d'objectes glTF, això s'assigna a "
"\"float4\", representat al glTF JSON com una matriu de quatre flotants."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Accessor type \"MAT2\". For the glTF object model, this maps to "
"\"float2x2\", represented in the glTF JSON as an array of four floats."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'accessori \"MAT2\". Per al model d'objectes glTF, s'assigna a "
"\"float2x2\", representat al JSON glTF com una matriu de quatre flotants."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Accessor type \"MAT3\". For the glTF object model, this maps to "
"\"float3x3\", represented in the glTF JSON as an array of nine floats."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'accessori \"MAT3\". Per al model d'objectes glTF, això s'assigna a "
"\"float3x3\", representat al glTF JSON com una matriu de nou flotants."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Accessor type \"MAT4\". For the glTF object model, this maps to "
"\"float4x4\", represented in the glTF JSON as an array of sixteen floats."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'accessori \"MAT4\". Per al model d'objectes glTF, això s'assigna a "
"\"float4x4\", representat al glTF JSON com una matriu de setze flotants."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"NONE\". This is not a valid component type, and is used to "
"indicate that the component type is not set."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"NONE\". Aquest no és un tipus de component vàlid i "
"s'utilitza per indicar que el tipus de component no està definit."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"BYTE\". The value is [code]0x1400[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 1-byte or 8-bit signed integers. "
"This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"BYTE\". El valor és [code]0x1400[/code] que prové "
"d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters signats "
"d'1 byte o 8 bits. Aquesta és una part bàsica de l'especificació glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_BYTE\". The value is [code]0x1401[/code] which "
"comes from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 1-byte or 8-bit unsigned "
"integers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"UNSIGNED_BYTE\". El valor és [code]0x1401[/code] que "
"prové d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters "
"sense signe d'1 byte o 8 bits. Aquesta és una part bàsica de l'especificació "
"glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"SHORT\". The value is [code]0x1402[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 2-byte or 16-bit signed integers. "
"This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"SHORT\". El valor és [code]0x1402[/code] que prové "
"d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters signats "
"de 2 o 16 bits. Aquesta és una part bàsica de l'especificació glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\". The value is [code]0x1403[/code] which "
"comes from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 2-byte or 16-bit "
"unsigned integers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\". El valor és [code]0x1403[/code] que "
"prové d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters "
"sense signe de 2 o 16 bits. Aquesta és una part bàsica de l'especificació "
"glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"INT\". The value is [code]0x1404[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 4-byte or 32-bit signed integers. "
"This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be supported "
"by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"INT\". El valor és [code]0x1404[/code] que prové "
"d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters signats "
"de 4 o 32 bits. Això NO és una part bàsica de l'especificació de glTF i és "
"possible que no sigui compatible amb tots els importadors de glTF. Pot ser "
"utilitzat per algunes extensions com [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_INT\". The value is [code]0x1405[/code] which "
"comes from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 4-byte or 32-bit "
"unsigned integers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"UNSIGNED_INT\". El valor és [code]0x1405[/code] que "
"prové d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters "
"sense signe de 4 o 32 bits. Aquesta és una part bàsica de l'especificació "
"glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"FLOAT\". The value is [code]0x1406[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 4-byte or 32-bit floating-point "
"numbers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"FLOAT\". El valor és [code]0x1406[/code] que prové "
"d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en números de coma "
"flotant de 4 o 32 bits. Aquesta és una part bàsica de l'especificació glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"DOUBLE\". The value is [code]0x140A[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 8-byte or 64-bit floating-point "
"numbers. This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be "
"supported by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"DOUBLE\". El valor és [code]0x140A[/code] que prové "
"d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en números de coma "
"flotant de 8 o 64 bits. Això NO és una part bàsica de l'especificació de "
"glTF i és possible que no sigui compatible amb tots els importadors de glTF. "
"Pot ser utilitzat per algunes extensions com [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"HALF_FLOAT\". The value is [code]0x140B[/code] which comes "
"from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 2-byte or 16-bit floating-"
"point numbers. This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may "
"not be supported by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions "
"including [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"HALF_FLOAT\". El valor és [code]0x140B[/code] que prové "
"d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en números de coma "
"flotant de 2 o 16 bits. Això NO és una part bàsica de l'especificació de "
"glTF i és possible que no sigui compatible amb tots els importadors de glTF. "
"Pot ser utilitzat per algunes extensions com [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"LONG\". The value is [code]0x140E[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 8-byte or 64-bit signed integers. "
"This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be supported "
"by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"LONG\". El valor és [code]0x140E[/code] que prové "
"d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters signats "
"de 8 o 64 bits. Això NO és una part bàsica de l'especificació de glTF i és "
"possible que no sigui compatible amb tots els importadors de glTF. Pot ser "
"utilitzat per algunes extensions com [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAccessor.xml
msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_LONG\". The value is [code]0x140F[/code] which "
"comes from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 8-byte or 64-bit "
"unsigned integers. This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and "
"may not be supported by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions "
"including [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de component \"UNSIGNED_LONG\". El valor és [code]0x140F[/code] que "
"prové d'OpenGL. Això indica que les dades s'emmagatzemen en nombres enters "
"sense signe de 8 o 64 bits. Això NO és una part bàsica de l'especificació de "
"glTF i és possible que no sigui compatible amb tots els importadors de glTF. "
"Pot ser utilitzat per algunes extensions com [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAnimation.xml
msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFAnimation] instance. This can be "
"used to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which "
"is important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obté dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància [GLTFAnimation]. "
"Això es pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per node a les classes "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè són sense estat.\n"
"L'argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no cal que "
"coincideixi amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF) i el valor de retorn "
"pot ser qualsevol cosa que establiu. Si no s'ha establert res, el valor de "
"retorn és [code]null[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAnimation.xml
msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFAnimation] instance. This can be "
"used to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which "
"is important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can "
"be anything you want."
msgstr ""
"Estableix dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància "
"[GLTFAnimation]. Això es pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per "
"node a les classes [GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè "
"són sense estat.\n"
"El primer argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no ha de "
"coincidir amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF), i el segon argument pot "
"ser el que vulgueu."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFAnimation.xml
msgid "The original name of the animation."
msgstr "El nom original de l'animació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid "Represents a glTF buffer view."
msgstr "Representa una vista de búfer glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"GLTFBufferView is a data structure representing a glTF [code]bufferView[/"
"code] that would be found in the [code]\"bufferViews\"[/code] array. A "
"buffer is a blob of binary data. A buffer view is a slice of a buffer that "
"can be used to identify and extract data from the buffer.\n"
"Most custom uses of buffers only need to use the [member buffer], [member "
"byte_length], and [member byte_offset]. The [member byte_stride] and [member "
"indices] properties are for more advanced use cases such as interleaved mesh "
"data encoded for the GPU."
msgstr ""
"GLTFBufferView és una estructura de dades que representa una glTF "
"[code]bufferView[/code] que es trobaria a la matriu [code]\"bufferViews\"[/"
"code]. Un buffer és una gota de dades binàries. Una vista de memòria "
"intermèdia és una part d'una memòria intermèdia que es pot utilitzar per "
"identificar i extreure dades de la memòria intermèdia.\n"
"La majoria dels usos personalitzats dels buffers només necessiten utilitzar "
"[member buffer], [member byte_length] i [member byte_offset]. Les propietats "
"[member byte_stride] i [member indices] són per a casos d'ús més avançats, "
"com ara dades de malla entrellaçada codificades per a la GPU."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFBufferView instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància de GLTFBufferView analitzant el [Dictionary] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"Loads the buffer view data from the buffer referenced by this buffer view in "
"the given [GLTFState]. Interleaved data with a byte stride is not yet "
"supported by this method. The data is returned as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"Carrega les dades de la vista de memòria intermèdia de la memòria intermèdia "
"a què fa referència aquesta vista de memòria intermèdia a la [GLTFState] "
"donada. Les dades entrellaçades amb un pas de bytes encara no són "
"compatibles amb aquest mètode. Les dades es retornen com a [PackedByteArray]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid "Serializes this GLTFBufferView instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "Serialitza aquesta instància de GLTFBufferView en un [Dictionary]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the buffer this buffer view is referencing. If [code]-1[/code], "
"this buffer view is not referencing any buffer."
msgstr ""
"L'índex de la memòria intermèdia al qual fa referència aquesta vista de "
"memòria intermèdia. Si [code]-1[/code], aquesta vista de memòria intermèdia "
"no fa referència a cap memòria intermèdia."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"The length, in bytes, of this buffer view. If [code]0[/code], this buffer "
"view is empty."
msgstr ""
"La longitud, en bytes, d'aquesta vista de memòria intermèdia. Si [code]0[/"
"code], aquesta vista de memòria intermèdia està buida."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"The offset, in bytes, from the start of the buffer to the start of this "
"buffer view."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament, en bytes, des de l'inici de la memòria intermèdia fins a "
"l'inici d'aquesta vista de memòria intermèdia."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"The stride, in bytes, between interleaved data. If [code]-1[/code], this "
"buffer view is not interleaved."
msgstr ""
"El pas, en bytes, entre les dades entrellaçades. Si [code]-1[/code], aquesta "
"vista de memòria intermèdia no està intercalada."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"[code]true[/code] if the GLTFBufferView's OpenGL GPU buffer type is an "
"[code]ELEMENT_ARRAY_BUFFER[/code] used for vertex indices (integer constant "
"[code]34963[/code]). [code]false[/code] if the buffer type is any other "
"value. See [url=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Tutorials/blob/master/"
"gltfTutorial/gltfTutorial_005_BuffersBufferViewsAccessors.md]Buffers, "
"BufferViews, and Accessors[/url] for possible values. This property is set "
"on import and used on export."
msgstr ""
"[code]true[/code] si el tipus de memòria intermèdia de GPU OpenGL de "
"GLTFBufferView és un [code]ELEMENT_ARRAY_BUFFER[/code] utilitzat per als "
"índexs de vèrtex (constante enter [code]34963[/code]). [code]false[/code] si "
"el tipus de memòria intermèdia és qualsevol altre valor. Vegeu [url=https://"
"github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Tutorials/blob/master/gltfTutorial/"
"gltfTutorial_005_BuffersBufferViewsAccessors.md]Buffers, BufferViews i "
"Accessors[/url] per a possibles valors. Aquesta propietat s'estableix a la "
"importació i s'utilitza a l'exportació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFBufferView.xml
msgid ""
"[code]true[/code] if the GLTFBufferView's OpenGL GPU buffer type is an "
"[code]ARRAY_BUFFER[/code] used for vertex attributes (integer constant "
"[code]34962[/code]). [code]false[/code] if the buffer type is any other "
"value. See [url=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Tutorials/blob/master/"
"gltfTutorial/gltfTutorial_005_BuffersBufferViewsAccessors.md]Buffers, "
"BufferViews, and Accessors[/url] for possible values. This property is set "
"on import and used on export."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "Represents a glTF camera."
msgstr "Representa una càmera glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "Represents a camera as defined by the base glTF spec."
msgstr ""
"Representa una càmera tal com la defineix l'especificació de base glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "glTF camera detailed specification"
msgstr "Especificació detallada de la càmera glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "glTF camera spec and example file"
msgstr "Especificació de la càmera glTF i fitxer d'exemple"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "Creates a new GLTFCamera instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància de GLTFCamera analitzant el [Dictionary] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "Create a new GLTFCamera instance from the given Godot [Camera3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Creeu una nova instància GLTFCamera des del node Godot [Camera3D] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "Serializes this GLTFCamera instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "Serialitza aquesta instància de GLTFCamera en una [Dictionary]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid "Converts this GLTFCamera instance into a Godot [Camera3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Converteix aquesta instància de GLTFCamera en un node Godot [Camera3D]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid ""
"The distance to the far culling boundary for this camera relative to its "
"local Z axis, in meters. This maps to glTF's [code]zfar[/code] property."
msgstr ""
"La distància fins al límit d'eliminació llunyà d'aquesta càmera en relació "
"amb el seu eix Z local, en metres. Això s'assigna a la propietat [code]zfar[/"
"code] de glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid ""
"The distance to the near culling boundary for this camera relative to its "
"local Z axis, in meters. This maps to glTF's [code]znear[/code] property."
msgstr ""
"La distància fins al límit d'eliminació proper d'aquesta càmera en relació "
"amb el seu eix Z local, en metres. Això s'associa a la propietat "
"[code]znear[/code] de glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid ""
"The FOV of the camera. This class and glTF define the camera FOV in radians, "
"while Godot uses degrees. This maps to glTF's [code]yfov[/code] property. "
"This value is only used for perspective cameras, when [member perspective] "
"is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El FOV de la càmera. Aquesta classe i glTF defineixen el FOV de la càmera en "
"radians, mentre que Godot utilitza graus. Això s'assigna a la propietat "
"[code]yfov[/code] de glTF. Aquest valor només s'utilitza per a càmeres de "
"perspectiva, quan [member perspective] és [code]true[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera is in perspective mode. Otherwise, the "
"camera is in orthographic/orthogonal mode. This maps to glTF's camera "
"[code]type[/code] property. See [member Camera3D.projection] and the glTF "
"spec for more information."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la càmera està en mode de perspectiva. En cas "
"contrari, la càmera està en mode ortogràfic/ortogonal. Això s'assigna a la "
"propietat [code]type[/code] de la càmera de glTF. Consulteu [member "
"Camera3D.projection] i l'especificació glTF per obtenir més informació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFCamera.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the camera. This class and glTF define the camera size magnitude "
"as a radius in meters, while Godot defines it as a diameter in meters. This "
"maps to glTF's [code]ymag[/code] property. This value is only used for "
"orthographic/orthogonal cameras, when [member perspective] is [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"La mida de la càmera. Aquesta classe i glTF defineixen la magnitud de la "
"mida de la càmera com un radi en metres, mentre que Godot la defineix com un "
"diàmetre en metres. Això s'assigna a la propietat [code]ymag[/code] de glTF. "
"Aquest valor només s'utilitza per a càmeres ortogràfiques/ortogonals, quan "
"[member perspective] és [code]false[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid "Class for importing and exporting glTF files in and out of Godot."
msgstr "Classe per importar i exportar fitxers glTF dins i fora de Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"GLTFDocument supports reading data from a glTF file, buffer, or Godot scene. "
"This data can then be written to the filesystem, buffer, or used to create a "
"Godot scene.\n"
"All of the data in a glTF scene is stored in the [GLTFState] class. "
"GLTFDocument processes state objects, but does not contain any scene data "
"itself. GLTFDocument has member variables to store export configuration "
"settings such as the image format, but is otherwise stateless. Multiple "
"scenes can be processed with the same settings using the same GLTFDocument "
"object and different [GLTFState] objects.\n"
"GLTFDocument can be extended with arbitrary functionality by extending the "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] class and registering it with GLTFDocument via "
"[method register_gltf_document_extension]. This allows for custom data to be "
"imported and exported."
msgstr ""
"GLTFDocument admet la lectura de dades d'un fitxer glTF, memòria intermèdia "
"o escena Godot. Aquestes dades es poden escriure al sistema de fitxers, a la "
"memòria intermèdia o utilitzar-se per crear una escena Godot.\n"
"Totes les dades d'una escena glTF s'emmagatzemen a la classe [GLTFState]. "
"GLTFDocument processa objectes d'estat, però no conté cap dada d'escena en "
"si. GLTFDocument té variables membres per emmagatzemar els paràmetres de "
"configuració d'exportació, com ara el format d'imatge, però d'altra manera "
"és sense estat. Es poden processar diverses escenes amb la mateixa "
"configuració utilitzant el mateix objecte GLTFDocument i diferents objectes "
"[GLTFState].\n"
"GLTFDocument es pot ampliar amb una funcionalitat arbitrària ampliant la "
"classe [GLTFDocumentExtension] i registrant-la amb GLTFDocument mitjançant "
"[method register_gltf_document_extension]. Això permet importar i exportar "
"dades personalitzades."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid "glTF 'What the duck?' guide"
msgstr "glTF \"Què l'ànec?\" guia"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid "Khronos glTF specification"
msgstr "Especificació Khronos glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Takes a [PackedByteArray] defining a glTF and imports the data to the given "
"[GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param base_path] tells [method append_from_buffer] where "
"to find dependencies and can be empty."
msgstr ""
"Pren un [PackedByteArray] que defineix un glTF i importa les dades a "
"l'objecte [GLTFState] donat mitjançant el paràmetre [param state].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param base_path] indica a [method append_from_buffer] on "
"trobar dependències i pot estar buit."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Takes a path to a glTF file and imports the data at that file path to the "
"given [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param base_path] tells [method append_from_file] where to "
"find dependencies and can be empty."
msgstr ""
"Pren un camí a un fitxer glTF i importa les dades d'aquest camí a l'objecte "
"[GLTFState] donat mitjançant el paràmetre [param state].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param base_path] indica a [method append_from_file] on trobar "
"dependències i pot estar buit."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Takes a Godot Engine scene node and exports it and its descendants to the "
"given [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter."
msgstr ""
"Pren un node d'escena del motor Godot i l'exporta i els seus descendents a "
"l'objecte [GLTFState] donat mitjançant el paràmetre [param state]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Determines a mapping between the given Godot [param node_path] and the "
"corresponding glTF Object Model JSON pointer(s) in the generated glTF file. "
"The details of this mapping are returned in a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] "
"object. Additional mappings can be supplied via the [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._import_object_model_property] callback method."
msgstr ""
"Determina una assignació entre el Godot [param node_path] donat i els "
"punters JSON del model d'objectes glTF corresponents al fitxer glTF generat. "
"Els detalls d'aquesta assignació es retornen en un objecte "
"[GLTFObjectModelProperty]. Es poden proporcionar mapes addicionals "
"mitjançant el mètode de devolució de trucada [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._import_object_model_property]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Takes a [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter and returns a "
"glTF [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"Pren un objecte [GLTFState] mitjançant el paràmetre [param state] i retorna "
"un glTF [PackedByteArray]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Takes a [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter and returns a "
"Godot Engine scene node.\n"
"The [param bake_fps] parameter overrides the bake_fps in [param state]."
msgstr ""
"Pren un objecte [GLTFState] a través del paràmetre [param state] i retorna "
"un node d'escena del motor Godot.\n"
"El paràmetre [param bake_fps] anul·la els bake_fps a [param state]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of all support glTF extensions, including extensions "
"supported directly by the engine, and extensions supported by user plugins "
"registering [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this method is run before a GLTFDocumentExtension is "
"registered, its extensions won't be included in the list. Be sure to only "
"run this method after all extensions are registered. If you run this when "
"the engine starts, consider waiting a frame before calling this method to "
"ensure all extensions are registered."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una llista de totes les extensions glTF compatibles, incloses les "
"extensions admeses directament pel motor i les extensions compatibles amb "
"els connectors d'usuari que registren classes [GLTFDocumentExtension].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si aquest mètode s'executa abans que es registri una "
"GLTFDocumentExtension, les seves extensions no s'inclouran a la llista. "
"Assegureu-vos d'executar aquest mètode només després d'haver registrat totes "
"les extensions. Si l'executeu quan s'engega el motor, considereu esperar un "
"fotograma abans de trucar a aquest mètode per assegurar-vos que totes les "
"extensions estiguin registrades."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Determines a mapping between the given glTF Object Model [param "
"json_pointer] and the corresponding Godot node path(s) in the generated "
"Godot scene. The details of this mapping are returned in a "
"[GLTFObjectModelProperty] object. Additional mappings can be supplied via "
"the [method GLTFDocumentExtension._export_object_model_property] callback "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Determina un mapeig entre el model d'objectes glTF donat [param "
"json_pointer] i els camins de node Godot corresponents a l'escena Godot "
"generada. Els detalls d'aquesta assignació es retornen en un objecte "
"[GLTFObjectModelProperty]. Es poden proporcionar mapes addicionals "
"mitjançant el mètode de devolució de trucada [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_object_model_property]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the given [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance with GLTFDocument. If "
"[param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], this extension will be run "
"first. Otherwise, it will be run last.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Like GLTFDocument itself, all GLTFDocumentExtension classes "
"must be stateless in order to function properly. If you need to store data, "
"use the [code]set_additional_data[/code] and [code]get_additional_data[/"
"code] methods in [GLTFState] or [GLTFNode]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid "Unregisters the given [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance."
msgstr "Cancel·la el registre de la instància [GLTFDocumentExtension] donada."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Takes a [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter and writes a "
"glTF file to the filesystem.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The extension of the glTF file determines if it is a .glb "
"binary file or a .gltf text file."
msgstr ""
"Pren un objecte [GLTFState] mitjançant el paràmetre [param state] i escriu "
"un fitxer glTF al sistema de fitxers.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'extensió del fitxer glTF determina si és un fitxer "
"binari .glb o un fitxer de text .gltf."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"The user-friendly name of the fallback image format. This is used when "
"exporting the glTF file, including writing to a file and writing to a byte "
"array.\n"
"This property may only be one of \"None\", \"PNG\", or \"JPEG\", and is only "
"used when the [member image_format] is not one of \"None\", \"PNG\", or "
"\"JPEG\". If having multiple extension image formats is desired, that can be "
"done using a [GLTFDocumentExtension] class - this property only covers the "
"use case of providing a base glTF fallback image when using a custom image "
"format."
msgstr ""
"El nom fàcil d'utilitzar del format d'imatge alternativa. S'utilitza quan "
"s'exporta el fitxer glTF, inclosa l'escriptura en un fitxer i l'escriptura "
"en una matriu de bytes.\n"
"Aquesta propietat només pot ser una de \"Cap\", \"PNG\" o \"JPEG\" i només "
"s'utilitza quan [member image_format] no és una de \"Cap\", \"PNG\" o "
"\"JPEG\". Si es desitja tenir diversos formats d'imatge d'extensió, això es "
"pot fer mitjançant una classe [GLTFDocumentExtension]: aquesta propietat "
"només cobreix el cas d'ús de proporcionar una imatge alternativa glTF de "
"base quan s'utilitza un format d'imatge personalitzat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"The quality of the fallback image, if any. For PNG files, this downscales "
"the image on both dimensions by this factor. For JPEG files, this is the "
"lossy quality of the image. A low value is recommended, since including "
"multiple high quality images in a glTF file defeats the file size gains of "
"using a more efficient image format."
msgstr ""
"La qualitat de la imatge alternativa, si n'hi ha. Per als fitxers PNG, això "
"redueix la imatge en ambdues dimensions per aquest factor. Per als fitxers "
"JPEG, aquesta és la pèrdua de qualitat de la imatge. Es recomana un valor "
"baix, ja que incloure diverses imatges d'alta qualitat en un fitxer glTF "
"elimina els guanys de mida del fitxer d'utilitzar un format d'imatge més "
"eficient."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"The user-friendly name of the export image format. This is used when "
"exporting the glTF file, including writing to a file and writing to a byte "
"array.\n"
"By default, Godot allows the following options: \"None\", \"PNG\", \"JPEG\", "
"\"Lossless WebP\", and \"Lossy WebP\". Support for more image formats can be "
"added in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes. A single extension class can "
"provide multiple options for the specific format to use, or even an option "
"that uses multiple formats at once."
msgstr ""
"El nom fàcil d'utilitzar del format d'imatge d'exportació. S'utilitza quan "
"s'exporta el fitxer glTF, inclosa l'escriptura en un fitxer i l'escriptura "
"en una matriu de bytes.\n"
"De manera predeterminada, Godot permet les opcions següents: \"Cap\", "
"\"PNG\", \"JPEG\", \"WebP sense pèrdues\" i \"WebP amb pèrdua\". Es pot "
"afegir suport per a més formats d'imatge a les classes "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension]. Una sola classe d'extensió pot proporcionar "
"diverses opcions per al format específic que s'utilitza, o fins i tot una "
"opció que utilitza diversos formats alhora."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"If [member image_format] is a lossy image format, this determines the lossy "
"quality of the image. On a range of [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code], "
"where [code]0.0[/code] is the lowest quality and [code]1.0[/code] is the "
"highest quality. A lossy quality of [code]1.0[/code] is not the same as "
"lossless."
msgstr ""
"Si [member image_format] és un format d'imatge amb pèrdues, això determina "
"la qualitat amb pèrdues de la imatge. En un rang de [code]0.0[/code] a "
"[code]1.0[/code], on [code]0.0@[/code] és la més baixa qualitat i [code]1.0[/"
"code] és de la màxima qualitat. Una qualitat amb pèrdues de [code]1.0[/code] "
"no és el mateix que sense pèrdues."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"How to process the root node during export. The default and recommended "
"value is [constant ROOT_NODE_MODE_SINGLE_ROOT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of how the glTF file is exported, when importing, "
"the root node type and name can be overridden in the scene import settings "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"Com processar el node arrel durant l'exportació. El valor predeterminat i "
"recomanat és [constant ROOT_NODE_MODE_SINGLE_ROOT].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Independentment de com s'exporti el fitxer glTF, quan "
"s'importa, el tipus i el nom del node arrel es poden substituir a la "
"pestanya de configuració d'importació d'escena."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"How to handle texture maps during import. The default and recommended value "
"is [constant TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_REMAP_TO_STANDARD_MATERIAL], which "
"automatically remaps from glTF's flexible texture map system to the more "
"specific texture map slots in Godot's [StandardMaterial3D] class. "
"Alternatively, [constant TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_DO_NOT_REMAP] can be used to "
"preserve the original texture maps from the glTF file, which may be "
"desirable if using the glTF file with custom shaders, but may not display "
"correctly with Godot's built-in materials."
msgstr ""
"Com gestionar els mapes de textures durant la importació. El valor "
"predeterminat i recomanat és [constant "
"TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_REMAP_TO_STANDARD_MATERIAL], que reasigna automàticament "
"des del sistema flexible de mapes de textures de glTF a les ranures de mapes "
"de textures més específiques de la classe [StandardMaterial3D] de Godot. "
"Alternativament, [constant TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_DO_NOT_REMAP] es pot utilitzar "
"per preservar els mapes de textures originals del fitxer glTF, cosa que pot "
"ser desitjable si s'utilitza el fitxer glTF amb ombrejats personalitzats, "
"però pot ser que no es mostri correctament amb els materials integrats de "
"Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"How to deal with node visibility during export. This setting does nothing if "
"all nodes are visible. The default and recommended value is [constant "
"VISIBILITY_MODE_INCLUDE_REQUIRED], which uses the [code]KHR_node_visibility[/"
"code] extension."
msgstr ""
"Com tractar la visibilitat del node durant l'exportació. Aquesta "
"configuració no fa res si tots els nodes són visibles. El valor "
"predeterminat i recomanat és [constant VISIBILITY_MODE_INCLUDE_REQUIRED], "
"que utilitza l'extensió [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Treat the Godot scene's root node as the root node of the glTF file, and "
"mark it as the single root node via the [code]GODOT_single_root[/code] glTF "
"extension. This will be parsed the same as [constant "
"ROOT_NODE_MODE_KEEP_ROOT] if the implementation does not support "
"[code]GODOT_single_root[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tracteu el node arrel de l'escena Godot com el node arrel del fitxer glTF i "
"marqueu-lo com a node arrel únic mitjançant l'extensió glTF "
"[code]GODOT_single_root[/code]. S'analitzarà igual que [constant "
"ROOT_NODE_MODE_KEEP_ROOT] si la implementació no admet "
"[code]GODOT_single_root[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Treat the Godot scene's root node as the root node of the glTF file, but do "
"not mark it as anything special. An extra root node will be generated when "
"importing into Godot. This uses only vanilla glTF features. This is "
"equivalent to the behavior in Godot 4.1 and earlier."
msgstr ""
"Tracteu el node arrel de l'escena Godot com el node arrel del fitxer glTF, "
"però no el marqueu com a res especial. Es generarà un node arrel addicional "
"en importar a Godot. Això només utilitza funcions glTF de vainilla. Això és "
"equivalent al comportament de Godot 4.1 i anteriors."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Treat the Godot scene's root node as the name of the glTF scene, and add all "
"of its children as root nodes of the glTF file. This uses only vanilla glTF "
"features. This avoids an extra root node, but only the name of the Godot "
"scene's root node will be preserved, as it will not be saved as a node."
msgstr ""
"Tracteu el node arrel de l'escena Godot com el nom de l'escena glTF i afegiu "
"tots els seus fills com a nodes arrel del fitxer glTF. Això només utilitza "
"funcions glTF de vainilla. Això evita un node arrel addicional, però només "
"es conservarà el nom del node arrel de l'escena Godot, ja que no es desarà "
"com a node."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Import the texture maps in the glTF file as they are, without trying to fit "
"them into specific texture slots suitable for Godot's built-in materials. "
"This may be desirable if using the glTF file with custom shaders, but may "
"not display correctly with Godot's built-in materials. This is equivalent to "
"the behavior in Godot 4.6 and earlier."
msgstr ""
"Importeu els mapes de textura al fitxer glTF tal com són, sense intentar "
"encaixar-los en ranures de textura específiques adequades per als materials "
"integrats de Godot. Això pot ser desitjable si s'utilitza el fitxer glTF amb "
"ombrejats personalitzats, però pot ser que no es mostri correctament amb els "
"materials integrats de Godot. Això és equivalent al comportament de Godot "
"4.6 i anteriors."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Import the texture maps in the glTF file remapped to the most suitable "
"texture slots based on Godot's [StandardMaterial3D] class. This is the "
"default behavior."
msgstr ""
"Importeu els mapes de textures al fitxer glTF reasignat a les ranures de "
"textures més adequades basades en la classe [StandardMaterial3D] de Godot. "
"Aquest és el comportament predeterminat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"If the scene contains any non-visible nodes, include them, mark them as non-"
"visible with [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], and require that importers "
"respect their non-visibility. Downside: If the importer does not support "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], the file cannot be imported."
msgstr ""
"Si l'escena conté nodes no visibles, incloeu-los, marqueu-los com a no "
"visibles amb [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code] i exigir als importadors que "
"en respectin la no visibilitat. Desavantatge: si l'importador no admet "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], el fitxer no es pot importar."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"If the scene contains any non-visible nodes, include them, mark them as non-"
"visible with [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], and do not impose any "
"requirements on importers. Downside: If the importer does not support "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], invisible objects will be visible."
msgstr ""
"Si l'escena conté nodes no visibles, incloeu-los, marqueu-los com a no "
"visibles amb [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code] i no imposeu cap requisit als "
"importadors. Desavantatge: si l'importador no admet "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], els objectes invisibles seran visibles."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"If the scene contains any non-visible nodes, do not include them in the "
"export. This is the same as the behavior in Godot 4.4 and earlier. Downside: "
"Invisible nodes will not exist in the exported file."
msgstr ""
"Si l'escena conté nodes no visibles, no els inclogueu a l'exportació. Aquest "
"és el mateix que el comportament de Godot 4.4 i anteriors. Desavantatge: els "
"nodes invisibles no existiran al fitxer exportat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid "[GLTFDocument] extension class."
msgstr "[GLTFDocument] classe d'extensió."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Extends the functionality of the [GLTFDocument] class by allowing you to run "
"arbitrary code at various stages of glTF import or export.\n"
"To use, make a new class extending GLTFDocumentExtension, override any "
"methods you need, make an instance of your class, and register it using "
"[method GLTFDocument.register_gltf_document_extension].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All GLTFDocumentExtension classes are duplicated when beginning "
"the import or export process. Except for configuration values, these classes "
"must be stateless in order to function properly. If you need to store data, "
"use the [code]set_additional_data[/code] and [code]get_additional_data[/"
"code] methods in [GLTFState] or [GLTFNode]."
msgstr ""
"Amplia la funcionalitat de la classe [GLTFDocument] permetent executar codi "
"arbitrari en diverses etapes d'importació o exportació de glTF.\n"
"Per utilitzar-lo, feu una nova classe que estenga GLTFDocumentExtension, "
"substituïu qualsevol mètode que necessiteu, feu una instància de la vostra "
"classe i registreu-la amb [method "
"GLTFDocument.register_gltf_document_extension].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Totes les classes GLTFDocumentExtension es dupliquen quan "
"s'inicia el procés d'importació o exportació. Excepte els valors de "
"configuració, aquestes classes han de ser sense estat per funcionar "
"correctament. Si necessiteu emmagatzemar dades, utilitzeu els mètodes "
"[code]set_additional_data[/code] i [code]get_additional_data[/code] a "
"[GLTFState] o [GLTFNode]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_export_preflight] and before [method _export_post_convert].\n"
"Runs when converting the data from a Godot scene node. This method can be "
"used to process the Godot scene node data into a format that can be used by "
"[method _export_node]."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_export_preflight] i abans de [method _export_post_convert].\n"
"S'executa quan es converteixen les dades d'un node d'escena Godot. Aquest "
"mètode es pot utilitzar per processar les dades del node de l'escena Godot "
"en un format que pugui utilitzar [method _export_node]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Runs prior to the export process. This method is run before [method "
"_export_preflight] when exporting a scene from the editor, or it may not be "
"run at all in other situations.\n"
"Unlike the rest of the export methods, this does not run when calling a "
"[GLTFDocument]'s export methods in sequence with everything else, but rather "
"runs before that entire process occurs, allowing configuration to occur "
"beforehand, potentially minutes or hours in advance of [method "
"_export_preflight]. This allows extensions to decide which properties to "
"show in the editor export settings dialog based on the contents of the "
"scene, hiding any settings that are not relevant for that scene. The [param "
"root_node] parameter may be [code]null[/code], in which case all properties "
"should be shown."
msgstr ""
"S'executa abans del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa abans de "
"[method _export_preflight] quan s'exporta una escena des de l'editor, o és "
"possible que no s'executi en altres situacions.\n"
"A diferència de la resta de mètodes d'exportació, això no s'executa quan es "
"crida als mètodes d'exportació d'un [GLTFDocument] en seqüència amb tota la "
"resta, sinó que s'executa abans que es produeixi tot el procés, permetent "
"que la configuració es produeixi abans, possiblement minuts o hores abans de "
"[method _export_preflight]. Això permet a les extensions decidir quines "
"propietats mostrar al diàleg de configuració d'exportació de l'editor en "
"funció del contingut de l'escena, amagant qualsevol configuració que no "
"sigui rellevant per a aquesta escena. El paràmetre [param root_node] pot ser "
"[code]null[/code], en aquest cas s'han de mostrar totes les propietats."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] and before [method _export_post]. If this "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] is used for exporting images, this runs after "
"[method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"This method can be used to modify the final JSON of each node. Data should "
"be primarily stored in [param gltf_node] prior to serializing the JSON, but "
"the original Godot [Node] is also provided if available. [param node] may be "
"[code]null[/code] if not available, such as when exporting glTF data not "
"generated from a Godot scene."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] i abans de [method _export_post]. Si aquest "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] s'utilitza per exportar imatges, s'executa després "
"de [method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per modificar el JSON final de cada node. Les "
"dades s'han d'emmagatzemar principalment a [param gltf_node] abans de "
"serialitzar el JSON, però també es proporciona el Godot original [Node] si "
"està disponible. [param node] pot ser [code]null[/code] si no està "
"disponible, com ara quan s'exporten dades glTF no generades a partir d'una "
"escena Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. Allows GLTFDocumentExtension classes to provide "
"mappings for properties of nodes in the Godot scene tree, to JSON pointers "
"to glTF properties, as defined by the glTF object model.\n"
"Returns a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] instance that defines how the property "
"should be mapped. If your extension can't handle the property, return "
"[code]null[/code] or an instance without any JSON pointers (see [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.has_json_pointers]). You should use [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.set_types] to set the types, and set the JSON "
"pointer(s) using the [member GLTFObjectModelProperty.json_pointers] "
"property.\n"
"The parameters provide context for the property, including the NodePath, the "
"Godot node, the GLTF node index, and the target object. The [param "
"target_object] will be equal to [param godot_node] if no sub-object can be "
"found, otherwise it will point to a sub-object. For example, if the path is "
"[code]^\"A/B/C/MeshInstance3D:mesh:surface_0/material:emission_intensity\"[/"
"code], it will get the node, then the mesh, and then the material, so [param "
"target_object] will be the [Material] resource, and [param target_depth] "
"will be 2 because 2 levels were traversed to get to the target."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run last, after all other parts "
"of the export process.\n"
"This method can be used to modify the final JSON of the generated glTF file."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa l'últim, després de "
"totes les altres parts del procés d'exportació.\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per modificar el JSON final del fitxer glTF "
"generat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_convert_scene_node] and before [method _export_preserialize].\n"
"This method can be used to modify the converted node data structures before "
"serialization with any additional data from the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_convert_scene_node] i abans de [method _export_preserialize].\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per modificar les estructures de dades del "
"node convertides abans de la serialització amb qualsevol dada addicional de "
"l'arbre de l'escena."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run first, before all other parts "
"of the export process.\n"
"The return value is used to determine if this [GLTFDocumentExtension] "
"instance should be used for exporting a given glTF file. If [constant OK], "
"the export will use this [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance. If not "
"overridden, [constant OK] is returned."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa primer, abans de totes "
"les altres parts del procés d'exportació.\n"
"El valor de retorn s'utilitza per determinar si aquesta instància "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] s'ha d'utilitzar per exportar un fitxer glTF "
"determinat. Si [constant OK], l'exportació utilitzarà aquesta instància "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension]. Si no es substitueix, es retorna [constant OK]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_export_post_convert] and before [method _get_saveable_image_formats].\n"
"This method can be used to alter the state before performing serialization. "
"It runs every time when generating a buffer with [method "
"GLTFDocument.generate_buffer] or writing to the file system with [method "
"GLTFDocument.write_to_filesystem]."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_export_post_convert] i abans de [method _get_saveable_image_formats].\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per alterar l'estat abans de realitzar la "
"serialització. S'executa cada cop quan es genera un buffer amb [method "
"GLTFDocument.generate_buffer] o s'escriu al sistema de fitxers amb [method "
"GLTFDocument.write_to_filesystem]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_import_pre_generate] and before [method _import_node].\n"
"Runs when generating a Godot scene node from a GLTFNode. The returned node "
"will be added to the scene tree. Multiple nodes can be generated in this "
"step if they are added as a child of the returned node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param scene_parent] parameter may be [code]null[/code] if "
"this is the single root node."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_import_pre_generate] i abans de [method _import_node].\n"
"S'executa quan es genera un node d'escena Godot des d'un GLTFNode. El node "
"retornat s'afegirà a l'arbre d'escenes. En aquest pas es poden generar "
"diversos nodes si s'afegeixen com a fills del node retornat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El paràmetre [param scene_parent] pot ser [code]null[/code] si "
"aquest és el node arrel únic."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the file extension to use for saving image data into, for example, "
"[code]\".png\"[/code]. If defined, when this extension is used to handle "
"images, and the images are saved to a separate file, the image bytes will be "
"copied to a file with this extension. If this is set, there should be a "
"[ResourceImporter] class able to import the file. If not defined or empty, "
"Godot will save the image into a PNG file."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'extensió de fitxer que cal utilitzar per desar dades d'imatge a, "
"per exemple, [code]\".png\"[/code]. Si es defineix, quan aquesta extensió "
"s'utilitza per gestionar imatges i les imatges es desen en un fitxer "
"independent, els bytes d'imatge es copiaran en un fitxer amb aquesta "
"extensió. Si s'estableix això, hauria d'haver una classe [ResourceImporter] "
"capaç d'importar el fitxer. Si no està definit o buit, Godot desarà la "
"imatge en un fitxer PNG."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_convert_scene_node] and before [method _export_node].\n"
"Returns an array of the image formats that can be saved/exported by this "
"extension. This extension will only be selected as the image exporter if the "
"[GLTFDocument]'s [member GLTFDocument.image_format] is in this array. If "
"this [GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as the image exporter, one of the "
"[method _save_image_at_path] or [method _serialize_image_to_bytes] methods "
"will run next, otherwise [method _export_node] will run next. If the format "
"name contains [code]\"Lossy\"[/code], the lossy quality slider will be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_convert_scene_node] i abans de [method _export_node].\n"
"Retorna una matriu dels formats d'imatge que es poden desar/exportar amb "
"aquesta extensió. Aquesta extensió només es seleccionarà com a exportador "
"d'imatges si [GLTFDocument] de [member GLTFDocument.image_format] es troba "
"en aquesta matriu. Si se selecciona aquest [GLTFDocumentExtension] com a "
"exportador d'imatges, un dels mètodes [method _save_image_at_path] o [method "
"_serialize_image_to_bytes] s'executarà a continuació, en cas contrari, "
"[method _export_node] s'executarà a continuació. Si el nom del format conté "
"[code]\"Lossy\"[/code], es mostrarà el control lliscant de qualitat amb "
"pèrdua."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_import_preflight] and before [method _parse_node_extensions].\n"
"Returns an array of the glTF extensions supported by this "
"GLTFDocumentExtension class. This is used to validate if a glTF file with "
"required extensions can be loaded."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_import_preflight] i abans de [method _parse_node_extensions].\n"
"Retorna una matriu de les extensions glTF admeses per aquesta classe "
"GLTFDocumentExtension. S'utilitza per validar si es pot carregar un fitxer "
"glTF amb les extensions necessàries."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_generate_scene_node] and before [method _import_post].\n"
"This method can be used to make modifications to each of the generated Godot "
"scene nodes."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_generate_scene_node] i abans de [method _import_post].\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per fer modificacions a cadascun dels nodes "
"d'escena Godot generats."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. Allows GLTFDocumentExtension classes to provide "
"mappings for JSON pointers to glTF properties, as defined by the glTF object "
"model, to properties of nodes in the Godot scene tree.\n"
"Returns a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] instance that defines how the property "
"should be mapped. If your extension can't handle the property, return "
"[code]null[/code] or an instance without any NodePaths (see [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.has_node_paths]). You should use [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.set_types] to set the types, and [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.append_path_to_property] function is useful for most "
"simple cases.\n"
"In many cases, [param partial_paths] will contain the start of a path, "
"allowing the extension to complete the path. For example, for [code]/nodes/3/"
"extensions/MY_ext/prop[/code], Godot will pass you a NodePath that leads to "
"node 3, so the GLTFDocumentExtension class only needs to resolve the last "
"[code]MY_ext/prop[/code] part of the path. In this example, the extension "
"should check [code]split.size() > 4 and split[0] == \"nodes\" and split[2] "
"== \"extensions\" and split[3] == \"MY_ext\"[/code] at the start of the "
"function to check if this JSON pointer applies to it, then it can use [param "
"partial_paths] and handle [code]split[4][/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run last, after all other parts "
"of the import process.\n"
"This method can be used to modify the final Godot scene generated by the "
"import process."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa l'últim, després de "
"totes les altres parts del procés d'importació.\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per modificar l'escena final de Godot "
"generada pel procés d'importació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_parse_node_extensions] and before [method _import_pre_generate].\n"
"This method can be used to modify any of the data imported so far after "
"parsing each node, but before generating the scene or any of its nodes."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_parse_node_extensions] i abans de [method _import_pre_generate].\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per modificar qualsevol de les dades "
"importades fins ara després d'analitzar cada node, però abans de generar "
"l'escena o qualsevol dels seus nodes."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_import_post_parse] and before [method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"This method can be used to modify or read from any of the processed data "
"structures, before generating the nodes and then running the final per-node "
"import step."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_import_post_parse] i abans de [method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per modificar o llegir des de qualsevol de "
"les estructures de dades processades, abans de generar els nodes i després "
"executar el pas final d'importació per node."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run first, before all other parts "
"of the import process.\n"
"The return value is used to determine if this [GLTFDocumentExtension] "
"instance should be used for importing a given glTF file. If [constant OK], "
"the import will use this [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance. If not "
"overridden, [constant OK] is returned."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa primer, abans de totes "
"les altres parts del procés d'importació.\n"
"El valor de retorn s'utilitza per determinar si aquesta instància "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] s'ha d'utilitzar per importar un fitxer glTF "
"determinat. Si [constant OK], la importació utilitzarà aquesta instància "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension]. Si no es substitueix, es retorna [constant OK]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_parse_node_extensions] and before [method _parse_texture_json].\n"
"Runs when parsing image data from a glTF file. The data could be sourced "
"from a separate file, a URI, or a buffer, and then is passed as a byte array."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_parse_node_extensions] i abans de [method _parse_texture_json].\n"
"S'executa quan s'analitza dades d'imatge d'un fitxer glTF. Les dades es "
"poden obtenir d'un fitxer separat, un URI o un buffer i després es "
"transmeten com a matriu de bytes."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_supported_extensions] and before [method _import_post_parse].\n"
"Runs when parsing the node extensions of a GLTFNode. This method can be used "
"to process the extension JSON data into a format that can be used by [method "
"_generate_scene_node]. The return value should be a member of the [enum "
"Error] enum."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_get_supported_extensions] i abans de [method _import_post_parse].\n"
"S'executa en analitzar les extensions de node d'un GLTFNode. Aquest mètode "
"es pot utilitzar per processar les dades JSON de l'extensió en un format que "
"pugui utilitzar [method _generate_scene_node]. El valor de retorn hauria de "
"ser un membre de la enumeració [enum Error]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_parse_image_data] and before [method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"Runs when parsing the texture JSON from the glTF textures array. This can be "
"used to set the source image index to use as the texture."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'importació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_parse_image_data] i abans de [method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"S'executa quan s'analitza la textura JSON de la matriu de textures glTF. "
"Això es pot utilitzar per establir l'índex d'imatge font que s'utilitzarà "
"com a textura."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] and before [method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"This method is run when saving images separately from the glTF file. When "
"images are embedded, [method _serialize_image_to_bytes] runs instead. Note "
"that these methods only run when this [GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as "
"the image exporter."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] i abans de [method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"Aquest mètode s'executa en desar imatges per separat del fitxer glTF. Quan "
"s'incorporen imatges, s'executa [method _serialize_image_to_bytes]. Tingueu "
"en compte que aquests mètodes només s'executen quan aquest "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] està seleccionat com a exportador d'imatges."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] and before [method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"This method is run when embedding images in the glTF file. When images are "
"saved separately, [method _save_image_at_path] runs instead. Note that these "
"methods only run when this [GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as the image "
"exporter.\n"
"This method must set the image MIME type in the [param image_dict] with the "
"[code]\"mimeType\"[/code] key. For example, for a PNG image, it would be set "
"to [code]\"image/png\"[/code]. The return value must be a [PackedByteArray] "
"containing the image data."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] i abans de [method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"Aquest mètode s'executa quan s'incrusten imatges al fitxer glTF. Quan les "
"imatges es desen per separat, s'executa [method _save_image_at_path]. "
"Tingueu en compte que aquests mètodes només s'executen quan aquest "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] està seleccionat com a exportador d'imatges.\n"
"Aquest mètode ha d'establir el tipus MIME de la imatge a [param image_dict] "
"amb la clau [code]\"mimeType\"[/code]. Per exemple, per a una imatge PNG, "
"s'establiria en [code]\"image/png\"[/code]. El valor de retorn ha de ser un "
"[PackedByteArray] que contingui les dades de la imatge."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocumentExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_save_image_at_path] or [method _serialize_image_to_bytes], and before "
"[method _export_node]. Note that this method only runs when this "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as the image exporter.\n"
"This method can be used to set up the extensions for the texture JSON by "
"editing [param texture_json]. The extension must also be added as used "
"extension with [method GLTFState.add_used_extension], be sure to set "
"[code]required[/code] to [code]true[/code] if you are not providing a "
"fallback."
msgstr ""
"Part del procés d'exportació. Aquest mètode s'executa després de [method "
"_save_image_at_path] o [method _serialize_image_to_bytes] i abans de [method "
"_export_node]. Tingueu en compte que aquest mètode només s'executa quan "
"aquest [GLTFDocumentExtension] està seleccionat com a exportador d'imatges.\n"
"Aquest mètode es pot utilitzar per configurar les extensions per a la "
"textura JSON editant [param texture_json]. L'extensió també s'ha d'afegir "
"com a extensió utilitzada amb [method GLTFState.add_used_extension], "
"assegureu-vos d'establir [code]required[/code] a [code]true[/code] si no "
"proporcioneu una alternativa."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid "Represents a glTF light."
msgstr "Representa una llum glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a light as defined by the [code]KHR_lights_punctual[/code] glTF "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"Representa una llum tal com la defineix l'extensió glTF "
"[code]KHR_lights_punctual[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid "KHR_lights_punctual glTF extension spec"
msgstr "Especificació de l'extensió glTF KHR_lights_punctual"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid "Creates a new GLTFLight instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr "Crea una nova instància de GLTFLight analitzant el [Dictionary] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid "Create a new GLTFLight instance from the given Godot [Light3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Creeu una nova instància de GLTFLight a partir del node Godot [Light3D] "
"donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid "Serializes this GLTFLight instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "Serialitza aquesta instància de GLTFLight en un [Dictionary]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid "Converts this GLTFLight instance into a Godot [Light3D] node."
msgstr "Converteix aquesta instància de GLTFLight en un node Godot [Light3D]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid ""
"The [Color] of the light in linear space. Defaults to white. A black color "
"causes the light to have no effect.\n"
"This value is linear to match glTF, but will be converted to nonlinear sRGB "
"when creating a Godot [Light3D] node upon import, or converted to linear "
"when exporting a Godot [Light3D] to glTF."
msgstr ""
"El [Color] de la llum en l'espai lineal. El blanc és per defecte. Un color "
"negre fa que la llum no tingui efecte.\n"
"Aquest valor és lineal per coincidir amb glTF, però es convertirà en sRGB no "
"lineal quan es creï un node Godot [Light3D] en importar-lo, o es convertirà "
"en lineal quan s'exporti un Godot [Light3D] a glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid ""
"The inner angle of the cone in a spotlight. Must be less than or equal to "
"the outer cone angle.\n"
"Within this angle, the light is at full brightness. Between the inner and "
"outer cone angles, there is a transition from full brightness to zero "
"brightness. When creating a Godot [SpotLight3D], the ratio between the inner "
"and outer cone angles is used to calculate the attenuation of the light."
msgstr ""
"L'angle interior del con en un focus. Ha de ser inferior o igual a l'angle "
"del con exterior.\n"
"Dins d'aquest angle, la llum està a plena brillantor. Entre els angles del "
"con interior i exterior, hi ha una transició de la brillantor total a la "
"brillantor zero. Quan es crea un Godot [SpotLight3D], la relació entre els "
"angles del con interior i exterior s'utilitza per calcular l'atenuació de la "
"llum."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the light. This is expressed in candelas (lumens per "
"steradian) for point and spot lights, and lux (lumens per m²) for "
"directional lights. When creating a Godot light, this value is converted to "
"a unitless multiplier."
msgstr ""
"La intensitat de la llum. Això s'expressa en candelas (lúmens per "
"esteradian) per a llums puntuals i puntuals, i lux (lúmens per m²) per a "
"llums direccionals. Quan es crea una llum Godot, aquest valor es converteix "
"en un multiplicador sense unitats."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid ""
"The type of the light. The values accepted by Godot are \"point\", \"spot\", "
"and \"directional\", which correspond to Godot's [OmniLight3D], "
"[SpotLight3D], and [DirectionalLight3D] respectively."
msgstr ""
"El tipus de llum. Els valors acceptats per Godot són \"punt\", \"punt\" i "
"\"direccional\", que corresponen a [OmniLight3D], [SpotLight3D] i "
"[DirectionalLight3D] de Godot respectivament."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid ""
"The outer angle of the cone in a spotlight. Must be greater than or equal to "
"the inner angle.\n"
"At this angle, the light drops off to zero brightness. Between the inner and "
"outer cone angles, there is a transition from full brightness to zero "
"brightness. If this angle is a half turn, then the spotlight emits in all "
"directions. When creating a Godot [SpotLight3D], the outer cone angle is "
"used as the angle of the spotlight."
msgstr ""
"L'angle exterior del con en un focus. Ha de ser major o igual a l'angle "
"interior.\n"
"En aquest angle, la llum baixa fins a una brillantor zero. Entre els angles "
"del con interior i exterior, hi ha una transició de la brillantor total a la "
"brillantor zero. Si aquest angle és de mitja volta, el focus emet en totes "
"direccions. Quan es crea un Godot [SpotLight3D], l'angle del con exterior "
"s'utilitza com a angle del focus."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFLight.xml
msgid ""
"The range of the light, beyond which the light has no effect. glTF lights "
"with no range defined behave like physical lights (which have infinite "
"range). When creating a Godot light, the range is clamped to [code]4096.0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"El rang de la llum, més enllà del qual la llum no té cap efecte. Les llums "
"glTF sense un rang definit es comporten com les llums físiques (que tenen un "
"rang infinit). Quan es crea una llum Godot, el rang es fixa a [code]4096.0[/"
"code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid "GLTFMesh represents a glTF mesh."
msgstr "GLTFMesh representa una malla glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid ""
"GLTFMesh handles 3D mesh data imported from glTF files. It includes "
"properties for blend channels, blend weights, instance materials, and the "
"mesh itself."
msgstr ""
"GLTFMesh gestiona les dades de malla 3D importades dels fitxers glTF. Inclou "
"propietats per a canals de barreja, pesos de barreja, materials d'instància "
"i la malla en si."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFMesh] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obté dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància [GLTFMesh]. Això es "
"pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per node a les classes "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè són sense estat.\n"
"L'argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no cal que "
"coincideixi amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF) i el valor de retorn "
"pot ser qualsevol cosa que establiu. Si no s'ha establert res, el valor de "
"retorn és [code]null[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFMesh] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can "
"be anything you want."
msgstr ""
"Estableix dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància [GLTFMesh]. "
"Això es pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per node a les classes "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè són sense estat.\n"
"El primer argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no ha de "
"coincidir amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF), i el segon argument pot "
"ser el que vulgueu."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid "An array of floats representing the blend weights of the mesh."
msgstr ""
"Una matriu de flotadors que representen els pesos de barreja de la malla."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid ""
"An array of Material objects representing the materials used in the mesh."
msgstr ""
"Una matriu d'objectes Material que representen els materials utilitzats a la "
"malla."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid "The [ImporterMesh] object representing the mesh itself."
msgstr "L'objecte [ImporterMesh] que representa la pròpia malla."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFMesh.xml
msgid "The original name of the mesh."
msgstr "El nom original de la malla."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid "glTF node class."
msgstr "classe de node glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a glTF node. glTF nodes may have names, transforms, children "
"(other glTF nodes), and more specialized properties (represented by their "
"own classes).\n"
"glTF nodes generally exist inside of [GLTFState] which represents all data "
"of a glTF file. Most of GLTFNode's properties are indices of other data in "
"the glTF file. You can extend a glTF node with additional properties by "
"using [method get_additional_data] and [method set_additional_data]."
msgstr ""
"Representa un node glTF. Els nodes glTF poden tenir noms, transformacions, "
"fills (altres nodes glTF) i propietats més especialitzades (representades "
"per les seves pròpies classes).\n"
"Els nodes glTF generalment existeixen dins de [GLTFState] que representa "
"totes les dades d'un fitxer glTF. La majoria de les propietats de GLTFNode "
"són índexs d'altres dades del fitxer glTF. Podeu ampliar un node glTF amb "
"propietats addicionals utilitzant [method get_additional_data] i [method "
"set_additional_data]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid "glTF scene and node spec"
msgstr "especificació d'escena i node glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid "Appends the given child node index to the [member children] array."
msgstr "Afegeix l'índex de node fill indicat a la matriu [member children]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFNode] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obté dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància [GLTFNode]. Això es "
"pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per node a les classes "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè són sense estat.\n"
"L'argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no cal que "
"coincideixi amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF) i el valor de retorn "
"pot ser qualsevol cosa que establiu. Si no s'ha establert res, el valor de "
"retorn és [code]null[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [NodePath] that this GLTF node will have in the Godot scene tree "
"after being imported. This is useful when importing glTF object model "
"pointers with [GLTFObjectModelProperty], for handling extensions such as "
"[code]KHR_animation_pointer[/code] or [code]KHR_interactivity[/code].\n"
"If [param handle_skeletons] is [code]true[/code], paths to skeleton bone "
"glTF nodes will be resolved properly. For example, a path that would be "
"[code]^\"A/B/C/Bone1/Bone2/Bone3\"[/code] if [code]false[/code] will become "
"[code]^\"A/B/C/Skeleton3D:Bone3\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [NodePath] que aquest node GLTF tindrà a l'arbre d'escena Godot "
"després d'haver estat importat. Això és útil quan s'importen punters de "
"model d'objectes glTF amb [GLTFObjectModelProperty], per gestionar "
"extensions com ara [code]KHR_animation_pointer[/code] o "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code].\n"
"Si [param handle_skeletons] és [code]true[/code], els camins als nodes glTF "
"de l'os esquelet es resoldran correctament. Per exemple, un camí que seria "
"[code]^\"A/B/C/Bone1/Bone2/Bone3\"[/code] si [code]false[/code] es "
"convertirà [code]^\"A/B/C/Skeleton3D:Bone3\"[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFNode] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can "
"be anything you want."
msgstr ""
"Estableix dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància [GLTFNode]. "
"Això es pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per node a les classes "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè són sense estat.\n"
"El primer argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no ha de "
"coincidir amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF), i el segon argument pot "
"ser el que vulgueu."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"If this glTF node is a camera, the index of the [GLTFCamera] in the "
"[GLTFState] that describes the camera's properties. If [code]-1[/code], this "
"node is not a camera."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest node glTF és una càmera, l'índex de [GLTFCamera] a [GLTFState] que "
"descriu les propietats de la càmera. Si [code]-1[/code], aquest node no és "
"una càmera."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"The indices of the child nodes in the [GLTFState]. If this glTF node has no "
"children, this will be an empty array."
msgstr ""
"Els índexs dels nodes fill a [GLTFState]. Si aquest node glTF no té fills, "
"serà una matriu buida."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"How deep into the node hierarchy this node is. A root node will have a "
"height of 0, its children will have a height of 1, and so on. If -1, the "
"height has not been calculated."
msgstr ""
"A quina profunditat de la jerarquia de nodes hi ha aquest node. Un node "
"arrel tindrà una alçada de 0, els seus fills una alçada d'1, i així "
"successivament. Si -1, l'alçada no s'ha calculat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"If this glTF node is a light, the index of the [GLTFLight] in the "
"[GLTFState] that describes the light's properties. If -1, this node is not a "
"light."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest node glTF és una llum, l'índex de [GLTFLight] a [GLTFState] que "
"descriu les propietats de la llum. Si -1, aquest node no és una llum."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"If this glTF node is a mesh, the index of the [GLTFMesh] in the [GLTFState] "
"that describes the mesh's properties. If -1, this node is not a mesh."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest node glTF és una malla, l'índex de [GLTFMesh] a [GLTFState] que "
"descriu les propietats de la malla. Si -1, aquest node no és una malla."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid "The original name of the node."
msgstr "El nom original del node."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the parent node in the [GLTFState]. If -1, this node is a root "
"node."
msgstr ""
"L'índex del node pare a [GLTFState]. Si -1, aquest node és un node arrel."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid "The position of the glTF node relative to its parent."
msgstr "La posició del node glTF relativa al seu pare."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid "The rotation of the glTF node relative to its parent."
msgstr "La rotació del node glTF en relació al seu pare."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid "The scale of the glTF node relative to its parent."
msgstr "L'escala del node glTF en relació al seu pare."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"If this glTF node has a skeleton, the index of the [GLTFSkeleton] in the "
"[GLTFState] that describes the skeleton's properties. If -1, this node does "
"not have a skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest node glTF té un esquelet, l'índex de [GLTFSkeleton] a [GLTFState] "
"que descriu les propietats de l'esquelet. Si -1, aquest node no té un "
"esquelet."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"If this glTF node has a skin, the index of the [GLTFSkin] in the [GLTFState] "
"that describes the skin's properties. If -1, this node does not have a skin."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest node glTF té una pell, l'índex de [GLTFSkin] a [GLTFState] que "
"descriu les propietats de la pell. Si -1, aquest node no té una pell."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the GLTF node is visible. If [code]false[/code], the "
"GLTF node is not visible. This is converted to the [member Node3D.visible] "
"property in the Godot scene, and is exported to [code]KHR_node_visibility[/"
"code] when [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el node GLTF és visible. Si [code]false[/code], el "
"node GLTF no és visible. Es converteix a la propietat [member "
"Node3D.visible] a l'escena Godot i s'exporta a [code]KHR_node_visibility[/"
"code] quan [code]false[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFNode.xml
msgid ""
"The transform of the glTF node relative to its parent. This property is "
"usually unused since the position, rotation, and scale properties are "
"preferred."
msgstr ""
"La transformació del node glTF en relació al seu pare. Aquesta propietat "
"normalment no s'utilitza ja que es prefereixen les propietats de posició, "
"rotació i escala."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid "Describes how to access a property as defined in the glTF object model."
msgstr ""
"Descriu com accedir a una propietat tal com es defineix al model d'objectes "
"glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"GLTFObjectModelProperty defines a mapping between a property in the glTF "
"object model and a NodePath in the Godot scene tree. This can be used to "
"animate properties in a glTF file using the [code]KHR_animation_pointer[/"
"code] extension, or to access them through an engine-agnostic script such as "
"a behavior graph as defined by the [code]KHR_interactivity[/code] "
"extension.\n"
"The glTF property is identified by JSON pointer(s) stored in [member "
"json_pointers], while the Godot property it maps to is defined by [member "
"node_paths]. In most cases [member json_pointers] and [member node_paths] "
"will each only have one item, but in some cases a single glTF JSON pointer "
"will map to multiple Godot properties, or a single Godot property will be "
"mapped to multiple glTF JSON pointers, or it might be a many-to-many "
"relationship.\n"
"[Expression] objects can be used to define conversions between the data, "
"such as when glTF defines an angle in radians and Godot uses degrees. The "
"[member object_model_type] property defines the type of data stored in the "
"glTF file as defined by the object model, see [enum GLTFObjectModelType] for "
"possible values."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid "GLTF Object Model"
msgstr "Model d'objectes GLTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid "KHR_animation_pointer GLTF extension"
msgstr "Extensió KHR_animation_pointer GLTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Appends a [NodePath] to [member node_paths]. This can be used by "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] classes to define how a glTF object model property "
"maps to a Godot property, or multiple Godot properties. Prefer using [method "
"append_path_to_property] for simple cases. Be sure to also call [method "
"set_types] once (the order does not matter)."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un [NodePath] a [member node_paths]. Això el poden utilitzar les "
"classes [GLTFDocumentExtension] per definir com una propietat de model "
"d'objectes glTF es mapeja a una propietat Godot o a diverses propietats "
"Godot. Preferiu utilitzar [method append_path_to_property] per a casos "
"senzills. Assegureu-vos de trucar també a [method set_types] una vegada "
"(l'ordre no importa)."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"High-level wrapper over [method append_node_path] that handles the most "
"common cases. It constructs a new [NodePath] using [param node_path] as a "
"base and appends [param prop_name] to the subpath. Be sure to also call "
"[method set_types] once (the order does not matter)."
msgstr ""
"Embolcall d'alt nivell sobre [method append_node_path] que gestiona els "
"casos més habituals. Construeix un nou [NodePath] utilitzant [param "
"node_path] com a base i afegeix [param prop_name] al subcamí. Assegureu-vos "
"de trucar també a [method set_types] una vegada (l'ordre no importa)."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"The GLTF accessor type associated with this property's [member "
"object_model_type]. See [member GLTFAccessor.accessor_type] for possible "
"values, and see [enum GLTFObjectModelType] for how the object model type "
"maps to accessor types."
msgstr ""
"El tipus d'accés GLTF associat amb [member object_model_type] d'aquesta "
"propietat. Vegeu [member GLTFAccessor.accessor_type] per veure els valors "
"possibles, i vegeu [enum GLTFObjectModelType] per veure com el tipus de "
"model d'objectes s'assigna als tipus d'accés."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [member json_pointers] is not empty. This is "
"used during export to determine if a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] can handle "
"converting a Godot property to a glTF object model property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si [member json_pointers] no està buit. S'utilitza "
"durant l'exportació per determinar si un [GLTFObjectModelProperty] pot "
"gestionar la conversió d'una propietat Godot a una propietat de model "
"d'objectes glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [member node_paths] is not empty. This is used "
"during import to determine if a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] can handle "
"converting a glTF object model property to a Godot property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si [member node_paths] no està buit. S'utilitza "
"durant la importació per determinar si un [GLTFObjectModelProperty] pot "
"gestionar la conversió d'una propietat de model d'objectes glTF a una "
"propietat Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [member variant_type] and [member object_model_type] properties. "
"This is a convenience method to set both properties at once, since they are "
"almost always known at the same time. This method should be called once. "
"Calling it again with the same values will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les propietats [member variant_type] i [member object_model_type]. "
"Aquest és un mètode convenient per establir les dues propietats alhora, ja "
"que gairebé sempre es coneixen al mateix temps. Aquest mètode s'ha de trucar "
"una vegada. Tornar a cridar-lo amb els mateixos valors no tindrà cap efecte."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"If set, this [Expression] will be used to convert the property value from "
"the glTF object model to the value expected by the Godot property. This is "
"useful when the glTF object model uses a different unit system, or when the "
"data needs to be transformed in some way. If [code]null[/code], the value "
"will be copied as-is."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix, aquest [Expression] s'utilitzarà per convertir el valor de "
"la propietat del model d'objectes glTF al valor esperat per la propietat "
"Godot. Això és útil quan el model d'objectes glTF utilitza un sistema "
"d'unitats diferent o quan les dades s'han de transformar d'alguna manera. Si "
"[code]null[/code], el valor es copiarà tal com està."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"If set, this [Expression] will be used to convert the property value from "
"the Godot property to the value expected by the glTF object model. This is "
"useful when the glTF object model uses a different unit system, or when the "
"data needs to be transformed in some way. If [code]null[/code], the value "
"will be copied as-is."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix, aquest [Expression] s'utilitzarà per convertir el valor de "
"la propietat de la propietat Godot al valor esperat pel model d'objectes "
"glTF. Això és útil quan el model d'objectes glTF utilitza un sistema "
"d'unitats diferent o quan les dades s'han de transformar d'alguna manera. Si "
"[code]null[/code], el valor es copiarà tal com està."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"The glTF object model JSON pointers used to identify the property in the "
"glTF object model. In most cases, there will be only one item in this array, "
"but specific cases may require multiple pointers. The items are themselves "
"arrays which represent the JSON pointer split into its components."
msgstr ""
"Els punters JSON del model d'objectes glTF utilitzats per identificar la "
"propietat al model d'objectes glTF. En la majoria dels casos, només hi haurà "
"un ítem en aquesta matriu, però els casos específics poden requerir diversos "
"punters. Els elements són en si mateixos matrius que representen el punter "
"JSON dividit en els seus components."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"An array of [NodePath]s that point to a property, or multiple properties, in "
"the Godot scene tree. On import, this will either be set by [GLTFDocument], "
"or by a [GLTFDocumentExtension] class. For simple cases, use [method "
"append_path_to_property] to add properties to this array.\n"
"In most cases [member node_paths] will only have one item, but in some cases "
"a single glTF JSON pointer will map to multiple Godot properties. For "
"example, a [GLTFCamera] or [GLTFLight] used on multiple glTF nodes will be "
"represented by multiple Godot nodes."
msgstr ""
"Una matriu de [NodePath]s que apunten a una propietat, o diverses "
"propietats, a l'arbre d'escena Godot. En importar-ho, serà establert per "
"[GLTFDocument] o per una classe [GLTFDocumentExtension]. En casos senzills, "
"utilitzeu [method append_path_to_property] per afegir propietats a aquesta "
"matriu.\n"
"En la majoria dels casos, [member node_paths] només tindrà un element, però "
"en alguns casos un sol punter JSON glTF s'assignarà a diverses propietats de "
"Godot. Per exemple, un [GLTFCamera] o [GLTFLight] utilitzat en diversos "
"nodes glTF estarà representat per diversos nodes Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"The type of data stored in the glTF file as defined by the object model. "
"This is a superset of the available accessor types, and determines the "
"accessor type."
msgstr ""
"El tipus de dades emmagatzemades al fitxer glTF tal com el defineix el model "
"d'objectes. Aquest és un superconjunt dels tipus d'accessoris disponibles i "
"determina el tipus d'accés."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"The type of data stored in the Godot property. This is the type of the "
"property that the [member node_paths] point to."
msgstr ""
"El tipus de dades emmagatzemades a la propietat Godot. Aquest és el tipus de "
"propietat que [member node_paths] apunten."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Unknown or not set object model type. If the object model type is set to "
"this value, the real type still needs to be determined."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte desconegut o no definit. Si el tipus de model "
"d'objecte s'estableix en aquest valor, encara s'ha de determinar el tipus "
"real."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"bool\". Represented in the glTF JSON as a boolean, and "
"encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\". When encoded in an accessor, a "
"value of [code]0[/code] is [code]false[/code], and any other value is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objectes \"bool\". Representat al glTF JSON com a booleà i "
"codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"SCALAR\". Quan es codifica en un "
"descriptor d'accés, un valor de [code]0[/code] és [code]false[/code] i "
"qualsevol altre valor és [code]true[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float\". Represented in the glTF JSON as a number, and "
"encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float\". Representat al glTF JSON com a nombre i "
"codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"SCALAR\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float[lb][rb]\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an "
"array of numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float[lb][rb]\". Representat al glTF JSON com una "
"matriu de números i codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"ESCALAR\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float2\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"two numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"VEC2\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float2\". Representat al glTF JSON com una matriu "
"de dos números i codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"VEC2\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float3\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"three numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"VEC3\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float3\". Representat al glTF JSON com una matriu "
"de tres números i codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"VEC3\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float4\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"four numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"VEC4\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float4\". Representat al glTF JSON com una matriu "
"de quatre números i codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"VEC4\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float2x2\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"four numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"MAT2\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float2x2\". Representat al glTF JSON com una "
"matriu de quatre números i codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"MAT2\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float3x3\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"nine numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"MAT3\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float3x3\". Representat al glTF JSON com una "
"matriu de nou nombres i codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"MAT3\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"float4x4\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"sixteen numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"MAT4\"."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"float4x4\". Representat al glTF JSON com una "
"matriu de setze números i codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"MAT4\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFObjectModelProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Object model type \"int\". Represented in the glTF JSON as a number, and "
"encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\". The range of values is limited to "
"signed integers. For [code]KHR_interactivity[/code], only 32-bit integers "
"are supported."
msgstr ""
"Tipus de model d'objecte \"int\". Representat al glTF JSON com a nombre i "
"codificat en un [GLTFAccessor] com a \"SCALAR\". L'interval de valors està "
"limitat als nombres enters amb signe. Per a [code]KHR_interactivity[/code], "
"només s'admeten nombres enters de 32 bits."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid "Represents a glTF physics body."
msgstr "Representa un cos de física glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a physics body as an intermediary between the "
"[code]OMI_physics_body[/code] glTF data and Godot's nodes, and it's "
"abstracted in a way that allows adding support for different glTF physics "
"extensions in the future."
msgstr ""
"Representa un cos físic com a intermediari entre el [code]OMI_physics_body[/"
"code] dades glTF i els nodes de Godot, i s'abstraeix d'una manera que permet "
"afegir suport per a diferents extensions de física glTF en el futur."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid "OMI_physics_body glTF extension"
msgstr "Extensió OMI_physics_body glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsBody instance by parsing the given [Dictionary] in "
"the [code]OMI_physics_body[/code] glTF extension format."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància GLTFPhysicsBody analitzant el [Dictionary] donat al "
"format d'extensió glTF [code]OMI_physics_body[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsBody instance from the given Godot "
"[CollisionObject3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància GLTFPhysicsBody a partir del node Godot "
"[CollisionObject3D] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"Serializes this GLTFPhysicsBody instance into a [Dictionary]. It will be in "
"the format expected by the [code]OMI_physics_body[/code] glTF extension."
msgstr ""
"Serialitza aquesta instància GLTFPhysicsBody en una [Dictionary]. Estarà en "
"el format previst per l'extensió glTF [code]OMI_physics_body[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"Converts this GLTFPhysicsBody instance into a Godot [CollisionObject3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Converteix aquesta instància GLTFPhysicsBody en un node Godot "
"[CollisionObject3D]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The angular velocity of the physics body, in radians per second. This is "
"only used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\"."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat angular del cos físic, en radians per segon. Això només "
"s'utilitza quan el tipus de carrosseria és \"rígid\" o \"vehicle\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The type of the body.\n"
"When importing, this controls what type of [CollisionObject3D] node Godot "
"should generate. Valid values are [code]\"static\"[/code], [code]"
"\"animatable\"[/code], [code]\"character\"[/code], [code]\"rigid\"[/code], "
"[code]\"vehicle\"[/code], and [code]\"trigger\"[/code].\n"
"When exporting, this will be squashed down to one of [code]\"static\"[/"
"code], [code]\"kinematic\"[/code], or [code]\"dynamic\"[/code] motion types, "
"or the [code]\"trigger\"[/code] property."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The center of mass of the body, in meters. This is in local space relative "
"to the body. By default, the center of the mass is the body's origin."
msgstr ""
"El centre de masses del cos, en metres. Això és a l'espai local en relació "
"al cos. Per defecte, el centre de la massa és l'origen del cos."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The inertia strength of the physics body, in kilogram meter squared (kg⋅m²). "
"This represents the inertia around the principle axes, the diagonal of the "
"inertia tensor matrix. This is only used when the body type is \"rigid\" or "
"\"vehicle\".\n"
"When converted to a Godot [RigidBody3D] node, if this value is zero, then "
"the inertia will be calculated automatically."
msgstr ""
"La força d'inèrcia del cos físic, en quilogram metre quadrat (kg⋅m²). Això "
"representa la inèrcia al voltant dels eixos principals, la diagonal de la "
"matriu del tensor d'inèrcia. Això només s'utilitza quan el tipus de "
"carrosseria és \"rígid\" o \"vehicle\".\n"
"Quan es converteix en un node Godot [RigidBody3D], si aquest valor és zero, "
"la inèrcia es calcularà automàticament."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The inertia orientation of the physics body. This defines the rotation of "
"the inertia's principle axes relative to the object's local axes. This is "
"only used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\" and [member "
"inertia_diagonal] is set to a non-zero value."
msgstr ""
"L'orientació d'inèrcia del cos físic. Això defineix la rotació dels eixos "
"principals de la inèrcia en relació amb els eixos locals de l'objecte. Això "
"només s'utilitza quan el tipus de carrosseria és \"rígid\" o \"vehicle\" i "
"[member inertia_diagonal] s'estableix en un valor diferent de zero."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The inertia tensor of the physics body, in kilogram meter squared (kg⋅m²). "
"This is only used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\".\n"
"When converted to a Godot [RigidBody3D] node, if this value is zero, then "
"the inertia will be calculated automatically."
msgstr ""
"El tensor d'inèrcia del cos físic, en quilogram metre quadrat (kg⋅m²). Això "
"només s'utilitza quan el tipus de carrosseria és \"rígid\" o \"vehicle\".\n"
"Quan es converteix en un node Godot [RigidBody3D], si aquest valor és zero, "
"la inèrcia es calcularà automàticament."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The linear velocity of the physics body, in meters per second. This is only "
"used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\"."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat lineal del cos físic, en metres per segon. Això només "
"s'utilitza quan el tipus de carrosseria és \"rígid\" o \"vehicle\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsBody.xml
msgid ""
"The mass of the physics body, in kilograms. This is only used when the body "
"type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\"."
msgstr ""
"La massa del cos físic, en quilograms. Això només s'utilitza quan el tipus "
"de carrosseria és \"rígid\" o \"vehicle\"."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid "Represents a glTF physics shape."
msgstr "Representa una forma de física glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a physics shape as defined by the [code]OMI_physics_shape[/code] "
"or [code]OMI_collider[/code] glTF extensions. This class is an intermediary "
"between the glTF data and Godot's nodes, and it's abstracted in a way that "
"allows adding support for different glTF physics extensions in the future."
msgstr ""
"Representa una forma física tal com la defineixen les extensions glTF "
"[code]OMI_physics_shape[/code] o [code]OMI_collider[/code]. Aquesta classe "
"és un intermediari entre les dades glTF i els nodes de Godot, i s'abstraeix "
"d'una manera que permet afegir suport per a diferents extensions de física "
"glTF en el futur."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid "OMI_physics_shape glTF extension"
msgstr "Extensió OMI_physics_shape glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid "OMI_collider glTF extension"
msgstr "Extensió glTF OMI_collider"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsShape instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància de GLTFPhysicsShape analitzant el [Dictionary] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsShape instance from the given Godot "
"[CollisionShape3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància GLTFPhysicsShape a partir del node Godot "
"[CollisionShape3D] donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsShape instance from the given Godot [Shape3D] "
"resource."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància GLTFPhysicsShape a partir del recurs Godot [Shape3D] "
"donat."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"Serializes this GLTFPhysicsShape instance into a [Dictionary] in the format "
"defined by [code]OMI_physics_shape[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Serialitza aquesta instància de GLTFPhysicsShape en una [Dictionary] en el "
"format definit per [code]OMI_physics_shape[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"Converts this GLTFPhysicsShape instance into a Godot [CollisionShape3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Converteix aquesta instància GLTFPhysicsShape en un node Godot "
"[CollisionShape3D]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"Converts this GLTFPhysicsShape instance into a Godot [Shape3D] resource."
msgstr ""
"Converteix aquesta instància GLTFPhysicsShape en un recurs Godot [Shape3D]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"The height of the shape, in meters. This is only used when the shape type is "
"[code]\"capsule\"[/code] or [code]\"cylinder\"[/code]. This value should not "
"be negative, and for [code]\"capsule\"[/code] it should be at least twice "
"the radius."
msgstr ""
"L'alçada de la forma, en metres. Això només s'utilitza quan el tipus de "
"forma és [code]\"càpsula\"[/code] o [code]\"cylinder\"[/code]. Aquest valor "
"no ha de ser negatiu, i per a [code]\"capsule\"[/code] hauria de ser almenys "
"el doble del radi."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"The [ImporterMesh] resource of the shape. This is only used when the shape "
"type is [code]\"hull\"[/code] (convex hull) or [code]\"trimesh\"[/code] "
"(concave trimesh)."
msgstr ""
"El recurs [ImporterMesh] de la forma. Això només s'utilitza quan el tipus de "
"forma és [code]\"casc\"[/code] (casc convex) o [code]\"trimesh\"[/code] "
"(malla còncava)."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], indicates that this shape is a trigger. For Godot, "
"this means that the shape should be a child of an [Area3D] node.\n"
"This is the only variable not used in the [method to_node] method, it's "
"intended to be used alongside when deciding where to add the generated node "
"as a child."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], indica que aquesta forma és un activador. Per a Godot, "
"això vol dir que la forma hauria de ser fill d'un node [Area3D].\n"
"Aquesta és l'única variable que no s'utilitza en el mètode [method to_node], "
"està pensada per utilitzar-la al costat de decidir on afegir el node generat "
"com a fill."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the shape's mesh in the glTF file. This is only used when the "
"shape type is [code]\"hull\"[/code] (convex hull) or [code]\"trimesh\"[/"
"code] (concave trimesh)."
msgstr ""
"L'índex de la malla de la forma al fitxer glTF. Això només s'utilitza quan "
"el tipus de forma és [code]\"casc\"[/code] (casc convex) o [code]"
"\"trimesh\"[/code] (malla còncava)."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"The radius of the shape, in meters. This is only used when the shape type is "
"[code]\"capsule\"[/code], [code]\"cylinder\"[/code], or [code]\"sphere\"[/"
"code]. This value should not be negative."
msgstr ""
"El radi de la forma, en metres. Això només s'utilitza quan el tipus de forma "
"és [code]\"càpsula\"[/code], [code]\"cylinder\"[/code] o [code]\"sphere\"[/"
"code]. Aquest valor no ha de ser negatiu."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"The type of shape this shape represents. Valid values are [code]\"box\"[/"
"code], [code]\"capsule\"[/code], [code]\"cylinder\"[/code], [code]"
"\"sphere\"[/code], [code]\"hull\"[/code], and [code]\"trimesh\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El tipus de forma que representa aquesta forma. Els valors vàlids són [code]"
"\"box\"[/code], [code]\"capsule\"[/code], [code]\"cylinder\"[/code], [code]"
"\"sphere\"[/code], [code]\"hull\"[/code] i [code]\"trimesh\"[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFPhysicsShape.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the shape, in meters. This is only used when the shape type is "
"[code]\"box\"[/code], and it represents the [code]\"diameter\"[/code] of the "
"box. This value should not be negative."
msgstr ""
"La mida de la forma, en metres. Només s'utilitza quan el tipus de forma és "
"[code]\"box\"[/code] i representa el [code]\"diàmetre\"[/code] de la caixa. "
"Aquest valor no ha de ser negatiu."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSkeleton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] that maps skeleton bone indices to the indices of "
"glTF nodes. This property is unused during import, and only set during "
"export. In a glTF file, a bone is a node, so Godot converts skeleton bones "
"to glTF nodes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Dictionary] que mapeja els índexs d'os de l'esquelet als índexs "
"dels nodes glTF. Aquesta propietat no s'utilitza durant la importació i "
"només s'estableix durant l'exportació. En un fitxer glTF, un os és un node, "
"de manera que Godot converteix els ossos de l'esquelet en nodes glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSkeleton.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a [Dictionary] that maps skeleton bone indices to the indices of glTF "
"nodes. This property is unused during import, and only set during export. In "
"a glTF file, a bone is a node, so Godot converts skeleton bones to glTF "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [Dictionary] que mapeja els índexs d'os de l'esquelet als "
"índexs dels nodes glTF. Aquesta propietat no s'utilitza durant la importació "
"i només s'estableix durant l'exportació. En un fitxer glTF, un os és un "
"node, de manera que Godot converteix els ossos de l'esquelet en nodes glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid "Archived glTF extension for specular/glossy materials."
msgstr "Extensió glTF arxivada per a materials especulars/brillants."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid ""
"KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness is an archived glTF extension. This "
"means that it is deprecated and not recommended for new files. However, it "
"is still supported for loading old files."
msgstr ""
"KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness és una extensió glTF arxivada. Això vol "
"dir que està obsolet i no es recomana per a fitxers nous. Tanmateix, encara "
"és compatible per carregar fitxers antics."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid "KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness glTF extension spec"
msgstr "KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness Extensió glTF especificació"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid "The reflected diffuse factor of the material."
msgstr "El factor difús reflectit del material."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid "The diffuse texture."
msgstr "La textura difusa."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid "The glossiness or smoothness of the material."
msgstr "La brillantor o suavitat del material."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid "The specular-glossiness texture."
msgstr "La textura especular brillant."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFSpecGloss.xml
msgid "The specular RGB color of the material. The alpha channel is unused."
msgstr "El color RGB especular del material. El canal alfa no s'utilitza."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "Represents all data of a glTF file."
msgstr "Representa totes les dades d'un fitxer glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Contains all nodes and resources of a glTF file. This is used by "
"[GLTFDocument] as data storage, which allows [GLTFDocument] and all "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] classes to remain stateless.\n"
"GLTFState can be populated by [GLTFDocument] reading a file or by converting "
"a Godot scene. Then the data can either be used to create a Godot scene or "
"save to a glTF file. The code that converts to/from a Godot scene can be "
"intercepted at arbitrary points by [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes. This "
"allows for custom data to be stored in the glTF file or for custom data to "
"be converted to/from Godot nodes."
msgstr ""
"Conté tots els nodes i recursos d'un fitxer glTF. Això l'utilitza "
"[GLTFDocument] com a emmagatzematge de dades, cosa que permet que "
"[GLTFDocument] i totes les classes [GLTFDocumentExtension] romanguin sense "
"estat.\n"
"GLTFState es pot omplir mitjançant [GLTFDocument] llegint un fitxer o "
"convertint una escena Godot. Aleshores, les dades es poden utilitzar per "
"crear una escena Godot o desar-les en un fitxer glTF. El codi que es "
"converteix a/des d'una escena Godot es pot interceptar en punts arbitraris "
"per les classes [GLTFDocumentExtension]. Això permet que les dades "
"personalitzades s'emmagatzemin al fitxer glTF o que les dades "
"personalitzades es converteixin a/des de nodes Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "glTF asset header schema"
msgstr "Esquema de capçalera d'actius glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Appends an extension to the list of extensions used by this glTF file during "
"serialization. If [param required] is [code]true[/code], the extension will "
"also be added to the list of required extensions. Do not run this in [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_post], as that stage is too late to add "
"extensions. The final list is sorted alphabetically."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una extensió a la llista d'extensions utilitzades per aquest fitxer "
"glTF durant la serialització. Si [param required] és [code]true[/code], "
"l'extensió també s'afegirà a la llista d'extensions necessàries. No executeu "
"això a [method GLTFDocumentExtension._export_post], ja que aquesta etapa és "
"massa tard per afegir extensions. La llista final està ordenada "
"alfabèticament."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Appends the given byte array [param data] to the buffers and creates a "
"[GLTFBufferView] for it. The index of the destination [GLTFBufferView] is "
"returned. If [param deduplication] is [code]true[/code], the buffers are "
"first searched for duplicate data, otherwise new bytes are always appended."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix la matriu de bytes [param data] als buffers i crea un "
"[GLTFBufferView] per a això. Es retorna l'índex de la destinació "
"[GLTFBufferView]. Si [param deduplication] és [code]true[/code], primer es "
"cerquen dades duplicades als buffers, en cas contrari sempre s'afegeixen "
"bytes nous."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Appends the given [GLTFNode] to the state, and returns its new index. This "
"can be used to export one Godot node as multiple glTF nodes, or inject new "
"glTF nodes at import time. On import, this must be called before [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._generate_scene_node] finishes for the parent node. On "
"export, this must be called before [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_node] runs for the parent node.\n"
"The [param godot_scene_node] parameter is the Godot scene node that "
"corresponds to this glTF node. This is highly recommended to be set to a "
"valid node, but may be [code]null[/code] if there is no corresponding Godot "
"scene node. One Godot scene node may be used for multiple glTF nodes, so if "
"exporting multiple glTF nodes for one Godot scene node, use the same Godot "
"scene node for each.\n"
"The [param parent_node_index] parameter is the index of the parent "
"[GLTFNode] in the state. If [code]-1[/code], the node will be a root node, "
"otherwise the new node will be added to the parent's list of children. The "
"index will also be written to the [member GLTFNode.parent] property of the "
"new node."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix el [GLTFNode] donat a l'estat i retorna el seu nou índex. Això es "
"pot utilitzar per exportar un node Godot com a múltiples nodes glTF o "
"injectar nous nodes glTF en el moment de la importació. A la importació, "
"s'ha de cridar abans que [method GLTFDocumentExtension._generate_scene_node] "
"finalitzi per al node pare. A l'exportació, s'ha de cridar abans que [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_node] s'executi per al node pare.\n"
"El paràmetre [param godot_scene_node] és el node d'escena Godot que "
"correspon a aquest node glTF. És molt recomanable que s'estableixi en un "
"node vàlid, però pot ser [code]null[/code] si no hi ha cap node d'escena "
"Godot corresponent. Es pot utilitzar un node d'escena Godot per a diversos "
"nodes glTF, de manera que si exporteu diversos nodes glTF per a un node "
"d'escena Godot, utilitzeu el mateix node d'escena Godot per a cadascun.\n"
"El paràmetre [param parent_node_index] és l'índex del pare [GLTFNode] a "
"l'estat. Si [code]-1[/code], el node serà un node arrel, en cas contrari, el "
"nou node s'afegirà a la llista de fills dels pares. L'índex també s'escriurà "
"a la propietat [member GLTFNode.parent] del nou node."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFState] instance. This can be "
"used to keep per-file state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which "
"is important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obté dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància [GLTFState]. Això es "
"pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per fitxer a les classes "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè són sense estat.\n"
"L'argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no cal que "
"coincideixi amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF) i el valor de retorn "
"pot ser qualsevol cosa que establiu. Si no s'ha establert res, el valor de "
"retorn és [code]null[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [AnimationPlayer] node with the given index. These nodes are "
"only used during the export process when converting Godot [AnimationPlayer] "
"nodes to glTF animations."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node [AnimationPlayer] amb l'índex donat. Aquests nodes només "
"s'utilitzen durant el procés d'exportació quan es converteixen els nodes "
"Godot [AnimationPlayer] en animacions glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of [AnimationPlayer] nodes in this [GLTFState]. These "
"nodes are only used during the export process when converting Godot "
"[AnimationPlayer] nodes to glTF animations."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de nodes [AnimationPlayer] en aquest [GLTFState]. Aquests "
"nodes només s'utilitzen durant el procés d'exportació quan es converteixen "
"els nodes Godot [AnimationPlayer] en animacions glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFAnimation]s in the glTF file. When importing, "
"these will be generated as animations in an [AnimationPlayer] node. When "
"exporting, these will be generated from Godot [AnimationPlayer] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els [GLTFAnimation]s del fitxer glTF. En "
"importar, es generaran com a animacions en un node [AnimationPlayer]. En "
"exportar, aquests es generaran des dels nodes Godot [AnimationPlayer]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFCamera]s in the glTF file. These are the "
"cameras that the [member GLTFNode.camera] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els [GLTFCamera]s del fitxer glTF. Aquestes són "
"les càmeres a les quals fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.camera]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "Use [member handle_binary_image_mode] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [member handle_binary_image_mode]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Deprecated untyped alias for [member handle_binary_image_mode]. When "
"importing a glTF file with unimported raw binary images embedded inside of "
"binary blob buffers, in data URIs, or separate files not imported by Godot, "
"this controls how the images are handled."
msgstr ""
"Àlies sense escriure obsolet per a [member handle_binary_image_mode]. Quan "
"s'importa un fitxer glTF amb imatges binàries sense importar incrustades "
"dins dels buffers de blob binaris, en URI de dades o fitxers separats no "
"importats per Godot, això controla com es gestionen les imatges."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the images of the glTF file as an array of [Texture2D]s. These are the "
"images that the [member GLTFTexture.src_image] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Obté les imatges del fitxer glTF com una matriu de [Texture2D]s. Aquestes "
"són les imatges a les quals fa referència l'índex [member "
"GLTFTexture.src_image]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFLight]s in the glTF file. These are the lights "
"that the [member GLTFNode.light] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els [GLTFLight]s del fitxer glTF. Aquestes són "
"les llums a les quals fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.light]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFMesh]es in the glTF file. These are the meshes "
"that the [member GLTFNode.mesh] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els [GLTFMesh]es del fitxer glTF. Aquestes són "
"les malles a les quals fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.mesh]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [GLTFNode] corresponding to this Godot scene node. "
"This is the inverse of [method get_scene_node]. Useful during the export "
"process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not every Godot scene node will have a corresponding "
"[GLTFNode], and not every [GLTFNode] will have a scene node generated. If "
"there is no [GLTFNode] index for this scene node, [code]-1[/code] is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex del [GLTFNode] corresponent a aquest node d'escena Godot. "
"Aquesta és la inversa de [method get_scene_node]. Útil durant el procés "
"d'exportació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No tots els nodes d'escena Godot tindran un [GLTFNode] "
"corresponent, i no tots els [GLTFNode] tindran un node d'escena generat. Si "
"no hi ha cap índex [GLTFNode] per a aquest node d'escena, es retorna "
"[code]-1[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFNode]s in the glTF file. These are the nodes "
"that [member GLTFNode.children] and [member root_nodes] refer to. This "
"includes nodes that may not be generated in the Godot scene, or nodes that "
"may generate multiple Godot scene nodes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els [GLTFNode]s del fitxer glTF. Aquests són els "
"nodes als quals es refereixen [member GLTFNode.children] i [member "
"root_nodes]. Això inclou nodes que potser no es generen a l'escena Godot o "
"nodes que poden generar diversos nodes d'escena Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the Godot scene node that corresponds to the same index as the "
"[GLTFNode] it was generated from. This is the inverse of [method "
"get_node_index]. Useful during the import process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not every [GLTFNode] will have a scene node generated, and not "
"every generated scene node will have a corresponding [GLTFNode]. If there is "
"no scene node for this [GLTFNode] index, [code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node d'escena Godot que correspon al mateix índex que [GLTFNode] "
"des del qual es va generar. Aquesta és la inversa de [method "
"get_node_index]. Útil durant el procés d'importació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No tots els [GLTFNode] tindran un node d'escena generat, i no "
"tots els nodes d'escena generats tindran un [GLTFNode] corresponent. Si no "
"hi ha cap node d'escena per a aquest índex [GLTFNode], es retorna "
"[code]null[/code]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFSkeleton]s in the glTF file. These are the "
"skeletons that the [member GLTFNode.skeleton] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els [GLTFSkeleton]s del fitxer glTF. Aquests són "
"els esquelets als quals fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.skeleton]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFSkin]s in the glTF file. These are the skins "
"that the [member GLTFNode.skin] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els [GLTFSkin]s del fitxer glTF. Aquestes són les "
"aparences a les quals fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.skin]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Retrieves the array of texture samplers that are used by the textures "
"contained in the glTF."
msgstr ""
"Recupera la matriu de mostrejos de textures que utilitzen les textures "
"contingudes al glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of unique animation names. This is only used during the "
"import process."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de noms d'animació únics. Això només s'utilitza durant el "
"procés d'importació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of unique node names. This is used in both the import "
"process and export process."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de noms de nodes únics. S'utilitza tant en el procés "
"d'importació com en el procés d'exportació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFState] instance. This can be "
"used to keep per-file state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which "
"is important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can "
"be anything you want."
msgstr ""
"Estableix dades arbitràries addicionals en aquesta instància [GLTFState]. "
"Això es pot utilitzar per mantenir les dades d'estat per fitxer a les "
"classes [GLTFDocumentExtension], la qual cosa és important perquè són sense "
"estat.\n"
"El primer argument hauria de ser el nom [GLTFDocumentExtension] (no ha de "
"coincidir amb el nom de l'extensió del fitxer glTF), i el segon argument pot "
"ser el que vulgueu."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFAnimation]s in the state. When importing, these will be "
"generated as animations in an [AnimationPlayer] node. When exporting, these "
"will be generated from Godot [AnimationPlayer] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [GLTFAnimation]s a l'estat. En importar, es generaran com a "
"animacions en un node [AnimationPlayer]. En exportar, aquests es generaran "
"des dels nodes Godot [AnimationPlayer]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFCamera]s in the state. These are the cameras that the [member "
"GLTFNode.camera] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [GLTFCamera]s a l'estat. Aquestes són les càmeres a les quals "
"fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.camera]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the images in the state stored as an array of [Texture2D]s. This can be "
"used during export. These are the images that the [member "
"GLTFTexture.src_image] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les imatges en l'estat emmagatzemat com a matriu de [Texture2D]s. "
"Això es pot utilitzar durant l'exportació. Aquestes són les imatges a les "
"quals fa referència l'índex [member GLTFTexture.src_image]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFLight]s in the state. These are the lights that the [member "
"GLTFNode.light] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [GLTFLight]s a l'estat. Aquestes són les llums a les quals fa "
"referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.light]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFMesh]es in the state. These are the meshes that the [member "
"GLTFNode.mesh] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [GLTFMesh]es a l'estat. Aquestes són les malles a les quals fa "
"referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.mesh]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFNode]s in the state. These are the nodes that [member "
"GLTFNode.children] and [member root_nodes] refer to. Some of the nodes set "
"here may not be generated in the Godot scene, or may generate multiple Godot "
"scene nodes."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [GLTFNode]s a l'estat. Aquests són els nodes als quals es "
"refereixen [member GLTFNode.children] i [member root_nodes]. És possible que "
"alguns dels nodes establerts aquí no es generin a l'escena de Godot o poden "
"generar diversos nodes d'escena de Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFSkeleton]s in the state. These are the skeletons that the "
"[member GLTFNode.skeleton] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [GLTFSkeleton]s a l'estat. Aquests són els esquelets als quals "
"fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.skeleton]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFSkin]s in the state. These are the skins that the [member "
"GLTFNode.skin] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els [GLTFSkin]s a l'estat. Aquestes són les aparences a les quals "
"fa referència l'índex [member GLTFNode.skin]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the array of texture samplers that are used by the textures contained "
"in the glTF."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la matriu de mostres de textures que utilitzen les textures "
"contingudes al glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the unique animation names in the state. This is only used during the "
"import process."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els noms d'animació únics a l'estat. Això només s'utilitza durant "
"el procés d'importació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the unique node names in the state. This is used in both the import "
"process and export process."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els noms de nodes únics a l'estat. S'utilitza tant en el procés "
"d'importació com en el procés d'exportació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "The baking fps of the animation for either import or export."
msgstr "Els fps de cocció de l'animació per a importació o exportació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"The folder path associated with this glTF data. This is used to find other "
"files the glTF file references, like images or binary buffers. This will be "
"set during import when appending from a file, and will be set during export "
"when writing to a file."
msgstr ""
"La ruta de la carpeta associada a aquestes dades glTF. S'utilitza per trobar "
"altres fitxers als quals fa referència el fitxer glTF, com ara imatges o "
"buffers binaris. S'establirà durant la importació quan s'adjunta des d'un "
"fitxer i s'establirà durant l'exportació quan s'escriu en un fitxer."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"The copyright string in the asset header of the glTF file. This is set "
"during import if present and export if non-empty. See the glTF asset header "
"documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"La cadena de drets d'autor a la capçalera del recurs del fitxer glTF. "
"S'estableix durant la importació si està present i l'exportació si no està "
"buida. Consulteu la documentació de la capçalera dels recursos glTF per "
"obtenir més informació."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"The file name associated with this glTF data. If it ends with [code].gltf[/"
"code], this is text-based glTF, otherwise this is binary GLB. This will be "
"set during import when appending from a file, and will be set during export "
"when writing to a file. If writing to a buffer, this will be an empty string."
msgstr ""
"El nom del fitxer associat amb aquestes dades glTF. Si acaba amb "
"[code].gltf[/code], això és glTF basat en text, en cas contrari, és GLB "
"binari. S'establirà durant la importació quan s'adjunta des d'un fitxer i "
"s'establirà durant l'exportació quan s'escriu en un fitxer. Si s'escriu en "
"un buffer, aquesta serà una cadena buida."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "The binary buffer attached to a .glb file."
msgstr "El buffer binari adjunt a un fitxer .glb."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with unimported raw binary images embedded inside "
"of binary blob buffers, in data URIs, or separate files not imported by "
"Godot, this controls how the images are handled. Images can be discarded, "
"saved as separate files, or embedded in the scene lossily or losslessly. See "
"[enum HandleBinaryImageMode] for options.\n"
"This property does nothing for image files in the [code]res://[/code] folder "
"imported by Godot, as those are handled by Godot's image importer directly, "
"and then the Godot scene generated from the glTF file will use the images as "
"Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'importa un fitxer glTF amb imatges binàries sense importar "
"incrustades dins dels buffers de blob binaris, en URI de dades o fitxers "
"separats no importats per Godot, això controla com es gestionen les imatges. "
"Les imatges es poden descartar, desar com a fitxers separats o incrustar-se "
"a l'escena amb pèrdua o sense pèrdua. Vegeu [enum HandleBinaryImageMode] per "
"obtenir opcions.\n"
"Aquesta propietat no fa res per als fitxers d'imatge de la carpeta "
"[code]res://[/code] importats per Godot, ja que els gestiona directament "
"l'importador d'imatges de Godot i, a continuació, l'escena de Godot generada "
"a partir del fitxer glTF utilitzarà les imatges tal com les va importar "
"Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces all GLTFNodes in the document to be bones of a "
"single [Skeleton3D] Godot node."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], obliga que tots els GLTFNodes del document siguin "
"ossos d'un sol node [Skeleton3D] Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "The original raw JSON document corresponding to this GLTFState."
msgstr "El document original JSON en brut corresponent a aquest GLTFState."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"The root nodes of the glTF file. Typically, a glTF file will only have one "
"scene, and therefore one root node. However, a glTF file may have multiple "
"scenes and therefore multiple root nodes, which will be generated as "
"siblings of each other and as children of the root node of the generated "
"Godot scene."
msgstr ""
"Els nodes arrel del fitxer glTF. Normalment, un fitxer glTF només tindrà una "
"escena i, per tant, un node arrel. Tanmateix, un fitxer glTF pot tenir "
"diverses escenes i, per tant, diversos nodes arrel, que es generaran com a "
"germans els uns dels altres i com a fills del node arrel de l'escena Godot "
"generada."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"The name of the scene. When importing, if not specified, this will be the "
"file name. When exporting, if specified, the scene name will be saved to the "
"glTF file."
msgstr ""
"El nom de l'escena. En importar, si no s'especifica, aquest serà el nom del "
"fitxer. Quan s'exporti, si s'especifica, el nom de l'escena es desarà al "
"fitxer glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, discards all images "
"and uses untextured materials in their place. Images stored as separate "
"files in the [code]res://[/code] folder are not affected by this; those will "
"be used as Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'importa un fitxer glTF amb imatges binàries incrustades, descarta "
"totes les imatges i utilitza materials sense textura al seu lloc. Les "
"imatges emmagatzemades com a fitxers separats a la carpeta [code]res://[/"
"code] no es veuen afectades per això; aquests s'utilitzaran tal com els va "
"importar Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, extracts them and "
"saves them to their own files. This allows the image to be imported by "
"Godot's image importer, which can then have their import options customized "
"by the user, including optionally compressing the image to VRAM texture "
"formats.\n"
"This will save the images's bytes exactly as-is, without recompression. For "
"image formats supplied by glTF extensions, the file will have a filename "
"ending with the file extension supplied by [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._get_image_file_extension] of the extension class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option is editor-only. At runtime, this acts the same as "
"[constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED]."
msgstr ""
"Quan importeu un fitxer glTF amb imatges binàries incrustades, les extreu i "
"les deseu als seus propis fitxers. Això permet que la imatge sigui importada "
"per l'importador d'imatges de Godot, que després pot tenir les seves opcions "
"d'importació personalitzades per l'usuari, inclosa la compressió opcional de "
"la imatge als formats de textura VRAM.\n"
"Això desarà els bytes de les imatges tal com estan, sense recompressió. Per "
"als formats d'imatge subministrats per les extensions glTF, el fitxer tindrà "
"un nom de fitxer que acabarà amb l'extensió de fitxer proporcionada per "
"[method GLTFDocumentExtension._get_image_file_extension] de la classe "
"d'extensió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta opció és només per a l'editor. En temps d'execució, "
"això actua igual que [constant "
"HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, embeds textures VRAM "
"compressed with Basis Universal into the generated scene. Images stored as "
"separate files in the [code]res://[/code] folder are not affected by this; "
"those will be used as Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'importa un fitxer glTF amb imatges binàries incrustades, incrusta "
"textures VRAM comprimides amb Basis Universal a l'escena generada. Les "
"imatges emmagatzemades com a fitxers separats a la carpeta [code]res://[/"
"code] no es veuen afectades per això; aquests s'utilitzaran tal com els va "
"importar Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, embeds textures "
"compressed losslessly into the generated scene. Images stored as separate "
"files in the [code]res://[/code] folder are not affected by this; those will "
"be used as Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'importa un fitxer glTF amb imatges binàries incrustades, incrusta "
"textures comprimides sense pèrdues a l'escena generada. Les imatges "
"emmagatzemades com a fitxers separats a la carpeta [code]res://[/code] no es "
"veuen afectades per això; aquests s'utilitzaran tal com els va importar "
"Godot."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_DISCARD_TEXTURES] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_DISCARD_TEXTURES]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "Discards all embedded textures and uses untextured materials."
msgstr ""
"Descarta totes les textures incrustades i utilitza materials sense textura."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EXTRACT_TEXTURES] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EXTRACT_TEXTURES]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Extracts embedded textures to be reimported and compressed. Editor only. "
"Acts as uncompressed at runtime."
msgstr ""
"Extreu textures incrustades per ser reimportades i comprimides. Només "
"editor. Actua com sense comprimir en temps d'execució."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_BASISU] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_BASISU]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Embeds textures VRAM compressed with Basis Universal into the generated "
"scene."
msgstr ""
"Incrusta textures VRAM comprimides amb Basis Universal a l'escena generada."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED]."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFState.xml
msgid ""
"Embeds textures compressed losslessly into the generated scene, matching old "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Incrusta textures comprimides sense pèrdues a l'escena generada, coincidint "
"amb el comportament antic."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTexture.xml
msgid "GLTFTexture represents a texture in a glTF file."
msgstr "GLTFTexture representa una textura en un fitxer glTF."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTexture.xml
msgid ""
"ID of the texture sampler to use when sampling the image. If -1, then the "
"default texture sampler is used (linear filtering, and repeat wrapping in "
"both axes)."
msgstr ""
"ID del mostrador de textures que s'utilitzarà quan mostreu la imatge. Si -1, "
"s'utilitza el mostrador de textures predeterminat (filtratge lineal i "
"embolcall repetit en ambdós eixos)."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the image associated with this texture, see [method "
"GLTFState.get_images]. If -1, then this texture does not have an image "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"L'índex de la imatge associada a aquesta textura, vegeu [method "
"GLTFState.get_images]. Si -1, aquesta textura no té una imatge assignada."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTextureSampler.xml
msgid "Represents a glTF texture sampler"
msgstr "Representa un mostrejador de textura glTF"

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTextureSampler.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a texture sampler as defined by the base glTF spec. Texture "
"samplers in glTF specify how to sample data from the texture's base image, "
"when rendering the texture on an object."
msgstr ""
"Representa un mostrador de textures tal com el defineix l'especificació de "
"glTF base. Els mostradors de textures a glTF especifiquen com es mostren les "
"dades de la imatge base de la textura quan es representen la textura en un "
"objecte."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTextureSampler.xml
msgid ""
"Texture's magnification filter, used when texture appears larger on screen "
"than the source image."
msgstr ""
"Filtre d'ampliació de la textura, que s'utilitza quan la textura apareix més "
"gran a la pantalla que la imatge d'origen."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTextureSampler.xml
msgid ""
"Texture's minification filter, used when the texture appears smaller on "
"screen than the source image."
msgstr ""
"Filtre de minificació de textures, que s'utilitza quan la textura apareix "
"més petita a la pantalla que la imatge d'origen."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTextureSampler.xml
msgid "Wrapping mode to use for S-axis (horizontal) texture coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Mode d'embolcall que s'utilitza per a les coordenades de textura de l'eix S "
"(horitzontal)."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFTextureSampler.xml
msgid "Wrapping mode to use for T-axis (vertical) texture coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Mode d'embolcall que s'utilitza per a les coordenades de textura de l'eix T "
"(vertical)."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid "Provides access to an embedded Godot instance."
msgstr "Proporciona accés a una instància de Godot incrustada."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid ""
"GodotInstance represents a running Godot instance that is controlled from an "
"outside codebase, without a perpetual main loop. It is created by the C API "
"[code]libgodot_create_godot_instance[/code]. Only one may be created per "
"process."
msgstr ""
"GodotInstance representa una instància Godot en execució que es controla des "
"d'una base de codi externa, sense un bucle principal perpetu. El crea l'API "
"C [code]libgodot_create_godot_instance[/code]. Només se'n pot crear un per "
"procés."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid "Notifies the instance that it is now in focus."
msgstr "Notifica a la instància que ara està enfocada."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid "Notifies the instance that it is now not in focus."
msgstr "Notifica a la instància que ara no està enfocada."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this instance has been fully started."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta instància s'ha iniciat completament."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid ""
"Runs a single iteration of the main loop. Returns [code]true[/code] if the "
"engine is attempting to quit."
msgstr ""
"Executa una sola iteració del bucle principal. Retorna [code]true[/code] si "
"el motor està intentant sortir."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid "Notifies the instance that it is going to be paused."
msgstr "Notifica a la instància que es posarà en pausa."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid "Notifies the instance that it is being resumed."
msgstr "Notifica a la instància que es reprèn."

#: doc/classes/GodotInstance.xml
msgid ""
"Finishes this instance's startup sequence. Returns [code]true[/code] on "
"success."
msgstr ""
"Acaba la seqüència d'inici d'aquesta instància. Retorna [code]true[/code] en "
"cas d'èxit."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "A 2D particle emitter."
msgstr "Un emissor de partícules 2D."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"2D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and effects. "
"[GPUParticles2D] features an emitter that generates some number of particles "
"at a given rate.\n"
"Use the [member process_material] property to add a "
"[ParticleProcessMaterial] to configure particle appearance and behavior. "
"Alternatively, you can add a [ShaderMaterial] which will be applied to all "
"particles.\n"
"2D particles can optionally collide with [LightOccluder2D], but they don't "
"collide with [PhysicsBody2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Node de partícules 2D utilitzat per crear una varietat de sistemes i efectes "
"de partícules. [GPUParticles2D] inclou un emissor que genera un cert nombre "
"de partícules a una velocitat determinada.\n"
"Utilitzeu la propietat [member process_material] per afegir un "
"[ParticleProcessMaterial] per configurar l'aspecte i el comportament de les "
"partícules. Alternativament, podeu afegir un [ShaderMaterial] que s'aplicarà "
"a totes les partícules.\n"
"Les partícules 2D poden xocar opcionalment amb [LightOccluder2D], però no "
"xoquen amb els nodes [PhysicsBody2D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "2D Particles Demo"
msgstr "Demostració de partícules 2D"

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"2D Dodge The Creeps Demo (uses GPUParticles2D for the trail behind the "
"player)"
msgstr ""
"Demostració 2D de Dodge The Creeps (utilitza GPUParticles2D per a la pista "
"darrere del jugador)"

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a rectangle containing the positions of all existing particles.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using threaded rendering this method synchronizes the "
"rendering thread. Calling it often may have a negative impact on performance."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un rectangle que conté les posicions de totes les partícules "
"existents.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'utilitza la representació amb fils, aquest mètode "
"sincronitza el fil de representació. Trucar-lo sovint pot tenir un impacte "
"negatiu en el rendiment."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Sets this node's properties to match a given [CPUParticles2D] node."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les propietats d'aquest node perquè coincideixin amb un node "
"[CPUParticles2D] determinat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emits a single particle. Whether [param xform], [param velocity], [param "
"color] and [param custom] are applied depends on the value of [param flags]. "
"See [enum EmitFlags].\n"
"The default ParticleProcessMaterial will overwrite [param color] and use the "
"contents of [param custom] as [code](rotation, age, animation, lifetime)[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method emit_particle] is only supported on the Forward+ and "
"Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Emet una sola partícula. Si s'apliquen [param xform], [param velocity], "
"[param color] i [param custom] depèn del valor de [param flags]. Veure [enum "
"EmitFlags].\n"
"El ParticleProcessMaterial predeterminat sobreescriurà [param color] i "
"utilitzarà el contingut de [param custom] com a [code](rotació, edat, "
"animació, vida útil)[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method emit_particle] només és compatible amb els mètodes de "
"representació Forward+ i Mobile, no la compatibilitat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Restarts the particle emission cycle, clearing existing particles. To avoid "
"particles vanishing from the viewport, wait for the [signal finished] signal "
"before calling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [signal finished] signal is only emitted by [member "
"one_shot] emitters.\n"
"If [param keep_seed] is [code]true[/code], the current random seed will be "
"preserved. Useful for seeking and playback."
msgstr ""
"Reinicia el cicle d'emissió de partícules, eliminant les partícules "
"existents. Per evitar que les partícules desapareguin de la finestra "
"gràfica, espereu el senyal [signal finished] abans de trucar.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El senyal [signal finished] només l'emeten els emissors [member "
"one_shot].\n"
"Si [param keep_seed] és [code]true[/code], es conservarà la llavor aleatòria "
"actual. Útil per buscar i reproduir."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of particles to emit in one emission cycle. The effective "
"emission rate is [code](amount * amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] particles "
"per second. Higher values will increase GPU requirements, even if not all "
"particles are visible at a given time or if [member amount_ratio] is "
"decreased.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value will cause the particle system to restart. "
"To avoid this, change [member amount_ratio] instead."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de partícules a emetre en un cicle d'emissió. La taxa d'emissió "
"efectiva és [code](amount * amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] partícules per "
"segon. Els valors més alts augmentaran els requisits de la GPU, fins i tot "
"si no totes les partícules són visibles en un moment determinat o si es "
"redueix [member amount_ratio].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si canvieu aquest valor, el sistema de partícules es "
"reiniciarà. Per evitar-ho, canvieu [member amount_ratio]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The ratio of particles that should actually be emitted. If set to a value "
"lower than [code]1.0[/code], this will set the amount of emitted particles "
"throughout the lifetime to [code]amount * amount_ratio[/code]. Unlike "
"changing [member amount], changing [member amount_ratio] while emitting does "
"not affect already-emitted particles and doesn't cause the particle system "
"to restart. [member amount_ratio] can be used to create effects that make "
"the number of emitted particles vary over time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Reducing the [member amount_ratio] has no performance benefit, "
"since resources need to be allocated and processed for the total [member "
"amount] of particles regardless of the [member amount_ratio]. If you don't "
"intend to change the number of particles emitted while the particles are "
"emitting, make sure [member amount_ratio] is set to [code]1[/code] and "
"change [member amount] to your liking instead."
msgstr ""
"La proporció de partícules que realment s'han d'emetre. Si s'estableix en un "
"valor inferior a [code]1.0[/code], això establirà la quantitat de partícules "
"emeses durant tota la vida útil a [code]amount * amount_ratio[/code]. A "
"diferència de canviar [member amount], canviar [member amount_ratio] mentre "
"s'emet no afecta les partícules ja emeses i no fa que el sistema de "
"partícules es reiniciï. [member amount_ratio] es pot utilitzar per crear "
"efectes que fan que el nombre de partícules emeses variï al llarg del "
"temps.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La reducció de [member amount_ratio] no té cap benefici de "
"rendiment, ja que els recursos s'han d'assignar i processar per a la [member "
"amount] total de partícules independentment de la [member amount_ratio]. Si "
"no teniu intenció de canviar el nombre de partícules emeses mentre emeten "
"les partícules, assegureu-vos que [member amount_ratio] estigui establert a "
"[code]1[/code] i canvieu [member amount] al vostre gust."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplier for particle's collision radius. [code]1.0[/code] corresponds to "
"the size of the sprite. If particles appear to sink into the ground when "
"colliding, increase this value. If particles appear to float when colliding, "
"decrease this value. Only effective if [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] is [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particles always have a spherical collision shape."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador del radi de col·lisió de partícules. [code]1.0[/code] "
"correspon a la mida del sprite. Si les partícules semblen enfonsar-se al "
"terra en xocar, augmenta aquest valor. Si les partícules semblen flotar en "
"xocar, reduïu aquest valor. Només efectiu si [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] és [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] o [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les partícules sempre tenen una forma de col·lisió esfèrica."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles are being emitted. [member emitting] can be "
"used to start and stop particles from emitting. However, if [member "
"one_shot] is [code]true[/code] setting [member emitting] to [code]true[/"
"code] will not restart the emission cycle unless all active particles have "
"finished processing. Use the [signal finished] signal to be notified once "
"all active particles finish processing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For [member one_shot] emitters, due to the particles being "
"computed on the GPU, there may be a short period after receiving the [signal "
"finished] signal during which setting this to [code]true[/code] will not "
"restart the emission cycle.\n"
"[b]Tip:[/b] If your [member one_shot] emitter needs to immediately restart "
"emitting particles once [signal finished] signal is received, consider "
"calling [method restart] instead of setting [member emitting]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Causes all the particles in this node to interpolate towards the end of "
"their lifetime.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only works when used with a [ParticleProcessMaterial]. It "
"needs to be manually implemented for custom process shaders."
msgstr ""
"Fa que totes les partícules d'aquest node s'interpolin cap al final de la "
"seva vida útil.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només funciona quan s'utilitza amb un "
"[ParticleProcessMaterial]. S'ha d'implementar manualment per als shaders de "
"processos personalitzats."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Enables particle interpolation, which makes the particle movement smoother "
"when their [member fixed_fps] is lower than the screen refresh rate."
msgstr ""
"Habilita la interpolació de partícules, la qual cosa fa que el moviment de "
"partícules sigui més suau quan el seu [member fixed_fps] és inferior a la "
"freqüència d'actualització de la pantalla."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of time each particle will exist (in seconds). The effective "
"emission rate is [code](amount * amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] particles "
"per second."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de temps que existirà cada partícula (en segons). La taxa "
"d'emissió efectiva és [code](amount * amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] "
"partícules per segon."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space "
"(known as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate "
"along the [GPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated. If [code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will "
"not move or rotate along the [GPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it "
"is moved or rotated."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les partícules utilitzen l'espai de coordenades del "
"node pare (conegut com a coordenades locals). Això farà que les partícules "
"es moguin i giren al llarg del node [GPUParticles2D] (i dels seus pares) "
"quan es mou o gira. Si [code]false[/code], les partícules utilitzen "
"coordenades globals; no es mouran ni giraran al llarg del node "
"[GPUParticles2D] (i dels seus pares) quan es mou o gira."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particle system starts as if it had already run for this many seconds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This can be very expensive if set to a high number as it "
"requires running the particle shader a number of times equal to the [member "
"fixed_fps] (or 30, if [member fixed_fps] is 0) for every second. In extreme "
"cases it can even lead to a GPU crash due to the volume of work done in a "
"single frame."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de partícules comença com si ja hagués funcionat durant tants "
"segons.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això pot ser molt car si s'estableix en un nombre alt, ja que "
"requereix executar l'ombrejador de partícules un nombre de vegades igual al "
"[member fixed_fps] (o 30, si [member fixed_fps] és 0) per cada segon. En "
"casos extrems, fins i tot pot provocar una fallada de la GPU a causa del "
"volum de treball realitzat en un únic fotograma."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"[Material] for processing particles. Can be a [ParticleProcessMaterial] or a "
"[ShaderMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"[Material] per processar partícules. Pot ser un [ParticleProcessMaterial] o "
"un [ShaderMaterial]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to another [GPUParticles2D] node that will be used as a subemitter (see "
"[member ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). Subemitters can be used "
"to achieve effects such as fireworks, sparks on collision, bubbles popping "
"into water drops, and more.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member sub_emitter] is set, the target [GPUParticles2D] "
"node will no longer emit particles on its own."
msgstr ""
"Camí a un altre node [GPUParticles2D] que s'utilitzarà com a subemissor "
"(vegeu [member ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). Els subemissors "
"es poden utilitzar per aconseguir efectes com ara focs artificials, espurnes "
"en col·lisió, bombolles que esclaten en gotes d'aigua i molt més.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'estableix [member sub_emitter], el node [GPUParticles2D] "
"objectiu ja no emetrà partícules per si mateix."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particle texture. If [code]null[/code], particles will be squares with a "
"size of 1×1 pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To use a flipbook texture, assign a new [CanvasItemMaterial] to "
"the [GPUParticles2D]'s [member CanvasItem.material] property, then enable "
"[member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation] and set [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_h_frames], [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_v_frames], and [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] to match the flipbook texture."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables particle trails using a mesh skinning system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [GPUParticles3D], the number of trail sections and "
"subdivisions is set with the [member trail_sections] and [member "
"trail_section_subdivisions] properties."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita els rastres de partícules mitjançant un "
"sistema de pell de malla.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A diferència de [GPUParticles3D], el nombre de seccions i "
"subdivisions del camí s'estableix amb les propietats [member trail_sections] "
"i [member trail_section_subdivisions]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of time the particle's trail should represent (in seconds). Only "
"effective if [member trail_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de temps que ha de representar el rastre de la partícula (en "
"segons). Només efectiu si [member trail_enabled] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of subdivisions to use for the particle trail rendering. Higher "
"values can result in smoother trail curves, at the cost of performance due "
"to increased mesh complexity. See also [member trail_sections]. Only "
"effective if [member trail_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de subdivisions que cal utilitzar per a la representació del "
"rastre de partícules. Els valors més alts poden donar lloc a corbes de "
"sender més suaus, a costa del rendiment a causa de l'augment de la "
"complexitat de la malla. Vegeu també [member trail_sections]. Només efectiu "
"si [member trail_enabled] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of sections to use for the particle trail rendering. Higher "
"values can result in smoother trail curves, at the cost of performance due "
"to increased mesh complexity. See also [member trail_section_subdivisions]. "
"Only effective if [member trail_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de seccions que s'utilitzaran per a la representació del rastre de "
"partícules. Els valors més alts poden donar lloc a corbes de sender més "
"suaus, a costa del rendiment a causa de l'augment de la complexitat de la "
"malla. Vegeu també [member trail_section_subdivisions]. Només efectiu si "
"[member trail_enabled] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Rect2] that determines the node's region which needs to be visible on "
"screen for the particle system to be active.\n"
"Grow the rect if particles suddenly appear/disappear when the node enters/"
"exits the screen. The [Rect2] can be grown via code or with the [b]Particles "
"→ Generate Visibility Rect[/b] editor tool."
msgstr ""
"El [Rect2] que determina la regió del node que ha de ser visible a la "
"pantalla perquè el sistema de partícules estigui actiu.\n"
"Feu créixer el rect si les partícules apareixen o desapareixen de sobte quan "
"el node entra o surt de la pantalla. El [Rect2] es pot fer créixer "
"mitjançant codi o amb l'eina d'editor [b]Particles → Genera visibilitat "
"Rect[/b]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when all active particles have finished processing. To immediately "
"restart the emission cycle, call [method restart].\n"
"This signal is never emitted when [member one_shot] is disabled, as "
"particles will be emitted and processed continuously.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For [member one_shot] emitters, due to the particles being "
"computed on the GPU, there may be a short period after receiving the signal "
"during which setting [member emitting] to [code]true[/code] will not restart "
"the emission cycle. This delay is avoided by instead calling [method "
"restart]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles are drawn in reverse order of remaining lifetime. In other words, "
"the particle with the lowest lifetime is drawn at the front."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules es dibuixen en ordre invers del temps de vida restant. En "
"altres paraules, la partícula amb la vida útil més baixa es dibuixa al "
"davant."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Particle starts at the specified position."
msgstr "La partícula comença a la posició especificada."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Particle starts with specified rotation and scale."
msgstr "La partícula comença amb la rotació i l'escala especificades."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Particle starts with the specified velocity vector, which defines the "
"emission direction and speed."
msgstr ""
"La partícula comença amb el vector velocitat especificat, que defineix la "
"direcció i la velocitat d'emissió."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Particle starts with specified color."
msgstr "La partícula comença amb el color especificat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Particle starts with specified [code]CUSTOM[/code] data."
msgstr "La partícula comença amb les dades especificades [code]CUSTOM[/code]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "A 3D particle emitter."
msgstr "Un emissor de partícules 3D."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"3D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and effects. "
"[GPUParticles3D] features an emitter that generates some number of particles "
"at a given rate.\n"
"Use [member process_material] to add a [ParticleProcessMaterial] to "
"configure particle appearance and behavior. Alternatively, you can add a "
"[ShaderMaterial] which will be applied to all particles."
msgstr ""
"Node de partícules 3D utilitzat per crear una varietat de sistemes i efectes "
"de partícules. [GPUParticles3D] inclou un emissor que genera un cert nombre "
"de partícules a una velocitat determinada.\n"
"Utilitzeu [member process_material] per afegir un [ParticleProcessMaterial] "
"per configurar l'aspecte i el comportament de les partícules. "
"Alternativament, podeu afegir un [ShaderMaterial] que s'aplicarà a totes les "
"partícules."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Controlling thousands of fish with Particles"
msgstr "Controlant milers de peixos amb partícules"

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Sets this node's properties to match a given [CPUParticles3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les propietats d'aquest node perquè coincideixin amb un node "
"[CPUParticles3D] determinat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [Mesh] that is drawn at index [param pass]."
msgstr "Retorna el [Mesh] que es dibuixa a l'índex [param pass]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Sets the [Mesh] that is drawn at index [param pass]."
msgstr "Estableix el [Mesh] que es dibuixa a l'índex [param pass]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The base diameter for particle collision in meters. If particles appear to "
"sink into the ground when colliding, increase this value. If particles "
"appear to float when colliding, decrease this value. Only effective if "
"[member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] is [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particles always have a spherical collision shape."
msgstr ""
"El diàmetre de la base per a la col·lisió de partícules en metres. Si les "
"partícules semblen enfonsar-se al terra en xocar, augmenta aquest valor. Si "
"les partícules semblen flotar en xocar, reduïu aquest valor. Només efectiu "
"si [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] és [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] o [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les partícules sempre tenen una forma de col·lisió esfèrica."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particle draw order.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant DRAW_ORDER_INDEX] is the only option that supports "
"motion vectors for effects like TAA. It is suggested to use this draw order "
"if the particles are opaque to fix ghosting artifacts."
msgstr ""
"Ordre d'extracció de partícules.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [constant DRAW_ORDER_INDEX] és l'única opció que admet vectors "
"de moviment per a efectes com TAA. Es recomana utilitzar aquest ordre de "
"dibuix si les partícules són opaques per arreglar els artefactes fantasma."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the first draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] que es sorteja per a la primera passada del sorteig."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the second draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] que es sorteja per a la segona passada del sorteig."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the third draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] que es sorteja per a la tercera passada del sorteig."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the fourth draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] que es sorteja per a la quarta passada del sorteig."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "The number of draw passes when rendering particles."
msgstr "El nombre de passades de dibuix en renderitzar partícules."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Time ratio between each emission. If [code]0[/code], particles are emitted "
"continuously. If [code]1[/code], all particles are emitted simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Relació temporal entre cada emissió. Si [code]0[/code], les partícules "
"s'emeten contínuament. Si [code]1[/code], totes les partícules s'emeten "
"simultàniament."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space "
"(known as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate "
"along the [GPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated. If [code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will "
"not move or rotate along the [GPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it "
"is moved or rotated."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les partícules utilitzen l'espai de coordenades del "
"node pare (conegut com a coordenades locals). Això farà que les partícules "
"es moguin i giren al llarg del node [GPUParticles3D] (i dels seus pares) "
"quan es mou o gira. Si [code]false[/code], les partícules utilitzen "
"coordenades globals; no es mouran ni giraran al llarg del node "
"[GPUParticles3D] (i dels seus pares) quan es mou o gira."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], only the number of particles equal to [member amount] "
"will be emitted."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Amount of time to preprocess the particles before animation starts. Lets you "
"start the animation some time after particles have started emitting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This can be very expensive if set to a high number as it "
"requires running the particle shader a number of times equal to the [member "
"fixed_fps] (or 30, if [member fixed_fps] is 0) for every second. In extreme "
"cases it can even lead to a GPU crash due to the volume of work done in a "
"single frame."
msgstr ""
"Quantitat de temps per preprocessar les partícules abans que comenci "
"l'animació. Permet iniciar l'animació un temps després que les partícules "
"hagin començat a emetre.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això pot ser molt car si s'estableix en un nombre alt, ja que "
"requereix executar l'ombrejador de partícules un nombre de vegades igual al "
"[member fixed_fps] (o 30, si [member fixed_fps] és 0) per cada segon. En "
"casos extrems, fins i tot pot provocar una fallada de la GPU a causa del "
"volum de treball realitzat en un únic fotograma."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Emission randomness ratio."
msgstr "Relació d'aleatorietat d'emissions."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Speed scaling ratio. A value of [code]0[/code] can be used to pause the "
"particles."
msgstr ""
"Relació d'escala de velocitat. Un valor de [code]0[/code] es pot utilitzar "
"per aturar les partícules."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to another [GPUParticles3D] node that will be used as a subemitter (see "
"[member ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). Subemitters can be used "
"to achieve effects such as fireworks, sparks on collision, bubbles popping "
"into water drops, and more.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member sub_emitter] is set, the target [GPUParticles3D] "
"node will no longer emit particles on its own."
msgstr ""
"Camí a un altre node [GPUParticles3D] que s'utilitzarà com a subemissor "
"(vegeu [member ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). Els subemissors "
"es poden utilitzar per aconseguir efectes com ara focs artificials, espurnes "
"en col·lisió, bombolles que esclaten en gotes d'aigua i molt més.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'estableix [member sub_emitter], el node [GPUParticles3D] "
"objectiu ja no emetrà partícules per si mateix."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables particle trails using a mesh skinning system. "
"Designed to work with [RibbonTrailMesh] and [TubeTrailMesh].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member BaseMaterial3D.use_particle_trails] must also be "
"enabled on the particle mesh's material. Otherwise, setting [member "
"trail_enabled] to [code]true[/code] will have no effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [GPUParticles2D], the number of trail sections and "
"subdivisions is set in the [RibbonTrailMesh] or the [TubeTrailMesh]'s "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita els rastres de partícules mitjançant un "
"sistema de pell de malla. Dissenyat per funcionar amb [RibbonTrailMesh] i "
"[TubeTrailMesh].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member BaseMaterial3D.use_particle_trails] també s'ha "
"d'habilitar al material de la malla de partícules. En cas contrari, establir "
"[member trail_enabled] a [code]true[/code] no tindrà cap efecte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A diferència de [GPUParticles2D], el nombre de seccions i "
"subdivisions del camí s'estableix a les propietats de [RibbonTrailMesh] o de "
"[TubeTrailMesh]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The alignment of particles. Use this for billboarding and aligning to "
"velocity."
msgstr ""
"L'alineació de les partícules. Utilitzeu-ho per fer cartelleres i alinear-"
"vos a la velocitat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"When using transform align local billboard, which axis to use for the "
"billboarding. Supports only X or Y."
msgstr ""
"Quan utilitzeu transformar alineeu la cartellera local, quin eix utilitzareu "
"per a la cartellera. Només admet X o Y."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"In the case of billboarded particles, which custom channel to read from to "
"calculate their angle."
msgstr ""
"En el cas de les partícules en cartellera, quin canal personalitzat cal "
"llegir per calcular-ne l'angle."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [AABB] that determines the node's region which needs to be visible on "
"screen for the particle system to be active. [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] is added on each of the AABB's axes. "
"Particle collisions and attraction will only occur within this area.\n"
"Grow the box if particles suddenly appear/disappear when the node enters/"
"exits the screen. The [AABB] can be grown via code or with the [b]Particles "
"→ Generate AABB[/b] editor tool.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member visibility_aabb] is overridden by [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.custom_aabb] if that property is set to a non-default "
"value."
msgstr ""
"El [AABB] que determina la regió del node que ha de ser visible a la "
"pantalla perquè el sistema de partícules estigui actiu. [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] s'afegeix a cadascun dels eixos de "
"l'AABB. Les col·lisions i l'atracció de partícules només es produiran dins "
"d'aquesta zona.\n"
"Feu créixer la caixa si les partícules apareixen o desapareixen de sobte "
"quan el node entra o surt de la pantalla. El [AABB] es pot fer créixer "
"mitjançant codi o amb l'eina d'editor [b]Particles → Genera AABB[/b].\n"
"[b]Nota: [/b] [member visibility_aabb] se substitueix per [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.custom_aabb] si aquesta propietat s'estableix en un valor "
"no predeterminat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum number of draw passes supported."
msgstr "Nombre màxim de passades de sorteig admeses."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Do not align particle transforms relative to the camera or velocity."
msgstr ""
"No alineeu les transformacions de partícules en relació amb la càmera o la "
"velocitat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Align each particle's Z axis to face the camera."
msgstr "Alineeu l'eix Z de cada partícula per mirar la càmera."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Align each particle's Y axis to the velocity vector."
msgstr "Alineeu l'eix Y de cada partícula amb el vector velocitat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Align each particle's Z axis to face the camera and Y axis to the velocity "
"vector."
msgstr ""
"Alineeu l'eix Z de cada partícula per mirar la càmera i l'eix Y al vector "
"velocitat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Align each particle's Z axis to face the camera, while preserving a given "
"axis (X or Y)."
msgstr ""
"Alineeu l'eix Z de cada partícula per mirar la càmera, tot conservant un eix "
"determinat (X o Y)."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractor3D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for 3D particle attractors."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a atractors de partícules 3D."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractor3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particle attractors can be used to attract particles towards the attractor's "
"origin, or to push them away from the attractor's origin.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"Attractors can be temporarily disabled by hiding them, or by setting their "
"[member strength] to [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Els atractors de partícules es poden utilitzar per atreure partícules cap a "
"l'origen de l'atractor o per allunyar-les de l'origen de l'atractor.\n"
"Els atractors de partícules funcionen en temps real i es poden moure, girar "
"i escalar durant el joc. A diferència de les formes de col·lisió, també "
"s'admet l'escala no uniforme dels atractors.\n"
"Els atractius es poden desactivar temporalment amagant-los o configurant el "
"seu [member strength] a [code]@0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els atractius de partícules només afecten [GPUParticles3D], no "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractor3D.xml
msgid ""
"The particle attractor's attenuation. Higher values result in more gradual "
"pushing of particles as they come closer to the attractor's origin. Zero or "
"negative values will cause particles to be pushed very fast as soon as the "
"touch the attractor's edges."
msgstr ""
"Atenuació de l'atractor de partícules. Els valors més alts donen lloc a una "
"empenta més gradual de les partícules a mesura que s'acosten a l'origen de "
"l'atractor. Els valors zero o negatius faran que les partícules s'impulsin "
"molt ràpidament tan bon punt toquin les vores de l'atractor."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractor3D.xml
msgid ""
"The particle rendering layers ([member VisualInstance3D.layers]) that will "
"be affected by the attractor. By default, all particles are affected by an "
"attractor.\n"
"After configuring particle nodes accordingly, specific layers can be "
"unchecked to prevent certain particles from being affected by attractors. "
"For example, this can be used if you're using an attractor as part of a "
"spell effect but don't want the attractor to affect unrelated weather "
"particles at the same position.\n"
"Particle attraction can also be disabled on a per-process material basis by "
"setting [member ParticleProcessMaterial.attractor_interaction_enabled] on "
"the [GPUParticles3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de renderització de partícules ([member VisualInstance3D.layers]) "
"que es veuran afectades per l'atractor. Per defecte, totes les partícules es "
"veuen afectades per un atractor.\n"
"Després de configurar els nodes de partícules en conseqüència, es poden "
"desmarcar capes específiques per evitar que determinades partícules es vegin "
"afectades pels atractors. Per exemple, això es pot utilitzar si utilitzeu un "
"atractiu com a part d'un efecte d'encanteri, però no voleu que l'atractor "
"afecti partícules meteorològiques no relacionades a la mateixa posició.\n"
"L'atracció de partícules també es pot desactivar segons el material per "
"procés configurant [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.attractor_interaction_enabled] al node "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractor3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adjusts how directional the attractor is. At [code]0.0[/code], the attractor "
"is not directional at all: it will attract particles towards its center. At "
"[code]1.0[/code], the attractor is fully directional: particles will always "
"be pushed towards local -Z (or +Z if [member strength] is negative).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member directionality] is greater than [code]0.0[/code], "
"the direction in which particles are pushed can be changed by rotating the "
"[GPUParticlesAttractor3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta la direccionalitat de l'atractor. A [code]0.0[/code], l'atractor no "
"és gens direccional: atraurà partícules cap al seu centre. A [code]1.0[/"
"code], l'atractor és totalment direccional: les partícules sempre seran "
"empès cap a -Z local (o +Z si [member strength] és negatiu).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si [member directionality] és més gran que [code]0.0[/code], la "
"direcció en què s'empenyen les partícules es pot canviar girant el "
"[GPUParticlesAttractor3D] node_10."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractor3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adjusts the strength of the attractor. If [member strength] is negative, "
"particles will be pushed in the opposite direction. Particles will be pushed "
"[i]away[/i] from the attractor's origin if [member directionality] is "
"[code]0.0[/code], or towards local +Z if [member directionality] is greater "
"than [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta la força de l'atractor. Si [member strength] és negatiu, les "
"partícules seran empès en la direcció oposada. Les partícules seran empès "
"[i]away[/i] des de l'origen de l'atractor si [member directionality] és "
"[code]@0.0[/code], o cap a +Z local si [member directionality] és superior "
"a__6@@ [code]0.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D.xml
msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Un atractor en forma de caixa que influeix en les partícules dels nodes "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D.xml
msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes. Can be used to attract particles towards its origin, or to push them "
"away from its origin.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Un atractor en forma de caixa que influeix en les partícules dels nodes "
"[GPUParticles3D]. Es pot utilitzar per atreure partícules cap al seu origen, "
"o per allunyar-les del seu origen.\n"
"Els atractors de partícules funcionen en temps real i es poden moure, girar "
"i escalar durant el joc. A diferència de les formes de col·lisió, també "
"s'admet l'escala no uniforme dels atractors.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els atractius de partícules només afecten [GPUParticles3D], no "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D.xml
msgid "The attractor box's size in 3D units."
msgstr "Mida de la caixa de l'atractiu en unitats 3D."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D.xml
msgid ""
"A spheroid-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"Un atractor en forma d'esferoide que influeix en les partícules dels nodes "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D.xml
msgid ""
"A spheroid-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes. Can be used to attract particles towards its origin, or to push them "
"away from its origin.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Un atractor en forma d'esferoide que influeix en les partícules dels nodes "
"[GPUParticles3D]. Es pot utilitzar per atreure partícules cap al seu origen, "
"o per allunyar-les del seu origen.\n"
"Els atractors de partícules funcionen en temps real i es poden moure, girar "
"i escalar durant el joc. A diferència de les formes de col·lisió, també "
"s'admet l'escala no uniforme dels atractors.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els atractius de partícules només afecten [GPUParticles3D], no "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D.xml
msgid ""
"The attractor sphere's radius in 3D units.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Stretched ellipses can be obtained by using non-uniform scaling "
"on the [GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Radi de l'esfera atractora en unitats 3D.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Es poden obtenir el·lipses estirades utilitzant l'escala no "
"uniforme al node [GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.xml
msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor with varying directions and strengths defined in it "
"that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Un atractor en forma de caixa amb diferents direccions i forces definides "
"que influeix en les partícules dels nodes [GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.xml
msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor with varying directions and strengths defined in it "
"that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Unlike [GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D], [GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] "
"uses a [member texture] to affect attraction strength within the box. This "
"can be used to create complex attraction scenarios where particles travel in "
"different directions depending on their location. This can be useful for "
"weather effects such as sandstorms.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Un atractor en forma de caixa amb diferents direccions i forces definides "
"que influeix en les partícules dels nodes [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"A diferència de [GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D], "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] utilitza un [member texture] per "
"afectar la força d'atracció dins de la caixa. Això es pot utilitzar per "
"crear escenaris d'atracció complexos on les partícules viatgen en diferents "
"direccions segons la seva ubicació. Això pot ser útil per als efectes "
"meteorològics com les tempestes de sorra.\n"
"Els atractors de partícules funcionen en temps real i es poden moure, girar "
"i escalar durant el joc. A diferència de les formes de col·lisió, també "
"s'admet l'escala no uniforme dels atractors.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els atractius de partícules només afecten [GPUParticles3D], no "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.xml
msgid "The size of the vector field box in 3D units."
msgstr "La mida del quadre de camp vectorial en unitats 3D."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D texture to be used. Values are linearly interpolated between the "
"texture's pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To get better performance, the 3D texture's resolution should "
"reflect the [member size] of the attractor. Since particle attraction is "
"usually low-frequency data, the texture can be kept at a low resolution such "
"as 64×64×64."
msgstr ""
"La textura 3D a utilitzar. Els valors s'interpolen linealment entre els "
"píxels de la textura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per obtenir un millor rendiment, la resolució de la textura 3D "
"hauria de reflectir la [member size] de l'atractor. Com que l'atracció de "
"partícules sol ser dades de baixa freqüència, la textura es pot mantenir a "
"una resolució baixa, com ara 64×64×64."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for 3D particle collision shapes affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a formes de col·lisió de partícules 3D que afecten "
"els nodes [GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particle collision shapes can be used to make particles stop or bounce "
"against them.\n"
"Particle collision shapes work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and "
"scaled during gameplay. Unlike attractors, non-uniform scaling of collision "
"shapes is [i]not[/i] supported.\n"
"Particle collision shapes can be temporarily disabled by hiding them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particles pushed by a collider that is being moved will not be "
"interpolated, which can result in visible stuttering. This can be alleviated "
"by setting [member GPUParticles3D.fixed_fps] to [code]0[/code] or a value "
"that matches or exceeds the target framerate."
msgstr ""
"Les formes de col·lisió de partícules es poden utilitzar per fer que les "
"partícules s'aturin o rebotin contra elles.\n"
"Les formes de col·lisió de partícules funcionen en temps real i es poden "
"moure, girar i escalar durant el joc. A diferència dels atractius, l'escala "
"no uniforme de les formes de col·lisió és [i]not[/i].\n"
"Les formes de col·lisió de partícules es poden desactivar temporalment "
"amagant-les.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ha de ser "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] o [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] al material de procés de "
"[GPUParticles3D] perquè la col·lisió funcioni.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La col·lisió de partícules només afecta a [GPUParticles3D], no "
"a [CPUParticles3D].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les partícules empeses per un col·lisionador que s'està movent "
"no s'interpolaran, cosa que pot provocar un tartamudeig visible. Això es pot "
"alleujar configurant [member GPUParticles3D.fixed_fps] a [code]0[/code] o un "
"valor que coincideixi o superi la velocitat de fotogrames objectiu."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"The particle rendering layers ([member VisualInstance3D.layers]) that will "
"be affected by the collision shape. By default, all particles that have "
"[member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] set to [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] will be affected by a "
"collision shape.\n"
"After configuring particle nodes accordingly, specific layers can be "
"unchecked to prevent certain particles from being affected by colliders. For "
"example, this can be used if you're using a collider as part of a spell "
"effect but don't want the collider to affect unrelated weather particles at "
"the same position.\n"
"Particle collision can also be disabled on a per-process material basis by "
"setting [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] on the "
"[GPUParticles3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de representació de partícules ([member VisualInstance3D.layers]) "
"que es veuran afectades per la forma de col·lisió. Per defecte, totes les "
"partícules que tinguin [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] "
"establert a [constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] o [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] es veuran afectades per "
"una forma de col·lisió.\n"
"Després de configurar els nodes de partícules en conseqüència, es poden "
"desmarcar capes específiques per evitar que determinades partícules es vegin "
"afectades pels col·lisionadors. Per exemple, això es pot utilitzar si feu "
"servir un col·lisionador com a part d'un efecte d'encanteri, però no voleu "
"que el col·lisionador afecti partícules meteorològiques no relacionades a la "
"mateixa posició.\n"
"La col·lisió de partícules també es pot desactivar segons el material per "
"procés configurant [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] al node "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionBox3D.xml
msgid ""
"A box-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D en forma de caixa que afecta els "
"nodes [GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionBox3D.xml
msgid ""
"A box-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Particle collision shapes work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and "
"scaled during gameplay. Unlike attractors, non-uniform scaling of collision "
"shapes is [i]not[/i] supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D en forma de caixa que afecta els "
"nodes [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"Les formes de col·lisió de partícules funcionen en temps real i es poden "
"moure, girar i escalar durant el joc. A diferència dels atractius, l'escala "
"no uniforme de les formes de col·lisió és [i]not[/i].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ha de ser "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] o [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] al material de procés de "
"[GPUParticles3D] perquè la col·lisió funcioni.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La col·lisió de partícules només afecta [GPUParticles3D], no "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionBox3D.xml
msgid "The collision box's size in 3D units."
msgstr "Mida de la caixa de col·lisió en unitats 3D."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"A real-time heightmap-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D en forma de mapa d'alçada en temps "
"real que afecta els nodes [GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"A real-time heightmap-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Heightmap shapes allow for efficiently representing collisions for convex "
"and concave objects with a single \"floor\" (such as terrain). This is less "
"flexible than [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D], but it doesn't require a baking "
"step.\n"
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] can also be regenerated in real-time "
"when it is moved, when the camera moves, or even continuously. This makes "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] a good choice for weather effects such "
"as rain and snow and games with highly dynamic geometry. However, this class "
"is limited since heightmaps cannot represent overhangs (e.g. indoors or "
"caves).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[code]true[/code] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s process material for collision "
"to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D en forma de mapa d'alçada en temps "
"real que afecta els nodes [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"Les formes de mapes d'alçada permeten representar de manera eficient les "
"col·lisions per a objectes convexos i còncaus amb un sol \"pis\" (com el "
"terreny). Això és menys flexible que [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D], però no "
"requereix un pas de cocció.\n"
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] també es pot regenerar en temps real "
"quan es mou, quan la càmera es mou, o fins i tot de manera contínua. Això fa "
"que [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] sigui una bona opció per als "
"efectes meteorològics com la pluja i la neu i els jocs amb una geometria "
"altament dinàmica. Tanmateix, aquesta classe és limitada ja que els mapes "
"d'alçada no poden representar voladissos (per exemple, a l'interior o a les "
"coves).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ha de ser "
"[code]true[/code] al material de procés de [GPUParticles3D] perquè la "
"col·lisió funcioni.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La col·lisió de partícules només afecta [GPUParticles3D], no "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified layer of the [member "
"heightfield_mask] is enabled, given a [param layer_number] between [code]1[/"
"code] and [code]20[/code], inclusive."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la capa especificada de [member "
"heightfield_mask] està habilitada, donada una [param layer_number] entre "
"[code]@1[/code] i [code]20[/code], inclòs."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member heightfield_mask], given a [param layer_number] between [code]1[/"
"code] and [code]20[/code], inclusive."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] will follow "
"the current camera in global space. The [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] "
"does not need to be a child of the [Camera3D] node for this to work.\n"
"Following the camera has a performance cost, as it will force the heightmap "
"to update whenever the camera moves. Consider lowering [member resolution] "
"to improve performance if [member follow_camera_enabled] is [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] seguirà la càmera "
"actual a l'espai global. El [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] no "
"necessita ser un fill del node [Camera3D] perquè això funcioni.\n"
"Seguir la càmera té un cost de rendiment, ja que obligarà a actualitzar el "
"mapa d'alçada sempre que la càmera es mogui. Penseu en reduir [member "
"resolution] per millorar el rendiment si [member follow_camera_enabled] és "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"The visual layers to account for when updating the heightmap. Only "
"[MeshInstance3D]s whose [member VisualInstance3D.layers] match with this "
"[member heightfield_mask] will be included in the heightmap collision "
"update. By default, all 20 user-visible layers are taken into account for "
"updating the heightmap collision.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since the [member heightfield_mask] allows for 32 layers to be "
"stored in total, there are an additional 12 layers that are only used "
"internally by the engine and aren't exposed in the editor. Setting [member "
"heightfield_mask] using a script allows you to toggle those reserved layers, "
"which can be useful for editor plugins.\n"
"To adjust [member heightfield_mask] more easily using a script, use [method "
"get_heightfield_mask_value] and [method set_heightfield_mask_value]."
msgstr ""
"Les capes visuals a tenir en compte en actualitzar el mapa d'alçada. Només "
"[MeshInstance3D]s els [member VisualInstance3D.layers] dels quals "
"coincideixin amb aquest [member heightfield_mask] s'inclouran a "
"l'actualització de col·lisions del mapa d'alçada. Per defecte, les 20 capes "
"visibles per l'usuari es tenen en compte per actualitzar la col·lisió del "
"mapa d'alçada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Com que [member heightfield_mask] permet emmagatzemar 32 capes "
"en total, hi ha 12 capes addicionals que només s'utilitzen internament pel "
"motor i no s'exposen a l'editor. Establir [member heightfield_mask] "
"mitjançant un script us permet canviar aquestes capes reservades, cosa que "
"pot ser útil per als connectors d'editor.\n"
"Per ajustar [member heightfield_mask] més fàcilment mitjançant un script, "
"utilitzeu [method get_heightfield_mask_value] i [method "
"set_heightfield_mask_value]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Higher resolutions can represent small details more accurately in large "
"scenes, at the cost of lower performance. If [member update_mode] is "
"[constant UPDATE_MODE_ALWAYS], consider using the lowest resolution possible."
msgstr ""
"Les resolucions més altes poden representar petits detalls amb més precisió "
"en escenes grans, a costa d'un rendiment inferior. Si [member update_mode] "
"és [constant UPDATE_MODE_ALWAYS], considereu utilitzar la resolució més "
"baixa possible."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"The collision heightmap's size in 3D units. To improve heightmap quality, "
"[member size] should be set as small as possible while covering the parts of "
"the scene you need."
msgstr ""
"Mida del mapa d'alçada de col·lisió en unitats 3D. Per millorar la qualitat "
"del mapa d'alçada, [member size] s'ha de configurar el més petit possible "
"mentre cobreix les parts de l'escena que necessiteu."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid "The update policy to use for the generated heightmap."
msgstr ""
"La política d'actualització que s'ha d'utilitzar per al mapa d'alçada "
"generat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a 256×256 heightmap. Intended for small-scale scenes, or larger "
"scenes with no distant particles."
msgstr ""
"Genereu un mapa d'alçada de 256×256. Destinat a escenes a petita escala o "
"escenes més grans sense partícules llunyanes."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a 512×512 heightmap. Intended for medium-scale scenes, or larger "
"scenes with no distant particles."
msgstr ""
"Genereu un mapa d'alçada de 512 × 512. Destinat a escenes a escala mitjana o "
"escenes més grans sense partícules llunyanes."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a 1024×1024 heightmap. Intended for large scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr ""
"Genereu un mapa d'alçada de 1024×1024. Destinat a escenes grans amb "
"partícules llunyanes."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a 2048×2048 heightmap. Intended for very large scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr ""
"Genereu un mapa d'alçada de 2048 × 2048. Destinat a escenes molt grans amb "
"partícules llunyanes."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a 4096×4096 heightmap. Intended for huge scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr ""
"Genereu un mapa d'alçada de 4096 × 4096. Destinat a escenes enormes amb "
"partícules llunyanes."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a 8192×8192 heightmap. Intended for gigantic scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr ""
"Genereu un mapa d'alçada de 8192 × 8192. Destinat a escenes gegantines amb "
"partícules llunyanes."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Resolution] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum Resolution]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Only update the heightmap when the [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] node "
"is moved, or when the camera moves if [member follow_camera_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]. An update can be forced by slightly moving the "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] in any direction, or by calling [method "
"RenderingServer.particles_collision_height_field_update]."
msgstr ""
"Actualitzeu el mapa d'alçada només quan es mogui el node "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] o quan la càmera es mogui si [member "
"follow_camera_enabled] és [code]true[/code]. Es pot forçar una actualització "
"movent lleugerament [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] en qualsevol "
"direcció o trucant a [method "
"RenderingServer.particles_collision_height_field_update]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml
msgid ""
"Update the heightmap every frame. This has a significant performance cost. "
"This update should only be used when geometry that particles can collide "
"with changes significantly during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"Actualitzeu el mapa d'alçada a cada fotograma. Això té un cost de rendiment "
"important. Aquesta actualització només s'ha d'utilitzar quan la geometria "
"amb què les partícules poden xocar canvia significativament durant el joc."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"A baked signed distance field 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D d'un camp de distància signat al "
"forn que afecta els nodes [GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"A baked signed distance field 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Signed distance fields (SDF) allow for efficiently representing approximate "
"collision shapes for convex and concave objects of any shape. This is more "
"flexible than [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D], but it requires a baking "
"step.\n"
"[b]Baking:[/b] The signed distance field texture can be baked by selecting "
"the [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] node in the editor, then clicking [b]Bake "
"SDF[/b] at the top of the 3D viewport. Any [i]visible[/i] [MeshInstance3D]s "
"within the [member size] will be taken into account for baking, regardless "
"of their [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Baking a [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D]'s [member texture] is "
"only possible within the editor, as there is no bake method exposed for use "
"in exported projects. However, it's still possible to load pre-baked "
"[Texture3D]s into its [member texture] property in an exported project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D d'un camp de distància signat al "
"forn que afecta els nodes [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"Els camps de distància signats (SDF) permeten representar de manera eficient "
"formes de col·lisió aproximades per a objectes convexos i còncaus de "
"qualsevol forma. Això és més flexible que "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D], però requereix un pas de cocció.\n"
"[b]Baking:[/b] La textura del camp de distància signada es pot preparar "
"seleccionant el node [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] a l'editor i després fent "
"clic a [b]Bake SDF[/b] a la part superior de la finestra de visualització. "
"Qualsevol [i]visible[/i] [MeshInstance3D] dins de [member size] es tindrà en "
"compte per coure, independentment de la seva [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Enfornar un [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] de [member texture] "
"només és possible dins de l'editor, ja que no hi ha cap mètode de cocció "
"exposat per utilitzar-lo en projectes exportats. Tanmateix, encara és "
"possible carregar [Texture3D]s precuinats a la seva propietat [member "
"texture] en un projecte exportat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ha de ser "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] o [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] al material de procés de "
"[GPUParticles3D] perquè funcioni la col·lisió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La col·lisió de partícules només afecta a [GPUParticles3D], no "
"a [CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
#: doc/classes/OccluderInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member bake_mask] is "
"enabled, given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si la capa especificada de [member bake_mask] està habilitada o no, "
"donat un [param layer_number] entre 1 i 32."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
#: doc/classes/OccluderInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member bake_mask], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"Basat en [param value], habilita o desactiva la capa especificada a [member "
"bake_mask], donat un [param layer_number] entre 1 i 32."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"The visual layers to account for when baking the particle collision SDF. "
"Only [MeshInstance3D]s whose [member VisualInstance3D.layers] match with "
"this [member bake_mask] will be included in the generated particle collision "
"SDF. By default, all objects are taken into account for the particle "
"collision SDF baking."
msgstr ""
"Les capes visuals a tenir en compte en coure la col·lisió de partícules SDF. "
"Només els [MeshInstance3D]s els quals [member VisualInstance3D.layers] "
"coincideixen amb aquest [member bake_mask] s'inclouran a l'SDF de col·lisió "
"de partícules generada. Per defecte, tots els objectes es tenen en compte "
"per a la cocció SDF de col·lisió de partícules."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"The bake resolution to use for the signed distance field [member texture]. "
"The texture must be baked again for changes to the [member resolution] "
"property to be effective. Higher resolutions have a greater performance cost "
"and take more time to bake. Higher resolutions also result in larger baked "
"textures, leading to increased VRAM and storage space requirements. To "
"improve performance and reduce bake times, use the lowest resolution "
"possible for the object you're representing the collision of."
msgstr ""
"La resolució de cocció que cal utilitzar per al camp de distància signat "
"[member texture]. La textura s'ha de tornar al forn perquè els canvis a la "
"propietat [member resolution] siguin efectius. Les resolucions més altes "
"tenen un cost de rendiment més gran i triguen més temps a coure. Les "
"resolucions més altes també donen lloc a textures al forn més grans, la qual "
"cosa comporta un augment de la VRAM i els requisits d'espai "
"d'emmagatzematge. Per millorar el rendiment i reduir els temps de cocció, "
"utilitzeu la resolució més baixa possible per a l'objecte del qual "
"representeu la col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"The collision SDF's size in 3D units. To improve SDF quality, the [member "
"size] should be set as small as possible while covering the parts of the "
"scene you need."
msgstr ""
"Mida de la col·lisió SDF en unitats 3D. Per millorar la qualitat de l'SDF, "
"[member size] s'ha de configurar el més petit possible mentre cobreix les "
"parts de l'escena que necessiteu."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid "The 3D texture representing the signed distance field."
msgstr "La textura 3D que representa el camp de distància signat."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"The collision shape's thickness. Unlike other particle colliders, "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] is actually hollow on the inside. [member "
"thickness] can be increased to prevent particles from tunneling through the "
"collision shape at high speeds, or when the [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] is "
"moved."
msgstr ""
"El gruix de la forma de col·lisió. A diferència d'altres col·lisionadors de "
"partícules, [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] és realment buit a l'interior. "
"[member thickness] es pot augmentar per evitar que les partícules entrin en "
"túnel a través de la forma de col·lisió a altes velocitats, o quan es mou el "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"Bake a 16×16×16 signed distance field. This is the fastest option, but also "
"the least precise."
msgstr ""
"Enforna un camp de distància signat de 16×16×16. Aquesta és l'opció més "
"ràpida, però també la menys precisa."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid "Bake a 32×32×32 signed distance field."
msgstr "Enforna un camp de distància signat de 32×32×32."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid "Bake a 64×64×64 signed distance field."
msgstr "Enforna un camp de distància signat de 64×64×64."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid "Bake a 128×128×128 signed distance field."
msgstr "Enforna un camp de distància signat de 128×128×128."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid "Bake a 256×256×256 signed distance field."
msgstr "Enforna un camp de distància signat de 256×256×256."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.xml
msgid ""
"Bake a 512×512×512 signed distance field. This is the slowest option, but "
"also the most precise."
msgstr ""
"Enforna un camp de distància signat de 512×512×512. Aquesta és l'opció més "
"lenta, però també la més precisa."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSphere3D.xml
msgid ""
"A sphere-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D en forma d'esfera que afecta els "
"nodes [GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSphere3D.xml
msgid ""
"A sphere-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes.\n"
"Particle collision shapes work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and "
"scaled during gameplay. Unlike attractors, non-uniform scaling of collision "
"shapes is [i]not[/i] supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de col·lisió de partícules 3D en forma d'esfera que afecta els "
"nodes [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"Les formes de col·lisió de partícules funcionen en temps real i es poden "
"moure, girar i escalar durant el joc. A diferència dels atractius, l'escala "
"no uniforme de les formes de col·lisió és [i]not[/i].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ha de ser "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] o [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] al material de procés de "
"[GPUParticles3D] perquè la col·lisió funcioni.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La col·lisió de partícules només afecta [GPUParticles3D], no "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/GPUParticlesCollisionSphere3D.xml
msgid "The collision sphere's radius in 3D units."
msgstr "Radi de l'esfera de col·lisió en unitats 3D."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "A color transition."
msgstr "Una transició de color."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"This resource describes a color transition by defining a set of colored "
"points and how to interpolate between them.\n"
"See also [Curve] which supports more complex easing methods, but does not "
"support colors."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recurs descriu una transició de color definint un conjunt de punts de "
"colors i com interpolar-los entre ells.\n"
"Vegeu també [Curve] que admet mètodes d'alleujament més complexos, però no "
"admet colors."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Adds the specified color to the gradient, with the specified offset."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix el color especificat al degradat, amb el desplaçament especificat."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Returns the color of the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr "Retorna el color del color degradat a l'índex [param point]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Returns the offset of the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el desplaçament del color del degradat a l'índex [param point]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Returns the number of colors in the gradient."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de colors del gradient."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Removes the color at index [param point]."
msgstr "Elimina el color a l'índex [param point]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"Reverses/mirrors the gradient.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method mirrors all points around the middle of the "
"gradient, which may produce unexpected results when [member "
"interpolation_mode] is set to [constant GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."
msgstr ""
"Inverteix/reflecteix el degradat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode reflecteix tots els punts al voltant del mig del "
"gradient, cosa que pot produir resultats inesperats quan [member "
"interpolation_mode] s'estableix a [constant GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the interpolated color specified by [param offset]. [param offset] "
"should be between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Using a "
"value lower than [code]0.0[/code] will return the same color as [code]0.0[/"
"code], and using a value higher than [code]1.0[/code] will return the same "
"color as [code]1.0[/code]. If your input value is not within this range, "
"consider using [method @GlobalScope.remap] on the input value with output "
"values set to [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Sets the color of the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr "Estableix el color del color del degradat a l'índex [param point]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Sets the offset for the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el desplaçament del color del degradat a l'índex [param point]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"Gradient's colors as a [PackedColorArray].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates all colors at once. To update any "
"color individually use [method set_color]."
msgstr ""
"Colors del degradat com a [PackedColorArray].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La configuració d'aquesta propietat actualitza tots els colors "
"alhora. Per actualitzar qualsevol color individualment, utilitzeu [method "
"set_color]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"The color space used to interpolate between points of the gradient. It does "
"not affect the returned colors, which will always use nonlinear sRGB "
"encoding.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect when [member interpolation_mode] is "
"set to [constant GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."
msgstr ""
"L'espai de color utilitzat per interpolar entre punts del degradat. No "
"afecta els colors retornats, que sempre utilitzaran la codificació sRGB no "
"lineal.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració no té cap efecte quan [member "
"interpolation_mode] s'estableix a [constant GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "The algorithm used to interpolate between points of the gradient."
msgstr "L'algorisme utilitzat per interpolar entre punts del gradient."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"Gradient's offsets as a [PackedFloat32Array].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates all offsets at once. To update "
"any offset individually use [method set_offset]."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçaments del gradient com a [PackedFloat32Array].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En establir aquesta propietat, s'actualitzen tots els "
"desplaçaments alhora. Per actualitzar qualsevol desplaçament individualment, "
"utilitzeu [method set_offset]."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"Constant interpolation, color changes abruptly at each point and stays "
"uniform between. This might cause visible aliasing when used for a gradient "
"texture in some cases."
msgstr ""
"Interpolació constant, el color canvia bruscament en cada punt i es manté "
"uniforme entre ells. Això pot provocar un àlies visible quan s'utilitza per "
"a una textura degradada en alguns casos."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Cubic interpolation."
msgstr "Interpolació cúbica."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "sRGB color space."
msgstr "Espai de color sRGB."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid "Linear sRGB color space."
msgstr "Espai de color sRGB lineal."

#: doc/classes/Gradient.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/]Oklab[/url] color space. This "
"color space provides a smooth and uniform-looking transition between colors."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/]Oklab[/url] espai de color. "
"Aquest espai de color proporciona una transició suau i uniforme entre els "
"colors."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture1D.xml
msgid "A 1D texture that uses colors obtained from a [Gradient]."
msgstr "Una textura 1D que utilitza colors obtinguts a partir d'un [Gradient]."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture1D.xml
msgid ""
"A 1D texture that obtains colors from a [Gradient] to fill the texture data. "
"The texture is filled by sampling the gradient for each pixel. Therefore, "
"the texture does not necessarily represent an exact copy of the gradient, as "
"it may miss some colors if there are not enough pixels. See also "
"[GradientTexture2D], [CurveTexture] and [CurveXYZTexture]."
msgstr ""
"Una textura 1D que obté colors d'un [Gradient] per omplir les dades de "
"textura. La textura s'omple mostrant el gradient de cada píxel. Per tant, la "
"textura no representa necessàriament una còpia exacta del degradat, ja que "
"pot perdre alguns colors si no hi ha prou píxels. Vegeu també "
"[GradientTexture2D], [CurveTexture] i [CurveXYZTexture]."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture1D.xml doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The [Gradient] used to fill the texture."
msgstr "El [Gradient] s'utilitza per omplir la textura."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture1D.xml doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the generated texture will support high dynamic range "
"([constant Image.FORMAT_RGBAF] format). This allows for glow effects to work "
"if [member Environment.glow_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. If [code]false[/"
"code], the generated texture will use low dynamic range; overbright colors "
"will be clamped ([constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] format)."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la textura generada admetrà un alt rang dinàmic "
"([constant Image.FORMAT_RGBAF] format). Això permet que els efectes de "
"resplendor funcionin si [member Environment.glow_enabled] és [code]true[/"
"code]. Si [code]false[/code], la textura generada utilitzarà un rang dinàmic "
"baix; els colors massa brillants es fixaran en format ([constant "
"Image.FORMAT_RGBA8])."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture1D.xml
msgid "The number of color samples that will be obtained from the [Gradient]."
msgstr "El nombre de mostres de color que s'obtindran del [Gradient]."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D texture that creates a pattern with colors obtained from a [Gradient]."
msgstr ""
"Una textura 2D que crea un patró amb colors obtinguts a partir d'un "
"[Gradient]."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D texture that obtains colors from a [Gradient] to fill the texture data. "
"This texture is able to transform a color transition into different patterns "
"such as a linear or a radial gradient. The texture is filled by "
"interpolating colors starting from [member fill_from] to [member fill_to] "
"offsets by default, but the gradient fill can be repeated to cover the "
"entire texture.\n"
"The gradient is sampled individually for each pixel so it does not "
"necessarily represent an exact copy of the gradient (see [member width] and "
"[member height]). See also [GradientTexture1D], [CurveTexture] and "
"[CurveXYZTexture]."
msgstr ""
"Una textura 2D que obté colors d'un [Gradient] per omplir les dades de "
"textura. Aquesta textura és capaç de transformar una transició de color en "
"diferents patrons com ara un degradat lineal o radial. La textura s'omple "
"mitjançant la interpolació de colors a partir de [member fill_from] fins a "
"[member fill_to] desplaçaments per defecte, però el farciment degradat es "
"pot repetir per cobrir tota la textura.\n"
"El gradient es mostra individualment per a cada píxel, de manera que no "
"necessàriament representa una còpia exacta del gradient (vegeu [member "
"width] i [member height]). Vegeu també [GradientTexture1D], [CurveTexture] i "
"[CurveXYZTexture]."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The gradient's fill type."
msgstr "El tipus d'emplenament del gradient."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"The initial offset used to fill the texture specified in UV coordinates."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament inicial utilitzat per omplir la textura especificada en "
"coordenades UV."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The final offset used to fill the texture specified in UV coordinates."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament final utilitzat per omplir la textura especificada en "
"coordenades UV."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of vertical color samples that will be obtained from the "
"[Gradient], which also represents the texture's height."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de mostres de color verticals que s'obtindran del [Gradient], que "
"també representa l'alçada de la textura."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The gradient's repeat type."
msgstr "Tipus de repetició del gradient."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of horizontal color samples that will be obtained from the "
"[Gradient], which also represents the texture's width."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de mostres de color horitzontals que s'obtindran del [Gradient], "
"que també representa l'amplada de la textura."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a straight line."
msgstr "Els colors s'interpolen linealment en línia recta."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a circular pattern."
msgstr "Els colors s'interpolen linealment en un patró circular."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a square pattern."
msgstr "Els colors s'interpolen linealment en un patró quadrat."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a cone pattern."
msgstr "Els colors s'interpolen linealment en un patró de con."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"The gradient fill is restricted to the range defined by [member fill_from] "
"to [member fill_to] offsets."
msgstr ""
"El farciment del degradat està restringit a l'interval definit per [member "
"fill_from] fins a [member fill_to]."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"The texture is filled starting from [member fill_from] to [member fill_to] "
"offsets, repeating the same pattern in both directions."
msgstr ""
"La textura s'omple començant des de [member fill_from] fins als "
"desplaçaments [member fill_to], repetint el mateix patró en ambdues "
"direccions."

#: doc/classes/GradientTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"The texture is filled starting from [member fill_from] to [member fill_to] "
"offsets, mirroring the pattern in both directions."
msgstr ""
"La textura s'omple des de [member fill_from] fins a [member fill_to] "
"desplaçaments, reflectint el patró en ambdues direccions."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid "An editor for graph-like structures, using [GraphNode]s."
msgstr ""
"Un editor per a estructures semblants a gràfics, utilitzant [GraphNode]s."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"[GraphEdit] provides tools for creation, manipulation, and display of "
"various graphs. Its main purpose in the engine is to power the visual "
"programming systems, such as visual shaders, but it is also available for "
"use in user projects.\n"
"[GraphEdit] by itself is only an empty container, representing an infinite "
"grid where [GraphNode]s can be placed. Each [GraphNode] represents a node in "
"the graph, a single unit of data in the connected scheme. [GraphEdit], in "
"turn, helps to control various interactions with nodes and between nodes. "
"When the user attempts to connect, disconnect, or delete a [GraphNode], a "
"signal is emitted in the [GraphEdit], but no action is taken by default. It "
"is the responsibility of the programmer utilizing this control to implement "
"the necessary logic to determine how each request should be handled.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] It is greatly advised to enable low-processor usage mode "
"(see [member OS.low_processor_usage_mode]) when using GraphEdits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Keep in mind that [method Node.get_children] will also return "
"the connection layer node named [code]_connection_layer[/code] due to "
"technical limitations. This behavior may change in future releases."
msgstr ""
"[GraphEdit] proporciona eines per a la creació, manipulació i visualització "
"de diversos gràfics. El seu propòsit principal al motor és alimentar els "
"sistemes de programació visual, com ara els ombrejats visuals, però també "
"està disponible per utilitzar-lo en projectes d'usuari.\n"
"[GraphEdit] només és un contenidor buit, que representa una graella infinita "
"on es poden col·locar [GraphNode]s. Cada [GraphNode] representa un node al "
"gràfic, una única unitat de dades en l'esquema connectat. [GraphEdit], al "
"seu torn, ajuda a controlar diverses interaccions amb nodes i entre nodes. "
"Quan l'usuari intenta connectar-se, desconnectar o eliminar un [GraphNode], "
"s'emet un senyal a [GraphEdit], però no es fa cap acció per defecte. És "
"responsabilitat del programador que utilitza aquest control implementar la "
"lògica necessària per determinar com s'ha de gestionar cada sol·licitud.\n"
"[b]Rendiment:[/b] Es recomana activar el mode d'ús de processador baix "
"(vegeu [member OS.low_processor_usage_mode]) quan feu servir GraphEdits.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Tingueu en compte que [method Node.get_children] també "
"retornarà el node de la capa de connexió anomenat [code]_connection_layer[/"
"code] a causa de limitacions tècniques. Aquest comportament pot canviar en "
"futures versions."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method which can be overridden to customize how connections are "
"drawn."
msgstr ""
"Mètode virtual que es pot substituir per personalitzar com es dibuixen les "
"connexions."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the [param mouse_position] is in the input hot zone.\n"
"By default, a hot zone is a [Rect2] positioned such that its center is at "
"[param in_node].[method GraphNode.get_input_port_position]([param in_port]) "
"(For output's case, call [method GraphNode.get_output_port_position] "
"instead). The hot zone's width is twice the Theme Property "
"[code]port_grab_distance_horizontal[/code], and its height is twice the "
"[code]port_grab_distance_vertical[/code].\n"
"Below is a sample code to help get started:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_input_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_input_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn rect.has_point(mouse_position)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna si [param mouse_position] es troba a la zona activa d'entrada.\n"
"Per defecte, una zona calenta és una [Rect2] posicionada de manera que el "
"seu centre estigui a [param in_node].[method "
"GraphNode.get_input_port_position]([param in_port]) (Per al cas de la "
"sortida, truqueu a [method GraphNode.get_output_port_position]). L'amplada "
"de la zona calenta és el doble de la propietat del tema "
"[code]port_grab_distance_horizontal[/code] i la seva alçada és el doble de "
"[code]port_grab_distance_vertical[/code].\n"
"A continuació es mostra un codi de mostra per ajudar-vos a començar:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_input_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant (\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_input_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\tretorn rect.has_point(posició_del ratolí)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the [param mouse_position] is in the output hot zone. For "
"more information on hot zones, see [method _is_in_input_hotzone].\n"
"Below is a sample code to help get started:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_output_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_output_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn rect.has_point(mouse_position)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna si [param mouse_position] es troba a la zona activa de sortida. Per "
"obtenir més informació sobre les zones calentes, vegeu [method "
"_is_in_input_hotzone].\n"
"A continuació es mostra un codi de mostra per ajudar-vos a començar:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_output_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant (\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_output_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\tretorn rect.has_point(posició_del ratolí)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"This virtual method can be used to insert additional error detection while "
"the user is dragging a connection over a valid port.\n"
"Return [code]true[/code] if the connection is indeed valid or return "
"[code]false[/code] if the connection is impossible. If the connection is "
"impossible, no snapping to the port and thus no connection request to that "
"port will happen.\n"
"In this example a connection to same node is suppressed:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _is_node_hover_valid(from, from_port, to, to_port):\n"
"\treturn from != to\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _IsNodeHoverValid(StringName fromNode, int fromPort, "
"StringName toNode, int toPort)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn fromNode != toNode;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Aquest mètode virtual es pot utilitzar per inserir una detecció d'errors "
"addicional mentre l'usuari arrossega una connexió per un port vàlid.\n"
"Torna [code]true[/code] si la connexió és realment vàlida o retorna "
"[code]false[/code] si la connexió és impossible. Si la connexió és "
"impossible, no hi haurà cap connexió al port i, per tant, no es produirà cap "
"sol·licitud de connexió a aquest port.\n"
"En aquest exemple es suprimeix una connexió al mateix node:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _is_node_hover_valid (des de, des del_port, fins al, cap al_port):\n"
"\ttornar de != a\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"substitució pública bool _IsNodeHoverValid(StringName fromNode, int "
"fromPort, StringName toNode, int toPort)\n"
"{\n"
"\ttorna des del node != cap al node;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Allows the connection between two different port types. The port type is "
"defined individually for the left and the right port of each slot with the "
"[method GraphNode.set_slot] method.\n"
"See also [method is_valid_connection_type] and [method "
"remove_valid_connection_type]."
msgstr ""
"Permet la connexió entre dos tipus de ports diferents. El tipus de port es "
"defineix individualment per al port esquerre i dret de cada ranura amb el "
"mètode [method GraphNode.set_slot].\n"
"Vegeu també [method is_valid_connection_type] i [method "
"remove_valid_connection_type]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Allows to disconnect nodes when dragging from the left port of the "
"[GraphNode]'s slot if it has the specified type. See also [method "
"remove_valid_left_disconnect_type]."
msgstr ""
"Permet desconnectar nodes en arrossegar des del port esquerre de la ranura "
"de [GraphNode] si té el tipus especificat. Vegeu també [method "
"remove_valid_left_disconnect_type]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Allows to disconnect nodes when dragging from the right port of the "
"[GraphNode]'s slot if it has the specified type. See also [method "
"remove_valid_right_disconnect_type]."
msgstr ""
"Permet desconnectar nodes en arrossegar des del port dret de la ranura de "
"[GraphNode] si té el tipus especificat. Vegeu també [method "
"remove_valid_right_disconnect_type]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Rearranges selected nodes in a layout with minimum crossings between "
"connections and uniform horizontal and vertical gap between nodes."
msgstr ""
"Reorganitza els nodes seleccionats en un disseny amb encreuaments mínims "
"entre connexions i un espai uniforme horitzontal i vertical entre nodes."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Attaches the [param element] [GraphElement] to the [param frame] "
"[GraphFrame]."
msgstr "Adjunta [param element] [GraphElement] a [param frame] [GraphFrame]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid "Removes all connections between nodes."
msgstr "Elimina totes les connexions entre nodes."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Create a connection between the [param from_port] of the [param from_node] "
"[GraphNode] and the [param to_port] of the [param to_node] [GraphNode]. If "
"the connection already exists, no connection is created.\n"
"Connections with [param keep_alive] set to [code]false[/code] may be deleted "
"automatically if invalid during a redraw."
msgstr ""
"Creeu una connexió entre [param from_port] de [param from_node] [GraphNode] "
"i [param to_port] de [param to_node] [GraphNode]. Si la connexió ja "
"existeix, no es crea cap connexió.\n"
"Les connexions amb [param keep_alive] establertes a [code]false[/code] es "
"poden suprimir automàticament si no són vàlides durant un redibuixament."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Detaches the [param element] [GraphElement] from the [GraphFrame] it is "
"currently attached to."
msgstr ""
"Separa el [param element] [GraphElement] del [GraphFrame] al qual està "
"connectat actualment."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the connection between the [param from_port] of the [param "
"from_node] [GraphNode] and the [param to_port] of the [param to_node] "
"[GraphNode]. If the connection does not exist, no connection is removed."
msgstr ""
"Elimina la connexió entre [param from_port] de [param from_node] [GraphNode] "
"i [param to_port] de [param to_node] [GraphNode]. Si la connexió no "
"existeix, no s'elimina cap connexió."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Ends the creation of the current connection. In other words, if you are "
"dragging a connection you can use this method to abort the process and "
"remove the line that followed your cursor.\n"
"This is best used together with [signal connection_drag_started] and [signal "
"connection_drag_ended] to add custom behavior like node addition through "
"shortcuts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method suppresses any other connection request signals "
"apart from [signal connection_drag_ended]."
msgstr ""
"Finalitza la creació de la connexió actual. En altres paraules, si "
"arrossegueu una connexió, podeu utilitzar aquest mètode per avortar el "
"procés i eliminar la línia que va seguir el cursor.\n"
"Això s'utilitza millor juntament amb [signal connection_drag_started] i "
"[signal connection_drag_ended] per afegir un comportament personalitzat com "
"l'addició de nodes mitjançant dreceres.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode suprimeix qualsevol altre senyal de sol·licitud "
"de connexió a part de [signal connection_drag_ended]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of node names that are attached to the [GraphFrame] with "
"the given name."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de noms de nodes que s'adjunten a [GraphFrame] amb el nom "
"donat."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the closest connection to the given point in screen space. If no "
"connection is found within [param max_distance] pixels, an empty "
"[Dictionary] is returned.\n"
"A connection is represented as a [Dictionary] in the form of:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\tfrom_node: StringName,\n"
"\tfrom_port: int,\n"
"\tto_node: StringName,\n"
"\tto_port: int,\n"
"\tkeep_alive: bool\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"For example, getting a connection at a given mouse position can be achieved "
"like this:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var connection = "
"get_closest_connection_at_point(mouse_event.get_position())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la connexió més propera al punt donat a l'espai de la pantalla. Si "
"no es troba cap connexió amb [param max_distance] píxels, es retorna un "
"[Dictionary] buit.\n"
"Una connexió es representa com a [Dictionary] en forma de:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\tfrom_node: StringName,\n"
"\tdes_port: int,\n"
"\tto_node: StringName,\n"
"\tto_port: int,\n"
"\tkeep_alive: bool\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Per exemple, obtenir una connexió en una posició determinada del ratolí es "
"pot aconseguir així:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var connexió = get_closest_connection_at_point(mouse_event.get_position())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of connections from [param from_port] of [param "
"from_node]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de connexions de [param from_port] de [param from_node]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the points which would make up a connection between [param "
"from_node] and [param to_node]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna els punts que constituirien una connexió entre [param from_node] i "
"[param to_node]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] containing a list of all connections for [param node].\n"
"A connection is represented as a [Dictionary] in the form of:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\tfrom_node: StringName,\n"
"\tfrom_port: int,\n"
"\tto_node: StringName,\n"
"\tto_port: int,\n"
"\tkeep_alive: bool\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Get all connections on a specific port:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func get_connection_list_from_port(node, port):\n"
"\tvar connections = get_connection_list_from_node(node)\n"
"\tvar result = []\n"
"\tfor connection in connections:\n"
"\t\tvar dict = {}\n"
"\t\tif connection[\"from_node\"] == node and connection[\"from_port\"] == "
"port:\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"node\"] = connection[\"to_node\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"port\"] = connection[\"to_port\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"type\"] = \"left\"\n"
"\t\t\tresult.push_back(dict)\n"
"\t\telif connection[\"to_node\"] == node and connection[\"to_port\"] == "
"port:\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"node\"] = connection[\"from_node\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"port\"] = connection[\"from_port\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"type\"] = \"right\"\n"
"\t\t\tresult.push_back(dict)\n"
"\treturn result\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Array] que conté una llista de totes les connexions per a [param "
"node].\n"
"Una connexió es representa com a [Dictionary] en forma de:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\tfrom_node: StringName,\n"
"\tdes_port: int,\n"
"\tto_node: StringName,\n"
"\tto_port: int,\n"
"\tkeep_alive: bool\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] Obteniu totes les connexions en un port específic:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func get_connection_list_from_port(node, port):\n"
"\tvar connexions = get_connection_list_from_node (node)\n"
"\tresultat var = []\n"
"\tper a la connexió en connexions:\n"
"\t\tvar dict = {}\n"
"\t\tsi connexió[\"from_node\"] == node i connexió[\"from_port\"] == port:\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"node\"] = connexió[\"to_node\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"port\"] = connexió[\"to_port\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"type\"] = \"esquerra\"\n"
"\t\t\tresultat.push_back(dict)\n"
"\t\telif connection[\"to_node\"] == node i connexió[\"to_port\"] == port:\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"node\"] = connexió[\"from_node\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"port\"] = connexió[\"from_port\"]\n"
"\t\t\tdict[\"type\"] = \"dreta\"\n"
"\t\t\tresultat.push_back(dict)\n"
"\tretornar el resultat\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] containing the list of connections that intersect with "
"the given [Rect2].\n"
"A connection is represented as a [Dictionary] in the form of:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\tfrom_node: StringName,\n"
"\tfrom_port: int,\n"
"\tto_node: StringName,\n"
"\tto_port: int,\n"
"\tkeep_alive: bool\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Array] que conté la llista de connexions que s'intersequen amb "
"el [Rect2] donat.\n"
"Una connexió es representa com a [Dictionary] en forma de:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\tfrom_node: StringName,\n"
"\tdes_port: int,\n"
"\tto_node: StringName,\n"
"\tto_port: int,\n"
"\tkeep_alive: bool\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the [GraphFrame] that contains the [GraphElement] with the given "
"name."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the [HBoxContainer] that contains the zooming and grid snap controls in "
"the top left of the graph. You can use this method to reposition the toolbar "
"or to add your own custom controls to it.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"Obté el [HBoxContainer] que conté els controls de zoom i d'ajustament a la "
"graella a la part superior esquerra del gràfic. Podeu utilitzar aquest "
"mètode per reposicionar la barra d'eines o per afegir-hi els vostres propis "
"controls personalitzats.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu amagar-lo o algun dels seus fills, feu "
"servir la seva propietat [member CanvasItem.visible]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param from_port] of the [param from_node] "
"[GraphNode] is connected to the [param to_port] of the [param to_node] "
"[GraphNode]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether it's possible to make a connection between two different "
"port types. The port type is defined individually for the left and the right "
"port of each slot with the [method GraphNode.set_slot] method.\n"
"See also [method add_valid_connection_type] and [method "
"remove_valid_connection_type]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si és possible establir una connexió entre dos tipus de port "
"diferents. El tipus de port es defineix individualment per al port esquerre "
"i dret de cada ranura amb el mètode [method GraphNode.set_slot].\n"
"Vegeu també [method add_valid_connection_type] i [method "
"remove_valid_connection_type]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Disallows the connection between two different port types previously allowed "
"by [method add_valid_connection_type]. The port type is defined individually "
"for the left and the right port of each slot with the [method "
"GraphNode.set_slot] method.\n"
"See also [method is_valid_connection_type]."
msgstr ""
"No permet la connexió entre dos tipus de port diferents que prèviament "
"permetia [method add_valid_connection_type]. El tipus de port es defineix "
"individualment per al port esquerre i dret de cada ranura amb el mètode "
"[method GraphNode.set_slot].\n"
"Vegeu també [method is_valid_connection_type]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Disallows to disconnect nodes when dragging from the left port of the "
"[GraphNode]'s slot if it has the specified type. Use this to disable a "
"disconnection previously allowed with [method "
"add_valid_left_disconnect_type]."
msgstr ""
"No permet desconnectar nodes en arrossegar des del port esquerre de la "
"ranura de [GraphNode] si té el tipus especificat. Utilitzeu-ho per "
"desactivar una desconnexió prèviament permesa amb [method "
"add_valid_left_disconnect_type]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Disallows to disconnect nodes when dragging from the right port of the "
"[GraphNode]'s slot if it has the specified type. Use this to disable a "
"disconnection previously allowed with [method "
"add_valid_right_disconnect_type]."
msgstr ""
"No permet desconnectar nodes en arrossegar des del port dret de la ranura de "
"[GraphNode] si té el tipus especificat. Utilitzeu-ho per desactivar una "
"desconnexió prèviament permesa amb [method add_valid_right_disconnect_type]."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the coloration of the connection between [param from_node]'s [param "
"from_port] and [param to_node]'s [param to_port] with the color provided in "
"the [theme_item activity] theme property. The color is linearly interpolated "
"between the connection color and the activity color using [param amount] as "
"weight."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la coloració de la connexió entre [param from_node] de [param "
"from_port] i [param to_node] [param to_port] amb el color proporcionat a la "
"propietat del tema [theme_item activity]. El color s'interpola linealment "
"entre el color de la connexió i el color de l'activitat utilitzant [param "
"amount] com a pes."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid "Sets the specified [param node] as the one selected."
msgstr "Estableix el [param node] especificat com el seleccionat."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the lines between nodes will use antialiasing."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les línies entre nodes utilitzaran l'antialiasing."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid ""
"The curvature of the lines between the nodes. 0 results in straight lines."
msgstr ""
"La curvatura de les línies entre els nodes. 0 resultats en línies rectes."

#: doc/classes/GraphEdit.xml
msgid "The thickness of the lines between the nodes."
