#: doc/classes/NavigationPathQueryResult2D.xml
#: doc/classes/NavigationPathQueryResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [RID]s of the regions and links that each point of the path goes through."
msgstr ""
"Els [RID]s de les regions i enllaços pels quals passa cada punt del camí."

#: doc/classes/NavigationPathQueryResult2D.xml
#: doc/classes/NavigationPathQueryResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"The type of navigation primitive (region or link) that each point of the "
