"Return [code]true[/code] if this object contains a valid configuration that "
"can be retrieved when calling [method _get_configuration]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid ""
"Gets a pointer to the [code]XrSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeaderEXT[/"
"code] struct.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used from GDExtensions."
msgstr ""
"Obté un punter a l'estructura "
"[code]XrSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeaderEXT[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode està pensat per ser utilitzat des de GDExtensions."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this object contains a valid configuration that "
"can be used when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest objecte conté una configuració vàlida "
"que es pot utilitzar quan es crida a [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationMicroQrCode.xml
