#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid "Abstraction and base class for packet-based protocols."
msgstr "Abstracció i classe base per a protocols basats en paquets."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"PacketPeer is an abstraction and base class for packet-based protocols (such "
"as UDP). It provides an API for sending and receiving packets both as raw "
"data or variables. This makes it easy to transfer data over a protocol, "
"without having to encode data as low-level bytes or having to worry about "
"network ordering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""
"PacketPeer és una classe base i d'abstracció per a protocols basats en "
"paquets (com ara UDP). Proporciona una API per enviar i rebre paquets tant "
"com a dades en brut com a variables. Això facilita la transferència de dades "
"a través d'un protocol, sense haver de codificar les dades com a bytes de "
"baix nivell ni haver de preocupar-se per l'ordre de la xarxa.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar la implementació amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the number of packets currently available in the ring-buffer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de paquets disponibles actualment a la memòria intermèdia."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a raw packet."
msgstr "Obté un paquet en brut."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the error state of the last packet received (via [method get_packet] "
"and [method get_var])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'estat d'error de l'últim paquet rebut (mitjançant [method "
"get_packet] i [method get_var])."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Gets a Variant. If [param allow_objects] is [code]true[/code], decoding "
"objects is allowed.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same decoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.bytes_to_var] method.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized objects can contain code which gets executed. "
"Do not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources "
"to avoid potential security threats such as remote code execution."
msgstr ""
"Decodifica una matriu de bytes de nou a un valor. Quan [code]allow_objects[/"
"code] és [code]true[/code] es permet la descodificació d'objectes.\n"
"[b]ADVERTÈNCIA:[/b] L'objecte deserialitzat pot contenir codi que s'executa. "
"No utilitzeu aquesta opció si l'objecte serialitzat prové de fonts no "
"fiables per a evitar possibles amenaces de seguretat (execució remota de "
"codi)."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid "Sends a raw packet."
msgstr "Envia un paquet en brut."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a [Variant] as a packet. If [param full_objects] is [code]true[/code], "
"encoding objects is allowed (and can potentially include code).\n"
"Internally, this uses the same encoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.var_to_bytes] method."
msgstr ""
"Envia un [Variant] com a paquet. Si [param full_objects] és [code]true[/"
"code], es permet la codificació d'objectes (i pot incloure codi).\n"
"Internament, utilitza el mateix mecanisme de codificació que el mètode "
"[method @GlobalScope.var_to_bytes]."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum buffer size allowed when encoding [Variant]s. Raise this value to "
"support heavier memory allocations.\n"
"The [method put_var] method allocates memory on the stack, and the buffer "
"used will grow automatically to the closest power of two to match the size "
"of the [Variant]. If the [Variant] is bigger than [member "
"encode_buffer_max_size], the method will error out with [constant "
"ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY]."
msgstr ""
"Mida màxima de la memòria intermèdia permesa quan es codifiquen [Variant]s. "
"Augmenteu aquest valor per suportar assignacions de memòria més pesades.\n"
"El mètode [method put_var] assigna memòria a la pila i el buffer utilitzat "
"creixerà automàticament fins a la potència més propera de dos per coincidir "
"amb la mida de [Variant]. Si [Variant] és més gran que [member "
"encode_buffer_max_size], el mètode s'error amb [constant ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY]."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid "DTLS packet peer."
msgstr "Peer de paquets DTLS."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid ""
"This class represents a DTLS peer connection. It can be used to connect to a "
"DTLS server, and is returned by [method DTLSServer.take_connection].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] TLS certificate revocation and certificate pinning are "
"currently not supported. Revoked certificates are accepted as long as they "
"are otherwise valid. If this is a concern, you may want to use automatically "
"managed certificates with a short validity period."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe representa una connexió entre iguals DTLS. Es pot utilitzar "
"per connectar-se a un servidor DTLS i és retornat per [method "
"DTLSServer.take_connection].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar la implementació amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa.\n"
"[b]Advertència:[/b] La revocació de certificats TLS i la fixació de "
"certificats no s'admeten actualment. Els certificats revocats s'accepten "
"sempre que siguin vàlids. Si això és un problema, és possible que vulgueu "
"utilitzar certificats gestionats automàticament amb un període de validesa "
"curt."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid ""
"Connects a [param packet_peer] beginning the DTLS handshake using the "
"underlying [PacketPeerUDP] which must be connected (see [method "
"PacketPeerUDP.connect_to_host]). You can optionally specify the [param "
"client_options] to be used while verifying the TLS connections. See [method "
"TLSOptions.client] and [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."
msgstr ""
"Connecta un [param packet_peer] començant l'enllaç DTLS mitjançant el "
"[PacketPeerUDP] subjacent que s'ha de connectar (vegeu [method "
"PacketPeerUDP.connect_to_host]). Opcionalment, podeu especificar [param "
"client_options] que s'utilitzarà mentre verifiqueu les connexions TLS. Vegeu "
"[method TLSOptions.client] i [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid "Disconnects this peer, terminating the DTLS session."
msgstr "Desconnecta aquest igual i finalitza la sessió DTLS."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "Returns the status of the connection."
msgstr "Retorna l'estat de la connexió."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid ""
"Poll the connection to check for incoming packets. Call this frequently to "
"update the status and keep the connection working."
msgstr ""
"Consulta la connexió per comprovar si hi ha paquets entrants. Truqueu-hi "
"sovint per actualitzar l'estat i mantenir la connexió en funcionament."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid "A status representing a [PacketPeerDTLS] that is disconnected."
msgstr "Un estat que representa un [PacketPeerDTLS] que està desconnectat."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid ""
"A status representing a [PacketPeerDTLS] that is currently performing the "
"handshake with a remote peer."
msgstr ""
"Un estat que representa un [PacketPeerDTLS] que actualment està realitzant "
"l'enllaç amb un parell remot."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid ""
"A status representing a [PacketPeerDTLS] that is connected to a remote peer."
msgstr ""
"Un estat que representa un [PacketPeerDTLS] connectat a un parell remot."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid "A status representing a [PacketPeerDTLS] in a generic error state."
msgstr ""
"Un estat que representa un [PacketPeerDTLS] en un estat d'error genèric."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerDTLS.xml
msgid ""
"An error status that shows a mismatch in the DTLS certificate domain "
"presented by the host and the domain requested for validation."
msgstr ""
"Un estat d'error que mostra una discrepància entre el domini del certificat "
"DTLS presentat per l'amfitrió i el domini sol·licitat per a la validació."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerStream.xml
msgid "Wrapper to use a PacketPeer over a StreamPeer."
msgstr "Embolcall per utilitzar un PacketPeer sobre un StreamPeer."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerStream.xml
msgid ""
"PacketStreamPeer provides a wrapper for working using packets over a stream. "
"This allows for using packet based code with StreamPeers. PacketPeerStream "
"implements a custom protocol over the StreamPeer, so the user should not "
"read or write to the wrapped StreamPeer directly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""
"PacketStreamPeer proporciona un embolcall per treballar amb paquets sobre un "
"flux. Això permet utilitzar codi basat en paquets amb StreamPeers. "
"PacketPeerStream implementa un protocol personalitzat sobre el StreamPeer, "
"de manera que l'usuari no hauria de llegir ni escriure directament al "
"StreamPeer embolicat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar la implementació amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerStream.xml
msgid "The wrapped [StreamPeer] object."
msgstr "L'objecte [StreamPeer] embolicat."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid "UDP packet peer."
msgstr "Peer de paquets UDP."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"UDP packet peer. Can be used to send and receive raw UDP packets as well as "
"[Variant]s.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Send a packet:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var peer = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Optionally, you can select the local port used to send the packet.\n"
"peer.bind(4444)\n"
"\n"
"peer.set_dest_address(\"1.1.1.1\", 4433)\n"
"peer.put_packet(\"hello\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Listen for packets:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var peer\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tpeer = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"\tpeer.bind(4433)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta):\n"
"\tif peer.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\tvar array_bytes = peer.get_packet()\n"
"\t\tvar packet_string = array_bytes.get_string_from_ascii()\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Received message: \", packet_string)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""
"Peer de paquets UDP. Es pot utilitzar per enviar i rebre paquets UDP en "
"brut, així com [Variant]s.\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] Envia un paquet:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var peer = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Opcionalment, podeu seleccionar el port local utilitzat per enviar el "
"paquet.\n"
"peer.bind(4444)\n"
"\n"
"peer.set_dest_address(\"1.1.1.1\", 4433)\n"
"peer.put_packet(\"hola\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] Escolteu els paquets:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var peer\n"
"\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tpeer = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"\tpeer.bind(4433)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"funció _procés(_delta):\n"
"\tsi peer.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\tvar array_bytes = peer.get_packet()\n"
"\t\tvar paquet_cadena = array_bytes.get_string_from_ascii()\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Missatge rebut: \", cadena_paquet)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar el desplegament amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Binds this [PacketPeerUDP] to the specified [param port] and [param "
"bind_address] with a buffer size [param recv_buf_size], allowing it to "
"receive incoming packets.\n"
"If [param bind_address] is set to [code]\"*\"[/code] (default), the peer "
"will be bound on all available addresses (both IPv4 and IPv6).\n"
"If [param bind_address] is set to [code]\"0.0.0.0\"[/code] (for IPv4) or "
"[code]\"::\"[/code] (for IPv6), the peer will be bound to all available "
"addresses matching that IP type.\n"
"If [param bind_address] is set to any valid address (e.g. [code]"
"\"192.168.1.101\"[/code], [code]\"::1\"[/code], etc.), the peer will only be "
"bound to the interface with that address (or fail if no interface with the "
"given address exists)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid "Closes the [PacketPeerUDP]'s underlying UDP socket."
msgstr "Tanca el sòcol UDP subjacent de [PacketPeerUDP]."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Calling this method connects this UDP peer to the given [param host]/[param "
"port] pair. UDP is in reality connectionless, so this option only means that "
"incoming packets from different addresses are automatically discarded, and "
"that outgoing packets are always sent to the connected address (future calls "
"to [method set_dest_address] are not allowed). This method does not send any "
"data to the remote peer, to do that, use [method PacketPeer.put_var] or "
"[method PacketPeer.put_packet] as usual. See also [UDPServer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Connecting to the remote peer does not help to protect from "
"malicious attacks like IP spoofing, etc. Think about using an encryption "
"technique like TLS or DTLS if you feel like your application is transferring "
"sensitive information."
msgstr ""
"La crida a aquest mètode connecta aquest parell UDP amb el parell [param "
"host]/[param port] donat. En realitat, UDP no té connexió, de manera que "
"aquesta opció només significa que els paquets entrants de diferents adreces "
"es descarten automàticament i que els paquets de sortida s'envien sempre a "
"l'adreça connectada (no es permeten les futures trucades a [method "
"set_dest_address]). Aquest mètode no envia cap dada al peer remot, per fer-"
"ho, utilitzeu [method PacketPeer.put_var] o [method PacketPeer.put_packet] "
"com de costum. Vegeu també [UDPServer].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La connexió al peer remot no ajuda a protegir-se d'atacs "
"maliciosos com la falsificació d'IP, etc. Penseu a utilitzar una tècnica de "
"xifratge com TLS o DTLS si creieu que la vostra aplicació està transferint "
"informació sensible."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the IP of the remote peer that sent the last packet(that was "
"received with [method PacketPeer.get_packet] or [method PacketPeer.get_var])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'IP del parell remot que va enviar l'últim paquet (que es va rebre "
"amb [method PacketPeer.get_packet] o [method PacketPeer.get_var])."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the port of the remote peer that sent the last packet(that was "
"received with [method PacketPeer.get_packet] or [method PacketPeer.get_var])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el port del peer remot que va enviar l'últim paquet (que es va rebre "
"amb [method PacketPeer.get_packet] o [method PacketPeer.get_var])."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether this [PacketPeerUDP] is bound to an address and can receive "
"packets."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si aquest [PacketPeerUDP] està lligat a una adreça i pot rebre "
"paquets."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the UDP socket is open and has been connected "
"to a remote address. See [method connect_to_host]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el sòcol UDP està obert i s'ha connectat a una "
"adreça remota. Veure [method connect_to_host]."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Joins the multicast group specified by [param multicast_address] using the "
"interface identified by [param interface_name].\n"
"You can join the same multicast group with multiple interfaces. Use [method "
"IP.get_local_interfaces] to know which are available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some Android devices might require the "
"[code]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/code] permission for multicast to work."
msgstr ""
"S'uneix al grup de multidifusió especificat per [param multicast_address] "
"mitjançant la interfície identificada per [param interface_name].\n"
"Podeu unir-vos al mateix grup de multidifusió amb diverses interfícies. "
"Utilitzeu [method IP.get_local_interfaces] per saber quines estan "
"disponibles.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] És possible que alguns dispositius Android requereixin el "
"permís [code]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/code] perquè funcioni la "
"multidifusió."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the interface identified by [param interface_name] from the "
"multicast group specified by [param multicast_address]."
msgstr ""
"Elimina la interfície identificada per [param interface_name] del grup de "
"multidifusió especificat per [param multicast_address]."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Enable or disable sending of broadcast packets (e.g. "
"[code]set_dest_address(\"255.255.255.255\", 4343)[/code]. This option is "
"disabled by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some Android devices might require the "
"[code]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/code] permission and this option to be "
"enabled to receive broadcast packets too."
msgstr ""
"Activa o desactiva l'enviament de paquets de difusió (p. ex. "
"[code]set_dest_address(\"255.255.255.255\", 4343)[/code]. Aquesta opció està "
"desactivada per defecte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Alguns dispositius Android poden requerir el permís "
"[code]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/code] i que aquesta opció estigui "
"activada per rebre paquets d'emissió també."

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the destination address and port for sending packets and variables. A "
"hostname will be resolved using DNS if needed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method set_broadcast_enabled] must be enabled before sending "
"packets to a broadcast address (e.g. [code]255.255.255.255[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
msgid ""
"Waits for a packet to arrive on the bound address. See [method bind].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method wait] can't be interrupted once it has been called. "
"This can be worked around by allowing the other party to send a specific "
"\"death pill\" packet like this:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"socket = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"# Server\n"
"socket.set_dest_address(\"127.0.0.1\", 789)\n"
"socket.put_packet(\"Time to stop\".to_ascii_buffer())\n"
"\n"
"# Client\n"
"while socket.wait() == OK:\n"
"\tvar data = socket.get_packet().get_string_from_ascii()\n"
"\tif data == \"Time to stop\":\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var socket = new PacketPeerUdp();\n"
"// Server\n"
"socket.SetDestAddress(\"127.0.0.1\", 789);\n"
"socket.PutPacket(\"Time to stop\".ToAsciiBuffer());\n"
"\n"
"// Client\n"
"while (socket.Wait() == OK)\n"
"{\n"
"\tstring data = socket.GetPacket().GetStringFromASCII();\n"
"\tif (data == \"Time to stop\")\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Espera que arribi un paquet a l'adreça vinculada. Veure [method bind].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method wait] no es pot interrompre un cop s'ha cridat. Això es "
"pot solucionar permetent que l'altra part enviï un paquet específic de "
"\"píndola de la mort\" com aquest:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"sòcol = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"# Servidor\n"
"socket.set_dest_address(\"127.0.0.1\", 789)\n"
"socket.put_packet(\"Hora d'aturar\".to_ascii_buffer())\n"
"\n"
"# Client\n"
"mentre socket.wait() == D'acord:\n"
"\tdades var = socket.get_packet().get_string_from_ascii()\n"
"\tif data == \"Hora d'aturar\":\n"
"\t\ttornar\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var socket = nou PacketPeerUdp();\n"
"// Servidor\n"
"socket.SetDestAddress(\"127.0.0.1\", 789);\n"
"socket.PutPacket(\"Hora d'aturar\".ToAsciiBuffer());\n"
"\n"
"// Client\n"
"mentre (socket.Wait() == D'acord)\n"
"{\n"
"\tdades de cadena = socket.GetPacket().GetStringFromASCII();\n"
"\tif (dades == \"Hora d'aturar\")\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\ttornar;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Panel.xml
msgid "A GUI control that displays a [StyleBox]."
msgstr "Un control GUI que mostra un [StyleBox]."

#: doc/classes/Panel.xml
msgid ""
"[Panel] is a GUI control that displays a [StyleBox]. See also "
"[PanelContainer]."
msgstr ""
"[Panel] és un control GUI que mostra un [StyleBox]. Vegeu també "
"[PanelContainer]."

#: doc/classes/Panel.xml
msgid "Hierarchical Finite State Machine Demo"
msgstr "Demostració jeràrquica de màquines d'estats finits"

#: doc/classes/Panel.xml
msgid "The [StyleBox] of this control."
msgstr "El [StyleBox] d'aquest control."

#: doc/classes/PanelContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that keeps its child controls within the area of a [StyleBox]."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que manté els seus controls secundaris dins de l'àrea d'un "
"[StyleBox]."

#: doc/classes/PanelContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that keeps its child controls within the area of a [StyleBox]. "
"Useful for giving controls an outline."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que manté els seus controls secundaris dins de l'àrea d'un "
"[StyleBox]. Útil per donar un esquema als controls."

#: doc/classes/PanelContainer.xml
msgid "The style of [PanelContainer]'s background."
msgstr "L'estil del fons de [PanelContainer]."

#: doc/classes/PanoramaSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A material that provides a special texture to a [Sky], usually an HDR "
"panorama."
msgstr ""
"Un material que proporciona una textura especial a una [Sky], normalment una "
"panoràmica HDR."

#: doc/classes/PanoramaSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A resource referenced in a [Sky] that is used to draw a background. "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial] functions similar to skyboxes in other engines, except "
"it uses an equirectangular sky map instead of a [Cubemap].\n"
"Using an HDR panorama is strongly recommended for accurate, high-quality "
"reflections. Godot supports the Radiance HDR ([code].hdr[/code]) and OpenEXR "
"([code].exr[/code]) image formats for this purpose.\n"
"You can use [url=https://danilw.github.io/GLSL-howto/cubemap_to_panorama_js/"
"cubemap_to_panorama.html]this tool[/url] to convert a cubemap to an "
"equirectangular sky map."
msgstr ""
"Un recurs referenciat en un [Sky] que s'utilitza per dibuixar un fons. "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial] funciona de manera semblant als skybox d'altres "
"motors, excepte que fa servir un mapa celeste equirectangular en lloc d'un "
"[Cubemap].\n"
"Es recomana fer servir una panoràmica HDR per obtenir reflexos precisos i "
"d'alta qualitat. Godot admet els formats d'imatge Radiance HDR ([code].hdr[/"
"code]) i OpenEXR ([code].exr[/code]) per a aquesta finalitat.\n"
"Podeu utilitzar [url=https://danilw.github.io/GLSL-howto/"
"cubemap_to_panorama_js/cubemap_to_panorama.html]aquesta eina[/url] per "
"convertir un mapa de cubs en un mapa celeste equirectangular."

#: doc/classes/PanoramaSkyMaterial.xml doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The sky's overall brightness multiplier. Higher values result in a brighter "
"sky."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador de brillantor global del cel. Els valors més alts donen lloc a "
"un cel més brillant."

#: doc/classes/PanoramaSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A boolean value to determine if the background texture should be filtered or "
"not."
msgstr ""
"Un valor booleà per determinar si la textura de fons s'ha de filtrar o no."

#: doc/classes/PanoramaSkyMaterial.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] to be applied to the [PanoramaSkyMaterial]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] que s'aplicarà a [PanoramaSkyMaterial]."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid "A node used to create a parallax scrolling background."
msgstr "Un node utilitzat per crear un fons de desplaçament de paral·laxi."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"A [Parallax2D] is used to create a parallax effect. It can move at a "
"different speed relative to the camera movement using [member scroll_scale]. "
"This creates an illusion of depth in a 2D game. If manual scrolling is "
"desired, the [Camera2D] position can be ignored with [member "
"ignore_camera_scroll].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Any changes to this node's position made after it enters the "
"scene tree will be overridden if [member ignore_camera_scroll] is "
"[code]false[/code] or [member screen_offset] is modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid "2D Parallax"
msgstr "Paral·laxi 2D"

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"Velocity at which the offset scrolls automatically, in pixels per second."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat a la qual el desplaçament es desplaça automàticament, en píxels "
"per segon."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this [Parallax2D] is offset by the current camera's "
"position. If the [Parallax2D] is in a [CanvasLayer] separate from the "
"current camera, it may be desired to match the value with [member "
"CanvasLayer.follow_viewport_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aquesta [Parallax2D] es compensa amb la posició actual "
"de la càmera. Si [Parallax2D] es troba en una [CanvasLayer] independent de "
"la càmera actual, pot ser que es desitgi fer coincidir el valor amb [member "
"CanvasLayer.follow_viewport_enabled]."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [Parallax2D]'s position is not affected by the "
"position of the camera."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la posició de [Parallax2D] no es veu afectada per la "
"posició de la càmera."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"Top-left limits for scrolling to begin. If the camera is outside of this "
"limit, the [Parallax2D] stops scrolling. Must be lower than [member "
"limit_end] minus the viewport size to work."
msgstr ""
"Límits superior esquerre per començar el desplaçament. Si la càmera està "
"fora d'aquest límit, [Parallax2D] deixa de desplaçar-se. Ha de ser inferior "
"a [member limit_end] menys la mida de la finestra gràfica perquè funcioni."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"Bottom-right limits for scrolling to end. If the camera is outside of this "
"limit, the [Parallax2D] will stop scrolling. Must be higher than [member "
"limit_begin] and the viewport size combined to work."
msgstr ""
"Límits inferior dret per desplaçar-se fins al final. Si la càmera està fora "
"d'aquest límit, [Parallax2D] deixarà de desplaçar-se. Ha de ser superior a "
"[member limit_begin] i la mida de la finestra gràfica combinada per "
"funcionar."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"Repeats the [Texture2D] of each of this node's children and offsets them by "
"this value. When scrolling, the node's position loops, giving the illusion "
"of an infinite scrolling background if the values are larger than the screen "
"size. If an axis is set to [code]0[/code], the [Texture2D] will not be "
"repeated."
msgstr ""
"Repeteix el [Texture2D] de cadascun dels fills d'aquest node i els compensa "
"amb aquest valor. Quan es desplaça, la posició del node fa un bucle, donant "
"la il·lusió d'un fons de desplaçament infinit si els valors són més grans "
"que la mida de la pantalla. Si un eix s'estableix a [code]0[/code], el "
"[Texture2D] no es repetirà."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the amount of times the texture repeats. Each texture copy spreads "
"evenly from the original by [member repeat_size]. Useful for when zooming "
"out with a camera."
msgstr ""
"Anul·la la quantitat de vegades que es repeteix la textura. Cada còpia de "
"textura s'estén uniformement des de l'original per [member repeat_size]. "
"Útil per allunyar-se amb una càmera."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"Offset used to scroll this [Parallax2D]. This value is updated automatically "
"unless [member ignore_camera_scroll] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament utilitzat per desplaçar aquest [Parallax2D]. Aquest valor "
"s'actualitza automàticament tret que [member ignore_camera_scroll] sigui "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Parallax2D]'s offset. Similar to [member screen_offset] and [member "
"Node2D.position], but will not be overridden.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Values will loop if [member repeat_size] is set higher than "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament de [Parallax2D]. Similar a [member screen_offset] i [member "
"Node2D.position], però no se substituirà.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els valors es produiran en bucle si [member repeat_size] "
"s'estableix més amunt que [code]@0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Parallax2D.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplier to the final [Parallax2D]'s offset. Can be used to simulate "
"distance from the camera.\n"
"For example, a value of [code]1[/code] scrolls at the same speed as the "
"camera. A value greater than [code]1[/code] scrolls faster, making objects "
"appear closer. Less than [code]1[/code] scrolls slower, making objects "
"appear further, and a value of [code]0[/code] stops the objects completely."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador de la compensació final de [Parallax2D]. Es pot utilitzar per "
"simular la distància de la càmera.\n"
"Per exemple, un valor de [code]1[/code] es desplaça a la mateixa velocitat "
"que la càmera. Un valor superior a [code]1[/code] es desplaça més "
"ràpidament, fent que els objectes semblin més a prop. Menys de [code]1[/"
"code] es desplaça més lentament, fent que els objectes apareguin més lluny, "
"i un valor de [code]0[/code] atura els objectes completament."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml doc/classes/ParallaxLayer.xml
msgid "Use the [Parallax2D] node instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu el node [Parallax2D]."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid ""
"A ParallaxBackground uses one or more [ParallaxLayer] child nodes to create "
"a parallax effect. Each [ParallaxLayer] can move at a different speed using "
"[member ParallaxLayer.motion_offset]. This creates an illusion of depth in a "
"2D game. If not used with a [Camera2D], you must manually calculate the "
"[member scroll_offset].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each [ParallaxBackground] is drawn on one specific [Viewport] "
"and cannot be shared between multiple [Viewport]s, see [member "
"CanvasLayer.custom_viewport]. When using multiple [Viewport]s, for example "
"in a split-screen game, you need create an individual [ParallaxBackground] "
"for each [Viewport] you want it to be drawn on."
msgstr ""
"Un ParallaxBackground utilitza un o més [ParallaxLayer] nodes fills per "
"crear un efecte de paral·laxi. Cada [ParallaxLayer] es pot moure a una "
"velocitat diferent mitjançant [member ParallaxLayer.motion_offset]. Això "
"crea una il·lusió de profunditat en un joc en 2D. Si no s'utilitza amb un "
"[Camera2D], heu de calcular manualment el [member scroll_offset].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Cada [ParallaxBackground] es dibuixa en un [Viewport] específic "
"i no es pot compartir entre diversos [Viewport]s, vegeu [member "
"CanvasLayer.custom_viewport]. Quan utilitzeu diversos [Viewport]s, per "
"exemple en un joc de pantalla dividida, heu de crear un [ParallaxBackground] "
"individual per a cada [Viewport] en què voleu que es dibuixi."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid "The base position offset for all [ParallaxLayer] children."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament de la posició base per a tots els nens [ParallaxLayer]."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid "The base motion scale for all [ParallaxLayer] children."
msgstr "L'escala de moviment base per a tots els nens [ParallaxLayer]."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], elements in [ParallaxLayer] child aren't affected by "
"the zoom level of the camera."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els elements de [ParallaxLayer] fill no es veuen "
"afectats pel nivell de zoom de la càmera."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid ""
"Top-left limits for scrolling to begin. If the camera is outside of this "
"limit, the background will stop scrolling. Must be lower than [member "
"scroll_limit_end] to work."
msgstr ""
"Límits superior esquerre per començar el desplaçament. Si la càmera està "
"fora d'aquest límit, el fons deixarà de desplaçar-se. Ha de ser inferior a "
"[member scroll_limit_end] per funcionar."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid ""
"Bottom-right limits for scrolling to end. If the camera is outside of this "
"limit, the background will stop scrolling. Must be higher than [member "
"scroll_limit_begin] to work."
msgstr ""
"Límits inferior dret per desplaçar-se fins al final. Si la càmera està fora "
"d'aquest límit, el fons deixarà de desplaçar-se. Ha de ser superior a "
"[member scroll_limit_begin] per funcionar."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxBackground.xml
msgid ""
"The ParallaxBackground's scroll value. Calculated automatically when using a "
"[Camera2D], but can be used to manually manage scrolling when no camera is "
"present."
msgstr ""
"El valor de desplaçament de ParallaxBackground. Es calcula automàticament "
"quan s'utilitza un [Camera2D], però es pot utilitzar per gestionar "
"manualment el desplaçament quan no hi ha càmera."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxLayer.xml
msgid "A parallax scrolling layer to be used with [ParallaxBackground]."
msgstr ""
"Una capa de desplaçament de paral·laxi que s'utilitzarà amb "
"[ParallaxBackground]."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxLayer.xml
msgid ""
"A ParallaxLayer must be the child of a [ParallaxBackground] node. Each "
"ParallaxLayer can be set to move at different speeds relative to the camera "
"movement or the [member ParallaxBackground.scroll_offset] value.\n"
"This node's children will be affected by its scroll offset.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Any changes to this node's position and scale made after it "
"enters the scene will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Un ParallaxLayer ha de ser el fill d'un node [ParallaxBackground]. Cada "
"ParallaxLayer es pot configurar per moure's a diferents velocitats en "
"relació amb el moviment de la càmera o el valor [member "
"ParallaxBackground.scroll_offset].\n"
"Els fills d'aquest node es veuran afectats pel seu desplaçament de "
"desplaçament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Qualsevol canvi a la posició i escala d'aquest node fet després "
"d'entrar a l'escena serà ignorat."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The interval, in pixels, at which the [ParallaxLayer] is drawn repeatedly. "
"Useful for creating an infinitely scrolling background. If an axis is set to "
"[code]0[/code], the [ParallaxLayer] will be drawn only once along that "
"direction.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want the repetition to pixel-perfect match a [Texture2D] "
"displayed by a child node, you should account for any scale applied to the "
"texture when defining this interval. For example, if you use a child "
"[Sprite2D] scaled to [code]0.5[/code] to display a 600x600 texture, and want "
"this sprite to be repeated continuously horizontally, you should set the "
"mirroring to [code]Vector2(300, 0)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the length of the viewport axis is bigger than twice the "
"repeated axis size, it will not repeat infinitely, as the parallax layer "
"only draws 2 instances of the layer at any given time. The visibility window "
"is calculated from the parent [ParallaxBackground]'s position, not the "
"layer's own position. So, if you use mirroring, [b]do not[/b] change the "
"[ParallaxLayer] position relative to its parent. Instead, if you need to "
"adjust the background's position, set the [member CanvasLayer.offset] "
"property in the parent [ParallaxBackground].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Despite the name, the layer will not be mirrored, it will only "
"be repeated."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ParallaxLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The ParallaxLayer's offset relative to the parent ParallaxBackground's "
"[member ParallaxBackground.scroll_offset]."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament de ParallaxLayer en relació amb el [member "
"ParallaxBackground.scroll_offset] de ParallaxBackground pare."

#: doc/classes/ParallaxLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies the ParallaxLayer's motion. If an axis is set to [code]0[/code], "
"it will not scroll."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica el moviment de ParallaxLayer. Si un eix s'estableix a [code]0[/"
"code], no es desplaçarà."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Holds a particle configuration for [GPUParticles2D] or [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"Conté una configuració de partícules per als nodes [GPUParticles2D] o "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"[ParticleProcessMaterial] defines particle properties and behavior. It is "
"used in the [code]process_material[/code] of the [GPUParticles2D] and "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes. Some of this material's properties are applied to "
"each particle when emitted, while others can have a [CurveTexture] or a "
"[GradientTexture1D] applied to vary numerical or color values over the "
"lifetime of the particle."
msgstr ""
"[ParticleProcessMaterial] defineix les propietats i el comportament de les "
"partícules. S'utilitza als [code]process_material[/code] dels nodes "
"[GPUParticles2D] i [GPUParticles3D]. Algunes de les propietats d'aquest "
"material s'apliquen a cada partícula quan s'emeten, mentre que d'altres "
"poden tenir un [CurveTexture] o un [GradientTexture1D] per variar els valors "
"numèrics o de color al llarg de la vida útil de la partícula."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the minimum and maximum values of the given [param param] as a "
"vector.\n"
"The [code]x[/code] component of the returned vector corresponds to minimum "
"and the [code]y[/code] component corresponds to maximum."
msgstr ""
"Retorna els valors mínim i màxim del [param param] donat com a vector.\n"
"El component [code]x[/code] del vector retornat correspon al mínim i el "
"component [code]y[/code] correspon al màxim."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Returns the [Texture2D] used by the specified parameter."
msgstr "Retorna la [Texture2D] utilitzada pel paràmetre especificat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified particle flag is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'indicador de partícula especificat està "
"habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the minimum and maximum values of the given [param param].\n"
"The [code]x[/code] component of the argument vector corresponds to minimum "
"and the [code]y[/code] component corresponds to maximum."
msgstr ""
"Estableix els valors mínim i màxim del [param param] donat.\n"
"El component [code]x[/code] del vector d'argument correspon al mínim i el "
"component [code]y[/code] correspon al màxim."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "Estableix l'interval de valors màxim del paràmetre indicat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Sets the minimum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "Estableix l'interval de valors mínim del paràmetre indicat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Sets the [Texture2D] for the specified [enum Parameter]."
msgstr "Estableix el [Texture2D] per al [enum Parameter] especificat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Sets the [param particle_flag] to [param enable]."
msgstr "Estableix el [param particle_flag] a [param enable]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The alpha value of each particle's color will be multiplied by this "
"[CurveTexture] over its lifetime.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member alpha_curve] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALPHA *= COLOR.a;[/code] must be inserted in "
"the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"alpha_curve] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El valor alfa del color de cada partícula es multiplicarà per aquest "
"[CurveTexture] durant la seva vida útil.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member alpha_curve] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de la "
"malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] "
"[code]true[/code]. Per a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALPHA *= COLOR.a;[/code] "
"s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas "
"contrari, [member alpha_curve] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Each particle's rotation will be animated along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr ""
"La rotació de cada partícula s'animarà al llarg d'aquest [CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial rotation applied to each particle, in degrees.\n"
"Only applied when [member particle_flag_disable_z] or [member "
"particle_flag_rotate_y] are [code]true[/code] or the [BaseMaterial3D] being "
"used to draw the particle is using [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.BILLBOARD_PARTICLES]."
msgstr ""
"Rotació inicial màxima aplicada a cada partícula, en graus.\n"
"Només s'aplica quan [member particle_flag_disable_z] o [member "
"particle_flag_rotate_y] són [code]true[/code] o el [BaseMaterial3D] que "
"s'utilitza per dibuixar la partícula utilitza [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.BILLBOARD_PARTICLES]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's angular velocity (rotation speed) will vary along this "
"[CurveTexture] over its lifetime."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat angular de cada partícula (velocitat de rotació) variarà al "
"llarg d'aquesta [CurveTexture] al llarg de la seva vida útil."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial angular velocity (rotation speed) applied to each particle "
"in [i]degrees[/i] per second.\n"
"Only applied when [member particle_flag_disable_z] or [member "
"particle_flag_rotate_y] are [code]true[/code] or the [BaseMaterial3D] being "
"used to draw the particle is using [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.BILLBOARD_PARTICLES]."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat angular inicial màxima (velocitat de rotació) aplicada a cada "
"partícula en [i]degrees[/i] per segon.\n"
"Només s'aplica quan [member particle_flag_disable_z] o [member "
"particle_flag_rotate_y] són [code]true[/code] o el [BaseMaterial3D] que "
"s'utilitza per dibuixar la partícula utilitza [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.BILLBOARD_PARTICLES]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Each particle's animation offset will vary along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament d'animació de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest "
"[CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Each particle's animation speed will vary along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat d'animació de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest "
"[CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], interaction with particle attractors is enabled. In "
"3D, attraction only occurs within the area defined by the [GPUParticles3D] "
"node's [member GPUParticles3D.visibility_aabb]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la interacció amb els atractors de partícules està "
"habilitada. En 3D, l'atracció només es produeix a l'àrea definida pel "
"[GPUParticles3D] del node [member GPUParticles3D.visibility_aabb]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The particles' bounciness. Values range from [code]0[/code] (no bounce) to "
"[code]1[/code] (full bounciness). Only effective if [member collision_mode] "
"is [constant COLLISION_RIGID]."
msgstr ""
"El rebot de les partícules. Els valors van des de [code]0[/code] (sense "
"rebot) fins a [code]1[/code] (rebot total). Només efectiu si [member "
"collision_mode] és [constant COLLISION_RIGID]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The particles' friction. Values range from [code]0[/code] (frictionless) to "
"[code]1[/code] (maximum friction). Only effective if [member collision_mode] "
"is [constant COLLISION_RIGID]."
msgstr ""
"Fricció de les partícules. Els valors van des de [code]0[/code] (sense "
"fricció) fins a [code]1[/code] (fricció màxima). Només efectiu si [member "
"collision_mode] és [constant COLLISION_RIGID]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The particles' collision mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] 3D Particles can only collide with [GPUParticlesCollision3D] "
"nodes, not [PhysicsBody3D] nodes. To make particles collide with various "
"objects, you can add [GPUParticlesCollision3D] nodes as children of "
"[PhysicsBody3D] nodes. In 3D, collisions only occur within the area defined "
"by the [GPUParticles3D] node's [member GPUParticles3D.visibility_aabb].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] 2D Particles can only collide with [LightOccluder2D] nodes, not "
"[PhysicsBody2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Mode de col·lisió de partícules.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les partícules 3D només poden xocar amb els nodes "
"[GPUParticlesCollision3D], no amb els nodes [PhysicsBody3D]. Per fer que les "
"partícules xoquin amb diversos objectes, podeu afegir nodes "
"[GPUParticlesCollision3D] com a fills dels nodes [PhysicsBody3D]. En 3D, les "
"col·lisions només es produeixen dins de l'àrea definida pel [GPUParticles3D] "
"del node [member GPUParticles3D.visibility_aabb].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les partícules 2D només poden xocar amb els nodes "
"[LightOccluder2D], no amb els nodes [PhysicsBody2D]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member GPUParticles3D.collision_base_size] is "
"multiplied by the particle's effective scale (see [member scale_min], "
"[member scale_max], [member scale_curve], and [member "
"scale_over_velocity_curve])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color. If the [GPUParticles2D]'s [code]texture[/"
"code] is defined, it will be multiplied by this color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex colors. To "
"have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member color] "
"will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color inicial de cada partícula. Si es defineix [GPUParticles2D] "
"[code]texture[/code], es multiplicarà per aquest color.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member color] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de la malla de "
"partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] ser [code]true[/"
"code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] s'ha "
"d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas contrari, "
"[member color] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color will vary along this [GradientTexture1D] "
"(multiplied with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_initial_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's "
"vertex colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"color_initial_ramp] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color inicial de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest "
"[GradientTexture1D] (multiplicat per [member color]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member color_initial_ramp] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de "
"la malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] ser "
"[code]true[/code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/"
"code] s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas "
"contrari, [member color_initial_ramp] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's color will vary along this [GradientTexture1D] over its "
"lifetime (multiplied with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"color_ramp] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [GradientTexture1D] al "
"llarg de la seva vida útil (multiplicat per [member color]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member color_ramp] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de la "
"malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] ser "
"[code]true[/code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/"
"code] s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas "
"contrari, [member color_ramp] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Damping will vary along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr "L'amortiment variarà al llarg d'aquest [CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A curve that specifies the velocity along each of the axes of the particle "
"system along its lifetime.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Una corba que especifica la velocitat al llarg de cadascun dels eixos del "
"sistema de partícules al llarg de la seva vida útil.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum directional velocity value, which is multiplied by [member "
"directional_velocity_curve].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Valor de velocitat direccional màxim, que es multiplica per [member "
"directional_velocity_curve].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum directional velocity value, which is multiplied by [member "
"directional_velocity_curve].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Valor de velocitat direccional mínim, que es multiplica per [member "
"directional_velocity_curve].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The box's extents if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member emission_box_extents] starts from the center point and "
"applies the X, Y, and Z values in both directions. The size is twice the "
"area of the extents."
msgstr ""
"Les extensions de la caixa si [member emission_shape] s'estableix en "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member emission_box_extents] comença des del punt central i "
"aplica els valors X, Y i Z en ambdues direccions. La mida és el doble de "
"l'àrea de les extensions."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Particle color will be modulated by color determined by sampling this "
"texture at the same point as the [member emission_point_texture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member emission_color_texture] multiplies the particle mesh's "
"vertex colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"emission_color_texture] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color de les partícules es modularà pel color determinat mostrant aquesta "
"textura al mateix punt que [member emission_point_texture].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member emission_color_texture] multiplica els colors del "
"vèrtex de la malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un "
"[BaseMaterial3D], [member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu "
"ser [/i] [code]true[/code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= "
"COLOR.rgb;[/code] s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del "
"shader. En cas contrari, [member emission_color_texture] no tindrà cap "
"efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's color will be multiplied by this [CurveTexture] over its "
"lifetime.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member emission_curve] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"emission_curve] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"El color de cada partícula es multiplicarà per aquest [CurveTexture] al "
"llarg de la seva vida útil.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member emission_curve] multiplica els colors del vèrtex de la "
"malla de partícules. Per tenir un efecte visible en un [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]deu ser [/i] "
"[code]true[/code]. Per a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/"
"code] s'ha d'inserir a la funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader. En cas "
"contrari, [member emission_curve] no tindrà cap efecte visible."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Particle velocity and rotation will be set by sampling this texture at the "
"same point as the [member emission_point_texture]. Used only in [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]. Can be created automatically from mesh or "
"node by selecting \"Create Emission Points from Mesh/Node\" under the "
"\"Particles\" tool in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat i la rotació de les partícules s'establiran mostrant aquesta "
"textura al mateix punt que [member emission_point_texture]. S'utilitza només "
"a [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]. Es pot crear automàticament a "
"partir de malla o node seleccionant \"Crea punts d'emissió des de malla/"
"node\" a l'eina \"Partícules\" de la barra d'eines."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The number of emission points if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de punts d'emissió si [member emission_shape] s'estableix en "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] o [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at positions determined by sampling this texture "
"at a random position. Used with [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] and "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]. Can be created automatically from "
"mesh or node by selecting \"Create Emission Points from Mesh/Node\" under "
"the \"Particles\" tool in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran en posicions determinades mitjançant el mostreig "
"d'aquesta textura en una posició aleatòria. S'utilitza amb [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] i [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]. Es pot "
"crear automàticament a partir de malla o node seleccionant \"Crea punts "
"d'emissió des de malla/node\" a l'eina \"Partícules\" de la barra d'eines."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "The offset for the [member emission_shape], in local space."
msgstr "El desplaçament per a [member emission_shape], a l'espai local."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "The scale of the [member emission_shape], in local space."
msgstr "L'escala del [member emission_shape], a l'espai local."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Amount of [member spread] along the Y axis."
msgstr "Quantitat de [member spread] al llarg de l'eix Y."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Each particle's hue will vary along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr ""
"La tonalitat de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest [CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Percentage of the velocity of the respective [GPUParticles2D] or "
"[GPUParticles3D] inherited by each particle when spawning."
msgstr ""
"Percentatge de la velocitat dels respectius [GPUParticles2D] o "
"[GPUParticles3D] heretat per cada partícula en generar."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Particle lifetime randomness ratio. The equation for the lifetime of a "
"particle is [code]lifetime * (1.0 - randf() * lifetime_randomness)[/code]. "
"For example, a [member lifetime_randomness] of [code]0.4[/code] scales the "
"lifetime between [code]0.6[/code] to [code]1.0[/code] of its original value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's linear acceleration will vary along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr ""
"L'acceleració lineal de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta "
"[CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's orbital velocity will vary along this [CurveTexture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For 3D orbital velocity, use a [CurveXYZTexture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat orbital de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquest "
"[CurveTexture].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per a la velocitat orbital 3D, utilitzeu un [CurveXYZTexture].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum orbital velocity applied to each particle. Makes the particles "
"circle around origin. Specified in number of full rotations around origin "
"per second.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat orbital màxima aplicada a cada partícula. Fa que les partícules "
"circulin al voltant de l'origen. Especificat en nombre de rotacions "
"completes al voltant de l'origen per segon.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum equivalent of [member orbit_velocity_max].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Equivalent mínim de [member orbit_velocity_max].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the behavior of the damping properties from a linear deceleration to "
"a deceleration based on speed percentage."
msgstr ""
"Canvia el comportament de les propietats d'amortiment d'una desacceleració "
"lineal a una desacceleració basada en el percentatge de velocitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], particles will not move on the z axis."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], les partícules no es mouran a l'eix z."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles will inherit the scale of the emitter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This has no effect when [member GPUParticles3D.local_coords] is "
"[code]true[/code], since particles in local space are already affected by "
"the emitter's scale."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les partícules heretaran l'escala de l'emissor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això no té cap efecte quan [member GPUParticles3D.local_coords] "
"és [code]true[/code], ja que les partícules de l'espai local ja estan "
"afectades per l'escala de l'emissor."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's radial acceleration will vary along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr ""
"L'acceleració radial de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta "
"[CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A [CurveTexture] that defines the velocity over the particle's lifetime away "
"(or toward) the [member velocity_pivot].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Un [CurveTexture] que defineix la velocitat al llarg de la vida útil de la "
"partícula lluny (o cap a) [member velocity_pivot].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum radial velocity applied to each particle. Makes particles move away "
"from the [member velocity_pivot], or toward it if negative.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat radial màxima aplicada a cada partícula. Fa que les partícules "
"s'allunyin de [member velocity_pivot], o cap a ella si són negatives.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum radial velocity applied to each particle. Makes particles move away "
"from the [member velocity_pivot], or toward it if negative.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Animated velocities will not be affected by damping, use "
"[member velocity_limit_curve] instead."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat radial mínima aplicada a cada partícula. Fa que les partícules "
"s'allunyin de [member velocity_pivot], o cap a ella si són negatives.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les velocitats animades no es veuran afectades per "
"l'amortiment, utilitzeu [member velocity_limit_curve]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum 3D orientation, in degrees. Works only in 3D and if [member "
"use_rotation_3d] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"La màxima orientació 3D, en graus. Només funciona en 3D i si [member "
"use_rotation_3d] està habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum 3D orientation, in degrees. Works only in 3D and if [member "
"use_rotation_3d] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"L'orientació 3D mínima, en graus. Només funciona en 3D i si [member "
"use_rotation_3d] està habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Rotation velocity curve over lifetime, per-axis. Enable [member "
"use_rotation_velocity_3d] to use this."
msgstr ""
"Corba de velocitat de rotació al llarg de la vida útil, per eix. Habiliteu "
"[member use_rotation_velocity_3d] per utilitzar-ho."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum 3D rotation velocity on the particle's local axis. Enable [member "
"use_rotation_velocity_3d] to use this."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat de rotació 3D màxima a l'eix local de la partícula. Habiliteu "
"[member use_rotation_velocity_3d] per utilitzar-ho."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum 3D rotation velocity on the particle's local axis. Enable [member "
"use_rotation_velocity_3d] to use this."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat de rotació 3D mínima sobre l'eix local de la partícula. Habiliteu "
"[member use_rotation_velocity_3d] per utilitzar-ho."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum value of the random scale vector for each particle.\n"
"Works only if [member use_scale_3d] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"El valor màxim del vector d'escala aleatòria per a cada partícula.\n"
"Només funciona si [member use_scale_3d] està habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum value of the random scale vector for each particle.\n"
"Works only if [member use_scale_3d] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"El valor mínim del vector d'escala aleatòria per a cada partícula.\n"
"Només funciona si [member use_scale_3d] està habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's scale will vary along this [CurveTexture] over its lifetime. "
"If a [CurveXYZTexture] is supplied instead, the scale will be separated per-"
"axis."
msgstr ""
"L'escala de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta [CurveTexture] al "
"llarg de la seva vida útil. Si es subministra un [CurveXYZTexture], l'escala "
"estarà separada per eix."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member scale_max]."
msgstr "Equivalent mínim de [member scale_max]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Either a [CurveTexture] or a [CurveXYZTexture] that scales each particle "
"based on its velocity."
msgstr ""
"O un [CurveTexture] o un [CurveXYZTexture] que escala cada partícula en "
"funció de la seva velocitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum velocity value reference for [member scale_over_velocity_curve].\n"
"[member scale_over_velocity_curve] will be interpolated between [member "
"scale_over_velocity_min] and [member scale_over_velocity_max]."
msgstr ""
"Referència del valor de velocitat màxima per a [member "
"scale_over_velocity_curve].\n"
"[member scale_over_velocity_curve] s'interpolarà entre [member "
"scale_over_velocity_min] i [member scale_over_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum velocity value reference for [member scale_over_velocity_curve].\n"
"[member scale_over_velocity_curve] will be interpolated between [member "
"scale_over_velocity_min] and [member scale_over_velocity_max]."
msgstr ""
"Referència del valor de velocitat mínima per a [member "
"scale_over_velocity_curve].\n"
"[member scale_over_velocity_curve] s'interpolarà entre [member "
"scale_over_velocity_min] i [member scale_over_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of particles to spawn from the subemitter node when a collision "
"occurs. When combined with [constant COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the main "
"particles material, this can be used to achieve effects such as raindrops "
"hitting the ground.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value shouldn't exceed [member GPUParticles2D.amount] or "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] defined on the [i]subemitter node[/i] (not "
"the main node), relative to the subemitter's particle lifetime. If the "
"number of particles is exceeded, no new particles will spawn from the "
"subemitter until enough particles have expired."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de partícules a generar des del node subemissor quan es "
"produeix una col·lisió. Quan es combina amb [constant "
"COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] sobre el material de partícules principals, això "
"es pot utilitzar per aconseguir efectes com ara gotes de pluja colpejant el "
"terra.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest valor no ha de superar [member GPUParticles2D.amount] o "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] definits al [i]subemitter node@[/i]), no en "
"relació amb la part principal de la vida útil. Si se supera el nombre de "
"partícules, no es generaran noves partícules del subemissor fins que hagin "
"expirat suficients partícules."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of particles to spawn from the subemitter node when the particle "
"expires.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value shouldn't exceed [member GPUParticles2D.amount] or "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] defined on the [i]subemitter node[/i] (not "
"the main node), relative to the subemitter's particle lifetime. If the "
"number of particles is exceeded, no new particles will spawn from the "
"subemitter until enough particles have expired."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de partícules a generar des del node subemissor quan la "
"partícula expira.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest valor no ha de superar [member GPUParticles2D.amount] o "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] definits al [i]subemitter node@[/i]), no en "
"relació amb la part principal de la vida útil. Si se supera el nombre de "
"partícules, no es generaran noves partícules del subemissor fins que hagin "
"expirat suficients partícules."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of particles to spawn from the subemitter node when the particle "
"spawns.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value shouldn't exceed [member GPUParticles2D.amount] or "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] defined on the [i]subemitter node[/i] (not "
"the main node), relative to the subemitter's particle lifetime. If the "
"number of particles is exceeded, no new particles will spawn from the "
"subemitter until enough particles have expired."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de partícules a generar des del node subemissor quan la "
"partícula es genera.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest valor no ha de superar [member GPUParticles2D.amount] o "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] definits al [i]subemitter node@[/i]), no en "
"relació amb la part principal de la vida útil. Si se supera el nombre de "
"partícules, no es generaran noves partícules del subemissor fins que hagin "
"expirat suficients partícules."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The frequency at which particles should be emitted from the subemitter node. "
"One particle will be spawned every [member sub_emitter_frequency] seconds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value shouldn't exceed [member GPUParticles2D.amount] or "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] defined on the [i]subemitter node[/i] (not "
"the main node), relative to the subemitter's particle lifetime. If the "
"number of particles is exceeded, no new particles will spawn from the "
"subemitter until enough particles have expired."
msgstr ""
"La freqüència a la qual s'han d'emetre les partícules des del node "
"subemissor. Es generarà una partícula cada [member sub_emitter_frequency] "
"segons.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest valor no ha de superar [member GPUParticles2D.amount] o "
"[member GPUParticles3D.amount] definits al [i]subemitter node@[/i]), no en "
"relació amb la part principal de la vida útil. Si se supera el nombre de "
"partícules, no es generaran noves partícules del subemissor fins que hagin "
"expirat suficients partícules."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the subemitter inherits the parent particle's velocity "
"when it spawns."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The particle subemitter mode (see [member GPUParticles2D.sub_emitter] and "
"[member GPUParticles3D.sub_emitter])."
msgstr ""
"El mode de subemissor de partícules (vegeu [member "
"GPUParticles2D.sub_emitter] i [member GPUParticles3D.sub_emitter])."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's tangential acceleration will vary along this [CurveTexture]."
msgstr ""
"L'acceleració tangencial de cada partícula variarà al llarg d'aquesta "
"[CurveTexture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables turbulence for the particle system. Turbulence "
"can be used to vary particle movement according to its position (based on a "
"3D noise pattern). In 3D, [GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] with "
"[NoiseTexture3D] can be used as an alternative to turbulence that works in "
"world space and with multiple particle systems reacting in the same way.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling turbulence has a high performance cost on the GPU. "
"Only enable turbulence on a few particle systems at once at most, and "
"consider disabling it when targeting mobile/web platforms."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita la turbulència per al sistema de partícules. "
"La turbulència es pot utilitzar per variar el moviment de les partícules "
"segons la seva posició (basat en un patró de soroll 3D). En 3D, "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] amb [NoiseTexture3D] es pot utilitzar "
"com a alternativa a la turbulència que funciona a l'espai mundial i amb "
"múltiples sistemes de partícules que reaccionen de la mateixa manera.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Habilitar la turbulència té un alt cost de rendiment a la GPU. "
"Activeu només la turbulència en uns quants sistemes de partícules alhora com "
"a màxim i considereu la possibilitat de desactivar-la quan us orienteu a "
"plataformes mòbils/web."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum turbulence influence on each particle.\n"
"The actual amount of turbulence influence on each particle is calculated as "
"a random value between [member turbulence_influence_min] and [member "
"turbulence_influence_max] and multiplied by the amount of turbulence "
"influence from [member turbulence_influence_over_life]."
msgstr ""
"Màxima influència de la turbulència sobre cada partícula.\n"
"La quantitat real d'influència de la turbulència sobre cada partícula es "
"calcula com un valor aleatori entre [member turbulence_influence_min] i "
"[member turbulence_influence_max] i es multiplica per la quantitat "
"d'influència de la turbulència de [member turbulence_influence_over_life]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum turbulence influence on each particle.\n"
"The actual amount of turbulence influence on each particle is calculated as "
"a random value between [member turbulence_influence_min] and [member "
"turbulence_influence_max] and multiplied by the amount of turbulence "
"influence from [member turbulence_influence_over_life]."
msgstr ""
"Influència de la turbulència mínima sobre cada partícula.\n"
"La quantitat real d'influència de la turbulència sobre cada partícula es "
"calcula com un valor aleatori entre [member turbulence_influence_min] i "
"[member turbulence_influence_max] i es multiplica per la quantitat "
"d'influència de la turbulència de [member turbulence_influence_over_life]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's amount of turbulence will be influenced along this "
"[CurveTexture] over its life time."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de turbulència de cada partícula es veurà influenciada al llarg "
"d'aquest [CurveTexture] durant la seva vida útil."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum displacement of each particle's spawn position by the turbulence.\n"
"The actual amount of displacement will be a factor of the underlying "
"turbulence multiplied by a random value between [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_min] and [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_max]."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament màxim de la posició de generació de cada partícula per la "
"turbulència.\n"
"La quantitat real de desplaçament serà un factor de la turbulència subjacent "
"multiplicada per un valor aleatori entre [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_min] i [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_max]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum displacement of each particle's spawn position by the turbulence.\n"
"The actual amount of displacement will be a factor of the underlying "
"turbulence multiplied by a random value between [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_min] and [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_max]."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament mínim de la posició de generació de cada partícula per la "
"turbulència.\n"
"La quantitat real de desplaçament serà un factor de la turbulència subjacent "
"multiplicada per un valor aleatori entre [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_min] i [member "
"turbulence_initial_displacement_max]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"This value controls the overall scale/frequency of the turbulence noise "
"pattern.\n"
"A small scale will result in smaller features with more detail while a high "
"scale will result in smoother noise with larger features."
msgstr ""
"Aquest valor controla l'escala/freqüència global del patró de soroll de "
"turbulència.\n"
"Una escala petita donarà com a resultat funcions més petites amb més "
"detalls, mentre que una escala alta donarà lloc a un soroll més suau amb "
"funcions més grans."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A scrolling velocity for the turbulence field. This sets a directional trend "
"for the pattern to move in over time.\n"
"The default value of [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] turns off the scrolling."
msgstr ""
"Una velocitat de desplaçament per al camp de turbulència. Això estableix una "
"tendència direccional perquè el patró es mogui al llarg del temps.\n"
"El valor predeterminat de [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] desactiva el "
"desplaçament."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The in-place rate of change of the turbulence field. This defines how "
"quickly the noise pattern varies over time.\n"
"A value of 0.0 will result in a fixed pattern."
msgstr ""
"La taxa de canvi in situ del camp de turbulència. Això defineix la rapidesa "
"amb què varia el patró de soroll al llarg del temps.\n"
"Un valor de 0,0 donarà lloc a un patró fix."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The turbulence noise strength. Increasing this will result in a stronger, "
"more contrasting, flow pattern."
msgstr ""
"La força del soroll de la turbulència. Augmentar això donarà lloc a un patró "
"de flux més fort i més contrastat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Enable the usage of [member rotation_3d_min] and [member rotation_3d_max]."
msgstr "Habiliteu l'ús de [member rotation_3d_min] i [member rotation_3d_max]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Enable 3D rotation velocity."
msgstr "Activa la velocitat de rotació 3D."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Enable the usage of [member scale_3d_min] and [member scale_3d_max]."
msgstr "Habiliteu l'ús de [member scale_3d_min] i [member scale_3d_max]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A [CurveTexture] that defines the maximum velocity of a particle during its "
"lifetime."
msgstr ""
"Un [CurveTexture] que defineix la velocitat màxima d'una partícula durant la "
"seva vida útil."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A pivot point used to calculate radial and orbital velocity of particles."
msgstr ""
"Un punt de pivot utilitzat per calcular la velocitat radial i orbital de les "
"partícules."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when this material's emission shape is changed in any way. This "
"includes changes to [member emission_shape], [member emission_shape_scale], "
"or [member emission_sphere_radius], and any other property that affects the "
"emission shape's offset, size, scale, or orientation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted inside the editor for performance "
"reasons."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan la forma d'emissió d'aquest material es modifica d'alguna "
"manera. Això inclou els canvis a [member emission_shape], [member "
"emission_shape_scale] o [member emission_sphere_radius] i qualsevol altra "
"propietat que afecti el desplaçament, la mida, l'escala o l'orientació de la "
"forma d'emissió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest senyal només s'emet dins de l'editor per raons de "
"rendiment."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set initial velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir les propietats de velocitat inicial."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set angular velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats de velocitat angular."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set orbital velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats de velocitat orbital."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set linear acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats d'acceleració lineal."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set radial acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats d'acceleració radial."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set tangential acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats d'acceleració tangencial."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set damping properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats d'amortiment."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set angle properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats d'angle."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set scale properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats d'escala."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set hue variation properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats de variació de to."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set animation speed properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per definir les propietats de velocitat de l'animació."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set animation offset properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats de compensació d'animació."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set radial velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats de velocitat radial."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set directional velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per establir propietats de velocitat direccional."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_texture] to set scale over velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] i [method "
"set_param_texture] per definir l'escala sobre les propietats de velocitat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position determined by sampling a random "
"point on the [member emission_point_texture]. Particle color will be "
"modulated by [member emission_color_texture]."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran en una posició determinada mitjançant el mostreig "
"d'un punt aleatori al [member emission_point_texture]. El color de les "
"partícules estarà modulat per [member emission_color_texture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position determined by sampling a random "
"point on the [member emission_point_texture]. Particle velocity and rotation "
"will be set based on [member emission_normal_texture]. Particle color will "
"be modulated by [member emission_color_texture]."
msgstr ""
"Les partícules s'emetran en una posició determinada mitjançant el mostreig "
"d'un punt aleatori al [member emission_point_texture]. La velocitat i la "
"rotació de les partícules s'establiran en funció de [member "
"emission_normal_texture]. El color de les partícules estarà modulat per "
"[member emission_color_texture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min] and [method set_param_max] to set the "
"turbulence minimum und maximum influence on each particles velocity."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min] i [method set_param_max] per "
"establir la influència mínima i màxima de la turbulència en la velocitat de "
"cada partícula."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min] and [method set_param_max] to set the "
"turbulence minimum and maximum displacement of the particles spawn position."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_min] i [method set_param_max] per "
"establir el desplaçament mínim i màxim de la turbulència de la posició de "
"generació de partícules."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_texture] to set the turbulence influence over the "
"particles life time."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu-lo amb [method set_param_texture] per establir la influència de la "
"turbulència sobre el temps de vida de les partícules."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "The subemitter is disabled."
msgstr "El subemissor està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The submitter is emitted on the constant interval defined by [member "
"sub_emitter_frequency]."
msgstr ""
"El remitent s'emet en l'interval constant definit per [member "
"sub_emitter_frequency]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "The subemitter is emitted at the end of the particle's lifetime."
msgstr "El subemissor s'emet al final de la vida útil de la partícula."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "The subemitter is emitted when the particle collides."
msgstr "El subemissor s'emet quan la partícula xoca."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "The subemitter is emitted when the particle spawns."
msgstr "El subemissor s'emet quan la partícula genera."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum SubEmitterMode] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum SubEmitterMode]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"No collision for particles. Particles will go through "
"[GPUParticlesCollision3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Sense col·lisió per a partícules. Les partícules passaran pels nodes "
"[GPUParticlesCollision3D]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"[RigidBody3D]-style collision for particles using [GPUParticlesCollision3D] "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"Col·lisió a l'estil [RigidBody3D] per a partícules que utilitzen nodes "
"[GPUParticlesCollision3D]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Hide particles instantly when colliding with a [GPUParticlesCollision3D] "
"node. This can be combined with a subemitter that uses the [constant "
"COLLISION_RIGID] collision mode to \"replace\" the parent particle with the "
"subemitter on impact."
msgstr ""
"Amaga les partícules a l'instant quan xoquen amb un node "
"[GPUParticlesCollision3D]. Això es pot combinar amb un subemissor que "
"utilitza el mode de col·lisió [constant COLLISION_RIGID] per \"substituir\" "
"la partícula pare pel subemissor a l'impacte."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum CollisionMode] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum CollisionMode]."

#: doc/classes/Path2D.xml
msgid "Contains a [Curve2D] path for [PathFollow2D] nodes to follow."
msgstr "Conté una ruta [Curve2D] perquè els nodes [PathFollow2D] segueixin."

#: doc/classes/Path2D.xml
msgid ""
"Can have [PathFollow2D] child nodes moving along the [Curve2D]. See "
"[PathFollow2D] for more information on usage.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The path is considered as relative to the moved nodes (children "
"of [PathFollow2D]). As such, the curve should usually start with a zero "
"vector ([code](0, 0)[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Pot tenir [PathFollow2D] nodes secundaris movent-se al llarg de [Curve2D]. "
"Vegeu [PathFollow2D] per obtenir més informació sobre l'ús.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El camí es considera com a relatiu als nodes moguts (fills de "
"[PathFollow2D]). Com a tal, la corba normalment hauria de començar amb un "
"vector zero ([code](0, 0)[/code])."

#: doc/classes/Path2D.xml
msgid "A [Curve2D] describing the path."
msgstr "Un [Curve2D] que descriu el camí."

#: doc/classes/Path3D.xml
msgid "Contains a [Curve3D] path for [PathFollow3D] nodes to follow."
msgstr "Conté una ruta [Curve3D] perquè els nodes [PathFollow3D] segueixin."

#: doc/classes/Path3D.xml
msgid ""
"Can have [PathFollow3D] child nodes moving along the [Curve3D]. See "
"[PathFollow3D] for more information on the usage.\n"
"Note that the path is considered as relative to the moved nodes (children of "
"[PathFollow3D]). As such, the curve should usually start with a zero vector "
"[code](0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Pot tenir [PathFollow3D] nodes secundaris movent-se al llarg de [Curve3D]. "
"Vegeu [PathFollow3D] per obtenir més informació sobre l'ús.\n"
"Tingueu en compte que el camí es considera com a relatiu als nodes moguts "
"(fills de [PathFollow3D]). Com a tal, la corba normalment hauria de començar "
"amb un vector zero [code](0, 0, 0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Path3D.xml
msgid "A [Curve3D] describing the path."
msgstr "Un [Curve3D] que descriu el camí."

#: doc/classes/Path3D.xml
msgid ""
"The custom color used to draw the path in the editor. If set to [constant "
"Color.BLACK] (as by default), the color set in [member ProjectSettings.debug/"
"shapes/paths/geometry_color] is used."
msgstr ""
"El color personalitzat utilitzat per dibuixar el camí a l'editor. Si "
"s'estableix a [constant Color.BLACK] (com per defecte), s'utilitza el color "
"establert a [member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/paths/geometry_color]."

#: doc/classes/Path3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [member curve] changes."
msgstr "S'emet quan canvia [member curve]."

#: doc/classes/Path3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [member debug_custom_color] changes."
msgstr "S'emet quan canvia el [member debug_custom_color]."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml
msgid "Point sampler for a [Path2D]."
msgstr "Mostra de punts per a un [Path2D]."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml
msgid ""
"This node takes its parent [Path2D], and returns the coordinates of a point "
"within it, given a distance from the first vertex.\n"
"It is useful for making other nodes follow a path, without coding the "
"movement pattern. For that, the nodes must be children of this node. The "
"descendant nodes will then move accordingly when setting the [member "
"progress] in this node."
msgstr ""
"Aquest node pren el seu pare [Path2D] i retorna les coordenades d'un punt "
"dins d'ell, donada una distància des del primer vèrtex.\n"
"És útil per fer que altres nodes segueixin un camí, sense codificar el patró "
"de moviment. Per això, els nodes han de ser fills d'aquest node. Els nodes "
"descendents es mouran en conseqüència quan s'estableixi [member progress] en "
"aquest node."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the position between two cached points is interpolated "
"cubically, and linearly otherwise.\n"
"The points along the [Curve2D] of the [Path2D] are precomputed before use, "
"for faster calculations. The point at the requested offset is then "
"calculated interpolating between two adjacent cached points. This may "
"present a problem if the curve makes sharp turns, as the cached points may "
"not follow the curve closely enough.\n"
"There are two answers to this problem: either increase the number of cached "
"points and increase memory consumption, or make a cubic interpolation "
"between two points at the cost of (slightly) slower calculations."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la posició entre dos punts en memòria cau s'interpola "
"cúbicament, i linealment en cas contrari.\n"
"Els punts al llarg de [Curve2D] de [Path2D] es calculen prèviament abans "
"d'utilitzar-los, per a càlculs més ràpids. A continuació, es calcula el punt "
"del desplaçament sol·licitat interpolant entre dos punts adjacents a la "
"memòria cau. Això pot presentar un problema si la corba fa girs pronunciats, "
"ja que és possible que els punts en memòria cau no segueixin la corba prou a "
"prop.\n"
"Hi ha dues respostes a aquest problema: augmentar el nombre de punts en "
"memòria cau i augmentar el consum de memòria, o fer una interpolació cúbica "
"entre dos punts a costa de càlculs (lleugerament) més lents."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "The node's offset along the curve."
msgstr "Desplaçament del node al llarg de la corba."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], any offset outside the path's length will wrap around, "
"instead of stopping at the ends. Use it for cyclic paths."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], qualsevol desplaçament fora de la longitud del camí "
"s'embolicarà, en lloc d'aturar-se als extrems. Utilitzeu-lo per a camins "
"cíclics."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance along the path, in pixels. Changing this value sets this node's "
"position to a point within the path."
msgstr ""
"La distància al llarg del camí, en píxels. Canviar aquest valor estableix la "
"posició d'aquest node en un punt dins del camí."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance along the path as a number in the range 0.0 (for the first "
"vertex) to 1.0 (for the last). This is just another way of expressing the "
"progress within the path, as the offset supplied is multiplied internally by "
"the path's length.\n"
"It can be set or get only if the [PathFollow2D] is the child of a [Path2D] "
"which is part of the scene tree, and that this [Path2D] has a [Curve2D] with "
"a non-zero length. Otherwise, trying to set this field will print an error, "
"and getting this field will return [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La distància al llarg del camí com a nombre en l'interval de 0,0 (per al "
"primer vèrtex) a 1,0 (per a l'últim). Aquesta és només una altra manera "
"d'expressar el progrés dins del camí, ja que el desplaçament subministrat es "
"multiplica internament per la longitud del camí.\n"
"Es pot establir o obtenir només si [PathFollow2D] és el fill d'un [Path2D] "
"que forma part de l'arbre de l'escena, i que aquest [Path2D] té un [Curve2D] "
"amb una longitud diferent de zero. En cas contrari, intentar configurar "
"aquest camp s'imprimirà un error i obtenir aquest camp retornarà [code]0.0[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this node rotates to follow the path, with the +X "
"direction facing forward on the path."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aquest node gira per seguir el camí, amb la direcció "
"+X mirant cap endavant al camí."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow2D.xml doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "The node's offset perpendicular to the curve."
msgstr "Desplaçament del node perpendicular a la corba."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "Point sampler for a [Path3D]."
msgstr "Mostra de punts per a un [Path3D]."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"This node takes its parent [Path3D], and returns the coordinates of a point "
"within it, given a distance from the first vertex.\n"
"It is useful for making other nodes follow a path, without coding the "
"movement pattern. For that, the nodes must be children of this node. The "
"descendant nodes will then move accordingly when setting the [member "
"progress] in this node."
msgstr ""
"Aquest node pren el seu pare [Path3D] i retorna les coordenades d'un punt "
"dins d'ell, donada una distància des del primer vèrtex.\n"
"És útil per fer que altres nodes segueixin un camí, sense codificar el patró "
"de moviment. Per això, els nodes han de ser fills d'aquest node. Els nodes "
"descendents es mouran en conseqüència quan s'estableixi [member progress] en "
"aquest node."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"Correct the [param transform]. [param rotation_mode] implicitly specifies "
"how posture (forward, up and sideway direction) is calculated."
msgstr ""
"Corregiu el [param transform]. [param rotation_mode] especifica "
"implícitament com es calcula la postura (direcció cap endavant, cap amunt i "
"lateral)."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the position between two cached points is interpolated "
"cubically, and linearly otherwise.\n"
"The points along the [Curve3D] of the [Path3D] are precomputed before use, "
"for faster calculations. The point at the requested offset is then "
"calculated interpolating between two adjacent cached points. This may "
"present a problem if the curve makes sharp turns, as the cached points may "
"not follow the curve closely enough.\n"
"There are two answers to this problem: either increase the number of cached "
"points and increase memory consumption, or make a cubic interpolation "
"between two points at the cost of (slightly) slower calculations."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la posició entre dos punts en memòria cau s'interpola "
"cúbicament, i linealment en cas contrari.\n"
"Els punts al llarg de [Curve3D] de [Path3D] es calculen prèviament abans "
"d'utilitzar-los, per a càlculs més ràpids. A continuació, es calcula el punt "
"del desplaçament sol·licitat interpolant entre dos punts adjacents a la "
"memòria cau. Això pot presentar un problema si la corba fa girs pronunciats, "
"ja que és possible que els punts en memòria cau no segueixin la corba prou a "
"prop.\n"
"Hi ha dues respostes a aquest problema: augmentar el nombre de punts en "
"memòria cau i augmentar el consum de memòria, o fer una interpolació cúbica "
"entre dos punts a costa de càlculs (lleugerament) més lents."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from the first vertex, measured in 3D units along the path. "
"Changing this value sets this node's position to a point within the path."
msgstr ""
"La distància des del primer vèrtex, mesurada en unitats 3D al llarg del "
"camí. Canviar aquest valor estableix la posició d'aquest node en un punt "
"dins del camí."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from the first vertex, considering 0.0 as the first vertex and "
"1.0 as the last. This is just another way of expressing the progress within "
"the path, as the progress supplied is multiplied internally by the path's "
"length.\n"
"It can be set or get only if the [PathFollow3D] is the child of a [Path3D] "
"which is part of the scene tree, and that this [Path3D] has a [Curve3D] with "
"a non-zero length. Otherwise, trying to set this field will print an error, "
"and getting this field will return [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La distància des del primer vèrtex, considerant 0,0 com a primer vèrtex i "
"1,0 com a darrer. Aquesta és només una altra manera d'expressar el progrés "
"dins del camí, ja que el progrés proporcionat es multiplica internament per "
"la longitud del camí.\n"
"Es pot establir o obtenir només si [PathFollow3D] és el fill d'un [Path3D] "
"que forma part de l'arbre de l'escena, i que aquest [Path3D] té un [Curve3D] "
"amb una longitud diferent de zero. En cas contrari, intentar configurar "
"aquest camp s'imprimirà un error i obtenir aquest camp retornarà [code]0.0[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"Allows or forbids rotation on one or more axes, depending on the [enum "
"RotationMode] constants being used."
msgstr ""
"Permet o prohibeix la rotació en un o més eixos, en funció de les constants "
"[enum RotationMode] que s'utilitzen."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the tilt property of [Curve3D] takes effect."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la propietat d'inclinació de [Curve3D] té efecte."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node moves on the travel path with orienting the "
"+Z axis as forward. See also [constant Vector3.FORWARD] and [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el node es mou pel camí de desplaçament orientant "
"l'eix +Z cap endavant. Vegeu també [constant Vector3.FORWARD] i [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "Forbids the PathFollow3D to rotate."
msgstr "Prohibeix que PathFollow3D giri."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "Allows the PathFollow3D to rotate in the Y axis only."
msgstr "Permet que PathFollow3D giri només a l'eix Y."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "Allows the PathFollow3D to rotate in both the X, and Y axes."
msgstr "Permet que PathFollow3D giri tant en els eixos X com en Y."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid "Allows the PathFollow3D to rotate in any axis."
msgstr "Permet que PathFollow3D giri en qualsevol eix."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the up vector information in a [Curve3D] to enforce orientation. This "
"rotation mode requires the [Path3D]'s [member Curve3D.up_vector_enabled] "
"property to be set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Utilitza la informació del vector amunt en un [Curve3D] per fer complir "
"l'orientació. Aquest mode de rotació requereix que la propietat [member "
"Curve3D.up_vector_enabled] de [Path3D] s'estableixi a [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PCKPacker.xml
msgid "Creates packages that can be loaded into a running project."
msgstr "Crea paquets que es poden carregar en un projecte en execució."

#: doc/classes/PCKPacker.xml
msgid ""
"The [PCKPacker] is used to create packages that can be loaded into a running "
"project using [method ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var packer = PCKPacker.new()\n"
"packer.pck_start(\"test.pck\")\n"
"packer.add_file(\"res://text.txt\", \"text.txt\")\n"
"packer.flush()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var packer = new PckPacker();\n"
"packer.PckStart(\"test.pck\");\n"
"packer.AddFile(\"res://text.txt\", \"text.txt\");\n"
"packer.Flush();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The above [PCKPacker] creates package [code]test.pck[/code], then adds a "
"file named [code]text.txt[/code] at the root of the package.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] PCK is Godot's own pack file format. To create ZIP archives "
"that can be read by any program, use [ZIPPacker] instead."
msgstr ""
"[PCKPacker] s'utilitza per crear paquets que es poden carregar en un "
"projecte en execució mitjançant [method "
"ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var empaquetador = PCKPacker.new()\n"
"packer.pck_start(\"test.pck\")\n"
"packer.add_file(\"res://text.txt\", \"text.txt\")\n"
"packer.flush()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var embalador = nou PckPacker();\n"
"packer.PckStart(\"test.pck\");\n"
"packer.AddFile(\"res://text.txt\", \"text.txt\");\n"
"packer.Flush();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"El [PCKPacker] anterior crea el paquet [code]test.pck[/code] i, a "
"continuació, afegeix un fitxer anomenat [code]text.txt[/code] a l'arrel del "
"paquet.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] PCK és el format de fitxer de paquet propi de Godot. Per crear "
"arxius ZIP que qualsevol programa pugui llegir, utilitzeu [ZIPPacker]."

#: doc/classes/PCKPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the [param source_path] file to the current PCK package at the [param "
"target_path] internal path. The [code]res://[/code] prefix for [param "
"target_path] is optional and stripped internally. File content is "
"immediately written to the PCK."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix el fitxer [param source_path] al paquet PCK actual al camí intern "
"[param target_path]. El prefix [code]res://[/code] per a [param target_path] "
"és opcional i està eliminat internament. El contingut del fitxer s'escriu "
"immediatament al PCK."

#: doc/classes/PCKPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the [param data] to the current PCK package at the [param target_path] "
"internal path. The [code]res://[/code] prefix for [param target_path] is "
"optional and stripped internally. File content is immediately written to the "
"PCK."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix [param data] al paquet PCK actual al camí intern [param "
"target_path]. El prefix [code]res://[/code] per a [param target_path] és "
"opcional i està eliminat internament. El contingut del fitxer s'escriu "
"immediatament al PCK."

#: doc/classes/PCKPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a file removal of the [param target_path] internal path to the "
"PCK. This is mainly used for patches. If the file at this path has been "
"loaded from a previous PCK, it will be removed. The [code]res://[/code] "
"prefix for [param target_path] is optional and stripped internally."
msgstr ""
"Registra una eliminació de fitxers del camí intern [param target_path] al "
"PCK. Això s'utilitza principalment per a pegats. Si el fitxer d'aquesta ruta "
"s'ha carregat des d'un PCK anterior, s'eliminarà. El prefix [code]res://[/"
"code] per a [param target_path] és opcional i està eliminat internament."

#: doc/classes/PCKPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Writes the file directory and closes the PCK. If [param verbose] is "
"[code]true[/code], a list of files added will be printed to the console for "
"easier debugging.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [PCKPacker] will automatically flush when it's freed, which "
"happens when it goes out of scope or when it gets assigned with [code]null[/"
"code]. In C# the reference must be disposed after use, either with the "
"[code]using[/code] statement or by calling the [code]Dispose[/code] method "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"Escriu el directori de fitxers i tanca el PCK. Si [param verbose] és "
"[code]true[/code], s'imprimirà una llista de fitxers afegits a la consola "
"per facilitar la depuració.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [PCKPacker] es netejarà automàticament quan s'alliberi, cosa "
"que passa quan surt de l'abast o quan s'assigna amb [code]null[/code]. En "
"C#, la referència s'ha d'eliminar després del seu ús, ja sigui amb la "
"instrucció [code]using[/code] o trucant directament al mètode [code]Dispose[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/PCKPacker.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new PCK file at the file path [param pck_path]. The [code].pck[/"
"code] file extension isn't added automatically, so it should be part of "
"[param pck_path] (even though it's not required)."
msgstr ""
"Crea un fitxer PCK nou al camí del fitxer [param pck_path]. L'extensió de "
"fitxer [code].pck[/code] no s'afegeix automàticament, de manera que hauria "
"de formar part de [param pck_path] (tot i que no és obligatori)."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid "Exposes performance-related data."
msgstr "Exposa dades relacionades amb el rendiment."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"This class provides access to a number of different monitors related to "
"performance, such as memory usage, draw calls, and FPS. These are the same "
"as the values displayed in the [b]Monitor[/b] tab in the editor's "
"[b]Debugger[/b] panel. By using the [method get_monitor] method of this "
"class, you can access this data from your code.\n"
"You can add custom monitors using the [method add_custom_monitor] method. "
"Custom monitors are available in [b]Monitor[/b] tab in the editor's "
"[b]Debugger[/b] panel together with built-in monitors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some of the built-in monitors are only available in debug mode "
"and will always return [code]0[/code] when used in a project exported in "
"release mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some of the built-in monitors are not updated in real-time for "
"performance reasons, so there may be a delay of up to 1 second between "
"changes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom monitors do not support negative values. Negative values "
"are clamped to 0."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe proporciona accés a una sèrie de monitors diferents "
"relacionats amb el rendiment, com ara l'ús de memòria, trucades de dibuix i "
"FPS. Són els mateixos que els valors que es mostren a la pestanya "
"[b]Monitor[/b] del tauler [b]Debugger[/b] de l'editor. Mitjançant el mètode "
"[method get_monitor] d'aquesta classe, podeu accedir a aquestes dades des "
"del vostre codi.\n"
"Podeu afegir monitors personalitzats mitjançant el mètode [method "
"add_custom_monitor]. Els monitors personalitzats estan disponibles a "
"[b]Monitor[/b] a la pestanya [b]Debugger[/b] de l'editor juntament amb els "
"monitors integrats.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Alguns dels monitors integrats només estan disponibles en mode "
"de depuració i sempre tornaran [code]0[/code] quan s'utilitzen en un "
"projecte exportat en mode de llançament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Alguns dels monitors integrats no s'actualitzen en temps real "
"per motius de rendiment, de manera que pot haver-hi un retard de fins a 1 "
"segon entre canvis.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els monitors personalitzats no admeten valors negatius. Els "
"valors negatius estan subjectes a 0."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom monitor with the name [param id]. You can specify the category "
"of the monitor using slash delimiters in [param id] (for example: [code]"
"\"Game/NumberOfNPCs\"[/code]). If there is more than one slash delimiter, "
"then the default category is used. The default category is [code]\"Custom\"[/"
"code]. Prints an error if given [param id] is already present.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar monitor_value = Callable(self, \"get_monitor_value\")\n"
"\n"
"\t# Adds monitor with name \"MyName\" to category \"MyCategory\".\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"MyCategory/MyMonitor\", monitor_value)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Adds monitor with name \"MyName\" to category \"Custom\".\n"
"\t# Note: \"MyCategory/MyMonitor\" and \"MyMonitor\" have same name but "
"different IDs, so the code is valid.\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"MyMonitor\", monitor_value)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Adds monitor with name \"MyName\" to category \"Custom\".\n"
"\t# Note: \"MyMonitor\" and \"Custom/MyMonitor\" have same name and same "
"category but different IDs, so the code is valid.\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"Custom/MyMonitor\", monitor_value)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Adds monitor with name \"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\" to "
"category \"Custom\".\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\", "
"monitor_value)\n"
"\n"
"func get_monitor_value():\n"
"\treturn randi() % 25\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar monitorValue = new Callable(this, MethodName.GetMonitorValue);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Adds monitor with name \"MyName\" to category \"MyCategory\".\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"MyCategory/MyMonitor\", monitorValue);\n"
"\t// Adds monitor with name \"MyName\" to category \"Custom\".\n"
"\t// Note: \"MyCategory/MyMonitor\" and \"MyMonitor\" have same name but "
"different ids so the code is valid.\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"MyMonitor\", monitorValue);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Adds monitor with name \"MyName\" to category \"Custom\".\n"
"\t// Note: \"MyMonitor\" and \"Custom/MyMonitor\" have same name and same "
"category but different ids so the code is valid.\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"Custom/MyMonitor\", monitorValue);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Adds monitor with name \"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\" to "
"category \"Custom\".\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\", "
"monitorValue);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public int GetMonitorValue()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn GD.Randi() % 25;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The debugger calls the callable to get the value of custom monitor. The "
"callable must return a zero or positive integer or floating-point number.\n"
"Callables are called with arguments supplied in argument array."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un monitor personalitzat amb el nom [param id]. Podeu especificar la "
"categoria del monitor mitjançant delimitadors de barra inclinada a [param "
"id] (per exemple: [code]\"Game/NumberOfNPCs\"[/code]). Si hi ha més d'un "
"delimitador de barra inclinada, s'utilitza la categoria predeterminada. La "
"categoria predeterminada és [code]\"Personalitzada\"[/code]. Imprimeix un "
"error si ja està present [param id].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tvar monitor_value = Callable(self, \"get_monitor_value\")\n"
"\n"
"\t# Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyName\" a la categoria \"MyCategory\".\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"MyCategory/MyMonitor\", monitor_value)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyName\" a la categoria "
"\"Personalitzat\".\n"
"\t# Nota: \"MyCategory/MyMonitor\" i \"MyMonitor\" tenen el mateix nom però "
"ID diferents, de manera que el codi és vàlid.\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"El meu monitor\", valor_monitor)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyName\" a la categoria "
"\"Personalitzat\".\n"
"\t# Nota: \"MyMonitor\" i \"Custom/MyMonitor\" tenen el mateix nom i la "
"mateixa categoria, però ID diferents, de manera que el codi és vàlid.\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"Personalitzat/MyMonitor\", "
"monitor_value)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\" "
"a la categoria \"Personalitzat\".\n"
"\tPerformance.add_custom_monitor(\"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\", "
"monitor_value)\n"
"\n"
"func get_monitor_value():\n"
"\tretorna randi() % 25\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"anul·lació pública void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar monitorValue = new Callable (això, MethodName.GetMonitorValue);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyName\" a la categoria "
"\"MyCategory\".\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"MyCategory/MyMonitor\", monitorValue);\n"
"\t// Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyName\" a la categoria "
"\"Personalitzat\".\n"
"\t// Nota: \"MyCategory/MyMonitor\" i \"MyMonitor\" tenen el mateix nom però "
"diferents identificadors, de manera que el codi és vàlid.\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"MyMonitor\", monitorValue);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyName\" a la categoria "
"\"Personalitzat\".\n"
"\t// Nota: \"MyMonitor\" i \"Custom/MyMonitor\" tenen el mateix nom i la "
"mateixa categoria, però identificadors diferents, de manera que el codi és "
"vàlid.\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"Personalitzat/MyMonitor\", monitorValue);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Afegeix un monitor amb el nom \"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\" "
"a la categoria \"Personalitzat\".\n"
"\tPerformance.AddCustomMonitor(\"MyCategoryOne/MyCategoryTwo/MyMonitor\", "
"monitorValue);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public int GetMonitorValue()\n"
"{\n"
"\tretornar GD.Randi() % 25;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"El depurador crida a l'anomenable per obtenir el valor del monitor "
"personalitzat. L'invocable ha de retornar un zero o un nombre enter positiu "
"o un nombre de coma flotant.\n"
"Els callables es criden amb arguments proporcionats a la matriu d'arguments."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of custom monitor with given [param id]. The callable is "
"called to get the value of custom monitor. See also [method "
"has_custom_monitor]. Prints an error if the given [param id] is absent."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor del monitor personalitzat amb [param id] donat. Es crida al "
"crible per obtenir el valor del monitor personalitzat. Vegeu també [method "
"has_custom_monitor]. Imprimeix un error si no hi ha [param id] indicat."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid "Returns the names of active custom monitors in an [Array]."
msgstr "Retorna els noms dels monitors personalitzats actius en un [Array]."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [enum MonitorType] values of active custom monitors in an "
"[Array]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna els valors [enum MonitorType] dels monitors personalitzats actius en "
"un [Array]."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of one of the available built-in monitors. You should "
"provide one of the [enum Monitor] constants as the argument, like this:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(Performance.get_monitor(Performance.TIME_FPS)) # Prints the FPS to the "
"console.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(Performance.GetMonitor(Performance.Monitor.TimeFps)); // Prints the "
"FPS to the console.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See [method get_custom_monitor] to query custom performance monitors' values."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor d'un dels monitors integrats disponibles. Hauríeu de "
"proporcionar una de les constants [enum Monitor] com a argument, com "
"aquest:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(Performance.get_monitor(Performance.TIME_FPS)) # Imprimeix l'FPS a la "
"consola.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(Performance.GetMonitor(Performance.Monitor.TimeFps)); // Imprimeix "
"l'FPS a la consola.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Vegeu [method get_custom_monitor] per consultar els valors dels monitors de "
"rendiment personalitzats."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last tick in which custom monitor was added/removed (in "
"microseconds since the engine started). This is set to [method "
"Time.get_ticks_usec] when the monitor is updated."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'última marca en què s'ha afegit/eliminat el monitor personalitzat "
"(en microsegons des que es va iniciar el motor). S'estableix en [method "
"Time.get_ticks_usec] quan s'actualitza el monitor."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if custom monitor with the given [param id] is "
"present, [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si hi ha un monitor personalitzat amb el [param "
"id] donat, [code]false[/code] en cas contrari."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the custom monitor with given [param id]. Prints an error if the "
"given [param id] is already absent."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el monitor personalitzat amb [param id] donat. Imprimeix un error si "
"el [param id] donat ja està absent."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"The number of frames rendered in the last second. This metric is only "
"updated once per second, even if queried more often. [i]Higher is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"El nombre de fotogrames representats en l'últim segon. Aquesta mètrica només "
"s'actualitza una vegada per segon, encara que es consulti més sovint. [i]Més "
"alt és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid "Time it took to complete one frame, in seconds. [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"Temps que va trigar a completar un fotograma, en segons. [i]Menor és millor."
"[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Time it took to complete one physics frame, in seconds. [i]Lower is better.[/"
"i]"
msgstr ""
"Temps que va trigar a completar un fotograma de física, en segons. [i]Menor "
"és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Time it took to complete one navigation step, in seconds. This includes "
"navigation map updates as well as agent avoidance calculations. [i]Lower is "
"better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"Temps que va trigar a completar un pas de navegació, en segons. Això inclou "
"actualitzacions de mapes de navegació, així com càlculs d'evitació d'agents. "
"[i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Static memory currently used, in bytes. Not available in release builds. "
"[i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"Memòria estàtica utilitzada actualment, en bytes. No disponible a les "
"versions de versions. [i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Available static memory. Not available in release builds. [i]Lower is better."
"[/i]"
msgstr ""
"Memòria estàtica disponible. No disponible a les versions de versions. "
"[i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Largest amount of memory the message queue buffer has used, in bytes. The "
"message queue is used for deferred functions calls and notifications. "
"[i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de memòria més gran que ha utilitzat la memòria intermèdia de "
"la cua de missatges, en bytes. La cua de missatges s'utilitza per a les "
"trucades i les notificacions de funcions diferides. [i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Number of objects currently instantiated (including nodes). [i]Lower is "
"better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"Nombre d'objectes instanciats actualment (inclosos els nodes). [i]Menor és "
"millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid "Number of resources currently used. [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr "Nombre de recursos utilitzats actualment. [i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Number of nodes currently instantiated in the scene tree. This also includes "
"the root node. [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"Nombre de nodes instanciats actualment a l'arbre d'escenes. Això també "
"inclou el node arrel. [i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Number of orphan nodes, i.e. nodes which are not parented to a node of the "
"scene tree. [i]Lower is better.[/i]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only available in debug mode and will always return "
"[code]0[/code] when used in a project exported in release mode."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de nodes orfes, és a dir, nodes que no estan relacionats amb un node "
"de l'arbre d'escenes. [i]Menor és millor.[/i]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només està disponible en mode de depuració i sempre "
"retornarà [code]0[/code] quan s'utilitza en un projecte exportat en mode de "
"llançament."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"The total number of objects in the last rendered frame. This metric doesn't "
"include culled objects (either via hiding nodes, frustum culling or "
"occlusion culling). [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"El nombre total d'objectes de l'últim marc representat. Aquesta mètrica no "
"inclou els objectes seleccionats (ja sigui mitjançant nodes d'amagat, "
"eliminació de frustum o eliminació d'oclusió). [i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"The total number of vertices or indices rendered in the last rendered frame. "
"This metric doesn't include primitives from culled objects (either via "
"hiding nodes, frustum culling or occlusion culling). Due to the depth "
"prepass and shadow passes, the number of primitives is always higher than "
"the actual number of vertices in the scene (typically double or triple the "
"original vertex count). [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"El nombre total de vèrtexs o índexs representats a l'últim fotograma "
"representat. Aquesta mètrica no inclou primitives d'objectes seleccionats "
"(ja sigui mitjançant nodes d'ocultació, eliminació de frustum o eliminació "
"d'oclusió). A causa del prepass de profunditat i els passos d'ombra, el "
"nombre de primitives sempre és superior al nombre real de vèrtexs de "
"l'escena (normalment el doble o el triple del nombre de vèrtexs original). "
"[i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"The total number of draw calls performed in the last rendered frame. This "
"metric doesn't include culled objects (either via hiding nodes, frustum "
"culling or occlusion culling), since they do not result in draw calls. "
"[i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"El nombre total de trucades de sorteig realitzades en l'últim fotograma "
"renderitzat. Aquesta mètrica no inclou els objectes seleccionats (ja sigui "
"mitjançant nodes d'amagat, eliminació de frustum o eliminació d'oclusió), ja "
"que no donen lloc a trucades de dibuix. [i]Menor és millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of video memory used (texture and vertex memory combined, in "
"bytes). Since this metric also includes miscellaneous allocations, this "
"value is always greater than the sum of [constant RENDER_TEXTURE_MEM_USED] "
"and [constant RENDER_BUFFER_MEM_USED]. [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de memòria de vídeo utilitzada (memoria de textura i vèrtex "
"combinada, en bytes). Com que aquesta mètrica també inclou assignacions "
"diverses, aquest valor sempre és més gran que la suma de [constant "
"RENDER_TEXTURE_MEM_USED] i [constant RENDER_BUFFER_MEM_USED]. [i]Menor és "
"millor.[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid "The amount of texture memory used (in bytes). [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de memòria de textura utilitzada (en bytes). [i]Menor és millor."
"[/i]"

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of render buffer memory used (in bytes). [i]Lower is better.[/i]"
