msgstr "La sortida del monitor té el format d'un valor enter."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Monitor output is formatted as computer memory. Submitted values should "
"represent a number of bytes."
msgstr ""
"La sortida del monitor està formatada com a memòria de l'ordinador. Els "
"valors enviats han de representar un nombre de bytes."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Monitor output is formatted as time in milliseconds. Submitted values should "
"represent a time in seconds (not milliseconds)."
msgstr ""
"La sortida del monitor està formatada com a temps en mil·lisegons. Els "
"valors enviats han de representar un temps en segons (no mil·lisegons)."

#: doc/classes/Performance.xml
msgid ""
"Monitor output is formatted as a percentage. Submitted values should "
"represent a fractional value rather than the percentage directly, e.g. "
"[code]0.5[/code] for [code]50.00%[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La sortida del monitor està formatada com a percentatge. Els valors enviats "
"haurien de representar un valor fraccional en lloc del percentatge "
"directament, p. ex. [code]0.5[/code] per a [code]@50.00%[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"A [RigidBody2D]-derived node used to make [Bone2D]s in a [Skeleton2D] react "
"to physics."
msgstr ""
"Un node derivat de [RigidBody2D] que s'utilitza per fer que [Bone2D]s en un "
"[Skeleton2D] reaccionin a la física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"The [PhysicalBone2D] node is a [RigidBody2D]-based node that can be used to "
"make [Bone2D]s in a [Skeleton2D] react to physics.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To make the [Bone2D]s visually follow the [PhysicalBone2D] "
"node, use a [SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones] modification on the "
"[Skeleton2D] parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [PhysicalBone2D] node does not automatically create a "
"[Joint2D] node to keep [PhysicalBone2D] nodes together. They must be created "
"manually. For most cases, you want to use a [PinJoint2D] node. The "
"[PhysicalBone2D] node will automatically configure the [Joint2D] node once "
"it's been added as a child node."
msgstr ""
"El node [PhysicalBone2D] és un node basat en [RigidBody2D] que es pot "
"utilitzar per fer que [Bone2D]s en un [Skeleton2D] reaccionin a la física.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per fer que els [Bone2D]s segueixin visualment el node "
"[PhysicalBone2D], utilitzeu una modificació "
"[SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones] al pare [Skeleton2D].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El node [PhysicalBone2D] no crea automàticament un node "
"[Joint2D] per mantenir junts els nodes [PhysicalBone2D]. S'han de crear "
"manualment. En la majoria dels casos, voleu utilitzar un node [PinJoint2D]. "
"El node [PhysicalBone2D] configurarà automàticament el node [Joint2D] un cop "
"s'hagi afegit com a node fill."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the first [Joint2D] child node, if one exists. This is mainly a "
"helper function to make it easier to get the [Joint2D] that the "
"[PhysicalBone2D] is autoconfiguring."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el primer node fill [Joint2D], si n'hi ha. Aquesta és principalment "
"una funció d'ajuda per facilitar l'obtenció del [Joint2D] que "
"[PhysicalBone2D] està configurant automàticament."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the [PhysicalBone2D] is running and "
"simulating using the Godot 2D physics engine. When [code]true[/code], the "
"PhysicalBone2D node is using physics."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un booleà que indica si [PhysicalBone2D] s'està executant i simulant "
"amb el motor de física Godot 2D. Quan [code]true[/code], el node "
"PhysicalBone2D està utilitzant la física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [PhysicalBone2D] will automatically configure the "
"first [Joint2D] child node. The automatic configuration is limited to "
"setting up the node properties and positioning the [Joint2D]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [PhysicalBone2D] configurarà automàticament el primer "
"node fill [Joint2D]. La configuració automàtica es limita a configurar les "
"propietats del node i posicionar el [Joint2D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid "The index of the [Bone2D] that this [PhysicalBone2D] should simulate."
msgstr "L'índex del [Bone2D] que aquest [PhysicalBone2D] hauria de simular."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"The [NodePath] to the [Bone2D] that this [PhysicalBone2D] should simulate."
msgstr ""
"El [NodePath] al [Bone2D] que aquest [PhysicalBone2D] hauria de simular."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [PhysicalBone2D] will keep the transform of the "
"bone it is bound to when simulating physics."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [PhysicalBone2D] mantindrà la transformació de l'os al "
"qual està vinculat quan es simula la física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [PhysicalBone2D] will start simulating using "
"physics. If [code]false[/code], the [PhysicalBone2D] will follow the "
"transform of the [Bone2D] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To have the [Bone2D]s visually follow the [PhysicalBone2D], use "
"a [SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones] modification on the [Skeleton2D] "
"node with the [Bone2D] nodes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "A physics body used to make bones in a [Skeleton3D] react to physics."
msgstr ""
"Un cos físic utilitzat per fer que els ossos d'un [Skeleton3D] reaccionin a "
"la física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [PhysicalBone3D] node is a physics body that can be used to make bones "
"in a [Skeleton3D] react to physics.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In order to detect physical bones with raycasts, the [member "
"SkeletonModifier3D.active] property of the parent [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] "
"must be [code]true[/code] and the [Skeleton3D]'s bone must be assigned to "
"[PhysicalBone3D] correctly; it means that [method get_bone_id] should return "
"a valid id ([code]>= 0[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "Ragdoll System"
msgstr "Sistema ragdoll"

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Called during physics processing, allowing you to read and safely modify the "
"simulation state for the object. By default, it is called before the "
"standard force integration, but the [member custom_integrator] property "
"allows you to disable the standard force integration and do fully custom "
"force integration for a body."
msgstr ""
"Es crida durant el processament físic, que us permet llegir i modificar de "
"manera segura l'estat de simulació de l'objecte. Per defecte, s'anomena "
"abans de la integració de força estàndard, però la propietat [member "
"custom_integrator] us permet desactivar la integració de força estàndard i "
"fer una integració de força totalment personalitzada per a un cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a directional impulse without affecting rotation.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_integrate_forces\" functions "
"otherwise).\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method apply_impulse] at the body's center of "
"mass."
msgstr ""
"Aplica un impuls direccional sense afectar la rotació.\n"
"Un impuls és independent del temps! Aplicar un impuls a cada fotograma "
"resultaria en una força depenent de la velocitat de fotogrames. Per aquest "
"motiu, només s'ha d'utilitzar quan es simula impactes puntuals (en cas "
"contrari, utilitzeu les funcions \"_integrate_forces\").\n"
"Això equival a utilitzar [method apply_impulse] al centre de massa del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a positioned impulse to the PhysicsBone3D.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_integrate_forces\" functions "
"otherwise).\n"
"[param position] is the offset from the PhysicsBone3D origin in global "
"coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Aplica un impuls posicionat al PhysicsBone3D.\n"
"Un impuls és independent del temps! Aplicar un impuls a cada fotograma "
"resultaria en una força depenent de la velocitat de fotogrames. Per aquest "
"motiu, només s'ha d'utilitzar quan es simula impactes puntuals (en cas "
"contrari, utilitzeu les funcions \"_integrate_forces\").\n"
"[param position] és el desplaçament de l'origen PhysicsBone3D en coordenades "
"globals."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "Returns the unique identifier of the PhysicsBone3D."
msgstr "Retorna l'identificador únic del PhysicsBone3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the PhysicsBone3D is allowed to simulate "
"physics."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the PhysicsBone3D is currently simulating "
"physics."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Damps the body's rotation. By default, the body will use the [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_angular_damp] project setting or any "
"value override set by an [Area3D] the body is in. Depending on [member "
"angular_damp_mode], you can set [member angular_damp] to be added to or to "
"replace the body's damping value.\n"
"See [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_angular_damp] for more "
"details about damping."
msgstr ""
"Amortiga la rotació del cos. De manera predeterminada, el cos utilitzarà la "
"configuració del projecte [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/"
"default_angular_damp] o qualsevol substitució de valor establerta per un "
"[Area3D] on es trobi el cos. Depenent de [member angular_damp_mode], podeu "
"configurar [member angular_damp] perquè s'afegeixi o substitueixi el valor "
"d'amortiment del cos.\n"
"Vegeu [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_angular_damp] per obtenir "
"més detalls sobre l'amortiment."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid "Defines how [member angular_damp] is applied."
msgstr "Defineix com s'aplica [member angular_damp]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "The PhysicalBone3D's rotational velocity in [i]radians[/i] per second."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat de rotació del PhysicalBone3D en [i]radians[/i] per segon."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "Sets the body's transform."
msgstr "Estableix la transformació del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's bounciness. Values range from [code]0[/code] (no bounce) to "
"[code]1[/code] (full bounciness).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even with [member bounce] set to [code]1.0[/code], some energy "
"will be lost over time due to linear and angular damping. To have a "
"[PhysicalBone3D] that preserves all its energy over time, set [member "
"bounce] to [code]1.0[/code], [member linear_damp_mode] to [constant "
"DAMP_MODE_REPLACE], [member linear_damp] to [code]0.0[/code], [member "
"angular_damp_mode] to [constant DAMP_MODE_REPLACE], and [member "
"angular_damp] to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body is deactivated when there is no movement, so "
"it will not take part in the simulation until it is awakened by an external "
"force."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el cos es desactiva quan no hi ha moviment, de manera "
"que no participarà en la simulació fins que no sigui despertat per una força "
"externa."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the standard force integration (like gravity or "
"damping) will be disabled for this body. Other than collision response, the "
"body will only move as determined by the [method _integrate_forces] method, "
"if that virtual method is overridden.\n"
"Setting this property will call the method [method "
"PhysicsServer3D.body_set_omit_force_integration] internally."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la integració de força estàndard (com la gravetat o "
"l'amortiment) es desactivarà per a aquest cos. A part de la resposta de "
"col·lisió, el cos només es mourà tal com ho determina el mètode [method "
"_integrate_forces], si aquest mètode virtual s'invalida.\n"
"L'establiment d'aquesta propietat cridarà internament al mètode [method "
"PhysicsServer3D.body_set_omit_force_integration]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's friction, from [code]0[/code] (frictionless) to [code]1[/code] "
"(max friction)."
msgstr ""
"La fricció del cos, des de [code]0[/code] (sense fricció) fins a [code]1[/"
"code] (fricció màxima)."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"This is multiplied by [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_gravity] to "
"produce this body's gravity. For example, a value of [code]1.0[/code] will "
"apply normal gravity, [code]2.0[/code] will apply double the gravity, and "
"[code]0.5[/code] will apply half the gravity to this body."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "Sets the joint's transform."
msgstr "Estableix la transformació de l'articulació."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "Sets the joint's rotation in radians."
msgstr "Estableix la rotació de l'articulació en radians."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "Sets the joint type."
msgstr "Estableix el tipus d'articulació."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid ""
"Damps the body's movement. By default, the body will use [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] or any value override set by "
"an [Area3D] the body is in. Depending on [member linear_damp_mode], [member "
"linear_damp] may be added to or replace the body's damping value.\n"
"See [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] for more details "
"about damping."
msgstr ""
"Amortiga el moviment del cos. Per defecte, el cos utilitzarà [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] o qualsevol substitució de "
"valor establerta per un [Area3D] on es trobi el cos. Depenent de [member "
"linear_damp_mode], [member linear_damp] es pot afegir o substituir el valor "
"d'amortiment del cos.\n"
"Vegeu [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] per obtenir "
"més detalls sobre l'amortiment."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid "Defines how [member linear_damp] is applied."
msgstr "Defineix com s'aplica [member linear_damp]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's linear velocity in units per second. Can be used sporadically, "
"but [b]don't set this every frame[/b], because physics may run in another "
"thread and runs at a different granularity. Use [method _integrate_forces] "
"as your process loop for precise control of the body state."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat lineal del cos en unitats per segon. Es pot utilitzar "
"esporàdicament, però [b]no ho configureu cada fotograma[/b], perquè la "
"física pot funcionar en un altre fil i s'executa amb una granularitat "
"diferent. Utilitzeu [method _integrate_forces] com a bucle de procés per a "
"un control precís de l'estat del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid "The body's mass."
msgstr "La massa del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"In this mode, the body's damping value is added to any value set in areas or "
"the default value."
msgstr ""
"En aquest mode, el valor d'amortiment del cos s'afegeix a qualsevol valor "
"establert en àrees o al valor predeterminat."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"In this mode, the body's damping value replaces any value set in areas or "
"the default value."
msgstr ""
"En aquest mode, el valor d'amortiment del cos substitueix qualsevol valor "
"establert en àrees o el valor predeterminat."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "No joint is applied to the PhysicsBone3D."
msgstr "No s'aplica cap articulació al PhysicsBone3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "A pin joint is applied to the PhysicsBone3D."
msgstr "S'aplica una articulació de pin al PhysicsBone3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "A cone joint is applied to the PhysicsBone3D."
msgstr "S'aplica una articulació de con al PhysicsBone3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "A hinge joint is applied to the PhysicsBone3D."
msgstr "S'aplica una articulació de frontissa al PhysicsBone3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "A slider joint is applied to the PhysicsBone3D."
msgstr "S'aplica una articulació lliscant al PhysicsBone3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBone3D.xml
msgid "A 6 degrees of freedom joint is applied to the PhysicsBone3D."
msgstr "S'aplica una articulació de 6 graus de llibertat al PhysicsBone3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Node that can be the parent of [PhysicalBone3D] and can apply the simulation "
"results to [Skeleton3D]."
msgstr ""
"Node que pot ser el pare de [PhysicalBone3D] i pot aplicar els resultats de "
"la simulació a [Skeleton3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] is "
"running and simulating."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un booleà que indica si [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] s'està executant i "
"simulant."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.xml doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception to the physical bone.\n"
"Works just like the [RigidBody3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una excepció de col·lisió a l'os físic.\n"
"Funciona igual que el node [RigidBody3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.xml doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception to the physical bone.\n"
"Works just like the [RigidBody3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Elimina una excepció de col·lisió a l'os físic.\n"
"Funciona igual que el node [RigidBody3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.xml doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the [PhysicalBone3D] nodes in the Skeleton to start simulating and "
"reacting to the physics world.\n"
"Optionally, a list of bone names can be passed-in, allowing only the passed-"
"in bones to be simulated."
msgstr ""
"Diu als nodes [PhysicalBone3D] de l'esquelet que comencin a simular i "
"reaccionar al món de la física.\n"
"Opcionalment, es pot passar una llista de noms d'ossos, permetent només "
"simular els ossos passats."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.xml doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Tells the [PhysicalBone3D] nodes in the Skeleton to stop simulating."
msgstr "Indica als nodes [PhysicalBone3D] de l'esquelet que deixin de simular."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A material that defines a sky for a [Sky] resource by a set of physical "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Un material que defineix un cel per a un recurs [Sky] mitjançant un conjunt "
"de propietats físiques."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The [PhysicalSkyMaterial] uses the Preetham analytic daylight model to draw "
"a sky based on physical properties. This results in a substantially more "
"realistic sky than the [ProceduralSkyMaterial], but it is slightly slower "
"and less flexible.\n"
"The [PhysicalSkyMaterial] only supports one sun. The color, energy, and "
"direction of the sun are taken from the first [DirectionalLight3D] in the "
"scene tree."
msgstr ""
"El [PhysicalSkyMaterial] utilitza el model analític de llum diürna de "
"Preetham per dibuixar un cel basat en propietats físiques. Això resulta en "
"un cel substancialment més realista que el [ProceduralSkyMaterial], però és "
"una mica més lent i menys flexible.\n"
"El [PhysicalSkyMaterial] només admet un sol. El color, l'energia i la "
"direcció del sol es prenen del primer [DirectionalLight3D] de l'arbre de "
"l'escena."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Modulates the [Color] on the bottom half of the sky to represent the ground."
msgstr "Modula el [Color] a la meitat inferior del cel per representar el sòl."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the strength of [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Mie_scattering]Mie scattering[/url] for the sky. Mie scattering results from "
"light colliding with larger particles (like water). On earth, Mie scattering "
"results in a whitish color around the sun and horizon."
msgstr ""
"Controla la força de [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mie_scattering]Mie "
"dispersió[/url] per al cel. La dispersió de Mie resulta de la col·lisió de "
"la llum amb partícules més grans (com l'aigua). A la terra, la dispersió de "
"Mie dóna com a resultat un color blanquinós al voltant del sol i l'horitzó."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the [Color] of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Mie_scattering]Mie scattering[/url] effect. While not physically accurate, "
"this allows for the creation of alien-looking planets."
msgstr ""
"Controla l'[Color] de l'efecte [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Mie_scattering]Mie dispersió[/url]. Tot i que no és físicament precís, això "
"permet la creació de planetes d'aspecte alienígena."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the direction of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Mie_scattering]Mie scattering[/url]. A value of [code]1[/code] means that "
"when light hits a particle it's passing through straight forward. A value of "
"[code]-1[/code] means that all light is scatter backwards."
msgstr ""
"Controla la direcció de la dispersió [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Mie_scattering]Mie[/url]. Un valor de [code]1[/code] significa que quan la "
"llum arriba a una partícula, la passa directament. Un valor de [code]-1[/"
"code] significa que tota la llum es dispersa cap enrere."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] for the night sky. This is added to the sky, so if it is bright "
"enough, it may be visible during the day."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] pel cel nocturn. Això s'afegeix al cel, de manera que si és prou "
"brillant, pot ser visible durant el dia."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the strength of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Rayleigh_scattering]Rayleigh scattering[/url]. Rayleigh scattering results "
"from light colliding with small particles. It is responsible for the blue "
"color of the sky."
msgstr ""
"Controla la força de la dispersió [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Rayleigh_scattering]Rayleigh[/url]. La dispersió de Rayleigh és el resultat "
"de la col·lisió de la llum amb partícules petites. És responsable del color "
"blau del cel."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the [Color] of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Rayleigh_scattering]Rayleigh scattering[/url]. While not physically "
"accurate, this allows for the creation of alien-looking planets. For "
"example, setting this to a red [Color] results in a Mars-looking atmosphere "
"with a corresponding blue sunset."
msgstr ""
"Controla la [Color] de la [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Rayleigh_scattering]Rayleigh dispersió[/url]. Tot i que no és físicament "
"precís, això permet la creació de planetes d'aspecte alienígena. Per "
"exemple, establir-ho a un [Color] vermell dóna com a resultat una atmosfera "
"d'aspecte de Mart amb una posta de sol blava corresponent."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the sun disk. Default value is based on Sol's perceived "
"size from Earth."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la mida del disc solar. El valor per defecte es basa en la mida "
"percebuda del Sol des de la Terra."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the thickness of the atmosphere. High turbidity creates a foggy-looking "
"atmosphere, while a low turbidity results in a clearer atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el gruix de l'atmosfera. Una terbolesa alta crea una atmosfera "
"d'aspecte boira, mentre que una terbolesa baixa produeix una atmosfera més "
"clara."

#: doc/classes/PhysicalSkyMaterial.xml doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables debanding. Debanding adds a small amount of "
"noise which helps reduce banding that appears from the smooth changes in "
"color in the sky."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], activa la desbandada. La eliminació de bandes afegeix "
"una petita quantitat de soroll que ajuda a reduir les bandes que apareixen a "
"causa dels suaus canvis de color al cel."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for 2D game objects affected by physics."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a objectes de joc 2D afectats per la física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"[PhysicsBody2D] is an abstract base class for 2D game objects affected by "
"physics. All 2D physics bodies inherit from it."
msgstr ""
"[PhysicsBody2D] és una classe base abstracta per a objectes de joc 2D "
"afectats per la física. Tots els cossos físics 2D en hereten."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid "Adds a body to the list of bodies that this body can't collide with."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un cos a la llista de cossos amb els quals aquest cos no pot xocar."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of nodes that were added as collision exceptions for this "
"body."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de nodes que s'han afegit com a excepcions de col·lisió "
"per a aquest cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the gravity vector computed from all sources that can affect the "
"body, including all gravity overrides from [Area2D] nodes and the global "
"world gravity."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el vector de gravetat calculat a partir de totes les fonts que poden "
"afectar el cos, incloses totes les substitucions de gravetat dels nodes "
"[Area2D] i la gravetat mundial global."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the body along the vector [param motion]. In order to be frame rate "
"independent in [method Node._physics_process] or [method Node._process], "
"[param motion] should be computed using [code]delta[/code].\n"
"Returns a [KinematicCollision2D], which contains information about the "
"collision when stopped, or when touching another body along the motion.\n"
"If [param test_only] is [code]true[/code], the body does not move but the "
"would-be collision information is given.\n"
"[param safe_margin] is the extra margin used for collision recovery (see "
"[member CharacterBody2D.safe_margin] for more details).\n"
"If [param recovery_as_collision] is [code]true[/code], any depenetration "
"from the recovery phase is also reported as a collision; this is used e.g. "
"by [CharacterBody2D] for improving floor detection during floor snapping."
msgstr ""
"Mou el cos al llarg del vector [param motion]. Per tal de ser independent de "
"la velocitat de fotogrames a [method Node._physics_process] o [method "
"Node._process], [param motion] s'ha de calcular mitjançant [code]delta[/"
"code].\n"
"Retorna un [KinematicCollision2D], que conté informació sobre la col·lisió "
"quan està aturat o quan es toca un altre cos al llarg del moviment.\n"
"Si [param test_only] és [code]true[/code], el cos no es mou, però es dóna la "
"informació de la possible col·lisió.\n"
"[param safe_margin] és el marge addicional utilitzat per a la recuperació de "
"col·lisions (vegeu [member CharacterBody2D.safe_margin] per a més detalls).\n"
"Si [param recovery_as_collision] és [code]true[/code], qualsevol "
"despenetració de la fase de recuperació també s'informa com a col·lisió; "
"això s'utilitza per ex. de [CharacterBody2D] per millorar la detecció del "
"sòl durant el trencament del sòl."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a body from the list of bodies that this body can't collide with."
msgstr ""
"Elimina un cos de la llista de cossos amb els quals aquest cos no pot xocar."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"Checks for collisions without moving the body. In order to be frame rate "
"independent in [method Node._physics_process] or [method Node._process], "
"[param motion] should be computed using [code]delta[/code].\n"
"Virtually sets the node's position, scale and rotation to that of the given "
"[Transform2D], then tries to move the body along the vector [param motion]. "
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a collision would stop the body from moving "
"along the whole path.\n"
"[param collision] is an optional object of type [KinematicCollision2D], "
"which contains additional information about the collision when stopped, or "
"when touching another body along the motion.\n"
"[param safe_margin] is the extra margin used for collision recovery (see "
"[member CharacterBody2D.safe_margin] for more details).\n"
"If [param recovery_as_collision] is [code]true[/code], any depenetration "
"from the recovery phase is also reported as a collision; this is useful for "
"checking whether the body would [i]touch[/i] any other bodies."
msgstr ""
"Comprova si hi ha xocs sense moure el cos. Per tal de ser independent de la "
"velocitat de fotogrames a [method Node._physics_process] o [method "
"Node._process], [param motion] s'ha de calcular mitjançant [code]delta[/"
"code].\n"
"Estableix virtualment la posició, l'escala i la rotació del node a la del "
"[Transform2D] donat, i després intenta moure el cos al llarg del vector "
"[param motion]. Retorna [code]true[/code] si una col·lisió impedeix que el "
"cos es mogui al llarg de tot el camí.\n"
"[param collision] és un objecte opcional del tipus [KinematicCollision2D], "
"que conté informació addicional sobre la col·lisió quan està aturat o quan "
"es toca un altre cos al llarg del moviment.\n"
"[param safe_margin] és el marge addicional utilitzat per a la recuperació de "
"col·lisions (vegeu [member CharacterBody2D.safe_margin] per a més detalls).\n"
"Si [param recovery_as_collision] és [code]true[/code], qualsevol "
"despenetració de la fase de recuperació també s'informa com a col·lisió; "
"això és útil per comprovar si el cos faria [i]touch[/i] qualsevol altre cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for 3D game objects affected by physics."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a objectes de joc 3D afectats per la física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"[PhysicsBody3D] is an abstract base class for 3D game objects affected by "
"physics. All 3D physics bodies inherit from it.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] With a non-uniform scale, this node will likely not behave "
"as expected. It is advised to keep its scale the same on all axes and adjust "
"its collision shape(s) instead."
msgstr ""
"[PhysicsBody3D] és una classe base abstracta per a objectes de jocs en 3D "
"afectats per la física. Tots els cossos de la física 3D en hereten.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Amb una escala no uniforme, aquest node probablement no es "
"comportarà com s'esperava. Es recomana mantenir la mateixa escala en tots "
"els eixos i ajustar-ne la forma de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified linear or rotational [param axis] "
"is locked."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el [param axis] lineal o rotatiu especificat "
"està bloquejat."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the gravity vector computed from all sources that can affect the "
"body, including all gravity overrides from [Area3D] nodes and the global "
"world gravity."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el vector de gravetat calculat a partir de totes les fonts que poden "
"afectar el cos, incloses totes les substitucions de gravetat dels nodes "
"[Area3D] i la gravetat mundial global."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the body along the vector [param motion]. In order to be frame rate "
"independent in [method Node._physics_process] or [method Node._process], "
"[param motion] should be computed using [code]delta[/code].\n"
"The body will stop if it collides. Returns a [KinematicCollision3D], which "
"contains information about the collision when stopped, or when touching "
"another body along the motion.\n"
"If [param test_only] is [code]true[/code], the body does not move but the "
"would-be collision information is given.\n"
"[param safe_margin] is the extra margin used for collision recovery (see "
"[member CharacterBody3D.safe_margin] for more details).\n"
"If [param recovery_as_collision] is [code]true[/code], any depenetration "
"from the recovery phase is also reported as a collision; this is used e.g. "
"by [CharacterBody3D] for improving floor detection during floor snapping.\n"
"[param max_collisions] allows to retrieve more than one collision result."
msgstr ""
"Mou el cos al llarg del vector [param motion]. Per tal de ser independent de "
"la velocitat de fotogrames a [method Node._physics_process] o [method "
"Node._process], [param motion] s'ha de calcular mitjançant [code]delta[/"
"code].\n"
"El cos s'aturarà si xoca. Retorna un [KinematicCollision3D], que conté "
"informació sobre la col·lisió quan està aturat o quan es toca un altre cos "
"al llarg del moviment.\n"
"Si [param test_only] és [code]true[/code], el cos no es mou, però es dóna la "
"informació de la possible col·lisió.\n"
"[param safe_margin] és el marge addicional utilitzat per a la recuperació de "
"col·lisions (vegeu [member CharacterBody3D.safe_margin] per a més detalls).\n"
"Si [param recovery_as_collision] és [code]true[/code], qualsevol "
"despenetració de la fase de recuperació també s'informa com a col·lisió; "
"això s'utilitza per ex. de [CharacterBody3D] per millorar la detecció del "
"sòl durant el trencament del sòl.\n"
"[param max_collisions] permet recuperar més d'un resultat de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Locks or unlocks the specified linear or rotational [param axis] depending "
"on the value of [param lock]."
msgstr ""
"Bloqueja o desbloqueja el [param axis] lineal o rotacional especificat en "
"funció del valor de [param lock]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Checks for collisions without moving the body. In order to be frame rate "
"independent in [method Node._physics_process] or [method Node._process], "
"[param motion] should be computed using [code]delta[/code].\n"
"Virtually sets the node's position, scale and rotation to that of the given "
"[Transform3D], then tries to move the body along the vector [param motion]. "
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a collision would stop the body from moving "
"along the whole path.\n"
"[param collision] is an optional object of type [KinematicCollision3D], "
"which contains additional information about the collision when stopped, or "
"when touching another body along the motion.\n"
"[param safe_margin] is the extra margin used for collision recovery (see "
"[member CharacterBody3D.safe_margin] for more details).\n"
"If [param recovery_as_collision] is [code]true[/code], any depenetration "
"from the recovery phase is also reported as a collision; this is useful for "
"checking whether the body would [i]touch[/i] any other bodies.\n"
"[param max_collisions] allows to retrieve more than one collision result."
msgstr ""
"Comprova si hi ha xocs sense moure el cos. Per tal de ser independent de la "
"velocitat de fotogrames a [method Node._physics_process] o [method "
"Node._process], [param motion] s'ha de calcular mitjançant [code]delta[/"
"code].\n"
"Estableix virtualment la posició, l'escala i la rotació del node a la del "
"[Transform3D] donat, i després intenta moure el cos al llarg del vector "
"[param motion]. Retorna [code]true[/code] si una col·lisió impedeix que el "
"cos es mogui al llarg de tot el camí.\n"
"[param collision] és un objecte opcional del tipus [KinematicCollision3D], "
"que conté informació addicional sobre la col·lisió quan està aturat o quan "
"es toca un altre cos al llarg del moviment.\n"
"[param safe_margin] és el marge addicional utilitzat per a la recuperació de "
"col·lisions (vegeu [member CharacterBody3D.safe_margin] per a més detalls).\n"
"Si [param recovery_as_collision] és [code]true[/code], qualsevol "
"despenetració de la fase de recuperació també s'informa com a col·lisió; "
"això és útil per comprovar si el cos faria [i]touch[/i] qualsevol altre "
"cos.\n"
"[param max_collisions] permet recuperar més d'un resultat de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid "Lock the body's rotation in the X axis."
msgstr "Bloqueja la rotació del cos en l'eix X."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid "Lock the body's rotation in the Y axis."
msgstr "Bloqueja la rotació del cos a l'eix Y."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid "Lock the body's rotation in the Z axis."
msgstr "Bloqueja la rotació del cos a l'eix Z."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid "Lock the body's linear movement in the X axis."
msgstr "Bloqueja el moviment lineal del cos en l'eix X."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid "Lock the body's linear movement in the Y axis."
msgstr "Bloqueja el moviment lineal del cos en l'eix Y."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsBody3D.xml
msgid "Lock the body's linear movement in the Z axis."
msgstr "Bloqueja el moviment lineal del cos a l'eix Z."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid "Provides direct access to a physics body in the [PhysicsServer2D]."
msgstr "Proporciona accés directe a un cos de física a [PhysicsServer2D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid ""
"Provides direct access to a physics body in the [PhysicsServer2D], allowing "
"safe changes to physics properties. This object is passed via the direct "
"state callback of [RigidBody2D], and is intended for changing the direct "
"state of that body. See [method RigidBody2D._integrate_forces]."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona accés directe a un cos físic a [PhysicsServer2D], permetent "
"canvis segurs a les propietats físiques. Aquest objecte es passa a través de "
"la devolució de trucada d'estat directe de [RigidBody2D] i està pensat per "
"canviar l'estat directe d'aquest cos. Veure [method "
"RigidBody2D._integrate_forces]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.xml doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml doc/classes/World2D.xml doc/classes/World3D.xml
msgid "Ray-casting"
msgstr "Projecció de raigs"

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a constant directional force without affecting rotation that keeps "
"being applied over time until cleared with [code]constant_force = Vector2(0, "
"0)[/code].\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method add_constant_force] at the body's center "
"of mass."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una força direccional constant sense afectar la rotació que s'aplica "
"al llarg del temps fins que s'esborra amb [code]constant_force = Vector2(0, "
"0)[/code].\n"
"Això equival a utilitzar [method add_constant_force] al centre de massa del "
"cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a constant positioned force to the body that keeps being applied over "
"time until cleared with [code]constant_force = Vector2(0, 0)[/code].\n"
"[param position] is the offset from the body origin in global coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una força posicionada constant al cos que s'aplica al llarg del "
"temps fins que s'esborra amb [code]constant_force = Vector2(0, 0)[/code].\n"
"[param position] és el desplaçament de l'origen del cos en coordenades "
"globals."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a constant rotational force without affecting position that keeps being "
"applied over time until cleared with [code]constant_torque = 0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una força de rotació constant sense afectar la posició que s'aplica "
"al llarg del temps fins que s'esborra amb [code]constant_torque = 0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a directional force without affecting rotation. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update.\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method apply_force] at the body's center of "
"mass."
msgstr ""
"Aplica una força direccional sense afectar la rotació. Una força depèn del "
"temps i s'ha d'aplicar a cada actualització de la física.\n"
"Això equival a utilitzar [method apply_force] al centre de massa del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a directional impulse without affecting rotation.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise).\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method apply_impulse] at the body's center of "
"mass."
msgstr ""
"Aplica un impuls direccional sense afectar la rotació.\n"
"Un impuls és independent del temps! Aplicar un impuls a cada fotograma "
"resultaria en una força depenent de la velocitat de fotogrames. Per aquest "
"motiu, només s'ha d'utilitzar quan es simula impactes puntuals (en cas "
"contrari, utilitzeu les funcions \"_force\").\n"
"Això equival a utilitzar [method apply_impulse] al centre de massa del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a positioned force to the body. A force is time dependent and meant "
"to be applied every physics update.\n"
"[param position] is the offset from the body origin in global coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Aplica una força posicionada al cos. Una força depèn del temps i s'ha "
"d'aplicar a cada actualització de la física.\n"
"[param position] és el desplaçament de l'origen del cos en coordenades "
"globals."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a positioned impulse to the body.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise).\n"
"[param position] is the offset from the body origin in global coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Aplica un impuls posicionat al cos.\n"
"Un impuls és independent del temps! Aplicar un impuls a cada fotograma "
"resultaria en una força depenent de la velocitat de fotogrames. Per aquest "
"motiu, només s'ha d'utilitzar quan es simula impactes puntuals (en cas "
"contrari, utilitzeu les funcions \"_force\").\n"
"[param position] és el desplaçament de l'origen del cos en coordenades "
"globals."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a rotational force without affecting position. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member inverse_inertia] is required for this to work. To have "
"[member inverse_inertia], an active [CollisionShape2D] must be a child of "
"the node, or you can manually set [member inverse_inertia]."
msgstr ""
"Aplica una força de rotació sense afectar la posició. Una força depèn del "
"temps i s'ha d'aplicar a cada actualització de la física.\n"
"[b]Nota: [/b] [member inverse_inertia] és necessari perquè això funcioni. "
"Per tenir [member inverse_inertia], un [CollisionShape2D] actiu ha de ser un "
"fill del node, o podeu configurar manualment [member inverse_inertia]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a rotational impulse to the body without affecting the position.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member inverse_inertia] is required for this to work. To have "
"[member inverse_inertia], an active [CollisionShape2D] must be a child of "
"the node, or you can manually set [member inverse_inertia]."
msgstr ""
"Aplica un impuls de rotació al cos sense afectar la posició.\n"
"Un impuls és independent del temps! Aplicar un impuls a cada fotograma "
"resultaria en una força depenent de la velocitat de fotogrames. Per aquest "
"motiu, només s'ha d'utilitzar quan es simula impactes puntuals (en cas "
"contrari, utilitzeu les funcions \"_force\").\n"
"[b]Nota: [/b] [member inverse_inertia] és necessari perquè això funcioni. "
"Per tenir [member inverse_inertia], un [CollisionShape2D] actiu ha de ser un "
"fill del node, o podeu configurar manualment [member inverse_inertia]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the body's total constant positional forces applied during each "
"physics update.\n"
"See [method add_constant_force] and [method add_constant_central_force]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna les forces posicionals constants totals del cos aplicades durant "
"cada actualització de la física.\n"
"Vegeu [method add_constant_force] i [method add_constant_central_force]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the body's total constant rotational forces applied during each "
"physics update.\n"
"See [method add_constant_torque]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna les forces de rotació constants totals del cos aplicades durant cada "
"actualització de la física.\n"
"Veure [method add_constant_torque]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "Returns the collider's [RID]."
msgstr "Retorna [RID] del col·lisionador."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "Returns the collider's object id."
msgstr "Retorna l'identificador de l'objecte del col·lisionador."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collider object. This depends on how it was created (will return "
"a scene node if such was used to create it)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'objecte col·lisionador. Això depèn de com s'ha creat (retornarà un "
"node d'escena si s'ha utilitzat per crear-lo)."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the contact point on the collider in the global "
"coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del punt de contacte al col·lisionador al sistema de "
"coordenades global."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "Returns the collider's shape index."
msgstr "Retorna l'índex de forma del col·lisionador."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid "Returns the velocity vector at the collider's contact point."
msgstr "Retorna el vector velocitat al punt de contacte del col·lisionador."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of contacts this body has with other bodies.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, this returns 0 unless bodies are configured to "
"monitor contacts. See [member RigidBody2D.contact_monitor]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de contactes que aquest cos té amb altres cossos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per defecte, retorna 0 tret que els cossos estiguin configurats "
"per supervisar els contactes. Veure [member RigidBody2D.contact_monitor]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid "Returns the impulse created by the contact."
msgstr "Retorna l'impuls creat pel contacte."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "Returns the local normal at the contact point."
msgstr "Retorna la normalitat local al punt de contacte."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the contact point on the body in the global "
"coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del punt de contacte al cos al sistema de coordenades "
"global."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "Returns the local shape index of the collision."
msgstr "Retorna l'índex de forma local de la col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid "Returns the velocity vector at the body's contact point."
msgstr "Retorna el vector velocitat al punt de contacte del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "Returns the current state of the space, useful for queries."
msgstr "Retorna l'estat actual de l'espai, útil per a consultes."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the body's velocity at the given relative position.\n"
"[param local_position] is the offset from the body origin in global "
"coordinates."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the body's linear and angular velocity by applying gravity and "
"damping for the equivalent of one physics tick."
msgstr ""
"Actualitza la velocitat lineal i angular del cos aplicant gravetat i "
"amortiment per a l'equivalent a una garrapata física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the body's total constant positional forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method add_constant_force] and [method add_constant_central_force]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les forces posicionals constants totals del cos aplicades durant "
"cada actualització de la física.\n"
"Vegeu [method add_constant_force] i [method add_constant_central_force]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the body's total constant rotational forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method add_constant_torque]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les forces de rotació constants totals del cos aplicades durant "
"cada actualització de la física.\n"
"Veure [method add_constant_torque]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody2D.xml
msgid "The body's rotational velocity in [i]radians[/i] per second."
msgstr "Velocitat de rotació del cos en [i]radians[/i] per segon."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's center of mass position relative to the body's center in the "
"global coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Posició del centre de massa del cos en relació amb el centre del cos en el "
"sistema de coordenades global."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's center of mass position in the body's local coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Posició del centre de massa del cos al sistema de coordenades locals del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "The body's collision layer."
msgstr "Capa de col·lisió del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "The body's collision mask."
msgstr "La màscara de col·lisió del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "The inverse of the inertia of the body."
msgstr "La inversa de la inèrcia del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "The inverse of the mass of the body."
msgstr "La inversa de la massa del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
msgid "The body's linear velocity in pixels per second."
msgstr "Velocitat lineal del cos en píxels per segon."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], this body is currently sleeping (not active)."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], aquest cos està dormint (no actiu)."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "The timestep (delta) used for the simulation."
msgstr "El pas de temps (delta) utilitzat per a la simulació."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"The rate at which the body stops rotating, if there are not any other forces "
"moving it."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat a la qual el cos deixa de girar, si no hi ha cap altra força "
"que el mogui."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "The total gravity vector being currently applied to this body."
msgstr ""
"El vector de gravetat total que s'està aplicant actualment a aquest cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid ""
"The rate at which the body stops moving, if there are not any other forces "
"moving it."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat a la qual el cos deixa de moure's, si no hi ha cap altra força "
"que el mogui."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState3D.xml
msgid "The body's transformation matrix."
msgstr "Matriu de transformació del cos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2DExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Provides virtual methods that can be overridden to create custom "
"[PhysicsDirectBodyState2D] implementations."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona mètodes virtuals que es poden substituir per crear "
"implementacions personalitzades [PhysicsDirectBodyState2D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsDirectBodyState2DExtension.xml
msgid ""
"This class extends [PhysicsDirectBodyState2D] by providing additional "
"virtual methods that can be overridden. When these methods are overridden, "
"they will be called instead of the internal methods of the physics server.\n"
"Intended for use with GDExtension to create custom implementations of "
"[PhysicsDirectBodyState2D]."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe amplia [PhysicsDirectBodyState2D] proporcionant mètodes "
"virtuals addicionals que es poden substituir. Quan es substitueixen aquests "
"mètodes, es cridaran en lloc dels mètodes interns del servidor de física.\n"
"Dissenyat per utilitzar-lo amb GDExtension per crear implementacions "
"personalitzades de [PhysicsDirectBodyState2D]."

