"Un valor igual o superior a la taxa de graduació de la física ([member "
"physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) aturarà l'objecte en una "
"iteració.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els càlculs d'amortiment de Godot depenen de la velocitat, el "
"que significa que els cossos que es mouen més ràpid trigaran més temps a "
"reposar. No simulen la inèrcia, la fricció o la resistència de l'aire. Per "
"tant, els cossos més pesats o més grans perdran velocitat al mateix ritme "
"proporcional que els cossos més lleugers o més petits.\n"
"Durant cada marca de física, Godot multiplicarà la velocitat angular de "
"RigidBodies per [code]@1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/"
"code]. Per defecte, els cossos combinen factors d'humitat: "
"[code]combined_damp[/code] és la suma del valor d'humitat del cos i aquest "
"valor o el valor de l'àrea on es troba el cos. Vegeu [enum "
"RigidBody3D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Els càlculs d'amortiment de Godot depenen de la velocitat de "
"simulació. Canviar [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] pot "
"canviar significativament els resultats i la sensació de la vostra "
"simulació. Això és cert per a tot el rang de valors d'amortiment superiors a "
"0. Per tornar a una sensació similar, també heu de canviar els valors "
"d'humitat. Aquest canvi necessari no és proporcional i difereix d'un cas a "
"un altre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default gravity strength in 3D (in meters per second squared).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default gravity at runtime, use the following code sample:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Set the default gravity strength to 9.8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY, 9.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity strength to 9.8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.Gravity, 9.8);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"La força de gravetat predeterminada en 3D (en metres per segon al quadrat).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar la gravetat predeterminada en temps d'execució, utilitzeu "
"l'exemple de codi següent:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Estableix la força de gravetat predeterminada a 9,8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY, 9.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Estableix la força de gravetat per defecte a 9.8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.Gravity, 9.8);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default gravity direction in 3D.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default gravity vector at runtime, use the following code sample:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Set the default gravity direction to `Vector3(0, -1, 0)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY_VECTOR, Vector3.DOWN)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity direction to `Vector3(0, -1, 0)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.GravityVector, Vector3.Down)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"La direcció de gravetat predeterminada en 3D.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar el vector de gravetat predeterminat en temps d'execució, "
"utilitzeu la mostra de codi següent:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Estableix la direcció de gravetat per defecte a \"Vector3(0, -1, 0)\".\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY_VECTOR, Vector3.DOWN)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Estableix la direcció de gravetat per defecte a \"Vector3(0, -1, 0)\".\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.GravityVector, Vector3.Down)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default linear motion damping in 3D. Damping is used to gradually slow "
"down physical objects over time. RigidBodies will fall back to this value "
"when combining their own damping values and no area damping value is "
"present.\n"
"Suggested values are in the range [code]0[/code] to [code]30[/code]. At "
"value [code]0[/code] objects will keep moving with the same velocity. "
"Greater values will stop the object faster. A value equal to or greater than "
"the physics tick rate ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) "
"will bring the object to a stop in one iteration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot damping calculations are velocity-dependent, meaning "
"bodies moving faster will take a longer time to come to rest. They do not "
"simulate inertia, friction, or air resistance. Therefore heavier or larger "
"bodies will lose speed at the same proportional rate as lighter or smaller "
"bodies.\n"
"During each physics tick, Godot will multiply the linear velocity of "
"RigidBodies by [code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code]. "
"By default, bodies combine damp factors: [code]combined_damp[/code] is the "
"sum of the damp value of the body and this value or the area's value the "
"body is in. See [enum RigidBody3D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Godot's damping calculations are simulation tick rate "
"dependent. Changing [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] may "
"significantly change the outcomes and feel of your simulation. This is true "
"for the entire range of damping values greater than 0. To get back to a "
"similar feel, you also need to change your damp values. This needed change "
"is not proportional and differs from case to case."
msgstr ""
"L'amortiment de moviment lineal predeterminat en 3D. L'amortiment s'utilitza "
"per frenar gradualment els objectes físics al llarg del temps. RigidBodies "
"baixarà a aquest valor en combinar els seus propis valors d'amortiment i no "
"hi ha cap valor d'amortiment d'àrea.\n"
"Els valors suggerits es troben en l'interval [code]0[/code] a [code]30[/"
"code]. Amb el valor [code]0[/code] els objectes seguiran movent-se amb la "
"mateixa velocitat. Els valors més grans aturaran l'objecte més ràpidament. "
"Un valor igual o superior a la taxa de graduació de la física ([member "
"physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) aturarà l'objecte en una "
"iteració.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els càlculs d'amortiment de Godot depenen de la velocitat, el "
"que significa que els cossos que es mouen més ràpid trigaran més temps a "
"reposar. No simulen la inèrcia, la fricció o la resistència de l'aire. Per "
"tant, els cossos més pesats o més grans perdran velocitat al mateix ritme "
"proporcional que els cossos més lleugers o més petits.\n"
"Durant cada marca de física, Godot multiplicarà la velocitat lineal de "
"RigidBodies per [code]@1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/"
"code]. Per defecte, els cossos combinen factors d'humitat: "
"[code]combined_damp[/code] és la suma del valor d'humitat del cos i aquest "
"valor o el valor de l'àrea on es troba el cos. Vegeu [enum "
"RigidBody3D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Els càlculs d'amortiment de Godot depenen de la velocitat de "
"simulació. Canviar [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] pot "
"canviar significativament els resultats i la sensació de la vostra "
"simulació. Això és cert per a tot el rang de valors d'amortiment superiors a "
"0. Per tornar a una sensació similar, també heu de canviar els valors "
"d'humitat. Aquest canvi necessari no és proporcional i difereix d'un cas a "
"un altre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets which physics engine to use for 3D physics.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] is currently equivalent to [b]GodotPhysics3D[/b], but may "
"change in future releases. Select an explicit implementation if you want to "
"ensure that your project stays on the same engine.\n"
"[b]GodotPhysics3D[/b] is Godot's internal 3D physics engine.\n"
"[b]Jolt Physics[/b] is an alternative physics engine that is generally "
"faster and more reliable than [b]GodotPhysics3D[/b]. Jolt Physics is the "
"default for projects created starting in Godot 4.6.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] is a 3D physics server that does nothing and returns only dummy "
"values, effectively disabling all 3D physics functionality.\n"
"Third-party extensions and modules can add other physics engines to select "
"with this setting."
msgstr ""
"Defineix quin motor físic s'utilitza per a la física 3D.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] és actualment equivalent a [b]GodotPhysics3D[/b], però pot "
"canviar en versions futures. Seleccioneu una implementació explícita si "
"voleu assegurar-vos que el vostre projecte es mantingui al mateix motor.\n"
"[b]GodotPhysics3D[/b] és el motor de física 3D intern de Godot.\n"
"[b]Jolt Physics[/b] és un motor de física alternatiu que en general és més "
"ràpid i més fiable que [b]GodotPhysics3D[/b]. Jolt Physics és l'opció "
"predeterminada per als projectes creats a partir de Godot 4.6.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] és un servidor de física 3D que no fa res i només retorna "
"valors ficticis, desactivant efectivament tota la funcionalitat de la física "
"3D.\n"
"Les extensions i els mòduls de tercers poden afegir altres motors físics per "
"seleccionar amb aquesta configuració."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The approach used for 3D scene traversal when physics interpolation is "
"enabled.\n"
"- [code]DEFAULT[/code]: The default optimized method.\n"
"- [code]Legacy[/code]: The previous reference method used for scene tree "
"traversal, which is slower.\n"
"- [code]Debug[/code]: Swaps between [code]DEFAULT[/code] and [code]Legacy[/"
"code] methods on alternating frames, and provides logging information (which "
"in turn makes it slower). Intended for debugging only; you should use the "
"[code]DEFAULT[/code] method in most cases."
msgstr ""
"L'enfocament utilitzat per al recorregut d'escenes en 3D quan la "
"interpolació física està habilitada.\n"
"- [code]DEFAULT[/code]: el mètode optimitzat per defecte.\n"
"- [code]Legacy[/code]: el mètode de referència anterior utilitzat per al "
"recorregut de l'arbre d'escenes, que és més lent.\n"
"- [code]Debug[/code]: Canvia entre [code]DEFAULT[/code] i [code]Legacy[/"
"code] els mètodes d'alternament de la informació fa que la informació sigui "
"més lenta (i proporciona més lentitud). Dissenyat només per a la depuració; "
"hauríeu d'utilitzar el mètode [code]DEFAULT[/code] en la majoria dels casos."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the 3D physics server runs on a separate thread, "
"making better use of multi-core CPUs. If [code]false[/code], the 3D physics "
"server runs on the main thread. Running the physics server on a separate "
"thread can increase performance, but restricts API access to only physics "
"process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member physics/3d/physics_engine] is set to [code]Jolt "
"Physics[/code], enabling this setting will prevent the 3D physics server "
"from being able to provide any context when reporting errors and warnings, "
"and will instead always refer to nodes as [code]<unknown>[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el servidor de física 3D s'executa en un fil separat, "
"fent un millor ús de les CPU de diversos nuclis. Si [code]false[/code], el "
"servidor de física 3D s'executa al fil principal. Executar el servidor de "
"física en un fil separat pot augmentar el rendiment, però restringeix "
"l'accés de l'API només al procés físic.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan [member physics/3d/physics_engine] s'estableix a "
"[code]Jolt Physics[/code], l'habilitació d'aquesta configuració evitarà que "
"el servidor de física 3D pugui fer referència a qualsevol error i context "
"quan es faci referència sempre a errors i guerra. [code]<unknown>[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Threshold angular velocity under which a 3D physics body will be considered "
"inactive. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_ANGULAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat angular llindar sota la qual un cos físic 3D es considerarà "
"inactiu. Veure [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_ANGULAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Threshold linear velocity under which a 3D physics body will be considered "
"inactive. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_LINEAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat lineal llindar sota la qual un cos físic 3D es considerarà "
"inactiu. Veure [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_LINEAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum distance a shape can penetrate another shape before it is considered "
"a collision. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_ALLOWED_PENETRATION].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Distància màxima que una forma pot penetrar en una altra forma abans que es "
"consideri una col·lisió. Veure [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_ALLOWED_PENETRATION].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum distance a shape can be from another before they are considered "
"separated and the contact is discarded. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_SEPARATION].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Distància màxima que pot estar una forma d'una altra abans que es considerin "
"separades i es descarti el contacte. Veure [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_SEPARATION].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum distance a pair of bodies has to move before their collision status "
"has to be recalculated. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_RECYCLE_RADIUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Distància màxima que ha de moure un parell de cossos abans que s'hagi de "
"recalcular el seu estat de col·lisió. Veure [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_RECYCLE_RADIUS].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default solver bias for all physics contacts. Defines how much bodies react "
"to enforce contact separation. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"Individual shapes can have a specific bias value (see [member "
"Shape3D.custom_solver_bias]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Biaix del solucionador per defecte per a tots els contactes de la física. "
"Defineix quant reaccionen els cossos per forçar la separació de contactes. "
"Veure [constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"Les formes individuals poden tenir un valor de biaix específic (vegeu "
"[member Shape3D.custom_solver_bias]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of solver iterations for all contacts and constraints. The greater "
"the number of iterations, the more accurate the collisions will be. However, "
"a greater number of iterations requires more CPU power, which can decrease "
"performance. See [constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_SOLVER_ITERATIONS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Nombre d'iteracions del solucionador per a tots els contactes i "
"restriccions. Com més gran sigui el nombre d'iteracions, més precises seran "
"les col·lisions. Tanmateix, un nombre més gran d'iteracions requereix més "
"potència de la CPU, cosa que pot reduir el rendiment. Veure [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_SOLVER_ITERATIONS].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Time (in seconds) of inactivity before which a 3D physics body will put to "
"sleep. See [constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_TIME_TO_SLEEP].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Temps (en segons) d'inactivitat abans del qual un cos de física 3D "
"s'adormirà. Veure [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_TIME_TO_SLEEP].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració del projecte només és efectiva quan "
"s'utilitza GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Enables [member Viewport.physics_object_picking] on the root viewport."
msgstr ""
"Activa [member Viewport.physics_object_picking] a la finestra de vista arrel."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the maximum number of physics steps that can be simulated each "
"rendered frame. The default value is tuned to avoid situations where the "
"framerate suddenly drops to a very low value beyond a certain amount of "
"physics simulation. This occurs because the physics engine can't keep up "
"with the expected simulation rate. In this case, the framerate will start "
"dropping, but the engine is only allowed to simulate a certain number of "
"physics steps per rendered frame. This snowballs into a situation where "
"framerate keeps dropping until it reaches a very low framerate (typically "
"1-2 FPS) and is called the [i]physics spiral of death[/i].\n"
"However, the game will appear to slow down if the rendering FPS is less than "
"[code]1 / max_physics_steps_per_frame[/code] of [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second]. This occurs even if [code]delta[/code] is "
"consistently used in physics calculations. To avoid this, increase [member "
"physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] if you have increased [member "
"physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] significantly above its default "
"value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the maximum number of simulated physics steps per frame at runtime, set "
"[member Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] instead."
msgstr ""
"Controla el nombre màxim de passos físics que es poden simular cada "
"fotograma renderitzat. El valor predeterminat s'ajusta per evitar situacions "
"en què la velocitat de fotogrames cau sobtadament a un valor molt baix més "
"enllà d'una certa quantitat de simulació física. Això passa perquè el motor "
"físic no pot mantenir el ritme de simulació esperat. En aquest cas, la "
"velocitat de fotogrames començarà a baixar, però el motor només pot simular "
"un nombre determinat de passos físics per fotograma representat. Això arriba "
"a una situació en què la velocitat de fotogrames continua baixant fins que "
"arriba a una velocitat de fotogrames molt baixa (normalment 1-2 FPS) i "
"s'anomena [i]espiral física de la mort[/i].\n"
"Tanmateix, sembla que el joc s'alenteix si el FPS de renderització és "
"inferior a [code]1 / max_physics_steps_per_frame[/code] de [member physics/"
"common/physics_ticks_per_second]. Això passa fins i tot si [code]delta[/"
"code] s'utilitza constantment en càlculs físics. Per evitar-ho, augmenteu "
"[member physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] si heu augmentat [member "
"physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] significativament per sobre del seu "
"valor predeterminat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar el nombre màxim de passos físics simulats per fotograma en temps "
"d'execució, configureu [member Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the renderer will interpolate the transforms of "
"objects (both physics and non-physics) between the last two transforms, so "
"that smooth motion is seen even when physics ticks do not coincide with "
"rendered frames. See also [method Node.reset_physics_interpolation].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Although this is a global setting, finer control of individual "
"branches of the [SceneTree] is possible using [member "
"Node.physics_interpolation_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle "
"physics interpolation at runtime, set [member "
"SceneTree.physics_interpolation] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Property [member physics/common/physics_jitter_fix] is "
"automatically disabled if [member physics/common/physics_interpolation] is "
"set to [code]true[/code], as the two methods are incompatible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el renderitzador interpolarà les transformacions dels "
"objectes (tant físiques com no físiques) entre les dues últimes "
"transformacions, de manera que es vegi un moviment suau fins i tot quan els "
"ticks de la física no coincideixen amb els fotogrames renderitzats. Vegeu "
"també [method Node.reset_physics_interpolation].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Tot i que aquesta és una configuració global, és possible un "
"control més fi de les branques individuals de [SceneTree] mitjançant [member "
"Node.physics_interpolation_mode].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar la interpolació física en temps d'execució, configureu [member "
"SceneTree.physics_interpolation].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La propietat [member physics/common/physics_jitter_fix] es "
"desactiva automàticament si [member physics/common/physics_interpolation] "
"s'estableix com a [code]true@[/code], com a mètodes compatibles."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how much physics ticks are synchronized with real time. For 0 or "
"less, the ticks are synchronized. Such values are recommended for network "
"games, where clock synchronization matters. Higher values cause higher "
"deviation of in-game clock and real clock, but allows smoothing out "
"framerate jitters. The default value of 0.5 should be good enough for most; "
"values above 2 could cause the game to react to dropped frames with a "
"noticeable delay and are not recommended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Jitter fix is automatically disabled at runtime when [member "
"physics/common/physics_interpolation] is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a custom physics interpolation solution, the physics "
"jitter fix should be disabled by setting [member physics/common/"
"physics_jitter_fix] to [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the physics jitter fix at runtime, set [member Engine.physics_jitter_fix] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Controla quantes marques de física es sincronitzen amb el temps real. Per a "
"0 o menys, les paparres es sincronitzen. Aquests valors es recomanen per als "
"jocs de xarxa, on la sincronització del rellotge és important. Els valors "
"més alts provoquen una desviació més alta del rellotge del joc i del "
"rellotge real, però permet suavitzar les fluctuacions de la velocitat de "
"fotogrames. El valor predeterminat de 0,5 hauria de ser prou bo per a la "
"majoria; valors superiors a 2 poden fer que el joc reaccioni a fotogrames "
"caigudes amb un retard notable i no es recomana.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La correcció de fluctuació es desactiva automàticament en temps "
"d'execució quan [member physics/common/physics_interpolation] està "
"habilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'utilitza una solució d'interpolació física "
"personalitzada, la correcció de fluctuació física s'ha de desactivar "
"configurant [member physics/common/physics_jitter_fix] a [code]@0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar la correcció de la fluctuació física en temps d'execució, "
"configureu [member Engine.physics_jitter_fix]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of fixed iterations per second. This controls how often physics "
"simulation and the [method Node._physics_process] method are run.\n"
"CPU usage scales approximately with the physics tick rate. However, at very "
"low tick rates (usually below 30), physics behavior can break down. Input "
"can also become less responsive at low tick rates as there can be a gap "
"between input being registered, and the response on the next physics tick. "
"High tick rates give more accurate physics simulation, particularly for fast "
"moving objects. For example, racing games may benefit from increasing the "
"tick rate above the default 60.\n"
"See also [member application/run/max_fps].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the physics FPS at runtime, set [member Engine.physics_ticks_per_second] "
"instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only [member physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] "
"physics ticks may be simulated per rendered frame at most. If more physics "
"ticks have to be simulated per rendered frame to keep up with rendering, the "
"project will appear to slow down (even if [code]delta[/code] is used "
"consistently in physics calculations). Therefore, it is recommended to also "
"increase [member physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] if increasing "
"[member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] significantly above its "
"default value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Consider enabling [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"interpolation/index.html]physics interpolation[/url] if you change [member "
"physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] to a value that is not a multiple "
"of [code]60[/code]. Using physics interpolation will avoid jittering when "
"the monitor refresh rate and physics update rate don't exactly match."
msgstr ""
"El nombre d'iteracions fixes per segon. Això controla la freqüència amb què "
"s'executen la simulació física i el mètode [method Node._physics_process].\n"
"L'ús de la CPU s'escala aproximadament amb la taxa de graduació de la "
"física. No obstant això, amb taxes molt baixes (generalment per sota de 30), "
"el comportament físic es pot trencar. L'entrada també pot ser menys sensible "
"a baixes taxes, ja que pot haver-hi una bretxa entre l'entrada que es "
"registra i la resposta a la següent marca de física. Els índexs alts de "
"marcatge ofereixen una simulació física més precisa, especialment per als "
"objectes en moviment ràpid. Per exemple, els jocs de carreres poden "
"beneficiar-se d'augmentar la taxa d'activació per sobre del 60 "
"predeterminat.\n"
"Vegeu també [member application/run/max_fps].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar l'FPS de la física en temps d'execució, configureu [member "
"Engine.physics_ticks_per_second].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només es poden simular els ticks de física [member physics/"
"common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] com a màxim per fotograma representat. "
"Si s'han de simular més ticks de física per fotograma renderitzat per "
"mantenir-se al dia amb la representació, semblarà que el projecte s'alentirà "
"(encara que [code]delta[/code] s'utilitzi de manera coherent en els càlculs "
"de la física). Per tant, es recomana augmentar també [member physics/common/"
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] si augmenta [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second] significativament per sobre del seu valor "
"predeterminat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Penseu en habilitar [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"interpolation/index.html]interpolació física[/url] si canvieu [member "
"physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] a un valor que no sigui múltiple de "
"[code]60[/code]. L'ús de la interpolació física evitarà tremolors quan la "
"taxa d'actualització del monitor i la taxa d'actualització de la física no "
"coincideixen exactament."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum angle, in radians, between two adjacent triangles in a "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] or [HeightMapShape3D] for which the edge between "
"those triangles is considered inactive.\n"
"Collisions against an inactive edge will have its normal overridden to "
"instead be the surface normal of the triangle. This can help alleviate ghost "
"collisions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this too high can result in objects not depenetrating "
"properly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This applies to all shape queries, as well as physics bodies "
"within the simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not apply when enabling Jolt's enhanced internal edge "
"removal, which supersedes this."
msgstr ""
"L'angle màxim, en radians, entre dos triangles adjacents en un "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] o [HeightMapShape3D] per al qual la vora entre "
"aquests triangles es considera inactiva.\n"
"Les col·lisions contra una vora inactiva tindran la seva normal anul·lació "
"per ser, en canvi, la normal de la superfície del triangle. Això pot ajudar "
"a alleujar les col·lisions fantasmes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Establir-ho massa alt pot provocar que els objectes no es "
"despenetrin correctament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això s'aplica a totes les consultes de formes, així com als "
"cossos físics de la simulació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això no s'aplica quan s'habilita l'eliminació millorada de les "
"vores internes de Jolt, que la substitueix."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of collision margin to use for certain convex collision shapes, "
"such as [BoxShape3D], [CylinderShape3D] and [ConvexPolygonShape3D], as a "
"fraction of the shape's shortest axis, with [member Shape3D.margin] as the "
"upper bound. This is mainly used to speed up collision detection with convex "
"shapes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Collision margins in Jolt do not add any extra size to the "
"shape. Instead the shape is first shrunk by the margin and then expanded by "
"the same amount, resulting in a shape with rounded corners.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this value too close to [code]0.0[/code] may also "
"negatively affect the accuracy of the collision detection with convex shapes."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de marge de col·lisió que cal utilitzar per a determinades "
"formes de col·lisió convexes, com ara [BoxShape3D], [CylinderShape3D] i "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D], com a fracció de l'eix més curt de la forma, amb "
"[member Shape3D.margin] com a límit superior. S'utilitza principalment per "
"accelerar la detecció de col·lisions amb formes convexes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els marges de col·lisió a Jolt no afegeixen cap mida addicional "
"a la forma. En canvi, la forma es redueix primer pel marge i després "
"s'expandeix en la mateixa quantitat, donant lloc a una forma amb cantonades "
"arrodonides.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Establir aquest valor massa a prop de [code]0.0[/code] també "
"pot afectar negativament la precisió de la detecció de col·lisions amb "
"formes convexes."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Which of the two nodes bound by a joint should represent the world when one "
"of the two is omitted, as either [member Joint3D.node_a] or [member "
"Joint3D.node_b]. This can be thought of as having the omitted node be a "
"[StaticBody3D] at the joint's position. Joint limits are more easily "
"expressed when [member Joint3D.node_a] represents the world.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In Godot Physics, only [member Joint3D.node_b] can represent "
"the world."
msgstr ""
"Quin dels dos nodes units per una articulació hauria de representar el món "
"quan s'omet un dels dos, ja sigui [member Joint3D.node_a] o [member "
"Joint3D.node_b]. Es pot pensar que el node omès sigui un [StaticBody3D] a la "
"posició de l'articulació. Els límits conjunts s'expressen més fàcilment quan "
"[member Joint3D.node_a] representa el món.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A Godot Physics, només [member Joint3D.node_b] pot representar "
"el món."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum angular velocity that a [RigidBody3D] can reach, in radians per "
"second.\n"
"This is mainly used as a fail-safe, to prevent the simulation from "
"exploding, as fast-moving objects colliding with complex physics structures "
"can otherwise cause them to go out of control. Fast-moving objects can also "
"cause a lot of stress on the collision detection system, which can slow down "
"the simulation considerably."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat angular màxima que pot assolir un [RigidBody3D], en radians per "
"segon.\n"
"S'utilitza principalment com a seguretat contra errors, per evitar que la "
"simulació exploti, ja que els objectes en moviment ràpid que xoquen amb "
"estructures físiques complexes poden provocar que es descontrolin. Els "
"objectes en moviment ràpid també poden causar molta tensió al sistema de "
"detecció de col·lisions, cosa que pot alentir considerablement la simulació."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of [PhysicsBody3D] to support at the same time, awake or "
"sleeping. When this limit is exceeded, an error is reported and anything "
"past that point is undefined behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This limit also applies within the editor."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de [PhysicsBody3D] per donar suport al mateix temps, despert "
"o dormint. Quan se supera aquest límit, s'informa d'un error i qualsevol "
"cosa que passi aquest punt és un comportament no definit.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest límit també s'aplica a l'editor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of body pairs to allow processing of. When this limit is "
"exceeded, a warning is reported and collisions will randomly be ignored "
"while bodies pass through each other."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de parells de cos per permetre el processament. Quan se "
"supera aquest límit, s'informa d'un avís i les col·lisions s'ignoraran "
"aleatòriament mentre els cossos es creuen."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of contact constraints to allow processing of. When this "
"limit is exceeded, a warning is reported and collisions will randomly be "
"ignored while bodies pass through each other."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de restriccions de contacte per permetre el processament. "
"Quan se supera aquest límit, s'informa d'un avís i les col·lisions "
"s'ignoraran aleatòriament mentre els cossos es creuen."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum linear velocity that a [RigidBody3D] can reach, in meters per "
"second.\n"
"This is mainly used as a fail-safe, to prevent the simulation from "
"exploding, as fast-moving objects colliding with complex physics structures "
"can otherwise cause them to go out of control. Fast-moving objects can also "
"cause a lot of stress on the collision detection system, which can slow down "
"the simulation considerably."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat lineal màxima que pot assolir un [RigidBody3D], en metres per "
"segon.\n"
"S'utilitza principalment com a seguretat contra errors, per evitar que la "
"simulació exploti, ja que els objectes en moviment ràpid que xoquen amb "
"estructures físiques complexes poden provocar que es descontrolin. Els "
"objectes en moviment ràpid també poden causar molta tensió al sistema de "
"detecció de col·lisions, cosa que pot alentir considerablement la simulació."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of memory to pre-allocate for the stack allocator used within "
"Jolt, in MiB. This allocator is used within the physics step to store things "
"that are only needed during it, like which bodies are in contact, how they "
"form islands and the data needed to solve the contacts."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de memòria que cal pre-assignar per a l'assignador de pila "
"utilitzat a Jolt, en MiB. Aquest assignador s'utilitza dins del pas de la "
"física per emmagatzemar coses que només es necessiten durant el mateix, com "
"quins cossos estan en contacte, com formen illes i les dades necessàries per "
"resoldre els contactes."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of [WorldBoundaryShape3D] boundaries, for all three dimensions. The "
"plane is effectively centered within a box of this size, and anything "
"outside of the box will not collide with it. This is necessary as "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] is not unbounded when using Jolt, in order to prevent "
"precision issues.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this value too high can make collision detection less "
"accurate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Collisions against the effective edges of a "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] will be inconsistent."
msgstr ""
"La mida dels límits [WorldBoundaryShape3D], per a les tres dimensions. "
"L'avió es centra efectivament dins d'una caixa d'aquesta mida, i qualsevol "
"cosa fora de la caixa no xocarà amb ella. Això és necessari ja que "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] no és il·limitat quan s'utilitza Jolt, per tal "
"d'evitar problemes de precisió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Establir aquest valor massa alt pot fer que la detecció de "
"col·lisions sigui menys precisa.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les col·lisions contra les vores efectives d'un "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] seran inconsistents."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Fraction of the total penetration to depenetrate per iteration during motion "
"queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] "
"and [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"Fracció de la penetració total per despenetrar per iteració durant les "
"consultes de moviment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això afecta els mètodes [method "
"CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], [method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] i [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of iterations to run when depenetrating during motion queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] "
"and [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre d'iteracions a executar quan es despenetra durant les consultes de "
"moviment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això afecta els mètodes [method "
"CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], [method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] i [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Jolt's enhanced internal edge removal during "
"motion queries. This can help alleviate ghost collisions, but only with "
"edges within a single body, meaning edges between separate bodies can still "
"cause ghost collisions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] "
"and [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita l'eliminació millorada de les vores internes "
"de Jolt durant les consultes de moviment. Això pot ajudar a alleujar les "
"col·lisions fantasma, però només amb vores dins d'un sol cos, és a dir, les "
"vores entre cossos separats encara poden causar col·lisions fantasmes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això afecta els mètodes [method "
"CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], [method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] i [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], populates the [code]face_index[/code] field in the "
"results of [method PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_ray], also accessed "
"through [method RayCast3D.get_collision_face_index]. If [code]false[/code], "
"the [code]face_index[/code] field will be left at its default value of "
"[code]-1[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling this setting will increase Jolt's memory usage for "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] by around 25%."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], emplena el camp [code]face_index[/code] als resultats "
"de [method PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_ray], també accessible "
"mitjançant [method RayCast3D.get_collision_face_index]. Si [code]false[/"
"code], el camp [code]face_index[/code] es deixarà amb el valor predeterminat "
"de [code]-1[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Activar aquesta configuració augmentarà l'ús de memòria de Jolt "
"per a [ConcavePolygonShape3D] al voltant d'un 25%."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Jolt's enhanced internal edge removal during "
"shape queries. This can help alleviate ghost collisions when using shape "
"queries for things like character movement, but only with edges within a "
"single body, meaning edges between separate bodies can still cause ghost "
"collisions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.cast_motion], [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.collide_shape], [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info] and [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_shape].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling this setting can cause certain shapes to be culled "
"from the results entirely, but you will get at least one intersection per "
"body."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita l'eliminació millorada de les vores internes "
"de Jolt durant les consultes de forma. Això pot ajudar a alleujar les "
"col·lisions fantasmes quan s'utilitzen consultes de forma per a coses com el "
"moviment de personatges, però només amb vores dins d'un sol cos, és a dir, "
"les vores entre cossos separats encara poden causar col·lisions fantasmes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això afecta els mètodes [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.cast_motion], [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.collide_shape], [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info] i [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_shape].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'activació d'aquesta configuració pot provocar que certes "
"formes s'eliminin completament dels resultats, però obtindreu almenys una "
"intersecció per cos."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [RigidBody3D] nodes are allowed to go to sleep if "
"their velocity is below the threshold defined in [member physics/"
"jolt_physics_3d/simulation/sleep_velocity_threshold] for the duration set in "
"[member physics/jolt_physics_3d/simulation/sleep_time_threshold]. This can "
"improve physics simulation performance when there are non-moving "
"[RigidBody3D] nodes, at the cost of some nodes possibly failing to wake up "
"in certain scenarios. Consider disabling this temporarily to troubleshoot "
"[RigidBody3D] nodes not moving when they should."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els nodes [RigidBody3D] poden anar a dormir si la seva "
"velocitat és per sota del llindar definit a [member physics/jolt_physics_3d/"
"simulation/sleep_velocity_threshold] durant la durada establerta a [member "
"physics/jolt_physics_3d/simulation/sleep_time_threshold]. Això pot millorar "
"el rendiment de la simulació física quan hi ha nodes [RigidBody3D] que no es "
"mouen, a costa d'alguns nodes que possiblement no es desperten en "
"determinats escenaris. Penseu en desactivar-ho temporalment per solucionar "
"problemes dels nodes [RigidBody3D] que no es mouen quan haurien de ser."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"How much of the position error of a [RigidBody3D] to fix during a physics "
"step, where [code]0.0[/code] is none and [code]1.0[/code] is the full "
"amount. This affects things like how quickly bodies depenetrate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this value too high can make [RigidBody3D] nodes "
"unstable."
msgstr ""
"Quina part de l'error de posició d'un [RigidBody3D] s'ha de solucionar "
"durant un pas de física, on [code]0.0[/code] no és cap i [code]1.0@[/code] "
"és l'import total. Això afecta coses com la rapidesa amb la qual es "
"despenetren els cossos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Establir aquest valor massa alt pot fer que els nodes "
"[RigidBody3D] siguin inestables."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum relative angle by which a body pair can move and still reuse the "
"collision results from the previous physics step, in radians."
msgstr ""
"L'angle relatiu màxim amb el qual un parell de cos es pot moure i encara "
"reutilitzar la col·lisió resulta del pas anterior de la física, en radians."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum relative distance by which a body pair can move and still reuse "
"the collision results from the previous physics step, in meters."
msgstr ""
"La distància relativa màxima a la qual un parell de cos es pot moure i "
"encara reutilitzar la col·lisió resulta del pas anterior de la física, en "
"metres."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the body pair contact cache, which removes the "
"need for potentially expensive collision detection when the relative "
"orientation between two bodies hasn't changed much."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita la memòria cau de contacte de parell de cos, "
"que elimina la necessitat d'una detecció de col·lisions potencialment cara "
"quan l'orientació relativa entre dos cossos no ha canviat gaire."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum velocity needed before a collision can be bouncy, in meters per "
"second."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat mínima necessària abans que una col·lisió pugui ser rebot, en "
"metres per segon."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Fraction of a body's inner radius that may penetrate another body while "
"using continuous collision detection."
msgstr ""
"Fracció del radi interior d'un cos que pot penetrar en un altre cos mentre "
"s'utilitza la detecció contínua de col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Fraction of a body's inner radius that the body must move per step to make "
"use of continuous collision detection."
msgstr ""
"Fracció del radi interior d'un cos que el cos ha de moure per pas per fer ús "
"de la detecció contínua de col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a [RigidBody3D] frozen with [constant "
"RigidBody3D.FREEZE_MODE_KINEMATIC] is able to collide with other kinematic "
"and static bodies, and therefore generate contacts for them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting can come at a heavy CPU and memory cost if you "
"allow many/large frozen kinematic bodies with a non-zero [member "
"RigidBody3D.max_contacts_reported] to overlap with complex static geometry, "
"such as [ConcavePolygonShape3D] or [HeightMapShape3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "How much bodies are allowed to penetrate each other, in meters."
msgstr "Quants cossos poden penetrar entre si, en metres."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of solver position iterations. The greater the number of iterations, "
"the more accurate the simulation will be, at the cost of CPU performance."
msgstr ""
"Nombre d'iteracions de la posició del solucionador. Com més gran sigui el "
"nombre d'iteracions, més precisa serà la simulació, a costa del rendiment de "
"la CPU."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Time in seconds a [RigidBody3D] will spend below the sleep velocity "
"threshold before going to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Temps en segons que un [RigidBody3D] passarà per sota del llindar de "
"velocitat del son abans d'anar a dormir."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The linear velocity of specific points on the bounding box of a "
"[RigidBody3D], below which it can be put to sleep, in meters per second. "
"These points help capture both the linear and angular motion of a "
"[RigidBody3D]."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat lineal de punts específics del quadre delimitador d'un "
"[RigidBody3D], per sota de la qual es pot posar a dormir, en metres per "
"segon. Aquests punts ajuden a capturar tant el moviment lineal com angular "
"d'un [RigidBody3D]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"How big the points of a [SoftBody3D] are, in meters. A higher value can "
"prevent behavior such as cloth laying perfectly flush against other surfaces "
"and causing Z-fighting."
msgstr ""
"Què tan grans són els punts d'un [SoftBody3D], en metres. Un valor més alt "
"pot evitar comportaments com ara la col·locació de la tela perfectament a "
"ras d'altres superfícies i provocar una lluita Z."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Radius around physics bodies, inside which speculative contact points will "
"be detected, in meters. This is mainly used to prevent tunneling/penetration "
"for [RigidBody3D] nodes during simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this too high may result in ghost collisions, as "
"speculative contacts are based on the closest points during the collision "
"detection step which may not be the actual closest points by the time the "
"two bodies hit."
msgstr ""
"Radi al voltant dels cossos físics, dins del qual es detectaran punts de "
"contacte especulatius, en metres. Això s'utilitza principalment per evitar "
"el túnel/penetració dels nodes [RigidBody3D] durant la simulació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Establir això massa alt pot provocar col·lisions fantasma, ja "
"que els contactes especulatius es basen en els punts més propers durant el "
"pas de detecció de col·lisions, que potser no són els punts més propers "
"reals en el moment en què els dos cossos toquen."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Jolt's enhanced internal edge removal for "
"[RigidBody3D]. This can help alleviate ghost collisions when, for example, a "
"[RigidBody3D] collides with the edges of two perfectly joined [BoxShape3D]. "
"The removal only applies to edges internal to a single body, meaning edges "
"between separate bodies can still cause ghost collisions."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita l'eliminació millorada de la vora interna de "
"Jolt per a [RigidBody3D]. Això pot ajudar a alleujar les col·lisions "
"fantasma quan, per exemple, un [RigidBody3D] xoca amb les vores de dos "
"[BoxShape3D] perfectament units. L'eliminació només s'aplica a les vores "
"internes d'un sol cos, és a dir, les vores entre cossos separats encara "
"poden provocar col·lisions fantasma."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of solver velocity iterations. The greater the number of iterations, "
"the more accurate the simulation will be, at the cost of CPU performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This needs to be at least [code]2[/code] in order for friction "
"to work, as friction is applied using the non-penetration impulse from the "
"previous iteration."
msgstr ""
"Nombre d'iteracions de velocitat del solucionador. Com més gran sigui el "
"nombre d'iteracions, més precisa serà la simulació, a costa del rendiment de "
"la CPU.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això ha de ser com a mínim [code]2[/code] perquè la fricció "
"funcioni, ja que la fricció s'aplica utilitzant l'impuls de no penetració de "
"la iteració anterior."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of canvas item commands that can be batched into a single "
"draw call."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim d'ordres d'elements de llenç que es poden agrupar en una única "
"trucada de sorteig."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of uniform sets that will be cached by the 2D renderer when "
"batching draw calls.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Increasing this value can improve performance if the project "
"renders many unique sprite textures every frame."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim de conjunts uniformes que el renderitzador 2D emmagatzemarà a "
"la memòria cau quan s'agrupin les trucades de dibuix.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Augmentar aquest valor pot millorar el rendiment si el projecte "
"representa moltes textures de sprite úniques a cada fotograma."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how much of the original viewport size should be covered by the 2D "
"signed distance field. This SDF can be sampled in [CanvasItem] shaders and "
"is used for [GPUParticles2D] collision. Higher values allow portions of "
"occluders located outside the viewport to still be taken into account in the "
"generated signed distance field, at the cost of performance. If you notice "
"particles falling through [LightOccluder2D]s as the occluders leave the "
"viewport, increase this setting.\n"
"The percentage specified is added on each axis and on both sides. For "
"example, with the default setting of 120%, the signed distance field will "
"cover 20% of the viewport's size outside the viewport on each side (top, "
"right, bottom, left).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the 2D SDF oversizing percentage at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"Controla quina part de la mida de la finestra gràfica original hauria de "
"cobrir el camp de distància signat en 2D. Aquest SDF es pot mostrar als "
"shaders [CanvasItem] i s'utilitza per a la col·lisió [GPUParticles2D]. Els "
"valors més alts permeten que les porcions d'oclusors ubicades fora de la "
"finestra gràfica encara es tinguin en compte al camp de distància signada "
"generada, a costa del rendiment. Si observeu que les partícules cauen a "
"través de [LightOccluder2D]s quan els oclusors surten de la finestra "
"gràfica, augmenteu aquesta configuració.\n"
"El percentatge especificat s'afegeix a cada eix i als dos costats. Per "
"exemple, amb la configuració predeterminada del 120%, el camp de distància "
"signat cobrirà el 20% de la mida de la finestra gràfica fora de la finestra "
"gràfica a cada costat (superior, dreta, inferior, esquerra).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar el percentatge de sobredimensionament de l'SDF 2D en temps "
"d'execució, utilitzeu [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The resolution scale to use for the 2D signed distance field. Higher values "
"lead to a more precise and more stable signed distance field as the camera "
"moves, at the cost of performance. The default value (50%) renders at half "
"the resolution of the viewport size on each axis, which means the SDF is "
"generated with 25% of the viewport's pixel count.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the 2D SDF resolution scale at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"L'escala de resolució que cal utilitzar per al camp de distància signada en "
"2D. Els valors més alts condueixen a un camp de distància signat més precís "
"i més estable a mesura que la càmera es mou, a costa del rendiment. El valor "
"predeterminat (50%) es representa a la meitat de la resolució de la mida de "
"la finestra gràfica a cada eix, el que significa que l'SDF es genera amb el "
"25% del recompte de píxels de la finestra gràfica.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar l'escala de resolució 2D SDF en temps d'execució, utilitzeu "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the 2D shadow atlas in pixels. Higher values result in more "
"precise [Light2D] shadows, at the cost of performance and video memory "
"usage. The specified value is rounded up to the nearest power of 2.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the 2D shadow atlas size at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.canvas_set_shadow_texture_size] instead."
msgstr ""
"La mida de l'atles d'ombres 2D en píxels. Els valors més alts donen lloc a "
"ombres [Light2D] més precises, a costa del rendiment i l'ús de la memòria de "
"vídeo. El valor especificat s'arrodoneix a la potència més propera de 2.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar la mida de l'atles d'ombres 2D en temps d'execució, utilitzeu "
"[method RenderingServer.canvas_set_shadow_texture_size]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [CanvasItem] nodes will internally snap to full "
"pixels. Useful for low-resolution pixel art games. Their position can still "
"be sub-pixel, but the decimals will not have effect as the position is "
"rounded. This can lead to a crisper appearance at the cost of less smooth "
"movement, especially when [Camera2D] smoothing is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle "
"2D transform snapping at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel] on the root "
"[Viewport] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Control] nodes are snapped to the nearest pixel by default. "
"This is controlled by [member gui/common/snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not recommended to use this setting together with [member "
"rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel], as movement may appear even "
"less smooth. Prefer only enabling this setting instead."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els nodes [CanvasItem] s'ajustaran internament a "
"píxels complets. Útil per a jocs d'art de píxels de baixa resolució. La seva "
"posició encara pot ser subpíxel, però els decimals no tindran efecte a "
"mesura que la posició s'arrodoni. Això pot provocar una aparença més nítida "
"a costa d'un moviment menys suau, especialment quan el suavitzat [Camera2D] "
"està habilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar l'ajustament de la transformació 2D en temps d'execució, "
"utilitzeu [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel] "
"a l'arrel [Viewport].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [Control] Els nodes s'ajusten al píxel més proper de manera "
"predeterminada. Això està controlat per [member gui/common/"
"snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No es recomana utilitzar aquesta configuració juntament amb "
"[member rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel], ja que el moviment pot "
"semblar encara menys suau. Preferiu activar només aquesta configuració."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], vertices of [CanvasItem] nodes will snap to full "
"pixels. Useful for low-resolution pixel art games. Only affects the final "
"vertex positions, not the transforms. This can lead to a crisper appearance "
"at the cost of less smooth movement, especially when [Camera2D] smoothing is "
"enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle "
"2D vertex snapping at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] on the root "
"[Viewport] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Control] nodes are snapped to the nearest pixel by default. "
"This is controlled by [member gui/common/snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not recommended to use this setting together with [member "
"rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel], as movement may appear even "
"less smooth. Prefer only enabling that setting instead."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els vèrtexs dels nodes [CanvasItem] s'ajustaran a "
"píxels complets. Útil per a jocs d'art de píxels de baixa resolució. Només "
"afecta les posicions finals dels vèrtexs, no les transformacions. Això pot "
"provocar una aparença més nítida a costa d'un moviment menys suau, "
"especialment quan el suavitzat [Camera2D] està habilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar l'ajustament del vèrtex 2D en temps d'execució, utilitzeu "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] a l'arrel "
"[Viewport].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [Control] Els nodes s'ajusten al píxel més proper de manera "
"predeterminada. Això està controlat per [member gui/common/"
"snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No es recomana utilitzar aquesta configuració juntament amb "
"[member rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel], ja que el moviment "
"pot semblar encara menys suau. Preferiu habilitar només aquesta configuració."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the number of multisample antialiasing (MSAA) samples to use for 2D/"
"Canvas rendering (as a power of two). MSAA is used to reduce aliasing around "
"the edges of polygons. A higher MSAA value results in smoother edges but can "
"be significantly slower on some hardware, especially integrated graphics due "
"to their limited memory bandwidth. This has no effect on shader-induced "
"aliasing or texture aliasing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] MSAA is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering "
"methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"number of 2D MSAA samples at runtime, set [member Viewport.msaa_2d] or use "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_2d]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nombre de mostres d'antialiasing multisample (MSAA) que "
"s'utilitzaran per a la representació 2D/Canvas (com una potència de dos). "
"MSAA s'utilitza per reduir l'àlies al voltant de les vores dels polígons. Un "
"valor MSAA més alt dóna lloc a vores més suaus, però pot ser "
"significativament més lents en alguns maquinari, especialment en gràfics "
"integrats a causa del seu ample de banda de memòria limitat. Això no té cap "
"efecte sobre l'àlies induït per l'ombra o l'àlies de textures.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] MSAA només és compatible amb els mètodes de representació "
"Forward+ i Mobile, no Compatibilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir el nombre de mostres de MSAA 2D en temps d'execució, configureu "
"[member Viewport.msaa_2d] o utilitzeu [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_2d]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the number of multisample antialiasing (MSAA) samples to use for 3D "
"rendering (as a power of two). MSAA is used to reduce aliasing around the "
"edges of polygons. A higher MSAA value results in smoother edges but can be "
"significantly slower on some hardware, especially integrated graphics due to "
"their limited memory bandwidth. See also [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode] "
"for supersampling, which provides higher quality but is much more expensive. "
"This has no effect on shader-induced aliasing or texture aliasing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"number of 3D MSAA samples at runtime, set [member Viewport.msaa_3d] or use "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_3d]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nombre de mostres d'antialiasing multisample (MSAA) que "
"s'utilitzaran per a la representació en 3D (com una potència de dos). MSAA "
"s'utilitza per reduir l'àlies al voltant de les vores dels polígons. Un "
"valor MSAA més alt dóna lloc a vores més suaus, però pot ser "
"significativament més lents en alguns maquinari, especialment en gràfics "
"integrats a causa del seu ample de banda de memòria limitat. Vegeu també "
"[member rendering/scaling_3d/mode] per al supermostreig, que proporciona una "
"qualitat més alta però és molt més car. Això no té cap efecte sobre l'àlies "
"induït per l'ombra o l'àlies de textures.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir el nombre de mostres de MSAA 3D en temps d'execució, configureu "
"[member Viewport.msaa_3d] o utilitzeu [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_3d]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the screen-space antialiasing mode for the default screen [Viewport]. "
"Screen-space antialiasing works by selectively blurring edges in a post-"
"process shader. It differs from MSAA which takes multiple coverage samples "
"while rendering objects. Screen-space AA methods are typically faster than "
"MSAA and will smooth out specular aliasing, but tend to make scenes appear "
"blurry. The blurriness is partially counteracted by automatically using a "
"negative mipmap LOD bias (see [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"texture_mipmap_bias]).\n"
"Another way to combat specular aliasing is to enable [member rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/screen_space_roughness_limiter/enabled].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Screen-space antialiasing is only supported in the Forward+ and "
"Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"screen-space antialiasing mode at runtime, set [member "
"Viewport.screen_space_aa] on the root [Viewport] instead, or use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_screen_space_aa]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el mode d'antialiasing de l'espai de pantalla per a la pantalla "
"predeterminada [Viewport]. L'antialiasing de l'espai de pantalla funciona "
"difuminant selectivament les vores en un ombrejat posterior al procés. Es "
"diferencia de MSAA que pren diverses mostres de cobertura mentre representa "
"objectes. Els mètodes AA d'espai de pantalla solen ser més ràpids que MSAA i "
"suavitzaran l'àlies especular, però tendeixen a fer que les escenes semblin "
"borroses. La borrosa es contraresta parcialment mitjançant l'ús automàtic "
"d'un biaix LOD de mipmap negatiu (vegeu [member rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/texture_mipmap_bias]).\n"
"Una altra manera de combatre l'àlies especular és activar [member rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/screen_space_roughness_limiter/enabled].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'antialiasing de l'espai de pantalla només és compatible amb "
"els mètodes de representació Forward+ i Mobile, no Compatibilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir el mode d'antialiasing de l'espai de pantalla en temps "
"d'execució, configureu [member Viewport.screen_space_aa] a l'arrel "
"[Viewport] o utilitzeu [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_screen_space_aa]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the sensitivity to edges when using SMAA for antialiasing. Lower values "
"will catch more edges, at a potentially higher performance cost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this setting at run-time."
msgstr ""
"Defineix la sensibilitat a les vores quan s'utilitza SMAA per a "
"l'antialiasing. Els valors més baixos capturaran més avantatges, amb un cost "
"de rendiment potencialment més elevat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Actualment no hi ha manera de canviar aquesta configuració en temps "
"d'execució."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses a fast dithering filter just before transforming "
"floating point color values to integer color values to make banding "
"significantly less visible. Debanding is applied at different steps of the "
"rendering process depending on the rendering method and [member rendering/"
"viewport/hdr_2d] setting.\n"
"In some cases, debanding may introduce a slightly noticeable dithering "
"pattern. It's recommended to enable debanding only when actually needed "
"since the dithering pattern will make lossless-compressed screenshots "
"larger.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts and "
"configures [method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] and [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding] of the root [Viewport]. When [member rendering/"
"viewport/hdr_2d] is disabled, you should additionally set the [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding] of other viewports in your project. To set debanding "
"at run-time, the property that should be set depends on the renderer: "
"Forward+ only uses [member Viewport.use_debanding] and Mobile uses both "
"[method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] and [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], utilitza un filtre de tramado ràpid just abans de "
"transformar els valors de color de coma flotant en valors de color enters "
"per fer que les bandes siguin molt menys visibles. La desbandada s'aplica en "
"diferents passos del procés de representació en funció del mètode de "
"representació i de la configuració [member rendering/viewport/hdr_2d].\n"
"En alguns casos, la desbandada pot introduir un patró de tramado "
"lleugerament notable. Es recomana habilitar la desbandada només quan sigui "
"realment necessari, ja que el patró de tramado augmentarà les captures de "
"pantalla comprimides sense pèrdues.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte i "
"configura [method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] i [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding] de l'arrel [Viewport]. Quan [member rendering/"
"viewport/hdr_2d] està desactivat, també hauríeu de configurar el [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding] d'altres finestres del vostre projecte. Per establir "
"la desbandada en temps d'execució, la propietat que s'ha d'establir depèn "
"del renderitzador: Forward+ només utilitza [member Viewport.use_debanding] i "
"Mobile utilitza tant [method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] com "
"[member Viewport.use_debanding]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enables temporal antialiasing for the default screen [Viewport]. TAA works "
"by jittering the camera and accumulating the images of the last rendered "
"frames, motion vector rendering is used to account for camera and object "
"motion. Enabling TAA can make the image blurrier, which is partially "
"counteracted by automatically using a negative mipmap LOD bias (see [member "
"rendering/textures/default_filters/texture_mipmap_bias]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The implementation is not complete yet. Some visual instances "
"such as particles and skinned meshes may show ghosting artifacts in motion.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] TAA is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set TAA "
"at runtime, set [member Viewport.use_taa] on the root [Viewport] instead, or "
"use [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_taa]."
msgstr ""
"Activa l'antialiasing temporal per a la pantalla predeterminada [Viewport]. "
"TAA funciona agitant la càmera i acumulant les imatges dels darrers "
"fotogrames renderitzats, la representació de vectors de moviment s'utilitza "
"per tenir en compte el moviment de la càmera i l'objecte. L'habilitació de "
"TAA pot fer que la imatge sigui més borrosa, cosa que es contraresta "
"parcialment mitjançant l'ús automàtic d'un biaix LOD de mipmap negatiu "
"(vegeu [member rendering/textures/default_filters/texture_mipmap_bias]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La implementació encara no s'ha completat. Alguns exemples "
"visuals, com ara partícules i malles amb pell, poden mostrar artefactes "
"fantasma en moviment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] TAA només s'admet al mètode de representació Forward+, no al "
"mòbil ni a la compatibilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir TAA en temps d'execució, configureu [member Viewport.use_taa] a "
"l'arrel [Viewport] o utilitzeu [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_taa]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"the screen-space roughness limiter at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.screen_space_roughness_limiter_set_active] instead."
msgstr ""
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per controlar el limitador de rugositat de l'espai de pantalla en temps "
"d'execució, truqueu a [method "
"RenderingServer.screen_space_roughness_limiter_set_active]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables a spatial filter to limit roughness in areas "
"with high-frequency detail. This can help reduce specular aliasing to an "
"extent, though not as much as enabling [member rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"quality/use_taa]. This filter has a small performance cost, so consider "
"disabling it if it doesn't benefit your scene noticeably.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The screen-space roughness limiter is only supported in the "
"Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"the screen-space roughness limiter at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.screen_space_roughness_limiter_set_active] instead."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita un filtre espacial per limitar la rugositat a "
"les zones amb detalls d'alta freqüència. Això pot ajudar a reduir l'àlies "
"especular fins a cert punt, encara que no tant com l'habilitació de [member "
"rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_taa]. Aquest filtre té un cost de "
"rendiment petit, així que penseu a desactivar-lo si no beneficia notablement "
"la vostra escena.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El limitador de rugositat de l'espai de pantalla només és "
"compatible amb els mètodes de representació Forward+ i Mobile, no "
"Compatibilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per controlar el limitador de rugositat de l'espai de pantalla en temps "
"d'execució, truqueu a [method "
"RenderingServer.screen_space_roughness_limiter_set_active]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the depth of field effect. Higher quality takes more "
"samples, which is slower but looks smoother."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la qualitat de l'efecte de profunditat de camp. Una qualitat més "
"alta pren més mostres, que és més lenta però sembla més suau."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the depth of field shape. Can be Box, Hexagon, or Circle. Box is the "
"fastest. Circle is the most realistic, but also the most expensive to "
"compute."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la forma de la profunditat de camp. Pot ser caixa, hexàgon o "
"cercle. Box és el més ràpid. El cercle és el més realista, però també el més "
"car de calcular."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], jitters DOF samples to make effect slightly blurrier "
"and hide lines created from low sample rates. This can result in a slightly "
"grainy appearance when used with a low number of samples."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les mostres de DOF tremolaran per fer que l'efecte "
"sigui una mica més borrós i ocultar les línies creades a partir de "
"freqüències de mostreig baixes. Això pot donar lloc a un aspecte "
"lleugerament granulat quan s'utilitza amb un nombre baix de mostres."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Disables [member rendering/driver/depth_prepass/enable] conditionally for "
"certain vendors. By default, disables the depth prepass for mobile devices "
"as mobile devices do not benefit from the depth prepass due to their unique "
"architecture."
msgstr ""
"Desactiva [member rendering/driver/depth_prepass/enable] condicionalment per "
"a determinats proveïdors. De manera predeterminada, desactiva el prepass de "
"profunditat per als dispositius mòbils, ja que els dispositius mòbils no es "
"beneficien del prepass de profunditat a causa de la seva arquitectura única."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs a previous depth pass before rendering 3D "
"materials. This increases performance significantly in scenes with high "
"overdraw, when complex materials and lighting are used. However, in scenes "
"with few occluded surfaces, the depth prepass may reduce performance. If "
"your game is viewed from a fixed angle that makes it easy to avoid overdraw "
"(such as top-down or side-scrolling perspective), consider disabling the "
"depth prepass to improve performance. This setting can be changed at run-"
"time to optimize performance depending on the scene currently being viewed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth prepass is only supported when using the Forward+ or "
"Compatibility rendering method. When using the Mobile rendering method, "
"there is no depth prepass performed."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], realitza una passada de profunditat prèvia abans de "
"renderitzar materials 3D. Això augmenta el rendiment de manera significativa "
"en escenes amb un alt nivell, quan s'utilitzen materials i il·luminació "
"complexos. Tanmateix, en escenes amb poques superfícies ocluses, el prepass "
"de profunditat pot reduir el rendiment. Si el vostre joc es veu des d'un "
"angle fix que fa que sigui fàcil d'evitar l'excés (com ara la perspectiva de "
"dalt a baix o de desplaçament lateral), penseu a desactivar el prepass de "
"profunditat per millorar el rendiment. Aquesta configuració es pot canviar "
"en temps d'execució per optimitzar el rendiment en funció de l'escena que es "
"visualitzi actualment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La prepassa de profunditat només s'admet quan s'utilitza el "
"mètode de representació Endavant+ o Compatibilitat. Quan s'utilitza el "
"mètode de representació mòbil, no es realitza cap prepass de profunditat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"This setting has several known bugs which can lead to crashing, especially "
"when using particles or resizing the window. Not recommended for use in "
"production at this stage."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta configuració té diversos errors coneguts que poden provocar que es "
"bloquegin, especialment quan s'utilitzen partícules o canvien la mida de la "
"finestra. No es recomana el seu ús en producció en aquesta fase."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The thread model to use for rendering. Rendering on a thread may improve "
"performance, but synchronizing to the main thread can cause a bit more "
"jitter."
msgstr ""
"El model de fil que s'utilitzarà per a la representació. La representació en "
"un fil pot millorar el rendiment, però la sincronització amb el fil "
"principal pot provocar una mica més de nerviosisme."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default background clear color. Overridable per [Viewport] using its "
"[Environment]. See [member Environment.background_mode] and [member "
"Environment.background_color] in particular. To change this default color "
"programmatically, use [method RenderingServer.set_default_clear_color]."
msgstr ""
"Color clar de fons predeterminat. Substituïble per [Viewport] mitjançant el "
"seu [Environment]. Vegeu [member Environment.background_mode] i [member "
"Environment.background_color] en particular. Per canviar aquest color "
"predeterminat amb programació, utilitzeu [method "
"RenderingServer.set_default_clear_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"[Environment] that will be used as a fallback environment in case a scene "
"does not specify its own environment. The default environment is loaded in "
"at scene load time regardless of whether you have set an environment or not. "
"If you do not rely on the fallback environment, you do not need to set this "
"property."
msgstr ""
"[Environment] que s'utilitzarà com a entorn de reserva en cas que una escena "
"no especifiqui el seu propi entorn. L'entorn predeterminat es carrega en el "
"moment de la càrrega de l'escena, independentment de si heu establert un "
"entorn o no. Si no confieu en l'entorn alternatiu, no cal que establiu "
"aquesta propietat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enables legacy fog blending behavior from version 4.5 and earlier. This is "
"intended for users who are developing on pre-4.6 versions and want to "
"upgrade to 4.6 with the smallest possible change to their visuals."
msgstr ""
"Habilita el comportament de barreja de boira heretat a partir de la versió "
"4.5 i anteriors. Això està pensat per als usuaris que estan desenvolupant "
"versions anteriors a la 4.6 i volen actualitzar a la 4.6 amb el menor canvi "
"possible a les seves imatges."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets how the glow effect is upscaled before being copied onto the screen. "
"Linear is faster, but looks blocky. Bicubic is slower but looks smooth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode] is only "
"effective when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering methods, as "
"Compatibility uses a different glow implementation."
msgstr ""
"Defineix com s'incrementa l'efecte de resplendor abans de copiar-se a la "
"pantalla. Lineal és més ràpid, però sembla en bloc. Bicubic és més lent però "
"sembla suau.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode] només és "
"efectiu quan s'utilitzen els mètodes de representació Forward+ o Mobile, ja "
"que la compatibilitat utilitza una implementació de brillantor diferent."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode] on "
"mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/environment/glow/"
"upscale_mode] en dispositius mòbils, a causa de problemes de rendiment o de "
"compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space reflections will be rendered at half size "
"and then upscaled before being added to the scene. This is faster but may "
"look pixelated or cause flickering. If [code]false[/code], screen-space "
"reflections will be rendered at full size."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els reflexos de l'espai de pantalla es representaran a "
"la meitat de la mida i després s'augmentaran abans d'afegir-se a l'escena. "
"Això és més ràpid, però pot semblar pixelat o provocar parpelleig. Si "
"[code]false[/code], els reflexos de l'espai de pantalla es mostraran a mida "
"completa."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Quality target to use when [member rendering/environment/ssao/quality] is "
"set to [code]Ultra[/code]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] provides a quality "
"and speed similar to [code]Medium[/code] while a value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"provides much higher quality than any of the other settings at the cost of "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"Objectiu de qualitat que cal utilitzar quan [member rendering/environment/"
"ssao/quality] s'estableix en [code]Ultra[/code]. Un valor de [code]0.0[/"
"code] proporciona una qualitat i una velocitat similars a [code]Medium[/"
"code] mentre que un valor de [code]@1.0[/code] proporciona un rendiment de "
"qualitat molt més alt que qualsevol altre ajust de cost."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of blur passes to use when computing screen-space ambient occlusion. "
"A higher number will result in a smoother look, but will be slower to "
"compute and will have less high-frequency detail."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de passades de desenfocament a utilitzar quan es calcula l'oclusió "
"ambiental de l'espai de la pantalla. Un nombre més alt donarà lloc a un "
"aspecte més suau, però serà més lent de calcular i tindrà menys detalls "
"d'alta freqüència."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space ambient occlusion effect starts to fade "
"out. Use this hide ambient occlusion from far away."
msgstr ""
"Distància a la qual l'efecte d'oclusió ambiental de l'espai pantalla comença "
"a esvair-se. Utilitzeu aquesta oculta oclusió ambiental des de lluny."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space ambient occlusion is fully faded out. Use "
"this hide ambient occlusion from far away."
msgstr ""
"Distància a la qual l'oclusió ambiental de l'espai pantalla s'esvaeix "
"completament. Utilitzeu aquesta oculta oclusió ambiental des de lluny."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space ambient occlusion will be rendered at "
"half size and then upscaled before being added to the scene. This is "
"significantly faster but may miss small details. If [code]false[/code], "
"screen-space ambient occlusion will be rendered at full size."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'oclusió ambiental de l'espai de pantalla es "
"representarà a la meitat de la mida i després s'augmentarà abans d'afegir-se "
"a l'escena. Això és molt més ràpid, però pot faltar petits detalls. Si "
"[code]false[/code], l'oclusió ambiental de l'espai de pantalla es "
"representarà a mida completa."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the screen-space ambient occlusion effect. Higher values "
"take more samples and so will result in better quality, at the cost of "
"performance. Setting to [code]Ultra[/code] will use the [member rendering/"
"environment/ssao/adaptive_target] setting."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la qualitat de l'efecte d'oclusió ambiental de l'espai pantalla. "
"Els valors més alts prenen més mostres i, per tant, donaran lloc a una "
"millor qualitat, a costa del rendiment. Si s'estableix a [code]Ultra[/code] "
"s'utilitzarà la configuració [member rendering/environment/ssao/"
"adaptive_target]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Quality target to use when [member rendering/environment/ssil/quality] is "
"set to [code]Ultra[/code]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] provides a quality "
"and speed similar to [code]Medium[/code] while a value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"provides much higher quality than any of the other settings at the cost of "
"performance. When using the adaptive target, the performance cost scales "
"with the complexity of the scene."
msgstr ""
"Objectiu de qualitat que cal utilitzar quan [member rendering/environment/"
"ssil/quality] s'estableix en [code]Ultra[/code]. Un valor de [code]0.0[/"
"code] proporciona una qualitat i una velocitat similars a [code]Medium[/"
"code] mentre que un valor de [code]@1.0[/code] proporciona un rendiment de "
"qualitat molt més alt que qualsevol altre ajust de cost. Quan s'utilitza "
"l'objectiu adaptatiu, el cost de rendiment s'escala amb la complexitat de "
"l'escena."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of blur passes to use when computing screen-space indirect lighting. "
"A higher number will result in a smoother look, but will be slower to "
"compute and will have less high-frequency detail."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de passades de desenfocament a utilitzar quan es calcula la "
"il·luminació indirecta de l'espai de la pantalla. Un nombre més alt donarà "
"lloc a un aspecte més suau, però serà més lent de calcular i tindrà menys "
"detalls d'alta freqüència."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space indirect lighting effect starts to fade "
"out. Use this to hide screen-space indirect lighting from far away."
msgstr ""
"Distància a la qual l'efecte d'il·luminació indirecta de l'espai de la "
"pantalla comença a esvair-se. Utilitzeu-ho per amagar la il·luminació "
"indirecta de l'espai de la pantalla des de lluny."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space indirect lighting is fully faded out. Use "
"this to hide screen-space indirect lighting from far away."
msgstr ""
"Distància a la qual la il·luminació indirecta de l'espai de la pantalla "
"s'apaga completament. Utilitzeu-ho per amagar la il·luminació indirecta de "
"l'espai de la pantalla des de lluny."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space indirect lighting will be rendered at "
"half size and then upscaled before being added to the scene. This is "
"significantly faster but may miss small details and may result in some "
"objects appearing to glow at their edges."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la il·luminació indirecta de l'espai de la pantalla es "
"representarà a la meitat de la mida i després s'augmentarà abans d'afegir-se "
"a l'escena. Això és molt més ràpid, però pot perdre petits detalls i pot "
"provocar que alguns objectes semblin brillar a les vores."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the screen-space indirect lighting effect. Higher values "
"take more samples and so will result in better quality, at the cost of "
"performance. Setting to [code]Ultra[/code] will use the [member rendering/"
"environment/ssil/adaptive_target] setting."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la qualitat de l'efecte d'il·luminació indirecta de l'espai de la "
"pantalla. Els valors més alts prenen més mostres i, per tant, donaran lloc a "
"una millor qualitat, a costa del rendiment. Si s'estableix a [code]Ultra[/"
"code] s'utilitzarà la configuració [member rendering/environment/ssil/"
"adaptive_target]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Scales the depth over which the subsurface scattering effect is applied. A "
"high value may allow light to scatter into a part of the mesh or another "
"mesh that is close in screen space but far in depth. See also [member "
"rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"subsurface scattering depth scale at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"Escala la profunditat sobre la qual s'aplica l'efecte de dispersió "
"subterrània. Un valor alt pot permetre que la llum s'escampi per una part de "
"la malla o una altra malla que estigui a prop de l'espai de la pantalla però "
"molt en profunditat. Vegeu també [member rendering/environment/"
"subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_scale].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir l'escala de profunditat de dispersió subterrània en temps "
"d'execució, truqueu a [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the subsurface scattering effect. Higher values are "
"slower but look nicer. This affects the rendering of materials that have "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.subsurf_scatter_enabled] set to [code]true[/code], "
"along with [ShaderMaterial]s that set [code]SSS_STRENGTH[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"subsurface scattering quality at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_quality] instead."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la qualitat de l'efecte de dispersió subterrània. Els valors més "
"alts són més lents però semblen més agradables. Això afecta la representació "
"dels materials que tenen [member BaseMaterial3D.subsurf_scatter_enabled] "
"establert a [code]true[/code], juntament amb [ShaderMaterial]s que "
"estableixen [code]SSS_STRENGTH[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir la qualitat de dispersió subterrània en temps d'execució, "
"truqueu a [method RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_quality]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Scales the distance over which samples are taken for subsurface scattering "
"effect. Changing this does not impact performance, but higher values will "
"result in significant artifacts as the samples will become obviously spread "
"out. A lower value results in a smaller spread of scattered light. See also "
"[member rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_depth_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"subsurface scattering scale at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"Escala la distància a la qual es prenen les mostres per a l'efecte de "
"dispersió subterrània. Canviar-ho no afecta el rendiment, però els valors "
"més alts donaran lloc a artefactes importants, ja que les mostres s'estenen "
"evidentment. Un valor més baix provoca una dispersió menor de la llum "
"dispersa. Vegeu també [member rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_depth_scale].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir l'escala de dispersió subterrània en temps d'execució, truqueu "
"a [method RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enables filtering of the volumetric fog effect prior to integration. This "
"substantially blurs the fog which reduces fine details but also smooths out "
"harsh edges and aliasing artifacts. Disable when more detail is required."
msgstr ""
"Permet el filtratge de l'efecte de boira volumètrica abans de la integració. "
"Això difumina substancialment la boira que redueix els detalls fins, però "
"també suavitza les vores dures i els artefactes d'àlies. Desactiva quan es "
"requereixi més detalls."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of slices to use along the depth of the froxel buffer for volumetric "
"fog. A lower number will be more efficient but may result in artifacts "
"appearing during camera movement. See also [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_length]."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de rodanxes que s'han d'utilitzar al llarg de la profunditat del "
"buffer Froxel per a la boira volumètrica. Un nombre més baix serà més "
"eficient, però pot provocar que apareguin artefactes durant el moviment de "
"la càmera. Vegeu també [member Environment.volumetric_fog_length]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Base size used to determine size of froxel buffer in the camera X-axis and Y-"
"axis. The final size is scaled by the aspect ratio of the screen, so actual "
"values may differ from what is set. Set a larger size for more detailed fog, "
"set a smaller size for better performance."
msgstr ""
"Mida base utilitzada per determinar la mida de la memòria intermèdia de "
"froxel a l'eix X i l'eix Y de la càmera. La mida final s'escala segons la "
"relació d'aspecte de la pantalla, de manera que els valors reals poden "
"diferir del que s'estableix. Estableix una mida més gran per a una boira més "
"detallada, estableix una mida més petita per a un millor rendiment."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the driver to be used by the renderer when using the Compatibility "
"renderer. Editing this property has no effect in the default configuration, "
"as first-party platforms each have platform-specific overrides. Use those "
"overrides to configure the driver for each platform.\n"
"This can be overridden using the [code]--rendering-driver <driver>[/code] "
"command line argument.\n"
"Supported values are:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL 3.3 on desktop platforms, OpenGL ES 3.0 on "
"mobile platforms, WebGL 2.0 on web.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 using the ANGLE compatibility "
"layer, supported on macOS (over native OpenGL) and Windows (over Direct3D "
"11).\n"
"- [code]opengl3_es[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 on Linux/BSD.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The availability of these options depends on whether the engine "
"was compiled with support for them (determined by SCons options "
"[code]opengl3[/code] and [code]angle_libs[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual rendering driver may be automatically changed by the "
"engine as a result of a fallback, or a user-specified command line argument. "
"To get the actual rendering driver that is used at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_driver_name] instead of reading this "
"project setting's value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Android override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 from native drivers."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació d'Android per a [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Només s'admet una opció:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 des de controladors natius."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"iOS override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 from native drivers."
msgstr ""
"Substitució d'iOS per a [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Només s'admet una opció:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 des de controladors natius."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"LinuxBSD override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (default), OpenGL 3.3 from native drivers.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_es[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_gles] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if OpenGL 3.3 is not supported."
msgstr ""
"Substitució de LinuxBSD per a [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"S'admeten dues opcions:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (per defecte), OpenGL 3.3 des de controladors "
"natius.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_es[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 des de controladors natius. Si "
"[member rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_gles] està habilitat, "
"s'utilitza com a alternativa si OpenGL 3.3 no és compatible."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"macOS override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (default), OpenGL 3.3 from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if ANGLE is configured as the preferred driver but not supported.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 using the ANGLE compatibility "
"layer over native OpenGL drivers. If [member rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"fallback_to_angle] is enabled, this is used as a fallback if OpenGL 3.3 is "
"not supported."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de macOS per a [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"S'admeten dues opcions:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (per defecte), OpenGL 3.3 des de controladors natius. "
"Si [member rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] està habilitat, "
"s'utilitza com a alternativa si ANGLE està configurat com a controlador "
"preferit però no és compatible.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 utilitzant la capa de "
"compatibilitat ANGLE sobre controladors OpenGL natius. Si [member rendering/"
"gl_compatibility/fallback_to_angle] està habilitat, s'utilitza com a "
"alternativa si OpenGL 3.3 no és compatible."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Web override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], WebGL 2.0. The underlying native API depends on the "
"target OS, browser, and browser configuration."
msgstr ""
"Anulació web per a [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Només s'admet una opció:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], WebGL 2.0. L'API nativa subjacent depèn del sistema "
"operatiu, del navegador i de la configuració del navegador objectiu."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Windows override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (default), OpenGL 3.3 from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if ANGLE is configured as the preferred driver but not supported.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 using the ANGLE compatibility "
"layer over native Direct3D 11 drivers. If [member rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"fallback_to_angle] is enabled, this is used as a fallback if OpenGL 3.3 is "
"not supported. By default, ANGLE is used as the default driver for some "
"devices listed in [member rendering/gl_compatibility/force_angle_on_devices]."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de Windows per a [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"S'admeten dues opcions:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (per defecte), OpenGL 3.3 des de controladors natius. "
"Si [member rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] està habilitat, "
"s'utilitza com a alternativa si ANGLE està configurat com a controlador "
"preferit però no és compatible.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 utilitzant la capa de "
"compatibilitat ANGLE sobre controladors Direct3D 11 natius. Si [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_angle] està habilitat, s'utilitza com "
"a alternativa si OpenGL 3.3 no és compatible. Per defecte, ANGLE s'utilitza "
"com a controlador predeterminat per a alguns dispositius llistats a [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/force_angle_on_devices]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Compatibility renderer will fall back to ANGLE if "
"native OpenGL is not supported or the device is listed in [member rendering/"
"gl_compatibility/force_angle_on_devices].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Compatibility renderer will fall back to OpenGLES "
"if desktop OpenGL is not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Linux/X11."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Compatibility renderer will fall back to native "
"OpenGL if ANGLE is not supported, or ANGLE dynamic libraries aren't found.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"An [Array] of devices which should always use the ANGLE renderer.\n"
"Each entry is a [Dictionary] with the following keys: [code]vendor[/code] "
"and [code]name[/code]. [code]name[/code] can be set to [code]*[/code] to add "
"all devices with the specified [code]vendor[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Un [Array] de dispositius que sempre haurien d'utilitzar el renderitzador "
"ANGLE.\n"
"Cada entrada és un [Dictionary] amb les claus següents: [code]vendor[/code] "
"i [code]name[/code]. [code]name[/code] es pot establir a [code]*[/code] per "
"afegir tots els dispositius amb el [code]vendor[/code] especificat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració només s'implementa a Windows."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of canvas items commands that can be drawn in a single "
"viewport update. If more render commands are issued they will be ignored. "
"Decreasing this limit may improve performance on bandwidth limited devices. "
"Increase this limit if you find that not all objects are being drawn in a "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim d'ordres d'elements de llenç que es poden dibuixar en una única "
"actualització de la finestra gràfica. Si s'emeten més ordres de "
"renderització, s'ignoraran. Disminuir aquest límit pot millorar el rendiment "
"en dispositius amb ample de banda limitat. Augmenteu aquest límit si trobeu "
"que no es dibuixen tots els objectes en un marc."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables the threaded optimization feature from the "
"NVIDIA drivers, which are known to cause stuttering in most OpenGL "
"applications.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only works on Windows, as threaded optimization is "
"disabled by default on other platforms."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], desactiva la funció d'optimització de fils dels "
"controladors NVIDIA, que se sap que provoquen tartamudes a la majoria "
"d'aplicacions OpenGL.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració només funciona a Windows, ja que "
"l'optimització de fils està desactivada per defecte en altres plataformes."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders [VoxelGI] and SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) buffers at halved resolution (e.g. 960×540 when "
"the viewport size is 1920×1080). This improves performance significantly "
"when VoxelGI or SDFGI is enabled, at the cost of artifacts that may be "
"visible on polygon edges. The loss in quality becomes less noticeable as the "
"viewport resolution increases. [LightmapGI] rendering is not affected by "
"this setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set half-"
"resolution GI at run-time, call [method "
"RenderingServer.gi_set_use_half_resolution] instead."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], representa els buffers [VoxelGI] i SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) amb una resolució reduïda a la meitat (p. ex., "
"960×540 quan la mida de la finestra gràfica és de 1920×1080). Això millora "
"significativament el rendiment quan VoxelGI o SDFGI està habilitat, a costa "
"d'artefactes que poden ser visibles a les vores del polígon. La pèrdua de "
"qualitat es fa menys notable a mesura que augmenta la resolució de la "
"finestra gràfica. La representació de [LightmapGI] no es veu afectada per "
"aquesta configuració.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per establir una GI de mitja resolució en temps d'execució, truqueu a "
"[method RenderingServer.gi_set_use_half_resolution]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of frames to use for converging signed distance field global "
"illumination. Higher values lead to a less noisy result, at the cost of "
"taking a longer time to fully converge. This means the scene's global "
"illumination will be too dark for a longer period of time, especially when "
"the camera moves fast. The actual convergence speed depends on rendered "
"framerate. For example, with the default setting of 30 frames, rendering at "
"60 FPS will make SDFGI fully converge after 0.5 seconds. See also [member "
"rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights] and [member "
"rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"SDFGI convergence speed at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_converge] instead."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de fotogrames a utilitzar per a la il·luminació global del camp de "
"distància signada convergent. Els valors més alts condueixen a un resultat "
"menys sorollós, a costa de trigar més temps a convergir completament. Això "
"significa que la il·luminació global de l'escena serà massa fosca durant un "
"període de temps més llarg, especialment quan la càmera es mou ràpidament. "
"La velocitat de convergència real depèn de la velocitat de fotograma "
"representada. Per exemple, amb la configuració predeterminada de 30 "
"fotogrames, la representació a 60 FPS farà que SDFGI convergi completament "
"després de 0,5 segons. Vegeu també [member rendering/global_illumination/"
"sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights] i [member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per controlar la velocitat de convergència SDFGI en temps d'execució, "
"truqueu a [method RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_converge]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of frames over which dynamic lights should be updated in signed "
"distance field global illumination. Higher values take more time to update "
"indirect lighting coming from dynamic lights, but result in better "
"performance when many dynamic lights are present. See also [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_converge] and [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only affects [Light3D] nodes whose [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode] is [constant Light3D.BAKE_DYNAMIC] (which is the "
"default). Consider making non-moving lights use the [constant "
"Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] bake mode to improve performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"SDFGI light update speed at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_update_light] instead."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de fotogrames sobre els quals s'han d'actualitzar les llums "
"dinàmiques a la il·luminació global del camp de distància signada. Els "
"valors més alts necessiten més temps per actualitzar la il·luminació "
"indirecta procedent de les llums dinàmiques, però donen lloc a un millor "
"rendiment quan hi ha moltes llums dinàmiques. Vegeu també [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_converge] i [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només afecta els nodes [Light3D] amb [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode] [constant Light3D.BAKE_DYNAMIC] (que és el valor "
"predeterminat). Penseu en fer servir llums que no es mouen amb el mode de "
"cocció [constant Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] per millorar el rendiment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per controlar la velocitat d'actualització de la llum SDFGI en temps "
"d'execució, truqueu a [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_update_light]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to throw per frame when computing signed distance field "
"global illumination. Higher values lead to a less noisy result, at the cost "
"of performance. See also [member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_converge] and [member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_update_lights].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"SDFGI quality at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_ray_count] instead."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que cal llançar per fotograma quan es calcula la "
"il·luminació global del camp de distància signada. Valors més alts "
"condueixen a un resultat menys sorollós, a costa del rendiment. Vegeu també "
"[member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_converge] i [member "
"rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per controlar la qualitat SDFGI en temps d'execució, truqueu a [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_ray_count]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The VoxelGI quality to use. High quality leads to more precise lighting and "
"better reflections, but is slower to render. This setting does not affect "
"the baked data and doesn't require baking the [VoxelGI] again to apply.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"VoxelGI quality at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.voxel_gi_set_quality] instead."
msgstr ""
"La qualitat VoxelGI a utilitzar. L'alta qualitat condueix a una il·luminació "
"més precisa i millors reflexos, però és més lent de renderitzar. Aquesta "
"opció de configuració no afecta les dades enfornades i no requereix que "
"torneu a coure el [VoxelGI] per aplicar-lo.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per controlar la qualitat de VoxelGI en temps d'execució, truqueu a [method "
"RenderingServer.voxel_gi_set_quality]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of rays that can be thrown per pass when baking lightmaps "
"with [LightmapGI]. Depending on the scene, adjusting this value may result "
"in higher GPU utilization when baking lightmaps, leading to faster bake "
"times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause "
"crashes due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the "
"graphics driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de raigs que es poden llançar per passada quan s'elaboren "
"mapes de llum amb [LightmapGI]. Depenent de l'escena, ajustar aquest valor "
"pot donar lloc a una major utilització de la GPU quan es creen mapes de "
"llum, la qual cosa comportarà temps de cocció més ràpids.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'ús d'un valor massa alt per al vostre sistema pot provocar "
"errors perquè la GPU no respon durant llargs períodes de temps i el sistema "
"operatiu restableix el controlador de gràfics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of rays that can be thrown per pass when baking dynamic "
"object lighting in [LightmapProbe]s with [LightmapGI]. Depending on the "
"scene, adjusting this value may result in higher GPU utilization when baking "
"lightmaps, leading to faster bake times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause "
"crashes due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the "
"graphics driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de raigs que es poden llançar per passada quan es cou la "
"il·luminació d'objectes dinàmics a [LightmapProbe]s amb [LightmapGI]. "
"Depenent de l'escena, ajustar aquest valor pot donar lloc a una major "
"utilització de la GPU quan es creen mapes de llum, la qual cosa comportarà "
"temps de cocció més ràpids.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'ús d'un valor massa alt per al vostre sistema pot provocar "
"errors perquè la GPU no respon durant llargs períodes de temps i el sistema "
"operatiu restableix el controlador de gràfics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of retry rays that can be thrown per pass when hitting a "
"transparent surface when baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI]. Depending on "
"the scene, reducing this value may lead to faster bake times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause "
"crashes due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the "
"graphics driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de raigs de reintentar que es poden llançar per passada en "
"colpejar una superfície transparent quan s'enfornen mapes de llum amb "
"[LightmapGI]. Depenent de l'escena, reduir aquest valor pot comportar temps "
"de cocció més ràpids.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'ús d'un valor massa alt per al vostre sistema pot provocar "
"errors perquè la GPU no respon durant llargs períodes de temps i el sistema "
"operatiu restableix el controlador de gràfics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The region size to use when baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI]. The "
"specified value is rounded up to the nearest power of 2.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause "
"crashes due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the "
"graphics driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"La mida de la regió que s'ha d'utilitzar per fer mapes de llum amb "
"[LightmapGI]. El valor especificat s'arrodoneix a la potència més propera de "
"2.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'ús d'un valor massa alt per al vostre sistema pot provocar "
"errors perquè la GPU no respon durant llargs períodes de temps i el sistema "
"operatiu restableix el controlador de gràfics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per cuinar la il·luminació d'objectes "
"dinàmics a [LightmapProbe]s quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when "
"[member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per fer mapes de llum amb [LightmapGI] "
"quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per cuinar la il·luminació d'objectes "
"dinàmics a [LightmapProbe]s quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when "
"[member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per fer mapes de llum amb [LightmapGI] "
"quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per cuinar la il·luminació d'objectes "
"dinàmics a [LightmapProbe]s quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when "
"[member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per fer mapes de llum amb [LightmapGI] "
"quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per cuinar la il·luminació d'objectes "
"dinàmics a [LightmapProbe]s quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when "
"[member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs que s'utilitza per fer mapes de llum amb [LightmapGI] "
"quan [member LightmapGI.quality] és [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Denoiser tool used for denoising lightmaps.\n"
"Using [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/]OpenImageDenoise[/url] (OIDN) "
"requires configuring a path to an OIDN executable in the editor settings at "
"[member EditorSettings.filesystem/tools/oidn/oidn_denoise_path]. OIDN can be "
"downloaded from [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/"
"downloads.html]OpenImageDenoise's downloads page[/url].\n"
"OIDN will use GPU acceleration when available. Unlike JNLM which uses "
"compute shaders for acceleration, OIDN uses vendor-specific acceleration "
"methods. For GPU acceleration to be available, the following libraries must "
"be installed on the system depending on your GPU:\n"
"- NVIDIA GPUs: CUDA libraries\n"
"- AMD GPUs: HIP libraries\n"
"- Intel GPUs: SYCL libraries\n"
"If no GPU acceleration is configured on the system, multi-threaded CPU-based "
"denoising will be performed instead. This CPU-based denoising is "
"significantly slower than the JNLM denoiser in most cases."
msgstr ""
"Eina de reducció de soroll que s'utilitza per eliminar mapes de llum.\n"
"L'ús de [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/]OpenImageDenoise[/url] (OIDN) "
"requereix configurar un camí a un executable OIDN a la configuració de "
"l'editor a [member EditorSettings.filesystem/tools/oidn/oidn_denoise_path]. "
"L'OIDN es pot descarregar des de la pàgina de descàrregues de [url=https://"
"www.openimagedenoise.org/downloads.html]OpenImageDenoise[/url].\n"
"OIDN utilitzarà l'acceleració GPU quan estigui disponible. A diferència de "
"JNLM que utilitza ombrejats de càlcul per a l'acceleració, OIDN utilitza "
"mètodes d'acceleració específics del proveïdor. Perquè l'acceleració de la "
"GPU estigui disponible, les biblioteques següents s'han d'instal·lar al "
"sistema en funció de la vostra GPU:\n"
"- GPU NVIDIA: biblioteques CUDA\n"
"- GPU AMD: biblioteques HIP\n"
"- GPU Intel: biblioteques SYCL\n"
"Si no es configura cap acceleració de la GPU al sistema, es realitzarà una "
"eliminació de soroll basat en CPU multiprocés. Aquest denoising basat en CPU "
"és significativament més lent que el denoiser JNLM en la majoria dels casos."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], applies a bicubic filter during lightmap sampling. "
"This makes lightmaps look much smoother, at a moderate performance cost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The bicubic filter exaggerates the 'bleeding' effect that "
"occurs when a lightmap's resolution is low enough."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aplica un filtre bicúbic durant el mostreig del mapa "
"de llum. Això fa que els mapes de llum semblin molt més suaus, amb un cost "
"de rendiment moderat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El filtre bicúbic exagera l'efecte \"sagnat\" que es produeix "
"quan la resolució d'un mapa de llum és prou baixa."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The texel_size that is used to calculate the [member "
"Mesh.lightmap_size_hint] on [PrimitiveMesh] resources if [member "
"PrimitiveMesh.add_uv2] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"La mida_texel que s'utilitza per calcular els recursos [member "
"Mesh.lightmap_size_hint] als recursos [PrimitiveMesh] si [member "
"PrimitiveMesh.add_uv2] està habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The framerate-independent update speed when representing dynamic object "
"lighting from [LightmapProbe]s. Higher values make dynamic object lighting "
"update faster. Higher values can prevent fast-moving objects from having "
"\"outdated\" indirect lighting displayed on them, at the cost of possible "
"flickering when an object moves from a bright area to a shaded area.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the BVH build quality at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.lightmap_set_probe_capture_update_speed]."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat d'actualització independent de la velocitat de fotogrames quan "
"es representa la il·luminació d'objectes dinàmics de [LightmapProbe]s. Els "
"valors més alts fan que la il·luminació d'objectes dinàmics actualitzin més "
"ràpidament. Els valors més alts poden evitar que els objectes que es mouen "
"ràpidament tinguin una il·luminació indirecta \"obsoleta\", a costa d'un "
"possible parpelleig quan un objecte es mou d'una zona lluminosa a una zona "
"ombrejada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per ajustar la qualitat de compilació de BVH en temps d'execució, utilitzeu "
"[method RenderingServer.lightmap_set_probe_capture_update_speed]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Use 16 bits for the directional shadow depth map. Enabling this results in "
"shadows having less precision and may result in shadow acne, but can lead to "
"performance improvements on some devices."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu 16 bits per al mapa direccional de profunditat d'ombra. Si activeu "
"això, les ombres tenen menys precisió i pot provocar acne d'ombra, però pot "
"provocar millores de rendiment en alguns dispositius."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The directional shadow's size in pixels. Higher values will result in "
"sharper shadows, at the cost of performance. The value is rounded up to the "
"nearest power of 2."
msgstr ""
"Mida de l'ombra direccional en píxels. Els valors més alts donaran lloc a "
"ombres més nítides, a costa del rendiment. El valor s'arrodoneix a la "
"potència més propera de 2."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/size] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or "
"driver support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/size] en dispositius mòbils, a causa de problemes de "
"rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Quality setting for shadows cast by [DirectionalLight3D]s. Higher quality "
"settings use more samples when reading from shadow maps and are thus slower. "
"Low quality settings may result in shadows looking grainy.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Soft Very Low setting will automatically multiply "
"[i]constant[/i] shadow blur by 0.75x to reduce the amount of noise visible. "
"This automatic blur change only affects the constant blur factor defined in "
"[member Light3D.shadow_blur], not the variable blur performed by "
"[DirectionalLight3D]s' [member Light3D.light_angular_distance].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Soft High and Soft Ultra settings will automatically "
"multiply [i]constant[/i] shadow blur by 1.5× and 2× respectively to make "
"better use of the increased sample count. This increased blur also improves "
"stability of dynamic object shadows."
msgstr ""
"Configuració de qualitat per a les ombres projectades per "
"[DirectionalLight3D]s. Els paràmetres de major qualitat utilitzen més "
"mostres quan llegeixen els mapes d'ombres i, per tant, són més lents. Els "
"paràmetres de baixa qualitat poden fer que les ombres semblin granulades.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La configuració suau molt baix multiplicarà automàticament "
"[i]constant[/i] el desenfocament d'ombra en 0,75x per reduir la quantitat de "
"soroll visible. Aquest canvi de desenfocament automàtic només afecta el "
"factor de desenfocament constant definit a [member Light3D.shadow_blur], no "
"el desenfocament variable realitzat per [member "
"Light3D.light_angular_distance] de [DirectionalLight3D]s.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els paràmetres Soft High i Soft Ultra multiplicaran "
"automàticament [i]constant[/i] el desenfocament d'ombra per 1,5× i 2× "
"respectivament per fer un millor ús del recompte de mostres augmentat. "
"Aquest desenfocament augmentat també millora l'estabilitat de les ombres "
"d'objectes dinàmics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality] on mobile devices, due to "
"performance concerns or driver support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality] en dispositius mòbils, a "
"causa de problemes de rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml doc/classes/Viewport.xml
msgid ""
"Use 16 bits for the omni/spot shadow depth map. Enabling this results in "
"shadows having less precision and may result in shadow acne, but can lead to "
"performance improvements on some devices."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu 16 bits per al mapa de profunditat d'ombra omni/punt. Si activeu "
"això, les ombres tenen menys precisió i pot provocar acne d'ombra, però pot "
"provocar millores de rendiment en alguns dispositius."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the first quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de subdivisió del primer quadrant de l'atles d'ombra. Consulteu "
"la [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the second quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de subdivisió del segon quadrant de l'atles d'ombra. Consulteu "
"la [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the third quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de subdivisió del tercer quadrant de l'atles d'ombra. Consulteu "
"la [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the fourth quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de subdivisió del quart quadrant de l'atles d'ombra. Consulteu "
"la [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the shadow atlas used for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D] nodes. "
"See the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"La mida de l'atles d'ombra utilitzat per als nodes [OmniLight3D] i "
"[SpotLight3D]. Consulteu la [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/"
"lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-atlas]documentation[/url] per obtenir més "
"informació."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"positional_shadow/atlas_size] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns "
"or driver support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"positional_shadow/atlas_size] en dispositius mòbils, a causa de problemes de "
"rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Quality setting for shadows cast by [OmniLight3D]s and [SpotLight3D]s. "
"Higher quality settings use more samples when reading from shadow maps and "
"are thus slower. Low quality settings may result in shadows looking grainy.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Soft Very Low setting will automatically multiply "
"[i]constant[/i] shadow blur by 0.75x to reduce the amount of noise visible. "
"This automatic blur change only affects the constant blur factor defined in "
"[member Light3D.shadow_blur], not the variable blur performed by "
"[DirectionalLight3D]s' [member Light3D.light_angular_distance].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Soft High and Soft Ultra settings will automatically "
"multiply shadow blur by 1.5× and 2× respectively to make better use of the "
"increased sample count. This increased blur also improves stability of "
"dynamic object shadows."
msgstr ""
"Configuració de qualitat per a les ombres projectades per [OmniLight3D]s i "
"[SpotLight3D]s. Els paràmetres de major qualitat utilitzen més mostres quan "
"llegeixen els mapes d'ombres i, per tant, són més lents. Els paràmetres de "
"baixa qualitat poden fer que les ombres semblin granulades.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La configuració suau molt baix multiplicarà automàticament "
"[i]constant[/i] el desenfocament d'ombra en 0,75x per reduir la quantitat de "
"soroll visible. Aquest canvi de desenfocament automàtic només afecta el "
"factor de desenfocament constant definit a [member Light3D.shadow_blur], no "
"el desenfocament variable realitzat per [member "
"Light3D.light_angular_distance] de [DirectionalLight3D]s.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els paràmetres Soft High i Soft Ultra multiplicaran "
"automàticament el desenfocament de l'ombra per 1,5× i 2× respectivament per "
"fer un millor ús del recompte de mostres augmentat. Aquest desenfocament "
"augmentat també millora l'estabilitat de les ombres d'objectes dinàmics."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"positional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality] on mobile devices, due to "
"performance concerns or driver support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"positional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality] en dispositius mòbils, a causa "
"de problemes de rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], items that cannot cast shadows into the view frustum "
"will not be rendered into shadow maps.\n"
"This can increase performance."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els elements que no poden projectar ombres al tronc de "
"la vista no es convertiran en mapes d'ombres.\n"
"Això pot augmentar el rendiment."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enables the use of physically based units for light sources. Physically "
"based units tend to be much larger than the arbitrary units used by Godot, "
"but they can be used to match lighting within Godot to real-world lighting. "
"Due to the large dynamic range of lighting conditions present in nature, "
"Godot bakes exposure into the various lighting quantities before rendering. "
"Most light sources bake exposure automatically at run time based on the "
"active [CameraAttributes] resource, but [LightmapGI] and [VoxelGI] require a "
"[CameraAttributes] resource to be set at bake time to reduce the dynamic "
"range. At run time, Godot will automatically reconcile the baked exposure "
"with the active exposure to ensure lighting remains consistent."
msgstr ""
"Permet l'ús d'unitats de base física per a fonts de llum. Les unitats de "
"base física solen ser molt més grans que les unitats arbitràries utilitzades "
"per Godot, però es poden utilitzar per combinar la il·luminació de Godot amb "
"la il·luminació del món real. A causa de l'ampli rang dinàmic de condicions "
"d'il·luminació presents a la natura, Godot fa l'exposició a les diferents "
"quantitats d'il·luminació abans de la representació. La majoria de les fonts "
"de llum s'exposen automàticament en temps d'execució en funció del recurs "
"[CameraAttributes] actiu, però [LightmapGI] i [VoxelGI] requereixen que un "
"recurs [CameraAttributes] s'estableixi en el temps de cocció per reduir el "
"rang dinàmic. En temps d'execució, Godot conciliarà automàticament "
"l'exposició al forn amb l'exposició activa per garantir que la il·luminació "
"es mantingui constant."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of clustered elements ([OmniLight3D] + [SpotLight3D] + "
"[Decal] + [ReflectionProbe]) that can be rendered at once in the camera "
"view. If there are more clustered elements present in the camera view, some "
"of them will not be rendered (leading to pop-in during camera movement). "
"Enabling distance fade on lights and decals ([member "
"Light3D.distance_fade_enabled], [member Decal.distance_fade_enabled]) can "
"help avoid reaching this limit.\n"
"Decreasing this value may improve GPU performance on certain setups, even if "
"the maximum number of clustered elements is never reached in the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Forward+ "
"rendering method, not Mobile and Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim d'elements agrupats ([OmniLight3D] + [SpotLight3D] + [Decal] "
"+ [ReflectionProbe]) que es poden representar alhora a la vista de la "
"càmera. Si hi ha més elements agrupats presents a la vista de la càmera, "
"alguns d'ells no es renderitzaran (provocant un pop-in durant el moviment de "
"la càmera). Habilitar l'esvaïment a distància a les llums i adhesius "
"([member Light3D.distance_fade_enabled], [member "
"Decal.distance_fade_enabled]) pot ajudar a evitar arribar a aquest límit.\n"
"Disminuir aquest valor pot millorar el rendiment de la GPU en determinades "
"configuracions, fins i tot si mai s'arriba al nombre màxim d'elements "
"agrupats al projecte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració només és efectiva quan s'utilitza el "
"mètode de representació Endavant+, no Mòbil i Compatibilitat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of uniforms that can be used by the global shader uniform "
"buffer. Each item takes up one slot. In other words, a single uniform float "
"and a uniform vec4 will take the same amount of space in the buffer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Compatibility renderer, most mobile devices (and "
"all web exports) will be limited to a maximum size of 1024 due to hardware "
"constraints."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim d'uniformes que pot utilitzar el buffer d'uniformes global "
"shader. Cada element ocupa un espai. En altres paraules, un únic flotador "
"uniforme i un vec4 uniforme ocuparan la mateixa quantitat d'espai al "
"buffer.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'utilitza el renderitzador de compatibilitat, la majoria "
"de dispositius mòbils (i totes les exportacions web) es limitaran a una mida "
"màxima de 1024 a causa de les restriccions de maquinari."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Max number of omnilights and spotlights renderable per object. At the "
"default value of 8, this means that each surface can be affected by up to 8 "
"omnilights and 8 spotlights. This is further limited by hardware support and "
"[member rendering/limits/opengl/max_renderable_lights]. Setting this low "
"will slightly reduce memory usage, may decrease shader compile times, and "
"may result in faster rendering on low-end, mobile, or web devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, not Forward+ and Mobile."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim d'omnilights i focus renderitzables per objecte. Amb el valor "
"predeterminat de 8, això significa que cada superfície es pot veure afectada "
"per fins a 8 omnilights i 8 focus. Això està encara més limitat pel suport "
"de maquinari i [member rendering/limits/opengl/max_renderable_lights]. "
"Establir aquest valor baix reduirà lleugerament l'ús de memòria, pot reduir "
"els temps de compilació de l'ombrejat i pot provocar una renderització més "
"ràpida en dispositius de gamma baixa, mòbils o web.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració només és efectiva quan s'utilitza el "
"mètode de representació de compatibilitat, no Reenvia+ i mòbil."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Max number of elements renderable in a frame. If more elements than this are "
"visible per frame, they will not be drawn. Keep in mind elements refer to "
"mesh surfaces and not meshes themselves. Setting this low will slightly "
"reduce memory usage and may decrease shader compile times, particularly on "
"web. For most uses, the default value is suitable, but consider lowering as "
"much as possible on web export.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, not Forward+ and Mobile."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim d'elements renderitzables en un marc. Si hi ha més elements "
"visibles per fotograma, no es dibuixaran. Tingueu en compte que els elements "
"es refereixen a superfícies de malla i no a les malles en si. Establir "
"aquest nivell baix reduirà lleugerament l'ús de memòria i pot reduir els "
"temps de compilació de l'ombrejat, especialment al web. Per a la majoria "
"d'usos, el valor predeterminat és adequat, però considereu reduir el màxim "
"possible a l'exportació web.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest paràmetre només és efectiu quan s'utilitza el mètode de "
"representació de compatibilitat, no Forward+ i Mobile."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Max number of positional lights renderable in a frame. If more lights than "
"this number are used, they will be ignored. Setting this low will slightly "
"reduce memory usage and may decrease shader compile times, particularly on "
"web. For most uses, the default value is suitable, but consider lowering as "
"much as possible on web export.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, not Forward+ and Mobile."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim de llums de posició que es poden renderitzar en un marc. Si "
"s'utilitzen més llums que aquest nombre, s'ignoraran. Establir aquest nivell "
"baix reduirà lleugerament l'ús de memòria i pot reduir els temps de "
"compilació de l'ombrejat, especialment al web. Per a la majoria d'usos, el "
"valor predeterminat és adequat, però considereu reduir el màxim possible a "
"l'exportació web.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest paràmetre només és efectiu quan s'utilitza el mètode de "
"representació de compatibilitat, no Forward+ i Mobile."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum number of instances that must be present in a scene to enable "
"culling computations on multiple threads. If a scene has fewer instances "
"than this number, culling is done on a single thread."
msgstr ""
"El nombre mínim d'instàncies que han d'estar presents en una escena per "
"permetre els càlculs d'eliminació en diversos fils. Si una escena té menys "
"casos que aquest nombre, l'eliminació es fa en un sol fil."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum time (in seconds) before the [code]TIME[/code] shader built-in "
"variable rolls over. The [code]TIME[/code] variable increments by "
"[code]delta[/code] each frame, and when it exceeds this value, it rolls over "
"to [code]0.0[/code]. Since large floating-point values are less precise than "
"small floating-point values, this should be set as low as possible to "
"maximize the precision of the [code]TIME[/code] built-in variable in "
"shaders. This is especially important on mobile platforms where precision in "
"shaders is significantly reduced. However, if this is set too low, shader "
"animations may appear to restart from the beginning while the project is "
"running.\n"
"On desktop platforms, values below [code]4096[/code] are recommended, "
"ideally below [code]2048[/code]. On mobile platforms, values below [code]64[/"
"code] are recommended, ideally below [code]32[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The automatic LOD bias to use for meshes rendered within the "
"[ReflectionProbe]. Higher values will use less detailed versions of meshes "
"that have LOD variations generated. If set to [code]0.0[/code], automatic "
"LOD is disabled. Increase [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/"
"threshold_pixels] to improve performance at the cost of geometry detail.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on the mesh's attributes (vertex colors, blend "
"shapes, ...), a mesh may have fewer levels of LOD generated to avoid visible "
"distortion of the mesh once it is affected by vertex colors or blend shapes. "
"Meshes with a very low vertex count will also not have any LODs generated, "
"which means this setting will not affect them at all. In general, this "
"setting makes the largest impact on static meshes with a high vertex count.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/threshold_pixels] does "
"not affect [GeometryInstance3D] visibility ranges (also known as \"manual\" "
"LOD or hierarchical LOD).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the automatic LOD threshold at runtime, set [member "
"Viewport.mesh_lod_threshold] on the root [Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"El biaix de LOD automàtic que s'ha d'utilitzar per a les malles "
"representades dins de [ReflectionProbe]. Els valors més alts utilitzaran "
"versions menys detallades de malles que tinguin variacions de LOD generades. "
"Si s'estableix a [code]0.0[/code], el LOD automàtic està desactivat. "
"Augmenta [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/threshold_pixels] per "
"millorar el rendiment a costa del detall de la geometria.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Depenent dels atributs de la malla (colors de vèrtex, formes de "
"barreja, ...), una malla pot tenir menys nivells de LOD generats per evitar "
"la distorsió visible de la malla una vegada que es vegi afectada pels colors "
"del vèrtex o les formes de barreja. Les malles amb un recompte de vèrtexs "
"molt baix tampoc no tindran cap LOD generat, el que significa que aquesta "
"configuració no els afectarà en absolut. En general, aquesta configuració té "
"l'impacte més gran a les malles estàtiques amb un recompte de vèrtexs "
"elevat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/threshold_pixels] no "
"afecta els intervals de visibilitat de [GeometryInstance3D] (també coneguts "
"com a LOD \"manual\" o LOD jeràrquic).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per ajustar el llindar de LOD automàtic en temps d'execució, configureu "
"[member Viewport.mesh_lod_threshold] a l'arrel [Viewport]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bounding_volume_hierarchy]Bounding "
"Volume Hierarchy[/url] quality to use when rendering the occlusion culling "
"buffer. Higher values will result in more accurate occlusion culling, at the "
"cost of higher CPU usage. See also [member rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"occlusion_rays_per_thread].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the BVH build quality at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_culling_build_quality]."
msgstr ""
"La qualitat [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bounding_volume_hierarchy]Bounding Volume Hierarchy[/url] que s'ha "
"d'utilitzar en renderitzar el buffer d'eliminació d'oclusió. Els valors més "
"alts donaran lloc a una eliminació d'oclusió més precisa, a costa d'un ús "
"més elevat de la CPU. Vegeu també [member rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"occlusion_rays_per_thread].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per ajustar la qualitat de compilació de BVH en temps d'execució, utilitzeu "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_culling_build_quality]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the projection used for rendering the occlusion buffer "
"will be jittered. This can help prevent objects being incorrectly culled "
"when visible through small gaps."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la projecció utilitzada per representar la memòria "
"intermèdia d'oclusió es veurà alterada. Això pot ajudar a evitar que els "
"objectes siguin seleccionats incorrectament quan siguin visibles a través de "
"petits buits."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of occlusion rays traced per CPU thread. Higher values will "
"result in more accurate occlusion culling, at the cost of higher CPU usage. "
"The occlusion culling buffer's pixel count is roughly equal to "
"[code]occlusion_rays_per_thread * number_of_logical_cpu_cores[/code], so it "
"will depend on the system's CPU. Therefore, CPUs with fewer cores will use a "
"lower resolution to attempt keeping performance costs even across devices. "
"See also [member rendering/occlusion_culling/bvh_build_quality].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the number of occlusion rays traced per thread at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_rays_per_thread]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de raigs d'oclusió traçats per fil de la CPU. Els valors més alts "
"donaran lloc a una eliminació d'oclusió més precisa, a costa d'un ús més "
"elevat de la CPU. El recompte de píxels del buffer d'eliminació d'oclusió és "
"aproximadament igual a [code]occlusion_rays_per_thread * "
"number_of_logical_cpu_cores[/code], de manera que dependrà de la CPU del "
"sistema. Per tant, les CPU amb menys nuclis utilitzaran una resolució més "
"baixa per intentar mantenir els costos de rendiment fins i tot entre "
"dispositius. Vegeu també [member rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"bvh_build_quality].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per ajustar el nombre de raigs d'oclusió traçats per fil en temps "
"d'execució, utilitzeu [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_rays_per_thread]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [OccluderInstance3D] nodes will be usable for "
"occlusion culling in 3D in the root viewport. In custom viewports, [member "
"Viewport.use_occlusion_culling] must be set to [code]true[/code] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling occlusion culling has a cost on the CPU. Only enable "
"occlusion culling if you actually plan to use it. Large open scenes with few "
"or no objects blocking the view will generally not benefit much from "
"occlusion culling. Large open scenes generally benefit more from mesh LOD "
"and visibility ranges ([member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] "
"and [member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_end]) compared to occlusion "
"culling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to memory constraints, occlusion culling is not supported "
"by default in Web export templates. It can be enabled by compiling custom "
"Web export templates with [code]module_raycast_enabled=yes[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els nodes [OccluderInstance3D] es podran utilitzar per "
"a l'eliminació d'oclusió en 3D a la finestra d'arrel. A les finestres "
"personalitzades, [member Viewport.use_occlusion_culling] s'ha d'establir a "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Habilitar l'eliminació d'oclusió té un cost per a la CPU. Només "
"activeu l'eliminació d'oclusió si realment teniu previst utilitzar-lo. Les "
"escenes obertes grans amb pocs objectes o cap objecte que bloquegen la vista "
"generalment no es beneficiaran gaire de l'eliminació d'oclusió. Les escenes "
"obertes grans generalment es beneficien més del LOD de malla i els intervals "
"de visibilitat ([member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] i [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_end]) en comparació amb l'eliminació "
"d'oclusió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa de les limitacions de memòria, l'eliminació d'oclusió "
"no s'admet de manera predeterminada a les plantilles d'exportació web. Es "
"pot activar compilant plantilles d'exportació web personalitzades amb "
"[code]module_raycast_enabled=yes[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of cubemaps to store in the reflection atlas. The number of "
"[ReflectionProbe]s in a scene will be limited by this amount. A higher "
"number requires more VRAM."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de mapes de cub per emmagatzemar a l'atles de reflexió. El nombre de "
"[ReflectionProbe]s en una escena estarà limitat per aquesta quantitat. Un "
"nombre més alt requereix més VRAM."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Size of cubemap faces for [ReflectionProbe]s. A higher number requires more "
"VRAM and may make reflection probe updating slower."
msgstr ""
"Mida de les cares de cubemap per a [ReflectionProbe]s. Un nombre més alt "
"requereix més VRAM i pot fer que l'actualització de la sonda de reflexió "
"sigui més lenta."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/reflection_atlas/"
"reflection_size] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/reflections/"
"reflection_atlas/reflection_size] en dispositius mòbils, a causa de "
"problemes de rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Use a higher quality variant of the fast filtering algorithm. Significantly "
"slower than using default quality, but results in smoother reflections. "
"Should only be used when the scene is especially detailed."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu una variant de més qualitat de l'algorisme de filtratge ràpid. "
"Significativament més lent que l'ús de la qualitat predeterminada, però "
"resulta en reflexos més suaus. Només s'ha d'utilitzar quan l'escena és "
"especialment detallada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the number of samples to take when using importance sampling for [Sky]s "
"and [ReflectionProbe]s. A higher value will result in smoother, higher "
"quality reflections, but increases time to calculate radiance maps. In "
"general, fewer samples are needed for simpler, low dynamic range "
"environments while more samples are needed for HDR environments and "
"environments with a high level of detail."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nombre de mostres a prendre quan s'utilitza el mostreig "
"d'importància per a [Sky]s i [ReflectionProbe]s. Un valor més alt donarà "
"lloc a reflexos més suaus i de major qualitat, però augmenta el temps per "
"calcular els mapes de radiació. En general, es necessiten menys mostres per "
"a entorns més senzills i de rang dinàmic baix, mentre que es necessiten més "
"mostres per a entorns HDR i entorns amb un alt nivell de detall."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/reflections/"
"sky_reflections/ggx_samples] en dispositius mòbils, a causa de problemes de "
"rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Limits the number of layers to use in radiance maps when using importance "
"sampling. A lower number will be slightly faster and take up less VRAM."
msgstr ""
"Limita el nombre de capes que s'han d'utilitzar als mapes de radiació quan "
"s'utilitza el mostreig d'importància. Un nombre més baix serà una mica més "
"ràpid i ocuparà menys VRAM."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses texture arrays instead of mipmaps for reflection "
"probes and panorama backgrounds (sky). This reduces jitter noise and "
"upscaling artifacts on reflections, but is significantly slower to compute "
"and uses [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers] "
"times more memory.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Texture array reflections are always disabled on macOS on Intel "
"GPUs due to driver bugs."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], utilitza matrius de textures en lloc de mipmaps per a "
"sondes de reflexió i fons panoràmics (cel). Això redueix el soroll de "
"fluctuació i els artefactes d'augment d'escala en els reflexos, però és molt "
"més lent de calcular i utilitza [member rendering/reflections/"
"sky_reflections/roughness_layers] vegades més memòria.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els reflexos de la matriu de textures sempre estan desactivats "
"a macOS a les GPU Intel a causa d'errors del controlador."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"texture_array_reflections] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or "
"driver support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/reflections/"
"sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections] en dispositius mòbils, a causa de "
"problemes de rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], reduces reflections based on ambient light."
msgstr ""
"Si és [code]true[/code], redueix les reflexions en funció de la llum "
"ambiental."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the renderer that will be used by the project. Options are:\n"
"[b]forward_plus[/b] (Forward+): High-end renderer designed for desktop "
"devices. Has a higher base overhead, but scales well with complex scenes. "
"Not suitable for older devices or mobile.\n"
"[b]mobile[/b] (Mobile): Modern renderer designed for mobile devices. Has a "
"lower base overhead than Forward+, but does not scale as well to large "
"scenes with many elements.\n"
"[b]gl_compatibility[/b] (Compatibility): Low-end renderer designed for older "
"devices. Based on the limitations of the OpenGL 3.3 / OpenGL ES 3.0 / WebGL "
"2 APIs. Lighting calculations are performed on nonlinear sRGB-encoded color "
"data, which produces inaccurate results that may look acceptable for some "
"games.\n"
"This can be overridden using the [code]--rendering-method <method>[/code] "
"command line argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual rendering method may be automatically changed by the "
"engine as a result of a fallback, or a user-specified command line argument. "
"To get the actual rendering method that is used at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_method] instead of reading this "
"project setting's value."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el renderitzador que utilitzarà el projecte. Les opcions són:\n"
"[b]forward_plus[/b] (Endavant+): renderitzador de gamma alta dissenyat per a "
"dispositius d'escriptori. Té una base més alta, però s'escala bé amb escenes "
"complexes. No apte per a dispositius antics o mòbils.\n"
"[b]mobile[/b] (Mòbil): renderitzador modern dissenyat per a dispositius "
"mòbils. Té una sobrecàrrega de base més baixa que Forward+, però no s'escala "
"tan bé a escenes grans amb molts elements.\n"
"[b]gl_compatibility[/b] (Compatibilitat): renderitzador de gamma baixa "
"dissenyat per a dispositius més antics. Basat en les limitacions de les API "
"OpenGL 3.3 / OpenGL ES 3.0 / WebGL 2. Els càlculs d'il·luminació es "
"realitzen amb dades de color codificades per sRGB no lineals, la qual cosa "
"produeix resultats inexactes que poden semblar acceptables per a alguns "
"jocs.\n"
"Això es pot substituir mitjançant l'argument de línia d'ordres [code]--"
"rendering-method <method>[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El motor pot canviar automàticament el mètode de representació "
"real com a resultat d'una alternativa o d'un argument de línia d'ordres "
"especificat per l'usuari. Per obtenir el mètode de representació real que "
"s'utilitza en temps d'execució, utilitzeu [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_method] en comptes de llegir el valor "
"d'aquesta configuració del projecte."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Override for [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] on mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"Anul·la per a [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] en dispositius "
"mòbils."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Override for [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] on web."
msgstr "Anul·lació per a [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] al web."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Version code of the [url=https://devblogs.microsoft.com/directx/"
"directx12agility/]Direct3D 12 Agility SDK[/url] to use "
"([code]D3D12SDKVersion[/code]). This must match the [i]minor[/i] version "
"that is installed next to the editor binary and in the export templates "
"directory for the current editor version. For example, if you have "
"[code]1.618.5[/code] installed, you need to input [code]618[/code] here."
msgstr ""
"Codi de versió de [url=https://devblogs.microsoft.com/directx/"
"directx12agility/]Direct3D 12 Agility SDK[/url] per utilitzar "
"([code]D3D12SDKVersion[/code]). Això ha de coincidir amb la versió [i]minor[/"
"i] instal·lada al costat del binari de l'editor i al directori de plantilles "
"d'exportació per a la versió actual de l'editor. Per exemple, si teniu "
"[code]1.618.5[/code] instal·lat, heu d'introduir [code]618[/code] aquí."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of entries in the resource descriptor heap the Direct3D 12 "
"rendering driver uses for most rendering operations.\n"
"Depending on the complexity of scenes, this value may be lowered or may need "
"to be raised."
msgstr ""
"El nombre d'entrades a la pila de descriptors de recursos que utilitza el "
"controlador de representació Direct3D 12 per a la majoria de les operacions "
"de representació.\n"
"Depenent de la complexitat de les escenes, aquest valor es pot reduir o cal "
"augmentar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of entries in the sampler descriptor heap the Direct3D 12 "
"rendering driver uses for most rendering operations.\n"
"Depending on the complexity of scenes, this value may be lowered or may need "
"to be raised."
msgstr ""
"El nombre d'entrades a la pila de descriptors de mostreig que el controlador "
"de renderització Direct3D 12 utilitza per a la majoria de les operacions de "
"representació.\n"
"Depenent de la complexitat de les escenes, aquest valor es pot reduir o cal "
"augmentar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the driver to be used by the renderer when using a RenderingDevice-"
"based renderer like the Forward+ or Mobile renderers. Editing this property "
"has no effect in the default configuration, as first-party platforms each "
"have platform-specific overrides. Use those overrides to configure the "
"driver for each platform.\n"
"This can be overridden using the [code]--rendering-driver <driver>[/code] "
"command line argument.\n"
"Supported values are:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code], Metal (supported on Apple Silicon Macs and iOS).\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan (supported on all desktop and mobile "
"platforms).\n"
"- [code]d3d12[/code], Direct3D 12 (supported on Windows).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The availability of these options depends on whether the engine "
"was compiled with support for them (determined by SCons options "
"[code]vulkan[/code], [code]metal[/code], and [code]d3d12[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a given platform has no registered drivers, it can fall back "
"to the Compatibility renderer (OpenGL 3) if [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/fallback_to_opengl3] is enabled. This fallback happens "
"automatically for the Web platform regardless of that property.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual rendering driver may be automatically changed by the "
"engine as a result of a fallback, or a user-specified command line argument. "
"To get the actual rendering driver that is used at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_driver_name] instead of reading this "
"project setting's value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Android override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan from native drivers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If Vulkan was disabled at compile time, there is no alternative "
"RenderingDevice driver."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació d'Android per a [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Només s'admet una opció:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan dels controladors natius.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si Vulkan estava desactivat en temps de compilació, no hi ha "
"cap controlador alternatiu de RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"iOS override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (default), Metal from native drivers.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan over Metal via MoltenVK."
msgstr ""
"Substitució d'iOS per a [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"S'admeten dues opcions:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (per defecte), metall dels controladors natius.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan sobre metall mitjançant MoltenVK."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"LinuxBSD override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan from native drivers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If Vulkan was disabled at compile time, there is no alternative "
"RenderingDevice driver."
msgstr ""
"Substitució de LinuxBSD per a [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Només s'admet una opció:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan dels controladors natius.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si Vulkan estava desactivat en temps de compilació, no hi ha "
"cap controlador alternatiu de RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"macOS override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (default), Metal from native drivers, only supported on "
"Apple Silicon Macs. On Intel Macs, it will automatically fall back to "
"[code]vulkan[/code] as Metal support is not implemented.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan over Metal via MoltenVK, supported on both "
"Apple Silicon and Intel Macs."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de macOS per a [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"S'admeten dues opcions:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (per defecte), metall dels controladors natius, només "
"compatible amb Apple Silicon Mac. En els Mac Intel, es tornarà "
"automàticament a [code]vulkan[/code] ja que el suport de metall no està "
"implementat.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan sobre metall mitjançant MoltenVK, compatible "
"tant amb Apple Silicon com amb Intel Mac."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"visionOS override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (default), Metal from native drivers."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de visionOS per a [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Només s'admet una opció:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (per defecte), metall dels controladors natius."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Windows override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code] (default), Vulkan from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/rendering_device/fallback_to_vulkan] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if Direct3D 12 is not supported.\n"
"- [code]d3d12[/code], Direct3D 12 from native drivers. If [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/fallback_to_d3d12] is enabled, this is used as a fallback "
"if Vulkan is not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Starting with Godot 4.6, new projects are configured by default "
"to use [code]d3d12[/code] on Windows. Projects created before Godot 4.6 keep "
"[code]vulkan[/code] for compatibility reasons, but it is recommended to "
"switch them manually to [code]d3d12[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de Windows per a [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"S'admeten dues opcions:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code] (per defecte), Vulkan dels controladors natius. Si "
"[member rendering/rendering_device/fallback_to_vulkan] està habilitat, "
"s'utilitza com a alternativa si Direct3D 12 no és compatible.\n"
"- [code]d3d12[/code], Direct3D 12 des de controladors natius. Si [member "
"rendering/rendering_device/fallback_to_d3d12] està habilitat, s'utilitza com "
"a alternativa si Vulkan no és compatible.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A partir de Godot 4.6, els nous projectes es configuren per "
"defecte per utilitzar [code]d3d12[/code] a Windows. Els projectes creats "
"abans de Godot 4.6 conserven [code]vulkan[/code] per motius de "
"compatibilitat, però es recomana canviar-los manualment a [code]d3d12[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Forward+ renderer will fall back to Direct3D 12 if "
"Vulkan is not supported. The fallback is always attempted regardless of this "
"setting if Vulkan driver support was disabled at compile time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Forward+ renderer will fall back to OpenGL 3 if "
"Direct3D 12, Metal, and Vulkan are not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on Windows, Android, macOS, iOS, "
"and Linux/X11."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Forward+ renderer will fall back to Vulkan if "
"Direct3D 12 (on Windows) or Metal (on macOS x86_64) are not supported. The "
"fallback is always attempted regardless of this setting if Direct3D 12 "
"(Windows) or Metal (macOS) driver support was disabled at compile time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on Windows and macOS."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enable the pipeline cache that is saved to disk if the graphics API supports "
"it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is unable to control the pipeline caching the GPU "
"driver itself does. Only turn this off along with deleting the contents of "
"the driver's cache if you wish to simulate the experience a user will get "
"when starting the game for the first time."
msgstr ""
"Activeu la memòria cau de la canalització que es desa al disc si l'API de "
"gràfics ho admet.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat no pot controlar l'emmagatzematge en memòria "
"cau de la canalització que fa el propi controlador de la GPU. Desactiveu-ho "
"només juntament amb suprimir el contingut de la memòria cau del controlador "
"si voleu simular l'experiència que tindrà un usuari quan iniciï el joc per "
"primera vegada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Determines at which interval pipeline cache is saved to disk. The lower the "
"value, the more often it is saved."
msgstr ""
"Determina a quin interval es desa la memòria cau de la canalització al disc. "
"Com més baix sigui el valor, més sovint es desa."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of a block allocated in the staging buffers. Staging buffers are "
"the intermediate resources the engine uses to upload or download data to the "
"GPU. This setting determines the max amount of data that can be transferred "
"in a copy operation. Increasing this will result in faster data transfers at "
"the cost of extra memory.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"La mida d'un bloc assignat a les memòries intermèdies. Els buffers d'estadi "
"són els recursos intermedis que fa servir el motor per carregar o "
"descarregar dades a la GPU. Aquesta configuració determina la quantitat "
"màxima de dades que es poden transferir en una operació de còpia. Augmentar "
"això donarà lloc a transferències de dades més ràpides a costa de memòria "
"addicional.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Actualment no hi ha manera de canviar aquest valor en temps d'execució."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum amount of memory allowed to be used by staging buffers. If the "
"amount of data being uploaded or downloaded exceeds this amount, the GPU "
"will stall and wait for previous frames to finish.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat màxima de memòria que es permet utilitzar les memòries "
"intermèdies. Si la quantitat de dades que s'estan penjant o descarregant "
"supera aquesta quantitat, la GPU s'aturarà i esperarà que finalitzin els "
"fotogrames anteriors.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Actualment no hi ha manera de canviar aquest valor en temps d'execució."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The region size in pixels used to download texture data from the GPU when "
"using methods like [method RenderingDevice.texture_get_data_async].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property's upper limit is controlled by [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] and whether it's possible to "
"allocate a single block of texture data with this region size in the format "
"that is requested.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"La mida de la regió en píxels que s'utilitza per descarregar dades de "
"textura de la GPU quan s'utilitzen mètodes com [method "
"RenderingDevice.texture_get_data_async].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El límit superior d'aquesta propietat està controlat per "
"[member rendering/rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] i si és "
"possible assignar un únic bloc de dades de textura amb aquesta mida de regió "
"en el format que es demana.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Actualment no hi ha manera de canviar aquest valor en temps d'execució."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The region size in pixels used to upload texture data from the GPU when "
"using methods like [method RenderingDevice.texture_update].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property's upper limit is controlled by [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] and whether it's possible to "
"allocate a single block of texture data with this region size in the format "
"that is requested.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"La mida de la regió en píxels que s'utilitza per carregar dades de textura "
"de la GPU quan s'utilitzen mètodes com [method "
"RenderingDevice.texture_update].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El límit superior d'aquesta propietat està controlat per "
"[member rendering/rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] i si és "
"possible assignar un únic bloc de dades de textura amb aquesta mida de regió "
"en el format que es demana.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Actualment no hi ha manera de canviar aquest valor en temps d'execució."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of frames to track on the CPU side before stalling to wait for "
"the GPU.\n"
"Try the [url=https://darksylinc.github.io/vsync_simulator/]V-Sync Simulator[/"
"url], an interactive interface that simulates presentation to better "
"understand how it is affected by different variables under various "
"conditions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de fotogrames que cal seguir al costat de la CPU abans d'aturar-se "
"per esperar la GPU.\n"
"Proveu el [url=https://darksylinc.github.io/vsync_simulator/]V-Sync "
"Simulator[/url], una interfície interactiva que simula la presentació per "
"entendre millor com es veu afectada per diferents variables en diferents "
"condicions.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Actualment no hi ha manera de canviar aquest valor en temps d'execució."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of images the swapchain will consist of (back buffers + front "
"buffer).\n"
"[code]2[/code] corresponds to double-buffering and [code]3[/code] to triple-"
"buffering.\n"
"Double-buffering may give you the lowest lag/latency but if V-Sync is on and "
"the system can't render at 60 fps, the framerate will go down in multiples "
"of it (e.g. 30 fps, 15, 7.5, etc.). Triple buffering gives you higher "
"framerate (specially if the system can't reach a constant 60 fps) at the "
"cost of up to 1 frame of latency, with [constant "
"DisplayServer.VSYNC_ENABLED] (FIFO).\n"
"Use double-buffering with [constant DisplayServer.VSYNC_ENABLED]. Triple-"
"buffering is a must if you plan on using [constant "
"DisplayServer.VSYNC_MAILBOX] mode.\n"
"Try the [url=https://darksylinc.github.io/vsync_simulator/]V-Sync Simulator[/"
"url], an interactive interface that simulates presentation to better "
"understand how it is affected by different variables under various "
"conditions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this setting will only be applied on startup or when "
"the swapchain is recreated (e.g. when setting the V-Sync mode).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some platforms may restrict the actual value."
msgstr ""
"El nombre d'imatges en què constarà la cadena d'intercanvi (búfers "
"posteriors + buffer frontal).\n"
"[code]2[/code] correspon a la memòria intermèdia doble i [code]3[/code] a la "
"memòria intermèdia triple.\n"
"El doble buffer us pot donar el retard/latència més baix, però si V-Sync "
"està activat i el sistema no es pot renderitzar a 60 fps, la velocitat de "
"fotogrames baixarà en múltiples (per exemple, 30 fps, 15, 7,5, etc.). La "
"memòria intermèdia triple us ofereix una velocitat de fotogrames més alta "
"(especialment si el sistema no pot arribar a 60 fps constants) a costa de "
"fins a 1 fotograma de latència, amb [constant DisplayServer.VSYNC_ENABLED] "
"(FIFO).\n"
"Utilitzeu la memòria intermèdia doble amb [constant "
"DisplayServer.VSYNC_ENABLED]. El triple buffer és imprescindible si teniu "
"previst utilitzar el mode [constant DisplayServer.VSYNC_MAILBOX].\n"
"Proveu el [url=https://darksylinc.github.io/vsync_simulator/]V-Sync "
"Simulator[/url], una interfície interactiva que simula la presentació per "
"entendre millor com es veu afectada per diferents variables en diferents "
"condicions.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els canvis a aquesta configuració només s'aplicaran a l'inici o "
"quan es torni a crear la cadena d'intercanvi (p. ex., quan s'estableix el "
"mode V-Sync).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Algunes plataformes poden restringir el valor real."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of descriptors per pool. Godot's Vulkan backend uses linear pools "
"for descriptors that will be created and destroyed within a single frame. "
"Instead of destroying every single descriptor every frame, they all can be "
"destroyed at once by resetting the pool they belong to.\n"
"A larger number is more efficient up to a limit, after that it will only "
"waste RAM (maximum efficiency is achieved when there is no more than 1 pool "
"per frame). A small number could end up with one pool per descriptor, which "
"negatively impacts performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this property requires a restart to take effect."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de descriptors per grup. El backend Vulkan de Godot utilitza grups "
"lineals per als descriptors que es crearan i es destruiran dins d'un únic "
"marc. En lloc de destruir tots els descriptors de cada fotograma, tots es "
"poden destruir alhora restablint el grup al qual pertanyen.\n"
"Un nombre més gran és més eficient fins a un límit, després d'això només "
"malgastarà RAM (la màxima eficiència s'aconsegueix quan no hi ha més d'1 "
"grup per fotograma). Un petit nombre podria acabar amb un grup per "
"descriptor, cosa que afecta negativament el rendiment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El canvi d'aquesta propietat requereix un reinici perquè tingui "
"efecte."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Determines how sharp the upscaled image will be when using the FSR upscaling "
"mode. Sharpness halves with every whole number. Values go from 0.0 "
"(sharpest) to 2.0. Values above 2.0 won't make a visible difference."
msgstr ""
"Determina la nítida que tindrà la imatge augmentada quan s'utilitza el mode "
"d'augment de l'FSR. Nitidesa meitats amb cada nombre sencer. Els valors van "
"de 0,0 (més nítid) a 2,0. Els valors superiors a 2,0 no marcaran cap "
"diferència visible."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the scaling 3D mode. Bilinear scaling renders at different resolution "
"to either undersample or supersample the viewport. FidelityFX Super "
"Resolution 1.0, abbreviated to FSR, is an upscaling technology that produces "
"high quality images at fast framerates by using a spatially-aware upscaling "
"algorithm. FSR is slightly more expensive than bilinear, but it produces "
"significantly higher image quality. On particularly low-end GPUs, the added "
"cost of FSR may not be worth it (compared to using bilinear scaling with a "
"slightly higher resolution scale to match performance).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] FSR is only effective when using the Forward+ rendering method, "
"not Mobile or Compatibility. If using an incompatible rendering method, FSR "
"will fall back to bilinear scaling."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el mode d'escala 3D. L'escalat bilineal es renderitza a diferents "
"resolucions per fer un submostreig o un supermostreig de la finestra "
"gràfica. FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0, abreujat com a FSR, és una "
"tecnologia d'augment d'escala que produeix imatges d'alta qualitat a "
"velocitats de fotogrames ràpides mitjançant l'ús d'un algorisme d'augment de "
"consciència espacial. FSR és una mica més car que el bilineal, però produeix "
"una qualitat d'imatge significativament més alta. A les GPU especialment de "
"gamma baixa, el cost afegit de FSR pot no valdre la pena (en comparació amb "
"l'ús d'una escala bilineal amb una escala de resolució una mica més alta per "
"igualar el rendiment).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] FSR només és efectiu quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació "
"Forward+, no mòbil o compatibilitat. Si s'utilitza un mètode de "
"representació incompatible, FSR tornarà a l'escala bilineal."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"iOS override for [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. This allows selecting "
"the MetalFX spatial and MetalFX temporal scaling modes, which are exclusive "
"to platforms where the Metal rendering driver is used."
msgstr ""
"Substitució d'iOS per a [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. Això permet "
"seleccionar els modes d'escala espacial i temporal de MetalFX, que són "
"exclusius de les plataformes on s'utilitza el controlador de renderització "
"de metall."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"macOS override for [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. This allows selecting "
"the MetalFX spatial and MetalFX temporal scaling modes, which are exclusive "
"to platforms where the Metal rendering driver is used."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de macOS per a [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. Això permet "
"seleccionar els modes d'escala espacial i temporal de MetalFX, que són "
"exclusius de les plataformes on s'utilitza el controlador de renderització "
"de metall."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Scales the 3D render buffer based on the viewport size uses an image filter "
"specified in [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode] to scale the output image to "
"the full viewport size. Values lower than [code]1.0[/code] can be used to "
"speed up 3D rendering at the cost of quality (undersampling). Values greater "
"than [code]1.0[/code] are only valid for bilinear mode and can be used to "
"improve 3D rendering quality at a high performance cost (supersampling). See "
"also [member rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] for multi-sample "
"antialiasing, which is significantly cheaper but only smooths the edges of "
"polygons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the [b]Nearest[/b] scaling mode, to avoid uneven "
"pixel scaling, it's highly recommended to use a value equal to an integer "
"divisor with a dividend of [code]1[/code]. For example, it's best to use a "
"scale of [code]0.5[/code] (1/2), [code]0.3333[/code] (1/3), [code]0.25[/"
"code] (1/4), [code]0.2[/code] (1/5), and so on."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enable the shader cache, which stores compiled shaders to disk to prevent "
"stuttering from shader compilation the next time the shader is needed."
msgstr ""
"Habiliteu la memòria cau de shader, que emmagatzema shaders compilats al "
"disc per evitar tartamudes de la compilació shader la propera vegada que es "
"necessiti."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses faster but lower-quality Lambert material "
"lighting model instead of Burley."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], utilitza un model d'il·luminació de material Lambert "
"més ràpid però de qualitat inferior en lloc de Burley."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/shading/overrides/"
"force_lambert_over_burley] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or "
"driver support."
msgstr ""
"Anul·lació de gamma baixa per a [member rendering/shading/overrides/"
"force_lambert_over_burley] en dispositius mòbils, a causa de problemes de "
"rendiment o de compatibilitat amb controladors."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces vertex shading for all rendering. This can "
"increase performance a lot, but also reduces quality immensely. Can be used "
"to optimize performance on low-end mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], força l'ombrejat de vèrtex per a tota la "
"representació. Això pot augmentar molt el rendiment, però també redueix "
"enormement la qualitat. Es pot utilitzar per optimitzar el rendiment en "
"dispositius mòbils de gamma baixa."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The dictionary size for Rate-Distortion Optimization (RDO) when importing "
"textures as Basis Universal and when RDO is enabled, ranging from [code]64[/"
"code] to [code]65536[/code]. Higher values reduce the file sizes further, "
"but make encoding times significantly longer."
msgstr ""
"La mida del diccionari per a l'optimització de la velocitat de distorsió "
"(RDO) quan s'importen textures com a Basis Universal i quan RDO està "
"habilitat, que va des de [code]64[/code] fins a [code]65536[/code]. Els "
"valors més alts redueixen encara més la mida dels fitxers, però fan que els "
"temps de codificació siguin molt més llargs."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Zstandard supercompression to reduce file size "
"when importing textures as Basis Universal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Basis Universal textures need to be compressed to gain the "
"benefit of smaller file sizes, otherwise they are as large as VRAM-"
"compressed textures."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita la supercompressió Zstandard per reduir la "
"mida del fitxer quan s'importen textures com a Basis Universal.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Base Les textures universals s'han de comprimir per obtenir el "
"benefici de mides de fitxers més petites, en cas contrari són tan grans com "
"les textures comprimides amb VRAM."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specify the compression level for Basis Universal Zstandard "
"supercompression, ranging from [code]1[/code] to [code]22[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Especifiqueu el nivell de compressió per a la supercompressió Basis "
"Universal Zstandard, que va des de [code]1[/code] fins a [code]22[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default texture filtering mode to use for [CanvasItem]s built-in "
"texture. In shaders, this texture is accessed as [code]TEXTURE[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For pixel art aesthetics, see also [member rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] and [member rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."
msgstr ""
"El mode de filtratge de textures predeterminat que s'utilitza per a la "
"textura integrada de [CanvasItem]. En els shaders, s'accedeix a aquesta "
"textura com a [code]TEXTURE[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per a l'estètica del pixel art, vegeu també [member rendering/"
"2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] i [member rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default texture repeating mode to use for [CanvasItem]s built-in "
"texture. In shaders, this texture is accessed as [code]TEXTURE[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El mode de repetició de textures predeterminat que s'utilitza per a la "
"textura integrada de [CanvasItem]. En els shaders, s'accedeix a aquesta "
"textura com a [code]TEXTURE[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The filtering quality to use for [Decal] nodes. When using one of the "
"anisotropic filtering modes, the anisotropic filtering level is controlled "
"by [member rendering/textures/default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"La qualitat de filtratge que cal utilitzar per als nodes [Decal]. Quan "
"s'utilitza un dels modes de filtratge anisòtrop, el nivell de filtratge "
"anisòtrop està controlat per [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of samples to take when using anisotropic filtering "
"on textures (as a power of two). A higher sample count will result in "
"sharper textures at oblique angles, but is more expensive to compute. A "
"value of [code]0[/code] forcibly disables anisotropic filtering, even on "
"materials where it is enabled.\n"
"The anisotropic filtering level also affects decals and light projectors if "
"they are configured to use anisotropic filtering. See [member rendering/"
"textures/decals/filter] and [member rendering/textures/light_projectors/"
"filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In 3D, for this setting to have an effect, set [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.texture_filter] to [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] or [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] on "
"materials.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In 2D, for this setting to have an effect, set [member "
"CanvasItem.texture_filter] to [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] or [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] on the "
"[CanvasItem] node displaying the texture (or in [CanvasTexture]). However, "
"anisotropic filtering is rarely useful in 2D, so only enable it for textures "
"in 2D if it makes a meaningful visual difference.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the anisotropic filtering level at runtime, set [member "
"Viewport.anisotropic_filtering_level] on the root [Viewport] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Affects the final texture sharpness by reading from a lower or higher mipmap "
"(also called \"texture LOD bias\"). Negative values make mipmapped textures "
"sharper but grainier when viewed at a distance, while positive values make "
"mipmapped textures blurrier (even when up close).\n"
"Enabling temporal antialiasing ([member rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"use_taa]) will automatically apply a [code]-0.5[/code] offset to this value, "
"while enabling FXAA ([member rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"screen_space_aa]) will automatically apply a [code]-0.25[/code] offset to "
"this value. If both TAA and FXAA are enabled at the same time, an offset of "
"[code]-0.75[/code] is applied to this value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member rendering/scaling_3d/scale] is lower than [code]1.0[/"
"code] (exclusive), [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"texture_mipmap_bias] is used to adjust the automatic mipmap bias which is "
"calculated internally based on the scale factor. The formula for this is "
"[code]log2(scaling_3d_scale) + mipmap_bias[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"renderers, not Compatibility. In Compatibility, this property is always "
"treated as if it was set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses nearest-neighbor mipmap filtering when using "
"mipmaps (also called \"bilinear filtering\"), which will result in visible "
"seams appearing between mipmap stages. This may increase performance in "
"mobile as less memory bandwidth is used. If [code]false[/code], linear "
"mipmap filtering (also called \"trilinear filtering\") is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this setting at run-time."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], utilitza el filtratge de mipmap del veí més proper "
"quan s'utilitza mipmaps (també anomenat \"filtratge bilineal\"), que farà "
"que apareguin costures visibles entre les etapes de mipmap. Això pot "
"augmentar el rendiment al mòbil a mesura que s'utilitza menys amplada de "
"banda de memòria. Si [code]false[/code], s'utilitza el filtratge lineal de "
"mipmap (també anomenat \"filtratge trilineal\").\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Actualment no hi ha manera de canviar aquesta configuració en temps "
"d'execució."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The filtering quality to use for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D] projectors. "
"When using one of the anisotropic filtering modes, the anisotropic filtering "
"level is controlled by [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"La qualitat de filtratge que cal utilitzar per als projectors [OmniLight3D] "
"i [SpotLight3D]. Quan s'utilitza un dels modes de filtratge anisòtrop, el "
"nivell de filtratge anisòtrop està controlat per [member rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will import lossless textures "
"using the PNG format. Otherwise, it will default to using WebP."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'importador de textures importarà textures sense "
"pèrdues utilitzant el format PNG. En cas contrari, utilitzarà WebP per "
"defecte."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the GPU texture compressor will cache the local "
"RenderingDevice and its resources (shaders and pipelines), making subsequent "
"imports faster at the cost of increased memory usage."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el compressor de textures de la GPU emmagatzemarà a la "
"memòria cau el RenderingDevice local i els seus recursos (shaders i "
"pipelines), fent que les importacions posteriors siguin més ràpides a costa "
"d'augmentar l'ús de la memòria."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will utilize the GPU for "
"compressing textures, improving the import time of large images.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only functions on a device which supports either Vulkan, "
"Direct3D 12, or Metal as a rendering driver.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Currently this only affects certain compressed formats (BC1, "
"BC3, BC4, BC5, and BC6), all of which are exclusive to desktop platforms and "
"consoles."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'importador de textures utilitzarà la GPU per "
"comprimir textures, millorant el temps d'importació d'imatges grans.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només funciona en un dispositiu que admet Vulkan, Direct3D "
"12 o Metal com a controlador de renderització.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Actualment només afecta certs formats comprimits (BC1, BC3, "
"BC4, BC5 i BC6), tots ells exclusius de plataformes d'escriptori i consoles."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will import VRAM-compressed "
"textures using the Ericsson Texture Compression 2 algorithm for lower "
"quality textures and normal maps and Adaptable Scalable Texture Compression "
"algorithm for high quality textures (in 4×4 block size).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is an override. The texture importer will always "
"import the format the host platform needs, even if this is set to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this setting does [i]not[/i] impact textures that were "
"already imported before. To make this setting apply to textures that were "
"already imported, exit the editor, remove the [code].godot/imported/[/code] "
"folder located inside the project folder then restart the editor (see "
"[member application/config/use_hidden_project_data_directory])."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'importador de textures importarà textures "
"comprimides amb VRAM mitjançant l'algoritme Ericsson Texture Compression 2 "
"per a textures de menor qualitat i mapes normals i l'algoritme de compressió "
"de textures escalable adaptable per a textures d'alta qualitat (en mida de "
"bloc 4×4).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració és una substitució. L'importador de "
"textures sempre importarà el format que necessita la plataforma amfitrió, "
"fins i tot si s'estableix en [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Canviar aquesta configuració [i]not[/i] afecta les textures que "
"ja s'han importat abans. Per fer que aquesta configuració s'apliqui a "
"textures que ja s'han importat, sortiu de l'editor, elimineu la carpeta "
"[code].godot/imported/[/code] situada dins de la carpeta del projecte i "
"reinicieu l'editor (vegeu [member application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory])."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will import VRAM-compressed "
"textures using the S3 Texture Compression algorithm (DXT1-5) for lower "
"quality textures and the BPTC algorithm (BC6H and BC7) for high quality "
"textures. This algorithm is only supported on PC desktop platforms and "
"consoles.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is an override. The texture importer will always "
"import the format the host platform needs, even if this is set to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this setting does [i]not[/i] impact textures that were "
"already imported before. To make this setting apply to textures that were "
"already imported, exit the editor, remove the [code].godot/imported/[/code] "
"folder located inside the project folder then restart the editor (see "
"[member application/config/use_hidden_project_data_directory])."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'importador de textures importarà textures "
"comprimides amb VRAM mitjançant l'algorisme de compressió de textures S3 "
"(DXT1-5) per a textures de menor qualitat i l'algoritme BPTC (BC6H i BC7) "
"per a textures d'alta qualitat. Aquest algorisme només és compatible amb les "
"plataformes d'escriptori i les consoles de PC.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta configuració és una substitució. L'importador de "
"textures sempre importarà el format que necessita la plataforma amfitrió, "
"fins i tot si s'estableix en [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Canviar aquesta configuració [i]not[/i] afecta les textures que "
"ja s'han importat abans. Per fer que aquesta configuració s'apliqui a "
"textures que ja s'han importat, sortiu de l'editor, elimineu la carpeta "
"[code].godot/imported/[/code] situada dins de la carpeta del projecte i "
"reinicieu l'editor (vegeu [member application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory])."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default compression method for WebP. Affects both lossy and lossless "
"WebP. A higher value results in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression method. "
"Supported values are 0 to 6. Note that compression methods above 4 are very "
"slow and offer very little savings."
msgstr ""
"El mètode de compressió predeterminat per a WebP. Afecta tant WebP amb "
"pèrdues com sense pèrdues. Un valor més alt es tradueix en fitxers més "
"petits a costa de la velocitat de compressió. La velocitat de descompressió "
"no es veu afectada principalment pel mètode de compressió. Els valors "
"admesos són de 0 a 6. Tingueu en compte que els mètodes de compressió "
"superiors a 4 són molt lents i ofereixen molt pocs estalvis."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default compression factor for lossless WebP. Decompression speed is "
"mostly unaffected by the compression factor. Supported values are 0 to 100."
msgstr ""
"El factor de compressió predeterminat per a WebP sense pèrdues. La velocitat "
"de descompressió no es veu afectada principalment pel factor de compressió. "
"Els valors admesos són de 0 a 100."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] on the root "
"Viewport. 2D rendering will use a high dynamic range (HDR) [code]RGBA16[/"
"code] format framebuffer. Additionally, 2D rendering will be performed on "
"linear values and will be converted using the appropriate transfer function "
"immediately before blitting to the screen.\n"
"Practically speaking, this means that the end result of the Viewport will "
"not be clamped to the [code]0-1[/code] range and can be used in 3D rendering "
"without color encoding adjustments. This allows 2D rendering to take "
"advantage of effects requiring high dynamic range (e.g. 2D glow) as well as "
"substantially improves the appearance of effects requiring highly detailed "
"gradients.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle "
"HDR 2D at runtime, set [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] on the root [Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] a la finestra de "
"vista arrel. La representació 2D utilitzarà un framebuffer de format d'alt "
"rang dinàmic (HDR) [code]RGBA16[/code]. A més, la representació 2D es "
"realitzarà en valors lineals i es convertirà mitjançant la funció de "
"transferència adequada immediatament abans de passar a la pantalla.\n"
"Pràcticament parlant, això vol dir que el resultat final de la finestra "
"gràfica no es fixarà al rang [code]0-1[/code] i es pot utilitzar en la "
"representació 3D sense ajustaments de codificació de colors. Això permet que "
"la renderització 2D aprofiti els efectes que requereixen un rang dinàmic "
"elevat (per exemple, resplendor 2D), així com millora substancialment "
"l'aspecte dels efectes que requereixen degradats molt detallats.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat només es llegeix quan s'inicia el projecte. "
"Per canviar l'HDR 2D en temps d'execució, configureu [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] a l'arrel [Viewport]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables [member Viewport.transparent_bg] on the root "
"viewport. This allows per-pixel transparency to be effective after also "
"enabling [member display/window/size/transparent] and [member display/window/"
"per_pixel_transparency/allowed]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita [member Viewport.transparent_bg] a la "
"finestra de vista arrel. Això permet que la transparència per píxel sigui "
"efectiva després d'habilitar també [member display/window/size/transparent] "
"i [member display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Set the default Variable Rate Shading (VRS) mode for the main viewport. See "
"[member Viewport.vrs_mode] to change this at runtime, and [enum "
"Viewport.VRSMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el mode d'ombrejat de velocitat variable (VRS) per defecte per a "
"la finestra principal. Vegeu [member Viewport.vrs_mode] per canviar-ho en "
"temps d'execució, i [enum Viewport.VRSMode] per als valors possibles."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [member rendering/vrs/mode] is set to [b]Texture[/b], this is the path to "
"default texture loaded as the VRS image.\n"
"The texture [i]must[/i] use a lossless compression format so that colors can "
"be matched precisely. The following VRS densities are mapped to various "
"colors, with brighter colors representing a lower level of shading "
"precision:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- 1×1 = rgb(0, 0, 0)     - #000000\n"
"- 1×2 = rgb(0, 85, 0)    - #005500\n"
"- 2×1 = rgb(85, 0, 0)    - #550000\n"
"- 2×2 = rgb(85, 85, 0)   - #555500\n"
"- 2×4 = rgb(85, 170, 0)  - #55aa00\n"
"- 4×2 = rgb(170, 85, 0)  - #aa5500\n"
"- 4×4 = rgb(170, 170, 0) - #aaaa00\n"
"- 4×8 = rgb(170, 255, 0) - #aaff00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"- 8×4 = rgb(255, 170, 0) - #ffaa00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"- 8×8 = rgb(255, 255, 0) - #ffff00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si [member rendering/vrs/mode] s'estableix a [b]Texture[/b], aquest és el "
"camí a la textura predeterminada carregada com a imatge VRS.\n"
"La textura [i]must[/i] utilitza un format de compressió sense pèrdues perquè "
"els colors es puguin combinar amb precisió. Les següents densitats de VRS "
"s'assignen a diversos colors, amb colors més brillants que representen un "
"nivell inferior de precisió d'ombrejat:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- 1×1 = rgb(0, 0, 0) - #000000\n"
"- 1×2 = rgb(0, 85, 0) - #005500\n"
"- 2×1 = rgb(85, 0, 0) - #550000\n"
"- 2×2 = rgb(85, 85, 0) - #555500\n"
"- 2×4 = rgb(85, 170, 0) - #55aa00\n"
"- 4×2 = rgb(170, 85, 0) - #aa5500\n"
"- 4×4 = rgb(170, 170, 0) - #aaaa00\n"
"- 4×8 = rgb(170, 255, 0) - #aaff00 - No és compatible amb la majoria de "
"maquinari\n"
"- 8×4 = rgb(255, 170, 0) - #ffaa00 - No és compatible amb la majoria de "
"maquinari\n"
"- 8×8 = rgb(255, 255, 0) - #ffff00 - No és compatible amb la majoria de "
"maquinari\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The ratio of [WorkerThreadPool]'s threads that will be reserved for low-"
"priority tasks. For example, if 10 threads are available and this value is "
"set to [code]0.3[/code], 3 of the worker threads will be reserved for low-"
"priority tasks. The actual value won't exceed the number of CPU cores minus "
"one, and if possible, at least one worker thread will be dedicated to low-"
"priority tasks."
msgstr ""
"La proporció de fils de [WorkerThreadPool] que es reservaran per a tasques "
"de baixa prioritat. Per exemple, si hi ha 10 fils disponibles i aquest valor "
"s'estableix en [code]0.3[/code], 3 dels fils de treball es reservaran per a "
"tasques de baixa prioritat. El valor real no superarà el nombre de nuclis de "
"CPU menys un i, si és possible, almenys un fil de treball es dedicarà a "
"tasques de baixa prioritat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of threads to be used by [WorkerThreadPool]. On Web, a value "
"of [code]-1[/code] means [code]1[/code]. On other platforms, it means all "
"[i]logical[/i] CPU cores available (see [method OS.get_processor_count])."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim de fils que ha d'utilitzar [WorkerThreadPool]. Al web, un valor "
"de [code]-1[/code] significa [code]1[/code]. En altres plataformes, vol dir "
"que tots els nuclis de CPU [i]logical[/i] estan disponibles (vegeu [method "
"OS.get_processor_count])."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the analog threshold binding modifier if "
"supported by the XR runtime."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the D-pad binding modifier if supported by the "
"XR runtime."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Action map configuration to load by default."
msgstr "Configuració del mapa d'accions per carregar per defecte."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Godot will setup and initialize OpenXR on startup."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specify how OpenXR should blend in the environment. This is specific to "
"certain AR and passthrough devices where camera images are blended in by the "
"XR compositor."
msgstr ""
"Especifiqueu com s'ha de combinar OpenXR amb l'entorn. Això és específic per "
"a determinats dispositius de RA i de transmissió on el compositor XR combina "
"les imatges de la càmera."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the message types for which we request debug messages. Requires "
"[member xr/openxr/extensions/debug_utils] to be set and the extension to be "
"supported by the XR runtime."
msgstr ""
"Especifica els tipus de missatges per als quals sol·licitem missatges de "
"depuració. Requereix que s'estableixi [member xr/openxr/extensions/"
"debug_utils] i que l'extensió sigui compatible amb el temps d'execució XR."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enables debug utilities on XR runtimes that supports the debug utils "
"extension. Sets the maximum severity being reported (0 = disabled, 1 = "
"error, 2 = warning, 3 = info, 4 = verbose)."
msgstr ""
"Habilita les utilitats de depuració en temps d'execució XR que admeten "
"l'extensió d'utilitats de depuració. Estableix la gravetat màxima que "
"s'informa (0 = desactivat, 1 = error, 2 = advertència, 3 = informació, 4 = "
"detallat)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specify whether to enable eye tracking for this project. Depending on the "
"platform, additional export configuration may be needed."
msgstr ""
"Especifiqueu si voleu activar el seguiment ocular per a aquest projecte. "
"Depenent de la plataforma, pot ser que calgui una configuració d'exportació "
"addicional."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the frame synthesis extension will be activated if "
"supported by the platform.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature should not be enabled in conjunction with "
"Application Space Warp, if supported this replaces ASW."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] s'activarà l'extensió de síntesi de fotogrames si és "
"compatible amb la plataforma.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta característica no s'hauria d'habilitar juntament amb "
"Application Space Warp, si és compatible, substitueix ASW."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the hand interaction profile extension will be "
"activated if supported by the platform."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the hand tracking extension is enabled if available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default hand tracking will only work for data sources chosen "
"by the XR runtime. For SteamVR this is the controller inferred data source, "
"for most other runtimes this is the unobstructed data source. There is no "
"way to query this. If a runtime supports the OpenXR data source extension "
"you can use the [member xr/openxr/extensions/"
"hand_tracking_controller_data_source] and/or [member xr/openxr/extensions/"
"hand_tracking_unobstructed_data_source] to indicate you wish to enable these "
"data sources. If neither is selected the data source extension is not "
"enabled and the XR runtimes default behavior persists."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'extensió de seguiment de mans està activada si està "
"disponible.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] De manera predeterminada, el seguiment manual només funcionarà "
"per a les fonts de dades escollides pel temps d'execució XR. Per a SteamVR "
"aquesta és la font de dades inferida del controlador, per a la majoria dels "
"altres temps d'execució aquesta és la font de dades sense obstruccions. No "
"hi ha manera de consultar això. Si un temps d'execució admet l'extensió de "
"font de dades OpenXR, podeu utilitzar [member xr/openxr/extensions/"
"hand_tracking_controller_data_source] i/o [member xr/openxr/extensions/"
"hand_tracking_unobstructed_data_source] per indicar que voleu habilitar "
"aquestes fonts de dades. Si no se selecciona cap de les dues, l'extensió de "
"la font de dades no està habilitada i el comportament predeterminat de temps "
"d'execució XR persisteix."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the controller inferred data source is "
"requested. If supported, you will receive hand tracking data even if the "
"user has a controller in hand, with finger positions automatically inferred "
"from controller input and/or sensors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires the OpenXR data source extension and controller "
"inferred handtracking to be supported by the XR runtime. If not supported "
"this setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking] "
"must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es demana suport per a la font de dades inferida del "
"controlador. Si s'admet, rebreu dades de seguiment manual encara que "
"l'usuari tingui un controlador a la mà, amb les posicions dels dits deduïdes "
"automàticament a partir de l'entrada del controlador i/o dels sensors.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això requereix que l'extensió de la font de dades d'OpenXR i el "
"seguiment manual deduït del controlador siguin compatibles amb el temps "
"d'execució XR. Si no és compatible, aquesta configuració s'ignorarà. [member "
"xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking] s'ha d'habilitar perquè aquesta "
"configuració es pugui utilitzar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the unobstructed data source is requested. "
"If supported, you will receive hand tracking data based on the actual finger "
"positions of the user often determined by optical tracking.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires the OpenXR data source extension and unobstructed "
"handtracking to be supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this "
"setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking] must be "
"enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es demana suport per a la font de dades sense "
"obstacles. Si s'admet, rebreu dades de seguiment de les mans basades en les "
"posicions reals dels dits de l'usuari, sovint determinades pel seguiment "
"òptic.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això requereix que l'extensió de la font de dades OpenXR i el "
"seguiment manual sense obstruccions siguin compatibles amb el temps "
"d'execució XR. Si no és compatible, aquesta configuració s'ignorarà. [member "
"xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking] s'ha d'habilitar perquè aquesta "
"configuració es pugui utilitzar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] we enable the render model extension if available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This relates to the core OpenXR render model extension and has "
"no relation to any vendor render model extensions."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilitem l'extensió del model de renderització si "
"està disponible.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això es relaciona amb l'extensió bàsica del model de "
"representació OpenXR i no té cap relació amb cap extensió de model de "
"representació del proveïdor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The April Tag marker types the built-in marker tracking is set to recognize "
"(if April Tag marker tracking is available and enabled)."
msgstr ""
"Els tipus de marcadors d'etiquetes d'abril que el seguiment del marcador "
"integrat està configurat per reconèixer (si el seguiment del marcador "
"d'etiquetes d'abril està disponible i activat)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The ArUco marker types the built-in marker tracking is set to recognize (if "
"ArUco marker tracking is available and enabled)."
msgstr ""
"Els tipus de marcadors ArUco que el seguiment del marcador integrat està "
"configurat per reconèixer (si el seguiment del marcador ArUco està "
"disponible i activat)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], we enable the built-in logic for handling anchors. "
"Godot will query (persistent) anchors and manage [OpenXRAnchorTracker] "
"instances for you. If disabled you'll need to create your own spatial and "
"persistence context and perform your own discovery queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This functionality requires that spatial anchors are supported "
"and enabled."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilitem la lògica integrada per gestionar els "
"ancoratges. Godot consultarà ancoratges (persistents) i gestionarà les "
"instàncies [OpenXRAnchorTracker] per vosaltres. Si està desactivat, haureu "
"de crear el vostre propi context espacial i de persistència i realitzar les "
"vostres pròpies consultes de descobriment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta funcionalitat requereix que els ancoratges espacials "
"siguin compatibles i habilitats."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], we enable the built-in logic for handling marker "
"tracking. Godot will query markers and manage [OpenXRMarkerTracker] "
"instances for you. If disabled you'll need to create your own spatial "
"context and perform your own discovery queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This functionality requires that marker tracking is supported "
"and enabled."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilitem la lògica integrada per gestionar el "
"seguiment de marcadors. Godot consultarà els marcadors i gestionarà les "
"instàncies [OpenXRMarkerTracker] per vosaltres. Si està desactivat, haureu "
"de crear el vostre propi context espacial i realitzar les vostres pròpies "
"consultes de descobriment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta funcionalitat requereix que el seguiment de marcadors "
"sigui compatible i habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], we enable the built-in logic for handling plane "
"detection. Godot will query detected planes (walls, floors, ceilings, etc.) "
"and manage [OpenXRPlaneTracker] instances for you. If disabled you'll need "
"to create your own spatial context and perform your own discovery queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This functionality requires that plane tracking is supported "
"and enabled."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilitem la lògica integrada per gestionar la "
"detecció de pla. Godot consultarà els avions detectats (parets, sòls, "
"sostres, etc.) i gestionarà les instàncies [OpenXRPlaneTracker] per "
"vosaltres. Si està desactivat, haureu de crear el vostre propi context "
"espacial i realitzar les vostres pròpies consultes de descobriment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta funcionalitat requereix que el seguiment d'avió sigui "
"compatible i habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the marker tracking extension is "
"requested. If supported, you will be able to query information about markers "
"detected by the XR runtime, e.g. QR codes, aruca markers and april tags.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities and marker "
"tracking extensions are supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this "
"setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enabled] must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es demana suport per a l'extensió de seguiment de "
"marcadors. Si és compatible, podreu consultar informació sobre els marcadors "
"detectats pel temps d'execució XR, p. Codis QR, marcadors aruca i etiquetes "
"d'abril.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això requereix que les entitats espacials OpenXR i les "
"extensions de seguiment de marcadors siguin compatibles amb el temps "
"d'execució XR. Si no és compatible, aquesta configuració s'ignorarà. [member "
"xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/enabled] s'ha d'habilitar perquè aquesta "
"configuració es pugui utilitzar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the persistent anchors extension is "
"requested. If supported, you will be able to store spatial anchors and they "
"will be restored on application startup.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities, spatial "
"anchors, and spatial persistence extensions are supported by the XR runtime. "
"If not supported this setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/"
"spatial_entity/enabled] and [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enable_spatial_anchors] must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es demana suport per a l'extensió d'ancoratges "
"persistents. Si s'admet, podreu emmagatzemar ancoratges espacials i es "
"restauraran a l'inici de l'aplicació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això requereix que les entitats espacials, els ancoratges "
"espacials i les extensions de persistència espacial d'OpenXR siguin "
"compatibles amb el temps d'execució XR. Si no és compatible, aquesta "
"configuració s'ignorarà. [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enabled] i [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enable_spatial_anchors] s'han d'habilitar perquè aquesta configuració es "
"pugui utilitzar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the plane tracking extension is requested. "
"If supported, you will be able to query information about planes detected by "
"the XR runtime, e.g. walls, floors, etc.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities and plane "
"tracking extensions are supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this "
"setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enabled] must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es demana suport per a l'extensió de seguiment de "
"l'avió. Si és compatible, podreu consultar informació sobre els avions "
"detectats pel temps d'execució XR, p. parets, terres, etc.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això requereix que les entitats espacials OpenXR i les "
"extensions de seguiment de plànols siguin compatibles amb el temps "
"d'execució XR. Si no és compatible, aquesta configuració s'ignorarà. [member "
"xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/enabled] s'ha d'habilitar perquè aquesta "
"configuració es pugui utilitzar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the spatial anchors extension is "
"requested. If supported, you will be able to register anchor locations in "
"the real world that the XR runtime will adjust as needed and/or potentially "
"share with other headsets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities and spatial "
"anchors extensions are supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this "
"setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enabled] must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es demana suport per a l'extensió d'ancoratges "
"espacials. Si s'admet, podreu registrar ubicacions d'ancoratge al món real "
"que el temps d'execució XR ajustarà segons sigui necessari i/o possiblement "
"compartirà amb altres auriculars.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això requereix que les entitats espacials i les extensions "
"d'ancoratges espacials d'OpenXR siguin compatibles amb el temps d'execució "
"XR. Si no és compatible, aquesta configuració s'ignorarà. [member xr/openxr/"
"extensions/spatial_entity/enabled] s'ha d'habilitar perquè aquesta "
"configuració es pugui utilitzar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the spatial entity extension is requested. "
"If supported, you will be able to access spatial information about the real "
"environment around you. What information is available is dependent on "
"additional extensions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities extension is "
"supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this setting will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es demana suport per a l'extensió d'entitat espacial. "
"Si és compatible, podreu accedir a informació espacial sobre l'entorn real "
"que us envolta. La informació disponible depèn de les extensions "
"addicionals.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això requereix que l'extensió d'entitats espacials OpenXR sigui "
"compatible amb el temps d'execució XR. Si no és compatible, aquesta "
"configuració s'ignorarà."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the user presence extension is enabled if available."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specify whether OpenXR should be configured for an HMD or a hand held device."
msgstr ""
"Especifiqueu si OpenXR s'ha de configurar per a un HMD o un dispositiu de mà."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and foveation is supported, will automatically adjust "
"foveation level based on framerate up to the level set on [member xr/openxr/"
"foveation_level]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] i la foveació és compatible, s'ajustarà automàticament "
"el nivell de foveació en funció de la velocitat de fotogrames fins al nivell "
"establert a [member xr/openxr/foveation_level]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and foveation level is set to anything other than "
"\"Disabled\", eye-tracked foveation will be used, so long as it's supported "
"by the headset."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] i el nivell de foveació s'estableix en qualsevol altra "
"cosa que no sigui \"Desactivat\", s'utilitzarà la foveació amb seguiment "
"visual, sempre que sigui compatible amb l'auricular."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Applied foveation level if supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On platforms other than Android, if [member rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] is enabled, this feature will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Nivell de foveació aplicat si és compatible.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En plataformes diferents d'Android, si [member rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] està habilitat, aquesta funció estarà "
"desactivada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and foveation is also enabled, subsampled images will "
"be used on Vulkan. This can improve the performance gain from foveated "
"rendering, especially when using high foveation levels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b]: Using subsampled images is incompatible with many screen-space "
"rendering features or post-processing effects like FXAA or glow. If any such "
"effects are enabled, subsampled images will automatically be disabled and a "
"warning shown in the log."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] i la foveació també està activada, s'utilitzaran "
"imatges submostrejades a Vulkan. Això pot millorar el rendiment de la "
"renderització foveated, especialment quan s'utilitzen nivells alts de "
"foveation.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b]: l'ús d'imatges submostrejades és incompatible amb moltes "
"funcions de representació de l'espai de pantalla o efectes de "
"postprocessament com FXAA o resplendor. Si s'habilita algun d'aquests "
"efectes, les imatges submostrejades es desactivaran automàticament i es "
"mostrarà un avís al registre."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Specify the default reference space."
msgstr "Especifiqueu l'espai de referència predeterminat."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Godot will display an alert modal when OpenXR "
"initialization fails on startup."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], Godot mostrarà una alerta modal quan la inicialització "
"de l'OpenXR falla a l'inici."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], OpenXR will manage the depth buffer and use the depth "
"buffer for advanced reprojection provided this is supported by the XR "
"runtime. Note that some rendering features in Godot can't be used with this "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], OpenXR gestionarà la memòria intermèdia de profunditat "
"i utilitzarà la memòria intermèdia de profunditat per a la reprojecció "
"avançada sempre que això sigui compatible amb el temps d'execució de XR. "
"Tingueu en compte que algunes funcions de renderització de Godot no es poden "
"utilitzar amb aquesta funció."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Optionally sets a specific API version of OpenXR to initialize in "
"[code]major.minor.patch[/code] notation. Some XR runtimes gate old behavior "
"behind version checks. This is non-standard OpenXR behavior."
msgstr ""
"Opcionalment, estableix una versió de l'API específica d'OpenXR per "
"inicialitzar-se en la notació [code]major.minor.patch[/code]. Alguns temps "
"d'execució d'XR contenen el comportament antic darrere de les comprovacions "
"de versions. Aquest és un comportament OpenXR no estàndard."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specify the view configuration with which to configure OpenXR setting up "
"either Mono or Stereo rendering."
msgstr ""
"Especifiqueu la configuració de la vista amb la qual configurar l'OpenXR amb "
"la representació mono o estèreo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], Godot will compile shaders required for XR."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], Godot compilarà els shaders necessaris per a XR."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Emitted when any setting is changed, up to once per process frame."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es canvia qualsevol paràmetre, fins a una vegada per marc de "
"procés."

#: doc/classes/PropertyTweener.xml
msgid "Interpolates an [Object]'s property over time."
msgstr "Interpola la propietat d'un [Object] al llarg del temps."

#: doc/classes/PropertyTweener.xml
msgid ""
"[PropertyTweener] is used to interpolate a property in an object. See "
"[method Tween.tween_property] for more usage information.\n"
"The tweener will finish automatically if the target object is freed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method Tween.tween_property] is the only correct way to create "
"[PropertyTweener]. Any [PropertyTweener] created manually will not function "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"[PropertyTweener] s'utilitza per interpolar una propietat en un objecte. "
"Vegeu [method Tween.tween_property] per obtenir més informació sobre l'ús.\n"
"El tweener finalitzarà automàticament si s'allibera l'objecte objectiu.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method Tween.tween_property] és l'única manera correcta de "
"crear [PropertyTweener]. Qualsevol [PropertyTweener] creat manualment no "
"funcionarà correctament."

#: doc/classes/PropertyTweener.xml
msgid ""
"When called, the final value will be used as a relative value instead.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Move the node by [code]100[/code] pixels to the right.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var tween = get_tree().create_tween()\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2.RIGHT * 100, "
"1).as_relative()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Tween tween = GetTree().CreateTween();\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", Vector2.Right * 100.0f, "
"1.0f).AsRelative();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Quan es crida, el valor final s'utilitzarà com a valor relatiu.\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] Mou el node [code]100[/code] a la dreta.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var tween = get_tree().create_tween()\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"posició\", Vector2.RIGHT * 100, "
"1).as_relative()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Tween tween = GetTree().CreateTween();\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(això, \"posició\", Vector2.Right * 100.0f, "
"1.0f).AsRelative();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/PropertyTweener.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom initial value to the [PropertyTweener].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Move the node from position [code](100, 100)[/code] to [code]"
"(200, 100)[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var tween = get_tree().create_tween()\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2(200, 100), "
"1).from(Vector2(100, 100))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Tween tween = GetTree().CreateTween();\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", new Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).From(new Vector2(100.0f, 100.0f));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PropertyTweener.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the [PropertyTweener] use the current property value (i.e. at the time "
"of creating this [PropertyTweener]) as a starting point. This is equivalent "
"of using [method from] with the current value. These two calls will do the "
"same:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2(200, 100), "
"1).from(position)\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2(200, 100), "
"1).from_current()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", new Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).From(Position);\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", new Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).FromCurrent();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Fa que [PropertyTweener] utilitzi el valor de propietat actual (és a dir, en "
"el moment de crear aquest [PropertyTweener]) com a punt de partida. Això "
"equival a utilitzar [method from] amb el valor actual. Aquestes dues "
"trucades faran el mateix:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"posició\", Vector2(200, 100), 1).from(posició)\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"posició\", Vector2(200, 100), "
"1).from_current()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(això, \"posició\", nou Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).From(Posició);\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(això, \"posició\", nou Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).FromCurrent();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/PropertyTweener.xml
msgid ""
"Allows interpolating the value with a custom easing function. The provided "
"[param interpolator_method] will be called with a value ranging from "
"[code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code] and is expected to return a value "
"within the same range (values outside the range can be used for overshoot). "
"The return value of the method is then used for interpolation between "
"initial and final value. Note that the parameter passed to the method is "
"still subject to the tweener's own easing.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export var curve: Curve\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar tween = create_tween()\n"
"\t# Interpolate the value using a custom curve.\n"
"\ttween.tween_property(self, \"position:x\", 300, "
"1).as_relative().set_custom_interpolator(tween_curve)\n"
"\n"
"func tween_curve(v):\n"
"\treturn curve.sample_baked(v)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export]\n"
"public Curve Curve { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tTween tween = CreateTween();\n"
"\t// Interpolate the value using a custom curve.\n"
"\tCallable tweenCurveCallable = Callable.From<float, float>(TweenCurve);\n"
"\ttween.TweenProperty(this, \"position:x\", 300.0f, "
"1.0f).AsRelative().SetCustomInterpolator(tweenCurveCallable);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private float TweenCurve(float value)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn Curve.SampleBaked(value);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Permet interpolar el valor amb una funció de relaxació personalitzada. El "
"[param interpolator_method] proporcionat es cridarà amb un valor que va des "
"de [code]0.0[/code] fins a [code]1.0[/code] i s'espera que torni un valor "
"dins del mateix interval (es poden utilitzar valors fora de l'interval). El "
"valor de retorn del mètode s'utilitza llavors per a la interpolació entre el "
"valor inicial i el final. Tingueu en compte que el paràmetre passat al "
"mètode encara està subjecte a la facilitat del propi tweener.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export var curve: corba\n"
"\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tvar tween = create_tween()\n"
"\t# Interpoleu el valor mitjançant una corba personalitzada.\n"
"\ttween.tween_property(self, \"posició:x\", 300, "
"1).as_relative().set_custom_interpolator(tween_curve)\n"
"\n"
"func tween_curve(v):\n"
"\tcorba de retorn.sample_baked(v)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export]\n"
"corba pública { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"anul·lació pública void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tTween tween = CreateTween();\n"
"\t// Interpola el valor mitjançant una corba personalitzada.\n"
"\tCallable tweenCurveCallable = Callable.From<float, float>(TweenCurve);\n"
"\ttween.TweenProperty(això, \"posició:x\", 300.0f, "
"1.0f).AsRelative().SetCustomInterpolator(tweenCurveCallable);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"flotant privat TweenCurve (valor flotant)\n"
"{\n"
"\tretorn Curve.SampleBaked(valor);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/PropertyTweener.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the time in seconds after which the [PropertyTweener] will start "
"interpolating. By default there's no delay."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el temps en segons després del qual [PropertyTweener] començarà a "
"interpolar-se. Per defecte no hi ha cap retard."

#: doc/classes/QuadMesh.xml
msgid "Class representing a square mesh facing the camera."
msgstr "Classe que representa una malla quadrada davant la càmera."

#: doc/classes/QuadMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Class representing a square [PrimitiveMesh]. This flat mesh does not have a "
"thickness. By default, this mesh is aligned on the X and Y axes; this "
"rotation is more suited for use with billboarded materials. A [QuadMesh] is "
"equivalent to a [PlaneMesh] except its default [member "
"PlaneMesh.orientation] is [constant PlaneMesh.FACE_Z]."
msgstr ""
"Classe que representa un quadrat [PrimitiveMesh]. Aquesta malla plana no té "
"un gruix. Per defecte, aquesta malla està alineada als eixos X i Y; aquesta "
"rotació és més adequada per al seu ús amb materials publicitaris. Un "
"[QuadMesh] és equivalent a un [PlaneMesh] tret que el seu [member "
"PlaneMesh.orientation] per defecte és [constant PlaneMesh.FACE_Z]."

#: doc/classes/QuadMesh.xml doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
#: doc/classes/Viewport.xml doc/classes/ViewportTexture.xml
msgid "2D in 3D Viewport Demo"
msgstr "Demostració de la finestra 2D en 3D"

#: doc/classes/QuadOccluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"Flat plane shape for use with occlusion culling in [OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"Forma plana per utilitzar-la amb l'eliminació d'oclusió a "
"[OccluderInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/QuadOccluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"[QuadOccluder3D] stores a flat plane shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system. See also [PolygonOccluder3D] if you need to "
"customize the quad's shape.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""
"[QuadOccluder3D] emmagatzema una forma plana que pot ser utilitzada pel "
"sistema d'eliminació d'oclusió del motor. Vegeu també [PolygonOccluder3D] si "
"necessiteu personalitzar la forma del quad.\n"
"Consulteu la documentació de [OccluderInstance3D] per obtenir instruccions "
"sobre com configurar l'eliminació d'oclusió."

#: doc/classes/QuadOccluder3D.xml
msgid "The quad's size in 3D units."
msgstr "Mida del quad en unitats 3D."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid "A unit quaternion used for representing 3D rotations."
msgstr "Un quaternió unitat utilitzat per representar rotacions 3D."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"The [Quaternion] built-in [Variant] type is a 4D data structure that "
"represents rotation in the form of a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Quaternions_and_spatial_rotation]Hamilton convention quaternion[/url]. "
"Compared to the [Basis] type which can store both rotation and scale, "
"quaternions can [i]only[/i] store rotation.\n"
"A [Quaternion] is composed by 4 floating-point components: [member w], "
"[member x], [member y], and [member z]. These components are very compact in "
"memory, and because of this some operations are more efficient and less "
"likely to cause floating-point errors. Methods such as [method get_angle], "
"[method get_axis], and [method slerp] are faster than their [Basis] "
"counterparts.\n"
"For a great introduction to quaternions, see [url=https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=d4EgbgTm0Bg]this video by 3Blue1Brown[/url]. You do not need to know "
"the math behind quaternions, as Godot provides several helper methods that "
"handle it for you. These include [method slerp] and [method "
"spherical_cubic_interpolate], as well as the [code]*[/code] operator.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternions must be normalized before being used for rotation "
"(see [method normalized]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Similarly to [Vector2] and [Vector3], the components of a "
"quaternion use 32-bit precision by default, unlike [float] which is always "
"64-bit. If double precision is needed, compile the engine with the option "
"[code]precision=double[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a quaternion will evaluate to "
"[code]false[/code] if it's equal to [constant IDENTITY]. Otherwise, a "
"quaternion will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El tipus [Quaternion] [Variant] integrat és una estructura de dades 4D que "
"representa la rotació en forma d'un quaternion de la convenció [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quaternions_and_spatial_rotation]Hamilton[/url]. En "
"comparació amb el tipus [Basis] que pot emmagatzemar tant la rotació com "
"l'escala, els quaternions poden [i]only[/i] emmagatzemar la rotació.\n"
"Un [Quaternion] està format per 4 components de coma flotant: [member w], "
"[member x], [member y] i [member z]. Aquests components són molt compactes a "
"la memòria i, per això, algunes operacions són més eficients i tenen menys "
"probabilitats de provocar errors de coma flotant. Mètodes com ara [method "
"get_angle], [method get_axis] i [method slerp] són més ràpids que els seus "
"homòlegs [Basis].\n"
"Per obtenir una gran introducció als quaternions, vegeu [url=https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=d4EgbgTm0Bg]aquest vídeo de 3Blue1Brown[/url]. No "
"cal que conegueu les matemàtiques que hi ha darrere dels quaternions, ja que "
"Godot ofereix diversos mètodes d'ajuda que us ho gestionen. Aquests inclouen "
"[method slerp] i [method spherical_cubic_interpolate], així com l'operador "
"[code]*[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els quaternions s'han de normalitzar abans d'utilitzar-los per "
"a la rotació (vegeu [method normalized]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] De manera semblant a [Vector2] i [Vector3], els components d'un "
"quaternió utilitzen una precisió de 32 bits per defecte, a diferència de "
"[float] que sempre és de 29@@. Si cal una doble precisió, compileu el motor "
"amb l'opció [code]precision=double[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En un context booleà, un quaternió s'avaluarà com a "
"[code]false[/code] si és igual a [constant IDENTITY]. En cas contrari, un "
"quaternió sempre s'avaluarà a [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid "3Blue1Brown's video on Quaternions"
msgstr "Vídeo de 3Blue1Brown sobre Quaternions"

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid "Online Quaternion Visualization"
msgstr "Visualització en línia del quaternió"

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid "Advanced Quaternion Visualization"
msgstr "Visualització avançada del quaternió"

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] identical to [constant IDENTITY].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this constructs a [Quaternion] with all of its "
"components set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Quaternion] idèntic a [constant IDENTITY].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, això construeix un [Quaternion] amb tots els seus "
"components establerts a [code]@0.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Quaternion] as a copy of the given [Quaternion]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Quaternion] com a còpia del [Quaternion] donat."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] representing the shortest arc between [param "
"arc_from] and [param arc_to]. These can be imagined as two points "
"intersecting a sphere's surface, with a radius of [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Quaternion] que representa l'arc més curt entre [param "
"arc_from] i [param arc_to]. Es poden imaginar com dos punts que tallen la "
"superfície d'una esfera, amb un radi de [code]1.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] representing rotation around the [param axis] by "
"the given [param angle], in radians. The axis must be a normalized vector."
msgstr ""
"Construeix una [Quaternion] que representa la rotació al voltant de la "
"[param axis] per la [param angle] donada, en radians. L'eix ha de ser un "
"vector normalitzat."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] from the given rotation [Basis].\n"
"This constructor is faster than [method Basis.get_rotation_quaternion], but "
"the given basis must be [i]orthonormalized[/i] (see [method "
"Basis.orthonormalized]). Otherwise, the constructor fails and returns "
"[constant IDENTITY]."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Quaternion] a partir de la rotació donada [Basis].\n"
"Aquest constructor és més ràpid que [method Basis.get_rotation_quaternion], "
"però la base donada ha de ser [i]orthonormalized[/i] (vegeu [method "
"Basis.orthonormalized]). En cas contrari, el constructor falla i retorna "
"[constant IDENTITY]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] defined by the given values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only normalized quaternions represent rotation; if these values "
"are not normalized, the new [Quaternion] will not be a valid rotation."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Quaternion] definit pels valors donats.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només els quaternions normalitzats representen la rotació; si "
"aquests valors no es normalitzen, la nova [Quaternion] no serà una rotació "
"vàlida."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the angle between this quaternion and [param to]. This is the "
"magnitude of the angle you would need to rotate by to get from one to the "
"other.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The magnitude of the floating-point error for this method is "
"abnormally high, so methods such as [code]is_zero_approx[/code] will not "
"work reliably."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'angle entre aquest quaternió i [param to]. Aquesta és la magnitud "
"de l'angle amb el qual hauríeu de girar per passar d'un a l'altre.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La magnitud de l'error de coma flotant d'aquest mètode és "
"anormalment alta, de manera que mètodes com ara [code]is_zero_approx[/code] "
"no funcionaran de manera fiable."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the dot product between this quaternion and [param with].\n"
"This is equivalent to [code](quat.x * with.x) + (quat.y * with.y) + (quat.z "
"* with.z) + (quat.w * with.w)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el producte escalat entre aquest quaternió i [param with].\n"
"Això és equivalent a [code](quat.x * with.x) + (quat.y * with.y) + (quat.z * "
"with.z) + (quat.w * with.w)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the exponential of this quaternion. The rotation axis of the result "
"is the normalized rotation axis of this quaternion, the angle of the result "
"is the length of the vector part of this quaternion."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'exponencial d'aquest quaternió. L'eix de rotació del resultat és "
"l'eix de rotació normalitzat d'aquest quaternió, l'angle del resultat és la "
"longitud de la part vectorial d'aquest quaternió."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a new [Quaternion] from the given [Vector3] of [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], in radians. In Godot, "
"Euler angles always use intrinsic order. This method always uses the "
"intrinsic YXZ convention ([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ])."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un nou [Quaternion] a partir del [Vector3] donat de [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], en radians. A Godot, "
"els angles d'Euler sempre utilitzen ordre intrínsec. Aquest mètode sempre "
"utilitza la convenció YXZ intrínseca ([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ])."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the angle of the rotation represented by this quaternion.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The quaternion must be normalized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'angle de rotació representat per aquest quaternió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El quaternió s'ha de normalitzar."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis of the rotation represented by this quaternion."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns this quaternion's rotation as a [Vector3] of [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], in radians.\n"
"The order of each consecutive rotation can be changed with [param order] "
"(see [enum EulerOrder] constants). In Godot, Euler angles always use "
"intrinsic order. By default, the intrinsic YXZ convention is used ([constant "
"EULER_ORDER_YXZ]): since we are decomposing, local Z (roll) is calculated "
"first, then local X (pitch), and lastly local Y (yaw). When using the "
"opposite method [method from_euler] to compose a rotation, this order is "
"reversed."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la rotació d'aquest quaternió com a [Vector3] de [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], en radians.\n"
"L'ordre de cada rotació consecutiva es pot canviar amb [param order] (vegeu "
"les constants [enum EulerOrder]). A Godot, els angles d'Euler sempre "
"utilitzen ordre intrínsec. De manera predeterminada, s'utilitza la convenció "
"intrínseca YXZ ([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ]): com que estem descomposant, "
"primer es calcula la Z local (rodall), després la X local (pas) i, "
"finalment, la Y local (guiada). Quan s'utilitza el mètode contrari [method "
"from_euler] per compondre una rotació, aquest ordre s'inverteix."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the inverse version of this quaternion, inverting the sign of every "
"component except [member w]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la versió inversa d'aquest quaternió, invertint el signe de cada "
"component excepte [member w]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this quaternion and [param to] are "
"approximately equal, by calling [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] on "
"each component."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest quaternió i [param to] són "
"aproximadament iguals, trucant a [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] a "
"cada component."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this quaternion is finite, by calling [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] on each component."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest quaternió és finit, trucant a [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] a cada component."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this quaternion is normalized. See also [method "
"normalized]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid "Returns this quaternion's length, also called magnitude."
msgstr "Retorna la longitud d'aquest quaternió, també anomenada magnitud."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns this quaternion's length, squared.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is faster than [method length], so prefer it if you "
"only need to compare quaternion lengths."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la longitud d'aquest quaternió, al quadrat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode és més ràpid que [method length], així que "
"preferiu-lo si només necessiteu comparar les longituds dels quaternions."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the logarithm of this quaternion. Multiplies this quaternion's "
"rotation axis by its rotation angle, and stores the result in the returned "
"quaternion's vector part ([member x], [member y], and [member z]). The "
"returned quaternion's real part ([member w]) is always [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el logaritme d'aquest quaternió. Multiplica l'eix de rotació "
"d'aquest quaternió pel seu angle de rotació i emmagatzema el resultat a la "
"part vectorial del quaternió retornat ([member x], [member y] i [member z]). "
"La part real del quaternió retornat ([member w]) sempre és [code]0.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this quaternion, normalized so that its length is "
"[code]1.0[/code]. See also [method is_normalized]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest quaternió, normalitzada de manera que la seva "
"longitud sigui [code]1.0[/code]. Vegeu també [method is_normalized]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a spherical-linear interpolation with the [param to] quaternion, "
"given a [param weight] and returns the result. Both this quaternion and "
"[param to] must be normalized."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una interpolació esfèrica-lineal amb el quaternió [param to], donat "
"un [param weight] i retorna el resultat. Tant aquest quaternió com [param "
"to] s'han de normalitzar."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a spherical-linear interpolation with the [param to] quaternion, "
"given a [param weight] and returns the result. Unlike [method slerp], this "
"method does not check if the rotation path is smaller than 90 degrees. Both "
"this quaternion and [param to] must be normalized."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una interpolació esfèrica-lineal amb el quaternió [param to], donat "
"un [param weight] i retorna el resultat. A diferència de [method slerp], "
"aquest mètode no verifica si el camí de rotació és inferior a 90 graus. Tant "
"aquest quaternió com [param to] s'han de normalitzar."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a spherical cubic interpolation between quaternions [param pre_a], "
"this vector, [param b], and [param post_b], by the given amount [param "
"weight]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una interpolació cúbica esfèrica entre quaternions [param pre_a], "
"aquest vector, [param b] i [param post_b], per la quantitat donada [param "
"weight]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a spherical cubic interpolation between quaternions [param pre_a], "
"this vector, [param b], and [param post_b], by the given amount [param "
"weight].\n"
"It can perform smoother interpolation than [method "
"spherical_cubic_interpolate] by the time values."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una interpolació cúbica esfèrica entre quaternions [param pre_a], "
"aquest vector, [param b] i [param post_b], per la quantitat donada [param "
"weight].\n"
"Pot realitzar una interpolació més suau que [method "
"spherical_cubic_interpolate] pels valors de temps."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"W component of the quaternion. This is the \"real\" part.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"Component W del quaternió. Aquesta és la part \"real\".\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els components de Quaternion normalment no s'han de manipular "
"directament."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"X component of the quaternion. This is the value along the \"imaginary\" "
"[code]i[/code] axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"X component del quaternió. Aquest és el valor al llarg de l'eix "
"\"imaginari\" [code]i[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els components de Quaternion normalment no s'han de manipular "
"directament."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Y component of the quaternion. This is the value along the \"imaginary\" "
"[code]j[/code] axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"component Y del quaternió. Aquest és el valor al llarg de l'eix "
"\"imaginari\" [code]j[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els components de Quaternion normalment no s'han de manipular "
"directament."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Z component of the quaternion. This is the value along the \"imaginary\" "
"[code]k[/code] axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"Component Z del quaternió. Aquest és el valor al llarg de l'eix "
"\"imaginari\" [code]k[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els components de Quaternion normalment no s'han de manipular "
"directament."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"The identity quaternion, representing no rotation. This has the same "
"rotation as [constant Basis.IDENTITY].\n"
"If a [Vector3] is rotated (multiplied) by this quaternion, it does not "
"change.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, this constant is equivalent to creating a "
"[constructor Quaternion] without any arguments. It can be used to make your "
"code clearer, and for consistency with C#."
msgstr ""
"El quaternió d'identitat, que no representa cap rotació. Té la mateixa "
"rotació que [constant Basis.IDENTITY].\n"
"Si un [Vector3] es gira (multiplica) per aquest quaternió, no canvia.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A GDScript, aquesta constant equival a crear un [constructor "
"Quaternion] sense cap argument. Es pot utilitzar per fer que el vostre codi "
"sigui més clar i per a la coherència amb C#."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the components of both quaternions are not "
"exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els components dels dos quaternions no són "
"exactament iguals.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa dels errors de precisió de coma flotant, considereu "
"utilitzar [method is_equal_approx], que és més fiable."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Composes (multiplies) two quaternions. This rotates the [param right] "
"quaternion (the child) by this quaternion (the parent)."
msgstr ""
"Compon (multiplica) dos quaternions. Això gira el quaternió [param right] "
"(el fill) per aquest quaternió (el pare)."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates (multiplies) the [param right] vector by this quaternion, returning "
"a [Vector3]."
msgstr ""
"Gira (multiplica) el vector [param right] per aquest quaternió, retornant un "
"[Vector3]."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [float] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada component del [Quaternion] pel valor [float] correcte.\n"
"Aquesta operació no té sentit per si sola, però es pot utilitzar com a part "
"d'una expressió més gran."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [int] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada component del [Quaternion] pel valor [int] correcte.\n"
"Aquesta operació no té sentit per si sola, però es pot utilitzar com a part "
"d'una expressió més gran."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Adds each component of the left [Quaternion] to the right [Quaternion].\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression, such as approximating an intermediate rotation between "
"two nearby rotations."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix cada component de la [Quaternion] esquerre a la dreta [Quaternion].\n"
"Aquesta operació no té sentit per si sola, però es pot utilitzar com a part "
"d'una expressió més gran, com ara aproximar una rotació intermèdia entre "
"dues rotacions properes."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Subtracts each component of the left [Quaternion] by the right "
"[Quaternion].\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"Resta cada component de l'esquerra [Quaternion] per la dreta [Quaternion].\n"
"Aquesta operació no té sentit per si sola, però es pot utilitzar com a part "
"d'una expressió més gran."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Divides each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [float] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"Divideix cada component del [Quaternion] pel valor [float] correcte.\n"
"Aquesta operació no té sentit per si sola, però es pot utilitzar com a part "
"d'una expressió més gran."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Divides each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [int] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"Divideix cada component del [Quaternion] pel valor [int] correcte.\n"
"Aquesta operació no té sentit per si sola, però es pot utilitzar com a part "
"d'una expressió més gran."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the components of both quaternions are exactly "
"equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els components dels dos quaternions són "
"exactament iguals.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa dels errors de precisió de coma flotant, considereu "
"utilitzar [method is_equal_approx], que és més fiable."

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Accesses each component of this quaternion by their index.\n"
"Index [code]0[/code] is the same as [member x], index [code]1[/code] is the "
"same as [member y], index [code]2[/code] is the same as [member z], and "
"index [code]3[/code] is the same as [member w]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Quaternion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [Quaternion]. This is the same as "
"multiplying all components by [code]-1[/code]. This operation results in a "
"quaternion that represents the same rotation."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor negatiu de [Quaternion]. Això és el mateix que multiplicar "
"tots els components per [code]-1[/code]. Aquesta operació dóna com a "
"resultat un quaternió que representa la mateixa rotació."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid "Provides methods for generating pseudo-random numbers."
msgstr "Proporciona mètodes per generar nombres pseudoaleatoris."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"RandomNumberGenerator is a class for generating pseudo-random numbers. It "
"currently uses [url=https://www.pcg-random.org/]PCG32[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The underlying algorithm is an implementation detail and should "
"not be depended upon.\n"
"To generate a random float number (within a given range) based on a time-"
"dependent seed:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar my_random_number = rng.randf_range(-10.0, 10.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"RandomNumberGenerator és una classe per generar números pseudoaleatoris. "
"Actualment utilitza [url=https://www.pcg-random.org/]PCG32[/url].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'algorisme subjacent és un detall d'implementació i no s'ha de "
"dependre d'ell.\n"
"Per generar un nombre flotant aleatori (dins d'un rang determinat) basat en "
"una llavor que depèn del temps:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tvar el meu_número_aleatori = rng.randf_range(-10,0, 10,0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a random integer between [code]0[/code] and the size of the array "
"that is passed as a parameter. Each value in the array should be a floating-"
"point number that represents the relative likelihood that it will be "
"returned as an index. A higher value means the value is more likely to be "
"returned as an index, while a value of [code]0[/code] means it will never be "
"returned as an index.\n"
"For example, if [code skip-lint][0.5, 1, 1, 2][/code] is passed as a "
"parameter, then the method is twice as likely to return [code]3[/code] (the "
"index of the value [code]2[/code]) and twice as unlikely to return [code]0[/"
"code] (the index of the value [code]0.5[/code]) compared to the indices "
"[code]1[/code] and [code]2[/code].\n"
"Prints an error and returns [code]-1[/code] if the array is empty.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"\n"
"var my_array = [\"one\", \"two\", \"three\", \"four\"]\n"
"var weights = PackedFloat32Array([0.5, 1, 1, 2])\n"
"\n"
"# Prints one of the four elements in `my_array`.\n"
"# It is more likely to print \"four\", and less likely to print \"one\".\n"
"print(my_array[rng.rand_weighted(weights)])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random float between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] "
"(inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un valor flotant pseudoaleatori entre [code]0.0[/code] i [code]1.0[/"
"code] (inclosos)."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random float between [param from] and [param to] "
"(inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un valor flotant pseudoaleatori entre [param from] i [param to] "
"(inclosos)."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Normal_distribution]normally-"
"distributed[/url], pseudo-random floating-point number from the specified "
"[param mean] and a standard [param deviation]. This is also known as a "
"Gaussian distribution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method uses the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Box%E2%80%93Muller_transform]Box-Muller transform[/url] algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Normal_distribution]normalment-"
"distributed[/url], un nombre de coma flotant pseudoaleatori del [param mean] "
"especificat i un [param deviation] estàndard. També es coneix com a "
"distribució gaussiana.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode utilitza l'algorisme [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Box%E2%80%93Muller_transform]Box-Muller transform[/"
"url]."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random 32-bit unsigned integer between [code]0[/code] and "
"[code]4294967295[/code] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un nombre enter sense signe pseudoaleatori de 32 bits entre [code]0[/"
"code] i [code]@4294967295[/code] (inclosos)."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random 32-bit signed integer between [param from] and "
"[param to] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un nombre enter amb signe pseudoaleatori de 32 bits entre [param "
"from] i [param to] (inclosos)."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Sets up a time-based seed for this [RandomNumberGenerator] instance. Unlike "
"the [@GlobalScope] random number generation functions, different "
"[RandomNumberGenerator] instances can use different seeds."
msgstr ""
"Configura una llavor basada en el temps per a aquesta instància "
"[RandomNumberGenerator]. A diferència de les funcions de generació de "
"números aleatoris [@GlobalScope], diferents instàncies de "
"[RandomNumberGenerator] poden utilitzar llavors diferents."

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the random number generator state based on the given seed value. "
"A given seed will give a reproducible sequence of pseudo-random numbers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The RNG does not have an avalanche effect, and can output "
"similar random streams given similar seeds. Consider using a hash function "
"to improve your seed quality if they're sourced externally.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of this property is pseudo-random, and "
"changes when calling [method randomize]. The [code]0[/code] value documented "
"here is a placeholder, and not the actual default seed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property produces a side effect of changing the "
"internal [member state], so make sure to initialize the seed [i]before[/i] "
"modifying the [member state]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"rng.seed = hash(\"Godot\")\n"
"rng.state = 100 # Restore to some previously saved state.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RandomNumberGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"The current state of the random number generator. Save and restore this "
"property to restore the generator to a previous state:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"print(rng.randf())\n"
"var saved_state = rng.state # Store current state.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # Advance internal state.\n"
"rng.state = saved_state # Restore the state.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # Prints the same value as previously.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not set state to arbitrary values, since the random number "
"generator requires the state to have certain qualities to behave properly. "
"It should only be set to values that came from the state property itself. To "
"initialize the random number generator with arbitrary input, use [member "
"seed] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of this property is pseudo-random, and "
"changes when calling [method randomize]. The [code]0[/code] value documented "
"here is a placeholder, and not the actual default state."
msgstr ""
"Estat actual del generador de números aleatoris. Deseu i restaurau aquesta "
"propietat per restaurar el generador a un estat anterior:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"imprimir(rng.randf())\n"
"var save_state = rng.state # Emmagatzema l'estat actual.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # Estat intern avançat.\n"
"rng.state = saved_state # Restaura l'estat.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # Imprimeix el mateix valor que anteriorment.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No configureu l'estat en valors arbitraris, ja que el generador "
"de números aleatoris requereix que l'estat tingui certes qualitats per "
"comportar-se correctament. Només s'hauria de fixar en valors que provenien "
"de la pròpia propietat estatal. Per inicialitzar el generador de números "
"aleatoris amb entrada arbitrària, utilitzeu [member seed].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El valor per defecte d'aquesta propietat és pseudoaleatori i "
"canvia quan es crida a [method randomize]. El valor [code]0[/code] "
"documentat aquí és un marcador de posició, i no l'estat predeterminat real."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for controls that represent a number within a range."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a controls que representen un nombre dins d'un "
"interval."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Range is an abstract base class for controls that represent a number within "
"a range, using a configured [member step] and [member page] size. See e.g. "
"[ScrollBar] and [Slider] for examples of higher-level nodes using Range."
msgstr ""
"L'interval és una classe base abstracta per a controls que representen un "
"nombre dins d'un interval, utilitzant una mida configurada [member step] i "
"[member page]. Vegeu per ex. [ScrollBar] i [Slider] per obtenir exemples de "
"nodes de nivell superior que utilitzen Range."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the [Range]'s value is changed (following the same conditions as "
"[signal value_changed])."
msgstr ""
"Es crida quan es canvia el valor de [Range] (seguint les mateixes condicions "
"que [signal value_changed])."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Range]'s current value to the specified [param value], without "
"emitting the [signal value_changed] signal."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el valor actual de [Range] al [param value] especificat, sense "
"emetre el senyal [signal value_changed]."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Binds two [Range]s together along with any ranges previously grouped with "
"either of them. When any of range's member variables change, it will share "
"the new value with all other ranges in its group."
msgstr ""
"Uneix dos [Range]s juntament amb els intervals agrupats prèviament amb "
"qualsevol d'ells. Quan alguna de les variables membres de l'interval canvia, "
"compartirà el nou valor amb la resta d'intervals del seu grup."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid "Stops the [Range] from sharing its member variables with any other."
msgstr ""
"Impedeix que [Range] comparteixi les seves variables membres amb qualsevol "
"altre."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member value] may be greater than [member max_value]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [member value] pot ser superior a [member max_value]."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member value] may be less than [member min_value]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [member value] pot ser inferior a [member min_value]."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and [member min_value] is greater or equal to [code]0[/"
"code], [member value] will be represented exponentially rather than linearly."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] i [member min_value] és major o igual a [code]0[/code], "
"[member value] es representarà exponencialment en lloc de lineal."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum value. Range is clamped if [member value] is greater than [member "
"max_value]."
msgstr ""
"Valor màxim. L'interval es limita si [member value] és més gran que [member "
"max_value]."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum value. Range is clamped if [member value] is less than [member "
"min_value]."
msgstr ""
"Valor mínim. L'interval es limita si [member value] és inferior a [member "
"min_value]."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Page size. Used mainly for [ScrollBar]. A [ScrollBar]'s grabber length is "
"the [ScrollBar]'s size multiplied by [member page] over the difference "
"between [member min_value] and [member max_value]."
msgstr ""
"Mida de la pàgina. S'utilitza principalment per a [ScrollBar]. La longitud "
"de captura d'un [ScrollBar] és la mida de [ScrollBar] multiplicada per "
"[member page] sobre la diferència entre [member min_value] i [member "
"max_value]."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid "The value mapped between 0 and 1."
msgstr "El valor assignat entre 0 i 1."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member value] will always be rounded to the nearest "
"integer."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"If greater than [code]0.0[/code], [member value] will always be rounded to a "
"multiple of this property's value above [member min_value]. For example, if "
"[member min_value] is [code]0.1[/code] and step is [code]0.2[/code], then "
"[member value] is limited to [code]0.1[/code], [code]0.3[/code], [code]0.5[/"
"code], and so on. If [member rounded] is also [code]true[/code], [member "
"value] will first be rounded to a multiple of this property's value, then "
"rounded to the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"Si és superior a [code]0.0[/code], [member value] sempre s'arrodonirà a un "
"múltiple del valor d'aquesta propietat per sobre de [member min_value]. Per "
"exemple, si [member min_value] és [code]0.1[/code] i el pas és [code]0.2[/"
"code], aleshores [member value] es limita a [code]0.1[/code], [code]@0.3[/"
"code], [code]@0.5[/code], etc. Si [member rounded] també és [code]true[/"
"code], primer s'arrodonirà [member value] a un múltiple del valor d'aquesta "
"propietat i després s'arrodonirà a l'enter més proper."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Range's current value. Changing this property (even via code) will trigger "
"[signal value_changed] signal. Use [method set_value_no_signal] if you want "
"to avoid it."
msgstr ""
"Valor actual de l'interval. Si canvieu aquesta propietat (fins i tot "
"mitjançant el codi) s'activarà el senyal [signal value_changed]. Utilitzeu "
"[method set_value_no_signal] si voleu evitar-ho."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when [member min_value], [member max_value], [member page], or "
"[member step] change."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan canvien [member min_value], [member max_value], [member page] o "
"[member step]."

#: doc/classes/Range.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when [member value] changes. When used on a [Slider], this is called "
"continuously while dragging (potentially every frame). If you are performing "
"an expensive operation in a function connected to [signal value_changed], "
"consider using a [i]debouncing[/i] [Timer] to call the function less often.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike signals such as [signal LineEdit.text_changed], [signal "
"value_changed] is also emitted when [param value] is set directly via code."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan canvia [member value]. Quan s'utilitza en un [Slider], es crida "
"contínuament mentre s'arrossega (potencialment cada fotograma). Si esteu "
"realitzant una operació costosa en una funció connectada a [signal "
"value_changed], penseu a utilitzar un [i]debouncing[/i] [Timer] per trucar a "
"la funció amb menys freqüència.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A diferència de senyals com ara [signal LineEdit.text_changed], "
"[signal value_changed] també s'emet quan [param value] s'estableix "
"directament mitjançant codi."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"A ray in 2D space, used to find the first collision object it intersects."
msgstr ""
"Un raig a l'espai 2D, utilitzat per trobar el primer objecte de col·lisió "
"que talla."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"A raycast represents a ray from its origin to its [member target_position] "
"that finds the closest object along its path, if it intersects any.\n"
"[RayCast2D] can ignore some objects by adding them to an exception list, by "
"making its detection reporting ignore [Area2D]s ([member "
"collide_with_areas]) or [PhysicsBody2D]s ([member collide_with_bodies]), or "
"by configuring physics layers.\n"
"[RayCast2D] calculates intersection every physics frame, and it holds the "
"result until the next physics frame. For an immediate raycast, or if you "
"want to configure a [RayCast2D] multiple times within the same physics "
"frame, use [method force_raycast_update].\n"
"To sweep over a region of 2D space, you can approximate the region with "
"multiple [RayCast2D]s or use [ShapeCast2D]."
msgstr ""
"Un raycast representa un raig des del seu origen fins al seu [member "
"target_position] que troba l'objecte més proper al seu recorregut, si en "
"interseca algun.\n"
"[RayCast2D] pot ignorar alguns objectes afegint-los a una llista "
"d'excepcions, fent que el seu informe de detecció ignori [Area2D]s ([member "
"collide_with_areas]) o [PhysicsBody2D]s ([member collide_with_bodies]), o "
"mitjançant la configuració de layers.\n"
"[RayCast2D] calcula la intersecció de cada fotograma de física i manté el "
"resultat fins al següent fotograma de física. Per a un raycast immediat, o "
"si voleu configurar un [RayCast2D] diverses vegades dins del mateix marc de "
"física, utilitzeu [method force_raycast_update].\n"
"Per escombrar una regió d'espai 2D, podeu aproximar la regió amb diversos "
"[RayCast2D]s o utilitzar [ShapeCast2D]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the ray does not report collisions with the "
"specified [param node]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the ray does not report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una excepció de col·lisió perquè el raig no informi de col·lisions "
"amb el [RID] especificat."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid "Removes all collision exceptions for this ray."
msgstr "Elimina totes les excepcions de col·lisió per a aquest raig."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the collision information for the ray immediately, without waiting "
"for the next [code]_physics_process[/code] call. Use this method, for "
"example, when the ray or its parent has changed state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member enabled] does not need to be [code]true[/code] for this "
"to work."
msgstr ""
"Actualitza la informació de col·lisió del raig immediatament, sense esperar "
"a la propera trucada [code]_physics_process[/code]. Utilitzeu aquest mètode, "
"per exemple, quan el raig o el seu pare ha canviat d'estat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member enabled] no cal que sigui [code]true[/code] perquè això "
"funcioni."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the first object that the ray intersects, or [code]null[/code] if no "
"object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] returns "
"[code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This object is not guaranteed to be a [CollisionObject2D]. For "
"example, if the ray intersects a [TileMapLayer], the method will return a "
"[TileMapLayer] instance."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el primer objecte que interseca el raig, o [code]null[/code] si cap "
"objecte talla el raig (és a dir, [method is_colliding] retorna [code]false[/"
"code]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No es garanteix que aquest objecte sigui un "
"[CollisionObject2D]. Per exemple, si el raig talla una [TileMapLayer], el "
"mètode retornarà una instància [TileMapLayer]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the first object that the ray intersects, or an empty "
"[RID] if no object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] "
"returns [code]false[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [RID] del primer objecte que interseca el raig, o un [RID] buit "
"si cap objecte talla el raig (és a dir, [method is_colliding] retorna "
"[code]false[/code])."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the shape ID of the first object that the ray intersects, or "
"[code]0[/code] if no object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method "
"is_colliding] returns [code]false[/code]).\n"
"To get the intersected shape node, for a [CollisionObject2D] target, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # A CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner(owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject2D)GetCollider(); // A CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner(shapeId); // The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'ID de la forma del primer objecte que interseca el raig, o "
"[code]0[/code] si cap objecte talla el raig (és a dir, [method is_colliding] "
"retorna [code]false[/code]).\n"
"Per obtenir el node de forma intersecada, per a un objectiu "
"[CollisionObject2D], utilitzeu:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # A CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # L'índex de forma del col·lisionador.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # L'identificador del "
"propietari del col·lisionador.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner (owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject2D)GetCollider(); // Un CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // L'índex de forma del col·lisionador.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner (shapeId); // L'identificador del "
"propietari al col·lisionador.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the normal of the intersecting object's shape at the collision "
"point, or [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] if the ray starts inside the shape and "
"[member hit_from_inside] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Check that [method is_colliding] returns [code]true[/code] "
"before calling this method to ensure the returned normal is valid and up-to-"
"date."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision point at which the ray intersects the closest object, "
"in the global coordinate system. If [member hit_from_inside] is [code]true[/"
"code] and the ray starts inside of a collision shape, this function will "
"return the origin point of the ray.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Check that [method is_colliding] returns [code]true[/code] "
"before calling this method to ensure the returned point is valid and up-to-"
"date."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt de col·lisió en què el raig talla l'objecte més proper, al "
"sistema de coordenades global. Si [member hit_from_inside] és [code]true[/"
"code] i el raig comença dins d'una forma de col·lisió, aquesta funció "
"retornarà el punt d'origen del raig.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Comproveu que [method is_colliding] retorni [code]true[/code] "
"abans de trucar a aquest mètode per assegurar-vos que el punt retornat sigui "
"vàlid i actualitzat."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether any object is intersecting with the ray's vector "
"(considering the vector length)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si qualsevol objecte es talla amb el vector del raig (tenint en "
"compte la longitud del vector)."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the ray can report collisions with the "
"specified [param node]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the ray can report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr ""
"Elimina una excepció de col·lisió perquè el raig pugui informar de "
"col·lisions amb el [RID] especificat."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions with [Area2D]s will be reported."
msgstr "Si és [code]true[/code], es notificaran les col·lisions amb [Area2D]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], collisions with [PhysicsBody2D]s will be reported."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], s'informarà de les col·lisions amb [PhysicsBody2D]s."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The ray's collision mask. Only objects in at least one collision layer "
"enabled in the mask will be detected. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Màscara de col·lisió del raig. Només es detectaran objectes d'almenys una "
"capa de col·lisió activada a la màscara. Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i "
"màscares de col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions will be reported."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], s'informarà de les col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this raycast will not report collisions with its "
"parent node. This property only has an effect if the parent node is a "
"[CollisionObject2D]. See also [method Node.get_parent] and [method "
"add_exception]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aquest raycast no informarà de col·lisions amb el seu "
"node pare. Aquesta propietat només té efecte si el node pare és un "
"[CollisionObject2D]. Vegeu també [method Node.get_parent] i [method "
"add_exception]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ray will detect a hit when starting inside shapes. "
"In this case the collision normal will be [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]. Does "
"not affect concave polygon shapes."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el raig detectarà un cop quan comenci dins de les "
"formes. En aquest cas, la col·lisió normal serà [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]. "
"No afecta les formes de polígon còncau."

#: doc/classes/RayCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"The ray's destination point, relative to this raycast's [member "
"Node2D.position]."
msgstr ""
"El punt de destinació del raig, en relació amb el [member Node2D.position] "
"d'aquest raycast."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"A ray in 3D space, used to find the first collision object it intersects."
msgstr ""
"Un raig a l'espai 3D, utilitzat per trobar el primer objecte de col·lisió "
"que talla."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"A raycast represents a ray from its origin to its [member target_position] "
"that finds the closest object along its path, if it intersects any.\n"
"[RayCast3D] can ignore some objects by adding them to an exception list, by "
"making its detection reporting ignore [Area3D]s ([member "
"collide_with_areas]) or [PhysicsBody3D]s ([member collide_with_bodies]), or "
"by configuring physics layers.\n"
"[RayCast3D] calculates intersection every physics frame, and it holds the "
"result until the next physics frame. For an immediate raycast, or if you "
"want to configure a [RayCast3D] multiple times within the same physics "
"frame, use [method force_raycast_update].\n"
"To sweep over a region of 3D space, you can approximate the region with "
"multiple [RayCast3D]s or use [ShapeCast3D]."
msgstr ""
"Un raycast representa un raig des del seu origen fins al seu [member "
"target_position] que troba l'objecte més proper al seu recorregut, si en "
"interseca algun.\n"
"[RayCast3D] pot ignorar alguns objectes afegint-los a una llista "
"d'excepcions, fent que el seu informe de detecció ignori [Area3D]s ([member "
"collide_with_areas]) o [PhysicsBody3D]s ([member collide_with_bodies]), o "
"mitjançant la configuració de layers.\n"
"[RayCast3D] calcula la intersecció de cada fotograma de física i manté el "
"resultat fins al següent fotograma de física. Per a un raycast immediat, o "
"si voleu configurar un [RayCast3D] diverses vegades dins del mateix marc de "
"física, utilitzeu [method force_raycast_update].\n"
"Per escombrar una regió d'espai 3D, podeu aproximar la regió amb múltiples "
"[RayCast3D]s o utilitzar [ShapeCast3D]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the first object that the ray intersects, or [code]null[/code] if no "
"object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] returns "
"[code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This object is not guaranteed to be a [CollisionObject3D]. For "
"example, if the ray intersects a [CSGShape3D] or a [GridMap], the method "
"will return a [CSGShape3D] or [GridMap] instance."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el primer objecte que interseca el raig, o [code]null[/code] si cap "
"objecte talla el raig (és a dir, [method is_colliding] retorna [code]false[/"
"code]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No es garanteix que aquest objecte sigui un "
"[CollisionObject3D]. Per exemple, si el raig talla una [CSGShape3D] o una "
"[GridMap], el mètode retornarà una instància [CSGShape3D] o [GridMap]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the shape ID of the first object that the ray intersects, or "
"[code]0[/code] if no object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method "
"is_colliding] returns [code]false[/code]).\n"
"To get the intersected shape node, for a [CollisionObject3D] target, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # A CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner(owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject3D)GetCollider(); // A CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner(shapeId); // The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'ID de la forma del primer objecte que interseca el raig, o "
"[code]0[/code] si cap objecte talla el raig (és a dir, [method is_colliding] "
"retorna [code]false[/code]).\n"
"Per obtenir el node de forma intersecada, per a un objectiu "
"[CollisionObject3D], utilitzeu:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # A CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # L'índex de forma del col·lisionador.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # L'identificador del "
"propietari del col·lisionador.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner (owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject3D)GetCollider(); // Un CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // L'índex de forma del col·lisionador.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner (shapeId); // L'identificador del "
"propietari al col·lisionador.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision object's face index at the collision point, or "
"[code]-1[/code] if the shape intersecting the ray is not a "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de cara de l'objecte de col·lisió al punt de col·lisió, o "
"[code]-1[/code] si la forma que talla el raig no és un "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the normal of the intersecting object's shape at the collision "
"point, or [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] if the ray starts inside the shape "
"and [member hit_from_inside] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Check that [method is_colliding] returns [code]true[/code] "
"before calling this method to ensure the returned normal is valid and up-to-"
"date."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions with [Area3D]s will be reported."
msgstr "Si és [code]true[/code], es notificaran les col·lisions amb [Area3D]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], collisions with [PhysicsBody3D]s will be reported."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], s'informarà de les col·lisions amb [PhysicsBody3D]s."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The custom color to use to draw the shape in the editor and at run-time if "
"[b]Visible Collision Shapes[/b] is enabled in the [b]Debug[/b] menu. This "
"color will be highlighted at run-time if the [RayCast3D] is colliding with "
"something.\n"
"If set to [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (by default), the color set in "
"[member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/collision/shape_color] is used."
msgstr ""
"El color personalitzat que cal utilitzar per dibuixar la forma a l'editor i "
"en temps d'execució si [b]Formes de col·lisió visibles[/b] està habilitat al "
"menú [b]Debug[/b]. Aquest color es ressaltarà en temps d'execució si "
"[RayCast3D] xoca amb alguna cosa.\n"
"Si s'estableix en [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (per defecte), "
"s'utilitzarà el color establert a [member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/"
"collision/shape_color]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]1[/code], a line is used as the debug shape. Otherwise, a "
"truncated pyramid is drawn to represent the [RayCast3D]. Requires [b]Visible "
"Collision Shapes[/b] to be enabled in the [b]Debug[/b] menu for the debug "
"shape to be visible at run-time."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix a [code]1[/code], s'utilitza una línia com a forma de "
"depuració. En cas contrari, es dibuixa una piràmide truncada per representar "
"el [RayCast3D]. Requereix que [b]Formes de col·lisió visibles[/b] estiguin "
"habilitades al menú [b]Debug[/b] perquè la forma de depuració sigui visible "
"en temps d'execució."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this raycast will not report collisions with its "
"parent node. This property only has an effect if the parent node is a "
"[CollisionObject3D]. See also [method Node.get_parent] and [method "
"add_exception]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aquest raycast no informarà de col·lisions amb el seu "
"node pare. Aquesta propietat només té efecte si el node pare és un "
"[CollisionObject3D]. Vegeu també [method Node.get_parent] i [method "
"add_exception]."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ray will hit back faces with concave polygon "
"shapes with back face enabled or heightmap shapes."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el raig colpejarà cares enrere amb formes de polígon "
"còncau amb la cara posterior activada o formes de mapa d'alçada."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ray will detect a hit when starting inside shapes. "
"In this case the collision normal will be [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code]. "
"Does not affect shapes with no volume like concave polygon or heightmap."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el raig detectarà un cop quan comenci dins de les "
"formes. En aquest cas, la col·lisió normal serà [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/"
"code]. No afecta les formes sense volum, com ara un polígon còncava o un "
"mapa d'alçada."

#: doc/classes/RayCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The ray's destination point, relative to this raycast's [member "
"Node3D.position]."
msgstr ""
"El punt de destinació del raig, en relació amb el [member Node3D.position] "
"d'aquest raycast."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Acceleration structure geometry (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Geometria de l'estructura d'acceleració (utilitzada per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureGeometry] describes a set of triangles used as "
"raytracing geometry in the [method RenderingDevice.blas_create] method.\n"
"The geometry is always in triangle list form, either indexed or non-indexed. "
"Triangle strips are not supported."
msgstr ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureGeometry] descriu un conjunt de triangles utilitzats "
"com a geometria de traçat de raigs en el mètode [method "
"RenderingDevice.blas_create].\n"
"La geometria està sempre en forma de llista de triangle, indexada o no "
"indexada. Les tires triangulars no són compatibles."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Flags for the geometry."
msgstr "Indicadors per a la geometria."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid ""
"Buffer containing vertex indices. If [code]null[/code], triangles are non-"
"indexed."
msgstr ""
"Buffer que conté índexs de vèrtex. Si [code]null[/code], els triangles no "
"estan indexats."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Number of indices used by this geometry in [member index_buffer]."
msgstr ""
"Nombre d'índexs utilitzats per aquesta geometria a [member index_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Byte offset of the first index in [member index_buffer]."
msgstr "Desplaçament de bytes del primer índex a [member index_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Buffer containing vertices."
msgstr "Buffer que conté vèrtexs."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Number of vertices used by this geometry in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de vèrtexs utilitzats per aquesta geometria a [member vertex_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Format of the vertices in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr "Format dels vèrtexs a [member vertex_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Byte offset of the first vertex in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr "Desplaçament de bytes del primer vèrtex a [member vertex_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.xml
msgid "Number of bytes between each vertex in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr "Nombre de bytes entre cada vèrtex a [member vertex_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid "Acceleration structure instance (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Instància d'estructura d'acceleració (utilitzada per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureInstance] describes an instance of a Bottom-Level "
"Acceleration Structure (BLAS) used in the [method "
"RenderingDevice.tlas_build] method."
msgstr ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureInstance] descriu una instància d'una estructura "
"d'acceleració de nivell inferior (BLAS) utilitzada en el mètode [method "
"RenderingDevice.tlas_build]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid ""
"The BLAS referenced by this instance. If [code]null[/code], the instance is "
"treated as a placeholder but still contributes to [code]gl_InstanceIndex[/"
"code] in GLSL."
msgstr ""
"El BLAS a què fa referència aquesta instància. Si [code]null[/code], la "
"instància es tracta com a marcador de posició, però encara contribueix a "
"[code]gl_InstanceIndex[/code] a GLSL."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid "Flags for the instance."
msgstr "Indicadors per a la instància."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid ""
"Hit shader binding table range used for this instance, allocated using the "
"[method RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_alloc] method."
msgstr ""
"Interval de taula d'enllaç d'ombres de clics utilitzat per a aquesta "
"instància, assignat mitjançant el mètode [method "
"RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_alloc]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid ""
"Custom instance ID that can be accessed in GLSL using "
"[code]gl_InstanceCustomIndexEXT[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Identificador d'instància personalitzat al qual es pot accedir a GLSL "
"mitjançant [code]gl_InstanceCustomIndexEXT[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid "Visibility mask used to control which rays can intersect this instance."
msgstr ""
"Màscara de visibilitat que s'utilitza per controlar quins raigs poden "
"intersecar aquesta instància."

#: doc/classes/RDAccelerationStructureInstance.xml
msgid "Transform applied to the referenced BLAS for this instance."
msgstr "Transformació aplicada al BLAS referenciat per a aquesta instància."

#: doc/classes/RDAttachmentFormat.xml
msgid "Attachment format (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Format de fitxer adjunt (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDAttachmentFormat.xml doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendState.xml
#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml doc/classes/RDTextureView.xml
#: doc/classes/RDUniform.xml doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid "This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr "Aquest objecte és utilitzat per [RenderingDevice]."

#: doc/classes/RDAttachmentFormat.xml
msgid "The attachment's data format."
msgstr "Format de dades del fitxer adjunt."

#: doc/classes/RDAttachmentFormat.xml
msgid "The number of samples used when sampling the attachment."
msgstr "El nombre de mostres utilitzades en el mostreig del fitxer adjunt."

#: doc/classes/RDAttachmentFormat.xml
msgid "The attachment's usage flags, which determine what can be done with it."
msgstr ""
"Les marques d'ús del fitxer adjunt, que determinen què es pot fer amb ell."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid "Framebuffer pass attachment description (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Descripció del fitxer adjunt de la passada de framebuffer (utilitzat per "
"[RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid ""
"This class contains the list of attachment descriptions for a framebuffer "
"pass. Each points with an index to a previously supplied list of texture "
"attachments.\n"
"Multipass framebuffers can optimize some configurations in mobile. On "
"desktop, they provide little to no advantage.\n"
"This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe conté la llista de descripcions de fitxers adjunts per a una "
"passada de framebuffer. Cadascun apunta amb un índex a una llista prèviament "
"proporcionada de fitxers adjunts de textura.\n"
"Els framebuffers multipass poden optimitzar algunes configuracions al mòbil. "
"A l'escriptori, ofereixen poc o cap avantatge.\n"
"Aquest objecte és utilitzat per [RenderingDevice]."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid ""
"Color attachments in order starting from 0. If this attachment is not used "
"by the shader, pass ATTACHMENT_UNUSED to skip."
msgstr ""
"Pinta els fitxers adjunts en ordre a partir de 0. Si el sombreador no "
"utilitza aquest fitxer adjunt, passa ATTACHMENT_UNUSED per ometre'l."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid ""
"Depth attachment. ATTACHMENT_UNUSED should be used if no depth buffer is "
"required for this pass."
msgstr ""
"Enganxament de profunditat. S'ha d'utilitzar ATTACHMENT_UNUSED si no es "
"requereix cap memòria intermèdia de profunditat per a aquesta passada."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid ""
"Used for multipass framebuffers (more than one render pass). Converts an "
"attachment to an input. Make sure to also supply it properly in the "
"[RDUniform] for the uniform set."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitza per a framebuffers multipass (més d'una passada de "
"renderització). Converteix un fitxer adjunt en una entrada. Assegureu-vos "
"també de subministrar-lo correctament a [RDUniform] per al conjunt "
"d'uniformes."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid "Attachments to preserve in this pass (otherwise they are erased)."
msgstr "Adjunts a conservar en aquesta passada (en cas contrari s'esborren)."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid ""
"If the color attachments are multisampled, non-multisampled resolve "
"attachments can be provided."
msgstr ""
"Si els fitxers adjunts de color són de mostreig múltiple, es poden "
"proporcionar fitxers adjunts de resolució que no es mostren múltiples."

#: doc/classes/RDFramebufferPass.xml
msgid "Attachment is unused."
msgstr "El fitxer adjunt no s'utilitza."

#: doc/classes/RDHitGroup.xml
msgid "Hit group (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Grup de visites (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDHitGroup.xml
msgid ""
"Defines a hit group for use with [method "
"RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create].\n"
"A hit group combines shaders that are executed when a ray intersects "
"geometry. It may include a closest-hit shader, any-hit shader, and "
"intersection shader.\n"
"Hit groups are referenced by index when populating hit shader binding tables "
"using [method RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_update]."
msgstr ""
"Defineix un grup de visites per utilitzar-lo amb [method "
"RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create].\n"
"Un grup d'èxits combina shaders que s'executen quan un raig talla la "
"geometria. Pot incloure un shader més proper, un shader de qualsevol cop i "
"un shader d'intersecció.\n"
"Els grups de visites es fan referència per índex quan s'omplen les taules "
"d'enllaç d'ombres de visites mitjançant [method "
"RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_update]."

#: doc/classes/RDHitGroup.xml
msgid ""
"Any-hit shader for this hit group. Executed for each potential intersection. "
"Can be [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Shader de qualsevol hit per a aquest grup d'èxits. S'executa per a cada "
"intersecció potencial. Pot ser [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDHitGroup.xml
msgid ""
"Closest-hit shader for this hit group. Executed for the closest "
"intersection. Can be [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Shader més proper per a aquest grup d'èxits. Executat per a la intersecció "
"més propera. Pot ser [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDHitGroup.xml
msgid ""
"Intersection shader for this hit group. Required for non-triangle geometry. "
"Must be [code]null[/code] when using for triangle geometry."
msgstr ""
"Shader d'intersecció per a aquest grup de visites. Necessari per a la "
"geometria no triangular. Ha de ser [code]null[/code] quan s'utilitza per a "
"la geometria del triangle."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendState.xml
msgid "Pipeline color blend state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Estat de barreja de colors de la canalització (utilitzat per "
"[RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendState.xml
msgid "The attachments that are blended together."
msgstr "Els adjunts que es barregen."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendState.xml
msgid ""
"The constant color to blend with. See also [method "
"RenderingDevice.draw_list_set_blend_constants]."
msgstr ""
"El color constant amb el qual es barreja. Vegeu també [method "
"RenderingDevice.draw_list_set_blend_constants]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs the logic operation defined in [member "
"logic_op]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], realitza l'operació lògica definida a [member "
"logic_op]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendState.xml
msgid ""
"The logic operation to perform for blending. Only effective if [member "
"enable_logic_op] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"L'operació lògica a realitzar per combinar. Només efectiu si [member "
"enable_logic_op] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid "Pipeline color blend state attachment (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Adjunt d'estat de barreja de colors de la canalització (utilitzat per "
"[RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how blending between source and destination fragments is performed "
"when using [RenderingDevice].\n"
"For reference, this is how common user-facing blend modes are implemented in "
"Godot's 2D renderer:\n"
"[b]Mix:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Add:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Subtract:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Multiply:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_COLOR\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Pre-multiplied alpha:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Controla com es realitza la combinació entre els fragments d'origen i de "
"destinació quan s'utilitza [RenderingDevice].\n"
"Com a referència, així s'implementen els modes de combinació comuns "
"orientats a l'usuari al renderitzador 2D de Godot:\n"
"[b]Mix:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var adjunt = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = cert\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = Dispositiu de representació.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = Dispositiu de representació.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Afegeix:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var adjunt = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = cert\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = Dispositiu de representació.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = Dispositiu de renderització.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"renderització.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Resta:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var adjunt = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = cert\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"renderització.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Multiplica:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var adjunt = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = cert\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = Dispositiu de representació.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = Dispositiu de renderització.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_COLOR\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Alfa premultiplicat:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var adjunt = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = cert\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = Dispositiu de representació.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = Dispositiu de renderització.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = Dispositiu de "
"representació.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid ""
"Convenience method to perform standard mix blending with straight (non-"
"premultiplied) alpha. This sets [member enable_blend] to [code]true[/code], "
"[member src_color_blend_factor] to [constant "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA], [member dst_color_blend_factor] to "
"[constant RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA], [member "
"src_alpha_blend_factor] to [constant RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA] "
"and [member dst_alpha_blend_factor] to [constant "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid "The blend mode to use for the alpha channel."
msgstr "El mode de combinació que s'utilitzarà per al canal alfa."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid "The blend mode to use for the red/green/blue color channels."
msgstr ""
"El mode de combinació que s'utilitzarà per als canals de color vermell/verd/"
"blau."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the alpha channel is determined based on "
"the destination's fragments."
msgstr ""
"Controla com es determina el factor de combinació del canal alfa en funció "
"dels fragments de la destinació."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the color channels is determined based on "
"the destination's fragments."
msgstr ""
"Controla com es determina el factor de combinació dels canals de color en "
"funció dels fragments de la destinació."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs blending between the source and destination "
"according to the factors defined in [member src_color_blend_factor], [member "
"dst_color_blend_factor], [member src_alpha_blend_factor] and [member "
"dst_alpha_blend_factor]. The blend modes [member color_blend_op] and [member "
"alpha_blend_op] are also taken into account, with [member write_r], [member "
"write_g], [member write_b] and [member write_a] controlling the output."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], realitza la combinació entre la font i la destinació "
"segons els factors definits a [member src_color_blend_factor], [member "
"dst_color_blend_factor], [member src_alpha_blend_factor] i [member "
"dst_alpha_blend_factor]. També es tenen en compte els modes de combinació "
"[member color_blend_op] i [member alpha_blend_op], amb [member write_r], "
"[member write_g], [member write_b] i [member write_a] controlant la sortida."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the alpha channel is determined based on "
"the source's fragments."
msgstr ""
"Controla com es determina el factor de combinació del canal alfa en funció "
"dels fragments de la font."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the color channels is determined based on "
"the source's fragments."
msgstr ""
"Controla com es determina el factor de combinació dels canals de color en "
"funció dels fragments de la font."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "If [code]true[/code], writes the new alpha channel to the final result."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes the new blue color channel to the final result."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes the new green color channel to the final result."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes the new red color channel to the final result."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "Pipeline depth/stencil state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Profunditat de la canonada/estat de la plantilla (utilitzat per "
"[RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"[RDPipelineDepthStencilState] controls the way depth and stencil comparisons "
"are performed when sampling those values using [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"[RDPipelineDepthStencilState] controla la manera com es realitzen les "
"comparacions de profunditat i plantilla quan es mostren aquests valors "
"mitjançant [RenderingDevice]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The method used for comparing the previous back stencil value and [member "
"back_op_reference]."
msgstr ""
"El mètode utilitzat per comparar el valor anterior de la plantilla posterior "
"i [member back_op_reference]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "Selects which bits from the back stencil value will be compared."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona quins bits del valor de la plantilla posterior es compararan."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for back pixels that pass the "
"stencil test but fail the depth test."
msgstr ""
"L'operació que cal realitzar a la memòria intermèdia de la plantilla per als "
"píxels posteriors que superen la prova de la plantilla però no la prova de "
"profunditat."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for back pixels that fail the "
"stencil test."
msgstr ""
"L'operació que cal realitzar a la memòria intermèdia de la plantilla per als "
"píxels posteriors que fallen la prova de la plantilla."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for back pixels that pass the "
"stencil test."
msgstr ""
"L'operació que cal realitzar a la memòria intermèdia de la plantilla per als "
"píxels posteriors que superen la prova de la plantilla."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "The value the previous back stencil value will be compared to."
msgstr ""
"El valor amb el qual es compararà el valor anterior de la plantilla "
"posterior."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "Selects which bits from the back stencil value will be changed."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona quins bits del valor de la plantilla posterior es canviaran."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "The method used for comparing the previous and current depth values."
msgstr ""
"El mètode utilitzat per comparar els valors de profunditat anteriors i "
"actuals."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum depth that returns [code]true[/code] for [member "
"enable_depth_range]."
msgstr ""
"La profunditat màxima que retorna [code]true[/code] per a [member "
"enable_depth_range]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum depth that returns [code]true[/code] for [member "
"enable_depth_range]."
msgstr ""
"La profunditat mínima que retorna [code]true[/code] per a [member "
"enable_depth_range]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], each depth value will be tested to see if it is "
"between [member depth_range_min] and [member depth_range_max]. If it is "
"outside of these values, it is discarded."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es provarà cada valor de profunditat per veure si es "
"troba entre [member depth_range_min] i [member depth_range_max]. Si està "
"fora d'aquests valors, es descarta."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables depth testing which allows objects to be "
"automatically occluded by other objects based on their depth. This also "
"allows objects to be partially occluded by other objects. If [code]false[/"
"code], objects will appear in the order they were drawn (like in Godot's 2D "
"renderer)."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita la prova de profunditat que permet que els "
"objectes siguin ocluïts automàticament per altres objectes en funció de la "
"seva profunditat. Això també permet que els objectes siguin ocluïts "
"parcialment per altres objectes. Si [code]false[/code], els objectes "
"apareixeran en l'ordre en què van ser dibuixats (com en el renderitzador 2D "
"de Godot)."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes to the depth buffer whenever the depth test "
"returns [code]true[/code]. Only works when enable_depth_test is also "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], escriu a la memòria intermèdia de profunditat sempre "
"que la prova de profunditat torni [code]true[/code]. Només funciona quan "
"enable_depth_test també és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables stencil testing. There are separate stencil "
"buffers for front-facing triangles and back-facing triangles. See properties "
"that begin with \"front_op\" and properties with \"back_op\" for each."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita la prova de plantilla. Hi ha tampons de "
"plantilla separats per a triangles frontals i triangles posteriors. Vegeu "
"propietats que comencen amb \"front_op\" i propietats amb \"back_op\" per a "
"cadascuna."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The method used for comparing the previous front stencil value and [member "
"front_op_reference]."
msgstr ""
"El mètode utilitzat per comparar el valor de la plantilla frontal anterior i "
"[member front_op_reference]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "Selects which bits from the front stencil value will be compared."
msgstr "Selecciona quins bits del valor de la plantilla frontal es compararan."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for front pixels that pass "
"the stencil test but fail the depth test."
msgstr ""
"L'operació que cal realitzar a la memòria intermèdia de la plantilla per als "
"píxels frontals que superen la prova de la plantilla però no la prova de "
"profunditat."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for front pixels that fail "
"the stencil test."
msgstr ""
"L'operació que cal realitzar a la memòria intermèdia de la plantilla per als "
"píxels frontals que fallen la prova de la plantilla."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for front pixels that pass "
"the stencil test."
msgstr ""
"L'operació que cal realitzar a la memòria intermèdia de la plantilla per als "
"píxels frontals que superen la prova de la plantilla."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "The value the previous front stencil value will be compared to."
msgstr ""
"El valor amb el qual es compararà el valor de la plantilla frontal anterior."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineDepthStencilState.xml
msgid "Selects which bits from the front stencil value will be changed."
msgstr "Selecciona quins bits del valor de la plantilla frontal es canviaran."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid "Pipeline multisample state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Estat multimostra de pipeline (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
"[RDPipelineMultisampleState] is used to control how multisample or "
"supersample antialiasing is being performed when rendering using "
"[RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"[RDPipelineMultisampleState] s'utilitza per controlar com s'està realitzant "
"l'antialiasing multimostra o supermostra quan es renderitza amb "
"[RenderingDevice]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], alpha to coverage is enabled. This generates a "
"temporary coverage value based on the alpha component of the fragment's "
"first color output. This allows alpha transparency to make use of "
"multisample antialiasing."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la cobertura alfa està habilitada. Això genera un "
"valor de cobertura temporal basat en el component alfa de la primera sortida "
"en color del fragment. Això permet que la transparència alfa faci ús de "
"l'antialiasing multimostra."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], alpha is forced to either [code]0.0[/code] or "
"[code]1.0[/code]. This allows hardening the edges of antialiased alpha "
"transparencies. Only relevant if [member enable_alpha_to_coverage] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], alpha està forçat a [code]0.0[/code] o a [code]1.0[/"
"code]. Això permet endurir les vores de les transparències alfa antialiased. "
"Només rellevant si [member enable_alpha_to_coverage] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables per-sample shading which replaces MSAA by "
"SSAA. This provides higher quality antialiasing that works with transparent "
"(alpha scissor) edges. This has a very high performance cost. See also "
"[member min_sample_shading]. See the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/html/vkspec.html#primsrast-sampleshading]per-"
"sample shading Vulkan documentation[/url] for more details."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], habilita l'ombrejat per mostra que substitueix MSAA "
"per SSAA. Això proporciona un antialiasing de major qualitat que funciona "
"amb vores transparents (tisora alfa). Això té un cost de rendiment molt "
"elevat. Vegeu també [member min_sample_shading]. Consulteu la documentació "
"de Vulkan [url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/html/"
"vkspec.html#primsrast-sampleshading]per a l'ombrejat per mostra [/url] per "
"obtenir més detalls."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
"The multiplier of [member sample_count] that determines how many samples are "
"performed for each fragment. Must be between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/"
"code] (inclusive). Only effective if [member enable_sample_shading] is "
"[code]true[/code]. If [member min_sample_shading] is [code]1.0[/code], "
"fragment invocation must only read from the coverage index sample. Tile "
"image access must not be used if [member enable_sample_shading] is [i]not[/"
"i] [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El multiplicador de [member sample_count] que determina quantes mostres es "
"realitzen per a cada fragment. Ha d'estar entre [code]0.0[/code] i "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclosos). Només efectiu si [member enable_sample_shading] "
"és [code]true[/code]. Si [member min_sample_shading] és [code]1.0[/code], la "
"invocació del fragment només s'ha de llegir de la mostra d'índex de "
"cobertura. L'accés a la imatge de mosaic no s'ha d'utilitzar si [member "
"enable_sample_shading] és [i]not[/i] [code]1.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
"The number of MSAA samples (or SSAA samples if [member "
"enable_sample_shading] is [code]true[/code]) to perform. Higher values "
"result in better antialiasing, at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de mostres MSAA (o mostres SSAA si [member enable_sample_shading] "
"és [code]true[/code]) a realitzar. Els valors més alts donen lloc a un "
"millor antialiasing, a costa del rendiment."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineMultisampleState.xml
msgid ""
"The sample mask array. See the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/"
"specs/1.3-extensions/html/vkspec.html#fragops-samplemask]sample mask Vulkan "
"documentation[/url] for more details."
msgstr ""
"La matriu de màscares de mostra. Consulteu la documentació de Vulkan "
"[url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/html/"
"vkspec.html#fragops-samplemask]de la màscara d'exemple[/url] per obtenir més "
"detalls."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid "Pipeline rasterization state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Estat de rasterització de la canalització (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"The cull mode to use when drawing polygons, which determines whether front "
"faces or backfaces are hidden."
msgstr ""
"El mode d'eliminació que s'ha d'utilitzar per dibuixar polígons, que "
"determina si s'amaguen les cares frontals o posteriors."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"A limit for how much each depth value can be offset. If negative, it serves "
"as a minimum value, but if positive, it serves as a maximum value."
msgstr ""
"Un límit de quant es pot compensar cada valor de profunditat. Si és negatiu, "
"serveix com a valor mínim, però si és positiu, serveix com a valor màxim."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"A constant offset added to each depth value. Applied after [member "
"depth_bias_slope_factor]."
msgstr ""
"Un desplaçament constant afegit a cada valor de profunditat. S'aplica "
"després de [member depth_bias_slope_factor]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], each generated depth value will by offset by some "
"amount. The specific amount is generated per polygon based on the values of "
"[member depth_bias_slope_factor] and [member depth_bias_constant_factor]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], cada valor de profunditat generat es compensarà en una "
"certa quantitat. La quantitat específica es genera per polígon en funció "
"dels valors de [member depth_bias_slope_factor] i [member "
"depth_bias_constant_factor]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"A constant scale applied to the slope of each polygons' depth. Applied "
"before [member depth_bias_constant_factor]."
msgstr ""
"Una escala constant aplicada al pendent de la profunditat de cada polígon. "
"Aplicat abans de [member depth_bias_constant_factor]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], primitives are discarded immediately before the "
"rasterization stage."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les primitives es descarten immediatament abans de "
"l'etapa de rasterització."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], clamps depth values according to the minimum and "
"maximum depth of the associated viewport."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"The winding order to use to determine which face of a triangle is considered "
"its front face."
msgstr ""
"L'ordre de bobinatge que s'utilitza per determinar quina cara d'un triangle "
"es considera la seva cara frontal."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"The line width to use when drawing lines (in pixels). Thick lines may not be "
"supported on all hardware."
msgstr ""
"L'amplada de línia que s'ha d'utilitzar per dibuixar línies (en píxels). És "
"possible que les línies gruixudes no siguin compatibles amb tot el maquinari."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"The number of control points to use when drawing a patch with tessellation "
"enabled. Higher values result in higher quality at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de punts de control que s'han d'utilitzar per dibuixar un pegat "
"amb la tessel·lació activada. Els valors més alts donen lloc a una qualitat "
"més alta a costa del rendiment."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineRasterizationState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs wireframe rendering for triangles instead of "
"flat or textured rendering."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], realitza una representació de filferro per a triangles "
"en comptes de la representació plana o amb textura."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineShader.xml
msgid "Pipeline shader (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Shader Pipeline (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineShader.xml
msgid ""
"Wraps a shader resource and allows specialization constants to be applied at "
"pipeline creation time.\n"
"Used by [method RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create] for ray "
"generation, miss, and hit shaders. The pipeline selects the required shader "
"stage automatically."
msgstr ""
"Embolcalla un recurs sombreador i permet que s'apliquin constants "
"d'especialització en el moment de la creació del pipeline.\n"
"Utilitzat per [method RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create] per a la "
"generació de raigs, miss i hit shaders. La canalització selecciona "
"automàticament l'etapa d'ombrejat requerida."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineShader.xml
msgid "Shader resource. The required stage is selected by the pipeline."
msgstr "Recursos shader. L'etapa requerida és seleccionada pel pipeline."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineShader.xml
msgid ""
"Specialization constants applied to the selected shader stage at pipeline "
"creation time."
msgstr ""
"Constants d'especialització aplicades a l'etapa d'ombra seleccionada en el "
"moment de la creació de la canalització."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineSpecializationConstant.xml
msgid "Pipeline specialization constant (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Constant d'especialització de pipeline (utilitzada per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineSpecializationConstant.xml
msgid ""
"A [i]specialization constant[/i] is a way to create additional variants of "
"shaders without actually increasing the number of shader versions that are "
"compiled. This allows improving performance by reducing the number of shader "
"versions and reducing [code]if[/code] branching, while still allowing "
"shaders to be flexible for different use cases.\n"
"This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"Una [i]constante d'especialització[/i] és una manera de crear variants "
"addicionals de shaders sense augmentar el nombre de versions de shaders que "
"es compilen. Això permet millorar el rendiment reduint el nombre de versions "
"de shader i reduint [code]if[/code], alhora que permet que els shaders "
"siguin flexibles per a diferents casos d'ús.\n"
"Aquest objecte és utilitzat per [RenderingDevice]."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineSpecializationConstant.xml
msgid ""
"The identifier of the specialization constant. This is a value starting from "
"[code]0[/code] and that increments for every different specialization "
"constant for a given shader."
msgstr ""
"L'identificador de la constant d'especialització. Aquest és un valor que "
"comença des de [code]0[/code] i que s'incrementa per a cada constant "
"d'especialització diferent per a un ombrador determinat."

#: doc/classes/RDPipelineSpecializationConstant.xml
msgid ""
"The specialization constant's value. Only [bool], [int] and [float] types "
"are valid for specialization constants."
msgstr ""
"Valor de la constant d'especialització. Només els tipus [bool], [int] i "
"[float] són vàlids per a constants d'especialització."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid "Sampler state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Estat del mostreig (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum anisotropy that can be used when sampling. Only effective if [member "
"use_anisotropy] is [code]true[/code]. Higher values result in a sharper "
"sampler at oblique angles, at the cost of performance (due to memory "
"bandwidth). This value may be limited by the graphics hardware in use. Most "
"graphics hardware only supports values up to [code]16.0[/code].\n"
"If [member anisotropy_max] is [code]1.0[/code], forcibly disables anisotropy "
"even if [member use_anisotropy] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Màxima anisotropia que es pot utilitzar en el mostreig. Només efectiu si "
"[member use_anisotropy] és [code]true[/code]. Els valors més alts donen lloc "
"a un mostreig més nítid en angles oblics, a costa del rendiment (a causa de "
"l'amplada de banda de la memòria). Aquest valor pot estar limitat pel "
"maquinari gràfic en ús. La majoria de maquinari gràfic només admet valors "
"fins a [code]16.0[/code].\n"
"Si [member anisotropy_max] és [code]1.0[/code], desactiva per força "
"l'anisotropia encara que [member use_anisotropy] sigui [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The border color that will be returned when sampling outside the sampler's "
"bounds and the [member repeat_u], [member repeat_v] or [member repeat_w] "
"modes have repeating disabled."
msgstr ""
"El color de la vora que es retornarà quan es mostri fora dels límits del "
"mostreig i els modes [member repeat_u], [member repeat_v] o [member "
"repeat_w] tenen la repetició desactivada."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The compare operation to use. Only effective if [member enable_compare] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"L'operació de comparació a utilitzar. Només efectiu si [member "
"enable_compare] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], returned values will be based on the comparison "
"operation defined in [member compare_op]. This is a hardware-based approach "
"and is therefore faster than performing this manually in a shader. For "
"example, compare operations are used for shadow map rendering by comparing "
"depth values from a shadow sampler."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els valors retornats es basaran en l'operació de "
"comparació definida a [member compare_op]. Aquest és un enfocament basat en "
"maquinari i, per tant, és més ràpid que fer-ho manualment en un shader. Per "
"exemple, les operacions de comparació s'utilitzen per a la representació del "
"mapa d'ombres comparant els valors de profunditat d'un mostrador d'ombres."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The mipmap LOD bias to use. Positive values will make the sampler blurrier "
"at a given distance, while negative values will make the sampler sharper at "
"a given distance (at the risk of looking grainy). Recommended values are "
"between [code]-0.5[/code] and [code]0.0[/code]. Only effective if the "
"sampler has mipmaps available."
msgstr ""
"El biaix LOD de mipmap a utilitzar. Els valors positius faran que el "
"mostreig sigui més borrós a una distància determinada, mentre que els valors "
"negatius faran que el mostreig sigui més nítid a una distància determinada "
"(amb el risc de semblar granulat). Els valors recomanats estan entre "
"[code]-0.5[/code] i [code]0.0[/code]. Només efectiu si el sampler té mipmaps "
"disponibles."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The sampler's magnification filter. It is the filtering method used when "
"sampling texels that appear bigger than on-screen pixels."
msgstr ""
"Filtre d'ampliació del mostreig. És el mètode de filtrat que s'utilitza quan "
"es mostren texels que semblen més grans que els píxels de la pantalla."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum mipmap LOD bias to display (lowest resolution). Only effective "
"if the sampler has mipmaps available."
msgstr ""
"El biaix màxim de LOD mipmap per mostrar (resolució més baixa). Només "
"efectiu si el sampler té mipmaps disponibles."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The sampler's minification filter. It is the filtering method used when "
"sampling texels that appear smaller than on-screen pixels."
msgstr ""
"Filtre de minificació del sampler. És el mètode de filtrat que s'utilitza "
"quan es mostren texels que semblen més petits que els píxels de la pantalla."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum mipmap LOD bias to display (highest resolution). Only effective "
"if the sampler has mipmaps available."
msgstr ""
"El biaix mínim de LOD de mipmap per mostrar (resolució més alta). Només "
"efectiu si el sampler té mipmaps disponibles."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid "The filtering method to use for mipmaps."
msgstr "El mètode de filtrat a utilitzar per als mipmaps."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The repeat mode to use along the U axis of UV coordinates. This affects the "
"returned values if sampling outside the UV bounds."
msgstr ""
"El mode de repetició que s'utilitza al llarg de l'eix U de les coordenades "
"UV. Això afecta els valors retornats si es mostren fora dels límits UV."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The repeat mode to use along the V axis of UV coordinates. This affects the "
"returned values if sampling outside the UV bounds."
msgstr ""
"El mode de repetició a utilitzar al llarg de l'eix V de les coordenades UV. "
"Això afecta els valors retornats si es mostren fora dels límits UV."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"The repeat mode to use along the W axis of UV coordinates. This affects the "
"returned values if sampling outside the UV bounds. Only effective for 3D "
"samplers."
msgstr ""
"El mode de repetició a utilitzar al llarg de l'eix W de les coordenades UV. "
"Això afecta els valors retornats si es mostren fora dels límits UV. Només "
"eficaç per a mostres 3D."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture will be sampled with coordinates ranging "
"from 0 to the texture's resolution. Otherwise, the coordinates will be "
"normalized and range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la textura es mostrarà amb coordenades que van des de "
"0 fins a la resolució de la textura. En cas contrari, les coordenades es "
"normalitzaran i aniran de 0 a 1."

#: doc/classes/RDSamplerState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], perform anisotropic sampling. See [member "
"anisotropy_max]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], feu un mostreig anisòtrop. Veure [member "
"anisotropy_max]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderFile.xml
msgid ""
"Compiled shader file in SPIR-V form (used by [RenderingDevice]). Not to be "
"confused with Godot's own [Shader]."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer shader compilat en forma SPIR-V (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice]). No "
"s'ha de confondre amb la [Shader] de Godot."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderFile.xml
msgid ""
"Compiled shader file in SPIR-V form.\n"
"See also [RDShaderSource]. [RDShaderFile] is only meant to be used with the "
"[RenderingDevice] API. It should not be confused with Godot's own [Shader] "
"resource, which is what Godot's various nodes use for high-level shader "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"Fitxer shader compilat en forma SPIR-V.\n"
"Vegeu també [RDShaderSource]. [RDShaderFile] només s'ha d'utilitzar amb "
"l'API [RenderingDevice]. No s'ha de confondre amb el recurs [Shader] de "
"Godot, que és el que utilitzen els diferents nodes de Godot per a la "
"programació d'ombres d'alt nivell."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderFile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the SPIR-V intermediate representation for the specified shader "
"[param version]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la representació intermèdia SPIR-V per al shader especificat [param "
"version]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderFile.xml
msgid "Returns the list of compiled versions for this shader."
msgstr "Retorna la llista de versions compilades d'aquest shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderFile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the SPIR-V [param bytecode] that will be compiled for the specified "
"[param version]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el SPIR-V [param bytecode] que es compilarà per al [param version] "
"especificat."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderFile.xml
msgid ""
"The base compilation error message, which indicates errors not related to a "
"specific shader stage if non-empty. If empty, shader compilation is not "
"necessarily successful (check [RDShaderSPIRV]'s error message members)."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació base, que indica errors no relacionats amb "
"una etapa d'ombrejat específica si no està buit. Si està buit, la compilació "
"de shader no és necessàriament correcta (comproveu els membres del missatge "
"d'error de [RDShaderSPIRV])."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Shader source code (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Codi font Shader (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid ""
"Shader source code in text form.\n"
"See also [RDShaderFile]. [RDShaderSource] is only meant to be used with the "
"[RenderingDevice] API. It should not be confused with Godot's own [Shader] "
"resource, which is what Godot's various nodes use for high-level shader "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"Codi font Shader en forma de text.\n"
"Vegeu també [RDShaderFile]. [RDShaderSource] només s'ha d'utilitzar amb "
"l'API [RenderingDevice]. No s'ha de confondre amb el recurs [Shader] de "
"Godot, que és el que utilitzen els diferents nodes de Godot per a la "
"programació d'ombres d'alt nivell."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid ""
"Returns source code for the specified shader [param stage]. Equivalent to "
"getting one of [member source_compute], [member source_fragment], [member "
"source_tesselation_control], [member source_tesselation_evaluation] or "
"[member source_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el codi font per al shader especificat [param stage]. Equivalent a "
"obtenir un de [member source_compute], [member source_fragment], [member "
"source_tesselation_control], [member source_tesselation_evaluation] o "
"[member source_vertex]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid ""
"Sets [param source] code for the specified shader [param stage]. Equivalent "
"to setting one of [member source_compute], [member source_fragment], [member "
"source_tesselation_control], [member source_tesselation_evaluation] or "
"[member source_vertex].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you set the compute shader source code using this method "
"directly, remember to remove the Godot-specific hint [code]#[compute][/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el codi [param source] per al shader especificat [param stage]. "
"Equivalent a establir un de [member source_compute], [member "
"source_fragment], [member source_tesselation_control], [member "
"source_tesselation_evaluation] o [member source_vertex].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si configureu el codi font de l'ombrador de càlcul mitjançant "
"aquest mètode directament, recordeu d'eliminar la pista específica de Godot "
"[code]#[compute][/code]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "The language the shader is written in."
msgstr "L'idioma en què està escrit el shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's any hit stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a qualsevol etapa d'èxit del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's closest hit stage."
msgstr "Codi font de l'etapa més propera de l'ombrador."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's compute stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa de càlcul del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's fragment stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa de fragment del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's intersection stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa d'intersecció del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's miss stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa de falta del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's ray generation stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa de generació de raigs del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's tessellation control stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa de control de tessel·lació del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's tessellation evaluation stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa d'avaluació de tessel·lació del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSource.xml
msgid "Source code for the shader's vertex stage."
msgstr "Codi font per a l'etapa de vèrtex del shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"SPIR-V intermediate representation as part of an [RDShaderFile] (used by "
"[RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"Representació intermèdia SPIR-V com a part d'un [RDShaderFile] (utilitzat "
"per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"[RDShaderSPIRV] represents an [RDShaderFile]'s [url=https://www.khronos.org/"
"spir/]SPIR-V[/url] code for various shader stages, as well as possible "
"compilation error messages. SPIR-V is a low-level intermediate shader "
"representation. This intermediate representation is not used directly by "
"GPUs for rendering, but it can be compiled into binary shaders that GPUs can "
"understand. Unlike compiled shaders, SPIR-V is portable across GPU models "
"and driver versions.\n"
"This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"[RDShaderSPIRV] representa el codi [url=https://www.khronos.org/spir/]SPIR-"
"V[/url] d'un [RDShaderFile] per a diverses etapes d'ombra, així com "
"possibles missatges d'error de compilació. SPIR-V és una representació "
"d'ombres intermedis de baix nivell. Aquesta representació intermèdia no "
"s'utilitza directament per les GPU per a la representació, però es pot "
"compilar en shaders binaris que les GPU poden entendre. A diferència dels "
"shaders compilats, SPIR-V és portàtil entre models de GPU i versions de "
"controladors.\n"
"Aquest objecte és utilitzat per [RenderingDevice]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"Equivalent to getting one of [member bytecode_compute], [member "
"bytecode_fragment], [member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation], [member bytecode_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"Equivalent a obtenir un de [member bytecode_compute], [member "
"bytecode_fragment], [member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation], [member bytecode_vertex]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the compilation error message for the given shader [param stage]. "
"Equivalent to getting one of [member compile_error_compute], [member "
"compile_error_fragment], [member compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation], [member compile_error_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el missatge d'error de compilació per al shader donat [param stage]. "
"Equivalent a obtenir un de [member compile_error_compute], [member "
"compile_error_fragment], [member compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation], [member compile_error_vertex]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the SPIR-V [param bytecode] for the given shader [param stage]. "
"Equivalent to setting one of [member bytecode_compute], [member "
"bytecode_fragment], [member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation], [member bytecode_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el SPIR-V [param bytecode] per al shader donat [param stage]. "
"Equivalent a establir un de [member bytecode_compute], [member "
"bytecode_fragment], [member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation], [member bytecode_vertex]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the compilation error message for the given shader [param stage] to "
"[param compile_error]. Equivalent to setting one of [member "
"compile_error_compute], [member compile_error_fragment], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation], [member compile_error_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el missatge d'error de compilació per al shader donat [param "
"stage] a [param compile_error]. Equivalent a establir un de [member "
"compile_error_compute], [member compile_error_fragment], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation], [member compile_error_vertex]."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the any hit shader stage."
msgstr "El bytecode SPIR-V per a l'etapa d'ombra de qualsevol hit."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the closest hit shader stage."
msgstr "El codi de bytes SPIR-V per a l'etapa d'ombrejat més propera."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the compute shader stage."
msgstr "El codi de bytes SPIR-V per a l'etapa d'ombra de càlcul."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the fragment shader stage."
msgstr "El codi de bytes SPIR-V per a l'etapa d'ombra de fragments."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the intersection shader stage."
msgstr "El bytecode SPIR-V per a l'etapa d'ombrejat d'intersecció."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the miss shader stage."
msgstr "El bytecode SPIR-V per a l'etapa de miss shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the ray generation shader stage."
msgstr "El bytecode SPIR-V per a l'etapa d'ombra de generació de raigs."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the tessellation control shader stage."
msgstr "El bytecode SPIR-V per a l'etapa d'ombra de control de tessel·lació."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the tessellation evaluation shader stage."
msgstr ""
"El bytecode SPIR-V per a l'etapa de shader d'avaluació de tessel·lació."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the vertex shader stage."
msgstr "El bytecode SPIR-V per a l'etapa de vertex shader."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the any hit shader stage (set by the SPIR-"
"V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombra de qualsevol hit "
"(establert pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació de "
"shader ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the closest hit shader stage (set by the "
"SPIR-V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombres més propera "
"(establert pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació de "
"shader ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the compute shader stage (set by the SPIR-"
"V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombra de càlcul (establert "
"pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació de shader ha "
"estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the fragment shader stage (set by the SPIR-"
"V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombra de fragments "
"(establert pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació de "
"shader ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the intersection shader stage (set by the "
"SPIR-V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombrejat d'intersecció "
"(establert pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació de "
"shader ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the miss shader stage (set by the SPIR-V "
"compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa de miss shader (establert "
"pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació de shader ha "
"estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the ray generation shader stage (set by "
"the SPIR-V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombra de generació de "
"raigs (establert pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació "
"de shader ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the tessellation control shader stage (set "
"by the SPIR-V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was "
"successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombra de control de "
"tessel·lació (establert pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la "
"compilació de shader ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the tessellation evaluation shader stage "
"(set by the SPIR-V compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was "
"successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa d'ombra d'avaluació de "
"tessel·lació (establert pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la "
"compilació de shader ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDShaderSPIRV.xml
msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the vertex shader stage (set by the SPIR-V "
"compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"El missatge d'error de compilació per a l'etapa de vertex shader (establert "
"pel compilador SPIR-V i Godot). Si està buit, la compilació de shader ha "
"estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "Texture format (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Format de textura (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid ""
"Adds [param format] as a valid format for the corresponding "
"[RDTextureView]'s [member RDTextureView.format_override] property. If any "
"format is added as shareable, then the main [member format] must also be "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix [param format] com a format vàlid per a la propietat [member "
"RDTextureView.format_override] corresponent a [RDTextureView]. Si s'afegeix "
"algun format com a compartible, també s'ha d'afegir el [member format] "
"principal."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid ""
"Removes [param format] from the list of valid formats that the corresponding "
"[RDTextureView]'s [member RDTextureView.format_override] property can be set "
"to."
msgstr ""
"Elimina [param format] de la llista de formats vàlids en què es pot establir "
"la propietat [member RDTextureView.format_override] de [RDTextureView] "
"corresponent."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid ""
"The number of layers in the texture. Only relevant for 2D texture arrays."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de capes de la textura. Només rellevant per a matrius de textures "
"2D."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid ""
"The texture's depth (in pixels). This is always [code]1[/code] for 2D "
"textures."
msgstr ""
"La profunditat de la textura (en píxels). Això sempre és [code]1[/code] per "
"a textures 2D."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "The texture's pixel data format."
msgstr "Format de dades de píxels de la textura."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "The texture's height (in pixels)."
msgstr "Alçada de la textura (en píxels)."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid ""
"If a texture is discardable, its contents do not need to be preserved "
"between frames. This flag is only relevant when the texture is used as "
"target in a draw list.\n"
"This information is used by [RenderingDevice] to figure out if a texture's "
"contents can be discarded, eliminating unnecessary writes to memory and "
"boosting performance."
msgstr ""
"Si una textura es pot descartar, no cal conservar el seu contingut entre "
"fotogrames. Aquesta bandera només és rellevant quan la textura s'utilitza "
"com a objectiu en una llista de dibuix.\n"
"Aquesta informació l'utilitza [RenderingDevice] per esbrinar si el contingut "
"d'una textura es pot descartar, eliminant les escriptures innecessàries a la "
"memòria i augmentant el rendiment."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "The texture will be used as the destination of a resolve operation."
msgstr "La textura s'utilitzarà com a destinació d'una operació de resolució."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "The number of mipmaps available in the texture."
msgstr "El nombre de mipmaps disponibles a la textura."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "The number of samples used when sampling the texture."
msgstr "El nombre de mostres utilitzades en mostrejar la textura."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "The texture type."
msgstr "El tipus de textura."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid ""
"The texture's usage bits, which determine what can be done using the texture."
msgstr "Bits d'ús de la textura, que determinen què es pot fer amb la textura."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureFormat.xml
msgid "The texture's width (in pixels)."
msgstr "L'amplada de la textura (en píxels)."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureView.xml
msgid "Texture view (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Vista de textura (utilitzada per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureView.xml
msgid ""
"Optional override for the data format to return sampled values in. The "
"corresponding [RDTextureFormat] must have had this added as a shareable "
"format. The default value of [constant RenderingDevice.DATA_FORMAT_MAX] does "
"not override the format."
msgstr ""
"Substitució opcional del format de dades per retornar els valors mostrats. "
"El [RDTextureFormat] corresponent s'ha d'haver afegit com a format "
"compartible. El valor predeterminat de [constant "
"RenderingDevice.DATA_FORMAT_MAX] no anul·la el format."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureView.xml
msgid "The channel to sample when sampling the alpha channel."
msgstr "El canal a mostrejar en mostrejar el canal alfa."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureView.xml
msgid "The channel to sample when sampling the blue color channel."
msgstr "El canal a mostrejar quan es mostra el canal de color blau."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureView.xml
msgid "The channel to sample when sampling the green color channel."
msgstr "El canal a mostrejar quan es mostra el canal de color verd."

#: doc/classes/RDTextureView.xml
msgid "The channel to sample when sampling the red color channel."
msgstr "El canal a mostrejar quan es mostra el canal de color vermell."

#: doc/classes/RDUniform.xml
msgid "Shader uniform (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Uniforme Shader (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDUniform.xml
msgid ""
"Binds the given id to the uniform. The data associated with the id is then "
"used when the uniform is passed to a shader."
msgstr ""
"Uneix l'identificador donat a l'uniforme. Les dades associades a "
"l'identificador s'utilitzen llavors quan l'uniforme es passa a un shader."

#: doc/classes/RDUniform.xml
msgid "Unbinds all ids currently bound to the uniform."
msgstr "Desenllaça tots els identificadors lligats actualment a l'uniforme."

#: doc/classes/RDUniform.xml
msgid "Returns an array of all ids currently bound to the uniform."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de tots els identificadors actualment vinculats a "
"l'uniforme."

#: doc/classes/RDUniform.xml
msgid "The uniform's binding."
msgstr "Enquadernació de l'uniforme."

#: doc/classes/RDUniform.xml
msgid "The uniform's data type."
msgstr "Tipus de dades de l'uniforme."

#: doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid "Vertex attribute (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Atribut de vèrtex (utilitzat per [RenderingDevice])."

#: doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the buffer in the vertex buffer array to bind this vertex "
"attribute. When set to [code]-1[/code], it defaults to the index of the "
"attribute.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You cannot mix binding explicitly assigned attributes with "
"implicitly assigned ones (i.e. [code]-1[/code]). Either all attributes must "
"have their binding set to [code]-1[/code], or all must have explicit "
"bindings."
msgstr ""
"L'índex de la memòria intermèdia a la matriu de buffer de vèrtex per "
"vincular aquest atribut de vèrtex. Quan s'estableix a [code]-1[/code], el "
"valor predeterminat és l'índex de l'atribut.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No podeu barrejar atributs assignats explícitament d'enllaç amb "
"atributs assignats implícitament (és a dir, [code]-1[/code]). Tots els "
"atributs han de tenir la seva vinculació establerta a [code]-1[/code], o bé "
"tots han de tenir enllaços explícits."

#: doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid ""
"The way that this attribute's data is interpreted when sent to a shader."
msgstr ""
"La forma en què s'interpreten les dades d'aquest atribut quan s'envien a un "
"shader."

#: doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid "The rate at which this attribute is pulled from its vertex buffer."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat a la qual s'extreu aquest atribut del seu buffer de vèrtex."

#: doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid "The location in the shader that this attribute is bound to."
msgstr "La ubicació a l'ombra a la qual està vinculat aquest atribut."

#: doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid ""
"The number of bytes between the start of the vertex buffer and the first "
"instance of this attribute."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de bytes entre l'inici de la memòria intermèdia de vèrtex i la "
"primera instància d'aquest atribut."

#: doc/classes/RDVertexAttribute.xml
msgid ""
"The number of bytes between the starts of consecutive instances of this "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de bytes entre els inicis d'instàncies consecutives d'aquest "
"atribut."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid "A 2D axis-aligned bounding box using floating-point coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Un quadre delimitador alineat amb eixos 2D amb coordenades de coma flotant."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"The [Rect2] built-in [Variant] type represents an axis-aligned rectangle in "
"a 2D space. It is defined by its [member position] and [member size], which "
"are [Vector2]. It is frequently used for fast overlap tests (see [method "
"intersects]). Although [Rect2] itself is axis-aligned, it can be combined "
"with [Transform2D] to represent a rotated or skewed rectangle.\n"
"For integer coordinates, use [Rect2i]. The 3D equivalent to [Rect2] is "
"[AABB].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Negative values for [member size] are not supported. With "
"negative size, most [Rect2] methods do not work correctly. Use [method abs] "
"to get an equivalent [Rect2] with a non-negative size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a [Rect2] evaluates to [code]false[/code] "
"if both [member position] and [member size] are zero (equal to [constant "
"Vector2.ZERO]). Otherwise, it always evaluates to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Rect2] with its [member position] and [member size] set to "
"[constant Vector2.ZERO]."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Rect2] amb els seus [member position] i [member size] "
"establerts a [constant Vector2.ZERO]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Rect2] as a copy of the given [Rect2]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Rect2] com a còpia del [Rect2] donat."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Rect2] from a [Rect2i]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Rect2] a partir d'un [Rect2i]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Rect2] by [param position] and [param size]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Rect2] per [param position] i [param size]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Rect2] by setting its [member position] to ([param x], [param "
"y]), and its [member size] to ([param width], [param height])."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Rect2] establint el seu [member position] a ([param x], "
"[param y]), i el seu [member size] a ([param width], [param height])."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Rect2] equivalent to this rectangle, with its width and height "
"modified to be non-negative values, and with its [member position] being the "
"top-left corner of the rectangle.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect = Rect2(25, 25, -100, -50)\n"
"var absolute = rect.abs() # absolute is Rect2(-75, -25, 100, 50)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect = new Rect2(25, 25, -100, -50);\n"
"var absolute = rect.Abs(); // absolute is Rect2(-75, -25, 100, 50)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to use this method when [member size] is "
"negative, as most other methods in Godot assume that the [member position] "
"is the top-left corner, and the [member end] is the bottom-right corner."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this rectangle [i]completely[/i] encloses the "
"[param b] rectangle."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this rectangle expanded to align the edges with the given "
"[param to] point, if necessary.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect = Rect2(0, 0, 5, 2)\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2(10, 0)) # rect is Rect2(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2(-5, 5)) # rect is Rect2(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect = new Rect2(0, 0, 5, 2);\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(new Vector2(10, 0)); // rect is Rect2(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(new Vector2(-5, 5)); // rect is Rect2(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest rectangle expandit per alinear les vores amb el "
"punt [param to] donat, si cal.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect = Rect2(0, 0, 5, 2)\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2(10, 0)) # rect és Rect2(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2(-5, 5)) # rect és Rect2(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect = nou Rect2(0, 0, 5, 2);\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(nou Vector2(10, 0)); // rect és Rect2(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(nou Vector2(-5, 5)); // rect és Rect2(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the rectangle's area. This is equivalent to [code]size.x * size.y[/"
"code]. See also [method has_area]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'àrea del rectangle. Això equival a [code]size.x * size.y[/code]. "
"Vegeu també [method has_area]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the center point of the rectangle. This is the same as "
"[code]position + (size / 2.0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt central del rectangle. Això és el mateix que [code]posició + "
"(mida / 2.0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the vertex's position of this rect that's the farthest in the given "
"direction. This point is commonly known as the support point in collision "
"detection algorithms."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició del vèrtex d'aquest recte que és el més llunyà en la "
"direcció donada. Aquest punt es coneix comunament com el punt de suport en "
"algorismes de detecció de col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this rectangle extended on all sides by the given [param "
"amount]. A negative [param amount] shrinks the rectangle instead. See also "
"[method grow_individual] and [method grow_side].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = Rect2(4, 4, 8, 8).grow(4) # a is Rect2(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = Rect2(0, 0, 8, 4).grow(2) # b is Rect2(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = new Rect2(4, 4, 8, 8).Grow(4); // a is Rect2(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = new Rect2(0, 0, 8, 4).Grow(2); // b is Rect2(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest rectangle estesa per tots els costats per [param "
"amount] donat. Un negatiu [param amount] redueix el rectangle. Vegeu també "
"[method grow_individual] i [method grow_side].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = Rect2(4, 4, 8, 8).grow(4) # a és Rect2(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = Rect2(0, 0, 8, 4).grow(2) # b és Rect2(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = nou Rect2(4, 4, 8, 8).Creix(4); // a és Rect2(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = nou Rect2(0, 0, 8, 4).Creix(2); // b és Rect2(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this rectangle with its [param left], [param top], [param "
"right], and [param bottom] sides extended by the given amounts. Negative "
"values shrink the sides, instead. See also [method grow] and [method "
"grow_side]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest rectangle amb els seus costats [param left], "
"[param top], [param right] i [param bottom] ampliats amb les quantitats "
"indicades. En canvi, els valors negatius redueixen els costats. Vegeu també "
"[method grow] i [method grow_side]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this rectangle with its [param side] extended by the given "
"[param amount] (see [enum Side] constants). A negative [param amount] "
"shrinks the rectangle, instead. See also [method grow] and [method "
"grow_individual]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest rectangle amb la seva [param side] ampliada per "
"la [param amount] donada (vegeu [enum Side] constants). Un negatiu [param "
"amount] redueix el rectangle, en canvi. Vegeu també [method grow] i [method "
"grow_individual]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this rectangle has positive width and height. "
"See also [method get_area]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the rectangle contains the given [param point]. "
"By convention, points on the right and bottom edges are [b]not[/b] "
"included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not reliable for [Rect2] with a [i]negative[/i] "
"[member size]. Use [method abs] first to get a valid rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el rectangle conté el [param point] donat. Per "
"convenció, els punts de les vores dreta i inferior s'inclouen [b]not[/b].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode no és fiable per a [Rect2] amb un [i]negatiu[/i] "
"[member size]. Utilitzeu primer [method abs] per obtenir un rectangle vàlid."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the intersection between this rectangle and [param b]. If the "
"rectangles do not intersect, returns an empty [Rect2].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect1 = Rect2(0, 0, 5, 10)\n"
"var rect2 = Rect2(2, 0, 8, 4)\n"
"\n"
"var a = rect1.intersection(rect2) # a is Rect2(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect1 = new Rect2(0, 0, 5, 10);\n"
"var rect2 = new Rect2(2, 0, 8, 4);\n"
"\n"
"var a = rect1.Intersection(rect2); // a is Rect2(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you only need to know whether two rectangles are "
"overlapping, use [method intersects], instead."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la intersecció entre aquest rectangle i [param b]. Si els rectangles "
"no es tallen, retorna un [Rect2] buit.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect1 = Rect2(0, 0, 5, 10)\n"
"var rect2 = Rect2(2, 0, 8, 4)\n"
"\n"
"var a = rect1.intersection(rect2) # a és Rect2(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect1 = nou Rect2(0, 0, 5, 10);\n"
"var rect2 = nou Rect2(2, 0, 8, 4);\n"
"\n"
"var a = rect1.Intersecció (rect2); // a és Rect2(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si només necessiteu saber si dos rectangles es superposen, "
"utilitzeu [method intersects]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this rectangle overlaps with the [param b] "
"rectangle. The edges of both rectangles are excluded, unless [param "
"include_borders] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this rectangle and [param rect] are "
"approximately equal, by calling [method Vector2.is_equal_approx] on the "
"[member position] and the [member size]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest rectangle i [param rect] són "
"aproximadament iguals, trucant a [method Vector2.is_equal_approx] a [member "
"position] i a [member size]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this rectangle's values are finite, by calling "
"[method Vector2.is_finite] on the [member position] and the [member size]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els valors d'aquest rectangle són finits, "
"cridant a [method Vector2.is_finite] a [member position] i a [member size]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Rect2] that encloses both this rectangle and [param b] around the "
"edges. See also [method encloses]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Rect2] que tanca aquest rectangle i [param b] al voltant de les "
"vores. Vegeu també [method encloses]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"The ending point. This is usually the bottom-right corner of the rectangle, "
"and is equivalent to [code]position + size[/code]. Setting this point "
"affects the [member size]."
msgstr ""
"El punt final. Normalment és la cantonada inferior dreta del rectangle i "
"equival a [code]posició + mida[/code]. La configuració d'aquest punt afecta "
"el [member size]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid "The origin point. This is usually the top-left corner of the rectangle."
msgstr ""
"El punt d'origen. Normalment és la cantonada superior esquerra del rectangle."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"The rectangle's width and height, starting from [member position]. Setting "
"this value also affects the [member end] point.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended setting the width and height to non-negative "
"values, as most methods in Godot assume that the [member position] is the "
"top-left corner, and the [member end] is the bottom-right corner. To get an "
"equivalent rectangle with non-negative size, use [method abs]."
msgstr ""
"L'amplada i l'alçada del rectangle, començant per [member position]. "
"Establir aquest valor també afecta el punt [member end].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Es recomana establir l'amplada i l'alçada en valors no "
"negatius, ja que la majoria dels mètodes de Godot assumeixen que [member "
"position] és la cantonada superior esquerra i [member end] és la cantonada "
"inferior dreta. Per obtenir un rectangle equivalent amb una mida no "
"negativa, utilitzeu [method abs]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [member position] or [member size] of both "
"rectangles are not equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els [member position] o [member size] dels dos "
"rectangles no són iguals.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa dels errors de precisió de coma flotant, considereu "
"utilitzar [method is_equal_approx], que és més fiable."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Inversely transforms (multiplies) the [Rect2] by the given [Transform2D] "
"transformation matrix, under the assumption that the transformation basis is "
"orthonormal (i.e. rotation/reflection is fine, scaling/skew is not).\n"
"[code]rect * transform[/code] is equivalent to [code]transform.inverse() * "
"rect[/code]. See [method Transform2D.inverse].\n"
"For transforming by inverse of an affine transformation (e.g. with scaling) "
"[code]transform.affine_inverse() * rect[/code] can be used instead. See "
"[method Transform2D.affine_inverse]."
msgstr ""
"Transforma (multiplica) a la inversa [Rect2] per la matriu de transformació "
"[Transform2D] donada, sota el supòsit que la base de la transformació és "
"ortonormal (és a dir, la rotació/reflexió està bé, l'escala/la inclinació "
"no).\n"
"[code]rect * transform[/code] és equivalent a [code]transform.inverse() * "
"rect[/code]. Veure [method Transform2D.inverse].\n"
"Per a la transformació inversa d'una transformació afí (per exemple, amb "
"escala) es pot utilitzar [code]transform.affine_inverse() * rect[/code]. "
"Veure [method Transform2D.affine_inverse]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both [member position] and [member size] of the "
"rectangles are exactly equal, respectively.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si tant [member position] com [member size] dels "
"rectangles són exactament iguals, respectivament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A causa dels errors de precisió de coma flotant, considereu "
"utilitzar [method is_equal_approx], que és més fiable."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid "A 2D axis-aligned bounding box using integer coordinates."
msgstr "Un quadre delimitador alineat amb eixos 2D amb coordenades senceres."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"The [Rect2i] built-in [Variant] type represents an axis-aligned rectangle in "
"a 2D space, using integer coordinates. It is defined by its [member "
"position] and [member size], which are [Vector2i]. Because it does not "
"rotate, it is frequently used for fast overlap tests (see [method "
"intersects]).\n"
"For floating-point coordinates, see [Rect2].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Negative values for [member size] are not supported. With "
"negative size, most [Rect2i] methods do not work correctly. Use [method abs] "
"to get an equivalent [Rect2i] with a non-negative size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a [Rect2i] evaluates to [code]false[/"
"code] if both [member position] and [member size] are zero (equal to "
"[constant Vector2i.ZERO]). Otherwise, it always evaluates to [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Rect2i] with its [member position] and [member size] set to "
"[constant Vector2i.ZERO]."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Rect2i] amb els seus [member position] i [member size] "
"establerts a [constant Vector2i.ZERO]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Rect2i] as a copy of the given [Rect2i]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Rect2i] com a còpia del [Rect2i] donat."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Rect2i] from a [Rect2]. The floating-point coordinates are "
"truncated."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Rect2i] a partir d'un [Rect2]. Les coordenades de coma "
"flotant es trunquen."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Rect2i] by [param position] and [param size]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Rect2i] per [param position] i [param size]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [Rect2i] by setting its [member position] to ([param x], [param "
"y]), and its [member size] to ([param width], [param height])."
msgstr ""
"Construeix un [Rect2i] establint el seu [member position] a ([param x], "
"[param y]), i el seu [member size] a ([param width], [param height])."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Rect2i] equivalent to this rectangle, with its width and height "
"modified to be non-negative values, and with its [member position] being the "
"top-left corner of the rectangle.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect = Rect2i(25, 25, -100, -50)\n"
"var absolute = rect.abs() # absolute is Rect2i(-75, -25, 100, 50)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect = new Rect2I(25, 25, -100, -50);\n"
"var absolute = rect.Abs(); // absolute is Rect2I(-75, -25, 100, 50)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to use this method when [member size] is "
"negative, as most other methods in Godot assume that the [member position] "
"is the top-left corner, and the [member end] is the bottom-right corner."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Rect2i] completely encloses another one."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest [Rect2i] n'inclou completament un altre."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this rectangle expanded to align the edges with the given "
"[param to] point, if necessary.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect = Rect2i(0, 0, 5, 2)\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2i(10, 0)) # rect is Rect2i(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2i(-5, 5)) # rect is Rect2i(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect = new Rect2I(0, 0, 5, 2);\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(new Vector2I(10, 0)); // rect is Rect2I(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(new Vector2I(-5, 5)); // rect is Rect2I(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest rectangle expandit per alinear les vores amb el "
"punt [param to] donat, si cal.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rect = Rect2i(0, 0, 5, 2)\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2i(10, 0)) # rect és Rect2i(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.expand(Vector2i(-5, 5)) # rect és Rect2i(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var rect = new Rect2I(0, 0, 5, 2);\n"
"\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(nou Vector2I(10, 0)); // rect és Rect2I(0, 0, 10, 2)\n"
"rect = rect.Expand(nou Vector2I(-5, 5)); // rect és Rect2I(-5, 0, 15, 5)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the center point of the rectangle. This is the same as "
"[code]position + (size / 2)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the [member size] is odd, the result will be rounded towards "
"[member position]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt central del rectangle. És el mateix que [code]posició + "
"(mida / 2)[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si [member size] és senar, el resultat s'arrodonirà cap a "
"[member position]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this rectangle extended on all sides by the given [param "
"amount]. A negative [param amount] shrinks the rectangle instead. See also "
"[method grow_individual] and [method grow_side].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = Rect2i(4, 4, 8, 8).grow(4) # a is Rect2i(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = Rect2i(0, 0, 8, 4).grow(2) # b is Rect2i(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = new Rect2I(4, 4, 8, 8).Grow(4); // a is Rect2I(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = new Rect2I(0, 0, 8, 4).Grow(2); // b is Rect2I(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia d'aquest rectangle estesa per tots els costats per [param "
"amount] donat. Un negatiu [param amount] redueix el rectangle. Vegeu també "
"[method grow_individual] i [method grow_side].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = Rect2i(4, 4, 8, 8).grow(4) # a és Rect2i(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = Rect2i(0, 0, 8, 4).grow(2) # b és Rect2i(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = new Rect2I(4, 4, 8, 8).Creix(4); // a és Rect2I(0, 0, 16, 16)\n"
"var b = nou Rect2I(0, 0, 8, 4).Creix(2); // b és Rect2I(-2, -2, 12, 8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the rectangle contains the given [param point]. "
"By convention, points on the right and bottom edges are [b]not[/b] "
"included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not reliable for [Rect2i] with a [i]negative[/i] "
"[member size]. Use [method abs] first to get a valid rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el rectangle conté el [param point] donat. Per "
"convenció, els punts de les vores dreta i inferior s'inclouen [b]not[/b].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode no és fiable per a [Rect2i] amb un [i]negatiu[/i] "
"[member size]. Utilitzeu primer [method abs] per obtenir un rectangle vàlid."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the intersection between this rectangle and [param b]. If the "
"rectangles do not intersect, returns an empty [Rect2i].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = Rect2i(0, 0, 5, 10)\n"
"var b = Rect2i(2, 0, 8, 4)\n"
"\n"
"var c = a.intersection(b) # c is Rect2i(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = new Rect2I(0, 0, 5, 10);\n"
"var b = new Rect2I(2, 0, 8, 4);\n"
"\n"
"var c = rect1.Intersection(rect2); // c is Rect2I(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you only need to know whether two rectangles are "
"overlapping, use [method intersects], instead."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la intersecció entre aquest rectangle i [param b]. Si els rectangles "
"no es tallen, retorna un [Rect2i] buit.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = Rect2i(0, 0, 5, 10)\n"
"var b = Rect2i(2, 0, 8, 4)\n"
"\n"
"var c = a.intersection(b) # c és Rect2i(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = nou Rect2I(0, 0, 5, 10);\n"
"var b = nou Rect2I(2, 0, 8, 4);\n"
"\n"
"var c = rect1.Intersecció (rect2); // c és Rect2I(2, 0, 3, 4)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si només necessiteu saber si dos rectangles es superposen, "
"utilitzeu [method intersects]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this rectangle overlaps with the [param b] "
"rectangle. The edges of both rectangles are excluded."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Rect2i] that encloses both this rectangle and [param b] around "
"the edges. See also [method encloses]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Rect2i] que tanca aquest rectangle i [param b] al voltant de les "
"vores. Vegeu també [method encloses]."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [member position] or [member size] of both "
"rectangles are not equal."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Rect2i.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both [member position] and [member size] of the "
"rectangles are equal, respectively."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RectangleShape2D.xml
msgid "A 2D rectangle shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Una forma de rectangle 2D utilitzada per a la col·lisió física."

#: doc/classes/RectangleShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D rectangle shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape2D].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [RectangleShape2D] is fast to check collisions against. "
"It is faster than [CapsuleShape2D], but slower than [CircleShape2D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma rectangular 2D, pensada per al seu ús en física. Normalment "
"s'utilitza per proporcionar una forma per a un [CollisionShape2D].\n"
"[b]Rendiment:[/b] [RectangleShape2D] és ràpid per comprovar les col·lisions. "
"És més ràpid que [CapsuleShape2D], però més lent que [CircleShape2D]."

#: doc/classes/RectangleShape2D.xml
msgid "The rectangle's width and height."
msgstr "L'amplada i l'alçada del rectangle."

#: doc/classes/RefCounted.xml
msgid "Base class for reference-counted objects."
msgstr "Classe base per a objectes comptats per referència."

#: doc/classes/RefCounted.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for any object that keeps a reference count. [Resource] and many "
"other helper objects inherit this class.\n"
"Unlike other [Object] types, [RefCounted]s keep an internal reference "
"counter so that they are automatically released when no longer in use, and "
"only then. [RefCounted]s therefore do not need to be freed manually with "
"[method Object.free].\n"
"[RefCounted] instances caught in a cyclic reference will [b]not[/b] be freed "
"automatically. For example, if a node holds a reference to instance [code]A[/"
"code], which directly or indirectly holds a reference back to [code]A[/"
"code], [code]A[/code]'s reference count will be 2. Destruction of the node "
"will leave [code]A[/code] dangling with a reference count of 1, and there "
"will be a memory leak. To prevent this, one of the references in the cycle "
"can be made weak with [method @GlobalScope.weakref].\n"
"In the vast majority of use cases, instantiating and using [RefCounted]-"
"derived types is all you need to do. The methods provided in this class are "
"only for advanced users, and can cause issues if misused.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, reference-counted objects will not be freed instantly "
"after they are no longer in use. Instead, garbage collection will run "
"periodically and will free reference-counted objects that are no longer in "
"use. This means that unused ones will remain in memory for a while before "
"being removed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RefCounted.xml
msgid "Returns the current reference count."
msgstr "Retorna el recompte de referència actual."

#: doc/classes/RefCounted.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the internal reference counter. Use this only if you really know "
"what you are doing.\n"
"Returns whether the initialization was successful."
msgstr ""
"Inicialitza el comptador de referència intern. Utilitzeu-ho només si "
"realment sabeu el que esteu fent.\n"
"Retorna si la inicialització ha estat correcta."

#: doc/classes/RefCounted.xml
msgid ""
"Increments the internal reference counter. Use this only if you really know "
"what you are doing.\n"
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the increment was successful, [code]false[/"
"code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Incrementa el comptador de referència intern. Utilitzeu-ho només si realment "
"sabeu el que esteu fent.\n"
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'increment ha tingut èxit, [code]false[/code] "
"en cas contrari."

#: doc/classes/RefCounted.xml
msgid ""
"Decrements the internal reference counter. Use this only if you really know "
"what you are doing.\n"
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the object should be freed after the decrement, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Disminueix el comptador de referència intern. Utilitzeu-ho només si realment "
"sabeu el que esteu fent.\n"
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'objecte s'ha d'alliberar després del "
"decrement, [code]false[/code] en cas contrari."

#: doc/classes/ReferenceRect.xml
msgid "A rectangular box for designing UIs."
msgstr "Una caixa rectangular per dissenyar interfícies d'usuari."

#: doc/classes/ReferenceRect.xml
msgid ""
"A rectangular box that displays only a colored border around its rectangle "
"(see [method Control.get_rect]). It can be used to visualize the extents of "
"a [Control] node, for testing purposes."
msgstr ""
"Un quadre rectangular que només mostra una vora de color al voltant del seu "
"rectangle (vegeu [method Control.get_rect]). Es pot utilitzar per "
"visualitzar les extensions d'un node [Control], amb finalitats de prova."

#: doc/classes/ReferenceRect.xml
msgid "Sets the border color of the [ReferenceRect]."
msgstr "Estableix el color de la vora del [ReferenceRect]."

#: doc/classes/ReferenceRect.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the border width of the [ReferenceRect]. The border grows both inwards "
"and outwards with respect to the rectangle box."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'amplada de la vora del [ReferenceRect]. La vora creix tant cap a "
"dins com cap a fora respecte al quadre rectangle."

#: doc/classes/ReferenceRect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [ReferenceRect] will only be visible while in "
"editor. Otherwise, [ReferenceRect] will be visible in the running project."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [ReferenceRect] només serà visible mentre estigui a "
"l'editor. En cas contrari, [ReferenceRect] serà visible al projecte en "
"execució."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Captures its surroundings to create fast, accurate reflections from a given "
"point."
msgstr ""
"Captura el seu entorn per crear reflexos ràpids i precisos des d'un punt "
"determinat."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Captures its surroundings as a cubemap, and stores versions of it with "
"increasing levels of blur to simulate different material roughnesses.\n"
"The [ReflectionProbe] is used to create high-quality reflections at a low "
"performance cost (when [member update_mode] is [constant UPDATE_ONCE]). "
"[ReflectionProbe]s can be blended together and with the rest of the scene "
"smoothly. [ReflectionProbe]s can also be combined with [VoxelGI], SDFGI "
"([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) and screen-space reflections ([member "
"Environment.ssr_enabled]) to get more accurate reflections in specific "
"areas. [ReflectionProbe]s render all objects within their [member "
"cull_mask], so updating them can be quite expensive. It is best to update "
"them once with the important static objects and then leave them as-is.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [VoxelGI] and SDFGI, [ReflectionProbe]s only source "
"their environment from a [WorldEnvironment] node. If you specify an "
"[Environment] resource within a [Camera3D] node, it will be ignored by the "
"[ReflectionProbe]. This can lead to incorrect lighting within the "
"[ReflectionProbe].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, only [code]8[/code] "
"reflection probes can be displayed on each mesh resource, while the "
"Compatibility rendering method only supports up to [code]2[/code] reflection "
"probes on each mesh. Attempting to display more than [code]8[/code] "
"reflection probes on a single mesh resource using the Mobile renderer will "
"result in reflection probes flickering in and out as the camera moves, while "
"the Compatibility renderer will not render any additional probes if more "
"than [code]2[/code] reflection probes are being used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, reflection probes will "
"only correctly affect meshes whose visibility AABB intersects with the "
"reflection probe's AABB. If using a shader to deform the mesh in a way that "
"makes it go outside its AABB, [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] "
"must be increased on the mesh. Otherwise, the reflection probe may not be "
"visible on the mesh."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid "Reflection probes"
msgstr "Sondes de reflexió"

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"The custom ambient color to use within the [ReflectionProbe]'s box defined "
"by its [member size]. Only effective if [member ambient_mode] is [constant "
"AMBIENT_COLOR]."
msgstr ""
"El color d'ambient personalitzat que s'ha d'utilitzar dins del quadre de "
"[ReflectionProbe] definit pel seu [member size]. Només efectiu si [member "
"ambient_mode] és [constant AMBIENT_COLOR]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"The custom ambient color energy to use within the [ReflectionProbe]'s box "
"defined by its [member size]. Only effective if [member ambient_mode] is "
"[constant AMBIENT_COLOR]."
msgstr ""
"L'energia de color ambiental personalitzada que s'ha d'utilitzar a la caixa "
"de [ReflectionProbe] definida pel seu [member size]. Només efectiu si "
"[member ambient_mode] és [constant AMBIENT_COLOR]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"The ambient color to use within the [ReflectionProbe]'s box defined by its "
"[member size]. The ambient color will smoothly blend with other "
"[ReflectionProbe]s and the rest of the scene (outside the "
"[ReflectionProbe]'s box defined by its [member size])."
msgstr ""
"El color ambiental que s'ha d'utilitzar dins del quadre de [ReflectionProbe] "
"definit pel seu [member size]. El color ambiental es barrejarà amb altres "
"[ReflectionProbe]s i la resta de l'escena (fora de la caixa de "
"[ReflectionProbe] definida pel seu [member size])."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Defines the distance in meters over which a probe blends into the scene."
msgstr ""
"Defineix la distància en metres sobre la qual una sonda es barreja amb "
"l'escena."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables box projection. This makes reflections look "
"more correct in rectangle-shaped rooms by offsetting the reflection center "
"depending on the camera's location.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To better fit rectangle-shaped rooms that are not aligned to "
"the grid, you can rotate the [ReflectionProbe] node."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], activa la projecció de caixa. Això fa que els reflexos "
"semblin més correctes a les habitacions en forma de rectangle compensant el "
"centre de reflexió en funció de la ubicació de la càmera.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per ajustar millor les habitacions en forma de rectangle que no "
"estiguin alineades a la quadrícula, podeu girar el node [ReflectionProbe]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the cull mask which determines what objects are drawn by this probe. "
"Every [VisualInstance3D] with a layer included in this cull mask will be "
"rendered by the probe. It is best to only include large objects which are "
"likely to take up a lot of space in the reflection in order to save on "
"rendering cost.\n"
"This can also be used to prevent an object from reflecting upon itself (for "
"instance, a [ReflectionProbe] centered on a vehicle)."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la màscara d'eliminació que determina quins objectes dibuixa "
"aquesta sonda. Cada [VisualInstance3D] amb una capa inclosa en aquesta "
"màscara de cull serà representada per la sonda. El millor és incloure només "
"objectes grans que probablement ocupin molt d'espai a la reflexió per tal "
"d'estalviar en costos de renderització.\n"
"Això també es pot utilitzar per evitar que un objecte es reflecteixi sobre "
"si mateix (per exemple, un [ReflectionProbe] centrat en un vehicle)."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], computes shadows in the reflection probe. This makes "
"the reflection probe slower to render; you may want to disable this if using "
"the [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] [member update_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], calcula les ombres a la sonda de reflexió. Això fa que "
"la sonda de reflexió sigui més lenta en render-se; potser voldreu desactivar-"
"ho si feu servir [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] [member update_mode]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Defines the reflection intensity. Intensity modulates the strength of the "
"reflection."
msgstr ""
"Defineix la intensitat de reflexió. La intensitat modula la força de la "
"reflexió."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], reflections will ignore sky contribution."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], els reflexos ignoraran la contribució del cel."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum distance away from the [ReflectionProbe] an object can be before "
"it is culled. Decrease this to improve performance, especially when using "
"the [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] [member update_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum reflection distance is always at least equal to the "
"probe's extents. This means that decreasing [member max_distance] will not "
"always cull objects from reflections, especially if the reflection probe's "
"box defined by its [member size] is already large."
msgstr ""
"La distància màxima de [ReflectionProbe] que pot estar un objecte abans de "
"ser seleccionat. Disminuïu-ho per millorar el rendiment, especialment quan "
"feu servir [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] [member update_mode].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La distància màxima de reflexió sempre és com a mínim igual a "
"les extensions de la sonda. Això vol dir que la disminució de [member "
"max_distance] no sempre eliminarà objectes dels reflexos, especialment si la "
"caixa de la sonda de reflexió definida pel seu [member size] ja és gran."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"The automatic LOD bias to use for meshes rendered within the "
"[ReflectionProbe] (this is analog to [member Viewport.mesh_lod_threshold]). "
"Higher values will use less detailed versions of meshes that have LOD "
"variations generated. If set to [code]0.0[/code], automatic LOD is disabled. "
"Increase [member mesh_lod_threshold] to improve performance at the cost of "
"geometry detail, especially when using the [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] [member "
"update_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member mesh_lod_threshold] does not affect "
"[GeometryInstance3D] visibility ranges (also known as \"manual\" LOD or "
"hierarchical LOD)."
msgstr ""
"El biaix de LOD automàtic que s'ha d'utilitzar per a les malles "
"representades dins de [ReflectionProbe] (això és anàleg a [member "
"Viewport.mesh_lod_threshold]). Els valors més alts utilitzaran versions "
"menys detallades de malles que tinguin variacions de LOD generades. Si "
"s'estableix a [code]0.0[/code], el LOD automàtic està desactivat. Augmenta "
"[member mesh_lod_threshold] per millorar el rendiment a costa del detall de "
"la geometria, especialment quan s'utilitza [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] [member "
"update_mode].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member mesh_lod_threshold] no afecta els intervals de "
"visibilitat de [GeometryInstance3D] (també coneguts com a LOD \"manual\" o "
"LOD jeràrquic)."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the origin offset to be used when this [ReflectionProbe] is in [member "
"box_projection] mode. This can be set to a non-zero value to ensure a "
"reflection fits a rectangle-shaped room, while reducing the number of "
"objects that \"get in the way\" of the reflection."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el desplaçament de l'origen que s'utilitzarà quan aquest "
"[ReflectionProbe] està en mode [member box_projection]. Això es pot establir "
"en un valor diferent de zero per assegurar-se que un reflex s'ajusta a una "
"habitació en forma de rectangle, alhora que es redueix el nombre d'objectes "
"que \"interfereixen\" el reflex."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the reflection mask which determines what objects have reflections "
"applied from this probe. Every [VisualInstance3D] with a layer included in "
"this reflection mask will have reflections applied from this probe. See also "
"[member cull_mask], which can be used to exclude objects from appearing in "
"the reflection while still making them affected by the [ReflectionProbe]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la màscara de reflexió que determina quins objectes tenen reflexos "
"aplicats des d'aquesta sonda. Cada [VisualInstance3D] amb una capa inclosa "
"en aquesta màscara de reflexió tindrà reflexos aplicats des d'aquesta sonda. "
"Vegeu també [member cull_mask], que es pot utilitzar per excloure objectes "
"d'aparèixer a la reflexió mentre encara els afecta el [ReflectionProbe]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the reflection probe. The larger the size, the more space "
"covered by the probe, which will lower the perceived resolution. It is best "
"to keep the size only as large as you need it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To better fit areas that are not aligned to the grid, you can "
"rotate the [ReflectionProbe] node."
msgstr ""
"La mida de la sonda de reflexió. Com més gran sigui la mida, més espai "
"ocuparà la sonda, cosa que reduirà la resolució percebuda. El millor és "
"mantenir la mida només tan gran com la necessiteu.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per ajustar millor les àrees que no estan alineades a la "
"quadrícula, podeu girar el node [ReflectionProbe]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Sets how frequently the [ReflectionProbe] is updated. Can be [constant "
"UPDATE_ONCE] or [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la freqüència amb què s'actualitza [ReflectionProbe]. Pot ser "
"[constant UPDATE_ONCE] o [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Update the probe once on the next frame (recommended for most objects). The "
"corresponding radiance map will be generated over the following six frames. "
"This takes more time to update than [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS], but it has a "
"lower performance cost and can result in higher-quality reflections. The "
"ReflectionProbe is updated when its transform changes, but not when nearby "
"geometry changes. You can force a [ReflectionProbe] update by moving the "
"[ReflectionProbe] slightly in any direction."
msgstr ""
"Actualitzeu la sonda una vegada al següent fotograma (recomanat per a la "
"majoria d'objectes). El mapa de radiació corresponent es generarà en els sis "
"fotogrames següents. Això necessita més temps per actualitzar-se que "
"[constant UPDATE_ALWAYS], però té un cost de rendiment més baix i pot donar "
"lloc a reflexions de més qualitat. El ReflectionProbe s'actualitza quan "
"canvia la seva transformació, però no quan canvia la geometria propera. "
"Podeu forçar una actualització de [ReflectionProbe] movent la "
"[ReflectionProbe] lleugerament en qualsevol direcció."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Update the probe every frame. This provides better results for fast-moving "
"dynamic objects (such as cars). However, it has a significant performance "
"cost. Due to the cost, it's recommended to only use one ReflectionProbe with "
"[constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] at most per scene. For all other use cases, use "
"[constant UPDATE_ONCE]."
msgstr ""
"Actualitzeu la sonda cada fotograma. Això proporciona millors resultats per "
"a objectes dinàmics de moviment ràpid (com ara cotxes). No obstant això, té "
"un cost de rendiment important. A causa del cost, es recomana utilitzar "
"només un ReflectionProbe amb [constant UPDATE_ALWAYS] com a màxim per "
"escena. Per a tots els altres casos d'ús, utilitzeu [constant UPDATE_ONCE]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Do not apply any ambient lighting inside the [ReflectionProbe]'s box defined "
"by its [member size]."
msgstr ""
"No apliqueu cap il·luminació ambiental dins de la caixa de [ReflectionProbe] "
"definida per la seva [member size]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Apply automatically-sourced environment lighting inside the "
"[ReflectionProbe]'s box defined by its [member size]."
msgstr ""
"Apliqueu il·luminació ambiental d'origen automàtic dins de la caixa de "
"[ReflectionProbe] definida per la seva [member size]."

#: doc/classes/ReflectionProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Apply custom ambient lighting inside the [ReflectionProbe]'s box defined by "
"its [member size]. See [member ambient_color] and [member "
"ambient_color_energy]."
msgstr ""
"Apliqueu il·luminació ambiental personalitzada dins de la caixa de "
"[ReflectionProbe] definida per la seva [member size]. Vegeu [member "
"ambient_color] i [member ambient_color_energy]."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid "Class for searching text for patterns using regular expressions."
msgstr "Classe per cercar text per patrons mitjançant expressions regulars."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid ""
"A regular expression (or regex) is a compact language that can be used to "
"recognize strings that follow a specific pattern, such as URLs, email "
"addresses, complete sentences, etc. For example, a regex of [code]ab[0-9][/"
"code] would find any string that is [code]ab[/code] followed by any number "
"from [code]0[/code] to [code]9[/code]. For a more in-depth look, you can "
"easily find various tutorials and detailed explanations on the Internet.\n"
"To begin, the RegEx object needs to be compiled with the search pattern "
"using [method compile] before it can be used. Alternatively, the static "
"method [method create_from_string] can be used to create and compile a RegEx "
"object in a single method call.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var regex = RegEx.new()\n"
"regex.compile(\"\\\\w-(\\\\d+)\")\n"
"# Shorthand to create and compile a regex (used in the examples below):\n"
"var regex2 = RegEx.create_from_string(\"\\\\w-(\\\\d+)\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The search pattern must be escaped first for GDScript before it is escaped "
"for the expression. For example, [code]compile(\"\\\\d+\")[/code] would be "
"read by RegEx as [code]\\d+[/code]. Similarly, [code]compile(\"\\\"(?:\\\\\\"
"\\.|[^\\\"])*\\\"\")[/code] would be read as [code]\"(?:\\\\.|[^\"])*\"[/"
"code]. In GDScript, you can also use raw string literals (r-strings). For "
"example, [code]compile(r'\"(?:\\\\.|[^\"])*\"')[/code] would be read the "
"same.\n"
"Using [method search], you can find the pattern within the given text. If a "
"pattern is found, [RegExMatch] is returned and you can retrieve details of "
"the results using methods such as [method RegExMatch.get_string] and [method "
"RegExMatch.get_start].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var regex = RegEx.create_from_string(\"\\\\w-(\\\\d+)\")\n"
"var result = regex.search(\"abc n-0123\")\n"
"if result:\n"
"\tprint(result.get_string()) # Prints \"n-0123\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The results of capturing groups [code]()[/code] can be retrieved by passing "
"the group number to the various methods in [RegExMatch]. Group 0 is the "
"default and will always refer to the entire pattern. In the above example, "
"calling [code]result.get_string(1)[/code] would give you [code]0123[/code].\n"
"This version of RegEx also supports named capturing groups, and the names "
"can be used to retrieve the results. If two or more groups have the same "
"name, the name would only refer to the first one with a match.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var regex = RegEx.create_from_string(\"d(?<digit>[0-9]+)|x(?<digit>[0-9a-f]+)"
"\")\n"
"var result = regex.search(\"the number is x2f\")\n"
"if result:\n"
"\tprint(result.get_string(\"digit\")) # Prints \"2f\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If you need to process multiple results, [method search_all] generates a "
"list of all non-overlapping results. This can be combined with a [code]for[/"
"code] loop for convenience.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"01 03 0 3f 42\"\n"
"for result in regex.search_all(\"d01, d03, d0c, x3f and x42\"):\n"
"\tprint(result.get_string(\"digit\"))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Split a string using a RegEx:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var regex = RegEx.create_from_string(\"\\\\S+\") # Negated whitespace "
"character class.\n"
"var results = []\n"
"for result in regex.search_all(\"One  Two \\n\\tThree\"):\n"
"\tresults.push_back(result.get_string())\n"
"print(results) # Prints [\"One\", \"Two\", \"Three\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot's regex implementation is based on the [url=https://"
"www.pcre.org/]PCRE2[/url] library. You can view the full pattern reference "
"[url=https://www.pcre.org/current/doc/html/pcre2pattern.html]here[/url].\n"
"[b]Tip:[/b] You can use [url=https://regexr.com/]Regexr[/url] to test "
"regular expressions online."
msgstr ""

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid ""
"This method resets the state of the object, as if it was freshly created. "
"Namely, it unassigns the regular expression of this object."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mètode restableix l'estat de l'objecte, com si s'hagués creat "
"recentment. És a dir, anul·la l'assignació de l'expressió regular d'aquest "
"objecte."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid ""
"Compiles and assign the search pattern to use. Returns [constant OK] if the "
"compilation is successful. If compilation fails, returns [constant FAILED] "
"and when [param show_error] is [code]true[/code], details are printed to "
"standard output."
msgstr ""
"Compila i assigna el patró de cerca a utilitzar. Retorna [constant OK] si la "
"compilació és correcta. Si la compilació falla, retorna [constant FAILED] i "
"quan [param show_error] és [code]true[/code], els detalls s'imprimeixen a la "
"sortida estàndard."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid "Creates and compiles a new [RegEx] object. See also [method compile]."
msgstr "Crea i compila un nou objecte [RegEx]. Vegeu també [method compile]."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid "Returns the number of capturing groups in compiled pattern."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de grups de captura en el patró compilat."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of names of named capturing groups in the compiled pattern. "
"They are ordered by appearance."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu de noms de grups de captura amb nom al patró compilat. "
"Estan ordenats per aparença."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid "Returns the original search pattern that was compiled."
msgstr "Retorna el patró de cerca original que s'ha compilat."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid "Returns whether this object has a valid search pattern assigned."
msgstr "Retorna si aquest objecte té assignat un patró de cerca vàlid."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid ""
"Searches the text for the compiled pattern. Returns a [RegExMatch] container "
"of the first matching result if found, otherwise [code]null[/code].\n"
"The region to search within can be specified with [param offset] and [param "
"end]. This is useful when searching for another match in the same [param "
"subject] by calling this method again after a previous success. Note that "
"setting these parameters differs from passing over a shortened string. For "
"example, the start anchor [code]^[/code] is not affected by [param offset], "
"and the character before [param offset] will be checked for the word "
"boundary [code]\\b[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid ""
"Searches the text for the compiled pattern. Returns an array of [RegExMatch] "
"containers for each non-overlapping result. If no results were found, an "
"empty array is returned instead.\n"
"The region to search within can be specified with [param offset] and [param "
"end]. This is useful when searching for another match in the same [param "
"subject] by calling this method again after a previous success. Note that "
"setting these parameters differs from passing over a shortened string. For "
"example, the start anchor [code]^[/code] is not affected by [param offset], "
"and the character before [param offset] will be checked for the word "
"boundary [code]\\b[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegEx.xml
msgid ""
"Searches the text for the compiled pattern and replaces it with the "
"specified string. Escapes and backreferences such as [code]$1[/code] and "
"[code]$name[/code] are expanded and resolved. By default, only the first "
"instance is replaced, but it can be changed for all instances (global "
"replacement).\n"
"The region to search within can be specified with [param offset] and [param "
"end]. This is useful when searching for another match in the same [param "
"subject] by calling this method again after a previous success. Note that "
"setting these parameters differs from passing over a shortened string. For "
"example, the start anchor [code]^[/code] is not affected by [param offset], "
"and the character before [param offset] will be checked for the word "
"boundary [code]\\b[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid "Contains the results of a [RegEx] search."
msgstr "Conté els resultats d'una cerca [RegEx]."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid ""
"Contains the results of a single [RegEx] match returned by [method "
"RegEx.search] and [method RegEx.search_all]. It can be used to find the "
"position and range of the match and its capturing groups, and it can extract "
"its substring for you."
msgstr ""
"Conté els resultats d'una única coincidència [RegEx] retornada per [method "
"RegEx.search] i [method RegEx.search_all]. Es pot utilitzar per trobar la "
"posició i l'abast de la coincidència i els seus grups de captura, i pot "
"extreure la seva subcadena per a vostè."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the end position of the match within the source string. The end "
"position of capturing groups can be retrieved by providing its group number "
"as an integer or its string name (if it's a named group). The default value "
"of 0 refers to the whole pattern.\n"
"Returns -1 if the group did not match or doesn't exist."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició final de la coincidència dins de la cadena d'origen. La "
"posició final dels grups de captura es pot recuperar proporcionant el seu "
"número de grup com a nombre enter o el seu nom de cadena (si és un grup amb "
"nom). El valor per defecte de 0 es refereix a tot el patró.\n"
"Retorna -1 si el grup no coincideix o no existeix."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid "Returns the number of capturing groups."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de grups de captura."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the starting position of the match within the source string. The "
"starting position of capturing groups can be retrieved by providing its "
"group number as an integer or its string name (if it's a named group). The "
"default value of 0 refers to the whole pattern.\n"
"Returns -1 if the group did not match or doesn't exist."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició inicial de la coincidència dins de la cadena d'origen. La "
"posició inicial dels grups de captura es pot recuperar proporcionant el seu "
"número de grup com a nombre enter o el seu nom de cadena (si és un grup amb "
"nom). El valor per defecte de 0 es refereix a tot el patró.\n"
"Retorna -1 si el grup no coincideix o no existeix."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the substring of the match from the source string. Capturing groups "
"can be retrieved by providing its group number as an integer or its string "
"name (if it's a named group). The default value of 0 refers to the whole "
"pattern.\n"
"Returns an empty string if the group did not match or doesn't exist."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la subcadena de la concordança de la cadena d'origen. Els grups de "
"captura es poden recuperar proporcionant el seu número de grup com a nombre "
"enter o el seu nom de cadena (si es tracta d'un grup amb nom). El valor per "
"defecte de 0 es refereix a tot el patró.\n"
"Retorna una cadena buida si el grup no coincideix o no existeix."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid ""
"A dictionary of named groups and its corresponding group number. Only groups "
"that were matched are included. If multiple groups have the same name, that "
"name would refer to the first matching one."
msgstr ""
"Un diccionari de grups amb nom i el seu número de grup corresponent. Només "
"s'inclouen els grups que han coincidit. Si diversos grups tenen el mateix "
"nom, aquest nom es referiria al primer que coincideixi."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid "An [Array] of the match and its capturing groups."
msgstr "Un [Array] del partit i els seus grups de captura."

#: modules/regex/doc_classes/RegExMatch.xml
msgid ""
"The source string used with the search pattern to find this matching result."
msgstr ""
"La cadena d'origen utilitzada amb el patró de cerca per trobar aquest "
"resultat coincident."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml
msgid ""
"RemoteTransform2D pushes its own [Transform2D] to another [Node2D] derived "
"node in the scene."
msgstr ""
"RemoteTransform2D envia el seu propi [Transform2D] a un altre node derivat "
"[Node2D] de l'escena."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml
msgid ""
"RemoteTransform2D pushes its own [Transform2D] to another [Node2D] derived "
"node (called the remote node) in the scene.\n"
"It can be set to update another node's position, rotation and/or scale. It "
"can use either global or local coordinates."
msgstr ""
"RemoteTransform2D envia el seu propi [Transform2D] a un altre [Node2D] node "
"derivat (anomenat node remot) a l'escena.\n"
"Es pot configurar per actualitzar la posició, la rotació i/o l'escala d'un "
"altre node. Pot utilitzar coordenades locals o globals."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml
msgid ""
"[RemoteTransform2D] caches the remote node. It may not notice if the remote "
"node disappears; [method force_update_cache] forces it to update the cache "
"again."
msgstr ""
"[RemoteTransform2D] guarda a la memòria cau el node remot. És possible que "
"no s'adoni si el node remot desapareix; [method force_update_cache] obliga a "
"actualitzar la memòria cau de nou."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml
msgid ""
"The [NodePath] to the remote node, relative to the RemoteTransform2D's "
"position in the scene."
msgstr ""
"El [NodePath] al node remot, en relació amb la posició del RemoteTransform2D "
"a l'escena."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the remote node's position is updated."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], la posició del node remot s'actualitza."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the remote node's rotation is updated."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], la rotació del node remot s'actualitza."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the remote node's scale is updated."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], l'escala del node remot s'actualitza."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform2D.xml doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], global coordinates are used. If [code]false[/code], "
"local coordinates are used."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], s'utilitzen les coordenades globals. Si [code]false[/"
"code], s'utilitzen les coordenades locals."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid ""
"RemoteTransform3D pushes its own [Transform3D] to another [Node3D] derived "
"Node in the scene."
msgstr ""
"RemoteTransform3D envia el seu propi [Transform3D] a un altre [Node3D] Node "
"derivat de l'escena."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid ""
"RemoteTransform3D pushes its own [Transform3D] to another [Node3D] derived "
"Node (called the remote node) in the scene.\n"
"It can be set to update another Node's position, rotation and/or scale. It "
"can use either global or local coordinates."
msgstr ""
"RemoteTransform3D envia el seu propi [Transform3D] a un altre [Node3D] Node "
"derivat (anomenat node remot) a l'escena.\n"
"Es pot configurar per actualitzar la posició, la rotació i/o l'escala d'un "
"altre node. Pot utilitzar coordenades locals o globals."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid ""
"[RemoteTransform3D] caches the remote node. It may not notice if the remote "
"node disappears; [method force_update_cache] forces it to update the cache "
"again."
msgstr ""
"[RemoteTransform3D] guarda a la memòria cau el node remot. És possible que "
"no s'adoni si el node remot desapareix; [method force_update_cache] obliga a "
"actualitzar la memòria cau de nou."

#: doc/classes/RemoteTransform3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [NodePath] to the remote node, relative to the RemoteTransform3D's "
"position in the scene."
msgstr ""
"El [NodePath] al node remot, en relació amb la posició del RemoteTransform3D "
"a l'escena."

#: doc/classes/RenderData.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract render data object, holds frame data related to rendering a single "
"frame of a viewport."
msgstr ""
"Objecte de dades de renderització abstracta, conté dades de marc "
"relacionades amb la representació d'un únic fotograma d'una finestra gràfica."

#: doc/classes/RenderData.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract render data object, exists for the duration of rendering a single "
"viewport. See also [RenderDataRD], [RenderSceneData], and "
"[RenderSceneDataRD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an internal rendering server object. Do not instantiate "
"this class from a script."
msgstr ""
"Objecte de dades de renderització abstracta, existeix mentre duri la "
"representació d'una sola finestra gràfica. Vegeu també [RenderDataRD], "
"[RenderSceneData] i [RenderSceneDataRD].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest és un objecte de servidor de renderització intern. No "
"instància aquesta classe des d'un script."

#: doc/classes/RenderData.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the camera attributes object in the [RenderingServer] "
"being used to render this viewport."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'[RID] de l'objecte d'atributs de la càmera al [RenderingServer] "
"que s'utilitza per representar aquesta finestra gràfica."

#: doc/classes/RenderData.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the environment object in the [RenderingServer] being "
"used to render this viewport."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [RID] de l'objecte d'entorn al [RenderingServer] que s'utilitza "
"per representar aquesta finestra gràfica."

#: doc/classes/RenderData.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RenderSceneBuffers] object managing the scene buffers for "
"rendering this viewport."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'objecte [RenderSceneBuffers] que gestiona els búfers d'escena per "
"representar aquesta finestra gràfica."

#: doc/classes/RenderData.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Returns the [RenderSceneData] object managing this frames scene data."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderDataExtension.xml
msgid ""
"This class allows for a RenderData implementation to be made in GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe permet fer una implementació de RenderData a GDExtension."

#: doc/classes/RenderDataExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this in GDExtension to return the [RID] for the implementation's "
"camera attributes object."
msgstr ""
"Implementeu-ho a GDExtension per retornar l'[RID] per a l'objecte d'atributs "
"de càmera de la implementació."

#: doc/classes/RenderDataExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this in GDExtension to return the [RID] of the implementation's "
"environment object."
msgstr ""
"Implementeu-ho a GDExtension per retornar el [RID] de l'objecte d'entorn de "
"la implementació."

#: doc/classes/RenderDataExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this in GDExtension to return the implementation's "
"[RenderSceneBuffers] object."
msgstr ""
"Implementeu-ho a GDExtension per retornar l'objecte [RenderSceneBuffers] de "
"la implementació."

#: doc/classes/RenderDataExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this in GDExtension to return the implementation's "
"[RenderSceneDataExtension] object."
msgstr ""
"Implementeu-ho a GDExtension per retornar l'objecte "
"[RenderSceneDataExtension] de la implementació."

#: doc/classes/RenderDataRD.xml
msgid "Render data implementation for the RenderingDevice based renderers."
msgstr ""
"Implementació de dades de renderització per als renderitzadors basats en "
"RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderDataRD.xml
msgid ""
"This object manages all render data for the [RenderingDevice]-based "
"renderers. See also [RenderData], [RenderSceneData], and "
"[RenderSceneDataRD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an internal rendering server object. Do not instantiate "
"this class from a script."
msgstr ""
"Aquest objecte gestiona totes les dades de renderització dels renderitzadors "
"basats en [RenderingDevice]. Vegeu també [RenderData], [RenderSceneData] i "
"[RenderSceneDataRD].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest és un objecte de servidor de renderització intern. No "
"instància aquesta classe des d'un script."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Abstraction for working with modern low-level graphics APIs."
msgstr "Abstracció per treballar amb API de gràfics de baix nivell modernes."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"[RenderingDevice] is an abstraction for working with modern low-level "
"graphics APIs such as Vulkan. Compared to [RenderingServer] (which works "
"with Godot's own rendering subsystems), [RenderingDevice] is much lower-"
"level and allows working more directly with the underlying graphics APIs. "
"[RenderingDevice] is used in Godot to provide support for several modern low-"
"level graphics APIs while reducing the amount of code duplication required. "
"[RenderingDevice] can also be used in your own projects to perform things "
"that are not exposed by [RenderingServer] or high-level nodes, such as using "
"compute shaders.\n"
"On startup, Godot creates a global [RenderingDevice] which can be retrieved "
"using [method RenderingServer.get_rendering_device]. This global "
"[RenderingDevice] performs drawing to the screen.\n"
"[b]Local RenderingDevices:[/b] Using [method "
"RenderingServer.create_local_rendering_device], you can create \"secondary\" "
"rendering devices to perform drawing and GPU compute operations on separate "
"threads.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [RenderingDevice] assumes intermediate knowledge of modern "
"graphics APIs such as Vulkan, Direct3D 12, Metal or WebGPU. These graphics "
"APIs are lower-level than OpenGL or Direct3D 11, requiring you to perform "
"what was previously done by the graphics driver itself. If you have "
"difficulty understanding the concepts used in this class, follow the "
"[url=https://vulkan-tutorial.com/]Vulkan Tutorial[/url] or [url=https://"
"vkguide.dev/]Vulkan Guide[/url]. It's recommended to have existing modern "
"OpenGL or Direct3D 11 knowledge before attempting to learn a low-level "
"graphics API.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [RenderingDevice] is not available when running in headless "
"mode or when using the Compatibility rendering method."
msgstr ""
"[RenderingDevice] és una abstracció per treballar amb API de gràfics de baix "
"nivell modernes com ara Vulkan. En comparació amb [RenderingServer] (que "
"funciona amb els subsistemes de renderització propis de Godot), "
"[RenderingDevice] és de nivell molt inferior i permet treballar més "
"directament amb les API de gràfics subjacents. [RenderingDevice] s'utilitza "
"a Godot per donar suport a diverses API de gràfics modernes de baix nivell "
"alhora que redueix la quantitat de duplicació de codi necessària. "
"[RenderingDevice] també es pot utilitzar en els vostres propis projectes per "
"dur a terme coses que no estan exposades per [RenderingServer] o nodes d'alt "
"nivell, com ara utilitzar ombrejats de càlcul.\n"
"A l'inici, Godot crea un [RenderingDevice] global que es pot recuperar "
"mitjançant [method RenderingServer.get_rendering_device]. Aquest "
"[RenderingDevice] global realitza el dibuix a la pantalla.\n"
"[b]Dispositius de representació local:[/b] Amb [method "
"RenderingServer.create_local_rendering_device], podeu crear dispositius de "
"renderització \"secundaris\" per realitzar operacions de dibuix i càlcul de "
"GPU en fils separats.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [RenderingDevice] suposa un coneixement intermedi de les API de "
"gràfiques modernes com ara Vulkan, Direct3D 12, Metal o WebGPU. Aquestes API "
"de gràfics són de nivell inferior a OpenGL o Direct3D 11, i requereixen que "
"realitzeu el que abans feia el propi controlador de gràfics. Si teniu "
"dificultats per entendre els conceptes utilitzats en aquesta classe, seguiu "
"el [url=https://vulkan-tutorial.com/]Vulkan Tutorial[/url] o [url=https://"
"vkguide.dev/]Vulkan Guide[/url]. Es recomana tenir coneixements moderns "
"d'OpenGL o Direct3D 11 abans d'intentar aprendre una API de gràfics de baix "
"nivell.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [RenderingDevice] no està disponible quan s'executa en mode "
"sense cap o quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació de compatibilitat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Using compute shaders"
msgstr "Ús d'ombrejats de càlcul"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Barriers are automatically inserted by RenderingDevice."
msgstr "Les barreres s'insereixen automàticament mitjançant RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Builds the [param blas]."
msgstr "Crea el [param blas]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new Bottom-Level Acceleration Structure (BLAS). It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova estructura d'acceleració de nivell inferior (BLAS). S'hi pot "
"accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the contents of the [param buffer], clearing [param size_bytes] "
"bytes, starting at [param offset].\n"
"Prints an error if:\n"
"- the size isn't a multiple of four\n"
"- the region specified by [param offset] + [param size_bytes] exceeds the "
"buffer\n"
"- a draw list is currently active (created by [method draw_list_begin])\n"
"- a compute list is currently active (created by [method compute_list_begin])"
msgstr ""
"Esborra el contingut dels [param buffer], esborrant [param size_bytes] "
"bytes, començant per [param offset].\n"
"Imprimeix un error si:\n"
"- la mida no és múltiple de quatre\n"
"- la regió especificada per [param offset] + [param size_bytes] supera el "
"buffer\n"
"- hi ha una llista de sorteig activa (creada per [method draw_list_begin])\n"
"- una llista de càlcul està activa actualment (creada per [method "
"compute_list_begin])"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Copies [param size] bytes from the [param src_buffer] at [param src_offset] "
"into [param dst_buffer] at [param dst_offset].\n"
"Prints an error if:\n"
"- [param size] exceeds the size of either [param src_buffer] or [param "
"dst_buffer] at their corresponding offsets\n"
"- a draw list is currently active (created by [method draw_list_begin])\n"
"- a compute list is currently active (created by [method compute_list_begin])"
msgstr ""
"Copia [param size] bytes de [param src_buffer] a [param src_offset] a [param "
"dst_buffer] a [param dst_offset].\n"
"Imprimeix un error si:\n"
"- [param size] supera la mida de [param src_buffer] o de [param dst_buffer] "
"als seus desplaçaments corresponents\n"
"- hi ha una llista de sorteig activa (creada per [method draw_list_begin])\n"
"- una llista de càlcul està activa actualment (creada per [method "
"compute_list_begin])"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the data of the specified [param buffer], optionally "
"[param offset_bytes] and [param size_bytes] can be set to copy only a "
"portion of the buffer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will block the GPU from working until the data is "
"retrieved. Refer to [method buffer_get_data_async] for an alternative that "
"returns the data in more performant way."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia de les dades del [param buffer] especificat, opcionalment "
"[param offset_bytes] i [param size_bytes] es pot configurar per copiar només "
"una part de la memòria intermèdia.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode bloquejarà el funcionament de la GPU fins que es "
"recuperin les dades. Consulteu [method buffer_get_data_async] per obtenir "
"una alternativa que retorni les dades d'una manera més eficient."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Asynchronous version of [method buffer_get_data]. RenderingDevice will call "
"[param callback] in a certain amount of frames with the data the buffer had "
"at the time of the request.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] At the moment, the delay corresponds to the amount of frames "
"specified by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/vsync/"
"frame_queue_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Downloading large buffers can have a prohibitive cost for real-"
"time even when using the asynchronous method due to hardware bandwidth "
"limitations. When dealing with large resources, you can adjust settings such "
"as [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/staging_buffer/"
"block_size_kb] to improve the transfer speed at the cost of extra memory.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _buffer_get_data_callback(array):\n"
"\tvalue = array.decode_u32(0)\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"rd.buffer_get_data_async(buffer, _buffer_get_data_callback)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Versió asíncrona de [method buffer_get_data]. RenderingDevice trucarà a "
"[param callback] en una determinada quantitat de fotogrames amb les dades "
"que tenia la memòria intermèdia en el moment de la sol·licitud.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] De moment, el retard correspon a la quantitat de fotogrames "
"especificada per [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/vsync/"
"frame_queue_size].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La descàrrega de buffers grans pot tenir un cost prohibitiu en "
"temps real fins i tot quan s'utilitza el mètode asíncron a causa de les "
"limitacions de l'amplada de banda del maquinari. Quan es tracta de recursos "
"grans, podeu ajustar paràmetres com ara [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] per millorar la velocitat de "
"transferència a costa de memòria addicional.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _buffer_get_data_callback (matriu):\n"
"\tvalor = array.decode_u32(0)\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"rd.buffer_get_data_async(buffer, _buffer_get_data_callback)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the address of the given [param buffer] which can be passed to "
"shaders in any way to access underlying data. Buffer must have been created "
"with this feature enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must check that the GPU supports this functionality by "
"calling [method has_feature] with [constant SUPPORTS_BUFFER_DEVICE_ADDRESS] "
"as a parameter."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'adreça del [param buffer] donat que es pot passar als shaders de "
"qualsevol manera per accedir a les dades subjacents. La memòria intermèdia "
"s'ha d'haver creat amb aquesta funció activada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Heu de comprovar que la GPU admet aquesta funcionalitat trucant "
"a [method has_feature] amb [constant SUPPORTS_BUFFER_DEVICE_ADDRESS] com a "
"paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Updates a region of [param size_bytes] bytes, starting at [param offset], in "
"the buffer, with the specified [param data].\n"
"Prints an error if:\n"
"- the region specified by [param offset] + [param size_bytes] exceeds the "
"buffer\n"
"- a draw list is currently active (created by [method draw_list_begin])\n"
"- a compute list is currently active (created by [method compute_list_begin])"
msgstr ""
"Actualitza una regió de [param size_bytes] bytes, començant per [param "
"offset], a la memòria intermèdia, amb el [param data] especificat.\n"
"Imprimeix un error si:\n"
"- la regió especificada per [param offset] + [param size_bytes] supera el "
"buffer\n"
"- hi ha una llista de sorteig activa (creada per [method draw_list_begin])\n"
"- una llista de càlcul està activa actualment (creada per [method "
"compute_list_begin])"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a timestamp marker with the specified [param name]. This is used for "
"performance reporting with the [method get_captured_timestamp_cpu_time], "
"[method get_captured_timestamp_gpu_time] and [method "
"get_captured_timestamp_name] methods."
msgstr ""
"Crea un marcador de marca de temps amb el [param name] especificat. "
"S'utilitza per als informes de rendiment amb els mètodes [method "
"get_captured_timestamp_cpu_time], [method get_captured_timestamp_gpu_time] i "
"[method get_captured_timestamp_name]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Raises a Vulkan compute barrier in the specified [param compute_list]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Starts a list of compute commands created with the [code]compute_*[/code] "
"methods. The returned value should be passed to other [code]compute_list_*[/"
"code] functions.\n"
"Multiple compute lists cannot be created at the same time; you must finish "
"the previous compute list first using [method compute_list_end].\n"
"A simple compute operation might look like this (code is not a complete "
"example):\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rd = RenderingDevice.new()\n"
"var compute_list = rd.compute_list_begin()\n"
"\n"
"rd.compute_list_bind_compute_pipeline(compute_list, "
"compute_shader_dilate_pipeline)\n"
"rd.compute_list_bind_uniform_set(compute_list, compute_base_uniform_set, 0)\n"
"rd.compute_list_bind_uniform_set(compute_list, dilate_uniform_set, 1)\n"
"\n"
"for i in atlas_slices:\n"
"\trd.compute_list_set_push_constant(compute_list, push_constant, "
"push_constant.size())\n"
"\trd.compute_list_dispatch(compute_list, group_size.x, group_size.y, "
"group_size.z)\n"
"\t# No barrier, let them run all together.\n"
"\n"
"rd.compute_list_end()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Inicia una llista d'ordres de càlcul creades amb els mètodes "
"[code]compute_*[/code]. El valor retornat s'ha de passar a altres funcions "
"[code]compute_list_*[/code].\n"
"No es poden crear diverses llistes de càlcul al mateix temps; primer heu "
"d'acabar la llista de càlcul anterior utilitzant [method compute_list_end].\n"
"Una operació de càlcul simple podria semblar així (el codi no és un exemple "
"complet):\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rd = RenderingDevice.new()\n"
"var compute_list = rd.compute_list_begin()\n"
"\n"
"rd.compute_list_bind_compute_pipeline(compute_list, "
"compute_shader_dilate_pipeline)\n"
"rd.compute_list_bind_uniform_set(compute_list, compute_base_uniform_set, 0)\n"
"rd.compute_list_bind_uniform_set(compute_list, dilate_uniform_set, 1)\n"
"\n"
"per jo a atles_slices:\n"
"\trd.compute_list_set_push_constant(compute_list, push_constant, "
"push_constant.size())\n"
"\trd.compute_list_dispatch(compute_list, group_size.x, group_size.y, "
"group_size.z)\n"
"\t# Sense barrera, deixeu-los córrer tots junts.\n"
"\n"
"rd.compute_list_end()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the GPU what compute pipeline to use when processing the compute list. "
"If the shader has changed since the last time this function was called, "
"Godot will unbind all descriptor sets and will re-bind them inside [method "
"compute_list_dispatch]."
msgstr ""
"Indica a la GPU quina canalització de càlcul ha d'utilitzar quan es processa "
"la llista de càlcul. Si el shader ha canviat des de l'última vegada que es "
"va cridar aquesta funció, Godot desenllaçarà tots els conjunts de "
"descriptors i els tornarà a enllaçar dins de [method compute_list_dispatch]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Binds the [param uniform_set] to this [param compute_list]. Godot ensures "
"that all textures in the uniform set have the correct Vulkan access masks. "
"If Godot had to change access masks of textures, it will raise a Vulkan "
"image memory barrier."
msgstr ""
"Enllaça el [param uniform_set] amb aquest [param compute_list]. Godot "
"assegura que totes les textures del conjunt uniforme tinguin les màscares "
"d'accés Vulkan correctes. Si Godot hagués de canviar les màscares d'accés de "
"les textures, augmentarà una barrera de memòria d'imatge Vulkan."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Submits the compute list for processing on the GPU. This is the compute "
"equivalent to [method draw_list_draw]."
msgstr ""
"Envia la llista de càlcul per processar-la a la GPU. Aquest és el càlcul "
"equivalent a [method draw_list_draw]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Submits the compute list for processing on the GPU with the given group "
"counts stored in the [param buffer] at [param offset]. Buffer must have been "
"created with [constant STORAGE_BUFFER_USAGE_DISPATCH_INDIRECT] flag."
msgstr ""
"Envia la llista de càlcul per processar-la a la GPU amb els recomptes de "
"grups donats emmagatzemats a [param buffer] a [param offset]. La memòria "
"intermèdia s'ha d'haver creat amb el senyalador [constant "
"STORAGE_BUFFER_USAGE_DISPATCH_INDIRECT]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Finishes a list of compute commands created with the [code]compute_*[/code] "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"Acaba una llista d'ordres de càlcul creades amb els mètodes [code]compute_*[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the push constant data to [param buffer] for the specified [param "
"compute_list]. The shader determines how this binary data is used. The "
"buffer's size in bytes must also be specified in [param size_bytes] (this "
"can be obtained by calling the [method PackedByteArray.size] method on the "
"passed [param buffer])."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les dades de la constant push a [param buffer] per al [param "
"compute_list] especificat. El shader determina com s'utilitzen aquestes "
"dades binàries. La mida del buffer en bytes també s'ha d'especificar a "
"[param size_bytes] (això es pot obtenir trucant al mètode [method "
"PackedByteArray.size] al [param buffer] passat)."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new compute pipeline. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when the [param shader] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea un canal de càlcul nou. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"S'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi [param shader]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the compute pipeline specified by the [param "
"compute_pipeline] RID is valid, [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Create a new local [RenderingDevice]. This is most useful for performing "
"compute operations on the GPU independently from the rest of the engine."
msgstr ""
"Creeu un nou [RenderingDevice] local. Això és molt útil per realitzar "
"operacions de càlcul a la GPU independentment de la resta del motor."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Create a command buffer debug label region that can be displayed in third-"
"party tools such as [url=https://renderdoc.org/]RenderDoc[/url]. All regions "
"must be ended with a [method draw_command_end_label] call. When viewed from "
"the linear series of submissions to a single queue, calls to [method "
"draw_command_begin_label] and [method draw_command_end_label] must be "
"matched and balanced.\n"
"The [code]VK_EXT_DEBUG_UTILS_EXTENSION_NAME[/code] Vulkan extension must be "
"available and enabled for command buffer debug label region to work. See "
"also [method draw_command_end_label]."
msgstr ""
"Creeu una regió d'etiquetes de depuració del buffer d'ordres que es pugui "
"mostrar a eines de tercers com ara [url=https://renderdoc.org/]RenderDoc[/"
"url]. Totes les regions s'han de finalitzar amb una trucada [method "
"draw_command_end_label]. Quan es visualitzen des de la sèrie lineal "
"d'enviaments a una única cua, les trucades a [method "
"draw_command_begin_label] i [method draw_command_end_label] s'han de fer "
"coincidir i equilibrar.\n"
"L'extensió Vulkan [code]VK_EXT_DEBUG_UTILS_EXTENSION_NAME[/code] ha d'estar "
"disponible i habilitada perquè la regió de l'etiqueta de depuració del "
"buffer d'ordres funcioni. Vegeu també [method draw_command_end_label]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Ends the command buffer debug label region started by a [method "
"draw_command_begin_label] call."
msgstr ""
"Finalitza la regió de l'etiqueta de depuració del buffer d'ordres iniciada "
"per una trucada [method draw_command_begin_label]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Inserting labels no longer applies due to command reordering."
msgstr ""
"La inserció d'etiquetes ja no s'aplica a causa de la reordenació d'ordres."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Starts a list of raster drawing commands created with the [code]draw_*[/"
"code] methods. The returned value should be passed to other "
"[code]draw_list_*[/code] functions.\n"
"Multiple draw lists cannot be created at the same time; you must finish the "
"previous draw list first using [method draw_list_end].\n"
"A simple drawing operation might look like this (code is not a complete "
"example):\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rd = RenderingDevice.new()\n"
"var clear_colors = PackedColorArray([Color(0, 0, 0, 0), Color(0, 0, 0, 0), "
"Color(0, 0, 0, 0)])\n"
"var draw_list = rd.draw_list_begin(framebuffers[i], "
"RenderingDevice.CLEAR_COLOR_ALL, clear_colors, true, 1.0f, true, 0, Rect2(), "
"RenderingDevice.OPAQUE_PASS)\n"
"\n"
"# Draw opaque.\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_render_pipeline(draw_list, raster_pipeline)\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_uniform_set(draw_list, raster_base_uniform, 0)\n"
"rd.draw_list_set_push_constant(draw_list, raster_push_constant, "
"raster_push_constant.size())\n"
"rd.draw_list_draw(draw_list, false, 1, slice_triangle_count[i] * 3)\n"
"# Draw wire.\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_render_pipeline(draw_list, raster_pipeline_wire)\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_uniform_set(draw_list, raster_base_uniform, 0)\n"
"rd.draw_list_set_push_constant(draw_list, raster_push_constant, "
"raster_push_constant.size())\n"
"rd.draw_list_draw(draw_list, false, 1, slice_triangle_count[i] * 3)\n"
"\n"
"rd.draw_list_end()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The [param draw_flags] indicates if the texture attachments of the "
"framebuffer should be cleared or ignored. Only one of the two flags can be "
"used for each individual attachment. Ignoring an attachment means that any "
"contents that existed before the draw list will be completely discarded, "
"reducing the memory bandwidth used by the render pass but producing garbage "
"results if the pixels aren't replaced. The default behavior allows the "
"engine to figure out the right operation to use if the texture is "
"discardable, which can result in increased performance. See "
"[RDTextureFormat] or [method texture_set_discardable].\n"
"The [param breadcrumb] parameter can be an arbitrary 32-bit integer that is "
"useful to diagnose GPU crashes. If Godot is built in dev or debug mode; when "
"the GPU crashes Godot will dump all shaders that were being executed at the "
"time of the crash and the breadcrumb is useful to diagnose what passes did "
"those shaders belong to.\n"
"It does not affect rendering behavior and can be set to 0. It is recommended "
"to use [enum BreadcrumbMarker] enumerations for consistency but it's not "
"required. It is also possible to use bitwise operations to add extra data. "
"e.g.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"rd.draw_list_begin(fb[i], RenderingDevice.CLEAR_COLOR_ALL, clear_colors, "
"true, 1.0f, true, 0, Rect2(), RenderingDevice.OPAQUE_PASS | 5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Inicia una llista d'ordres de dibuix ràster creades amb els mètodes "
"[code]draw_*[/code]. El valor retornat s'ha de passar a altres funcions "
"[code]draw_list_*[/code].\n"
"No es poden crear múltiples llistes de sorteig al mateix temps; primer heu "
"d'acabar la llista del sorteig anterior utilitzant [method draw_list_end].\n"
"Una operació de dibuix senzilla podria semblar a aquesta (el codi no és un "
"exemple complet):\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rd = RenderingDevice.new()\n"
"var clear_colors = PackedColorArray([Color(0, 0, 0, 0), Color(0, 0, 0, 0), "
"Color(0, 0, 0, 0)])\n"
"var draw_list = rd.draw_list_begin(framebuffers[i], "
"RenderingDevice.CLEAR_COLOR_ALL, clear_colors, true, 1.0f, true, 0, Rect2(), "
"RenderingDevice.OPAQUE_PASS)\n"
"\n"
"# Dibuixa opac.\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_render_pipeline(draw_list, raster_pipeline)\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_uniform_set(draw_list, raster_base_uniform, 0)\n"
"rd.draw_list_set_push_constant(draw_list, raster_push_constant, "
"raster_push_constant.size())\n"
"rd.draw_list_draw(draw_list, false, 1, slice_triangle_count[i] * 3)\n"
"# Treu filferro.\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_render_pipeline(draw_list, raster_pipeline_wire)\n"
"rd.draw_list_bind_uniform_set(draw_list, raster_base_uniform, 0)\n"
"rd.draw_list_set_push_constant(draw_list, raster_push_constant, "
"raster_push_constant.size())\n"
"rd.draw_list_draw(draw_list, false, 1, slice_triangle_count[i] * 3)\n"
"\n"
"rd.draw_list_end()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"El [param draw_flags] indica si s'han d'esborrar o ignorar els fitxers "
"adjunts de textura del framebuffer. Només es pot utilitzar una de les dues "
"banderes per a cada fitxer adjunt individual. Ignorar un fitxer adjunt "
"significa que qualsevol contingut que existia abans de la llista de dibuix "
"es descartarà completament, reduint l'amplada de banda de memòria utilitzada "
"per la passada de renderització, però produint resultats d'escombraries si "
"no es substitueixen els píxels. El comportament predeterminat permet al "
"motor esbrinar l'operació adequada per utilitzar si la textura es pot "
"descartar, cosa que pot augmentar el rendiment. Vegeu [RDTextureFormat] o "
"[method texture_set_discardable].\n"
"El paràmetre [param breadcrumb] pot ser un nombre enter arbitrari de 32 bits "
"útil per diagnosticar fallades de la GPU. Si Godot està construït en mode de "
"desenvolupament o depuració; quan la GPU es bloqueja, Godot abocarà tots els "
"shaders que s'estaven executant en el moment de la fallada i la ruta de "
"navegació és útil per diagnosticar a quins passos pertanyien aquests "
"shaders.\n"
"No afecta el comportament de representació i es pot establir en 0. Es "
"recomana utilitzar enumeracions [enum BreadcrumbMarker] per a la coherència, "
"però no és necessari. També és possible utilitzar operacions bit a bit per "
"afegir dades addicionals. p. ex.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"rd.draw_list_begin(fb[i], RenderingDevice.CLEAR_COLOR_ALL, clear_colors, "
"true, 1.0f, true, 0, Rect2(), RenderingDevice.OPAQUE_PASS | 5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"High-level variant of [method draw_list_begin], with the parameters "
"automatically being adjusted for drawing onto the window specified by the "
"[param screen] ID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Cannot be used with local RenderingDevices, as these don't have "
"a screen. If called on a local RenderingDevice, [method "
"draw_list_begin_for_screen] returns [constant INVALID_ID]."
msgstr ""
"Variant d'alt nivell de [method draw_list_begin], amb els paràmetres que "
"s'ajusten automàticament per dibuixar a la finestra especificada per l'ID "
"[param screen].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No es pot utilitzar amb RenderingDevices locals, ja que aquests "
"no tenen pantalla. Si es truca a un RenderingDevice local, [method "
"draw_list_begin_for_screen] retorna [constant INVALID_ID]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Split draw lists are used automatically by RenderingDevice."
msgstr ""
"RenderingDevice utilitza automàticament les llistes de dibuix dividits."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"This method does nothing and always returns an empty [PackedInt64Array]."
msgstr "Aquest mètode no fa res i sempre retorna un [PackedInt64Array] buit."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Binds [param index_array] to the specified [param draw_list]."
msgstr "Enllaça [param index_array] amb el [param draw_list] especificat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Binds [param render_pipeline] to the specified [param draw_list]."
msgstr "Enllaça [param render_pipeline] amb el [param draw_list] especificat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Binds [param uniform_set] to the specified [param draw_list]. A [param "
"set_index] must also be specified, which is an identifier starting from "
"[code]0[/code] that must match the one expected by the draw list."
msgstr ""
"Enllaça [param uniform_set] amb el [param draw_list] especificat. També s'ha "
"d'especificar un [param set_index], que és un identificador que comença per "
"[code]0[/code] que ha de coincidir amb l'esperat per la llista de sorteig."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Binds [param vertex_array] to the specified [param draw_list]."
msgstr "Enllaça [param vertex_array] amb el [param draw_list] especificat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Binds a set of [param vertex_buffers] directly to the specified [param "
"draw_list] using [param vertex_format] without creating a vertex array RID. "
"Provide the number of vertices in [param vertex_count]; optional per-buffer "
"byte [param offsets] may also be supplied."
msgstr ""
"Enllaça un conjunt de [param vertex_buffers] directament a [param draw_list] "
"especificat mitjançant [param vertex_format] sense crear un RID de matriu de "
"vèrtex. Proporcioneu el nombre de vèrtexs a [param vertex_count]; També es "
"pot proporcionar un byte opcional per memòria intermèdia [param offsets]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Removes and disables the scissor rectangle for the specified [param "
"draw_list]. See also [method draw_list_enable_scissor]."
msgstr ""
"Elimina i desactiva el rectangle de tisora per al [param draw_list] "
"especificat. Vegeu també [method draw_list_enable_scissor]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Submits [param draw_list] for rendering on the GPU. This is the raster "
"equivalent to [method compute_list_dispatch]."
msgstr ""
"Envia [param draw_list] per a la representació a la GPU. Aquest és el ràster "
"equivalent a [method compute_list_dispatch]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Submits [param draw_list] for rendering on the GPU with the given parameters "
"stored in the [param buffer] at [param offset]. Parameters being integers: "
"vertex count, instance count, first vertex, first instance. And when using "
"indices: index count, instance count, first index, vertex offset, first "
"instance. Buffer must have been created with [constant "
"STORAGE_BUFFER_USAGE_DISPATCH_INDIRECT] flag."
msgstr ""
"Envia [param draw_list] per a la representació a la GPU amb els paràmetres "
"donats emmagatzemats a [param buffer] a [param offset]. Els paràmetres són "
"nombres enters: recompte de vèrtexs, recompte d'instàncies, primer vèrtex, "
"primera instància. I quan s'utilitzen índexs: recompte d'índex, recompte "
"d'instàncies, primer índex, compensació de vèrtex, primera instància. La "
"memòria intermèdia s'ha d'haver creat amb el senyalador [constant "
"STORAGE_BUFFER_USAGE_DISPATCH_INDIRECT]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a scissor rectangle and enables it for the specified [param "
"draw_list]. Scissor rectangles are used for clipping by discarding fragments "
"that fall outside a specified rectangular portion of the screen. See also "
"[method draw_list_disable_scissor].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The specified [param rect] is automatically intersected with "
"the screen's dimensions, which means it cannot exceed the screen's "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Crea un rectangle de tisora i l'habilita per al [param draw_list] "
"especificat. Els rectangles de tisora s'utilitzen per retallar descartant "
"fragments que queden fora d'una part rectangular especificada de la "
"pantalla. Vegeu també [method draw_list_disable_scissor].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El [param rect] especificat es talla automàticament amb les "
"dimensions de la pantalla, el que significa que no pot superar les "
"dimensions de la pantalla."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Finishes a list of raster drawing commands created with the [code]draw_*[/"
"code] methods."
msgstr ""
"Acaba una llista d'ordres de dibuix ràster creades amb els mètodes "
"[code]draw_*[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Sets blend constants for the specified [param draw_list] to [param color]. "
"Blend constants are used only if the graphics pipeline is created with "
"[constant DYNAMIC_STATE_BLEND_CONSTANTS] flag set."
msgstr ""
"Estableix constants de combinació per a [param draw_list] especificat a "
"[param color]. Les constants de combinació només s'utilitzen si la "
"canalització de gràfics es crea amb la marca [constant "
"DYNAMIC_STATE_BLEND_CONSTANTS] establerta."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the push constant data to [param buffer] for the specified [param "
"draw_list]. The shader determines how this binary data is used. The buffer's "
"size in bytes must also be specified in [param size_bytes] (this can be "
"obtained by calling the [method PackedByteArray.size] method on the passed "
"[param buffer])."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les dades de la constant push a [param buffer] per al [param "
"draw_list] especificat. El shader determina com s'utilitzen aquestes dades "
"binàries. La mida del buffer en bytes també s'ha d'especificar a [param "
"size_bytes] (això es pot obtenir trucant al mètode [method "
"PackedByteArray.size] al [param buffer] passat)."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Switches to the next draw pass."
msgstr "Canvia a la següent passada del sorteig."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new framebuffer. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when any of the [param textures] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou framebuffer. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"S'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi qualsevol dels [param textures]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new empty framebuffer. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou framebuffer buit. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new multipass framebuffer. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when any of the [param textures] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou framebuffer multipass. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es "
"retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"S'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi qualsevol dels [param textures]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new framebuffer format with the specified [param attachments] and "
"[param view_count]. Returns the new framebuffer's unique framebuffer format "
"ID.\n"
"If [param view_count] is greater than or equal to [code]2[/code], enables "
"multiview which is used for VR rendering. This requires support for the "
"Vulkan multiview extension."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou format de framebuffer amb [param attachments] i [param "
"view_count] especificats. Retorna l'ID únic de format de framebuffer del nou "
"framebuffer.\n"
"Si [param view_count] és superior o igual a [code]2[/code], habilita la "
"visualització múltiple que s'utilitza per a la representació de realitat "
"virtual. Això requereix suport per a l'extensió multivista Vulkan."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new empty framebuffer format with the specified number of [param "
"samples] and returns its ID."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou format de framebuffer buit amb el número especificat de [param "
"samples] i retorna el seu ID."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a multipass framebuffer format with the specified [param "
"attachments], [param passes] and [param view_count] and returns its ID. If "
"[param view_count] is greater than or equal to [code]2[/code], enables "
"multiview which is used for VR rendering. This requires support for the "
"Vulkan multiview extension."
msgstr ""
"Crea un format de framebuffer multipass amb els [param attachments] "
"especificats, [param passes] i [param view_count] i retorna el seu ID. Si "
"[param view_count] és superior o igual a [code]2[/code], habilita la "
"visualització múltiple que s'utilitza per a la representació de realitat "
"virtual. Això requereix suport per a l'extensió multivista Vulkan."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of texture samples used for the given framebuffer [param "
"format] ID (returned by [method framebuffer_get_format])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de mostres de textura utilitzades per al framebuffer donat "
"[param format] ID (retornat per [method framebuffer_get_format])."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the format ID of the framebuffer specified by the [param "
"framebuffer] RID. This ID is guaranteed to be unique for the same formats "
"and does not need to be freed."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'ID de format del framebuffer especificat pel RID [param "
"framebuffer]. Es garanteix que aquest identificador és únic per als mateixos "
"formats i no cal alliberar-lo."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the framebuffer specified by the [param "
"framebuffer] RID is valid, [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el framebuffer especificat pel [param "
"framebuffer] RID és vàlid, [code]false[/code] en cas contrari."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Tries to free an object in the RenderingDevice. To avoid memory leaks, this "
"should be called after using an object as memory management does not occur "
"automatically when using RenderingDevice directly."
msgstr ""
"Intenta alliberar un objecte al RenderingDevice. Per evitar fuites de "
"memòria, s'hauria de cridar després d'utilitzar un objecte, ja que la gestió "
"de la memòria no es produeix automàticament quan s'utilitza directament "
"RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the timestamp in CPU time for the rendering step specified by [param "
"index] (in microseconds since the engine started). See also [method "
"get_captured_timestamp_gpu_time] and [method capture_timestamp]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la marca de temps en temps de CPU per al pas de renderització "
"especificat per [param index] (en microsegons des que el motor s'ha "
"iniciat). Vegeu també [method get_captured_timestamp_gpu_time] i [method "
"capture_timestamp]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the timestamp in GPU time for the rendering step specified by [param "
"index] (in microseconds since the engine started). See also [method "
"get_captured_timestamp_cpu_time] and [method capture_timestamp]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la marca de temps en temps de GPU per al pas de renderització "
"especificat per [param index] (en microsegons des que el motor s'ha "
"iniciat). Vegeu també [method get_captured_timestamp_cpu_time] i [method "
"capture_timestamp]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the timestamp's name for the rendering step specified by [param "
"index]. See also [method capture_timestamp]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom de la marca de temps per al pas de representació especificat "
"per [param index]. Vegeu també [method capture_timestamp]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total number of timestamps (rendering steps) available for "
"profiling."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre total de marques de temps (passos de representació) "
"disponibles per al perfil."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the last frame rendered that has rendering timestamps "
"available for querying."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de l'últim fotograma representat que té marques de temps de "
"representació disponibles per a la consulta."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns how many allocations the GPU has performed for internal driver "
"structures.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Retorna quantes assignacions ha realitzat la GPU per a estructures de "
"controladors internes.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [method get_device_allocation_count] but filtered for a given object "
"type.\n"
"The type argument must be in range [code][0; get_tracked_object_type_count - "
"1][/code]. If [method get_tracked_object_type_count] is 0, then type "
"argument is ignored and always returns 0.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Igual que [method get_device_allocation_count] però filtrat per a un tipus "
"d'objecte determinat.\n"
"L'argument del tipus ha d'estar dins l'interval [code][0; "
"get_tracked_object_type_count - 1][/code]. Si [method "
"get_tracked_object_type_count] és 0, l'argument tipus s'ignora i sempre "
"retorna 0.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [method get_device_total_memory] but filtered for a given object "
"type.\n"
"The type argument must be in range [code][0; get_tracked_object_type_count - "
"1][/code]. If [method get_tracked_object_type_count] is 0, then type "
"argument is ignored and always returns 0.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Igual que [method get_device_total_memory] però filtrat per a un tipus "
"d'objecte determinat.\n"
"L'argument del tipus ha d'estar dins l'interval [code][0; "
"get_tracked_object_type_count - 1][/code]. Si [method "
"get_tracked_object_type_count] és 0, l'argument tipus s'ignora i sempre "
"retorna 0.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the video adapter (e.g. \"GeForce GTX 1080/PCIe/SSE2\"). "
"Equivalent to [method RenderingServer.get_video_adapter_name]. See also "
"[method get_device_vendor_name]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom de l'adaptador de vídeo (p. ex., \"GeForce GTX 1080/PCIe/"
"SSE2\"). Equivalent a [method RenderingServer.get_video_adapter_name]. Vegeu "
"també [method get_device_vendor_name]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the universally unique identifier for the pipeline cache. This is "
"used to cache shader files on disk, which avoids shader recompilations on "
"subsequent engine runs. This UUID varies depending on the graphics card "
"model, but also the driver version. Therefore, updating graphics drivers "
"will invalidate the shader cache."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'identificador únic universal per a la memòria cau de la "
"canalització. S'utilitza per emmagatzemar a la memòria cau els fitxers "
"shader al disc, la qual cosa evita recompilacions de shader en execucions "
"posteriors del motor. Aquest UUID varia en funció del model de targeta "
"gràfica, però també de la versió del controlador. Per tant, l'actualització "
"dels controladors de gràfics invalidarà la memòria cau del shader."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns how much bytes the GPU is using.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Retorna quants bytes està utilitzant la GPU.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the vendor of the video adapter (e.g. \"NVIDIA Corporation\"). "
"Equivalent to [method RenderingServer.get_video_adapter_vendor]. See also "
"[method get_device_name]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el proveïdor de l'adaptador de vídeo (p. ex., \"NVIDIA "
"Corporation\"). Equivalent a [method "
"RenderingServer.get_video_adapter_vendor]. Vegeu també [method "
"get_device_name]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns how many allocations the GPU driver has performed for internal "
"driver structures.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Retorna quantes assignacions ha realitzat el controlador GPU per a les "
"estructures internes del controlador.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [method get_driver_allocation_count] but filtered for a given object "
"type.\n"
"The type argument must be in range [code][0; get_tracked_object_type_count - "
"1][/code]. If [method get_tracked_object_type_count] is 0, then type "
"argument is ignored and always returns 0.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Igual que [method get_driver_allocation_count] però filtrat per a un tipus "
"d'objecte determinat.\n"
"L'argument del tipus ha d'estar dins l'interval [code][0; "
"get_tracked_object_type_count - 1][/code]. Si [method "
"get_tracked_object_type_count] és 0, l'argument tipus s'ignora i sempre "
"retorna 0.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns string report in CSV format using the following methods:\n"
"- [method get_tracked_object_name]\n"
"- [method get_tracked_object_type_count]\n"
"- [method get_driver_total_memory]\n"
"- [method get_driver_allocation_count]\n"
"- [method get_driver_memory_by_object_type]\n"
"- [method get_driver_allocs_by_object_type]\n"
"- [method get_device_total_memory]\n"
"- [method get_device_allocation_count]\n"
"- [method get_device_memory_by_object_type]\n"
"- [method get_device_allocs_by_object_type]\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds. Godot must also be started with "
"the [code]--extra-gpu-memory-tracking[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un informe de cadena en format CSV mitjançant els mètodes següents:\n"
"- [method get_tracked_object_name]\n"
"- [method get_tracked_object_type_count]\n"
"- [method get_driver_total_memory]\n"
"- [method get_driver_allocation_count]\n"
"- [method get_driver_memory_by_object_type]\n"
"- [method get_driver_allocs_by_object_type]\n"
"- [method get_device_total_memory]\n"
"- [method get_device_allocation_count]\n"
"- [method get_device_memory_by_object_type]\n"
"- [method get_device_allocs_by_object_type]\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració. Godot també s'ha "
"d'iniciar amb l'argument de línia d'ordres [code]--extra-gpu-memory-"
"tracking[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html][/"
"url]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [method get_driver_total_memory] but filtered for a given object "
"type.\n"
"The type argument must be in range [code][0; get_tracked_object_type_count - "
"1][/code]. If [method get_tracked_object_type_count] is 0, then type "
"argument is ignored and always returns 0.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Igual que [method get_driver_total_memory] però filtrat per a un tipus "
"d'objecte determinat.\n"
"L'argument del tipus ha d'estar dins l'interval [code][0; "
"get_tracked_object_type_count - 1][/code]. Si [method "
"get_tracked_object_type_count] és 0, l'argument tipus s'ignora i sempre "
"retorna 0.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the unique identifier of the driver [param resource] for the "
"specified [param rid]. Some driver resource types ignore the specified "
"[param rid]. [param index] is always ignored but must be specified anyway."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'identificador únic del controlador [param resource] per al [param "
"rid] especificat. Alguns tipus de recursos del controlador ignoren el [param "
"rid] especificat. [param index] sempre s'ignora, però s'ha d'especificar de "
"totes maneres."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns how much bytes the GPU driver is using for internal driver "
"structures.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds and can return 0 when this "
"information is not tracked or unknown."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la quantitat de bytes que utilitza el controlador de la GPU per a "
"les estructures internes del controlador.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza a les compilacions de depuració i pot tornar 0 quan "
"aquesta informació no es fa un seguiment o es desconeix."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the frame count kept by the graphics API. Higher values result in "
"higher input lag, but with more consistent throughput. For the main "
"[RenderingDevice], frames are cycled (usually 3 with triple-buffered V-Sync "
"enabled). However, local [RenderingDevice]s only have 1 frame."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el recompte de fotogrames conservat per l'API de gràfics. Els valors "
"més alts donen lloc a un retard d'entrada més elevat, però amb un rendiment "
"més consistent. Per al [RenderingDevice] principal, els fotogrames es ciclen "
"(normalment 3 amb V-Sync de triple memòria intermèdia habilitat). Tanmateix, "
"els [RenderingDevice]s locals només tenen 1 fotograma."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the memory usage in bytes corresponding to the given [param type]. "
"When using Vulkan, these statistics are calculated by [url=https://"
"github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/VulkanMemoryAllocator]Vulkan Memory "
"Allocator[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'ús de memòria en bytes corresponents al [param type] donat. Quan "
"s'utilitza Vulkan, aquestes estadístiques les calculen [url=https://"
"github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/VulkanMemoryAllocator]Vulkan Memory "
"Allocator[/url]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a string with a performance report from the past frame. Updates "
"every frame."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una cadena amb un informe de rendiment del fotograma anterior. "
"Actualitza cada fotograma."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the type of object for the given [param type_index]. "
"This value must be in range [code][0; get_tracked_object_type_count - 1][/"
"code]. If [method get_tracked_object_type_count] is 0, then type argument is "
"ignored and always returns the same string.\n"
"The return value is important because it gives meaning to the types passed "
"to [method get_driver_memory_by_object_type], [method "
"get_driver_allocs_by_object_type], [method "
"get_device_memory_by_object_type], and [method "
"get_device_allocs_by_object_type]. Examples of strings it can return (not "
"exhaustive):\n"
"- DEVICE_MEMORY\n"
"- PIPELINE_CACHE\n"
"- SWAPCHAIN_KHR\n"
"- COMMAND_POOL\n"
"Thus if e.g. [code]get_tracked_object_name(5)[/code] returns "
"\"COMMAND_POOL\", then [code]get_device_memory_by_object_type(5)[/code] "
"returns the bytes used by the GPU for command pools.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds. Godot must also be started with "
"the [code]--extra-gpu-memory-tracking[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom del tipus d'objecte per al [param type_index] donat. Aquest "
"valor ha d'estar dins l'interval [code][0; get_tracked_object_type_count - 1]"
"[/code]. Si [method get_tracked_object_type_count] és 0, l'argument tipus "
"s'ignora i sempre retorna la mateixa cadena.\n"
"El valor de retorn és important perquè dóna significat als tipus passats a "
"[method get_driver_memory_by_object_type], [method "
"get_driver_allocs_by_object_type], [method get_device_memory_by_object_type] "
"i [method get_device_allocs_by_object_type]. Exemples de cadenes que pot "
"retornar (no exhaustius):\n"
"- DEVICE_MEMORY\n"
"- PIPELINE_CACHE\n"
"- SWAPCHAIN_KHR\n"
"- COMMAND_POOL\n"
"Així, si per ex. [code]get_tracked_object_name(5)[/code] retorna "
"\"COMMAND_POOL\", aleshores [code]get_device_memory_by_object_type(5)[/code] "
"retorna l'ordre GPU per a l'agrupació de bytes utilitzats.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza en les compilacions de depuració. Godot també s'ha "
"d'iniciar amb l'argument de línia d'ordres [code]--extra-gpu-memory-"
"tracking[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html][/"
"url]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns how many types of trackable objects there are.\n"
"This is only used by Vulkan in debug builds. Godot must also be started with "
"the [code]--extra-gpu-memory-tracking[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna quants tipus d'objectes rastrejables hi ha.\n"
"Vulkan només l'utilitza en les compilacions de depuració. Godot també s'ha "
"d'iniciar amb l'argument de la línia d'ordres [code]--extra-gpu-memory-"
"tracking[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html][/"
"url]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param feature] is supported by the GPU."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new hit shader binding table (SBT). It can be accessed with the "
"RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when the [param raytracing_pipeline] is "
"freed.\n"
"The hit SBT resizes itself as needed. [param initial_hit_group_capacity] is "
"used to allocate the initial backing memory."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova taula d'enllaç d'ombres d'èxit (SBT). S'hi pot accedir amb el "
"RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"S'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi [param raytracing_pipeline].\n"
"L'èxit SBT es redimensiona segons sigui necessari. [param "
"initial_hit_group_capacity] s'utilitza per assignar la memòria de suport "
"inicial."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Allocates a contiguous range of SBT entries from [param hit_sbt].\n"
"The returned value should be assigned to [member "
"RDAccelerationStructureInstance.hit_sbt_range].\n"
"During ray traversal, hit group index is computed as:\n"
"\t(geometry index in [member RDAccelerationStructureInstance.blas])\n"
"\t× (SBT stride used in [code]traceRayEXT[/code])\n"
"\t+ (SBT offset used in [code]traceRayEXT[/code])\n"
"\t+ (range offset)\n"
"[param hit_group_count] must be large enough to cover all SBT entries that "
"may be indexed by this equation. This typically corresponds to:\n"
"\t(geometry count in [member RDAccelerationStructureInstance.blas])\n"
"\t× (SBT stride used in [code]traceRayEXT[/code])\n"
"The allocated range is uninitialized and must be filled using [method "
"hit_sbt_range_update]."
msgstr ""
"Assigna un rang contigu d'entrades SBT des de [param hit_sbt].\n"
"El valor retornat s'ha d'assignar a [member "
"RDAccelerationStructureInstance.hit_sbt_range].\n"
"Durant la travessa de raigs, l'índex del grup de cops es calcula com:\n"
"\t(índex de geometria a [member RDAccelerationStructureInstance.blas])\n"
"\t× (SBT stride utilitzat a [code]traceRayEXT[/code])\n"
"\t+ (Desplaçament SBT utilitzat a [code]traceRayEXT[/code])\n"
"\t+ (desplaçament d'interval)\n"
"[param hit_group_count] ha de ser prou gran per cobrir totes les entrades "
"SBT que es puguin indexar mitjançant aquesta equació. Això normalment "
"correspon a:\n"
"\t(recompte de geometria a [member RDAccelerationStructureInstance.blas])\n"
"\t× (SBT stride utilitzat a [code]traceRayEXT[/code])\n"
"L'interval assignat no està inicialitzat i s'ha d'omplir amb [method "
"hit_sbt_range_update]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Frees a hit SBT range previously allocated with [method "
"hit_sbt_range_alloc].\n"
"The range must not be in use by any acceleration structure after being freed."
msgstr ""
"Allibera un rang SBT d'èxit assignat prèviament amb [method "
"hit_sbt_range_alloc].\n"
"El rang no ha de ser utilitzat per cap estructura d'acceleració després de "
"ser alliberat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the contents of a hit SBT range.\n"
"[param hit_group_indices] specifies indices into the hit group array "
"provided in [method raytracing_pipeline_create].\n"
"The [param offset] parameter specifies where within the allocated range the "
"writing begins. This allows partial updates of a range. However, the "
"complete range must be fully initialized before it is used in a raytracing "
"dispatch."
msgstr ""
"Actualitza el contingut d'un rang SBT d'èxit.\n"
"[param hit_group_indices] especifica índexs a la matriu de grups de visites "
"proporcionada a [method raytracing_pipeline_create].\n"
"El paràmetre [param offset] especifica on dins de l'interval assignat "
"comença l'escriptura. Això permet actualitzacions parcials d'un rang. "
"Tanmateix, el rang complet s'ha d'inicialitzar completament abans "
"d'utilitzar-lo en un enviament de traçat de raigs."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a new [param raytracing_pipeline] for [param hit_sbt].\n"
"The new pipeline must be a superset of the previous one. Existing hit groups "
"must keep the same order and new hit groups should be appended to the end. "
"This preserves existing SBT entries.\n"
"The previous pipeline must remain valid during the call."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un nou [param raytracing_pipeline] per a [param hit_sbt].\n"
"La nova canonada ha de ser un superconjunt de l'anterior. Els grups de "
"visites existents han de mantenir el mateix ordre i els nous grups de "
"visites s'han d'afegir al final. Això conserva les entrades SBT existents.\n"
"El pipeline anterior ha de romandre vàlid durant la convocatòria."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new index array. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when the [param index_buffer] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova matriu d'índexs. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"S'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi [param index_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new index buffer. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou buffer d'índex. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the specified [param limit]. This limit varies "
"depending on the current graphics hardware (and sometimes the driver "
"version). If the given limit is exceeded, rendering errors will occur.\n"
"Limits for various graphics hardware can be found in the [url=https://"
"vulkan.gpuinfo.org/]Vulkan Hardware Database[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor del [param limit] especificat. Aquest límit varia en funció "
"del maquinari gràfic actual (i de vegades de la versió del controlador). Si "
"se supera el límit donat, es produiran errors de representació.\n"
"Els límits per a diversos maquinari gràfics es poden trobar a la "
"[url=https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/]Vulkan Hardware Database[/url]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Starts a list of raytracing commands. The returned value should be passed to "
"other [code]raytracing_list_*[/code] functions.\n"
"Multiple raytracing lists cannot be created at the same time; you must "
"finish the previous raytracing list first using [method "
"raytracing_list_end].\n"
"A simple raytracing operation might look like this (code is not a complete "
"example):\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rd = RenderingDevice.new()\n"
"assert(rd.has_feature(RenderingDevice.SUPPORTS_RAYTRACING_PIPELINE))\n"
"\n"
"# Create a BLAS for a mesh.\n"
"var geometry = RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.new()\n"
"geometry.flags = RenderingDevice.ACCELERATION_STRUCTURE_GEOMETRY_OPAQUE_BIT\n"
"geometry.vertex_buffer = vertex_buffer\n"
"geometry.vertex_stride = 12\n"
"geometry.vertex_format = RenderingDevice.DATA_FORMAT_R32G32B32_SFLOAT\n"
"geometry.vertex_count = 3\n"
"geometry.index_buffer = index_buffer\n"
"geometry.index_count = 3\n"
"geometries.push_back(geometry)\n"
"\n"
"blas = rd.blas_create([geometry], 0)\n"
"\n"
"# Create TLAS.\n"
"tlas = rd.tlas_create(1, 0)\n"
"\n"
"# Build acceleration structures.\n"
"rd.blas_build(blas)\n"
"\n"
"var instance = RDAccelerationStructureInstance.new()\n"
"instance.blas = blas\n"
"\n"
"instance.hit_sbt_range = rd.hit_sbt_range_alloc(hit_sbt, 1)\n"
"rd.hit_sbt_range_update(hit_sbt, instance.hit_sbt_range, 0, [0])\n"
"\n"
"rd.tlas_build(tlas, [instance])\n"
"\n"
"var raylist = rd.raytracing_list_begin()\n"
"\n"
"# Bind pipeline and uniforms.\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_bind_raytracing_pipeline(raylist, raytracing_pipeline)\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_bind_uniform_set(raylist, uniform_set, 0)\n"
"\n"
"# Trace rays.\n"
"var width = get_viewport().size.x\n"
"var height = get_viewport().size.y\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_trace_rays(raylist, 0, hit_sbt, width, height, 1)\n"
"\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_end()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Inicia una llista d'ordres de traçat de raigs. El valor retornat s'ha de "
"passar a altres funcions [code]raytracing_list_*[/code].\n"
"No es poden crear múltiples llistes de traçat de raigs al mateix temps; "
"primer heu d'acabar la llista de traçat de raigs anterior utilitzant [method "
"raytracing_list_end].\n"
"Una simple operació de traçat de raigs podria semblar així (el codi no és un "
"exemple complet):\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rd = RenderingDevice.new()\n"
"assert(rd.has_feature(RenderingDevice.SUPPORTS_RAYTRACING_PIPELINE))\n"
"\n"
"# Creeu un BLAS per a una malla.\n"
"var geometry = RDAccelerationStructureGeometry.new()\n"
"geometry.flags = RenderingDevice.ACCELERATION_STRUCTURE_GEOMETRY_OPAQUE_BIT\n"
"geometry.vertex_buffer = vertex_buffer\n"
"geometry.vertix_stride = 12\n"
"geometry.vertex_format = RenderingDevice.DATA_FORMAT_R32G32B32_SFLOAT\n"
"geometry.vertex_count = 3\n"
"geometry.index_buffer = index_buffer\n"
"geometry.index_count = 3\n"
"geometries.push_back(geometria)\n"
"\n"
"blas = rd.blas_create([geometry], 0)\n"
"\n"
"# Crea TLAS.\n"
"tlas = rd.tlas_create(1, 0)\n"
"\n"
"# Construir estructures d'acceleració.\n"
"rd.blas_build(blas)\n"
"\n"
"var instance = RDAccelerationStructureInstance.new()\n"
"instance.blas = blas\n"
"\n"
"instance.hit_sbt_range = rd.hit_sbt_range_alloc(hit_sbt, 1)\n"
"rd.hit_sbt_range_update(hit_sbt, instance.hit_sbt_range, 0, [0])\n"
"\n"
"rd.tlas_build(tlas, [instance])\n"
"\n"
"var raylist = rd.raytracing_list_begin()\n"
"\n"
"# Lligar canonades i uniformes.\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_bind_raytracing_pipeline(raylist, raytracing_pipeline)\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_bind_uniform_set(raylist, uniform_set, 0)\n"
"\n"
"# Raigs de traça.\n"
"var amplada = get_viewport().size.x\n"
"var alçada = get_viewport().size.y\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_trace_rays(raylist, 0, hit_sbt, amplada, alçada, 1)\n"
"\n"
"rd.raytracing_list_end()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Binds [param raytracing_pipeline] to the specified [param raytracing_list]."
msgstr ""
"Enllaça [param raytracing_pipeline] amb el [param raytracing_list] "
"especificat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Binds the [param uniform_set] to this [param raytracing_list]."
msgstr "Vincula el [param uniform_set] a aquesta [param raytracing_list]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Finishes a list of raytracing commands created with the [code]raytracing_*[/"
"code] methods."
msgstr ""
"Acaba una llista d'ordres de traçat de raigs creades amb els mètodes "
"[code]raytracing_*[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the push constant data to [param buffer] for the specified [param "
"raytracing_list]. The shader determines how this binary data is used. The "
"buffer's size in bytes must also be specified in [param size_bytes] (this "
"can be obtained by calling the [method PackedByteArray.size] method on the "
"passed [param buffer])."
msgstr ""
"Estableix les dades de la constant push a [param buffer] per al [param "
"raytracing_list] especificat. El shader determina com s'utilitzen aquestes "
"dades binàries. La mida del buffer en bytes també s'ha d'especificar a "
"[param size_bytes] (això es pot obtenir trucant al mètode [method "
"PackedByteArray.size] al [param buffer] passat)."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes a raytracing dispatch for [param raytracing_list], launching "
"[param width] × [param height] × [param depth] rays.\n"
"[param raygen_shader_index] selects the ray generation shader from the "
"pipeline bound with [method raytracing_list_bind_raytracing_pipeline].\n"
"[param hit_sbt] must use the same pipeline bound to [param raytracing_list]."
msgstr ""
"Inicialitza un enviament de traçat de raigs per a [param raytracing_list], "
"llançant [param width] × [param height] × [param depth].\n"
"[param raygen_shader_index] selecciona el shader de generació de raigs de la "
"canalització vinculada amb [method "
"raytracing_list_bind_raytracing_pipeline].\n"
"[param hit_sbt] ha d'utilitzar la mateixa canalització vinculada a [param "
"raytracing_list]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new raytracing pipeline. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"Each shader must provide the required stage. All stages must use compatible "
"pipeline layouts. The pipeline selects the required stage from each shader.\n"
"Input order defines stable indices used by the API:\n"
"- [param raygen_shaders] is indexed in [method raytracing_list_trace_rays].\n"
"- [param miss_shaders] is indexed in [code]traceRayEXT[/code].\n"
"- [param hit_groups] is indexed in [method hit_sbt_range_update]."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou canal de traçat de raigs. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es "
"retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"Cada shader ha de proporcionar l'etapa requerida. Totes les etapes han "
"d'utilitzar dissenys de canonades compatibles. El pipeline selecciona "
"l'etapa requerida de cada shader.\n"
"L'ordre d'entrada defineix índexs estables utilitzats per l'API:\n"
"- [param raygen_shaders] està indexat a [method "
"raytracing_list_trace_rays].\n"
"- [param miss_shaders] està indexat a [code]traceRayEXT[/code].\n"
"- [param hit_groups] està indexat a [method hit_sbt_range_update]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the raytracing pipeline specified by the [param "
"raytracing_pipeline] RID is valid, [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new render pipeline. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when the [param shader] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea una canalització de renderització nova. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que "
"es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"S'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi [param shader]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the render pipeline specified by the [param "
"render_pipeline] RID is valid, [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la canalització de renderització especificada "
"pel [param render_pipeline] RID és vàlida, [code]false[/code] en cas "
"contrari."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new sampler. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea una mostra nova. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if implementation supports using a texture of "
"[param format] with the given [param sampler_filter]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the framebuffer format of the given screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only the main [RenderingDevice] returned by [method "
"RenderingServer.get_rendering_device] has a format. If called on a local "
"[RenderingDevice], this method prints an error and returns [constant "
"INVALID_ID]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el format de framebuffer de la pantalla donada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només el [RenderingDevice] principal retornat per [method "
"RenderingServer.get_rendering_device] té un format. Si es crida a un "
"[RenderingDevice] local, aquest mètode imprimeix un error i retorna "
"[constant INVALID_ID]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the window height matching the graphics API context for the given "
"window ID (in pixels). Despite the parameter being named [param screen], "
"this returns the [i]window[/i] size. See also [method screen_get_width].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only the main [RenderingDevice] returned by [method "
"RenderingServer.get_rendering_device] has a height. If called on a local "
"[RenderingDevice], this method prints an error and returns [constant "
"INVALID_ID]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'alçada de la finestra que coincideix amb el context de l'API de "
"gràfics per a l'ID de finestra donat (en píxels). Tot i que el paràmetre "
"s'anomena [param screen], això retorna la mida [i]window[/i]. Vegeu també "
"[method screen_get_width].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només el [RenderingDevice] principal retornat per [method "
"RenderingServer.get_rendering_device] té una alçada. Si es crida a un "
"[RenderingDevice] local, aquest mètode imprimeix un error i retorna "
"[constant INVALID_ID]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the window width matching the graphics API context for the given "
"window ID (in pixels). Despite the parameter being named [param screen], "
"this returns the [i]window[/i] size. See also [method screen_get_height].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only the main [RenderingDevice] returned by [method "
"RenderingServer.get_rendering_device] has a width. If called on a local "
"[RenderingDevice], this method prints an error and returns [constant "
"INVALID_ID]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'amplada de la finestra que coincideix amb el context de l'API de "
"gràfics per a l'ID de finestra donat (en píxels). Tot i que el paràmetre "
"s'anomena [param screen], això retorna la mida [i]window[/i]. Vegeu també "
"[method screen_get_height].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només el [RenderingDevice] principal retornat per [method "
"RenderingServer.get_rendering_device] té una amplada. Si es crida a un "
"[RenderingDevice] local, aquest mètode imprimeix un error i retorna "
"[constant INVALID_ID]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the resource name for [param id] to [param name]. This is used for "
"debugging with third-party tools such as [url=https://"
"renderdoc.org/]RenderDoc[/url].\n"
"The following types of resources can be named: texture, sampler, vertex "
"buffer, index buffer, uniform buffer, texture buffer, storage buffer, "
"uniform set buffer, shader, render pipeline and compute pipeline. "
"Framebuffers cannot be named. Attempting to name an incompatible resource "
"type will print an error.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Resource names are only set when the engine runs in verbose "
"mode ([method OS.is_stdout_verbose] = [code]true[/code]), or when using an "
"engine build compiled with the [code]dev_mode=yes[/code] SCons option. The "
"graphics driver must also support the "
"[code]VK_EXT_DEBUG_UTILS_EXTENSION_NAME[/code] Vulkan extension for named "
"resources to work."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nom del recurs per a [param id] a [param name]. S'utilitza per "
"a la depuració amb eines de tercers com ara [url=https://"
"renderdoc.org/]RenderDoc[/url].\n"
"Es poden anomenar els següents tipus de recursos: textura, mostrador, "
"memòria intermèdia de vèrtex, memòria intermèdia d'índex, memòria intermèdia "
"uniforme, memòria intermèdia de textura, memòria intermèdia "
"d'emmagatzematge, memòria intermèdia uniforme, shader, canalització de "
"renderització i canalització de càlcul. Els framebuffers no es poden "
"anomenar. Si intenteu anomenar un tipus de recurs incompatible, s'imprimirà "
"un error.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els noms de recursos només s'estableixen quan el motor "
"s'executa en mode detallat ([method OS.is_stdout_verbose] = [code]true[/"
"code]), o quan s'utilitza una compilació de motor compilada amb el "
"[code]dev_mode=yes[/code] Opció SCons. El controlador de gràfics també ha de "
"ser compatible amb l'extensió Vulkan "
"[code]VK_EXT_DEBUG_UTILS_EXTENSION_NAME[/code] perquè funcionin els recursos "
"amb nom."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Compiles a binary shader from [param spirv_data] and returns the compiled "
"binary data as a [PackedByteArray]. This compiled shader is specific to the "
"GPU model and driver version used; it will not work on different GPU models "
"or even different driver versions. See also [method "
"shader_compile_spirv_from_source].\n"
"[param name] is an optional human-readable name that can be given to the "
"compiled shader for organizational purposes."
msgstr ""
"Compila un shader binari de [param spirv_data] i retorna les dades binàries "
"compilades com a [PackedByteArray]. Aquest shader compilat és específic per "
"al model de GPU i la versió del controlador utilitzats; no funcionarà en "
"diferents models de GPU o fins i tot en diferents versions de controladors. "
"Vegeu també [method shader_compile_spirv_from_source].\n"
"[param name] és un nom opcional llegible per l'home que es pot donar a "
"l'ombrejat compilat amb finalitats organitzatives."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Compiles a SPIR-V from the shader source code in [param shader_source] and "
"returns the SPIR-V as an [RDShaderSPIRV]. This intermediate language shader "
"is portable across different GPU models and driver versions, but cannot be "
"run directly by GPUs until compiled into a binary shader using [method "
"shader_compile_binary_from_spirv].\n"
"If [param allow_cache] is [code]true[/code], make use of the shader cache "
"generated by Godot. This avoids a potentially lengthy shader compilation "
"step if the shader is already in cache. If [param allow_cache] is "
"[code]false[/code], Godot's shader cache is ignored and the shader will "
"always be recompiled."
msgstr ""
"Compila un SPIR-V a partir del codi font del shader a [param shader_source] "
"i torna el SPIR-V com a [RDShaderSPIRV]. Aquest shader de llenguatge "
"intermedi és portàtil en diferents models de GPU i versions de controladors, "
"però no es pot executar directament per les GPU fins que no es compila en un "
"shader binari mitjançant [method shader_compile_binary_from_spirv].\n"
"Si [param allow_cache] és [code]true[/code], feu ús de la memòria cau de "
"shader generada per Godot. D'aquesta manera s'evita un pas de compilació de "
"shader potencialment llarg si el shader ja està a la memòria cau. Si [param "
"allow_cache] és [code]false[/code], la memòria cau del shader de Godot "
"s'ignora i el shader sempre es recompilarà."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new shader instance from a binary compiled shader. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method. See also [method "
"shader_compile_binary_from_spirv] and [method shader_create_from_spirv]."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància de shader a partir d'un shader compilat binari. S'hi "
"pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice. Vegeu també [method "
"shader_compile_binary_from_spirv] i [method shader_create_from_spirv]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new shader instance from SPIR-V intermediate code. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method. See also [method "
"shader_compile_spirv_from_source] and [method shader_create_from_bytecode]."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova instància de shader a partir del codi intermedi SPIR-V. S'hi "
"pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice. Vegeu també [method "
"shader_compile_spirv_from_source] i [method shader_create_from_bytecode]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Create a placeholder RID by allocating an RID without initializing it for "
"use in [method shader_create_from_bytecode]. This allows you to create an "
"RID for a shader and pass it around, but defer compiling the shader to a "
"later time."
msgstr ""
"Creeu un RID de marcador de posició assignant un RID sense inicialitzar-lo "
"per utilitzar-lo a [method shader_create_from_bytecode]. Això us permet "
"crear un RID per a un shader i passar-lo, però ajornar la compilació del "
"shader per a un moment posterior."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the internal vertex input mask. Internally, the vertex input mask is "
"an unsigned integer consisting of the locations (specified in GLSL via. "
"[code]layout(location = ...)[/code]) of the input variables (specified in "
"GLSL by the [code]in[/code] keyword)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a [url=https://vkguide.dev/docs/chapter-4/storage_buffers/]storage "
"buffer[/url] with the specified [param data] and [param usage]. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea una memòria intermèdia [url=https://vkguide.dev/docs/chapter-4/"
"storage_buffers/][/url] amb [param data] i [param usage] especificats. S'hi "
"pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Pushes the frame setup and draw command buffers then marks the local device "
"as currently processing (which allows calling [method sync]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in local RenderingDevices."
msgstr ""
"Empènyer la configuració del marc i dibuixar memòries intermèdies d'ordres, "
"a continuació, marca el dispositiu local com a processant actualment (la "
"qual cosa permet trucar a [method sync]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només disponible als dispositius de representació locals."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Forces a synchronization between the CPU and GPU, which may be required in "
"certain cases. Only call this when needed, as CPU-GPU synchronization has a "
"performance cost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in local RenderingDevices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method sync] can only be called after a [method submit]."
msgstr ""
"Força una sincronització entre la CPU i la GPU, que pot ser necessària en "
"determinats casos. Truqueu-ho només quan sigui necessari, ja que la "
"sincronització CPU-GPU té un cost de rendiment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només disponible als dispositius de representació locals.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method sync] només es pot trucar després d'un [method submit]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new texture buffer. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou buffer de textura. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the specified [param texture] by replacing all of its pixels with the "
"specified [param color]. [param base_mipmap] and [param mipmap_count] "
"determine which mipmaps of the texture are affected by this clear operation, "
"while [param base_layer] and [param layer_count] determine which layers of a "
"3D texture (or texture array) are affected by this clear operation. For 2D "
"textures (which only have one layer by design), [param base_layer] must be "
"[code]0[/code] and [param layer_count] must be [code]1[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param texture] can't be cleared while a draw list that uses it "
"as part of a framebuffer is being created. Ensure the draw list is finalized "
"(and that the color/depth texture using it is not set to [constant "
"FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) to clear this texture."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Copies the [param from_texture] to [param to_texture] with the specified "
"[param from_pos], [param to_pos] and [param size] coordinates. For 2-"
"dimensional textures, [param from_pos] and [param to_pos] must have a Z axis "
"of [code]0[/code], and [param size] must have a Z axis of [code]1[/code]. "
"Source and destination mipmaps/layers must also be specified, with these "
"parameters being [code]0[/code] for textures without mipmaps or single-layer "
"textures. Returns [constant @GlobalScope.OK] if the texture copy was "
"successful or [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param from_texture] texture can't be copied while a draw list "
"that uses it as part of a framebuffer is being created. Ensure the draw list "
"is finalized (and that the color/depth texture using it is not set to "
"[constant FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) to copy this texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param from_texture] texture requires the [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_FROM_BIT] to be retrieved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param to_texture] can't be copied while a draw list that uses "
"it as part of a framebuffer is being created. Ensure the draw list is "
"finalized (and that the color/depth texture using it is not set to [constant "
"FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) to copy this texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param to_texture] requires the [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_TO_BIT] to be retrieved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param from_texture] and [param to_texture] must be of the same "
"type (color or depth)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new texture. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param data] takes an [Array] of [PackedByteArray]s. For "
"[constant TEXTURE_TYPE_1D], [constant TEXTURE_TYPE_2D], and [constant "
"TEXTURE_TYPE_3D] types, this array should only have one element, a "
"[PackedByteArray] containing all the data for the texture. For [code]_ARRAY[/"
"code] and [code]_CUBE[/code] types, the length should be the same as the "
"number of [member RDTextureFormat.array_layers] in [param format].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not to be confused with [method "
"RenderingServer.texture_2d_create], which creates the Godot-specific "
"[Texture2D] resource as opposed to the graphics API's own texture type."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova textura. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param data] pren un [Array] de [PackedByteArray]s. Per als "
"tipus [constant TEXTURE_TYPE_1D], [constant TEXTURE_TYPE_2D] i [constant "
"TEXTURE_TYPE_3D], aquesta matriu només hauria de tenir un element, un "
"[PackedByteArray] que contingui totes les dades de la textura. Per als tipus "
"[code]_ARRAY[/code] i [code]_CUBE[/code], la longitud hauria de ser la "
"mateixa que el nombre de [member RDTextureFormat.array_layers] a [param "
"format].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No s'ha de confondre amb [method "
"RenderingServer.texture_2d_create], que crea el recurs [Texture2D] específic "
"de Godot en lloc del propi tipus de textura de l'API de gràfics."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an RID for an existing [param image] ([code]VkImage[/code]) with the "
"given [param type], [param format], [param samples], [param usage_flags], "
"[param width], [param height], [param depth], [param layers], and [param "
"mipmaps]. This can be used to allow Godot to render onto foreign images."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a shared texture using the specified [param view] and the texture "
"information from [param with_texture].\n"
"This will be freed automatically when the [param with_texture] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea una textura compartida utilitzant el [param view] especificat i la "
"informació de textura de [param with_texture].\n"
"Això s'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi [param with_texture]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a shared texture using the specified [param view] and the texture "
"information from [param with_texture]'s [param layer] and [param mipmap]. "
"The number of included mipmaps from the original texture can be controlled "
"using the [param mipmaps] parameter. Only relevant for textures with "
"multiple layers, such as 3D textures, texture arrays and cubemaps. For "
"single-layer textures, use [method texture_create_shared].\n"
"For 2D textures (which only have one layer), [param layer] must be [code]0[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Layer slicing is only supported for 2D texture arrays, not 3D "
"textures or cubemaps.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when the [param with_texture] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea una textura compartida utilitzant el [param view] especificat i la "
"informació de textura de [param with_texture] [param layer] i [param "
"mipmap]. El nombre de mipmaps inclosos de la textura original es pot "
"controlar mitjançant el paràmetre [param mipmaps]. Només rellevant per a "
"textures amb diverses capes, com ara textures 3D, matrius de textures i "
"mapes de cubs. Per a textures d'una sola capa, utilitzeu [method "
"texture_create_shared].\n"
"Per a textures 2D (que només tenen una capa), [param layer] ha de ser "
"[code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El tall de capes només és compatible amb matrius de textures "
"2D, no textures 3D ni mapes de cubs.\n"
"Això s'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi [param with_texture]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [param texture] data for the specified [param layer] as raw "
"binary data. For 2D textures (which only have one layer), [param layer] must "
"be [code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param texture] can't be retrieved while a draw list that uses "
"it as part of a framebuffer is being created. Ensure the draw list is "
"finalized (and that the color/depth texture using it is not set to [constant "
"FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) to retrieve this texture. Otherwise, an error is "
"printed and an empty [PackedByteArray] is returned.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param texture] requires the [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_FROM_BIT] to be retrieved. Otherwise, an error is "
"printed and an empty [PackedByteArray] is returned.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will block the GPU from working until the data is "
"retrieved. Refer to [method texture_get_data_async] for an alternative that "
"returns the data in more performant way."
msgstr ""
"Retorna les dades [param texture] de l'[param layer] especificat com a dades "
"binàries en brut. Per a textures 2D (que només tenen una capa), [param "
"layer] ha de ser [code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param texture] no es pot recuperar mentre s'està creant una "
"llista de dibuix que l'utilitza com a part d'un framebuffer. Assegureu-vos "
"que la llista de dibuix estigui finalitzada (i que la textura de color/"
"profunditat que l'utilitza no estigui configurada en [constant "
"FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) per recuperar aquesta textura. En cas contrari, "
"s'imprimeix un error i es retorna un [PackedByteArray] buit.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param texture] requereix que es recuperi [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_FROM_BIT]. En cas contrari, s'imprimeix un error i es "
"retorna un [PackedByteArray] buit.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode bloquejarà el funcionament de la GPU fins que es "
"recuperin les dades. Consulteu [method texture_get_data_async] per obtenir "
"una alternativa que retorni les dades d'una manera més eficient."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Asynchronous version of [method texture_get_data]. RenderingDevice will call "
"[param callback] in a certain amount of frames with the data the texture had "
"at the time of the request.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] At the moment, the delay corresponds to the amount of frames "
"specified by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/vsync/"
"frame_queue_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Downloading large textures can have a prohibitive cost for real-"
"time even when using the asynchronous method due to hardware bandwidth "
"limitations. When dealing with large resources, you can adjust settings such "
"as [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/staging_buffer/"
"texture_download_region_size_px] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] to improve the transfer speed "
"at the cost of extra memory.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _texture_get_data_callback(array):\n"
"\tvalue = array.decode_u32(0)\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"rd.texture_get_data_async(texture, 0, _texture_get_data_callback)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Versió asíncrona de [method texture_get_data]. RenderingDevice trucarà a "
"[param callback] en una determinada quantitat de fotogrames amb les dades "
"que tenia la textura en el moment de la sol·licitud.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] De moment, el retard correspon a la quantitat de fotogrames "
"especificada per [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/vsync/"
"frame_queue_size].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La descàrrega de textures grans pot tenir un cost prohibitiu en "
"temps real fins i tot quan s'utilitza el mètode asíncron a causa de les "
"limitacions de l'amplada de banda del maquinari. Quan es tracta de recursos "
"grans, podeu ajustar paràmetres com ara [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/texture_download_region_size_px] i [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] per "
"millorar la velocitat de transferència a costa de la memòria addicional.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _texture_get_data_callback (matriu):\n"
"\tvalor = array.decode_u32(0)\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"rd.texture_get_data_async(texture, 0, _texture_get_data_callback)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Returns the data format used to create this texture."
msgstr "Retorna el format de dades utilitzat per crear aquesta textura."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method get_driver_resource] with [constant DRIVER_RESOURCE_TEXTURE] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu [method get_driver_resource] amb [constant "
"DRIVER_RESOURCE_TEXTURE]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the internal graphics handle for this texture object. For use when "
"communicating with third-party APIs mostly with GDExtension.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function returns a [code]uint64_t[/code] which internally "
"maps to a [code]GLuint[/code] (OpenGL) or [code]VkImage[/code] (Vulkan)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param texture] is discardable, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise. See [RDTextureFormat] or [method "
"texture_set_discardable]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param format] is supported for "
"the given [param usage_flags], [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el [param format] especificat és compatible amb "
"el [param usage_flags] donat, [code]false[/code] en cas contrari."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param texture] is shared, [code]false[/"
"code] otherwise. See [RDTextureView]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param texture] is valid, [code]false[/"
"code] otherwise."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Resolves the [param from_texture] texture onto [param to_texture] with "
"multisample antialiasing enabled. This must be used when rendering a "
"framebuffer for MSAA to work. Returns [constant @GlobalScope.OK] if "
"successful, [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param from_texture] and [param to_texture] textures must have "
"the same dimension, format and type (color or depth).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param from_texture] can't be copied while a draw list that "
"uses it as part of a framebuffer is being created. Ensure the draw list is "
"finalized (and that the color/depth texture using it is not set to [constant "
"FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) to resolve this texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param from_texture] requires the [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_FROM_BIT] to be retrieved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param from_texture] must be multisampled and must also be 2D "
"(or a slice of a 3D/cubemap texture).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param to_texture] can't be copied while a draw list that uses "
"it as part of a framebuffer is being created. Ensure the draw list is "
"finalized (and that the color/depth texture using it is not set to [constant "
"FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) to resolve this texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param to_texture] texture requires the [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_TO_BIT] to be retrieved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param to_texture] texture must [b]not[/b] be multisampled and "
"must also be 2D (or a slice of a 3D/cubemap texture)."
msgstr ""
"Resol la textura [param from_texture] a [param to_texture] amb "
"l'antialiasing de múltiples mostres habilitat. Això s'ha d'utilitzar quan es "
"representa un framebuffer perquè funcioni MSAA. Retorna [constant "
"@GlobalScope.OK] si té èxit, [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] "
"en cas contrari.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param from_texture] i [param to_texture] han de tenir la "
"mateixa dimensió, format i tipus (color o profunditat).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param from_texture] no es pot copiar mentre s'està creant una "
"llista de dibuix que l'utilitza com a part d'un framebuffer. Assegureu-vos "
"que la llista de dibuix s'hagi acabat (i que la textura de color/profunditat "
"que l'utilitza no estigui configurada en [constant FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) "
"per resoldre aquesta textura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param from_texture] requereix que es recuperi [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_FROM_BIT].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param from_texture] ha de ser de mostreig múltiple i també ha "
"de ser 2D (o una porció d'una textura de mapa de cubs/3D).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param to_texture] no es pot copiar mentre es crea una llista "
"de dibuix que l'utilitza com a part d'un framebuffer. Assegureu-vos que la "
"llista de dibuix estigui finalitzada (i que la textura de color/profunditat "
"que l'utilitzi no estigui configurada en [constant FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) "
"per resoldre aquesta textura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param to_texture] La textura requereix que la [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_COPY_TO_BIT] es recuperi.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param to_texture] la textura ha de ser [b]not[/b] i també ha "
"de ser 2D (o una porció d'una textura 3D/cubemap)."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the discardable property of [param texture].\n"
"If a texture is discardable, its contents do not need to be preserved "
"between frames. This flag is only relevant when the texture is used as "
"target in a draw list.\n"
"This information is used by [RenderingDevice] to figure out if a texture's "
"contents can be discarded, eliminating unnecessary writes to memory and "
"boosting performance."
msgstr ""
"Actualitza la propietat descartable de [param texture].\n"
"Si una textura es pot descartar, no cal conservar el seu contingut entre "
"fotogrames. Aquesta bandera només és rellevant quan la textura s'utilitza "
"com a objectiu en una llista de dibuix.\n"
"Aquesta informació l'utilitza [RenderingDevice] per esbrinar si el contingut "
"d'una textura es pot descartar, eliminant les escriptures innecessàries a la "
"memòria i augmentant el rendiment."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Updates texture data with new data, replacing the previous data in place. "
"The updated texture data must have the same dimensions and format. For 2D "
"textures (which only have one layer), [param layer] must be [code]0[/code]. "
"Returns [constant @GlobalScope.OK] if the update was successful, [constant "
"@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Updating textures is forbidden during creation of a draw or "
"compute list.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The existing [param texture] can't be updated while a draw list "
"that uses it as part of a framebuffer is being created. Ensure the draw list "
"is finalized (and that the color/depth texture using it is not set to "
"[constant FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) to update this texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The existing [param texture] requires the [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_UPDATE_BIT] to be updatable."
msgstr ""
"Actualitza les dades de textura amb dades noves, substituint les dades "
"anteriors al seu lloc. Les dades de textura actualitzades han de tenir les "
"mateixes dimensions i format. Per a textures 2D (que només tenen una capa), "
"[param layer] ha de ser [code]0[/code]. Retorna [constant @GlobalScope.OK] "
"si l'actualització ha tingut èxit, [constant "
"@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] en cas contrari.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'actualització de textures està prohibida durant la creació "
"d'una llista de dibuix o càlcul.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El [param texture] existent no es pot actualitzar mentre s'està "
"creant una llista de dibuix que l'utilitza com a part d'un framebuffer. "
"Assegureu-vos que la llista de dibuix estigui finalitzada (i que la textura "
"de color/profunditat que l'utilitza no estigui configurada en [constant "
"FINAL_ACTION_CONTINUE]) per actualitzar aquesta textura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El [param texture] existent requereix que [constant "
"TEXTURE_USAGE_CAN_UPDATE_BIT] es pugui actualitzar."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Builds the [param tlas]. The contents of previous builds are discarded.\n"
"Any BLAS provided through the [member RDAccelerationStructureInstance.blas] "
"member must already have been built using the [method blas_build] method.\n"
"The number of instances can be equal to or smaller than the maximum instance "
"count provided in the [method tlas_create] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Freeing or rebuilding any of the provided BLASes after this "
"method invalidates the TLAS and requires it to be rebuilt."
msgstr ""
"Crea el [param tlas]. Es descarta el contingut de les versions anteriors.\n"
"Qualsevol BLAS proporcionat a través del membre [member "
"RDAccelerationStructureInstance.blas] ja s'ha d'haver construït mitjançant "
"el mètode [method blas_build].\n"
"El nombre d'instàncies pot ser igual o inferior al nombre màxim d'instàncies "
"proporcionat al mètode [method tlas_create].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Alliberar o reconstruir qualsevol dels BLAS proporcionats "
"després d'aquest mètode invalida el TLAS i requereix que es reconstrueixi."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new Top-Level Acceleration Structure (TLAS). It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea una nova estructura d'acceleració de nivell superior (TLAS). S'hi pot "
"accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new uniform buffer. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou buffer uniforme. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new uniform set. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when the [param shader] or any of the RIDs "
"in the [param uniforms] is freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou conjunt uniforme. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"Això s'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi [param shader] o qualsevol "
"dels RID de l'[param uniforms]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Checks if the [param uniform_set] is valid, i.e. is owned."
msgstr "Comprova si [param uniform_set] és vàlid, és a dir, si és propietat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a vertex array based on the specified buffers. Optionally, [param "
"offsets] (in bytes) may be defined for each buffer.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"This will be freed automatically when any of the [param src_buffers] is "
"freed."
msgstr ""
"Crea una matriu de vèrtex basada en els buffers especificats. Opcionalment, "
"es pot definir [param offsets] (en bytes) per a cada memòria intermèdia.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice.\n"
"Això s'alliberarà automàticament quan s'alliberi qualsevol dels [param "
"src_buffers]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new vertex buffer. It can be accessed with the RID that is "
"returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingDevice's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou buffer de vèrtex. S'hi pot accedir amb el RID que es retorna.\n"
"Un cop hàgiu acabat amb el vostre RID, voldreu alliberar-lo mitjançant el "
"mètode [method free_rid] del RenderingDevice."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new vertex format with the specified [param vertex_descriptions]. "
"Returns a unique vertex format ID corresponding to the newly created vertex "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou format de vèrtex amb el [param vertex_descriptions] especificat. "
"Retorna un ID de format de vèrtex únic corresponent al format de vèrtex que "
"s'acaba de crear."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Rendering device type does not match any of the other enum values or is "
"unknown."
msgstr ""
"El tipus de dispositiu de representació no coincideix amb cap dels altres "
"valors d'enumeració o és desconegut."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Rendering device is an integrated GPU, which is typically [i](but not always)"
"[/i] slower than dedicated GPUs ([constant DEVICE_TYPE_DISCRETE_GPU]). On "
"Android and iOS, the rendering device type is always considered to be "
"[constant DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU]."
msgstr ""
"El dispositiu de renderització és una GPU integrada, que normalment és [i]"
"(però no sempre)[/i] més lenta que les GPU dedicades ([constant "
"DEVICE_TYPE_DISCRETE_GPU]). A Android i iOS, el tipus de dispositiu de "
"renderització sempre es considera [constant DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Rendering device is a dedicated GPU, which is typically [i](but not always)[/"
"i] faster than integrated GPUs ([constant DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU])."
msgstr ""
"El dispositiu de renderització és una GPU dedicada, que normalment és [i]"
"(però no sempre)[/i] més ràpid que les GPU integrades ([constant "
"DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU])."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Rendering device is an emulated GPU in a virtual environment. This is "
"typically much slower than the host GPU, which means the expected "
"performance level on a dedicated GPU will be roughly equivalent to [constant "
"DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU]. Virtual machine GPU passthrough (such as VFIO) "
"will not report the device type as [constant DEVICE_TYPE_VIRTUAL_GPU]. "
"Instead, the host GPU's device type will be reported as if the GPU was not "
"emulated."
msgstr ""
"El dispositiu de renderització és una GPU emulada en un entorn virtual. Això "
"sol ser molt més lent que la GPU amfitrió, el que significa que el nivell de "
"rendiment esperat en una GPU dedicada serà aproximadament equivalent a "
"[constant DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU]. El pas de GPU de la màquina virtual "
"(com ara VFIO) no informarà del tipus de dispositiu com a [constant "
"DEVICE_TYPE_VIRTUAL_GPU]. En canvi, el tipus de dispositiu de la GPU "
"amfitrió s'informarà com si la GPU no s'hagués emulat."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Rendering device is provided by software emulation (such as Lavapipe or "
"[url=https://github.com/google/swiftshader]SwiftShader[/url]). This is the "
"slowest kind of rendering device available; it's typically much slower than "
"[constant DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU]."
msgstr ""
"El dispositiu de renderització es proporciona mitjançant l'emulació de "
"programari (com ara Lavapipe o [url=https://github.com/google/"
"swiftshader]SwiftShader[/url]). Aquest és el tipus de dispositiu de "
"renderització més lent disponible; normalment és molt més lent que [constant "
"DEVICE_TYPE_INTEGRATED_GPU]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DeviceType] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum DeviceType]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Specific device object based on a physical device ([code]rid[/code] "
"parameter is ignored).\n"
"- Vulkan: Vulkan device driver resource ([code]VkDevice[/code]).\n"
"- D3D12: D3D12 device driver resource ([code]ID3D12Device[/code]).\n"
"- Metal: Metal device driver resource ([code]MTLDevice[/code])."
msgstr ""
"S'ignora l'objecte de dispositiu específic basat en un dispositiu físic "
"([code]rid[/code]).\n"
"- Vulkan: recurs del controlador del dispositiu Vulkan ([code]VkDevice[/"
"code]).\n"
"- D3D12: recurs del controlador del dispositiu D3D12 ([code]ID3D12Device[/"
"code]).\n"
"- Metall: recurs del controlador del dispositiu de metall ([code]MTLDevice[/"
"code])."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Physical device the specific logical device is based on ([code]rid[/code] "
"parameter is ignored).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkPhysicalDevice[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]IDXGIAdapter[/code]."
msgstr ""
"El dispositiu físic en què es basa el dispositiu lògic específic ([code]rid[/"
"code] s'ignora el paràmetre).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkPhysicalDevice[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]IDXGIAdapter[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Top-most graphics API entry object ([code]rid[/code] parameter is ignored).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkInstance[/code]."
msgstr ""
"L'objecte d'entrada de l'API de gràfics superior ([code]rid[/code] "
"s'ignora).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkInstance[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"The main graphics-compute command queue ([code]rid[/code] parameter is "
"ignored).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkQueue[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]ID3D12CommandQueue[/code].\n"
"- Metal: [code]MTLCommandQueue[/code]."
msgstr ""
"S'ignora el paràmetre principal de la cua d'ordres de càlcul de gràfics "
"([code]rid[/code]).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkQueue[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]ID3D12CommandQueue[/code].\n"
"- Metall: [code]MTLCommandQueue[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"The specific family the main queue belongs to ([code]rid[/code] parameter is "
"ignored).\n"
"- Vulkan: The queue family index, a [code]uint32_t[/code]."
msgstr ""
"S'ignora la família específica a la qual pertany la cua principal "
"([code]rid[/code]).\n"
"- Vulkan: l'índex de la família de la cua, un [code]uint32_t[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"- Vulkan: [code]VkImage[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]ID3D12Resource[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"The view of an owned or shared texture.\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkImageView[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]ID3D12Resource[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La vista d'una textura propietat o compartida.\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkImageView[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]ID3D12Resource[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"The native id of the data format of the texture.\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkFormat[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]DXGI_FORMAT[/code]."
msgstr ""
"L'identificador natiu del format de dades de la textura.\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkFormat[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]DXGI_FORMAT[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "- Vulkan: [code]VkSampler[/code]."
msgstr "- Vulkan: [code]VkSampler[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "- Vulkan: [code]VkDescriptorSet[/code]."
msgstr "- Vulkan: [code]VkDescriptorSet[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Buffer of any kind of (storage, vertex, etc.).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkBuffer[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]ID3D12Resource[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Buffer de qualsevol tipus (emmagatzematge, vèrtex, etc.).\n"
"- Vulkan: [code]VkBuffer[/code].\n"
"- D3D12: [code]ID3D12Resource[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"- Vulkan: [code]VkPipeline[/code].\n"
"- Metal: [code]MTLComputePipelineState[/code]."
msgstr ""
"- Vulkan: [code]VkPipeline[/code].\n"
"- Metall: [code]MTLComputePipelineState[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"- Vulkan: [code]VkPipeline[/code].\n"
"- Metal: [code]MTLRenderPipelineState[/code]."
msgstr ""
"- Vulkan: [code]VkPipeline[/code].\n"
"- Metall: [code]MTLRenderPipelineState[/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid "Use [constant DRIVER_RESOURCE_LOGICAL_DEVICE] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [constant DRIVER_RESOURCE_LOGICAL_DEVICE]."

