msgstr ""
"Format de dades d'enter signat de 32 bits per canal vermell/verd/blau/alfa. "
"Els valors es troben a l'interval [code][2^31 + 1, 2^31 - 1][/code]."

#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"32-bit-per-channel signed floating-point red/green/blue/alpha channel data "
