#: doc/classes/ScriptBacktrace.xml
msgid "A captured backtrace of a specific script language."
msgstr "Una traça inversa capturada d'un llenguatge de guió específic."

#: doc/classes/ScriptBacktrace.xml
msgid ""
"[ScriptBacktrace] holds an already captured backtrace of a specific script "
"language, such as GDScript or C#, which are captured using [method "
"Engine.capture_script_backtraces].\n"
"See [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_call_stacks] and [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/"
"gdscript/always_track_local_variables] for ways of controlling the contents "
"of this class."
msgstr ""
"[ScriptBacktrace] conté una traça inversa ja capturada d'un llenguatge de "
"script específic, com ara GDScript o C#, que es capturen amb [method "
"Engine.capture_script_backtraces].\n"
"Vegeu [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_call_stacks] i [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_local_variables] per a maneres de controlar els continguts "
"d'aquesta classe."

#: doc/classes/ScriptBacktrace.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the backtrace to a [String], where the entire string will be "
"indented by [param indent_all] number of spaces, and the individual stack "
"frames will be additionally indented by [param indent_frames] number of "
"spaces.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling [method Object.to_string] on a [ScriptBacktrace] will "
"produce the same output as calling [method format] with all parameters left "
"at their default values."
msgstr ""
"Converteix la traça inversa en un [String], on la cadena sencera estarà "
"sagnada per [param indent_all] nombre d'espais, i els fotogrames de pila "
"individuals seran sagnats addicionalment per [param indent_frames] nombre "
"d'espais.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La trucada a [method Object.to_string] en un [ScriptBacktrace] "
"produirà la mateixa sortida que la trucada a [method format] amb tots els "
"paràmetres en els seus valors predeterminats."

#: doc/classes/ScriptBacktrace.xml
