#: doc/classes/ScriptCreateDialog.xml
msgid "Godot editor's popup dialog for creating new [Script] files."
msgstr "Diàleg emergent de l'editor Godot per crear nous fitxers [Script]."

#: doc/classes/ScriptCreateDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The [ScriptCreateDialog] creates script files according to a given template "
"for a given scripting language. The standard use is to configure its fields "
"prior to calling one of the [method Window.popup] methods.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar dialog = ScriptCreateDialog.new();\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"Node\", \"res://new_node.gd\") # For in-engine types.\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"\\\"res://base_node.gd\\\"\", \"res://derived_node.gd\") # "
"For script types.\n"
"\tdialog.popup_centered()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar dialog = new ScriptCreateDialog();\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"Node\", \"res://NewNode.cs\"); // For in-engine types.\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"\\\"res://BaseNode.cs\\\"\", \"res://DerivedNode.cs\"); // "
"For script types.\n"
"\tdialog.PopupCentered();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"El [ScriptCreateDialog] crea fitxers de script segons una plantilla "
"determinada per a un llenguatge de script determinat. L'ús estàndard és "
"configurar els seus camps abans de cridar un dels mètodes [method "
"Window.popup].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tvar dialog = ScriptCreateDialog.new();\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"Node\", \"res://new_node.gd\") # Per a tipus dins del "
"motor.\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"\\\"res://base_node.gd\\\"\", \"res://derived_node.gd\") # "
"Per als tipus d'script.\n"
"\tdialog.popup_centered()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"anul·lació pública void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar dialog = new ScriptCreateDialog();\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"Node\", \"res://NewNode.cs\"); // Per als tipus dins del "
"motor.\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"\\\"res://BaseNode.cs\\\"\", \"res://DerivedNode.cs\"); // "
"Per als tipus d'script.\n"
"\tdialog.PopupCentered();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

