#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Opens help for the given topic. The [param topic] is an encoded string that "
"controls which class, method, constant, signal, annotation, property, or "
"theme item should be focused.\n"
"The supported [param topic] formats include [code]class_name:class[/code], "
"[code]class_method:class:method[/code], [code]class_constant:class:constant[/"
"code], [code]class_signal:class:signal[/code], "
"[code]class_annotation:class:@annotation[/code], "
"[code]class_property:class:property[/code], and "
"[code]class_theme_item:class:item[/code], where [code]class[/code] is the "
"class name, [code]method[/code] is the method name, [code]constant[/code] is "
"the constant name, [code]signal[/code] is the signal name, [code]annotation[/"
"code] is the annotation name, [code]property[/code] is the property name, "
"and [code]item[/code] is the theme item.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Shows help for the Node class.\n"
"class_name:Node\n"
"# Shows help for the global min function.\n"
"# Global objects are accessible in the `@GlobalScope` namespace, shown "
"here.\n"
"class_method:@GlobalScope:min\n"
"# Shows help for get_viewport in the Node class.\n"
"class_method:Node:get_viewport\n"
"# Shows help for the Input constant MOUSE_BUTTON_MIDDLE.\n"
"class_constant:Input:MOUSE_BUTTON_MIDDLE\n"
"# Shows help for the BaseButton signal pressed.\n"
"class_signal:BaseButton:pressed\n"
"# Shows help for the CanvasItem property visible.\n"
"class_property:CanvasItem:visible\n"
"# Shows help for the GDScript annotation export.\n"
"# Annotations should be prefixed with the `@` symbol in the descriptor, as "
"shown here.\n"
"class_annotation:@GDScript:@export\n"
"# Shows help for the GraphNode theme item named panel_selected.\n"
"class_theme_item:GraphNode:panel_selected\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid "Goes to the specified line in the current script."
msgstr "Va a la línia especificada a l'script actual."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the script create dialog. The script will extend [param base_name]. "
"The file extension can be omitted from [param base_path]. It will be added "
"based on the selected scripting language."
msgstr ""
"Obre el diàleg de creació de l'script. L'script ampliarà [param base_name]. "
"L'extensió del fitxer es pot ometre de [param base_path]. S'afegirà en "
"funció del llenguatge de script seleccionat."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] to the editor, the "
"[EditorSyntaxHighlighter] will be available on all open scripts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Does not apply to scripts that are already opened."
msgstr ""
"Registra el [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] a l'editor, el "
"[EditorSyntaxHighlighter] estarà disponible en tots els scripts oberts.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No s'aplica als scripts que ja estan oberts."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Reloads all currently opened files. This should be used when opened files "
"are changed outside of the script editor. The user may be prompted to "
"resolve file conflicts, see [member EditorSettings.text_editor/behavior/"
"files/auto_reload_scripts_on_external_change]."
msgstr ""
"Torna a carregar tots els fitxers oberts actualment. Això s'ha d'utilitzar "
"quan els fitxers oberts es canvien fora de l'editor d'scripts. Es pot "
"demanar a l'usuari que resolgui els conflictes de fitxers, vegeu [member "
"EditorSettings.text_editor/behavior/files/"
"auto_reload_scripts_on_external_change]."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid "Saves all open scripts."
msgstr "Desa tots els scripts oberts."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Unregisters the [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] from the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] will still be applied to scripts "
"that are already opened."
msgstr ""
"Cancel·la el registre [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] de l'editor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] encara s'aplicarà als scripts que "
"ja estan oberts."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the documentation for the given [param script].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This should be called whenever the script is changed to keep "
"the open documentation state up to date."
msgstr ""
"Actualitza la documentació per al [param script] donat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] S'hauria de cridar sempre que es canviï l'script per mantenir "
"actualitzat l'estat de la documentació oberta."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when user changed active script. Argument is a freshly activated "
"[Script]."
msgstr ""
"S'ha emès quan l'usuari ha canviat l'script actiu. L'argument és un [Script] "
"recentment activat."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when editor is about to close the active script. Argument is a "
"[Script] that is going to be closed."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'editor està a punt de tancar l'script actiu. L'argument és un "
"[Script] que es tancarà."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid "Base editor for editing scripts in the [ScriptEditor]."
msgstr "Editor base per editar scripts a [ScriptEditor]."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Base editor for editing scripts in the [ScriptEditor]. This does not include "
"documentation items."
msgstr ""
"Editor base per editar scripts a [ScriptEditor]. Això no inclou elements de "
"documentació."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid "Adds an [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] to the open script."
msgstr "Afegeix un [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] a l'script obert."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the underlying [Control] used for editing scripts. For text scripts, "
"this is a [CodeEdit]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [Control] subjacent utilitzat per editar scripts. Per als scripts "
"de text, aquest és un [CodeEdit]."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid "Emitted after script validation."
msgstr "Emès després de la validació de l'script."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user requests a specific documentation page."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari sol·licita una pàgina de documentació específica."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user requests to view a specific method of a script, "
"similar to [signal request_open_script_at_line]."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari sol·licita veure un mètode específic d'un script, "
"similar a [signal request_open_script_at_line]."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted after script validation or when the edited resource has changed."
msgstr ""
"S'emet després de la validació de l'script o quan el recurs editat ha "
"canviat."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user request to find and replace text in the file system."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari sol·licita cercar i substituir text al sistema de "
"fitxers."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user requests contextual help."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari sol·licita ajuda contextual."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user requests to view a specific line of a script, similar "
"to [signal go_to_method]."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari sol·licita veure una línia específica d'un script, "
"similar a [signal go_to_method]."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user contextual goto and the item is in the same script."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari va contextual i l'element es troba al mateix script."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user changes current script or moves caret by 10 or more "
"columns within the same script."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'usuari canvia l'script actual o mou el cursor 10 o més "
"columnes dins del mateix script."

#: doc/classes/ScriptEditorBase.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user request to search text in the file system."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari sol·licita cercar text al sistema de fitxers."

#: doc/classes/ScriptExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Return the expected argument count for the given [param method], or "
"[code]null[/code] if it can't be determined (which will then fall back to "
"the default behavior)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el recompte d'arguments esperat per al [param method] donat, o "
"[code]null[/code] si no es pot determinar (que després tornarà al "
"comportament predeterminat)."

#: doc/classes/ScriptExtension.xml doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid "This method is not called by the engine."
msgstr "Aquest mètode no és cridat pel motor."

#: doc/classes/ScriptExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script is an abstract script. Abstract "
"scripts cannot be instantiated directly, instead other scripts should "
"inherit them. Abstract scripts will be either unselectable or hidden in the "
"Create New Node dialog (unselectable if there are non-abstract classes "
"inheriting it, otherwise hidden)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'script és un script abstracte. Els scripts "
"abstractes no es poden instanciar directament, sinó que altres scripts "
"haurien d'heretar-los. Els scripts abstractes no seran seleccionables o "
"s'amagaran al diàleg Crea un nou node (no es poden seleccionar si hi ha "
"classes no abstractes que l'hereten, en cas contrari s'amagaran)."

#: doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the source associated with a given debug stack position."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la font associada a una posició determinada de la pila de depuració."

#: doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the line where the function is defined in the code, or [code]-1[/"
"code] if the function is not present."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la línia on es defineix la funció al codi, o [code]-1[/code] si la "
"funció no està present."

#: doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Reloads all [param scripts] from disk and the specifics of how that happens "
"is [ScriptLanguageExtension] specific."
msgstr ""
"Torna a carregar tots els [param scripts] des del disc i les especificitats "
"de com passa això són específiques de [ScriptLanguageExtension]."

#: doc/classes/ScriptLanguageExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Reloads the given [param script] from disk and the specifics of how that "
"happens is [ScriptLanguageExtension] specific."
msgstr ""
"Torna a carregar el [param script] donat des del disc i les especificitats "
"de com passa això són específiques de [ScriptLanguageExtension]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for scrollbars."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a barres de desplaçament."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for scrollbars, typically used to navigate through "
"content that extends beyond the visible area of a control. Scrollbars are "
"[Range]-based controls."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a barres de desplaçament, que normalment "
"s'utilitza per navegar pel contingut que s'estén més enllà de l'àrea visible "
"d'un control. Les barres de desplaçament són controls basats en [Range]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the step used when clicking increment and decrement buttons or "
"when using arrow keys when the [ScrollBar] is focused."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix el pas utilitzat quan es fa clic als botons d'increment i "
"disminució o quan s'utilitzen les tecles de fletxa quan [ScrollBar] està "
"enfocat."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Emitted when the scrollbar is being scrolled."
msgstr "S'emet quan es desplaça la barra de desplaçament."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"Icon used as a button to scroll the [ScrollBar] left/up. Supports custom "
"step using the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] property."
msgstr ""
"Icona que s'utilitza com a botó per desplaçar-se per [ScrollBar] cap a "
"l'esquerra/amunt. Admet el pas personalitzat mitjançant la propietat [member "
"ScrollBar.custom_step]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Displayed when the mouse cursor hovers over the decrement button."
msgstr ""
"Es mostra quan el cursor del ratolí passa per sobre del botó de disminució."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Displayed when the decrement button is being pressed."
msgstr "Es mostra quan es prem el botó de disminució."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"Icon used as a button to scroll the [ScrollBar] right/down. Supports custom "
"step using the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] property."
msgstr ""
"Icona que s'utilitza com a botó per desplaçar-se per [ScrollBar] cap a la "
"dreta/avall. Admet el pas personalitzat mitjançant la propietat [member "
"ScrollBar.custom_step]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Displayed when the mouse cursor hovers over the increment button."
msgstr ""
"Es mostra quan el cursor del ratolí passa per sobre del botó d'increment."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Displayed when the increment button is being pressed."
msgstr "Es mostra quan es prem el botó d'increment."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"Used as texture for the grabber, the draggable element representing current "
"scroll."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitza com a textura per a la captura, l'element arrossegable que "
"representa el desplaçament actual."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Used when the mouse hovers over the grabber."
msgstr "S'utilitza quan el ratolí passa per sobre de l'agarrador."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Used when the grabber is being dragged."
msgstr "S'utilitza quan s'està arrossegant l'agarrador."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Used as background of this [ScrollBar]."
msgstr "S'utilitza com a fons d'aquest [ScrollBar]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollBar.xml
msgid "Used as background when the [ScrollBar] has the GUI focus."
msgstr "S'utilitza com a fons quan [ScrollBar] té el focus GUI."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid "A container used to provide scrollbars to a child control when needed."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que s'utilitza per proporcionar barres de desplaçament a un "
"control infantil quan cal."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container used to provide a child control with scrollbars when needed. "
"Scrollbars will automatically be drawn at the right (for vertical) or bottom "
"(for horizontal) and will enable dragging to move the viewable Control (and "
"its children) within the ScrollContainer. Scrollbars will also automatically "
"resize the grabber based on the [member Control.custom_minimum_size] of the "
"Control relative to the ScrollContainer."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que s'utilitza per proporcionar un control infantil amb barres "
"de desplaçament quan sigui necessari. Les barres de desplaçament es "
"dibuixaran automàticament a la dreta (per a vertical) o inferior (per a "
"horitzontal) i permetran arrossegar per moure el control visible (i els seus "
"fills) dins del ScrollContainer. Les barres de desplaçament també canviaran "
"la mida automàticament de la captura en funció del [member "
"Control.custom_minimum_size] del Control relatiu al ScrollContainer."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Ensures the given [param control] is visible (must be a direct or indirect "
"child of the ScrollContainer). Used by [member follow_focus].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will not work on a node that was just added during the "
"same frame. If you want to scroll to a newly added child, you must wait "
"until the next frame using [signal SceneTree.process_frame]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"add_child(child_node)\n"
"await get_tree().process_frame\n"
"ensure_control_visible(child_node)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Assegura que el [param control] donat sigui visible (ha de ser un fill "
"directe o indirecte del ScrollContainer). Utilitzat per [member "
"follow_focus].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això no funcionarà en un node que s'acaba d'afegir durant el "
"mateix marc. Si voleu desplaçar-vos a un fill nou afegit, heu d'esperar fins "
"al següent fotograma amb [signal SceneTree.process_frame]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"add_child(child_node)\n"
"espereu get_tree().process_frame\n"
"garantir_control_visible (node_infant)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the horizontal scrollbar [HScrollBar] of this [ScrollContainer].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to disable or hide a scrollbar, you can use "
"[member horizontal_scroll_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la barra de desplaçament horitzontal [HScrollBar] d'aquest "
"[ScrollContainer].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu desactivar o amagar una barra de "
"desplaçament, podeu utilitzar [member horizontal_scroll_mode]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the vertical scrollbar [VScrollBar] of this [ScrollContainer].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to disable or hide a scrollbar, you can use "
"[member vertical_scroll_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la barra de desplaçament vertical [VScrollBar] d'aquest "
"[ScrollContainer].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu desactivar o amagar una barra de "
"desplaçament, podeu utilitzar [member vertical_scroll_mode]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [theme_item focus] is drawn when the ScrollContainer "
"or one of its descendant nodes is focused."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [theme_item focus] es dibuixa quan el ScrollContainer "
"o un dels seus nodes descendents està enfocat."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ScrollContainer will automatically scroll to "
"focused children (including indirect children) to make sure they are fully "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], ScrollContainer es desplaçarà automàticament fins als "
"nens enfocats (inclosos els indirectes) per assegurar-se que siguin "
"completament visibles."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Controls whether horizontal scrollbar can be used and when it should be "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Controla si es pot utilitzar la barra de desplaçament horitzontal i quan "
"hauria de ser visible."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Deadzone for touch scrolling. Lower deadzone makes the scrolling more "
"sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Zona morta per al desplaçament tàctil. La zona morta més baixa fa que el "
"desplaçament sigui més sensible."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The way which scroll hints (indicators that show that the content can still "
"be scrolled in a certain direction) will be shown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Hints won't be shown if the content can be scrolled both "
"vertically and horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Es mostrarà la forma en què es mostrarà les pistes de desplaçament "
"(indicadors que mostren que el contingut encara es pot desplaçar en una "
"direcció determinada).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No es mostraran consells si el contingut es pot desplaçar tant "
"verticalment com horitzontalment."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The current horizontal scroll value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you are setting this value in the [method Node._ready] "
"function or earlier, it needs to be wrapped with [method "
"Object.set_deferred], since scroll bar's [member Range.max_value] is not "
"initialized yet.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tset_deferred(\"scroll_horizontal\", 600)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"El valor de desplaçament horitzontal actual.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si esteu establint aquest valor a la funció [method "
"Node._ready] o abans, s'ha d'embolicar amb [method Object.set_deferred], ja "
"que [member Range.max_value] encara no està inicialitzat.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tset_deferred(\"desplaçament_horitzontal\", 600)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the mouse wheel scrolls the view horizontally, and "
"holding [kbd]Shift[/kbd] scrolls vertically.\n"
"If [code]false[/code] (default), the mouse wheel scrolls the view "
"vertically, and holding [kbd]Shift[/kbd] scrolls horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la roda del ratolí desplaça la vista horitzontalment i "
"mantenint premut [kbd]Shift[/kbd] es desplaça verticalment.\n"
"Si [code]false[/code] (per defecte), la roda del ratolí desplaça la vista "
"verticalment i mantenint premut [kbd]Shift[/kbd] es desplaça horitzontalment."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] used when clicking the internal "
"scroll bar's horizontal increment and decrement buttons or when using arrow "
"keys when the [ScrollBar] is focused."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix el [member ScrollBar.custom_step] que s'utilitza quan es fa clic "
"als botons d'increment i disminució horitzontal de la barra de desplaçament "
"interna o quan s'utilitzen les tecles de fletxa quan el [ScrollBar] està "
"enfocat."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The current vertical scroll value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting it early needs to be deferred, just like in [member "
"scroll_horizontal].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tset_deferred(\"scroll_vertical\", 600)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"El valor de desplaçament vertical actual.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Cal ajornar la configuració d'hora, igual que a [member "
"scroll_horizontal].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tset_deferred(\"scroll_vertical\", 600)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] used when clicking the internal "
"scroll bar's vertical increment and decrement buttons or when using arrow "
"keys when the [ScrollBar] is focused."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix el [member ScrollBar.custom_step] que s'utilitza quan es fa clic "
"als botons d'increment i disminució vertical de la barra de desplaçament "
"interna o quan s'utilitzen les tecles de fletxa quan el [ScrollBar] està "
"enfocat."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Controls whether vertical scrollbar can be used and when it should be "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Controla si es pot utilitzar la barra de desplaçament vertical i quan hauria "
"de ser visible."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when scrolling stops when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a "
"touch event[/i]. This signal is [i]not[/i] emitted when scrolling by "
"dragging the scrollbar, scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with "
"keyboard/gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/"
"web platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan el desplaçament s'atura en arrossegar l'àrea de desplaçament "
"[i]amb un esdeveniment tàctil[/i]. Aquest senyal s'emet [i]not[/i] en "
"desplaçar-se arrossegant la barra de desplaçament, desplaçant-se amb la roda "
"del ratolí o desplaçant-se amb els esdeveniments del teclat/jocpad.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest senyal només s'emet a Android o iOS, o a plataformes "
"d'escriptori/web quan [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] està habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when scrolling starts when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a "
"touch event[/i]. This signal is [i]not[/i] emitted when scrolling by "
"dragging the scrollbar, scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with "
"keyboard/gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/"
"web platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan s'inicia el desplaçament en arrossegar l'àrea de desplaçament "
"[i]amb un esdeveniment tàctil[/i]. Aquest senyal s'emet [i]not[/i] en "
"desplaçar-se arrossegant la barra de desplaçament, desplaçant-se amb la roda "
"del ratolí o desplaçant-se amb els esdeveniments del teclat/jocpad.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest senyal només s'emet a Android o iOS, o a plataformes "
"d'escriptori/web quan [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] està habilitat."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid "Scrolling disabled, scrollbar will be invisible."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament està desactivat, la barra de desplaçament serà invisible."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Scrolling enabled, scrollbar will be visible only if necessary, i.e. "
"container's content is bigger than the container."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament està activat, la barra de desplaçament només serà visible si "
"cal, és a dir, el contingut del contenidor és més gran que el contenidor."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid "Scrolling enabled, scrollbar will be always visible."
msgstr "Desplaçament activat, la barra de desplaçament serà sempre visible."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid "Scrolling enabled, scrollbar will be hidden."
msgstr "El desplaçament està activat, la barra de desplaçament s'amagarà."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Combines [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO] and [constant SCROLL_MODE_SHOW_ALWAYS]. "
"The scrollbar is only visible if necessary, but the content size is adjusted "
"as if it was always visible. It's useful for ensuring that content size "
"stays the same regardless if the scrollbar is visible."
msgstr ""
"Combina [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO] i [constant SCROLL_MODE_SHOW_ALWAYS]. La "
"barra de desplaçament només és visible si cal, però la mida del contingut "
"s'ajusta com si sempre fos visible. És útil per garantir que la mida del "
"contingut es mantingui igual independentment de si la barra de desplaçament "
"és visible."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Behaves like [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO], but makes the [ScrollContainer] "
"report a minimum size based on its content (limited by [member "
"Control.custom_maximum_size] when set on the corresponding axis). This "
"allows it to grow first and only start scrolling once constrained."
msgstr ""
"Es comporta com [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO], però fa que [ScrollContainer] "
"informi una mida mínima en funció del seu contingut (limitat per [member "
"Control.custom_maximum_size] quan es defineix a l'eix corresponent). Això li "
"permet créixer primer i només començar a desplaçar-se un cop està limitat."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Scroll hints will be shown at the top and bottom (if vertical), or left and "
"right (if horizontal)."
msgstr ""
"Les pistes de desplaçament es mostraran a la part superior i inferior (si és "
"vertical) o a l'esquerra i a la dreta (si és horitzontal)."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Scroll hints will be shown at the top (if vertical), or the left (if "
"horizontal)."
msgstr ""
"Les pistes de desplaçament es mostraran a la part superior (si és vertical) "
"o a l'esquerra (si és horitzontal)."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Scroll hints will be shown at the bottom (if horizontal), or the right (if "
"horizontal)."
msgstr ""
"Les pistes de desplaçament es mostraran a la part inferior (si és "
"horitzontal) o a la dreta (si és horitzontal)."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"[Color] used to modulate the [theme_item scroll_hint_horizontal] texture."
msgstr ""
"[Color] s'utilitza per modular la textura [theme_item "
"scroll_hint_horizontal]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid "[Color] used to modulate the [theme_item scroll_hint_vertical] texture."
msgstr ""
"[Color] s'utilitza per modular la textura [theme_item scroll_hint_vertical]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The space between the ScrollContainer's vertical scroll bar and its content, "
"in pixels. No space will be added when the content's minimum size is larger "
"than the ScrollContainer's size."
msgstr ""
"L'espai entre la barra de desplaçament vertical del ScrollContainer i el seu "
"contingut, en píxels. No s'afegirà cap espai quan la mida mínima del "
"contingut sigui més gran que la mida del ScrollContainer."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The space between the ScrollContainer's horizontal scroll bar and its "
"content, in pixels. No space will be added when the content's minimum size "
"is larger than the ScrollContainer's size."
msgstr ""
"L'espai entre la barra de desplaçament horitzontal del ScrollContainer i el "
"seu contingut, en píxels. No s'afegirà cap espai quan la mida mínima del "
"contingut sigui més gran que la mida del ScrollContainer."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The indicator that will be shown when the content can still be scrolled "
"horizontally. See [member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr ""
"L'indicador que es mostrarà quan el contingut encara es pugui desplaçar "
"horitzontalment. Veure [member scroll_hint_mode]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The indicator that will be shown when the content can still be scrolled "
"vertically. See [member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr ""
"L'indicador que es mostrarà quan el contingut encara es pugui desplaçar "
"verticalment. Veure [member scroll_hint_mode]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The focus border [StyleBox] of the [ScrollContainer]. Only used if [member "
"draw_focus_border] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La vora del focus [StyleBox] de la [ScrollContainer]. Només s'utilitza si "
"[member draw_focus_border] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
msgid "The background [StyleBox] of the [ScrollContainer]."
msgstr "El fons [StyleBox] de [ScrollContainer]."

#: doc/classes/SegmentShape2D.xml
msgid "A 2D line segment shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Una forma de segment de línia 2D utilitzada per a la col·lisió física."

#: doc/classes/SegmentShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D line segment shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to "
"provide a shape for a [CollisionShape2D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de segment de línia 2D, pensada per al seu ús en física. "
"Normalment s'utilitza per proporcionar una forma per a un [CollisionShape2D]."

#: doc/classes/SegmentShape2D.xml
msgid "The segment's first point position."
msgstr "Primer punt de posició del segment."

#: doc/classes/SegmentShape2D.xml
msgid "The segment's second point position."
msgstr "La segona posició del punt del segment."

#: doc/classes/Semaphore.xml
msgid ""
"A synchronization mechanism used to control access to a shared resource by "
"[Thread]s."
msgstr ""
"Un mecanisme de sincronització utilitzat per controlar l'accés a un recurs "
"compartit per [Thread]s."

#: doc/classes/Semaphore.xml
msgid ""
"A synchronization semaphore that can be used to synchronize multiple "
"[Thread]s. Initialized to zero on creation. For a binary version, see "
"[Mutex].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Semaphores must be used carefully to avoid deadlocks.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] To guarantee that the operating system is able to perform "
"proper cleanup (no crashes, no deadlocks), these conditions must be met:\n"
"- When a [Semaphore]'s reference count reaches zero and it is therefore "
"destroyed, no threads must be waiting on it.\n"
"- When a [Thread]'s reference count reaches zero and it is therefore "
"destroyed, it must not be waiting on any semaphore."
msgstr ""
"Un semàfor de sincronització que es pot utilitzar per sincronitzar diversos "
"[Thread]s. Inicialitzat a zero en la creació. Per obtenir una versió "
"binària, vegeu [Mutex].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Els semàfors s'han d'utilitzar amb cura per evitar bloquejos.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Per garantir que el sistema operatiu pugui realitzar una neteja "
"adequada (sense bloquejos, sense bloquejos), s'han de complir aquestes "
"condicions:\n"
"- Quan el recompte de referència d'un [Semaphore] arriba a zero i, per tant, "
"es destrueix, no hi ha d'estar esperant cap fil.\n"
"- Quan el recompte de referència d'un [Thread] arriba a zero i, per tant, es "
"destrueix, no ha d'estar esperant cap semàfor."

#: doc/classes/Semaphore.xml
msgid ""
"Lowers the [Semaphore], allowing one thread in, or more if [param count] is "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Redueix el [Semaphore], permetent l'entrada d'un fil, o més si s'especifica "
"[param count]."

#: doc/classes/Semaphore.xml
msgid ""
"Like [method wait], but won't block, so if the value is zero, fails "
"immediately and returns [code]false[/code]. If non-zero, it returns "
"[code]true[/code] to report success."
msgstr ""
"Igual que [method wait], però no es bloqueja, de manera que si el valor és "
"zero, falla immediatament i retorna [code]false[/code]. Si no és zero, "
"retorna [code]true[/code] per informar de l'èxit."

#: doc/classes/Semaphore.xml
msgid "Waits for the [Semaphore], if its value is zero, blocks until non-zero."
msgstr ""
"Espera que [Semaphore], si el seu valor és zero, es bloqueja fins que no "
"sigui zero."

#: doc/classes/SeparationRayShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D ray shape used for physics collision that tries to separate itself from "
"any collider."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de raig 2D utilitzada per a la col·lisió física que intenta "
"separar-se de qualsevol col·lisionador."

#: doc/classes/SeparationRayShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D ray shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a shape "
"for a [CollisionShape2D]. When a [SeparationRayShape2D] collides with an "
"object, it tries to separate itself from it by moving its endpoint to the "
"collision point. For example, a [SeparationRayShape2D] next to a character "
"can allow it to instantly move up when touching stairs."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de raig 2D, pensada per al seu ús en física. Normalment s'utilitza "
"per proporcionar una forma per a un [CollisionShape2D]. Quan un "
"[SeparationRayShape2D] xoca amb un objecte, intenta separar-se d'ell movent "
"el seu punt final al punt de col·lisió. Per exemple, un "
"[SeparationRayShape2D] al costat d'un personatge pot permetre que es mogui a "
"l'instant quan toqui les escales."

#: doc/classes/SeparationRayShape2D.xml doc/classes/SeparationRayShape3D.xml
msgid "The ray's length."
msgstr "Longitud del raig."

#: doc/classes/SeparationRayShape2D.xml doc/classes/SeparationRayShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code] (default), the shape always separates and returns a "
"normal along its own direction.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the shape can return the correct normal and separate "
"in any direction, allowing sliding motion on slopes."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]false[/code] (per defecte), la forma sempre es separa i retorna una "
"normal en la seva pròpia direcció.\n"
"Si [code]true[/code], la forma pot tornar a la normalitat correcta i separar-"
"se en qualsevol direcció, permetent el moviment de lliscament en pendents."

#: doc/classes/SeparationRayShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D ray shape used for physics collision that tries to separate itself from "
"any collider."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de raig 3D utilitzada per a la col·lisió física que intenta "
"separar-se de qualsevol col·lisionador."

#: doc/classes/SeparationRayShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D ray shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a shape "
"for a [CollisionShape3D]. When a [SeparationRayShape3D] collides with an "
"object, it tries to separate itself from it by moving its endpoint to the "
"collision point. For example, a [SeparationRayShape3D] next to a character "
"can allow it to instantly move up when touching stairs."
msgstr ""
"Una forma de raig 3D, pensada per al seu ús en física. Normalment s'utilitza "
"per proporcionar una forma per a un [CollisionShape3D]. Quan un "
"[SeparationRayShape3D] xoca amb un objecte, intenta separar-se d'ell movent "
"el seu punt final al punt de col·lisió. Per exemple, un "
"[SeparationRayShape3D] al costat d'un personatge pot permetre que es mogui a "
"l'instant quan toqui les escales."

#: doc/classes/Separator.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for separators."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a separadors."

#: doc/classes/Separator.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for separators, used for separating other controls. "
"[Separator]s are purely visual and normally drawn as a [StyleBoxLine]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a separadors, utilitzada per separar altres "
"controls. Els [Separator]s són purament visuals i normalment es dibuixen com "
"a [StyleBoxLine]."

#: doc/classes/Separator.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the area covered by the separator. Effectively works like a "
"minimum width/height."
msgstr ""
"La mida de l'àrea coberta pel separador. Funciona efectivament com una "
"amplada/alçada mínima."

#: doc/classes/Separator.xml
msgid ""
"The style for the separator line. Works best with [StyleBoxLine] (remember "
"to enable [member StyleBoxLine.vertical] for [VSeparator])."
msgstr ""
"L'estil de la línia separadora. Funciona millor amb [StyleBoxLine] (recordeu "
"activar [member StyleBoxLine.vertical] per a [VSeparator])."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid "A shader implemented in the Godot shading language."
msgstr "Un shader implementat en el llenguatge d'ombrejat Godot."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"A custom shader program implemented in the Godot shading language, saved "
"with the [code].gdshader[/code] extension.\n"
"This class is used by a [ShaderMaterial] and allows you to write your own "
"custom behavior for rendering visual items or updating particle information. "
"For a detailed explanation and usage, please see the tutorials linked below."
msgstr ""
"Un programa d'ombrejat personalitzat implementat en el llenguatge d'ombrejat "
"Godot, desat amb l'extensió [code].gdshader[/code].\n"
"Aquesta classe l'utilitza un [ShaderMaterial] i us permet escriure el vostre "
"propi comportament personalitzat per representar elements visuals o "
"actualitzar la informació de les partícules. Per obtenir una explicació "
"detallada i l'ús, consulteu els tutorials enllaçats a continuació."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml doc/classes/ShaderMaterial.xml
msgid "Shaders documentation index"
msgstr "Índex de documentació de Shaders"

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the texture that is set as default for the specified parameter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param name] must match the name of the uniform in the code "
"exactly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the sampler array is used use [param index] to access the "
"specified texture."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la textura que s'estableix com a predeterminada per al paràmetre "
"especificat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param name] ha de coincidir exactament amb el nom de "
"l'uniforme del codi.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si s'utilitza la matriu de mostreig, utilitzeu [param index] "
"per accedir a la textura especificada."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid "Returns the shader mode for the shader."
msgstr "Retorna el mode de shader del shader."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of shader uniforms that can be assigned to a "
"[ShaderMaterial], for use with [method ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] "
"and [method ShaderMaterial.get_shader_parameter]. The parameters returned "
"are contained in dictionaries in a similar format to the ones returned by "
"[method Object.get_property_list].\n"
"If argument [param get_groups] is [code]true[/code], parameter grouping "
"hints are also included in the list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la llista d'uniformes shader que es poden assignar a un "
"[ShaderMaterial], per utilitzar-los amb [method "
"ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] i [method "
"ShaderMaterial.get_shader_parameter]. Els paràmetres retornats estan "
"continguts en diccionaris en un format similar als retornats per [method "
"Object.get_property_list].\n"
"Si l'argument [param get_groups] és [code]true[/code], les pistes "
"d'agrupació de paràmetres també s'inclouen a la llista."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"Only available when running in the editor. Opens a popup that visualizes the "
"generated shader code, including all variants and internal shader code. See "
"also [method Material.inspect_native_shader_code]."
msgstr ""
"Només disponible quan s'executa a l'editor. Obre una finestra emergent que "
"visualitza el codi shader generat, incloses totes les variants i el codi "
"shader intern. Vegeu també [method Material.inspect_native_shader_code]."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the default texture to be used with a texture uniform. The default is "
"used if a texture is not set in the [ShaderMaterial].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param name] must match the name of the uniform in the code "
"exactly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the sampler array is used use [param index] to access the "
"specified texture."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la textura per defecte que s'utilitzarà amb una textura uniforme. "
"El valor predeterminat s'utilitza si no s'estableix una textura a "
"[ShaderMaterial].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param name] ha de coincidir exactament amb el nom de "
"l'uniforme del codi.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si s'utilitza la matriu de mostreig, utilitzeu [param index] "
"per accedir a la textura especificada."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the shader's code as the user has written it, not the full generated "
"code used internally."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el codi del shader tal com l'ha escrit l'usuari, no el codi generat "
"complet utilitzat internament."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid "Mode used to draw all 3D objects."
msgstr "Mode utilitzat per dibuixar tots els objectes 3D."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid "Mode used to draw all 2D objects."
msgstr "Mode utilitzat per dibuixar tots els objectes 2D."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"Mode used to calculate particle information on a per-particle basis. Not "
"used for drawing."
msgstr ""
"Mode utilitzat per calcular la informació de partícules per partícula. No "
"s'utilitza per dibuixar."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid ""
"Mode used for drawing skies. Only works with shaders attached to [Sky] "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Mode utilitzat per dibuixar cels. Només funciona amb shaders connectats als "
"objectes [Sky]."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid "Mode used for setting the color and density of volumetric fog effect."
msgstr ""
"Mode utilitzat per configurar el color i la densitat de l'efecte de boira "
"volumètrica."

#: doc/classes/Shader.xml
msgid "Mode used for drawing to DrawableTexture resources via blit calls."
msgstr ""
"Mode utilitzat per dibuixar als recursos DrawableTexture mitjançant trucades "
"blit."

#: doc/classes/ShaderGlobalsOverride.xml
msgid "A node used to override global shader parameters' values in a scene."
msgstr ""
"Un node que s'utilitza per anul·lar els valors dels paràmetres globals de "
"l'ombra en una escena."

#: doc/classes/ShaderGlobalsOverride.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to how a [WorldEnvironment] node can be used to override the "
"environment while a specific scene is loaded, [ShaderGlobalsOverride] can be "
"used to override global shader parameters temporarily. Once the node is "
"removed, the project-wide values for the global shader parameters are "
"restored. See the [RenderingServer] [code]global_shader_parameter_*[/code] "
"methods for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only one [ShaderGlobalsOverride] can be used per scene. If "
"there is more than one [ShaderGlobalsOverride] node in the scene tree, only "
"the first node (in tree order) will be taken into account.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All [ShaderGlobalsOverride] nodes are made part of a [code]"
"\"shader_overrides_group\"[/code] group when they are added to the scene "
"tree. The currently active [ShaderGlobalsOverride] node also has a [code]"
"\"shader_overrides_group_active\"[/code] group added to it. You can use this "
"to check which [ShaderGlobalsOverride] node is currently active."
msgstr ""
"De manera similar a com es pot utilitzar un node [WorldEnvironment] per "
"anul·lar l'entorn mentre es carrega una escena específica, "
"[ShaderGlobalsOverride] es pot utilitzar per anul·lar temporalment els "
"paràmetres globals de l'ombra. Un cop eliminat el node, es restauren els "
"valors de tot el projecte per als paràmetres globals de l'ombra. Consulteu "
"els mètodes [RenderingServer] [code]global_shader_parameter_*[/code] per "
"obtenir més informació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només es pot utilitzar un [ShaderGlobalsOverride] per escena. "
"Si hi ha més d'un node [ShaderGlobalsOverride] a l'arbre de l'escena, només "
"es tindrà en compte el primer node (en ordre d'arbre).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Tots els nodes [ShaderGlobalsOverride] formen part d'un grup "
"[code]\"shader_overrides_group\"[/code] quan s'afegeixen a l'arbre "
"d'escenes. El node [ShaderGlobalsOverride] actualment actiu també té un grup "
"[code]\"shader_overrides_group_active\"[/code] afegit. Podeu utilitzar-ho "
"per comprovar quin node [ShaderGlobalsOverride] està actiu actualment."

#: doc/classes/ShaderGlobalsOverride.xml
msgid "Shading language"
msgstr "Llenguatge d'ombrejat"

#: doc/classes/ShaderInclude.xml
msgid ""
"A snippet of shader code to be included in a [Shader] with [code]#include[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Un fragment de codi d'ombra que s'ha d'incloure en un [Shader] amb "
"[code]#include[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ShaderInclude.xml
msgid ""
"A shader include file, saved with the [code].gdshaderinc[/code] extension. "
"This class allows you to define a custom shader snippet that can be included "
"in a [Shader] by using the preprocessor directive [code]#include[/code], "
"followed by the file path (e.g. [code]#include \"res://"
"shader_lib.gdshaderinc\"[/code]). The snippet doesn't have to be a valid "
"shader on its own."
msgstr ""
"Un fitxer d'inclusió d'ombres, desat amb l'extensió [code].gdshaderinc[/"
"code]. Aquesta classe us permet definir un fragment de shader personalitzat "
"que es pot incloure en un [Shader] mitjançant la directiva del "
"preprocessador [code]#include[/code], seguida de la ruta del fitxer (p. ex. "
"[code]#include \"res://shader_lib.gdshaderinc\"[/code]). El fragment no ha "
"de ser un shader vàlid per si sol."

#: doc/classes/ShaderInclude.xml
msgid "Shader preprocessor"
msgstr "Preprocessador Shader"

#: doc/classes/ShaderInclude.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the code of the shader include file. The returned text is what the "
"user has written, not the full generated code used internally."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el codi del fitxer include shader. El text retornat és el que ha "
"escrit l'usuari, no el codi complet generat utilitzat internament."

#: doc/classes/ShaderIncludeDB.xml
msgid "Internal database of built in shader include files."
msgstr "La base de dades interna del shader incorporat inclou fitxers."

#: doc/classes/ShaderIncludeDB.xml
msgid ""
"This object contains shader fragments from Godot's internal shaders. These "
"can be used when access to internal uniform buffers and/or internal "
"functions is required for instance when composing compositor effects or "
"compute shaders. Only fragments for the current rendering device are loaded."
msgstr ""
"Aquest objecte conté fragments de shader dels shaders interns de Godot. "
"Aquests es poden utilitzar quan es requereix accés a memòries intermèdies "
"uniformes internes i/o funcions internes, per exemple, quan es compon "
"efectes de compositor o ombrejats de càlcul. Només es carreguen fragments "
"per al dispositiu de renderització actual."

#: doc/classes/ShaderIncludeDB.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the code for the built-in shader fragment. You can also access this "
"in your shader code through [code]#include \"filename\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el codi del fragment de shader integrat. També podeu accedir-hi al "
"vostre codi d'ombra mitjançant [code]#incloeu \"nom de fitxer\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ShaderIncludeDB.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if an include file with this name exists."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si existeix un fitxer d'inclusió amb aquest nom."

#: doc/classes/ShaderIncludeDB.xml
msgid "Returns a list of built-in include files that are currently registered."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una llista de fitxers d'inclusió integrats que estan registrats "
"actualment."

#: doc/classes/ShaderMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A material defined by a custom [Shader] program and the values of its shader "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Un material definit per un programa personalitzat [Shader] i els valors dels "
"seus paràmetres shader."

#: doc/classes/ShaderMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A material that uses a custom [Shader] program to render visual items "
"(canvas items, meshes, skies, fog), or to process particles. Compared to "
"other materials, [ShaderMaterial] gives deeper control over the generated "
"shader code. For more information, see the shaders documentation index "
"below.\n"
"Multiple [ShaderMaterial]s can use the same shader and configure different "
"values for the shader uniforms.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For performance reasons, the [signal Resource.changed] signal "
"is only emitted when the [member Resource.resource_name] changes. Only in "
"editor, it is also emitted for [member shader] changes."
msgstr ""
"Un material que utilitza un programa personalitzat [Shader] per representar "
"elements visuals (elements de llenç, malles, cels, boira) o per processar "
"partícules. En comparació amb altres materials, [ShaderMaterial] ofereix un "
"control més profund sobre el codi d'ombra generat. Per obtenir més "
"informació, consulteu l'índex de documentació dels shaders a continuació.\n"
"Diversos [ShaderMaterial]s poden utilitzar el mateix shader i configurar "
"diferents valors per als uniformes shader.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per raons de rendiment, el senyal [signal Resource.changed] "
"només s'emet quan canvia [member Resource.resource_name]. Només a l'editor, "
"també s'emet per als canvis [member shader]."

#: doc/classes/ShaderMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current value set for this material of a uniform in the shader."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor actual establert per a aquest material d'un uniforme al "
"shader."

#: doc/classes/ShaderMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the value set for this material of a uniform in the shader.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param param] is case-sensitive and must match the name of the "
"uniform in the code exactly (not the capitalized name in the inspector).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to the shader uniform will be effective on all "
"instances using this [ShaderMaterial]. To prevent this, use per-instance "
"uniforms with [method CanvasItem.set_instance_shader_parameter], [method "
"GeometryInstance3D.set_instance_shader_parameter] or duplicate the "
"[ShaderMaterial] resource using [method Resource.duplicate]. Per-instance "
"uniforms allow for better shader reuse and are therefore faster, so they "
"should be preferred over duplicating the [ShaderMaterial] when possible."
msgstr ""
"Canvia el valor establert per a aquest material d'un uniforme a l'ombra.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param param] distingeix entre majúscules i minúscules i ha de "
"coincidir exactament amb el nom de l'uniforme del codi (no amb el nom en "
"majúscula de l'inspector).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els canvis a l'uniforme d'ombres seran efectius en totes les "
"instàncies que utilitzen aquest [ShaderMaterial]. Per evitar-ho, utilitzeu "
"uniformes per instància amb [method "
"CanvasItem.set_instance_shader_parameter], [method "
"GeometryInstance3D.set_instance_shader_parameter] o dupliqueu el recurs "
"[ShaderMaterial] amb [method Resource.duplicate]. Els uniformes per "
"instància permeten una millor reutilització de l'ombra i, per tant, són més "
"ràpids, per la qual cosa s'han de preferir que duplicar el [ShaderMaterial] "
"quan sigui possible."

#: doc/classes/ShaderMaterial.xml
msgid "The [Shader] program used to render this material."
msgstr "El programa [Shader] utilitzat per representar aquest material."

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for 2D shapes used for physics collision."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a formes 2D utilitzades per a la col·lisió física."

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all 2D shapes, intended for use in physics.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Primitive shapes, especially [CircleShape2D], are fast "
"to check collisions against. [ConvexPolygonShape2D] is slower, and "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D] is the slowest."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a totes les formes 2D, pensada per al seu ús en "
"física.\n"
"[b]Rendiment:[/b] Les formes primitives, especialment [CircleShape2D], són "
"ràpids per comprovar les col·lisions. [ConvexPolygonShape2D] és més lent, i "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D] és el més lent."

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this shape is colliding with another.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), and "
"the transformation matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta forma xoca amb una altra.\n"
"Aquest mètode necessita la matriu de transformació per a aquesta forma "
"([param local_xform]), la forma per comprovar les col·lisions amb ([param "
"with_shape]) i la matriu de transformació d'aquesta forma ([param "
"shape_xform])."

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of contact point pairs where this shape touches another.\n"
"If there are no collisions, the returned list is empty. Otherwise, the "
"returned list contains contact points arranged in pairs, with entries "
"alternating between points on the boundary of this shape and points on the "
"boundary of [param with_shape].\n"
"A collision pair A, B can be used to calculate the collision normal with "
"[code](B - A).normalized()[/code], and the collision depth with [code](B - "
"A).length()[/code]. This information is typically used to separate shapes, "
"particularly in collision solvers.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), and "
"the transformation matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una llista de parells de punts de contacte on aquesta forma toca una "
"altra.\n"
"Si no hi ha col·lisions, la llista retornada està buida. En cas contrari, la "
"llista retornada conté punts de contacte disposats per parelles, amb "
"entrades alternant entre punts al límit d'aquesta forma i punts al límit de "
"[param with_shape].\n"
"Es pot utilitzar un parell de col·lisió A, B per calcular la normal de "
"col·lisió amb [code](B - A).normalized()[/code] i la profunditat de "
"col·lisió amb [code](B - A).length()[/code]. Aquesta informació s'utilitza "
"normalment per separar formes, especialment en solucionadors de "
"col·lisions.\n"
"Aquest mètode necessita la matriu de transformació d'aquesta forma ([param "
"local_xform]), la forma per comprovar les col·lisions amb ([param "
"with_shape]) i la matriu de transformació d'aquesta forma ([param "
"shape_xform])."

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether this shape would collide with another, if a given movement "
"was applied.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the movement to test on this shape ([param local_motion]), "
"the shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), the transformation "
"matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform]), and the movement to test onto "
"the other object ([param shape_motion])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of contact point pairs where this shape would touch another, "
"if a given movement was applied.\n"
"If there would be no collisions, the returned list is empty. Otherwise, the "
"returned list contains contact points arranged in pairs, with entries "
"alternating between points on the boundary of this shape and points on the "
"boundary of [param with_shape].\n"
"A collision pair A, B can be used to calculate the collision normal with "
"[code](B - A).normalized()[/code], and the collision depth with [code](B - "
"A).length()[/code]. This information is typically used to separate shapes, "
"particularly in collision solvers.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the movement to test on this shape ([param local_motion]), "
"the shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), the transformation "
"matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform]), and the movement to test onto "
"the other object ([param shape_motion])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Draws a solid shape onto a [CanvasItem] with the [RenderingServer] API "
"filled with the specified [param color]. The exact drawing method is "
"specific for each shape and cannot be configured."
msgstr ""
"Dibuixa una forma sòlida en un [CanvasItem] amb l'API [RenderingServer] "
"completa amb el [param color] especificat. El mètode de dibuix exacte és "
"específic per a cada forma i no es pot configurar."

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid "Returns a [Rect2] representing the shapes boundary."
msgstr "Retorna un [Rect2] que representa el límit de les formes."

#: doc/classes/Shape2D.xml
msgid ""
"The shape's custom solver bias. Defines how much bodies react to enforce "
"contact separation when this shape is involved.\n"
"When set to [code]0[/code], the default value from [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/solver/default_contact_bias] is used."
msgstr ""
"El biaix de solucionador personalitzat de la forma. Defineix quant "
"reaccionen els cossos per forçar la separació de contactes quan es tracta "
"d'aquesta forma.\n"
"Quan s'estableix a [code]0[/code], s'utilitza el valor predeterminat de "
"[member ProjectSettings.physics/2d/solver/default_contact_bias]."

#: doc/classes/Shape3D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for 3D shapes used for physics collision."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a formes 3D utilitzades per a la col·lisió física."

#: doc/classes/Shape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all 3D shapes, intended for use in physics.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Primitive shapes, especially [SphereShape3D], are fast "
"to check collisions against. [ConvexPolygonShape3D] and [HeightMapShape3D] "
"are slower, and [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is the slowest."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a totes les formes 3D, pensada per al seu ús en "
"física.\n"
"[b]Rendiment:[/b] Les formes primitives, especialment [SphereShape3D], són "
"ràpids per comprovar les col·lisions. [ConvexPolygonShape3D] i "
"[HeightMapShape3D] són més lents, i [ConcavePolygonShape3D] és el més lent."

#: doc/classes/Shape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [ArrayMesh] used to draw the debug collision for this [Shape3D]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [ArrayMesh] utilitzat per dibuixar la col·lisió de depuració per "
"a aquest [Shape3D]."

#: doc/classes/Shape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The shape's custom solver bias. Defines how much bodies react to enforce "
"contact separation when this shape is involved.\n"
"When set to [code]0[/code], the default value from [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/3d/solver/default_contact_bias] is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member custom_solver_bias] is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"El biaix de solucionador personalitzat de la forma. Defineix quant "
"reaccionen els cossos per forçar la separació de contactes quan es tracta "
"d'aquesta forma.\n"
"Quan s'estableix a [code]0[/code], s'utilitza el valor predeterminat de "
"[member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/solver/default_contact_bias].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member custom_solver_bias] només és efectiu quan s'utilitza "
"GodotPhysics3D. No té cap efecte quan s'utilitza Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/Shape3D.xml
msgid ""
"The collision margin for the shape. This is not used in Godot Physics.\n"
"Collision margins allow collision detection to be more efficient by adding "
"an extra shell around shapes. Collision algorithms are more expensive when "
"objects overlap by more than their margin, so a higher value for margins is "
"better for performance, at the cost of accuracy around edges as it makes "
"them less sharp."
msgstr ""
"El marge de col·lisió de la forma. Això no s'utilitza a Godot Physics.\n"
"Els marges de col·lisió permeten que la detecció de col·lisions sigui més "
"eficient afegint una capa addicional al voltant de les formes. Els "
"algorismes de col·lisió són més cars quan els objectes se superposen més que "
"el seu marge, de manera que un valor més alt dels marges és millor per al "
"rendiment, a costa de la precisió al voltant de les vores, ja que els fa "
"menys nítids."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D shape that sweeps a region of space to detect [CollisionObject2D]s."
msgstr ""
"Una forma 2D que escombra una regió de l'espai per detectar "
"[CollisionObject2D]s."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"Shape casting allows to detect collision objects by sweeping its [member "
"shape] along the cast direction determined by [member target_position]. This "
"is similar to [RayCast2D], but it allows for sweeping a region of space, "
"rather than just a straight line. [ShapeCast2D] can detect multiple "
"collision objects. It is useful for things like wide laser beams or snapping "
"a simple shape to a floor.\n"
"Immediate collision overlaps can be done with the [member target_position] "
"set to [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] and by calling [method "
"force_shapecast_update] within the same physics frame. This helps to "
"overcome some limitations of [Area2D] when used as an instantaneous "
"detection area, as collision information isn't immediately available to it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Shape casting is more computationally expensive than ray "
"casting."
msgstr ""
"La fosa de formes permet detectar objectes de col·lisió escombrant el seu "
"[member shape] al llarg de la direcció de llançament determinada per [member "
"target_position]. Això és similar a [RayCast2D], però permet escombrar una "
"regió de l'espai, en lloc d'una línia recta. [ShapeCast2D] pot detectar "
"diversos objectes de col·lisió. És útil per a coses com ara raigs làser "
"amples o ajustar una forma senzilla a un terra.\n"
"Les superposicions de col·lisió immediates es poden fer amb [member "
"target_position] establert a [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] i trucant a [method "
"force_shapecast_update] dins del mateix marc físic. Això ajuda a superar "
"algunes limitacions de [Area2D] quan s'utilitza com a àrea de detecció "
"instantània, ja que la informació de col·lisió no està disponible "
"immediatament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La fosa de formes és més costosa computacionalment que la fosa "
"de raigs."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the shape does not report collisions with the "
"specified node."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una excepció de col·lisió perquè la forma no informi de col·lisions "
"amb el node especificat."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the shape does not report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una excepció de col·lisió perquè la forma no informi de col·lisions "
"amb el [RID] especificat."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid "Removes all collision exceptions for this shape."
msgstr "Elimina totes les excepcions de col·lisió per a aquesta forma."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the collision information for the shape immediately, without waiting "
"for the next [code]_physics_process[/code] call. Use this method, for "
"example, when the shape or its parent has changed state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member enabled] to [code]true[/code] is not required "
"for this to work."
msgstr ""
"Actualitza la informació de col·lisió de la forma immediatament, sense "
"esperar a la propera trucada [code]_physics_process[/code]. Utilitzeu aquest "
"mètode, per exemple, quan la forma o el seu pare ha canviat d'estat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No cal establir [member enabled] a [code]true[/code] perquè "
"això funcioni."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the fraction from this cast's origin to its [member target_position] "
"of how far the shape can move without triggering a collision, as a value "
"between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la fracció de l'origen d'aquest repartiment al seu [member "
"target_position] de fins a quin punt es pot moure la forma sense provocar "
"una col·lisió, com a valor entre [code]0.0[/code] i [code]1.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the fraction from this cast's origin to its [member target_position] "
"of how far the shape must move to trigger a collision, as a value between "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"In ideal conditions this would be the same as [method "
"get_closest_collision_safe_fraction], however shape casting is calculated in "
"discrete steps, so the precise point of collision can occur between two "
"calculated positions."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la fracció de l'origen d'aquest repartiment al seu [member "
"target_position] de fins a quin punt s'ha de moure la forma per desencadenar "
"una col·lisió, com a valor entre [code]@0.0[/code] i [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"En condicions ideals, això seria el mateix que [method "
"get_closest_collision_safe_fraction], però el modelat de forma es calcula en "
"passos discrets, de manera que el punt precís de col·lisió es pot produir "
"entre dues posicions calculades."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collided [Object] of one of the multiple collisions at [param "
"index], or [code]null[/code] if no object is intersecting the shape (i.e. "
"[method is_colliding] returns [code]false[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la [Object] col·lisionada d'una de les col·lisions múltiples a "
"[param index], o [code]null[/code] si no hi ha cap objecte que talla la "
"forma (és a dir, [method is_colliding] retorna [code]false[/code])."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the collided object of one of the multiple collisions "
"at [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [RID] de l'objecte col·lisionat d'una de les col·lisions "
"múltiples a [param index]."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the shape ID of the colliding shape of one of the multiple "
"collisions at [param index], or [code]0[/code] if no object is intersecting "
"the shape (i.e. [method is_colliding] returns [code]false[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of collisions detected at the point of impact. Use this to "
"iterate over multiple collisions as provided by [method get_collider], "
"[method get_collider_shape], [method get_collision_point], and [method "
"get_collision_normal] methods."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de col·lisions detectades en el punt d'impacte. Utilitzeu-ho per "
"iterar sobre diverses col·lisions tal com proporcionen els mètodes [method "
"get_collider], [method get_collider_shape], [method get_collision_point] i "
"[method get_collision_normal]."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the normal of one of the multiple collisions at [param index] of the "
"intersecting object."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la normal d'una de les col·lisions múltiples a [param index] de "
"l'objecte que s'interseca."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision point of one of the multiple collisions at [param "
"index] where the shape intersects the colliding object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This point is in the [b]global[/b] coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el punt de col·lisió d'una de les col·lisions múltiples a [param "
"index] on la forma talla l'objecte en col·lisió.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest punt es troba al sistema de coordenades [b]global[/b]."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether any object is intersecting with the shape's vector "
"(considering the vector length)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si algun objecte es talla amb el vector de la forma (tenint en "
"compte la longitud del vector)."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the shape does report collisions with the "
"specified node."
msgstr ""
"Elimina una excepció de col·lisió perquè la forma informi de col·lisions amb "
"el node especificat."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the shape does report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr ""
"Elimina una excepció de col·lisió perquè la forma informi de col·lisions amb "
"el [RID] especificat."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The shape's collision mask. Only objects in at least one collision layer "
"enabled in the mask will be detected. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"La màscara de col·lisió de la forma. Només es detectaran objectes d'almenys "
"una capa de col·lisió activada a la màscara. Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes "
"i màscares de col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the complete collision information from the collision sweep. The "
"data returned is the same as in the [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D.get_rest_info] method."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la informació completa de la col·lisió de l'escombrat de col·lisió. "
"Les dades retornades són les mateixes que en el mètode [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D.get_rest_info]."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the parent node will be excluded from collision "
"detection."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el node pare quedarà exclòs de la detecció de "
"col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The collision margin for the shape. A larger margin helps detecting "
"collisions more consistently, at the cost of precision."
msgstr ""
"El marge de col·lisió de la forma. Un marge més gran ajuda a detectar les "
"col·lisions de manera més coherent, a costa de la precisió."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of intersections can be limited with this parameter, to reduce "
"the processing time."
msgstr ""
"El nombre d'interseccions es pot limitar amb aquest paràmetre, per reduir el "
"temps de processament."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid "The shape to be used for collision queries."
msgstr "La forma que s'utilitzarà per a les consultes de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast2D.xml
msgid ""
"The shape's destination point, relative to this node's [member "
"Node2D.position]."
msgstr ""
"El punt de destinació de la forma, en relació amb el [member "
"Node2D.position] d'aquest node."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D shape that sweeps a region of space to detect [CollisionObject3D]s."
msgstr ""
"Una forma 3D que escombra una regió de l'espai per detectar "
"[CollisionObject3D]s."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Shape casting allows to detect collision objects by sweeping its [member "
"shape] along the cast direction determined by [member target_position]. This "
"is similar to [RayCast3D], but it allows for sweeping a region of space, "
"rather than just a straight line. [ShapeCast3D] can detect multiple "
"collision objects. It is useful for things like wide laser beams or snapping "
"a simple shape to a floor.\n"
"Immediate collision overlaps can be done with the [member target_position] "
"set to [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] and by calling [method "
"force_shapecast_update] within the same physics frame. This helps to "
"overcome some limitations of [Area3D] when used as an instantaneous "
"detection area, as collision information isn't immediately available to it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Shape casting is more computationally expensive than ray "
"casting."
msgstr ""
"La fosa de formes permet detectar objectes de col·lisió escombrant el seu "
"[member shape] al llarg de la direcció de llançament determinada per [member "
"target_position]. Això és similar a [RayCast3D], però permet escombrar una "
"regió de l'espai, en lloc d'una línia recta. [ShapeCast3D] pot detectar "
"diversos objectes de col·lisió. És útil per a coses com ara raigs làser "
"amples o ajustar una forma senzilla a un terra.\n"
"Les superposicions de col·lisió immediates es poden fer amb [member "
"target_position] establert a [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] i trucant a "
"[method force_shapecast_update] dins del mateix marc físic. Això ajuda a "
"superar algunes limitacions de [Area3D] quan s'utilitza com a àrea de "
"detecció instantània, ja que la informació de col·lisió no està disponible "
"immediatament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La fosa de formes és més costosa computacionalment que la fosa "
"de raigs."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the complete collision information from the collision sweep. The "
"data returned is the same as in the [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info] method."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la informació completa de la col·lisió de l'escombrat de col·lisió. "
"Les dades retornades són les mateixes que en el mètode [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info]."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The custom color to use to draw the shape in the editor and at run-time if "
"[b]Visible Collision Shapes[/b] is enabled in the [b]Debug[/b] menu. This "
"color will be highlighted at run-time if the [ShapeCast3D] is colliding with "
"something.\n"
"If set to [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (by default), the color set in "
"[member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/collision/shape_color] is used."
msgstr ""
"El color personalitzat que cal utilitzar per dibuixar la forma a l'editor i "
"en temps d'execució si [b]Formes de col·lisió visibles[/b] està habilitat al "
"menú [b]Debug[/b]. Aquest color es ressaltarà en temps d'execució si "
"[ShapeCast3D] xoca amb alguna cosa.\n"
"Si s'estableix en [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (per defecte), "
"s'utilitzarà el color establert a [member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/"
"collision/shape_color]."

#: doc/classes/ShapeCast3D.xml
msgid ""
"The shape's destination point, relative to this node's [member "
"Node3D.position]."
msgstr ""
"El punt de destinació de la forma, en relació amb el [member "
"Node3D.position] d'aquest node."

#: doc/classes/Shortcut.xml
msgid "A shortcut for binding input."
msgstr "Una drecera per a l'entrada d'enllaç."

#: doc/classes/Shortcut.xml
msgid ""
"Shortcuts (also known as hotkeys) are containers of [InputEvent] resources. "
"They are commonly used to interact with a [Control] element from an "
"[InputEvent].\n"
"One shortcut can contain multiple [InputEvent] resources, making it possible "
"to trigger one action with multiple different inputs.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Capture the [kbd]Ctrl + S[/kbd] shortcut using a [Shortcut] "
"resource:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var save_shortcut = Shortcut.new()\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar key_event = InputEventKey.new()\n"
"\tkey_event.keycode = KEY_S\n"
"\tkey_event.ctrl_pressed = true\n"
"\tkey_event.command_or_control_autoremap = true # Swaps Ctrl for Command on "
"Mac.\n"
"\tsave_shortcut.events = [key_event]\n"
"\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif save_shortcut.matches_event(event) and event.is_pressed() and not "
"event.is_echo():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Save shortcut pressed!\")\n"
"\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate readonly Shortcut _saveShortcut = new Shortcut();\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInputEventKey keyEvent = new InputEventKey\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tKeycode = Key.S,\n"
"\t\t\tCtrlPressed = true,\n"
"\t\t\tCommandOrControlAutoremap = true, // Swaps Ctrl for Command on Mac.\n"
"\t\t};\n"
"\n"
"\t\t_saveShortcut.Events = [keyEvent];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (@event is InputEventKey keyEvent &&\n"
"\t\t\t_saveShortcut.MatchesEvent(@event) &&\n"
"\t\t\tkeyEvent.Pressed && !keyEvent.Echo)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Save shortcut pressed!\");\n"
"\t\t\tGetViewport().SetInputAsHandled();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Les dreceres (també conegudes com a tecles d'accés directe) són contenidors "
"de recursos [InputEvent]. S'utilitzen habitualment per interactuar amb un "
"element [Control] d'un [InputEvent].\n"
"Una drecera pot contenir diversos recursos [InputEvent], cosa que permet "
"activar una acció amb diverses entrades diferents.\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] Captura la drecera [kbd]Ctrl + S[/kbd] amb un recurs "
"[Shortcut]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"amplia el Node\n"
"\n"
"var save_shortcut = Shortcut.new()\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tvar key_event = InputEventKey.new()\n"
"\tkey_event.keycode = KEY_S\n"
"\tkey_event.ctrl_pressed = cert\n"
"\tkey_event.command_or_control_autoremap = true # Canvia Ctrl per Command al "
"Mac.\n"
"\tsave_shortcut.events = [key_event]\n"
"\n"
"func _entrada(esdeveniment):\n"
"\tsi save_shortcut.matches_event(esdeveniment) i event.is_pressed() i no "
"event.is_echo():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Desa la drecera premuda!\")\n"
"\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"utilitzant Godot;\n"
"\n"
"classe parcial pública MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tDrecera privada de només lectura _saveShortcut = drecera nova ();\n"
"\n"
"\tanul·lació pública void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInputEventKey keyEvent = nova InputEventKey\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tCodi clau = Key.S,\n"
"\t\t\tCtrlPressed = cert,\n"
"\t\t\tCommandOrControlAutoremap = true, // Canvia Ctrl per Command a Mac.\n"
"\t\t};\n"
"\n"
"\t\t_saveShortcut.Events = [keyEvent];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tanul·lació pública void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tsi (@esdeveniment és InputEventKey keyEvent &&\n"
"\t\t\t_saveShortcut.MatchesEvent(@event) &&\n"
"\t\t\tkeyEvent.Pressed && !keyEvent.Echo)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Desa la drecera premuda!\");\n"
"\t\t\tGetViewport().SetInputAsHandled();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Shortcut.xml
msgid "Returns the shortcut's first valid [InputEvent] as a [String]."
msgstr "Retorna el primer [InputEvent] vàlid de la drecera com a [String]."

#: doc/classes/Shortcut.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether [member events] contains an [InputEvent] which is valid."
msgstr "Retorna si [member events] conté un [InputEvent] que és vàlid."

#: doc/classes/Shortcut.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether any [InputEvent] in [member events] equals [param event]. "
"This uses [method InputEvent.is_match] to compare events."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si qualsevol [InputEvent] a [member events] és igual a [param "
"event]. Això utilitza [method InputEvent.is_match] per comparar "
"esdeveniments."

#: doc/classes/Shortcut.xml
msgid ""
"The shortcut's [InputEvent] array.\n"
"Generally the [InputEvent] used is an [InputEventKey], though it can be any "
"[InputEvent], including an [InputEventAction]."
msgstr ""
"La matriu [InputEvent] de la drecera.\n"
"Generalment, el [InputEvent] utilitzat és un [InputEventKey], encara que pot "
"ser qualsevol [InputEvent], inclòs un [InputEventAction]."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid "A built-in type representing a signal of an [Object]."
msgstr "Un tipus integrat que representa un senyal d'un [Object]."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"[Signal] is a built-in [Variant] type that represents a signal of an "
"[Object] instance. Like all [Variant] types, it can be stored in variables "
"and passed to functions. Signals allow all connected [Callable]s (and by "
"extension their respective objects) to listen and react to events, without "
"directly referencing one another. This keeps the code flexible and easier to "
"manage. You can check whether an [Object] has a given signal name using "
"[method Object.has_signal].\n"
"In GDScript, signals can be declared with the [code]signal[/code] keyword. "
"In C#, you may use the [code][Signal][/code] attribute on a delegate.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"signal attacked\n"
"\n"
"# Additional arguments may be declared.\n"
"# These arguments must be passed when the signal is emitted.\n"
"signal item_dropped(item_name, amount)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Signal]\n"
"delegate void AttackedEventHandler();\n"
"\n"
"// Additional arguments may be declared.\n"
"// These arguments must be passed when the signal is emitted.\n"
"[Signal]\n"
"delegate void ItemDroppedEventHandler(string itemName, int amount);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Connecting signals is one of the most common operations in Godot and the API "
"gives many options to do so, which are described further down. The code "
"block below shows the recommended approach.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar button = Button.new()\n"
"\t# `button_down` here is a Signal Variant type. We therefore call the "
"Signal.connect() method, not Object.connect().\n"
"\t# See discussion below for a more in-depth overview of the API.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(_on_button_down)\n"
"\n"
"\t# This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `hit` "
"signal.\n"
"\tvar player = Player.new()\n"
"\t# We use Signal.connect() again, and we also use the Callable.bind() "
"method,\n"
"\t# which returns a new Callable with the parameter binds.\n"
"\tplayer.hit.connect(_on_player_hit.bind(\"sword\", 100))\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_down():\n"
"\tprint(\"Button down!\")\n"
"\n"
"func _on_player_hit(weapon_type, damage):\n"
"\tprint(\"Hit with weapon %s for %d damage.\" % [weapon_type, damage])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar button = new Button();\n"
"\t// C# supports passing signals as events, so we can use this idiomatic "
"construct:\n"
"\tbutton.ButtonDown += OnButtonDown;\n"
"\n"
"\t// This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `Hit` "
"signal.\n"
"\tvar player = new Player();\n"
"\t// We can use lambdas when we need to bind additional parameters.\n"
"\tplayer.Hit += () => OnPlayerHit(\"sword\", 100);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnButtonDown()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Button down!\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnPlayerHit(string weaponType, int damage)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Hit with weapon {weaponType} for {damage} damage.\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[code skip-lint]Object.connect()[/code] [b]or[/b] [code skip-"
"lint]Signal.connect()[/code][b]?[/b]\n"
"As seen above, the recommended method to connect signals is not [method "
"Object.connect]. The code block below shows the four options for connecting "
"signals, using either this legacy method or the recommended [method "
"Signal.connect], and using either an implicit [Callable] or a manually "
"defined one.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar button = Button.new()\n"
"\t# Option 1: Object.connect() with an implicit Callable for the defined "
"function.\n"
"\tbutton.connect(\"button_down\", _on_button_down)\n"
"\t# Option 2: Object.connect() with a constructed Callable using a target "
"object and method name.\n"
"\tbutton.connect(\"button_down\", Callable(self, \"_on_button_down\"))\n"
"\t# Option 3: Signal.connect() with an implicit Callable for the defined "
"function.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(_on_button_down)\n"
"\t# Option 4: Signal.connect() with a constructed Callable using a target "
"object and method name.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(Callable(self, \"_on_button_down\"))\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_down():\n"
"\tprint(\"Button down!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar button = new Button();\n"
"\t// Option 1: In C#, we can use signals as events and connect with this "
"idiomatic syntax:\n"
"\tbutton.ButtonDown += OnButtonDown;\n"
"\t// Option 2: GodotObject.Connect() with a constructed Callable from a "
"method group.\n"
"\tbutton.Connect(Button.SignalName.ButtonDown, "
"Callable.From(OnButtonDown));\n"
"\t// Option 3: GodotObject.Connect() with a constructed Callable using a "
"target object and method name.\n"
"\tbutton.Connect(Button.SignalName.ButtonDown, new Callable(this, "
"MethodName.OnButtonDown));\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnButtonDown()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Button down!\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"While all options have the same outcome ([code]button[/code]'s [signal "
"BaseButton.button_down] signal will be connected to [code]_on_button_down[/"
"code]), [b]option 3[/b] offers the best validation: it will print a compile-"
"time error if either the [code]button_down[/code] [Signal] or the "
"[code]_on_button_down[/code] [Callable] are not defined. On the other hand, "
"[b]option 2[/b] only relies on string names and will only be able to "
"validate either names at runtime: it will generate an error at runtime if "
"[code]\"button_down\"[/code] is not a signal, or if [code]"
"\"_on_button_down\"[/code] is not a method in the object [code]self[/code]. "
"The main reason for using options 1, 2, or 4 would be if you actually need "
"to use strings (e.g. to connect signals programmatically based on strings "
"read from a configuration file). Otherwise, option 3 is the recommended (and "
"fastest) method.\n"
"[b]Binding and passing parameters:[/b]\n"
"The syntax to bind parameters is through [method Callable.bind], which "
"returns a copy of the [Callable] with its parameters bound.\n"
"When calling [method emit] or [method Object.emit_signal], the signal "
"parameters can be also passed. The examples below show the relationship "
"between these signal parameters and bound parameters.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `hit` "
"signal.\n"
"\tvar player = Player.new()\n"
"\t# Using Callable.bind().\n"
"\tplayer.hit.connect(_on_player_hit.bind(\"sword\", 100))\n"
"\n"
"\t# Parameters added when emitting the signal are passed first.\n"
"\tplayer.hit.emit(\"Dark lord\", 5)\n"
"\n"
"# We pass two arguments when emitting (`hit_by`, `level`),\n"
"# and bind two more arguments when connecting (`weapon_type`, `damage`).\n"
"func _on_player_hit(hit_by, level, weapon_type, damage):\n"
"\tprint(\"Hit by %s (level %d) with weapon %s for %d damage.\" % [hit_by, "
"level, weapon_type, damage])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `Hit` "
"signal.\n"
"\tvar player = new Player();\n"
"\t// Using lambda expressions that create a closure that captures the "
"additional parameters.\n"
"\t// The lambda only receives the parameters defined by the signal's "
"delegate.\n"
"\tplayer.Hit += (hitBy, level) => OnPlayerHit(hitBy, level, \"sword\", "
"100);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Parameters added when emitting the signal are passed first.\n"
"\tplayer.EmitSignal(SignalName.Hit, \"Dark lord\", 5);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// We pass two arguments when emitting (`hit_by`, `level`),\n"
"// and bind two more arguments when connecting (`weapon_type`, `damage`).\n"
"private void OnPlayerHit(string hitBy, int level, string weaponType, int "
"damage)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Hit by {hitBy} (level {level}) with weapon {weaponType} for "
"{damage} damage.\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a signal will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's null (see [method is_null]). Otherwise, a signal will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid "Using Signals"
msgstr "Ús dels senyals"

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid "GDScript Basics"
msgstr "Conceptes bàsics de GDScript"

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid "Constructs an empty [Signal] with no object nor signal name bound."
msgstr "Construeix un [Signal] buit sense cap objecte ni nom de senyal lligat."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Signal] as a copy of the given [Signal]."
msgstr "Construeix un [Signal] com a còpia del [Signal] donat."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a [Signal] object referencing a signal named [param signal] in the "
"specified [param object]."
msgstr ""
"Crea un objecte [Signal] que fa referència a un senyal anomenat [param "
"signal] al [param object] especificat."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Connects this signal to the specified [param callable]. Optional [param "
"flags] can be also added to configure the connection's behavior (see [enum "
"Object.ConnectFlags] constants). You can provide additional arguments to the "
"connected [param callable] by using [method Callable.bind].\n"
"A signal can only be connected once to the same [Callable]. If the signal is "
"already connected, this method returns [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] and "
"generates an error, unless the signal is connected with [constant "
"Object.CONNECT_REFERENCE_COUNTED]. To prevent this, use [method "
"is_connected] first to check for existing connections.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for button in $Buttons.get_children():\n"
"\tbutton.pressed.connect(_on_pressed.bind(button))\n"
"\n"
"func _on_pressed(button):\n"
"\tprint(button.name, \" was pressed\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the [param callable]'s object is freed, the connection will "
"be lost."
msgstr ""
"Connecta aquest senyal al [param callable] especificat. També es pot afegir "
"[param flags] opcional per configurar el comportament de la connexió (vegeu "
"les constants [enum Object.ConnectFlags]). Podeu proporcionar arguments "
"addicionals al [param callable] connectat mitjançant [method "
"Callable.bind].\n"
"Un senyal només es pot connectar una vegada al mateix [Callable]. Si el "
"senyal ja està connectat, aquest mètode retorna [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] i genera un error, tret que el senyal estigui "
"connectat amb [constant Object.CONNECT_REFERENCE_COUNTED]. Per evitar-ho, "
"utilitzeu primer [method is_connected] per comprovar si hi ha connexions "
"existents.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"botó per a $Buttons.get_children():\n"
"\tbutton.pressed.connect(_on_pressed.bind(botó))\n"
"\n"
"func _on_prem(botó):\n"
"\tprint(button.name, \" s'ha premut\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si s'allibera l'objecte de [param callable], es perdrà la "
"connexió."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Disconnects this signal from the specified [Callable]. If the connection "
"does not exist, generates an error. Use [method is_connected] to make sure "
"that the connection exists."
msgstr ""
"Desconnecta aquest senyal del [Callable] especificat. Si la connexió no "
"existeix, genera un error. Utilitzeu [method is_connected] per assegurar-vos "
"que la connexió existeix."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Emits this signal. All [Callable]s connected to this signal will be "
"triggered. This method supports a variable number of arguments, so "
"parameters can be passed as a comma separated list."
msgstr ""
"Emet aquest senyal. S'activaran tots els [Callable]s connectats a aquest "
"senyal. Aquest mètode admet un nombre variable d'arguments, de manera que "
"els paràmetres es poden passar com una llista separada per comes."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of connections for this signal. Each connection is "
"represented as a [Dictionary] that contains three entries:\n"
"- [code]signal[/code] is a reference to this signal;\n"
"- [code]callable[/code] is a reference to the connected [Callable];\n"
"- [code]flags[/code] is a combination of [enum Object.ConnectFlags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Array] de connexions per a aquest senyal. Cada connexió es "
"representa com a [Dictionary] que conté tres entrades:\n"
"- [code]signal[/code] és una referència a aquest senyal;\n"
"- [code]callable[/code] és una referència al [Callable] connectat;\n"
"- [code]flags[/code] és una combinació de [enum Object.ConnectFlags]."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid "Returns the name of this signal."
msgstr "Retorna el nom d'aquest senyal."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid "Returns the object emitting this signal."
msgstr "Retorna l'objecte que emet aquest senyal."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the object emitting this signal (see [method "
"Object.get_instance_id])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'ID de l'objecte que emet aquest senyal (vegeu [method "
"Object.get_instance_id])."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if any [Callable] is connected to this signal."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [Callable] is connected to this "
"signal."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el [Callable] especificat està connectat a "
"aquest senyal."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Signal] has no object and the signal name "
"is empty. Equivalent to [code]signal == Signal()[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the signals do not share the same object and "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els senyals no comparteixen el mateix objecte i "
"nom."

#: doc/classes/Signal.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both signals share the same object and name."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si tots dos senyals comparteixen el mateix objecte "
"i nom."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"The parent of a hierarchy of [Bone2D]s, used to create a 2D skeletal "
"animation."
msgstr ""
"El pare d'una jerarquia de [Bone2D]s, que s'utilitza per crear una animació "
"d'esquelet en 2D."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"[Skeleton2D] parents a hierarchy of [Bone2D] nodes. It holds a reference to "
"each [Bone2D]'s rest pose and acts as a single point of access to its "
"bones.\n"
"To set up different types of inverse kinematics for the given Skeleton2D, a "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D] should be created. The inverse kinematics be "
"applied by increasing [member "
"SkeletonModificationStack2D.modification_count] and creating the desired "
"number of modifications."
msgstr ""
"[Skeleton2D] pares una jerarquia de nodes [Bone2D]. Conté una referència a "
"la postura de descans de cada [Bone2D] i actua com un únic punt d'accés als "
"seus ossos.\n"
"Per configurar diferents tipus de cinemàtica inversa per a l'Skeleton2D "
"donat, s'hauria de crear un [SkeletonModificationStack2D]. La cinemàtica "
"inversa s'aplica augmentant [member "
"SkeletonModificationStack2D.modification_count] i creant el nombre desitjat "
"de modificacions."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid "2D skeletons"
msgstr "Esquelets 2D"

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"Executes all the modifications on the [SkeletonModificationStack2D], if the "
"Skeleton2D has one assigned."
msgstr ""
"Executa totes les modificacions a [SkeletonModificationStack2D], si "
"l'Skeleton2D en té una assignada."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Bone2D] from the node hierarchy parented by Skeleton2D. The "
"object to return is identified by the parameter [param idx]. Bones are "
"indexed by descending the node hierarchy from top to bottom, adding the "
"children of each branch before moving to the next sibling."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Bone2D] de la jerarquia de nodes creada per Skeleton2D. "
"L'objecte a retornar s'identifica amb el paràmetre [param idx]. Els ossos "
"s'indexen baixant la jerarquia de nodes de dalt a baix, afegint els fills de "
"cada branca abans de passar al següent germà."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of [Bone2D] nodes in the node hierarchy parented by "
"Skeleton2D."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de nodes [Bone2D] a la jerarquia de nodes creada per "
"Skeleton2D."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid "Returns the local pose override transform for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la transformació de substitució de la posició local per a [param "
"bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] attached to this skeleton, if one "
"exists."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [SkeletonModificationStack2D] adjunt a aquest esquelet, si n'hi "
"ha."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid "Returns the [RID] of a Skeleton2D instance."
msgstr "Retorna el [RID] d'una instància de Skeleton2D."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the local pose transform, [param override_pose], for the bone at [param "
"bone_idx].\n"
"[param strength] is the interpolation strength that will be used when "
"applying the pose, and [param persistent] determines if the applied pose "
"will remain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The pose transform needs to be a local transform relative to "
"the [Bone2D] node at [param bone_idx]!"
msgstr ""
"Estableix la transformació de posició local, [param override_pose], per a "
"l'os a [param bone_idx].\n"
"[param strength] és la força d'interpolació que s'utilitzarà en aplicar la "
"postura, i [param persistent] determina si la postura aplicada es "
"mantindrà.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La transformació de pose ha de ser una transformació local "
"relativa al node [Bone2D] a [param bone_idx]!"

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid "Sets the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] attached to this skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el [SkeletonModificationStack2D] connectat a aquest esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton2D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the [Bone2D] setup attached to this skeletons changes. This is "
"primarily used internally within the skeleton."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan canvia la configuració [Bone2D] adjunta a aquest esquelet. Això "
"s'utilitza principalment a l'interior de l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node containing a bone hierarchy, used to create a 3D skeletal animation."
msgstr ""
"Un node que conté una jerarquia òssia, que s'utilitza per crear una animació "
"esquelètica en 3D."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"[Skeleton3D] provides an interface for managing a hierarchy of bones, "
"including pose, rest and animation (see [Animation]). It can also use "
"ragdoll physics.\n"
"The overall transform of a bone with respect to the skeleton is determined "
"by bone pose. Bone rest defines the initial transform of the bone pose.\n"
"Note that \"global pose\" below refers to the overall transform of the bone "
"with respect to skeleton, so it is not the actual global/world transform of "
"the bone."
msgstr ""
"[Skeleton3D] proporciona una interfície per gestionar una jerarquia d'ossos, "
"inclosa la postura, el descans i l'animació (vegeu [Animation]). També pot "
"utilitzar la física de ragdoll.\n"
"La transformació global d'un os respecte a l'esquelet està determinada per "
"la postura òssia. El repòs ossi defineix la transformació inicial de la "
"postura òssia.\n"
"Tingueu en compte que la \"posició global\" a continuació es refereix a la "
"transformació global de l'os respecte a l'esquelet, de manera que no és la "
"transformació global/mundial real de l'os."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new bone with the given name. Returns the new bone's index, or "
"[code]-1[/code] if this method fails.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Bone names should be unique, non empty, and cannot include the "
"[code]:[/code] and [code]/[/code] characters."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un os nou amb el nom donat. Retorna l'índex de l'os nou, o [code]-1[/"
"code] si aquest mètode falla.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els noms dels ossos han de ser únics, no buits i no poden "
"incloure els caràcters [code]:[/code] i [code]/[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Manually advance the child [SkeletonModifier3D]s by the specified time (in "
"seconds).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param delta] is temporarily accumulated in the "
"[Skeleton3D], and the deferred process uses the accumulated value to process "
"the modification."
msgstr ""
"Avança manualment el nen [SkeletonModifier3D]s en el temps especificat (en "
"segons).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El [param delta] s'acumula temporalment al [Skeleton3D] i el "
"procés ajornat utilitza el valor acumulat per processar la modificació."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Clear all the bones in this skeleton."
msgstr "Netegeu tots els ossos d'aquest esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Removes the global pose override on all bones in the skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Elimina la substitució de la posició global de tots els ossos de l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the bone index that matches [param name] as its name. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if no bone with this name exists."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Force updates the bone transforms/poses for all bones in the skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Force actualitza les transformacions/poses òssies de tots els ossos de "
"l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Force updates the bone transform for the bone at [param bone_idx] and all of "
"its children."
msgstr ""
"Force actualitza la transformació òssia per a l'os a [param bone_idx] i tots "
"els seus fills."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the bone indexes of all the child node of the "
"passed in bone, [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Returns the number of bones in the skeleton."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre d'ossos de l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the overall transform of the specified bone, with respect to the "
"skeleton. Being relative to the skeleton frame, this is not the actual "
"\"global\" transform of the bone.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is the global pose you set to the skeleton in the process, "
"the final global pose can get overridden by modifiers in the deferred "
"process, if you want to access the final global pose, use [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la transformació global de l'os especificat, respecte a l'esquelet. "
"En relació amb el marc de l'esquelet, aquesta no és la transformació "
"\"global\" real de l'os.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta és la posició global que heu definit a l'esquelet en el "
"procés, la posició global final es pot substituir per modificadors en el "
"procés diferit, si voleu accedir a la posició global final, utilitzeu "
"[signal SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the overall transform of the specified bone, with respect to the "
"skeleton, but without any global pose overrides. Being relative to the "
"skeleton frame, this is not the actual \"global\" transform of the bone."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la transformació global de l'os especificat, respecte a l'esquelet, "
"però sense cap substitució global de la posició. En relació amb el marc de "
"l'esquelet, aquesta no és la transformació \"global\" real de l'os."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Returns the global pose override transform for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la transformació de substitució de la posició global per a [param "
"bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Returns the global rest transform for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna la transformació de repòs global per a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the metadata with the given [param key] for the bone at index [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the list of all metadata keys for the bone at index [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Returns the name of the bone at index [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el nom de l'os a l'índex [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the bone index which is the parent of the bone at [param bone_idx]. "
"If -1, then bone has no parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The parent bone returned will always be less than [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex d'os que és el pare de l'os a [param bone_idx]. Si -1, l'os "
"no té cap pare.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'os del pare retornat sempre serà inferior a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the pose transform of the specified bone.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is the pose you set to the skeleton in the process, the "
"final pose can get overridden by modifiers in the deferred process, if you "
"want to access the final pose, use [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la transformació de postura de l'os especificat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta és la postura que heu establert a l'esquelet en el "
"procés, la postura final es pot substituir per modificadors en el procés "
"diferit, si voleu accedir a la postura final, feu servir [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the pose position of the bone at [param bone_idx]. The returned "
"[Vector3] is in the local coordinate space of the [Skeleton3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició de la postura de l'os a [param bone_idx]. El [Vector3] "
"retornat es troba a l'espai de coordenades locals del node [Skeleton3D]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the pose rotation of the bone at [param bone_idx]. The returned "
"[Quaternion] is local to the bone with respect to the rotation of any parent "
"bones."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la rotació de la postura de l'os a [param bone_idx]. El [Quaternion] "
"retornat és local a l'os respecte a la rotació de qualsevol ossos pare."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Returns the pose scale of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna l'escala de la postura de l'os a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Returns the rest transform for a bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna la resta de transformació d'un os [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all bone names concatenated with commas ([code],[/code]) as a single "
"[StringName].\n"
"It is useful to set it as a hint for the enum property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna tots els noms d'os concatenats amb comes ([code],[/code]) com un sol "
"[StringName].\n"
"És útil establir-lo com a pista per a la propietat enum."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array with all of the bones that are parentless. Another way to "
"look at this is that it returns the indexes of all the bones that are not "
"dependent or modified by other bones in the Skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu amb tots els ossos que no tenen pares. Una altra manera "
"de veure-ho és que retorna els índexs de tots els ossos que no depenen ni "
"modifiquen altres ossos de l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of times the bone hierarchy has changed within this "
"skeleton, including renames.\n"
"The Skeleton version is not serialized: only use within a single instance of "
"Skeleton3D.\n"
"Use for invalidating caches in IK solvers and other nodes which process "
"bones."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de vegades que la jerarquia òssia ha canviat dins d'aquest "
"esquelet, inclosos els canvis de nom.\n"
"La versió Skeleton no està serialitzada: només s'utilitza dins d'una única "
"instància de Skeleton3D.\n"
"S'utilitza per invalidar les memòries cau en solucionadors IK i altres nodes "
"que processen els ossos."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the bone at index [param bone_idx] has metadata "
"with the given [param key]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the bone pose for the bone at [param bone_idx] is enabled."
msgstr "Retorna si la postura de l'os a [param bone_idx] està activada."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Returns all bones in the skeleton to their rest poses."
msgstr "Retorna tots els ossos de l'esquelet a les seves posicions de repòs."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Binds the given Skin to the Skeleton."
msgstr "Uneix la pell donada a l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Sets the bone pose to rest for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix la postura de l'os per a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Sets all bone poses to rests."
msgstr "Estableix totes les posicions òssies en repòs."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Disables the pose for the bone at [param bone_idx] if [code]false[/code], "
"enables the bone pose if [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Desactiva la postura de l'os a [param bone_idx] si [code]false[/code], "
"activa la postura de l'os si [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the global pose transform, [param pose], for the bone at [param "
"bone_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If other bone poses have been changed, this method executes a "
"dirty poses recalculation and will cause performance to deteriorate. If you "
"know that multiple global poses will be applied, consider using [method "
"set_bone_pose] with precalculation."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la transformació global de la postura, [param pose], per a l'os a "
"[param bone_idx].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si s'han canviat altres posicions òssies, aquest mètode executa "
"un recàlcul de posicions brutes i farà que el rendiment es deteriori. Si "
"sabeu que s'aplicaran diverses posicions globals, penseu a utilitzar [method "
"set_bone_pose] amb precàlcul."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the global pose transform, [param pose], for the bone at [param "
"bone_idx].\n"
"[param amount] is the interpolation strength that will be used when applying "
"the pose, and [param persistent] determines if the applied pose will "
"remain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The pose transform needs to be a global pose! To convert a "
"world transform from a [Node3D] to a global bone pose, multiply the [method "
"Transform3D.affine_inverse] of the node's [member Node3D.global_transform] "
"by the desired world transform."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la transformació global de la postura, [param pose], per a l'os a "
"[param bone_idx].\n"
"[param amount] és la força d'interpolació que s'utilitzarà en aplicar la "
"postura, i [param persistent] determina si la postura aplicada es "
"mantindrà.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La transformació de la postura ha de ser una postura global! "
"Per convertir una transformació del món d'una [Node3D] a una posició òssia "
"global, multipliqueu la [method Transform3D.affine_inverse] de la [member "
"Node3D.global_transform] del node per la transformació del món desitjada."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sets the metadata with the given [param key] to [param value] for the bone "
"at index [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Sets the bone name, [param name], for the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix el nom de l'os, [param name], per a l'os a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the bone index [param parent_idx] as the parent of the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]. If -1, then bone has no parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param parent_idx] must be less than [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'índex d'os [param parent_idx] com a pare de l'os a [param "
"bone_idx]. Si -1, l'os no té cap pare.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param parent_idx] ha de ser inferior a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sets the pose transform, [param pose], for the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the pose position of the bone at [param bone_idx] to [param position]. "
"[param position] is a [Vector3] describing a position local to the "
"[Skeleton3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la posició de la postura de l'os a [param bone_idx] a [param "
"position]. [param position] és un [Vector3] que descriu una posició local al "
"node [Skeleton3D]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the pose rotation of the bone at [param bone_idx] to [param rotation]. "
"[param rotation] is a [Quaternion] describing a rotation in the bone's local "
"coordinate space with respect to the rotation of any parent bones."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la rotació de la postura de l'os a [param bone_idx] a [param "
"rotation]. [param rotation] és un [Quaternion] que descriu una rotació a "
"l'espai de coordenades locals de l'os respecte a la rotació de qualsevol "
"ossos pare."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sets the pose scale of the bone at [param bone_idx] to [param scale]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Sets the rest transform for bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix la transformació de resta per a l'os [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Unparents the bone at [param bone_idx] and sets its rest position to that of "
"its parent prior to being reset."
msgstr ""
"Elimina l'os a [param bone_idx] i estableix la seva posició de repòs a la "
"del seu pare abans de restablir-lo."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"If you follow the recommended workflow and explicitly have "
"[PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] as a child of [Skeleton3D], you can control "
"whether it is affected by raycasting without running [method "
"physical_bones_start_simulation], by its [member "
"SkeletonModifier3D.active].\n"
"However, for old (deprecated) configurations, [Skeleton3D] has an internal "
"virtual [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] for compatibility. This property controls "
"the internal virtual [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D]'s [member "
"SkeletonModifier3D.active]."
msgstr ""
"Si seguiu el flux de treball recomanat i teniu explícitament "
"[PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] com a fill de [Skeleton3D], podeu controlar si es "
"veu afectat pel raycasting sense executar [method "
"physical_bones_start_simulation], mitjançant el seu [member "
"SkeletonModifier3D.active].\n"
"Tanmateix, per a configuracions antigues (obsoletes), [Skeleton3D] té un "
"[PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] virtual intern per a la compatibilitat. Aquesta "
"propietat controla el [member SkeletonModifier3D.active] virtual intern de "
"[PhysicalBoneSimulator3D]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Sets the processing timing for the Modifier."
msgstr "Estableix el moment de processament del modificador."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies the 3D position track animation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unless this value is [code]1.0[/code], the key value in "
"animation will not match the actual position value."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica l'animació de la pista de posició en 3D.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Tret que aquest valor sigui [code]1.0[/code], el valor de la "
"clau de l'animació no coincidirà amb el valor de la posició real."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces the bones in their default rest pose, "
"regardless of their values. In the editor, this also prevents the bones from "
"being edited."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], força els ossos en la seva posició de repòs "
"predeterminada, independentment dels seus valors. A l'editor, això també "
"evita que els ossos siguin editats."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the bone at [param bone_idx] is toggled with [method "
"set_bone_enabled]. Use [method is_bone_enabled] to check the new value."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'os a [param bone_idx] es canvia amb [method set_bone_enabled]. "
"Utilitzeu [method is_bone_enabled] per comprovar el valor nou."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the list of bones changes, such as when calling [method "
"add_bone], [method set_bone_parent], [method unparent_bone_and_rest], or "
"[method clear_bones]."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan la llista d'ossos canvia, com ara quan es truca a [method "
"add_bone], [method set_bone_parent], [method unparent_bone_and_rest] o "
"[method clear_bones]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the pose is updated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] During the update process, this signal is not fired, so "
"modification by [SkeletonModifier3D] is not detected."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan s'actualitza la postura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Durant el procés d'actualització, aquest senyal no s'activa, de "
"manera que no es detecta cap modificació per part de [SkeletonModifier3D]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when the rest is updated."
msgstr "S'emet quan s'actualitza el repòs."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when the value of [member show_rest_only] changes."
msgstr "S'emet quan el valor de [member show_rest_only] canvia."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the final pose has been calculated will be applied to the skin "
"in the update process.\n"
"This means that all [SkeletonModifier3D] processing is complete. In order to "
"detect the completion of the processing of each [SkeletonModifier3D], use "
"[signal SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."
msgstr ""
"L'emissió quan s'ha calculat la postura final s'aplicarà a la pell en el "
"procés d'actualització.\n"
"Això vol dir que tot el processament [SkeletonModifier3D] s'ha completat. "
"Per detectar la finalització del processament de cada [SkeletonModifier3D], "
"utilitzeu [signal SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when this skeleton's pose needs to be updated. In that "
"case, this is called only once per frame in a deferred process."
msgstr ""
"S'ha rebut una notificació quan cal actualitzar la postura d'aquest "
"esquelet. En aquest cas, només s'anomena una vegada per fotograma en un "
"procés diferit."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set a flag to process modification during physics frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"Estableix una marca per processar la modificació durant els fotogrames de la "
"física (vegeu [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set a flag to process modification during process frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"Estableix una marca per processar la modificació durant els marcs del procés "
"(vegeu [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."

#: doc/classes/Skeleton3D.xml
msgid ""
"Do not process modification. Use [method advance] to process the "
"modification manually."
msgstr ""
"No processeu la modificació. Utilitzeu [method advance] per processar la "
"modificació manualment."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node used to rotate all bones of a [Skeleton3D] bone chain a way that "
"places the end bone at a desired 3D position."
msgstr ""
"Un node que s'utilitza per girar tots els ossos d'una cadena òssia "
"[Skeleton3D] de manera que col·loqui l'os final a la posició 3D desitjada."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"SkeletonIK3D is used to rotate all bones of a [Skeleton3D] bone chain a way "
"that places the end bone at a desired 3D position. A typical scenario for IK "
"in games is to place a character's feet on the ground or a character's hands "
"on a currently held object. SkeletonIK uses FabrikInverseKinematic "
"internally to solve the bone chain and applies the results to the "
"[Skeleton3D] [code]bones_global_pose_override[/code] property for all "
"affected bones in the chain. If fully applied, this overwrites any bone "
"transform from [Animation]s or bone custom poses set by users. The applied "
"amount can be controlled with the [member SkeletonModifier3D.influence] "
"property.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Apply IK effect automatically on every new frame (not the current)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start()\n"
"\n"
"# Apply IK effect only on the current frame\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start(true)\n"
"\n"
"# Stop IK effect and reset bones_global_pose_override on Skeleton\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.stop()\n"
"\n"
"# Apply full IK effect\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(1.0)\n"
"\n"
"# Apply half IK effect\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.5)\n"
"\n"
"# Apply zero IK effect (a value at or below 0.01 also removes "
"bones_global_pose_override on Skeleton)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"SkeletonIK3D s'utilitza per girar tots els ossos d'una cadena òssia "
"[Skeleton3D] de manera que col·loqui l'os final a la posició 3D desitjada. "
"Un escenari típic per a IK als jocs és col·locar els peus d'un personatge a "
"terra o les mans d'un personatge sobre un objecte que es manté actualment. "
"SkeletonIK utilitza FabrikInverseKinematic internament per resoldre la "
"cadena òssia i aplica els resultats a la propietat [Skeleton3D] "
"[code]bones_global_pose_override[/code] per a tots els ossos afectats de la "
"cadena. Si s'aplica completament, sobreescriu qualsevol transformació d'os "
"de [Animation]s o poses personalitzades d'os establertes pels usuaris. La "
"quantitat aplicada es pot controlar amb la propietat [member "
"SkeletonModifier3D.influence].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Aplica l'efecte IK automàticament a cada fotograma nou (no l'actual)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start()\n"
"\n"
"# Apliqueu l'efecte IK només al marc actual\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start(true)\n"
"\n"
"# Atureu l'efecte IK i reinicieu bones_global_pose_override a Skeleton\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.stop()\n"
"\n"
"# Apply full IK effect\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(1.0)\n"
"\n"
"# Aplica la meitat de l'efecte IK\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.5)\n"
"\n"
"# Aplica l'efecte IK zero (un valor igual o inferior a 0,01 també elimina "
"bones_global_pose_override a Skeleton)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the parent [Skeleton3D] node that was present when SkeletonIK "
"entered the scene tree. Returns [code]null[/code] if the parent node was not "
"a [Skeleton3D] node when SkeletonIK3D entered the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node principal [Skeleton3D] que estava present quan SkeletonIK va "
"entrar a l'arbre de l'escena. Retorna [code]null[/code] si el node pare no "
"era un node [Skeleton3D] quan SkeletonIK3D va entrar a l'arbre de l'escena."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if SkeletonIK is applying IK effects on continues "
"frames to the [Skeleton3D] bones. Returns [code]false[/code] if SkeletonIK "
"is stopped or [method start] was used with the [code]one_time[/code] "
"parameter set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Starts applying IK effects on each frame to the [Skeleton3D] bones but will "
"only take effect starting on the next frame. If [param one_time] is "
"[code]true[/code], this will take effect immediately but also reset on the "
"next frame."
msgstr ""
"Comença a aplicar efectes IK a cada fotograma als ossos [Skeleton3D] però "
"només tindrà efecte a partir del fotograma següent. Si [param one_time] és "
"[code]true[/code], això tindrà efecte immediatament però també es restablirà "
"al següent fotograma."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Stops applying IK effects on each frame to the [Skeleton3D] bones and also "
"calls [method Skeleton3D.clear_bones_global_pose_override] to remove "
"existing overrides on all bones."
msgstr ""
"Deixa d'aplicar efectes IK a cada fotograma als ossos [Skeleton3D] i també "
"crida a [method Skeleton3D.clear_bones_global_pose_override] per eliminar "
"les substitucions existents a tots els ossos."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid "Use [member SkeletonModifier3D.influence] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [member SkeletonModifier3D.influence]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Interpolation value for how much the IK results are applied to the current "
"skeleton bone chain. A value of [code]1.0[/code] will overwrite all skeleton "
"bone transforms completely while a value of [code]0.0[/code] will visually "
"disable the SkeletonIK."
msgstr ""
"Valor d'interpolació de quant s'apliquen els resultats IK a la cadena òssia "
"actual de l'esquelet. Un valor de [code]1.0[/code] sobreescriurà "
"completament totes les transformacions d'os de l'esquelet, mentre que un "
"valor de [code]0.0[/code] desactivarà visualment l'SkeletonIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Secondary target position (first is [member target] property or [member "
"target_node]) for the IK chain. Use magnet position (pole target) to control "
"the bending of the IK chain. Only works if the bone chain has more than 2 "
"bones. The middle chain bone position will be linearly interpolated with the "
"magnet position."
msgstr ""
"Posició objectiu secundària (la primera és la propietat [member target] o "
"[member target_node]) per a la cadena IK. Utilitzeu la posició de l'imant "
"(objectiu del pol) per controlar la flexió de la cadena IK. Només funciona "
"si la cadena òssia té més de 2 ossos. La posició de l'os de la cadena "
"mitjana s'interpolarà linealment amb la posició de l'imant."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Number of iteration loops used by the IK solver to produce more accurate "
"(and elegant) bone chain results."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de bucles d'iteració utilitzats pel solucionador IK per produir "
"resultats de cadena òssia més precisos (i elegants)."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum distance between bone and goal target. If the distance is below "
"this value, the IK solver stops further iterations."
msgstr ""
"La distància mínima entre l'os i la porteria. Si la distància és per sota "
"d'aquest valor, el solucionador IK atura més iteracions."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] overwrites the rotation of the tip bone with the "
"rotation of the [member target] (or [member target_node] if defined)."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] sobreescriu la rotació de l'os de la punta amb la "
"rotació de [member target] (o [member target_node] si està definit)."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid "The name of the current root bone, the first bone in the IK chain."
msgstr "El nom de l'os de l'arrel actual, el primer os de la cadena IK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"First target of the IK chain where the tip bone is placed and, if [member "
"override_tip_basis] is [code]true[/code], how the tip bone is rotated. If a "
"[member target_node] path is available the nodes transform is used instead "
"and this property is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Primer objectiu de la cadena IK on es col·loca l'os de la punta i, si "
"[member override_tip_basis] és [code]true[/code], com es gira l'os de la "
"punta. Si hi ha disponible una ruta [member target_node], s'utilitza la "
"transformació dels nodes i s'ignora aquesta propietat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Target node [NodePath] for the IK chain. If available, the node's current "
"[Transform3D] is used instead of the [member target] property."
msgstr ""
"Node objectiu [NodePath] per a la cadena IK. Si està disponible, s'utilitza "
"la [Transform3D] actual del node en lloc de la propietat [member target]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"The name of the current tip bone, the last bone in the IK chain placed at "
"the [member target] transform (or [member target_node] if defined)."
msgstr ""
"El nom de l'os de la punta actual, l'últim os de la cadena IK col·locat a la "
"transformació [member target] (o [member target_node] si està definit)."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], instructs the IK solver to consider the secondary "
"magnet target (pole target) when calculating the bone chain. Use the magnet "
"position (pole target) to control the bending of the IK chain."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], indica al solucionador IK que tingui en compte "
"l'objectiu de l'imant secundari (objectiu del pol) quan calculi la cadena "
"òssia. Utilitzeu la posició de l'imant (pol objectiu) per controlar la "
"flexió de la cadena IK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid "Base class for resources that operate on [Bone2D]s in a [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base per als recursos que operen en [Bone2D]s en un [Skeleton2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"This resource provides an interface that can be expanded so code that "
"operates on [Bone2D] nodes in a [Skeleton2D] can be mixed and matched "
"together to create complex interactions.\n"
"This is used to provide Godot with a flexible and powerful Inverse "
"Kinematics solution that can be adapted for many different uses."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recurs proporciona una interfície que es pot ampliar, de manera que "
"el codi que opera als nodes [Bone2D] d'un [Skeleton2D] es pot barrejar i "
"combinar per crear interaccions complexes.\n"
"Això s'utilitza per proporcionar a Godot una solució de cinemàtica inversa "
"flexible i potent que es pot adaptar per a molts usos diferents."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Used for drawing [b]editor-only[/b] modification gizmos. This function will "
"only be called in the Godot editor and can be overridden to draw custom "
"gizmos.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You will need to use the Skeleton2D from [method "
"SkeletonModificationStack2D.get_skeleton] and it's draw functions, as the "
"[SkeletonModification2D] resource cannot draw on its own."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitza per dibuixar els dispositius de modificació [b]editor-only[/b]. "
"Aquesta funció només s'anomenarà a l'editor Godot i es pot substituir per "
"dibuixar aparells personalitzats.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Haureu d'utilitzar l'Skeleton2D de [method "
"SkeletonModificationStack2D.get_skeleton] i les seves funcions de dibuix, ja "
"que el recurs [SkeletonModification2D] no pot dibuixar per si sol."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Executes the given modification. This is where the modification performs "
"whatever function it is designed to do."
msgstr ""
"Executa la modificació donada. Aquí és on la modificació realitza qualsevol "
"funció per a la qual estigui dissenyada."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the modification is setup. This is where the modification "
"performs initialization."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan es configura la modificació. Aquí és on la modificació "
"realitza la inicialització."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Takes an angle and clamps it so it is within the passed-in [param min] and "
"[param max] range. [param invert] will inversely clamp the angle, clamping "
"it to the range outside of the given bounds."
msgstr ""
"Pren un angle i el subjecta perquè quedi dins del rang [param min] i [param "
"max] passat. [param invert] fixarà l'angle de manera inversa, fixant-lo a "
"l'interval fora dels límits donats."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether this modification will call [method _draw_editor_gizmo] in "
"the Godot editor to draw modification-specific gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si aquesta modificació cridarà a [method _draw_editor_gizmo] a "
"l'editor Godot per dibuixar aparells específics de modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid "Returns whether this modification has been successfully setup or not."
msgstr "Retorna si aquesta modificació s'ha configurat correctament o no."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] that this modification is bound "
"to. Through the modification stack, you can access the Skeleton2D the "
"modification is operating on."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [SkeletonModificationStack2D] al qual està vinculada aquesta "
"modificació. A través de la pila de modificacions, podeu accedir a "
"l'Skeleton2D en què està operant la modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether this modification will call [method _draw_editor_gizmo] in the "
"Godot editor to draw modification-specific gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si aquesta modificació cridarà a [method _draw_editor_gizmo] a "
"l'editor Godot per dibuixar aparells específics de modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"Manually allows you to set the setup state of the modification. This "
"function should only rarely be used, as the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] "
"the modification is bound to should handle setting the modification up."
msgstr ""
"Permet configurar manualment l'estat de configuració de la modificació. "
"Aquesta funció només s'ha d'utilitzar poques vegades, ja que "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D] a la qual està obligada la modificació hauria "
"de gestionar la configuració de la modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the modification's [method _execute] function will be "
"called by the [SkeletonModificationStack2D]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [SkeletonModificationStack2D] cridarà la funció "
"[method _execute] de la modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2D.xml
msgid ""
"The execution mode for the modification. This tells the modification stack "
"when to execute the modification. Some modifications have settings that are "
"only available in certain execution modes."
msgstr ""
"El mode d'execució de la modificació. Això indica a la pila de modificacions "
"quan ha d'executar la modificació. Algunes modificacions tenen paràmetres "
"que només estan disponibles en determinats modes d'execució."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"A modification that uses CCDIK to manipulate a series of bones to reach a "
"target in 2D."
msgstr ""
"Una modificació que utilitza CCDIK per manipular una sèrie d'ossos per "
"arribar a un objectiu en 2D."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] uses an algorithm called Cyclic Coordinate "
"Descent Inverse Kinematics, or CCDIK, to manipulate a chain of bones in a "
"[Skeleton2D] so it reaches a defined target.\n"
"CCDIK works by rotating a set of bones, typically called a \"bone chain\", "
"on a single axis. Each bone is rotated to face the target from the tip (by "
"default), which over a chain of bones allow it to rotate properly to reach "
"the target. Because the bones only rotate on a single axis, CCDIK [i]can[/i] "
"look more robotic than other IK solvers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The CCDIK modifier has [code]ccdik_joints[/code], which are the "
"data objects that hold the data for each joint in the CCDIK chain. This is "
"different from a bone! CCDIK joints hold the data needed for each bone in "
"the bone chain used by CCDIK.\n"
"CCDIK also fully supports angle constraints, allowing for more control over "
"how a solution is met."
msgstr ""
"Aquest [SkeletonModification2D] utilitza un algorisme anomenat Cyclic "
"Coordinate Descent Inverse Kinematics, o CCDIK, per manipular una cadena "
"d'ossos en un [Skeleton2D] perquè assoleixi un objectiu definit.\n"
"CCDIK funciona fent girar un conjunt d'ossos, normalment anomenat \"cadena "
"òssia\", en un sol eix. Cada os es gira per fer front a l'objectiu des de la "
"punta (per defecte), que sobre una cadena d'ossos li permet girar "
"correctament per arribar a l'objectiu. Com que els ossos només giren en un "
"únic eix, CCDIK [i]can[/i] sembla més robòtic que altres solucionadors de "
"CI.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El modificador CCDIK té [code]ccdik_joints[/code], que són els "
"objectes de dades que contenen les dades de cada articulació de la cadena "
"CCDIK. Això és diferent d'un os! Les articulacions CCDIK contenen les dades "
"necessàries per a cada os de la cadena òssia utilitzada per CCDIK.\n"
"CCDIK també admet totalment les restriccions d'angle, permetent un major "
"control sobre com es compleix una solució."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node assigned to the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació CCDIK a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node assigned to the CCDIK joint at [param "
"joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex del node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació CCDIK a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] uses an inverted joint "
"constraint. See [method set_ccdik_joint_constraint_angle_invert] for details."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si l'articulació CCDIK a [param joint_idx] utilitza una restricció "
"d'articulació invertida. Vegeu [method "
"set_ccdik_joint_constraint_angle_invert] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la restricció d'angle màxima per a l'articulació a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the minimum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la restricció d'angle mínima per a l'articulació a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether angle constraints on the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] "
"are enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si les restriccions d'angle a l'articulació CCDIK a [param "
"joint_idx] estan habilitades."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is set to rotate from the "
"joint, [code]true[/code], or to rotate from the tip, [code]false[/code]. The "
"default is to rotate from the tip."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si l'articulació a [param joint_idx] està configurada per girar des "
"de l'articulació, [code]true[/code], o per girar des de la punta, "
"[code]false[/code]. El valor predeterminat és girar des de la punta."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node assigned to the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació CCDIK a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the bone index, [param bone_idx], of the CCDIK joint at [param "
"joint_idx]. When possible, this will also update the [code]bone2d_node[/"
"code] of the CCDIK joint based on data provided by the linked skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'índex ossi, [param bone_idx], de l'articulació CCDIK a [param "
"joint_idx]. Quan sigui possible, això també actualitzarà el "
"[code]bone2d_node[/code] de l'articulació CCDIK en funció de les dades "
"proporcionades per l'esquelet enllaçat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] uses an inverted joint "
"constraint.\n"
"An inverted joint constraint only constraints the CCDIK joint to the angles "
"[i]outside of[/i] the inputted minimum and maximum angles. For this reason, "
"it is referred to as an inverted joint constraint, as it constraints the "
"joint to the outside of the inputted values."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si l'articulació CCDIK a [param joint_idx] utilitza una restricció "
"d'articulació invertida.\n"
"Una restricció d'articulació invertida només limita l'articulació CCDIK als "
"angles [i]fora de[/i] dels angles mínim i màxim introduïts. Per aquesta raó, "
"es coneix com a restricció d'unió invertida, ja que limita l'articulació a "
"l'exterior dels valors introduïts."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la restricció d'angle màxima per a l'articulació a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid "Sets the minimum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la restricció d'angle mínima per a l'articulació a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Determines whether angle constraints on the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] "
"are enabled. When [code]true[/code], constraints will be enabled and taken "
"into account when solving."
msgstr ""
"Determina si les restriccions d'angle a l'articulació CCDIK a [param "
"joint_idx] estan habilitades. Quan [code]true[/code], les restriccions "
"s'habilitaran i es tindran en compte a l'hora de resoldre'ls."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is set to rotate from the joint, "
"[code]true[/code], or to rotate from the tip, [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si l'articulació a [param joint_idx] està configurada per girar "
"des de l'articulació, [code]true[/code], o per girar des de la punta, "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid "The number of CCDIK joints in the CCDIK modification."
msgstr "El nombre d'articulacions CCDIK a la modificació CCDIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the CCDIK modification. This "
"node is what the CCDIK chain will attempt to rotate the bone chain to."
msgstr ""
"El NodePath al node que és l'objectiu de la modificació CCDIK. Aquest node "
"és el que la cadena CCDIK intentarà girar la cadena òssia."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DCCDIK.xml
msgid ""
"The end position of the CCDIK chain. Typically, this should be a child of a "
"[Bone2D] node attached to the final [Bone2D] in the CCDIK chain."
msgstr ""
"La posició final de la cadena CCDIK. Normalment, aquest hauria de ser un "
"fill d'un node [Bone2D] connectat al [Bone2D] final de la cadena CCDIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"A modification that uses FABRIK to manipulate a series of [Bone2D] nodes to "
"reach a target."
msgstr ""
"Una modificació que utilitza FABRIK per manipular una sèrie de nodes "
"[Bone2D] per arribar a un objectiu."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] uses an algorithm called Forward And Backward "
"Reaching Inverse Kinematics, or FABRIK, to rotate a bone chain so that it "
"reaches a target.\n"
"FABRIK works by knowing the positions and lengths of a series of bones, "
"typically called a \"bone chain\". It first starts by running a forward "
"pass, which places the final bone at the target's position. Then all other "
"bones are moved towards the tip bone, so they stay at the defined bone "
"length away. Then a backwards pass is performed, where the root/first bone "
"in the FABRIK chain is placed back at the origin. Then all other bones are "
"moved so they stay at the defined bone length away. This positions the bone "
"chain so that it reaches the target when possible, but all of the bones stay "
"the correct length away from each other.\n"
"Because of how FABRIK works, it often gives more natural results than those "
"seen in [SkeletonModification2DCCDIK].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The FABRIK modifier has [code]fabrik_joints[/code], which are "
"the data objects that hold the data for each joint in the FABRIK chain. This "
"is different from [Bone2D] nodes! FABRIK joints hold the data needed for "
"each [Bone2D] in the bone chain used by FABRIK.\n"
"To help control how the FABRIK joints move, a magnet vector can be passed, "
"which can nudge the bones in a certain direction prior to solving, giving a "
"level of control over the final result."
msgstr ""
"Aquest [SkeletonModification2D] utilitza un algorisme anomenat Forward And "
"Backward Reaching Inverse Kinematics, o FABRIK, per girar una cadena òssia "
"de manera que arribi a un objectiu.\n"
"FABRIK treballa coneixent les posicions i longituds d'una sèrie d'ossos, "
"normalment anomenada \"cadena òssia\". Primer comença executant una passada "
"cap endavant, que situa l'os final a la posició de l'objectiu. A "
"continuació, tots els altres ossos es mouen cap a l'os de la punta, de "
"manera que es mantenen a la longitud de l'os definida. A continuació, es "
"realitza una passada cap enrere, on l'arrel/primer os de la cadena FABRIK es "
"torna a col·locar a l'origen. A continuació, es mouen tots els altres ossos "
"perquè es quedin a la longitud òssia definida. Això posiciona la cadena "
"òssia de manera que arribi a l'objectiu quan sigui possible, però tots els "
"ossos es mantenen a la longitud correcta els uns dels altres.\n"
"A causa de com funciona FABRIK, sovint dóna resultats més naturals que els "
"que es veuen a [SkeletonModification2DCCDIK].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El modificador FABRIK té [code]fabrik_joints[/code], que són "
"els objectes de dades que contenen les dades de cada unió de la cadena "
"FABRIK. Això és diferent dels nodes [Bone2D]! Les articulacions FABRIK "
"contenen les dades necessàries per a cada [Bone2D] de la cadena òssia "
"utilitzada per FABRIK.\n"
"Per ajudar a controlar com es mouen les articulacions FABRIK, es pot passar "
"un vector imant, que pot moure els ossos en una certa direcció abans de "
"resoldre's, donant un nivell de control sobre el resultat final."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node assigned to the FABRIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació FABRIK a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node assigned to the FABRIK joint at "
"[param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex del node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació FABRIK a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid "Returns the magnet position vector for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el vector de posició de l'imant per a l'articulació a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the joint is using the target's rotation rather than "
"allowing FABRIK to rotate the joint. This option only applies to the tip/"
"final joint in the chain."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si l'articulació està utilitzant la rotació de l'objectiu en lloc de "
"permetre que FABRIK giri l'articulació. Aquesta opció només s'aplica a la "
"punta/unió final de la cadena."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node assigned to the FABRIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació FABRIK a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the bone index, [param bone_idx], of the FABRIK joint at [param "
"joint_idx]. When possible, this will also update the [code]bone2d_node[/"
"code] of the FABRIK joint based on data provided by the linked skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'índex ossi, [param bone_idx], de l'articulació FABRIK a [param "
"joint_idx]. Quan sigui possible, això també actualitzarà el "
"[code]bone2d_node[/code] de l'articulació FABRIK a partir de les dades "
"proporcionades per l'esquelet enllaçat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid "Sets the magnet position vector for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el vector de posició de l'imant per a l'articulació a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the joint at [param joint_idx] will use the target node's "
"rotation rather than letting FABRIK rotate the node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option only works for the tip/final joint in the chain. "
"For all other nodes, this option will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si l'articulació a [param joint_idx] utilitzarà la rotació del "
"node objectiu en lloc de deixar que FABRIK giri el node.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta opció només funciona per a la punta/unió final de la "
"cadena. Per a la resta de nodes, aquesta opció s'ignorarà."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid "The number of FABRIK joints in the FABRIK modification."
msgstr "El nombre de juntes FABRIK a la modificació FABRIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DFABRIK.xml
msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the FABRIK modification. "
"This node is what the FABRIK chain will attempt to rotate the bone chain to."
msgstr ""
"El NodePath al node que és l'objectiu de la modificació FABRIK. Aquest node "
"és el que la cadena FABRIK intentarà girar la cadena òssia."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"A modification that jiggles [Bone2D] nodes as they move towards a target."
msgstr ""
"Una modificació que sacseja els nodes [Bone2D] mentre es mouen cap a un "
"objectiu."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"This modification moves a series of bones, typically called a bone chain, "
"towards a target. What makes this modification special is that it calculates "
"the velocity and acceleration for each bone in the bone chain, and runs a "
"very light physics-like calculation using the inputted values. This allows "
"the bones to overshoot the target and \"jiggle\" around. It can be "
"configured to act more like a spring, or sway around like cloth might.\n"
"This modification is useful for adding additional motion to things like "
"hair, the edges of clothing, and more. It has several settings to that allow "
"control over how the joint moves when the target moves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Jiggle modifier has [code]jiggle_joints[/code], which are "
"the data objects that hold the data for each joint in the Jiggle chain. This "
"is different from than [Bone2D] nodes! Jiggle joints hold the data needed "
"for each [Bone2D] in the bone chain used by the Jiggle modification."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta modificació mou una sèrie d'ossos, normalment anomenada cadena "
"òssia, cap a un objectiu. El que fa que aquesta modificació sigui especial "
"és que calcula la velocitat i l'acceleració per a cada os de la cadena "
"òssia, i realitza un càlcul semblant a la física molt lleuger utilitzant els "
"valors introduïts. Això permet que els ossos sobrepassin l'objectiu i "
"\"gigglein\" al voltant. Es pot configurar per actuar més com una molla o "
"balancejar-se com un drap.\n"
"Aquesta modificació és útil per afegir moviment addicional a coses com ara "
"els cabells, les vores de la roba i molt més. Té diversos paràmetres que "
"permeten controlar com es mou l'articulació quan es mou l'objectiu.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El modificador Jiggle té [code]jiggle_joints[/code], que són "
"els objectes de dades que contenen les dades de cada articulació de la "
"cadena Jiggle. Això és diferent dels nodes [Bone2D]! Les articulacions "
"Jiggle contenen les dades necessàries per a cada [Bone2D] de la cadena òssia "
"utilitzada per la modificació Jiggle."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision mask used by the Jiggle modifier when collisions are "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la màscara de col·lisió que utilitza el modificador Jiggle quan les "
"col·lisions estan habilitades."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node assigned to the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node assigned to the Jiggle joint at "
"[param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex del node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació Jiggle a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "Returns the amount of damping of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la quantitat d'amortiment de l'articulació Jiggle a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Vector2] representing the amount of gravity the Jiggle joint at "
"[param joint_idx] is influenced by."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Vector2] que representa la quantitat de gravetat per la qual "
"influeix l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "Returns the amount of mass of the jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la quantitat de massa de l'articulació oscil·lant a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is "
"overriding the default Jiggle joint data defined in the modification."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un valor booleà que indica si l'articulació a [param joint_idx] està "
"anul·lant les dades de l'articulació Jiggle per defecte definides a la "
"modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "Returns the stiffness of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna la rigidesa de l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is "
"using gravity or not."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un valor booleà que indica si l'articulació a [param joint_idx] "
"utilitza la gravetat o no."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the jiggle modifier is taking physics colliders into account "
"when solving."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si el modificador de vibració té en compte els col·lisionadors "
"físics a l'hora de resoldre'ls."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Resets the internal jiggle simulation state to the current bone positions, "
"clearing velocity, acceleration, and accumulated forces."
msgstr ""
"Restableix l'estat de simulació de moviment intern a les posicions òssies "
"actuals, la velocitat de neteja, l'acceleració i les forces acumulades."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the collision mask that the Jiggle modifier will use when reacting to "
"colliders, if the Jiggle modifier is set to take colliders into account."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la màscara de col·lisió que utilitzarà el modificador Jiggle quan "
"reacciona als col·lisionadors, si el modificador Jiggle està configurat per "
"tenir en compte els col·lisionadors."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node assigned to the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el node [Bone2D] assignat a l'articulació Jiggle a [param "
"joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the bone index, [param bone_idx], of the Jiggle joint at [param "
"joint_idx]. When possible, this will also update the [code]bone2d_node[/"
"code] of the Jiggle joint based on data provided by the linked skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'índex ossi, [param bone_idx], de l'articulació Jiggle a [param "
"joint_idx]. Quan sigui possible, això també actualitzarà el "
"[code]bone2d_node[/code] de l'articulació Jiggle en funció de les dades "
"proporcionades per l'esquelet enllaçat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sets the amount of damping of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "Sets the gravity vector of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el vector de gravetat de l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "Sets the of mass of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix la massa de l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx] should override the "
"default Jiggle joint settings. Setting this to [code]true[/code] will make "
"the joint use its own settings rather than the default ones attached to the "
"modification."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx] ha de substituir la "
"configuració predeterminada de l'articulació Jiggle. Establir-ho a "
"[code]true[/code] farà que l'articulació faci servir la seva pròpia "
"configuració en lloc de la predeterminada adjunta a la modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "Sets the of stiffness of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix la rigidesa de l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "Sets whether the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx] should use gravity."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si l'articulació Jiggle a [param joint_idx] hauria d'utilitzar la "
"gravetat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Jiggle modifier will take colliders into account, "
"keeping them from entering into these collision objects."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el modificador Jiggle tindrà en compte els "
"col·lisionadors, evitant que entrin en aquests objectes de col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"The default amount of damping applied to the Jiggle joints, if they are not "
"overridden. Higher values lead to more of the calculated velocity being "
"applied."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'amortiment per defecte aplicada a les articulacions Jiggle, "
"si no s'anul·len. Els valors més alts fan que s'apliqui més velocitat "
"calculada."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"The default amount of gravity applied to the Jiggle joints, if they are not "
"overridden."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat predeterminada de gravetat aplicada a les articulacions Jiggle, "
"si no s'han substituït."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid "The amount of Jiggle joints in the Jiggle modification."
msgstr "La quantitat d'articulacions Jiggle a la modificació Jiggle."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"The default amount of mass assigned to the Jiggle joints, if they are not "
"overridden. Higher values lead to faster movements and more overshooting."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat predeterminada de massa assignada a les articulacions Jiggle, "
"si no se substitueixen. Els valors més alts donen lloc a moviments més "
"ràpids i més desbordaments."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"The default amount of stiffness assigned to the Jiggle joints, if they are "
"not overridden. Higher values act more like springs, quickly moving into the "
"correct position."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat predeterminada de rigidesa assignada a les articulacions "
"Jiggle, si no s'han substituït. Els valors més alts actuen més com molles, "
"movent-se ràpidament a la posició correcta."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the Jiggle modification. "
"This node is what the Jiggle chain will attempt to rotate the bone chain to."
msgstr ""
"El NodePath al node que és l'objectiu de la modificació Jiggle. Aquest node "
"és el que la cadena Jiggle intentarà girar la cadena òssia."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DJiggle.xml
msgid ""
"Whether the gravity vector, [member gravity], should be applied to the "
"Jiggle joints, assuming they are not overriding the default settings."
msgstr ""
"Si el vector de gravetat, [member gravity], s'ha d'aplicar a les "
"articulacions Jiggle, suposant que no anul·len la configuració "
"predeterminada."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid "A modification that rotates a [Bone2D] node to look at a target."
msgstr "Una modificació que gira un node [Bone2D] per mirar un objectiu."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] rotates a bone to look a target. This is "
"extremely helpful for moving character's head to look at the player, "
"rotating a turret to look at a target, or any other case where you want to "
"make a bone rotate towards something quickly and easily."
msgstr ""
"Aquest [SkeletonModification2D] gira un os per mirar un objectiu. Això és "
"molt útil per moure el cap del personatge per mirar el jugador, girar una "
"torreta per mirar un objectiu o qualsevol altre cas en què vulgueu fer girar "
"un os cap a alguna cosa de manera ràpida i senzilla."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the amount of additional rotation that is applied after the LookAt "
"modification executes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la quantitat de rotació addicional que s'aplica després de "
"l'execució de la modificació LookAt."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the constraints to this modification are inverted or not."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si les restriccions d'aquesta modificació estan invertides o no."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid "Returns the constraint's maximum allowed angle."
msgstr "Retorna l'angle màxim permès de la restricció."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid "Returns the constraint's minimum allowed angle."
msgstr "Retorna l'angle mínim permès de la restricció."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the LookAt modification is using constraints."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la modificació LookAt utilitza restriccions."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the amount of additional rotation that is to be applied after executing "
"the modification. This allows for offsetting the results by the inputted "
"rotation amount."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la quantitat de rotació addicional que s'ha d'aplicar després "
"d'executar la modificació. Això permet compensar els resultats amb la "
"quantitat de rotació introduïda."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"When [code]true[/code], the modification will use an inverted joint "
"constraint.\n"
"An inverted joint constraint only constraints the [Bone2D] to the angles "
"[i]outside of[/i] the inputted minimum and maximum angles. For this reason, "
"it is referred to as an inverted joint constraint, as it constraints the "
"joint to the outside of the inputted values."
msgstr ""
"Quan [code]true[/code], la modificació utilitzarà una restricció conjunta "
"invertida.\n"
"Una restricció conjunta invertida només limita el [Bone2D] als angles "
"[i]fora de [/i] els angles mínim i màxim introduïts. Per aquesta raó, es "
"coneix com a restricció d'unió invertida, ja que limita l'articulació a "
"l'exterior dels valors introduïts."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid "Sets the constraint's maximum allowed angle."
msgstr "Estableix l'angle màxim permès de la restricció."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid "Sets the constraint's minimum allowed angle."
msgstr "Estableix l'angle mínim permès de la restricció."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether this modification will use constraints or not. When [code]true[/"
"code], constraints will be applied when solving the LookAt modification."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si aquesta modificació utilitzarà restriccions o no. Quan "
"[code]true[/code], s'aplicaran restriccions en resoldre la modificació "
"LookAt."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid "The [Bone2D] node that the modification will operate on."
msgstr "El node [Bone2D] sobre el qual operarà la modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid "The index of the [Bone2D] node that the modification will operate on."
msgstr "L'índex del node [Bone2D] sobre el qual operarà la modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DLookAt.xml
msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the LookAt modification. "
"This node is what the modification will rotate the [Bone2D] to."
msgstr ""
"El NodePath al node que és l'objectiu de la modificació LookAt. Aquest node "
"és el que la modificació girarà [Bone2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid ""
"Physical bones may be changed in the future to perform the position update "
"of [Bone2D] on their own, without needing this resource."
msgstr ""
"Els ossos físics es poden canviar en el futur per realitzar l'actualització "
"de la posició de [Bone2D] pel seu compte, sense necessitat d'aquest recurs."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid ""
"A modification that applies the transforms of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes to "
"[Bone2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Una modificació que aplica les transformacions dels nodes [PhysicalBone2D] "
"als nodes [Bone2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid ""
"This modification takes the transforms of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes and applies "
"them to [Bone2D] nodes. This allows the [Bone2D] nodes to react to physics "
"thanks to the linked [PhysicalBone2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta modificació pren les transformacions dels nodes [PhysicalBone2D] i "
"les aplica als nodes [Bone2D]. Això permet que els nodes [Bone2D] reaccionin "
"a la física gràcies als nodes [PhysicalBone2D] enllaçats."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid ""
"Empties the list of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes and populates it with all "
"[PhysicalBone2D] nodes that are children of the [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr ""
"Buida la llista de nodes [PhysicalBone2D] i l'emplena amb tots els nodes "
"[PhysicalBone2D] que són fills de [Skeleton2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid "Returns the [PhysicalBone2D] node at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el node [PhysicalBone2D] a [param joint_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [PhysicalBone2D] node at [param joint_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is just the index used for this modification, not the bone "
"index used in the [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el node [PhysicalBone2D] a [param joint_idx].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest és només l'índex utilitzat per a aquesta modificació, no "
"l'índex ossi utilitzat a [Skeleton2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid ""
"Tell the [PhysicalBone2D] nodes to start simulating and interacting with the "
"physics world.\n"
"Optionally, an array of bone names can be passed to this function, and that "
"will cause only [PhysicalBone2D] nodes with those names to start simulating."
msgstr ""
"Digues als nodes [PhysicalBone2D] que comencen a simular i interactuar amb "
"el món de la física.\n"
"Opcionalment, es pot passar una matriu de noms d'os a aquesta funció, i això "
"farà que només els nodes [PhysicalBone2D] amb aquests noms comencin a "
"simular."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid ""
"Tell the [PhysicalBone2D] nodes to stop simulating and interacting with the "
"physics world.\n"
"Optionally, an array of bone names can be passed to this function, and that "
"will cause only [PhysicalBone2D] nodes with those names to stop simulating."
msgstr ""
"Digues als nodes [PhysicalBone2D] que deixin de simular i interactuar amb el "
"món de la física.\n"
"Opcionalment, es pot passar una matriu de noms d'os a aquesta funció, i això "
"farà que només els nodes [PhysicalBone2D] amb aquests noms deixin de simular."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DPhysicalBones.xml
msgid "The number of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes linked in this modification."
msgstr "El nombre de nodes [PhysicalBone2D] enllaçats en aquesta modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DStackHolder.xml
msgid "A modification that holds and executes a [SkeletonModificationStack2D]."
msgstr "Una modificació que manté i executa un [SkeletonModificationStack2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DStackHolder.xml
msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] holds a reference to a "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D], allowing you to use multiple modification "
"stacks on a single [Skeleton2D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The modifications in the held [SkeletonModificationStack2D] "
"will only be executed if their execution mode matches the execution mode of "
"the SkeletonModification2DStackHolder."
msgstr ""
"Aquest [SkeletonModification2D] conté una referència a un "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D], que us permet utilitzar diverses piles de "
"modificació en un sol [Skeleton2D].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les modificacions a l'[SkeletonModificationStack2D] només "
"s'executaran si el seu mode d'execució coincideix amb el mode d'execució de "
"SkeletonModification2DStackHolder."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DStackHolder.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] that this modification is holding."
msgstr "Retorna el [SkeletonModificationStack2D] que té aquesta modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DStackHolder.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] that this modification is holding. "
"This modification stack will then be executed when this modification is "
"executed."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el [SkeletonModificationStack2D] que té aquesta modificació. "
"Aquesta pila de modificacions s'executarà quan s'executi aquesta modificació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"A modification that rotates two bones using the law of cosines to reach the "
"target."
msgstr ""
"Una modificació que fa girar dos ossos utilitzant la llei dels coseus per "
"arribar a l'objectiu."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] uses an algorithm typically called TwoBoneIK. "
"This algorithm works by leveraging the law of cosines and the lengths of the "
"bones to figure out what rotation the bones currently have, and what "
"rotation they need to make a complete triangle, where the first bone, the "
"second bone, and the target form the three vertices of the triangle. Because "
"the algorithm works by making a triangle, it can only operate on two bones.\n"
"TwoBoneIK is great for arms, legs, and really any joints that can be "
"represented by just two bones that bend to reach a target. This solver is "
"more lightweight than [SkeletonModification2DFABRIK], but gives similar, "
"natural looking results."
msgstr ""
"Aquest [SkeletonModification2D] utilitza un algorisme que normalment es diu "
"TwoBoneIK. Aquest algorisme funciona aprofitant la llei dels coseus i les "
"longituds dels ossos per esbrinar quina rotació tenen actualment els ossos i "
"quina rotació necessiten per fer un triangle complet, on el primer os, el "
"segon os i l'objectiu formen els tres vèrtexs del triangle. Com que "
"l'algorisme funciona fent un triangle, només pot operar sobre dos ossos.\n"
"TwoBoneIK és ideal per a braços, cames i realment qualsevol articulació que "
"es pugui representar amb només dos ossos que es dobleguen per arribar a un "
"objectiu. Aquest solucionador és més lleuger que "
"[SkeletonModification2DFABRIK], però dóna resultats similars i d'aspecte "
"natural."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone in the "
"TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a primer os a la modificació "
"TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone "
"in the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex del node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a primer os a la "
"modificació TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone in the "
"TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a segon os a la modificació "
"TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone "
"in the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex del node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a segon os a la "
"modificació TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone in the TwoBoneIK "
"modification."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a primer os a la modificació "
"TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone in "
"the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'índex del node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a primer os a la "
"modificació TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone in the "
"TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a segon os a la modificació "
"TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone in "
"the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'índex del node [Bone2D] que s'utilitza com a segon os a la "
"modificació TwoBoneIK."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the bones in the modification will bend outward as "
"opposed to inwards when contracting. If [code]false[/code], the bones will "
"bend inwards when contracting."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els ossos de la modificació es doblegaran cap a fora "
"en lloc de cap a dins quan es contrauen. Si [code]false[/code], els ossos es "
"doblegaran cap a dins quan es contrauen."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum distance the target can be at. If the target is farther than "
"this distance, the modification will solve as if it's at this maximum "
"distance. When set to [code]0[/code], the modification will solve without "
"distance constraints."
msgstr ""
"La distància màxima a la qual pot estar l'objectiu. Si l'objectiu està més "
"lluny d'aquesta distància, la modificació es resoldrà com si estigués a "
"aquesta distància màxima. Quan s'estableix a [code]0[/code], la modificació "
"es resoldrà sense restriccions de distància."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum distance the target can be at. If the target is closer than this "
"distance, the modification will solve as if it's at this minimum distance. "
"When set to [code]0[/code], the modification will solve without distance "
"constraints."
msgstr ""
"La distància mínima a la qual pot estar l'objectiu. Si l'objectiu està més a "
"prop d'aquesta distància, la modificació es resoldrà com si estigués a "
"aquesta distància mínima. Quan s'estableix a [code]0[/code], la modificació "
"es resoldrà sense restriccions de distància."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK.xml
msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the TwoBoneIK modification. "
"This node is what the modification will use when bending the [Bone2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"El NodePath al node que és l'objectiu de la modificació TwoBoneIK. Aquest "
"node és el que utilitzarà la modificació en doblegar els nodes [Bone2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid "A resource that holds a stack of [SkeletonModification2D]s."
msgstr "Un recurs que conté una pila de [SkeletonModification2D]s."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"This resource is used by the Skeleton and holds a stack of "
"[SkeletonModification2D]s.\n"
"This controls the order of the modifications and how they are applied. "
"Modification order is especially important for full-body IK setups, as you "
"need to execute the modifications in the correct order to get the desired "
"results. For example, you want to execute a modification on the spine "
"[i]before[/i] the arms on a humanoid skeleton.\n"
"This resource also controls how strongly all of the modifications are "
"applied to the [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recurs és utilitzat per l'esquelet i conté una pila de "
"[SkeletonModification2D]s.\n"
"Això controla l'ordre de les modificacions i com s'apliquen. L'ordre de "
"modificació és especialment important per a les configuracions IK de cos "
"sencer, ja que cal executar les modificacions en l'ordre correcte per "
"obtenir els resultats desitjats. Per exemple, voleu executar una modificació "
"a la columna vertebral [i]before[/i] els braços d'un esquelet humanoide.\n"
"Aquest recurs també controla amb quina força s'apliquen totes les "
"modificacions a [Skeleton2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid "Adds the passed-in [SkeletonModification2D] to the stack."
msgstr "Afegeix el [SkeletonModification2D] passat a la pila."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"Deletes the [SkeletonModification2D] at the index position [param mod_idx], "
"if it exists."
msgstr ""
"Suprimeix [SkeletonModification2D] a la posició d'índex [param mod_idx], si "
"existeix."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid "Enables all [SkeletonModification2D]s in the stack."
msgstr "Habilita tots els [SkeletonModification2D]s de la pila."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"Executes all of the [SkeletonModification2D]s in the stack that use the same "
"execution mode as the passed-in [param execution_mode], starting from index "
"[code]0[/code] to [member modification_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The order of the modifications can matter depending on the "
"modifications. For example, modifications on a spine should operate before "
"modifications on the arms in order to get proper results."
msgstr ""
"Executa tots els [SkeletonModification2D]s de la pila que utilitzen el "
"mateix mode d'execució que el [param execution_mode] passat, començant des "
"de l'índex [code]0[/code] fins a [member modification_count].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'ordre de les modificacions pot importar en funció de les "
"modificacions. Per exemple, les modificacions a la columna s'han d'operar "
"abans que les modificacions als braços per tal d'obtenir resultats adequats."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the modification stack is setup and "
"can execute."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un valor booleà que indica si la pila de modificacions està "
"configurada i es pot executar."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModification2D] at the passed-in index, [param mod_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna [SkeletonModification2D] a l'índex passat, [param mod_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Skeleton2D] node that the SkeletonModificationStack2D is bound "
"to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node [Skeleton2D] al qual està vinculat "
"SkeletonModificationStack2D."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the modification at [param mod_idx] to the passed-in modification, "
"[param modification]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la modificació a [param mod_idx] a la modificació transmesa, "
"[param modification]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets up the modification stack so it can execute. This function should be "
"called by [Skeleton2D] and shouldn't be manually called unless you know what "
"you are doing."
msgstr ""
"Configura la pila de modificacions perquè es pugui executar. Aquesta funció "
"hauria de ser cridada per [Skeleton2D] i no s'hauria de cridar manualment "
"tret que sàpigues què estàs fent."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the modification's in the stack will be called. This "
"is handled automatically through the [Skeleton2D] node."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es cridarà la modificació de la pila. Això es gestiona "
"automàticament mitjançant el node [Skeleton2D]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid "The number of modifications in the stack."
msgstr "El nombre de modificacions a la pila."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModificationStack2D.xml
msgid ""
"The interpolation strength of the modifications in stack. A value of "
"[code]0[/code] will make it where the modifications are not applied, a "
"strength of [code]0.5[/code] will be half applied, and a strength of "
"[code]1[/code] will allow the modifications to be fully applied and override "
"the [Skeleton2D] [Bone2D] poses."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "A node that may modify a Skeleton3D's bones."
msgstr "Un node que pot modificar els ossos d'un Skeleton3D."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] retrieves a target [Skeleton3D] by having a "
"[Skeleton3D] parent.\n"
"If there is an [AnimationMixer], a modification always performs after "
"playback process of the [AnimationMixer].\n"
"This node should be used to implement custom IK solvers, constraints, or "
"skeleton physics."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] recupera un objectiu [Skeleton3D] tenint un pare "
"[Skeleton3D].\n"
"Si hi ha un [AnimationMixer], sempre es realitza una modificació després del "
"procés de reproducció de [AnimationMixer].\n"
"Aquest node s'ha d'utilitzar per implementar solucionadors de CI "
"personalitzats, restriccions o física de l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Design of the Skeleton Modifier 3D"
msgstr "Disseny del Skeleton Modifier 3D"

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Use [method _process_modification_with_delta] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [method _process_modification_with_delta]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Override this virtual method to implement a custom skeleton modifier. You "
"should do things like get the [Skeleton3D]'s current pose and apply the pose "
"here.\n"
"[method _process_modification] must not apply [member influence] to bone "
"poses because the [Skeleton3D] automatically applies influence to all bone "
"poses set by the modifier."
msgstr ""
"Substituïu aquest mètode virtual per implementar un modificador d'esquelet "
"personalitzat. Hauríeu de fer coses com obtenir la postura actual de "
"[Skeleton3D] i aplicar-la aquí.\n"
"[method _process_modification] no ha d'aplicar [member influence] a les "
"posicions òssies perquè [Skeleton3D] aplica automàticament la influència a "
"totes les posicions òssies establertes pel modificador."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Override this virtual method to implement a custom skeleton modifier. You "
"should do things like get the [Skeleton3D]'s current pose and apply the pose "
"here.\n"
"[method _process_modification_with_delta] must not apply [member influence] "
"to bone poses because the [Skeleton3D] automatically applies influence to "
"all bone poses set by the modifier.\n"
"[param delta] is passed from parent [Skeleton3D]. See also [method "
"Skeleton3D.advance].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method may be called outside [method Node._process] and "
"[method Node._physics_process] with [param delta] is [code]0.0[/code], since "
"the modification should be processed immediately after initialization of the "
"[Skeleton3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Called when the skeleton is changed."
msgstr "Es crida quan es canvia l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Called when bone names and indices need to be validated, such as when "
"entering the scene tree or changing skeleton."
msgstr ""
"S'anomena quan cal validar els noms i els índexs dels ossos, com ara quan "
"s'entra a l'arbre de l'escena o es canvia l'esquelet."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the parent [Skeleton3D] node if it exists. Otherwise, returns "
"[code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el node principal [Skeleton3D] si existeix. En cas contrari, retorna "
"[code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the [SkeletonModifier3D] will be processing."
msgstr "Si és [code]true[/code], el [SkeletonModifier3D] estarà processant."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the influence of the modification.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is used by [Skeleton3D] to blend, so the "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] should always apply only 100% of the result without "
"interpolation."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la influència de la modificació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest valor l'utilitza [Skeleton3D] per combinar, de manera "
"que [SkeletonModifier3D] sempre hauria d'aplicar només el 100% del resultat "
"sense interpolació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Notifies when the modification have been finished.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to get the modified bone pose by the modifier, you "
"must use [method Skeleton3D.get_bone_pose] or [method "
"Skeleton3D.get_bone_global_pose] at the moment this signal is fired."
msgstr ""
"Avisa quan s'ha acabat la modificació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si voleu obtenir la postura de l'os modificada pel modificador, "
"heu d'utilitzar [method Skeleton3D.get_bone_pose] o [method "
"Skeleton3D.get_bone_global_pose] en el moment en què es dispara aquest "
"senyal."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the +X axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a l'eix +X."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the -X axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a l'eix -X."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the +Y axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a l'eix +Y."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the -Y axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a l'eix Y."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the +Z axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a l'eix +Z."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the -Z axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a l'eix -Z."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the axis from a parent bone to the child bone."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a l'eix des d'un os pare fins a l'os fill."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the case when the axis is undefined."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per al cas quan l'eix no està definit."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for an optional axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a un eix opcional."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the rotation of the X axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a la rotació de l'eix X."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the rotation of the Y axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a la rotació de l'eix Y."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the rotation of the Z axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a la rotació de l'eix Z."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for the unconstrained rotation."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a la rotació sense restriccions."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonModifier3D.xml
msgid "Enumerated value for an optional rotation axis."
msgstr "Valor enumerat per a un eix de rotació opcional."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for a profile of a virtual skeleton used as a target for "
"retargeting."
msgstr ""
"Classe base per a un perfil d'un esquelet virtual utilitzat com a objectiu "
"per a la reorientació."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"This resource is used in [EditorScenePostImport]. Some parameters are "
"referring to bones in [Skeleton3D], [Skin], [Animation], and some other "
"nodes are rewritten based on the parameters of [SkeletonProfile].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] These parameters need to be set only when creating a custom "
"profile. In [SkeletonProfileHumanoid], they are defined internally as read-"
"only values."
msgstr ""
"Aquest recurs s'utilitza a [EditorScenePostImport]. Alguns paràmetres es "
"refereixen als ossos a [Skeleton3D], [Skin], [Animation] i alguns altres "
"nodes es reescriuen en funció dels paràmetres de [SkeletonProfile].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquests paràmetres només s'han de configurar quan es crea un "
"perfil personalitzat. A [SkeletonProfileHumanoid], es defineixen internament "
"com a valors de només lectura."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Returns the bone index that matches [param bone_name] as its name."
msgstr "Retorna l'índex d'os que coincideix amb [param bone_name] com a nom."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the key name "
"in the [BoneMap].\n"
"In the retargeting process, the returned bone name is the bone name of the "
"target skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom de l'os a [param bone_idx] que serà el nom de la clau a "
"[BoneMap].\n"
"En el procés de reorientació, el nom de l'os retornat és el nom de l'os de "
"l'esquelet objectiu."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the bone which is the parent to the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]. The result is empty if the bone has no parent."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom de l'os que és el pare de l'os a [param bone_idx]. El "
"resultat és buit si l'os no té cap progenitor."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the bone which is the tail of the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el nom de l'os que és la cua de l'os a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Returns the group of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el grup de l'os a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the drawing "
"group in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nom del grup a [param group_idx] que serà el grup de dibuix a "
"l'editor [BoneMap]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the offset of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the button "
"position in the [BoneMap] editor.\n"
"This is the offset with origin at the top left corner of the square."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el desplaçament de l'os a [param bone_idx] que serà la posició del "
"botó a l'editor [BoneMap].\n"
"Aquest és el desplaçament amb l'origen a la cantonada superior esquerra del "
"quadrat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Returns the reference pose transform for bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la transformació de posició de referència per a l'os [param "
"bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Returns the tail direction of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna la direcció de la cua de l'os a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the texture of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the "
"drawing group background image in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la textura del grup a [param group_idx] que serà la imatge de fons "
"del grup de dibuix a l'editor [BoneMap]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the bone at [param bone_idx] is required for retargeting.\n"
"This value is used by the bone map editor. If this method returns "
"[code]true[/code], and no bone is assigned, the handle color will be red on "
"the bone map editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si l'os a [param bone_idx] és necessari per a la reorientació.\n"
"Aquest valor l'utilitza l'editor de mapes d'os. Si aquest mètode retorna "
"[code]true[/code] i no s'assigna cap os, el color del mànec serà vermell a "
"l'editor de mapes d'os."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the name of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the key name in "
"the [BoneMap].\n"
"In the retargeting process, the setting bone name is the bone name of the "
"target skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nom de l'os a [param bone_idx] que serà el nom de la clau a "
"[BoneMap].\n"
"En el procés de reorientació, el nom de l'os de configuració és el nom de "
"l'os de l'esquelet objectiu."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the bone with name [param bone_parent] as the parent of the bone at "
"[param bone_idx]. If an empty string is passed, then the bone has no parent."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'os amb el nom [param bone_parent] com a pare de l'os a [param "
"bone_idx]. Si es passa una cadena buida, l'os no té cap pare."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the bone with name [param bone_tail] as the tail of the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'os amb el nom [param bone_tail] com a cua de l'os a [param "
"bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Sets the group of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix el grup de l'os a [param bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the name of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the drawing "
"group in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nom del grup a [param group_idx] que serà el grup de dibuix a "
"l'editor [BoneMap]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the offset of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the button "
"position in the [BoneMap] editor.\n"
"This is the offset with origin at the top left corner of the square."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el desplaçament de l'os a [param bone_idx] que serà la posició del "
"botó a l'editor [BoneMap].\n"
"Aquest és el desplaçament amb l'origen a la cantonada superior esquerra del "
"quadrat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Sets the reference pose transform for bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la transformació de posició de referència per a l'os [param "
"bone_idx]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sets the required status for bone [param bone_idx] to [param required]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the tail direction of the bone at [param bone_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only specifies the method of calculation. The actual "
"coordinates required should be stored in an external skeleton, so the "
"calculation itself needs to be done externally."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la direcció de la cua de l'os a [param bone_idx].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només especifica el mètode de càlcul. Les coordenades "
"reals necessàries s'han d'emmagatzemar en un esquelet extern, de manera que "
"el càlcul en si s'ha de fer externament."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the texture of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the drawing "
"group background image in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la textura del grup a [param group_idx] que serà la imatge de fons "
"del grup de dibuix a l'editor [BoneMap]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of bones in retargeting section's [BoneMap] editor. For example, "
"[SkeletonProfileHumanoid] has 56 bones.\n"
"The size of elements in [BoneMap] updates when changing this property in "
"it's assigned [SkeletonProfile]."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'ossos a l'editor [BoneMap] de la secció de reorientació. Per "
"exemple, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] té 56 ossos.\n"
"La mida dels elements a [BoneMap] s'actualitza quan es canvia aquesta "
"propietat a [SkeletonProfile]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of groups of bones in retargeting section's [BoneMap] editor. For "
"example, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] has 4 groups.\n"
"This property exists to separate the bone list into several sections in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de grups d'ossos a l'editor [BoneMap] de la secció de "
"reorientació. Per exemple, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] té 4 grups.\n"
"Aquesta propietat existeix per separar la llista d'os en diverses seccions a "
"l'editor."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"A bone name that will be used as the root bone in [AnimationTree]. This "
"should be the bone of the parent of hips that exists at the world origin."
msgstr ""
"Un nom d'os que s'utilitzarà com a os de l'arrel a [AnimationTree]. Aquest "
"hauria de ser l'os del progenitor dels malucs que existeix a l'origen "
"mundial."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"A bone name which will use model's height as the coefficient for "
"normalization. For example, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] defines it as "
"[code]Hips[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Un nom d'os que utilitzarà l'alçada del model com a coeficient per a la "
"normalització. Per exemple, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] el defineix com a "
"[code]Hips[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid ""
"This signal is emitted when change the value in profile. This is used to "
"update key name in the [BoneMap] and to redraw the [BoneMap] editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is not connected directly to editor to simplify the "
"reference, instead it is passed on to editor through the [BoneMap]."
msgstr ""
"Aquest senyal s'emet quan es canvia el valor de perfil. S'utilitza per "
"actualitzar el nom de la clau a [BoneMap] i per tornar a dibuixar l'editor "
"[BoneMap].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest senyal no està connectat directament a l'editor per "
"simplificar la referència, sinó que es passa a l'editor mitjançant [BoneMap]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Direction to the average coordinates of bone children."
msgstr "Direcció a les coordenades mitjanes dels nens ossis."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Direction to the coordinates of specified bone child."
msgstr "Direcció a les coordenades del nen ossi especificat."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfile.xml
msgid "Direction is not calculated."
msgstr "No es calcula la direcció."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfileHumanoid.xml
msgid "A humanoid [SkeletonProfile] preset."
msgstr "Un preajust humanoide [SkeletonProfile]."

#: doc/classes/SkeletonProfileHumanoid.xml
msgid ""
"A [SkeletonProfile] as a preset that is optimized for the human form. This "
"exists for standardization, so all parameters are read-only.\n"
"A humanoid skeleton profile contains 56 bones divided into 4 groups: [code]"
"\"Body\"[/code], [code]\"Face\"[/code], [code]\"LeftHand\"[/code], and [code]"
"\"RightHand\"[/code]. It is structured as follows:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"Root\n"
"└─ Hips\n"
"    ├─ LeftUpperLeg\n"
"    │  └─ LeftLowerLeg\n"
"    │     └─ LeftFoot\n"
"    │        └─ LeftToes\n"
"    ├─ RightUpperLeg\n"
"    │  └─ RightLowerLeg\n"
"    │     └─ RightFoot\n"
"    │        └─ RightToes\n"
"    └─ Spine\n"
"        └─ Chest\n"
"            └─ UpperChest\n"
"                ├─ Neck\n"
"                │   └─ Head\n"
"                │       ├─ Jaw\n"
"                │       ├─ LeftEye\n"
"                │       └─ RightEye\n"
"                ├─ LeftShoulder\n"
"                │  └─ LeftUpperArm\n"
"                │     └─ LeftLowerArm\n"
"                │        └─ LeftHand\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftThumbMetacarpal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftThumbProximal\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftThumbDistal\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftIndexProximal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftIndexIntermediate\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftIndexDistal\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftMiddleProximal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftMiddleIntermediate\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftMiddleDistal\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftRingProximal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftRingIntermediate\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftRingDistal\n"
"                │           └─ LeftLittleProximal\n"
"                │              └─ LeftLittleIntermediate\n"
"                │                └─ LeftLittleDistal\n"
"                └─ RightShoulder\n"
"                   └─ RightUpperArm\n"
"                      └─ RightLowerArm\n"
"                         └─ RightHand\n"
"                            ├─ RightThumbMetacarpal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightThumbProximal\n"
"                            │     └─ RightThumbDistal\n"
"                            ├─ RightIndexProximal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightIndexIntermediate\n"
"                            │     └─ RightIndexDistal\n"
"                            ├─ RightMiddleProximal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightMiddleIntermediate\n"
"                            │     └─ RightMiddleDistal\n"
"                            ├─ RightRingProximal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightRingIntermediate\n"
"                            │     └─ RightRingDistal\n"
"                            └─ RightLittleProximal\n"
"                               └─ RightLittleIntermediate\n"
"                                 └─ RightLittleDistal\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SkinReference.xml
msgid ""
"A reference-counted holder object for a skeleton RID used in the "
"[RenderingServer]."
msgstr ""
"Un objecte de suport comptat per referència per a un RID d'esquelet "
"utilitzat a [RenderingServer]."

#: doc/classes/SkinReference.xml
msgid ""
"An internal object containing a mapping from a [Skin] used within the "
"context of a particular [MeshInstance3D] to refer to the skeleton's [RID] in "
"the RenderingServer.\n"
"See also [method MeshInstance3D.get_skin_reference] and [method "
"RenderingServer.instance_attach_skeleton].\n"
"Note that despite the similar naming, the skeleton RID used in the "
"[RenderingServer] does not have a direct one-to-one correspondence to a "
"[Skeleton3D] node.\n"
"In particular, a [Skeleton3D] node with no [MeshInstance3D] children may be "
"unknown to the [RenderingServer].\n"
"On the other hand, a [Skeleton3D] with multiple [MeshInstance3D] nodes which "
"each have different [member MeshInstance3D.skin] objects may have multiple "
"SkinReference instances (and hence, multiple skeleton [RID]s)."
msgstr ""
"Un objecte intern que conté un mapeig d'un [Skin] utilitzat en el context "
"d'un [MeshInstance3D] particular per referir-se a [RID] de l'esquelet al "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"Vegeu també [method MeshInstance3D.get_skin_reference] i [method "
"RenderingServer.instance_attach_skeleton].\n"
"Tingueu en compte que, malgrat la denominació semblant, l'esquelet RID "
"utilitzat al [RenderingServer] no té una correspondència directa d'un a un "
"amb un node [Skeleton3D].\n"
"En particular, un node [Skeleton3D] sense [MeshInstance3D] pot ser "
"desconegut per [RenderingServer].\n"
"D'altra banda, un [Skeleton3D] amb múltiples [MeshInstance3D] que tenen "
"diferents objectes [member MeshInstance3D.skin] poden tenir múltiples "
"instàncies de SkinReference (i, per tant, múltiples esquelets [RID]s)."

#: doc/classes/SkinReference.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] owned by this SkinReference, as returned by [method "
"RenderingServer.skeleton_create]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [RID] propietat d'aquesta SkinReference, tal com el retorna "
"[method RenderingServer.skeleton_create]."

#: doc/classes/SkinReference.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Skin] connected to this SkinReference. In the case of "
"[MeshInstance3D] with no [member MeshInstance3D.skin] assigned, this will "
"reference an internal default [Skin] owned by that [MeshInstance3D].\n"
"Note that a single [Skin] may have more than one [SkinReference] in the case "
"that it is shared by meshes across multiple [Skeleton3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [Skin] connectat a aquesta SkinReference. En el cas de "
"[MeshInstance3D] sense [member MeshInstance3D.skin] assignat, això farà "
"referència a un [Skin] per defecte intern propietat d'aquest "
"[MeshInstance3D].\n"
"Tingueu en compte que un sol [Skin] pot tenir més d'un [SkinReference] en el "
"cas que sigui compartit per malles entre diversos [Skeleton3D] nodes."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Defines a 3D environment's background by using a [Material]."
msgstr "Defineix el fons d'un entorn 3D utilitzant un [Material]."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"The [Sky] class uses a [Material] to render a 3D environment's background "
"and the light it emits by updating the reflection/radiance cubemaps."
msgstr ""
"La classe [Sky] utilitza un [Material] per representar el fons d'un entorn "
"3D i la llum que emet actualitzant els mapes de cubs de reflexió/radiància."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"The method for generating the radiance map from the sky. The radiance map is "
"a cubemap with increasingly blurry versions of the sky corresponding to "
"different levels of roughness. Radiance maps can be expensive to calculate."
msgstr ""
"El mètode per generar el mapa de radiació des del cel. El mapa de radiació "
"és un mapa de cubs amb versions cada cop més borroses del cel corresponents "
"a diferents nivells de rugositat. Els mapes de radiació poden ser cars de "
"calcular."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"The [Sky]'s radiance map size. The higher the radiance map size, the more "
"detailed the lighting from the [Sky] will be.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some hardware will have trouble with higher radiance sizes, "
"especially [constant RADIANCE_SIZE_512] and above. Only use such high values "
"on high-end hardware."
msgstr ""
"Mida del mapa de lluminositat de [Sky]. Com més gran sigui la mida del mapa "
"de radiació, més detallada serà la il·luminació de [Sky].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Alguns maquinari tindran problemes amb mides de brillantor més "
"altes, especialment [constant RADIANCE_SIZE_512] i superiors. Utilitzeu "
"només valors tan alts en maquinari de gamma alta."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"[Material] used to draw the background. Can be [PanoramaSkyMaterial], "
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial], [PhysicalSkyMaterial], or even a [ShaderMaterial] "
"if you want to use your own custom shader."
msgstr ""
"[Material] s'utilitza per dibuixar el fons. Pot ser [PanoramaSkyMaterial], "
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial], [PhysicalSkyMaterial], o fins i tot un "
"[ShaderMaterial] si voleu utilitzar el vostre propi shader personalitzat."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Radiance texture size is 32×32 pixels."
msgstr "La mida de la textura radiant és de 32 × 32 píxels."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Radiance texture size is 64×64 pixels."
msgstr "La mida de la textura radiant és de 64 × 64 píxels."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Radiance texture size is 128×128 pixels."
msgstr "La mida de la textura brillant és de 128 × 128 píxels."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Radiance texture size is 256×256 pixels."
msgstr "La mida de la textura radiant és de 256 × 256 píxels."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Radiance texture size is 512×512 pixels."
msgstr "La mida de la textura radiant és de 512 × 512 píxels."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Radiance texture size is 1024×1024 pixels."
msgstr "La mida de la textura radiant és de 1024 × 1024 píxels."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Radiance texture size is 2048×2048 pixels."
msgstr "La mida de la textura radiant és de 2048 × 2048 píxels."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum RadianceSize] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum RadianceSize]."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"Automatically selects the appropriate process mode based on your sky shader. "
"If your shader uses [code]TIME[/code] or [code]POSITION[/code], this will "
"use [constant PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME]. If your shader uses any of the "
"[code]LIGHT_*[/code] variables or any custom uniforms, this uses [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_INCREMENTAL]. Otherwise, this defaults to [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY]."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona automàticament el mode de procés adequat segons el vostre sky "
"shader. Si el vostre shader utilitza [code]TIME[/code] o [code]POSITION[/"
"code], aquest utilitzarà [constant PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME]. Si el vostre "
"shader utilitza alguna de les variables [code]LIGHT_*[/code] o qualsevol "
"uniforme personalitzat, això fa servir [constant PROCESS_MODE_INCREMENTAL]. "
"En cas contrari, el valor predeterminat és [constant PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY]."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"Uses high quality importance sampling to process the radiance map. In "
"general, this results in much higher quality than [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME] but takes much longer to generate. This should not be "
"used if you plan on changing the sky at runtime. If you are finding that the "
"reflection is not blurry enough and is showing sparkles or fireflies, try "
"increasing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples]."
msgstr ""
"Utilitza un mostreig d'importància d'alta qualitat per processar el mapa de "
"radiació. En general, això resulta en una qualitat molt superior a [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME], però triga molt més a generar-se. Això no s'ha "
"d'utilitzar si teniu previst canviar el cel en temps d'execució. Si trobeu "
"que el reflex no és prou borrós i mostra centelleigs o lluernes, proveu "
"d'augmentar [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples]."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the same high quality importance sampling to process the radiance map "
"as [constant PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY], but updates over several frames. The "
"number of frames is determined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers]. Use this when you need "
"highest quality radiance maps, but have a sky that updates slowly."
msgstr ""
"Utilitza el mateix mostreig d'importància d'alta qualitat per processar el "
"mapa de radiació que [constant PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY], però s'actualitza en "
"diversos fotogrames. El nombre de fotogrames ve determinat per [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers]. "
"Utilitzeu-ho quan necessiteu mapes de brillantor de la màxima qualitat, però "
"tingueu un cel que s'actualitzi lentament."

#: doc/classes/Sky.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the fast filtering algorithm to process the radiance map. In general "
"this results in lower quality, but substantially faster run times. If you "
"need better quality, but still need to update the sky every frame, consider "
"turning on [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"fast_filter_high_quality].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The fast filtering algorithm is limited to 256×256 cubemaps, so "
"[member radiance_size] must be set to [constant RADIANCE_SIZE_256]. "
"Otherwise, a warning is printed and the overridden radiance size is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Utilitza l'algoritme de filtratge ràpid per processar el mapa de radiació. "
"En general, això es tradueix en temps d'execució de menor qualitat, però "
"substancialment més ràpids. Si necessiteu una millor qualitat, però encara "
"heu d'actualitzar el cel cada fotograma, penseu a activar [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"fast_filter_high_quality].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'algorisme de filtratge ràpid està limitat a 256 × 256 mapes "
"de cub, de manera que [member radiance_size] s'ha d'establir a [constant "
"RADIANCE_SIZE_256]. En cas contrari, s'imprimeix un avís i s'ignora la mida "
"de lluminositat anul·lada."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for sliders."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per a lliscants."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for sliders, used to adjust a value by moving a grabber "
"along a horizontal or vertical axis. Sliders are [Range]-based controls."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per a controls lliscants, que s'utilitza per ajustar "
"un valor movent un captador al llarg d'un eix horitzontal o vertical. Els "
"controls lliscants són controls basats en [Range]."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the slider can be interacted with. If [code]false[/"
"code], the value can be changed only by code."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es pot interactuar amb el control lliscant. Si "
"[code]false[/code], el valor només es pot canviar mitjançant el codi."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the value can be changed using the mouse wheel."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], el valor es pot canviar amb la roda del ratolí."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"Number of ticks displayed on the slider, including border ticks. Ticks are "
"uniformly-distributed value markers."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de marques que es mostren al control lliscant, incloses les marques "
"de vora. Les paparres són marcadors de valor distribuïts uniformement."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the slider will display ticks for minimum and maximum "
"values."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el control lliscant mostrarà marques per als valors "
"mínims i màxims."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sets the position of the ticks. See [enum TickPosition] for details."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the grabber stops being dragged. If [param value_changed] is "
"[code]true[/code], [member Range.value] is different from the value when the "
"dragging was started."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'agarrador deixa de ser arrossegat. Si [param value_changed] és "
"[code]true[/code], [member Range.value] és diferent del valor quan es va "
"iniciar l'arrossegament."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the grabber starts being dragged. This is emitted before the "
"corresponding [signal Range.value_changed] signal."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan l'agarrador comença a ser arrossegat. Això s'emet abans del "
"senyal [signal Range.value_changed] corresponent."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"Places the ticks at the bottom of the [HSlider], or right of the [VSlider]."
msgstr ""
"Col·loca les marques a la part inferior de [HSlider] o a la dreta de "
"[VSlider]."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "Places the ticks at the top of the [HSlider], or left of the [VSlider]."
msgstr ""
"Col·loca les marques a la part superior de [HSlider] o a l'esquerra de "
"[VSlider]."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "Places the ticks at the both sides of the slider."
msgstr "Col·loca les marques a banda i banda del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "Places the ticks at the center of the slider."
msgstr "Col·loca les marques al centre del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"Boolean constant. If [code]1[/code], the grabber texture size will be "
"ignored and it will fit within slider's bounds based only on its center "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Constant booleana. Si [code]1[/code], la mida de la textura del captador "
"s'ignorarà i s'ajustarà als límits del control lliscant en funció només de "
"la seva posició central."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "Vertical or horizontal offset of the grabber."
msgstr "Desplaçament vertical o horitzontal de la presa."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"Vertical or horizontal offset of the ticks. The offset is reversed for top "
"or left ticks."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament vertical o horitzontal de les paparres. El desplaçament "
"s'inverteix per a les marques superiors o esquerres."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "The texture for the grabber (the draggable element)."
msgstr "La textura per a l'agarrador (l'element arrossegable)."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "The texture for the grabber when it's disabled."
msgstr "La textura per a la captura quan està desactivada."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "The texture for the grabber when it's focused."
msgstr "La textura per a l'agarrador quan està enfocat."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"The texture for the ticks, visible when [member Slider.tick_count] is "
"greater than 0."
msgstr ""
"La textura de les paparres, visible quan [member Slider.tick_count] és "
"superior a 0."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid "The background of the area to the left or bottom of the grabber."
msgstr "El fons de l'àrea a l'esquerra o a la part inferior del captador."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"The background of the area to the left or bottom of the grabber that "
"displays when it's being hovered or focused."
msgstr ""
"El fons de l'àrea a l'esquerra o a la part inferior del captador que es "
"mostra quan es posa el cursor o s'enfoca."

#: doc/classes/Slider.xml
msgid ""
"The background for the whole slider. Affects the height or width of the "
"[theme_item grabber_area]."
msgstr ""
"El fons de tot el control lliscant. Afecta l'alçada o l'amplada de "
"[theme_item grabber_area]."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that restricts the movement of a 3D physics body along an "
"axis relative to another physics body."
msgstr ""
"Una articulació física que restringeix el moviment d'un cos físic en 3D al "
"llarg d'un eix en relació amb un altre cos físic."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that restricts the movement of a 3D physics body along an "
"axis relative to another physics body. For example, Body A could be a "
"[StaticBody3D] representing a piston base, while Body B could be a "
"[RigidBody3D] representing the piston head, moving up and down."
msgstr ""
"Una articulació física que restringeix el moviment d'un cos físic en 3D al "
"llarg d'un eix en relació amb un altre cos físic. Per exemple, el cos A "
"podria ser un [StaticBody3D] que representa una base del pistó, mentre que "
"el cos B podria ser un [RigidBody3D] que representa el cap del pistó, movent-"
"se cap amunt i cap avall."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "Returns the value of the given parameter."
msgstr "Retorna el valor del paràmetre indicat."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "Assigns [param value] to the given parameter."
msgstr "Assigna [param value] al paràmetre indicat."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping of the rotation when the limit is surpassed.\n"
"A lower damping value allows a rotation initiated by body A to travel to "
"body B slower."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'amortiment de la rotació quan es supera el límit.\n"
"Un valor d'amortiment més baix permet que una rotació iniciada pel cos A "
"viatgi cap al cos B més lentament."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "The lower limit of rotation in the slider."
msgstr "El límit inferior de rotació del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution of the rotation when the limit is surpassed.\n"
"Does not affect damping."
msgstr ""
"Import de la restitució de la rotació quan es supera el límit.\n"
"No afecta l'amortiment."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the all rotation once the limit is surpassed.\n"
"Makes all rotation slower when between 0 and 1."
msgstr ""
"Un factor aplicat a tota la rotació un cop superat el límit.\n"
"Fa que tota la rotació sigui més lenta quan entre 0 i 1."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "The upper limit of rotation in the slider."
msgstr "El límit superior de rotació del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "The amount of damping of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr "La quantitat d'amortiment de la rotació en els límits."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "The amount of restitution of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr "L'import de la restitució de la rotació en els límits."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "A factor applied to the all rotation in the limits."
msgstr "Un factor aplicat a tota la rotació en els límits."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'amortiment de la rotació entre eixos ortogonals al control "
"lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de restitució de la rotació entre eixos ortogonals al control "
"lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the all rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"Un factor aplicat a tota la rotació entre eixos ortogonals al control "
"lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping that happens once the limit defined by [member "
"linear_limit/lower_distance] and [member linear_limit/upper_distance] is "
"surpassed."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'amortiment que es produeix un cop superat el límit definit "
"per [member linear_limit/lower_distance] i [member linear_limit/"
"upper_distance]."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution once the limits are surpassed. The lower, the more "
"velocity-energy gets lost."
msgstr ""
"L'import de la restitució un cop superats els límits. Com més baix, més "
"velocitat-energia es perd."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis once the limits get "
"surpassed. The lower, the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"Un factor aplicat al moviment a través de l'eix del control lliscant un cop "
"es superen els límits. Com més baix, més lent és el moviment."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "The amount of damping inside the slider limits."
msgstr "La quantitat d'amortiment dins dels límits del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "The amount of restitution inside the slider limits."
msgstr "La quantitat de restitució dins dels límits del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis as long as the "
"slider is in the limits. The lower, the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"Un factor aplicat al moviment a través de l'eix del control lliscant sempre "
"que el control lliscant estigui dins dels límits. Com més baix, més lent és "
"el moviment."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping when movement is across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat d'amortiment quan el moviment és a través dels eixos ortogonals "
"al control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution when movement is across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider."
msgstr ""
"La quantitat de restitució quan el moviment és a través dels eixos "
"ortogonals al control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "A factor applied to the movement across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr "Factor aplicat al moviment entre eixos ortogonals al control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/upper_distance]. The maximum "
"difference between the pivot points on their X axis before damping happens."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_limit/upper_distance]. La diferència "
"màxima entre els punts de pivot del seu eix X abans que es produeixi "
"l'amortiment."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/lower_distance]. The minimum "
"difference between the pivot points on their X axis before damping happens."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_limit/lower_distance]. La diferència "
"mínima entre els punts de pivot del seu eix X abans que es produeixi "
"l'amortiment."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the movement across the slider axis once the limits get surpassed. The "
"lower, the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_limit/softness]. Un factor aplicat al "
"moviment a través de l'eix del control lliscant un cop es superen els "
"límits. Com més baix, més lent és el moviment."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution once the limits are surpassed. The lower, the more velocity-"
"energy gets lost."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_limit/restitution]. L'import de la "
"restitució un cop superats els límits. Com més baix, més velocitat-energia "
"es perd."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/damping]. The amount of damping "
"once the slider limits are surpassed."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_limit/damping]. La quantitat "
"d'amortiment un cop superats els límits del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the movement across the slider axis as long as the slider is in the limits. "
"The lower, the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_motion/softness]. Un factor aplicat al "
"moviment a través de l'eix del control lliscant sempre que el control "
"lliscant estigui dins dels límits. Com més baix, més lent és el moviment."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution inside the slider limits."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_motion/restitution]. La quantitat de "
"restitució dins dels límits del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/damping]. The amount of damping "
"inside the slider limits."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_motion/damping]. La quantitat "
"d'amortiment dins dels límits del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_ortho/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the movement across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_ortho/softness]. Factor aplicat al "
"moviment entre eixos ortogonals al control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution when movement is across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_motion/restitution]. La quantitat de "
"restitució quan el moviment és a través dels eixos ortogonals al control "
"lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/damping]. The amount of damping "
"when movement is across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member linear_motion/damping]. La quantitat "
"d'amortiment quan el moviment és a través dels eixos ortogonals al control "
"lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/upper_angle]. The upper limit "
"of rotation in the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_limit/upper_angle]. El límit superior "
"de rotació del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/lower_angle]. The lower limit "
"of rotation in the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_limit/lower_angle]. El límit inferior "
"de rotació del control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the all rotation once the limit is surpassed."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_limit/softness]. Un factor aplicat a "
"tota la rotació un cop superat el límit."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution of the rotation when the limit is surpassed."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_limit/restitution]. Import de la "
"restitució de la rotació quan es supera el límit."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/damping]. The amount of damping "
"of the rotation when the limit is surpassed."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_limit/damping]. La quantitat "
"d'amortiment de la rotació quan es supera el límit."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_motion/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the all rotation in the limits."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_motion/softness]. Un factor aplicat a "
"tota la rotació en els límits."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_motion/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_motion/restitution]. L'import de la "
"restitució de la rotació en els límits."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_motion/damping]. The amount of "
"damping of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_motion/damping]. La quantitat "
"d'amortiment de la rotació en els límits."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_ortho/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the all rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_ortho/softness]. Un factor aplicat a "
"tota la rotació entre eixos ortogonals al control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_ortho/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_ortho/restitution]. La quantitat de "
"restitució de la rotació entre eixos ortogonals al control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_ortho/damping]. The amount of damping "
"of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"Constant per accedir a [member angular_ortho/damping]. La quantitat "
"d'amortiment de la rotació entre eixos ortogonals al control lliscant."

#: doc/classes/SocketServer.xml
msgid "An abstract class for servers based on sockets."
msgstr "Una classe abstracta per a servidors basada en sockets."

#: doc/classes/SocketServer.xml
msgid "A socket server."
msgstr "Un servidor socket."

#: doc/classes/SocketServer.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a connection is available for taking."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] si hi ha una connexió disponible."

#: doc/classes/SocketServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the server is currently listening for "
"connections."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] si el servidor està escoltant connexions."

#: doc/classes/SocketServer.xml
msgid "Stops listening."
msgstr "Deixa d'escoltar."

#: doc/classes/SocketServer.xml
msgid ""
"If a connection is available, returns a StreamPeerSocket with the connection."
msgstr ""
"Si hi ha una connexió disponible, retorna un StreamPeerSocket amb la "
"connexió."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid "A deformable 3D physics mesh."
msgstr "Una malla de física 3D deformable."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"A deformable 3D physics mesh. Used to create elastic or deformable objects "
"such as cloth, rubber, or other flexible materials.\n"
"Additionally, [SoftBody3D] is subject to wind forces defined in [Area3D] "
"(see [member Area3D.wind_source_path], [member Area3D.wind_force_magnitude], "
"and [member Area3D.wind_attenuation_factor]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to use Jolt Physics when using [SoftBody3D] "
"instead of the default GodotPhysics3D, as Jolt Physics' soft body "
"implementation is faster and more reliable. You can switch the physics "
"engine using the [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/physics_engine] project "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Una malla de física 3D deformable. S'utilitza per crear objectes elàstics o "
"deformables com ara tela, goma o altres materials flexibles.\n"
"A més, [SoftBody3D] està subjecte a les forces del vent definides a [Area3D] "
"(vegeu [member Area3D.wind_source_path], [member "
"Area3D.wind_force_magnitude] i [member Area3D.wind_attenuation_factor]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Es recomana utilitzar Jolt Physics quan s'utilitza [SoftBody3D] "
"en comptes del GodotPhysics3D predeterminat, ja que la implementació del cos "
"tou de Jolt Physics és més ràpida i fiable. Podeu canviar el motor de física "
"mitjançant la configuració del projecte [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/"
"physics_engine]."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid "SoftBody"
msgstr "SoftBody"

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Returns the internal [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer3D] for this body."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid "Returns local translation of a vertex in the surface array."
msgstr "Retorna la traducció local d'un vèrtex a la matriu de superfície."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if vertex is set to pinned."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] si el vèrtex està fixat."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the pinned state of a surface vertex. When set to [code]true[/code], "
"the optional [param attachment_path] can define a [Node3D] the pinned vertex "
"will be attached to."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'estat fixat d'un vèrtex de superfície. Quan s'estableix a "
"[code]true[/code], l'opcional [param attachment_path] pot definir un "
"[Node3D] al qual s'adjuntarà el vèrtex fixat."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this SoftBody3D [b]is in[/b]. Collision objects can exist "
"in one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision "
"layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de la física aquest SoftBody3D [b]es a[/b]. Els objectes de "
"col·lisió poden existir en una o més de les 32 capes diferents. Vegeu també "
"[member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'objecte A només pot detectar un contacte amb l'objecte B si "
"l'objecte B es troba a qualsevol de les capes que l'objecte A explora. "
"Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i màscares de "
"col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The physics layers this SoftBody3D [b]scans[/b]. Collision objects can scan "
"one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision "
"layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes de la física aquest SoftBody3D [b]scans[/b]. Els objectes de "
"col·lisió poden escanejar una o més de les 32 capes diferents. Vegeu també "
"[member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'objecte A només pot detectar un contacte amb l'objecte B si "
"l'objecte B es troba a qualsevol de les capes que l'objecte A explora. "
"Consulteu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Capes i màscares de "
"col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's damping coefficient. Higher values will slow down the body more "
"noticeably when forces are applied."
msgstr ""
"Coeficient d'amortiment del cos. Els valors més alts alentiran el cos de "
"manera més notable quan s'apliquen forces."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's drag coefficient. Higher values increase this body's air "
"resistance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is currently unused by Godot's default physics "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"Coeficient d'arrossegament del cos. Els valors més alts augmenten la "
"resistència a l'aire d'aquest cos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest valor no s'utilitza actualment per la implementació de "
"física per defecte de Godot."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Higher values will result in a stiffer body, while lower values will "
"increase the body's ability to bend. The value can be between [code]0.0[/"
"code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Els valors més alts donaran lloc a un cos més rígid, mentre que els valors "
"més baixos augmentaran la capacitat del cos de doblegar-se. El valor pot "
"estar entre [code]0.0[/code] i [code]1.0[/code] (inclosos)."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"[NodePath] to a [CollisionObject3D] this SoftBody3D should avoid clipping."
msgstr ""
"[NodePath] a un [CollisionObject3D] aquest SoftBody3D hauria d'evitar "
"retalls."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The pressure coefficient of this soft body. Simulate pressure build-up from "
"inside this body. Higher values increase the strength of this effect."
msgstr ""
"El coeficient de pressió d'aquest cos tou. Simula l'acumulació de pressió "
"des de l'interior d'aquest cos. Els valors més alts augmenten la força "
"d'aquest efecte."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the [SoftBody3D] will respond to [RayCast3D]s."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], [SoftBody3D] respondrà a [RayCast3D]s."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Scales the rest lengths of [SoftBody3D]'s edge constraints. Positive values "
"shrink the mesh, while negative values expand it. For example, a value of "
"[code]0.1[/code] shortens the edges of the mesh by 10%, while [code]-0.1[/"
"code] expands the edges by 10%.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member shrinking_factor] is best used on surface meshes with "
"pinned points."
msgstr ""
"Escala les longituds restants de les restriccions de vora de [SoftBody3D]. "
"Els valors positius redueixen la malla, mentre que els valors negatius "
"l'amplien. Per exemple, un valor de [code]@0.1[/code] escurça les vores de "
"la malla un 10%, mentre que [code]-0.1[/code] amplia les vores un 10%.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member shrinking_factor] s'utilitza millor en malles de "
"superfície amb punts fixats."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Increasing this value will improve the resulting simulation, but can affect "
"performance. Use with care."
msgstr ""
"Augmentar aquest valor millorarà la simulació resultant, però pot afectar el "
"rendiment. Feu servir amb cura."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid "The SoftBody3D's mass."
msgstr "La massa del SoftBody3D."

#: doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], remove from the physics simulation to stop all "
"physics interactions with this [SoftBody3D].\n"
"Automatically re-added to the physics simulation when the [Node] is "
"processed again."
msgstr ""
"Quan [member Node.process_mode] s'estableix en [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], suprimiu-lo de la simulació de física per "
"aturar totes les interaccions físiques amb aquest [SoftBody3D].\n"
"S'ha tornat a afegir automàticament a la simulació de física quan es torna a "
"processar [Node]."

#: doc/classes/SphereMesh.xml
msgid "Class representing a spherical [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "Classe que representa un [PrimitiveMesh] esfèric."

#: doc/classes/SphereMesh.xml
msgid "Full height of the sphere."
msgstr "Altura total de l'esfera."

#: doc/classes/SphereMesh.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a hemisphere is created rather than a full sphere.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To get a regular hemisphere, the height and radius of the "
"sphere must be equal."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es crea un hemisferi en lloc d'una esfera completa.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per obtenir un hemisferi regular, l'alçada i el radi de "
"l'esfera han de ser iguals."

#: doc/classes/SphereMesh.xml
msgid "Number of radial segments on the sphere."
msgstr "Nombre de segments radials a l'esfera."

#: doc/classes/SphereMesh.xml
msgid "Radius of sphere."
msgstr "Radi de l'esfera."

#: doc/classes/SphereMesh.xml
msgid "Number of segments along the height of the sphere."
msgstr "Nombre de segments al llarg de l'altura de l'esfera."

#: doc/classes/SphereOccluder3D.xml
msgid "Spherical shape for use with occlusion culling in [OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"Forma esfèrica per utilitzar-lo amb l'eliminació d'oclusió a "
"[OccluderInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/SphereOccluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"[SphereOccluder3D] stores a sphere shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""
"[SphereOccluder3D] emmagatzema una forma d'esfera que pot utilitzar el "
"sistema d'eliminació d'oclusió del motor.\n"
"Consulteu la documentació de [OccluderInstance3D] per obtenir instruccions "
"sobre com configurar l'eliminació d'oclusió."

#: doc/classes/SphereOccluder3D.xml
msgid "The sphere's radius in 3D units."
msgstr "El radi de l'esfera en unitats 3D."

#: doc/classes/SphereShape3D.xml
msgid "A 3D sphere shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Una forma d'esfera 3D utilitzada per a la col·lisió física."

#: doc/classes/SphereShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D sphere shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [SphereShape3D] is fast to check collisions against. It "
"is faster than [BoxShape3D], [CapsuleShape3D], and [CylinderShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una forma d'esfera 3D, pensada per al seu ús en física. Normalment "
"s'utilitza per proporcionar una forma per a un [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Rendiment:[/b] [SphereShape3D] és ràpid per comprovar les col·lisions. És "
"més ràpid que [BoxShape3D], [CapsuleShape3D] i [CylinderShape3D]."

#: doc/classes/SphereShape3D.xml
msgid "The sphere's radius. The shape's diameter is double the radius."
msgstr "El radi de l'esfera. El diàmetre de la forma és el doble del radi."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "An input field for numbers."
msgstr "Un camp d'entrada per a números."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"[SpinBox] is a numerical input text field. It allows entering integers and "
"floating-point numbers. The [SpinBox] also has up and down buttons that can "
"be clicked to increase or decrease the value. The value can also be changed "
"by dragging the mouse up or down over the [SpinBox]'s arrows.\n"
"Additionally, mathematical expressions can be entered. These are evaluated "
"when the user presses [kbd]Enter[/kbd] while editing the [SpinBox]'s text "
"field. This uses the [Expression] class to parse and evaluate the "
"expression. The result of the expression is then set as the value of the "
"[SpinBox]. Some examples of valid expressions are [code]5 + 2 * 3[/code], "
"[code]pow(2, 4)[/code], and [code]PI + sin(0.5)[/code]. Expressions are case-"
"sensitive.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Create a [SpinBox], disable its context menu and set its "
"text alignment to right.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var spin_box = SpinBox.new()\n"
"add_child(spin_box)\n"
"var line_edit = spin_box.get_line_edit()\n"
"line_edit.context_menu_enabled = false\n"
"spin_box.horizontal_alignment = LineEdit.HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_RIGHT\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var spinBox = new SpinBox();\n"
"AddChild(spinBox);\n"
"var lineEdit = spinBox.GetLineEdit();\n"
"lineEdit.ContextMenuEnabled = false;\n"
"spinBox.AlignHorizontal = LineEdit.HorizontalAlignEnum.Right;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See [Range] class for more options over the [SpinBox].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With the [SpinBox]'s context menu disabled, you can right-click "
"the bottom half of the spinbox to set the value to its minimum, while right-"
"clicking the top half sets the value to its maximum.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [SpinBox] relies on an underlying [LineEdit] node. To theme a "
"[SpinBox]'s background, add theme items for [LineEdit] and customize them. "
"The [LineEdit] has the [code]SpinBoxInnerLineEdit[/code] theme variation, so "
"that you can give it a distinct appearance from regular [LineEdit]s.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to implement drag and drop for the underlying "
"[LineEdit], you can use [method Control.set_drag_forwarding] on the node "
"returned by [method get_line_edit]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Applies the current value of this [SpinBox]. This is equivalent to pressing "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd] while editing the [LineEdit] used by the [SpinBox]. This "
"will cause [signal LineEdit.text_submitted] to be emitted and its currently "
"contained expression to be evaluated."
msgstr ""
"Aplica el valor actual d'aquest [SpinBox]. Això equival a prémer [kbd]Enter[/"
"kbd] mentre editeu el [LineEdit] utilitzat per [SpinBox]. Això farà que "
"[signal LineEdit.text_submitted] s'emeti i s'avaluï la seva expressió que "
"conté actualment."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [LineEdit] instance from this [SpinBox]. You can use it to "
"access properties and methods of [LineEdit].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la instància [LineEdit] d'aquesta [SpinBox]. Podeu utilitzar-lo per "
"accedir a propietats i mètodes de [LineEdit].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu amagar-lo o algun dels seus fills, feu "
"servir la seva propietat [member CanvasItem.visible]."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Changes the alignment of the underlying [LineEdit]."
msgstr "Canvia l'alineació de la [LineEdit] subjacent."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the value will be rounded to a multiple of [member "
"custom_arrow_step] when interacting with the arrow buttons. Otherwise, "
"increments the value by [member custom_arrow_step] and then rounds it "
"according to [member Range.step]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el valor s'arrodonirà a un múltiple de [member "
"custom_arrow_step] quan interactueu amb els botons de fletxa. En cas "
"contrari, augmenta el valor en [member custom_arrow_step] i després "
"l'arrodoneix segons [member Range.step]."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"If not [code]0[/code], sets the step when interacting with the arrow buttons "
"of the [SpinBox].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member Range.value] will still be rounded to a multiple of "
"[member Range.step]."
msgstr ""
"Si no és [code]0[/code], estableix el pas quan interacciona amb els botons "
"de fletxa de [SpinBox].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member Range.value] encara s'arrodonirà a un múltiple de "
"[member Range.step]."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [SpinBox] will be editable. Otherwise, it will be "
"read only."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [SpinBox] es podrà editar. En cas contrari, només serà "
"de lectura."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the specified prefix string before the numerical value of the [SpinBox]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix la cadena de prefix especificada abans del valor numèric de "
"[SpinBox]."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [SpinBox] will select the whole text when the "
"[LineEdit] gains focus. Clicking the up and down arrows won't trigger this "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'[SpinBox] seleccionarà tot el text quan [LineEdit] "
"guanyi el focus. Si feu clic a les fletxes amunt i avall no activarà aquest "
"comportament."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the specified suffix string after the numerical value of the [SpinBox]."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix la cadena de sufix especificada després del valor numèric de "
"[SpinBox]."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the value of the [Range] for this [SpinBox] when the [LineEdit] text is "
"[i]changed[/i] instead of [i]submitted[/i]. See [signal "
"LineEdit.text_changed] and [signal LineEdit.text_submitted].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If set to [code]true[/code], this will interfere with entering "
"mathematical expressions in the [SpinBox]. The [SpinBox] will try to "
"evaluate the expression as you type, which means symbols like a trailing "
"[code]+[/code] are removed immediately by the expression being evaluated."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Down button icon modulation color, when the button is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Color de modulació de la icona del botó avall, quan el botó està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Down button icon modulation color, when the button is hovered."
msgstr "Color de modulació de la icona del botó avall, quan es passa el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Down button icon modulation color."
msgstr "Color de modulació de la icona del botó avall."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Down button icon modulation color, when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "Color de modulació de la icona del botó avall, quan es prem el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Up button icon modulation color, when the button is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Color de modulació de la icona del botó amunt, quan el botó està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Up button icon modulation color, when the button is hovered."
msgstr "Color de modulació de la icona del botó amunt, quan es passa el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Up button icon modulation color."
msgstr "Color de modulació de la icona del botó amunt."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Up button icon modulation color, when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "Color de modulació de la icona del botó amunt, quan es prem el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Vertical separation between the up and down buttons."
msgstr "Separació vertical entre els botons amunt i avall."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Width of the up and down buttons. If smaller than any icon set on the "
"buttons, the respective icon may overlap neighboring elements. If smaller "
"than [code]0[/code], the width is automatically adjusted from the icon size."
msgstr ""
"Amplada dels botons amunt i avall. Si és petita que qualsevol icona "
"establerta als botons, la icona corresponent pot sobreposar-se a elements "
"veïns. Si és més petit que [code]0[/code], l'amplada s'ajusta automàticament "
"a partir de la mida de la icona."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Width of the horizontal separation between the text input field ([LineEdit]) "
"and the buttons."
msgstr ""
"Amplada de la separació horitzontal entre el camp d'entrada de text "
"([LineEdit]) i els botons."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"This property exists only for compatibility with older themes. Setting "
"[theme_item buttons_width] to a negative value has the same effect."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta propietat només existeix per a la compatibilitat amb temes "
"anteriors. Establir [theme_item buttons_width] a un valor negatiu té el "
"mateix efecte."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"If not [code]0[/code], the minimum button width corresponds to the widest of "
"all icons set on those buttons, even if [theme_item buttons_width] is "
"smaller."
msgstr ""
"Si no és [code]0[/code], l'amplada mínima del botó correspon a la més ampla "
"de totes les icones establertes en aquests botons, encara que [theme_item "
"buttons_width] sigui més petita."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Down button icon, displayed in the middle of the down (value-decreasing) "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Icona del botó avall, que es mostra al mig del botó cap avall (que "
"disminueix el valor)."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Down button icon when the button is disabled."
msgstr "Icona del botó avall quan el botó està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Down button icon when the button is hovered."
msgstr "Icona del botó avall quan es passa el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Down button icon when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "Icona del botó avall quan es prem el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Up button icon, displayed in the middle of the up (value-increasing) button."
msgstr ""
"Icona del botó amunt, que es mostra al mig del botó amunt (augment de valor)."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Up button icon when the button is disabled."
msgstr "Icona del botó amunt quan el botó està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Up button icon when the button is hovered."
msgstr "Icona del botó amunt quan es passa el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Up button icon when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "Icona del botó amunt quan es prem el botó."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Use [theme_item up] and [theme_item down] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [theme_item up] i [theme_item down]."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"Single texture representing both the up and down buttons icons. It is "
"displayed in the middle of the buttons and does not change upon interaction. "
"If a valid icon is assigned, it will replace [theme_item up] and [theme_item "
"down]."
msgstr ""
"Textura única que representa les icones dels botons amunt i avall. Es mostra "
"al centre dels botons i no canvia amb la interacció. Si s'assigna una icona "
"vàlida, substituirà [theme_item up] i [theme_item down]."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the down button."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó avall."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the down button when disabled."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó avall quan està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the down button when hovered."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó avall quan es passa el ratolí."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the down button when being pressed."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó avall quan es prem."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] drawn in the space occupied by the separation between the input "
"field and the buttons."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] dibuixat a l'espai que ocupa la separació entre el camp d'entrada "
"i els botons."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the up button."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó amunt."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the up button when disabled."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó amunt quan està desactivat."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the up button when hovered."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó amunt quan es passa el ratolí."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid "Background style of the up button when being pressed."
msgstr "Estil de fons del botó amunt quan es prem."

#: doc/classes/SpinBox.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] drawn in the space occupied by the separation between the up and "
"down buttons."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] dibuixat a l'espai ocupat per la separació entre els botons amunt "
"i avall."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid "A [SkeletonModifier3D] for aligning bones along a [Path3D]."
msgstr "Un [SkeletonModifier3D] per alinear els ossos al llarg d'un [Path3D]."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] for aligning bones along a [Path3D]. The smoothness "
"of the fitting depends on the [member Curve3D.bake_interval].\n"
"If you want the [Path3D] to attach to a specific bone, it is recommended to "
"place a [ModifierBoneTarget3D] before the [SplineIK3D] in the "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] list (children of the [Skeleton3D]), and then place a "
"[Path3D] as the [ModifierBoneTarget3D]'s child.\n"
"Bone twist is determined based on the [method Curve3D.get_point_tilt].\n"
"If the root bone joint and the start point of the [Curve3D] are separated, "
"it assumes that there is a linear line segment between them. This means that "
"the vector pointing toward the start point of the [Curve3D] takes precedence "
"over the shortest intersection point along the [Curve3D].\n"
"If the end bone joint exceeds the path length, it is bent as close as "
"possible to the end point of the [Curve3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All the methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] "
"parameter. This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if "
"the IK has multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid "Returns the node path of the [Path3D] which is describing the path."
msgstr "Retorna el camí del node del [Path3D] que descriu el camí."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the tilt interpolation method used between the root bone and the "
"start point of the [Curve3D] when they are apart. See also [method "
"set_tilt_fade_in]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el mètode d'interpolació d'inclinació utilitzat entre l'os de "
"l'arrel i el punt inicial de [Curve3D] quan estan separats. Vegeu també "
"[method set_tilt_fade_in]."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the tilt interpolation method used between the end bone and the end "
"point of the [Curve3D] when they are apart. See also [method "
"set_tilt_fade_out]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el mètode d'interpolació d'inclinació utilitzat entre l'os final i "
"el punt final de [Curve3D] quan estan separats. Vegeu també [method "
"set_tilt_fade_out]."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid "Returns if the tilt property of the [Curve3D] affects the bone twist."
msgstr ""
"Retorna si la propietat d'inclinació de [Curve3D] afecta el gir de l'os."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid "Sets the node path of the [Path3D] which is describing the path."
msgstr "Estableix el camí del node del [Path3D] que descriu el camí."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets if the tilt property of the [Curve3D] should affect the bone twist."
msgstr ""
"Estableix si la propietat d'inclinació de [Curve3D] hauria d'afectar la "
"torsió de l'os."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param size] is greater than [code]0[/code], the tilt is interpolated "
"between [param size] start bones from the start point of the [Curve3D] when "
"they are apart.\n"
"If [param size] is equal [code]0[/code], the tilts between the root bone "
"head and the start point of the [Curve3D] are unified with a tilt of the "
"start point of the [Curve3D].\n"
"If [param size] is less than [code]0[/code], the tilts between the root bone "
"and the start point of the [Curve3D] are [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [param size] és més gran que [code]0[/code], la inclinació s'interpola "
"entre [param size] des del punt inicial de [Curve3D] quan estan separats.\n"
"Si [param size] és igual a [code]0[/code], les inclinacions entre el cap de "
"l'os de l'arrel i el punt inicial de [Curve3D] s'unifiquen amb una "
"inclinació del punt inicial de [Curve3D].\n"
"Si [param size] és inferior a [code]0[/code], les inclinacions entre l'os de "
"l'arrel i el punt inicial de [Curve3D] són [code]@0.0[/code]EN."

#: doc/classes/SplineIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param size] is greater than [code]0[/code], the tilt is interpolated "
"between [param size] end bones from the end point of the [Curve3D] when they "
"are apart.\n"
"If [param size] is equal [code]0[/code], the tilts between the end bone tail "
"and the end point of the [Curve3D] are unified with a tilt of the end point "
"of the [Curve3D].\n"
"If [param size] is less than [code]0[/code], the tilts between the end bone "
"and the end point of the [Curve3D] are [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [param size] és més gran que [code]0[/code], la inclinació s'interpola "
"entre els ossos finals [param size] des del punt final de [Curve3D] quan "
"estan separats.\n"
"Si [param size] és igual a [code]0[/code], les inclinacions entre la cua de "
"l'os final i el punt final de [Curve3D] s'unifiquen amb una inclinació del "
"punt final de la [Curve3D].\n"
"Si [param size] és inferior a [code]0[/code], les inclinacions entre l'os "
"final i el punt final de [Curve3D] són [code]@0.0[/code]EN."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that arranges child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"provides grabbers for adjusting the split ratios between them."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que disposa els controls infantils horitzontalment o "
"verticalment i proporciona agafadors per ajustar les proporcions de divisió "
"entre ells."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that arranges child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"creates grabbers between them. The grabbers can be dragged around to change "
"the size relations between the child controls."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que disposa els controls infantils horitzontalment o "
"verticalment i crea agafadors entre ells. Els agafadors es poden arrossegar "
"per canviar les relacions de mida entre els controls secundaris."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Clamps the [member split_offsets] values to ensure they are within valid "
"ranges and do not overlap with each other. When overlaps occur, this method "
"prioritizes one split offset (at index [param priority_index]) by clamping "
"any overlapping split offsets to it."
msgstr ""
"Fixeu els valors [member split_offsets] per assegurar-vos que estiguin dins "
"d'intervals vàlids i que no es superposen entre ells. Quan es produeixen "
"solapaments, aquest mètode prioritza un desplaçament dividit (a l'índex "
"[param priority_index]) fixant-hi els desplaçaments de divisions superposats."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "Use the first element of [method get_drag_area_controls] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu el primer element de [method get_drag_area_controls]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the drag area [Control]. For example, you can move a pre-configured "
"button into the drag area [Control] so that it rides along with the split "
"bar. Try setting the [Button] anchors to [code]center[/code] prior to the "
"[code]reparent()[/code] call.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"$BarnacleButton.reparent($SplitContainer.get_drag_area_control())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The drag area [Control] is drawn over the [SplitContainer]'s "
"children, so [CanvasItem] draw objects called from the [Control] and "
"children added to the [Control] will also appear over the [SplitContainer]'s "
"children. Try setting [member Control.mouse_filter] of custom children to "
"[constant Control.MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] to prevent blocking the mouse from "
"dragging if desired.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'àrea d'arrossegament [Control]. Per exemple, podeu moure un botó "
"preconfigurat a l'àrea d'arrossegament [Control] de manera que vagi "
"juntament amb la barra dividida. Proveu d'establir les àncores [Button] a "
"[code]center[/code] abans de la trucada [code]reparent()[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"$BarnacleButton.reparent($SplitContainer.get_drag_area_control())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'àrea d'arrossegament [Control] es dibuixa sobre els fills de "
"[SplitContainer], de manera que [CanvasItem] dibuixa objectes cridats des de "
"[Control] afegits a [Control]MLC_14@@@@@@MLC_14_14@@@ també apareixerà sobre "
"els fills de [SplitContainer]. Proveu d'establir [member "
"Control.mouse_filter] dels fills personalitzats a [constant "
"Control.MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] per evitar que el ratolí s'arrossegueixi si ho "
"desitja.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of the drag area [Control]s. These are the interactable "
"[Control] nodes between each child. For example, this can be used to add a "
"pre-configured button to a drag area [Control] so that it rides along with "
"the split bar. Try setting the [Button] anchors to [code]center[/code] prior "
"to the [method Node.reparent] call.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"$BarnacleButton.reparent($SplitContainer.get_drag_area_controls()[0])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The drag area [Control]s are drawn over the [SplitContainer]'s "
"children, so [CanvasItem] draw objects called from a drag area and children "
"added to it will also appear over the [SplitContainer]'s children. Try "
"setting [member Control.mouse_filter] of custom children to [constant "
"Control.MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] to prevent blocking the mouse from dragging if "
"desired.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] These are required internal nodes, removing or freeing them "
"may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the draggers will be disabled and the children will be "
"sized as if all [member split_offsets] were [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Highlights the drag area [Rect2] so you can see where it is during "
"development. The drag area is gold if [member dragging_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code], and red if [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Ressalta l'àrea d'arrossegament [Rect2] perquè pugueu veure on és durant el "
"desenvolupament. L'àrea d'arrossegament és daurada si [member "
"dragging_enabled] és [code]true[/code], i vermella si [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Reduces the size of the drag area and split bar [theme_item "
"split_bar_background] at the beginning of the container."
msgstr ""
"Redueix la mida de l'àrea d'arrossegament i la barra dividida [theme_item "
"split_bar_background] al principi del contenidor."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Reduces the size of the drag area and split bar [theme_item "
"split_bar_background] at the end of the container."
msgstr ""
"Redueix la mida de l'àrea d'arrossegament i la barra dividida [theme_item "
"split_bar_background] al final del contenidor."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Shifts the drag area in the axis of the container to prevent the drag area "
"from overlapping the [ScrollBar] or other selectable [Control] of a child "
"node."
msgstr ""
"Desplaça l'àrea d'arrossegament a l'eix del contenidor per evitar que l'àrea "
"d'arrossegament se superposi amb [ScrollBar] o un altre [Control] "
"seleccionable d'un node fill."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Adds extra draggers at the intersection of the draggers of two "
"SplitContainers to allow dragging both at once. This must be set to "
"[code]true[/code] for both SplitContainers, and one needs to be a descendant "
"of the other. They also must be orthogonal (their [member vertical] are "
"different) and the descendant must be next to at least one of the ancestor's "
"draggers (within [theme_item minimum_grab_thickness])."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix arrossegadors addicionals a la intersecció dels arrossegadors de dos "
"SplitContainers per permetre arrossegar tots dos alhora. S'ha d'establir a "
"[code]true[/code] per a tots dos SplitContainers, i un ha de ser descendent "
"de l'altre. També han de ser ortogonals (els seus [member vertical] són "
"diferents) i el descendent ha d'estar al costat d'almenys un dels draggers "
"de l'avantpassat (dins de [theme_item minimum_grab_thickness])."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Determines the dragger's visibility. This property does not determine "
"whether dragging is enabled or not. Use [member dragging_enabled] for that."
msgstr ""
"Determina la visibilitat de l'arrossegador. Aquesta propietat no determina "
"si l'arrossegament està habilitat o no. Utilitzeu [member dragging_enabled] "
"per a això."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "Enables or disables split dragging."
msgstr "Activa o desactiva l'arrossegament dividit."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Use [member split_offsets] instead. The first element of the array is the "
"split offset between the first two children."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu [member split_offsets]. El primer element de la matriu és el "
"desplaçament dividit entre els dos primers fills."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "The first element of [member split_offsets]."
msgstr "El primer element de [member split_offsets]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Offsets for each dragger in pixels. Each one is the offset of the split "
"between the [Control] nodes before and after the dragger, with [code]0[/"
"code] being the default position. The default position is based on the "
"[Control] nodes expand flags and minimum sizes. See [member "
"Control.size_flags_horizontal], [member Control.size_flags_vertical], and "
"[member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio].\n"
"If none of the [Control] nodes before the dragger are expanded, the default "
"position will be at the start of the [SplitContainer]. If none of the "
"[Control] nodes after the dragger are expanded, the default position will be "
"at the end of the [SplitContainer]. If the dragger is in between expanded "
"[Control] nodes, the default position will be in the middle, based on the "
"[member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio]s and minimum sizes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the split offsets cause [Control] nodes to overlap, the "
"first split will take priority when resolving the positions."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçaments per a cada arrossegament en píxels. Cadascun és el "
"desplaçament de la divisió entre els nodes [Control] abans i després de "
"l'arrossegador, amb [code]0[/code] com a posició per defecte. La posició per "
"defecte es basa en els indicadors d'expansió dels nodes [Control] i les "
"mides mínimes. Vegeu [member Control.size_flags_horizontal], [member "
"Control.size_flags_vertical] i [member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio].\n"
"Si no s'amplia cap dels nodes [Control] abans de l'arrossegador, la posició "
"per defecte serà a l'inici de la [SplitContainer]. Si cap dels nodes "
"[Control] després de l'arrossegador s'amplia, la posició per defecte serà al "
"final de l'[SplitContainer]. Si l'arrossegador es troba entre els nodes "
"[Control] expandits, la posició predeterminada estarà al mig, segons els "
"[member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio]s i les mides mínimes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si els desplaçaments de la divisió fan que els nodes [Control] "
"se superposin, la primera divisió tindrà prioritat en resoldre les posicions."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a touch-friendly drag handle will be enabled for "
"better usability on smaller screens. Unlike the standard grabber, this drag "
"handle overlaps the [SplitContainer]'s children and does not affect their "
"minimum separation. The standard grabber will no longer be drawn when this "
"option is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], s'habilitarà un mànec d'arrossegament tàctil per a una "
"millor usabilitat en pantalles més petites. A diferència del captador "
"estàndard, aquest mànec d'arrossegament se superposa als fills de "
"[SplitContainer] i no afecta la seva separació mínima. La captura estàndard "
"ja no es dibuixarà quan aquesta opció estigui habilitada."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [SplitContainer] will arrange its children "
"vertically, rather than horizontally.\n"
"Can't be changed when using [HSplitContainer] and [VSplitContainer]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [SplitContainer] disposarà els seus fills "
"verticalment, en lloc de horitzontalment.\n"
"No es pot canviar quan s'utilitza [HSplitContainer] i [VSplitContainer]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user ends dragging."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari acaba d'arrossegar."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user starts dragging."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari comença a arrossegar."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when any dragger is dragged by user."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari arrossega qualsevol arrossegador."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is always visible when [theme_item autohide] is "
"[code]false[/code], otherwise visible only when the cursor hovers it.\n"
"The size of the grabber icon determines the minimum [theme_item "
"separation].\n"
"The dragger icon is automatically hidden if the length of the grabber icon "
"is longer than the split bar."
msgstr ""
"La icona de l'arrossegador dividit sempre és visible quan [theme_item "
"autohide] és [code]false[/code], en cas contrari només és visible quan el "
"cursor la passa.\n"
"La mida de la icona de captura determina el mínim [theme_item separation].\n"
"La icona de l'arrossegador s'amaga automàticament si la longitud de la icona "
"d'agarrador és més llarga que la barra dividida."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is never visible regardless of the value of "
"[theme_item autohide].\n"
"The size of the grabber icon determines the minimum [theme_item separation]."
msgstr ""
"La icona de l'arrossegador dividit mai és visible, independentment del valor "
"de [theme_item autohide].\n"
"La mida de la icona de captura determina el mínim [theme_item separation]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is not visible, and the split bar is collapsed to "
"zero thickness."
msgstr ""
"La icona de l'arrossegador dividit no és visible i la barra dividida està "
"replegada fins a un gruix zero."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "The color of the touch dragger."
msgstr "El color de l'arrossegador tàctil."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "The color of the touch dragger when hovered."
msgstr "El color de l'arrossegador tàctil quan es passa el ratolí."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid "The color of the touch dragger when pressed."
msgstr "El color de l'arrossegador tàctil quan es prem."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Boolean value. If [code]1[/code] ([code]true[/code]), the grabbers will hide "
"automatically when they aren't under the cursor. If [code]0[/code] "
"([code]false[/code]), the grabbers are always visible. The [member "
"dragger_visibility] must be [constant DRAGGER_VISIBLE]."
msgstr ""
"Valor booleà. Si [code]1[/code] ([code]true[/code]), els capturadors "
"s'amagaran automàticament quan no estiguin sota el cursor. Si [code]0[/code] "
"([code]false[/code]), els capturadors sempre són visibles. El [member "
"dragger_visibility] ha de ser [constant DRAGGER_VISIBLE]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum thickness of the area users can click on to grab a split bar. "
"This ensures that the split bar can still be dragged if [theme_item "
"separation] or [theme_item h_grabber] / [theme_item v_grabber]'s size is too "
"narrow to easily select."
msgstr ""
"El gruix mínim de l'àrea que els usuaris poden fer clic per agafar una barra "
"dividida. Això garanteix que la barra dividida encara es pugui arrossegar si "
"la mida de [theme_item separation] o [theme_item h_grabber] / [theme_item "
"v_grabber] és massa estreta per seleccionar-la fàcilment."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The split bar thickness, i.e., the gap between each child of the container. "
"This is overridden by the size of the grabber icon if [member "
"dragger_visibility] is set to [constant DRAGGER_VISIBLE], or [constant "
"DRAGGER_HIDDEN], and [theme_item separation] is smaller than the size of the "
"grabber icon in the same axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To obtain [theme_item separation] values less than the size of "
"the grabber icon, for example a [code]1 px[/code] hairline, set [theme_item "
"h_grabber] or [theme_item v_grabber] to a new [ImageTexture], which "
"effectively sets the grabber icon size to [code]0 px[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The icon used for the grabbers drawn in the separations. This is only used "
"in [HSplitContainer] and [VSplitContainer]. For [SplitContainer], see "
"[theme_item h_grabber] and [theme_item v_grabber] instead."
msgstr ""
"La icona utilitzada per als grabbers dibuixats a les separacions. Això només "
"s'utilitza a [HSplitContainer] i [VSplitContainer]. Per a [SplitContainer], "
"consulteu [theme_item h_grabber] i [theme_item v_grabber]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The icon used for the grabbers drawn in the separations when [member "
"vertical] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La icona utilitzada per als capturadors dibuixats a les separacions quan "
"[member vertical] és [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The icon used for the drag handle when [member touch_dragger_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code] and [member vertical] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La icona utilitzada per al mànec d'arrossegament quan [member "
"touch_dragger_enabled] és [code]true[/code] i [member vertical] és "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The icon used for the drag handle when [member touch_dragger_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]. This is only used in [HSplitContainer] and "
"[VSplitContainer]. For [SplitContainer], see [theme_item h_touch_dragger] "
"and [theme_item v_touch_dragger] instead."
msgstr ""
"La icona utilitzada per al mànec d'arrossegament quan [member "
"touch_dragger_enabled] és [code]true[/code]. Això només s'utilitza a "
"[HSplitContainer] i [VSplitContainer]. Per a [SplitContainer], consulteu "
"[theme_item h_touch_dragger] i [theme_item v_touch_dragger]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The icon used for the grabbers drawn in the separations when [member "
"vertical] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La icona utilitzada per als capturadors dibuixats a les separacions quan "
"[member vertical] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The icon used for the drag handle when [member touch_dragger_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code] and [member vertical] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La icona utilitzada per al mànec d'arrossegament quan [member "
"touch_dragger_enabled] és [code]true[/code] i [member vertical] és "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Determines the background of the split bar if its thickness is greater than "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"Determina el fons de la barra dividida si el seu gruix és superior a zero."

#: doc/classes/SpotLight3D.xml
msgid "A spotlight, such as a reflector spotlight or a lantern."
msgstr "Un focus, com ara un reflector o una llanterna."

#: doc/classes/SpotLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"A Spotlight is a type of [Light3D] node that emits lights in a specific "
"direction, in the shape of a cone. The light is attenuated through the "
"distance. This attenuation can be configured by changing the energy, radius "
"and attenuation parameters of [Light3D].\n"
"Light is emitted in the -Z direction of the node's global basis. For an "
"unrotated light, this means that the light is emitted forwards, illuminating "
"the front side of a 3D model (see [constant Vector3.FORWARD] and [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, only 8 spot lights can "
"be displayed on each mesh resource. Attempting to display more than 8 spot "
"lights on a single mesh resource will result in spot lights flickering in "
"and out as the camera moves. When using the Compatibility rendering method, "
"only 8 spot lights can be displayed on each mesh resource by default, but "
"this can be increased by adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/limits/"
"opengl/max_lights_per_object].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering methods, spot "
"lights will only correctly affect meshes whose visibility AABB intersects "
"with the light's AABB. If using a shader to deform the mesh in a way that "
"makes it go outside its AABB, [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] "
"must be increased on the mesh. Otherwise, the light may not be visible on "
"the mesh."
msgstr ""
"Un Spotlight és un tipus de node [Light3D] que emet llums en una direcció "
"específica, en forma de con. La llum s'atenua a través de la distància. "
"Aquesta atenuació es pot configurar canviant els paràmetres d'energia, radi "
"i atenuació de [Light3D].\n"
"La llum s'emet en la direcció -Z de la base global del node. Per a una llum "
"sense girar, això significa que la llum s'emet cap endavant, il·luminant la "
"part frontal d'un model 3D (vegeu [constant Vector3.FORWARD] i [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'utilitza el mètode de representació mòbil, només es "
"poden mostrar 8 focus a cada recurs de malla. Si intenteu mostrar més de 8 "
"llums puntuals en un sol recurs de malla, els llums puntuals parpellejaran "
"dins i fora mentre la càmera es mou. Quan s'utilitza el mètode de "
"representació de compatibilitat, només es poden mostrar 8 focus a cada "
"recurs de malla de manera predeterminada, però això es pot augmentar "
"ajustant [member ProjectSettings.rendering/limits/opengl/"
"max_lights_per_object].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'utilitzen els mètodes de representació mòbil o de "
"compatibilitat, els focus només afectaran correctament les malles la "
"visibilitat de les quals AABB es creua amb l'AABB de la llum. Si utilitzeu "
"un shader per deformar la malla d'una manera que la faci sortir del seu "
"AABB, [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] s'ha d'augmentar a la "
"malla. En cas contrari, és possible que la llum no sigui visible a la malla."

#: doc/classes/SpotLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"The spotlight's angle in degrees. This is the angular radius, meaning the "
"angle from the -Z axis, the cone's center, to the edge of the cone. The "
"default angular radius of 45 degrees corresponds to a cone with an angular "
"diameter of 90 degrees.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member spot_angle] is not affected by [member Node3D.scale] "
"(the light's scale or its parent's scale)."
msgstr ""
"Angle del focus en graus. Aquest és el radi angular, és a dir, l'angle des "
"de l'eix -Z, el centre del con, fins a la vora del con. El radi angular "
"predeterminat de 45 graus correspon a un con amb un diàmetre angular de 90 "
"graus.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member spot_angle] no es veu afectada per [member "
"Node3D.scale] (l'escala de la llum o l'escala dels seus pares)."

#: doc/classes/SpotLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"The spotlight's [i]angular[/i] attenuation curve. See also [member "
"spot_attenuation]."
msgstr ""
"La corba d'atenuació [i]angular[/i] del focus. Vegeu també [member "
"spot_attenuation]."

#: doc/classes/SpotLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the distance attenuation function for spotlights.\n"
"A value of [code]0.0[/code] will maintain a constant brightness through most "
"of the range, but smoothly attenuate the light at the edge of the range. Use "
"a value of [code]2.0[/code] for physically accurate lights as it results in "
"the proper inverse square attenutation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting attenuation to [code]2.0[/code] or higher may result in "
"distant objects receiving minimal light, even within range. For example, "
"with a range of [code]4096[/code], an object at [code]100[/code] units is "
"attenuated by a factor of [code]0.0001[/code]. With a default brightness of "
"[code]1[/code], the light would not be visible at that distance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using negative or values higher than [code]10.0[/code] may lead "
"to unexpected results."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpotLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximal range that can be reached by the spotlight. Note that the "
"effectively lit area may appear to be smaller depending on the [member "
"spot_attenuation] in use. No matter the [member spot_attenuation] in use, "
"the light will never reach anything outside this range.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member spot_range] is not affected by [member Node3D.scale] "
"(the light's scale or its parent's scale)."
msgstr ""
"L'abast màxim al qual es pot assolir el focus. Tingueu en compte que l'àrea "
"il·luminada efectivament pot semblar més petita segons el [member "
"spot_attenuation] que s'utilitzi. Independentment del [member "
"spot_attenuation] en ús, la llum mai arribarà a res fora d'aquest rang.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member spot_range] no es veu afectada per [member "
"Node3D.scale] (l'escala de la llum o l'escala dels seus pares)."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D raycast that dynamically moves its children near the collision point."
msgstr ""
"Un raycast en 3D que mou dinàmicament els seus fills a prop del punt de "
"col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"[SpringArm3D] casts a ray or a shape along its Z axis and moves all its "
"direct children to the collision point, with an optional margin. This is "
"useful for 3rd person cameras that move closer to the player when inside a "
"tight space (you may need to exclude the player's collider from the "
"[SpringArm3D]'s collision check)."
msgstr ""
"[SpringArm3D] projecta un raig o una forma al llarg del seu eix Z i mou tots "
"els seus fills directes al punt de col·lisió, amb un marge opcional. Això és "
"útil per a càmeres de tercera persona que s'apropen al jugador quan es "
"troben dins d'un espai reduït (pot ser que hàgiu d'excloure el "
"col·lisionador del jugador de la comprovació de col·lisió de [SpringArm3D])."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid "Third-person camera with spring arm"
msgstr "Càmera en tercera persona amb braç de molla"

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the [PhysicsBody3D] object with the given [RID] to the list of "
"[PhysicsBody3D] objects excluded from the collision check."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix l'objecte [PhysicsBody3D] amb el [RID] donat a la llista d'objectes "
"[PhysicsBody3D] exclosos de la comprovació de col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the list of [PhysicsBody3D] objects excluded from the collision check."
msgstr ""
"Esborra la llista d'objectes [PhysicsBody3D] exclosos de la comprovació de "
"col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid "Returns the spring arm's current length."
msgstr "Retorna la longitud actual del braç de molla."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given [RID] from the list of [PhysicsBody3D] objects excluded "
"from the collision check."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el [RID] donat de la llista d'objectes [PhysicsBody3D] exclosos de "
"la comprovació de col·lisions."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"The layers against which the collision check will be done. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-"
"and-masks]Collision layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Les capes contra les quals es farà la comprovació de col·lisions. Consulteu "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-"
"and-masks]Capes i màscares de col·lisió[/url] a la documentació per obtenir "
"més informació."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"When the collision check is made, a candidate length for the SpringArm3D is "
"given.\n"
"The margin is then subtracted to this length and the translation is applied "
"to the child objects of the SpringArm3D.\n"
"This margin is useful for when the SpringArm3D has a [Camera3D] as a child "
"node: without the margin, the [Camera3D] would be placed on the exact point "
"of collision, while with the margin the [Camera3D] would be placed close to "
"the point of collision."
msgstr ""
"Quan es fa la comprovació de col·lisions, es dóna una longitud candidata per "
"al SpringArm3D.\n"
"A continuació, es resta el marge a aquesta longitud i la traducció s'aplica "
"als objectes fills del SpringArm3D.\n"
"Aquest marge és útil quan el SpringArm3D té un [Camera3D] com a node fill: "
"sense el marge, el [Camera3D] es col·locaria al punt exacte de col·lisió, "
"mentre que amb el marge el [Camera3D] es col·locaria a prop del punt de "
"col·lisió."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Shape3D] to use for the SpringArm3D.\n"
"When the shape is set, the SpringArm3D will cast the [Shape3D] on its z axis "
"instead of performing a ray cast."
msgstr ""
"El [Shape3D] que s'utilitzarà per al SpringArm3D.\n"
"Quan s'estableixi la forma, el SpringArm3D llançarà el [Shape3D] al seu eix "
"z en comptes de realitzar un model de raig."

#: doc/classes/SpringArm3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum extent of the SpringArm3D. This is used as a length for both the "
"ray and the shape cast used internally to calculate the desired position of "
"the SpringArm3D's child nodes.\n"
"To know more about how to perform a shape cast or a ray cast, please consult "
"the [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D] documentation."
msgstr ""
"L'extensió màxima del SpringArm3D. S'utilitza com a longitud tant per al "
"raig com per al model de forma utilitzat internament per calcular la posició "
"desitjada dels nodes fills del SpringArm3D.\n"
"Per obtenir més informació sobre com realitzar un model de forma o un model "
"de raig, consulteu la documentació [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"A base class of the collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una classe base de la col·lisió que interactua amb [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"A collision can be a child of [SpringBoneSimulator3D]. If it is not a child "
"of [SpringBoneSimulator3D], it has no effect.\n"
"The colliding and sliding are done in the [SpringBoneSimulator3D]'s "
"modification process in order of its collision list which is set by [method "
"SpringBoneSimulator3D.set_collision_path]. If [method "
"SpringBoneSimulator3D.are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/"
"code], the order matches [SceneTree].\n"
"If [member bone] is set, it synchronizes with the bone pose of the ancestor "
"[Skeleton3D], which is done in before the [SpringBoneSimulator3D]'s "
"modification process as the pre-process.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A scaled [SpringBoneCollision3D] will likely not behave as "
"expected. Make sure that the parent [Skeleton3D] and its bones are not "
"scaled."
msgstr ""
"Una col·lisió pot ser un fill de [SpringBoneSimulator3D]. Si no és un fill "
"de [SpringBoneSimulator3D], no té cap efecte.\n"
"La col·lisió i el lliscament es fan en el procés de modificació de "
"[SpringBoneSimulator3D] per ordre de la seva llista de col·lisions que "
"s'estableix per [method SpringBoneSimulator3D.set_collision_path]. Si "
"[method SpringBoneSimulator3D.are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és "
"[code]true[/code], l'ordre coincideix amb [SceneTree].\n"
"Si s'estableix [member bone], es sincronitza amb la postura òssia de "
"l'avantpassat [Skeleton3D], que es fa abans del procés de modificació de "
"[SpringBoneSimulator3D] com a preprocés.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] És probable que un [SpringBoneCollision3D] escalat no es "
"comporti com s'esperava. Assegureu-vos que el pare [Skeleton3D] i els seus "
"ossos no estiguin escalats."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Get parent [Skeleton3D] node of the parent [SpringBoneSimulator3D] if found."
msgstr ""
"Obteniu el node principal [Skeleton3D] del pare [SpringBoneSimulator3D] si "
"es troba."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"The offset of the position from [Skeleton3D]'s [member bone] pose position."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament de la posició respecte a la posició de la posició [member "
"bone] de [Skeleton3D]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"The offset of the rotation from [Skeleton3D]'s [member bone] pose rotation."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament de la rotació respecte a la rotació de poses [Skeleton3D] de "
"[member bone]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollisionCapsule3D.xml
msgid "A capsule shape collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una col·lisió en forma de càpsula que interactua amb [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollisionCapsule3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollisionSphere3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the collision acts to trap the joint within the "
"collision."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollisionPlane3D.xml
msgid ""
"An infinite plane collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una col·lisió plana infinita que interactua amb [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollisionPlane3D.xml
msgid ""
"An infinite plane collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]. It "
"is an infinite size XZ plane, and the +Y direction is treated as normal."
msgstr ""
"Una col·lisió plana infinita que interactua amb [SpringBoneSimulator3D]. És "
"un pla XZ de mida infinita i la direcció +Y es tracta com a normal."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollisionSphere3D.xml
msgid "A sphere shape collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr ""
"Una col·lisió en forma d'esfera que interactua amb [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneCollisionSphere3D.xml
msgid "The sphere's radius."
msgstr "El radi de l'esfera."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "A [SkeletonModifier3D] to apply inertial wavering to bone chains."
msgstr ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] per aplicar fluctuacions inercials a les cadenes "
"òssies."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModifier3D] can be used to wiggle hair, cloth, and tails. This "
"modifier behaves differently from [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] as it attempts "
"to return the original pose after modification.\n"
"If you setup [method set_root_bone] and [method set_end_bone], it is treated "
"as one bone chain. Note that it does not support a branched chain like Y-"
"shaped chains.\n"
"When a bone chain is created, an array is generated from the bones that "
"exist in between and listed in the joint list.\n"
"Several properties can be applied to each joint, such as [method "
"set_joint_stiffness], [method set_joint_drag], and [method "
"set_joint_gravity].\n"
"For simplicity, you can set values to all joints at the same time by using a "
"[Curve]. If you want to specify detailed values individually, set [method "
"set_individual_config] to [code]true[/code].\n"
"For physical simulation, [SpringBoneSimulator3D] can have children as self-"
"standing collisions that are not related to [PhysicsServer3D], see also "
"[SpringBoneCollision3D].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A scaled [SpringBoneSimulator3D] will likely not behave as "
"expected. Make sure that the parent [Skeleton3D] and its bones are not "
"scaled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] "
"parameter. This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if "
"the IK has multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"Aquest [SkeletonModifier3D] es pot utilitzar per moure els cabells, els "
"draps i les cues. Aquest modificador es comporta de manera diferent de "
"[PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] ja que intenta tornar la postura original després "
"de la modificació.\n"
"Si configureu [method set_root_bone] i [method set_end_bone], es tractarà "
"com una cadena òssia. Tingueu en compte que no admet una cadena ramificada "
"com les cadenes en forma d'Y.\n"
"Quan es crea una cadena òssia, es genera una matriu a partir dels ossos que "
"hi ha entremig i que figuren a la llista conjunta.\n"
"Es poden aplicar diverses propietats a cada unió, com ara [method "
"set_joint_stiffness], [method set_joint_drag] i [method set_joint_gravity].\n"
"Per simplificar, podeu establir valors a totes les articulacions al mateix "
"temps mitjançant un [Curve]. Si voleu especificar valors detallats "
"individualment, establiu [method set_individual_config] a [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"Per a la simulació física, [SpringBoneSimulator3D] pot tenir fills com a "
"col·lisions autònomes que no estan relacionades amb [PhysicsServer3D], vegeu "
"també [SpringBoneCollision3D].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] És probable que un [SpringBoneSimulator3D] escalat no es "
"comporti com s'esperava. Assegureu-vos que el pare [Skeleton3D] i els seus "
"ossos no estiguin escalats.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La majoria dels mètodes d'aquesta classe prenen un paràmetre "
"[code]index[/code]. Aquest paràmetre especifica quina entrada de la llista "
"de paràmetres cal tornar si l'IK té diverses entrades (per exemple, "
"[code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if all child [SpringBoneCollision3D]s are "
"contained in the collision list at [param index] in the settings."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Clears all collisions from the collision list at [param index] in the "
"settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Esborra totes les col·lisions de la llista de col·lisions a [param index] a "
"la configuració quan [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Clears all exclude collisions from the collision list at [param index] in "
"the settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Esborra totes les col·lisions d'exclusió de la llista de col·lisions a "
"[param index] a la configuració quan [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the center bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna l'índex de l'os central de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the center bone name of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna el nom de l'os central de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns what the center originates from in the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna d'on s'origina el centre a la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the center node path of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna el camí del node central de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision count of the bone chain's collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el recompte de col·lisions de la llista de col·lisions de la cadena "
"òssia quan [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in "
"the bone chain's collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el camí del node de [SpringBoneCollision3D] a [param collision] a la "
"llista de col·lisions de la cadena òssia quan [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the drag force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la corba d'esmorteïment de la força de resistència de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the exclude collision count of the bone chain's exclude collision "
"list when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el recompte de col·lisions d'exclusió de la llista de col·lisions "
"d'exclusió de la cadena òssia quan [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] "
"és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in "
"the bone chain's exclude collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el camí del node de [SpringBoneCollision3D] a [param collision] a la "
"llista de col·lisions d'exclusió de la cadena òssia quan [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the gravity amount of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna la quantitat de gravetat de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the gravity amount damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la corba d'esmorteïment de la quantitat de gravetat de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the gravity direction of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna la direcció de la gravetat de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Returns the drag force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the gravity amount at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la quantitat de gravetat a [param joint] a la llista d'articulacions "
"de la cadena òssia."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the gravity direction at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la direcció de la gravetat a [param joint] a la llista "
"d'articulacions de la cadena òssia."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the radius at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el radi a [param joint] a la llista d'articulacions de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the stiffness force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the joint radius of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna el radi de l'articulació de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the joint radius damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la corba d'esmorteïment del radi de l'articulació de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the rotation axis of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna l'eix de rotació de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis vector of the bone chain. This vector represents "
"the axis around which the bone chain can rotate. It is determined based on "
"the rotation axis set for the bone chain.\n"
"If [method get_rotation_axis] is [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL], this method returns [code]Vector3(0, "
"0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el vector de l'eix de rotació de la cadena òssia. Aquest vector "
"representa l'eix al voltant del qual pot girar la cadena òssia. Es determina "
"en funció de l'eix de rotació establert per a la cadena òssia.\n"
"Si [method get_rotation_axis] és [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL], aquest mètode retorna "
"[code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the stiffness force of the bone chain."
msgstr "Retorna la força de rigidesa de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Returns the stiffness force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la corba d'esmorteïment de la força de rigidesa de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the config can be edited individually for each "
"joint."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Resets a simulating state with respect to the current bone pose.\n"
"It is useful to prevent the simulation result getting violent. For example, "
"calling this immediately after a call to [method AnimationPlayer.play] "
"without a fading, or within the previous [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed] signal if it's condition changes "
"significantly."
msgstr ""
"Restableix un estat de simulació respecte a la postura òssia actual.\n"
"És útil per evitar que el resultat de la simulació sigui violent. Per "
"exemple, trucant-ho immediatament després d'una trucada a [method "
"AnimationPlayer.play] sense esvair, o dins del senyal anterior [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed] si la seva condició canvia "
"significativament."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Sets the center bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "Estableix l'índex de l'os central de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Sets the center bone name of the bone chain."
msgstr "Estableix el nom de l'os central de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets what the center originates from in the bone chain.\n"
"Bone movement is calculated based on the difference in relative distance "
"between center and bone in the previous and next frames.\n"
"For example, if the parent [Skeleton3D] is used as the center, the bones are "
"considered to have not moved if the [Skeleton3D] moves in the world.\n"
"In this case, only a change in the bone pose is considered to be a bone "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"Estableix de què s'origina el centre a la cadena òssia.\n"
"El moviment ossi es calcula a partir de la diferència de distància relativa "
"entre el centre i l'os en els fotogrames anterior i següent.\n"
"Per exemple, si el pare [Skeleton3D] s'utilitza com a centre, es considera "
"que els ossos no s'han mogut si [Skeleton3D] es mou al món.\n"
"En aquest cas, només un canvi en la postura òssia es considera un moviment "
"ossi."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Sets the center node path of the bone chain."
msgstr "Estableix el camí del node central de la cadena d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the number of collisions in the collision list at [param index] in the "
"settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nombre de col·lisions a la llista de col·lisions a [param "
"index] a la configuració quan [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in "
"the bone chain's collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el camí del node de [SpringBoneCollision3D] a [param collision] a "
"la llista de col·lisions de la cadena òssia quan [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the drag force of the bone chain. The greater the value, the more "
"suppressed the wiggling.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_drag_damping_curve] and cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la força d'arrossegament de la cadena òssia. Com més gran sigui el "
"valor, més suprimirà el moviment.\n"
"[method set_drag_damping_curve] escala el valor i s'emmagatzema a la memòria "
"cau a cada paràmetre conjunt de la llista conjunta."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Sets the drag force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la corba d'esmorteïment de la força de resistència de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], all child [SpringBoneCollision3D]s "
"are colliding and [method set_exclude_collision_path] is enabled as an "
"exclusion list at [param index] in the settings.\n"
"If [param enabled] is [code]false[/code], you need to manually register all "
"valid collisions with [method set_collision_path]."
msgstr ""
"Si [param enabled] és [code]true[/code], tots els [SpringBoneCollision3D]s "
"infantils estan xocant i [method set_exclude_collision_path] està habilitat "
"com a llista d'exclusió a [param index] a la configuració.\n"
"Si [param enabled] és [code]false[/code], heu de registrar manualment totes "
"les col·lisions vàlides amb [method set_collision_path]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the end bone name of the bone chain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] End bone must be the root bone or a child of the root bone. If "
"they are the same, the tail must be extended by [method set_extend_end_bone] "
"to jiggle the bone."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nom de l'os final de la cadena òssia.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'os final ha de ser l'os de l'arrel o un fill de l'os de "
"l'arrel. Si són iguals, la cua s'ha d'estendre amb [method "
"set_extend_end_bone] per moure l'os."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the number of exclude collisions in the exclude collision list at "
"[param index] in the settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] "
"is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el nombre de col·lisions d'exclusió a la llista de col·lisions "
"d'exclusió a [param index] a la configuració quan [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in "
"the bone chain's exclude collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el camí del node de [SpringBoneCollision3D] a [param collision] a "
"la llista de col·lisions d'exclusió de la cadena òssia quan [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the gravity amount of the bone chain. This value is not an "
"acceleration, but a constant velocity of movement in [method "
"set_gravity_direction].\n"
"If [param gravity] is not [code]0[/code], the modified pose will not return "
"to the original pose since it is always affected by gravity.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_gravity_damping_curve] and cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la quantitat de gravetat de la cadena òssia. Aquest valor no és "
"una acceleració, sinó una velocitat de moviment constant a [method "
"set_gravity_direction].\n"
"Si [param gravity] no és [code]0[/code], la postura modificada no tornarà a "
"la postura original ja que sempre es veu afectada per la gravetat.\n"
"[method set_gravity_damping_curve] escala el valor i s'emmagatzema a la "
"memòria cau a cada paràmetre conjunt de la llista conjunta."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Sets the gravity amount damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la corba d'esmorteïment de la quantitat de gravetat de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the gravity direction of the bone chain. This value is internally "
"normalized and then multiplied by [method set_gravity].\n"
"The value is cached in each joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la direcció de gravetat de la cadena òssia. Aquest valor es "
"normalitza internament i després es multiplica per [method set_gravity].\n"
"El valor s'emmagatzema a la memòria cau a cada paràmetre conjunt de la "
"llista conjunta."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the config can be edited "
"individually for each joint."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the drag force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la força d'arrossegament a [param joint] a la llista "
"d'articulacions de la cadena òssia quan [method is_config_individual] és "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the gravity amount at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la quantitat de gravetat a [param joint] a la llista "
"d'articulacions de la cadena òssia quan [method is_config_individual] és "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the gravity direction at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list "
"when [method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la direcció de la gravetat a [param joint] a la llista "
"d'articulacions de la cadena òssia quan [method is_config_individual] és "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the joint radius at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el radi de l'articulació a [param joint] a la llista "
"d'articulacions de la cadena òssia quan [method is_config_individual] és "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"The axes are based on the reference pose's space, if [param axis] is "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], you can specify any "
"axis.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before the "
"simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rotation axis and the forward vector shouldn't be colinear "
"to avoid unintended rotation since [SpringBoneSimulator3D] does not factor "
"in twisting forces."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'eix de rotació a [param joint] a la llista d'articulacions de la "
"cadena òssia quan [method is_config_individual] és [code]true[/code].\n"
"Els eixos es basen en l'espai de la postura de referència, si [param axis] "
"és [constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], podeu especificar "
"qualsevol eix.\n"
"Aquí, la postura de referència és la postura òssia immediatament abans de la "
"simulació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'eix de rotació i el vector cap endavant no han de ser "
"colineals per evitar una rotació no desitjada ja que [SpringBoneSimulator3D] "
"no té en compte les forces de torsió."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the stiffness force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list "
"when [method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la força de rigidesa a [param joint] a la llista d'articulacions "
"de la cadena òssia quan [method is_config_individual] és [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the joint radius of the bone chain. It is used to move and slide with "
"the [SpringBoneCollision3D] in the collision list.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_radius_damping_curve] and cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el radi articular de la cadena òssia. S'utilitza per moure's i "
"lliscar amb [SpringBoneCollision3D] a la llista de col·lisions.\n"
"[method set_radius_damping_curve] escala el valor i s'emmagatzema a la "
"memòria cau a cada paràmetre conjunt de la llista conjunta."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Sets the joint radius damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la corba d'esmorteïment del radi de l'articulació de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis of the bone chain. If set to a specific axis, it acts "
"like a hinge joint. The value is cached in each joint setting in the joint "
"list.\n"
"The axes are based on the reference pose's space, if [param axis] is "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], you can specify any "
"axis.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before the "
"simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rotation axis vector and the forward vector shouldn't be "
"colinear to avoid unintended rotation since [SpringBoneSimulator3D] does not "
"factor in twisting forces."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'eix de rotació de la cadena òssia. Si s'estableix en un eix "
"específic, actua com una articulació de frontissa. El valor s'emmagatzema a "
"la memòria cau a cada paràmetre conjunt de la llista conjunta.\n"
"Els eixos es basen en l'espai de la postura de referència, si [param axis] "
"és [constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], podeu especificar "
"qualsevol eix.\n"
"Aquí, la postura de referència és la postura òssia immediatament abans de la "
"simulació.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El vector de l'eix de rotació i el vector cap endavant no han "
"de ser colineals per evitar una rotació no desitjada, ja que "
"[SpringBoneSimulator3D] no té en compte les forces de torsió."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis vector of the bone chain. The value is cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list.\n"
"This vector is normalized by an internal process and represents the axis "
"around which the bone chain can rotate.\n"
"If the vector length is [code]0[/code], it is considered synonymous with "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el vector de l'eix de rotació de la cadena òssia. El valor "
"s'emmagatzema a la memòria cau a cada paràmetre conjunt de la llista "
"conjunta.\n"
"Aquest vector es normalitza per un procés intern i representa l'eix al "
"voltant del qual pot girar la cadena òssia.\n"
"Si la longitud del vector és [code]0[/code], es considera sinònim de "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the stiffness force of the bone chain. The greater the value, the "
"faster it recovers to its initial pose.\n"
"If [param stiffness] is [code]0[/code], the modified pose will not return to "
"the original pose.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_stiffness_damping_curve] and cached in "
"each joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la força de rigidesa de la cadena òssia. Com més gran sigui el "
"valor, més ràpid es recupera a la seva postura inicial.\n"
"Si [param stiffness] és [code]0[/code], la postura modificada no tornarà a "
"la postura original.\n"
"[method set_stiffness_damping_curve] escala el valor i s'emmagatzema a la "
"memòria cau a cada paràmetre conjunt de la llista conjunta."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "Sets the stiffness force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la corba d'esmorteïment de la força de rigidesa de la cadena "
"d'ossos."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"The constant force that always affected bones. It is equal to the result "
"when the parent [Skeleton3D] moves at this speed in the opposite direction.\n"
"This is useful for effects such as wind and anti-gravity."
msgstr ""
"La força constant que sempre afectava els ossos. És igual al resultat quan "
"el pare [Skeleton3D] es mou a aquesta velocitat en sentit contrari.\n"
"Això és útil per a efectes com el vent i l'antigravetat."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone pose "
"every frame.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone rest "
"and caches it, which increases performance slightly, but position changes in "
"the bone pose made before processing this [SpringBoneSimulator3D] are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el solucionador recupera l'eix ossi de la posició de "
"l'os a cada fotograma.\n"
"Si [code]false[/code], el solucionador recupera l'eix ossi del suport ossi i "
"l'emmagatzema a la memòria cau, la qual cosa augmenta lleugerament el "
"rendiment, però els canvis de posició en la postura òssia fets abans de "
"processar aquesta [SpringBoneSimulator3D] s'ignoren."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid "The world origin is defined as center."
msgstr "L'origen mundial es defineix com a centre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Node3D] specified by [method set_center_node] is defined as center.\n"
"If [Node3D] is not found, the parent [Skeleton3D] is treated as center."
msgstr ""
"El [Node3D] especificat per [method set_center_node] es defineix com a "
"centre.\n"
"Si no es troba [Node3D], el pare [Skeleton3D] es tractarà com a centre."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"The bone pose origin of the parent [Skeleton3D] specified by [method "
"set_center_bone] is defined as center.\n"
"If [Node3D] is not found, the parent [Skeleton3D] is treated as center."
msgstr ""
"L'origen de la postura òssia del pare [Skeleton3D] especificat per [method "
"set_center_bone] es defineix com a centre.\n"
"Si no es troba [Node3D], el pare [Skeleton3D] es tractarà com a centre."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid "General-purpose sprite node."
msgstr "Node de sprite d'ús general."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that displays a 2D texture. The texture displayed can be a region "
"from a larger atlas texture, or a frame from a sprite sheet animation."
msgstr ""
"Un node que mostra una textura 2D. La textura que es mostra pot ser una "
"regió d'una textura d'atles més gran o un fotograma d'una animació de full "
"de sprites."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Rect2] representing the Sprite2D's boundary in local "
"coordinates.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Detect if the Sprite2D was clicked:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton and event.pressed and event.button_index "
"== MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tif get_rect().has_point(to_local(event.position)):\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"A click!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton inputEventMouse)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (inputEventMouse.Pressed && inputEventMouse.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (GetRect().HasPoint(ToLocal(inputEventMouse.Position)))\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print(\"A click!\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Rect2] que representa el límit de Sprite2D en coordenades "
"locals.\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] Detecta si s'ha fet clic a Sprite2D:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _entrada(esdeveniment):\n"
"\tsi l'esdeveniment és InputEventMouseButton i event.pressed i "
"event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tsi get_rect().has_point(a_local(event.position)):\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Un clic!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"anul·lació pública void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event és InputEventMouseButton inputEventMouse)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (inputEventMouse.Pressed && inputEventMouse.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (GetRect().HasPoint(ToLocal(inputEventMouse.Position)))\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Un clic!\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the pixel at the given position is opaque, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise. Also returns [code]false[/code] if the given "
"position is out of bounds or this sprite's [member texture] is [code]null[/"
"code]. [param pos] is in local coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el píxel a la posició donada és opac, "
"[code]false[/code] en cas contrari. També retorna [code]false[/code] si la "
"posició donada està fora dels límits o si el [member texture] d'aquest "
"sprite és [code]null[/code]. [param pos] està en coordenades locals."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], texture is centered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For games with a pixel art aesthetic, textures may appear "
"deformed when centered. This is caused by their position being between "
"pixels. To prevent this, set this property to [code]false[/code], or "
"consider enabling [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la textura està centrada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per als jocs amb una estètica d'art de píxels, les textures "
"poden semblar deformades quan estan centrades. Això és causat perquè la seva "
"posició està entre píxels. Per evitar-ho, establiu aquesta propietat a "
"[code]false[/code] o considereu habilitar [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] i [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/"
"snap/snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"Current frame to display from sprite sheet. [member hframes] or [member "
"vframes] must be greater than 1. This property is automatically adjusted "
"when [member hframes] or [member vframes] are changed to keep pointing to "
"the same visual frame (same column and row). If that's impossible, this "
"value is reset to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Marc actual per mostrar des del full de sprites. [member hframes] o [member "
"vframes] ha de ser superior a 1. Aquesta propietat s'ajusta automàticament "
"quan es canvia [member hframes] o [member vframes] per continuar apuntant al "
"mateix marc visual (mateixa columna i fila). Si això és impossible, aquest "
"valor es restableix a [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"Coordinates of the frame to display from sprite sheet. This is as an alias "
"for the [member frame] property. [member hframes] or [member vframes] must "
"be greater than 1."
msgstr ""
"Coordenades del marc per mostrar des del full de sprites. Això és com un "
"àlies per a la propietat [member frame]. [member hframes] o [member vframes] "
"han de ser superiors a 1."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of columns in the sprite sheet. When this property is changed, "
"[member frame] is adjusted so that the same visual frame is maintained (same "
"row and column). If that's impossible, [member frame] is reset to [code]0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de columnes del full de sprites. Quan es canvia aquesta propietat, "
"[member frame] s'ajusta perquè es mantingui el mateix marc visual (mateixa "
"fila i columna). Si això és impossible, [member frame] es restableix a "
"[code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid ""
"The texture's drawing offset.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When you increase [member offset].y in Sprite2D, the sprite "
"moves downward on screen (i.e., +Y is down)."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament del dibuix de la textura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan augmenteu [member offset].y a Sprite2D, el sprite es mou "
"cap avall a la pantalla (és a dir, +Y està avall)."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], texture is cut from a larger atlas texture. See "
"[member region_rect].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a custom [Shader] on a [Sprite2D], the [code]UV[/"
"code] shader built-in will refer to the entire texture space. Use the "
"[code]REGION_RECT[/code] built-in to get the currently visible region "
"defined in [member region_rect] instead. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.html]CanvasItem shaders[/url] "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la textura es talla d'una textura d'atles més gran. "
"Veure [member region_rect].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan s'utilitza un [Shader] personalitzat en un [Sprite2D], el "
"[code]UV[/code] integrat farà referència a tot l'espai de textura. Utilitzeu "
"el [code]REGION_RECT[/code] integrat per obtenir la regió visible actualment "
"definida a [member region_rect]. Vegeu [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/shaders/"
"shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.html]CanvasItem shaders[/url] per "
"obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the area outside of the [member region_rect] is "
"clipped to avoid bleeding of the surrounding texture pixels. [member "
"region_enabled] must be [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], l'àrea exterior de [member region_rect] es retalla per "
"evitar el sagnat dels píxels de textura circumdants. [member region_enabled] "
"ha de ser [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"The region of the atlas texture to display. [member region_enabled] must be "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"La regió de la textura de l'atles a mostrar. [member region_enabled] ha de "
"ser [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] object to draw."
msgstr "[Texture2D] objecte per dibuixar."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of rows in the sprite sheet. When this property is changed, "
"[member frame] is adjusted so that the same visual frame is maintained (same "
"row and column). If that's impossible, [member frame] is reset to [code]0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de files al full de sprites. Quan es canvia aquesta propietat, "
"[member frame] s'ajusta perquè es mantingui el mateix marc visual (mateixa "
"fila i columna). Si això és impossible, [member frame] es restableix a "
"[code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [member frame] changes."
msgstr "S'emet quan canvia [member frame]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [member texture] changes."
msgstr "S'emet quan canvia [member texture]."

#: doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid "2D sprite node in a 3D world."
msgstr "Node de sprite 2D en un món 3D."

#: doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that displays a 2D texture in a 3D environment. The texture displayed "
"can be a region from a larger atlas texture, or a frame from a sprite sheet "
"animation. See also [SpriteBase3D] where properties such as the billboard "
"mode are defined."
msgstr ""
"Un node que mostra una textura 2D en un entorn 3D. La textura que es mostra "
"pot ser una regió d'una textura d'atles més gran o un fotograma d'una "
"animació de full de sprites. Vegeu també [SpriteBase3D] on es defineixen "
"propietats com ara el mode de cartellera."

#: doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the sprite will use [member region_rect] and display "
"only the specified part of its texture."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el sprite utilitzarà [member region_rect] i només "
"mostrarà la part especificada de la seva textura."

#: doc/classes/Sprite3D.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] object to draw. If [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override] "
"is used, this will be overridden. The size information is still used."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] objecte per dibuixar. Si s'utilitza [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_override], se substituirà. La informació de mida "
"encara es fa servir."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "2D sprite node in 3D environment."
msgstr "Node sprite 2D en entorn 3D."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node that displays 2D texture information in a 3D environment. See also "
"[Sprite3D] where many other properties are defined."
msgstr ""
"Un node que mostra informació de textura 2D en un entorn 3D. Vegeu també "
"[Sprite3D] on es defineixen moltes altres propietats."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [TriangleMesh] with the sprite's vertices following its current "
"configuration (such as its [member axis] and [member pixel_size])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [TriangleMesh] amb els vèrtexs del sprite seguint la seva "
"configuració actual (com ara el seu [member axis] i [member pixel_size])."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "Returns the rectangle representing this sprite."
msgstr "Retorna el rectangle que representa aquest sprite."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the specified flag will be enabled."
msgstr "Si és [code]true[/code], l'indicador especificat s'habilitarà."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "The direction in which the front of the texture faces."
msgstr "La direcció en què mira la part frontal de la textura."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"The billboard mode to use for the sprite.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When billboarding is enabled and the material also casts "
"shadows, billboards will face [b]the[/b] camera in the scene when rendering "
"shadows. In scenes with multiple cameras, the intended shadow cannot be "
"determined and this will result in undefined behavior. See [url=https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/72638]GitHub Pull Request #72638[/url] for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"El mode de cartellera que s'utilitzarà per al sprite.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan la cartellera està activada i el material també fa ombres, "
"les cartelleres s'enfrontaran a la [b]@[/b] a la càmera de l'escena quan es "
"representen ombres. En escenes amb diverses càmeres, no es pot determinar "
"l'ombra prevista i això donarà lloc a un comportament indefinit. Consulteu "
"[url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/72638]GitHub Pull Request "
"#72638[/url] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], texture will be centered."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], la textura es centrarà."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], texture can be seen from the back as well, if "
"[code]false[/code], it is invisible when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la textura també es pot veure des del darrere, si "
"[code]false[/code], és invisible quan la mirem des del darrere."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture is rendered at the same size regardless of "
"distance. The texture's size on screen is the same as if the camera was "
"[code]1.0[/code] units away from the texture's origin, regardless of the "
"actual distance from the camera. The [Camera3D]'s field of view (or [member "
"Camera3D.size] when in orthogonal/frustum mode) still affects the size the "
"sprite is drawn at."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la textura es renderitza a la mateixa mida "
"independentment de la distància. La mida de la textura a la pantalla és la "
"mateixa que si la càmera estigués [code]@1.0[/code] unitats lluny de "
"l'origen de la textura, independentment de la distància real de la càmera. "
"El camp de visió de [Camera3D] (o [member Camera3D.size] quan està en mode "
"ortogonal/frustum) encara afecta la mida en què està dibuixat l'esprit."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"A color value used to [i]multiply[/i] the texture's colors. Can be used for "
"mood-coloring or to simulate the color of ambient light.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member CanvasItem.modulate] for 2D, colors with values "
"above [code]1.0[/code] (overbright) are not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override] is defined "
"on the [SpriteBase3D], the material override must be configured to take "
"vertex colors into account for albedo. Otherwise, the color defined in "
"[member modulate] will be ignored. For a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] must be [code]true[/code]. For a "
"[ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted in the "
"shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function."
msgstr ""
"Un valor de color utilitzat per [i]multiply[/i] els colors de la textura. Es "
"pot utilitzar per pintar l'estat d'ànim o per simular el color de la llum "
"ambiental.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A diferència de [member CanvasItem.modulate] per a 2D, els "
"colors amb valors superiors a [code]1.0[/code] (sobrebrillant) no són "
"compatibles.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si es defineix un [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override] "
"a [SpriteBase3D], la substitució del material s'ha de configurar per tenir "
"en compte els colors del vèrtex per a l'albedo. En cas contrari, el color "
"definit a [member modulate] s'ignorarà. Per a un [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] ha de ser [code]true[/code]. Per "
"a un [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] s'ha d'inserir a la "
"funció [code]fragment()[/code] del shader."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"The texture's drawing offset.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When you increase [member offset].y in Sprite3D, the sprite "
"moves upward in world space (i.e., +Y is up)."
msgstr ""
"Desplaçament del dibuix de la textura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan augmenteu [member offset].y a Sprite3D, el sprite es mou "
"cap amunt a l'espai mundial (és a dir, +Y és amunt)."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "The size of one pixel's width on the sprite to scale it in 3D."
msgstr "La mida de l'amplada d'un píxel al sprite per escalar-lo en 3D."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the render priority for the sprite. Higher priority objects will be "
"sorted in front of lower priority objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies if [member alpha_cut] is set to [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (default value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to sorting of transparent objects. This will "
"not impact how transparent objects are sorted relative to opaque objects. "
"This is because opaque objects are not sorted, while transparent objects are "
"sorted from back to front (subject to priority)."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la prioritat de renderització del sprite. Els objectes de "
"prioritat més alta s'ordenaran davant dels objectes de prioritat més baixa.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només s'aplica si [member alpha_cut] s'estableix en "
"[constant ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (valor per defecte).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Això només s'aplica a l'ordenació d'objectes transparents. Això "
"no afectarà com s'ordenen els objectes transparents en relació als objectes "
"opacs. Això es deu al fet que els objectes opacs no s'ordenen, mentre que "
"els objectes transparents s'ordenen de darrere a davant (segons la "
"prioritat)."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Light3D] in the [Environment] has effects on the "
"sprite."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], [Light3D] a [Environment] té efectes sobre l'esprit."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"Filter flags for the texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Linear filtering may cause artifacts around the edges, which "
"are especially noticeable on opaque textures. To prevent this, use textures "
"with transparent or identical colors around the edges."
msgstr ""
"Filtre les banderes per a la textura.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El filtratge lineal pot provocar artefactes al voltant de les "
"vores, que es noten especialment en textures opaques. Per evitar-ho, "
"utilitzeu textures amb colors transparents o idèntics al voltant de les "
"vores."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture's transparency and the opacity are used to "
"make those parts of the sprite invisible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la transparència i l'opacitat de la textura "
"s'utilitzen per fer invisibles aquestes parts de l'esprit."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set, the texture's transparency and the opacity are used to make those "
"parts of the sprite invisible."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix, la transparència i l'opacitat de la textura s'utilitzen per "
"fer invisibles aquestes parts de l'esprit."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "If set, lights in the environment affect the sprite."
msgstr "Si s'estableix, les llums de l'entorn afecten el sprite."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set, texture can be seen from the back as well. If not, the texture is "
"invisible when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix, la textura també es pot veure des del darrere. Si no, la "
"textura és invisible mirant-la des del darrere."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"This mode performs standard alpha blending. It can display translucent "
"areas, but transparency sorting issues may be visible when multiple "
"transparent materials are overlapping."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mode realitza una combinació alfa estàndard. Pot mostrar àrees "
"translúcides, però els problemes d'ordenació de transparència poden ser "
"visibles quan es superposen diversos materials transparents."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"This mode only allows fully transparent or fully opaque pixels. Harsh edges "
"will be visible unless some form of screen-space antialiasing is enabled "
"(see [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"screen_space_aa]). On the bright side, this mode doesn't suffer from "
"transparency sorting issues when multiple transparent materials are "
"overlapping. This mode is also known as [i]alpha testing[/i] or [i]1-bit "
"transparency[/i]."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mode només permet píxels totalment transparents o totalment opacs. "
"Les vores dures seran visibles tret que s'habiliten algun tipus "
"d'antialiasing de l'espai de pantalla (vegeu [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa]). D'altra "
"banda, aquest mode no pateix problemes d'ordenació de transparència quan es "
"superposen diversos materials transparents. Aquest mode també es coneix com "
"a [i]alpha testing[/i] o [i]Transparència d'1 bit[/i]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"This mode draws fully opaque pixels in the depth prepass. This is slower "
"than [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] or [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISCARD], but it "
"allows displaying translucent areas and smooth edges while using proper "
"sorting."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mode dibuixa píxels totalment opacs al prepass de profunditat. Això "
"és més lent que [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] o [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISCARD], però permet mostrar àrees translúcides i vores suaus "
"mentre s'utilitza una ordenació adequada."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Sprite frame library for AnimatedSprite2D and AnimatedSprite3D."
msgstr ""
"Biblioteca de marcs de Sprite per a AnimatedSprite2D i AnimatedSprite3D."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Sprite frame library for an [AnimatedSprite2D] or [AnimatedSprite3D] node. "
"Contains frames and animation data for playback."
msgstr ""
"Biblioteca de marcs sprite per a un node [AnimatedSprite2D] o "
"[AnimatedSprite3D]. Conté fotogrames i dades d'animació per a la reproducció."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Adds a new [param anim] animation to the library."
msgstr "Afegeix una nova animació [param anim] a la biblioteca."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a frame to the [param anim] animation. If [param at_position] is "
"[code]-1[/code], the frame will be added to the end of the animation. [param "
"duration] specifies the relative duration, see [method get_frame_duration] "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un marc a l'animació [param anim]. Si [param at_position] és "
"[code]-1[/code], el marc s'afegirà al final de l'animació. [param duration] "
"especifica la durada relativa, vegeu [method get_frame_duration] per obtenir "
"més informació."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Removes all frames from the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "Elimina tots els fotogrames de l'animació [param anim]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Removes all animations. An empty [code]default[/code] animation will be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Elimina totes les animacions. Es crearà una animació buida [code]default[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicates the animation [param anim_from] to a new animation named [param "
"anim_to]. Fails if [param anim_to] already exists, or if [param anim_from] "
"does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Duplica l'animació [param anim_from] a una nova animació anomenada [param "
"anim_to]. Falla si [param anim_to] ja existeix, o si [param anim_from] no "
"existeix."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Use [method get_animation_loop_mode] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [method get_animation_loop_mode]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [code]get_animation_loop_mode(anim) == "
"LOOP_LINEAR[/code]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Returns the loop mode for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "Retorna el mode de bucle de l'animació [param anim]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the names associated to each animation. Values "
"are placed in alphabetical order."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu que conté els noms associats a cada animació. Els valors "
"es col·loquen per ordre alfabètic."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Returns the speed in frames per second for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Returns the number of frames for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de fotogrames per a l'animació [param anim]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a relative duration of the frame [param idx] in the [param anim] "
"animation (defaults to [code]1.0[/code]). For example, a frame with a "
"duration of [code]2.0[/code] is displayed twice as long as a frame with a "
"duration of [code]1.0[/code]. You can calculate the absolute duration (in "
"seconds) of a frame using the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"absolute_duration = relative_duration / (animation_fps * "
"abs(playing_speed))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"In this example, [code]playing_speed[/code] refers to either [method "
"AnimatedSprite2D.get_playing_speed] or [method "
"AnimatedSprite3D.get_playing_speed]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una durada relativa del fotograma [param idx] a l'animació [param "
"anim] (per defecte és [code]1.0[/code]). Per exemple, un fotograma amb una "
"durada de [code]2.0[/code] es mostra el doble de temps que un fotograma amb "
"una durada de [code]@1.0[/code]. Podeu calcular la durada absoluta (en "
"segons) d'un fotograma mitjançant la fórmula següent:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"durada_absoluta = durada_relativa / (animation_fps * "
"abs(velocitat_de_reproducció))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"En aquest exemple, [code]playing_speed[/code] fa referència a [method "
"AnimatedSprite2D.get_playing_speed] o a [method "
"AnimatedSprite3D.get_playing_speed]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the texture of the frame [param idx] in the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "Retorna la textura del marc [param idx] a l'animació [param anim]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param anim] animation exists."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] si existeix l'animació [param anim]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Removes the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "Elimina l'animació [param anim]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Removes the [param anim] animation's frame [param idx]."
msgstr "Elimina el marc de l'animació [param anim] [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Changes the [param anim] animation's name to [param newname]."
msgstr "Canvia el nom de l'animació [param anim] a [param newname]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Use [method set_animation_loop_mode] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [method set_animation_loop_mode]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"If [param loop] is [code]false[/code] equivalent to "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_NONE)[/code].\n"
"If [param loop] is [code]true[/code] equivalent to "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_LINEAR)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Si [param loop] és [code]false[/code] equivalent a "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_NONE)[/code].\n"
"Si [param loop] és [code]true[/code] equivalent a "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_LINEAR)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Sets the [param loop_mode] for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "Estableix el [param loop_mode] de l'animació [param anim]."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid "Sets the speed for the [param anim] animation in frames per second."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la velocitat de l'animació [param anim] en fotogrames per segon."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [param texture] and the [param duration] of the frame [param idx] "
"in the [param anim] animation. [param duration] specifies the relative "
"duration, see [method get_frame_duration] for details."
msgstr ""
"Estableix [param texture] i [param duration] del marc [param idx] a "
"l'animació [param anim]. [param duration] especifica la durada relativa, "
"vegeu [method get_frame_duration] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"The animation plays once and stops when it reaches the end, or the start if "
"played in reverse."
msgstr ""
"L'animació es reprodueix una vegada i s'atura quan arriba al final, o al "
"començament si es reprodueix al revés."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"The animation restarts from the beginning when it reaches the end, or from "
"the end if played in reverse, repeating continuously."
msgstr ""
"L'animació es reinicia des del principi quan arriba al final, o des del "
"final si es reprodueix al revés, repetint-se contínuament."

#: doc/classes/SpriteFrames.xml
msgid ""
"The animation alternates direction each time it reaches the end or start, "
"playing forward and then in reverse repeatedly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Both [AnimatedSprite2D] and [AnimatedSprite3D] play the first/"
"last frame for its duration only once at each end of the animation loop "
"(instead of twice, once per forward/backward animation direction)."
msgstr ""
"L'animació alterna direcció cada vegada que arriba al final o al "
"començament, reproduint-se cap endavant i després cap enrere repetidament.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Tant [AnimatedSprite2D] com [AnimatedSprite3D] reprodueixen el "
"primer/últim fotograma durant la seva durada només una vegada a cada extrem "
"del bucle d'animació (en lloc de dues vegades, una vegada per direcció "
"d'animació cap endavant/enrere)."

#: doc/classes/StandardMaterial3D.xml
msgid "A PBR (Physically Based Rendering) material to be used on 3D objects."
msgstr ""
"Un material PBR (Physically Based Rendering) per utilitzar-lo en objectes 3D."

#: doc/classes/StandardMaterial3D.xml
msgid ""
"[StandardMaterial3D]'s properties are inherited from [BaseMaterial3D]. "
"[StandardMaterial3D] uses separate textures for ambient occlusion, roughness "
"and metallic maps. To use a single ORM map for all 3 textures, use an "
"[ORMMaterial3D] instead."
msgstr ""
"Les propietats de [StandardMaterial3D] s'hereten de [BaseMaterial3D]. "
"[StandardMaterial3D] utilitza textures separades per a l'oclusió ambiental, "
"la rugositat i els mapes metàl·lics. Per utilitzar un mapa ORM únic per a "
"les 3 textures, utilitzeu un [ORMMaterial3D]."

#: doc/classes/StaticBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D physics body that can't be moved by external forces. When moved "
"manually, it doesn't affect other bodies in its path."
msgstr ""
"Un cos de física 2D que no es pot moure per forces externes. Quan es mou "
"manualment, no afecta els altres cossos al seu pas."

#: doc/classes/StaticBody2D.xml
msgid ""
"A static 2D physics body. It can't be moved by external forces or contacts, "
"but can be moved manually by other means such as code, [AnimationMixer]s "
"(with [member AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] set to [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]), and "
"[RemoteTransform2D].\n"
"When [StaticBody2D] is moved, it is teleported to its new position without "
"affecting other physics bodies in its path. If this is not desired, use "
"[AnimatableBody2D] instead.\n"
"[StaticBody2D] is useful for completely static objects like floors and "
"walls, as well as moving surfaces like conveyor belts and circular revolving "
"platforms (by using [member constant_linear_velocity] and [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."
msgstr ""
"Un cos de física 2D estàtic. No es pot moure per forces o contactes externs, "
"però es pot moure manualment per altres mitjans, com ara codi, "
"[AnimationMixer]s (amb [member AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] "
"establert a [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]) i "
"[RemoteTransform2D].\n"
"Quan [StaticBody2D] es mou, es teletransporta a la seva nova posició sense "
"afectar altres cossos físics al seu pas. Si no ho desitja, utilitzeu "
"[AnimatableBody2D].\n"
"[StaticBody2D] és útil per a objectes completament estàtics com terres i "
"parets, així com superfícies mòbils com cintes transportadores i plataformes "
"giratòries circulars (utilitzant [member constant_linear_velocity] i [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."

#: doc/classes/StaticBody2D.xml doc/classes/StaticBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's constant angular velocity. This does not rotate the body, but "
"affects touching bodies, as if it were rotating."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat angular constant del cos. Això no fa girar el cos, sinó que "
"afecta els cossos que toquen, com si estigués girant."

#: doc/classes/StaticBody2D.xml doc/classes/StaticBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"The body's constant linear velocity. This does not move the body, but "
"affects touching bodies, as if it were moving."
msgstr ""
"La velocitat lineal constant del cos. Això no mou el cos, sinó que afecta "
"els cossos que toquen, com si es mogués."

#: doc/classes/StaticBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D physics body that can't be moved by external forces. When moved "
"manually, it doesn't affect other bodies in its path."
msgstr ""
"Un cos de física 3D que no es pot moure per forces externes. Quan es mou "
"manualment, no afecta els altres cossos al seu pas."

#: doc/classes/StaticBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"A static 3D physics body. It can't be moved by external forces or contacts, "
"but can be moved manually by other means such as code, [AnimationMixer]s "
"(with [member AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] set to [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]), and "
"[RemoteTransform3D].\n"
"When [StaticBody3D] is moved, it is teleported to its new position without "
"affecting other physics bodies in its path. If this is not desired, use "
"[AnimatableBody3D] instead.\n"
"[StaticBody3D] is useful for completely static objects like floors and "
"walls, as well as moving surfaces like conveyor belts and circular revolving "
"platforms (by using [member constant_linear_velocity] and [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."
msgstr ""
"Un cos de física estàtic en 3D. No es pot moure per forces o contactes "
"externs, però es pot moure manualment per altres mitjans, com ara codi, "
"[AnimationMixer]s (amb [member AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] "
"establert a [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]) i "
"[RemoteTransform3D].\n"
"Quan [StaticBody3D] es mou, es teletransporta a la seva nova posició sense "
"afectar altres cossos físics al seu pas. Si no ho desitja, utilitzeu "
"[AnimatableBody3D].\n"
"[StaticBody3D] és útil per a objectes completament estàtics com terres i "
"parets, així com superfícies mòbils com cintes transportadores i plataformes "
"giratòries circulars (utilitzant [member constant_linear_velocity] i [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."

#: doc/classes/StatusIndicator.xml
msgid ""
"Application status indicator (aka notification area icon).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Status indicator is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Indicador d'estat de l'aplicació (coneguda com a icona de l'àrea de "
"notificació).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] L'indicador d'estat s'implementa a macOS i Windows."

#: doc/classes/StatusIndicator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the status indicator rectangle in screen coordinates. If this status "
"indicator is not visible, returns an empty [Rect2]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el rectangle indicador d'estat en coordenades de pantalla. Si aquest "
"indicador d'estat no és visible, retorna un [Rect2] buit."

#: doc/classes/StatusIndicator.xml
msgid "Status indicator icon."
msgstr "Icona d'indicador d'estat."

#: doc/classes/StatusIndicator.xml
msgid ""
"Status indicator native popup menu. If this is set, the [signal pressed] "
"signal is not emitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Native popup is only supported if [NativeMenu] supports "
"[constant NativeMenu.FEATURE_POPUP_MENU] feature."
msgstr ""
"Menú emergent natiu de l'indicador d'estat. Si s'estableix, el senyal "
"[signal pressed] no s'emet.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Només s'admet la finestra emergent nativa si [NativeMenu] admet "
"la funció [constant NativeMenu.FEATURE_POPUP_MENU]."

#: doc/classes/StatusIndicator.xml
msgid "Status indicator tooltip."
msgstr "Informació sobre l'indicador d'estat."

#: doc/classes/StatusIndicator.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the status indicator is visible."
msgstr "Si és [code]true[/code], l'indicador d'estat és visible."

#: doc/classes/StatusIndicator.xml
msgid "Emitted when the status indicator is pressed."
msgstr "S'emet quan es prem l'indicador d'estat."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for interacting with streams."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per interactuar amb fluxos."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"StreamPeer is an abstract base class mostly used for stream-based protocols "
"(such as TCP). It provides an API for sending and receiving data through "
"streams as raw data or strings.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""
"StreamPeer és una classe base abstracta que s'utilitza principalment per a "
"protocols basats en fluxos (com ara TCP). Proporciona una API per enviar i "
"rebre dades a través de fluxos com a dades en brut o cadenes.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar la implementació amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a signed byte from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un byte signat del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a signed 16-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un valor signat de 16 bits del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a signed 32-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un valor signat de 32 bits del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a signed 64-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un valor signat de 64 bits del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the number of bytes this [StreamPeer] has available."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de bytes que té disponible aquest [StreamPeer]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a chunk data with the received bytes, as an [Array] containing two "
"elements: an [enum Error] constant and a [PackedByteArray]. [param bytes] is "
"the number of bytes to be received. If not enough bytes are available, the "
"function will block until the desired amount is received."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un fragment de dades amb els bytes rebuts, com a [Array] que conté "
"dos elements: una constant [enum Error] i una [PackedByteArray]. [param "
"bytes] és el nombre de bytes a rebre. Si no hi ha prou bytes disponibles, la "
"funció es bloquejarà fins que es rebi la quantitat desitjada."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a double-precision float from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un flotant de doble precisió del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a single-precision float from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un flotant de precisió única del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets a half-precision float from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un flotador de mitja precisió del corrent."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a chunk data with the received bytes, as an [Array] containing two "
"elements: an [enum Error] constant and a [PackedByteArray]. [param bytes] is "
"the number of bytes to be received. If not enough bytes are available, the "
"function will return how many were actually received."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un fragment de dades amb els bytes rebuts, com a [Array] que conté "
"dos elements: una constant [enum Error] i una [PackedByteArray]. [param "
"bytes] és el nombre de bytes a rebre. Si no hi ha prou bytes disponibles, la "
"funció retornarà quants s'han rebut realment."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Gets an ASCII string with byte-length [param bytes] from the stream. If "
"[param bytes] is negative (default) the length will be read from the stream "
"using the reverse process of [method put_string]."
msgstr ""
"Obté una cadena ASCII amb longitud de bytes [param bytes] del flux. Si "
"[param bytes] és negatiu (per defecte), la longitud es llegirà del flux "
"mitjançant el procés invers de [method put_string]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets an unsigned byte from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un byte sense signar del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets an unsigned 16-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un valor de 16 bits sense signar del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets an unsigned 32-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un valor de 32 bits sense signar del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Gets an unsigned 64-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "Obté un valor de 64 bits sense signar del flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Gets a UTF-8 string with byte-length [param bytes] from the stream (this "
"decodes the string sent as UTF-8). If [param bytes] is negative (default) "
"the length will be read from the stream using the reverse process of [method "
"put_utf8_string]."
msgstr ""
"Obté una cadena UTF-8 amb longitud de bytes [param bytes] del flux (això "
"descodifica la cadena enviada com a UTF-8). Si [param bytes] és negatiu (per "
"defecte), la longitud es llegirà del flux mitjançant el procés invers de "
"[method put_utf8_string]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Gets a Variant from the stream. If [param allow_objects] is [code]true[/"
"code], decoding objects is allowed.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same decoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.bytes_to_var] method.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized objects can contain code which gets executed. "
"Do not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources "
"to avoid potential security threats such as remote code execution."
msgstr ""
"Decodifica una matriu de bytes de nou a un valor. Quan [code]allow_objects[/"
"code] és [code]true[/code] es permet la descodificació d'objectes.\n"
"[b]ADVERTÈNCIA:[/b] L'objecte deserialitzat pot contenir codi que s'executa. "
"No utilitzeu aquesta opció si l'objecte serialitzat prové de fonts no "
"fiables per a evitar possibles amenaces de seguretat (execució remota de "
"codi)."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts a signed byte into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un byte signat al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts a signed 16-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un valor signat de 16 bits al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts a signed 32-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un valor signat de 32 bits al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts a signed 64-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un valor signat de 64 bits al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a chunk of data through the connection, blocking if necessary until "
"the data is done sending. This function returns an [enum Error] code."
msgstr ""
"Envia un tros de dades a través de la connexió, bloquejant-los si cal fins "
"que s'acabi d'enviar les dades. Aquesta funció retorna un codi [enum Error]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts a double-precision float into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un flotador de doble precisió al corrent."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts a single-precision float into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un flotador de precisió única al corrent."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts a half-precision float into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un flotador de mitja precisió al corrent."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a chunk of data through the connection. If all the data could not be "
"sent at once, only part of it will. This function returns two values, an "
"[enum Error] code and an integer, describing how much data was actually sent."
msgstr ""
"Envia un tros de dades a través de la connexió. Si no es poguessin enviar "
"totes les dades alhora, només una part ho farà. Aquesta funció retorna dos "
"valors, un codi [enum Error] i un nombre enter, que descriu quantes dades "
"s'han enviat realment."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Puts a zero-terminated ASCII string into the stream prepended by a 32-bit "
"unsigned integer representing its size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To put an ASCII string without prepending its size, you can use "
"[method put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hello world\".to_ascii_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hello World\".ToAsciiBuffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Posa una cadena ASCII amb terminació zero a la seqüència d'informació amb un "
"nombre enter sense signe de 32 bits que representa la seva mida.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per posar una cadena ASCII sense anteposar la seva mida, podeu "
"utilitzar [method put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hola món\".to_ascii_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hola món\".ToAsciiBuffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts an unsigned byte into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un byte sense signar al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts an unsigned 16-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un valor de 16 bits sense signar al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts an unsigned 32-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un valor de 32 bits sense signar al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid "Puts an unsigned 64-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "Posa un valor de 64 bits sense signar al flux."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Puts a zero-terminated UTF-8 string into the stream prepended by a 32 bits "
"unsigned integer representing its size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To put a UTF-8 string without prepending its size, you can use "
"[method put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hello world\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hello World\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Posa una cadena UTF-8 amb terminació zero a la seqüència, davant d'un nombre "
"enter sense signe de 32 bits que representa la seva mida.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per posar una cadena UTF-8 sense anteposar-ne la mida, podeu "
"utilitzar [method put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hola món\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hola món\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Puts a Variant into the stream. If [param full_objects] is [code]true[/code] "
"encoding objects is allowed (and can potentially include code).\n"
"Internally, this uses the same encoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.var_to_bytes] method."
msgstr ""
"Posa una variant al flux. Si [param full_objects] és [code]true[/code] es "
"permeten els objectes de codificació (i poden incloure codi).\n"
"Internament, utilitza el mateix mecanisme de codificació que el mètode "
"[method @GlobalScope.var_to_bytes]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this [StreamPeer] will using big-endian format for "
"encoding and decoding."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], aquest [StreamPeer] utilitzarà el format big-endian "
"per a la codificació i la descodificació."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid "A stream peer used to handle binary data streams."
msgstr "Un peer de flux utilitzat per gestionar fluxos de dades binàries."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid ""
"A data buffer stream peer that uses a byte array as the stream. This object "
"can be used to handle binary data from network sessions. To handle binary "
"data stored in files, [FileAccess] can be used directly.\n"
"A [StreamPeerBuffer] object keeps an internal cursor which is the offset in "
"bytes to the start of the buffer. Get and put operations are performed at "
"the cursor position and will move the cursor accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Un peer de flux de memòria intermèdia de dades que utilitza una matriu de "
"bytes com a flux. Aquest objecte es pot utilitzar per gestionar dades "
"binàries de sessions de xarxa. Per gestionar dades binàries emmagatzemades "
"en fitxers, es pot utilitzar directament [FileAccess].\n"
"Un objecte [StreamPeerBuffer] manté un cursor intern que és el desplaçament "
"en bytes a l'inici de la memòria intermèdia. Les operacions d'obtenció i "
"posada es realitzen a la posició del cursor i mouran el cursor en "
"conseqüència."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid "Clears the [member data_array] and resets the cursor."
msgstr "Esborra [member data_array] i restableix el cursor."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new [StreamPeerBuffer] with the same [member data_array] content."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [StreamPeerBuffer] nou amb el mateix contingut [member "
"data_array]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid "Returns the current cursor position."
msgstr "Retorna la posició actual del cursor."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid "Returns the size of [member data_array]."
msgstr "Retorna la mida de [member data_array]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid "Resizes the [member data_array]. This [i]doesn't[/i] update the cursor."
msgstr ""
"Canvia la mida de [member data_array]. Aquest [i]no[/i] actualitza el cursor."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the cursor to the specified position. [param position] must be a valid "
"index of [member data_array]."
msgstr ""
"Mou el cursor a la posició especificada. [param position] ha de ser un índex "
"vàlid de [member data_array]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerBuffer.xml
msgid "The underlying data buffer. Setting this value resets the cursor."
msgstr ""
"El buffer de dades subjacent. En establir aquest valor, el cursor es "
"restableix."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerGZIP.xml
msgid "A stream peer that handles GZIP and deflate compression/decompression."
msgstr ""
"Un stream peer que gestiona GZIP i desinfla la compressió/descompressió."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerGZIP.xml
msgid ""
"This class allows to compress or decompress data using GZIP/deflate in a "
"streaming fashion. This is particularly useful when compressing or "
"decompressing files that have to be sent through the network without needing "
"to allocate them all in memory.\n"
"After starting the stream via [method start_compression] (or [method "
"start_decompression]), calling [method StreamPeer.put_partial_data] on this "
"stream will compress (or decompress) the data, writing it to the internal "
"buffer. Calling [method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] will return the "
"pending bytes in the internal buffer, and [method "
"StreamPeer.get_partial_data] will retrieve the compressed (or decompressed) "
"bytes from it. When the stream is over, you must call [method finish] to "
"ensure the internal buffer is properly flushed (make sure to call [method "
"StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] on last time to check if more data needs to "
"be read after that)."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta classe permet comprimir o descomprimir dades mitjançant GZIP/deflate "
"de manera streaming. Això és especialment útil quan es comprimeixen o "
"descomprimeixen fitxers que s'han d'enviar a través de la xarxa sense "
"necessitat d'assignar-los tots a la memòria.\n"
"Després d'iniciar el flux mitjançant [method start_compression] (o [method "
"start_decompression]), trucar a [method StreamPeer.put_partial_data] en "
"aquest flux comprimirà (o descomprimirà) les dades, escrivint-les a la "
"memòria intermèdia interna. Trucar a [method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] "
"retornarà els bytes pendents a la memòria intermèdia interna i [method "
"StreamPeer.get_partial_data] recuperarà els bytes comprimits (o "
"descomprimits). Quan s'acabi el flux, heu de trucar a [method finish] per "
"assegurar-vos que la memòria intermèdia s'ha esborrat correctament "
"(assegureu-vos de trucar a [method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] l'última "
"vegada per comprovar si s'han de llegir més dades després)."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerGZIP.xml
msgid "Clears this stream, resetting the internal state."
msgstr "Esborra aquest flux, restablint l'estat intern."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerGZIP.xml
msgid ""
"Finalizes the stream, compressing any buffered chunk left.\n"
"You must call it only when you are compressing."
msgstr ""
"Finalitza el flux, comprimint qualsevol fragment de memòria intermèdia que "
"quedi.\n"
"Només l'heu d'anomenar quan esteu comprimint."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerGZIP.xml
msgid ""
"Start the stream in compression mode with the given [param buffer_size], if "
"[param use_deflate] is [code]true[/code] uses deflate instead of GZIP."
msgstr ""
"Inicieu el flux en mode de compressió amb el [param buffer_size] donat, si "
"[param use_deflate] és [code]true@[/code] utilitza deflate en lloc de GZIP."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerGZIP.xml
msgid ""
"Start the stream in decompression mode with the given [param buffer_size], "
"if [param use_deflate] is [code]true[/code] uses deflate instead of GZIP."
msgstr ""
"Inicieu el flux en mode de descompressió amb [param buffer_size] donat, si "
"[param use_deflate] és [code]true[/code] utilitza deflate en lloc de GZIP."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for interacting with socket streams."
msgstr "Classe base abstracta per interaccionar amb fluxos de socket."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
msgid ""
"StreamPeerSocket is an abstract base class that defines common behavior for "
"socket-based streams."
msgstr ""
"StreamPeerSocket és una classe base abstracta que defineix un comportament "
"comú per a fluxos basats en sòcols."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "Disconnects from host."
msgstr "Es desconnecta de l'amfitrió."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
msgid "Polls the socket, updating its state. See [method get_status]."
msgstr "Sondeja el sòcol, actualitzant-ne l'estat. Veure [method get_status]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
msgid ""
"The initial status of the [StreamPeerSocket]. This is also the status after "
"disconnecting."
msgstr ""
"L'estat inicial de [StreamPeerSocket]. Aquest és també l'estat després de "
"desconnectar."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
msgid ""
"A status representing a [StreamPeerSocket] that is connecting to a host."
msgstr ""
"Un estat que representa un [StreamPeerSocket] que s'està connectant a un "
"amfitrió."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerSocket] that is connected to a host."
msgstr "Un estat que representa un [StreamPeerSocket] connectat a un amfitrió."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerSocket.xml
msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerSocket] in error state."
msgstr "Un estat que representa un [StreamPeerSocket] en estat d'error."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid "A stream peer that handles TCP connections."
msgstr "Un stream peer que gestiona connexions TCP."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid ""
"A stream peer that handles TCP connections. This object can be used to "
"connect to TCP servers, or also is returned by a TCP server.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""
"Un stream peer que gestiona connexions TCP. Aquest objecte es pot utilitzar "
"per connectar-se a servidors TCP, o també és retornat per un servidor TCP.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar la implementació amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the TCP socket, and binds it to the specified local address.\n"
"This method is generally not needed, and only used to force the subsequent "
"call to [method connect_to_host] to use the specified [param host] and "
"[param port] as source address. This can be desired in some NAT punchthrough "
"techniques, or when forcing the source network interface."
msgstr ""
"Obre el sòcol TCP i l'enllaça a l'adreça local especificada.\n"
"En general, aquest mètode no és necessari i només s'utilitza per forçar la "
"trucada posterior a [method connect_to_host] perquè utilitzi [param host] i "
"[param port] especificats com a adreça d'origen. Això es pot desitjar en "
"algunes tècniques de perforació NAT, o quan es força la interfície de xarxa "
"d'origen."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid ""
"Connects to the specified [code]host:port[/code] pair. A hostname will be "
"resolved if valid. Returns [constant OK] on success."
msgstr ""
"Es connecta a la parella especificada [code]host:port[/code]. Un nom "
"d'amfitrió es resoldrà si és vàlid. Retorna [constant OK] en cas d'èxit."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid "Returns the IP of this peer."
msgstr "Retorna la IP d'aquest igual."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid "Returns the port of this peer."
msgstr "Retorna el port d'aquest igual."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], packets will be sent immediately. "
"If [param enabled] is [code]false[/code] (the default), packet transfers "
"will be delayed and combined using [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nagle%27s_algorithm]Nagle's algorithm[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to leave this disabled for applications that "
"send large packets or need to transfer a lot of data, as enabling this can "
"decrease the total available bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Si [param enabled] és [code]true[/code], els paquets s'enviaran "
"immediatament. Si [param enabled] és [code]false[/code] (el valor "
"predeterminat), les transferències de paquets es retardaran i es combinaran "
"mitjançant l'algorisme de [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nagle%27s_algorithm]Nagle[/url].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Es recomana deixar-ho desactivat per a aplicacions que envien "
"paquets grans o necessiten transferir moltes dades, ja que activar-ho pot "
"reduir l'amplada de banda total disponible."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "A stream peer that handles TLS connections."
msgstr "Un stream peer que gestiona les connexions TLS."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid ""
"A stream peer that handles TLS connections. This object can be used to "
"connect to a TLS server or accept a single TLS client connection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""
"Un stream peer que gestiona les connexions TLS. Aquest objecte es pot "
"utilitzar per connectar-se a un servidor TLS o acceptar una única connexió "
"de client TLS.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar la implementació amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid ""
"Accepts a peer connection as a server using the given [param "
"server_options]. See [method TLSOptions.server]."
msgstr ""
"Accepta una connexió entre iguals com a servidor mitjançant el [param "
"server_options] donat. Veure [method TLSOptions.server]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid ""
"Connects to a peer using an underlying [StreamPeer] [param stream] and "
"verifying the remote certificate is correctly signed for the given [param "
"common_name]. You can pass the optional [param client_options] parameter to "
"customize the trusted certification authorities, or disable the common name "
"verification. See [method TLSOptions.client] and [method "
"TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."
msgstr ""
"Es connecta a un parell mitjançant un [StreamPeer] [param stream] subjacent "
"i verificant que el certificat remot està signat correctament per al [param "
"common_name] donat. Podeu passar el paràmetre opcional [param "
"client_options] per personalitzar les autoritats de certificació de "
"confiança o desactivar la verificació del nom comú. Vegeu [method "
"TLSOptions.client] i [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the underlying [StreamPeer] connection, used in [method "
"accept_stream] or [method connect_to_stream]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la connexió subjacent [StreamPeer], utilitzada a [method "
"accept_stream] o [method connect_to_stream]."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid ""
"Poll the connection to check for incoming bytes. Call this right before "
"[method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] for it to work properly."
msgstr ""
"Sondeja la connexió per comprovar si hi ha bytes entrants. Truqueu-ho just "
"abans de [method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] perquè funcioni "
"correctament."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] that is disconnected."
msgstr "Un estat que representa un [StreamPeerTLS] que està desconnectat."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] during handshaking."
msgstr "Un estat que representa un [StreamPeerTLS] durant l'enllaç."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] that is connected to a host."
msgstr "Un estat que representa un [StreamPeerTLS] connectat a un amfitrió."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] in error state."
msgstr "Un estat que representa un [StreamPeerTLS] en estat d'error."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid ""
"An error status that shows a mismatch in the TLS certificate domain "
"presented by the host and the domain requested for validation."
msgstr ""
"Un estat d'error que mostra una discrepància entre el domini del certificat "
"TLS presentat per l'amfitrió i el domini sol·licitat per a la validació."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerUDS.xml
msgid "A stream peer that handles UNIX Domain Socket (UDS) connections."
msgstr "Un stream peer que gestiona connexions UNIX Domain Socket (UDS)."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerUDS.xml
msgid ""
"A stream peer that handles UNIX Domain Socket (UDS) connections. This object "
"can be used to connect to UDS servers, or also is returned by a UDS server. "
"Unix Domain Sockets provide inter-process communication on the same machine "
"using the filesystem namespace.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] UNIX Domain Sockets are only available on UNIX-like systems "
"(Linux, macOS, etc.) and are not supported on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Un stream peer que gestiona connexions UNIX Domain Socket (UDS). Aquest "
"objecte es pot utilitzar per connectar-se als servidors UDS, o també és "
"retornat per un servidor UDS. Els sòcols de domini Unix proporcionen "
"comunicació entre processos a la mateixa màquina mitjançant l'espai de noms "
"del sistema de fitxers.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els sòcols de domini UNIX només estan disponibles en sistemes "
"semblants a UNIX (Linux, macOS, etc.) i no són compatibles amb Windows."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerUDS.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the UDS socket, and binds it to the specified socket path.\n"
"This method is generally not needed, and only used to force the subsequent "
"call to [method connect_to_host] to use the specified [param path] as the "
"source address."
msgstr ""
"Obre el sòcol UDS i l'enllaça al camí del sòcol especificat.\n"
"Aquest mètode generalment no és necessari i només s'utilitza per forçar la "
"trucada posterior a [method connect_to_host] perquè utilitzi l' [param path] "
"especificat com a adreça d'origen."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerUDS.xml
msgid ""
"Connects to the specified UNIX Domain Socket path. Returns [constant OK] on "
"success."
msgstr ""
"Es connecta a la ruta del sòcol de domini UNIX especificada. Retorna "
"[constant OK] en cas d'èxit."

#: doc/classes/StreamPeerUDS.xml
msgid "Returns the socket path of this peer."
msgstr "Retorna el camí del sòcol d'aquest parell."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid "A built-in type for strings."
msgstr "Un tipus integrat per a cordes."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"This is the built-in string Variant type (and the one used by GDScript). "
"Strings may contain any number of Unicode characters, and expose methods "
"useful for manipulating and generating strings. Strings are reference-"
"counted and use a copy-on-write approach (every modification to a string "
"returns a new [String]), so passing them around is cheap in resources.\n"
"Some string methods have corresponding variations. Variations suffixed with "
"[code]n[/code] ([method countn], [method findn], [method replacen], etc.) "
"are [b]case-insensitive[/b] (they make no distinction between uppercase and "
"lowercase letters). Method variations prefixed with [code]r[/code] ([method "
"rfind], [method rsplit], etc.) are reversed, and start from the end of the "
"string, instead of the beginning.\n"
"To convert any [Variant] to or from a string, see [method @GlobalScope.str], "
"[method @GlobalScope.str_to_var], and [method @GlobalScope.var_to_str].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a string will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it is empty ([code]\"\"[/code]). Otherwise, a string will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid "GDScript format strings"
msgstr "Cadenas de format GDScript"

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid "Constructs an empty [String] ([code]\"\"[/code])."
msgstr "Construeix un [String] buit ([code]\"\"[/code])."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid "Constructs a [String] as a copy of the given [String]."
msgstr "Construeix un [String] com a còpia del [String] donat."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid "Constructs a new [String] from the given [NodePath]."
msgstr "Construeix un nou [String] a partir del [NodePath] donat."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid "Constructs a new [String] from the given [StringName]."
msgstr "Construeix un nou [String] a partir del [StringName] donat."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string begins with the given [param text]. "
"See also [method ends_with]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la cadena comença amb el [param text] donat. "
"Vegeu també [method ends_with]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the bigrams (pairs of consecutive characters) of "
"this string.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Get up!\".bigrams()) # Prints [\"Ge\", \"et\", \"t \", \" u\", "
"\"up\", \"p!\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna una matriu que conté els bigrams (parells de caràcters consecutius) "
"d'aquesta cadena.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Aixeca't!\".bigrams()) # Imprimeix [\"Ge\", \"et\", \"t \", \" u\", "
"\"up\", \"p!\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string representing a binary number into an [int]. The string "
"may optionally be prefixed with [code]\"0b\"[/code], and an additional "
"[code]-[/code] prefix for negative numbers.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"101\".bin_to_int())   # Prints 5\n"
"print(\"0b101\".bin_to_int()) # Prints 5\n"
"print(\"-0b10\".bin_to_int()) # Prints -2\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"101\".BinToInt());   // Prints 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"0b101\".BinToInt()); // Prints 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"-0b10\".BinToInt()); // Prints -2\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena que representa un nombre binari en un [int]. "
"Opcionalment, la cadena pot tenir el prefix [code]\"0b\"[/code] i un prefix "
"addicional [code]-[/code] per als números negatius.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"101\".bin_to_int()) # Imprimeix 5\n"
"print(\"0b101\".bin_to_int()) # Imprimeix 5\n"
"print(\"-0b10\".bin_to_int()) # Imprimeix -2\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"101\".BinToInt());   // Imprimeix 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"0b101\".BinToInt()); // Imprimeix 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"-0b10\".BinToInt()); // Imprimeix -2\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with special characters escaped using the C "
"language standard."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia de la cadena amb caràcters especials escapats utilitzant "
"l'estàndard de llenguatge C."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with escaped characters replaced by their "
"meanings. Supported escape sequences are [code]\\'[/code], [code]\\\"[/"
"code], [code]\\\\[/code], [code]\\a[/code], [code]\\b[/code], [code]\\f[/"
"code], [code]\\n[/code], [code]\\r[/code], [code]\\t[/code], [code]\\v[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike the GDScript parser, this method doesn't support the "
"[code]\\uXXXX[/code] escape sequence."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with changed appearance. Replaces underscores "
"([code]_[/code]) and hyphens ([code]-[/code]) with spaces, adds spaces "
"before uppercase letters in the middle of a word, converts all letters to "
"lowercase, then converts the first one and each one following a space to "
"uppercase.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".capitalize()   # Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".capitalize()   # Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"example-name\".capitalize()   # Returns \"Example Name\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".Capitalize(); // Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"example-name\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"Example Name\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia de la cadena amb un aspecte canviat. Substitueix els "
"guions baixos ([code]_[/code]) i els guions ([code]-[/code]) per espais, "
"afegeix espais abans de les majúscules al mig d'una paraula, converteix "
"totes les lletres en minúscules i després cada una de les majúscules després "
"d'un espai.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\". capitalize() # Retorna \"Mou Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # Retorna \"Camí del fitxer de l'escena\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\". capitalize() # Retorna \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"nom-exemple\". capitalize() # Retorna \"Nom de l'exemple\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\". Capitalize();   // Retorna \"Mou la X local\"\n"
"\"camí_fitxer_escena\". Capitalitzar(); // Retorna \"Camí del fitxer de "
"l'escena\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\". Capitalitzar ();   // Retorna \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"nom-exemple\". Capitalitzar ();   // Retorna \"Nom d'exemple\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a case-sensitive comparison to another string. Returns [code]-1[/"
"code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, or [code]0[/code] if "
"equal. \"Less than\" and \"greater than\" are determined by the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] "
"of each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical order.\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method nocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], "
"and [method naturalcasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a single Unicode character from the integer [param code]. You may "
"use [url=https://unicodelookup.com/]unicodelookup.com[/url] or [url=https://"
"www.unicode.org/charts/]unicode.org[/url] as points of reference.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(String.chr(65))     # Prints \"A\"\n"
"print(String.chr(129302)) # Prints \"🤖\" (robot face emoji)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method unicode_at], [method @GDScript.char], and [method "
"@GDScript.ord]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un únic caràcter Unicode a partir de l'enter [param code]. Podeu "
"utilitzar [url=https://unicodelookup.com/]unicodelookup.com[/url] o "
"[url=https://www.unicode.org/charts/]unicode.org[/url] com a punts de "
"referència.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(String.chr(65)) # Imprimeix \"A\"\n"
"print(String.chr(129302)) # Imprimeix \"🤖\" (emoji de cara de robot)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Vegeu també [method unicode_at], [method @GDScript.char] i [method "
"@GDScript.ord]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string contains [param what]. In GDScript, "
"this corresponds to the [code]in[/code] operator.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Node\".contains(\"de\")) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"team\".contains(\"I\"))  # Prints false\n"
"print(\"I\" in \"team\")         # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"Node\".Contains(\"de\")); // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(\"team\".Contains(\"I\"));  // Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If you need to know where [param what] is within the string, use [method "
"find]. See also [method containsn]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la cadena conté [param what]. A GDScript, això "
"correspon a l'operador [code]in[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Node\". conté (\"de\")) # Imprimeix true\n"
"print(\"equip\".conté(\"I\")) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"print(\"I\" a \"equip\") # Imprimeix fals\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print (\"Node\". Conté (\"de\")); // Imprimeix True\n"
"GD.Print (\"equip\". Conté (\"I\"));  // Imprimeix fals\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Si necessiteu saber on es troba [param what] dins de la cadena, utilitzeu "
"[method find]. Vegeu també [method containsn]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string contains [param what], [b]ignoring "
"case[/b].\n"
"If you need to know where [param what] is within the string, use [method "
"findn]. See also [method contains]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la cadena conté [param what], [b]ignorant "
"majúscules i minúscules[/b].\n"
"Si necessiteu saber on es troba [param what] dins de la cadena, utilitzeu "
"[method findn]. Vegeu també [method contains]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of occurrences of the substring [param what] between "
"[param from] and [param to] positions. If [param to] is 0, the search "
"continues until the end of the string."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre d'ocurrències de la subcadena [param what] entre les "
"posicions [param from] i [param to]. Si [param to] és 0, la cerca continua "
"fins al final de la cadena."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of occurrences of the substring [param what] between "
"[param from] and [param to] positions, [b]ignoring case[/b]. If [param to] "
"is 0, the search continues until the end of the string."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre d'ocurrències de la subcadena [param what] entre les "
"posicions [param from] i [param to], [b]ignorant majúscules i minúscules[/"
"b]. Si [param to] és 0, la cerca continua fins al final de la cadena."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with indentation (leading tabs and spaces) "
"removed. See also [method indent] to add indentation."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia de la cadena amb el sagnat (tabulacions i espais inicials) "
"eliminat. Vegeu també [method indent] per afegir sagnat."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string ends with the given [param text]. "
"See also [method begins_with]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la cadena acaba amb el [param text] donat. "
"Vegeu també [method begins_with]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a string with [param chars] characters erased starting from [param "
"position]. If [param chars] goes beyond the string's length given the "
"specified [param position], fewer characters will be erased from the "
"returned string. Returns an empty string if either [param position] or "
"[param chars] is negative. Returns the original string unmodified if [param "
"chars] is [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una cadena amb [param chars] caràcters esborrats a partir de [param "
"position]. Si [param chars] supera la longitud de la cadena donada la [param "
"position] especificada, s'esborraran menys caràcters de la cadena retornada. "
"Retorna una cadena buida si [param position] o [param chars] és negativa. "
"Retorna la cadena original sense modificar si [param chars] és [code]0[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Like [method naturalcasecmp_to] but prioritizes strings that begin with "
"periods ([code].[/code]) and underscores ([code]_[/code]) before any other "
"character. Useful when sorting folders or file names.\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method filenocasecmp_to], [method "
"naturalcasecmp_to], and [method casecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Igual que [method naturalcasecmp_to] però prioritza les cadenes que comencen "
"amb punts ([code].[/code]) i subratllats ([code]_[/code]) abans que "
"qualsevol altre caràcter. Útil per ordenar carpetes o noms de fitxers.\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method filenocasecmp_to], [method "
"naturalcasecmp_to] i [method casecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Like [method naturalnocasecmp_to] but prioritizes strings that begin with "
"periods ([code].[/code]) and underscores ([code]_[/code]) before any other "
"character. Useful when sorting folders or file names.\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method filecasecmp_to], [method "
"naturalnocasecmp_to], and [method nocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Igual que [method naturalnocasecmp_to] però prioritza les cadenes que "
"comencen amb punts ([code].[/code]) i subratllats ([code]_[/code]) abans que "
"qualsevol altre caràcter. Útil per ordenar carpetes o noms de fitxers.\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method filecasecmp_to], [method "
"naturalnocasecmp_to] i [method nocasecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]first[/b] occurrence of [param what] in this "
"string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The search's start can be "
"specified with [param from], continuing to the end of the string.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Team\".find(\"I\")) # Prints -1\n"
"\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\"))    # Prints 2\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\", 3)) # Prints 4\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\", 5)) # Prints -1\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"Team\".Find(\"I\")); // Prints -1\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\"));    // Prints 2\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\", 3)); // Prints 4\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\", 5)); // Prints -1\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you just want to know whether the string contains [param "
"what], use [method contains]. In GDScript, you may also use the [code]in[/"
"code] operator.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A negative value of [param from] is converted to a starting "
"index by counting back from the last possible index with enough space to "
"find [param what]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de l'aparició [b]first[/b] de [param what] en aquesta "
"cadena, o [code]-1[/code] si no n'hi ha cap. L'inici de la cerca es pot "
"especificar amb [param from], continuant fins al final de la cadena.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Equip\". trobar(\"I\")) # Imprimeix -1\n"
"\n"
"print(\"Patata\". find(\"t\")) # Imprimeix 2\n"
"print(\"Patata\". find(\"t\", 3)) # Imprimeix 4\n"
"print(\"Patata\". trobar(\"t\", 5)) # Imprimeix -1\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"Equip\".Find (\"I\")); // Imprimeix -1\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(\"Patata\".Find (\"t\"));    // Imprimeix 2\n"
"GD.Print(\"Patata\".Find (\"t\", 3)); // Imprimeix 4\n"
"GD.Print(\"Patata\".Find (\"t\", 5)); // Imprimeix -1\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si només voleu saber si la cadena conté [param what], feu "
"servir [method contains]. A GDScript, també podeu utilitzar l'operador "
"[code]in[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Un valor negatiu de [param from] es converteix en un índex "
"inicial comptant enrere des de l'últim índex possible amb prou espai per "
"trobar [param what]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]first[/b] [b]case-insensitive[/b] occurrence of "
"[param what] in this string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The "
"starting search index can be specified with [param from], continuing to the "
"end of the string."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Formats the string by replacing all occurrences of [param placeholder] with "
"the elements of [param values].\n"
"[param values] can be a [Dictionary], an [Array], or an [Object]. Any "
"underscores in [param placeholder] will be replaced with the corresponding "
"keys in advance. Array elements use their index as keys.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"Waiting for Godot is a play by Samuel Beckett, and Godot Engine "
"is named after it.\"\n"
"var use_array_values = \"Waiting for {0} is a play by {1}, and {0} Engine is "
"named after it.\"\n"
"print(use_array_values.format([\"Godot\", \"Samuel Beckett\"]))\n"
"\n"
"# Prints \"User 42 is Godot.\"\n"
"print(\"User {id} is {name}.\".format({\"id\": 42, \"name\": \"Godot\"}))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Some additional handling is performed when [param values] is an [Array]. If "
"[param placeholder] does not contain an underscore, the elements of the "
"[param values] array will be used to replace one occurrence of the "
"placeholder in order; If an element of [param values] is another 2-element "
"array, it'll be interpreted as a key-value pair.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"User 42 is Godot.\"\n"
"print(\"User {} is {}.\".format([42, \"Godot\"], \"{}\"))\n"
"print(\"User {id} is {name}.\".format([[\"id\", 42], [\"name\", "
"\"Godot\"]]))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"When passing an [Object], the property names from [method "
"Object.get_property_list] are used as keys.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"Visible true, position (0, 0)\"\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"print(\"Visible {visible}, position {position}\".format(node))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format string[/url] tutorial.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each replacement is done sequentially for each element of "
"[param values], [b]not[/b] all at once. This means that if any element is "
"inserted and it contains another placeholder, it may be changed by the next "
"replacement. While this can be very useful, it often causes unexpected "
"results. If not necessary, make sure [param values]'s elements do not "
"contain placeholders.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"{1}\", \"x\"]))           # Prints \"x x\"\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"x\", \"{0}\"]))           # Prints \"x {0}\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"a\": \"{b}\", \"b\": \"c\"})) # Prints \"c c\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"b\": \"c\", \"a\": \"{b}\"})) # Prints \"{b} "
"c\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, it's recommended to [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/tokens/interpolated]interpolate strings "
"with \"$\"[/url], instead."
msgstr ""
"Formata la cadena substituint totes les ocurrències de [param placeholder] "
"amb els elements de [param values].\n"
"[param values] pot ser un [Dictionary], un [Array] o un [Object]. Qualsevol "
"guió baix a [param placeholder] es substituirà per les tecles corresponents "
"amb antelació. Els elements de la matriu utilitzen el seu índex com a "
"claus.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"Waiting for Godot és una obra de Samuel Beckett, i Godot Engine "
"porta el seu nom\".\n"
"var use_array_values = \"Esperant {0} és una jugada de {1}, i el motor {0} "
"porta el seu nom.\"\n"
"print(use_array_values.format([\"Godot\", \"Samuel Beckett\"]))\n"
"\n"
"# Imprimeix \"L'usuari 42 és Godot\".\n"
"print(\"L'usuari {id} és {name}.\".format({\"id\": 42, \"name\": "
"\"Godot\"}))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Es realitza alguna gestió addicional quan [param values] és un [Array]. Si "
"[param placeholder] no conté un guió baix, els elements de la matriu [param "
"values] s'utilitzaran per substituir una ocurrència del marcador de posició "
"en ordre; Si un element de [param values] és una altra matriu de 2 elements, "
"s'interpretarà com un parell clau-valor.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Imprimeix \"L'usuari 42 és Godot\".\n"
"print(\"L'usuari {} és {}.\".format([42, \"Godot\"], \"{}\"))\n"
"print(\"L'usuari {id} és {name}.\".format([[\"id\", 42], [\"name\", "
"\"Godot\"]]))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Quan es passa un [Object], els noms de propietat de [method "
"Object.get_property_list] s'utilitzen com a claus.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Imprimeix \"Visible veritable, posició (0, 0)\"\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"print(\"Visible {visible}, posició {position}\".format(node))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Consulteu també el tutorial [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format string[/url].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Cada substitució es fa seqüencialment per a cada element de "
"[param values], [b]not[/b] alhora. Això vol dir que si s'insereix algun "
"element i conté un altre marcador de posició, es pot canviar amb el següent "
"reemplaçament. Tot i que això pot ser molt útil, sovint provoca resultats "
"inesperats. Si no és necessari, assegureu-vos que els elements de [param "
"values] no continguin marcadors de posició.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"{1}\", \"x\"])) # Imprimeix \"x x\"\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"x\", \"{0}\"])) # Imprimeix \"x {0}\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"a\": \"{b}\", \"b\": \"c\"})) # Imprimeix \"c "
"c\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"b\": \"c\", \"a\": \"{b}\"}))) # Imprimeix \"{b} "
"c\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, es recomana [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"dotnet/csharp/language-reference/tokens/interpolated]interpolar cadenes amb "
"\"$\"[/url], en canvi."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, returns the base directory name.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var dir_path = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_base_dir() # dir_path is \"/path/"
"to\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si la cadena és una ruta de fitxer vàlida, retorna el nom del directori "
"base.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var dir_path = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_base_dir() # dir_path és \"/path/"
"to\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, returns the full file path, without the "
"extension.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var base = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_basename() # base is \"/path/to/file\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si la cadena és una ruta de fitxer vàlida, retorna la ruta completa del "
"fitxer, sense l'extensió.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var base = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_basename() # base és \"/path/to/file\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file name or path, returns the file extension "
"without the leading period ([code].[/code]). Otherwise, returns an empty "
"string.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_extension() # a is \"txt\"\n"
"var b = \"cool.txt\".get_extension()          # b is \"txt\"\n"
"var c = \"cool.font.tres\".get_extension()    # c is \"tres\"\n"
"var d = \".pack1\".get_extension()            # d is \"pack1\"\n"
"\n"
"var e = \"file.txt.\".get_extension()  # e is \"\"\n"
"var f = \"file.txt..\".get_extension() # f is \"\"\n"
"var g = \"txt\".get_extension()        # g is \"\"\n"
"var h = \"\".get_extension()           # h is \"\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si la cadena és un nom de fitxer o un camí vàlid, retorna l'extensió del "
"fitxer sense el punt inicial ([code].[/code]). En cas contrari, retorna una "
"cadena buida.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_extension() # a és \"txt\"\n"
"var b = \"cool.txt\".get_extension() # b és \"txt\"\n"
"var c = \"cool.font.tres\".get_extension() # c és \"tres\"\n"
"var d = \".pack1\".get_extension() # d és \"pack1\"\n"
"\n"
"var e = \"fitxer.txt.\".get_extension() # e és \"\"\n"
"var f = \"fitxer.txt..\".get_extension() # f és \"\"\n"
"var g = \"txt\".get_extension() # g és \"\"\n"
"var h = \"\".get_extension() # h és \"\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, returns the file name, including the "
"extension.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var file = \"/path/to/icon.png\".get_file() # file is \"icon.png\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si la cadena és una ruta de fitxer vàlida, retorna el nom del fitxer, "
"inclosa l'extensió.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var fitxer = \"/path/to/icon.png\".get_file() # el fitxer és \"icon.png\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns the substring at "
"index [param slice]. Returns the original string if [param delimiter] does "
"not occur in the string. Returns an empty string if the [param slice] does "
"not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one or two substrings.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # Prints \"example\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Divideix la cadena utilitzant un [param delimiter] i retorna la subcadena a "
"l'índex [param slice]. Retorna la cadena original si [param delimiter] no "
"apareix a la cadena. Retorna una cadena buida si [param slice] no existeix.\n"
"Això és més ràpid que [method split], si només necessiteu una o dues "
"subcadenes.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # Imprimeix \"exemple\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total number of slices when the string is split with the given "
"[param delimiter] (see [method split]).\n"
"Use [method get_slice] to extract a specific slice.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/string\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # Prints '4'.\n"
"print(\"i am example string\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # Prints '1'.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre total de seccions quan la cadena es divideix amb el [param "
"delimiter] donat (vegeu [method split]).\n"
"Utilitzeu [method get_slice] per extreure una porció específica.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/string\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # Imprimeix '4'.\n"
"print(\"sóc una cadena d'exemple\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # Imprimeix '1'.\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the string using a Unicode character with code [param delimiter] and "
"returns the substring at index [param slice]. Returns an empty string if the "
"[param slice] does not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one or two substrings.\n"
"This is a Unicode version of [method get_slice]."
msgstr ""
"Divideix la cadena utilitzant un caràcter Unicode amb el codi [param "
"delimiter] i retorna la subcadena a l'índex [param slice]. Retorna una "
"cadena buida si [param slice] no existeix.\n"
"Això és més ràpid que [method split], si només necessiteu una o dues "
"subcadenes.\n"
"Aquesta és una versió Unicode de [method get_slice]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the 32-bit hash value representing the string's contents.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Strings with equal hash values are [i]not[/i] guaranteed to be "
"the same, as a result of hash collisions. On the contrary, strings with "
"different hash values are guaranteed to be different."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor hash de 32 bits que representa el contingut de la cadena.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les cadenes amb valors hash iguals són [i]not[/i] com a "
"resultat de les col·lisions hash. Per contra, es garanteix que les cadenes "
"amb diferents valors hash són diferents."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Decodes a hexadecimal string as a [PackedByteArray].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var text = \"hello world\"\n"
"var encoded = text.to_utf8_buffer().hex_encode() # outputs "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"print(encoded.hex_decode().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var text = \"hello world\";\n"
"var encoded = text.ToUtf8Buffer().HexEncode(); // outputs "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"GD.Print(encoded.HexDecode().GetStringFromUtf8());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Descodifica una cadena hexadecimal com a [PackedByteArray].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var text = \"hola món\"\n"
"var encoded = text.to_utf8_buffer().hex_encode() # surt "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"imprimir(encoded.hex_decode().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var text = \"hola món\";\n"
"var codificat = text.ToUtf8Buffer().HexEncode(); // surt "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"GD.Print(encoded.HexDecode().GetStringFromUtf8());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string representing a hexadecimal number into an [int]. The "
"string may be optionally prefixed with [code]\"0x\"[/code], and an "
"additional [code]-[/code] prefix for negative numbers.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"0xff\".hex_to_int()) # Prints 255\n"
"print(\"ab\".hex_to_int())   # Prints 171\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"0xff\".HexToInt()); // Prints 255\n"
"GD.Print(\"ab\".HexToInt());   // Prints 171\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena que representa un nombre hexadecimal en un [int]. La "
"cadena es pot prefixar opcionalment amb [code]\"0x\"[/code] i un prefix "
"addicional [code]-[/code] per als números negatius.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"0xff\".hex_to_int()) # Imprimeix 255\n"
"print(\"ab\".hex_to_int()) # Imprimeix 171\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"0xff\".HexToInt()); // Imprimeix 255\n"
"GD.Print(\"ab\".HexToInt());   // Imprimeix 171\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Converts [param size] which represents a number of bytes into a human-"
"readable form.\n"
"The result is in [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Binary_prefix#IEC_prefixes]IEC prefix format[/url], which may end in either "
"[code]\"B\"[/code], [code]\"KiB\"[/code], [code]\"MiB\"[/code], [code]"
"\"GiB\"[/code], [code]\"TiB\"[/code], [code]\"PiB\"[/code], or [code]"
"\"EiB\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Converteix [param size] que representa un nombre de bytes en una forma "
"llegible per l'home.\n"
"El resultat està en format de prefix [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Binary_prefix#IEC_prefixes]IEC[/url], que pot acabar en [code]\"B\"[/code], "
"[code]\"KiB\"[/code], [code]\"MiB\"[/code], [code]\"GiB\"[/code], [code]"
"\"TiB\"[/code], [code]\"PiB\"[/code] o [code]\"EiB\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Indents every line of the string with the given [param prefix]. Empty lines "
"are not indented. See also [method dedent] to remove indentation.\n"
"For example, the string can be indented with two tabulations using [code]"
"\"\\t\\t\"[/code], or four spaces using [code]\"    \"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Sagna cada línia de la cadena amb el [param prefix] donat. Les línies buides "
"no estan sagnades. Vegeu també [method dedent] per eliminar el sagnat.\n"
"Per exemple, la cadena es pot sagnar amb dues tabulacions utilitzant [code]"
"\"\\t\\t\"[/code], o quatre espais amb [code]\" \"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid "Inserts [param what] at the given [param position] in the string."
msgstr "Insereix [param what] al [param position] donat a la cadena."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string is a path to a file or directory, "
"and its starting point is explicitly defined. This method is the opposite of "
"[method is_relative_path].\n"
"This includes all paths starting with [code]\"res://\"[/code], [code]"
"\"user://\"[/code], [code]\"C:\\\"[/code], [code]\"/\"[/code], etc."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la cadena és una ruta d'accés a un fitxer o "
"directori i el seu punt de partida està definit explícitament. Aquest mètode "
"és el contrari de [method is_relative_path].\n"
"Això inclou tots els camins que comencen per [code]\"res://\"[/code], [code]"
"\"user://\"[/code], [code]\"C:\\\"[/code], [code]\"/\"[/code], etc."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string's length is [code]0[/code] ([code]"
"\"\"[/code]). See also [method length]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la longitud de la cadena és [code]0[/code] "
"([code]\"\"[/code]). Vegeu també [method length]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string is a path, and its starting point is "
"dependent on context. The path could begin from the current directory, or "
"the current [Node] (if the string is derived from a [NodePath]), and may "
"sometimes be prefixed with [code]\"./\"[/code]. This method is the opposite "
"of [method is_absolute_path]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la cadena és un camí i el seu punt de partida "
"depèn del context. El camí podria començar des del directori actual, o "
"l'actual [Node] (si la cadena es deriva d'un [NodePath]), i de vegades pot "
"tenir el prefix [code]\"./\"[/code]. Aquest mètode és el contrari de [method "
"is_absolute_path]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if all characters of this string can be found in "
"[param text] in their original order. This is not the same as [method "
"contains].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var text = \"Wow, incredible!\"\n"
"\n"
"print(\"inedible\".is_subsequence_of(text)) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"Word!\".is_subsequence_of(text))    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"Window\".is_subsequence_of(text))   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"\".is_subsequence_of(text))         # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si tots els caràcters d'aquesta cadena es poden "
"trobar a [param text] en el seu ordre original. Això no és el mateix que "
"[method contains].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var text = \"Wow, increïble!\"\n"
"\n"
"print(\"incomible\".és_subseqüència_de(text)) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"Paraula!\".és_subseqüència_de(text)) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"Finestra\".és_subseqüència_de(text)) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"print(\"\".és_subseqüència_de(text)) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if all characters of this string can be found in "
"[param text] in their original order, [b]ignoring case[/b]. This is not the "
"same as [method containsn]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si tots els caràcters d'aquesta cadena es poden "
"trobar a [param text] en el seu ordre original, [b]ignorant majúscules i "
"minúscules[/b]. Això no és el mateix que [method containsn]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid ASCII identifier. A "
"valid ASCII identifier may contain only letters, digits, and underscores "
"([code]_[/code]), and the first character may not be a digit.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_ascii_identifier())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method is_valid_unicode_identifier]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta cadena és un identificador ASCII vàlid. "
"Un identificador ASCII vàlid pot contenir només lletres, dígits i guions "
"baixos ([code]_[/code]), i el primer caràcter pot no ser un dígit.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"1r_mètode\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"print(\"El meuMètode#2\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Imprimeix false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Vegeu també [method is_valid_unicode_identifier]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid file name. A valid file "
"name cannot be empty, begin or end with space characters, or contain "
"characters that are not allowed ([code]:[/code] [code]/[/code] [code]\\[/"
"code] [code]?[/code] [code]*[/code] [code]\"[/code] [code]|[/code] [code]%[/"
"code] [code]<[/code] [code]>[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string represents a valid floating-point "
"number. A valid float may contain only digits, one decimal point ([code].[/"
"code]), and the exponent letter ([code]e[/code]). It may also be prefixed "
"with a positive ([code]+[/code]) or negative ([code]-[/code]) sign. Any "
"valid integer is also a valid float (see [method is_valid_int]). See also "
"[method to_float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"1.7\".is_valid_float())   # Prints true\n"
"print(\"24\".is_valid_float())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"7e3\".is_valid_float())   # Prints true\n"
"print(\"Hello\".is_valid_float()) # Prints false\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta cadena representa un nombre de coma "
"flotant vàlid. Un nombre flotant vàlid pot contenir només dígits, un punt "
"decimal ([code].[/code]) i la lletra exponent ([code]e[/code]). També pot "
"anar prefixat amb un signe positiu ([code]+[/code]) o negatiu ([code]-[/"
"code]). Qualsevol enter vàlid també és un nombre flotant vàlid (vegeu "
"[method is_valid_int]). Vegeu també [method to_float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"1.7\".is_valid_float()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"24\".is_valid_float()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"7e3\".is_valid_float()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"Hola\".is_valid_float()) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid hexadecimal number. A "
"valid hexadecimal number only contains digits or letters [code]A[/code] to "
"[code]F[/code] (either uppercase or lowercase), and may be prefixed with a "
"positive ([code]+[/code]) or negative ([code]-[/code]) sign.\n"
"If [param with_prefix] is [code]true[/code], the hexadecimal number needs to "
"prefixed by [code]\"0x\"[/code] to be considered valid.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"A08E\".is_valid_hex_number())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"-AbCdEf\".is_valid_hex_number()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"2.5\".is_valid_hex_number())     # Prints false\n"
"\n"
"print(\"0xDEADC0DE\".is_valid_hex_number(true)) # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid color in hexadecimal "
"HTML notation. The string must be a hexadecimal value (see [method "
"is_valid_hex_number]) of either 3, 4, 6 or 8 digits, and may be prefixed by "
"a hash sign ([code]#[/code]). Other HTML notations for colors, such as names "
"or [code]hsl()[/code], are not considered valid. See also [method "
"Color.html]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta cadena és un color vàlid en notació "
"HTML hexadecimal. La cadena ha de ser un valor hexadecimal (vegeu [method "
"is_valid_hex_number]) de 3, 4, 6 o 8 dígits, i pot anar prefixada per un "
"signe hash ([code]#[/code]). Altres anotacions HTML per als colors, com ara "
"els noms o [code]hsl()[/code], no es consideren vàlides. Vegeu també [method "
"Color.html]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid "Use [method is_valid_ascii_identifier] instead."
msgstr "Utilitzeu [method is_valid_ascii_identifier]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid identifier. A valid "
"identifier may contain only letters, digits and underscores ([code]_[/"
"code]), and the first character may not be a digit.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_identifier())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta cadena és un identificador vàlid. Un "
"identificador vàlid pot contenir només lletres, dígits i guions baixos "
"([code]_[/code]), i el primer caràcter pot no ser un dígit.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_identifier()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_identifier()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"1r_mètode\".is_valid_identifier()) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"print(\"El meuMètode#2\".is_valid_identifier()) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string represents a valid integer. A valid "
"integer only contains digits, and may be prefixed with a positive ([code]+[/"
"code]) or negative ([code]-[/code]) sign. See also [method to_int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"7\".is_valid_int())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1.65\".is_valid_int()) # Prints false\n"
"print(\"Hi\".is_valid_int())   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"+3\".is_valid_int())   # Prints true\n"
"print(\"-12\".is_valid_int())  # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta cadena representa un nombre enter "
"vàlid. Un nombre enter vàlid només conté dígits i pot anar prefixat amb un "
"signe ([code]+[/code]) positiu o negatiu ([code]-[/code]). Vegeu també "
"[method to_int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"7\".is_valid_int()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"1.65\".is_valid_int()) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"print(\"Hola\".is_valid_int()) # Imprimeix fals\n"
"print(\"+3\".is_valid_int()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"print(\"-12\".is_valid_int()) # Imprimeix cert\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string represents a well-formatted IPv4 or "
"IPv6 address. This method considers [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Reserved_IP_addresses]reserved IP addresses[/url] such as [code]\"0.0.0.0\"[/"
"code] and [code]\"ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff\"[/code] as valid."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta cadena representa una adreça IPv4 o "
"IPv6 ben formatada. Aquest mètode considera [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Reserved_IP_addresses]adreces IP reservades[/url] com ara [code]"
"\"0.0.0.0\"[/code] i [code]\"ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff\"[/"
"code] com a vàlid."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid Unicode identifier.\n"
"A valid Unicode identifier must begin with a Unicode character of class "
"[code]XID_Start[/code] or [code]\"_\"[/code], and may contain Unicode "
"characters of class [code]XID_Continue[/code] in the other positions.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())      # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"állóképesség\".is_valid_unicode_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"выносливость\".is_valid_unicode_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"体力\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())         # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method is_valid_ascii_identifier].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method checks identifiers the same way as GDScript. See "
"[method TextServer.is_valid_identifier] for more advanced checks."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the concatenation of [param parts]' elements, with each element "
"separated by the string calling this method. This method is the opposite of "
"[method split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"]\n"
"\n"
"print(\", \".join(fruits))  # Prints \"Apple, Orange, Pear, Kiwi\"\n"
"print(\"---\".join(fruits)) # Prints \"Apple---Orange---Pear---Kiwi\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"string[] fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"];\n"
"\n"
"// In C#, this method is static.\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\", \", fruits));  // Prints \"Apple, Orange, Pear, "
"Kiwi\"\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\"---\", fruits)); // Prints \"Apple---Orange---Pear---"
"Kiwi\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la concatenació dels elements [param parts]', amb cada element "
"separat per la cadena que crida aquest mètode. Aquest mètode és el contrari "
"de [method split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"]\n"
"\n"
"print(\", \".join(fruites)) # Imprimeix \"Poma, Taronja, Pera, Kiwi\"\n"
"print(\"---\".join(fruites)) # Imprimeix \"Poma---Taronja---Pera---Kiwi\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"string[] fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"];\n"
"\n"
"// En C#, aquest mètode és estàtic.\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\", \", fruites));  // Imprimeix \"Poma, Taronja, Pera, "
"Kiwi\"\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\"---\", fruites)); // Imprimeix \"Poma---Taronja---"
"Pera---Kiwi\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with special characters escaped using the JSON "
"standard. Because it closely matches the C standard, it is possible to use "
"[method c_unescape] to unescape the string, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia de la cadena amb caràcters especials amb escapada "
"mitjançant l'estàndard JSON. Com que coincideix molt amb l'estàndard C, és "
"possible utilitzar [method c_unescape] per desactivar la cadena, si cal."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the first [param length] characters from the beginning of the "
"string. If [param length] is negative, strips the last [param length] "
"characters from the string's end.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".left(3))  # Prints \"Hel\"\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".left(-4)) # Prints \"Hello Wo\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna els primers caràcters [param length] des del principi de la cadena. "
"Si [param length] és negatiu, elimina els últims [param length] del final de "
"la cadena.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hola món!\".esquerra(3)) # Imprimeix \"Hel\"\n"
"print(\"Hola món!\".esquerra(-4)) # Imprimeix \"Hola Wo\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of characters in the string. Empty strings ([code]\"\"[/"
"code]) always return [code]0[/code]. See also [method is_empty]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre de caràcters de la cadena. Les cadenes buides ([code]\"\"[/"
"code]) sempre tornen [code]0[/code]. Vegeu també [method is_empty]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Formats the string to be at least [param min_length] long by adding [param "
"character]s to the left of the string, if necessary. See also [method rpad]."
msgstr ""
"Formata la cadena com a mínim [param min_length] afegint [param character]s "
"a l'esquerra de la cadena, si cal. Vegeu també [method rpad]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a set of characters defined in [param chars] from the string's "
"beginning. See also [method rstrip].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param chars] is not a prefix. Use [method trim_prefix] to "
"remove a single prefix, rather than a set of characters."
msgstr ""
"Elimina un conjunt de caràcters definits a [param chars] des del principi de "
"la cadena. Vegeu també [method rstrip].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param chars] no és un prefix. Utilitzeu [method trim_prefix] "
"per eliminar un únic prefix, en lloc d'un conjunt de caràcters."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Does a simple expression match (also called \"glob\" or \"globbing\"), where "
"[code]*[/code] matches zero or more arbitrary characters and [code]?[/code] "
"matches any single character except a period ([code].[/code]). An empty "
"string or empty expression always evaluates to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Does a simple [b]case-insensitive[/b] expression match, where [code]*[/code] "
"matches zero or more arbitrary characters and [code]?[/code] matches any "
"single character except a period ([code].[/code]). An empty string or empty "
"expression always evaluates to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] of the "
"string as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] de la "
"cadena com a [PackedByteArray]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] of the "
"string as another [String]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] de la "
"cadena com un altre [String]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-sensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to another "
"string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater "
"than, or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" are "
"determined by the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] of each string, which "
"roughly matches the alphabetical order.\n"
"When used for sorting, natural order comparison orders sequences of numbers "
"by the combined value of each digit as is often expected, instead of the "
"single digit's value. A sorted sequence of numbered strings will be [code]"
"[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], not [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", "
"\"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method naturalnocasecmp_to], [method "
"filecasecmp_to], and [method nocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una comparació [b]case-sensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] amb una "
"altra cadena. Retorna [code]-1[/code] si és inferior a, [code]1[/code] si és "
"més gran que, o [code]@0[/code] si és igual. \"Menys que\" o \"més gran "
"que\" estan determinats pels [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode punts[/url] de cada cadena, que "
"coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic.\n"
"Quan s'utilitza per ordenar, la comparació d'ordre natural ordena les "
"seqüències de nombres pel valor combinat de cada dígit com s'espera sovint, "
"en lloc del valor d'un dígit. Una seqüència ordenada de cadenes numerades "
"serà [code][\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], no [code][\"1\", \"10\", "
"\"2\", \"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"Si la comparació de caràcters arriba al final d'una cadena, però l'altra "
"cadena conté més caràcters, utilitzarà la longitud com a factor decisiu: es "
"retornarà [code]1[/code] si aquesta cadena és més llarga que la cadena "
"[param to], o [code]-1[/code] si és més curt. Tingueu en compte que la "
"longitud de les cadenes buides sempre és [code]0[/code].\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method naturalnocasecmp_to], "
"[method filecasecmp_to] i [method nocasecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-insensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to "
"another string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if "
"greater than, or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" "
"are determined by the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] of each string, which "
"roughly matches the alphabetical order. Internally, lowercase characters are "
"converted to uppercase for the comparison.\n"
"When used for sorting, natural order comparison orders sequences of numbers "
"by the combined value of each digit as is often expected, instead of the "
"single digit's value. A sorted sequence of numbered strings will be [code]"
"[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], not [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", "
"\"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method naturalcasecmp_to], [method "
"filenocasecmp_to], and [method casecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una comparació [b]case-insensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] amb "
"una altra cadena. Retorna [code]-1[/code] si és inferior a, [code]1[/code] "
"si és més gran que, o [code]@0[/code] si és igual. \"Menys que\" o \"més "
"gran que\" estan determinats pels [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode punts[/url] de cada cadena, que "
"coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic. Internament, els caràcters "
"minúscules es converteixen en majúscules per a la comparació.\n"
"Quan s'utilitza per ordenar, la comparació d'ordre natural ordena les "
"seqüències de nombres pel valor combinat de cada dígit com s'espera sovint, "
"en lloc del valor d'un dígit. Una seqüència ordenada de cadenes numerades "
"serà [code][\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], no [code][\"1\", \"10\", "
"\"2\", \"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"Si la comparació de caràcters arriba al final d'una cadena, però l'altra "
"cadena conté més caràcters, utilitzarà la longitud com a factor decisiu: es "
"retornarà [code]1[/code] si aquesta cadena és més llarga que la cadena "
"[param to], o [code]-1[/code] si és més curt. Tingueu en compte que la "
"longitud de les cadenes buides sempre és [code]0[/code].\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method naturalcasecmp_to], [method "
"filenocasecmp_to] i [method casecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-insensitive[/b] comparison to another string. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, or [code]0[/"
"code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" are determined by the "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code "
"points[/url] of each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical order. "
"Internally, lowercase characters are converted to uppercase for the "
"comparison.\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method casecmp_to], [method filenocasecmp_to], "
"and [method naturalnocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una comparació [b]case-insensitive[/b] amb una altra cadena. "
"Retorna [code]-1[/code] si és inferior a, [code]1[/code] si és superior a, o "
"[code]@0[/code] si és igual. \"Menys que\" o \"més gran que\" estan "
"determinats pels [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode punts[/url] de cada cadena, que "
"coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic. Internament, els caràcters "
"minúscules es converteixen en majúscules per a la comparació.\n"
"Si la comparació de caràcters arriba al final d'una cadena, però l'altra "
"cadena conté més caràcters, llavors utilitzarà la longitud com a factor "
"decisiu: es retornarà [code]1[/code] si aquesta cadena és més llarga que la "
"cadena [param to], o [code]-1[/code] si és més curt. Tingueu en compte que "
"la longitud de les cadenes buides sempre és [code]0[/code].\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method casecmp_to], [method "
"filenocasecmp_to] i [method naturalnocasecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Converts a [float] to a string representation of a decimal number, with the "
"number of decimal places specified in [param decimals].\n"
"If [param decimals] is [code]-1[/code] as by default, the string "
"representation may only have up to 14 significant digits, with digits before "
"the decimal point having priority over digits after.\n"
"Trailing zeros are not included in the string. The last digit is rounded, "
"not truncated.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"String.num(3.141593)     # Returns \"3.141593\"\n"
"String.num(3.141593, 3)  # Returns \"3.142\"\n"
"String.num(3.14159300)   # Returns \"3.141593\"\n"
"\n"
"# Here, the last digit will be rounded up,\n"
"# which reduces the total digit count, since trailing zeros are removed:\n"
"String.num(42.129999, 5) # Returns \"42.13\"\n"
"\n"
"# If `decimals` is not specified, the maximum number of significant digits "
"is 14:\n"
"String.num(-0.0000012345432123454321)     # Returns \"-0.00000123454321\"\n"
"String.num(-10000.0000012345432123454321) # Returns \"-10000.0000012345\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Converteix un [float] en una representació de cadena d'un nombre decimal, "
"amb el nombre de decimals especificat a [param decimals].\n"
"Si [param decimals] és [code]-1[/code] de manera predeterminada, la "
"representació de cadena només pot tenir fins a 14 dígits significatius, amb "
"els dígits anteriors al punt decimal que tenen prioritat sobre els dígits "
"posteriors.\n"
"Els zeros al final no s'inclouen a la cadena. L'últim dígit és arrodonit, no "
"truncat.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"String.num(3.141593) # Retorna \"3.141593\"\n"
"String.num(3.141593, 3) # Retorna \"3.142\"\n"
"String.num(3.14159300) # Retorna \"3.141593\"\n"
"\n"
"# Aquí, l'últim dígit s'arrodonirà cap amunt,\n"
"# que redueix el nombre total de dígits, ja que s'eliminen els zeros "
"finals:\n"
"String.num(42.129999, 5) # Retorna \"42.13\"\n"
"\n"
"# Si no s'especifica \"decimals\", el nombre màxim de dígits significatius "
"és 14:\n"
"String.num(-0,0000012345432123454321) # Retorna \"-0,00000123454321\"\n"
"String.num(-10000.0000012345432123454321) # Retorna \"-10000.0000012345\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the given [param number] to a string representation, with the given "
"[param base].\n"
"By default, [param base] is set to decimal ([code]10[/code]). Other common "
"bases in programming include binary ([code]2[/code]), [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octal]octal[/url] ([code]8[/code]), hexadecimal "
"([code]16[/code]).\n"
"If [param capitalize_hex] is [code]true[/code], digits higher than 9 are "
"represented in uppercase."
msgstr ""
"Converteix el [param number] donat en una representació de cadena, amb el "
"[param base] donat.\n"
"Per defecte, [param base] s'estableix en decimal ([code]10[/code]). Altres "
"bases comunes en la programació inclouen binari ([code]2[/code]), "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octal]octal[/url] ([code]@8[/code]), "
"hexadecimal ([code]16[/code]).\n"
"Si [param capitalize_hex] és [code]true[/code], els dígits superiors a 9 es "
"representen en majúscules."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the given [param number] to a string representation, in scientific "
"notation.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var n = -5.2e8\n"
"print(n)                        # Prints -520000000\n"
"print(String.num_scientific(n)) # Prints -5.2e+08\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// This method is not implemented in C#.\n"
"// Use `string.ToString()` with \"e\" to achieve similar results.\n"
"var n = -5.2e8f;\n"
"GD.Print(n);                // Prints -520000000\n"
"GD.Print(n.ToString(\"e1\")); // Prints -5.2e+008\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this method is not implemented. To achieve similar "
"results, see C#'s [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/"
"base-types/standard-numeric-format-strings]Standard numeric format strings[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Converteix el [param number] donat en una representació de cadena, en "
"notació científica.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var n = -5,2e8\n"
"print(n) # Prints -520000000\n"
"print(String.num_scientific(n)) # Imprimeix -5.2e+08\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Aquest mètode no està implementat en C#.\n"
"// Utilitzeu `string.ToString()` amb \"e\" per aconseguir resultats "
"similars.\n"
"var n = -5,2e8f;\n"
"GD.Print(n);                // Imprimeix -520000000\n"
"GD.Print(n.ToString(\"e1\")); // Imprimeix -5.2e+008\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, aquest mètode no està implementat. Per aconseguir "
"resultats similars, vegeu les cadenes de format numèric estàndard "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/base-types/standard-"
"numeric-format-strings][/url] de C#."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the given unsigned [int] to a string representation, with the given "
"[param base].\n"
"By default, [param base] is set to decimal ([code]10[/code]). Other common "
"bases in programming include binary ([code]2[/code]), [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octal]octal[/url] ([code]8[/code]), hexadecimal "
"([code]16[/code]).\n"
"If [param capitalize_hex] is [code]true[/code], digits higher than 9 are "
"represented in uppercase."
msgstr ""
"Converteix el [int] sense signar donat en una representació de cadena, amb "
"el [param base] donat.\n"
"Per defecte, [param base] s'estableix en decimal ([code]10[/code]). Altres "
"bases comunes en la programació inclouen binari ([code]2[/code]), "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octal]octal[/url] ([code]@8[/code]), "
"hexadecimal ([code]16[/code]).\n"
"Si [param capitalize_hex] és [code]true[/code], els dígits superiors a 9 es "
"representen en majúscules."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Formats the string representing a number to have an exact number of [param "
"digits] [i]after[/i] the decimal point."
msgstr ""
"Formata la cadena que representa un nombre perquè tingui un nombre exacte de "
"[param digits] [i]després de[/i] el punt decimal."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Formats the string representing a number to have an exact number of [param "
"digits] [i]before[/i] the decimal point."
msgstr ""
"Formata la cadena que representa un nombre perquè tingui un nombre exacte de "
"[param digits] [i]before[/i] el punt decimal."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Concatenates [param path] at the end of the string as a subpath, adding "
"[code]/[/code] if necessary.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] [code]\"this/is\".path_join(\"path\") == \"this/is/path\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Concatena [param path] al final de la cadena com a subruta, afegint [code]/[/"
"code] si cal.\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] [code]\"this/is\".path_join(\"path\") == \"this/is/path\"[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Removes all occurrences of the Unicode character with code [param what]. "
"Faster version of [method replace] when the key is only one character long "
"and the replacement is [code]\"\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Elimina totes les ocurrències del caràcter Unicode amb el codi [param what]. "
"Versió més ràpida de [method replace] quan la clau només té un caràcter i la "
"substitució és [code]\"\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Removes all occurrences of the characters in [param chars]. See also [method "
"remove_char]."
msgstr ""
"Elimina totes les ocurrències dels caràcters a [param chars]. Vegeu també "
"[method remove_char]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Repeats this string a number of times. [param count] needs to be greater "
"than [code]0[/code]. Otherwise, returns an empty string."
msgstr ""
"Repeteix aquesta cadena diverses vegades. [param count] ha de ser més gran "
"que [code]0[/code]. En cas contrari, retorna una cadena buida."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces all occurrences of [param what] inside the string with the given "
"[param forwhat]."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix totes les ocurrències de [param what] dins de la cadena per "
"[param forwhat] donada."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces all occurrences of the Unicode character with code [param key] with "
"the Unicode character with code [param with]. Faster version of [method "
"replace] when the key is only one character long. To get a single character "
"use [code]\"X\".unicode_at(0)[/code] (note that some strings, like compound "
"letters and emoji, can be composed of multiple unicode codepoints, and will "
"not work with this method, use [method length] to make sure)."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix totes les ocurrències del caràcter Unicode pel codi [param key] "
"pel caràcter Unicode amb el codi [param with]. Versió més ràpida de [method "
"replace] quan la clau només té un caràcter. Per obtenir un sol caràcter, "
"utilitzeu [code]\"X\".unicode_at(0)[/code] (tingueu en compte que algunes "
"cadenes, com ara lletres compostes i emoji, poden estar compostes per "
"diversos punts de codi Unicode i no funcionaran amb aquest mètode, utilitzeu "
"[method length] per assegurar-vos-en)."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces any occurrence of the characters in [param keys] with the Unicode "
"character with code [param with]. See also [method replace_char]."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix qualsevol aparició dels caràcters a [param keys] pel caràcter "
"Unicode amb el codi [param with]. Vegeu també [method replace_char]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces all [b]case-insensitive[/b] occurrences of [param what] inside the "
"string with the given [param forwhat]."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix totes les aparicions [b]case-insensitive[/b] de [param what] "
"dins de la cadena amb la [param forwhat] donada."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the copy of this string in reverse order. This operation works on "
"unicode codepoints, rather than sequences of codepoints, and may break "
"things like compound letters or emojis."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la còpia d'aquesta cadena en ordre invers. Aquesta operació funciona "
"amb punts de codi Unicode, en lloc de seqüències de punts de codi, i pot "
"trencar coses com les lletres compostes o els emojis."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]last[/b] occurrence of [param what] in this "
"string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The search's start can be "
"specified with [param from], continuing to the beginning of the string. This "
"method is the reverse of [method find].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A negative value of [param from] is converted to a starting "
"index by counting back from the last possible index with enough space to "
"find [param what].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A value of [param from] that is greater than the last possible "
"index with enough space to find [param what] is considered out-of-bounds, "
"and returns [code]-1[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]last[/b] [b]case-insensitive[/b] occurrence of "
"[param what] in this string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The "
"starting search index can be specified with [param from], continuing to the "
"beginning of the string. This method is the reverse of [method findn]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last [param length] characters from the end of the string. If "
"[param length] is negative, strips the first [param length] characters from "
"the string's beginning.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".right(3))  # Prints \"ld!\"\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".right(-4)) # Prints \"o World!\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna els últims [param length] des del final de la cadena. Si [param "
"length] és negatiu, elimina els primers caràcters [param length] des del "
"principi de la cadena.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hola món!\".right(3)) # Imprimeix \"ld!\"\n"
"print(\"Hola món!\".right(-4)) # Imprimeix \"o món!\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Formats the string to be at least [param min_length] long, by adding [param "
"character]s to the right of the string, if necessary. See also [method lpad]."
msgstr ""
"Formata la cadena com a mínim [param min_length], afegint [param character]s "
"a la dreta de la cadena, si cal. Vegeu també [method lpad]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns an array of the "
"substrings, starting from the end of the string. The splits in the returned "
"array appear in the same order as the original string. If [param delimiter] "
"is an empty string, each substring will be a single character.\n"
"If [param allow_empty] is [code]false[/code], empty strings between adjacent "
"delimiters are excluded from the array.\n"
"If [param maxsplit] is greater than [code]0[/code], the number of splits may "
"not exceed [param maxsplit]. By default, the entire string is split, which "
"is mostly identical to [method split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_string = \"One,Two,Three,Four\"\n"
"var some_array = some_string.rsplit(\",\", true, 1)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # Prints 2\n"
"print(some_array[0])     # Prints \"One,Two,Three\"\n"
"print(some_array[1])     # Prints \"Four\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// In C#, there is no String.RSplit() method.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Divideix la cadena utilitzant un [param delimiter] i retorna una matriu de "
"les subcadenes, començant des del final de la cadena. Les divisions de la "
"matriu retornada apareixen en el mateix ordre que la cadena original. Si "
"[param delimiter] és una cadena buida, cada subcadena serà un únic "
"caràcter.\n"
"Si [param allow_empty] és [code]false[/code], les cadenes buides entre "
"delimitadors adjacents s'exclouen de la matriu.\n"
"Si [param maxsplit] és més gran que [code]0[/code], el nombre de divisions "
"no pot superar [param maxsplit]. De manera predeterminada, es divideix tota "
"la cadena, que és majoritàriament idèntica a [method split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_string = \"Un, Dos, Tres, Quatre\"\n"
"var some_array = some_string.rsplit(\",\", true, 1)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # Imprimeix 2\n"
"print(some_array[0]) # Imprimeix \"Un, dos, tres\"\n"
"print(some_array[1]) # Imprimeix \"Quatre\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// En C#, no hi ha cap mètode String.RSplit().\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a set of characters defined in [param chars] from the string's end. "
"See also [method lstrip].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param chars] is not a suffix. Use [method trim_suffix] to "
"remove a single suffix, rather than a set of characters."
msgstr ""
"Elimina un conjunt de caràcters definits a [param chars] del final de la "
"cadena. Vegeu també [method lstrip].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [param chars] no és un sufix. Utilitzeu [method trim_suffix] "
"per eliminar un únic sufix, en lloc d'un conjunt de caràcters."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1[/url] hash of the "
"string as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el hash [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1[/url] de la "
"cadena com a [PackedByteArray]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1[/url] hash of the "
"string as another [String]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el hash [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1[/url] de la "
"cadena com un altre [String]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256[/url] hash of "
"the string as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el hash [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256[/url] de la "
"cadena com a [PackedByteArray]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256[/url] hash of "
"the string as another [String]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el hash [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256[/url] de la "
"cadena com un altre [String]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the similarity index ([url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"S%C3%B8rensen%E2%80%93Dice_coefficient]Sørensen-Dice coefficient[/url]) of "
"this string compared to another. A result of [code]1.0[/code] means totally "
"similar, while [code]0.0[/code] means totally dissimilar.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"ABC123\")) # Prints 1.0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"XYZ456\")) # Prints 0.0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"123ABC\")) # Prints 0.8\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"abc123\")) # Prints 0.4\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de semblança ([url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"S%C3%B8rensen%E2%80%93Dice_coefficient]Sørensen-Dice coeficient[/url]) "
"d'aquesta cadena en comparació amb una altra. Un resultat de [code]1.0[/"
"code] significa totalment semblant, mentre que [code]@0.0[/code] significa "
"totalment diferent.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"ABC123\")) # Imprimeix 1.0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"XYZ456\")) # Imprimeix 0,0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"123ABC\")) # Imprimeix 0,8\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"abc123\")) # Imprimeix 0,4\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, converts the string into a canonical "
"path. This is the shortest possible path, without [code]\"./\"[/code], and "
"all the unnecessary [code]\"..\"[/code] and [code]\"/\"[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var simple_path = \"./path/to///../file\".simplify_path()\n"
"print(simple_path) # Prints \"path/file\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns an array of the "
"substrings. If [param delimiter] is an empty string, each substring will be "
"a single character. This method is the opposite of [method join].\n"
"If [param allow_empty] is [code]false[/code], empty strings between adjacent "
"delimiters are excluded from the array.\n"
"If [param maxsplit] is greater than [code]0[/code], the number of splits may "
"not exceed [param maxsplit]. By default, the entire string is split.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_array = \"One,Two,Three,Four\".split(\",\", true, 2)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # Prints 3\n"
"print(some_array[0])     # Prints \"One\"\n"
"print(some_array[1])     # Prints \"Two\"\n"
"print(some_array[2])     # Prints \"Three,Four\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// C#'s `Split()` does not support the `maxsplit` parameter.\n"
"var someArray = \"One,Two,Three\".Split(\",\");\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[0]); // Prints \"One\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[1]); // Prints \"Two\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[2]); // Prints \"Three\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you only need one substring from the array, consider using "
"[method get_slice] which is faster. If you need to split strings with more "
"complex rules, use the [RegEx] class instead."
msgstr ""
"Divideix la cadena utilitzant un [param delimiter] i retorna una matriu de "
"les subcadenes. Si [param delimiter] és una cadena buida, cada subcadena "
"serà un únic caràcter. Aquest mètode és el contrari de [method join].\n"
"Si [param allow_empty] és [code]false[/code], les cadenes buides entre "
"delimitadors adjacents s'exclouen de la matriu.\n"
"Si [param maxsplit] és superior a [code]0[/code], el nombre de divisions no "
"pot superar [param maxsplit]. Per defecte, tota la cadena està dividida.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_array = \"Un, Dos, Tres, Quatre\".split(\",\", true, 2)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # Imprimeix 3\n"
"print(some_array[0]) # Imprimeix \"Un\"\n"
"print(some_array[1]) # Imprimeix \"Two\"\n"
"print(some_array[2]) # Imprimeix \"Tres, Quatre\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// `Split()` de C# no admet el paràmetre `maxsplit`.\n"
"var someArray = \"Un, Dos, Tres\". Split(\",\");\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[0]); // Imprimeix \"Un\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[1]); // Imprimeix \"Dos\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[2]); // Imprimeix \"Tres\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si només necessiteu una subcadena de la matriu, considereu "
"utilitzar [method get_slice] que és més ràpid. Si necessiteu dividir cadenes "
"amb regles més complexes, feu servir la classe [RegEx]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the string into floats by using a [param delimiter] and returns a "
"[PackedFloat64Array].\n"
"If [param allow_empty] is [code]false[/code], empty or invalid [float] "
"conversions between adjacent delimiters are excluded.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"1,2,4.5\".split_floats(\",\")         # a is [1.0, 2.0, 4.5]\n"
"var c = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\")        # c is [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 4.5]\n"
"var b = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\", false) # b is [1.0, 4.5]\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Divideix la cadena en flotants utilitzant un [param delimiter] i retorna un "
"[PackedFloat64Array].\n"
"Si [param allow_empty] és [code]false[/code], s'exclouen les conversions "
"[float] buides o no vàlides entre delimitadors adjacents.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"1,2,4.5\".split_floats(\",\") # a és [1.0, 2.0, 4.5]\n"
"var c = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\") # c és [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 4.5]\n"
"var b = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\", fals) # b és [1.0, 4.5]\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Strips all non-printable characters from the beginning and the end of the "
"string. These include spaces, tabulations ([code]\\t[/code]), and newlines "
"([code]\\n[/code] [code]\\r[/code]).\n"
"If [param left] is [code]false[/code], ignores the string's beginning. "
"Likewise, if [param right] is [code]false[/code], ignores the string's end."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Strips all escape characters from the string. These include all non-"
"printable control characters of the first page of the ASCII table (values "
"from 0 to 31), such as tabulation ([code]\\t[/code]) and newline ([code]\\n[/"
"code], [code]\\r[/code]) characters, but [i]not[/i] spaces."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns part of the string from the position [param from] with length [param "
"len]. If [param len] is [code]-1[/code] (as by default), returns the rest of "
"the string starting from the given position."
msgstr ""
"Retorna part de la cadena des de la posició [param from] amb longitud [param "
"len]. Si [param len] és [code]-1[/code] (com per defecte), retorna la resta "
"de la cadena començant des de la posició donada."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string to an [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASCII]ASCII[/"
"url]/Latin-1 encoded [PackedByteArray]. This method is slightly faster than "
"[method to_utf8_buffer], but replaces all unsupported characters with "
"spaces. This is the inverse of [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_ascii]."
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena en un [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASCII]ASCII[/"
"url]/Latin-1 codificat [PackedByteArray]. Aquest mètode és una mica més "
"ràpid que [method to_utf8_buffer], però substitueix tots els caràcters no "
"admesos per espais. Aquesta és la inversa de [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_ascii]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]camelCase[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna la cadena convertida a [code]camelCase[/code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string representing a decimal number into a [float]. This "
"method stops on the first non-number character, except the first decimal "
"point ([code].[/code]) and the exponent letter ([code]e[/code]). See also "
"[method is_valid_float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"12.35\".to_float()  # a is 12.35\n"
"var b = \"1.2.3\".to_float()  # b is 1.2\n"
"var c = \"12xy3\".to_float()  # c is 12.0\n"
"var d = \"1e3\".to_float()    # d is 1000.0\n"
"var e = \"Hello!\".to_float() # e is 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena que representa un nombre decimal en un [float]. Aquest "
"mètode s'atura en el primer caràcter no numèric, excepte el primer punt "
"decimal ([code].[/code]) i la lletra exponent ([code]e[/code]). Vegeu també "
"[method is_valid_float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"12.35\".to_float() # a és 12.35\n"
"var b = \"1.2.3\".to_float() # b és 1.2\n"
"var c = \"12xy3\".to_float() # c és 12.0\n"
"var d = \"1e3\".to_float() # d és 1000,0\n"
"var e = \"Hola!\".to_float() # e és 0,0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string representing an integer number into an [int]. This "
"method removes any non-number character and stops at the first decimal point "
"([code].[/code]). See also [method is_valid_int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"123\".to_int()    # a is 123\n"
"var b = \"x1y2z3\".to_int() # b is 123\n"
"var c = \"-1.2.3\".to_int() # c is -1\n"
"var d = \"Hello!\".to_int() # d is 0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena que representa un nombre enter en un [int]. Aquest "
"mètode elimina qualsevol caràcter que no sigui numèric i s'atura al primer "
"punt decimal ([code].[/code]). Vegeu també [method is_valid_int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"123\".to_int() # a és 123\n"
"var b = \"x1y2z3\".to_int() # b és 123\n"
"var c = \"-1.2.3\".to_int() # c és -1\n"
"var d = \"Hola!\".to_int() # d és 0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the string converted to [code]kebab-case[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Numbers followed by a [i]single[/i] letter are not separated in "
"the conversion to keep some words (such as \"2D\") together.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_kebab_case()               # Returns \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".to_kebab_case()            # Returns \"2-nd-place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_kebab_case() # Returns \"texture-3d-asset-"
"folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToKebabCase();               // Returns \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".ToKebabCase();            // Returns \"2-nd-place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToKebabCase(); // Returns \"texture-3d-asset-"
"folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la cadena convertida a [code]kebab-case[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els números seguits d'una [i]single[/i] no es separen a la "
"conversió per mantenir algunes paraules (com ara \"2D\") juntes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_kebab_case() # Retorna \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2n lloc\".to_kebab_case() # Retorna \"2n lloc\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_kebab_case() # Retorna \"texture-3d-asset-"
"folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToKebabCase();               // Retorna \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2n lloc\".ToKebabCase();            // Retorna \"2n lloc\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToKebabCase(); // Retorna \"texture-3d-asset-"
"folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]lowercase[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna la cadena convertida a [code]lowercase[/code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string to system multibyte code page encoded [PackedByteArray]. "
"If conversion fails, empty array is returned.\n"
"The values permitted for [param encoding] are system dependent. If [param "
"encoding] is empty string, system default encoding is used.\n"
"- For Windows, see [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/Intl/"
"code-page-identifiers]Code Page Identifiers[/url] .NET names.\n"
"- For macOS and Linux/BSD, see [code]libiconv[/code] library documentation "
"and [code]iconv --list[/code] for a list of supported encodings."
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena a la pàgina de codis multibyte del sistema codificada "
"[PackedByteArray]. Si la conversió falla, es retorna una matriu buida.\n"
"Els valors permesos per a [param encoding] depenen del sistema. Si [param "
"encoding] és una cadena buida, s'utilitza la codificació predeterminada del "
"sistema.\n"
"- Per a Windows, vegeu [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/"
"Intl/code-page-identifiers]Code Page Identifiers[/url] Noms .NET.\n"
"- Per a macOS i Linux/BSD, vegeu [code]libiconv[/code] documentació de la "
"biblioteca i [code]iconv --list[/code] per obtenir una llista de "
"codificacions admeses."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]PascalCase[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna la cadena convertida a [code]PascalCase[/code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the string converted to [code]snake_case[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Numbers followed by a [i]single[/i] letter are not separated in "
"the conversion to keep some words (such as \"2D\") together.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_snake_case()               # Returns \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".to_snake_case()            # Returns \"2_nd_place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_snake_case() # Returns "
"\"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToSnakeCase();               // Returns \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".ToSnakeCase();            // Returns \"2_nd_place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToSnakeCase(); // Returns "
"\"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la cadena convertida a [code]snake_case[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els números seguits d'una [i]single[/i] no es separen a la "
"conversió per mantenir algunes paraules (com ara \"2D\") juntes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_snake_case() # Retorna \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2n lloc\".to_snake_case() # Retorna \"2_placement\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_snake_case() # Retorna "
"\"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToSnakeCase();               // Retorna \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2n lloc\".ToSnakeCase();            // Retorna \"2_nd_place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToSnakeCase(); // Retorna "
"\"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]UPPERCASE[/code]."
msgstr "Retorna la cadena convertida a [code]UPPERCASE[/code]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-8]UTF-8[/"
"url] encoded [PackedByteArray]. This method is slightly slower than [method "
"to_ascii_buffer], but supports all UTF-8 characters. For most cases, prefer "
"using this method. This is the inverse of [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf8]."
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena en un [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-8]UTF-8[/"
"url] codificat [PackedByteArray]. Aquest mètode és una mica més lent que "
"[method to_ascii_buffer], però admet tots els caràcters UTF-8. En la majoria "
"dels casos, preferiu utilitzar aquest mètode. Aquesta és la inversa de "
"[method PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf8]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-16]UTF-16[/"
"url] encoded [PackedByteArray]. This is the inverse of [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf16]."
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena en un [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-16]UTF-16[/"
"url] codificat [PackedByteArray]. Aquesta és la inversa de [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf16]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-32]UTF-32[/"
"url] encoded [PackedByteArray]. This is the inverse of [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf32]."
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena en un [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-32]UTF-32[/"
"url] codificat [PackedByteArray]. Aquesta és la inversa de [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf32]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Wide_character]wide character[/url] ([code]wchar_t[/code], UTF-16 on "
"Windows, UTF-32 on other platforms) encoded [PackedByteArray]. This is the "
"inverse of [method PackedByteArray.get_string_from_wchar]."
msgstr ""
"Converteix la cadena en un caràcter [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Wide_character][/url] ([code]wchar_t[/code], UTF-16 a Windows, UTF-32 a "
"altres plataformes) codificat [PackedByteArray]. Aquesta és la inversa de "
"[method PackedByteArray.get_string_from_wchar]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given [param prefix] from the start of the string, or returns "
"the string unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el [param prefix] donat des de l'inici de la cadena o retorna la "
"cadena sense canvis."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given [param suffix] from the end of the string, or returns the "
"string unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el [param suffix] donat del final de la cadena o retorna la cadena "
"sense canvis."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the character code at position [param at].\n"
"See also [method chr], [method @GDScript.char], and [method @GDScript.ord]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el codi de caràcter a la posició [param at].\n"
"Vegeu també [method chr], [method @GDScript.char] i [method @GDScript.ord]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Decodes the string from its URL-encoded format. This method is meant to "
"properly decode the parameters in a URL when receiving an HTTP request. See "
"also [method uri_encode].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"print(url.uri_decode()) # Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"GD.Print(url.URIDecode()) // Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot "
"Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method decodes [code]+[/code] as space."
msgstr ""
"Descodifica la cadena des del seu format codificat per URL. Aquest mètode "
"està pensat per descodificar correctament els paràmetres d'una URL quan es "
"rep una sol·licitud HTTP. Vegeu també [method uri_encode].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"print(url.uri_decode()) # Imprimeix \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot "
"Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"GD.Print(url.URIDecode()) // Imprimeix \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot "
"Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode descodifica [code]+[/code] com a espai."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Encodes the string to URL-friendly format. This method is meant to properly "
"encode the parameters in a URL when sending an HTTP request. See also "
"[method uri_decode].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var prefix = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\"\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".uri_encode()\n"
"\n"
"print(url) # Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var prefix = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\";\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".URIEncode();\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(url); // Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Codifica la cadena en un format compatible amb URL. Aquest mètode està "
"pensat per codificar correctament els paràmetres en una URL quan s'envia una "
"sol·licitud HTTP. Vegeu també [method uri_decode].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"prefix var = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\"\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".uri_encode()\n"
"\n"
"print(url) # Imprimeix \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"prefix var = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\";\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".URIEncode();\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(url); // Imprimeix \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Decodes the file path from its URL-encoded format. Unlike [method "
"uri_decode] this method leaves [code]+[/code] as is."
msgstr ""
"Descodifica la ruta del fitxer des del seu format codificat per URL. A "
"diferència de [method uri_decode], aquest mètode deixa [code]+[/code] tal "
"qual."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with all characters that are not allowed in "
"[method is_valid_filename] replaced with underscores."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia de la cadena amb tots els caràcters que no es permeten a "
"[method is_valid_filename] substituïts per guions baixos."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with all characters that are not allowed in "
"[member Node.name] ([code].[/code] [code]:[/code] [code]@[/code] [code]/[/"
"code] [code]\"[/code] [code]%[/code]) replaced with underscores."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with special characters escaped using the XML "
"standard. If [param escape_quotes] is [code]true[/code], the single quote "
"([code]'[/code]) and double quote ([code]\"[/code]) characters are also "
"escaped."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with escaped characters replaced by their "
"meanings according to the XML standard."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una còpia de la cadena amb caràcters d'escapada substituïts pels "
"seus significats segons l'estàndard XML."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both strings do not contain the same sequence "
"of characters."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si les dues cadenes no contenen la mateixa "
"seqüència de caràcters."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [String] is not equivalent to the given "
"[StringName]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta [String] no és equivalent a la "
"[StringName] donada."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Formats the [String], replacing the placeholders with one or more "
"parameters. To pass multiple parameters, [param right] needs to be an "
"[Array].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"I caught %d fishes!\" % 2) # Prints \"I caught 2 fishes!\"\n"
"\n"
"var my_message = \"Travelling to %s, at %2.2f km/h.\"\n"
"var location = \"Deep Valley\"\n"
"var speed = 40.3485\n"
"print(my_message % [location, speed]) # Prints \"Travelling to Deep Valley, "
"at 40.35 km/h.\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"For more information, see the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format strings[/url] tutorial.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this operator is not available. Instead, see "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/"
"tokens/interpolated]how to interpolate strings with \"$\"[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Formata el [String], substituint els marcadors de posició per un o més "
"paràmetres. Per passar diversos paràmetres, [param right] ha de ser un "
"[Array].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"He capturat %d peixos!\" % 2) # Imprimeix \"He capturat 2 peixos!\"\n"
"\n"
"var my_message = \"Viatjant a %s, a %2,2f km/h.\"\n"
"var location = \"Vall profunda\"\n"
"velocitat var = 40,3485\n"
"print(my_message % [location, speed]) # Imprimeix \"Viatjant a Deep Valley, "
"a 40,35 km/h\".\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Per obtenir més informació, consulteu el tutorial de cadenes de format "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript[/url].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, aquest operador no està disponible. En lloc d'això, "
"vegeu [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-"
"reference/tokens/interpolated]com interpolar cadenes amb \"$\"[/url]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Appends [param right] at the end of this [String], also known as a string "
"concatenation."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix [param right] al final d'aquesta [String], també coneguda com a "
"concatenació de cadenes."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Appends [param right] at the end of this [String], returning a [String]. "
"This is also known as a string concatenation."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix [param right] al final d'aquest [String], retornant un [String]. "
"Això també es coneix com a concatenació de cadenes."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes before [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order. Useful for sorting."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'esquerra [String] arriba abans que [param "
"right] a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Ordre "
"Unicode[/url], que coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic. Útil per "
"ordenar."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes before [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order, or if both are equal."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'esquerra [String] arriba abans de [param "
"right] a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Ordre "
"Unicode[/url], que coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic, o si "
"tots dos són iguals."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both strings contain the same sequence of "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si ambdues cadenes contenen la mateixa seqüència "
"de caràcters."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [String] is equivalent to the given "
"[StringName]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest [String] és equivalent al [StringName] "
"donat."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes after [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order. Useful for sorting."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'esquerra [String] ve després de [param right] "
"a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Ordre "
"Unicode[/url], que coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic. Útil per "
"ordenar."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes after [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order, or if both are equal."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si l'esquerra [String] ve després de [param right] "
"a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Ordre "
"Unicode[/url], que coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic, o si "
"tots dos són iguals."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new [String] that only contains the character at [param index]. "
"Indices start from [code]0[/code]. If [param index] is greater or equal to "
"[code]0[/code], the character is fetched starting from the beginning of the "
"string. If [param index] is a negative value, it is fetched starting from "
"the end. Accessing a string out-of-bounds will cause a run-time error, "
"pausing the project execution if run from the editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [String] nou que només conté el caràcter a [param index]. Els "
"índexs comencen des de [code]0[/code]. Si [param index] és major o igual a "
"[code]0[/code], el caràcter s'obté des del principi de la cadena. Si [param "
"index] és un valor negatiu, s'obté des del final. L'accés a una cadena fora "
"dels límits provocarà un error en temps d'execució, aturant l'execució del "
"projecte si s'executa des de l'editor."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid "A built-in type for unique strings."
msgstr "Un tipus integrat per a cordes úniques."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"[StringName]s are immutable strings designed for general-purpose "
"representation of unique names (also called \"string interning\"). Two "
"[StringName]s with the same value are the same object. Comparing them is "
"extremely fast compared to regular [String]s.\n"
"You will usually pass a [String] to methods expecting a [StringName] and it "
"will be automatically converted (often at compile time), but in rare cases "
"you can construct a [StringName] ahead of time with the [StringName] "
"constructor or, in GDScript, the literal syntax [code]&\"example\"[/code]. "
"Manually constructing a [StringName] allows you to control when the "
"conversion from [String] occurs or to use the literal and prevent "
"conversions entirely.\n"
"See also [NodePath], which is a similar concept specifically designed to "
"store pre-parsed scene tree paths.\n"
"All of [String]'s methods are available in this class too. They convert the "
"[StringName] into a string, and they also return a string. This is highly "
"inefficient and should only be used if the string is desired.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, an explicit conversion to [code]System.String[/code] is "
"required to use the methods listed on this page. Use the [code]ToString()[/"
"code] method to cast a [StringName] to a string, and then use the equivalent "
"methods in [code]System.String[/code] or [code]StringExtensions[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a [StringName] will evaluate to "
"[code]false[/code] if it is empty ([code]StringName(\"\")[/code]). "
"Otherwise, a [StringName] will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[StringName]s són cadenes immutables dissenyades per a la representació de "
"propòsit general de noms únics (també anomenada \"intern de cadenes\"). Dos "
"[StringName]s amb el mateix valor són el mateix objecte. Comparar-los és "
"extremadament ràpid en comparació amb els [String]s habituals.\n"
"Normalment passareu un [String] als mètodes que esperen un [StringName] i es "
"convertirà automàticament (sovint en temps de compilació), però en casos "
"rars podeu construir un [StringName] amb antelació amb el [StringName] "
"constructor o, en GDScript, el syntascript literal. [code]&\"exemple\"[/"
"code]. Construir manualment un [StringName] us permet controlar quan es "
"produeix la conversió de [String] o utilitzar el literal i evitar "
"conversions completament.\n"
"Vegeu també [NodePath], que és un concepte similar dissenyat específicament "
"per emmagatzemar camins d'arbre d'escenes analitzats prèviament.\n"
"Tots els mètodes de [String] també estan disponibles en aquesta classe. "
"Converteixen [StringName] en una cadena i també retornen una cadena. Això és "
"altament ineficient i només s'ha d'utilitzar si es desitja la cadena.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, es requereix una conversió explícita a "
"[code]System.String[/code] per utilitzar els mètodes enumerats en aquesta "
"pàgina. Utilitzeu el mètode [code]ToString()[/code] per emetre un "
"[StringName] a una cadena i, a continuació, utilitzeu els mètodes "
"equivalents a [code]System.String[/code] o [code]StringExtensions[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En un context booleà, un [StringName] avaluarà com a "
"[code]false[/code] si està buit ([code]StringName(\"\")[/code]). En cas "
"contrari, un [StringName] sempre s'avaluarà com a [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid "Constructs an empty [StringName]."
msgstr "Construeix un [StringName] buit."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid "Constructs a [StringName] as a copy of the given [StringName]."
msgstr "Construeix un [StringName] com a còpia del [StringName] donat."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [StringName] from the given [String]. In GDScript, "
"[code]StringName(\"example\")[/code] is equivalent to [code]&\"example\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Crea un nou [StringName] a partir del [String] donat. A GDScript, "
"[code]StringName(\"example\")[/code] és equivalent a [code]&\"example\"[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the appearance of the string: replaces underscores ([code]_[/code]) "
"with spaces, adds spaces before uppercase letters in the middle of a word, "
"converts all letters to lowercase, then converts the first one and each one "
"following a space to uppercase.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".capitalize()   # Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".capitalize()   # Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".Capitalize(); // Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Canvia l'aparença de la cadena: substitueix els guions baixos ([code]_[/"
"code]) per espais, afegeix espais abans de les majúscules al mig d'una "
"paraula, converteix totes les lletres en minúscules i després converteix la "
"primera i cadascuna que segueix un espai en majúscules.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\". capitalize() # Retorna \"Mou Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # Retorna \"Camí del fitxer de l'escena\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\". capitalize() # Retorna \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\". Capitalize();   // Retorna \"Mou la X local\"\n"
"\"camí_fitxer_escena\". Capitalitzar(); // Retorna \"Camí del fitxer de "
"l'escena\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\". Capitalitzar ();   // Retorna \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a case-sensitive comparison to another string. Returns [code]-1[/"
"code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, or [code]0[/code] if "
"equal. \"Less than\" and \"greater than\" are determined by the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] "
"of each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical order.\n"
"With different string lengths, returns [code]1[/code] if this string is "
"longer than the [param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that "
"the length of empty strings is [i]always[/i] [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method nocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], "
"and [method naturalcasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una comparació que distingeix entre majúscules i minúscules amb una "
"altra cadena. Retorna [code]-1[/code] si és inferior a, [code]1[/code] si és "
"més gran que, o [code]@0[/code] si és igual. \"Menys que\" i \"més gran "
"que\" estan determinats pels [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode punts[/url] de cada cadena, que "
"coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic.\n"
"Amb longituds de cadena diferents, retorna [code]1[/code] si aquesta cadena "
"és més llarga que la cadena [param to], o [code]-1[/code] si és més curta. "
"Tingueu en compte que la longitud de les cadenes buides és [i]always[/i] "
"[code]0[/code].\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method nocasecmp_to], [method "
"filecasecmp_to] i [method naturalcasecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns the substring at "
"index [param slice]. Returns the original string if [param delimiter] does "
"not occur in the string. Returns an empty string if the [param slice] does "
"not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one substring.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # Prints \"example\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Divideix la cadena utilitzant un [param delimiter] i retorna la subcadena a "
"l'índex [param slice]. Retorna la cadena original si [param delimiter] no "
"apareix a la cadena. Retorna una cadena buida si [param slice] no existeix.\n"
"Això és més ràpid que [method split], si només necessiteu una subcadena.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # Imprimeix \"exemple\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total number of slices when the string is split with the given "
"[param delimiter] (see [method split])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nombre total de seccions quan la cadena es divideix amb el [param "
"delimiter] donat (vegeu [method split])."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Splits the string using a Unicode character with code [param delimiter] and "
"returns the substring at index [param slice]. Returns an empty string if the "
"[param slice] does not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one substring."
msgstr ""
"Divideix la cadena utilitzant un caràcter Unicode amb el codi [param "
"delimiter] i retorna la subcadena a l'índex [param slice]. Retorna una "
"cadena buida si [param slice] no existeix.\n"
"Això és més ràpid que [method split], si només necessiteu una subcadena."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-sensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to another "
"string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater "
"than, or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" are "
"determined by the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] of each string, which "
"roughly matches the alphabetical order.\n"
"When used for sorting, natural order comparison orders sequences of numbers "
"by the combined value of each digit as is often expected, instead of the "
"single digit's value. A sorted sequence of numbered strings will be [code]"
"[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], not [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", "
"\"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"With different string lengths, returns [code]1[/code] if this string is "
"longer than the [param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that "
"the length of empty strings is [i]always[/i] [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method naturalnocasecmp_to], [method "
"filecasecmp_to], and [method nocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una comparació [b]case-sensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] amb una "
"altra cadena. Retorna [code]-1[/code] si és inferior a, [code]1[/code] si és "
"més gran que, o [code]@0[/code] si és igual. \"Menys que\" o \"més gran "
"que\" estan determinats pels [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode punts[/url] de cada cadena, que "
"coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic.\n"
"Quan s'utilitza per ordenar, la comparació d'ordre natural ordena les "
"seqüències de nombres pel valor combinat de cada dígit com s'espera sovint, "
"en lloc del valor d'un dígit. Una seqüència ordenada de cadenes numerades "
"serà [code][\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], no [code][\"1\", \"10\", "
"\"2\", \"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"Amb longituds de cadena diferents, retorna [code]1[/code] si aquesta cadena "
"és més llarga que la cadena [param to], o [code]-1@[/code] si és més curta. "
"Tingueu en compte que la longitud de les cadenes buides és [i]always[/i] "
"[code]0[/code].\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method naturalnocasecmp_to], "
"[method filecasecmp_to] i [method nocasecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-insensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to "
"another string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if "
"greater than, or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" "
"are determined by the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] of each string, which "
"roughly matches the alphabetical order. Internally, lowercase characters are "
"converted to uppercase for the comparison.\n"
"When used for sorting, natural order comparison orders sequences of numbers "
"by the combined value of each digit as is often expected, instead of the "
"single digit's value. A sorted sequence of numbered strings will be [code]"
"[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], not [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", "
"\"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"With different string lengths, returns [code]1[/code] if this string is "
"longer than the [param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that "
"the length of empty strings is [i]always[/i] [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method naturalcasecmp_to], [method "
"filenocasecmp_to], and [method casecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una comparació [b]case-insensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] amb "
"una altra cadena. Retorna [code]-1[/code] si és inferior a, [code]1[/code] "
"si és més gran que, o [code]@0[/code] si és igual. \"Menys que\" o \"més "
"gran que\" estan determinats pels [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode punts[/url] de cada cadena, que "
"coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic. Internament, els caràcters "
"minúscules es converteixen en majúscules per a la comparació.\n"
"Quan s'utilitza per ordenar, la comparació d'ordre natural ordena les "
"seqüències de nombres pel valor combinat de cada dígit com s'espera sovint, "
"en lloc del valor d'un dígit. Una seqüència ordenada de cadenes numerades "
"serà [code][\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], no [code][\"1\", \"10\", "
"\"2\", \"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"Amb longituds de cadena diferents, retorna [code]1[/code] si aquesta cadena "
"és més llarga que la cadena [param to], o [code]-1@[/code] si és més curta. "
"Tingueu en compte que la longitud de les cadenes buides és [i]always[/i] "
"[code]0[/code].\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method naturalcasecmp_to], [method "
"filenocasecmp_to] i [method casecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-insensitive[/b] comparison to another string. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, or [code]0[/"
"code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" are determined by the "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code "
"points[/url] of each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical order. "
"Internally, lowercase characters are converted to uppercase for the "
"comparison.\n"
"With different string lengths, returns [code]1[/code] if this string is "
"longer than the [param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that "
"the length of empty strings is [i]always[/i] [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method casecmp_to], [method filenocasecmp_to], "
"and [method naturalnocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"Realitza una comparació [b]case-insensitive[/b] amb una altra cadena. "
"Retorna [code]-1[/code] si és inferior a, [code]1[/code] si és superior a, o "
"[code]@0[/code] si és igual. \"Menys que\" o \"més gran que\" estan "
"determinats pels [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode punts[/url] de cada cadena, que "
"coincideix aproximadament amb l'ordre alfabètic. Internament, els caràcters "
"minúscules es converteixen en majúscules per a la comparació.\n"
"Amb longituds de cadena diferents, retorna [code]1[/code] si aquesta cadena "
"és més llarga que la cadena [param to], o [code]-1@[/code] si és més curta. "
"Tingueu en compte que la longitud de les cadenes buides és [i]always[/i] "
"[code]0[/code].\n"
"Per obtenir un resultat [bool] d'una comparació de cadenes, utilitzeu "
"l'operador [code]==[/code]. Vegeu també [method casecmp_to], [method "
"filenocasecmp_to] i [method naturalnocasecmp_to]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the character code at position [param at].\n"
"See also [method String.chr], [method @GDScript.char], and [method "
"@GDScript.ord]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el codi de caràcter a la posició [param at].\n"
"Vegeu també [method String.chr], [method @GDScript.char] i [method "
"@GDScript.ord]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [StringName] is not equivalent to the "
"given [String]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquesta [StringName] no és equivalent a la "
"[String] donada."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [StringName] and [param right] do not refer "
"to the same name. Comparisons between [StringName]s are much faster than "
"regular [String] comparisons."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si [StringName] i [param right] no fan referència "
"al mateix nom. Les comparacions entre [StringName]s són molt més ràpides que "
"les comparacions habituals de [String]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Formats the [StringName], replacing the placeholders with one or more "
"parameters, returning a [String]. To pass multiple parameters, [param right] "
"needs to be an [Array].\n"
"For more information, see the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format strings[/url] tutorial.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this operator is not available. Instead, see "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/"
"tokens/interpolated]how to interpolate strings with \"$\"[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Formata el [StringName], substituint els marcadors de posició per un o més "
"paràmetres, retornant un [String]. Per passar diversos paràmetres, [param "
"right] ha de ser un [Array].\n"
"Per obtenir més informació, consulteu el tutorial de cadenes de format "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript[/url].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] En C#, aquest operador no està disponible. En lloc d'això, "
"vegeu [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-"
"reference/tokens/interpolated]com interpolar cadenes amb \"$\"[/url]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Appends [param right] at the end of this [StringName], returning a [String]. "
"This is also known as a string concatenation."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix [param right] al final d'aquest [StringName], retornant un [String]. "
"Això també es coneix com a concatenació de cadenes."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [StringName]'s pointer comes before "
"[param right]. Note that this will not match their [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el punter esquerre de [StringName] arriba abans "
"de [param right]. Tingueu en compte que això no coincidirà amb la seva "
"comanda [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode[/url]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [StringName]'s pointer comes before "
"[param right] or if they are the same. Note that this will not match their "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el punter de l'esquerra [StringName] arriba "
"abans que [param right] o si són iguals. Tingueu en compte que això no "
"coincidirà amb la seva comanda [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode[/url]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [StringName] is equivalent to the given "
"[String]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si aquest [StringName] és equivalent al [String] "
"donat."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [StringName] and [param right] refer to the "
"same name. Comparisons between [StringName]s are much faster than regular "
"[String] comparisons."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si [StringName] i [param right] fan referència al "
"mateix nom. Les comparacions entre [StringName]s són molt més ràpides que "
"les comparacions habituals de [String]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [StringName]'s pointer comes after "
"[param right]. Note that this will not match their [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el punter esquerre de [StringName] ve després "
"de [param right]. Tingueu en compte que això no coincidirà amb la seva "
"comanda [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode[/url]."

#: doc/classes/StringName.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [StringName]'s pointer comes after "
"[param right] or if they are the same. Note that this will not match their "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si el punter esquerre de [StringName] ve després "
"de [param right] o si són iguals. Tingueu en compte que això no coincidirà "
"amb la seva comanda [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode[/url]."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for defining stylized boxes for UI elements."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstracta per definir caixes estilitzades per als elements de la "
"IU."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] is an abstract base class for drawing stylized boxes for UI "
"elements. It is used for panels, buttons, [LineEdit] backgrounds, [Tree] "
"backgrounds, etc. and also for testing a transparency mask for pointer "
"signals. If mask test fails on a [StyleBox] assigned as mask to a control, "
"clicks and motion signals will go through it to the one below.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For control nodes that have [i]Theme Properties[/i], the "
"[code]focus[/code] [StyleBox] is displayed over the [code]normal[/code], "
"[code]hover[/code] or [code]pressed[/code] [StyleBox]. This makes the "
"[code]focus[/code] [StyleBox] more reusable across different nodes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns a custom minimum size "
"that the stylebox must respect when drawing. By default [method "
"get_minimum_size] only takes content margins into account. This method can "
"be overridden to add another size restriction. A combination of the default "
"behavior and the output of this method will be used, to account for both "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Mètode virtual a implementar per l'usuari. Retorna una mida mínima "
"personalitzada que el quadre d'estil ha de respectar en dibuixar. Per "
"defecte [method get_minimum_size] només té en compte els marges de "
"contingut. Aquest mètode es pot substituir per afegir una altra restricció "
"de mida. S'utilitzarà una combinació del comportament predeterminat i la "
"sortida d'aquest mètode, per tenir en compte ambdues mides."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"Draws this stylebox using a canvas item identified by the given [RID].\n"
"The [RID] value can either be the result of [method "
"CanvasItem.get_canvas_item] called on an existing [CanvasItem]-derived node, "
"or directly from creating a canvas item in the [RenderingServer] with "
"[method RenderingServer.canvas_item_create]."
msgstr ""
"Dibuixa aquest quadre d'estil utilitzant un element de llenç identificat per "
"[RID] donat.\n"
"El valor [RID] pot ser el resultat de [method CanvasItem.get_canvas_item] "
"cridat a un node derivat de [CanvasItem] o directament de crear un element "
"de llenç a [RenderingServer] amb [method RenderingServer.canvas_item_create]."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid "Returns the default margin of the specified [enum Side]."
msgstr "Retorna el marge per defecte del [enum Side] especificat."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [CanvasItem] that handles its [constant "
"CanvasItem.NOTIFICATION_DRAW] or [method CanvasItem._draw] callback at this "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [CanvasItem] que gestiona la seva devolució de trucada [constant "
"CanvasItem.NOTIFICATION_DRAW] o [method CanvasItem._draw] en aquest moment."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the content margin offset for the specified [enum Side].\n"
"Positive values reduce size inwards, unlike [Control]'s margin values."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el desplaçament del marge de contingut per al [enum Side] "
"especificat.\n"
"Els valors positius redueixen la mida cap a dins, a diferència dels valors "
"de marge de [Control]."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid "Returns the minimum size that this stylebox can be shrunk to."
msgstr "Retorna la mida mínima a la qual es pot reduir aquesta caixa d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the \"offset\" of a stylebox. This helper function returns a value "
"equivalent to [code]Vector2(style.get_margin(MARGIN_LEFT), "
"style.get_margin(MARGIN_TOP))[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el \"offset\" d'un quadre d'estil. Aquesta funció d'ajuda retorna un "
"valor equivalent a [code]Vector2(style.get_margin(MARGIN_LEFT), "
"style.get_margin(MARGIN_TOP))[/code]."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the default value of the specified [enum Side] to [param offset] pixels."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el valor predeterminat dels [enum Side] especificats en [param "
"offset] píxels."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid "Sets the default margin to [param offset] pixels for all sides."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el marge predeterminat en [param offset] píxels per a tots els "
"costats."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid "Test a position in a rectangle, return whether it passes the mask test."
msgstr ""
"Proveu una posició en un rectangle, retorneu si passa la prova de màscara."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"The bottom margin for the contents of this style box. Increasing this value "
"reduces the space available to the contents from the bottom.\n"
"If this value is negative, it is ignored and a child-specific margin is used "
"instead. For example, for [StyleBoxFlat], the border thickness (if any) is "
"used instead.\n"
"It is up to the code using this style box to decide what these contents are: "
"for example, a [Button] respects this content margin for the textual "
"contents of the button.\n"
"[method get_margin] should be used to fetch this value as consumer instead "
"of reading these properties directly. This is because it correctly respects "
"negative values and the fallback mentioned above."
msgstr ""
"El marge inferior del contingut d'aquest quadre d'estil. Augmentant aquest "
"valor es redueix l'espai disponible per als continguts des de la part "
"inferior.\n"
"Si aquest valor és negatiu, s'ignora i s'utilitza un marge específic per a "
"fills. Per exemple, per a [StyleBoxFlat], s'utilitza el gruix de la vora (si "
"n'hi ha).\n"
"Depèn del codi que utilitza aquest quadre d'estil decidir quins són aquests "
"continguts: per exemple, un [Button] respecta aquest marge de contingut per "
"als continguts textuals del botó.\n"
"S'ha d'utilitzar [method get_margin] per obtenir aquest valor com a "
"consumidor en lloc de llegir aquestes propietats directament. Això es deu al "
"fet que respecta correctament els valors negatius i la alternativa esmentada "
"anteriorment."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"The left margin for the contents of this style box. Increasing this value "
"reduces the space available to the contents from the left.\n"
"Refer to [member content_margin_bottom] for extra considerations."
msgstr ""
"El marge esquerre del contingut d'aquest quadre d'estil. Augmentant aquest "
"valor es redueix l'espai disponible per als continguts des de l'esquerra.\n"
"Consulteu [member content_margin_bottom] per a consideracions addicionals."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"The right margin for the contents of this style box. Increasing this value "
"reduces the space available to the contents from the right.\n"
"Refer to [member content_margin_bottom] for extra considerations."
msgstr ""
"El marge dret del contingut d'aquest quadre d'estil. Augmentant aquest valor "
"es redueix l'espai disponible per als continguts des de la dreta.\n"
"Consulteu [member content_margin_bottom] per a consideracions addicionals."

#: doc/classes/StyleBox.xml
msgid ""
"The top margin for the contents of this style box. Increasing this value "
"reduces the space available to the contents from the top.\n"
"Refer to [member content_margin_bottom] for extra considerations."
msgstr ""
"El marge superior del contingut d'aquest quadre d'estil. Augmentant aquest "
"valor es redueix l'espai disponible per als continguts des de la part "
"superior.\n"
"Consulteu [member content_margin_bottom] per a consideracions addicionals."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxEmpty.xml
msgid "An empty [StyleBox] (does not display anything)."
msgstr "Un [StyleBox] buit (no mostra res)."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxEmpty.xml
msgid ""
"An empty [StyleBox] that can be used to display nothing instead of the "
"default style (e.g. it can \"disable\" [code]focus[/code] styles)."
msgstr ""
"Un [StyleBox] buit que es pot utilitzar per mostrar res en lloc de l'estil "
"predeterminat (per exemple, pot \"desactivar\" els estils [code]focus[/"
"code])."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "A customizable [StyleBox] that doesn't use a texture."
msgstr "Un [StyleBox] personalitzable que no utilitza una textura."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"By configuring various properties of this style box, you can achieve many "
"common looks without the need of a texture. This includes optionally rounded "
"borders, antialiasing, shadows, and skew.\n"
"Setting corner radius to high values is allowed. As soon as corners overlap, "
"the stylebox will switch to a relative system:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"height = 30\n"
"corner_radius_top_left = 50\n"
"corner_radius_bottom_left = 100\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The relative system now would take the 1:2 ratio of the two left corners to "
"calculate the actual corner width. Both corners added will [b]never[/b] be "
"more than the height. Result:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"corner_radius_top_left: 10\n"
"corner_radius_bottom_left: 20\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"En configurar diverses propietats d'aquest quadre d'estil, podeu aconseguir "
"molts aspectes comuns sense necessitat d'una textura. Això inclou "
"opcionalment vores arrodonides, antialiasing, ombres i inclinació.\n"
"Es permet establir un radi de cantonada en valors alts. Tan aviat com les "
"cantonades se superposen, el quadre d'estil canviarà a un sistema relatiu:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"alçada = 30\n"
"angle_radius_top_left = 50\n"
"angle_radius_bottom_left = 100\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"El sistema relatiu ara prendria la proporció 1:2 de les dues cantonades "
"esquerres per calcular l'amplada real de la cantonada. Les dues cantonades "
"afegides seran [b]never[/b] més que l'alçada. Resultat:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"angle_radius_top_left: 10\n"
"angle_radius_bottom_left: 20\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Returns the specified [enum Side]'s border width."
msgstr "Retorna l'amplada de vora especificada [enum Side]."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Returns the smallest border width out of all four borders."
msgstr "Retorna l'amplada de vora més petita de les quatre vores."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Returns the given [param corner]'s radius."
msgstr "Retorna el radi del [param corner] indicat."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Returns the size of the specified [enum Side]'s expand margin."
msgstr "Retorna la mida del marge d'expansió de [enum Side] especificat."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Sets the specified [enum Side]'s border width to [param width] pixels."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'amplada de vora especificada de [enum Side] en [param width] "
"píxels."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Sets the border width to [param width] pixels for all sides."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'amplada de la vora en [param width] píxels per a tots els "
"costats."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sets the corner radius to [param radius] pixels for the given [param corner]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Sets the corner radius to [param radius] pixels for all corners."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el radi de la cantonada en [param radius] píxels per a totes les "
"cantonades."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the expand margin to [param size] pixels for the specified [enum Side]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el marge d'expansió en [param size] píxels per a [enum Side] "
"especificat."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "Sets the expand margin to [param size] pixels for all sides."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el marge d'expansió en [param size] píxels per a tots els costats."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"Antialiasing draws a small ring around the edges, which fades to "
"transparency. As a result, edges look much smoother. This is only noticeable "
"when using rounded corners or [member skew].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using beveled corners with 45-degree angles ([member "
"corner_detail] = 1), it is recommended to set [member anti_aliasing] to "
"[code]false[/code] to ensure crisp visuals and avoid possible visual "
"glitches."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"This changes the size of the antialiasing effect. [code]1.0[/code] is "
"recommended for an optimal result at 100% scale, identical to how rounded "
"rectangles are rendered in web browsers and most vector drawing software.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Higher values may produce a blur effect but can also create "
"undesired artifacts on small boxes with large-radius corners."
msgstr ""
"Això canvia la mida de l'efecte antialiasing. Es recomana [code]1.0[/code] "
"per obtenir un resultat òptim a una escala del 100%, idèntica a com es "
"representen els rectangles arrodonits als navegadors web i a la majoria de "
"programaris de dibuix vectorial.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Els valors més alts poden produir un efecte de desenfocament, "
"però també poden crear artefactes no desitjats en caixes petites amb "
"cantonades de radi gran."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "The background color of the stylebox."
msgstr "El color de fons de la caixa d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the border will fade into the background color."
msgstr "Si [code]true[/code], la vora s'esvaeix en el color de fons."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Sets the color of the border."
msgstr "Estableix el color de la vora."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Border width for the bottom border."
msgstr "Amplada de la vora per a la vora inferior."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Border width for the left border."
msgstr "Amplada de la vora per a la vora esquerra."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Border width for the right border."
msgstr "Amplada de la vora per a la vora dreta."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Border width for the top border."
msgstr "Amplada de la vora per a la vora superior."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"This sets the number of vertices used for each corner. Higher values result "
"in rounder corners but take more processing power to compute. When choosing "
"a value, you should take the corner radius ([method set_corner_radius_all]) "
"into account.\n"
"For corner radii less than 10, [code]4[/code] or [code]5[/code] should be "
"enough. For corner radii less than 30, values between [code]8[/code] and "
"[code]12[/code] should be enough.\n"
"A corner detail of [code]1[/code] will result in chamfered corners instead "
"of rounded corners, which is useful for some artistic effects."
msgstr ""
"Això estableix el nombre de vèrtexs utilitzats per a cada cantonada. Els "
"valors més alts donen lloc a cantonades més arrodonides, però necessiten més "
"potència de processament per calcular. Quan escolliu un valor, hauríeu de "
"tenir en compte el radi de la cantonada ([method set_corner_radius_all]).\n"
"Per a radis de cantonada inferiors a 10, [code]4[/code] o [code]5[/code] "
"hauria de ser suficient. Per a radis de cantonada inferiors a 30, els valors "
"entre [code]8[/code] i [code]12[/code] haurien de ser suficients.\n"
"Un detall de cantonada de [code]1[/code] donarà lloc a cantonades "
"xamfranades en lloc de cantonades arrodonides, cosa que és útil per a alguns "
"efectes artístics."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"The bottom-left corner's radius. If [code]0[/code], the corner is not "
"rounded."
msgstr ""
"Radi de la cantonada inferior esquerra. Si [code]0[/code], la cantonada no "
"està arrodonida."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"The bottom-right corner's radius. If [code]0[/code], the corner is not "
"rounded."
msgstr ""
"Radi de la cantonada inferior dreta. Si [code]0[/code], la cantonada no està "
"arrodonida."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"The top-left corner's radius. If [code]0[/code], the corner is not rounded."
msgstr ""
"Radi de la cantonada superior esquerra. Si [code]0[/code], la cantonada no "
"està arrodonida."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"The top-right corner's radius. If [code]0[/code], the corner is not rounded."
msgstr ""
"Radi de la cantonada superior dreta. Si [code]0[/code], la cantonada no està "
"arrodonida."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "Toggles drawing of the inner part of the stylebox."
msgstr "Commuta el dibuix de la part interior de la caixa d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the stylebox outside of the control rect on the bottom edge. Useful "
"in combination with [member border_width_bottom] to draw a border outside "
"the control rect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member StyleBox.content_margin_bottom], [member "
"expand_margin_bottom] does [i]not[/i] affect the size of the clickable area "
"for [Control]s. This can negatively impact usability if used wrong, as the "
"user may try to click an area of the StyleBox that cannot actually receive "
"clicks."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the stylebox outside of the control rect on the left edge. Useful in "
"combination with [member border_width_left] to draw a border outside the "
"control rect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member StyleBox.content_margin_left], [member "
"expand_margin_left] does [i]not[/i] affect the size of the clickable area "
"for [Control]s. This can negatively impact usability if used wrong, as the "
"user may try to click an area of the StyleBox that cannot actually receive "
"clicks."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the stylebox outside of the control rect on the right edge. Useful "
"in combination with [member border_width_right] to draw a border outside the "
"control rect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member StyleBox.content_margin_right], [member "
"expand_margin_right] does [i]not[/i] affect the size of the clickable area "
"for [Control]s. This can negatively impact usability if used wrong, as the "
"user may try to click an area of the StyleBox that cannot actually receive "
"clicks."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the stylebox outside of the control rect on the top edge. Useful in "
"combination with [member border_width_top] to draw a border outside the "
"control rect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member StyleBox.content_margin_top], [member "
"expand_margin_top] does [i]not[/i] affect the size of the clickable area for "
"[Control]s. This can negatively impact usability if used wrong, as the user "
"may try to click an area of the StyleBox that cannot actually receive clicks."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"The color of the shadow. This has no effect if [member shadow_size] is lower "
"than 1."
msgstr ""
"El color de l'ombra. Això no té cap efecte si [member shadow_size] és "
"inferior a 1."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"The shadow offset in pixels. Adjusts the position of the shadow relatively "
"to the stylebox."
msgstr ""
"El desplaçament de l'ombra en píxels. Ajusta la posició de l'ombra en "
"relació al quadre d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid "The shadow size in pixels."
msgstr "La mida de l'ombra en píxels."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml
msgid ""
"If set to a non-zero value on either axis, [member skew] distorts the "
"StyleBox horizontally and/or vertically. This can be used for \"futuristic\"-"
"style UIs. Positive values skew the StyleBox towards the right (X axis) and "
"upwards (Y axis), while negative values skew the StyleBox towards the left "
"(X axis) and downwards (Y axis).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To ensure text does not touch the StyleBox's edges, consider "
"increasing the [StyleBox]'s content margin (see [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_bottom]). It is preferable to increase the content "
"margin instead of the expand margin (see [member expand_margin_bottom]), as "
"increasing the expand margin does not increase the size of the clickable "
"area for [Control]s."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix en un valor diferent de zero en qualsevol dels eixos, [member "
"skew] distorsiona l'StyleBox horitzontalment i/o verticalment. Això es pot "
"utilitzar per a interfícies d'usuari d'estil \"futurista\". Els valors "
"positius obliguen l'StyleBox cap a la dreta (eix X) i cap amunt (eix Y), "
"mentre que els valors negatius obliguen l'StyleBox cap a l'esquerra (eix X) "
"i cap avall (eix Y).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per assegurar-vos que el text no toqui les vores de StyleBox, "
"considereu augmentar el marge de contingut de [StyleBox] (vegeu [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_bottom]). És preferible augmentar el marge de "
"contingut en lloc del marge d'expansió (vegeu [member "
"expand_margin_bottom]), ja que augmentar el marge d'expansió no augmenta la "
"mida de l'àrea on es pot fer clic per a [Control]s."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxLine.xml
msgid ""
"A [StyleBox] that displays a single line of a given color and thickness."
msgstr ""
"Un [StyleBox] que mostra una única línia d'un color i un gruix determinats."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxLine.xml
msgid ""
"A [StyleBox] that displays a single line of a given color and thickness. The "
"line can be either horizontal or vertical. Useful for separators."
msgstr ""
"Un [StyleBox] que mostra una única línia d'un color i un gruix determinats. "
"La línia pot ser horitzontal o vertical. Útil per a separadors."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxLine.xml
msgid "The line's color."
msgstr "El color de la línia."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxLine.xml
msgid ""
"The number of pixels the line will extend before the [StyleBoxLine]'s "
"bounds. If set to a negative value, the line will begin inside the "
"[StyleBoxLine]'s bounds."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de píxels que s'estendrà la línia abans dels límits de "
"[StyleBoxLine]. Si s'estableix en un valor negatiu, la línia començarà dins "
"dels límits de [StyleBoxLine]."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxLine.xml
msgid ""
"The number of pixels the line will extend past the [StyleBoxLine]'s bounds. "
"If set to a negative value, the line will end inside the [StyleBoxLine]'s "
"bounds."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de píxels que la línia s'estendrà més enllà dels límits de "
"[StyleBoxLine]. Si s'estableix en un valor negatiu, la línia acabarà dins "
"dels límits de [StyleBoxLine]."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxLine.xml
msgid "The line's thickness in pixels."
msgstr "El gruix de la línia en píxels."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxLine.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the line will be vertical. If [code]false[/code], the "
"line will be horizontal."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la línia serà vertical. Si [code]false[/code], la "
"línia serà horitzontal."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "A texture-based nine-patch [StyleBox]."
msgstr "Un [StyleBox] de nou pegats basat en textures."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"A texture-based nine-patch [StyleBox], in a way similar to [NinePatchRect]. "
"This stylebox performs a 3×3 scaling of a texture, where only the center "
"cell is fully stretched. This makes it possible to design bordered styles "
"regardless of the stylebox's size."
msgstr ""
"Un [StyleBox] de nou pegats basat en textures, d'una manera similar a "
"[NinePatchRect]. Aquesta caixa d'estil realitza una escala 3×3 d'una "
"textura, on només la cel·la central està totalment estirada. Això fa "
"possible dissenyar estils amb vores independentment de la mida de la caixa "
"d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "Returns the expand margin size of the specified [enum Side]."
msgstr "Retorna la mida del marge d'ampliació de la [enum Side] especificada."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "Returns the margin size of the specified [enum Side]."
msgstr "Retorna la mida del marge del [enum Side] especificat."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "Sets the margin to [param size] pixels for the specified [enum Side]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el marge en [param size] píxels per a [enum Side] especificat."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "Sets the margin to [param size] pixels for all sides."
msgstr "Estableix el marge en [param size] píxels per a tots els costats."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how the stylebox's texture will be stretched or tiled horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Controla com s'estirarà o enrajolarà horitzontalment la textura del quadre "
"d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Controls how the stylebox's texture will be stretched or tiled vertically."
msgstr ""
"Controla com s'estirarà o enrajolarà verticalment la textura del quadre "
"d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the nine-patch texture's center tile will be drawn."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], es dibuixarà la rajola central de la textura de nou "
"pegats."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the bottom margin of this style box when drawing, causing it to be "
"drawn larger than requested."
msgstr ""
"Amplia el marge inferior d'aquest quadre d'estil quan es dibuixa, fent que "
"es dibuixi més gran del que es demana."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the left margin of this style box when drawing, causing it to be "
"drawn larger than requested."
msgstr ""
"Amplia el marge esquerre d'aquest quadre d'estil quan es dibuixa, fent que "
"es dibuixi més gran del que es demana."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the right margin of this style box when drawing, causing it to be "
"drawn larger than requested."
msgstr ""
"Amplia el marge dret d'aquest quadre d'estil quan es dibuixa, fent que es "
"dibuixi més gran del que es demana."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the top margin of this style box when drawing, causing it to be "
"drawn larger than requested."
msgstr ""
"Amplia el marge superior d'aquest quadre d'estil quan es dibuixa, fent que "
"es dibuixi més gran del que es demana."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "Modulates the color of the texture when this style box is drawn."
msgstr "Modula el color de la textura quan es dibuixa aquest quadre d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The region to use from the [member texture].\n"
"This is equivalent to first wrapping the [member texture] in an "
"[AtlasTexture] with the same region.\n"
"If empty ([code]Rect2(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code]), the whole [member texture] is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"La regió que cal utilitzar des de [member texture].\n"
"Això equival a embolicar primer [member texture] en un [AtlasTexture] amb la "
"mateixa regió.\n"
"Si està buit ([code]Rect2(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code]), s'utilitza el [member "
"texture] sencer."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid "The texture to use when drawing this style box."
msgstr "La textura que cal utilitzar per dibuixar aquest quadre d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Increases the bottom margin of the 3×3 texture box.\n"
"A higher value means more of the source texture is considered to be part of "
"the bottom border of the 3×3 box.\n"
"This is also the value used as fallback for [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_bottom] if it is negative."
msgstr ""
"Augmenta el marge inferior del quadre de textura 3×3.\n"
"Un valor més alt significa que es considera que més de la textura d'origen "
"forma part de la vora inferior del quadre 3×3.\n"
"Aquest és també el valor utilitzat com a alternativa per a [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_bottom] si és negatiu."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Increases the left margin of the 3×3 texture box.\n"
"A higher value means more of the source texture is considered to be part of "
"the left border of the 3×3 box.\n"
"This is also the value used as fallback for [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_left] if it is negative."
msgstr ""
"Augmenta el marge esquerre del quadre de textura 3×3.\n"
"Un valor més alt significa que es considera que més de la textura d'origen "
"forma part de la vora esquerra del quadre 3×3.\n"
"Aquest és també el valor utilitzat com a alternativa per a [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_left] si és negatiu."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Increases the right margin of the 3×3 texture box.\n"
"A higher value means more of the source texture is considered to be part of "
"the right border of the 3×3 box.\n"
"This is also the value used as fallback for [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_right] if it is negative."
msgstr ""
"Augmenta el marge dret del quadre de textura 3×3.\n"
"Un valor més alt significa que es considera que més de la textura d'origen "
"forma part de la vora dreta del quadre 3×3.\n"
"This is also the value used as fallback for [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_right] if it is negative."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Increases the top margin of the 3×3 texture box.\n"
"A higher value means more of the source texture is considered to be part of "
"the top border of the 3×3 box.\n"
"This is also the value used as fallback for [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_top] if it is negative."
msgstr ""
"Augmenta el marge superior del quadre de textura 3×3.\n"
"Un valor més alt significa que es considera que més de la textura d'origen "
"forma part de la vora superior del quadre 3×3.\n"
"Aquest és també el valor utilitzat com a alternativa per a [member "
"StyleBox.content_margin_top] si és negatiu."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Stretch the stylebox's texture. This results in visible distortion unless "
"the texture size matches the stylebox's size perfectly."
msgstr ""
"Estireu la textura de la caixa d'estil. Això provoca una distorsió visible "
"tret que la mida de la textura coincideixi perfectament amb la mida de la "
"caixa d'estil."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Repeats the stylebox's texture to match the stylebox's size according to the "
"nine-patch system."
msgstr ""
"Repeteix la textura de la caixa d'estil perquè coincideixi amb la mida de la "
"caixa d'estil segons el sistema de nou pegats."

#: doc/classes/StyleBoxTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Repeats the stylebox's texture to match the stylebox's size according to the "
"nine-patch system. Unlike [constant AXIS_STRETCH_MODE_TILE], the texture may "
"be slightly stretched to make the nine-patch texture tile seamlessly."
msgstr ""
"Repeteix la textura de la caixa d'estil perquè coincideixi amb la mida de la "
"caixa d'estil segons el sistema de nou pegats. A diferència de [constant "
"AXIS_STRETCH_MODE_TILE], la textura es pot estirar lleugerament per fer que "
"la rajola de textura de nou pegats sigui perfecta."

#: doc/classes/SubtweenTweener.xml
msgid "Runs a [Tween] nested within another [Tween]."
msgstr "Executa un [Tween] imbricat dins d'un altre [Tween]."

#: doc/classes/SubtweenTweener.xml
msgid ""
"[SubtweenTweener] is used to execute a [Tween] as one step in a sequence "
"defined by another [Tween]. See [method Tween.tween_subtween] for more usage "
"information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method Tween.tween_subtween] is the only correct way to create "
"[SubtweenTweener]. Any [SubtweenTweener] created manually will not function "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"[SubtweenTweener] s'utilitza per executar un [Tween] com un pas en una "
"seqüència definida per un altre [Tween]. Vegeu [method Tween.tween_subtween] "
"per obtenir més informació sobre l'ús.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [method Tween.tween_subtween] és l'única manera correcta de "
"crear [SubtweenTweener]. Qualsevol [SubtweenTweener] creat manualment no "
"funcionarà correctament."

#: doc/classes/SubtweenTweener.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the time in seconds after which the [SubtweenTweener] will start "
"running the subtween. By default there's no delay."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el temps en segons després del qual [SubtweenTweener] començarà a "
"executar la subinterpolació. Per defecte no hi ha cap retard."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"An interface to a game world that doesn't create a window or draw to the "
"screen directly."
msgstr ""
"Una interfície per a un món de jocs que no crea una finestra ni dibuixa "
"directament a la pantalla."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"[SubViewport] Isolates a rectangular region of a scene to be displayed "
"independently. This can be used, for example, to display UI in 3D space.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [SubViewport] is a [Viewport] that isn't a [Window], i.e. it "
"doesn't draw anything by itself. To display anything, [SubViewport] must "
"have a non-zero size and be either put inside a [SubViewportContainer] or "
"assigned to a [ViewportTexture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [InputEvent]s are not passed to a standalone [SubViewport] by "
"default. To ensure [InputEvent] propagation, a [SubViewport] can be placed "
"inside of a [SubViewportContainer]."
msgstr ""
"[SubViewport] Aïlla una regió rectangular d'una escena que es mostrarà "
"independentment. Això es pot utilitzar, per exemple, per mostrar la "
"interfície d'usuari a l'espai 3D.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [SubViewport] és un [Viewport] que no és un [Window], és a dir, "
"no dibuixa res per si mateix. Per mostrar qualsevol cosa, [SubViewport] ha "
"de tenir una mida diferent de zero i s'ha de posar dins d'un "
"[SubViewportContainer] o assignar-se a un [ViewportTexture].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [InputEvent]s no es passen a un [SubViewport] autònom per "
"defecte. Per garantir la propagació de [InputEvent], es pot col·locar un "
"[SubViewport] dins d'un [SubViewportContainer]."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml doc/classes/Viewport.xml
msgid "Using Viewports"
msgstr "Ús de finestres gràfiques"

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml doc/classes/Viewport.xml
#: doc/classes/ViewportTexture.xml
msgid "3D in 2D Viewport Demo"
msgstr "Demostració de la finestra 3D en 2D"

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml doc/classes/Viewport.xml
msgid "Screen Capture Demo"
msgstr "Demostració de captura de pantalla"

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml doc/classes/Viewport.xml
msgid "Dynamic Split Screen Demo"
msgstr "Demostració de pantalla dividida dinàmica"

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml doc/classes/Viewport.xml
#: doc/classes/ViewportTexture.xml
msgid "3D Resolution Scaling Demo"
msgstr "Demostració d'escala de resolució 3D"

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"The clear mode when the sub-viewport is used as a render target.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is intended for 2D usage."
msgstr ""
"El mode clar quan la subfinestra s'utilitza com a objectiu de "
"renderització.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta propietat està pensada per a l'ús en 2D."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid "The update mode when the sub-viewport is used as a render target."
msgstr ""
"El mode d'actualització quan s'utilitza la subfinestra com a objectiu de "
"renderització."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"The width and height of the sub-viewport. Must be set to a value greater "
"than or equal to 2 pixels on both dimensions. Otherwise, nothing will be "
"displayed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the parent node is a [SubViewportContainer] and its [member "
"SubViewportContainer.stretch] is [code]true[/code], the viewport size cannot "
"be changed manually."
msgstr ""
"L'amplada i l'alçada de la subvitrina. S'ha d'establir en un valor superior "
"o igual a 2 píxels en ambdues dimensions. En cas contrari, no es mostrarà "
"res.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si el node principal és un [SubViewportContainer] i el seu "
"[member SubViewportContainer.stretch] és [code]true[/code], la mida de la "
"finestra gràfica no es pot canviar manualment."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"The 2D size override of the sub-viewport. If either the width or height is "
"[code]0[/code], the override is disabled."
msgstr ""
"La substitució de la mida 2D de la subfinestra. Si l'amplada o l'alçada és "
"[code]0[/code], la substitució està desactivada."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the 2D size override affects stretch as well."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la substitució de la mida 2D també afecta l'estirament."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"The number of view layers we are rendering to. Set this to [code]2[/code] to "
"enable stereo rendering."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de capes de visualització a les quals estem renderitzant. "
"Estableix-ho a [code]2[/code] per habilitar la representació estèreo."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid "Always clear the render target before drawing."
msgstr "Netegeu sempre l'objectiu de renderització abans de dibuixar."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid "Never clear the render target."
msgstr "No esborreu mai l'objectiu de renderització."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"Clear the render target on the next frame, then switch to [constant "
"CLEAR_MODE_NEVER]."
msgstr ""
"Esborra l'objectiu de renderització al següent fotograma i, a continuació, "
"canvia a [constant CLEAR_MODE_NEVER]."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid "Do not update the render target."
msgstr "No actualitzeu l'objectiu de renderització."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"Update the render target once, then switch to [constant UPDATE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Actualitzeu l'objectiu de renderització una vegada i, a continuació, canvieu "
"a [constant UPDATE_DISABLED]."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid ""
"Update the render target only when it is visible. This is the default value."
msgstr ""
"Actualitzeu l'objectiu de renderització només quan sigui visible. Aquest és "
"el valor predeterminat."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid "Update the render target only when its parent is visible."
msgstr ""
"Actualitzeu l'objectiu de renderització només quan el seu pare sigui visible."

#: doc/classes/SubViewport.xml
msgid "Always update the render target."
msgstr "Actualitzeu sempre l'objectiu de renderització."

#: doc/classes/SubViewportContainer.xml
msgid "A container used for displaying the contents of a [SubViewport]."
msgstr "Un contenidor utilitzat per mostrar el contingut d'un [SubViewport]."

#: doc/classes/SubViewportContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that displays the contents of underlying [SubViewport] child "
"nodes. It uses the combined size of the [SubViewport]s as minimum size, "
"unless [member stretch] is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing a [SubViewportContainer]'s [member Control.scale] will "
"cause its contents to appear distorted. To change its visual size without "
"causing distortion, adjust the node's margins instead (if it's not already "
"in a container).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [SubViewportContainer] forwards mouse-enter and mouse-exit "
"notifications to its sub-viewports."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que mostra el contingut dels nodes fills [SubViewport] "
"subjacents. Utilitza la mida combinada dels [SubViewport]s com a mida "
"mínima, tret que [member stretch] estigui habilitat.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Canviar el [member Control.scale] d'un [SubViewportContainer] "
"farà que el seu contingut sembli distorsionat. Per canviar la seva mida "
"visual sense causar distorsió, ajusteu els marges del node (si encara no es "
"troba en un contenidor).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [SubViewportContainer] reenvia les notificacions d'entrada i "
"sortida del ratolí a les seves subfinestres."

#: doc/classes/SubViewportContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. If it returns [code]true[/"
"code], the [param event] is propagated to [SubViewport] children. "
"Propagation doesn't happen if it returns [code]false[/code]. If the function "
"is not implemented, all events are propagated to SubViewports."
msgstr ""
"Mètode virtual a implementar per l'usuari. Si retorna [code]true[/code], "
"[param event] es propaga als fills [SubViewport]. La propagació no es "
"produeix si retorna [code]false[/code]. Si la funció no s'implementa, tots "
"els esdeveniments es propaguen a SubViewports."

#: doc/classes/SubViewportContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Configure, if either the [SubViewportContainer] or alternatively the "
"[Control] nodes of its [SubViewport] children should be available as targets "
"of mouse-related functionalities, like identifying the drop target in drag-"
"and-drop operations or cursor shape of hovered [Control] node.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the [Control] nodes inside its [SubViewport] children "
"are considered as targets.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the [SubViewportContainer] itself will be considered "
"as a target."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SubViewportContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the sub-viewport will be automatically resized to the "
"control's size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [code]true[/code], this will prohibit changing [member "
"SubViewport.size] of its children manually."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la sub-visualització es redimensionarà automàticament "
"a la mida del control.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Si [code]true[/code], això prohibirà canviar [member "
"SubViewport.size] dels seus fills manualment."

#: doc/classes/SubViewportContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Divides the sub-viewport's effective resolution by this value while "
"preserving its scale. This can be used to speed up rendering.\n"
"For example, a 1280×720 sub-viewport with [member stretch_shrink] set to "
"[code]2[/code] will be rendered at 640×360 while occupying the same size in "
"the container.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member stretch] must be [code]true[/code] for this property to "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Divideix la resolució efectiva de la subvisualització per aquest valor tot "
"conservant la seva escala. Això es pot utilitzar per accelerar la "
"renderització.\n"
"Per exemple, una subvisualització de 1280 × 720 amb [member stretch_shrink] "
"establert a [code]2[/code] es representarà a 640 × 360 mentre ocupi la "
"mateixa mida al contenidor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member stretch] ha de ser [code]true[/code] perquè aquesta "
"propietat funcioni."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Helper tool to create geometry."
msgstr "Eina auxiliar per crear geometria."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"The [SurfaceTool] is used to construct a [Mesh] by specifying vertex "
"attributes individually. It can be used to construct a [Mesh] from a script. "
"All properties except indices need to be added before calling [method "
"add_vertex]. For example, to add vertex colors and UVs:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var st = SurfaceTool.new()\n"
"st.begin(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES)\n"
"st.set_color(Color(1, 0, 0))\n"
"st.set_uv(Vector2(0, 0))\n"
"st.add_vertex(Vector3(0, 0, 0))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var st = new SurfaceTool();\n"
"st.Begin(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles);\n"
"st.SetColor(new Color(1, 0, 0));\n"
"st.SetUV(new Vector2(0, 0));\n"
"st.AddVertex(new Vector3(0, 0, 0));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The above [SurfaceTool] now contains one vertex of a triangle which has a UV "
"coordinate and a specified [Color]. If another vertex were added without "
"calling [method set_uv] or [method set_color], then the last values would be "
"used.\n"
"Vertex attributes must be passed [b]before[/b] calling [method add_vertex]. "
"Failure to do so will result in an error when committing the vertex "
"information to a mesh.\n"
"Additionally, the attributes used before the first vertex is added determine "
"the format of the mesh. For example, if you only add UVs to the first "
"vertex, you cannot add color to any of the subsequent vertices.\n"
"See also [ArrayMesh], [ImmediateMesh] and [MeshDataTool] for procedural "
"geometry generation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot uses clockwise [url=https://learnopengl.com/Advanced-"
"OpenGL/Face-culling]winding order[/url] for front faces of triangle "
"primitive modes."
msgstr ""
"[SurfaceTool] s'utilitza per construir un [Mesh] especificant els atributs "
"de vèrtex individualment. Es pot utilitzar per construir un [Mesh] a partir "
"d'un script. Totes les propietats excepte els índexs s'han d'afegir abans de "
"trucar a [method add_vertex]. Per exemple, per afegir colors de vèrtex i "
"UV:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var st = SurfaceTool.new()\n"
"st.begin(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES)\n"
"st.set_color(Color(1, 0, 0))\n"
"st.set_uv(Vector2(0, 0))\n"
"st.add_vèrtex(Vector3(0, 0, 0))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var st = new SurfaceTool();\n"
"st.Begin(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles);\n"
"st.SetColor(color nou (1, 0, 0));\n"
"st.SetUV(nou Vector2(0, 0));\n"
"st.AddVertex(nou Vector3(0, 0, 0));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"El [SurfaceTool] de dalt ara conté un vèrtex d'un triangle que té una "
"coordenada UV i un [Color] especificat. Si s'afegeix un altre vèrtex sense "
"cridar a [method set_uv] o [method set_color], s'utilitzarien els últims "
"valors.\n"
"Els atributs de vèrtex s'han de passar [b]before[/b] trucant a [method "
"add_vertex]. Si no ho feu, es produirà un error en enviar la informació del "
"vèrtex a una malla.\n"
"A més, els atributs utilitzats abans d'afegir el primer vèrtex determinen el "
"format de la malla. Per exemple, si només afegiu UV al primer vèrtex, no "
"podreu afegir color a cap dels vèrtexs posteriors.\n"
"Vegeu també [ArrayMesh], [ImmediateMesh] i [MeshDataTool] per a la generació "
"de geometria procedimental.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Godot utilitza [url=https://learnopengl.com/Advanced-OpenGL/"
"Face-culling]ordre de bobinat[/url] en sentit horari per a les cares "
"frontals dels modes primitius del triangle."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Using the SurfaceTool"
msgstr "Ús de SurfaceTool"

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a vertex to index array if you are using indexed vertices. Does not "
"need to be called before adding vertices."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un vèrtex a la matriu d'índexs si esteu utilitzant vèrtexs indexats. "
"No cal cridar abans d'afegir vèrtexs."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Inserts a triangle fan made of array data into [Mesh] being constructed.\n"
"Requires the primitive type be set to [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."
msgstr ""
"Insereix un ventilador triangular fet de dades de matriu a [Mesh] que s'està "
"construint.\n"
"Requereix que el tipus primitiu s'estableixi a [constant "
"Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the position of current vertex. Should be called after specifying "
"other vertex properties (e.g. Color, UV)."
msgstr ""
"Especifica la posició del vèrtex actual. S'ha de cridar després "
"d'especificar altres propietats de vèrtex (per exemple, Color, UV)."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Append vertices from a given [Mesh] surface onto the current vertex array "
"with specified [Transform3D]."
msgstr ""
"Afegiu vèrtexs d'una superfície determinada [Mesh] a la matriu de vèrtexs "
"actual amb [Transform3D] especificat."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Called before adding any vertices. Takes the primitive type as an argument "
"(e.g. [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES])."
msgstr ""
"S'ha cridat abans d'afegir-hi cap vèrtex. Pren el tipus primitiu com a "
"argument (per exemple, [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES])."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Clear all information passed into the surface tool so far."
msgstr ""
"Esborra tota la informació que s'ha passat a l'eina de superfície fins ara."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a constructed [ArrayMesh] from current information passed in. If an "
"existing [ArrayMesh] is passed in as an argument, will add an extra surface "
"to the existing [ArrayMesh].\n"
"The [param flags] argument can be the bitwise OR of [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USE_DYNAMIC_UPDATE], [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS], or [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USES_EMPTY_VERTEX_ARRAY]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [ArrayMesh] construït a partir de la informació actual que s'ha "
"passat. Si es passa un [ArrayMesh] existent com a argument, afegirà una "
"superfície addicional a la [ArrayMesh] existent.\n"
"L'argument [param flags] pot ser l'OR bit a bit de [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USE_DYNAMIC_UPDATE], [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS] o [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USES_EMPTY_VERTEX_ARRAY]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Commits the data to the same format used by [method "
"ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays], [method ImporterMesh.add_surface], and "
"[method create_from_arrays]. This way you can further process the mesh data "
"using the [ArrayMesh] or [ImporterMesh] APIs."
msgstr ""
"Envia les dades al mateix format que utilitzen [method "
"ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays], [method ImporterMesh.add_surface] i "
"[method create_from_arrays]. D'aquesta manera, podeu processar encara més "
"les dades de la malla mitjançant les API [ArrayMesh] o [ImporterMesh]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Creates a vertex array from an existing [Mesh]."
msgstr "Crea una matriu de vèrtexs a partir d'un [Mesh] existent."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Creates this SurfaceTool from existing vertex arrays such as returned by "
"[method commit_to_arrays], [method Mesh.surface_get_arrays], [method "
"Mesh.surface_get_blend_shape_arrays], [method "
"ImporterMesh.get_surface_arrays], and [method "
"ImporterMesh.get_surface_blend_shape_arrays]. [param primitive_type] "
"controls the type of mesh data, defaulting to [constant "
"Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."
msgstr ""
"Crea aquesta SurfaceTool a partir de matrius de vèrtexs existents com ara "
"[method commit_to_arrays], [method Mesh.surface_get_arrays], [method "
"Mesh.surface_get_blend_shape_arrays], [method "
"ImporterMesh.get_surface_arrays] i [method "
"ImporterMesh.get_surface_blend_shape_arrays]. [param primitive_type] "
"controla el tipus de dades de malla, per defecte [constant "
"Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a vertex array from the specified blend shape of an existing [Mesh]. "
"This can be used to extract a specific pose from a blend shape."
msgstr ""
"Crea una matriu de vèrtex a partir de la forma de barreja especificada d'un "
"[Mesh] existent. Això es pot utilitzar per extreure una postura específica "
"d'una forma de barreja."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Removes the index array by expanding the vertex array."
msgstr "Elimina la matriu d'índexs ampliant la matriu de vèrtexs."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"This method is unused internally, as it does not preserve normals or UVs. "
"Consider using [method ImporterMesh.generate_lods] instead."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mètode no s'utilitza internament, ja que no conserva normals ni UV. "
"Penseu en utilitzar [method ImporterMesh.generate_lods]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Generates an LOD for a given [param nd_threshold] in linear units (square "
"root of quadric error metric), using at most [param target_index_count] "
"indices."
msgstr ""
"Genera un LOD per a un determinat [param nd_threshold] en unitats lineals "
"(arrel quadrada de la mètrica d'error quàdric), utilitzant com a màxim "
"[param target_index_count] índexs."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Generates normals from vertices so you do not have to do it manually. If "
"[param flip] is [code]true[/code], the resulting normals will be inverted. "
"[method generate_normals] should be called [i]after[/i] generating geometry "
"and [i]before[/i] committing the mesh using [method commit] or [method "
"commit_to_arrays]. For correct display of normal-mapped surfaces, you will "
"also have to generate tangents using [method generate_tangents].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method generate_normals] only works if the primitive type is "
"set to [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method generate_normals] takes smooth groups into account. To "
"generate smooth normals, set the smooth group to a value greater than or "
"equal to [code]0[/code] using [method set_smooth_group] or leave the smooth "
"group at the default of [code]0[/code]. To generate flat normals, set the "
"smooth group to [code]-1[/code] using [method set_smooth_group] prior to "
"adding vertices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Generates a tangent vector for each vertex. Requires that each vertex "
"already has UVs and normals set (see [method generate_normals])."
msgstr ""
"Genera un vector tangent per a cada vèrtex. Requereix que cada vèrtex ja "
"tingui UV i normals establertes (vegeu [method generate_normals])."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Returns the axis-aligned bounding box of the vertex positions."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el quadre delimitador alineat amb l'eix de les posicions dels "
"vèrtexs."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the format for custom [param channel_index] (currently up to 4). "
"Returns [constant CUSTOM_MAX] if this custom channel is unused."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el format per a [param channel_index] personalitzat (actualment fins "
"a 4). Retorna [constant CUSTOM_MAX] si aquest canal personalitzat no "
"s'utilitza."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the type of mesh geometry, such as [constant "
"Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el tipus de geometria de malla, com ara [constant "
"Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"By default, returns [constant SKIN_4_WEIGHTS] to indicate only 4 bone "
"influences per vertex are used.\n"
"Returns [constant SKIN_8_WEIGHTS] if up to 8 influences are used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function returns an enum, not the exact number of weights."
msgstr ""
"Per defecte, retorna [constant SKIN_4_WEIGHTS] per indicar que només "
"s'utilitzen 4 influències òssies per vèrtex.\n"
"Retorna [constant SKIN_8_WEIGHTS] si s'utilitzen fins a 8 influències.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta funció retorna una enumeració, no el nombre exacte de "
"pesos."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Shrinks the vertex array by creating an index array. This can improve "
"performance by avoiding vertex reuse."
msgstr ""
"Redueix la matriu de vèrtexs creant una matriu d'índexs. Això pot millorar "
"el rendiment evitant la reutilització de vèrtexs."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Optimizes triangle sorting for performance. Requires that [method "
"get_primitive_type] is [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."
msgstr ""
"Optimitza l'ordenació del triangle per al rendiment. Requereix que [method "
"get_primitive_type] sigui [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies an array of bones to use for the [i]next[/i] vertex. [param bones] "
"must contain 4 integers."
msgstr ""
"Especifica una matriu d'ossos per utilitzar per al vèrtex [i]next[/i]. "
"[param bones] ha de contenir 4 nombres enters."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies a [Color] to use for the [i]next[/i] vertex. If every vertex needs "
"to have this information set and you fail to submit it for the first vertex, "
"this information may not be used at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The material must have [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] enabled for the vertex color to "
"be visible."
msgstr ""
"Especifica un [Color] per utilitzar-lo per al vèrtex [i]next[/i]. Si cada "
"vèrtex necessita tenir aquesta informació establerta i no l'envieu per al "
"primer vèrtex, és possible que aquesta informació no s'utilitzi en absolut.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El material ha de tenir [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] habilitat perquè el color del "
"vèrtex sigui visible."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the custom value on this vertex for [param channel_index].\n"
"[method set_custom_format] must be called first for this [param "
"channel_index]. Formats which are not RGBA will ignore other color channels."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el valor personalitzat en aquest vèrtex per a [param "
"channel_index].\n"
"Primer s'ha de trucar a [method set_custom_format] per a aquest [param "
"channel_index]. Els formats que no siguin RGBA ignoraran altres canals de "
"color."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the color format for this custom [param channel_index]. Use [constant "
"CUSTOM_MAX] to disable.\n"
"Must be invoked after [method begin] and should be set before [method "
"commit] or [method commit_to_arrays]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el format de color per a aquest [param channel_index] "
"personalitzat. Utilitzeu [constant CUSTOM_MAX] per desactivar.\n"
"S'ha d'invocar després de [method begin] i s'ha d'establir abans de [method "
"commit] o [method commit_to_arrays]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Sets [Material] to be used by the [Mesh] you are constructing."
msgstr "Estableix [Material] perquè l'utilitzi el [Mesh] que esteu construint."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies a normal to use for the [i]next[/i] vertex. If every vertex needs "
"to have this information set and you fail to submit it for the first vertex, "
"this information may not be used at all."
msgstr ""
"Especifica una normal que s'utilitzarà per al vèrtex [i]next[/i]. Si cada "
"vèrtex necessita tenir aquesta informació establerta i no l'envieu per al "
"primer vèrtex, és possible que aquesta informació no s'utilitzi en absolut."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Set to [constant SKIN_8_WEIGHTS] to indicate that up to 8 bone influences "
"per vertex may be used.\n"
"By default, only 4 bone influences are used ([constant SKIN_4_WEIGHTS]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function takes an enum, not the exact number of weights."
msgstr ""
"Establiu a [constant SKIN_8_WEIGHTS] per indicar que es poden utilitzar fins "
"a 8 influències òssies per vèrtex.\n"
"Per defecte, només s'utilitzen 4 influències òssies ([constant "
"SKIN_4_WEIGHTS]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta funció pren una enumeració, no el nombre exacte de "
"pesos."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the smooth group to use for the [i]next[/i] vertex. If this is "
"never called, all vertices will have the default smooth group of [code]0[/"
"code] and will be smoothed with adjacent vertices of the same group. To "
"produce a mesh with flat normals, set the smooth group to [code]-1[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function actually takes a [code]uint32_t[/code], so C# "
"users should use [code]uint32.MaxValue[/code] instead of [code]-1[/code] to "
"produce a mesh with flat normals."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies a tangent to use for the [i]next[/i] vertex. If every vertex needs "
"to have this information set and you fail to submit it for the first vertex, "
"this information may not be used at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even though [param tangent] is a [Plane], it does not directly "
"represent the tangent plane. Its [member Plane.x], [member Plane.y], and "
"[member Plane.z] represent the tangent vector and [member Plane.d] should be "
"either [code]-1[/code] or [code]1[/code]. See also [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT]."
msgstr ""
"Especifica una tangent que cal utilitzar per al vèrtex [i]next[/i]. Si cada "
"vèrtex necessita tenir aquesta informació establerta i no l'envieu per al "
"primer vèrtex, és possible que aquesta informació no s'utilitzi en absolut.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Tot i que [param tangent] és un [Plane], no representa "
"directament el pla tangent. Els seus [member Plane.x], [member Plane.y] i "
"[member Plane.z] representen el vector tangent i [member Plane.d] hauria de "
"ser [code]-1[/code] o [code]1[/code]. Vegeu també [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies a set of UV coordinates to use for the [i]next[/i] vertex. If "
"every vertex needs to have this information set and you fail to submit it "
"for the first vertex, this information may not be used at all."
msgstr ""
"Especifica un conjunt de coordenades UV que s'utilitzaran per al vèrtex "
"[i]next[/i]. Si cada vèrtex necessita tenir aquesta informació establerta i "
"no l'envieu per al primer vèrtex, és possible que aquesta informació no "
"s'utilitzi en absolut."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies an optional second set of UV coordinates to use for the [i]next[/"
"i] vertex. If every vertex needs to have this information set and you fail "
"to submit it for the first vertex, this information may not be used at all."
msgstr ""
"Especifica un segon conjunt opcional de coordenades UV per utilitzar per al "
"vèrtex [i]next[/i]. Si cada vèrtex necessita tenir aquesta informació "
"establerta i no l'envieu per al primer vèrtex, és possible que aquesta "
"informació no s'utilitzi en absolut."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies weight values to use for the [i]next[/i] vertex. [param weights] "
"must contain 4 values. If every vertex needs to have this information set "
"and you fail to submit it for the first vertex, this information may not be "
"used at all."
msgstr ""
"Especifica els valors de pes a utilitzar per al vèrtex [i]next[/i]. [param "
"weights] ha de contenir 4 valors. Si cada vèrtex necessita tenir aquesta "
"informació establerta i no l'envieu per al primer vèrtex, és possible que "
"aquesta informació no s'utilitzi en absolut."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Limits range of data passed to [method set_custom] to unsigned normalized 0 "
"to 1 stored in 8 bits per channel. See [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM]."
msgstr ""
"Limita el rang de dades passats a [method set_custom] a 0 a 1 normalitzat "
"sense signar emmagatzemat en 8 bits per canal. Veure [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Limits range of data passed to [method set_custom] to signed normalized -1 "
"to 1 stored in 8 bits per channel. See [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM]."
msgstr ""
"Limita l'interval de dades passat a [method set_custom] a signat normalitzat "
"-1 a 1 emmagatzemat en 8 bits per canal. Veure [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Stores data passed to [method set_custom] as half precision floats, and uses "
"only red and green color channels. See [constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF]."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema les dades que s'han passat a [method set_custom] com a mitja "
"precisió flotant i utilitza només canals de color vermell i verd. Veure "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Stores data passed to [method set_custom] as half precision floats and uses "
"all color channels. See [constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema les dades que s'han passat a [method set_custom] mentre flota la "
"meitat de la precisió i utilitza tots els canals de color. Veure [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Stores data passed to [method set_custom] as full precision floats, and uses "
"only red color channel. See [constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_R_FLOAT]."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema les dades que s'han passat a [method set_custom] com a flotadors "
"de precisió total i només utilitza el canal de color vermell. Veure "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_R_FLOAT]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Stores data passed to [method set_custom] as full precision floats, and uses "
"only red and green color channels. See [constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_FLOAT]."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema les dades passades a [method set_custom] com a flotadors de "
"precisió total i només utilitza canals de color vermell i verd. Veure "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_FLOAT]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Stores data passed to [method set_custom] as full precision floats, and uses "
"only red, green and blue color channels. See [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGB_FLOAT]."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema les dades passades a [method set_custom] com a flotadors de "
"precisió total i només utilitza canals de color vermell, verd i blau. Veure "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGB_FLOAT]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid ""
"Stores data passed to [method set_custom] as full precision floats, and uses "
"all color channels. See [constant Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_FLOAT]."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema les dades passades a [method set_custom] com a flotadors de "
"precisió total i utilitza tots els canals de color. Veure [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_FLOAT]."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Used to indicate a disabled custom channel."
msgstr "S'utilitza per indicar un canal personalitzat desactivat."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Each individual vertex can be influenced by only 4 bone weights."
msgstr "Cada vèrtex individual pot ser influenciat per només 4 pesos ossis."

#: doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml
msgid "Each individual vertex can be influenced by up to 8 bone weights."
msgstr "Cada vèrtex individual pot ser influenciat per fins a 8 pesos ossis."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for syntax highlighters. Provides syntax highlighting data to a "
"[TextEdit]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base per a ressaltats de sintaxi. Proporciona dades de ressaltat de "
"sintaxi a un [TextEdit]."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for syntax highlighters. Provides syntax highlighting data to a "
"[TextEdit]. The associated [TextEdit] will call into the [SyntaxHighlighter] "
"on an as-needed basis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A [SyntaxHighlighter] instance should not be used across "
"multiple [TextEdit] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Classe base per a ressaltats de sintaxi. Proporciona dades de ressaltat de "
"sintaxi a un [TextEdit]. L'associat [TextEdit] trucarà a [SyntaxHighlighter] "
"segons sigui necessari.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Una instància [SyntaxHighlighter] no s'ha d'utilitzar en "
"diversos nodes [TextEdit]."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid "Virtual method which can be overridden to clear any local caches."
msgstr ""
"Mètode virtual que es pot anul·lar per esborrar qualsevol memòria cau local."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method which can be overridden to return syntax highlighting data.\n"
"See [method get_line_syntax_highlighting] for more details."
msgstr ""
"Mètode virtual que es pot substituir per retornar dades de ressaltat de "
"sintaxi.\n"
"Vegeu [method get_line_syntax_highlighting] per a més detalls."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid "Virtual method which can be overridden to update any local caches."
msgstr ""
"Mètode virtual que es pot anul·lar per actualitzar qualsevol memòria cau "
"local."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Clears all cached syntax highlighting data.\n"
"Then calls overridable method [method _clear_highlighting_cache]."
msgstr ""
"Esborra totes les dades de ressaltat de sintaxi emmagatzemades a la memòria "
"cau.\n"
"A continuació, crida al mètode anul·lable [method _clear_highlighting_cache]."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the syntax highlighting data for the line at index [param line]. If "
"the line is not cached, calls [method _get_line_syntax_highlighting] first "
"to calculate the data.\n"
"Each entry is a column number containing a nested [Dictionary]. The column "
"number denotes the start of a region, the region will end if another region "
"is found, or at the end of the line. The nested [Dictionary] contains the "
"data for that region. Currently only the key [code]\"color\"[/code] is "
"supported.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Possible return value. This means columns [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]4[/code] should be red, and columns [code]5[/code] to the end of the "
"line should be green:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t0: {\n"
"\t\t\"color\": Color(1, 0, 0)\n"
"\t},\n"
"\t5: {\n"
"\t\t\"color\": Color(0, 1, 0)\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna les dades de ressaltat de sintaxi per a la línia a l'índex [param "
"line]. Si la línia no s'emmagatzema a la memòria cau, truqueu primer a "
"[method _get_line_syntax_highlighting] per calcular les dades.\n"
"Cada entrada és un número de columna que conté un [Dictionary] imbricat. El "
"número de columna indica l'inici d'una regió, la regió acabarà si es troba "
"una altra regió, o al final de la línia. El [Dictionary] imbricat conté les "
"dades d'aquesta regió. Actualment només s'admet la clau [code]\"color\"[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Exemple:[/b] Possible valor de retorn. Això vol dir que les columnes "
"[code]0[/code] a [code]4[/code] haurien de ser vermelles i les columnes "
"[code]@5[/code] al final de la línia haurien de ser verdes:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t0: {\n"
"\t\t\"color\": Color(1, 0, 0)\n"
"\t},\n"
"\t5: {\n"
"\t\t\"color\": Color(0, 1, 0)\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid "Returns the associated [TextEdit] node."
msgstr "Retorna el node [TextEdit] associat."

#: doc/classes/SyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Clears then updates the [SyntaxHighlighter] caches. Override [method "
"_update_cache] for a callback.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is called automatically when the associated [TextEdit] "
"node, updates its own cache."
msgstr ""
"Esborra i després actualitza les memòries cau de [SyntaxHighlighter]. "
"Substituïu [method _update_cache] per a una devolució de trucada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] S'anomena automàticament quan el node [TextEdit] associat "
"actualitza la seva pròpia memòria cau."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"A font loaded from a system font. Falls back to a default theme font if not "
"implemented on the host OS."
msgstr ""
"Un tipus de lletra carregat des d'un tipus de lletra del sistema. Torna a un "
"tipus de lletra de tema predeterminat si no s'implementa al sistema operatiu "
"amfitrió."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"[SystemFont] loads a font from a system font with the first matching name "
"from [member font_names].\n"
"It will attempt to match font style, but it's not guaranteed.\n"
"The returned font might be part of a font collection or be a variable font "
"with OpenType \"weight\", \"width\" and/or \"italic\" features set.\n"
"You can create [FontVariation] of the system font for precise control over "
"its features.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is implemented on iOS, Linux, macOS and Windows, on "
"other platforms it will fallback to default theme font."
msgstr ""
"[SystemFont] carrega una font d'una font del sistema amb el primer nom "
"coincident de [member font_names].\n"
"Intentarà coincidir amb l'estil de lletra, però no està garantit.\n"
"El tipus de lletra retornat pot formar part d'una col·lecció de tipus de "
"lletra o ser un tipus de lletra variable amb les funcions de \"pes\", "
"\"amplada\" i/o \"cursiva\" d'OpenType.\n"
"Podeu crear [FontVariation] del tipus de lletra del sistema per a un control "
"precís de les seves característiques.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquesta classe s'implementa a iOS, Linux, macOS i Windows, en "
"altres plataformes tornarà a la font del tema predeterminada."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid "If set to [code]true[/code], italic or oblique font is preferred."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix en [code]true[/code], es prefereix la lletra cursiva o "
"obliqua."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"Array of font family names to search, first matching font found is used."
msgstr ""
"Matriu de noms de família de tipus de lletra per cercar, s'utilitza el "
"primer tipus de lletra coincident trobat."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"Preferred font stretch amount, compared to a normal width. A percentage "
"value between [code]50%[/code] and [code]200%[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Quantitat d'estirament de tipus de lletra preferida, en comparació amb una "
"amplada normal. Un valor percentual entre [code]50%[/code] i [code]200%[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"Preferred weight (boldness) of the font. A value in the [code]100...999[/"
"code] range, normal font weight is [code]400[/code], bold font weight is "
"[code]700[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], auto-hinting is supported and preferred over "
"font built-in hinting."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix a [code]true[/code], s'admet la indicació automàtica i es "
"prefereix a la indicació integrada del tipus de lletra."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid "Font hinting mode."
msgstr "Mode d'indicació de tipus de lletra."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], glyphs of all sizes are rendered using single "
"multichannel signed distance field generated from the dynamic font vector "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix en [code]true[/code], els glifos de totes les mides es "
"representen mitjançant un camp de distància signat multicanal únic generat a "
"partir de les dades del vector de font dinàmica."

#: doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
msgid ""
"Font glyph subpixel positioning mode. Subpixel positioning provides shaper "
"text and better kerning for smaller font sizes, at the cost of memory usage "
"and font rasterization speed. Use [constant "
"TextServer.SUBPIXEL_POSITIONING_AUTO] to automatically enable it based on "
"the font size."
msgstr ""
"Mode de posicionament de subpíxels de glif de lletra. El posicionament de "
"subpíxels proporciona un text més modelat i un millor kerning per a mides de "
"lletra més petites, a costa de l'ús de la memòria i la velocitat de "
"rasterització de la font. Utilitzeu [constant "
"TextServer.SUBPIXEL_POSITIONING_AUTO] per activar-lo automàticament en "
"funció de la mida de la lletra."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "A control that provides a horizontal bar with tabs."
msgstr "Un control que proporciona una barra horitzontal amb pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"A control that provides a horizontal bar with tabs. Similar to "
"[TabContainer] but is only in charge of drawing tabs, not interacting with "
"children."
msgstr ""
"Un control que proporciona una barra horitzontal amb pestanyes. Similar a "
"[TabContainer] però només s'encarrega de dibuixar pestanyes, no interactuar "
"amb els nens."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Adds a new tab."
msgstr "Afegeix una pestanya nova."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Clears all tabs."
msgstr "Esborra totes les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Moves the scroll view to make the tab visible."
msgstr "Mou la vista de desplaçament per fer visible la pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the offset buttons (the ones that appear when "
"there's not enough space for all tabs) are visible."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si els botons de desplaçament (els que apareixen "
"quan no hi ha prou espai per a totes les pestanyes) són visibles."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Returns the previously active tab index."
msgstr "Retorna l'índex de pestanyes actiu anteriorment."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the icon for the right button of the tab at index [param tab_idx] or "
"[code]null[/code] if the right button has no icon."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la icona del botó dret de la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx] o "
"[code]null[/code] si el botó dret no té cap icona."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the icon for the tab at index [param tab_idx] or [code]null[/code] "
"if the tab has no icon."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la icona de la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx] o [code]null[/"
"code] si la pestanya no té cap icona."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum allowed width of the icon for the tab at index [param "
"tab_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the tab at local coordinates [param point]. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if the point is outside the control boundaries or if there's "
"no tab at the queried position."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de la pestanya a les coordenades locals [param point]. "
"Retorna [code]-1[/code] si el punt està fora dels límits de control o si no "
"hi ha cap pestanya a la posició consultada."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Returns tab title language code."
msgstr "Retorna el codi d'idioma del títol de la pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the metadata value set to the tab at index [param tab_idx] using "
"[method set_tab_metadata]. If no metadata was previously set, returns "
"[code]null[/code] by default."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor de metadades establert a la pestanya a l'índex [param "
"tab_idx] mitjançant [method set_tab_metadata]. Si anteriorment no s'havia "
"establert cap metadades, retorna [code]null[/code] de manera predeterminada."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Returns the number of hidden tabs offsetted to the left."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de pestanyes amagades desplaçades a l'esquerra."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Returns tab [Rect2] with local position and size."
msgstr "Retorna la pestanya [Rect2] amb la posició i la mida locals."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Returns tab title text base writing direction."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la direcció d'escriptura de la base del text del títol de la "
"pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Returns the title of the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el títol de la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Returns the tooltip text of the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el text de descripció emergent de la pestanya a l'índex [param "
"tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the tab at index [param tab_idx] is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la pestanya de l'índex [param tab_idx] està "
"desactivada."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the tab at index [param tab_idx] is hidden."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] si la pestanya de l'índex [param tab_idx] està "
"oculta."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Moves a tab from [param from] to [param to]."
msgstr "Mou una pestanya de [param from] a [param to]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Removes the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr "Elimina la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Selects the first available tab with greater index than the currently "
"selected. Returns [code]true[/code] if tab selection changed."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la primera pestanya disponible amb un índex més gran que el "
"seleccionat actualment. Retorna [code]true[/code] si la selecció de "
"pestanyes ha canviat."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Selects the first available tab with lower index than the currently "
"selected. Returns [code]true[/code] if tab selection changed."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la primera pestanya disponible amb un índex més baix que el "
"seleccionat actualment. Retorna [code]true[/code] si la selecció de "
"pestanyes ha canviat."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Sets an [param icon] for the button of the tab at index [param tab_idx] "
"(located to the right, before the close button), making it visible and "
"clickable (See [signal tab_button_pressed]). Giving it a [code]null[/code] "
"value will hide the button."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [param icon] per al botó de la pestanya a l'índex [param "
"tab_idx] (situat a la dreta, abans del botó de tanca), fent-lo visible i fer "
"clic (vegeu [signal tab_button_pressed]). Si li doneu un valor [code]null[/"
"code], s'amagarà el botó."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [param disabled] is [code]true[/code], disables the tab at index [param "
"tab_idx], making it non-interactable."
msgstr ""
"Si [param disabled] és [code]true[/code], desactiva la pestanya a l'índex "
"[param tab_idx], de manera que no es pot interactuar."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [param hidden] is [code]true[/code], hides the tab at index [param "
"tab_idx], making it disappear from the tab area."
msgstr ""
"Si [param hidden] és [code]true[/code], amaga la pestanya a l'índex [param "
"tab_idx], fent-la desaparèixer de l'àrea de pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Sets an [param icon] for the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [param icon] per a la pestanya de l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum allowed width of the icon for the tab at index [param "
"tab_idx]. This limit is applied on top of the default size of the icon and "
"on top of [theme_item icon_max_width]. The height is adjusted according to "
"the icon's ratio."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'amplada màxima permesa de la icona per a la pestanya a l'índex "
"[param tab_idx]. Aquest límit s'aplica a sobre de la mida predeterminada de "
"la icona i a sobre de [theme_item icon_max_width]. L'alçada s'ajusta segons "
"la proporció de la icona."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the language code of the title for the tab at index [param tab_idx] to "
"[param language]. This is used for line-breaking and text shaping "
"algorithms. If [param language] is empty, the current locale is used."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el codi d'idioma del títol de la pestanya a l'índex [param "
"tab_idx] a [param language]. S'utilitza per als algorismes de trencament de "
"línia i de conformació de text. Si [param language] està buit, s'utilitza la "
"configuració regional actual."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the metadata value for the tab at index [param tab_idx], which can be "
"retrieved later using [method get_tab_metadata]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el valor de metadades per a la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx], "
"que es pot recuperar més tard mitjançant [method get_tab_metadata]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Sets tab title base writing direction."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la direcció d'escriptura de la base del títol de la pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Sets a [param title] for the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [param title] per a la pestanya de l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a [param tooltip] for tab at index [param tab_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, if the [param tooltip] is empty and the tab text is "
"truncated (not all characters fit into the tab), the title will be displayed "
"as a tooltip. To hide the tooltip, assign [code]\" \"[/code] as the [param "
"tooltip] text."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un [param tooltip] per a la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] De manera predeterminada, si [param tooltip] està buit i el "
"text de la pestanya està truncat (no tots els caràcters encaixen a la "
"pestanya), el títol es mostrarà com a informació sobre eines. Per ocultar la "
"informació sobre eines, assigneu [code]\" \"[/code] com a text [param "
"tooltip]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], tabs overflowing this node's width will be hidden, "
"displaying two navigation buttons instead. Otherwise, this node's minimum "
"size is updated so that all tabs are visible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les pestanyes que desborden l'amplada d'aquest node "
"s'amagaran i mostraran dos botons de navegació. En cas contrari, la mida "
"mínima d'aquest node s'actualitza perquè totes les pestanyes siguin visibles."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], middle-clicking on a tab will emit the [signal "
"tab_close_pressed] signal."
msgstr "Retorna el sinus hiperbòlic invers del paràmetre."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the current selected tab. A value of [code]-1[/code] means that "
"no tab is selected and can only be set when [member deselect_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code] or if all tabs are hidden or disabled."
msgstr ""
"L'índex de la pestanya seleccionada actual. Un valor de [code]-1[/code] "
"significa que no s'ha seleccionat cap pestanya i només es pot establir quan "
"[member deselect_enabled] és [code]true[/code] o si totes les pestanyes "
"estan amagades o desactivades."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], all tabs can be deselected so that no tab is selected. "
"Click on the current tab to deselect it."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], totes les pestanyes es poden deseleccionar de manera "
"que no es seleccioni cap pestanya. Feu clic a la pestanya actual per "
"deseleccionar-la."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], tabs can be rearranged with mouse drag."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les pestanyes es poden reordenar arrossegant el ratolí."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum width which all tabs should be limited to. Unlimited if set "
"to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estableix l'amplada màxima a la qual s'han de limitar totes les pestanyes. "
"Il·limitat si s'estableix com a [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the tab offset will be changed to keep the currently "
"selected tab visible."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], el desplaçament de la pestanya es canviarà per "
"mantenir visible la pestanya seleccionada actualment."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"if [code]true[/code], the mouse's scroll wheel can be used to navigate the "
"scroll view."
msgstr ""
"si [code]true[/code], la roda de desplaçament del ratolí es pot utilitzar "
"per navegar per la vista de desplaçament."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables selecting a tab with the right mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], permet seleccionar una pestanya amb el botó dret del "
"ratolí."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hovering over a tab while dragging something will "
"switch to that tab. Does not have effect when hovering another tab to "
"rearrange. The delay for when this happens is dictated by [theme_item "
"hover_switch_wait_msec]."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], passar el cursor per sobre d'una pestanya mentre "
"arrossegueu alguna cosa canviarà a aquesta pestanya. No té efecte quan es "
"passa el cursor per una altra pestanya per reorganitzar. El retard per quan "
"això succeeix el dicta [theme_item hover_switch_wait_msec]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The horizontal alignment of the tabs."
msgstr "L'alineació horitzontal de les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "When the close button will appear on the tabs."
msgstr "Quan apareixerà el botó de tancament a les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "The number of tabs currently in the bar."
msgstr "El nombre de pestanyes que hi ha actualment a la barra."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the tab at [code]index[/code] is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. tab_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la pestanya a [code]index[/code] està desactivada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"tab_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the tab at [code]index[/code] is hidden.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. tab_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la pestanya a [code]index[/code] està amagada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"tab_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"The title text of the tab at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. tab_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"El text del títol de la pestanya a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"tab_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"The tooltip text of the tab at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. tab_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"El text informatiu de la pestanya a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"tab_count - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"[TabBar]s with the same rearrange group ID will allow dragging the tabs "
"between them. Enable drag with [member drag_to_rearrange_enabled].\n"
"Setting this to [code]-1[/code] will disable rearranging between [TabBar]s."
msgstr ""
"[TabBar]s amb el mateix ID de grup de reordenació permetrà arrossegar les "
"pestanyes entre elles. Activa l'arrossegament amb [member "
"drag_to_rearrange_enabled].\n"
"Establir-ho a [code]-1[/code] desactivarà la reordenació entre [TabBar]s."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the active tab is rearranged via mouse drag. See [member "
"drag_to_rearrange_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan la pestanya activa es reordena mitjançant l'arrossegament del "
"ratolí. Veure [member drag_to_rearrange_enabled]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a tab's right button is pressed. See [method "
"set_tab_button_icon]."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es prem el botó dret d'una pestanya. Veure [method "
"set_tab_button_icon]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when switching to another tab."
msgstr "S'emet en canviar a una altra pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when a tab is clicked, even if it is the current tab."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es fa clic en una pestanya, encara que sigui la pestanya actual."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a tab's close button is pressed or, if [member "
"close_with_middle_mouse] is [code]true[/code], when middle-clicking on a "
"tab.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Tabs are not removed automatically; this behavior needs to be "
"coded manually. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"$TabBar.tab_close_pressed.connect($TabBar.remove_tab)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetNode<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").TabClosePressed += "
"GetNode<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").RemoveTab;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es prem el botó de tancament d'una pestanya o, si [member "
"close_with_middle_mouse] és [code]true[/code], quan es fa clic amb el mig "
"sobre una pestanya.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Les pestanyes no s'eliminen automàticament; aquest comportament "
"s'ha de codificar manualment. Per exemple:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"$TabBar.tab_close_pressed.connect($TabBar.remove_tab)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetNode<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").TabClosePressed += "
"GetNode<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").RemoveTab;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when a tab is hovered by the mouse."
msgstr "S'emet quan es passa el ratolí amb una pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Emitted when a tab is right-clicked."
msgstr "S'emet quan es fa clic dret en una pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a tab is selected via click, directional input, or script, even "
"if it is the current tab."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es selecciona una pestanya mitjançant un clic, una entrada "
"direccional o un script, encara que sigui la pestanya actual."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Aligns tabs to the left."
msgstr "Alinea les pestanyes a l'esquerra."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Aligns tabs in the middle."
msgstr "Alinea les pestanyes al mig."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Aligns tabs to the right."
msgstr "Alinea les pestanyes a la dreta."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum AlignmentMode] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum AlignmentMode]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Never show the close buttons."
msgstr "No mostris mai els botons de tancament."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Only show the close button on the currently active tab."
msgstr "Mostra només el botó de tancament a la pestanya activa actualment."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Show the close button on all tabs."
msgstr "Mostra el botó de tancament a totes les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum CloseButtonDisplayPolicy] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de la enumeració [enum CloseButtonDisplayPolicy]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Modulation color for the [theme_item drop_mark] icon."
msgstr "Color de modulació per a la icona [theme_item drop_mark]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Font color of disabled tabs."
msgstr "Color de lletra de les pestanyes desactivades."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Font color of the currently hovered tab. Does not apply to the selected tab."
msgstr ""
"Color del tipus de lletra de la pestanya que es troba actualment. No "
"s'aplica a la pestanya seleccionada."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The tint of text outline of the tab name."
msgstr "El to del contorn del text del nom de la pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Font color of the currently selected tab."
msgstr "Color de lletra de la pestanya seleccionada actualment."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Font color of the other, unselected tabs."
msgstr "Color de lletra de les altres pestanyes no seleccionades."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Icon color of disabled tabs."
msgstr "Color de la icona de les pestanyes desactivades."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Icon color of the currently hovered tab. Does not apply to the selected tab."
msgstr ""
"Color de la icona de la pestanya que es troba actualment. No s'aplica a la "
"pestanya seleccionada."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Icon color of the currently selected tab."
msgstr "Color de la icona de la pestanya seleccionada actualment."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Icon color of the other, unselected tabs."
msgstr "Color de la icona de les altres pestanyes no seleccionades."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "The horizontal separation between the elements inside tabs."
msgstr "La separació horitzontal entre els elements dins de les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"During a drag-and-drop, this is how many milliseconds to wait before "
"switching the tab."
msgstr ""
"Durant un arrossegar i deixar anar, aquest és el nombre de mil·lisegons que "
"cal esperar abans de canviar de pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum allowed width of the tab's icon. This limit is applied on top of "
"the default size of the icon, but before the value set with [method "
"set_tab_icon_max_width]. The height is adjusted according to the icon's "
"ratio."
msgstr ""
"L'amplada màxima permesa de la icona de la pestanya. Aquest límit s'aplica a "
"sobre de la mida predeterminada de la icona, però abans del valor establert "
"amb [method set_tab_icon_max_width]. L'alçada s'ajusta segons la proporció "
"de la icona."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the tab text outline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a font with [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] enabled, its [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the value of "
"[theme_item outline_size] for outline rendering to look correct. Otherwise, "
"the outline may appear to be cut off earlier than intended."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The space between tabs in the tab bar."
msgstr "L'espai entre pestanyes a la barra de pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The font used to draw tab names."
msgstr "El tipus de lletra utilitzat per dibuixar els noms de les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Font size of the tab names."
msgstr "Mida de lletra dels noms de les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "The icon for the close button (see [member tab_close_display_policy])."
msgstr ""
"La icona del botó de tancament (vegeu [member tab_close_display_policy])."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Icon for the left arrow button that appears when there are too many tabs to "
"fit in the container width. When the button is disabled (i.e. the first tab "
"is visible), it appears semi-transparent."
msgstr ""
"Icona del botó de fletxa esquerra que apareix quan hi ha massa pestanyes per "
"cabre a l'amplada del contenidor. Quan el botó està desactivat (és a dir, la "
"primera pestanya és visible), apareix semitransparent."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Icon for the left arrow button that appears when there are too many tabs to "
"fit in the container width. Used when the button is being hovered with the "
"cursor."
msgstr ""
"Icona del botó de fletxa esquerra que apareix quan hi ha massa pestanyes per "
"cabre a l'amplada del contenidor. S'utilitza quan es passa el botó amb el "
"cursor."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Icon shown to indicate where a dragged tab will be dropped (see [member "
"drag_to_rearrange_enabled])."
msgstr ""
"Es mostra la icona per indicar on es deixarà anar una pestanya arrossegada "
"(vegeu [member drag_to_rearrange_enabled])."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Icon for the right arrow button that appears when there are too many tabs to "
"fit in the container width. When the button is disabled (i.e. the last tab "
"is visible) it appears semi-transparent."
msgstr ""
"Icona del botó de fletxa dreta que apareix quan hi ha massa pestanyes per "
"cabre a l'amplada del contenidor. Quan el botó està desactivat (és a dir, "
"l'última pestanya és visible) apareix semitransparent."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Icon for the right arrow button that appears when there are too many tabs to "
"fit in the container width. Used when the button is being hovered with the "
"cursor."
msgstr ""
"Icona del botó de fletxa dreta que apareix quan hi ha massa pestanyes per "
"cabre a l'amplada del contenidor. S'utilitza quan es passa el botó amb el "
"cursor."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Background of the tab and close buttons when they're being hovered with the "
"cursor."
msgstr ""
"Fons de la pestanya i botons de tancament quan es passen amb el cursor."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid "Background of the tab and close buttons when it's being pressed."
msgstr "Fons de la pestanya i botons de tancament quan es prem."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The style of disabled tabs."
msgstr "L'estil de les pestanyes desactivades."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [TabBar] is focused. The [theme_item tab_focus] "
"[StyleBox] is displayed [i]over[/i] the base [StyleBox] of the selected tab, "
"so a partially transparent [StyleBox] should be used to ensure the base "
"[StyleBox] remains visible. A [StyleBox] that represents an outline or an "
"underline works well for this purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, "
"assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that disabling the focus visual "
"effect will harm keyboard/controller navigation usability, so this is not "
"recommended for accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"The style of the currently hovered tab. Does not apply to the selected tab.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This style will be drawn with the same width as [theme_item "
"tab_unselected] at minimum."
msgstr ""
"L'estil de la pestanya que es troba actualment. No s'aplica a la pestanya "
"seleccionada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest estil es dibuixarà amb la mateixa amplada que "
"[theme_item tab_unselected] com a mínim."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The style of the currently selected tab."
msgstr "L'estil de la pestanya seleccionada actualment."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The style of the other, unselected tabs."
msgstr "L'estil de les altres pestanyes no seleccionades."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that creates a tab for each child control, displaying only the "
"active tab's control."
msgstr ""
"Un contenidor que crea una pestanya per a cada control secundari, mostrant "
"només el control de la pestanya activa."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Arranges child controls into a tabbed view, creating a tab for each one. The "
"active tab's corresponding control is made visible, while all other child "
"controls are hidden. Ignores non-control children.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The drawing of the clickable tabs is handled by this node; "
"[TabBar] is not needed."
msgstr ""
"Organitza els controls secundaris en una vista amb pestanyes, creant una "
"pestanya per a cadascun. El control corresponent de la pestanya activa es fa "
"visible, mentre que tots els altres controls secundaris estan ocults. Ignora "
"els nens sense control.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest node gestiona el dibuix de les pestanyes clicables; "
"[TabBar] no és necessari."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Returns the child [Control] node located at the active tab index."
msgstr "Retorna el node fill [Control] situat a l'índex de pestanya activa."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Popup] node instance if one has been set already with [method "
"set_popup].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la instància del node [Popup] si ja s'ha establert una amb [method "
"set_popup].\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu amagar-lo o algun dels seus fills, feu "
"servir la seva propietat [member Window.visible]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [TabBar] contained in this container.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it or "
"editing its tabs may cause a crash. If you wish to edit the tabs, use the "
"methods provided in [TabContainer]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [TabBar] contingut en aquest contenidor.\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"o editar-ne les pestanyes pot provocar un error. Si voleu editar les "
"pestanyes, utilitzeu els mètodes proporcionats a [TabContainer]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Returns the button icon from the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna la icona del botó de la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Returns the [Control] node from the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna el node [Control] de la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Returns the number of tabs."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Texture2D] for the tab at index [param tab_idx] or [code]null[/"
"code] if the tab has no [Texture2D]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [Texture2D] per a la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx] o "
"[code]null[/code] si la pestanya no té [Texture2D]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the tab tied to the given [param control]. The control "
"must be a child of the [TabContainer]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex de la pestanya lligada al [param control] donat. El control "
"ha de ser un fill de [TabContainer]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the title of the tab at index [param tab_idx]. Tab titles default to "
"the name of the indexed child node, but this can be overridden with [method "
"set_tab_title]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el títol de la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx]. Els títols de les "
"pestanyes tenen per defecte el nom del node fill indexat, però es pot "
"substituir amb [method set_tab_title]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If set on a [Popup] node instance, a popup menu icon appears in the top-"
"right corner of the [TabContainer] (setting it to [code]null[/code] will "
"make it go away). Clicking it will expand the [Popup] node."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix en una instància de node [Popup], apareix una icona de menú "
"emergent a l'extrem superior dret de [TabContainer] (establir-la a "
"[code]null[/code] desapareixerà). En fer-hi clic, s'ampliarà el node [Popup]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Sets the button icon from the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix la icona del botó de la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Sets an icon for the tab at index [param tab_idx]."
msgstr "Estableix una icona per a la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom title for the tab at index [param tab_idx] (tab titles default "
"to the name of the indexed child node). Set it back to the child's name to "
"make the tab default to it again."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un títol personalitzat per a la pestanya a l'índex [param tab_idx] "
"(els títols de la pestanya són per defecte el nom del node fill indexat). "
"Torneu-lo al nom del nen perquè la pestanya torni a ser predeterminada."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom tooltip text for tab at index [param tab_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, if the [param tooltip] is empty and the tab text is "
"truncated (not all characters fit into the tab), the title will be displayed "
"as a tooltip. To hide the tooltip, assign [code]\" \"[/code] as the [param "
"tooltip] text."
msgstr ""
"Estableix un text d'informació eines personalitzada per a la pestanya a "
"l'índex [param tab_idx].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] De manera predeterminada, si [param tooltip] està buit i el "
"text de la pestanya està truncat (no tots els caràcters encaixen a la "
"pestanya), el títol es mostrarà com a informació sobre eines. Per ocultar la "
"informació sobre eines, assigneu [code]\" \"[/code] com a text [param "
"tooltip]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Due to internal changes this doesn't do anything anymore, as they're always "
"in front."
msgstr ""
"A causa dels canvis interns això ja no fa res, ja que sempre estan al davant."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "This doesn't do anything."
msgstr "Això no fa res."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The current tab index. When set, this index's [Control] node's "
"[code]visible[/code] property is set to [code]true[/code] and all others are "
"set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"A value of [code]-1[/code] means that no tab is selected."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], all tabs can be deselected so that no tab is selected. "
"Click on the [member current_tab] to deselect it.\n"
"Only the tab header will be shown if no tabs are selected."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], totes les pestanyes es poden deseleccionar de manera "
"que no es seleccioni cap pestanya. Feu clic a [member current_tab] per "
"deseleccionar-lo.\n"
"Només es mostrarà la capçalera de la pestanya si no hi ha cap pestanya "
"seleccionada."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hovering over a tab while dragging something will "
"switch to that tab. Does not have effect when hovering another tab to "
"rearrange."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], passar el cursor per sobre d'una pestanya mentre "
"arrossegueu alguna cosa canviarà a aquesta pestanya. No té efecte quan es "
"passa el cursor per una altra pestanya per reorganitzar."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The position at which tabs will be placed."
msgstr "La posició on es col·locaran les pestanyes."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The focus access mode for the internal [TabBar] node."
msgstr "El mode d'accés al focus per al node intern [TabBar]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the tab at [code]index[/code] is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. get_tab_count() "
"- 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la pestanya a [code]index[/code] està desactivada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"get_tab_count() - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the tab at [code]index[/code] is hidden.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. get_tab_count() "
"- 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], la pestanya a [code]index[/code] està amagada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"get_tab_count() - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The title text of the tab at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. get_tab_count() "
"- 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"El text del títol de la pestanya a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"get_tab_count() - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The tooltip text of the tab at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. get_tab_count() "
"- 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"El text informatiu de la pestanya a [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]index[/code] és un valor de l'interval [code]0 .. "
"get_tab_count() - 1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"[TabContainer]s with the same rearrange group ID will allow dragging the "
"tabs between them. Enable drag with [member drag_to_rearrange_enabled].\n"
"Setting this to [code]-1[/code] will disable rearranging between "
"[TabContainer]s."
msgstr ""
"[TabContainer]s amb el mateix ID de grup de reordenació permetrà arrossegar "
"les pestanyes entre elles. Activa l'arrossegament amb [member "
"drag_to_rearrange_enabled].\n"
"Establir-ho a [code]-1[/code] desactivarà la reordenació entre "
"[TabContainer]s."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], tabs are visible. If [code]false[/code], tabs' content "
"and titles are hidden."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], les pestanyes són visibles. Si [code]false[/code], el "
"contingut i els títols de les pestanyes s'amaguen."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], child [Control] nodes that are hidden have their "
"minimum size take into account in the total, instead of only the currently "
"visible one."
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code], els nodes fill [Control] que estan ocults tenen en "
"compte la seva mida mínima en el total, en lloc de només la visible "
"actualment."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the [TabContainer]'s [Popup] button is clicked. See [method "
"set_popup] for details."
msgstr ""
"S'emet quan es fa clic al botó [Popup] de [TabContainer]. Vegeu [method "
"set_popup] per obtenir més informació."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user clicks on the button icon on this tab."
msgstr "S'emet quan l'usuari fa clic a la icona del botó d'aquesta pestanya."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Places the tab bar at the top."
msgstr "Col·loca la barra de pestanyes a la part superior."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Places the tab bar at the bottom. The tab bar's [StyleBox] will be flipped "
"vertically."
msgstr ""
"Col·loca la barra de pestanyes a la part inferior. El [StyleBox] de la barra "
"de pestanyes es girarà verticalment."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum TabPosition] enum."
msgstr "Representa la mida de l'enumeració [enum TabPosition]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum allowed width of the tab's icon. This limit is applied on top of "
"the default size of the icon, but before the value set with [method "
"TabBar.set_tab_icon_max_width]. The height is adjusted according to the "
"icon's ratio."
msgstr ""
"L'amplada màxima permesa de la icona de la pestanya. Aquest límit s'aplica a "
"sobre de la mida predeterminada de la icona, però abans del valor establert "
"amb [method TabBar.set_tab_icon_max_width]. L'alçada s'ajusta segons la "
"proporció de la icona."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Space between tab's name and its icon."
msgstr "Espai entre el nom de la pestanya i la seva icona."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The space at the left or right edges of the tab bar, accordingly with the "
"current [member tab_alignment].\n"
"The margin is ignored with [constant TabBar.ALIGNMENT_RIGHT] if the tabs are "
"clipped (see [member clip_tabs]) or a popup has been set (see [method "
"set_popup]). The margin is always ignored with [constant "
"TabBar.ALIGNMENT_CENTER]."
msgstr ""
"L'espai a les vores esquerra o dreta de la barra de pestanyes, segons "
"l'actual [member tab_alignment].\n"
"El marge s'ignora amb [constant TabBar.ALIGNMENT_RIGHT] si les pestanyes "
"estan retallades (vegeu [member clip_tabs]) o s'ha establert una finestra "
"emergent (vegeu [method set_popup]). El marge sempre s'ignora amb [constant "
"TabBar.ALIGNMENT_CENTER]."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The icon for the menu button (see [method set_popup])."
msgstr "La icona del botó de menú (vegeu [method set_popup])."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The icon for the menu button (see [method set_popup]) when it's being "
"hovered with the cursor."
msgstr ""
"La icona del botó de menú (vegeu [method set_popup]) quan es mou amb el "
"cursor."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The style for the background fill."
msgstr "L'estil per al farciment de fons."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The style of the currently hovered tab.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This style will be drawn with the same width as [theme_item "
"tab_unselected] at minimum."
msgstr ""
"L'estil de la pestanya que es troba actualment.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest estil es dibuixarà amb la mateixa amplada que "
"[theme_item tab_unselected] com a mínim."

#: doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "The style for the background fill of the [TabBar] area."
msgstr "L'estil per al farciment de fons de l'àrea [TabBar]."

#: doc/classes/TCPServer.xml
msgid "A TCP server."
msgstr "Un servidor TCP."

#: doc/classes/TCPServer.xml
msgid ""
"A TCP server. Listens to connections on a port and returns a [StreamPeerTCP] "
"when it gets an incoming connection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""
"Un servidor TCP. Escolta les connexions d'un port i retorna un "
"[StreamPeerTCP] quan rep una connexió entrant.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Quan exporteu a Android, assegureu-vos d'habilitar el permís "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] al valor predefinit d'exportació d'Android abans "
"d'exportar el projecte o utilitzar la implementació amb un sol clic. En cas "
"contrari, Android bloquejarà qualsevol tipus de comunicació de xarxa."

#: doc/classes/TCPServer.xml doc/classes/UDPServer.xml
msgid "Returns the local port this server is listening to."
msgstr "Retorna el port local que escolta aquest servidor."

#: doc/classes/TCPServer.xml
msgid ""
"Listen on the [param port] binding to [param bind_address].\n"
"If [param bind_address] is set as [code]\"*\"[/code] (default), the server "
"will listen on all available addresses (both IPv4 and IPv6).\n"
"If [param bind_address] is set as [code]\"0.0.0.0\"[/code] (for IPv4) or "
"[code]\"::\"[/code] (for IPv6), the server will listen on all available "
"addresses matching that IP type.\n"
"If [param bind_address] is set to any valid address (e.g. [code]"
"\"192.168.1.101\"[/code], [code]\"::1\"[/code], etc.), the server will only "
"listen on the interface with that address (or fail if no interface with the "
"given address exists)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/TCPServer.xml
msgid ""
"If a connection is available, returns a StreamPeerTCP with the connection."
msgstr ""
"Si hi ha una connexió disponible, retorna un StreamPeerTCP amb la connexió."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "A multiline text editor."
msgstr "Un editor de text multilínia."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"A multiline text editor. It also has limited facilities for editing code, "
"such as syntax highlighting support. For more advanced facilities for "
"editing code, see [CodeEdit].\n"
"While entering text, it is possible to insert special characters using "
"Unicode, OEM or Windows alt codes:\n"
"- To enter Unicode codepoints, hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type the codepoint on "
"the numpad. For example, to enter the character [code]á[/code] (U+00E1), "
"hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type [kbd]+E1[/kbd] on the numpad (the leading "
"zeroes can be omitted).\n"
"- To enter OEM codepoints, hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type the code on the "
"numpad. For example, to enter the character [code]á[/code] (OEM 160), hold "
"[kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type [code]160[/code] on the numpad.\n"
"- To enter Windows codepoints, hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type the code on the "
"numpad. For example, to enter the character [code]á[/code] (Windows 0225), "
"hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type [kbd]0[/kbd], [kbd]2[/kbd], [kbd]2[/kbd], "
"[kbd]5[/kbd] on the numpad. The leading zero here must [b]not[/b] be "
"omitted, as this is how Windows codepoints are distinguished from OEM "
"codepoints.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most viewport, caret, and edit methods contain a "
"[code]caret_index[/code] argument for [member caret_multiple] support. The "
"argument should be one of the following: [code]-1[/code] for all carets, "
"[code]0[/code] for the main caret, or greater than [code]0[/code] for "
"secondary carets in the order they were created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When holding down [kbd]Alt[/kbd], the vertical scroll wheel "
"will scroll 5 times as fast as it would normally do. This also works in the "
"Godot script editor."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define what happens when the user presses the "
"backspace key."
msgstr ""
"Substituïu aquest mètode per definir què passa quan l'usuari prem la tecla "
"de retrocés."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define what happens when the user performs a copy "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Substituïu aquest mètode per definir què passa quan l'usuari realitza una "
"operació de còpia."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define what happens when the user performs a cut "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Anul·leu aquest mètode per definir què passa quan l'usuari realitza una "
"operació de tall."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define what happens when the user types in the "
"provided key [param unicode_char]."
msgstr ""
"Substituïu aquest mètode per definir què passa quan l'usuari escriu la clau "
"proporcionada [param unicode_char]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define what happens when the user performs a paste "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Substituïu aquest mètode per definir què passa quan l'usuari realitza una "
"operació d'enganxament."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define what happens when the user performs a paste "
"operation with middle mouse button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux."
msgstr ""
"Substituïu aquest mètode per definir què passa quan l'usuari realitza una "
"operació d'enganxament amb el botó central del ratolí.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Aquest mètode només s'implementa a Linux."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new caret at the given location. Returns the index of the new caret, "
"or [code]-1[/code] if the location is invalid."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un accent nou a la ubicació donada. Retorna l'índex del nou accent, "
"o [code]-1[/code] si la ubicació no és vàlida."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an additional caret above or below every caret. If [param below] is "
"[code]true[/code] the new caret will be added below and above otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix un accent addicional per sobre o per sota de cada accent. Si [param "
"below] és [code]true[/code], el nou accent s'afegirà a sota i a sobre en cas "
"contrari."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Register a new gutter to this [TextEdit]. Use [param at] to have a specific "
"gutter order. A value of [code]-1[/code] appends the gutter to the right."
msgstr ""
"Registreu un canal nou en aquest [TextEdit]. Utilitzeu [param at] per tenir "
"un ordre de canals específic. Un valor de [code]-1[/code] afegeix el canal a "
"la dreta."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a selection and a caret for the next occurrence of the current "
"selection. If there is no active selection, selects word under caret."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix una selecció i un accent per a la següent ocurrència de la selecció "
"actual. Si no hi ha cap selecció activa, selecciona la paraula sota l'accent."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "No longer necessary since methods now adjust carets themselves."
msgstr "Ja no és necessari, ja que els mètodes ara s'ajusten ells mateixos."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Adjust the viewport so the caret is visible."
msgstr ""
"Ajusteu la finestra gràfica de manera que el punt d'accent sigui visible."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Applies text from the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input "
"Method Editor[/url] (IME) to each caret and closes the IME if it is open."
msgstr ""
"Aplica el text de l'editor de mètodes d'entrada [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method][/url] (IME) a cada accent i tanca l'IME "
"si està obert."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the user presses the backspace key. Can be overridden with "
"[method _backspace]."
msgstr ""
"Es crida quan l'usuari prem la tecla de retrocés. Es pot substituir amb "
"[method _backspace]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Starts a multipart edit. All edits will be treated as one action until "
"[method end_complex_operation] is called."
msgstr ""
"Inicia una edició multipart. Totes les edicions es tractaran com una acció "
"fins que es cridi [method end_complex_operation]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Starts an edit for multiple carets. The edit must be ended with [method "
"end_multicaret_edit]. Multicaret edits can be used to edit text at multiple "
"carets and delay merging the carets until the end, so the caret indexes "
"aren't affected immediately. [method begin_multicaret_edit] and [method "
"end_multicaret_edit] can be nested, and the merge will happen at the last "
"[method end_multicaret_edit].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"begin_complex_operation()\n"
"begin_multicaret_edit()\n"
"for i in range(get_caret_count()):\n"
"\tif multicaret_edit_ignore_caret(i):\n"
"\t\tcontinue\n"
"\t# Logic here.\n"
"end_multicaret_edit()\n"
"end_complex_operation()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Inicia una edició per a diversos accents. L'edició s'ha d'acabar amb [method "
"end_multicaret_edit]. Les edicions de multicaret es poden utilitzar per "
"editar text amb diversos cursots i retardar la fusió dels cursots fins al "
"final, de manera que els índexs de cursor no es vegin afectats "
"immediatament. [method begin_multicaret_edit] i [method end_multicaret_edit] "
"es poden imbricar i la fusió es produirà a l'últim [method "
"end_multicaret_edit].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"començar_operació_complexa()\n"
"begin_multicaret_edit()\n"
"per a i dins l'interval (get_caret_count()):\n"
"\tif multicaret_edit_ignore_caret(i):\n"
"\t\tcontinuar\n"
"\t# Lògica aquí.\n"
"end_multicaret_edit()\n"
"final_operació_complexa()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Centers the viewport on the line the editing caret is at. This also resets "
"the [member scroll_horizontal] value to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Centra la finestra gràfica a la línia on es troba el punt d'edició. Això "
"també restableix el valor [member scroll_horizontal] a [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Performs a full reset of [TextEdit], including undo history."
msgstr ""
"Realitza un restabliment complet de [TextEdit], inclòs l'historial de "
"desfers."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Clears the undo history."
msgstr "Esborra l'historial de desfers."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Collapse all carets in the given range to the [param from_line] and [param "
"from_column] position.\n"
"[param inclusive] applies to both ends.\n"
"If [method is_in_mulitcaret_edit] is [code]true[/code], carets that are "
"collapsed will be [code]true[/code] for [method "
"multicaret_edit_ignore_caret].\n"
"[method merge_overlapping_carets] will be called if any carets were "
"collapsed."
msgstr ""
"Reduïu tots els cursots de l'interval donat a la posició [param from_line] i "
"[param from_column].\n"
"[param inclusive] s'aplica als dos extrems.\n"
"Si [method is_in_mulitcaret_edit] és [code]true[/code], els accents "
"col·lapsats seran [code]true[/code] per a [method "
"multicaret_edit_ignore_caret].\n"
"Es trucarà a [method merge_overlapping_carets] si s'han replegat els signes "
"de cursor."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Copies the current text selection. Can be overridden with [method _copy]."
msgstr ""
"Copia la selecció de text actual. Es pot substituir amb [method _copy]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Cut's the current selection. Can be overridden with [method _cut]."
msgstr "Tallar és la selecció actual. Es pot substituir amb [method _cut]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Deletes the selected text."
msgstr "Esborra el text seleccionat."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Deselects the current selection."
msgstr "Desselecciona la selecció actual."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Marks the end of steps in the current action started with [method "
"start_action]."
msgstr ""
"Marca el final dels passos de l'acció actual iniciada amb [method "
"start_action]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Ends a multipart edit, started with [method begin_complex_operation]. If "
"called outside a complex operation, the current operation is pushed onto the "
"undo/redo stack."
msgstr ""
"Finalitza una edició de diverses parts, començada amb [method "
"begin_complex_operation]. Si es crida fora d'una operació complexa, "
"l'operació actual s'envia a la pila desfer/refer."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Ends an edit for multiple carets, that was started with [method "
"begin_multicaret_edit]. If this was the last [method end_multicaret_edit] "
"and [method merge_overlapping_carets] was called, carets will be merged."
msgstr ""
"Finalitza una edició per a diversos accents, que es va iniciar amb [method "
"begin_multicaret_edit]. Si aquesta va ser l'última [method "
"end_multicaret_edit] i es va trucar a [method merge_overlapping_carets], es "
"fusionaran els accents."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the column the editing caret is at."
msgstr "Retorna la columna on es troba el punt d'edició."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the number of carets in this [TextEdit]."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de carets en aquest [TextEdit]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the caret pixel draw position."
msgstr "Retorna la posició de dibuix del píxel del cursor."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Carets no longer need to be edited in any specific order. If the carets need "
"to be sorted, use [method get_sorted_carets] instead."
msgstr ""
"Els carets ja no s'han d'editar en cap ordre específic. Si cal ordenar els "
"accents, utilitzeu [method get_sorted_carets]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of caret indexes in their edit order, this done from bottom "
"to top. Edit order refers to the way actions such as [method "
"insert_text_at_caret] are applied."
msgstr ""
"Retorna una llista d'índexs de cursor en el seu ordre d'edició, fet de baix "
"a dalt. L'ordre d'edició fa referència a la manera com s'apliquen accions "
"com ara [method insert_text_at_caret]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the line the editing caret is on."
msgstr "Retorna la línia on es troba el cursor d'edició."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the wrap index the editing caret is on."
msgstr "Retorna l'índex d'ajustament on es troba el cursor d'edició."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the first column containing a non-whitespace character on the given "
"line. If there is only whitespace, returns the number of characters."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la primera columna que conté un caràcter que no és espai en blanc a "
"la línia donada. Si només hi ha espais en blanc, retorna el nombre de "
"caràcters."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the first visible line."
msgstr "Retorna la primera línia visible."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the number of gutters registered."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de canalons registrats."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the name of the gutter at the given index."
msgstr "Retorna el nom del canal a l'índex donat."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the type of the gutter at the given index. Gutters can contain "
"icons, text, or custom visuals."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el tipus de canal a l'índex donat. Els canalons poden contenir "
"icones, text o elements visuals personalitzats."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the width of the gutter at the given index."
msgstr "Retorna l'amplada del canal a l'índex donat."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the [HScrollBar] used by [TextEdit]."
msgstr "Retorna el [HScrollBar] utilitzat per [TextEdit]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the indent level of the given line. This is the number of spaces and "
"tabs at the beginning of the line, with the tabs taking the tab size into "
"account (see [method get_tab_size])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el nivell de sagnat de la línia donada. Aquest és el nombre d'espais "
"i pestanyes al començament de la línia, amb les pestanyes que tenen en "
"compte la mida de la pestanya (vegeu [method get_tab_size])."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last visible line. Use [method "
"get_last_full_visible_line_wrap_index] for the wrap index."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'última línia visible. Utilitzeu [method "
"get_last_full_visible_line_wrap_index] per a l'índex d'ajustament."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the last visible wrap index of the last visible line."
msgstr "Retorna l'últim índex d'ajust visible de l'última línia visible."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the last unhidden line in the entire [TextEdit]."
msgstr "Retorna l'última línia no oculta de tota la [TextEdit]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the text of a specific line."
msgstr "Retorna el text d'una línia específica."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the custom background color of the given line. If no color is set, "
"returns [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el color de fons personalitzat de la línia donada. Si no s'estableix "
"cap color, retorna [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the line and column at the given position. In the returned vector, "
"[code]x[/code] is the column and [code]y[/code] is the line.\n"
"If [param clamp_line] is [code]false[/code] and [param position] is below "
"the last line, [code]Vector2i(-1, -1)[/code] is returned.\n"
"If [param clamp_column] is [code]false[/code] and [param position] is "
"outside the column range of the line, [code]Vector2i(-1, -1)[/code] is "
"returned."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the number of lines in the text."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de línies del text."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the icon currently in [param gutter] at [param line]. This only "
"works when the gutter type is [constant GUTTER_TYPE_ICON] (see [method "
"set_gutter_type])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la icona actualment a [param gutter] a [param line]. Això només "
"funciona quan el tipus de canal és [constant GUTTER_TYPE_ICON] (vegeu "
"[method set_gutter_type])."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the color currently in [param gutter] at [param line]."
msgstr "Retorna el color actual a [param gutter] a [param line]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the metadata currently in [param gutter] at [param line]."
msgstr "Retorna les metadades actualment a [param gutter] a [param line]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the text currently in [param gutter] at [param line]. This only "
"works when the gutter type is [constant GUTTER_TYPE_STRING] (see [method "
"set_gutter_type])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el text actualment a [param gutter] a [param line]. Això només "
"funciona quan el tipus de canal és [constant GUTTER_TYPE_STRING] (vegeu "
"[method set_gutter_type])."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum value of the line height among all lines.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The return value is influenced by [theme_item line_spacing] and "
"[theme_item font_size]. And it will not be less than [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el valor màxim de l'alçada de la línia entre totes les línies.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] El valor de retorn està influenciat per [theme_item "
"line_spacing] i [theme_item font_size]. I no serà inferior a [code]1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of line ranges where [code]x[/code] is the first line and "
"[code]y[/code] is the last line. All lines within these ranges will have a "
"caret on them or be part of a selection. Each line will only be part of one "
"line range, even if it has multiple carets on it.\n"
"If a selection's end column ([method get_selection_to_column]) is at column "
"[code]0[/code], that line will not be included. If a selection begins on the "
"line after another selection ends and [param merge_adjacent] is [code]true[/"
"code], or they begin and end on the same line, one line range will include "
"both selections."
msgstr ""
"Retorna un [Array] d'intervals de línies on [code]x[/code] és la primera "
"línia i [code]y@[/code] és l'última línia. Totes les línies d'aquests "
"intervals tindran un accent o formaran part d'una selecció. Cada línia només "
"formarà part d'un rang de línies, fins i tot si hi ha diversos accents.\n"
"Si la columna final d'una selecció ([method get_selection_to_column]) es "
"troba a la columna [code]0[/code], aquesta línia no s'inclourà. Si una "
"selecció comença a la línia després d'acabar una altra selecció i [param "
"merge_adjacent] és [code]true[/code], o comencen i acaben a la mateixa "
"línia, un rang de línia inclourà les dues seleccions."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the width in pixels of the [param wrap_index] on [param line]."
msgstr "Retorna l'amplada en píxels de [param wrap_index] a [param line]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns line text as it is currently displayed, including IME composition "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el text de línia tal com es mostra actualment, inclosa la cadena de "
"composició IME."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the number of times the given line is wrapped."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de vegades que s'ha embolicat la línia donada."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the wrap index of the given column on the given line. This ranges "
"from [code]0[/code] to [method get_line_wrap_count]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna l'índex d'ajustament de la columna donada a la línia donada. Això va "
"des de [code]0[/code] fins a [method get_line_wrap_count]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns an array of [String]s representing each wrapped index."
msgstr "Retorna una matriu de [String]s que representen cada índex embolicat."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the local mouse position adjusted for the text direction."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició local del ratolí ajustada per a la direcció del text."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [PopupMenu] of this [TextEdit]. By default, this menu is "
"displayed when right-clicking on the [TextEdit].\n"
"You can add custom menu items or remove standard ones. Make sure your IDs "
"don't conflict with the standard ones (see [enum MenuItems]). For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar menu = get_menu()\n"
"\t# Remove all items after \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.item_count = menu.get_item_index(MENU_REDO) + 1\n"
"\t# Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.add_separator()\n"
"\tmenu.add_item(\"Insert Date\", MENU_MAX + 1)\n"
"\t# Connect callback.\n"
"\tmenu.id_pressed.connect(_on_item_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_item_pressed(id):\n"
"\tif id == MENU_MAX + 1:\n"
"\t\tinsert_text_at_caret(Time.get_date_string_from_system())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar menu = GetMenu();\n"
"\t// Remove all items after \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.ItemCount = menu.GetItemIndex(TextEdit.MenuItems.Redo) + 1;\n"
"\t// Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.AddSeparator();\n"
"\tmenu.AddItem(\"Insert Date\", TextEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1);\n"
"\t// Add event handler.\n"
"\tmenu.IdPressed += OnItemPressed;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void OnItemPressed(int id)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (id == TextEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInsertTextAtCaret(Time.GetDateStringFromSystem());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el [PopupMenu] d'aquest [TextEdit]. Per defecte, aquest menú es "
"mostra quan es fa clic amb el botó dret a [TextEdit].\n"
"Podeu afegir elements de menú personalitzats o eliminar els estàndards. "
"Assegureu-vos que els vostres identificadors no entren en conflicte amb els "
"estàndards (vegeu [enum MenuItems]). Per exemple:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _preparat():\n"
"\tvar menú = get_menu()\n"
"\t# Elimina tots els elements després de \"Refer\".\n"
"\tmenu.item_count = menu.get_item_index(MENU_REDO) + 1\n"
"\t# Afegeix articles personalitzats.\n"
"\tmenu.add_separator()\n"
"\tmenu.add_item(\"Insereix data\", MENU_MAX + 1)\n"
"\t# Connecta la devolució de trucada.\n"
"\tmenu.id_pressed.connect(_on_item_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_item_pressed(id):\n"
"\tsi id == MENU_MAX + 1:\n"
"\t\tinsert_text_at_caret(Time.get_date_string_from_system())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"anul·lació pública void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar menú = GetMenu();\n"
"\t// Elimina tots els elements després de \"Refer\".\n"
"\tmenu.ItemCount = menu.GetItemIndex(TextEdit.MenuItems.Redo) + 1;\n"
"\t// Afegeix elements personalitzats.\n"
"\tmenu.AddSeparator();\n"
"\tmenu.AddItem(\"Insereix data\", TextEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1);\n"
"\t// Afegeix un controlador d'esdeveniments.\n"
"\tmenu.IdPressed += OnItemPressed;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void OnItemPressed(int id)\n"
"{\n"
"\tsi (id == TextEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInsertTextAtCaret(Time.GetDateStringFromSystem());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Avís:[/b] Aquest és un node intern obligatori, eliminar-lo i alliberar-lo "
"pot provocar un error. Si voleu amagar-lo o algun dels seus fills, feu "
"servir la seva propietat [member Window.visible]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the equivalent minimap line at [param position]."
msgstr "Retorna la línia equivalent del minimapa a [param position]."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the number of lines that may be drawn on the minimap."
msgstr "Retorna el nombre de línies que es poden dibuixar al minimapa."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the correct column at the end of a composite character like ❤️‍🩹 "
"(mending heart; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) which is "
"comprised of more than one Unicode code point, if the caret is at the start "
"of the composite character. Also returns the correct column with the caret "
"at mid grapheme and for non-composite characters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To check at caret location use "
"[code]get_next_composite_character_column(get_caret_line(), "
"get_caret_column())[/code]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la columna correcta al final d'un caràcter compost com ❤️‍🩹 (cor "
"reparador; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) que consta de "
"més d'un punt de codi Unicode, si el caràcter es troba a l'inici del "
"compost. També retorna la columna correcta amb el cursor a mig grafema i per "
"a caràcters no compostos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per comprovar a la ubicació de l'indicador, utilitzeu "
"[code]get_next_composite_character_column(get_caret_line(), "
"get_caret_column())[/code]"

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [method get_next_visible_line_offset_from], but takes into "
"account the line wrap indexes. In the returned vector, [code]x[/code] is the "
"line, [code]y[/code] is the wrap index."
msgstr ""
"Similar a [method get_next_visible_line_offset_from], però té en compte els "
"índexs d'ajust de línia. En el vector retornat, [code]x[/code] és la línia, "
"[code]y[/code] és l'índex d'embolcall."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the count to the next visible line from [param line] to [code]line + "
"visible_amount[/code]. Can also count backwards. For example if a [TextEdit] "
"has 5 lines with lines 2 and 3 hidden, calling this with [code]line = 1, "
"visible_amount = 1[/code] would return 3."
msgstr ""
"Retorna el recompte a la següent línia visible des de [param line] fins a "
"[code]line + visible_amount[/code]. També es pot comptar enrere. Per "
"exemple, si un [TextEdit] té 5 línies amb les línies 2 i 3 amagades, trucant-"
"ho amb [code]line = 1, visible_amount = 1[/code] retornaria 3."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the local position for the given [param line] and [param column]. If "
"[code]x[/code] or [code]y[/code] of the returned vector equal [code]-1[/"
"code], the position is outside of the viewable area of the control.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Y position corresponds to the bottom side of the line. Use "
"[method get_rect_at_line_column] to get the top side position."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició local per a [param line] i [param column] donats. Si "
"[code]x[/code] o [code]y[/code] del vector retornat és igual a [code]-1[/"
"code], la posició està fora de l'àrea visible del control.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La posició Y correspon a la part inferior de la línia. "
"Utilitzeu [method get_rect_at_line_column] per obtenir la posició lateral "
"superior."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the correct column at the start of a composite character like ❤️‍🩹 "
"(mending heart; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) which is "
"comprised of more than one Unicode code point, if the caret is at the end of "
"the composite character. Also returns the correct column with the caret at "
"mid grapheme and for non-composite characters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To check at caret location use "
"[code]get_previous_composite_character_column(get_caret_line(), "
"get_caret_column())[/code]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna la columna correcta al començament d'un caràcter compost com ❤️‍🩹 "
"(cor reparador; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) que "
"consta de més d'un punt de codi Unicode, si el caràcter composat és final. "
"També retorna la columna correcta amb el cursor a mig grafema i per a "
"caràcters no compostos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Per comprovar a la ubicació de l'apunt, utilitzeu "
"[code]get_previous_composite_character_column(get_caret_line(), "
"get_caret_column())[/code]"

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the local position and size for the grapheme at the given [param "
"line] and [param column]. If [code]x[/code] or [code]y[/code] position of "
"the returned rect equal [code]-1[/code], the position is outside of the "
"viewable area of the control.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Y position of the returned rect corresponds to the top side "
"of the line, unlike [method get_pos_at_line_column] which returns the bottom "
"side."
msgstr ""
"Retorna la posició i la mida locals del grafema als [param line] i [param "
"column] donats. Si la posició [code]x[/code] o [code]y[/code] del recte "
"retornat és igual a [code]-1[/code], la posició està fora de l'àrea de "
"control.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] La posició Y del recte retornat correspon a la part superior de "
"la línia, a diferència de [method get_pos_at_line_column] que retorna la "
"part inferior."

#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
