#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the components of the given "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) * Vector4i(3, 4, 5, 6)) # Prints (30, 80, "
"150, 240)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
