#: doc/classes/XRHandModifier3D.xml
msgid "A node for driving hand meshes from [XRHandTracker] data."
msgstr ""
"Un node per controlar malles de mà a partir de dades de [XRHandTracker]."

#: doc/classes/XRHandModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"This node uses hand tracking data from an [XRHandTracker] to pose the "
"skeleton of a hand mesh.\n"
"Positioning of hands is performed by creating an [XRNode3D] ancestor of the "
"hand mesh driven by the same [XRHandTracker].\n"
"The hand tracking position-data is scaled by [member "
"Skeleton3D.motion_scale] when applied to the skeleton, which can be used to "
"adjust the tracked hand to match the scale of the hand model."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/XRHandModifier3D.xml
